(25804, '??, ??. ?????? ???? ?????????????? ?????? ?????? ?????? ?????????? ???? ???? ????????.\n????, [NAME]???? ???? ?????? ?? ????, ???? ?? ?????? ?????????\n{color,yellow,??????10??, ????????30??}?? ?????? ?? ??????.\n??????... {color,yellow,???? ??????}?? ?????? ???? ??????. \n??????, ??... ???? ???????? ?????? ?????? ?? ????????. \n[BUTTON]=[???? ?????? ????????. ???? ???? ??????.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[???????? ????????? ???? ??????...][2]'),
