(38401, '???????????? ???? ???????? ???????? ?? ?????? ?????????? ??????.\n8???????? ?????? ???????? ?????? ????????, ?????? 500?? ???? ???????????? ????????.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
