(38403, '??????????????! ???????? ??????????????.\n???? ?????? 500?? ???? ???? ???????????\n?????? ???? ?????? {color,yellow,???????? ???????? > ?????????? > ?????????? ???? ????} ???? ?? ????????.\n\n[BUTTON]=[?????? ????][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38404, 'Merry Christmas!\n[BUTTON]=[????][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38500, 'Spider Attack 1'),
(38501, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat 5 Fighter Spiders, 5 Fierce Spiders, 5 Speedy Spiders, 5 Cannibal Spiders, \n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38502, '<Soldier 1>\nAdrian, these are the belongings of missing traveler\n<Adrian>\nI know this pandant, traveler I saw yesterday wore the same one on their chest. Something unholy resides at underground square.\n<Soldier 2>\nAdrian, I\'m sorry to tell you this but, patrols we sent out this morning hasn\'t returned yet. They were making rounds to the underground square.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38503, 'Hello Adrian,\nHuh? What\'s going on?\n(They are all serious?)\n[NEXT]'),
(38504, 'Oh [NAME], I\'ll be with you in second.\nSo, they haven\'t returned?\n[NEXT]'),
(38505, '<Soldier 2>\nYes, it\'s been more then 4 hours past their due time. \n[NEXT]'),
(38506, 'Why didn\'t you tell me any sooner? What\'s going on in that square?\n[NEXT]'),
(38507, '(He must be busy. What is that?)\nHey guard, what is that on your hand? Looks like a web of some sort...\nYes it is. It\'s like a spider web.\n[NEXT]'),
(38508, 'Wait! Stay put!\nIt is spider. The one who took those travelers. \nThose missing people are in danger. \nPlease recruit as many as others. I\'ll lead the group. [NAME], I need your help on this rescue mission. We need to defeat those spiders right away! \n[BUTTON]=[Sure thing!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just can\'t sorry][2]'),
(38509, 'Whew! We did managed to defeat those spiders but, where are their victims.\n[NEXT]'),
(38510, 'We couldn\'t find them. We only found their clothings and such. It seems it\'s too late for them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38511, 'We need to hurry. We have to be on time for the gate to open! Let\'s go!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38600, 'Spider Attack 2'),
(38601, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat 10 Merciless Greenky, 10 Great Spiders, 10 Ultra Spiders, 1 Madness Grave Robber.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38602, '[NAME]! I really can\'t just stand here and watch people die!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38603, 'I feel the same way. Those spiders... They give me the chills. I did managed to get away but... They were strong.\n[NEXT]'),
(38604, 'You are right. It is hard to take on the spider but if we take out other monsters that are plaguing the square, then we might have a chance against it. \nWhy don\'t we leave the Great Spider alone for now but take on other monsters first? \nYou\'ll help out right, [NAME]?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know if I can][2]'),
(38605, 'Are you alright? What about the missing soldiers? Are they saved?\n[NEXT]'),
(38606, 'Ah, you are alright!\nPlease take a look at this. \n(Soldiers are bound tightly in spider web)\nThis is all thanks to your help. We saved them just in time. \nI do feel horrible about not being able to take out Great Big Spider. \nWe have to give our best and try to eliminate it. Otherwise, similar tragedies will plague our future.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38607, 'It\'s almost time for the square gate to be open. Are you ready? Did you prepare all necessary scrolls and stones?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38700, 'Spider Attack 3'),
(38701, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat Great Spider, Mini Spiders.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38702, 'Urgh... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38703, 'Adrian?\nHey! Are you alright?\nYou have been wounded.\n[NEXT]'),
(38704, 'I\'ll live.\nI took on that Great Big Spider by myself.\nWhen it is wounded almost fatally, it hatches countless Mini Spider to protect itself. Only if I had more time, and strength. I could\'ve finished it off.\n[NEXT]'),
(38705, 'Oh no!\nI will take it on!\nI\'ll group up with others and take them out, once and for all.\nDon\'t you worry.\n[NEXT]'),
(38706, 'Urgh!\nIt\'s too dangerous! It\'ll try to hatch {color,yellow,Mini Spider} to attack you when its health reaches almost 0. You\'re really willing to take on something that dangerous?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, trust me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Come to think of it, that does sound nasty.][2]'),
(38707, 'I\'m back.\nI did it though, I\'ve finished them off for good!\n[NEXT]'),
(38708, 'Oh... Good!\nAre you alright? I\'m so glad that you are okay. Wow, you took on all that spiders? Wow!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38709, 'Please, do take care of yourself.\nIf you don\'t think you can handle it, it\'s okay. They are too much to take on... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38800, 'Lost Mini Dragon 1'),
(38801, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Small Procks, Wild Lips, Madness Hobs, and Heavy Ogres.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38802, 'Welcome [NAME].\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38803, 'Captain Shutian, have you called for me?\n[NEXT]'),
(38804, 'Yes, I have something important to discuss about with you.\n[NEXT]'),
(38805, '(It\'s usually something hard)\nWhat is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(38806, 'You are aware of ancient records right?\nAncient giants whom roam the earth and dragons whom ruled the sky...\n[NEXT]'),
(38807, 'Yes a bit.\nIn ancient times, the world was filled with giant monsters.\n[NEXT]'),
(38808, 'I want you to know this first.\nThere isn\'t any dragon surviving in this continent anymore. For 600 years, there isn\'t a one case of dragon sighting recorded.\nYou know about that too right?\n[NEXT]'),
(38809, 'Well, I haven\'t really followed the records.\n[NEXT]'),
(38810, 'Of course, you wouldn\'t know about that. \nWell the, I\'ll give you a chance to view and experience the ancient times. \nDo you know where Boulder Canyon is located at? \nTravel there, and hunt some monsters for me. Ones such as {color,yellow,Small Procks}, {color,yellow,Wild Lips}, {color,yellow,Madness Hobs}, and {color,yellow,Heavy Ogres}. \n[BUTTON]=[Why are you speaking in codes? Fine okay I\'ll get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What\'d you talkin\' \'bout Shutian?][2]'),
(38811, 'Shutian!\n[NEXT]'),
(38812, 'So I take it you saw them?\nWhy don\'t you go think about what you saw.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38813, 'Are you finished with your task yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38900, 'Lost Mini Dragon 2'),
(38901, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Werebear Master, Grave Robber Master, Millenium Robo, and Great Goblin King.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38902, 'Have you found out about secrets of the Boulder Canyon?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(38903, 'Huh? What are you talking about? Oh there was a dragon!\n[NEXT]'),
(38904, 'What? So you haven\'t found out the secret of that place yet?\n[NEXT]'),
(38905, 'Seriously man, what are you talking about? What secret?\n[NEXT]'),
(38906, 'All monsters reside there bears secrets. It\'s probably because way the place is formed.\nWhat are you still doing here? Travel to Boulder Canyon and hunt {color,yellow,Werebear Master}, {color,yellow,Grave Robber Master}, {color,yellow,Millenium Robo}, and {color,yellow,Great Goblin King} now! Well go on!\n[BUTTON]=[Okay already!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Forget it. Are you senile or something?][2]'),
(38907, 'I think I know the secret now. When you kill those powerful ones, ones related to them dies with it.\n[NEXT]'),
(38908, 'I knew you would find it out! I am a good judge of character ha ha ha! \nI\'ll tell you the last secret when you are ready then.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(38909, 'Did you find out?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39000, 'Lost Mini Dragon 3'),
(39001, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Mini Dragon.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39002, 'Yes, it is a dragon. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39003, 'I knew it. But, you know what though? It looked bit odd. It was like if it was a baby, who were crying for its mother.\n[NEXT]'),
(39004, 'Very perceptive! You are right! It\'s a young dragon. I believe it got seperated from its mother while migrating from continent to continent. It maybe young, but still powerful. I decided to put a spell on entire canyon just to be safe.\n[NEXT]'),
(39005, 'I see. Is that mean, in neigboring continents, dragons still exists?\n[NEXT]'),
(39006, 'That\'s what it seems like. \nThere were record of their sightings. Ttime to time, we run across a bones of deceased dragons.\nThey must have been moving contients to contients. Even if they are {color,yellow,Mini Dragons}, they cannot be tamed. Before they can too out of control, we need to get rid of it. For our world sake.\n[BUTTON]=[I think so too][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not going to be part of it.][2]'),
(39007, 'Captain, I took care of the Mini Dragon.\nI don\'t feel right though. It just seems wrong.\n[NEXT]'),
(39008, 'Good job.\nIt was inevitable, we would\'ve been Depraved if it was left to grow.\nWe should pray for its slain soul though. Why don\'t we have a silent moment for it\'s slain life.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39009, 'Be strong.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39100, 'Evil Spirit, Gordon Master 1'),
(39101, 'In past, there were great warrior in land of Isya called Berserker Lionheart. Years have passed since he left for Karlzar Mountains, now he appears front of Roumenous as a cold, dead soul. Roumenous calls for emergency expedition. (Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39102, 'Thank you for coming. It\'s good to have you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39103, 'What is it Roumenous? You look like you saw a ghost.\n[NEXT]'),
(39104, 'Yes, I should calm down. \nYears ago, there was a great warrior. He was dubbed as {color,yellow,Spirit Sword. He\'s name was Berserker Lionheart}.\n[NEXT]\n'),
(39105, 'What a name. I mean who would name their kid Berserker?\n[NEXT]'),
(39106, 'Well, that\'s not important.\nHe was a true hero. He stood up for righteousness and had a strength to carry it on. Such a charismatic leader he was.\nOne day, wanting to test his limits, he left form {color,yellow,Karlzar Mountains}. To a deadily place where no one came out alive.\n[NEXT]'),
(39107, 'I didn\'t know such place existed.\n[NEXT]'),
(39108, 'Well, yes. To get there, one must go past the Dawn Swamp. No one, and I mean no one dared to venture past Dawn Swamp. It is deadily and dangerous place. But, he went there, by himself.\n[NEXT]'),
(39109, 'And what happened? I\'m guessing he didn\'t came back.\n[NEXT]'),
(39110, 'Well, yes and no. \nWe know that he had reached the mountain and went on inside of its depth. We believe, with all his might and power, he would return one day. No matter how long it\'ll take. \nLast night, he didn\'t returned.\n[NEXT]'),
(39111, 'Okay.\n[NEXT]'),
(39112, 'He returned as a cold, dead, in form of spirit. \nHe talked about the mountains. As soon as he entered the {color,yellow,mountains he encountered a giant jewels and a being}. He called the being {color,yellow,Gordon Master}. \nHe\'s a messenger of devil himself. Pure evil. \nHe\'ll destroy Elderine and Roumen for sure, along with Uruga. He also said that he is confined at {color,yellow,Endless Maze}. I have an idea where might that be. I\'ve been told that place is plagued with powerful monsters such as {color,yellow,Stoney, Jewel Keeper, Pixie, Sylph} in evil form.\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll check it out][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You need to call an exorcist.][2]'),
(39113, 'Roumenous, you were right. All the monsters were indeed turned evil. They were soaked with evil spirits.\n[NEXT]'),
(39114, 'I knew it. \nIt\'s horrible. I believe we need to team up with others to take them on.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39115, 'I\'m still shaking.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39200, 'Evil Spirit, Gordon Master 2'),
(39201, 'In past, there were great warrior in land of Isya called Berserker Lionheart. Years have passed since he left for Karlzar Mountains, now he appears front of Roumenous as a cold, dead soul. Roumenous calls for emergency expedition. (Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39202, 'At the maze, what was the first monster you encountered?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39203, 'Dark Stoney.\n[NEXT]'),
(39204, 'Yes of course, I\'m sure their reasoning and intellegence were all gone by then. However power wise they are strong as high class monsters like Incubus or Jokers.\n[NEXT]'),
(39205, 'You are right, I did see them through Dark Stonies and Dark Pixies. Yes, they were definitely there.\n[NEXT]'),
(39206, 'I believe, they have a key to all these madness. Go get them!\n[BUTTON]=[I will,hang on][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t you be ordering me around. You do it.][2]'),
(39207, 'I did get them, but they didn\'t give off any clues. I think I ran into one called {color,yellow,Berserker Lionheart}. He disappered rather quickly though.\n[NEXT]'),
(39208, 'You seen him too?\nDid he leave anything? Anything?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39209, 'I need a clue.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39300, 'Evil spirit, Gordon Master 3'),
(39301, 'In past, there were great warrior in land of Isya called Berserker Lionheart. Years have passed since he left for Karlzar Mountains, now he appears front of Roumenous as a cold, dead soul. Roumenous calls for emergency expedition. (Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39302, 'Did he leave you anything at all?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39303, 'Wait, come to think of it, he did dropped something. \n[NEXT]'),
(39304, 'That\'s it! It\'s the key to defeat Gordon Master! This is what he told me, to defeat Gordon Master, one would need 3 different \'things\'.\nPlease go retrieve it, it\'s the only way to defeat these horrible evil beings.\n[NEXT]'),
(39305, 'I don\'t know about that. It was really tough I mean, it came out in flash and oppressed me with darkness.\n[NEXT]'),
(39306, 'I know you can do it.\nUse those {color,yellow,3 keys} he gave you, and defeat Gordon Master once and for all!\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, that keys better work!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How come Berserker died then huh? No way!][2]'),
(39307, 'I did it! Gordon Master is gone once and for all!\n[NEXT]'),
(39308, 'You truly are the chosen one. I knew you can do it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39309, 'Only the one with keys are able to see him.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39400, 'Cranky Giant Honeying 1'),
(39401, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Dirty Mushrooms, Hungry Boogies, Madness Ratmen, and Crazy Foxes.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39402, 'Such a disaster.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39403, 'Captain Shutian, what\'s going on? What\'s with all this mess?\n[NEXT]'),
(39404, 'I don\'t understand it. How could this have happened? During the night, Giant Honeyings raided Elderine.\n[NEXT]'),
(39405, 'How did they enter through the town\'s defense?\n[NEXT]'),
(39406, 'I don\'t know how, but they tore through the defenses, and destroyed half the town. I need your help. \nFirst, could you hunt down {color,yellow, Dirty Mushrooms, {color,yellow, Hungry Boogies, {color,yellow, Madness Ratmen}, and {color,yellow, Crazy Foxes} that are guarding its nest?\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No! Why me?][2]'),
(39407, 'It\'s clean now. The deed is done.\n[NEXT]'),
(39408, 'Thank you. Thanks to you, we were able to infiltrate into their nest. I\'m sure the recon team will contact soon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39409, 'How is it coming along?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39500, 'Cranky Giant Honeying 2'),
(39501, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Big Bone Imps, Poison Procks, Brutal Wolves, and Cruel Bats.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39502, 'I don\'t believe this, they invaded the Slime\'s nest, and are using it as their own.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39503, 'Slime\'s nest?\n[NEXT]'),
(39504, 'I\'m sure the Slimes offered no resistance. Giant Honeyings are way superior in power.\n[NEXT]'),
(39505, 'You got that right.\n[NEXT]'),
(39506, 'Hmm... There is a report of some {color,yellow,Mid-level boss monster} sightings. Before taking on the Giant Honeying, you should take these monsters out first. Can you handle it?\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me, I\'ll get the job done with my friends...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t tell me what to do old man, the answer is no!][2]'),
(39507, 'Captain! The deed is done. Any updates yet?\n[NEXT]'),
(39508, 'Thank you, we are currently on standby. Thank you for all your support!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39509, 'What are you still doing here?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39600, 'Cranky Giant Honeying 3'),
(39601, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to defeat Giant Honeying and Shadow Honeying.\n(Kingdom Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39602, 'I can\'t believe this! This is so humiliating!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39603, 'Hey Captain, what\'s going on? What\'s with all these injured soldiers?\n[NEXT]'),
(39604, 'Yes, I might have taken the Giant Honeying too lightly. We took it on full frontal and this is what happened.\n[NEXT]'),
(39605, 'I see.\n[NEXT]'),
(39606, 'I don\'t know what to say but, I was wondering if you could take it on.\n[BUTTON]=[Consider it done, I\'ll go kill that Giant Honeying and teach it a lesson!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just don\'t have the time. Sorry.][2]'),
(39607, 'The Giant Honeying is dead captain!\n[NEXT]'),
(39608, 'Oh! Thank you! This is great news! Thank you so much! Please take this, it\'s not much,  but, it\'s for all your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39609, 'This is really embarrassing.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39700, 'King Kong Phino\'s Rampage 1'),
(39701, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat 5 King Kong Colls, 5 King Kong Tortures, and 5 King Kong Golden Bats.\n(Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39702, 'Oh no!\nOh Hans, can you take care of Grandma Mary?\nI would need more bandages.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39703, 'Hey what\'s going on? What\'s with all these people?\n[NEXT]'),
(39704, 'It\'s all King Kong Phino\'s doing. Valley of Fairy is filled with them and Giant Phinoflies, and no one can go pass them now. \nNot only that, they are now attacking anybody they come across. No one can talk them out of it. Not only that because all the monsters they attracted, we can\'t even get near them now. \n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me. I\'ll get to them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[C\'est la vie.][2]'),
(39705, 'Adrian, you shouldn\'t have a problem getting to them now. I defeated those little monsters.\n[NEXT]'),
(39706, 'Thank you for getting the job done so quickly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39707, 'Mr. Jones, you have big injuries. What\'s going on?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39800, 'King Kong Phino\'s Rampage 2'),
(39801, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat 1 Returned Mara, 1 Returned Marlone, 1 Returned Ghost Slime, and 1 Returned Millenium Robo.\n(Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39802, 'Did you hear the news?!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39803, 'About what?\n[NEXT]'),
(39804, 'Marlone, Mara, and Ghost Slimes. Not only that Millenium Robo also have joined King Kong Phino\'s rampage.\n[NEXT]'),
(39805, 'I really didn\'t know, that King Kong Phino had such persuasion in him.\n[NEXT]'),
(39806, 'I thought King Kong Phino only had size to him, and no intelligence to conspire with others. I guess I was grossly mistaken.\nWe need to get rid of {color,yellow,Returned Mara}, {color,yellow,Returned Marlone}, {color,yellow,Returned Ghost Slime}, and {color,yellow,Returned Millenium Robo}. quickly.\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on it][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What do you mean by we?][2]'),
(39807, 'It was true. After taking care of them, the others just dropped like flies.\n[NEXT]'),
(39808, 'I believe they were going to use King Kong Phino to attract new travelers. How was it to fight off, now stronger old foes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39809, 'Those monsters who returned. They must be strong right?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39900, 'King Kong Phino\'s Rampage 3'),
(39901, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga asks you to defeat 1 King Kong Phino.\n(Kingdom quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39902, 'There is one important thing you have to remember.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(39903, 'What is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(39904, 'You must stay clear of Phinoflies. You musn\'t hurt them in anyway. You would never know, how it\'ll change.\n[NEXT]'),
(39905, 'I\'m guessing Phinoflies are its mate.\n[NEXT]'),
(39906, 'That\'s right, without hurting Phinoflies you must defeat {color,yellow,King Kong Phino}. Can you pull that off?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not sure about that.][2]'),
(39907, 'I did it. I was able to get a help from a lot of people who shared my vision.\n[NEXT]'),
(39908, 'I see, that is great news [NAME]. We should really celebrate this victory in proper way.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(39909, 'I\'m sure you can do it [NAME].\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40000, 'Arrogant Guard Paulmon 1'),
(40001, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to speak with his nephew Guard Paulmon. \n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40002, 'Oh, [NAME], it\'s been a while.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40003, 'What are you talking about, we just saw each other not too long ago.\nWhat is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(40004, 'Well, I have a request for you. It\'s bit of on personal side.\n[NEXT]'),
(40005, 'Ah, personal?\n[NEXT]'),
(40006, 'I have this nephew, {color,yellow,Guard Paulmon}. Well, he joined as guard. I think he\'s looking for free-ride. He\'s been bragging to his superior that he\'s my nephew. So, I\'m going to order him to guard the {color,yellow,Scaffold Execution Ground} by himself to punish him. Thing is I don\'t want to order it directly at him. So could you possibly deliver this order to him?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, give it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do I look alike your personal maid?][2]'),
(40007, 'Execuse me, are you Paulmon?\n[NEXT]'),
(40008, 'Do you know who I am? How dare you to call me by my name! You little kid!\n[NEXT]'),
(40009, 'I\'m just a messenger whose delivering Captain Shutian\'s order. Here take it.\n[NEXT]'),
(40010, 'Messenger? Tsk! Fine give it to me.\nWhat!? Well, this is totally unfair! How can he do this to me?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40011, 'Did you deliver it?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40100, 'Arrogant Guard Paulmon 2'),
(40101, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to collect of Harken\'s Clubs.\n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40102, 'NOOOOO!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40103, 'What is with you?\n[NEXT]'),
(40104, 'I can\'t do this by myself! There\'s just no way!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(40105, '(I should get out of here)\n[NEXT]'),
(40106, 'Yo messenger! Stay right there! You don\'t think you can just serve me this little order and sneak out like that! Hey help me out man, hunt {color,yellow,Harkens} down for me and bring back {color,yellow, Clubs}?\n[BUTTON]=[Since he\'s paying, let\'s just do it and tell Shutian.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You want to get clubbed son?][2]'),
(40107, 'Here, Harken\'s clubs.\n[NEXT]'),
(40108, 'Thanks, thanks. You can leave it right there. If you tell, my uncle I will track you down kid. GOT IT!?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40109, 'Hey what\'s keeping you?\nI\'m so hungry and tired.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40200, 'Paulmon\'s Threat 1'),
(40201, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to defeat Prisoners and of Torturers.\n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground for Prisoners and Collapsed Prison for Torturers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40202, 'Hey messenger! Get over here quick!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40203, '(Maybe I should just kill him and scatter his arrogant behind all over)\nI have a name you know, it\'s [NAME]!\n[NEXT]'),
(40204, 'I have a name you know, waaah! Fine, [NAME]! You\'re the one who told my uncle about that club issue right? \n[NEXT]'),
(40205, 'Of course! You are lucky I didn\'t waste you right then and there.\n[NEXT]'),
(40206, 'Wooo big talker! It\'s all your fault that my vacation time has been taken away! I broke up with my girlfriend because of you! You should be ashamed of yourself. \n[NEXT]'),
(40207, 'Why is that my fault, if you did your chores yourself, none of this would\'ve happened.\n[NEXT]'),
(40208, 'It all started with you and you should resolve this. Otherwise I\'m going tell everyone I know that you are an untrustworthy snitch! If you do my mission for me and hunt down {color,yellow, Prisoners} and {color,yellow, Torturers} then you are off the hook.\n[BUTTON]=[ I don\'t want you to spread rumors.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No Way!][2]'),
(40209, 'I did it, I\'m going now.\n[NEXT]'),
(40210, 'Not bad kid! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40211, 'What are you doing? What\'s keeping you?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40300, 'Paulmon\'s Threat 2'),
(40301, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to collect Apples and Jerky.\n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground, Apples can be obtained from Woods and Jerky can be obtained by defeating Prisoners)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40302, 'Wait!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40303, 'What? You told me I can go.\n[NEXT]'),
(40304, 'I don\'t know. I still feel victimized by all this craziness.\n[NEXT]'),
(40305, '(Does this guy know the word \'stop\'?)\n[NEXT]'),
(40306, 'Because of you, I\'ve been standing here on guard duty without any food! I\'m starving! All those scary monsters are roaming about so now I\'m stuck here. \nHey, be a pal and bring me some apples and jerky.{color,yellow, Apples} and {color,yellow, Jerky} will do. Yes  Jerky. You got that? Apples, Jerky got it?\n[BUTTON]=[Fine, but this is last time man!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Forget you.][2]'),
(40307, 'Here, eat it.\n[NEXT]'),
(40308, 'He he he! Alright! Nice, good job. You may go now kid.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40309, 'I\'m hungry! Either you stand guard for me or get me food!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40400, 'Paulmon\'s Plead 1'),
(40401, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to collect Ebony Tree Branches.\n(Search Collapsed Prisobn. Ebony Tree Branches can be obtained by defeating Dead Tree Souls)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40402, 'This is a death sentence! Look! \nMaybe if it was Weaken Ogres, I\'ll think about it, but getting a branch from Dead Tree Soul?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40403, '(Yes, I don\'t think he can take on something like that)\nYou are right, you are no match for it.\n[NEXT]'),
(40404, 'Right? You think so too right? I mean, granted I might have abused a little power, but sending his own nephew to certain death? Come on! \nIt all started after you told on me. It\'s all your fault! All your fault!\n[NEXT]'),
(40405, '(Well, still haven\'t learned a lesson haven\'t we?)\nHey, why do you think it\'s my fault huh? Think about what you\'ve done first!\n[NEXT]'),
(40406, 'Oh come on have a heart! I might be kicked out if I can\'t get these two things done. Not only that, my own daddy will disown me for sure! Come on you don\'t want me to be a completely failure? It should be easy for you, I mean {color,yellow, Ebony Tree Branches}, that shoud be a cinch for you.\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, that is too much. Let\'s help him out.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it yourself!][2]'),
(40407, 'Here, I\'m off then.\n[NEXT]'),
(40408, 'Whoa, hey, wait! I told you I had two things done!\nYou gotta grant my other wish!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40409, 'Hurry up, hurry up!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40500, 'Paulmon\'s Plead 2'),
(40501, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to defeat Senior Torturers and collect Masks.\n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground. Masks can be obtained by defeating Senior Torturers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40502, 'Just one more! One simple wish!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40503, '(What am I a genie in a lamp?)\nOkay this is the LAST time!\n[NEXT]'),
(40504, 'Yes, Yes last time, sure last time man. You got some trust issue kid.\nOkay, 2nd mission is to defeat Senior Torturer and bring back their masks. Easy \'nuff right? Defeat {color,yellow, Senior Torturers} and bring back {color,yellow, masks}. \n[BUTTON]=[Sure, looks like it would be too much for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hope you die and they make a mask out your face!][2]'),
(40505, 'Here, this was it. No more!\n[NEXT]'),
(40506, 'Okay, you may have a wrong impression on me, but I do keep my words. You go now, and I go sleep now. Capiche?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40507, 'Hey, faster! Which part of fast you don\'t understand?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40600, 'Shutian\'s Last Gift'),
(40601, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to find Senior Torturer\'s belongings. \n(Search Collapsed Prison. Senior Torturer\'s belongings can be obtained by defeating Senior Torturers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40602, 'Torturers were once a human beings. Now they roam the earth as monsters.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40603, 'How can they turn like that? I just can\'t believe that they turned to such a horrible beings.\n[NEXT]'),
(40604, 'Neither can I. It is tragic. More sorrowful thing is that, most of their families are still around, waiting for them. I would want to at least deliever those who moans for them, their momentos to remember their formal humanities. Could you retrieve {color,yellow,Senior Torturer\'s personal belongings}?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are joking right?][2]'),
(40605, 'Captain Shutian, I\'ve brought it back. \n[NEXT]'),
(40606, 'Thank you so much for you help. Let\'s hope with these artifacts, can at least comfort their loss. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40607, 'This is sad.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40700, 'Monster Experiment'),
(40701, 'Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine asks you to collect a Hand Written Note.\n(Search Collapsed Prison. You can obtain a Hand Written Note by defeating Karasian Soldiers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40702, 'Captain, I ran into something that is very fishy.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40703, 'What is is?\n[NEXT]'),
(40704, 'I got this from a Karasian Soldier. Look, it has a list of monsters and some odd bits about them written down.\n[NEXT]'),
(40705, 'Looks like it\'s a coded message. Let\'s see...\nHoneyings, Bees, Wolf\'s, Eagle\'s, King Crab, and Dark blood?\n[NEXT]'),
(40706, 'It sure doesn\'t sound like a grocery list.\n[NEXT]'),
(40707, 'You got that right.\nThis is a short grocery list of chimera experiment of monsters. Try to combine properties of different monsters together to create new type of monster. \nThank you for such a great intel. I will organize a rangers, please follow me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40708, 'What?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40800, 'Paulmon\'s Odd Behavior'),
(40801, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to collect a Silver Necklace with a family photograph inside.\n(Search Scaffold Execution Ground. You can obtain a Silver Necklace by defeating Karasian Templars)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40802, 'Hey Paulmon, you got some time?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40803, 'OH! NOTHING TO REPORT SIR!\nWhat?! Oh it\'s you! You scare me to death! \n[NEXT]'),
(40804, 'Oh nevermind.\nI\'ll be on my way.\n[NEXT]'),
(40805, 'Hey, wait! That {color,yellow,locket in your hand}. Where did you get it?\n[NEXT]'),
(40806, 'This?\nA Karasian Templar dropped it during battle. \nWell, the picture of boy inside of this locke, looks a lot like you, that\'s why.\n[NEXT]'),
(40807, 'Let... Let me see that...\n(Paulmon stares into the finish of the locket for long time, then slowly opens creaking cover. As soon as he sees the photo, hurls it into the bushes.)\n[NEXT]'),
(40808, 'What are you doing! Come on!\n[NEXT]'),
(40809, 'things like that shouldn\'t be found! Don\'t you even think of looking for it again! YOU GOT IT?!\nNow, beat it!\nJust go away!\n[NEXT]'),
(40810, '(He has some serious issues. Something is going on. I should ask Shutian to see what\'s up with him.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40811, 'Snores...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40900, 'Paulmon\'s Back Story'),
(40901, 'Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground asks you to speak with Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine.\n(Search Elderine)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40902, '(Paulmon is acting odd, I should ask Shutian what\'s going on.)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(40903, 'Captain, I have a question to ask you.\n[NEXT]'),
(40904, 'Of course [NAME], what is on your mind?\n[NEXT]'),
(40905, 'I found a locket with photo resembling Paulmon from a Karasian Templar, and when I brought it back to Paulmon, he just threw it away. \nHe seemed furious yet very emotional to see that locket again. I just wanted to know what was that all about.\n[NEXT]'),
(40906, 'Hmm...\nI thought that child would\'ve forgotten it all by now.\nI didn\'t think that he would still remember.\n[NEXT]'),
(40907, 'Remember what?\n[NEXT]'),
(40908, 'Paulmon is not related by blood. He was adopted by my brother, when he was young. My brother thought since the child was so young, he wouldn\'t remember his past. \nAnd so did I.\n[NEXT]'),
(40909, 'Is that why he acts like a such an.\n[NEXT]'),
(40910, 'Yes, to rebel. Maybe to forget. Who really knows?\nI really thought Paulmon would\'ve forgotten all the pains in the past.\nI am the one who rescued that child.\n[NEXT]'),
(40911, 'Rescued?\n[NEXT]'),
(40912, 'When that child and his family were moving to Uruga, their caravan was attacked by Karasians. His parents were killed in the incident. When I finally got to the scene I was only able to save Paulmon.\n[NEXT]'),
(40913, 'Do you think that What he\'s lashing out on world?\n[NEXT]'),
(40914, 'That child feels guilty for what happened. He has a beautiful soul, but as he grew up, he distanced himself from others by putting on a mask. \nHe\'s a poor child.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(40915, 'Hmm... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41000, 'Queen Spider\'s Web'),
(41001, 'Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine asks you to collect a Queen Spider\'s Web that would highlight his new design. \n(Search Concealed Prison. You obtain Queen Spider\'s Web by defeating Queen Spiders)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41002, 'Hey honey, would you be a darling and come over here?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41003, '(Honey? Darling?)\nSup?\n[NEXT]'),
(41004, 'Look at this design! Isn\'t it fabulous? Simple, elegant yet touch of luxurious.\n[NEXT]'),
(41005, '(It\'s a basic white priest robe)\nI guess so, but isn\'t that a just priest\'s robe?\n[NEXT]'),
(41006, 'Even priests\' need something, something in their gears don\'t you think? I know it\'s bit simple now but if I sew it up with that luxurious {color,yellow,Queen Spider\'s Web}, any priests wearing this will feel like a natural diva for sure! So, you sexy, strong adventurer, can you get me {color,yellow,1 Queen Spider\'s Web}? There\'s a big reward for you, if you get my drift. Ho Ho Ho!\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks][2]'),
(41007, 'Mr. Kenton, your webs.\n[NEXT]'),
(41008, 'You are speedy, wham, bam, thank you ma\'am type of person aren\'t ya? Thank you very much! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41009, 'Honey, what are you still doing here? Let\'s get it on... With your mission!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41100, 'Greenkie\'s Green Slough'),
(41101, 'Furniture Shop Owner Forest Tim of Uruga asks you to collect 60 Greenkie\'s Sloughs\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Greenkie\'s sloughs can be obtained by defeating Greenkies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41102, 'How unholy is that, an animal slough that doesn\'t break down. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41103, 'Sloughs that don\'t break down?\n[NEXT]'),
(41104, 'Yes, just look.\n{color,yellow,Greenkie\'s sloughs} are tough, poisonous, and at the same time brittle.\n[NEXT]'),
(41105, 'Wow, it\'s weird. It would make a perfect clothing material, only if it wasn\'t poisonous.\n[NEXT]'),
(41106, 'Greenkies shed their skins 20 times a year. Sheer size of poisonous sloughs left behind is just too much for many trees. It\'s taking a toll on tree roots, rotting away because these discarded wastes. \n[BUTTON]=[Oh no, I\'ll go collect those sloughs][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s a lost cause, never ending cycle.][2]'),
(41107, 'Tim, I got those sloughs, how should we get rid of these?\n[NEXT]'),
(41108, 'Thank you, I would need to neutralize their poison then burn them. Although it takes six months to neutralize their poison.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41109, 'Then I\'ll leave it up to you.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41200, 'Give up the Weapons! 1'),
(41201, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga asks you to retreive his Long Sword cargo that was hijacked during transport. \n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Han\'s Long Sword  can be found by defeating Clover Trumpies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41202, '[NAME]! Over here!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41203, 'Hey Hans, what\'s going on?\n[NEXT]'),
(41204, 'My shipments of swords were hijacked. I worked so hard on it. Those swords were a special order.\n[NEXT]'),
(41205, 'Oh no, do you know who hijacked it?\n[NEXT]'),
(41206, 'I\'m sure it was {color,yellow,Clover Trumpies}. They are known to hijack new weapons in transport. Can you retrieve some of their weapons, so I can verify if they did it or not?\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You got eyes, you do it][2]'),
(41207, 'Hans, here it is. They are carrying some fancy weapons for sure, I mean look at all these jewels.\n[NEXT]'),
(41208, 'That\'s it! Those are my swords! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41209, 'Did you get it? Was it mine?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41300, 'Give up the Weapons! 2'),
(41301, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga asks you to collect 60 Long Sword cargo that was hijacked during transport. \n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Han\'s Long Sword  can be found by defeating Clover Trumpies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41302, 'I need to get all of swords back! Otherwise I don\'t have anything to deliver! I\'ll be ruined!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41303, 'Okay, stop shouting.\n[NEXT]'),
(41304, 'I really don\'t have time to re-make all the sword they hijacked. I need to deliver {color,yellow,Long Swords} by tomorrow! Can you help me retrive all of my cargo please? \n[NEXT]'),
(41305, 'You know, aren\'t you losing your cargo just way too much these days? I maen how many times do I have to get it back for you?\n[NEXT]'),
(41306, 'No! It\'s not my fault! It\'s the carrier service, who keeps losing my weapons. It won\'t happen again. Just please? {color,yellow,60} swords that\'s it! Please?\n[BUTTON]=[Fine, this is the last time!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Take it up to carrier service customer support][2]'),
(41307, 'Here, oh these weapons are heavy!\n[NEXT]'),
(41308, 'Thank you! You saved my business! Thank you!\nI won\'t forget for sure!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41309, 'OH NO!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41400, 'Charm made out of Claws 1'),
(41401, 'Skill Master Ruby of Roumen asks you to collect 5 Lizardman\'s Claws.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Lizardman\'s Claws can be obtained by defeating Lizardmen)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41402, '(Hey, [NAME])\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41403, 'Huh? Am I hearing things?\n[NEXT]'),
(41404, 'Over here! Here! (Whispering)\n[NEXT]'),
(41405, 'Ruby? Why are you whispering?\n[NEXT]'),
(41406, 'Sheesh! Please stay quiet. I have a favor to ask you.\n[NEXT]'),
(41407, 'A favor? Okay what is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(41408, 'I really, really need a {color,yellow,Lizardman\'s claws}. It\'s for a... Well, I have this Skill Master Tournament, and I really need to win this one. For our town sake. \nIf I have a charm made from {color,yellow,Lizardman\'s claws}, I\'ll win for sure. According to my grandma.\n[BUTTON]=[Well, whatever floats your boat. Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am so disappointed at you. I can\'t believe you are into such things.][2]'),
(41409, 'Here you go, it wasn\'t hard at all, but I can\'t believe you are in to these things.\n[NEXT]'),
(41410, 'Yes, me neither. But right now, I really need anything that would help me. Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41411, 'Whew.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41500, 'Charm made out of Claws 2'),
(41501, 'Skill Master Ruby of Roumen asks you to collect 15 Lizardman\'s Claws.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Lizardman\'s Claws can be obtained by defeating Lizardmen)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41502, 'Hey [NAME]!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41503, 'Ruby, what\'s up? Did you finish making the charm yet?\n[NEXT]'),
(41504, 'Well, it\'s about that. According to grandma, when you are making a Lizardman claw charm, you need at least 20 claws. I\'m kind of of 15 short from required. So, I was wondering. If you could get me about {color,yellow,15} more {color,yellow,Lizardman\'s claws}? I\'ll pay of course.\n[BUTTON]=[Well, sure since I already got 5 for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, you should just practice.][2]'),
(41505, 'Here, Ruby. But I really think you should practice more then relying on things like these.\n[NEXT]'),
(41506, 'Well, I know. In a way, I want my grandma happy too. She really believes in this thing you know.\nThank you anyways.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41507, 'Could you please talk quiet? This is really embarrassing.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41600, 'Trumphy\'s Cowardly Revenge'),
(41601, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga asks you to defeat 100 Heart Trumpies and bring back Hans weapons.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. You can obtain Han\'s weapons be defeating Heart Trumpies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41602, 'NOOOOOOO!\n(Crowds are gathered around)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41603, 'What\'s going on? What\'s with all these people doing at the foundary? \nHey, what happened here? The place is mess!\n[NEXT]'),
(41604, '[NAME]! You are here! Just look my foundary! Look at all these mess!\n[NEXT]'),
(41605, 'I\'m guessing {color,yellow,Heart Trumpies}.\nThey were pretty ticked off by getting your weapon back from them.\n[NEXT]'),
(41606, 'They snucked into the town while Ardian was on patrol. \nWhew. I am officially ruined.\nIf I knew how vicious they can be, I would\'ve just let\'em have my swords. \nWhat should I do now?\n[BUTTON]=[Clean this mess up and open up your shop, I\'m bringing your weapons back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yes it is kind of your fault. ][2]'),
(41607, 'Okay, I got your things. Man it\'s heavy! \nI taught them a serious lessons, so they won\'t be venturing into town no more.\n[NEXT]'),
(41608, 'Thank you! (HUGS!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41609, 'NOOOOOOOOO!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41700, 'Blood Red Dye'),
(41701, 'Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine asks you to collect 20 of Red Stonies hide pieces.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Red Stoneis Hide Pieces can be obtained by defeating Red Stonies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41702, '[NAME]! [NAME]!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41703, '(Who is this nasty voice calling my name?)\nOh snap! It\'s you! What do you want?\n[NEXT]'),
(41704, 'Hey beautiful! It\'s a job offer, come one don\'t you want to make little something, something?\n[NEXT]'),
(41705, 'Job offer? You call a gathering weird things for you a job offer?\n[NEXT]'),
(41706, 'Hey, haven\'t you heard that there is no shame in honest day of work? \nWell, anyways, I\'m making this stunning red dress and I don\'t like the red dye I\'m currently using. \nSo I got this idea right? Picture this! A fabulous red dress in tints of Red Stonies skins. To die for right? Okay, get me {color,yellow,20 Red Stonies hide pieces}. \n[BUTTON]=[Well, you are right job is job. I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to be part of something nasty like that.][2]'),
(41707, 'Okay Kenton, I got your skins.\n[NEXT]'),
(41708, 'Oh! Look at that! Oh! Isn\'t it just darling? Oh you too [NAME], don\'t get jeolous honey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41709, 'Are you still here?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41800, 'Lost Heart 1'),
(41801, 'Healer Poring of Uruga asks you to collect Elf Knight Soul\'s blood, heart and spirits.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. Elf Knight Soul\'s blood, heart and spirits can be obtained by defeating Elf Knight Souls)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41802, 'Monsters\' spirits cannot be cleansed while they are alive. It is an unfortunate truth about spirits and monsters who have fallen into darkness.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41803, 'I see. That reminds me, I\'ve heard an association between elves and faries have formed. You are the Uruga\'s representative.\n[NEXT]'),
(41804, 'You are right. That\'s precisely what I have a request to you about. \n[NEXT]'),
(41805, 'Me? How can I be in service? \n[NEXT]'),
(41806, '{color,yellow,Elf Knight Souls}, want desperately come back to the light, but their heart is completely soaked in evil beyond repair. To end their suffering, I need their {color,yellow,blood}, {color,yellow,heart}, and {color,yellow,spirits}. It\'s now only way to help ease their permanent state of pain.\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you. I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think death, is right answer.][2]'),
(41807, 'Poring, I\'ve collected what you wanted. Whenever I battle them, I don\'t know why, but I become succumb to sorrows sipping from their heart. It feels as I am fighting my fellow traveler.\n[NEXT]'),
(41808, 'They were once like us. However, they are nothing but a walking shell with stolen souls.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41809, 'Please, I\'ll leave this up to you.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41900, 'Lost Heart 2'),
(41901, 'Healer Poring of Uruga asks you to collect 10 Old Spirit Dust, 25 Faded Spirit Dust, 10 Brilliant Spirit Dust, and 1 Multicolor Spirit Dust.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41902, 'We are almost ready but, {color,yellow,We are missing a few things}. Could you help me gather thing we need?\nI need to man my post right now.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(41903, 'What exactly do you need?\n[NEXT]'),
(41904, 'Well, little of a lot of different things like:\n{color,yellow,10 Old Spirit Dust}\n{color,yellow,25 Faded Spirit Dust}\n{color,yellow,10 Brilliant Spirit Dust}\n{color,yellow,1 Multicolor Spirit Dust}\nDo you think you can handle it?\n[BUTTON]=[No to worry, I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Too tedious, I\'ll pass. ][2]'),
(41905, 'Poring, I got all the things you need.\n[NEXT]'),
(41906, 'Thank you for getting all that. I know it wasn\'t easy tracking it all down. Thank you for helping out such a great cause.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(41907, 'I have so many things on my mind.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42000, 'Copied Key'),
(42001, 'Storage Keeper Curly of Uruga asks you to collect 1 Shining Key.\n(Search Ancient Elven Woods. You can obtained the Shining Key by defeating Blue Clover Trumpies)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42002, 'Yo Curly! How you doing?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42003, 'What? Oh it\'s you. So what\'s going on?\n[NEXT]'),
(42004, 'Guess what I have on me. No, better yet... Have you lost something lately? Something like this?\n[NEXT]'),
(42005, 'Huh?! That key! Where? How did you get this?\n[NEXT]'),
(42006, '{color,yellow,Blue Clover Trumpies} had it on them. It\'s yours right?\n[NEXT]'),
(42007, 'Yes! It is! It sure is!\nI\'ve been losing sleeps over this key! I was on the way back to Uruga from Elderine and got attacked by some creature and passed out. When I came to all my things, including this key to the storage was gone. It was going to take days to change the lock, so I was worried that those who stolen the key would empty out this storage. \n[NEXT]'),
(42008, 'Well, it turn out pretty good then huh? \n[NEXT]'),
(42009, 'Sure did! All thanks to you! Thank you so much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42010, 'Huh?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42100, 'Flame Shot!'),
(42101, 'Guard Nus of Elderine asks you to collect 2 Sylph\'s flames, 20 Herb leaves, 1 Ram\'s ear, 1 Rosemary, and 5 high class spirit\'s fruits\n(Search Forest of Slumber) \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42102, 'Flame shot! Flame Shot!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42103, 'What are you doing Nus? \nThat\'s hilarious!\n[NEXT]'),
(42104, 'Don\'t you laugh at me kid! Do you want to be schooled by my infamous Flame Shoot! There are only 3 days left till the big game!\nWell, are you ready for the game?\n[NEXT]'),
(42105, 'Me? I\'m not even from this town, why do I have to be ready for something I don\'t belong to. Why don\'t you worry about your own self Nus.\n[NEXT]'),
(42106, 'Speaking of me getting ready, I have a big, I mean huge soccer game that day. I\'m really going to be famous, and heroic on this game. I\'ll be the hottest thing in soccer that Elderine seen in years. I\'ll be a walking, soccer legend! \n[NEXT]'),
(42107, 'Okay Nus, you be sure to do that okay?\n[NEXT]'),
(42108, 'Hey, where are you going? Wait a minute. \nYou know about Legend of Flame Shot? It goes like this: If one puts a Flame from Sylph in their soccer cleats, your aim and shooting power will be so accurate and powerful that no goal keeper can withstand it. \nI need it, I really do! Also I need to really bulk up before game, so could you please get me {color,yellow,2 Sylph\'s flames}, {color,yellow,20 Herb leaves, {color,yellow,1 Ram\'s ear}, {color,yellow,1 Rosemary}, and {color,yellow,5 high class spirit\'s fruits}? You got all that? Don\'t you need to write down or something?\n[BUTTON]=[Actually, this I gotta see, I\'ll be back with them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even with all that things, you can\'t possibly win that match man.][2]'),
(42109, 'Alright Nus, I got all the things. Now I gotta see if this will help your athletic abilities. Ha Ha Ha!\n[NEXT]'),
(42110, 'Okay fine [NAME], You just wait and see on my game day. You\'ll regret that you didn\'t get my autograph now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42111, 'Please!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42200, 'Bran\'s Monster Expo'),
(42201, 'Weapon Title Merchant Bran of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Flame Sylph Feather, Orc Captain\'s Armor, and 1 Spade Trumpy Lance for his Monster Expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42202, 'How have you been, [NAME].\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42203, 'I\'ve been good. How are you Bran?\n[NEXT]'),
(42204, 'Considering good. I know you are doing some extraordinary works at Uruga. I do have a quest you might be interested. What do you say?\n[NEXT]'),
(42205, 'I\'m always down for a good challenge. What is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(42206, 'You probably know that temple anniversary is coming up right? To celebrate such great day, I came up with an educational, yet entertaining venue. A Monster Expo! What do you think? It\'s an event where out children can learn about monsters and how to handle them. \nIt\'s not like we\'ll have real monsters there, but rather show off their teeth, claws and such. What do you think? Are you up for some scavenger hunt? I need: {color,yellow,Flame Sylph Feather}, {color,yellow,Orc Captain\'s armor}, and last but not least {color,yellow,Spade Trumpy Spearman\'s Lance}. I jusst need {color,yellow,one of each}. Are you up for it?\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a plan. Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I\'m just not up for it.][2]'),
(42207, 'Bran, I got all the things you need.\n[NEXT]'),
(42208, 'Wow! Such a good specimen. Thank you, good work.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42209, 'Shouldn\'t you be on your way to {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber}?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42300, 'Nina\'s Monster Expo'),
(42301, 'Item merchant Nina of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Sylph\'s Wing, 10 Red Flowers, 10 Yellow Flowers, and 10 Blue Flowers for her Monster Expo.\n(Search Forest of Slumber. Red, Yellow, and Blue Flowers can be collected by gathering flowers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42302, 'It\'s been a while, how are you?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42303, 'Nina, how are you? How\'s your business going?\n[NEXT]'),
(42304, 'It\'s going. We are so busy preparing for the monster expo though. You already know about the expo right? Whole town is pitching in to set up a great event. I do need to gather some things for it, could you help me out? I need {color,yellow,Sylph\'s wing}, and need to gather {color,yellow,10 Red Flowers}, {color,yellow,10 Yellow Flowers}, and {color,yellow,10 Blue Flowers}. Can you handle it? \n[BUTTON]=[Okay, not a problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just can\'t][2]'),
(42305, 'Nina, I got all the things you need.\n[NEXT]'),
(42306, 'Oh my, look at those beautiful flowers. You really are something.\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42307, 'I really need those decorations.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42400, 'Avon\'s Monster Expo'),
(42401, 'Healer Avon of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Blue Archon\'s Feather, 10 Violets, 10 Sages, and 10 Geraniums for his Monster Expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber. Violets, Sages, and Geraniums can be gathered from flowers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42402, '[NAME], it\'s good to see you. I\'ve been looking for you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42403, 'Avon, are you helping out expo too?\n[NEXT]'),
(42404, 'I sure am. It will be such a great educational event for the children. I can\'t miss such event.\n[NEXT]'),
(42405, 'I see, what do you exactly need Avon?\n[NEXT]'),
(42406, 'Well, I am preparing a Blue Archon special. \nI would need {color,yellow,Blue Archon\'s feather}. I would also want to teach kids about herbs. So I would need {color,yellow,10 Violets}, {color,yellow,10 Sages}, and {color,yellow,10 Geraniums}. \n[BUTTON]=[Okay, sounds good.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Man that\'s too tedious, forget it][2]'),
(42407, 'Avon, I got all the things you wanted.\n[NEXT]'),
(42408, 'Thank you, this will help so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42409, 'There should be herbs growing all over the fields.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42500, 'Karl\'s Monster Expo'),
(42501, 'Blacksmith Karl of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Tail hair of Old Archon, 10 Low Copper Ores, 10 Mid Copper Ores, and 5 of High Copper Ores for his Monster Expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber. Ores can be gathered in mines)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42502, 'Hey!! [NAME]!! Over here.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42503, 'What\'s going on Karls?\n[NEXT]'),
(42504, 'What do you think? Why don\'t you take a guess? Of course it\'s about the expo. I need some materials for it, I\'ve heard that you can help, so how about it kid?\n[NEXT]'),
(42505, 'Alright, what do you need?\n[NEXT]'),
(42506, 'I need Old Archon things. I also want to showcase the beauty of ores to the children. So I would need: {color,yellow,Tail hair of Old Archon}, {color,yellow,10 Low Copper Ores}, {color,yellow,10 Mid Copper Ores}, and {color,yellow,5 High Copper Ores}. You\'ll be paid handsomely for your service of course.\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, why not.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m just not a miner type, answer is no.][2]'),
(42507, 'Okay Karls, I got all the things you wanted.\n[NEXT]'),
(42508, 'Whahahahaha! Good job! I always can rely on you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42509, 'I got plenty of silver and ore, so please get coppers for me.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42600, 'Kenton\'s Monster Expo'),
(42601, 'Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine asks you to collect 1 pair of Diamond Trumpy\'s and 10 Glittering Jewel Powders for his monster expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42602, 'Oh hello darling, I\'ve been expecting you honey.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42603, 'I wonder why.\n[NEXT]'),
(42604, 'Don\'t be shy child, come closer, I won\'t bite, maybe just little ho ho ho ho! Anyways, you do know of monster expo no?\n[NEXT]'),
(42605, 'I actually do. You are part of it too I assume.\n[NEXT]'),
(42606, 'Of course darling, they\'ll be lost without me. \nI\'m thinking of something more fantastic then the other rural folks. Joker Trumpy special! Isn\'t it just scrumptious? \n{color,yellow,1 pair of Diamond Trumpy\'s wardrobe} is what I desire. Oh, I almost forgot, I need that little glitters to liven things up, so I need {color,yellow,10 Glittering Jewel Powders}. That\'s not so hard for someone so capable like you right darling?\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, fine, just step back okay?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Bad touch, bad touch! NOOOO!][2]'),
(42607, 'Here it is.\n[NEXT]'),
(42608, 'Bingo! You are so awesome! Thank you honey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42609, 'Would you hurry up? \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42700, 'Nus\'s Monster Expo'),
(42701, 'Guard Nus of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Elf Knight Demon\'s Cape, 1 Sncient Stonie\'s Heart, 30 HP Potions (Tier 1), and 30 HP Potions (Tier 2) for his monster expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42702, 'Oh good you are here!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42703, 'What do you want Nus?\n[NEXT]'),
(42704, 'Hey, what\'s with the attitude? I need your help on a really good cause!\n[NEXT]'),
(42705, 'I don\'t know Nus, I feel like a gopher, I mean everyone tells me to get this and that. I feel like everyone just want something from me. I mean, oh never mind, what is it that you want?\n[NEXT]'),
(42706, 'I don\'t know what you are talking about. Well, anyways, it\'s about monster expo! Isn\'t it awesome! I know you\'ll help out in such a great cause!!! I decided to showcase Elf Knight Demon and ancient Stonies! So I would need {color,yellow,Elf Knight Demon\'s cape} and {color,yellow,Ancient Stonie\'s heart}! Oh, oh, and I\'m going to give away HP potions for my little visitors. so I need {color,yellow,30 HP Potions (Tier 1)}, and {color,yellow,30 HP Potions (Tier 2)}! I believe in you!\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t we all? okay. Stay put.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d rather talk to a slime. No Nus I can\'t help you.][2]'),
(42707, 'Nus, here it is. All the things you wanted.\n[NEXT]'),
(42708, 'Thank you, thank you! I can\'t wait to see the surprised faces of childrens. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42709, 'Yes, Yes, black will be the perfect complementary color to my showcase.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42800, 'Kyle\'s Monster Expo'),
(42801, 'Storage Keeper Kyle of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Lizardman Knight\'s Tail for his monster expo. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42802, 'Hey, How y\'all doing?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42803, 'Hey Kyle, you look cheerful.\n[NEXT]'),
(42804, 'Thanks, I\'m sure it\'s all because of this new expo I\'m working on. \n[NEXT]'),
(42805, 'You are in it too huh? Is there anything I can help you out with?\n[NEXT]'),
(42806, 'You\'ll help out? Great! Geez thanks! \nI was going to show {color,yellow,Lizardman Knight\'s Tail}! So you think you can help me out?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, just wait here.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe not, I\'m sorry.][2]'),
(42807, 'Kyle, I got it! Whoa, it\'s still moving!\n[NEXT]'),
(42808, 'Thank you so much! Why look at that, it would be perfect to make a soup stock with this. Oh! You are still here! I was just joking!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42809, 'Kids will be so excited to see such tail right?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42900, 'Myzen\'s Monster Expo'),
(42901, 'Grandma Myzen of Elderine asks you to collect 1 Joker Trumpy\'s Boots, 10 Fragrant Mushrooms, 10 Chewy Meats, and 5 Rosemarys for her monster expo \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42902, '[NAME], could you come here for a second?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(42903, 'Myzen! It\'s been a while huh?\nYou look good, so I take it that you are in this expo deal too huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(42904, 'I sure am!\n[NEXT]'),
(42905, 'So, do you need anything for your showcase?\n[NEXT]'),
(42906, 'Wow, you do get to the point don\'t you?\nOkay then, could you get me {color,yellow,Joker Trumpy\'s boots}? \nI was also thinking of making treats for the children so, could I trouble you for {color,yellow,10 Fragrant Mushrooms}, {color,yellow,10 Chewy Meat}, and {color,yellow,5 Rosemarys}?\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I was just asking out of courtesy, get a clue lady.][2]'),
(42907, 'Myzen, I got all the things you needed.\n[NEXT]'),
(42908, 'Oh thank you. Here take your reward. Nice doing business with you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(42909, 'Kids just love mushroom kebabs.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43000, 'Fire Monster'),
(43001, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen asks you to collect 50 Fire Smelting Stones.\n(Search Burning Rock. Fire Smelting Stones can be obtained by defeating Fire Nix\'s, Fire Spirits, and Flame Honeyings)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43002, 'Bad fire. Is it time already to change it? Whew.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43003, 'James, how are you doing? It\'s been a while right?\n[NEXT]'),
(43004, '[NAME]! Wow, it is been a while. How have been doing?\n[NEXT]'),
(43005, 'I\'m good! I\'ve been keeping myself busy!\n[NEXT]'),
(43006, 'I bet! Wow! Look at your! You became such a strong warrrior! \nI am so proud of you! \nOh, by the way, are you able to enter Burning Rock?\n[NEXT]'),
(43007, 'Sure, I\'m pretty comfortable hunting there now.\n[NEXT]'),
(43008, 'Great! Hey can you do me a favor?\nI need to replace my fire source and I need a fire smelting stones from a flame based monsters. Would it be possible for you to get {color,yellow,50 Fire Smelting Stones}? I believe monsters like {color,yellow,Fire Nix}, {color,yellow,Fire Spirit}, and {color,yellow,Flame Honeyings} will give off such stones. \n[BUTTON]=[For you, sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can handle that yet.][2]'),
(43009, 'I got them! It\'s really hot so watch your hands!\n[NEXT]'),
(43010, 'Oh, becareful don\'t burn yourself! If you get burnt by these smeting stone, there are no available treatments!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43011, 'You got to really be careful okay?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43100, 'Tail Hair Brush'),
(43101, 'Healer Poring of Uruga asks you to collect 30 Miner Mole\'s tail hair so she can make a new paint brush.\n(Search Burning Rock. Miner Mole\'s Tail Hair can be obtained by defeating Miner Moles)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43102, 'It\'s no good, brush qualities are just so bad.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43103, 'Hey Poring, what\'s going on? Why are you throwing that painting away?\n[NEXT]'),
(43104, 'It didn\'t came out right. With such bad brush, I can\'t create a good piece of art. \nOh! [NAME], could you get me about {color,yellow, 30 Mining Mole\'s tail hair} so I can make my brush? \n[BUTTON]=[For art and you? Of course.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s not a brush\'s fault, you just got no talent!][2]'),
(43105, 'Poring! I got those hairs you wanted.\n[NEXT]'),
(43106, 'These are so soft! It\'s lovely! Thank you so much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43107, 'I\'m going to paint so many things with that new brush!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43200, 'Stranded Royden'),
(43201, 'Royden in the Swamp of Dawn asks you to defeat 100 Ping Pigs.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43202, 'Please, over here! Help me!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43203, 'Hey, what are you doing in such a dangerous place?\nThis isn\'t a place to stroll about you know.\n[NEXT]'),
(43204, 'No kidding! I\'m an explorer. I go by the name of Royden. I really wanted to find out what the big deal with this place is, and as soon as I got here, I was surrounded by those Ping Pigs! I barely kept myself alive with my supplies, but now all the potions are gone too!\n[NEXT]'),
(43205, 'How are you planning to get home then?\n[NEXT]'),
(43206, 'I don\'t know! Could you help me? I\'m tired and hungry. Could you please defeat {color,yellow,100 Ping Pigs}? \n[BUTTON]=[Okay about 100 of them would do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This is called a life lesson. Take it like a man.][2]'),
(43207, 'Alright, I got them. Why don\'t you try to make a run for it now?\n[NEXT]'),
(43208, 'Thank you so much!\nI owe you one big!\nBye!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43209, 'I\'m so hungry.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43300, 'Should\'ve really ran for it'),
(43301, 'Royden in Swamp of Dawn asks you to defeat 200 Rhinoce Lords.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43302, 'I\'m gonna die, I\'m gonna die! Help!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43303, 'Royden? Is that you? What are you still doing here?\n[NEXT]'),
(43304, 'I couldn\'t! When I was about to make a run for it, these {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lords} all jumped me! Look at these wounds! \n[NEXT]'),
(43305, 'You should\'ve really ran for it like I told you! Rhinoce Lord right?\n[NEXT]'),
(43306, 'Yes, look at them, mocking me with their crazy armor. Hey, could you defeat {color,yellow,200 Rhinoce Lords}? I should be able to break out of here! \n[BUTTON]=[Fine, but this time break out fast like you mean it okay?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Man you are hopeless, just die already.][2]'),
(43307, 'Go now! Run!\n[NEXT]'),
(43308, 'Thanks! I really won\'t forget!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43309, 'Whaaaaah! I\'m going to die here!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50010, '?????? ?????? ??????(?????? ??????)'),
(50011, '?????? ?????? ???? ?????? ?????? ?????? ??????????.\n?????? ???????? ?????? 10???? ?????????? ??????.\n(???? ??????)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50012, '????????!!\n[BUTTON]=[?????? ????][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50013, '(????... ????????)\n??, ???? ?????????! ??????!!\n[NEXT]'),
(50014, '?? ??????... ??????...!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(50015, '?????? ?????\n???!\n?????? ???? ??????????! ??... ???? ?????? ?? ?????????\n[NEXT]'),
(50016, '?? ?????? ????!! ????... ?????? ???? ?????? ?????? ???? ????????????... ??????~!! ?? ????~!\n[NEXT]'),
(50017, '????... ???????? ????????? ????... ?? ???????? ???? ?????????? ???????? ???? ????????. \n???????? ?????? ???? ???????? ???????\n[NEXT]'),
(50018, '????, ?? ???? ???? ?????? ?????????? ???? ???? ??????, ???? ?????? ???? ???? ???? ????????.\n?????? ?????? ?????? ???? ??????... ?? ???? ???????? ??????.\n???? ?????? ?????? ?????????? ???????? ????. ??... \n???????????? ???????? ???? ???????? ????????, ???? ?????? ?????\n[BUTTON]=[???? ????????????! ???? ??????!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[???? ?? ???? ?????? ??. ???? ?????? ???? ???? ????????.][2]'),
(50019, '??????! ???? ???? 10???? ?????? ??????!!\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(50020, '??????! 10???? ??????????. ????????.\n??... ?????? ?????? ???????? ?????? ???? ?????????? ???? ????????. \n10???? ?????? ???? ???? ?????? ???? ?????????\n[BUTTON]=[????????. ????????.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[???? ???? ???? ?????? ?? ???????][2]\n[MENU]'),
(50021, '??, ?? ???? ?????? ???? ?? ??????... \n[BUTTON]=[????][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50100, 'King\'s Chocolate (Event Quest)'),
(50101, 'Storage Keeper Raina wants to eat the \'King\'s Chocolate\', a snack of a mighty monster! Deliver the \'King\'s Chocolate\' to Storage Keeper Raina. (You can find chocolate from any monster around your level.)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50102, 'Ah... chocolate! I want to eat the King\'s Chocolate!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50103, 'King\'s Chocolate?\n[NEXT]'),
(50104, 'Oh, were you listening?\nHmm...  My favorite hobby is eating rare chocolates and\nthere\'s a rumor about the \'King\'s Chocolate\', that only mighty monsters can have.\nSince I heard that rumor yesterday, I can\'t get the \'King\'s Chocolate\' out of mind... what should I do?\n[NEXT]'),
(50105, 'What do you mean? Just get it...\n[NEXT]'),
(50106, 'Well... It\'s not that easy.\nIt\'s a chocolate that only a boss monster has so it\'ll be pretty tough to get.\nIt\'s not your average Joe Schmoe monster. It\'s a very strong mighty boss monster.\n[BUTTON]=[If it\'s for you, Raina, I will be glad to get that chocolate for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... that\'s too bad.][2]'),
(50107, 'Hey Raina! Here you go! I got the King\'s Chocolate for you!\nLook at this!  Doesn\'t it look delicious?\n[NEXT]'),
(50108, 'Good gracious! You really did it!\nThank you! Finally, I can eat the King\'s Chocolate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50109, 'Ah...  chocolate...  It\'s making me fat..\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50200, 'Vietree\'s Chocolate (Event Quest)'),
(50201, 'Chief designer, Vietree, didn\'t settle down that long ago in Roumen. She would like to give gifts of chocolate to Roumen residents.\nTake 50 Mousse Chocolates and 1 Truffle Chocolate to Vietree. (You can find both chocolates from any monster around your level. Be aware that Truffles are harder to find!)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50202, 'Hello?  We have seen each other before, right?\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Begin][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50203, 'Oh, yes! We have seen each other several times!\nI guess you haven\'t been here long enough, right?\nGlad to meet you.  I am [NAME].\nPlease enjoy your new home.\n[NEXT]'),
(50204, 'Thank you! I should have greeted you before. Sorry about that. By the way, I know this is our first time chatting but,\ndo you know a place where I can buy some chocolate?\nI would like to hand out some chocolates to Roumen residents.\n[NEXT]'),
(50205, 'Hmm...  I have never seen a store that sells chocolates,\nbut I am pretty sure that you can get it from a monster.\n[NEXT]'),
(50206, 'Oh, really?\nI thought I could buy Mousse Chocolates and Truffle Chocolates... but they don\'t sell them at the store.\nHmm...  I was going to give a Truffle Chocolate to Chief Roumenus who helped me settle in Roumen...\nWhat should I do?\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... I can help you?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That chocolate makes you fat!  Forget it.][2]'),
(50207, 'Hey, Vietree!  I got all chocolates that you need!\n50 Mousse Chocolates and 1 Truffle Chocolate.  Is it enough?\n[NEXT]'),
(50208, 'Thank goodness! You were pretty fast. You are great!\nThank you so much! Here is your reward...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50209, 'Ah...  I\'m liking the Mousse Chocolates...\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50300, 'Vietree\'s Chocolate 2 (Event Quest)'),
(50301, 'Chief designer, Vietree, didn\'t settle down that long ago in Roumen. She would like to give gifts of chocolate to Roumen residents.\nTake 50 Mousse Chocolates to Vietree.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50302, 'I would appreciate your help a lot.\nIf it\'s ok, may I ask for more chocolate?\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Begin][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50303, 'Chocolate?  Sure!  Monster drop a lot of chocolate these days.\n[NEXT]'),
(50304, 'Hmm...  I would prefer Mousse Chocolates.  The more the better! Can you bring 50 Mousse Chocolates?\n[BUTTON]=[Piece of cake!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Too much! You are bothering me!][2]'),
(50305, 'Vietree! Here are your 50 Mousse Chocolates!\n[NEXT]'),
(50306, 'Wow!  You were really fast.\nThank you.  Want to get me more?\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will be right back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think I did enough.][2]\n[MENU]'),
(50307, 'If it is too much for you, you can quit at anytime.  So don\'t worry.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43400, 'Essential gift'),
(43401, 'Once you become Lv. 10, Roumen town chief, Roumenous promised an essential gift for the journey.\nYou must visit the item merchant, Pey after you reach Lv. 10.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43402, 'Hello chief!  Oh I\'m beat... could I rest here for a bit?  My legs are killing me.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43403, 'Sure, of course...  Legs bothering you, huh?  I don\'t blame you.  I mean, walking around such a big land...  Have you heard of "Movers"?  I guess you\'re not ready to ride those yet, huh? \n[NEXT]'),
(43404, 'Yeah, I\'ve heard you have to be at least Lv. 20 to ride one of those.  I\'m just not there yet...\n[NEXT]'),
(43405, 'I see... You know, I\'ll give you a special gift.  \nInterested?  When you get to Lv. 10, why don\'t you go see Pey.\n[BUTTON]=[Lv. 10? Okay sounds good.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Forget it.  Leave me alone][2]'),
(43406, 'Excuse me Miss Pey!\nChief Roumenous told me to visit you when I become Lv. 10.\n[NEXT]'),
(43407, 'Oh it\'s you!\nChief Roumenous told me to take care of this special adventurer.  I didn\'t know it was you.  \nHere, try this on.  It\'s a great mover, so take a good care of it.\nDon\'t forget to buy a better mover when you get to Lv. 20 though, okay?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43408, 'Have you reached Lv. 10 yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43500, 'Reward for Perseverance and Passion'),
(43501, 'Roumen town chief, Roumenous wants to test your perseverance and passion.\nLet\'s visit him when you reach Lv. 20.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43502, 'Wow, you\'ve already reached Lv. 10.\nGreat job!  However, one just can\'t be satisfied with Lv. 10.  Don\'t you agree?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43503, 'Yeah, I know what you mean.\nUmm... what\'s on your mind?\n[NEXT]'),
(43504, 'I want to give you a goal to shoot for.\nRight now, you are young and filled with desire, but soon you might fall into that same old routine...\nThere are some people who just give up before even reaching Lv. 20.  \nI believe in you, please come and visit me when you reach Lv. 20.  I know you can do it.\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. I\'ll be Lv. 20 in no time.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Lv. 20?  Forget it...][2]'),
(43505, 'Chief!  I became Lv. 20, look!\nSee I told you I can do it.\n[NEXT]'),
(43506, 'Wonderful!  You kept your promise.  \nThank you, I just knew you could do it.\nHere, it\'s an item that\'ll blow your mind away.\nPlease take it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43507, 'How is it going?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43600, 'Perfect Adventurer'),
(43601, 'Elderine Guard Captain Shutian is asking me to reach Lv. 30.  \nLet\'s see if we can do it!\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43602, 'Oh, are you on a quest?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43603, 'Oh, Captain Shutian!  How have you been?  I\'ve been doing great.\n[NEXT]'),
(43604, 'Hmm, that\'s good to hear.\nThere are some weaklings who whine about adventures being too tough.  However, you are different breed.  \nI\'ll give you some advice though.  \nTo become a perfect adventurer, one must be relentless.\nAlso, you should have good judgment, and be ready.  \nFor example, you need to study what skills and stats that are available to you, and follow the one that suits you.\nDo you understand what I mean?\n[NEXT]'),
(43605, 'Yes sir!\nTo be ready for anything right?\n[NEXT]'),
(43606, 'Ha Ha Ha!  Your are right!\nThat\'s the spirit!\nOkay then,  when you reach Lv. 30, come back and see me.\nCan you do that?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, don\'t worry!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nah, that\'s not my thing.][2]'),
(43607, 'Captain!  I\'ve reached Lv. 30!\n[NEXT]'),
(43608, 'Oh, amazing.  You are good...  I\'ve never seen anyone get there that fast!\nI\'m very proud of you.\nHere, take this.  I\'ve been preparing this as a your Lv. 30 gift.  \nI just wanted to teach you that when you prepare and work at it, you can achieve anything.  \nHowever, sometimes we do make mistakes.  This item is for such occasions.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43609, 'When you are tired, and want to quit...  Imagine a more brave and fierce self.  That is your destiny.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43700, 'Guard Captain Shutian\'s Apple Cider (Event Quest)'),
(43701, 'Guard Captain Shutian wants to make apple cider for his \nSt. Patrick\'s Day party tonight. But there\'s a problem! \nA leprechuan has come and stolen all of the apples and \ngave them to the monsters! (Kill any monster and find\nhis apples)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43702, 'My apples! I need to make cider in time for the party!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43703, 'Mmm, I am a bit thirsty...\n[NEXT]'),
(43704, 'Oh, you can help? A leprechaun has stolen my apples and\ngave them to the monsters in exchange to help protect\nhis gold! \nI have a party tonight and I need those apples! Do you\nthink you\'re lucky enough to find all my apples?\n[NEXT]'),
(43705, 'Well, it won\'t be easy but I\'m pretty sure I can find \nthem. Those monsters won\'t be so lucky if i\'m wearing\na 4-Leaf Clover...\n[NEXT]'),
(43706, 'Ah good, find my apples and I shall reward you well.\nI\'ll be needing 50 apples to make just enough cider\nfor everyone in Elderine. Now go off and get me those\napples!\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll gladly find those apples and we can celebrate together!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not if you\'re going to be THAT demanding...][2]'),
(43707, 'Guard Captain Shutian! I found all of the apples! Now\nyou can make your cider and we can all celebrate!\n[NEXT]'),
(43708, 'Wow, you really did it! Now we can celebrate\nSt. Patrick\'s Day! Mmm, I hope you\'re thirsty?\nI make the best cider in Isya! Just don\'t drink too\nmuch...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43709, 'Oh no, too much cider makes me have to use the restroom!\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43710, 'Yeah, I\'ve heard stories about those little guys. They can be pretty mean, Shutian! [NEXT]'),
(43711, 'You\'re telling me! I have to prepare for that party tonight and I need my key ingredient! Do you think you\'re lucky enough to find all my apples?\n[NEXT]'),
(43800, 'Easter Egg Hunt'),
(43801, 'Element Helper Remi of Roumen asks you to find 30 Easter Eggs.\n(Easter Eggs can be found by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43802, 'Oh no! The children will be heart-broken without an Easter Egg Hunt!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43803, 'I must help the children...\n[NEXT]'),
(43804, '[NAME], What will I ever do? The Easter\nEgg Hunt is soon and clumsy Kid Woz dropped all of the eggs and broke them!\nNow I have nothing to use for the hunt!\nI really need those eggs... \n[NEXT]'),
(43805, 'Well, it won\'t be easy! But I\'m pretty sure I can find them. \n[NEXT]'),
(43806, 'Please! I\'m begging you! Can you find me {color,yellow,30 Easter Eggs}?\nOnly you can make the children happy!\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I\'ll help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Those kids deserve nothing!][2]'),
(43807, 'I\'ve gathered all of the eggs!\nNow you can have your Easter Egg Hunt and all the children will be happy!\n[NEXT]'),
(43808, 'Thank you so much! \nTake this reward and good luck on your journey!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43809, 'Where\'s my {color,yellow,Easter Eggs}?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53300, 'The Wedding Planner 1 (Event Quest)'),
(53301, 'Vietree of Roumen asks you to collect 20 Isya Blossoms so she can \ndecorate the Blessed Garden.\n(Isya Blossoms can be obtained by gathering flowers)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53302, '[NAME]! I\'m glad you\'re here! Do you think you can help me out?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53303, 'Of course I can. What\'s up?\n[NEXT]'),
(53304, 'Great! Love is in the air and I\'m the official wedding planner of Isya.\nSo far everything seems to be in order except for the shipment of\n{color,yellow,Isya Blossoms}. They never arrived!\n[NEXT]'),
(53305, 'So... what do you want me to do? Can\'t we just go buy some?\n[NEXT]'),
(53306, 'It\'s not that easy. {color,yellow,Isya Blossoms} are fairly rare. \n[NEXT]'),
(53307, 'You may be able to find some out in the field. Do you think you can\ngather {color,yellow,20 Isya Blossoms for me}?  \n[BUTTON]=[Of course I can!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to get my hands dirty.][2]'),
(53308, 'Hey Vietree! I\'ve gathered all {color,yellow,20 Isya Blossoms}. They sure do smell great!\n[NEXT]'),
(53309, 'Thank you! Finally, we can get started with the decorations. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53310, 'Have you collected  {color,yellow,20 Isya Blossoms yet}?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53400, 'The Wedding Planner 2 (Event Quest)'),
(53401, 'Vietree of Roumen asks you to collect 30 Isya Blossoms so she can \ndecorate the Blessed Garden.\n(Isya Blossoms can be obtained by gathering flowers)\n(Repeatable Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53402, 'Welcome back [NAME]! Are you here to help me out with the \ndecorations?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53403, 'Sure. What do you need help with?\n[NEXT]'),
(53404, 'As a matter of fact, I think I need more {color,yellow,Isya Blossoms}. Do you think you have enough time to collect {color,yellow,30} more for me?\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What? You need more?][2]'),
(53405, 'Vietree!  I found more {color,yellow,Isya blossoms}!  Here you go!\n[NEXT]'),
(53406, 'These are even more beautiful than the last group you brought!  Thank you so much!  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53407, 'Have you collected  {color,yellow,30 Isya Blossoms yet}?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(22750, 'Let There Be Cake 1 (Event Quest)'),
(22751, 'Vietree of Roumen asks you to help her bake a cake. Gather 1 Happy Seed, 5 Cups of Flour, and 5 Roumen Eggs. \n(Happy Seeds can be found by gathering flowers. Roumen Eggs and Flour can be found by defeating monsters.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22752, 'This is a disaster!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(22753, 'What\'s wrong Vietree?\n[NEXT]'),
(22754, 'What does it matter? I\'m Depraved!!! Depraved!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(22755, 'I might be able to help you if you tell me whats wrong.\n[NEXT]'),
(22756, 'Okay, well there\'s a birthday party coming up soon and I\'m in charge of baking the cake. \n[NEXT]'),
(22757, 'That sounds great! \n[NEXT]'),
(22758, 'No wait! Let me finish!\nIt turns out that more people are coming than I expected! Now I don\'t have enough ingredients to bake a cake to feed everyone!\n[NEXT]'),
(22759, 'Oh dear, what will you do?\n[NEXT]'),
(22760, 'Well, If you really want to help me, do you think you can find {color,yellow,5 Roumen Eggs}, {color,yellow,5 Cups of Flour}, and {color,yellow,1 Happy Seed}?\nIf you help me, I\'ll guarantee you a slice!\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be back ASAP!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like cake.][2]'),
(22761, 'Vietree! I\'m back! I have all the ingredients!\n[NEXT]'),
(22762, 'Thank you very much! I can now bake more cakes for everyone! Here [NAME]... take this, I made it just for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(22763, 'Cool! A mini cake! SWEET!!!\n\n[EMOTION][9]\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22764, 'It doesn\'t look like you have all the ingredients I requested. Please hurry!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(22850, 'Let There Be Cake 2 (Event Quest)'),
(22851, 'Vietree of Roumen asks you to help her bake a cake. Gather 1 Happy Seed, 5 Cups of Flour, and 5 Roumen Eggs. \n(Happy Seeds can be found by gathering flowers. Roumen Eggs and Flour can be found by defeating monsters.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22852, 'I still have a big order to fill though. Are you willing to help bring me more ingredients?  \n[BUTTON]=[Sure! I\'ve got a big sweet tooth. Count me in!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way! I am trying to watch my weight!][2]\n[MENU]'),
(22853, 'It doesn\'t look like you have all the ingredients I requested. Please hurry!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23260, 'Myzen\'s Halloween Bash (Event Quest)'),
(23261, 'Grandma Myzen of Elderine asks you to collect 50 Lantern Souls for her annual Halloween Bash.\n(Lantern Souls can be obtained by defeating monsters) \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n'),
(23262, '[NAME]!  Great timing!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)(Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23263, 'What do you mean?\n[NEXT]'),
(23264, 'Well, Halloween is just around the corner you know?  I\'ve been thinking about carving some pumpkins. What do you think? \n[NEXT]'),
(23265, 'Really? I think that\'s awesome!\nYou must be a Jack O\'Lantern master huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(23266, 'You\'re too kind! Listen, in order to create the perfect Jack O\' Lantern, I\'ll require {color,yellow,Lantern Souls}.  I\'ll need {color,yellow,50} of those.  If you collect them for me, I\'ll give you a Pumpkin Head or my famous Special Pumpkin Pudding in return!  So, what do you say?\n[BUTTON]=[You got a deal!  I\'ll be back soon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks! I\'m busy!][2]'),
(23267, 'Myzen! I\'ve collected  all {color,yellow,50 Lantern Souls}!\nIt\'s luminous glow is so beautiful!\n[NEXT]'),
(23268, 'Wow, that was fast! Thanks [NAME]! I can always rely on you.\nPlease choose your reward.\nI could always use more {color,yellow,Lantern Souls}. Would you mind collecting {color,yellow,50} more for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a deal! I\'ll be back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I\'m a little busy.][2]\n\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(23269, 'Go get\'em!  The more the merrier!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23270, 'Zach\'s Halloween Bash (Event Quest)'),
(23271, 'Weapon Title Merchant Zach asks you to bring him Special Pumpkin Puddings. \n(Special Pumpkin Puddings can be obtained by completeing Myzen\'s Halloween Bash quest).\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n '),
(23272, 'There\'s my favorite student!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23273, 'Hey Zach! What\'s going on?\n[NEXT]'),
(23274, 'That\'s SIR ZACH to you [Name]!\nAnyways, I\'m hosting a Halloween Bash and I\'m in need of tasty desserts. \n[NEXT]'),
(23275, 'What kind of desserts?\n[NEXT]'),
(23276, 'I\'ve heard that Grandma Myzen makes a delicious Special Pumpkin Pudding. Everyone\'s been raving about it. I\'d ask her for one but I\'m very busy right now. Hey [NAME], could you do me a favor and bring me {color,yellow,5 Special Pumpkin Puddings}? I\'ll reward you with something special when you return.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay you got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks.][2]'),
(23277, 'Here you go Zach! \n[NEXT]'),
(23278, 'This is some delicious pudding! The texture! The taste! I\'m in pumpkin heaven!\nThank you!\n[NEXT]'),
(23279, 'You ate one!? I thought you needed 5!\n[NEXT]'),
(23280, 'Don\'t worry [NAME]!  Here, take this.\n[NEXT]'),
(23281, 'I wonder what that pudding actually tastes like. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23282, 'Where\'s my pudding?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(22950, 'Amateur Fighter\'s Insignia'),
(22951, 'Shutian, the guard captain of Elderine is giving novice adventurers a task. \nThey must pass the Amateur Fighter\'s test and earn the Insignia \n(Join the Warrior\'s Code- Amateur Fighter Kingdom Quest.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22952, 'I do feel the strong potential of a great warrior in you. \nHowever, potential alone does not make you a hero. \nThat reminds me... There is this trial, that will benefit you. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1] \n[MENU] '),
(22953, 'Trial?  What kind of trial?  It isn\'t too dangerous is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(22954, 'Well, it all depends on how committed you are to the cause...\nWe all pitched in and prepared an arena for this trial. Sometimes there isn\'t any better ways to measure your skills until you have battled it out.\nI believe you are ready to take on such quest.\nSo what do you say? Would you like to try out for Apprentice Fighter\'s trial?\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready! Let\'s get it on!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope, I still need to work on my skills...][2]'),
(22955, '(Panting) Shutian! \nI\'ve passed the trial! Look I\'ve earned the Amateur Fighter\'s Insignia! \n[NEXT] '),
(22956, 'I knew you could do it! \nI must say, I do have a knack for sorting out good potentials! \nWell, let me see that insignia. \nYou did well, you should collect your reward. \nBy the way, if you take on the trial again and bring back the insignia, I\'ll make it worth your time. What do you say? \n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22957, 'You do know what a Kingdom Quest is... Right? \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(23050, 'Brave Warrior\'s Insignia'),
(23051, 'Chief Adrian of Uruga, has prepared a trial for the budding adventurers. \nYou must pass the Brave Warrior\'s trial and bring back its insignia. \n(Join the Warrior\'s Code- Brave Warrior Kingdom Quest.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23052, '[NAME], you really are fast learner!  Your indomitable spirit is simply amazing!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23053, 'You are too kind.  I still have more to learn.\n[NEXT]'),
(23054, 'Hmph... Do you really think so? \nWell, I have a proposal to make. \nDo you know about the Brave Warrior\'s trial? \nWell, I\'m sure you already do... Complete the trial, and bring the Brave Warrior\'s Insignia back. \nI\'m sure, such a humble yet strong warrior such as yourself, will have no trouble taking on such a task. \n[BUTTON]=[Well, sure no problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe next time. I just can\'t now...][2]'),
(23055, 'Adrian!  I have finished and met your request!\nIt wasn\'t easy...\n[NEXT]'),
(23056, 'I knew you could do it, [NAME]! \nCongratulations. \nThis is a gift for you. You have met my request, it\'s only natural to claim the prize. Also, if you have an itch to take on the Brave Warrior\'s trial again and bring back its insignia. I\'ll definitely reward you for it. You got it? \n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23057, '...What is it? Do you not know that the Brave Warrior\'s Trial is a Kingdom Quest? \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(23150, 'Valiant Warrior\'s Insignia'),
(23151, 'Chief Adrian of Uruga, has a strong attachment towards the Trials Arena. \nYou must successfully pass the Valiant Warrior\'s trial and bring back its insignia \n(Join the Warrior\'s Code- Valiant Warrior Kingdom Quest.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD] '),
(23152, 'Hello [NAME],\nI\'m always thankful for all your contributions to the cause.\nI have a request to ask you... Well, it is about Valiant Warrior\'s trial\nYou do know that you\'ve earned your right to enter the Valiant Warrior\'s trial right?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23153, 'I know you always strive to become a formidable force in the cause. That is why each chief of the towns created such trials, to find someone like you. \nAs you\'ve probably already experienced first hand, trial isn\'t easy... \nHowever, it is necessary to rake out the best. \nWould you take on the Valiant Warrior\'s trials, and bring its insignia back to me? \n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I got this!][1] \n[BUTTON]=[Frankly, I don\'t think I can handle it just yet.][2] '),
(23154, 'You have done it! I knew you could do it. \nYou always can take on the trial again, if you do, please bring the insignia back. \nChance will be on your side. \n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23155, 'Do you know where trial is held at? \nPress the Kingdom Quest button and find out.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23250, 'Invincible Hero\'s Insignia'),
(23251, 'Item Merchant Nina is proud of her involvement in the trials.  You must take on the Invincible Hero\'s trial and bring the insignia back\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23252, 'Not too long ago, great chiefs of each major town got together and dreamed up a trial arena to sort out a champion.\nThat was the root of the Warrior\'s Code.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(23253, 'I was blissful to find out that my input can help out our great cause!\nOf course the outcome from all these trials are more important than our initial dreams...\n[NAME], would you take on the Invincible Hero\'s trial and bring the insignia back?\nI believe you are ready to take on such trial, I know this won\'t be an easy task but... I think you are ready.\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! I\'ll be back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I\'ll survive such trial... ][2]'),
(23254, 'You are back!  Did you pass all the trials?\nWell, did you bring the Invincible Hero\'s Insignia back?\nYou certainly are the champion of the champions!  We finally found someone worthy of such a deed!\nPlease if you are up to it, you can always take on the trial again and bring another insignia back!  It will proudly show what you are made out of!\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(23255, 'Huh?  Trial Arena?  Did you try the Kingdom Quest yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62300, 'Dragon\'s Relic 1'),
(62301, 'Give Town Chief Adrian\'s letter to Skill Master Cyburn.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62302, 'Oh... {color,yellow,[NAME].} I was waiting for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62303, 'For me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62304, 'Yes. Um,. Please don\'t ask further questions, and take this letter to {color,yellow,Skill Master Cyburn}.  Go to {color,yellow,Cyburn} right away. {color,yellow,Cyburn} will tell you the details.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds urgent,. I will leave right away,.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ask someone else...][2]'),
(62305, 'Skill Master Cyburn!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62306, 'What\'s going on?\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62307, 'It\'s Skill Master Cyburn. Please hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62400, 'Dragon\'s Relic 2'),
(62401, 'Listen to Skill Master Cyburn about the details of Town Chief Adrian\'s letter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62402, '{color,yellow,Town Chief Adrian} told me to give this to you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62403, 'Hm.. Okay. Let me see it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62404, 'What\'s written there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62405, 'Ah.. It\'s about the mysterious noise coming from {color,yellow,near the Uruga village} for the past few days. First he thought it was one of the monsters living near Uruga that was making the noise. But the noise kept increasing in numbers.  So he started searching for the monster near Uruga. But none of the monsters were making that noise.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62406, 'In the middle of the search for the monster making noise near Uruga. There was this adventurer who claimed that he heard the exact same noise {color,yellow,near the Dragon\'s Relic}. First he didn\'t believe him.. but the adventurer said the noise repeated in a timely interval. \nIt\'s written here that {color,yellow,the Dragon\'s Relic,.} needs investigation. It says that the adventurer went to the Dragon\'s Relic to find the source of the mysterious noise, but the entrance was locked.  It seems like they\'re even experiencing a slight earthquake near the place recently. It is important to investigate the place where the noise is originating from, but the entrance is locked. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(62407, ' I\'ve also went past the Dragon\'s Relic. But never heard any noise.\nBy the way.. The size of the Dragon\'s Relic was pretty big.. Was it a dragon with huge power?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62408, 'Ah.. According to the legend, {color,yellow, inside the relic lies the Chief of Dungeon Cornelius who became a slave of the God of War Enide}. He was a pitiful being who wasn\'t able to control the enormous power he possessed... and ended up in destruction.\nHm.. There is no possible way to investigate the Dragon\'s Relic at the moment... All we can do is wait.\nI will help out.. But the best way to investigate is to get inside the Dragon\'s Relic. Anyhow, there is no way to do that right now.  First, tell {color,yellow,Town Chief Adrian} that I am willing to cooperate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I see. I will let him know right away. ][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do I have to tell him right now?][2]'),
(62409, 'Town Chief Adrian!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62410, '.........\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62500, 'Dragon\'s Relic 3'),
(62501, 'After talking to Skill Master Cyburn, go to Town Chief Adrian and receive the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62502, 'Oh~ You\'re here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62503, 'Yes.. {color,yellow,Skill Master Cyburn} said that he will cooperate with your investigation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62504, 'Ah.. He will cooperate? Well done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62505, 'I guess my task here is done. Farewell.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62506, 'Oh.. Wait.{color,yellow,[NAME]}! I have another favor to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62507, 'To me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62508, 'Yes.. You are the only one suitable for this task, {color,yellow,[NAME]}. Have you heard the story about {color,yellow, the Dragon\'s Relic from Cyburn}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62509, 'Yes,. I have heard.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62510, 'It\'s about the Dragon\'s Relic... Not long ago... This was found near {color,yellow,Dragon\'s Relic}. It looks like a {color,yellow,necklace}... But mysteriously, the markings here are same as the markings on the entrance of the Dragon\'s Relic. So I was wondering...If this is {color,yellow,related to the Dragon\'s Relic}.\nI\'m not completely sure... But if... This actually is related the Dragon\'s Relic. I would like you to {color,yellow,investigate} {color,yellow,inside the Dragon\'s Relic}, {color,yellow,[NAME].} No one knows what\'s inside the relic, so I\'m thinking there might be trouble. For your safety, please investigate the place along with some of your trustworthy friends.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62511, 'It\'s the Dragon\'s Relic. The place is very dangerous. So take your friends along.\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62600, 'Tainted Holy Ground 1'),
(62601, 'Monsters started to plague the Dragon\'s Tomb.\nYou must exterminate 250 Flame Spirits\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62602, 'Hello Maxuter. \nI heard very odd sounding cries on the way here... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1] \n[MENU] '),
(62603, 'Yes. \nIt was probably coming from the... Dragon\'s Tomb... \nIt was once a holy place for dragons to prepare for their final rest. \nHowever, now it is plagued with monsters ever since that dark evil force started to drench the place. \nI have a favor to ask you. There are {color,yellow,\'Dungeon Flame Sprits\'} near the entrance of the tomb. Would you exterminate them for me? \n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I got this!][1] \n[BUTTON]=[No, sorry I have no plan to go there][2] '),
(62604, 'Oh you are back! \nI was worried something might have happened to you [NAME], so I dispatched some patrols. \nYou\'ve got them... Thank you. \nPlease take this reward for your service and trouble. I believe it is my destiny to protect the Dragon\'s Tomb, learn its history and spread their message. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62605, 'Good luck, we will cover your back.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62700, 'Tainted Holy Ground 2'),
(62701, 'Monsters started to plague Dragon\'s Tomb.\nYou must exterminate 15 Giant Magmatons\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62702, 'Maxuter, those horrible cries... It won\'t stop. \nDo you think monsters still plague the Dragon\'s Tomb? \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1] \n[MENU] '),
(62703, 'It seems so.\nMany adventurers are dispatched to exterminate the monsters, but we are desperately short in numbers.\nI\'ve heard even the {color,yellow,Dungeon Giant Magmatons} were sighted.\nWould you lend your hand to exterminate these foul beasts?\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s roll!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks not this time][2]'),
(62704, 'You are back! \nI heard about the seriousness of the infestation... Many adventurers have returned seriously injured or suffered the worst fate... Thank you for returning safe. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62705, 'Sighs... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(62800, 'Tainted Holy Ground 3'),
(62801, 'Monsters started to plague the Dragon\'s Tomb.\nYou must exterminate 50 Dungeon Nerpas, 50 Dungeon Caravans, 30 Dungeon Fire Shella, and 15 Dungeon Fire Titans\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62802, 'Maxuter? \n(He\'s not in a good mood...) \nWhat\'s wrong? \nIs it about the Dragon\'s Tomb? \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1] \n[MENU] '),
(62803, 'Ah, [NAME]... \nI was about to form and dispatch a reconnaissance party. I would like to ask you to partake in this party. \nI have located the evil spirits that plague the Dragon\'s Tomb. Evil force in such a holy place... \nI will not stand for this! Please exterminate {color,yellow,50 Dungeon Nerpas, 50 Dungeon Caravans, 30 Dungeon Fire Shella, and 15 Dungeon Fire Titans}! \n[BUTTON]=[That\'s a lot of monsters, Yeah let\'s get them together!][1] \n[BUTTON]=[No, too many... I just can\'t handle it][2] '),
(62804, 'You are safe! They were such terrifying monsters. \nThere were many causalities, but we pulled if off. \nWhew... It\'s a never ending battle isn\'t it? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62805, 'Let\'s do this!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62900, 'Tainted Holy Ground 4'),
(62901, 'Monsters started to plague the Dragon\'s Tomb.\nYou must exterminate 60 Dungeon Gargoyles, and 15 Dungeon Weasels.\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62902, 'That tomb is still plagued with monsters... \nWhy are you so attached to the Dragon\'s Tomb Maxuter? \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1] \n[MENU]'),
(62903, 'Attached... Yes, I guess I am attached to it. \nTo tell you the truth, I used to despise anything old and antique... My father was an archeologist... He used to search for dragons, Hellgaites, and any signs of ancient elves... \nMy father neglected his family because he was too involved with his work. \nTo make the story short, I hated what he had chosen over me... \nHis ultimate holy grail was the Dragon\'s Relic... \nHe died before he found it. I guess you can say that he spent his entire life searching for it. \nI\'m not really sure why I\'m so attached to this Dragon\'s Tomb. I think my relationship with this \nDragon\'s Tomb has passed the point of being attached and more of an obligation to protect it. \nWell, enough of my sentimental stories... \nThere are more serious matters to attend to. At the tomb, news of Dungeon Gargoyles and Dungeon Weasel sightings have been reported. Please lend a hand to exterminate them. \n[BUTTON]=[You got it. Leave it to me!][1] \n[BUTTON]=[No, I\'ll pass on this.][2] '),
(62904, 'It was an honor to see you in action!\nYou certainly are a brave warrior!\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62905, 'Let\'s go!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63000, 'Tainted Holy Ground 5'),
(63001, 'Monsters started to plague the Dragon\'s Tomb.  \nYou must survey the dragon that reside deep in the tomb.\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63002, '[NAME], did you happen to see a monster that resembled a dragon when we went on the mission last time? \nI just can\'t believe it. A dragon... walking amongst us... \n(Maxuter is shivering with clenched fist) \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1] \n[MENU]'),
(63003, 'I don\'t know much about them... \nI suppose we will have to ask Adrian about it. \nI thought I was hallucinating but others claimed to have seen it too. \nPlease, I need to know more about it, could you deliverer this letter to Chief Adrian? \nI\'ll try to find more about it from the merchants too. \n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I got it.][1] \n[BUTTON]=[No.][2] '),
(63004, 'Adrian! I have an important letter from Maxuter! \n[NEXT] '),
(63005, 'Important letter? \nLet\'s see. \n... \n... \nHmm... I see. \nDragon... have... resurrected \n[NAME], please wait for a second, I will write a reply. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63006, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63100, 'Tainted Holy Ground 6'),
(63101, 'You have received a reply letter from Adrian. You must deliverer it to Maxuter. (Epic Quest) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD] '),
(63102, 'Here it is.  Please hurry!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63103, 'Maxouter!\nI have a reply from Adrian!\nHere!\n[NEXT]'),
(63104, 'Ah! \nThank you, let\'s see! \n... \n... ... \nI see... that\'s what happened... \nThat dragon is called... \'Phantom Cornelius\'... \nThe misfortunate dragon that led to the fall of the dragons... \nHe has resurrected. \n[NAME], we must do something about it. We have to raise army and stand against Phantom Cornelius. Defeat Phantom Cornelius and retrieve the \'Dragon\'s Tear\' that contains the essence of the dragon clan. \nWhen you are ready, talk to me again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63105, 'You must go to the frontline.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63200, 'Tainted Holy Ground 7'),
(63201, 'You have learned about the mysterious dragon. \nDefeat \'Phantom Cornelius\' \n(Epic Quest) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD] '),
(63202, 'Are you ready to take on the dragon? \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1] \n[MENU] '),
(63203, 'Please defeat {color,yellow,\'Phantom Cornelius\'} that led to the fall of the dragons and bring back its {color,yellow, Dragon\'s Tear}!\nIt won\'t be an easy task.  You should party up with other adventurers.\nI am in dept to you.\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry, I\'ll be back! ][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Whew... It\'s too much for me ][2]'),
(63204, 'You have done it. \nPlease let me see the Dragon\'s Tear. \nI\'m sure the dragon is asleep permanently... \n... \nThis dragon, used to hold immense power in its time. \nAccording to the record, this dragon... {color,yellow,\'Cornelius\' has waged war against its own kind}. He bares rages, darkness of dragon clan in its soul... \nIt\'s disturbing to see that such a dark natured dragon has resurrected and others did not... \nIt\'s hard to bare the duty of protecting the Dragon\'s Relics, but I will certainly continue my struggles. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63205, 'Dragon\'s Tear contains its power, memories and rage... \nMay power of good protect you. \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(24150, 'Roumen\'s Thanksgiving Feast (Event Quest)'),
(24151, 'Town Chief Roumenus of Roumen asks you to collect 150 Turkey Legs for his Thanksgiving dinner. \n(Turkey Legs can be obtained by defeating monsters).\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24152, '[NAME]!  Great timing!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24153, 'Hey Chief! How\'s it going?\n[NEXT]'),
(24154, 'Thanksgiving is near and I need some turkey legs to prepare for our feast.\n[NEXT]'),
(24155, 'Am I invited?\n[NEXT]'),
(24156, 'Of course you are, [NAME]! But on one condition. You need to collect  {color,yellow,150 Turkey Legs}! I have all of Isya to feed! Are you up for the challenge?\n[BUTTON]=[You got a deal!  I\'ll be back soon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks! I\'m busy!][2]'),
(24157, 'Chief! I\'ve collected all {color,yellow,150 Turkey Legs}!\nI can\'t wait to feast!\n[NEXT]'),
(24158, 'Are you serious!? That\'s amazing! I have something for you that\nmay help you get around Isya. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(24159, 'Go get me those {color,yellow,Turkey Legs}!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24250, 'Raina\'s Christmas (Event Quest)'),
(24251, 'Roumen\'s storage keeper Raina wants to build the most beautiful Christmas tree ever. \nYou must gather a Candy Cane, Star Piece, Angel Bell, Scarlet Candle, and a Pure White Cotton Ball for her. \n(Search the Free Battle Zone.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24252, 'Welcome, [NAME]. \nHave you seen Roumen\'s Christmas tree yet? \nI\'m so depressed to see it, it\'s so tacky and well, shabby.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1] \n[MENU]'),
(24253, 'Really? I thought it was pretty cool.\n[NEXT]'),
(24254, 'No way! It\'s the same every year. That design and those ornaments haven\'t changed in a decade! \nThis year I want Roumen\'s tree to outshine any other Christmas tree in Isya! \nI heard at the {color,yellow,Free Battle Zone}, you can find {color,yellow, Santa\'s Lost Stuff}. From it you can get your hands on some beautiful Christmas related decorations that no one has seen before. \nI know the \'Kebing Claws\' who guards it can be troublesome but you will help me out right?\nCould you bring back {color,yellow, 1 Candy, 1 Star Piece, 1 Angel Bell, 1 Scarlet Candle, and 1 Pure White Cotton Ball?} \n[BUTTON]=[No problem, I would love to see this new tree creation of yours.][1] \n[BUTTON]=[Nah, I think the tree is fine as it is.][2]'),
(24255, 'Raina, I\'ve got all the decorations you wanted. They\'re all so pretty! Just look!\nThe sound of Christmas carols in the distance, the abundance of candy canes. This really is what Christmas is all about!\n[NEXT]'),
(24256, 'Yeah, they just put you in the Christmas mood no matter what.\nThank you for all your help, [NAME].  Thanks to you, our Christmas will be even more cheerful!\n{color,yellow,Merry Christmas!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24257, 'Jingle Bells! Jingle Bells! Oh were you listening? \nYou will find Santa\'s Lost Stuff at the Free Battle Zone. Where is Free Battle Zone? It\'s in town silly!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU]'),
(24350, 'Kyle\'s Christmas (Event Quest)'),
(24351, 'Kyle wants to decorate the best Christmas tree that Elderine has ever seen. You must gather one of each: Candy Cane, Star Piece, Angel Bell, Scarlet Candle, and Pure White Cotton Ball for Kyle. \n(Search the Free Battle Zone.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24352, 'Welcome!  Merry Christmas y\'all!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24353, 'Hey Kyle!  Merry Christmas!\n[NEXT]'),
(24354, 'I wanna make the best Christmas tree Elderine has ever seen. I think, the tree can use more of them ornaments.\n[NEXT]'),
(24355, 'Really? No, I think it looks fine.\n[NEXT] '),
(24356, 'NO WAY! There\'s never enough ornaments for a Christmas tree! You gotta... You gotta put way more! \nIf you go to the {color,yellow,Free Battle Zone} right now, you\'ll see {color,yellow, Santa\'s Lost Stuff}. From there you can get a bunch of Christmas stuff! I know there\'s a Kebing Claws guarding the area, but I know you can handle that no good monster! So could you get me some more ornaments that I need? I need {color,yellow, 1 Candy Cane, 1 Star Piece, 1 Angel Bell, 1 Scarlet Candle, and 1 Pure White Cotton Ball}! You\'ll get\'em right? \n[BUTTON]=[Why not, sure thing][1] \n[BUTTON]=[Nope][2] '),
(24357, 'Hey Kyle, I got that stuff you wanted. \nYou are right, these things are simply beautiful! I can\'t wait to see them on the tree. \n[NEXT] '),
(24358, 'Wow!  Yeah, they\'re gorgeous!\nThank you!\nWe\'ll have best Christmas tree ever!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24359, 'Whew, I\'m in charge of the tree this year, and I want it to be the prettiest thing people see this year. \nYou don\'t know where to start? Go to the Free Battle Zone in town. \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(24450, 'Curly\'s Christmas (Event Quest)'),
(24451, 'Curly wants to decorate the best Christmas tree that the town of Uruga has ever seen. You must gather one of each: Candy Cane, Star Piece, Angel Bell, Scarlet Candle, and Pure White Cotton Ball for Curly. \n(Search the Free Battle Zone.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24452, 'Welcome, welcome! It\'s getting chilly isn\'t it? Yeah, it gets really cold here in Uruga.\nWell, Merry Christmas anyway!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1] \n[MENU]'),
(24453, 'Yeah, Merry Christmas, Curly!\n[NEXT]'),
(24454, 'Ah ha, did you see Elderine and Roumen\'s Christmas trees? If you haven\'t noticed, this year it was the storage keeper\'s job to decorate the Christmas tree at each town. I wonder who helped them out with that...\nThing is, I\'m just not much of the artistic type. Oh well, a job is a job.\nDo you think you can help me out? Just because I have no talent in decorating, the town folks shouldn\'t suffer, you know? \nIf you go to the {color,yellow,Free Battle Zone} right now, you\'ll see {color,yellow, Santa\'s Lost Stuff}. From there you can get a bunch of Christmas stuff! I know there\'s a Kebing Claws guarding the area, but I know you can handle that monster! So what do you say? could you get me {color,yellow, 1 Candy Cane, 1 Star Piece, 1 Angel Bell, 1 Scarlet Candle, and 1 Pure White Cotton Ball}? I trust that you can do this! \n[BUTTON]=[Sure thing, I can handle it.][1] \n[BUTTON]=[No, stop trusting me!][2]'),
(24455, 'Yo! Here are all the things you needed!\n[NEXT]'),
(24456, 'Oh! Good timing! I was about to decorate with the stuff I had, but it turns out all I had was junk. \nGreat! Look at all this stuff! I think our tree will turn out great! \nThank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24457, 'Well, dirty socks and moldy spores can\'t be decorations right? \nSorry, smells a little, huh? Ha ha, I guess I can\'t put this up on the tree. \nThat\'s why I need you at the Free Battle Zone! It\'s in the town of Uruga!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU] '),
(26250, 'Love is in the Air (Event Quest)'),
(26251, 'Element Helper Remi of Roumen asks you to be her Valentine!\n(Search Roumen)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26252, 'Hey, [NAME]!\nIt wasn\'t too long ago that we\'ve spoken for the first time, back then you were all full of expectation and just hopes for the best. Look at you now, you\'ve become a dashing hero!  I don\'t know why, but my heart flutters every time I see you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26253, 'That makes two of us!  When I first arrived to Roumen, you were the first one who were kind enough to guide me.  I feel right at home when I talk to you. \n[NEXT]'),
(26254, 'It\'s Valentine\'s Day, and well...  I heard on that day, you give chocolate to someone you really care about.\n[NEXT]'),
(26255, 'Yeah! I heard about that too!\n[NEXT]'),
(26256, 'Ta da!\nI have a {color,yellow,Valentine\'s Day Chocolate} for you.\nI really like you [NAME]. I just never had the courage to tell you how I feel. I thought since it\'s Valentine\'s Day, I just had to let you know!\nSo, will you be my Valentine?\n[BUTTON]=[No way woman! Muhahahaha!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry, I don\'t like chocolate...][2]\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!! Thank you Remi!][3]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(26257, 'R...Really...?\nI, I take that back. I don\'t like you either [NAME]!!\nI don\'t want to see you anymore, go away! \n[NEXT]'),
(26258, 'You..You don\'t like Chocolate?\nI..I see....\nI\'m sorry.....(sob)\n[NEXT]'),
(26259, 'I\'m so happy!\nI will see you everyday from now on.\nHehehe..Today is truly the best day ever!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Event Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26260, 'Look at me...I\'m blushing!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26350, 'True Beauty (Event Quest)'),
(26351, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants to give you some Strawberry Candy.\n(Search Roumen)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26352, 'It\'s you!  Our town\'s pride and joy!  Are you hunting again?  You sure are diligent!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26353, 'You\'re too kind.  I\'m just doing my job.\nWait, what is that?\n[NEXT]'),
(26354, ' Ta da!\nIt\'s {color,yellow,Strawberry Candy}! Do you smell that sweet scent?  \nI asked Grandma Myzen to specially make these just for you! \n[NEXT]'),
(26355, 'For me?  What for?   \nYou are not coming on to me are you?\n[NEXT]'),
(26356, 'This is a present for one with a true inner beauty!  Outside you may be armed and dangerous, but you have a kind heart!\n[NEXT]'),
(26357, 'Thank you.\nBut does that mean I\'m not pretty outside?!\n(Stares)\n[NEXT]'),
(26358, 'Of course not! \nI hope you enjoy the Strawberry Candy. I really meant what I said about your heart.\n[BUTTON]=[Ewww no! Get away from me!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you hitting on me? I hate candy!][2]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, thank you! You are so sweet!][3]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(26359, 'That...That\'s harsh..! \n[NEXT]'),
(26360, 'You, you hate candy?\nThat\'s too bad..Very well, give it back to me.\n[NEXT]'),
(26361, 'Hahah! Good. Good. I hope you enjoy it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Event Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26362, 'You are so beautiful... To me!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26450, 'Holy Promise'),
(26451, 'Grandpa Robin will teach you about the Holy Promise.\nLet\'s hear what he have to say.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26452, 'Ahem!\nHey!  Come over here, would you?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26453, 'Ehhh... Are you talking to me?\n[NEXT]'),
(26454, 'Yeah, you.  Over here.\nYes, yes...  \nOh!  Adventurer huh?  Looking like a pro already, nice!\nI still remember the day you were wet behind the ears...  Ahem!\n[NEXT]'),
(26455, 'Really?  Oh thanks Grandpa Robin.\nOh!  By the way, what\'s up?\nWhat\'s that paper in your hand?\n[NEXT]'),
(26456, 'Huh?  Oh this?\nAhem!  It\'s a note...  Well, listen up alright?\n(Robin glances at the note and reads it off)\n\nDo you know what {color,yellow,Holy Promise} is?\nIt\'s a great promise between adventurers.\n{color,yellow,It\'s a system that benefits both novice and experienced by giving the novice more powerful items, and monetary profits for experienced users.}\n[NEXT]'),
(26457, '{color,yellow,Holy promise?} \n[NEXT]'),
(26458, 'That\'s right.\nAhem...  Don\'t tell me that you didn\'t know about it!\nRoles of the holy promise system are divided into {color,yellow,apprentice} and {color,yellow,master}.\n{color,yellow,Experienced adventurers may acquire many apprentices, and apprentice can select one master} in order to help each other.\n{color,yellow,Masters will benefit more from this union, when they acquire more apprentices.}  I believe they can acquire up to{color,yellow,20 apprentices}.\nOf course {color,yellow,apprentices will gain a lot from this union as they\'ll receive great prizes when they reach levels 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, and 60 while registered as an apprentice.} \nHowever, one must remember that in order to stay in a Holy Promise relationship, the level differences between master and apprentice {color,yellow, must exceed at least 5 levels}.\nIf their levels {color,yellow,are within 4 levels, their Holy Promise contract will be broken}.\nYou got... all that right?  Ahem!  What\'s with that stupid blank stare?!\n[NEXT]'),
(26459, 'Huh...?  Wha...?  Ah, yeah!\nI got it!\nReally, I did!\n[NEXT]'),
(26460, 'Ahem!  You sure about that?  Well... Since you insist that you did, then good.\nIf you didn\'t get it, don\'t you press that \'Complete the Quest\' button you hear?!\nAhem!  Sometimes I\'m not really sure that you get all of what I tell you... \nHuh?  Wait a minute...  What are you doing here by the way?\nWhat the...!?  Did you eat my sweet potatoes?\nGive me back my sweet potatoes!  Why you little!  Fork it over!  My sweet potatoes!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26461, 'What!  You still don\'t get what Holy Promise is all about?\nJust go to the homepage, it\'s explained step by step there.  Alright kid?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26550, 'Guild Academy'),
(26551, 'Roumen town chief Roumenous will teach you about the Guild Academy.\nLet\'s learn about the Guild Academy.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26552, 'Oh! [NAME].  It\'s bee awhile. \nSo, how\'s your adventure going?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26553, 'Whew...\nWell, I suppose it\'s going...\nBut... It isn\'t easy...  Leveling up and earning money... All of those are really hard you know...  I sometimes question my progress and abilities...\n[NEXT]'),
(26554, 'Oh no! \nIt must be daunting out there to hear such words from you.\nHmph...  Maybe you could benefit from your peer\'s help.\nI know just the cure!  You can join a {color,yellow,Guild Academy!}\n[NEXT]'),
(26555, 'Guild... Academy?\n[NEXT]'),
(26556, 'Yes, that\'s right!\nGuild Academy is open to those who are under {color,yellow,Level 60}.\nYou can only join when the guild is recruiting a new member.  The procedure is very similar to those of joining a guild.\nAs a member of Guild Academy, {color,yellow,you\'ll receive buffs for every level up}, and receive {color,yellow,a reward} based on the {color,yellow,Guild Master\'s} discretion. \nNot only that, you\'ll have entire Guild Academy members\' support for  {color,yellow,any questions that you might have had.}   What do you think?  That\'ll probably help you out right?\n[NEXT]'),
(26557, 'Yeah, sounds like it.\nThat sounds like a really good system!\nThank you Roumenus!\n[NEXT]'),
(26558, 'Whahahaha!  No sweat!  Now cheer up and go seek a Guild Academy that suits you! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26559, 'Hmm... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26650, 'Party Matching System'),
(26651, 'Element Helper Remi will teach you about the Party Matching System.\nLet\'s listen to what she have to say.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26652, 'Hello, [NAME]!\nHow\'s your adventure going?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26653, 'Hi Remi!  It really has been a long time huh?\nWell...  It\'s bit lonely...  Traveling alone.  Leveling up... Hunting... Im really having a hard time doing it by myself... \n[NEXT]'),
(26654, 'Oh really?  Couldn\'t you ask for help from others?  \n[NEXT]'),
(26655, 'Huh?  Oh...  well, it\'s kind of harder that I thought... \nI mean, my friends and I can\'t really find a right time to hunt and travel at the same time you know...\n[NEXT]'),
(26656, 'I see...\nWell then, there is a perfect solution for you!\nPress the {color,yellow,F} button right now.\nYou see the Community window huh?  Do you see the {color,yellow,Party Matching} button on the top right corner?\nClick on it.\n[NEXT]'),
(26657, 'Whoa!  I didn\'t know such feature existed.\nI can find help through this Party Matching stuff huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(26658, 'That\'s right.  With this feature, you can search for any friends near or far.  Also, this is very useful for selling and buying items as well.\nI hope this information was helpful to your quest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26659, '... What is it?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43900, 'Entrance, and destruction of the force fields 1'),
(43901, 'Elderine\'s lord Elbama is joyous over destruction of force fields that used to shield Kahalzare Mountains from being explored.  \nYou must explore these new lands behalf of people of Isya and gather biological datas from the region.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43902, 'Oh, It\'s really good to see you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(43903, 'Oh... Hi.  Were you... looking for me?\n[NEXT]'),
(43904, 'I sure was, ha ha ha!  Why are you standing so far away?  Come on over here, and get close.\nYou and I aren\'t strangers anymore you know?\n[NEXT]'),
(43905, 'Oh... Well.... Okay, so did you want something from me?\n[NEXT]'),
(43906, 'Yes, I am in need of your service. \nThis matter is bit urgent and must be done in secret by someone I can rely on.  That is why I summoned you.\nNo one fits the bill better than you.\n[NEXT]'),
(43907, 'What kind of mission is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(43908, 'A new land has been found, and I am the one who discovered it.\nForce fields that used to shield the entrance to Kahalzare Mountains have been lifted.  A whole new virgin  lands have been open for exploration!\nI\'m sure you know by now that these mountains surrounding land of Isya were impenetrable.  \nThat place... isn\'t like any other places that have existed before!  I\'m so excited to unveil its mysteries.\nThat is where you come in.  I want you to lead the expedition, and take the honor of being the first one to walk its soils... \n[BUTTON]=[Me...?  O.. Okay... I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, you just want to use me again.][2]'),
(43909, 'I\'m back, Lord Elbama.  It was an amazing place.\n[NEXT]'),
(43910, 'Oh you are back!  So, let\'s see what you have brought me.\nIs this it?  Hmph...  I see.\nYou\'ve done well, now be on your way.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(43911, 'I trust you\'ll finish the job!  Well, come on now, be on your way then.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44000, 'Entrance, and destruction of the force fields 2'),
(44001, 'Uruga\'s Chief Adrian have found out the news of new land have been discovered.\nYou must help Adrian and uncover mystery of new land and monsters within.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44002, '[NAME]! [NAME]!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44003, 'Chief Adrian?\nWhat\'s going on?!\n[NEXT]'),
(44004, 'Did...  Did you hear the news!?  A new land have been discovered!\nAn entrance to Kahalzare Mountains... and shields have been disappeared... \n[NEXT]'),
(44005, 'Oh, that... Yeah shields did broke and new entrance have beens discovered.\nDid you just found out?  I would\'ve imagined that you knew about this by now... \n[NEXT]'),
(44006, 'You... knew...?  How... how did you found out?\n[NEXT]'),
(44007, 'Huh?  Well, I just found out myself as well.  Lord Elbama asked me to explore it.\nI thought... Person like Chief Adrian would have already known about it.\n[NEXT]'),
(44008, 'Ah... I see...  I thought Lord Elbama wouldn\'t hide such big news from rest of us.\nI have been naive... \nWell, it doesn\'t matter.  I would need to start surveying the new land.\nCould you help me?  I need your help to survey the new land and find more informations of monsters from that region.\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  Let me handle it][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Adrian, are you trying to use me too?][2]'),
(44009, 'Chief Adrian, I got some datas for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(44010, 'You are back.  My first patrol to the region have just returned as well.\nHmm... [NAME], no one can top your skills to gather accurate data.\nThank you, I\'ll contact you again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44011, 'I thought Elbama was up to something...  I just didn\'t realize the magnitude of his secret... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44100, 'Entrance, and destruction of the force fields 3'),
(44101, 'Chief Roumenous of Roumen learned of new lands that have recently discovered.\nIn behalf of Roumenous, you must gather data of new land and its inhabitants within.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44102, 'There you are!  I\'ve been waiting for you!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44103, 'Oh, I\'m sorry to keep you waiting.  I had to visit Chief Adrian.  So what was so urgent to see me for?\n[NEXT]'),
(44104, 'Ha Ha, well... I guess same reason as Adrian.\nShe told me about the new lands.\nWell...  I believe that new finding should come to Elderine first... \nI mean don\'t you think so?\nUruga is just way too far from the place...   It\'s a daunting task to just deliver the news there. \nElderine in other hand, is so conveniently located don\'t you think so?\nWell...  I really wasn\'t expecting that Elbama to share good news but... I was bit disappointed.\n[NEXT]'),
(44105, 'Hmph...  Lord Elbama likes to keep things under wraps huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(44106, 'Oh well,  I guess he and us think different.\nUnless Adrian shared the news, I probably didn\'t find out about this big event. Adrian sure knows how to look out for each other... \nHmm, could you...  lead an expedition in behalf of me?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure thing!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m done, why don\'t discuss with Adrian and Elbama?][2]'),
(44107, 'Roumenous, I\'m back with the findings.\n[NEXT]'),
(44108, 'Oh!  Thank you!  You are really something.\nPlease take this... It\'s your reward for your trouble.  Thank you again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44109, 'I really need to apologize... I mean to Adrian...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46000, 'Open wounds of Olverstol 1'),
(46001, 'Taylor from Olverstol is worried about Black Bears on sudden rampage.  Apparently these once docile creatures have gone violent and start destroying town fences.\nYou must defeat 200 Black Bears near the town of Overstol.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46002, 'Did you ran into any bears on the way to Olverstol?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46003, 'Oh, those vicious bears?\nI sure did, they were really going nuts... \n[NEXT]'),
(46004, 'Yes...  They were once very docile creatures who used to beg for fruits from town\'s people.\nEver since that mishap at the town... They started to turn vicious... Now they pounce on anything with a breath.\nThese days, it\'s gotten so bad that they started to throw their massive bodies at the town fence to cause harm on both the fences and their bodies... \n[BUTTON]=[Oh no...  I\'ll need to stop those Black Bears!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They are so pitiful][2]'),
(46005, 'Taylor!  I\'ve taken care of those Black Bears.\nThere are still a lot of them...  but I\'m sure you\'ll see less damage to the town.\n[NEXT]'),
(46006, 'I\'m sure...  They may have turned bad, but I\'m sure they still have some senses left...\nSigh... This truly is a sad...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46007, 'I feel so depressed...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46100, 'Open wounds of Olverstol 2'),
(46101, 'Taylor from town of Olverstol is worried about recently turned vicious bears charging at the town.\nYou must defeat 200 Brown Bears near Olverstol.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46102, 'Brown Bears are way more cunning than the Black Bears... Did you know about that?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46103, 'Well, I kind of thought that they had similar strength... I didn\'t know they were smarter... \n[NEXT]'),
(46104, 'Well, Black Bears stopped after destroying the fences, but Brown Bears actually invade and terrorize the town. \nTown\'s people can get into some serious trouble, if we aren\'t ready....\nWe also lack resources to properly defend our entrance, so it becomes very dangerous time to time.\n[NEXT]'),
(46105, 'I see...\nI heard that only minimal number of spirits keeps their physical form.\n[NEXT]'),
(46106, 'Yes... \nYou are right.  Not too long ago, Rell was seriously startled because of Brown Bears.\nWe can\'t really seal off entrance with a reinforced steel door... I am in serious dilemma.\n[BUTTON]=[Well, leave thouse Brown Bears to me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Tell Rell to stay put in the town...][2]'),
(46107, 'Taylor, I took care of those Brown Bears!\n[NEXT]'),
(46108, 'Oh, you are back!  I knew you could handle it.\nThere\'s good news, Rell is recovering from the shock.  Rell regained to smile as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46109, 'Sighs... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47500, 'My fruits'),
(47501, 'Curly from Uruga is asking you to defeat Big Mudmen who have been attacking migrate fruit merchants.\nYou must defeat 200 Big Mudmen, and bring him 3 Apples\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47502, 'I need fruits!  Do you have any fruits on  you!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47503, 'Hey Curly... Fruits?  I don\'t have any on me...\n[NEXT]'),
(47504, 'Phew, fruits... \nIt\'s been months since I\'ve smelled the scent of any fruits.\nThis is all the Big Mudmen\'s doing.  Those no good monsters have been attacking all the fruit merchants coming near the town.\nSo everyone has been avoiding Uruga to do business.\nThere is a solution though!\n[NAME], you can defeat Big Mudmen!\nKill {color,yellow,200} of those no good monsters.\nAlso, could I trouble you for {color,yellow,3 Apples}?\n[BUTTON]=[No worry, I got this!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s your problem!][2]'),
(47505, 'Curly!  Take these apples... Also you don\'t need to worry about those Big Mudmen anymore.\n[NEXT]'),
(47506, 'Ha Ha Ha! I knew [NAME] could handle it.\nThanks!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47507, '... I miss fruits... SO, SO MUCH!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47600, 'Moving Statues 1'),
(47601, 'An expedition consisting of soldiers and priest have returned from the Temple of Spirit with great harm done to them.\nYou must defeat 200 Living Statues and return to Median.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47602, 'Hello Median!  Busy researching as usual huh?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47603, 'Oh... [NAME]...\nSighs, actually I\'m a little scared to be around here... \n[NEXT]'),
(47604, 'Why are you scared? You can easily heal yourself, if anything were to happen to you.\n[NEXT]'),
(47605, 'Well, my recovery magic can only heal up to a certain level.\nSo, if I was attacked by a monster, I might get into some serious trouble.\nOn top of that... Elderine priests escorted by soldiers barely escaped with their lives not too long ago.\nThey were saying some sort of {color,yellow, moving statues attacked} them... \nThey also mentioned that those statues were wielding a {color,yellow, sword} in their hands.\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like Living Statues are the culprits.  I\'ll get them don\'t worry about it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t be lying through your teeth! Statues moving? Come on!][2]'),
(47606, 'Median!  You don\'t need to worry anymore!  I took care of those Living Statues.\n[NEXT]'),
(47607, 'Wow, you are covered in stone dust.\nThanks to you, I feel much safer.  I\'m sure I don\'t need to worry about my safety on the next expedition.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47608, '...Sighs.\nThe swords that they are wielding... must be really massive and deadly right? \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47700, 'Don\'t be fooled by their cutesy looks'),
(47701, 'Maxuter\'s associate, Cleo, is researching a kind of cute looking Phouch from the Swamp of Dawn. \nLet\'s gather 60 of Phouch\'s needle ridden hides.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47702, 'Have you come across a monster called Phouch yet?\nThey may look adorable, but their vicious nature make them one of the most deceptive and dangerous monsters around.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47703, 'Really? You\'re talking about those fat huggable bear like animals that totter around?\n[NEXT]'),
(47704, 'Yes, they do look so huggable for sure. \nAs younglings they are weak... but when they are fully grown, they become very dangerous.\nTheir tough spine ridden hides makes one of the best materials for a shield construction.  Shields made out of their hides are not only great for defense but as emergency offensive weapon all thanks to their spines.\nWill you bring me 60 of Phouch\'s needle ridden hides?  I\'ll definitely reward you handsomely for all of your trouble.\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem, consider it done!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll pass, I don\'t think I can handle it.][2]'),
(47705, 'Cleo look!  I got those hides you wanted!\n[NEXT]'),
(47706, 'Great!  You didn\'t get hurt did you?\nThank goodness that you are okay!\nThank you, and please take you reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47707, 'You won\'t have trouble finding Phouchs around here... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47800, 'Moving Statues 2'),
(47801, 'Median, in Swamp of Dawn, can\'t enter the Temple of Spirit because of Living Stones.\nHelp her by defeating 200 Living Stones, in the Temple of Spirit.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47802, '[NAME], over here!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47803, 'What? What is it!?\n[NEXT]'),
(47804, 'Remember those moving statues you took care for me?!\nThis time they {color,yellow, attacked with bows and arrows.}\nThey were firing from the such a distant range that no one could even enter the temple.\n[BUTTON]=[I see, don\'t worry leave it to me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Take a hint, they don\'t want you in there.][2]'),
(47805, 'Median! I took care of them..\nWhew...  It was kind of tough taking on monsters made out of rocks.\nThey were very chatty too... \n[NEXT]'),
(47806, 'They talked?  Those rocks?\nI thought they didn\'t have any intelligence...  This is a great find.\nThank you, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47807, '... \nIt\'s the stone statues who uses archery...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47900, 'Mutant Weasel?'),
(47901, 'Lately, there has been arguments whether the Weasel is a mutation, or was created by dark force.\nTo resolve this issue, Skill Master Cyburn is asking you to gather 30 of each Weasel\'s Slough and Scales.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47902, 'It\'s been a while.  How is it going these days?  \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47903, 'Oh Hi Cyburn.  I\'m always doing good.  How are you?\n[NEXT]'),
(47904, 'Nothing special but, I am busy as always.\nOh yeah...  Do you know anything about this monster called Weasel that resides at the Swamp of Dawn?\n[NEXT]'),
(47905, 'Of course.\nThat snake with multiple heads.\n[NEXT]'),
(47906, 'That\'s right.\nThere are many theories about whether the Weasel is a freak of nature that mutated into a multiple headed animal or just a monster who was merely created by dark force.\nAll this bickering about the Weasel\'s origin gives me such a headache...\nSo I decided to give it a full diagnosis to conclude the fight, and in order to do so I need some samples.\nWell, I was hoping... If you have some time... Will you bring 30 of each Weasel Slough and Weasel Scales?\nI of course will make it worth your trouble.\n[BUTTON]=[A job that pays?  I\'m on it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll pass.][2]'),
(47907, 'Cyburn, I brought all the Weasel Slough and Scales you need.\n[NEXT]'),
(47908, 'Nice.\nI should be able to find out what really happened and end all this annoying bickering.\nHere take your reward, you deserve every single piece of that reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47909, 'Hmph... It\'s too perfectly formed to be merely mutated... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48000, 'Soul piercing arrow'),
(48001, 'A priest sits motionless and stares into the horizon like a mindless zombie. Skill Master Deikid from Elderine believes that a special arrow is the culprit for the priest\'s unfortunate state.  \nYou must bring back 1 Rhinoce Hunter\'s Bow and 10 Rhinoce Arrows.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48002, 'Hello, it\'s been a while hasn\'t it?\nI saw you not too long ago, but I was bit preoccupied at the moment to talk to you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48003, 'Don\'t worry about it.  Everyone knows that you are very busy Deikid.\nIs there anything wrong?  You look especially tired.\n[NEXT]'),
(48004, 'Oh... Yes. \nI\'ve been researching some unusual circumstances lately... \nWhich leads to many clashes... \n[NEXT]'),
(48005, 'Clash?  Who would go against your words? \n[NEXT]'),
(48006, 'Well, to tell you the truth, it was between me and Keast.\nI was just too sure of the outcome, so I might have yelled...  I feel ashamed to think about it. \nI already apologized to Keast of course.\n[NEXT]'),
(48007, 'I see... What was the quarrel about by the way?\n[NEXT]'),
(48008, 'Sighs... Well, it\'s about... \nYou know about the large expedition dispatched to the Temple of Spirit not to long ago right?\nMost returned with major but treatable injuries... \nHowever, this one person, returned with a blank stare as if his soul had left his body.  He doesn\'t talk, eat or feel pain from an arrow embedded in his back.\nThey treated him by removing the arrow so I wasn\'t able to verify it, but I believe that arrow had a something to do with his current state...\nKeast thinks it\'s because of shock, but for the past three days his mental condition has worsened as his body heals.\n[NEXT]'),
(48009, 'I see...\nTo verify it, you would need the arrows and bows that struck him.\n[NEXT]'),
(48010, 'That\'s right.\nThey told me that Rhinoce Hunter was the barer of the bow and arrows... \nWill you bring me a {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter\'s bow and arrows}?\nI will need{color,yellow,one bow and 10 arrows.}\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way, I don\'t want to become a stupid like him!][2]'),
(48011, 'Deikid, I got all the arrows and bow you need.  I almost got into the same trouble... \n[NEXT]'),
(48012, 'I do apologizes for putting you in a great danger.\nThere aren\'t many strong adventurers like you [NAME]...\nI sincerely thank you for all of your troubles.\nI should be able to get to the bottom of what happened to that man.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48013, 'Thank you for agreeing to help me out.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48100, 'The last measure of offense'),
(48101, 'It is known that Caiman Giant\'s horns are the last measure of offense for these monsters.\nThere has been a request to gather a strong horn to craft an ultimate sword.\nYou must gather and deliever a Caiman Giant\'s horn to Cleo.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48102, 'Oh hello, we meet again.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48103, 'Hi Cleo, what can I do for you?\n[NEXT]'),
(48104, 'Yes, well about three days ago we received a request with a large sum of reward. \nThey wanted to craft a sword made out of Caiman Giant\'s horns.\n[NEXT]'),
(48105, 'Are you serious?\nCaiman Giant\'s horns are hard to come by you know... \nIt\'s not like they shed them, you will have to forcibly pull it off of them after you\'ve hunted them down.\n[NEXT]'),
(48106, 'That\'s why I\'m asking you, [NAME].  \nSeasoned Caiman Giants who have lived a long time will not shed their horns even after their death, but... Young Caiman Giant, they might drop their horns when they are defeated.  \nThere simply aren\'t many people who can handle job of this magnitude.\nI know it won\'t be easy but will you bring me a horn?\nI need {color,yellow,1 Caiman Giant\'s Horn}.   \n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll pass.][2]'),
(48107, 'Okay Cleo... It wasn\'t easy, but I got your horn... \n[NEXT]'),
(48108, 'May I see it?\n(Examining it carefully...)\nWell... It\'s one fine example.\nThank you for your efforts, please take your reward.\nWell I\'ll see you around.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48109, '...Hmph.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48200, 'Will of Shadow Master'),
(48201, 'Chief Adrian of Uruga is showing real interest in the will power of the Shadow Clans.\nYou must research about their strong minds and endless powers.\nDefeat a Shadow Master and retrieve its hardened heart.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48202, 'Even in a severly restricted place such as the Temple of Spirit, there is a monster who freely walks on its own will.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48203, 'You are talking about the Shadow Masters huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(48204, 'That\'s right.\nI knew you would understand.\nThe Temple of Spirit retains any beings within its belly with it\'s powerful desires.\nHowever...  Shadow Masters walk freely against the temple\'s devestating desires.\n[NEXT]'),
(48205, 'Then how come, with such a strong willed mind, Shadow Masters cannot control themselves, and destroy anything they touch?\n[NEXT]'),
(48206, 'Because their desire to destroy is overriding their desire to reason.\nThey aren\'t built to survive, but rather built to destroy.\nThat is the reason they opt not to live a peaceful life.  They would rather kill one more being to just satisfy its presence.\nHowever [NAME], I do believe their strong will may hold the key to purify their darkened hearts.\nWill you go and dispatch a {color,yellow,Shadow Master}, and bring its {color,yellow,Hardened Heart}?\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a plan, leave it to me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you nuts?  No thanks...][2]'),
(48207, 'I\'m back!  I have your Hardened Heart right here!\n[NEXT]'),
(48208, 'Thank goodness!  You\'ve returned without being harmed!\nI\'ve been worried sick... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48209, '...Please take extra caution, this won\'t be a walk in the park for sure.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48300, 'Dark spells of ancient elf '),
(48301, 'Chief Adrien from Uruga suspects something odd of the unusal spell from the Temple of Spirit.\nYou must defeat Black Shadows and retrieve 10 sorcery books.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48302, '[NAME], I still can\'t shake off questions about the Spirit Temple.\nHowcome and why would they put such a strong restrictive spell on the the entire temple?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48303, 'Well, I\'m not entirely sure...  Did you find any other clues about it?\n[NEXT]'),
(48304, 'No, not yet.\nHowever, there are a couple of hypothesis about how it became what it is today. \nWell...  the first hypothesis is that, since all ancient elves used magics and spells, they fell victim to their own spell that they casted upon the Spirit Temple.\nThe other is... Well, a war might have sparked amongst contradicting groups.\nA war caused by powerful spell casters would have adverse effects on the remains.  Of course all of these are just guesses, and we don\'t have any solid evidence to back these claims up.\n[NEXT]'),
(48305, 'Why don\'t we gather clues from these Black Shadows then?  I\'m sure those strong, dark monsters will hold the clues to their origins and powers.\n[NEXT]'),
(48306, 'You might be on to something.\nAny sorcery books, or even something they mutter out might be the key to unravel this mystery.\nThey also used intricate languages and documentation as well.  I\'m sure they might hold some sort of a clue.\n[BUTTON]=[Got it!  I\'ll dispatch Black Shadows and bring back a clue!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I\'m kind of in the middle of something, so I can\'t help you.][2]'),
(48307, 'I got it!  It\'s some sort of sorcery book!  I can\'t make out anything that is written, but I got them from those Black Shadows!\n[NEXT]'),
(48308, 'Oh my!\nThis is a great breakthrough!  We will learn so much from these sorcery books!\nYou\'ve done a tremendous task!  Thank you!  Now let us decode this sorcery book and study it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48309, 'It\'s a mystery... What could\'ve happened?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18050, 'Merchant Request 1'),
(18051, 'Cleo, from the Maxuter\'s merchant group, has received a request from Deikid of Elderine.\nYou must Collect 5 Red Shadow\'s Blades, and 10 Laplan Petals.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18052, 'Oh, hello.\nThere is a request you may be able to take on.  Would you like to hear about it?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18053, 'Of course, I hope it\'s something I can handle.\n[NEXT]'),
(18054, 'Me too.\nLet\'s see...  Where is that list...? \nYes, here it is... It\'s from Deikid of Elderine.\nDeikid is requesting {color,yellow,5 Red Shadow\'s Blades, and 10 Laplan\'s Petals.}  So, what do you think, can you handle it?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, not a problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Boring, I\'ll pass.][2]'),
(18055, 'Cleo!  I\'m done with my request.  Here are 5 Blades and 10 Petals.\n[NEXT]'),
(18056, 'Oh, you\'ve done well.  Let\'s see one, two, three.... Yes ten!  It\'s all there.\nHere\'s your reward, I hope to see you again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18057, 'You should be able to find some Laplans around here without a problem, and Red Shadows in the Temple of Spirit.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18150, 'Merchant Request 2'),
(18151, 'Cleo, from the Maxuter\'s merchant group, Has received an order from Grandpa Robin.\nYou must hunt Big Mudmen, in the Swamp of Dawn, and bring back 30 Big Mudman\'s Mud Facials.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18152, 'You are back!\nThere is another request you may be able to take on.  Would you like to hear about it?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18153, 'Yes, please!\n[NEXT]'),
(18154, 'Let\'s see... This time it\'s Grandpa Robin\'s request.\nHe needs {color,yellow, 30 Big Mudman\'s Mud Facial}.\nWhat on earth will he be using these for?  Well anyway how about it?\n[BUTTON]=[I know right?  I\'ll get them don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, what a freak... No thanks. ][2]'),
(18155, 'Miss Cleo!  I\'ve brought you Big Mudman\'s Mud Facial.  It\'s surprisingly smooth... \n[NEXT]'),
(18156, 'Oh what do you know... It is soft to touch!  Grandpa Robin must be trying to do a mud facial oh hohohoho.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18157, 'Yes?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18250, 'Merchant Request 3'),
(18251, 'Cleo, from the Maxuter\'s merchant group, has received a request to deliver 2 Phouch\'s Needlecoats to Item Merchant Kenton, in Elderine. Obtain 2 Phouch\'s Needlecoats by defeating Phouches in the Swamp of Dawn.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18252, 'Welcome!  Would you like to hear what job is available?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18253, 'Sure, go ahead.\n[NEXT]'),
(18254, 'It\'s a delivery request.\nPlease deliver 2 Phouch\'s Needlecoats to Elderines Item Merchant, Kenton... \nPhouch\'s Needlecoats can be obtained by defeating Phouchs, in the Swamp of Dawn.\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s too far, I\'ll pass.][2]'),
(18255, 'Hey Kenton!  I\'ve got a delivery for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(18256, 'Oh my!  Is that you [NAME]? I\'d recognize that fabulous voice from anywhere!  Are you on a delivery mission?\nIt\'s really good to see you!  Here, this is your reward.  Hmph... you still have that dangerous, sexy and sassy thing going on all at once huh?  delicious!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18257, 'Yes?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18550, 'Ancient Bow'),
(18551, 'Deikid, the Elderine\'s Scout Master is intrigued by ancient bows used by ancient elves.\nYou must retrieve 5 Living Stones\' Bows.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18552, 'Those ancient lives...  I wonder what sort of society they have had... Do you think they shared the same thoughts and instincts like us?  What type of weapons would they have used in what kind of battles?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18553, 'I think I know what you are talking about.  It\'s about the bows and arrows from those Living Stones right?\n[NEXT]'),
(18554, '(Flinching...)\nDo you read minds as well?\nYou are right.  Those bows and arrows held by ancient monsters are entirely different from what we wield.\nI would love to study them, even if it\'s just glancing at their basic mechanics.\nIf you can... Will you bring me 5 bows from Living Stones?\n[BUTTON]=[Got it, consider it done.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks, you\'re probablly going to ask me to get arrows too... ][2]'),
(18555, 'Here they are.  They\'re pretty massive and heavy.\n[NEXT]'),
(18556, 'Wow... So this is it.\nTo tell you the truth...  I too attempted to get these bows without any success. \nThanks to you, I should be able to study these bows.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18557, 'Living Stones can be found inside of the Temple of Spirit.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18650, 'Greed 1'),
(18651, 'Median believes by consuming a Black Shadow\'s heart, she\'ll harness great magical power.\nYou must defeat Black Shadows, and retrieve a Black Shadow\'s Heart for Median.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18652, 'I yearn for more magical power. \nI know I\'m a novice priestess right now, but if I gain more magical power I know I\'ll be promoted to a higher class priestess.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18653, 'I don\'t know if you can really skip the steps when you are pursuing to be a priest.  Besides, you\'ve just become a priestess not to long ago.\nMaybe you need to be more patient.\n[NEXT]'),
(18654, 'I\'m beginning to find out that disciplining is a waste of time, when you can become more powerful by utilizing stronger gears!  I want to harness more powerful magic as soon as possible!\n[NEXT]'),
(18655, 'Well, Median... I\'m not sure if it\'s my place to tell you this but...  I think you are mistaken.  Only through discipline without shortcuts, will you harness true power.\n[NEXT]'),
(18656, 'But, but... I am constantly disciplining myself.  Everyone desires to be the best!  Even you, I\'m sure, secretly yearns to be the best.\nI want to be strong!  I yearn to be the greatest priestess who ever lived!\n[NAME], please help me and bring me a Black Shadow\'s Heart.\nOne who consumes a Black Shadow\'s heart will wield great power.\n[BUTTON]=[Fine it\'s your funeral.  I\'ll get you the heart and let you see it for yourself.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you nuts?  Wake up!  I\'m gone!][2]'),
(18657, 'Median, take a good look!  This is a Black Shadow\'s Heart.\nThis hardened, stinking piece of rotting meat does not harness a single drop of magic, only hate.\n[NEXT]'),
(18658, 'It stinks...\nI really didn\'t know, it smelled this bad... but I know medicine is supposed to be bitter!  I\'m going to eat it and become mighty!\n(Takes a piece of heart and exams it, then puts it in her mouth)\n... \n... ... \nBarf!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(18659, 'Median?!  Are you alright?  Hey wake up!  Come on spit that out right now!  Median? Can you hear me?!\n[NEXT]'),
(18660, 'Barf!!\n(After throwing most of the heart up, she looks up with teary eyes.)\nIt was a terrible taste...\n(Her tongue is turned jet black...)\n[NEXT]'),
(18661, 'Your tongue... \n[NEXT]'),
(18662, '...Eh... Eh?  Deed yah... Say... Shum...thang?  I... con\'t spake... Whacha... What cha gong naan...?\n[NEXT]'),
(18663, 'Mediang?  Did your tongue harden?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18664, 'I\'m going to become strong.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18750, 'Greed 2'),
(18751, 'Median believed that by consuming a Black Shadow\'s heart, she\'d become a mighty priestess.  \nBy consuming the monster\'s heart, Median\'s tongue has turned black and become as hard as a rock. To find the cure for her condition, you must seek Chief Adrian of Uruga\'s help. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18752, 'Uh... Ba... Ba... Bu... BA... Uh...\n\n{color,yellow,(Median takes out a notebook and a pen and starts writing.)}\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18753, '{color,yellow,<The note\'s contents>}\n\n{color,yellow, Please, I beg you not to tell Keast about what happened.}\nIf anyone found out about this, it would be the end of me for sure.\n{color,yellow, Could you find someone who can help me?}\nI\'m sorry, [NAME].  I\'ve been too greedy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(18754, 'Okay.  Hmm... I\'ll go seek Adrian\'s help.\nPlease wait here okay?\n\n(Median nods yes with big teary eyes. Even her lips are now turning blue.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(18755, '<The note\'s contents>\n\nI\'m sorry. I\'ll leave it up to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go seek Adrian\'s help right now, don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well then, I\'m leaving you as is! Bye!][2]'),
(18756, 'Adrian!  I Need your help!\n[NEXT]'),
(18757, 'Huh?  [NAME]?  What\'s the matter?  Is something wrong?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18758, '... (Sobs)\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18850, 'Greed 3'),
(18851, 'Adrian tells you to deliver an antidote recipe to Healer Poring, in Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18852, 'Adrian! Median ate a monster\'s heart and now she can\'t talk!  It\'s all my fault, I shouldn\'t have gotten her the heart!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18853, 'I see...\nYes, it\'s a very dangerous superstition.  In the past we found an adventurer who consumed an Elite Monster\'s entire heart. He had turned completely black and was in a coma.  He unfortunately died from his afflictions.  We used everything to turn him around but...  \nWell, good news is it seems Median only consumed a small portion of the heart.  I\'m sure it won\'t kill her.\n[NEXT]'),
(18854, 'But... She can\'t speak, and her tongue is turning black and is hardening... And her lips are turning blue.\n[NEXT]'),
(18855, 'So far, she seems to have a chance since only a portion of her body is affected.\nHere, {color,yellow,it\'s an antidote recipe. Take this to Healer Poring.}  Poring will know how to make it.  Now hurry.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay!  I\'ll be back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do I have to go? Since, she\'s not dying at all?][2]'),
(18856, 'Poring! I need an antidote ASAP!\n[NEXT]'),
(18857, 'Huh?  What antidote?\nIs that a recipe?  Let me see that quick!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18858, 'You must make haste!  Median may not be able to talk for rest of her life if untreated.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18950, 'Greed 4'),
(18951, 'You\'ve asked Poring to make an antidote, but Poring is short of one ingredient. \nYou must return with 30 Sages.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18952, 'Oh no... That\'s terrible!\nWe must hurry, she is in danger for sure!\nWait there, I need to check if I have everything I need.\nHmph... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(18953, '...So?  Can you make it?\n[NEXT]'),
(18954, 'No...  I have everything except Sages... \nI need 30 Sages!  Can you bring me 30 Sages right now?\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Where am I going to get those now...? ][2]'),
(18955, 'Poring!  I\'ve brought you 30 Sages! \n[NEXT]'),
(18956, 'You are back!  Right on time!  Okay let\'s put these Sages and...\nAnd, now shake it...  Little sprinkles of Sprit Powder and...\nFinished!\nHere, hurry and take it to her!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(18957, 'Sage is an herb!  You must bring them quick!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19050, 'Greed 5'),
(19051, 'You must deliver Poring\'s antidote to Median.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19052, 'You must hurry, every second counts!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19053, 'I\'m off!\n'),
(19054, 'Median! Are you still alive?  I\'ve got an antidote for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(19055, 'Ahh... Ung... Ang... Ah... Kay... \n[NEXT]'),
(19056, 'Here, you got to swallow this!\n[NEXT]'),
(19057, 'Ugh...Ugh \n... \n... \n(Swallowing)\nCaugh! Caugh!\n[NEXT]'),
(19058, 'Try to take it all in... Don\'t worry about spilling it... I think there is enough to cure you.  How do you feel?\n[NEXT]'),
(19059, 'Uh... Ah... Oh... Wahh... \nI...dan... Knah... Yeah...et \n(Caughs...)\nUmm, Umm. Ummm.\nI... I...thin...koo... Think... I\'m better... \n(Sobs)\n[NEXT]'),
(19060, 'Whew... it seems it\'s working.\nYour tongue colors are getting better too.\nThank goodness... Median you have to promise me that you won\'t do something stupid like this again!\nIt\'s my fault to get you that horrible stuff.  You could have been in real trouble!\n[NEXT]'),
(19061, 'I... I\'m... Sorry... I... won\'t  do... stupid things... like that anymore... \n(Sobs)\nI, I think I can talk aga...in...\nThank... thank you... (Sobs)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19062, 'Hurry!  You must make haste!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19150, 'Smooth as silk 1'),
(19151, 'Kenton from Elderine wants Black Bear hides from the Alberstol Ruins region.\nLet\'s gather 60 Black Bear hides for Mr. Kenton.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19152, 'It\'s so dark, and luxurious... Look at that sheen on its coat!  I think I just saw a refelction of my perfect face on it! \nOh lord!  This is one fine bear hide! \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19153, 'Huh...?\nHey Kenton, how is it going?\nWhat is that hunk of black fur you are holding?\n[NEXT]'),
(19154, '\n[NEXT]'),
(19155, 'How can you call this beautiful speciman, a hunk of fur?  Just look at it, isn\'t it dreamy?  So luxurious and elegant...  It\'ll make one fine wardrobe don\'t you think?\nOh yeah!  That\'s right!  [NAME]? You are one strong, bucking, adventurer aren\'t you?  Such a strong person won\'t have trouble knocking down a few Black Bears am I right?\nOh, look at your strong arms, I\'m sure you can skin those bears with one hand, you certainly are soooo cool!\nWould you do me a small, tiny favor and bring me {color,yellow,60 Black Bear hides}?\nYou\'ll be awarded handsomely, just like my face! Pretty, just like my nose, please?\n[BUTTON]=[Yuck... Fine I\'ll get you those hides.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s run!!!][2]'),
(19156, 'Okay Kenton, I got your Black Bear hides... I\'m leaving them right here, so don\'t get to close. \n[NEXT]'),
(19157, 'Oh don\'t be scared cutie.  I don\'t know why people are so scared to approach me. I know I\'m beautiful and all but... Here I got rewards for you, I\'m going to thank you personally.  Oh hohohohohoho!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19158, 'Yessss?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19250, 'Smooth as silk 2'),
(19251, 'Kenton from Elderine wants Red Bear hides from the Alberstol Ruins region.\nLet\'s gather 30 Red Bear hides from Mr. Kenton.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19252, 'Soooo red... It burns with its sheen... So... Hypnotic.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(19253, '(Ugh!)\nHey... Well... excuse me...  I\'ll be on my way... \n[NEXT]'),
(19254, 'Hey! Wait just a sexy minute!  Where are you prancing your tight buns off to?\nI know you got time to talk to me.\nCome on!  Please, will you do me one tiny favor again?  Please?\n[NEXT]'),
(19255, 'Darn...\nOkay what is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(19256, 'It\'s so simple and easy!\nGetting {color,yellow,30 Red Bear hides}!\nHow simple can it get huh?\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, fine I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Bears again? No thanks, I\'m sick of bears.][2]'),
(19257, 'Okay, I got all the bear hides you wanted.  Here take it Mr. Kenton.\n[NEXT]'),
(19258, 'Oh thank you my hero!\nWould you like a peck on your cheek?\nYou know I\'m soooo thankful for all your trouble right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(19259, 'Yeeeeeeessss???\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53700, 'Call of the Fire Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(53701, 'Fire Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53702, 'What... was that?  Someone is calling me...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53703, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(53704, 'Am I hearing things...?  I\'m sure it came from around here... \n{color,yellow,Huh?!  I definitely heard something coming from over there...  Let\' see what it is!!}\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53800, 'Call of the Wind Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(53801, 'Wind Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53802, 'Huh...?  I heard something again...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53803, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(53804, 'That is odd... I thought something was definitely calling me...\nAm I hearing things?\n...\n{color,yellow,Huh?!}\n{color,yellow,What is this?}\n{color,yellow,(A shining object is sparkling in your inventory)}\n\n{color,yellow,What is this shining object?  I should seek Kiera\'s help on this.}\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53900, 'Call of the Water Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(53901, 'Water Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53902, 'What is that...?  Somone is calling me.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53903, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(53904, 'Am I hearing things?  It was coming from around here... \n{color,yellow,Huh?  Yeah, it was definitely coming from over there!  Let\'s see what it is!!!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54000, 'Call of the Earth Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54001, 'Earth Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54002, 'There is it again...  What is that?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54003, '{color,yellow,...}\n[NEXT]'),
(54004, 'I definitely heard something... Someone or something was definately calling for me...\n...\n{color,yellow,Huh?!}\n{color,yellow,What is this?}\n{color,yellow,(There is something sparkling in your inventory)}\n\n{color,yellow,What is this shining thing?  I should go ask Kiera about this.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54100, 'Call of the Tree Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54101, 'Tree Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54102, 'What is that...? Something is calling me.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54103, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54104, 'Am... I hearing things?  I swear it came from around here... \n{color,yellow,Huh?  Yeah something is definitely calling me from over there!  Let\'s go!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54200, 'Call of the Wind Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54201, 'Wind Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54202, 'Huh...?  I heard something again...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54203, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54204, 'I swear... I heard something from here.\nAm I hearing things?\n...\n{color,yellow,Huh?!}\n{color,yellow,What is this?}\n{color,yellow,(Something sparkling is in your inventory)}\n\n{color,yellow, What is this shiny thing?  Hmm... I should take this to Kiera.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54300, 'Call of the Fire Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54301, 'Fire Guradian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54302, 'What is that...?  Something is calling me.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54303, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54304, 'Am I hearing things...?  I swear it came from around here... \n{color,yellow,Huh?  Yeah I really heard something from over there!  Let\'s see what it is!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54400, 'Call of the Wind Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54401, 'Wind Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54402, 'Huh...?  I heard it again!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54403, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54404, 'That\'s odd...  I thought I heard something coming from here...\nAm I hearing things?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54500, 'Call of the Tree Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54501, 'Tree Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54502, 'Huh!  I heard it again!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54503, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54504, 'Was I hearing things...?  I\'m sure it came from around here... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54600, 'Call of the Earth Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54601, 'Earth Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54602, 'Huh?  I heard it again!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54603, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54604, 'That\'s odd...  I really heard something calling me from here.  Why am I hearing stuff so much lately?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54700, 'Call of the Water Guardian Stone [Job Change Quest]'),
(54701, 'Water Guardian Stone is calling me.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54702, 'What was that?!  I really heard something calling me!!! \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54703, '{color,yellow,... }\n[NEXT]'),
(54704, 'That\'s weird...  Something was definitely calling me...\nAm I getting old?\n...\n{color,yellow,Huh?!}\n{color,yellow,What is this?}\n{color,yellow,(There is something shiny in my inventory)}\n\n{color,yellow,What is this shiny thing?  I should take it to Kiera.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54800, 'Kiera\'s Tears [Job Change Quest]'),
(54801, 'Kiera started to sense unusual energies flowing through the town.\nAs spirits churned with uneasiness, Kiera summoned me.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54802, 'Oh... Welcome, I\'ve been expecting you. \n[BUTTON]=[Start Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54803, 'What is it Kiera?\nDid... something happened?\n[NEXT]'),
(54804, 'Well... I can\'t really put a finger on it but...\nThere seems to be an odd energy flowing through the town, disturbing the spirits.\nIt feels like the prelude to a big event...\n[NEXT]'),
(54805, 'Disturbance?  Really?  I can\'t really tell... \nI\'m kind of in a rut these days, so I don\'t catch all those small changes.\n[NEXT]'),
(54806, 'Rut?  [NAME] in a rut... {color,yellow,But you are full of energy and strenghth!}\n[NEXT]'),
(54807, 'Nah... {color,yellow,lately, nothing really sparks my interest...}\nWhew... Oh yeah!  Could you take a look at this?  {color,yellow,I found this in my pocket.}\nI heard something really odd calling me... When I went to see what it was, I found this thing in my pocket.\nDo you know what this is?\n[NEXT]'),
(54808, 'Well, let me take a look... \n(Kiera takes the object in her hand)\n... \n!!!!!!\n{color,yellow,(With a surprised look on her face, she stares into the gleaming object)}\n[NEXT]'),
(54809, '...?\n(What\'s wrong with her?)\n[NEXT]'),
(54810, 'Ah... \n{color,yellow,(Kiera starts to sob...)}\n[NEXT]'),
(54811, 'Hey, what\'s wrong!  Why are you crying!\nI\'m... I\'m not in a rut!  I\'m fine look see!\nDon\'t cry!!\n[NEXT]'),
(54812, '(Sobs)... No, it\'s not... That... \nI\'m just... \nI\'m just... so happy... \n(Sobs)... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Completes the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54813, 'Ah... !!!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54900, 'Name of the Faith and Confidence 1 [Job Change Quest]'),
(54901, 'Kiera cried silently for a long time...  \nWhen she finally regain her composure, Kiera asked me to bring Marcudos, Paella, and Geric\'s guardian stones.\nYou must retrieve Marcudos, Paella, and Geric\'s guardian stones.  \nLet\'s go seek Marcudos first.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54902, 'I\'m sorry to let you see me this way [NAME]. \nI have a big favor to ask you.\nCould you...  Go seek Blacksmith Marcudos, Paella, and Geric and borrow their guardian stones for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(54903, 'Guardian stones?  The one...  you get when you reach your adulthood...  That guardian stone?\n[NEXT]'),
(54904, 'Yes. Also please don\'t tell them that I asked for them.\n{color,yellow, Make sure that they think you are borrowing the stones.}\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, it\'s kind of an odd request, but I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t lie like that... I\'m sorry but no.][2]'),
(54905, 'Marcudos!  Excuse me.. Could I ask you a question?\n[NEXT]'),
(54906, 'Uh? [NAME]?  Yeah, sure what is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(54907, '(Huh?  He\'s not getting mad... That\'s something you don\'t see everyday...)\nWell, I can\'t tell you why... But will you lend me your guardian stone?\n[NEXT]'),
(54908, 'My... Guardian stone?!\n[NEXT]'),
(54909, 'Yes, the guardian stone that you received at your adulthood ceremony.\n[NEXT]'),
(54910, '... \n... \n(Marcudos is in deep thought)\nFine, but you must bring it back.\n[NEXT]'),
(54911, 'Whoa!  Thank you!  I\'ll bring it right back!  Don\'t worry!\n{color,yellow,(Okay now let\'s go see Paella!)}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Finish Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(54912, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55000, 'Name of the Faith and Confidence 2 [Job Change Quest]'),
(55001, 'You must borrow Paella\'s guardian stone.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55002, '(I should go see Paella!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55003, 'Hello Paella, it\'s been a while.\n[NEXT]'),
(55004, '...[NAME]?  Yeah, It... has been a while huh...\nUmm... How... Are you?\n[NEXT]'),
(55005, 'I\'m good thanks!  Hey Paella, could I borrow your guardian stone?  The one that you received at your adulthood ceremony.\n[NEXT]'),
(55006, 'My... Guardian stone...?  What for?\n[NEXT]'),
(55007, 'I can\'t tell you why,  but I promise that I\'ll bring it right back.\n[NEXT]'),
(55008, '...\nOkay. Here, take it.\n[NEXT]'),
(55009, 'Thank you Paella!\n{color,yellow,(I need to visit Geric and that\'s it!  I\'m done!)}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55010, '...?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry, but can you give me the stone back?][2]\n[MENU]'),
(55100, 'Name of the Faith and Confidence 3 [Job Change Quest]'),
(55101, 'You must borrow Geric\'s guardian stone.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55102, '\n{color,yellow,(Okay, let\'s go see Geric!)}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55103, 'Hello Geric!  How\'s it hanging?\n[NEXT]'),
(55104, 'Oh, [NAME], I\'m good.  How is it going [NAME]?\n[NEXT]'),
(55105, 'I\'m doing really well!  \nAnyways, I was wondering if I can borrow your guardian stone.  I can\'t tell you why I need it, but I\'ll return it soon.\n[NEXT]'),
(55106, 'My... Guardian stone?\nWhatever for...?\n... \nOkay, I understand. \nWait there, I\'ll bring it to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55107, '...Yes?\n[BUTTON]=[Condtinue][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry but, could you return my stones?][2]\n[MENU]'),
(55200, 'Name of the Faith and Confidence 4 [Job Change Quest]'),
(55201, 'You have borrowed all needed guardian stones.  \nYou must return to Kiera.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55202, 'Thank you!  I\'ll see you!\n{color,yellow,(I should return to Kiera now.)}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55203, 'Kiera!  Here, I got all the stones you wanted.\nLook I\'ve got Marcudos\' stone, Paella\'s stone, and Geric\'s stone.\nThey sure are transparent and pretty!  Do you have one of your own too?\n[NEXT]'),
(55204, '...\n(Kiera isn\'t speaking)\n[NEXT]'),
(55205, 'Kiera...?  Is everything okay?\n(What\'s wrong with her... )\n[NEXT]'),
(55206, 'I see... \nThat\'s why... \n... \nI\'m sorry, [NAME]...\nThe reason why I asked you to borrow these stones were to measure the spirit\'s trust about you.\n[NEXT]'),
(55207, 'Trust?  About... Me?  What for?\n[NEXT]'),
(55208, 'I... Can\'t tell you that right now, but... \nTo a spirit, these guardian stones are like their life itself.\nFor them to let you hold their guardian stones means that they trust their lives with you.\nTo them... \n[NAME], you are such a person... \n[NEXT]'),
(55209, 'I didn\'t... Know... That guardian stones hold such importance.\nEveryone... Let me borrow their guardian stone without a single question.\nI... Really didn\'t know... \n[NEXT]'),
(55210, 'Don\'t think it as a burden.\n[NAME], you are being trusted by all.\nThe Reason I asked you to bring the guardian stones was to measure your reputation amongst everyone.\n... \nWhen you are ready... \nThere is something important that I would like to ask you.\nLet me know when you are ready, and talk to me again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55211, '... Shouldn\'t you be on your way?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry but, will you return my stones?][2]\n[MENU]'),
(55300, 'What is the Most Important Thing in the World? [Job Change Quest]'),
(55301, 'Kiera is asking you to answer what is the most important thing in the world. \n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55302, '[NAME], I would like to ask you something very important.\n\n{color,yellow,\'What is the most important thing in the world?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55303, 'Huh...?  Wha...?!  Most important thing in the world?\n[NEXT]'),
(55304, 'Yes, the most important thing in the whole wide world, what do you think it is?\n[NEXT]'),
(55305, 'Well... I suppose... It is... \n[NEXT]'),
(55306, '{color,yellow,You don\'t need to answer right away.}\n{color,yellow,You may seek guidance from other wise people around you.}\n{color,yellow,However [NAME], you must tell me \'your\' most treasured thing in the world, not someone elses.}\n[NEXT]'),
(55307, 'My most treasured thing... \nHmm, Okay... I understand.\n(Whew...  It\'s more difficult than I though... )\n\n{color,yellow,Ah...  maybe, the village chiefs could give me some insights...  I should ask Chief Roumenus!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55308, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55400, 'Most Important Thing in the World [Job Change Quest]'),
(55401, 'Kiera asks \'what is the most important thing in the world\'.\nTo make a wise decision, I should seek cousel of wise elders.\nLet\'s ask wise people from Roumen, Elderine, and Uruga, what is their opinions of the most important thing in the world.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55402, 'Hello Roumenus, are you busy at the moment?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55403, 'Oh, [NAME], no I\'m good right now.\nWhat brings you here?\n[NEXT]'),
(55404, 'Well...  I had a question to ask you.\nWhat do you think is the most important thing in the world?\n[NEXT]'),
(55405, 'Huh?  What is that?  Are you asking me a riddle?  Well... I suppose\nYes, that\'s right it\'s {color,yellow,an adventure!!}\n[NEXT]'),
(55406, 'An adventure?  Why is that?\n[NEXT]'),
(55407, 'Well, {color,yellow,without an adventure we wouldn\'t be standing here now would we?}\n{color,yellow,Challenging the unknown, is the power that drives Elves and Humans to new ground.}\nDon\'t you think so?\n[NEXT]'),
(55408, 'Oh... I suppose so. Hmm... \n\n(I should ask other people too.)\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55409, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55500, 'Most Important Thing in the World [Job Change Quest]'),
(55501, 'Kiera asks \'what is the most important thing in the world\'.\nTo make a wise decision, I should seek cousel of wise elders.\nLet\'s ask wise people from Roumen, Elderine, and Uruga, what is their opinions of the most important thing in the world.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55502, 'Hello, Lord Elbama.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55503, 'Hmph?  What brings you here?  I don\'t believe I summoned you.\n[NEXT]'),
(55504, '(Man...)\nWell, I have a question to ask you.\nLord Elbama, what is the most important thing in the world?\n[NEXT]'),
(55505, 'Most important in the world?\n...Why are you asking me that?\n[NEXT]'),
(55506, 'Well, I\'m not really sure myself, so I wanted to get advice from an adviser.\n[NEXT]'),
(55507, '...Hmph.\nSeeking advice are we?\nThat might not be such a bad idea for you.\nThe most important thing for me is... \nAmbition.\n[NEXT]'),
(55508, 'Ambition?\n[NEXT]'),
(55509, 'Yes, without it, no one can strive forward to better themselves.\nOne must always look and hope higher than what they have right now in order to advance.\nNow do you understand?\n[NEXT]'),
(55510, 'Huh?  Yeah, you are right... It\'s just that... Ambition huh?\n(I should ask others too?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55511, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55600, 'Most Important Thing in the World [Job Change Quest]'),
(55601, 'Kiera asks \'what is the most important thing in the world\'.\nTo make a wise decision, I should seek cousel of wise elders.\nLet\'s ask wise people from Roumen, Elderine, and Uruga, what is their opinions of the most important thing in the world.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55602, 'Hello Adrian, it\'s been a while!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55603, '[NAME], so how\'s Alberstol treating you?  What brings you here?\n[NEXT]'),
(55604, 'I missed you of course!\n[NEXT]'),
(55605, 'You always know what to say.\nAre you well?  You do look well.\n[NEXT]'),
(55606, 'Yes I am thanks to you.\nWell, I had a question to ask you.\n[NEXT]'),
(55607, 'You can ask me anything.\n[NEXT]'),
(55608, 'Okay... \nI want to know what you think the most important thing in the world is? Something you treasure more than anything.\n[NEXT]'),
(55609, 'Most treasured and important... \nHmm... Well... \nIt\'s love.\n[NEXT]'),
(55610, 'Love?\n[NEXT]'),
(55611, 'Yes, {color,yellow,Love.}\nWithout love, how would this world will look?\nEven in most excruciating pains, one can overcome it with love.  A most devestating loss can be healed with love.\nHmm... What\'s the matter?\n[NEXT]'),
(55612, 'Huh?  Oh, it\'s nothing. \nI think you have a point.  Love... Love... \n\n{color,yellow,(It\'s odd... What everyone said are all true, but yet something is still missing.  The final piece of the puzzle is still out there... and I don\'t know what that is...  I wish there was someone who can give me a clear answer that quenches my question...)}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55613, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55700, 'Most Important Thing in the World [Job Change Quest]'),
(55701, 'You have run into a mysterious man named Ed.\nHe tells you to seek Kid Woz of Elderine\'s answer if I want to know the answer.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55702, ' Ed, what is the most important thing in the world? Adventure? Ambition? Or Love?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55703, 'Why are you asking me that?\n[NEXT]'),
(55704, 'Well... Kiera gave me a task.\nShe told me to seek an answer to what is the most important thing in the world.\nHowever, Roumenus\'s answer was adventure, Elbama\'s answer was ambition, and Adrian told me it\'s love.\n[NEXT]'),
(55705, 'I see... Well, it seems you haven\'t asked yourself what is the most important thing in the world. So what do you think it is? Is your question answered by one of those examples they gave you?\n[NEXT]'),
(55706, 'Well... Hmm... \nNo.\nIt... Didn\'t.\nAdventure, ambition, and love they are all important, but I think there is something more to it than that.\n[NEXT]'),
(55707, 'Really?\nYou should give yourself more credit.  I believe you already know the answer you seek.\n[NEXT]'),
(55708, 'I do?  No I don\'t really.\nThat\'s why I\'m here to seek your advice.\n[NEXT]'),
(55709, 'Well, I\'ll tell you what.  I promise you that you already have engraved an answer in your heart.\nIt\'s just that... You don\'t understand your own answer.\nIf you really what to know... However, I think there is someone who can interpret your own answer.\nWhy don\'t you go ask Woz what that is.\nI\'m sure he can answer better than any philosopher can.\n[BUTTON]=[Woz huh?  Okay I\'m on my way.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That little kid?  Oh come on! Stop kidding around!][2]'),
(55710, 'Hey Woz!  How have you been?  Look at you!  You look grown.\n[NEXT]'),
(55711, 'Hey!  [NAME]!  Long time no see!\nYeah I\'ve been good.  Patty is good too!  [NAME] look at you!  You look so cool!\n[NEXT]'),
(55712, 'Thanks kid!\nHey... I had a question for you. \n...Woz, what do you think is the most important thing in the world?\nTo you I mean.\n[NEXT]'),
(55713, 'Umm... \nWell... \nThere are so many, I can\'t count!!!\nMy friend Patty, Nina, and, and those sparkling stars in a night sky.  \nAlso, also Karls who is like a daddy to me... And also that stray cat MiMi she\'s so cute.  And this silver spoon that I got as a present!  Yeah and that flower right over there!  That is definately important, and also milk!  It\'ll take forever to count all the important stuff in the world!\n[NEXT]'),
(55714, '...\n... \n...\n!!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(55715, '[NAME]. What\'s wrong?\nAre you okay? \nDid you get a boo boo or something?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55716, 'What\'s keeping you?  You should be on your way.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55800, 'Most Important Thing in the World [Job Change Quest]'),
(55801, 'Seems like Woz answered your question.  You must return to Kiera, in Albersol Ruins.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55802, 'Are you okay?\nHey?\n[NEXT]'),
(55803, 'Huh?  Oh, no I\'m fine Woz...\nThanks... You are right.\nSee ya Woz!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55804, 'Have you found your answer?\n[NEXT]'),
(55805, 'Yes.\nI\'ve found my answer.\nAnd, I think I know why you\'ve asked me that question.\n[NEXT]'),
(55806, 'I see...\nWill you share what you have found?\n[NEXT]'),
(55807, '[BUTTON]=[Adventure.  Nothing beats adventure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ambition!  You got to be ambitious!][2]\n[BUTTON]=[Love. Everyone needs love!][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Everything... Everything in a wold is important.][4]'),
(55808, 'Adventure huh?  Adventure... I understand...\nTo you [NAME], the most important thing in the world is adventure? Are you sure?\n[NEXT]'),
(55809, 'Ambition? \nI see... To [NAME], ambition is most important? Are you sure?\n[NEXT]'),
(55810, 'Love?  Yes, love... It is important.\nI understand [NAME], to you love is most important thing in a world. But is it really YOUR answer?\n[NEXT]'),
(55811, '...\nYes.\nYou are right.\nThat\'s the answer I was hoping for.\n{color,yellow,There isn\'t any less important thing in the world.}\nEven unknown overgrowth in a field, empty sea shells scattered on beaches... Those things that we take for granted, they all are equally important.\nOne individual cannot form this world.  With collective effort, this world exists.\nYou are a true companion of the world.\n{color,yellow,You are ready to take on a new kind of power.}\n[NEXT]'),
(55812, 'That\'s good to hear.\nNow I see what Ed meant... \nLike how he said, I think I knew that from beginning... That\'s why even though the answers by the wise elders all had their merits, it still didn\'t seem right. \n[NEXT]'),
(55813, 'Do you feel the power of spirits around you?\nSpirits of Alberstol have already leaned toward your favor.\n{color,yellow,Now, it\'s time for us to lend a helping hand.}\nWhen you are ready, talk to me again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55814, '...Why?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55900, 'Crossroads [Job Change Quest]'),
(55901, 'Kiera is explaning about powers you can harness as a fighter.\nYou can hear information about Gladiator and Knight\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55902, '[NAME]... What do you think the true power a fighter should have?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(55903, 'A power needed for fighter...  Well... \n[NEXT]'),
(55904, '{color,yellow,Brute power and speed}, that is what Gladiators are made of.\n{color,yellow,Strong defense with precise offense} can sum up what Knights are capable of.\nYou have a choice between, {color,yellow,more destructive force, or being balanced}...\n[NEXT]'),
(55905, '{color,yellow,Gladiator} and... {color,yellow,Knight}...?\n[NEXT]'),
(55906, 'Yes. \n{color,yellow,A gladiator wields destructive axes, and two handed swords... }\nwith their amazing strength and speed...\n{color,yellow,Gladiators utilize their speed to strike their opponent down when they are least expecting, and also have the ability to throw their weapon for a range attack.}\nAlso there is a... {color,yellow,Knight, who wields one handed sword and sheild.}\n{color,yellow,They strike their opponent down with a massive attack power while attaining near perfect defensive measure.  Their Discharge attack is just deadly.}\nNow... it is a time for you to choose the path you\'ll walk.\n\nI bless thee with the spirits of fire and wind.  Listen to their whisper and make your decision.\nWhen you are ready, and know what power you must take on, then return to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(55907, 'You must choose... Gladiator, or Knight...           \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56000, 'Crossroads [Job Change Quest]'),
(56001, 'Kiera is advising you on powers you can harness as a cleric.\nYou\'ll hear information on Guardians and Holy Knights.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56002, '[NAME].  What do you think is the most important power that a cleric will need?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56003, 'Well... To a cleric huh...?  Let\'s see...\n[NEXT]'),
(56004, '{color,yellow,Power to overcome their own death,} that is the true power of a Guardian.\nThen there is the Holy Knight,{color,yellow, who knows to be afraid of tears shed through destruction...}\n[NEXT]'),
(56005, '{color,yellow,Guardian} and... {color,yellow,Holy Knight...}.\n[NEXT]'),
(56006, 'That\'s right.\n{color,yellow, Guardians are masters of Rebirth.  They also can nullify opponent\'s magic spell.}\n{color,yellow,Holy Knights harnesses both destruction and holiness at the same time.  They have the strength of a warrior, but anointed with the holiness of the gods.}\nNow...  It\'s a time for you to choose your path.\n\nGo forth and seek advice from earth and water.  When you are ready to choose... Return to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56007, 'You must decide upon Guardian, or Holy Knight.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56100, 'Crossroads [Job Change Quest]'),
(56101, 'Kiera is advising you on powers you can attain as an archer.\nYou\'ll hear informations about Ranger and Sharp Shooter.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56102, '[NAME].  What do you think is the most important power that an archer can attain?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56103, 'To an archer... ?  Well... \n[NEXT]'),
(56104, '{color,yellow,One with the undetectable footsteps,} that is Rangers.\nThen there is are Sharp Shooters, {color,yellow, who shoot true, straight, and accurrate arrows.}\n[NEXT]'),
(56105, '{color,yellow,Ranger} and... {color,yellow,Sharp Shooter...}?\n[NEXT]'),
(56106, 'That\'s right.\n{color,yellow, Rangers move with such stealth that, their opponent never finds out what they are struck by. They can also set traps.}\n{color,yellow,Sharp Shooters can blind their target. And have the ability to detect others around them.}\nIt\'s now time... to choose your path.\n\nGo seek a blessing from the trees and the winds, then return to me to choose your path.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56107, 'You must choose between Ranger, or Sharp Shooter.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56200, 'Crossroads [Job Change Quest]'),
(56201, 'Kiera is advising you on powers you can attain as a Mage.\nYou\'ll hear informations about Warlock and Wizard.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56202, '[NAME].  What do you think is the most important power a mage can have?\n[BUTTON]=[Start Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56203, 'To a Mage...  Well... Hmm...\n[NEXT]'),
(56204, '\nOne who can {color,yellow,view everything from the sky,} that is what a Warlock is.\nThen there is a Wizard {color,yellow,who can create life.}\n[NEXT]'),
(56205, '{color,yellow,Warlock} and... {color,yellow,Wizard...}?\n[NEXT]'),
(56206, 'It\'s a time for you to choose a path.\n\nYou must receive a blessing from all elemental powers... Fire, Wind, Water, Earth, and Trees...  Listen to what they whisper to your heart then choose your path.\nWhen your heart is settled on a path, return to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56207, 'You must choose between Wizard, or Warlock.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56300, 'Blessing of Fire Spirit Pamelaous [Job Change Quest]'),
(56301, 'Let\'s receive a blessing from Fire Spirit Pamelaous.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56302, '\n{color,yellow,[NAME]... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Pamelaous\'  Whisper][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56303, 'Huh...  Wha...?!\n[NEXT]'),
(56304, '{color,yellow,\'By the firing heat of red blood and the blazing heart that they course through... }\n{color,yellow,Your heart, blood, and soul will be blessed... }\n\n{color,yellow,It\'s time for you to be protected by us... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Received blessing of Fire Spirit][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56305, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56400, 'Wind Spirit Napion\'s blessing [Job Change Quest]'),
(56401, 'Let\'s receive Wind Spirit Napion\'s blessing.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56402, '\n{color,yellow,[NAME]... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Napion\'s whisper][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56403, 'Huh...?!\n[NEXT]'),
(56404, '{color,yellow,Even the breeze that caresses your cheeks... }\n{color,yellow,Petals dancing in the wind will bless you...} \n\n{color,yellow,It\'s time for you to be protected by us... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Received blessing of Wind Spirits][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56405, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56500, 'Water Spirit Alki\'s blessing [Job Change Quest]'),
(56501, 'Let\'s receive Water Spirit Alki\'s blessing.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56502, '\n{color,yellow,[NAME]... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alki\'s whisper][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56503, 'What...?!\n[NEXT]'),
(56504, '{color,yellow,Power that sustains a life...} \n{color,yellow,Your heart will be purified by true heart... }\n\n{color,yellow,It\'s time for you to be protected by us... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Received blessing of Water Spirit][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56505, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56600, 'Earth Spirit Vandelio\'s blessing [Job Change Quest]'),
(56601, 'Let\'s receive Earth Spirit Vandelio\'s blessing.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56602, '\n{color,yellow,[NAME]... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Vandelio\'s whisper][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56603, 'Huh...?!\n[NEXT]'),
(56604, '{color,yellow,I will support your two standing legs...} \n{color,yellow,I will lead you to wisdom... }\n\n{color,yellow,It\'s time for us to protect you... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Received blessing of the Earth Spirit][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56605, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56700, 'Tree Spirit Ophilia\'s blessing [Job Change Quest]'),
(56701, 'Let\'s receive a blessing from Earth Spirit Ophilia.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56702, '\n{color,yellow,[NAME]... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ophilia\'s whisper][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56703, 'Huh...?!\n[NEXT]'),
(56704, '{color,yellow,By the power of the source to start a heart beat... }\n{color,yellow,I will ease the load of your every step... }\n\n{color,yellow,It\'s a time for us to protect you... }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Received a blessing of the Tree Spirit][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56705, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56800, 'Return to Kiera [Job Change Quest]'),
(56801, 'Please return to Kiera.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56802, 'Dear holy one, you have received blessings from elemental spirits.\n{color,yellow,Now, please return to Kiera... }\nWe\'ll be watching you.\n[BUTTON]=[I understand][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56900, 'Decision [Job Change Quest]'),
(56901, 'You have received a blessing from the elemental spirits.\nNow you must listen to Kiera, and make your final decision on what type of power you\'ll take on.\nYou can choose between Gladiator and Knight.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56902, 'You\'ve been blessed... \nAs I have suspected, you have become stronger.\nIt\'s all thanks to your diligence and pure heart.  You have done well.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(56903, 'Not at all... \nIt\'s all thanks to you Kiera.\n[NEXT]'),
(56904, 'To a blessed one... There will be the chance to choose their own path.\nYou must choose your path in order to continue the daunting journey ahead.\nYou\'ll be given one chance... \nand one chance only.\nSo, what will be your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be the Gladiator][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be the Knight][2]'),
(56905, '{color,yellow,Gladiators wield poweful two handed swords and axes... } And utilize their brute physical strength and speed to overcome obstacles.\n{color,yellow,Their fast speed and weapon throws will devestate any opponents that are in their way.}\nIs the power of Gladiator what you seek as your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][Gladiator]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(56906, '{color,yellow,Knights use swords sheilds...}\n{color,yellow, Knights have strong balanced attack as well as perfect defense, while destroying enemies with their Discharge skill.}\n\nIs the power of Knight what you seek as your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][Knight]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(56907, 'I understand.  This is the power you were seeking.\n[NEXT]'),
(56908, 'I feel... A strength within.\nThere is something blazing in my heart.\n[NEXT]'),
(56909, 'You have received a new power.\nHowever... \nHow you wield that power depends...  Sorely on you.\nPlease take this.\nThis... is the burden you must carry on from now on.\n\nMay Legel\'s blessing be with you always... \n\n{color,yellow,I have prepared a present that was blessed by Legel.  When you are ready, please talk to me again.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(56910, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57000, 'Decision [Job Change Quest]'),
(57001, 'You have received a blessing from the elemental spirits.\nNow you must listen to Kiera, and make your final decision on what type of power you\'ll take on.\nYou can choose between Guardian and Holy Knight.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57002, 'You\'ve been blessed... \nAs I have suspected, you have become stronger.\nIt\'s all thanks to your diligence and pure heart.  You have done well.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57003, 'Not at all... \nIt\'s all thanks to you Kiera.\n[NEXT]'),
(57004, 'To a blessed one... They will have a chance to choose their own path.\nYou must choose one of the paths in order to continue the daunting journey ahead.\nYou\'ll be given one chance... \nAnd one chance only.\nSo, what will be your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be a Guardian][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be a Holy Knight][2]\n'),
(57005, 'Guardians {color,yellow,overcome their own death}... {color,yellow, They are the master of rebirth, and have the power to nullify magics casted upon them.}\n\nIs this the path that you are seeking?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(57006, '{color,yellow,Holy Knights possess both holiness and destruction.} \n{color,yellow,Their attack abilities are as strong as a warrior.}\n{color,yellow, One who fears the tear shed through destruction...} That is what the Holy Knights are all about.\n\nIs this the path that you are seeking?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(57007, 'I understand.  This is the power you were seeking.\n[NEXT]'),
(57008, 'I feel... A strength within.\nThere is something blazing in my heart.\n[NEXT]'),
(57009, 'You have received a new power.\nHowever... \nHow you wield that power depends...  Sorely on you.\nPlease take this.\nThis... Is the burden you must carry on from now on.\n\nMay Legel\'s blessing be with you always... \n\n{color,yellow,I have prepared a present that was blessed by Legel.  When you are ready, please talk to me again.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57010, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57100, 'Decision [Job Change Quest]'),
(57101, 'You have received a blessing from the elemental spirits.\nNow you must listen to Kiera, and make your final decision on what type of power you\'ll take on.\nYou can choose between Ranger and Sharp Shooter.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57102, 'You\'ve been blessed... \nAs I have suspected, you have become stronger.\nIt\'s all thanks to your diligence and pure heart.  You have done well.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57103, 'Not at all... \nIt\'s all thanks to you Kiera.\n[NEXT]'),
(57104, 'As a blessed one... You will have the chance to choose your own path.\nYou must choose in order to continue the daunting journey ahead.\nYou\'ll be given one chance... \nAnd one chance only.\nSo, what will be your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be the Ranger][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'ll be the Sharp Shooter][2]\n'),
(57105, '{color,yellow,A Ranger is one with undetectable movement...} \n{color,yellow, They move with stealth while setting traps for their opponents.}\n\nIs the Ranger the path you seek?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][Ranger]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(57106, 'Sharp Shooter {color,yellow,shoots an arrow that never misses...}\n{color,yellow,Their arrows can blind their target.  They can also detect others who are around them.}\n\nIs the Sharp Shooter the path you seek?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][SharpShooter]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(57107, 'I understand.  This is the power you were seeking.\n[NEXT]'),
(57108, 'I feel... A strength within.\nThere is something blazing in my heart.\n[NEXT]'),
(57109, 'You have received a new power.\nHowever... \nHow you wield that power depends...  Sorely on you.\nPlease take this.\nThis... Is the burden you must carry on from now on.\n\nMay Legel\'s blessing be with you always... \n\n{color,yellow,I have prepared a present that was blessed by Legel.  When you are ready, please talk to me again.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57110, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57200, 'Decision [Job Change Quest]'),
(57201, 'You have received a blessing from the elemental spirits.\nNow you must listen to Kiera, and make your final decision on what type of power you\'ll take on.\nYou can choose between Warlock and Wizard.\n(Job Change Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57202, 'You\'ve been blessed... \nAs I have suspected, you have become stronger.\nIt\'s all thanks to your diligence and pure heart.  You have done well.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Job Change Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57203, 'Not at all... \nIt\'s all thanks to you Kiera.\n[NEXT]'),
(57204, 'As a blessed one... You will be given the chance to choose your own path.\nYou must choose your path in order to continue the daunting journey ahead.\nYou\'ll be given one chance... \nAnd one chance only.\nSo, what will be your new path?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It is Warlock][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is Wizard][2]'),
(57205, '{color,yellow,One who governs from above,} That is a {color,yellow,Warlock} They have a power to put opponents to sleep.\n\nIs Warlock the path you seek?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][Warlock]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(57206, '{color,yellow, Wizards} can {color,yellow,summon creatures to fight along side them.} They have power to teleport to where enemies are at, meanwhile never displaying any weakness to an enemy.\n\nIs Wizard the path you seek?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes][Wizard]\n[BUTTON]=[No][2]'),
(57207, 'I understand.  This is the power you were seeking.\n[NEXT]'),
(57208, 'I feel... A strength within.\nThere is something blazing in my heart.\n[NEXT]'),
(57209, 'You have received a new power.\nHowever... \nHow you wield that power depends...  Sorely on you.\nPlease take this.\nThis... Is the burden you must carry on from now on.\n\nMay Legel\'s blessing be with you always... \n\n{color,yellow,I have prepared a present that was blessed by Legel.  When you are ready, please talk to me again.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Job Change Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57210, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57300, 'Blessing of Isya'),
(57301, 'Kiera gave you a gift.\nKiera is telling you that all the inhabitants within Isya will bless you.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57302, '{color,yellow,This is a first gift I\'ve prepared for you}.\nYou have... Achieved an important feat.\nYou may not feel right about it now but, it\'s okay to be happy about it.  Both you and I are allowed to celebrate.\nYou\'ll be blessed by all the inhabitants from the towns.\nCongratulations. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57303, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57400, 'Remi\'s Blessing'),
(57401, 'Remi has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57402, '[NAME], congratulations on your new job.\nThis is a little something of gratitude that I\'ve prepared.\nI hope to see more of your awesome work in the future!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57403, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57500, 'Roumenus\' Blessing'),
(57501, 'Roumenous has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57502, '[NAME], congratulations on your new job!\nI knew you could do it!\nThis is little something something that I put together Ha Ha... I hope you like it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complet the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57503, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57600, 'James\' Blessing'),
(57601, 'James has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57602, 'Oh!  [NAME], congratulations!\nYou really are something!  I knew from the beginning that you\'d pull through!   Whahahaha!\nPlease take this, it\'s nothing really big...  I hope you enjoy them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57603, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57700, 'Pey\'s Blessing'),
(57701, 'Pey has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57702, '[NAME], congratulations.\nWow...  You really are something huh?\nHere, take this.  It\'s just something I want you to have. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57703, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57800, 'Zach\'s Blessing'),
(57801, 'Zach has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57802, '[NAME], congratulations!\nI knew you could do it!\nRemember, you can boast around your blessings okay?!\nHere, why don\'t you take this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57803, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57900, 'Julia\'s Blessing'),
(57901, 'Julia has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57902, '[NAME], congratulations.\nPlease take this as my token of appreciation.\nI hope you\'ll succeed in your future endeavor!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57903, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58000, 'Ruby\'s Blessing'),
(58001, 'Ruby has prepared a gift for you.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58002, '[NAME], congratulations on your job change.\nWow... I didn\'t know you had it in you!\nHere, this is my gift to you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58003, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58100, 'Raina\'s Blessing'),
(58101, 'Reina has prepared a gift for you.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
