(58400, 'Vietree\'s Blessing'),
(58401, 'Vietri has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58402, 'Congratulations.\nI never thought that anyone I know could achieve an accomplishment like you have.\nWell, please take this.  It\'s to celebrate your new achievement.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58403, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58500, 'Elbama\'s Blessing'),
(58501, 'Elbama has prepared a gift.  Let\'s go receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58502, 'Huh... \nCongratulations.\nIt was really a surprise when I heard of your promotion.\nThis is my gift for your grand achievement.\nI wish the best in your future endeavors.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58503, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58600, 'Shutian\'s Blessing'),
(58601, 'Shutian has prepared.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58602, '[NAME]! I really can\'t believe this!\nIt seems like it was a just yesterday that you were running around with a wooden stick as a weapon... \nMan, this really is something... Am I crying?  Whahaha.\nHere, take this!  You deserve every single bit of it!\nCongratulations.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58603, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58700, 'Karl\'s Blessing'),
(58701, 'Karl has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58702, 'Oh, [NAME], congratulations!\nYou really are something!  I knew you could do it!  Whahahaha!\nThis is my gift to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58703, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58800, 'Kenton\'s Blessing'),
(58801, 'Kenton has prepared a gift.  Let\'s receive it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58802, 'Heeeeeey! [NAME], how are you doin\'!\nYou are soooooo cool!\nWhoa!  Here, take it!  It\'s little piece of me!\nMy love to you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
