(59201, 'Marty has prepared a gift.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59202, 'Hey!  That\'s amazing!\n[NAME], congratulations.  You finally got a promotion huh!\nDid you tell Ruby yet?\nOh yeah!  Before I forget, this is a gift from me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
