(60101, 'Bellon has prepared a gift.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60102, 'Whoa... [NAME]. \nThat\'s great news.\nYou want to hear my congratulatory song?\nHey!  Wait, you should get your gift!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
