(60401, 'Forest Tim has prepared a gift\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60402, '[NAME], congratulations.\nIt\'s really awesome work you did...!\nPlease take this.  This is to celebrate your great work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60403, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(60500, 'Curly\'s Blessing'),
(60501, 'Curly has prepared a gift.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60502, 'Whoa!  That\'s really something!\nCongrats!\nIf I knew that you had it in you, I would\'ve been much nicer to you!  Whahahaha!\nOh yeah, please take this!  You did an awesome job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60503, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(60600, 'Cyburn\'s Blessing'),
(60601, 'Cyburn has prepared a gift.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60602, '[NAME], congratulations.\nYou did an amazing job!\nPlease take this.  This is my gift to you!  Whahahahaha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60603, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(60700, 'Sean\'s Blessing'),
(60701, 'Sean has prepared a gift\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60702, 'Hmph!\nYou are tougher than you look.\nI still remember your novice days just like yesterday.\nWhahaha.\nHere, please take this gift I prepared for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60703, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(60800, 'Maxuter\'s Blessing'),
(60801, 'Maxouter has prepared a gift\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60802, '[NAME], congratulations.\nThat\'s an amazing job you did...!\nThis is my gift to you.  Please take it.\nGood luck in your new endeavors.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60803, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(60900, 'Taylor\'s Blessing'),
(60901, 'Taylor has prepared a gift.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60902, '[NAME]... \nCongratulations!\nWhen, Kiera was taking interest in you, I should\'ve seen your potentials...\nWell...\nIt seems like I have a long way to train.\nThis is my gift to you.  Please take it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(60903, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29550, 'Battlefield!'),
(29551, 'Ruby, the skill master of Roumen always has good advice to anyone who wants to level up fast. Let\'s see what she has to say.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29552, 'Welcome. Is there a problem? You don\'t look well.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29553, 'No... no problem.\nI\'m just tired from hunting monsters all day long. It\'s getting harder and harder to level up and grinding can get boring sometimes.\n[NEXT]'),
(29554, 'Not a problem?!\nIt is a big problem.\nHmm... we got to find a solution...\nYou said leveling can be boring right?\nWell... how about somewhere {color,yellow,more thrilling}?\n[NEXT]'),
(29555, 'Thrilling? \n[NEXT]'),
(29556, 'That\'s right!\nIt\'s kind of a {color,yellow,dangerous place} but...\n[NAME], I think you can handle it.\nThat place is called... {color,yellow,Battlefield!}\n{color,yellow,Everyone is your enemy when you are in this place. It doesn\'t matter who it is. It\'s you versus everyone else.}\nBut the danger comes with a reward. Both {color,yellow,item} drops, and {color,yellow,Experience points} are much higher than normal fields.\nWhat do you think?\n[NEXT]'),
(29557, 'Really? Battlefield huh...?\nI didn\'t know there was such a place.\nHow do I get there? I want to check it out right away!\n[NEXT]'),
(29558, 'Hahaha, no need to rush.\nBattlefield is not going anywhere.\n{color,yellow,Go to Elderine, and you will see the Battle Field Guard located behind Item Merchant Nina.}\nIf you talk to the Battle Field Guard, you will be able to move to the  {color,yellow,Forest Perimeter}, from there, you will be able to move to the desired Battlefield.\nIf you are ready, try the {color,yellow,level 20, Abysmal Cave}?\nIf the Abysmal Cave is not challenging enough for you, try the level 30 Battlefield.\n[NEXT]'),
(29559, 'I am so excited! I\'m going to go there right now.\nHmm... I hope it\'s not too dangerous...\nBut I don\'t care... I\'m not afraid!\nThank you so much for the information Ruby!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
