(22555, '????, ??, ??????. ???????? ???????? ????????... \n{color,yellow,???? ???? ????????. ??? ?????? ???? ?????????!}\n[NEXT]'),
(22556, '{color,yellow,??... ???? ???????}\n??, {color,yellow,???? ?? ???????? ????.} ?? ?? ???? ?? ????????.\n????... ?????? ???? ???????? ?????????? ?????? ?????? ??????.\n??... ???????? ?? ?? ??????. ?????? ???????? ???? ???? ???????? ?????\n\n[BUTTON]=[?????? ????][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(22557, '... ... ?? ???? ?????\n[BUTTON]=[????][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34550, 'The Forgotten Part 1 (Event Quest)'),
(34551, 'Element Helper Remi of Roumen asks you to find Forgotten Relics of the forgotten wars.\n(Forgotten Relics can be found by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34552, 'Please everyone remember those that died to protect our lives. Honor those that fell in the wars of the past. Recover the Forgotten Relics they lost, and I shall reward you with Memorial Incense to burn at Teva\'s memorial statue.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34553, 'Lost Relics?\n[NEXT]'),
(34554, '[NAME], All over the world creatures keep relics that soldiers lost on their quest to bring peace to Isya. \n[NEXT]'),
(34555, 'Well, it won\'t be easy! But I\'m pretty sure that I will be able to help.\n[NEXT]'),
(34556, 'Please! That would be an extraordinary achivement, please collect {color,yellow,30 Forgotten Relics}?\nWe must all honor those that died for us, and never forget their sacrifice!\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I\'ll help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should we care about the dead?][2]'),
(34557, 'I\'ve found a few items that might be relics!\nYou can protect the honor of the past warriors now!\n[NEXT]'),
(34558, 'Thank you so much! \nTake this Memorial Incense to Adrian, in Uruga to burn it at Teva\'s memorial statue, she should reward your efforts!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34559, 'Have you found any {color,yellow,Forgotten Relics} yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34650, 'The Forgotten Part 2 (Event Quest)'),
(34651, 'Element Helper Remi of Roumen asks you to deliver the Memorial Incense to Town Chief Adrian of Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34652, 'You have done good. Now you must deliver the {color,yellow,Memorial Incense} to Town Chief Adrian, who was a good friend of Teva.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34653, 'I would be glad to honor Teva\'s death.\n[NEXT]'),
(34654, 'I think that Teva would be happy to know you still remember her.\n[BUTTON]=[I could never forget her!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Who cares about Teva!][2]'),
(34655, 'Adrian! I brought you Memorial Incense to burn at Teva\'s memorial shrine!\n[NEXT]'),
(34656, 'Thank you so much! \n(Adrian burns the Incense, and a light shines down and bathes you in a golden glow.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34657, 'Have you delivered the {color,yellow,Memorial Incense}?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26750, 'Will of Iyzel'),
(26751, 'Ancient Templar Maria of Roumen has found the will of her master.\nLet\'s listen to Maria\'s story. (Epic quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26752, 'I am Ancient Templar Maria guarding Roumen\'s Seal.\n[NAME], Did you know my master, Iyzel Reaar, once was called the Wizard of Light long ago?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26753, 'Iyzel Reaar? Well... I\'ve never heard of him before.\nHe was your master?\n[NEXT]'),
(26754, 'Yes, he was.\nMaybe... the news about my master is almost gone.\nHe renounced the world and spent the rest of his life raising and teaching me. [NAME], I called you because I have something urgent to tell you.\n[NEXT]'),
(26755, 'Me...? What is it...?\n[NEXT]'),
(26756, 'Last night on my master\'s 3rd death day... I was cleaning his room.\nIt wasn\'t that special because I do it every year. But this time... \nI found his will from a clear box that I\'ve never seen before. \nThe story is this... He was researching the power of darkness when he was young. Life and materials... and their relationship in magic... perhaps it was an evil thing to do. The tower, once was called the \'Tower of the White Wizard\', now remains somewhere in the Forest of Mist.\nAt the time, it was full of beautiful lights. But... now....\n[NEXT]'),
(26757, '...now...?\n[NEXT]'),
(26758, 'Well... {color, yellow, It became the terrible tower filled only with the power of darkness.}\nMy master was... {color, yellow, regretting his arrogant and greedy feelings...}\nHe suffered from regret and a guilty conscience his whole life. He wanted to erase\nwhat he had done by raising me, but he died with the look of sadness till his final breath.\n{color, yellow, Now I realize the sadness and dark shadow hidden in his eyes.}\n(weeping)\n[NEXT]'),
(26759, 'I see... Maria, it\'s not your fault. Don\'t be sad, alright?\n[NEXT]'),
(26760, '(weeping)\nYes, I\'ll try.\n{color, yellow, There can\'t be anymore harm because of that tower.}\nPerhaps my master had a hunch of what would happen to the tower after his death. Teaching the magic of the Seal intensively...... I can tell.\nThe tower built by his mistakes won\'t cause harm to the people...\nThat\'s what my master wants...\n{color, yellow, \'Tower of Iyzel\', I\'ll call it this way...}\nIt can\'t just be hidden like this. Anyone who has done wrong must pay the price for their mistakes. \n[NEXT]'),
(26761, 'Right! I agree. Is there anything I can help with?\nI am the brave Henneath Adventurer! Feel free to tell me if there\'s anything I can do!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26762, 'Ah... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26850, 'Tower of Iyzel 2nd Floor'),
(26851, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 2nd floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26852, 'While alive, he said he once created monsters called Magic Spirits and gave them his own name. They were his first work. \nI heard they are very annoying and aggressive; but they are also weak... not dangerous at all.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26853, 'Ha-ha! Aggressive, but not dangerous....\nSounds like he made them for fun.\n[NEXT]'),
(26854, 'That\'s my opinion, too. How lucky! If dangerous monsters were put near the entrance, it would be very easy for them to break the entrance and come out.\nFirst of all, please defeat the monsters of the tower\'s 2nd floor.\nThey are {color, yellow, Iyzel Imps and Iyzel Gang Imps.}\n[BUTTON]=[Sure! It\'s a piece of cake!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m afraid I can\'t do that right now... ][2]'),
(26855, 'Maria! I\'ve defeated the monsters of the tower. They were as weak as I expected.\nThey were knocked out by a single blow. Ha-ha.\n[NEXT]'),
(26856, 'Yeah... Lucky you. This is really fortunate that weak monsters are downstairs.\nYou did a good job. I\'ll check the entrance, so please wait a little.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26857, 'Well... the tower is really high...\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26950, 'Tower of Iyzel 3rd Floor'),
(26951, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 3rd floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26952, 'As expected, the 3rd floor also swarm with monsters.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26953, 'Yes, I know. Monsters of the 3rd floor were much stronger than the 2nd floor.\n[NEXT]'),
(26954, 'Oh dear, you\'ve already come back from there.\nI should have been more careful...\nIt\'s really hard to get rid of all the monsters by myself.\nPlease {color, yellow, defeat Iyzel Hungry Wolves and Iyzel Ratmen} of the 3rd floor.\n[BUTTON]=[Yep! You can count on me!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What? Why me?][2]'),
(26955, 'Yippee! I\'m back. They didn\'t even touch me, not a bit!\n[NEXT]'),
(26956, 'Is that so? I\'m glad to see you are okay.\nI guess there are no dangerous monsters yet. Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26957, 'Did you not go to the tower yet?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27050, 'Tower of Iyzel 4th Floor'),
(27051, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 4th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27052, 'How was the 3rd floor?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27053, 'Well... the 3rd floor... It wasn\'t that hard. Monsters were rather weak... \nThey don\'t use any powerful magic.\n[NEXT]'),
(27054, 'Ah... was it? Good for you...\nI was going to go to the 4th floor, but it\'s beyond my power.\nCould you please settle the 4th floor? If you defeat {color, yellow, Iyzel Boars and Iyzel Kebings}, I can take care of the rest.\nI know it\'s easy work for [NAME], isn\'t it?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course! It\'s easy as pie!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am not sure about the 4th floor.][2]'),
(27055, 'Hey! I\'ve cleared the 4th floor!\n[NEXT] '),
(27056, 'I see. Thank you. Now I also need to get ready to start.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27057, 'Hm....\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27150, 'Iyzel, Beginning of Chaos'),
(27151, 'A mysterious monster has been found in the Tower of Iyzel.\nMaria thinks this monster is the first evil spirit of her master Iyzel.\nThe Dust Golem has to be defeated. (Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27152, 'On the 5th floor of the tower... I... finally saw \'that\'.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27153, '...\'that\'? You mean \'that\'....\nWhat is that...?\n[NEXT]'),
(27154, 'It is a \'Golem\'.\nA dark creature that my master\'s evil heart caused... dark Magic Spirit.\nIt wasn\'t made as its original purpose. Probably the power of magic formation made the Golem. That was the first dark Magic Spirit born from the darkness of the tower. It seems that magic formation created the Dust Golem by massing dark power and dust in an empty room. {color, yellow, Please defeat the Dust Golem.}\nIt will be impossible to destroy the magic formation completely, but the Dust Golem must be defeated!\n[BUTTON]=[OK! Leave it to me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Eh? me? Weren\'t you supposed to do it?][2]'),
(27155, 'Maria! I\'ve defeated the Dust Golem!\nBut I\'m worried... {color. Yellow, the magic formation isn\'t disappearing.}\nShall the Dust Golem be born again?\n[NEXT]'),
(27156, 'Yeah... I think so.\nUnless the magic formation disappears, the Dust Golem will be born again and again. But we can stall for now while I can make the Seal of the tower stronger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27157, '...Um.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27250, 'Tower of Iyzel 6th floor'),
(27251, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 6th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27252, 'Gosh... it\'s getting tougher.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27253, 'Did you finish checking the 5th floor?\nThere are monsters on the 6th floor, aren\'t there?\n[NEXT]'),
(27254, 'Yes, of course... there are.\nIt will take a very long time to check the tower if things go like this.\nCould you defeat the wicked monsters of the tower?  Defeat  \n{color, yellow, Iyzel Skeleton Archers}, please.\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry! I\'ll be back in one second!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I\'m not good enough to go to the 6th floor.][2]'),
(27255, 'I\'m back, Maria! \nEverything\'s in order on the 6th floor.\n[NEXT]'),
(27256, 'Wow, you are so fast! I\'m so pleased.\nThank you. I hope you will do great on the next floor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27257, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27350, 'Tower of Iyzel 8th floor'),
(27351, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 8th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27352, 'I rely upon you today, too. Monsters of the 8th floor.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27353, 'Yes! Now it\'s more like my daliy routine. He-he. Not bad.\n[NEXT]'),
(27354, 'Good for you. To be frank, I was worried a litte if you felt annoyed for doing this work. Thank you. {color, yellow, Please defeat Iyzel Skeleton and Iyzel Skeleton Archer.}\n[BUTTON]=[Got it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Uh-uh, I\'ve flashed on something very urgent!][2]'),
(27355, 'Maria~~~~ I\'m baaaaaaaaaack~~~\n[NEXT]'),
(27356, 'I\'m glad to see you in good condition.\nYou look very energetic and quite healthful since you\'ve been going to the tower!\nHave you been developing your strength?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27357, 'It\'s the 8th floor.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27450, 'Tower of Iyzel 9th floor'),
(27451, 'Magic books of 9th floor have been given life by the power of dark magic, and are acting violently.\nYou should collect the pages of Iyzel Archmage Books. (Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27452, 'Magic books in the tower are a real pain in my neck. \nThey do whatever they like, I even got hurt in my face by the pages.\nI thought they were weak... but they were pretty strong.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27453, 'Oh... my! They cut your face! How naughty.\nThey really have a violent temper though. I shall eliminate them all at once...\n[NEXT] '),
(27454, 'You can\'t completely sweep them all by just defeating them. \nIsn\'t there any other idea? Ah! That reminds me... the master had always drawn the magic formation that can conjure up energy. Maybe that magic formation is still forming energy, so the books can revive.\n{color, yellow, [NAME], please bring me ripped pages of Iyzel Archmage Books. will be enough.} I\'ll look for a way to get rid of the magic formation.\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope!][2]'),
(27455, 'Hurray! Maria! Here are the pages. \nLots of strange pictures are drawn here. Maybe you are right, these are collecting energy, the pages are still warm.\n[NEXT]'),
(27456, 'Ah...! They are!\nAs I expected, this is the magic formation that can bring energy of the tower together.\nIt was collecting the dark power and using their energy.\nYou are a great help! Thank you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27457, 'Well... I feel uneasy to see my respecful master\'s magic formation\'s being misused like this.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27550, 'Collection'),
(27551, 'Lord of Elderine, Elbama, has read the letter Maria sent to each village.\nElbama said he would also participate in purging the tower.\nThe Iyzel Skeleton Warrior\'s Weapon on the 9th floor should be brought.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27552, 'Good to see you! I was looking for you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27553, 'Ah... yes... May I ask what is...?\n[NEXT]'),
(27554, 'I heard you are trying to purge the \'Tower of Iyzel\'. And of course, I\'ll take part in that work, too. So I am going to suggest you a good deal.\nHave you been to the {color, yellow, 9th floor of the tower}? There were {color, yellow, Iyzel Skeleton Warriors}, right?\nBring his {color, yellow, weapon}. I will reward you, of course.\n[BUTTON]=[Well, oh, okay...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What are you going to do with that?][2]'),
(27555, 'Well, Lord Elbama. Here it is. But what is this?\n[NEXT]'),
(27556, 'Ah. Good job.\n(murmuring)\nSo my weapon collection\'s been added again... haha.\nAh... were you still there? You can leave now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27557, 'Actually, I am not taking you for my personal matter.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27650, 'Iyzel, Acceleration of Chaos'),
(27651, 'It seems a gigantic mysterious monster is on the 10th floor of the tower similar to what was seen on the 5th floor.\nYou should defeat the Stone Golem.\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27652, 'It\'s already the 10th floor. Have we covered only half the distance?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27653, 'I heard it\'s 20-stories. Lots of work to do. We should put forth our strength!\n[NEXT]'),
(27654, 'Thank you. I feel better as you encourage me like this.\nI heard a strange sound when I was checking the 9th floor.\n*Thud* (Sound of hitting the floor) Something huge and heavy was striking the floor.\nI could feel how enormous it was. \n{color, yellow, If it\'s the one like a gigantic Golem seen on the 5th floor, it will be very dangerous.}\nIt\'s better to fight it in numbers.\n[BUTTON]=[Count on me. I\'ll certainly defeat whatever it is!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can it be really done?][2]'),
(27655, 'Oh, my back.\nMaria! It was the Stone Golem. I guess a gigantic stone was moved by magical powers.\n[NEXT]'),
(27656, 'I see... I expected that... \nAs you know, plenty of magic is necessary to move the Golem.\nPower to move that gigantic Golem, is not just common magic.\nIt is obvious that the power of magic coming from the tower is... far beyond our imagination.\nWell... I\'m really worried about our future.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27657, '...... I hope everything works out.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27750, 'Unexpected Event'),
(27751, 'Wishis of Elderine said her wand is in the Tower of Iyzel.\nLet\'s defeat Iyzel flying staffs and  take back the wand of Wishis.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27752, '...[NAME]. Can you come here for second?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27753, 'Me? Wishis, what is the matter?\n[NEXT]'),
(27754, 'Well, to be frank.... I\'ve recalled something embarrassing. If you don\'t mind, [NAME], it\'s just between you and me.\nWell... indeed... I\'ve been to the Tower of Iyzel with my wand which was made for fun long ago. I sneaked in the tower and put it there...\nI feel really embarrassed now. Some time ago, I went out to check the tower and... {color, yellow, that wand was staring at me from the window.}\nI was surprised, and also felt bad.\n[NAME], can you {color, yellow, get that wand back} for me?\nIt\'s kind of hard for me to clear the seat, so... \n[BUTTON]=[Well, I\'ll do it for the present.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What? Something is fishy...][2]'),
(27755, 'Wishis, here\'s your wand.\nBy the way, I heard the tower was open long, long ago. Then how old are you...?\n[NEXT]'),
(27756, 'Ahem. Oh, my! I forgot to do something very very important...\nAnd... Ignorance is bliss. Now I gotta go. Anyway, thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27757, '...... Don\'t ask too many questions.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27850, 'A work unwilling to do'),
(27851, 'Lord of Elderine, Elbama, asks for help again under the name of purging the tower.\nRed Liver of Iyzel Tomb Fox has to be brought.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27852, 'Oh, you are here. What made you come so late?\nIt\'s been a while I\'ve called you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27853, 'Ah... I was quite busy.\nAnyway, what\'s the matter...?\n[NEXT]'),
(27854, 'I see, you are busy for the Tower of Iyzel. That tower is a real headache. \nThat\'s why I called you though. I\'ll also be working on purging the tower, you know.\nThere\'s Iyzel Tomb Fox on the 12th floor. Get me {color, yellow, \'red liver\' of Iyzel Tomb Fox.} It\'s not a problem to you, right?\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, not a big deal. Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No matter how easy it is, NO!][2]'),
(27855, 'Here. \n[NEXT]'),
(27856, 'Hm, you really got me one. Thank you.\nWhy? Hand it over. Don\'t even try to bother me with questions. I\'m not a person for leisure.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27857, '......\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27950, 'Tower of Iyzel 12th floor'),
(27951, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 12th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27952, 'Ah... I\'m full of dust. I have a sore throat because of the dust of the tower.\nAre you alright, [NAME]?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(27953, 'Me? Of course!! Don\'t worry! I got a strong body!\n[NEXT]'),
(27954, 'I see. Good for you. \nThere will be more powerful monsters on the 12th floor.\n{color, yellow, Please defeat Iyzel Tomb Fox and Iyzel Wild Wolves.}\n[BUTTON]=[OK! It won\'t take long.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Gosh... when will this end...][2]'),
(27955, 'I\'m back, I\'ve defeated them completely!\n[NEXT]'),
(27956, 'Ah, you came back. Let me brush away the dust.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(27957, 'ACHOO~\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28050, 'Tower of Iyzel 13th floor'),
(28051, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 13th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28052, 'Achoo... I still have a sore throat.\nHm, this time is 13th floor.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28053, 'Maria, you don\'t look so good...\nAre you alright? If it\'s hard, you can speak slowly.\n[NEXT]'),
(28054, '(Coughing)\nI, I\'m alright. Now is the time to concentrate on purging the tower. I\'ll take care of myself after that.\n{color, yellow, I heard there are Iyzel Zombies on the 13th floor. Please defeat of them.}\n[BUTTON]=[OK. I got that. Please take care, Maria!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Monsters are not the problem now.][2]'),
(28055, 'I\'m back. I\'ve got them all defeated!\n[NEXT]'),
(28056, 'You came back. Ah... I\'m so sorry... You did... a good job... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28057, '(Coughing)\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28150, 'Green Maria 1'),
(28151, 'Maria was checking the tower, and she got attack by the Poison Golem. Her body turned green.\nLet\'s ask Julia for help. (Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28152, '...(weeping)\nOh, my!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]]'),
(28153, 'Oh, my! Maria! What happened to you? Are you suffering from some kind of skin disease or what? Your face... and your whole body turned green... look at these hands, neck... what happened? \n[NEXT]'),
(28154, 'I went to the tower... then I became like this.\n{color, yellow, I was purging the Poison Golem... and...}\nFortunately, I\'ve cured the poison, but I can\'t do anything with this color.\nWhat am I going to do? I can\'t go around like this!! (crying)\n[NEXT]'),
(28155, 'Calm down, Maria. I\'ll find a way. First of all, did you get any help from the Healer?\nAh, you can\'t ask for any help in this condition. Let me go to Julia.\n{color, yellow, Julia} will help us, right?\n[NEXT]'),
(28156, 'Okay, we can trust her. If it\'s Julia, it\'s okay to tell her about my condition.\nBut... don\'t tell anybody else, ever!!! \n{color, yellow, You promise?! Promise me, [NAME]!!! Don\'t tell anybody else!!!}\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, okay!! I promise!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Gosh!! Don\'t get closer to me!!][2]'),
(28157, 'Excuse me, Julia?\n[NEXT]'),
(28158, 'Oh, it\'s you, [NAME].\nWhat brings you here today... stones again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28159, '... ... aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!!\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28250, 'Green Maria 2'),
(28251, 'Maria was checking the tower, and she got attack by the Poison Golem. Her body turned green. \nYou need to get Poison Golem\'s Rock Dust, Old Spirit Dust, Old Gem Dust, Old Soul Dust, Plain Toadstools, to help Julia, who will cure Maria. (Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28252, 'Good day! You came here for stones, right?\nBy the way, did you see Maria? I haven\'t seen her lately.\nShe used to visit me when she has time, but she hasn\'t stopped by recently.\nI want to visit her, but she\'s always busy for the Seal, and I don\'t want to bother her.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28253, 'Well, actually... I\'m here for Maria.\n[NEXT]'),
(28254, 'Oh, really?\nBut, why...? Oh, dear, did something happen to Maria?!\n[NEXT]'),
(28255, 'Yeah? No, Not at all. Well, yes... Something happened to her...\nSo... the truth is... Maria was {color, yellow, purging the Tower of Iyzel. There, she was attacked by the Poison Golem...}\n(whispering) She became green because of the Poison Golem\'s attack.\n[NEXT]'),
(28256, 'Oh, my... Now I see. That\'s why she wanted me... \nWell, in a case like this, she should have informed me right away.\nAnyway, at least she contacted me because of you, [NAME].\nTo cure Maria... {color, yellow, I need part of the Poison Golem\'s body. Well... some of his Rock Dust will be fine.}\nAnd collect {color, yellow, Old Spirit Dust, Old Gem Dust, Old Soul Dust, and Plain Toadstools}, please.\nI know it\'s a lot. But these things are necessary to make an antidote of magic. Can you do this?\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem! I need to help her.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No... I got lots of work to do. I\'ll do this next time.][2]'),
(28257, 'Julia! Here they are. Rock Dust, Spirit Dust, Gem Dust, Soul Dust, Old Soul Dust... and Plain Toadstools!\nBut Toadstools... will it be okay to put that in the antidote?\n[NEXT] '),
(28258, 'Well, it will be used for absorbing the magic rather than being part of the antidote.\nGive them to me. Thank you.\nI\'ll make an antidote, so please wait a while!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28259, '... Maria... she\'s so bashful... so I need to take care of her first... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28350, 'Green Maria 3'),
(28351, 'Let\'s bring Julia\'s medication and the letter to Maria.\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28352, 'Here you are. You should be careful carrying the medication. Okay?\nAnd give her this letter, too. Thank you...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28353, 'Maria! I brought the medication! Julia made it. And here is the letter, too...\n[NEXT]'),
(28354, 'Thank you... \n(weeping)\nLet\'s see... (reads letter)\n...\n... ... \nWell... Julia... she\'s a dear friend of mine.\nThe one I can only open my heart to. She wants me to rely on her always... \nI thought it would be embarrassing to tell her such a thing or to ask for help... \nI\'m sorry for being like this... let me take the medication, first.\n(Drinks the medication in one gulp)\n[NEXT]'),
(28355, '... ...\nHow do you feel? Any better?\n[NEXT]'),
(28356, 'I don\'t think it\'ll get better right away.\nShe said it\'ll take a quarter of the day till the medication takes effect... I think I\'m going to be sick...\nNow I feel relieved. Thank you... I\'ll go visit Julia after I get recovered.\nI was unconscious for a while because of this condition.\nThe Poison Golem... strangely {color, yellow, didn\'t have the evil spirit.}\nHe was aggressive, but it was only because he wanted to {color, yellow, defend himself and to get rid of fear.}\nMaybe my master was confused on his belief, when he made the Poison Golem.\nWhen the Poison Golem attacked me, I felt something unknown before.\nA look trembled with fear... saying don\'t get closer...\nIt was really strange that I could never find something like that from other monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28357, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28450, 'Tower of Iyzel 15th floor'),
(28451, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 15th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28452, 'This time, it\'s the 15th floor. Defeat Iyzel Procks and Iyzel Spiders. Are you ready?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28453, 'Iyzel Procks and Spiders? Ok!\n[BUTTON]=[Yep!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What?!][2]'),
(28454, 'Maria! I\'m here!\nI cleaned the 15th floor!\n[NEXT]'),
(28455, 'You\'ve done a great job! Are you ready to go straight to the 16th floor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28456, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28550, 'Tower of Iyzel 16th floor'),
(28551, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 16th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28552, 'We\'re on the 16th floor now. At first, things looked black, but we\'ve made much progress.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28553, 'There is a huge spider on the 16th floor.\nPlase defeat Iyzel King Spiders.\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s a cinch!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Gosh!! I hate spiders!!][2]'),
(28554, 'Behold!! The Brave [NAME] who has just defeated monsters of the 16th floor!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(28555, 'Wow! You are full of energy!!\nI wish I could be like you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28556, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28650, 'Tower of Iyzel 17th floor'),
(28651, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 17th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28652, 'It\'s the 17th floor. Are you ready?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28653, 'Of course!! I am always a well-prepared adventurer!!\n[NEXT]'),
(28654, 'I see. There will be Iyzel Spiders. They\'re so annoying with their weaving webs.\nMoreover, that web is so unusual that it may be some kind of combined monster.\nI want to investigate more... so please bring me {color, yellow, Iyzel Spider\'s Sticky Cobweb.}\n[BUTTON]=[Sure! I\'ll bring it for you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I feel tired...][2]'),
(28655, 'Here\'s the cobweb.\nWow, it\'s really sticky. And what is this sweet smell?\n[NEXT]'),
(28656, 'Well, I\'ve been researching the form of this thread... and this is honey.\nMaster\'s black-hearted research is getting confused.\nI can see what he was thinking by the monsters... what irony... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28657, 'I smelled something really uncommon... it was very sweet... and... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28750, 'Tower of Iyzel 18th floor'),
(28751, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 18th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28752, 'Wow... we were busy with purging the tower and defeating monsters... and now it\'s already the 18th floor...\nIt could all be done because of you, [NAME]. Thank you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU] '),
(28753, 'No, I didn\'t do anything. I just did what you asked me to do.\nYou\'ve done a really great thing, Maria! You protect the Seal for the village, purge the tower, and check it... \n[NEXT]'),
(28754, 'That\'s my duty. I don\'t think it\'s hard to do. It is to protect my own village.\nWell, I can\'t be this sentimental right now.\nThis time is {color, yellow, Iyzel King Coll of the 18th floor. Please defeat them.}\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! Just wait for me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What?! I don\'t know what you mean!][2]'),
(28755, '... ... Kaaaaaaaaaaaaah~!!\nI was imitating King Coll\'s sound... but it wasn\'t funny at all.\n[NEXT]'),
(28756, '... \nOh, was it? I thought you were choked by something. \nAnyway, you did a good job. Come here and take a break.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28757, 'Thank you.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28850, 'Tower of Iyzel 20th floor'),
(28851, 'Maria is checking the Tower of Iyzel and trying to purge the tower, but she\'s in trouble because of dark monsters of the tower. You should defeat monsters of the 20th floor.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28852, 'I do not know what kind of awful thing awaits on the 20th floor.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28853, 'Awful... thing?\n[NEXT]'),
(28854, 'Yes... \nIt\'s been mentioned shortly in my master\'s will. A monster with pure and strong power.\nIt will be there.\nTo face it, you should first {color, yellow, defeat small fry monsters. Defeat Iyzel Iron Slimes and Iyzel Flying Stalves.}\n[BUTTON]=[Trust me! I\'ll take care of myself!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well.. nothing will happen, right?][2]'),
(28855, 'I am back with no harm at all!!! I am the Great [NAME]!!! Haha!\n[NEXT]'),
(28856, 'Great. You deserve my respect.\n(You\'ll be better if you don\'t act silly sometimes... )\nUh-uh, did you hear that? It was a joke, you know. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28857, '... Would you be careful on that.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28950, 'Jet-black Purity'),
(28951, 'Maria faced the monster on the top of the tower. You need to defeat the Iron Golem on the top of the tower and bring the Black Heart.\n(Epic Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28952, 'On the top of the tower, my master\'s beginning and end exist together.\nThe most powerful, biggest... and maybe the purest of monsters would be born there...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(28953, 'A powerful, huge...  and pure monster?\nPure monster... What do you mean by that?\n[NEXT]'),
(28954, 'Well... \nIt has the power of darkness... but not an evil being.\nIt doesn\'t know how to bear evil in mind, but already a dark being by being itself... \nI believe that is the pure monster.\nIt will be hard for you to understand yet.\n{color, yellow, Darkness wasn\'t \'evil\' from the beginning.}\n{color, yellow, as there\'s day and a night in our lives... it is also the natural harmony of power.}\n[NEXT]'),
(28955, 'Well... it\'s a little difficult for me. But I think I\'d get it somehow.\n[NEXT]'),
(28956, 'There will be a monster with the power of darkness, but it does not know \'evil\'. \nI clearly saw that. The mighty power of darkness... if that power is given to a baby, it will be very dangerous. It is a heartbreaking thing, but we can\'t help it.\nThe {color, yellow, Iron Golem} at the top of the tower... It is a monster of that kind.\nDon\'t let the Iron Golem fall into its own darkness, please. Please bring its {color, yellow, Black Heart} to me.\nIt is way too severe...  to destroy the purity completely. It is also a creature with its own life. Please... \n[BUTTON]=[Okay... I see... I\'ll bring the Iron Golem\'s heart.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You want me to kill that one?][2]'),
(28957, 'Maria! I\'ve defeated the Iron Golem. But somehow I don\'t feel comfortable.\nI feel as if I still hear the naive voice of the Iron Golem.\n[NEXT]'),
(28958, 'Yes... You really did a good job. But, it will be the work for the Iron Golem itself.\nIt will be terrible to see a baby going down the path of darkness... \nFortunately, my master didn\'t conceal his mistake before he died.\n{color, yellow, If he wanted to keep his honor even after death... that tower would make lots of sacrifices...}\nAlso... I feel lucky that he raised me and taught me as the guardian.\n{color, yellow, I believe there could be a chance to settle my master\'s evil deed because he had me as his disciple...}\nWell, I\'m alright, [NAME]. {color, yellow, I really think that I am blessed.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(28959, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34750, 'We Want Ice Cream 1 (Event Quest)'),
(34751, 'Vietree\'s stock of Ice Cream was raided by monsters. \n(Gather 30 Uruga Cocoas from Woods, 30 Roumen Sugars from Flowers. 5 Elderine Milks can be fround by defeating Monsters anywhere in Isya.)\n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34752, 'Oh [NAME]! What am I going to do now?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34753, 'What\'s wrong Vietree?\n[NEXT]'),
(34754, 'What does it matter? I\'m Depraved!!! Do you hear me? I\'m Depraved!\n[NEXT]'),
(34755, 'Well maybe If you tell me what\'s wrong, I may be able to help?\n[NEXT]'),
(34756, 'Its Summer and everyone wants Ice Cream on a hot day.\n[NEXT]'),
(34757, 'Oh that\'s true!\n[NEXT]'),
(34758, 'That\'s the problem though!\nIt turns out that even monsters like Ice Cream! They raided our storage and ate all of it!\n[NEXT]'),
(34759, 'WHAT?\n[NEXT]'),
(34760, 'Well, If you really want to help me, gather as much {color,yellow,Uruga Cocoa} and {color,yellow,Roumen Sugar} as you can! (from Flowers and Wood) I will also need Milk the monsters took all of the bottles we had left. (found from monsters)\nAnd please hurry... There isn\'t much time! Will you help me? Oh, you will also get to have some to beat the heat!\n[BUTTON]=[Alright Vietree, I\'ll return as soon as possible!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... Ice Cream is not my thing.][2]'),
(34761, 'Vietree! I\'m back! I found what you needed!\n[NEXT]'),
(34762, 'Thank you So much! Now we have a way to cool down during these hot days. Here\n[NAME]... Take this, I made it just for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(34763, 'Yay! Ice Cream Hat!!!\n\n[EMOTION][9]\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34764, 'Oh no... That\'s not enough of what I need. Please hurry!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(34850, 'We Want Ice Cream 2 (Event Quest)'),
(34851, 'Vietree\'s stock of Ice Cream was raided by monsters. \n(Gather 30 Uruga Cocoas from Woods, 30 Roumen Sugars from Flowers. 5 Elderine Milks can be fround by defeating Monsters anywhere in Isya.) (Repeatable Quest)\n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34852, 'We will still need more Ice Cream to last through this summer. Would you care to keep helping?  \n[BUTTON]=[Sure Remi, I\'ve got a big sweet tooth. Count me in!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way! I am trying to watch my figure.][2]\n[MENU]'),
(34853, 'Vietree! I\'m back again! I found what you needed!\n[NEXT]'),
(34854, 'Thank you So much! Now we have a way to cool down during these hot days. Here\n[NAME]... Take this, I made it just for you!\n[NEXT]'),
(34855, 'Yay for Ice Cream!!!\n\n[EMOTION][9]\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(34856, 'Oh no... That\'s not enough of what I need. Please hurry!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29050, 'Is strength what you seek?'),
(29051, 'Chief Roumenus is asking an unusual question.\nLet\'s listen to what he has to say.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29052, 'Hmph... What level are you?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29053, 'My level?  Why do you ask?\n[NEXT]'),
(29054, 'Hmph... Well... You seems to have a bright future ahead...\nStrong foundation, I see that in you...\nI believe {color,yellow,you are good enough for a promotion.}\nLet me give you some advice.\nWhen you become {color,yellow,Level 20}, you should seek {color,yellow,Grand Master Sean} at {color,yellow,the Forest of Mist}\n[NEXT]'),
(29055, 'Grand Master Sean?\n[NEXT]'),
(29056, 'You shouldn\'t blurt out his name like that.\nWhen addressing {color,yellow,Grand Master Sean}, you should always show respect.\nHmph!  Hmph!\nIt\'s for your own good, so don\'t just shrug it off.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29057, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29150, 'Do you want to be stronger?'),
(29151, 'Roumen\'s weird old man Robin blurts out odd comments.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29152, 'No!  No!  All wrong!  Look at you...!  Such a weakling!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29153, 'Are you talking about me?  What are you talking about Robin?  I\'m not even Level 20 yet, I know I  have room to grow but... Come on that\'s uncalled for.  I mean have you seen me slaying Slimes?\n[NEXT]'),
(29154, 'Slimes?  Even I can give those no good monsters a good beating!  Not good at all... You are not there yet...\n[NEXT]'),
(29155, '(Tsk...)\nYou\'ll see!  I\'ll be stronger then ever!  I\'m going to do my best!\nYou can\'t judge a book by its cover!\n[NEXT]'),
(29156, 'Ka Ka Ka!\nYeah... That\'s the spirit.  Well, I\'ll let you in on a little secret.\nWhen you become {color,yellow,Level 20}, travel to {color,yellow,Forest of Mist}.  There you\'ll find {color,yellow,Grand Master Sean}.  He\'ll teach you how to become stronger.\nYou got all that wee one?\nI\'m telling you to go for one of those {color,yellow,promotions}!\nAhem!  Be on your way then...  I\'m done with you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29157, 'What are you looking at?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29250, 'If you wish to be stronger!'),
(29251, 'Elderine Captain Shutian wants to have a word with me.\nLet\'s listen to what he has to say and give him the answer he seeks.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29252, 'It\'s joyous to see your great progress.  Are you about to level up?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29253, 'Yeah!  You know what?  I am about to.\nMy head is becoming clear with every single bead of sweat I shed.  I\'m focused, healthy and I see the beautiful land of Isya with different eyes.\nBut... I know that I have room to grow.\nI\'m going to do my best!\n[NEXT]'),
(29254, 'Hmm... You are right.  Do your best.\nHowever, there are certain things you can\'t achieve even with your best effort.\n[NEXT]'),
(29255, 'Huh?  What... do you mean?\n[NEXT]'),
(29256, 'I\'m just letting you know that there are certain events in life that you require someone else\'s hand to achieve the result.  \nDo you know what to do {color,yellow,when you reach Level 20}?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, hunt alone of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Change job?][2]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not sure. Hmm... Is it... getting hitched?][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Promotion right?][4]'),
(29257, 'Ha Ha, you are already hunting aren\'t you?\n[NEXT]'),
(29258, 'Change job?  At your level?  You have a long way to go, sorry...\n[NEXT]'),
(29259, 'Ha Ha!  Marriage huh?  I wasn\'t talking about your personal relationship.\n[NEXT]'),
(29260, 'Oh!  So you\'ve heard.  That\'s right it\'s a {color,yellow,promotion.}\nYou are still a grub who strives to be an adult.  For you this is the time to gather your strength and grow so you can bloom into something great later.  Be strong and don\'t let the hardship overtake you and lose focus.  \nWhat I\'m trying to say is that, one must win over one\'s self in order to breeze through the storm that lies ahead of you.\n[NEXT] '),
(29261, 'I see...\nNow I remember what Chief Roumenus and Robin talked about...\n{color,yellow,Seek Grand Master Sean at Forest of Mist when I reach Level 20}...\nYou meant to remind me of that huh?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29262, 'Hmph... I\'m still talking...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29350, 'Road to promotion!'),
(29351, 'Captain Shutian advised that I seek Grand Master Sean at Forest of Mist.\nLet\'s travel to Forest of Mist near south of Elderine.\n(You\'ll find Grand Master Sean near the southern lake at Forest of Mist)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29352, 'That\'s right.\nSeek {color,yellow,Grand Master Sean} at Forest of Mist.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29353, 'Excuse me.  My name is [NAME].\nAre you Grand Master Sean?\n[NEXT]'),
(29354, 'That\'s right, I\'m Sean.\nWhat brings you here young one?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29355, 'Travel to Forest of Mist.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29450, 'Over the huddles, to higher places!'),
(29451, 'You have found Grand Master Sean.\nLet\'s find out more about the promotion.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(29452, 'Are you the one called [NAME]?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(29453, 'Yes I am!\nNice to meet you.\n[NEXT]'),
(29454, 'Whahaha!\nGood!  You are full of spirit!\nI bet you are here to find out about promotions.\nYou don\'t seem to fit the bill though... I think you need more experience to tell you the truth.\n[NEXT]'),
(29455, 'But I\'ve been trying really hard!  I\'ve helped out a lot and also defeated many monsters!\n[NEXT]'),
(29456, 'A true warrior never boasts about their achievements.  It seems you lack even the basics.  I don\'t think you are ready to take on such an important promotion.\nYou must let it go to go forward.\nGo home, and forget about this, okay kid?\n[NEXT]'),
(29457, 'Ah...\nI\'m sorry... I was too conceited.  \nI thought, all I have attained, is because of my efforts.  I forgot why I must walk the path of righteousness.  \nI apologize.\n[NEXT]'),
(29458, '...\nGood!\nI knew you would come to your senses.  You do have what it takes to pursue the promotion.  \nI\'m going to let you know how to take on the promotion just once, so listen well.\nTo overcome one\'s self, you must challenge the {color,yellow,\'Shadow Dungeon\'}.  \nMany have taken on the Shadow Dungeon and resulted in dire fate.  \nIt is dangerous yet also easy if you look in a different angle.  \nYou must take this on all by yourself.\n[NEXT]'),
(29459, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(35050, 'Freedom Fighter (Event Quest)'),
(35051, 'Town Chief Roumenus of Roumen asks you to find 50 White Stars to complete his flag.\n(White Stars can be found by defeating monsters.)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(35052, 'Liberty and justice for all!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(35053, 'Wow you\'re sounding very patriotic today!\n[NEXT]'),
(35054, 'Of course I am! Today, we celebrate our independence day in Isya. But there\'s just one problem. \n[NEXT]'),
(35055, 'What\'s the problem?\n[NEXT]'),
(35056, 'I want to show off my pride by saluting those who have fought to gain our independence. The only problem is, my flag is incomplete! [NAME], could you help me gather {color,yellow,50 White Stars}?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I\'ll help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t care! Get them yourself!][2]'),
(35057, 'I\'ve found all 50 White Stars!\nNow we can officially celebrate our independence!\n[NEXT]'),
(35058, 'I am truly greatful! Thank you so much!\nHopefully this reward will show off your pride!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(35059, 'Have you found any {color,yellow,White Stars} yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57150, 'The Coat of Arms (Event Quest)'),
(57151, 'There is news that Guard Captain Shutian is recruiting a special band of heroes to help maintain the harmony of Isya.\n(Guard Captain Shutain can be found in Elderine)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57152, 'Ah, [NAME], it\'s you. How goes your adventuring?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57153, 'Well.\n\nI\'ve gotten word about your endeavor to find the finest adventurers in Isya.\n[NEXT]'),
(57154, 'News gets around rather quickly here. You inquire of a task that isn\'t simple.\n[NEXT]'),
(57155, 'Proving one\'s worth is never simple.\n[NEXT]'),
(57156, 'Then you will get your chance to prove it.\n\nI have gotten word that there are remnants that exist of the old world. They are coins that are dedicated to the Goddess Teva. I am told that these coins are bestowed to those who acheive great milestones. Bring me one {color,yellow,Coin of Teva} and you will be called upon in the future as protector of these lands, and the benefits that you will reap from one of these will give you a great distinction.\n\nDoes this sound like something that you want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(57157, 'Yes, sir!\n[NEXT]'),
(57158, 'Then so be it!\n\nI am asking only the most stalwart of adventurers.\n\nYou must reach level 50, and you must do so quickly. There are only 500 {color,yellow,Coins of Teva} in existense and they will go only to those who want it most.\n\nReturn to me with one.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(57159, 'I understand.\n\nThank you, Shutian. I\'ll not let you down.\n[NEXT]'),
(57160, '[NAME], you\'ve proven yourself a powerful citizen, worthy of praise. Take this, and heed the call when you are beckoned by the people of Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57161, 'Do you have a {color,yellow,Coin of Teva}?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57350, 'Myzen\'s Halloween Bash (Event Quest)'),
(57351, 'Grandma Myzen of Elderine asks you to collect 50 Lantern Souls for her annual Halloween Bash.\n(Lantern Souls can be obtained by defeating monsters) \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n'),
(57352, '[NAME]!  Great timing!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)(Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57353, 'What do you mean?\n[NEXT]'),
(57354, 'Well, since Halloween is just around the corner, I\'ve been thinking about carving some pumpkins. What do you think? \n[NEXT]'),
(57355, 'Really? I think that\'d be awesome!\nYou must be a master at making Jack O\'Lanterns!\n[NEXT]'),
(57356, 'You\'re too kind! Listen, in order to create the perfect Jack O\' Lantern, I need something called {color,yellow,Lantern Souls} and I\'ll need {color,yellow,50} of those to create the best Jack O\' Lanterns in all of Elderine. If you collect them for me, I\'ll give you my famous Special Pumpkin Pudding in return!  So, what do you say?\n[BUTTON]=[You got a deal!  I\'ll be back soon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks! I\'m busy!][2]'),
(57357, 'Myzen! I\'ve collected  all {color,yellow,50 Lantern Souls}!\nThese sure do give off an eerie, hypnotic glow.\n[NEXT]'),
(57358, 'Wow, that was fast! Thanks, [NAME]! I can always rely on you.\nI could always use more {color,yellow,Lantern Souls}. Would you mind collecting {color,yellow,50} more for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a deal! I\'ll be back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I\'m a little busy.][2]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(57359, 'Go get\'em!  The more the merrier!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57450, 'Zach\'s Halloween Bash (Event Quest)'),
(57451, 'Weapon Title Merchant Zach asks you to bring him Special Pumpkin Puddings. \n(Special Pumpkin Puddings can be obtained by completeing Myzen\'s Halloween Bash quest).\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n '),
(57452, 'There\'s my favorite student!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57453, 'Hey Zach! What\'s going on?\n[NEXT]'),
(57454, 'That\'s SIR ZACH to you, [Name]!\nAnyways, I\'m hosting a Halloween Bash and I\'m in need of tasty desserts.\n[NEXT]'),
(57455, 'What kind of desserts?\n[NEXT]'),
(57456, 'I\'ve heard that Grandma Myzen makes a delicious Special Pumpkin Pudding. Everyone\'s been raving about it. I\'d ask her for one but I\'m very busy right now. Could you do me a favor and bring me {color,yellow,5 Special Pumpkin Puddings}? I\'ll reward you with something unique when you return.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay you got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks.][2]'),
(57457, 'Here you go Zach! \n[NEXT]'),
(57458, 'This is some delicious pudding! The texture! The taste! I\'m in pumpkin heaven!\nThank you!\n[NEXT]'),
(57459, 'You ate one!? I thought you needed 5!\n[NEXT]'),
(57460, 'Did I say 5? I may have meant 4. Here, take this.\n[NEXT]'),
(57461, 'I wonder what that pudding actually tastes like. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[NEXT]'),
(57462, 'Where\'s my pudding?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57950, 'Second Tower 1'),
(57951, 'Maria heard that there is another tower made by her master Iyzel, and the resident Uruga lost his life because of that tower from Adrien.\nListen to Maria\'s story.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57952, 'Boo-hoo... boo... hoo... \n(Crying... )\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(57953, 'Maria...\nWhy are you crying in such sorrow...? Why?\nDon\'t cry like that, Maria...\nPlease...\n[NEXT]'),
(57954, 'Sorry...\nPardon me for being like this...\nIt\'s all my fault. I should have checked it beforehand, I should have found it and sealed it...\n[NEXT]'),
(57955, 'Well, what\'s going on?\nTell me more about it.\nYour heart will be aching if you undertake it alone.\n[NEXT]'),
(57956, 'Right... Yeah...\nA while ago...\n{color,yellow,Chief Adrien} came to see me.\n...{color,yellow,a resident of Uruga ... lost his life...} \n...in master Iyzel\'s {color,yellow,second Tower}.... \nAnother tower of my master is found out...\nnearby Uruga village...\nI didn\'t know it\'s been made... with the same purpose of the first tower.\nBut there were monsters bustled inside the tower...\n[NEXT]'),
(57957, 'Another... tower is found?\nLike... like the tower in which he was doing experiments?\n[NEXT]'),
(57958, 'I don\'t know yet.\nBut the obvious thing is that...\nit is full of {color,yellow, Crystals...} inside the tower.\nThe brilliant crystals dazzled people from the gate of the tower.\nIt seemed dangerous, but people couldn\'t just pass by that place full of treasures.\n{color,yellow, I\'m not saying that I don\'t understand... the anger of Adrien.}\nI know how it feels more than anyone. But... \nMy master\'s {color,yellow,remorse} was {color,yellow,true}.\nI couldn\'t put up with his {color,yellow, insult for my master\'s true heart}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(57959, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58050, 'Second Tower 2'),
(58051, 'Maria requested you to check the second tower of Iyzel.\nYou should defeat monsters of the tower.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58052, 'Nobody knows what the tower really is yet.\nSomeone must reveal it.\nI want to believe.\nI want to believe that my master didn\'t make the same mistake again.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58053, 'Yeah. I hope so.\nIt\'ll be my pleasure to help you in this. I\'ll take care of it.\nLeave it to me.\n[NEXT]'),
(58054, 'Ah...\nThank you.\nThen... \nFirst... You... should check the tower in detail. Monsters in that place, surroundings, and even a little clue... \nCould you do that for me?\n[NEXT]'),
(58055, 'Trust me!\nYou won\'t regret it Maria!\n[NEXT]'),
(58056, 'Thank you so much.\n(sobs)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58057, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58150, 'What I do?'),
(58151, 'Lord of Elderine begins to talk to you.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58152, 'Oh, welcome.\n[NAME] is your name, right?\nYou\'ve been going in and out the Crystal Tower frequently... What are you doing there?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58153, 'Oh, I am...\n(How did he know that?)\nBy the way... What\'s the matter?\n[NEXT]'),
(58154, 'Oh, nothing special.\nI was just wondering what you were doing so eagerly.\n[NEXT]'),
(58155, 'Well, I\'m just browsing...\nBut really, I\'m helping Maria out.\n[NEXT]'),
(58156, 'Um...\nIs that so?\nThen... what is the dark crystal?\n[NEXT]'),
(58157, '(Huh? How did he know this one, too?)\nWell... it is the substance that came out from the monster there, it has the dark energy and...\n(Oops, I told him too much.)\nAnyway, it is the by-product from the monster.\nOh, I should get going \'cause I\'m kinda busy. Thank you for the invite.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58158, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58250, 'Reward for the Dark Crystal?! 1'),
(58251, 'Guard Nus of Elderine has his eyes on the prize for the Dark Crystal.\nYou need to deliver Nus the Dark Crystal.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58252, '[NAME]! It\'s the reward! There\'s a reward poster after all this time!\nI feel so excited now! That\'s why I was behaving like that earlier... \nUh! Where are you going?!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58253, 'So... tell me.\nWhat do I have to do to receive the reward? Capture monsters?\n[NEXT]'),
(58254, 'No, nothing like that.\nIt has to do with the \'Magic Staff\'s Dark Crystal\' or was it \'Black Crystal\' or something...?\n{color,yellow, I heard the monster of the Crystal Tower has it.}\n[NEXT]'),
(58255, '...what?\n{color,yellow, Dark crystal from the Crystal Tower?!}\n(no way... who did... Wait... the Lord of Elderine?)\nThat reward poster... who posted it?\n[NEXT]'),
(58256, 'Uh? I don\'t know, but it should be from the trading corps.\nPerhaps from the Max Uter Corps?\nHe-he, who cares... by the way, [NAME]~\nYou know what I\'m thinking, right?\nI\'ll give a share to you.\nI\'m dying to go to the summer vacation this year!!\nPlease, please, please!!\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way! Get out!][2]'),
(58257, 'Here you are, the Dark Crystal.\nBy the way, is this reward poster really from the Max Uter Corps... Or the Lord of Elderine himself...?\n[NEXT]'),
(58258, 'What? Why would you think that? What for?\nHe doesn\'t care about it.\nAnyway, I feel on top of the world!! Ha-ha!\nThank you so much! I just wanna kiss you!\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58259, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58350, 'Reward for the Dark Crystal?! 2'),
(58351, 'Storage Keeper Kyle of Elderine is very happy to see the reward poster in Elderine.\nYou need to deliver Kyle the Dark Crystal.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58352, 'Do you know there is a reward notice in the village that only the village people can participate in?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58353, 'Ah, I heard it from Nus.\nBut, why is this reward thing announced only to the people of Elderine?\n[NEXT]'),
(58354, 'I don\'t know why~\nBy the way, [NAME]... could you do me a favor?\nI think... I need some money to get married...  \nSo... what I am saying is... if you could get me bit of the dark crystal for me... it\'ll help me out... and you... you know it\'s only allowed to village people, so...\n[BUTTON]=[Alright, alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So what do you want to say!!][2]'),
(58355, 'Here.\nWell... Is there any other adventurers except me who are doing this reward thing?\n[NEXT]'),
(58356, 'Wow~ it\'s the crystal.\nOh, I guess so... Most of the village people will ask the adventurers~\nYou know this village is very busy, no one has time to retrieve the Dark Crystal themselves.\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58357, '...Thank you for your work.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58450, 'Reward for the Dark Crystal?! 3'),
(58451, 'Marty of Elderine asks that you get the Dark Crystal after he sees the reward notice.\nYou need to deliver Marty the Dark Crystal.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58452, 'Ha ha ha ha... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58453, 'Whack! Why are you laughing so wickedly, Marty?!\n[NEXT]'),
(58454, 'Look at my eyes...\nYou already know what kind of favor I will ask you, right?!\nI heard the news, too.\n[BUTTON]=[Alright, alright! I\'ll get it for you, too!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope! I don\'t know! I know nothing of it!!][2]'),
(58455, 'Here, Marty. \nNow it\'s fair, right? I\'m generous to the person who asks me... But I don\'t like the person who threatens me. So don\'t make an excuse of other people next time.\n[NEXT]'),
(58456, 'He-he!! Alrighty! I got it!\nGood... Now I can give Ruby a ruby.\nIf I give Ruby a ruby as a gift, Ruby will be happy to see a ruby.\nHa-ha!\nWhat? Why do you give me that kind of look?\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58457, '...I need to buy Ruby a ruby...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58550, 'Tower Guardian 1'),
(58551, 'You must defeat guardians of the tower Lizardman.\n[LINE[\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58552, '[NAME]...\nYou do know that there is a reward out for dark crystal right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58553, 'Yes, I do know that Lord Elbama put a hefty amount of reward out there, and many are taking their chances at the Crystal Castle.\n[NEXT]'),
(58554, 'Many challengers who take upon Crystal Castle return gravely injured by the Guardian of the tower Lizardman.\nI am disturbed by the idea that my mentor\'s creations are hurting innocent people.  \nWould you lend me your hand and defeat these Lizardman?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem, I\'ll help you out][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe some other time... ][2]'),
(58555, 'Miss Maria!  You don\'t need to worry anymore!  I\'ve defeated those Lizardman!\nI\'m sure the journey to Crystal Castle will be a lot safer.\n[NEXT]'),
(58556, 'Oh... Thank you...\nI feel a lot better already...\nBut I\'ve heard that... There are more of them than we previously assummed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58557, 'I pray everyday that no one else gets hurt from now on...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58650, 'Tower Guardian 1'),
(58651, 'Maria asks that you defeat the Guardian of the Tower Lizardman.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58652, '[NAME]...\nMay I ask you to defeat the Guardian of the Tower Lizardman one more time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58653, 'Of course... Trust me, I got this!\n[NEXT]'),
(58654, 'I\'m so sorry to keep asking you to take on a daunting task... But... When I think about all those innocent bystanders getting hurt....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry Maria, I got this!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry Maria, but I don\'t think I can take on the job][2]'),
(58655, 'Maria I\'ve defeated them!  I\'m sure no one will get hurt from now on!\n[NEXT]'),
(58656, 'Thank you....\nYou are a miracle worker...\nWhile you were on the way here... I\'ve heard of news that Lizardman reappeared and is now terrorizing some parts...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58657, 'I\'m hoping no one else gets hurt...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58750, 'Tower Guardian 2'),
(58751, 'Ancient Templar Maria is requesting to exterminate the Great Orc that guards Crystal Castle.'),
(58752, '[NAME], good to see you!\nThere\'s a big problem though...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58753, 'What\'s wrong?  You seem to have many worries on your shoulder...\n[NEXT]'),
(58754, 'You know that all the young adventurers are flocking to Crystal Castle these days right?\nOn top of all the craziness Elbama even put a reward out!\n[NEXT]'),
(58755, 'Yes, I know about that...\nI know you\'re worried about the many people who return injured.\n[NEXT]'),
(58756, 'Yeah well... I was hoping that you can defeat the tower guardian Great Orc who\'s been doing some damage...\nI know it\'s a daunting task... but it\'ll save many people from getting seriously hurt.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, leave it to me][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks.][2]'),
(58757, 'Maria, it wasn\'t easy... But the deed is done!\n[NEXT]'),
(58758, 'I knew it!  [NAME], you are a miracle worker!\nThanks to you many lives are spared but...\nI\'ve heard that there are more than one Orc...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58759, 'At this rate, the town will turn into triage from all the returning injured...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58850, 'Tower Guardian 2'),
(58851, 'Ancient Templar Maria requests that the Guardian of the Tower Great Orc is exterminated.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58852, 'I am unsettled by the idea that there are still Great Orc running about...\nAt this rate causalities are just a matter of time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58853, 'Well then, I\'ll go and exterminate those Great Orc!\n[NEXT]'),
(58854, 'Could you?\nThank you [NAME]!  I was really concerned that such monster roams freely!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me!  I\'ll go stop them!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I was kidding!  Can\'t you tell that I was being sarcastic?][2]'),
(58855, 'Maria!  You were right!  There was another Great Orc!  You don\'t need to worry about it anymore!  It is defeated.\n[NEXT]'),
(58856, 'Thank you [NAME]...\nUnfortunately, while you were away... There was another Great Orc sighting...\n[NEXT]'),
(58857, 'Another one?\n[NEXT]'),
(58858, 'It seems that way...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58859, 'For Legel\'s sake!  How many Great Orc are there?  Really?!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58950, 'The Mysterious Guardian'),
(58951, 'Rumor is spreading about a mysterious guardian that drops great treasure!  You must verify if this rumor is true.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58952, '[NAME], there is talk about a very powerful monster within the walls of Crystal Castle.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(58953, 'A powerful monster?\n[NEXT]'),
(58954, 'Well, it is from a source that was very terrified at the time so I\'m not really sure how accurate it is but... At the final stages of Crystal Castle, you run into a huge rock decorated with many jewels... It turns out that this rock moves and attacks any intruders.  Apparently strong magic, and sharp endless showers of arrows did nothing to this massive monster.  They said it almost felt as if the whole castle was moving...\n[NEXT]'),
(58955, 'That sounds amazing!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(58956, 'So how about it [NAME]?\nWould you care to find out if this rumor is true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a challenge!  I\'m on it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like more than I can chew.  I\'ll pass...][2]'),
(58957, 'I\'m back!\nIt was amazing!  What you said was all true!  \nA Jewel Golem!  I didn\'t realized it existed!  That was one tough monster!\n[NEXT]'),
(58958, 'I see!  I have to put a bulletin out and warn other travelers!\nYou\'ve saved many lives [NAME]!  \nThank you very much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(58959, '[NAME], I believe in you!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59050, 'Endless Greed'),
(59051, 'Elbama is relentlessly collecting Dark Crystal magic .\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59052, 'Welcome...\n[NAME], I\'ve heard that when there is a problem to be solved you are the person to talk to.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59053, 'Those are kind words but I\'m sure there are many other qualified people out there.\n[NEXT]'),
(59054, 'Don\'t be modest... I have a proposition for you.\nI\'ve been intrigued by these so called Dark Crystals lately.\nEffects of Dark Crystal may be new to you but, with it you can overrule most monsters out roaming about.\nDo you know why I\'m telling you all this?\n[NEXT]'),
(59055, 'No not really... Well, I\'m not quite interested in Dark Crystals anyways.\n[NEXT]'),
(59056, 'Hmph... That is too bad...\nWith such talent, you could\'ve taken on way more important tasks...\n[NEXT]'),
(59057, 'Maybe you should look for someone more qualified than me.\nWell, I must be on my way.  Good bye.\n[NEXT]'),
(59058, 'I\'m sure in time... [NAME], you too will understand what it means to be truly powerful.  When that time comes, you\'ll definitely regret it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59059, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59150, 'Dark Crystal Power'),
(59151, 'Enchanter Master Wishis is concerned about powers of the Dark Crystal being abused.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59152, '[NAME], could I talk to you please?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]\n'),
(59153, 'Yes Master Wishis, is there something you want me to do?\n[NEXT]'),
(59154, 'Well...\nAs you probably have noticed, many travelers are flocking to Crystal Castle to gain powers from the Dark Crystal... But it seems no one is concerned about the true nature of the dark and evil power that lies dormant within...\n[NEXT]'),
(59155, 'Dark and evil powers...\nAre those Dark Crystals that dangerous?\n[NEXT]'),
(59156, 'It isn\'t so dangerous by itself...\nHowever, in great numbers dangerous it will become...\nAlso I have hunch that its dark power derived from much larger evil force.\n[NEXT]'),
(59157, 'Larger evil force?!\n[NEXT]'),
(59158, 'Yes, this is just a hunch so far but... I have a feeling it\'ll be more than a feeling when left alone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59159, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59250, 'Destruction of Giant Crystal'),
(59251, 'Enchanter Master Wishis believes that there is a Giant Crystal that fuels the Dark Crystal\'s power.  Whisis is requesting to have this Giant Crystal destroyed before its dark power becomes to powerful.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59252, '[NAME], with your help I\'m sure we can drive away dark powers!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59253, 'Me?\nBut how?\n[NEXT]'),
(59254, 'A small amount of darkness when left alone by itself will dissipate in time.\nHowever, Dark Crystal\'s do not follow the rules of nature.  There is something that fuels these dark forces.\n[NEXT]'),
(59255, 'Are you saying if you cut off the power source, then Dark Crystals will seize to exist?\n[NEXT]'),
(59256, 'Precisely!  Well, at least I\'m hoping that is the case...\nI know I\'m asking a lot from you but [NAME], could you please help me?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I want to help no matter what.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, but I don\'t think I can handle such task yet.][2]'),
(59257, 'Wishis...\nI couldn\'t find the Giant Dark Crystal but I\'ve defeated a Giant Golem with many jewel decorations...\n[NEXT]'),
(59258, 'No [NAME], you have defeated the Giant Crystal!\n[NEXT]'),
(59259, 'What do you mean?\nI didn\'t even see any Giant Dark Crystals anywhere.\n[NEXT]'),
(59260, 'That Jewel Golem you\'ve defeated is the essence of power of all Dark Crystals!  It seems once you\'ve defeated that Jewel Golem the power of the Dark Crystals weakened.  It also means that there is more than one Jewel Golem since the Dark Crystal\'s power still remains.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59261, 'I don\'t want to even think about the aftermath of when the Dark Crystal\'s power is at full force...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59350, 'Destruction of Giant Crystal'),
(59351, 'Enchanter Master Wishsis believes that there is a Giant Crystal that fuels the Dark Crystal\'s power.  Wishis is requesting to have this Giant Crystal destroyed before its dark power becomes too powerful.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59352, '[NAME], could you help me out a little further?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59353, 'My power isn\'t much but, if it helps I\'m more than happy to lend a hand!\n[NEXT]'),
(59354, 'I believe in you [NAME].\nIf I didn\'t I wouldn\'t have asked you to take on such an important task.\nCould you please help me out one more time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes of course.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry but... I don\'t think I can][2]'),
(59355, 'Wishis, I\'ve defeated the other Jewel Golem!\nHas all of the Dark Crystals Power gone away?\n[NEXT]'),
(59356, 'I\'m sorry but not yet...\nHowever, it definitely has weakened.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59357, 'I don\'t want to even think about the aftermath of when the Dark Crystal\'s power is at full force...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59450, 'Nothing to say but sorry'),
(59451, 'Deliver the crumpled letter of Iyzel found from the Jewel Golem to Maria.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59452, '[NAME], I believe this will be my final request.\n[BUTTON]=[Quest begins][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59453, 'What is it?\n(What could\'ve happened now?)\n[NEXT]'),
(59454, 'Don\'t be too frightened. \nThanks to you, the dark power of the Crystal is now weakened and the number of monsters has muchly decreased that there are fewer cases of adventurers returning injured. \n[NEXT]'),
(59455, 'It wasn\'t just me. Many other adventurers joined forces to make this happen.\nAs one of the Henneath adventurer~!\nWhat favor do you have to ask me?\n[NEXT]'),
(59456, 'Some time ago I went to the Crystal castle and found a letter that says"Dear Maria".\nAlthough I am curious to know what is written inside the letter, would you please deliver it to Maria for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Certainly! Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you do it?][2]'),
(59457, 'Maria~\nI brought a present!\nIt is a letter chief Adrian found in the Crystal castle and I think it\'s for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59458, 'A letter for me..?\nThis..is master Iyzel\'s handwritting..\nIt\'s a letter from my master!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59459, '<Iyzel>\nI\'m sure you already know but, this second tower represents my labor of remorse...\nHave you seen all the practice monsters and intriguing equipments?\nThey are powered by my magic power that resides within the crystals.  Do not greed over these crystals or that\'ll be the end of you.\nI\'m sure you\'ve already heard from Maria but, in my youth I\'ve done many regretful acts.  \nThis is my attempt at remorse.\n[NEXT]'),
(59460, '(Sobs..)\nYes...\nThank you...\n....\n....\nMaster is repenting...\nIn his {color,yellow,letter... it\'s littered with words of remorse...}\nHe has... been loving me like his own daughter... I have no way to repay for his kindness but... I can offer nothing when he is in such pain...\nI must be an awful pupil...\n[NEXT]'),
(59461, 'Maria...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59462, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59550, 'Carry on'),
(59551, 'Maria asks you to inform Adrian about the purpose of construction of the Crystal castle to Adrian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59552, '[NAME], I can feel master Iyzel\'s sincerity.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest begins][1]\n[MENU]'),
(59553, 'I\'m relieved that all misunderstandings are cleared up~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59554, 'There is one more thing.\nWe have to try hard so that the Crystle castle can be used for the right purpose as my master intended!\nPlease deliver master Iyzel\'s letter to chief Adrian and tell her the purpose of Crystal castle!\n\nI ask you so that my master\'s intention would not be in vain!\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think you should do it yourself....][2]'),
(59555, 'Chief Adrian~\nChief Adrian~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59556, 'Ah~ [NAME], was Maria delighted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59557, 'Yes~ She was full of joy! \nOh, yeah, now is not the time for this.... \nChief! The letter you found was written by Iyzel..!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59558, 'So it seems.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59559, '(Hands over the letter to Adrian)\nAs you can see in the letter, the Crystal castle is a dungeon built to train Henneath adventurers.\nThat\'s why Maria requested your assistance so that the castle would be used for the right purpose as her master intended.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59560, '(Adrian reads the letter)\n...\n...\nIf the Crystal castle would become the dungeon for Henneath adventurers, it would be very helpful in many ways~\nI promise I will do everything I can to help~!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(59561, 'As a Henneath adventurer, I am truly grateful for your concern.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(59562, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1140, 'Goblin Captain Hunting'),
(1141, 'Carole is having trouble with Goblin Captain.  Capture Goblin Captains. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1142, 'Hello. [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1143, 'Oh,.. Carole, hello.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1144, 'You\'ve become gorgeous.  I barely recognized you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1145, 'Ha ha,.. I\'m flattered. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1146, '[NAME]! I\'m sorry, but I have a favor.  {color,yellow, Goblin Camp\'s Goblins} are attacking adventurers these days. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1147, 'So many have been injured.  So, {color,yellow, could you capture Goblin Captains, the heads of Goblins?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t.  I\'m scared.][2]'),
(1148, '(Panting) I\'m back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1149, 'Well done.  I was right to ask you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1150, 'This is Goblin Camp.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1160, 'Silver Allon\'s Staff'),
(1161, 'Silver Ellon asks you to slay Ogres.  Slay Ogres for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1162, 'Welcome.  It\'s good to see you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1163, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1164, 'There is something I want to ask you, [NAME].  A while ago, I lost my precious weapon while hunting at {color,yellow, Goblin Camp}.  I was not paying attention, but I was catching Mini Lips. Then, all of a sudden, an {color,yellow, Ogre} appeared and my weapon broke into pieces!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1165, 'Can\'t you just buy or make a new one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1166, 'Yes.  But that staff was handed down to me by my father when I first became a sorcerer.  It\'s invaluable to me.  I can\'t even repair it because it\'s in pieces, but I can\'t forgive the {color,yellow, Ogres}. So, {color,yellow, please slay Ogres for me.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. I\'ll do it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like Ogres...][2]'),
(1167, 'I\'m back.  Ogres are not easy to slay. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1168, 'Thank you.  I feel better now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1169, 'Do you not know the way to Goblin Camp?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1170, 'Imaginary Bird 1'),
(1171, 'Grunt says that he saw Goblins that are acting weird these days. He found a strange feather, that he wishes you to ask Blacksmith Rohan about.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1172, 'Hello. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1173, 'Hello, Mr. Grunt. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1174, 'Have you ever been to {color,yellow, the Concealed Peak}? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1175, 'Yes, I have. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1176, 'Oh... Then you must know about the Goblins there...  Those Goblins are acting weird these days.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1177, 'How are they?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1178, 'Some are out of focus and others fall down for no reason.  When I examined them, they were already dead...  Then, I found this feather, which I have never seen before. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1179, 'That is weird.  Dying all of a sudden...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1180, 'So, could you bring this feather to Rohan?  {color,yellow, feathers are used to make arrows, so Rohan might know what it is},..  Could... you ask him for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can ask him yourself.][2]'),
(1181, 'Mr. Rohan!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1182, '...It\'s weird...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1300, 'Imaginary Bird 2'),
(1301, 'Rohan asks you to defeat Dungeon Goblins in the Concealed Peak. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1302, 'What\'s up?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1303, 'Mr. Grunt told me to ask you about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1304, 'Hmm, Grunt?  Let me see that!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1305, 'Here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1306, 'Hmm, I have never seen this before...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1307, '(Talk about what happened with Grunt.)\nYou don\'t know what this is?  Mr. Grunt says that you use feathers like this to make the arrows...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1308, 'Hmm, I do make arrows using feathers, but I have never seen this kind...  It\'s mysterious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1309, 'Mr. Grunt says that he found this near weird goblins.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1310, 'Near the goblins?  Hmm, that\'s strange...  [NAME], can you defeat {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblins} for me?  I want to find out what this is. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Dungeon Goblins? Ok!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(1311, '(Panting) I defeated the goblins.  They were not acting weird. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1312, 'Really?  Hmm, so strange.  I bet Grunt is not making this up...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1313, '..Let\'s go to the Concealed Peak. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1320, 'Imaginary Bird 3'),
(1321, 'Defeat Dungeon Goblin Mages and bring back any clues to Mr. Grunt.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1322, 'Hmm, I doubt Grunt is making this up...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1323, '......\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1324, 'Hmm, how about fighting another goblin besides the {color,yellow,Dungeon Goblin}?  Yes, defeat the {color,yellow,Dungeon Goblin Mages}.  Hmm, you might find some clues?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Dungeon Goblin Mage? Ok!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me take a rest before I leave.][2]'),
(1325, 'I\'m back. A Dungeon Goblin Mage dropped this book. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1326, 'Oh, well done. Hmm, this... book...  Bring it to Grunt.  Tell me what Grunt finds out.  I\'m very curious.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1327, 'Go to the Concealed Peak.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1330, 'Imaginary Bird 4'),
(1331, 'Listen to Mr. Grunt about the book and tell Mr. Lohan. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1332, 'Mr. Grunt!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1333, 'What did he say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1334, '(You talk to him about what you found with Mr. Rohan.)\nI brought this book.  It seemed relevant. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1335, '(Opens the book.)\n\nThis book... has some information... about a bird called Barbet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1336, 'Barbet?  What\'s that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1337, 'It\'s an imaginary bird.  It is unknown whether it really exists, but I have never seen any records on it that is so detailed. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1338, 'What does it say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1339, 'It discusses Barbet\'s appearance and Efficiencies...\n<The contents of book>\n... Said to have 5 colorful legs and translucent feathers......If you catch one and eat it, you will be strong.  To cook Barbet, pick all of its feathers using Guardian\'s Flame Segment and boil it in a big pot...\n\nDid the goblins really do this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1340, 'Well, if this feather is really Barbet\'s... maybe they did. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1341, 'It\'s hard to trust this book, but considering what\'s been happening lately, it seems relevant. \nWell done.  Something\'s still fishy, but you\'ve done your job.  Go and tell Rohan.  He must be dying to know this. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll tell him later.][2]'),
(1342, 'Mr. Rohan!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1343, 'Oh, you\'re back.  Did you find something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1344, '(Tell him about your talk with Mr. Grunt.)\nThat\'s all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1345, 'I see...  Thanks for telling me.  I was dying to know. [NAME], well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1346, 'Go to Rohan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1350, 'Drein\'s Past 1'),
(1351, 'Drain doesn\'t seem well.  Ask her what\'s wrong. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1352, '(Drain is holding a stuffed animal with a worried face.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1353, 'Hey, Drein. Is everything OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1354, '(Hides the stuffed animal.)\nYou, again?  What\'s up?  Do what you have to do and go away!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1355, 'I was just asking because you didn\'t seem well... Well, I\'ll just go.  Anyways, why are you holding that stuffed animal?...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1356, 'It\'s not your business.  What about this stuffed animal?  I\'m holding it for a friend! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1357, 'Oh, I see.  But... you were looking at it with a worried face...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1358, 'What? I was?  Why do you care?  Just go away!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1359, 'Are you still there?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1360, 'Drein\'s Past 2'),
(1361, 'Drein asks you to defeat Weakened Ogres.  Kill a Weakened Ogre for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1362, 'Drain!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1363, 'Are you still here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1364, 'Do you happen to have a bad memory about this stuffed animal?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(1365, 'Just let it go.  You are so persistent...  Hmm, OK.  If you {color,yellow, defeat Weakened Ogres for me}, then I will tell you.  I wonder if you can really defeat them.  You will only be scared to death.  Now, get going!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Weakened Ogre? Ok!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(1366, 'I\'m back.  Now, tell me your story. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(1367, 'You... you really killed them?  Hmm, OK.  Thank you.\nThat stuffed animal was my only daughter\'s favorite thing.  She was truly lovable...  I was away for few hours and she was attacked by Ogres. (I think I saw tears in her eyes)  There!!  Are you satisfied?  Now, you are really through.  Go away!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1368, 'You think you can kill the Weakened Ogres?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15050, 'Ancient Heroes\' Armory'),
(15051, 'Go to Vellon and listen to the story about the War of the Age of Dragon.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15052, '(Looking for something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15053, 'Mr. Vellon, what are you looking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15054, 'Hmm, an adventurer asked me to keep his {color,yellow, Ancient Hero\'s Helmet}... I thought I left it here...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15055, 'Ah? Isn\'t that it?  That looks like a helmet...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15056, 'Oh, yes.  That\'s it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15057, 'It looks special...  Does it have a story?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15058, 'Oh, this helmet... Was a part of the armory that was given to the soldiers that fought for the War of the Age of Dragon.  I must be right... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(15059, '{color,yellow, The heroes} wore the armory that didn\'t even melt in the fire of {color,yellow,Cornelius}...  My ancestor used the wisdom granted by Nature, the god of nature and greenery, to make the armor and give it to them.\n \n[NEXT]'),
(15060, 'That\'s long time ago. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(15061, 'Yes, it is...  At that time, the Elves and Men joined forces to protect the lands from the power of {color,yellow, Cornelius}.\nMany gathered from every plain and valley of Ayasha Continent, but they were lost in the fire {color,yellow, Cornelius}.\nMy ancestor gained the wisdom to defeat {color,yellow, Cornelius} from Nature, the god of nature and greenery that was worried about the lands being burnt by {color,yellow,Cornelius}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(15062, 'Most of the soldiers were melted down in the fire of {color,yellow,Cornelius} and didn\'t even have a chance to get close to {color,yellow,Cornelius}...  So, he learned to make iron that can resist the fire.  My ancestor immediately used his wisdom to make armory that can resist fire and strong fangs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15063, 'Then, he listened to Nature to deliver the armory to the soldiers to protect the lands from burning.  The soldiers {color,yellow, won the battle against Cornelius.} However, the soldiers disappeared from Ayasha Continents along with Cornelius.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15064, 'Few years ago, Nature said that it is tragic to see {color,yellow, the ancient heroes that defeated Cornelius} being forgotten when they are still resting with {color,yellow, Cornelius}.  So, he told me to find the armory that they wore when they sacrificed their lives, although their bodies have already gone back to soil.  Since then, I have been looking for {color,yellow, the pieces of Ancient Heroes\' Armory}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15065, '(Looking for something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15150, 'Ancient Heroes\' Armory'),
(15151, 'Bring Ancient Heroes\' Armor, Ancient Heroes\' Pants, and Ancient Heroes\' Boots to Vellon.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15152, 'I don\'t know how many {color,yellow, ancient heroes} are {color,yellow, resting with Cornelius}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15153, 'I wanted to devote my live to find {color,yellow, the rest of Ancient Heroes\' Armory} so they can rest in peace. {color,yellow,[NAME]}, you understand me, right?!  {color,yellow, Please find as many pieces of Ancient Heroes\' Armor, Pants, and Boots as you can find.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s long time ago.  It won\'t be easy.][2]'),
(15154, 'Mr. Vellon!!  Here are Ancient Heroes\' Armor, Pants, and Boots.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(15155, 'Thank you so much.  It shouldn\'t be long until I can console all their spirits.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15156, '...Remember, it\'s Ancient Heroes\' Armor, Pants, and Boots.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62650, 'Guardian of the Relic 1'),
(62651, 'Defeat 25 Dungeon Gargoyles and 20 Dungeon Krugers. The monsters are guarding the entrance of the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62652, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}! Have you went to the {color,yellow,Dragon\'s Relic}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62653, 'Yes... It was a place full of powerful and scary monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62654, 'I see. I\'ve heard about your task from Town Chief Adrian. He asked you to investigate the Dragon\'s Relic. Best of luck to you. I would love to join the investigation. But Adrian asked me to do something else. That is why. Can you take my place and investigate the Dragon\'s Relic? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes. I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will,. After I get some rest,.][2]'),
(62655, 'I\'m back. There were monsters called the Dungeon Gargoyle and Dungeon Kruger. They were very powerful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62656, 'Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62657, '... Ah... This is a lot of work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62750, 'Guardian of the Relic 2'),
(62751, 'Defeat 20 Dungeon Caravans and 15 Dungeon Nerpa inside the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62752, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  What, Are you waiting for?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62753, 'Cyburn. What is going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62754, 'There is a task I received from Town Chief Adrian which needs to be taken care of immediately. There was a report about a rampage caused by {color,yellow,monsters called Dungeon Caravan and Dungeon Nerpa} inside the Dragon\'s Relic... I... This needs to be stopped immediately.. {color,yellow,[NAME]}, can you teach them a lesson? Defeating about.. .{color,yellow, 20 Dungeon Caravan, and 15 Dungeon Nerpas}. Will surely stop them.Can you do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I will....][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t. I\'m scared.][2]'),
(62755, 'Phew,. I\'m back. They were really scary. When they swing their arms,. It was like a lightning strike.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62756, 'Well done. As I expected. I\'m glad I asked you to do the job. Now this is the only task left.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62757, 'This time... It\'s Dungeon Caravan and Dungeon Nerpa.\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62850, 'Guardian of the Relic 3'),
(62851, 'Defeat 15 each of Dungeon Fire Shellas and Dungeon Flame Spirits deep inside the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62852, 'Ah, This is so confusing...  Ah... color,yellow,[NAME]} Good thing you\'re here. I was going to call you soon...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62853, 'What is going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62854, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, there is a task for you. I\'m very busy with the work I was asked to do by {color,yellow,Town Chief Adrian}.  There was a report about a brutal rampage caused by {color,yellow,fire attributive monsters inside Dragon\'s Relic}. Someone needs to stop them, though I\'m too busy at this moment, and you look free for a task,. It will be great if you go there and destroy {color,yellow, 15 each of monsters called the Dungeon Fire Shella and Dungeon Flame Spirit}!! Hurry and get going!!\n[BUTTON]=[Do I have a choice?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No. No way. Ask someone else.][2]'),
(62855, 'Dungeon Fire Shella and Dungeon Flame Spirit. They sure wasn\'t easy to deal with. I was very close to getting burnt by their flames.\n[NEXT]'),
(62856, 'Thank you.\nAs I expected.You are very trustworthy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62857, 'They\'re called Dungeon Fire Shella and Dungeon Flame Spirit. Remember that...\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62950, 'Guardian Monster'),
(62951, 'Defeat Dungeon Giant Magmaton and Dungeon Fire Titan who are guarding the Dungeon Cornelius of the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62952, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, I\'ve heard about your activities from {color,yellow,Skill Master Cyburn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62953, 'I know you\'ve been very busy with the tasks in the Dragon\'s Relic. Anyway... According to the report I received from {color,yellow,Cyburn}, after combining the movements and tracks of the monsters,. He was wondering if this has some kind of relations with the relic\'s owner who would be buried deep inside the {color,yellow,Dragon\'s Relic}. As a result of searching for the monsters that were guarding {color,yellow,Dungeon Cornelius}, there is a monster who seems to be responsible for the continuous vibration coming from inside the relic recently,...  It seems like it\'s the huge {color,yellow,Giant Dungeon Giant Magmaton and Dungeon Fire Titan},. {color,yellow,[NAME]}you have to destroy them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Um,. I\'m so tired, I need some rest.][2]'),
(62954, 'I\'m back. I\'ve destroyed the {color,yellow,Dungeon Giant Magmaton and Dungeon Fire Titan}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62955, 'Great job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62956, 'You didn\'t take off yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63050, 'Guardian Monster'),
(63051, 'Defeat Dungeon Weasel and Dungeon Big Mudman. They are the guardian monsters of Dungeon Cornelius of the Dragon\'s Relic.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63052, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, I know this will be hard,. But I have a task for you.\n \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63053, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, I\'ve heard a lot about you from {color,yellow,Skill Master Cyburn}. Among what I heard from {color,yellow,Cyburn}, there was a news that the owner of the {color,yellow,Dragon\'s Relic} has been awake. There are these monsters called {color,yellow,Dungeon Weasel and Dungeon Big Mudman}, who are part of the monsters guarding {color,yellow,Dungeon Cornelius},..It seems like they\'re causing an upset inside the Dragon\'s Relic. {color,yellow, [NAME]}, please verify that they actually exist, and if so, you have to destroy {color,yellow,all you can find}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'re telling me to face them?,..][2]'),
(63054, 'I\'m back. I\'ve verified {color,yellow,Dungeon Weasel and Dungeon Big Mudman}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63055, 'I see. Well done. We have a lot of work ahead of us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[COMPLETE_QUEST][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63056, 'It\'s Dungeon Weasel and Dungeon Big Mudman.\n\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3770, 'Fake, fake, fake'),
(3771, 'Healer Poring of Uruga asks for the goods to be sold in the charity event.\nGive the Fake Jewels of Jewel Tree and Glass Jewels of Miner to Healer Poring.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3772, 'Ohhohoho! Welcome! [NAME]!\nHave you been busy lately? Everyone\'s asking for your help for the charity event, right?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3773, 'Haha... It seems so.\nThanks to the charity event, I\'m making quite a lot of money... \n[NEXT]'),
(3774, 'Hmnm. I see. I\'m sure you will enjoy my request as well.\nI\'m planning to sell some goods in the charity event. Of course my target is the richest person in Elderine, Item Merchant Kenton.\nI\'m sure I won\'t be the only one selling fake jewels there.\nI\'ve heard that Item Merchant Kenton collects everything that is shiny and looks like a jewel.\nI\'m going to sell the Fake Jewel from the Jewel Tree and the Glass Jewel from the Miner.\nIf this goes well... Item Merchant Kenton will be broke! Hohohoho!\n\n[BUTTON]=[So I should bring fake jewels?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What kind of a charity event is that?][2]'),
(3775, 'Here, Poring. The jewels you asked for.\nAnyway, do you think Item Merchant Kenton will be able to purchase all of these?\n[NEXT]'),
(3776, 'Oh my god, Kenton is very rich!\nRicher than you could ever imagine!\nHe looks greasy, but he\'s different than the way he looks!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3777, 'Hm. What are you doing? Don\'t tell me that you don\'t know where to find Miners and Jewel Trees? You know where they are, right?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(20770, 'Karl\'s Explosive Idea'),
(20771, 'Blacksmith Karl of Elderine asks you to collect 100 cases of Blast Powder for his new weapon design!\n(Blast Powder can be obtained by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(20772, 'Why, hello there [NAME]! What a coincidence you decided to drop by!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(20773, 'Oh, really? Why do you say that?\n[NEXT]'),
(20774, 'Well, I was just thinking that if that big bully Helga ever decides to attack Elderine, I\'m going to be ready for him! I\'ve been developing this new explosive weapon! It... has a fuse... and it goes boom... uh, what are they called again?\n[NEXT]'),
(20775, 'Oh, I know! You mean a bomb?\n[NEXT]'),
(20776, 'That\'s it! I think a bomb just might do it, old Helga won\'t know what hit him! But I need your help, [NAME]! Can you collect some cases of {color,yellow,Blast Powder} for me? {color,yellow,100} cases should be enough. Without it, my bomb idea goes up in smoke! What do you say?\n[BUTTON]=[Anything for Elderine! I\'ll be back soon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks! I\'m busy!][2]'),
(20777, 'Blacksmith Karl! I\'ve collected all {color,yellow,100 cases of Blast Powder} for you! How is the research going?\n[NEXT]'),
(20778, 'Wow, that was fast! Thanks, [NAME]! I knew I could count on you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(20779, 'Have you collected 100 Blast Powder yet?\nDon\'t you want to help me?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(400, 'Heart to a Good Child 1'),
(401, 'Ancient Templar Maria of Roumen is planning for a fun and educational event for the orphans.\nGo to Item Merchant Kenton in Elderine to receive the Heart Armband.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(402, 'Welcome, [NAME].\nGood to see you again. Haha.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(403, 'Yes. It\'s good to see you too. How have you been, Maria?\nBy the way, you look very excited. What\'s going on?\n[NEXT]'),
(404, 'Oh, it\'s nothing... Hehehe. \nI\'m just planning to open a small event for the orphans.\nFrankly, I called you because of that. I promised the kids that I will award them with a Heart Armband if they do something good. \nI\'m going to award it to the child with the best participation.\nI\'ve already asked Item Merchant Kenton in Elderine for the Heart Armband... Please do me a favor. Can you bring that to me? \n[BUTTON]=[Of course I will help out!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m kinda busy... Maybe next time.][2]'),
(405, 'Hello, Mr. Kenton!\nI\'m here to get the Heart Armband that Ancient Templar Maria asked for.\n[NEXT]'),
(406, 'Um... Hm... That\'s... Um~ \nW, wait... Umm... So... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(407, 'Please be careful.\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(800, 'Heart to a Good Child 2'),
(801, 'Item Merchant Kenton did not make the Heart Armband that Ancient Templar Maria asked for.\nTake the heart from Heart Trumpy and give it to Ancient Templar Maria.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(802, 'Oh, my...! So, sorry! I, I totally forgot about that!\nGee~ I promised Maria to have it ready by today... \nWhat am I going to do? Gee~ \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(803, 'God...! Please don\'t talk like that!\nDoes it take long to make? Can\'t you just make one now?\n[NEXT]'),
(804, 'Gee~ N~O~ It takes at least a week!\nOh, my~ It\'s so embarrassing to talk like this... I probably forgot about it because I was making a tiny profit out of... Gee!!\n[NAME], Could you please bring... the heart... to me... pretty~please?\nIt takes a long time to make it, but bringing the Heart Trumpy\'s heart is a piece of cake for you, isn\'t that right darling~?\nGet one from them... and make the armband just like mine and give it to Maria. please?\n[BUTTON]=[Hm. Heart Trumpy? Bringing the heart will solve this, right?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What the! That\'s your job!!][2]'),
(805, 'Hm. Maria... \nHere... Th..the armband from Item Merchant Kenton.\nHere you go.\n[NEXT]'),
(806, '...Wha? It\'s much bigger than the one I asked for.\nAnd... Hm.\n...I... see....\nHm, hm... [NAME]. You look tired. You should sit yourself down here for a while. Thanks for the armband.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(807, 'Gee~ Sorry~ I\'m so sorry, okay? So please... Hm? Hmm?\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(900, 'Warm Winter 1'),
(901, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga is gathering firewood for the upcoming winter, but all the trees are burned. \nDestroy the Flame Honeying that\'s burning up all the trees.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(902, 'Phew... Burnt trees here and there.\nWhat a waste... What a waste... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(903, 'Wha? Mister? What are those black things?\nAnd why are you talking to yourself? Are you sick?\n[NEXT]'),
(904, 'Humph! I\'m not sick!\nIt\'s because...\nIt will be winter soon... So I need to gather up a lot of firewood.\nBut these wicked Flame Honeyings have burned up all the trees of Burning Rocks... \nI don\'t see any firewood.\nHm... Can you destroy the Flame Honeyings?\n[BUTTON]=[Hm, Sounds fun. I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you catch one of the Honeyings and use it over the winter?][2]'),
(905, 'I\'m back, Blacksmith Hans!\nI\'ve destroyed all the Honeyings. But how are we going to gather firewood out of all these burnt trees?\n[NEXT]'),
(906, 'Hm, well done. \nYeah... You\'re right. All the Honeyings are destroyed, but the trees are still burnt... \nPhew... What am I gonna do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(907, 'Honeying... Honeying... I\'m sick of these Honeyings... Grrrr...\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1100, 'Warm Winter 2'),
(1101, 'Blacksmith Hans is very relieved after hearing the idea from Town Chief Adrian and Skill Master Cyburn.\nBring the Flame Honeyings\'s wing feathers.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1102, 'Hahaha... Humph, How\'s that? Don\'t I look intelligent today?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1103, 'Wha? Hm... I think you look rough, like always.\n[NEXT]'),
(1104, 'Humph! You have no sense of humor.\nListen well. I found a way to stay warm over the winter. It\'s the feather of the Flame Honeying! I heard that the Honeying\'s feathers stay warm for months.\nIf I make a comforter with these feathers... It\'ll be so warm?! Don\'t you think? I\'m so smart!\nHm, actually it was Adrian and Cyburn\'s idea....\n[BUTTON]=[So you\'re telling me to bring Flame Honeying\'s feathers, right?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have no idea what you\'re saying...][2]'),
(1105, 'Tada! Here you go.\nBut... Can you make a comforter with these? It\'s not much... \n[NEXT]'),
(1106, 'Haha, these are not like duck or goose feathers.\nIt gets warm with only a few! Hahaha! I\'m so excited!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1107, 'Huh? What are you still doing here?!\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1110, 'Weird Heat 1'),
(1111, 'Stone Merchant Thompson in Burning Rock wants to go back to the village as soon as possible.\nBring cold potions to Stone Merchant Thompson who is very hot.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1112, 'Phew... Seriously, it\'s so hot out there.\nWhy do the Merchant have to be in this weird place... This really chaps my hide!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1113, 'You\'re still complaining about something, huh? Is it that hot?\nI don\'t feel very hot... \n[NEXT]'),
(1114, 'Humph! That\'s because you don\'t stay here everyday like I do.\nMan... It\'s hot. Do you have a... potion by any chance?\nIt\'ll feel so cool if I drink three cold HP Potion (Tier 5)... \n[BUTTON]=[Hm... Fine. I will get some for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s your problem!][2]'),
(1115, 'Here. The potions. Drink up.\n[NEXT]'),
(1116, 'Oh, boy! Thank you so much! And it\'s free too!\n(gulp, gulp....)\nWow! That was good. Hm... Well the thirst is gone.  But the heat isn\'t. I want something cool... Don\'t you have anything cool?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1117, '... So hot... So hot... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1400, 'Weird Heat 2'),
(1401, 'Item Merchant Julian in Burning Rock says he\'s hot as well.\nBring one HP Potion (Tier 5) to Item Merchant Julian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1402, 'It\'s so hot.\nAren\'t you hot?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1403, 'Wha? You\'re hot too? I don\'t feel very... \n[NEXT]'),
(1404, 'Hm... Since yesterday, it\'s been so hot that I can\'t stand it.\nYou don\'t look very hot at all... Phewww.\nBy the way, I\'m so thirsty. Do you have a HP Potion (Tier 1) by any chance?\nIf you do, I\'ll pay you for it.\n[BUTTON]=[You\'re so different compared to Thompson. You can just have it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[HP Potion (Tier 1)? Do I look like a low-level newbie?][2]'),
(1405, 'Here! I brought the potion.\nYou can just drink it for free.\n[NEXT]'),
(1406, 'Oh... Thank you so much.\nYou saved my life.\n(gulp gulp)\nAah- It feels great.\nBut this feeling won\'t last long... I\'ll be hot and thirsty in no time.\nWhen will this heat go away...? This is too much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1407, '... (Sigh)\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1650, 'Weird Heat 3'),
(1651, 'Merchant Master Maxuter has doubts about the heat that has been raging recently in Burning Rock.\nTake Maxuter\'s letter to Healer Avon in Elderine.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1652, 'Welcome [NAME].\nHm... As I expected, you don\'t look hot at all.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(1653, 'Huh? Oh... Are you hot and thirsty as well?\nDo you need a potion?\nBy the way... It is weird that I\'m not very hot like other people around here.\nI do feel a bit of heat but... \n[NEXT]'),
(1654, 'Yes... I\'m sure you\'re not very hot.\nJust like all the other adventurers I\'ve met here... \nIt seems like we, the merchants, are the only people who are able to feel this heat.\nI\'ve got a feeling that something bad is going on right now.\nThat\'s why... I wrote a letter to Healer Avon in Elderine to ask for aid regarding this situation. If you can deliver this to him... \n[NEXT]'),
(1655, 'Ah... I see. Anyway, are you asking this as a favor? Or an official request?\nHm, I will not accept this if it\'s an official request!\nThis task is too small to be considered a request.\nI\'ll just do it for free. I go to Elderine pretty often anyway.\n[NEXT]'),
(1656, 'Haha... \nJust as I thought... \nAnyway... I will be counting on you.\nHere is the letter.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll deliver it right now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Give it to me later.][2]'),
(1657, 'Avon!\nI brought Merchant Master Maxuter\'s letter. Here... \n[NEXT]'),
(1658, 'Ah, Okay.\nI\'ll read it right away.\n...\n......\n......... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(1659, '... ... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2000, 'Weird Heat 4'),
(2001, 'After reading the letter from Merchant Master Maxuter, Healer Avon was in deep thought, until he brought something from his house.\nTake Healer Avon\'s vaccine to Merchant Master Maxuter in Burning Rock.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2002, 'Just as I thought... This is the accident I\'ve been hoping to avoid.\nAlthough I\'ve been recently expecting this to happen.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2003, 'You\'ve been expecting this? So, you mean you knew that the people in merchant were going to suffer from the raging heat? \n[NEXT]'),
(2004, 'Yes... Maybe. No, for sure.\nSince Maxuter told me that he is planning to build a merchant camp in Burning Rock.\nI\'m personally close with him so... Anyway, I was kind of hoping that this wouldn\'t happen, but I guess it did.\nThat is... an infectious disease. It originated from the mutated monsters from Burning Rock.\nThat\'s why I\'ve already started developing a vaccine several months ago... \nThis vaccine has not been officially verified yet. \nBut we have no time to waste... You should give this vaccine to Merchant Master Maxuter.\nI\'m enclosing a letter as well, so please take these together.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I will deliver these.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'re asking me to deliver this suspicious medicine?!][2]'),
(2005, 'Maxuter! Here is a letter from Avon and the vaccine.\nThe vaccine hasn\'t been officially verified yet. Please read the letter first. \n[NEXT]'),
(2006, 'Phew... \n(looking tired)\nOkay... Thank you. I\'m kind of tired... \nI should sit down first... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2007, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2650, 'Weird Heat 5'),
(2651, 'After reading Healer Avon\'s letter, Merchant Master Maxuter asks to complete a task.\nFind all the monster body parts Merchant Master Maxuter asks to find, and take them to Item Merchant Julian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2652, 'Hm... According to Avon\'s letter... (Phew)\nThe symptoms will eventually get worse ...In worst cases, one can end up losing a partial function of the body. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2653, 'What?! Then this is a very dangerous disease!\nHurry up and take the vaccine...!!\n[NEXT]'),
(2654, 'No... It says here that it is dangerous to take the vaccine by itself.\nIt says to take it with a counteragent containing a monster\'s heat... \nFortunately, it seems like Julian is able to make this counteragent as well.\nAs written here... Please bring these monster parts.\nHm... This is a difficult task, so please consider this as an official request. After you find all the parts, take them to Julian right away.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay! You can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m kinda busy at the moment...!][2]'),
(2655, 'Julian! Here, I\'ve brought all the monster parts.\nAre you okay? You look awful... Your face is blue like a Smurf... \n[NEXT]'),
(2656, '...Hah... To live... I have no... Choice but to... Make the...Hah... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2657, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2750, 'Weird Heat 6'),
(2751, 'Deliver the counteragent made by Item Merchant Julian to Merchant Master Maxuter.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2752, 'Here... All... Done... \nGive this... to... Maxuter... Hurry... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2753, 'Maxuter!\nYikes! Another Smurf...!!\nHere\'s the counteragent.\nTake it with the vaccine right away. Hurry.\nI should take this to Stone Merchant Thompson as well.\n[NEXT]'),
(2754, 'Thank... you... so much... \nDon\'t worry about... me. Phewww... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2755, 'Hurry... to Maxuter... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2850, 'Weird Heat 7'),
(2851, 'Deliver the counteragent made by Item Merchant Julian to Stone Merchant Thompson.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2852, 'Go to... Thompson... Hurry... He\'s such a crybaby... \nHe\'ll be... having a hard... time.. I already got... the vaccine... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2853, 'Thompson! Thompson.. Thompson?\nWake up!!\n[NEXT]'),
(2854, 'P... Please! I don\'t wanna die! \nAaaaah... A, a ghost! Yikes!! Grim, Grim Reaper!! Help me!\nPlease!! The scam... It wasn\'t me!! It was Julian! \nI... Don\'t wanna die! Please!!!\n[NEXT]'),
(2855, '(... He sure seems to be having a hard time. Although, very energetic.)\nSnap out of it. \nThompson!\n(Slaps him on his cheek)\nHere, take this now.\nHurry. You have the vaccine, right?\n[NEXT]'),
(2856, 'Hm... Huh?! Are you here to save me?!\n(Consumes the vaccine impatiently)\nHa! Hehehe! I\'m not dead, right? Right?\nHehehe... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2857, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3070, 'Token of Appreciation'),
(3071, 'Merchant Master Maxuter of Burning Rock shows his appreciation for helping out the Merchant.\nReceive the reward from Merchant Master Maxuter.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3072, 'Ah... Sorry to bother you.\nBut I had to say thank you for helping us out before... Haha.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3073, 'Huh? Ah... You mean... The heat disease?\nHehe, you don\'t have to... \nIt was no biggie.\n[NEXT]'),
(3074, 'You could have just ignored it.\nSaving people\'s lives must be rewarded.\nThis... Is the reward.\nIf you don\'t accept this, there will be no more requests from now on!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3075, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3170, 'Charity Event 1'),
(3171, 'Merchant Master Maxuter of Burning Rock prepares for the goods to be sold in the charity event being held in Uruga.\nGather Fake Jewels from Jewel Tree and give them to Merchant Master Maxuter.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3172, 'Welcome. There are lots of requests waiting for you. Aren\'t you excited?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3173, 'Huh? Ah...  Haha, I... Certainly am.\nShould I be dancing around?\n[NEXT]'),
(3174, 'That won\'t be necessary. Hm. Anyway... Have you heard about the charity event in Uruga?\nIt\'s an event being held to help raise donations for the orphanage in Roumen... And I\'m planning to sell something there myself.\nI heard that there is a fake jewels you can get from a monster called the Jewel Tree. The fake jewel is a great item to use for an instant decoration. \nI\'m sure Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine will be looking for those.\nI have two tasks for you.\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe later.][2]'),
(3175, 'Here. Just as you asked. Count \'em yourself.\n[NEXT]'),
(3176, 'Haha, there\'s no need to count, [NAME].  I trust your work. Well done. Here\'s your reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3177, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3250, 'Charity Event 2'),
(3251, 'Item Merchant Julian of Burning Rock is also interested in selling stuff at the charity event.\nTake the Lava ViVi\'s Flame to Item Merchant Julian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3252, 'Welcome.\nI also have a request for you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3253, 'You too? Ah... Is it regarding the charity event?\n[NEXT]'),
(3254, 'Bingo!\nYou\'re very smart.\nI\'m also planning to sell some stuff in the charity event.\nAnd of course... My target is Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine! I\'m sure all the donation money for the event will come out of Item Merchant Kenton\'s pocket. Haha.\nI was thinking about selling the Lava ViVi\'s Flame... \nFrankly, I\'m worried that Storage Keeper Curly might sell the same thing, but that\'s okay.  I\'ll be selling it before she does.\n[BUTTON]=[I got it. The Lava ViVi\'s Flame?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s not right.][2]'),
(3255, 'Here! The Flame... This Lava ViVi\'s Flame is so mysterious. How can a flame stay like this in a solid form?\n[NEXT]'),
(3256, 'Haha, I\'m curious about that too. \nHm... I heard that Storage Keeper Curly has completed the ViVi collection... I wonder if she\'ll be selling this at the event...\nCan you go ask her?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3257, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3350, 'Charity Event 3'),
(3351, 'Item Merchant Julian is worried that his goods for the charity event might overlap with Storage Keeper Curly\'s.\nTalk to Storage Keeper Curly.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3352, 'Can you go ask her?\nTo find out weather if Curly\'s planning to sell the Lava ViVi\'s Flame or not... \nI\'ll be counting on you. Haha.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3353, 'Hey~ What are you doing? Curly?\n[NEXT]'),
(3354, 'Huh? Ah! I\'m glad you\'re here, [NAME]!\nAt the upcoming charity event, I\'m gonna sell my Vivi collection.\nWhat do you think? Cool, huh? Ice Vivi, Lighting Vivi, Lava Vivi, Lamp Vivi... \n[NEXT]'),
(3355, '(Oops, just as Julian was worrying about... )\nUm, Curly? Don\'t you have something other to sell than... your Vivi collection?\n I don\'t think... people will be very interested in those. Hehe.\n[NEXT]'),
(3356, 'What are you talking about! As soon as I put these on sale, Item Merchant Vellon will buy them all.\nThese will all be sold right away unless... there\'s another person selling these. Yeah, yeah.\n[NEXT]'),
(3357, 'Um... Actually... There\'s... someone planning to sell...those.\nIt\'s umm... someone from Burning Rock... \n[NEXT]'),
(3358, '...What?! Someone from Burning Rock... It, it\'s not Item Merchant Julian, is it?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3359, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3360, 'Charity Event 4'),
(3361, 'Storage Keeper Curly knows what Item Merchant Julian is up to.\nDeliver Storage Keeper Curly\'s message to Item Merchant Julian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3362, 'I knew it! It was him!\nThat chump is always in my way!\nDid he sent you to spy on me?!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3363, 'Ah... Umm... Not exactly... Julian told me that he will be selling the Lava ViVi\'s Flame so... \nHe just wanted me to check if you\'re... \n(Gulp)\n[NEXT]'),
(3364, 'Humph! Tell him this!\n"You filthy animal, I will be selling the Lava ViVi\'s Flame\'s at the event before you do, so don\'t even think about it!" Go tell him.\nRight now!!\n[BUTTON]=[O, Okay I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You tell him yourself!][2]'),
(3365, 'Umm... Julian... Storage Keeper Curly wanted me to tell you this... \n"You filthy animal, I will be selling the Lava ViVi\'s Flame\'s at the event before you do, so don\'t even think about it!" \n[NEXT]'),
(3366, '... ha, hahah! hahahaha!!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3367, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4050, 'Charity Event Only for Item Merchant Kenton?!'),
(4051, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga is shocked after witnessing the items being sold in the charity event.\nTalk to Town Chief Adrian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4052, 'This is so ridiculous.\nIs this a charity event, or a party for Kenton?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4053, 'Huh? ah... is it because of the items out for sale in this event?\n[NEXT]'),
(4054, '[NAME], I heard that you\'ve helped them with this.\nPhew... This is a charity event. It is an event held with a good purpose... I don\'t understand this. \nEveryone was supposed to sell something useful among the stuff that they don\'t need. Like a flea market.\nAnd all the profits were originally planned to be used to help the Orphanage of Roumen... \nThis is ridiculous... Targetting someone and competing to sell... \nThis is unacceptable.\n[NEXT]'),
(4055, 'Ah... \nI see..\nSo, are you going to stop this event?\n[NEXT]'),
(4056, 'With the current items being sold here, the event must be stopped.\nIf the items are not needed by the owner, but could be useful to someone else...\nIf all of those items are for Kenton, then this means the event is held only for Kenton instead of a charity event. Don\'t you think?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4057, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4150, 'Event with No Purpose 1'),
(4151, 'Adrian tells you that she will not accept any of the items for the charity event.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4152, 'Do you remember the charity event?\nI have given it much thought and I really can\'t proceed with an event like this. \nReturn these items to their owners. \n[NAME], can you do this for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4153, 'Oh... Yes... \nI will help you. Since I did take a part in this... Hmm.\nI\'m sory.\n[NEXT]'),
(4154, '[NAME], you don\'t have to be sorry. \nEveryone has forgotten the purpose of this charity event. \nPlease return these items to the owners and deliver my message as well. \nTell them that the event has been cancelled. \n[NEXT]'),
(4155, 'But ... then how would you support the orphanage...? \n[NEXT]'),
(4156, 'I wanted to raise a lot of funds this time. \nBut I can raise funds by going here and there and increase the amount of my donation. \nDon\'t worry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4157, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4250, 'Event with No Purpose 2'),
(4251, 'Return the items to everyone and deliver Adrian\'s message that the event has been cancelled. \nFirst, return Poring\'s item. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4252, 'Here are all of the items.  It would be easier to start with the nearest person. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4253, 'Poring.\nHere\'s the items you donated. \nThe event has been cancelled. Chief Adrian is upset. \n[NEXT]'),
(4254, 'Really?  Why? What has her upset?\nDid I do something wrong?\n[NEXT]'),
(4255, 'Hmm... \nI don\'t know!\nYou are part of the reason. Since everyone donated items that might attract Mr. Kenton of Elderine.\nThey must have wanted their items to be sold first... \nBut the charity event became an event for Mr. Kenton. \n[NEXT]'),
(4256, 'Really.  Everyone else, too... ?\nOh, no.  What should I do?  Should I visit Chief Adrian?  How embarrassing. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4257, 'Go ahead.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3470, 'Event with No Purpose 3'),
(3471, 'Return the items to everyone and deliver Adrian\'s message that the event has been cancelled.\nReturn Curly\'s item. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3472, 'I have delivered the message, right?\nI should be going now. \n(Let\'s go to Curly!)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3473, 'Curly!\nHere\'s the items you donated.\nThe event has been cancelled.\nChief Adrian told me to pass on the message. \n[NEXT]'),
(3474, 'Huh?!  Why? What happened?\n[NEXT]'),
(3475, 'Hmm... Talk to the Chief for more information.\nThe event is cancelled!\n[NEXT]'),
(3476, 'Huh? Hey! Hey!\nYou can\'t just leave like that!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3477, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4450, 'Event with No Purpose 4'),
(4451, 'Return the items to everyone and deliver Adrian\'s message that the event has been cancelled.\nReturn Julian\'s item.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4452, 'Ask him yourself~\n(I don\'t want to explain this again.  Let\'s run!  Next is Julian?)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4453, 'Julian!\nHere\'s the items you donated. \nChief Adrian says that the event is cancelled. \n[NEXT]'),
(4454, 'Huh? Why? What happened?\n[NEXT]'),
(4455, 'No.  The thing is... \n(You explain everything)\n[NEXT]'),
(4456, 'Oh... \nI see.\nHmm.  Everyone donated items to attract Mr. Kenton... \nHa ha, it sounds right that Chief Adrian cancelled the event. \nOK.  I will apologize to the Chief myself... \nAh, Maxuter, too?\nHa ha!  This is funny... \nHa ha!  I can almost see Maxuter\'s startled face now.\nEnjoy that look on his face when you tell him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4457, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4550, 'Event with No Purpose 5'),
(4551, 'Return the items to everyone and deliver Adrian\'s message that the event has been cancelled.\nReturn Maxuter\'s item.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4552, 'Funny face?\nHmm... Anyways, I should be going!\n(Let\'s go to Maxuter\'s!)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4553, 'Maxuter?\nChief Adrian says that the charity event is cancelled. \nHere\'s your donations back.\n[NEXT]'),
(4554, 'Cancelled?  What do you mean?\nDid Chief Adrian really say so? \n[NEXT]'),
(4555, 'Yes, she did.\n(You explain everything)\n...\nThat\'s what happened.\nChief Adrian is very upset. \n[NEXT]'),
(4556, '...\n...\n...!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4557, '\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4650, 'Event with No Purpose 6'),
(4651, 'You returned all of the items and delivered Adrian\'s message that the event is cancelled.\nListen to Maxuter\'s story. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4652, 'I see.  That\'s why she... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4653, '(Maxuter drops his head)\nHuh?  Mr.?\n(His ears are so red?)\nAre you OK?  Are you sick?!\nYour face is red... \n[NEXT]'),
(4654, 'That\'s, that\'s OK... Hick!\nThat\'s OK.\nHick!\nHmm!\nSorry, hick!\nBut I want to be alone... hick!\nPlease. Hick!\n[NEXT]'),
(4655, 'Huh?! Why are you getting all the hiccups all of a sudden?\nAre you OK?  Would you like some water or potion?\n[NEXT]'),
(4656, 'I want, hick!\nTo be, hick!\nAlone. Hick!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4657, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4750, 'Event with No Purpose 7'),
(4751, 'You returned all of the items and delivered Adrian\'s message that the event is cancelled.\nListen to Maxuter\'s story. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4752, 'Are you OK now?\nI was scared because of your hiccups. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4753, 'Hmm.\nSorry.  This is embarrassing. \nThis is a secret, [NAME]... \nActually, I get severe hiccups when I am ashamed or feel guilty. \nThis is a secret, so don\'t tell anyone... \n[NEXT]'),
(4754, '(Ah, this might be the funny thing that Julian was talking about.)\nOh... I see.  Ha ha.\n(Julian knows already...)\n[NEXT]'),
(4755, 'Doh... Anyways, everyone\'s selfishness has contributed to this trouble.\nNo wonder why Chief Adrian is upset. \nI\'m ashamed... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4756, '...... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4870, 'Maxuter\'s Donation 1'),
(4871, 'Maxuter hands over an enormous donation, sayting that he has made a bad example for others. \nYou must return to Adrian with Maxuter\'s donation and letter. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4872, 'I have made a childish mistake when I\'m suppose to set a good example for others... \nI have no excuse. \nSo, please take this.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4873, 'Eh? What... Huh?!\nWow!  How much is this?!\n(So much gold!)\n[NEXT]'),
(4874, 'That... is what I have made by running the business. \nIt\'s a great deal of money for me... But I want to take responsibility for this trouble. \nPlease deliver it to Chief Adrian.  Tell her to use it for the Orphanage of Roumen.\nHold on... Give me a second...  I want to write her a letter as well.\n... \n... \n[NEXT]'),
(4875, '(Hands over a letter.)\nOK.  I will definitely deliver the money and the letter to the Chief. \n[NEXT]'),
(4876, '... Yes, thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4877, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5750, 'Hearts Becoming One'),
(5751, 'Listen to Adrian\'s story. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5752, 'This is too much.  Maxuter\'s donation is much greater than what I expected for the charity event. \nWith this charity event, I will be able to build a big orphanage in Roumen.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5753, 'What?  But... The charity event has been cancelled, hasn\'t it?\n[NEXT]'),
(5754, 'Everyone has sent me donations.  Poring, Curly, and Julian... \nAlthough Maxuter\'s donation is the greatest, of course. \nI am still thankful for everyone\'s help. \n[NEXT]'),
(5755, 'Oh... Everyone has contributed donations... \nThat\'s nice.  So we will be building a big orphanage in Roumen with that?\n[NEXT]'),
(5756, 'Yes.  Maria has been worried a great deal... I think Maria will like this very much. \nThe old orphanage building was so slummy.  I felt so sorry for them.  \nOh, I have one last favor to ask you.  Can you help me? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5757, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5850, 'Donation Delivery'),
(5851, 'Adrian asks you to deliver the donation to Maria in Roumen.\nDeliver the donation to Maria. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5852, 'You have played a big role, [NAME]. \nYou have helped me and all of the others...  Thank you so much.\nSo, you are a big contributor, [NAME].\nCan you deliver this donation yourself?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5853, 'Eh?!  But I can\'t... \n[NEXT]'),
(5854, 'That\'s OK. \nThis is everyone\'s donation. \nAnd you have done the most, [NAME]. \nThe list of all donators will be posted at the square in Roumen.  You will be the first on the list, of course. \nPlease deliver this donation to Maria. \n[BUTTON]=[Yes!  I will!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[but I didn\'t make any donation... ][2]'),
(5855, 'Maria. \nI am here!  I brought the donations!\nChief Adrienne, Maxuter, Curly, Poring, Julian and many other people of Uruga have made a large donation. \n[NEXT]'),
(5856, 'Oh... wow...!\nI can\'t believe this.  Oh, wow... (almost faints)\nThis is too much.  My hands are shaking.\nAh, the list... \nWow, your name is on the top, [NAME]!  Did you make a donation too, [NAME]? \n[NEXT]'),
(5857, 'Um, no, but... I donated my time and effort... \n[NEXT]'),
(5858, 'Oh, I have no time to waste! \nI must deliver the list to Chief Roumenus and call the contractors.  Oh, no!  I have to find land first!\nWow!  I\'m so busy! \nOops, I almost forgot to thank you!\nThank you.  Thank you so much!\nThe orphans of Roumen will no longer have to endure cold winds. \n(Maria holds much hands and sobs.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5859, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6050, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union'),
(6051, 'A group of unfamilar faces appeared in Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6052, 'Hmm, you an adventurer?\nYou look like a novice...  But you are certainly an adventurer of Henneath.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6053, 'Why, yes... Who are you?\nI don\'t think I have seen you in Uruga before... \n[NEXT]'),
(6054, 'Hmph!  I am the leader of the great {color,yellow, Hunters\' Union}! {color,yellow, Kasandra}!\n[NEXT]'),
(6055, 'The Hunters\' Union?!\nHmm, I have never heard of it...  Is it new?\n[NEXT]'),
(6056, 'Hmm!  No!  It has been around for a while, but we have just come to Uruga.  That\'s why you don\'t know us!\nAnyways, you are still a youngster.  Come back to me when you get stronger.\nBut sign up first if you want to work for us later. \n{color,yellow, Here... sign here and your name here... Good.}\n... [NAME]?  Ha, that\'s a funny name.\nOK.  You are now a member of the Hunter\'s Union.  Come to me for work when you get stronger.  Get it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6057, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6150, 'Carol of the Hunters\' Union'),
(6151, 'A group of unfamilar faces appeared in Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6152, 'Ah... Hello. \nI, I am {color,yellow, Carol}.\nI work for {color,yellow, Kasandra} of the Hunters\' Union.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6153, 'Yes, hello.\nI am [NAME].  I am with the Henneath Adventurers.\nIs there anyone else in the Hunters\' Union besides the three of you?\n[NEXT]'),
(6154, 'What?  Err...  Well... Kasandra assigns us to our job... I do ... Cleaning... cooking and washing clothes... \nSo, yes.  There are just the three of us for now.\nBut many people have been signing up lately.\nYou registered too, right, [NAME]?\n[NEXT]'),
(6155, 'Ah... yes. \nHe told me to sign my name to get some quests from her.\nI didn\'t know that was signing up...  Hmm.\n(I don\'t like this feeling...)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6156, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6250, 'Reno of the Hunters\' Union'),
(6251, 'A group of unfamilar faces appeared in Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6252, 'Huh?  What?  A new member of the Hunters\' Union?\nNice to meet you.  I\'m {color,yellow, Reno}.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6253, '(He doesn\'t sound so friendly.)\nOh, yes.  I\'m [NAME].... of the Henneath Adventurers.\n[NEXT]'),
(6254, 'Hey, you are one of the Hunters\' Union now.  The Hunters\' Union comes first and then Henneath Adventurers comes second.  Got it?\nWhat\'s that?  You got a problem with that?\nGet going.  We don\'t have anything to do now. \n[NEXT]'),
(6255, '(Observes the faces)\nI think you and Carol look so much alike...  Are you brother and sister?\n[NEXT]'),
(6256, 'What?\nWhy do you ask?  That\'s none of your business!\nHmph... Yeah, yeah,  We are {color,yellow, twins!}  OK?\nNo more questions.  Get going.  I have enough to worry about. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6257, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6300, 'Why Are You So Angry?'),
(6301, 'Talk to Kasandra.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6302, 'Hmm.  You...  Come here.\nLet\'s see...  You have good muscles and skills... \nYou have achieved a high level, too.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6303, 'Ha ha, right.  I think I have?\nDo you want me to work for you?\n[NEXT]'),
(6304, 'I haven\'t decided whether I could trust you. \nAlthough you look OK... \nFine, I\'ll tell you about the Hunters\' Union. \nI am {color,yellow, Master Kasandra}.  You must know me already. \nOthers in the Union are {color,yellow, Carol and Reno.  They are twins}.  They have very {color,yellow, important jobs}, so you can trust them. \nAnyways, I {color,yellow, really, really don\'t like the Chief of this village, so never ever say "Our Chief or Our Chief Adrian" in front of my face}.  {color,yellow, It\'s strictly prohibited}.\nOK?\n[NEXT]'),
(6305, 'What? Why? Everyone admires Chief Adrian... \n[NEXT]'),
(6306, 'There you go!!  {color,yellow, I prohibit Admirable Chief Adrian!!!}\nYou are not ready for a job, yet.  Go away!  No job for you!  Hmph!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6307, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6350, 'Carol\'s Advice'),
(6351, 'Carol tells you why Kasandra is so angry. \nFind Advanced SP Potion to make Kasandra feel better. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6352, 'Hey... (whispering)\nAdventurer.  This way.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6353, '(Carefully)\nOh, Carol.  Did you want to talk to me?\n[NEXT]'),
(6354, 'Did you just make Kasandra angry?\nYou should have been more careful. You should never talk about Chief Adrian in front of Kassandra.\n[NEXT]'),
(6355, 'Why?  I don\'t get it.  Everyone admires her... \nWhy... \n[NEXT]'),
(6356, 'Actually... {color,yellow, Kasandra thinks Chief Adrian is her rival}.\nThey were {color,yellow, good friends} when they were {color,yellow, young}... But Chief Adrian was so much better than her... Anyways.\nI can\'t tell you anything else about it.\nKasandra likes this {color,yellow, Advanced SP Potion}.  You should bring it to her and she will give you a job. \nPhew, she has kicked out so many adventurers because of this...\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  You said Advanced SP Potion, right?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Whatever.  I\'ll just go home.][2]'),
(6357, 'Um, President Kasandra?\n[NEXT]'),
(6358, 'Huh?  What!  Didn\'t I tell you to... Huh?\nIs that thing in your hand...  Is that {color,yellow, Advanced SP Potion?}\nHmph... Hmm.  If you want to apologize, I accept.  \n(Faint smile)\nGive me that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6359, 'Go ahead.  You have the ability to find an Advanced SP Potion, right?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6450, 'The Hunters\' Union: Warm Up 1'),
(6451, 'Kasandra feels better. \nYou must first defeat 30 Red Nix.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6452, 'Ahem!\nGood, I will give you a job. \nSince I don\'t know your skills, I will give you an easy one.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6453, 'Hey, I can handle it...\nWhat do you mean by an easy job?\n[NEXT]'),
(6454, 'Go to Flaming Mine and find a monster called Red Nix.\nYou know, the ones that look like birds... \nDefeat some of them...  Maybe about 30?\nWouldn\'t that be easy?\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You call that easy?][2]'),
(6455, 'I\'m back!\nI defeated 30 Red Nix.\n[NEXT]'),
(6456, 'Huh?!\nWhat?  Already?\nAren\'t you lying?  You couldn\'t have done it already.\nAre you trying to fool me?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6457, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6550, 'The Hunters\' Union: Warm Up 2'),
(6551, 'Kasandra doesn\'t believe that you have defeated the Red Nix so fast.\nYou must defeat 30 Red Nix this time.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6552, 'You couldn\'t have defeat them already!\nDon\'t even think about lying to me.  I can read people\'s mind.\nHow dare you trying to fool me... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6553, 'Fool you?\nI am not a bad person!  How could you lead the Hunters\' Union when you can\'t trust the Henneath Adventurers? \n[NEXT]'),
(6554, 'Hmm.  \nI didn\'t say I can\'t trust you... But you came back so soon... \nOK, if you insist.  Defeat some more this time. \nHow about 30 Red Nix this time!\n[BUTTON]=[Good.  I\'ll do it faster this time.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I when you don\'t even trust me?][2]'),
(6555, 'I\'m back!\nI defeated them all.  Alright?  If you can\'t trust me, go out and see it for yourself!\n[NEXT]'),
(6556, 'OK.  OK!\nHmph, you must have pretty good skills... Good.  Now that I know where you are, I will give you a real job. \nYou\'d better be prepared.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6557, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6650, 'The Hunters\' Union: Crystal Sword'),
(6651, 'Kasandra, the Leader of the Hunters\' Union of Uruga, assigns you to a job. \nYou must bring the Crystal Sword of the Crystal Guardian. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6652, 'It\'s about time you got here.  What took you so long?\nYou should have been here once when I called for you!  Don\'t you want a job?  Huh?!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6653, 'I do want a job.  I did my best. \n[NEXT]'),
(6654, 'Hmph!  I don\'t like lazy people.\nThis job is to bring the Sword of the Crystal Guardian.\nIt\'s called the Crystal Sword.  It has the most splendid and beautiful glow... \nIt\'s rather rare, so it would take some time for you to get one. \nYou think you can do it?\n[BUTTON]=[Of course.  It\'s a piece of cake!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmph, what do you expect?  I\'m just a lazy one.][2]'),
(6655, 'Ta-dah!\nHere\'s the Crystal Sword!  It\'s really bright. \nYou can\'t even imagine how many Crystal Guardians I had to defeat...\n[NEXT]'),
(6656, 'Hmm.  I see... \nGood.  You did well. \nHere\'s your reward.  I wanted to keep this myself. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6657, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12350, 'An Old Letter 1'),
(12351, 'You got a tattered letter from Item Merchant Vellon.\nYou can\'t make it out, but you found that Kasandra\'s name is written on it. \nTalk to Kasandra.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12352, '[NAME]! Wait a second.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12353, 'Vellon, I haven\'t seen you for a while. How is it going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12354, 'Everything is good!  By the way, I was in the middle of walking, found this  {color,yellow,tattered letter} in front of the brook.\nIt seems to be one of the Hunter\'s union member\'s belongings, I came here to ask  [NAME] to return this old letter.\n\n[NEXT]\n'),
(12355, '...\n...\n(Kasandra\'s name is written on the letter)\nI guess this belongs to Kasandra, Don\'t worry! \nI will send it to her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12356, 'Thanks for going there to deliver this letter. I would do it but since I am not close to the Hunter union people, yet. I feel strange doing it\n[NAME], Thanks! I was so much concerned about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let me do it][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like them, either.][2]'),
(12357, 'What is that dirty piece of paper?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12358, 'Hmm...I brought the letter from the item Merchant Vellon. I found your name on it. \nThe ink has smudged and the letter is torn up, so you can\'t quite see what it\'s saying... \nI just thought it might be a letter for you. \n[NEXT]'),
(12359, 'Hmm.  Give me that.\n... \n... \n...... This handwriting...?\n[NEXT]'),
(12360, '(Kasandra carefully examines the letter and frowns.)\nHmph.  What a worthless piece of junk... \nI can\'t even make it out. Who cares!\n(Throws away the letter.)\n[NEXT]'),
(12361, 'Oh, I guess it\'s too beat up. \nI shouldn\'t have brought it. \nI am leaving now\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12362, '... \n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12450, 'An Old Letter 2'),
(12451, 'Reno gives you a job. \nTake the letter to Elderine\'s Enchanter Master Wishis.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12452, 'Hey, adventurer.\nYour name was... [NAME], right?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12453, 'Right.\nWhat is it...?\nIs it about the Hunter\'s Union?\n[NEXT]'),
(12454, 'I have a job for you.  I don\'t if I should do this...But... \nYou should restore this letter.  Elderine\'s Wishis?  You should bring it to her.\nBe careful.  It\'s so old and torn you don\'t want to damage it any more. \n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to... ][2]'),
(12455, 'Wishis!  It\'s bean a while.\nI have something for you... \n(I carefully take out the letter and found that it looks familiar!)\nEh?  It\'s the one that I picked up for her?\n[NEXT]'),
(12456, 'Huh?  What\'s wrong, [NAME]?\nDidn\'t you say it\'s for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12457, '... What are you doing?  Get going.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12550, 'An Old Letter 3'),
(12551, 'Enchanter Master Wishis says that she needs more materials to restore the letter. \nFind 10 White Powder of Lava Magmaton.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12552, 'Oh, yes.  It\'s for you.  \nIt\'s a letter that I found.  Here. \n(He said he didn\'t care... Maybe he got curious?)\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12553, 'Oh, you need to restore it. \nI developed a chemical that perfectly restores \'ink\' on \'paper.\'  That is keeping me busy. \nI\'m already busy and I\'m getting so many requests. \n[NEXT]'),
(12554, 'Oh... I see.\nI will leave the letter with you.  It should take some time, right?\n[NEXT]'),
(12555, 'Oh no... Hold on!\nI almost lost my mind.\nI need more materials to make the chemical.  What should I do? \nHmm... Could you find some materials for me if you have time? \nI just need White Powder of Lava Magmaton... 10 of them to be exact \n[BUTTON]=[I have the time to do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have any time.][2]'),
(12556, '(Panting) Enchanter Master Wishis!\nHere you are.  Phew... It certainly was a long way. \nShould I wait here?\n[NEXT]'),
(12557, 'Oh, yes.  It won\'t take long. \nThank you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12558, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12650, 'An Old Letter 4'),
(12651, 'You received the restored letter. \nReturn to Reno in Uruga.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12652, 'Here. \nEverything has been restored except the areas that are torn. \nYou should be able to make it out. \nYou can take it. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12653, 'Mr. Reno.  Um... Reno? Reno... \n[NEXT]'),
(12654, 'Hey, I know I look young, but I am the Manager of the Union. \nCall me Mr. Reno. \nOK?!\nYou got what I asked for?\n[NEXT]'),
(12655, 'Oh, OK.  Mr. Reno. \nHere\'s the letter.\n(Hmph, you certainly look younger than me... Show some respect...)\n[NEXT]'),
(12656, 'Hmm.  Well done.  Here\'s the reward.\nYou didn\'t read the letter, did you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12657, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12750, 'Kasandra\'s Depression'),
(12751, 'Kasandra looks very depressed. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12752, '...Huh?\nKasandra looks so blue... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12753, '...Um... Master Kasandra...? Are you OK?\nDo you feel sick?\n[NEXT]'),
(12754, '(Glimses and then turns her head away.)\nI\'m fine.\n[NEXT]'),
(12755, '(You don\'t look fine...)\nIf you are sick... \n[NEXT]'),
(12756, 'I\'m not sick.  Don\'t worry about me.  Go away... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12757, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12850, 'Don\'t Be Blue 1'),
(12851, 'Carol says that Kasandra has been acting weird for the past couple of days and asks you to find SP Potion(Tier 4) for her. \nBring SP Potion(Tier 4) to Carol.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12852, 'Phew... I\'m so worried... \nOh!  Adventurer!  Wait a second.  Could you do me a favor?!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12853, 'Huh? A favor?\nWhat is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(12854, 'Oh... Well, Kasandra seems so depressed and blue for the past couple of days.  I\'m so worried about her... \nPhew... She might sound and look like a bully, but she is actually a very warm and vulnerable person. \n{color,yellow, She saved us when we were in the dangers of death.}\nSo... I was thinking... If you could find SP Potion(Tier 4) for her, she might feel better. \n[BUTTON]=[Sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have any.][2]'),
(12855, 'Here.  It\'s an everyday item, so it\'s easy to find. \n[NEXT]'),
(12856, 'Why, thank you. \nI hope Kasandra feels better... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12857, 'Phew... When she feels down, I feel down... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12950, 'Don\'t Be Blue 2'),
(12951, 'Kasandra still doesn\'t feel uplifted with Carol\'s SP Potions. \nAsk Grandma Myzen for her Special Mushroom Soup. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12952, 'Adventurer! Adventurer!\nSorry to bother you again... \nActually, the SP Potion did not work.\nWhat should I do?  Do you have {color,yellow, any ideas}?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12953, 'Hmm... If SP Potion didn\'t work... what about something different?\nSomething tasty... or flowers... \nOh, what about finding out why she is so depressed... \n[NEXT]'),
(12954, 'Food?!  Tasty food?\nThat\'s it!\nShe hasn\'t been eating much these days.  It could be because she doesn\'t like what I make for her. \nTasty food... Oh, {color,yellow, I hear that Elderine\'s Grandma Myzen makes very good Meat & Mushroom Soup.}\nCould you bring some for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Um, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think food will solve the problem.][2]'),
(12955, 'Grandma Myzen!\nI hear you make a good Mushroom soup!  Could you please make some Meat & Mushroom Soup for me.\n[NEXT]'),
(12956, 'Huh?  Soup?\nWhy should I?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12957, '... I feel so depressed, too... I don\'t have any appetite.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13050, 'Don\'t Be Blue 3'),
(13051, 'To make Meat & Mushroom Soup that Carol asked for, you need several different kinds of mushrooms. \nFind some mushrooms for Grandma Myzen.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13052, 'Meat & Mushroom Soup doesn\'t come right away... \nI need the ingredients... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13053, 'Oh, I see... Then... I will bring some mushrooms. \nWhat kinds of mushrooms do you need?\n[NEXT]'),
(13054, 'Hmm. My special Meat & Mushroom Soup needs a lot of ingredients...  Can you find them all?\nI\'ll give you the list. \n{color,yellow, 10 Fragrant Mushrooms}, \n{color,yellow, 10 Chewy Meat} for the broth, \nand {color,yellow, 5 Rosemary and 5 Basil} for the flavor. \nDo you think you can find them all?\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s a lot, but I\'ll try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many!][2]'),
(13055, 'Phew... Here are all the ingredients.\nIt\'s definitely hard work to make some Meat & Mushroom Soup... \n[NEXT]'),
(13056, 'That\'s why it\'s \'special\'!\nSome people travel for a week to taste it! \nShall we begin?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13057, 'It\'s not easy to find mushrooms, is it?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13150, 'Don\'t Be Blue 4'),
(13151, 'You made the Meat & Mushroom Soup.  Bring it to Carol before it gets cold. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13152, 'There, it\'s all done.\nHere you go.  Have a safe trip!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13153, 'Carol!  Here\'s the Meat & Mushroom Soup.\nYou know how hard it was to find all the ingredients?\nI am sooooo exhausted. \n[NEXT]'),
(13154, 'Oh... I see.  I owe you one.\nI hope this helps Kasandra feel better... \nPhew, you think this will work?\n[NEXT]'),
(13155, '(You just don\'t care about me.)\nI hope so. \nBut you should ask her why she is depressed first... \n[NEXT]'),
(13156, 'Thank you so much!\n(She is not listening to me!)\nI will take this to Kasandra before it gets cold.  Be safe on your way back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13157, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13250, 'Even so... 1'),
(13251, 'Take a peek at Kasandra.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13252, 'Does Kasandra feel better yet?\nOh, there she is.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13253, '(Kasandra is murmuring.)\n... \n... Adrian... \n[NEXT]'),
(13254, '(... Adrian?  That\'s weird.  She told me not to even mention Adrian in front of her. \nShe says she hates her... Right!  Carol said they were good friends in the past.) \n[NEXT]'),
(13255, '{color,yellow,(Kasandra sheds a tear!!)}\n[NEXT]'),
(13256, 'Huh...!\nTear?!\nWhat in the world has happened between them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13257, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15250, 'Even so... 2'),
(15251, 'You saw Kasandra shedding tears, calling Chief Adrian.\nGo to Chief Adrian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15252, 'Hmm, something must have happened between them. \nI should talk to Chief Adrian!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15253, 'Um... Chief?  Are you busy?\nCan I talk to you for a second... \n[NEXT]'),
(15254, 'Oh, [NAME]?\nI should definitely have time to talk to you.\nWhat is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(15255, 'Well... \n(You told the story about the old letter and Kasandra\'s tear.)\n... \n... That\'s why I am here.\nI thought you might know the reason... \nI know it\'s not my business, but I think the letter I brought was the cause. \n[NEXT]'),
(15256, '... Hmm... I see.\n[NAME]... You must have been worried. \nDon\'t worry.  I will tell you the story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15257, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13450, 'Even so... 3'),
(13451, 'You saw Kasandra shedding tears, calling Chief Adrienne.\nListen to Chief Adrian\'s story.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13452, 'It was a long time ago. \nWe were very young, me and Kasandra. \nWe were best friends. \nI was first introduced to magic... by her father who was magician. \nHe was {color,yellow, a teacher for me and Kasandra}.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13453, 'We began to learn magic at the same time... but I was probably a faster learner than her.  I don\'t quite remember... \nWhen I was able to perform Magic Ball, Kasandra barely performed Magic Missiles.\nI... was not considerate of her feelings. \n{color,yellow, I was so hooked on learning the magic every day and became her father\'s favorite student.}\n[NEXT]'),
(13454, 'Her father?  Oh... Kasandra\'s father... \n[NEXT]'),
(13455, 'Yes. My immature behaviors must have hurt her so much... \nI feel so ashamed.  \nBut... at that time, all I could think of was the magic.  Several years have passed... \nBut{color,yellow, I didn\'t realize that our friendship was not like how it was before.}\nOne day... \nShe disappeared.\nShe {color,yellow, left a letter for her family and me and then left.}\nFor me... she wrote {color,yellow, "Our friendship is over"}... \nThen, she left the town... for good... \n(Adrian bursts into tears.)\n[NEXT]'),
(13456, '...Chief... \n(I should just leave and let her cry for now.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13457, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13550, 'Even so... 4'),
(13551, 'You saw Kasandra shedding tears, calling Chief Adrian.\nListen to Chief Adrian\'s story.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13552, '(Sniffles)\nI am sorry.\n...Anyways... She has returned to town not that long ago.  \nI recognized her and wanted to welcome her, but she... acted like she didn\'t know me. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13553, 'I see... That\'s why she told me not to even mention your name.... \n[NEXT]'),
(13554, 'Yes.  I know.\nShe talks ill of me in front of my face.  I deserve that. \nIt\'s just that... a while ago ... I heard that she stopped by Elderine for a few days. \nI wrote her a letter.  I wrote about how ashamed I am of myself and how sorry I am... I wanted to tell her how I feel. \nBut {color,yellow, the letter... was returned to me.  It was not even opened.}\n[NEXT]'),
(13555, 'Then, that letter...?\n[NEXT]'),
(13556, 'That\'s probably it.\nThat letter contains only the truth... \nI just crumpled it and threw it in the river... It has flown into her hands after all this time.\n... Now... \n... I guess it\'s better that it has reached her. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13557, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13650, 'Even so... 5'),
(13651, 'Kasandra seems to have found out that you talked to Adrian about her.\nListen to her story.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13652, 'Hey! Over there!  You!\nCome here.  Hurry.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13653, 'Yes? Oh... Master Kasandra. \n(She seems brighter today.)\n[NEXT]'),
(13654, 'Hmm. You talked to... Adrian about me, right?\nTell me the truth.  Don\'t think about lying to me.\n[NEXT]'),
(13655, '(How did she know?)\nUm... Er... That\'s... Well... \n(Whatever!)\n...Yes, I did.\n[NEXT]'),
(13656, 'I knew it.\nHmm. Keep this in mind.  It\'s not {color,yellow, an excuse}, OK?\nGo ahead and tell her. \nI don\'t {color,yellow, blame} her or anything like she thinks.  \nI went on a trip just for myself.\n{color,yellow, I was not, never, angry, sad, or intimidated by losing my dad to her.  OK?}\nAnd the letter... \n(Hesitates)\nOK.  That\'s how I felt back them.  I didn\'t want to see her.\nThat\'s why I returned it.  I read it this time... \nBecause my feelings have changed now.  That\'s why.\n[NEXT]'),
(13657, 'Oh... I see.\nI am relieved.  You shouldn\'t blame someone for too long... \n[NEXT]'),
(13658, 'Hey, wait a second.  I told you I don\'t.\nBut remember!\nI know she is good with magic, but I realized that I am talented in {color,yellow, magical fencing}!  I just learned that too late. \nGot it?\nAnd because I read the letter... {color,yellow, It does not mean that I want to be friends with her}... or catch up... {color,yellow, Never!}\nIf I feel all better... no, weaker, {color,yellow, then what I have lived up to becomes nothing.}\nSo, I\'ll just be like this. That doesn\'t make her any better of a person to me!!\nRemember that!  Remember!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13659, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15350, 'The Hunters\' Union: Kasandra\'s Test 1'),
(15351, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she will test you to see if you are good for a job. \nYou must find a Tattered Rabbit Doll from a Giant Sparkdog.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15352, 'Hey, adventurer!  You... signed up, right?\nLet\'s see... Your name is... [NAME]?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15353, 'Yes, I am.  Can I get a job now?\n[NEXT]'),
(15354, 'No... Not a job, but I want to test you.\nI must know where you are to give you the right job.\nFirst... I left Tattered Rabbit Doll in the Concealed Prison yesterday... Go there and bring it.\nI am not asking you to do it for free.  Get going!\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope.][2]'),
(15355, 'Kasandra.  Here...  Is this the right Tattered Rabbit Doll? \nIt\'s all filthy, probably because the giant Sparkdog had swallowed it, but I brought it anyway... \n[NEXT]'),
(15356, 'Wow!  You found it.\nHmm... Well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15357, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13850, 'The Burning Stone 2'),
(13851, 'The Sand Hill camp is still stuggling for warmth. \nFind some extra Burning Stones from the Giant Magmaton for Silver Allon.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13852, 'You\'ve come a long way.  I should serve you a cup of tea... \nOops, I don\'t have any more tea... I\'m sorry.  I\'ve got nothing to serve you... \nI can\'t just give you this stale barley bread... Phew.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13853, 'Oh... I guess the supplies are still short here.\nIf I had known, I would have brought something... \nOh, and... What did you order those Burning Stones for?\n[NEXT]'),
(13854, 'You see... The Camp gets really cold at night. \nAll I have is this thin blanket to endure the night...  \nThen, someone told me that Giant Magmaton\'s rocks stay warm for a really long time. \nSo, I saved up some money to get some. \nHa ha, do I sound miserable?\n[BUTTON]=[(Sobbing... ) I will find some more for you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, you do... ][2]'),
(13855, 'Oh... wow!  Thank you so much.\nI mean it... (tears gathering)\nOh, I can\'t let you go empty-handed.  Please take this. \nThis much would keep everyone at the Camp warm all night. \nDon\'t say no, then I\'ll be mad at you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13856, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13950, 'Crystal Guardian\'s Eye 1'),
(13951, 'Silver Allon calls you and tells you to go to Julian.\nGo to Julian, a member of the Henneath Union Envoys.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13952, 'Oh, I almost forgot.\nActually... I was talking to Julian the other day and your name came up.\nHe told me to call him the next time you stopped. \nIf you have time, would you give him a visit?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13953, 'Julian! Hi, long time no see.\nDid you miss me?\nI heard that you wanted to see me! \n[NEXT]'),
(13954, 'Oh...?\n[NAME]! It\'s been so long.\nYou look even braver.  I almost couldn\'t recognize you... \nThe reason for me looking for you, [NAME], is... because... I heard that you go to Burning Rock often these days.  So... I have a small favor to ask you... \nIt\'s not anything hard. \nWell... I thought about it on the anniversary of my mother\'s death... My mother... when she was alive, had a sparkling gemstone.  She later told me that... it\'s the eye of a Crystal Guardian... \nShe always kept it with her because it was so beautiful.  \n[NEXT]'),
(13955, 'Oh,  a Crystal Guardian\'s Eye...?\nWow, no one would have been able to go near the Burning Rock back then.  She had something really precious!\n[NEXT]'),
(13956, 'Yes.  It was a gift my father gift to her...  \nOne day... she lost it and she was very disappointed.  She passed away about a year after that... \nIt... just came to my mind. \nI thought you could find something just like that.  Could you, [NAME]? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13957, 'You didn\'t forget whom Julian is, did you?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14050, 'Crystal Guardian\'s Eye 2'),
(14051, 'Bring a Crystal Guardian\'s Eye to Julian.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14052, 'If I am asking too much, you can say no. \nI know that the Crystal Guardian is a very powerful monster. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14053, 'No, it\'s not!\nI can take it all by myself?\nSure!  I am stronger than you think!\n[NEXT]'),
(14054, 'Oh really?\nI knew you were the right person to ask.\nPlease get me the eye of a Crystal Guardian.\nI hear that it\'s quite rare... \n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry! Just count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s rare?  Maybe next time... ][2]'),
(14055, 'Julian!\nHere you are!  You were right.  It is rare...\nBut I got it.  I feel so good.\nI guess your mother would be happy, too.\n[NEXT]'),
(14056, 'Oh... \nYes.  This is it.  That bright sparkle... \nMy mother will be most definitely happy.\nI should get a vacation right away and visit her grave.\nThank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14057, 'Thank you.  I owe you big time... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14150, 'Anything that Sparkles! 1'),
(14151, 'Elderine\'s Mr. Kenton is disappointed that the Charity Event got cancelled.  \nBring Lava Gargoyle\'s Sparkling Horn to Mr. Kenton. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14152, 'Oh... My sparkling things... Oh~ I can\'t see that beautiful light... \nI was so excited... Oh~ God! Oh~ My treasure!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14153, '...Mr. Kenton. What are you doing?  All by yourself?\nWho are you talking to?\n[NEXT]'),
(14154, 'Hmm?! It feels like I am seeing a bright light in my dark heart. \nYour beautiful voice.  You are my savior!\n[NAME]!!! I\'m so sad.  I feel like crying. \nThe charity event got cancelled... and I can\'t buy those sparkling things. \nCan you... find some for me, honey bunch?\nI want, want, want... {color,yellow, Lava Gargoyle\'s Sparkling Horn}. \n(Twists his body.)\n[BUTTON]=[Huh, I will find one if you don\'t come any nearer!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Arrr! Stop!][2]'),
(14155, 'Here. Lave Gargoyle\'s Sparkling Horn that you longed for. \nAre you satisfied?\n[NEXT]'),
(14156, 'Huh? Wow! [NAME], you are mean!  So insensitive!\nYou brought just one?  Huh? Just one!!\nI expected at least ten!  You let me down!  I hate you! Hmph!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14157, '... Bye~ Bye~\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14250, 'Anything that Sparkles! 2'),
(14251, 'Mr. Kenton demands more sparkling things.\nYou must find 1 Crystal Guardian\'s Sword.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14252, 'Oh, look... \n[NAME]... \nYou are bad! bad! bad! Villain!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14253, 'What?!  Why am I a villain?  I didn\'t do anything wrong!\n[NEXT]'),
(14254, 'Hmph!  I heard a rumor!\nI heard that you found that precious Crystal Sword for a lady named Kassandra in Uruga, right? \nHmph!  You are bad! Hmph! I am so mad!\nHow could you do that to me!  Huh?!  I mean much more to you than that woman, don\'t I? \n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK! I\'ll get you one, too!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hey... Mr., Please don\'t do that to me.][2]'),
(14255, 'Here.  Here you go.\nI\'m exhausted... What a hassle... \n(I can never get used to this man...)\n[NEXT]'),
(14256, 'Wow!  How beautiful!  This glamour is indescribable!\nCome here, [NAME]! I\'ll give you a kiss!\n\n(Arrrr!!! Help!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14257, 'Hmph, you are bad... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14350, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 1'),
(14351, 'Mr. Hans, the Blacksmith of Uruga, is intereated in the weapons created by Cursed Knights.\nYou must find Cursed Knights\'s Axe.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14352, 'Hey, it\'s hard to find you these days. \nDid you just learn the skill to hide yourself?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14353, 'Haha, hide myself?\nI know some people that have that skill... \nWhat did you need me for?\n[NEXT]'),
(14354, 'Ah... I heard about a monster called Cursed Knights... They\'re a skillful monster that makes its own weapon. \nNot only that, its weapon is really something... I was wondering if you could find one for me.  \nI wanted to study it. Ha ha ha!\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.  I was going there anyway... ][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope.  I don\'t want to go there.][2]'),
(14355, 'Here!  It\'s pretty heavy? \nThe weapon is blunt... The monsters were really strong.  It was a tough fight. \n[NEXT]'),
(14356, 'Hmm. Good. Let\'s see... \nI\'ll have to melt this down. \nOops, almost forgot to thank you.  Thank you.  Ha ha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14357, 'I heard it\'s really strong... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14450, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 2'),
(14451, 'Mr. Hans, the Blacksmith of Uruga, discovered something bizarre while studying the Cursed Knights\'s weapon. \nYou must find Cursed Knights\'s Armor. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14452, 'Hey~ [NAME]! Here. Come here at once.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14453, 'Yes?\nMr. Hans? How are you doing with the research?  You look tired... \nSomething wrong? \n[NEXT]'),
(14454, 'Argh... You know, I discovered some of the materials use to make the weapon... like copper, iron, silver... Things like that. \nBut there was also things I have never seen before.  I was unable to find the secret of its power. \nSo... I was thinking if you could find its armor... \n[BUTTON]=[Sure. I\'ll get you one.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too busy today.][2]'),
(14455, 'Phew... It sure is heavy.  Here you go. Not only does it look really heavy... It also looks pretty durable... The monsters still fight well in it reguardless of its weight.\n[NEXT]'),
(14456, 'Wow... \nThe color of it is very similar to that of the sword?  Did they make this armor, too?\nOh, thank you.  I should melt it down at once. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14457, '... Phew.  It\'s too complicated for me... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14550, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 3'),
(14551, 'Mr. Hans discovered a very hot metal while analyzing the Cursed Knights\'s weaponry. \nYou must find a Piece of Lava Magmaton\'s Body.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14552, 'Hey, hey! [NAME]!\nI discovered something stunning. \nHa... It\'s definitely a remarkable achievement for me!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14553, 'Huh? Oh... What is it? Are you still studying that weapon? Wow, you are really into it. [NEXT]'),
(14554, 'Ha ha... Right. So, what I found was a very hot metal.  Much hotter than other metals. \nIsn\'t that strange?  \nI once saw that kind of metal a long time ago.  \nIt\'s Magmaton!  A piece of Lava Magmaton.\nBut I don\'t have it... Ahem. \nI want to check out something.  Could you get one for me?\nIt\'s a part of my research.  It will benefit you, too.  OK?\n[BUTTON]=[OK... Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... I don\'t want to anymore...][2]'),
(14555, 'Here.  Here\'s a piece of a Lava Magmaton.  It\'s still warm.\nIt\'s certainly different from Magmaton. \n[NEXT]'),
(14556, 'Ha... Right? I was right! \nHa ha! Don\'t you think I\'m smart? It feels refreshing to use my brain instead of my body. \nI have no time to waste!  Thanks!  I should get back to my research.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14557, 'Ha, I think this makes me look attractive.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14650, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 4'),
(14651, 'Mr. Hans succeeded in extracting Magmaton from the Cursed Knights\'s weapon and armor. \nYou must bring that to Elderine\'s Karl. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14652, 'I got it! I got it at last!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14653, 'Eh? Mr. Hans? Huh?! What\'s that white gown? You look like a doctor... Ha ha ha... \n[NEXT]'),
(14654, 'How do I look?  Nice, eh?  Don\'t I look like a researcher?\nAnyhow, look at this.  I studied the weapon, armor, and the hot metal that you brought. Ahem.\nThe hot metal was the same as the piece of Lava Magmaton. \nBut... that\'s not the strange part.  This unidentified material... I succeeded in extracting it. \nBut the problem is that I can\'t figure out what it is.  Ha ha ha!! \nSo, take this to Master Karl.  I think he could find out something.\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to... ][2]'),
(14655, 'Mr. Karl, hello.  It\'s been a while. \n[NEXT]'),
(14656, 'Oh, aren\'t you [NAME]?\nIt certainly has. Oh, is that what Hans made you come here for?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14657, '... What are you doing? Go to Elderine now. \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14750, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 5'),
(14751, 'Listen to Mr. Karl about the results.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14752, 'Wow... This is bizarre... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14753, 'What is?  That material?\n[NEXT]'),
(14754, 'Yes... It\'s... \nIt\'s really strange...\nHow could it...?\n[NEXT]'),
(14755, 'Why? Why do you sound so serious... \n[NEXT]'),
(14756, 'Hmm, it\'s... \nIt\'s the monsters\' blood!!\nI\'ve never heard of Cursed Knights making weapons out of monsters\' blood... \nI don\'t know what happened... Hmm, it gives me a headache. \nDeliver the results to Hans. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14757, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14850, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 6'),
(14851, 'Mr. Karls, the master of Hans, found out the secret of the unidentified material.  Deliver the results to Hans. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14852, 'Here.  This has all the results on it. \nIt\'s the list of all the monsters.  Honeying, Guardian, Red Nix... So many different kinds of blood.\nGo back to Hans.  That guy... would probably need to squeeze out his brain for this one.  Ha ha!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14853, 'Mr. Hans!  I have the results.\nHere.  He wrote it down for you.\n[NEXT]'),
(14854, 'Oh... OK, let\'s see. \nHmm... Hmm... \nHmm... \nWhat are these?  Oh?  Oh... Monst?  Oh, monster?\nHmm... OK... Blood... So, it\'s blood... \n[NEXT]'),
(14855, '...Do you have a clue?\n[NEXT]'),
(14856, 'Hmm... Er? Yes... \nI... think... \nWell... \nI should research it a little more!  Ha ha ha!\nThanks.  I should go back to my research now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14857, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14950, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 7'),
(14951, 'Take Hans\' results to Skill Master Cyburn.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14952, 'Arr... You know, I tried to finish it, but I don\'t think I can.\nI talked to Cyburn... and he told me to bring what I don\'t know.\nI wanted to do it all by myself... but I can\'t even read well after all. \nOh, Snap! That\'s a secret... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(14953, 'Mr. Cyburn. Hans... says he can\'t finish this research. \nHe wants you to take it from here... \n[NEXT]'),
(14954, 'Hmm, is that so?\nI was surprised when he volunteered to do the research... \nBut I am proud that he has gotten this far. \nLet\'s have a look... \nOh, you can come back later.  I\'ll call you when I\'m done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(14955, 'Phew. It\'s embarrassing... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15070, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 8'),
(15071, 'Mr. Cyburn tells you about the results. \nTake the results back to Hans.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15072, 'Here are the results.  You must be curious, too.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15073, 'Of course!! I\'m so curious.  What on earth is the unidentified material of the Cursed Knights? \nI know that there is the blood of other monsters...  but there is something else... \n[NEXT]'),
(15074, 'Ha ha ha. Just wait. \nYou know why, because half of the research has been done by Hans. \nWell... I\'m not saying he did more than half of it. \nBut bring this back to Hans and discuss it with him.\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! Sir!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I played a big part, too.  I want to see it first!][2]'),
(15075, 'Mr. Hans!  I\'m back with the results!\nI haven\'t seen it yet, either.  Let\'s look at it together!\n[NEXT]'),
(15076, 'Wow!\nAt last!\nThe outcome of my research!!  Ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15077, 'Just take it back.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15170, 'Cursed Knights the Blacksmith 9'),
(15171, 'See the results with Hans.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15172, 'OK, let\'s see...\nHmm.\nOh, [NAME].  Let\'s read it together.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15173, '<Results>\nThe Analysis of Cursed Knights\'s Weapon and Armor\nCopper 20%\nIron 30%\nLead 10%\nSilver 5%\nMonsters\' Blood 5%\nAll other materials match the physical constituents of Cursed Knights.\n[NEXT]'),
(15174, 'Hey, [NAME].  What is that word on the last line... This here...  Phy... Phys...?\n[NEXT]'),
(15175, 'Physical.  Oh! Then... does that mean the weapon is Cursed Knights itself?\nMr. Hans!  Doesn\'t that mean the Cursed Knights mixes various metals, blood, and {color,yellow, it\'s own flesh} to make the weapon to integrate with its body?\nIt mixes itself with the weapon to be one with it!\n[NEXT]'),
(15176, 'Hmm... So the secret to its power is... then its oneness with the weapon!!!\n(Thunder crash!)\nThat\'s it!  That\'s it!\n{color,yellow, The oneness!  Becoming one with the weapon!}\nHa ha, [NAME]! Thank you! I must make a weapon right now! A weapon that is one with its owner!\nI can\'t be beaten by a mere monster!  Right?\n[NEXT]'),
(15177, '(It\'s been a while since I last saw him so motivated.)\nThat\'s good. \nWill you make me one?\nEr... Huh?\nMr.! Mr.? Where are you going? Mr.... Hans!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15178, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17470, 'The Hunters\' Union: Petals for the Ball'),
(17471, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she needs some petals for the Ball at Elderine.\nYou must find 50 Petals of Laplan.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17472, 'Hmph, a ball... that\'s just great.. \nHey! We have a job.\nYou want it?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17473, 'Oh, a job?  Of course!\nWhat is it?\n[NEXT]'),
(17474, 'There is a Ball at Elderine.\nThey need a lot of petals... I guess they are looking for the best offer.\nThey need 50 petals... \nWe should offer them {color,yellow, the Petals of Laplan}!!\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too big.][2]'),
(17475, 'Hmm... I\'ll do what you say, but wouldn\'t that be too big?\n[NEXT]'),
(17476, 'What? That\'s how petals should be!\nBesides, I\'m jealous. Ha ha ha!\n\nWhy?\nYou got a problem?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17477, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17570, 'The Hunters\' Union: Banquet Catering 1'),
(17571, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she needs some ingredients for the snail dish for the Ball at Elderine. \nYou must find 50 Slug Meat.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17572, 'A job.\nIt\'s the food this time!  Ha ha ha!!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17573, 'Why are you so happy?\nYou said you were jealous... \n[NEXT]'),
(17574, 'Huh? I didn\'t say I am happy?  I have nothing to do with it... \nHa ha ha!\nHmm.\nAnyways, they need some ingredients for the snail dish. \nGo out and {color,yellow, find 50 Slug Meat.  The ones that are really, really sticky.}\nThe more disgusting, the better.\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK... but that for a dish...?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yuck!  You, devil!  Are you trying to get people killed?][2]'),
(17575, 'I found some... \nBut is this edible?\nIt\'s too sticky and looks weird... \n[NEXT]'),
(17576, 'Enough!  I already tested it.  It won\'t kill you. \n(Whispers) I gave it to Reno and he liked it.  Ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17577, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17670, 'The Hunters\' Union: Banquet Catering 2'),
(17671, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she needs some ingredients for the food for the Ball at Elderine.\nYou must find 30 Slug\'s Meat and 60 Mad Slug\'s Meat.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17672, 'Ha ha ha!  Ha ha ha ha!!  Ha ha ha ha ha!!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17673, '(That\'s hideous...)\nWhat\'s so funny?  Huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(17674, 'What? Oh, it\'s so hilarious!  Ha ha ha!!\nYou remembet that meat?\nThat was the first to be sold out? So, they are asking for more!  Wow, they have a really bad taste.\nYou know what, they ordered another kind, too.\nSo, find {color,yellow, 30 Slug\'s Meat and 60 Mad Slug\'s Meat}.\nHa ha ha ha!!\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... But... (Flinch) OK... ][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too much.][2]'),
(17675, 'Here... I brought it all.\nBut it smells bad and this sticky mucus almost melted down my bag.\nIs it really OK to feed this to people?\n[NEXT]'),
(17676, 'Hey! You think I am a murderer?!\nJust two hours in this neutralizer will make it just as tasty as any other meat.  OK?\nYou will like it when you taste it.  Me?  I don\'t eat it, of course.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17677, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17770, 'Competitor 1'),
(17771, 'Cleo of the Swamp of Dawn is antagonistic to the Hunters\' Union that is new to Uruga.\nYou must talk to Cleo. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17772, 'Hello.\nDo you... happened to work for the Hunters\' Union?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17773, 'Oh! Yes, I do.\nThey give me work and they pay me pretty well... although it\'s almost same as what Maxuter pays me. \nBut I would take any job in this economy. \n[NEXT]'),
(17774, 'Oh... I see.\nIt\'s usually difficult for a union or merchant to settle in a town... \nAre you related to the Chief of Uruga?  Or to the Skill Master... \n[NEXT]'),
(17775, 'Hmm... Not exactly... \n(I should not say anything about Chief Adrine.)\nI think they are just staying here without permission... \n[NEXT]'),
(17776, 'Hmm... I hear that it is lead by a lady... The name was... Cassa... Cassan... dra? Kasandra, is it?\nHave you met her?  How is she?\n[NEXT]'),
(17777, 'Hmm, I guess... \nShe seemed {color,yellow, like a bully at first, but she is cool}.\nShe likes to play jokes on people... She seems mean sometimes... but she is not a bad person...\nShe has done some nice things as well.\n[NEXT]'),
(17778, 'Hmm... I see. I can trust you, [NAME]... \nSo, she is not a bad person?\nOK. I will deliver this message to Maxuter.\nSince they are our competitor... we must watch them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17759, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17870, 'Competitor 2'),
(17871, 'Cleo of the Swamp of Dawn is antagonistic to the Hunters\' Union that is new to Uruga.\nYou must deliver Maxuter\'s letter to Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17872, '[NAME]!\nI got a reply from Maxuter right away... and he says we should be friendly with them. \nThey must have some powerful connections strings to get settled in town... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17873, '(They are just shameless... )\nWell, about the connections... \n[NEXT]'),
(17874, 'Kasandra is known for her {color,yellow, money skills}.\nShe purchased a lot of Slug Shells that has started to gain value and is selling back it at a high price. \nShe was so fast that no one else could get a hand of it... \nPhew, we should definitely make friends with her and than confront her. \nCan you deliver this letter to her? I can always trust you, [NAME].\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. Consider it delivered.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I should stay out of it... ][2]'),
(17875, 'Hello, Kasandra.\nI have a letter for you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17876, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17970, 'Competitor 3'),
(17971, 'Deliver Maxuter\'s letter to Kasandra.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17972, 'Huh?  What are you doing here?  Did you come to see me?  \nThat\'s new. \nI don\'t have a job for you.  Come back later. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17973, 'It\'s not about a job. \nI brought a letter from Maxuter.\nHere it is.\n[NEXT]'),
(17974, 'Maxuter?  What\'s that?\nIs that a snack?  Ha ha ha!\nDon\'t look at me like that.  I really don\'t know.\nYou should bring that to Reno.\nMaxter, is it?  Hey, alright.  Maxuter?  OK, OK.\nI will give it to Reno. You can go now.\n[NEXT]'),
(17975, 'But Cleo told me to give it to you... \n[NEXT]'),
(17976, 'Cleo?  I don\'t know her. \nAnd... if they want friendship, they should send something nice, not a letter!\nSomething sparkling!  Or, a good weapon!\nThey don\'t have a clue. \n{color,yellow, It\'s polite to send MATERIAL!}\nOK?\nOK?\nGot it?! \n{color,yellow, I don\'t like money! Gold! Jewelry!!!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17977, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15450, 'The Hunters\' Union: Kasandra\'s Test 2'),
(15451, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she will test you to see if you are good for a job. \nYou must bring back the Old Lion Doll from a Spade Guard Trumpy.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15452, 'Actually, the last test was an easy one. \nI might have underestimated one... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15453, 'Hmm, it wasn\'t that easy... \nYou want to test me again?\n[NEXT]'),
(15454, 'Correct, smarty pants. \nThe second test is finding my Old Lion Doll.  You know of the Spade Guard Trumpy?\nWell I threw it in their cage.  Find it. \n[BUTTON]=[I will. You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I\'m not in the mood.][2]'),
(15455, 'Hyah!  Here you go!\nThis is it, right?\n[NEXT]'),
(15456, 'Hmm... Well done.\nI guess this was another easy one. \nGood job, anyways.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15457, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15550, 'The Hunters\' Union: Kasandra\'s Test 3'),
(15551, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says that she will test you to see if you are good for a job. \nYou must bring back the Slime Doll from the Navar Hunters. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15552, 'I should give you a more difficult task.  Ahem.\nI won\'t show mercy!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15553, 'Oh... OK... When were you, anyway?\nWhat\'s the next test?\n[NEXT]'),
(15554, 'This one\'s for a Slime Doll! \nIt\'s entitled to be more difficult. \nIf you don\'t get it, no reward for you.  \n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry. I won\'t fail.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you kidding me?][2]'),
(15555, 'Ta-dah!  Slime Doll!  It\'s the one you asked for, right?\n[NEXT]'),
(15556, 'Huh? Huh?\nYou really got it. \nHmm... Well, OK. But... But you have one last step!\nYou have to win this one to pass, OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15557, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15650, 'The Hunters\' Union: Kasandra\'s Test 4'),
(15651, 'Kasandra says she will be giving you the last test.\nThis time, you must bring back Tattered Rabbit Doll, Old Lion Doll, and a Slime Doll from Naiad Demons, Greedy Lizzardmen, and Legendary Trees. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15652, 'This is the last test!  Ha ha ha ha!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15653, '(She seems to be enjoying something...  She is bizarre.)\nOK, OK... \n[NEXT]'),
(15654, 'The dolls you have brought back so far... I scattered them amongst Naiad Demons, Greedy Lizzardmen, and Legendary Trees!\nCould you get those back?  Ha ha ha!\nGo ahead if you can!\n[BUTTON]=[I will definitely get them!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I quit, it\'s not worth it.][2]'),
(15655, 'Here! The rabbit! The lion! And the slime! \nI got them all!\nWhat do you say, huh? You should keep your promise.\n[NEXT]'),
(15656, 'Er... \nErr... \nHmph!!  You got it all.\nDid I pick the wrong places?  You didn\'t find them on the street, did you?\nHey! Don\'t look at me like that.  OK. Don\'t make that scary face. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15657, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15750, 'The Hunters\' Union?'),
(15751, 'Uruga\'s Poring is curious about the Hunters\' Union.\nTell Poring about the Hunters\' Union.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15752, 'Did you hear that?  A strange group has appeared outside Uruga... \nThey say it\'s a young elf and two young humans.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15753, 'Oh, I know them.\nMaster Kasandra, Carol and Reno. \nI even worked for them.\n[NEXT]'),
(15754, 'You work for them?\nOh... So, they hire you. \nWell, it makes things easy for us to have them around... \nBut the problem is financial things since they have to make profits. \nOK. \nI have something to discuss at the Village Meeting. \nThank you for telling me. \nCassan... Kasandra? Did you say Kasandra?\n[NEXT]'),
(15755, 'Yes, you\'re right. Master Kasandra...\nI really don\'t get her yet.  All that I know is that she likes to test people and talks like a bully. \n[NEXT]'),
(15756, 'Hmm. I see.\nThank you for the information.\nI might have a favor to ask you... I will call you when I do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15757, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15850, 'Curly\'s Sad Love 1'),
(15851, 'Curly of Uruga can\'t forget the short-haired cute girl that he once saw near the village. \nYou must find the girl at the Hunters\' Union.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15852, 'Oh... \nThe cold eyes, the lovely face... Ahh... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15853, 'Curly? What are you doing? Are you praying?\n[NEXT]'),
(15854, 'I\'m not praying... \nAhh... I saw a really pretty girl.  She looked smart and cold-hearted... She is so my type. \nI just saw her once... But I can\'t forget her... \nShe seemed to be with a tall elf lady that I don\'t know... Do you happened to know who she is?\nIf you do... please give her my letter! Please!\n[BUTTON]=[Carol...? OK. I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Who is it?][2]'),
(15855, 'Carol! I brought a letter for you. It\'s from Curly of Uruga... \nHmm. It might be something about asking you out for a date, so you\'d better be prepared. \n[NEXT]'),
(15856, 'A letter...? Curly?\nThat\'s weird, adventurer. I have never been to Uruga...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15857, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15950, 'Curly\'s Sad Love 2'),
(15951, 'There must have been a mistake. Return the letter to Curly. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15952, 'I read the letter, but I don\'t think it\'s for me. \nI never went to the village, but the letter says, \'When I first saw you at the village...\'.\nI think you should return this letter to him... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(15953, 'Huh? That\'s strange. I thought it was you... Then who is it?\nI should return the letter to Curly then.\n[NEXT]'),
(15954, 'Here. I opened it... Tell him sorry that I did.\n[BUTTON]=[I think it\'s fine (Let\'s return it to Curly!)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ahh, what should I do? I might kill me!][2]'),
(15955, 'Curly! Curly... Huh?!\nWhat are you doing...?\n[NEXT]'),
(15956, 'Oh! This? I am making a present for my mystery girl.  \nLook.  Isn\'t it nice? I carved a wooden doll that looks like her.\nHa ha... Do you think she will like it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(15957, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16070, 'Curly\'s Sad Love 3'),
(16071, 'Curly\'s wooden doll looks strange. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16072, 'Huh...? This face is definitely Carol... \nBut the hair... is short... Oh, no!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16073, 'Huh? Why? Do you like it?\nDoesn\'t it look just like her? Did you give her my letter? What did she say? Huh?\n[NEXT]'),
(16074, 'Er... You... know... \nIt\'s... not... a girl... \n(It\'s not Carol, it\'s Reno!)\nEr... This person... is not a girl..., but... a boy... \nHis name is Reno.\n[NEXT]'),
(16075, '... \n... \n......!!!\nWhat?! He\'s not a girl? A boy?\nYuck?! My dream girl is a boy?!\n... \nI... want to be alone... Could you leave?\n[NEXT]'),
(16076, '...Cheer up, Curly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16077, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16170, 'Let\'s Go!'),
(16171, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union says she will not test you anymore. \nYou must gather the Stone Heart of the Ancient Stonie. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16172, 'Hey, adventurer.\nNow that my tests are finished... I will give you a real job.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16173, 'Oh, OK... \nIf it\'s a real job, will you pay me more?\n[NEXT]'),
(16174, 'That... That depends on the job!  If you have a problem, you can just quit.\nHere\'s the job description.\nHave you heard of the Ancient Stonie?  It looks like a bunch of rocks.  I will not tell you where they are. \nFind the Hearts that contain its energy.  Find about five of them. \n[BUTTON]=[OK.  You can count of me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I do it later?][2]'),
(16175, 'Here are the Stone Hearts!\nIt\'s big and heavy. \nLooks like ordinary stone... \n[NEXT]'),
(16176, 'Ho~ You are quite fast?  Ha ha. It has more energy than it looks.\nI think you are useful... I will give you another job next time. \nWell done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16177, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16270, 'Bad Guys 1'),
(16271, 'Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union give you a job.\nYou must defeat 20 Lizard Knights.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16272, 'This request is from the herb collectors of the Sleeping Forest.\nThere are so many Lizard Knights that they can\'t collect herbs anymore.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16273, 'Hmm... So they want me to collect herbs for them?\n[NEXT]'),
(16274, 'Are you stupid?\nYour job is to defeat Lizardmen!  Defeat Lizard Knights!\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not stupid!][2]'),
(16275, 'I defeated Lizard Knights!\n[NEXT]'),
(16276, 'Hmph, don\'t sound so confident.\nTake your reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16277, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16370, 'Bad Guys 2'),
(16371, 'It seems that Lizard Knights are getting even more violent.\nYou must retrieve 20 Herbs from them and defeat 20 Lizard Knights.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16372, 'Remember the ones that you defeated last time?\nThey took away the herbs of herb collectors and beat them up to a pulp. \nThere are so many casualties.  You should have done it correctly... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16373, 'Wait a minute!  You told me to defeat only 20 of them!\n[NEXT]'),
(16374, 'Huh? I said so?\nI thought I said 200.  Hmm.\nAnyways... This time, get those Herbs back and defeat more of them!\n[BUTTON]=[OK. Remember what you ordered this time!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t try to make it my mistake.][2]'),
(16375, 'I did it right this time. Here are the Herbs, too!\n[NEXT]'),
(16376, 'Ah, OK. That\'s all. \nGood job. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16377, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16470, 'Kasandra, Kasandra! 1'),
(16471, 'Carol of the Hunters\' Union says that she is making a cape for Kasandra.\nYou must find 10 Skin of the Miner Moles.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16472, 'Oh... Hello, adventurer.\nI... have a personal favor to ask you.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16473, 'Oh, you have a job for me?\nWhat is it? Hmm... I wonder what it is.\n[NEXT]'),
(16474, 'Yes... Kasandra\'s birthday is coming up... \nI want to give her a cape and boots that I have made. \nPlease get me 10 Skin of the Miner Moles... Please.\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I do it later?][2]'),
(16475, 'Carol! Here\'s the Skin!\nIs this enough? It might not be enough to make a cape... \n[NEXT]'),
(16476, 'Oh... Kasandra likes her capes short.\nOh, I would have to make books as well.  I will call you again soon. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16477, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16870, 'Kasandra, Kasandra! 2'),
(16871, 'Carol of the Hunters\' Union is making boots for Kasandra.\nYou must find 20 Skin of the Miner Moles.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16872, 'Err, adventurer? I have another favor... \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16873, 'Ah, are you done with the cape?\nIs this about the boots?\n[NEXT]'),
(16874, 'Yes... You\'re right.\nI think a matching pair of boots would be nice with the cape... \nPlease help me.  I need more skin for the boots.  I want to make it double-layered. \nPlease find 20 Skin of the Miner Moles... Please.\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No!][2]'),
(16875, 'Here\'s 20 Skins!\nDoes this seem enough? The boots will be really durable with two layers of skin... \n[NEXT]'),
(16876, 'Yes... \nI want it double-layered and... I also want to attach a good amount of "bows".\nI added bows to the cape, so I want bows for the boots as well.\nDon\'t you think it will be pretty? I hope Kasandra likes it... \nWhat\'s wrong? What\'s that face... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16877, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16970, 'Simply A Lot!'),
(16971, 'Reno of the Hunters\' Union thinks that he is obliged to get a present for Kasandra on her birthday.\nYou must gather 30 SP Potions(Tier 4).\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16972, 'Ah... I don\'t know... Phew, what should I get her?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(16973, 'Get what to whom?\nOh... A birthday present for Kasandra?\n[NEXT]'),
(16974, 'Argh... Right.\nI don\'t know why I have to give presents on birthdays... \nI know what Kasandra likes the most... And the more is better. \nCould you find 30  SP Potions(Tier 4) for me?\nI will reward you.\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I?][2]'),
(16975, 'Here. The SP Potions you asked for... \n[NEXT]'),
(16976, 'Well done.  You can go now. \nOh... \nI think it\'s better to tell her that I got this myself, so keep your mouth shut.  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(16977, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17070, 'A Big Birthday Party 1'),
(17071, 'You have a job from Kasandra of the Hunters\' Union.\nYou must bring fake jewels from the Miner for the birthday party.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17072, 'A job!\nYou want it?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17073, 'Oh, yes... \n(She sounds so cool...)\nOf course.\n[NEXT]'),
(17074, 'You know the Miner of Burning Rock?\nThat monster that throws fake jewels at you.\nGather some of its fake jewel.  Someone wants it for a birthday party in Roumen.\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired today.][2]'),
(17075, 'Here. But... Whose birthday is it?  I want to say happy birthday... \n[NEXT]'),
(17076, 'Huh? Why do you want to say happy birthday?\nAhh... You grew up on Roumen.\nIt\'s a lady named Raina.  If you want to visit her, can you deliver this, too?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17077, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17170, 'A Big Birthday Party 2'),
(17171, 'You must deliver fake jewels from Miner to Roumen\'s Storage Keeper Raina.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17172, 'Here.  Take it to her.\nDon\'t lose it, OK?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17173, 'Raina~\nI\'m here.  It\'s been a long time.\nThis is what you asked from the Hunters\' Union.  I brought it for you. \nWhose birthday is it? I want to say happy birthday!\n[NEXT]'),
(17174, 'Oh?\nReally?\nIt\'s Julia\'s birthday in a few days. We usally have family parties every year, but we want to have a big party this year. \nWe want to create sparkling decorationg with light bulbs on flowers and jewelry.\n[NEXT]'),
(17175, 'Oh, I see. I want to give something to Julia, too... \nIs there something she needs?  Or, can I just help...? \n[NEXT]'),
(17176, 'Hmm... We don\'t need anything for now... \nBut we will when it\'s closer to the big day.\nI will call you then.  How does that sound?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17177, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17270, 'A Big Birthday Party 3'),
(17271, 'Raina says that she needs something for Julia\'s birthday.\nRaina asks you to find High Quality Slime Jelly, Chewy Meat, and Fragrant Mushrooms for the party. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17272, '[NAME]!\nWe are almost ready for the birthday party.  Tomorrow is the big day! Ha ha!\nWe have done a good job for the past few days.  It\'s really pretty and colorful. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17273, 'Wow, really?\nI want to see it... Oh! Is there anything I can help you with?\nI want to do something for Julia.\n[NEXT]'),
(17274, 'Of course, there is.\nPlease find some food for the party.\nWe need 30 Chewy Meat, 30 High Quality Slime Jelly, and 20 Fragrant Mushrooms!\nI think that\'ll be enough.  Is it OK?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure! You can count on me!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hey, who eats so much?][2]'),
(17275, 'Here\'s everything!\nIt\'s a good amount of stuff.  Are you inviting all of the merchants in Roumen?\n[NEXT]'),
(17276, 'What? No.\nJust the ladies of Roumen.\nHa ha! You don\'t know how much the women of Roumen can eat! \nBut don\'t tell anyone, OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17277, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17370, 'No Bribe?'),
(17371, 'Mr. Kenton of Elderine says he wants to write a friendly letter to the Hunters\' Union.\nYou must deliver Mr. Kenton\'s letter to Reno. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17372, 'Honey~!\nHello?  Sweetie, [NAME]?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(17373, 'Yuck... Mr... Don\'t call me that.\nI am not sweet at all.  And could you step back a little bit?\n[NEXT]'),
(17374, 'Darling! Don\'t avoid my eyes!\nOops, I don\'t have time for this.\nYou know about the Hunters\' Union in Uruga, right?  You know everything! \nAnd you know I need many things, right? I need money and materials for my art... \nSo, what I want to say is... deliver this letter! To the leader of the Hunters\' Union!\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK... I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to...][2]'),
(17375, 'Hello, Reno. Err... Mr. Reno.\nI brought a friendly letter from Mr. Kenton, a merchant in Elderine.  He wants to make friends with the Hunters\' Union.\n[NEXT]'),
(17376, 'Huh? Oh... You, what was your name again?\nAnyways, give that to me.\nWe don\'t need a letter... He should just place an order.  Should I write him back?\nHey... what is this? No bribe.  Letters should come with gold or a gift. \nHmph, he doesn\'t have a clue.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(17377, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5570, 'Maxuter\'s Donation 2'),
(5571, 'Maxuter hands over an enormous donation, saying he has set a bad example for others. \nYou must return to Adrian with Maxuter\'s donation. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5572, 'Please deliver it safely. \nThe roads are not paved well, so you should use the Scroll function. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5573, 'Chief!\nChief Adrian!  (Panting) I got here as fast as I could because of the money... \nAnd this is why I am the best at what I do... Don\'t you thinks so, Chief?\n[NEXT]'),
(5574, 'Huh? [NAME]... Everyone on the Isya Continent knows that you are good, [NAME].  But... did you say money?\nWhat money... \n[NEXT]'),
(5575, 'Ta-dah!\nChief! You won\'t need to worry about the donation anymore.  Maxuter donated an enormous amount of money.\n[NEXT]'),
(5576, '... Really...?\nMaxuter?\n... Hmm... \n(Reads the letter)\n... \n... I see.  Everyone... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5577, '... \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13750, 'The Burning Stone 1'),
(13751, 'You need to collect the Burning Stones from the Giant Magmaton and bring them to Sand Hill.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13752, 'We have some work. Will you do it?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(13753, 'Yes, sir. Of course, I will do it. Have you ever seen me rejected a job?\n[NEXT]'),
(13754, 'Hum...right. You always say "Yes". The delegation of Sand Hill asked for this mission about collecting{color, yellow, 1 Giant Magmaton\'s Burning Stone}.\nObtain it and deliver it to Silver Allon in Sand Hill. Get it?\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I see.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I don\'t understand.][2]'),
(13755, 'Long time no see, Silver Allon! I haven\'t seen you for a long time. How have you been?\n[NEXT]'),
(13756, 'HaHa!! I have been kind of busy these days. Anyway, Didn\'t you ask this to the hunter alliance?\nThis is for you, here you are.\nI hope to come by here again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(13757, '...\n[BUTTON]=[CONTINUE][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2370, 'A Suspicious Kid by the Cave'),
(2371, 'A suspicious person is standing in front of the cave.  Approach and talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2372, '(She is looking into the cave.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2373, 'Hey~  What are you doing here?\nThis is no place for a kid. \nIt\'s a dangerous place.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2374, 'Oh,. hello.\nAre you an adventurer?\nI am {color,yellow, Polan}.\nI look young, but I have traveled across the Isya Continent for a long time. \nI just happened to come to this place. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2375, 'Nice to meet you. \nI am {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2376, 'Nice to meet you.\nI am traveling {color,yellow, in search of a Strange Bat}.\nThen, I heard that {color,yellow, Strange Bats live in Thorn Tree Cave}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2377, 'Bat... You are strange.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2378, 'I know.  But I can\'t help it. \nIt\'s... my destiny...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2379, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2350, 'Bat Hunter'),
(2351, 'Talk to Elf Boy Polan who collects bats. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2352, 'Phew...(sighs.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2353, 'What\'s wrong?  You don\'t look happy...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2354, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!\nDo you remember what I said? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2356, 'That you are looking for bats?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2357, 'Yes.  Actually, I met a {color,yellow, Strange Bat} long time ago.  It was a coincident.  I was having a very hard time and that bat transformed me into a young boy. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2358, 'It\'s been a long time... I am still wandering around to find that bat and someone told me that \n{color,yellow, Strange Bats live in Thorn Tree Cave}.  That bat might be the one that make me look like this...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2359, 'It\'s been a long time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2360, 'Bat Hunter'),
(2361, 'Capture 10 Dracula Bats for Elf Boy Polan who collects bats. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2362, 'If I keep capturing the bats in Thorny Tree Cave, then I might...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2363, 'I might find a clue where that bat is... {color,yellow,[NAME]}, please capture as many {color,yellow, Bats in Thorny Tree Cave} as you can. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!  I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'ve done enough.  Just give up!][2]'),
(2364, 'Phew!!  There you go.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2365, 'You are back.  Thank you.\nBut, {color,yellow,[NAME]}, I believe it\'s not in here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2366, 'I must get at least a clue. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2380, 'Gray Bats'),
(2381, 'Bat Hunter Polan is looking for you.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2382, 'Oh, it can\'t be...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2383, 'Polan, what is it?  What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2384, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, there was not just one kind of bat. \nI saw it.  There is another kind besides Dracula Bats...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2385, 'You went in there all by yourself again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2386, 'I didn\'t want to bother you, {color,yellow,[NAME]}...\nI used all of my courage to go in, but when I saw that bat, I had to hurry up to get out of that place. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2387, 'It was really... really beautiful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2390, 'Gray Bats'),
(2391, 'Capture 10 Fog Bats for Bat Hunter Polan who collects bats.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2392, 'I think I should capture a different types of bats.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2393, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, please find those gray bats that I saw and capture as many as you can.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just... give up.][2]'),
(2394, 'Is this enough for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2395, 'No, it\'s not. \nI need many more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2396, 'Remember... look for grayish bats.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2520, 'Easter Egg Hunt'),
(2521, 'Kid Woz in Elderine needs help with his Easter Egg Hunt! Collect 15 Blue Eggs and 15 Yellow Eggs for a reward.\n(Eggs can be found by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2522, 'Thank my luck stars you\'re here, [NAME]! You have to help me!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2523, 'Whoa, calm down! What\'s wrong, Kid Woz?\n[NEXT]'),
(2524, 'Guard Captain Shutian is asking everyone to participate in the Easter Egg Hunt this year, and I haven\'t even found one egg yet! I\'m just too small to fight all the monsters out there myself! Oh, please say you\'ll help!\n[NEXT]'),
(2525, 'Hm, I don\'t know. You didn\'t say there would be monsters involved...\n[NEXT]'),
(2526, 'Oh, I didn\'t? Don\'t worry about the monsters- you can handle those! They have all the eggs I need. Will you please collect 15 Yellow Eggs and 15 Blue Eggs for me? I would be very grateful! \n[NEXT]'),
(2527, 'It sounds simple enough. What\'s in this for me if I help you?\n[NEXT]'),
(2528, 'Well let\'s see... oh, I know! I\'ll give you one of my cute Mini Chicks! They just hatched and they\'re ready to go to a good home!\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a deal! Consider those eggs found.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, but not today!][2]'),
(2529, 'I\'m back, Kid Woz! Now you can turn in all those eggs to Shutian for the Easter Egg Hunt!\n[NEXT]'),
(2530, 'Thank you so much, [NAME]! Here is your Mini Chick! You\'ve definitely earned it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2531, 'Have your found all of the eggs yet? Oh no... what will Shutian say if I don\'t turn in anything?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2540, 'A Strange New Presence 1 (Event Quest)'),
(2541, 'Enchanter Master Wishis requests your help in collecting 30 Lunar Shards for her research!\n(Lunar Shards can be found by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2542, 'Greetings, young traveler! I don\'t suppose you\'ve seen any strange glowing shards around here lately, have you?\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2543, 'Shards that glow? I don\'t think I have. There\'s a question I don\'t hear very often! Why do you ask, Master Wishis?\n[NEXT]'),
(2544, 'If you must know, I\'m currently conducing research under the supervision of Lord Elbama. We\'re not quite sure what power these shards contain, but we think it has something to do with the moon.\n[NEXT]'),
(2545, 'The moon? Wow, that sounds pretty complicated!\n[NEXT]'),
(2546, 'Well, there\'s only one real problem. I\'ve determined that the shards are falling from the sky, yet for some reason they are difficult to find. I think the monsters in the land may be stealing these shards!\n[NEXT]'),
(2547, 'Oh no! Why would they do such a thing?\n[NEXT]'),
(2548, 'I don\'t know what their motives are, but I do know these shards are essential to my research! Please say you\'ll help me, [NAME]. I need you to slay monsters and collect 30 Lunar Shards at least!\n[NEXT]'),
(2549, 'I\'d love to help you Mater Wishis, but I have a lot of other things to do today! However, I might be willing to reconsider. What will you give me if I help you collect these shards?\n[NEXT]'),
(2550, 'Reward? Your priceless contribution to science and knowledge should be enough! Ah, but you drive a hard bargain. If you aid me with my research, I shall give you one of my beautiful Phoenix Tails! What do you say?\n[BUTTON]=[You have a deal! Let\'s find these shards and solve the mystery!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, but I really am busy!][2]'),
(2551, 'Those monsters did not want to give up the shards without a fight! I managed to collect all 30 of them, though.\n[NEXT]'),
(2552, 'Thank you, [NAME]! I can finally begin working on my research again. Take this reward, you have certainly earned it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2553, 'How is the collection process going? Well, I hope.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2560, 'A Strange New Presence 2 (Event Quest)'),
(2561, 'Enchanter Master Wishis requests your help in collecting 40 Lunar Shards for her research!\n(Lunar Shards can be found by defeating monsters)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2562, 'My research is finally coming along, but I think I still need more Lunar Shards. Would you mind collecting 40 more for me? I would greatly appreciate it.                                                      [BUTTON]=[More shards? No problem!][1]                                 [BUTTON]=[I just don\'t have the time, Master Wishis!][2]'),
(2563, 'Thank you, [NAME]! This is a big help to my research. Take this reward, you have certainly earned it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2564, 'How is the collection process going? Well, I hope.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24650, 'Lost Key to the Lighthouse'),
(24651, 'Roumen\'s Town Chief Roumenus thought that it is strange that he hasn\'t seen Raphael, the town\'s lighthouse keeper, for several days. \nOn his way to the lighthouse with the Key to look for Raphael, Roumenus was attacked by monsters... \nYou must find the key that Roumenus lost. (Epic Quest)\n(A Nest Slime in the Forest of Tides have taken it.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24652, 'Oh, [NAME]!\nCan you spare some time to help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24653, 'Oh, Chief Roumenus! Of course I will help. Just tell me what you need. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(24654, 'You know what... I haven\'t seen Raphael, the lighthouse keeper of Roumen, for several days now. \nHe always stopped by to say hi to me every evening...  but I haven\'t seen him for the past three days. I tried to visit the lighthouse myself, but I was attacked by monsters at the lighthouse entrance. \nSo, I lost the Key to the lighthouse. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(24655, 'I see... I hope he\'s fine.  Are you hurt?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24656, 'I sprained my ankle, but it\'s not serious... But, I can\'t go to the lighthouse because I lost the Key. \nCan you find the Key for me?\nI believe I was attacked by... {color,yellow, Nest Slime}.  It was near the western corner... \nYou should be able to locate the Key from them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.  I will find your Key.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hey, you can\'t find it.  Just let it go.][2]'),
(24657, 'Chief! Chief!! I found the Key!\nIt\'s covered in something sticky, but you can still use it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(24658, 'Oh, I\'m relieved! \nWait a second... I hurt my ankle.\nCan you help me find Raphael?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24659, '...... Phew, I am worried about Raphael... I hope he\'s safe... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24750, 'Raphael\'s Whereabouts'),
(24751, 'Roumenus asks you to find Raphael, the missing lighthouse keeper. \nLook for Raphael.  (Epic Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24752, 'Phew, thank you.  Please look for Raphael for me... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24753, 'Sure, I\'ll look for Raphael.  I can go into the lighthouse with this Key, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24754, 'Yes.  Roumen\'s lighthouse... is not ordinary.  You should see it for yourself... I don\'t know much about it, either.\nPlease be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry!  I\'ll find Raphael.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hey, I am scared.  I should level up first.][2]'),
(24755, 'Um, excuse me...  Are you OK?  You look severely injured, oh...! \nAre you Raphael?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24756, 'Yes... I am.  You are... an adventurer?\nHugh...! \nI hurt my leg... and I can\'t move... \nAre you... are you here to save me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24757, 'Please hurry.  I will pray for your safe return and Raphael\'s... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24850, 'Raphael\'s Illness'),
(24851, 'Raphael is injured and can\'t move, but he says that his chest pain hurts him more than the injury. \nFind Raphael\'s Bottle that Nest Caiman Junior took. (Epic Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24852, 'Hugh... Argh, my... my chest...!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24853, 'Oh! Didn\'t you hurt your leg?  Your chest hurts too?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24854, 'Hugh... I... I am hurt... but... I also have a chronic illness... \nHugh... I need... my medicine... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(24855, 'Hey, hold on!  Where is your medicine?  Is that all you need?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24856, '{color,yellow, Nest... Caiman Junior ... stole my medicine... }\nIt\'s a clear bottle... Please... bring my... medicine back to me... \nHugh, Hugh... please hurry... Hurry...!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Please hold on!  I will find it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hold on!  Can\'t you hold on?][2]'),
(24857, 'Raphael!  Is this it?!  I found a clear bottle.  Take it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24858, 'Oh... \n(Gulps)\nOh... \nOhh... \n(Suffers for a while)\nPhew... \nIt\'s better now.  I can\'t... thank you enough... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24859, '... Hugh... please... my... medicine... Hurry... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24950, 'Guilt 1'),
(24951, 'Talk to Healer Julia and bring a Splint and Bandage to the Raphael the Lighthouse Keeper.\n (Epic Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24952, 'How did you get injured?\nAnd what are these monsters!\nAny idea of what is going on?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(24953, 'Ha... yes... I didn\'t know until I saw it.\nBut, I knew the moment I saw that horrible Leviathan creature... That thing... must be a horrible monster released by an evil power to wipe out the Town. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(24954, 'I don\'t understand.  Can\'t you just tell me everything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24955, 'Oh, I\'m sorry.  I feel so lost...  I\'ll tell you everything.\nI am the lighthouse keeper of Roumen. {color,yellow, On my way home after work one day... I saw a strange traveler disappear into the lighthouse.} \nI will admit I was scared, but I followed him anyway.   I couldn\'t find him anywhere.  \n{color,yellow, The traveler returned the next couple of days and roamed around the lighthouse some more.}\nI told Chief Roumenus about it and he patrolled around the lighthouse. \nSuddenly...{color,yellow, the strange person stopped coming back.  I was relieved to see that and returned to the lighthouse... but there was something really strange.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24956, 'Something strange?!  What was it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24957, 'There was a small and narrow {color,yellow, door leading to the basement... }\n{color,yellow, that I had never seen before.}\n{color,yellow, I was scared, but I still opened the door.  I was amazed to find out that the key to the lighthouse also worked on that door.}\nThis key is {color,yellow, the lighthouse keeper\'s key that has been succeeded for generations}...  It could open the main entrance and the lighting chamber.\nI came down here... and {color,yellow, found these relics.}\n{color,yellow, This beautiful massive gemstone... Its light pointing toward the sky has been the source of light for Roumen\'s lighthouse.}\n{color,yellow, The light of the lighthouse} was actually {color,yellow, from this basement}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24958, 'Oh... I see...! But I thought the light has become weaker these days.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24959, 'You are absolutely right. {color,yellow, I discovered the strange traveler near the gemstone.}\n{color,yellow, He took out a small snake from his pocket.} \nThe snake slowly approached the gemstone.  I hid myself and watched...  Then, {color,yellow, I found that the snake became larger as it approached the gemstone.}\nAnd I was right. \n{color,yellow, The snake absorbed the light of the gemstone and began to enlarge in size.  I knew that something was wrong... }\nI attacked the snake, but the snake became {color,yellow, so big quickly... The traveler disappeared and I barely managed to escape with injury... }\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24960, 'I see... \nThat\'s what happened... \nI think you are lucky your injury is not that severe.  Don\'t worry!  I\'m here for you!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24961, 'Don\'t underestimate it.  Since the Leviathan has become gigantic, this place has been covered with a dark energy.  Then, monsters began to appear... \nYou should take it serious even though they look weak. \nHugh...!! {color,yellow, I can\'t move my leg.  I can\'t even move it a bit... Ah, I need a Splint and Bandage.}\nCan you get me {color,yellow, a Splint and Bandage from Roumen\'s Healer Julia}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I should help you with your leg first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Um... You want me to go back to the town again?][2]'),
(24962, 'Julia!! Hi.  Oh, I don\'t have any time to waste!\nRaphael has hurt his leg.  Can I get a Splint and Bandage?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(24963, 'Raphael?\nOh, really? Hold on a second.  I have it right here.\nHmm, where is it...?  Oh, I have so many things piled up... Just wait a second.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(24964, '...... You shouldn\'t underestimate them. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25050, 'Guilt 2'),
(25051, 'Julia was looking for a Splint and Bandage for Raphael, but she says she needs more materials to make a new one.  She tells you she needs Fine Firewood. \nFind 1 Fine Firewood for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25052, 'Oh, oops...!  What should I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25053, 'What is it, Julia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25054, 'I don\'t have a Splint and Bandage .  Oh, what should I do...\nI think I can fix something up with Fine Firewood...!\n{color,yellow, Can you go out there and find 1 Fine Firewood?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah!  I\'ll be as fast as wind!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can\'t you just find something else?][2]'),
(25055, 'Here!  I found it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25056, 'Oh! You are fast.\nJust wait a second.  I\'ll make a Splint and Bandage out of it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25057, '... Phew, this is not a good time to not have an extra Band... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25150, 'Guilt 3'),
(25151, 'Julia gave you a Splint and Bandage.\nReturn to Raphael to treat him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25152, 'Here\'s the Splint and Bandage.\nI hope Raphael is fine... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25153, 'Oh... Ohhh... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25154, 'Raphael!!  I brought a Splint and Bandage.\nI can help you get it on...  Can you turn your body this way?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25155, 'Hugh... Oh, thank... you.\nHugh... Hugh... \nPhew... \nI think I can move now. \nPhew... This is all my fault.  I should have known that something was wrong... Then, I could have been able to stop that monster... \nIt\'s all ... my fault.\nThe only way to fix this... is to kill that monster... \nIf someone in the town is hurt or killed... then... Hugh... \nI... I will never be able to forgive myself...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25156, '... You can get going.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25250, 'Guilt 4'),
(25251, 'You must ask Chief Roumenus for help to take Raphael, who is suffering from the sense of guilt and injury, back to the town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25252, 'Ah... My pain is getting worse. \nI don\'t think you can get me out of here all by yourself.  \nPlease tell Chief Roumenus about me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25253, 'Chief! Chief Roumenus!!\nYour bad feeling was right.  Raphael is stuck in the lighthouse because of a severe injury...  I can\'t get him out because of the enormous monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25254, 'Hmm, as I assumed.\nAncient Templar Maria told me that she can feel a strange energy coming from the lighthouse since yesterday. \nI was worried since you went in there... \nI was right... \nThank you anyways.  I will organize a rescue team to save Raphael.  You can rest now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25255, '... Please.  I appreciate it... Hugh... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25350, 'Dark Road - Another Way 1'),
(25351, 'Elderine\'s Lord Elbama found out that something is happening in Roumen\'s lighthouse and went on a secret investigation. \nFind him 5 Wings from Nest Bats and 3 Boogy Shells from  Nest Boogys. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25352, 'Oh, welcome.  I have an urgent matter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25353, '(What does he want?  I\'m already busy...)\nUm, I am a little busy right now.  What is it?  If it\'s not urgent... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25354, 'Oh, it\'s urgent.  Of course, it\'s urgent.\nYou... do you know what\'s been happening in Roumen these days?\nHmm, I can tell that you know from the look of your face. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25355, '... Huh?  What are you talking about... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25356, 'Hmm, I\'ll just take it that you know. \nIf you want to keep it a secret, too bad... But I want to make a deal.\nIt\'ll be helpful to you, so don\'t say no. \nIt\'s about the monsters in the basement of Roumen\'s lighthouse.  I want a few pieces of their bodies.  Wouldn\'t that help you, too? \nYou can have the cake and eat it too. \nHow does that sound?\nGet me {color,yellow, 5 Wings from Nest Bats and 5 Boogy Shells from Nest Boogys}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... I don\'t know why you want them... But, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do you need that stuff when Roumen is in danger!][2]'),
(25357, 'Here. (Panting)... Here you go.  You know... I have to go back now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25358, 'Oh, yes.  Give that to me.\nHo ho... You said you\'re busy?  You can get going.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25359, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25450, 'Dark Road - Another Way 2'),
(25451, 'Elderine\'s Lord Elbama found that something is happening at Roumen\'s lighthouse and went on a secret investigation. \nYou should get him 1 Hair Strand from the Nest Alca and 3 Teeth from the Nest Caiman Giants.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25452, 'Ho ho. Good to see you again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25453, 'Um... Lord, what is it this time?  (Panting)... You said it\'s urgent... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25454, 'Yes, it is. It\'s always urgent. \nI must know about the monsters found in Roumen\'s lighthouse. \nIsn\'t that right?\nPlease get me {color,yellow, 1 Hair Strand from Nest Alca and 3 Teeth from the Nest Caiman Giants in the lighthouse}.\nWouldn\'t that be easy for you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, I will, since I am on my way there.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have to go there today.  I\'ll go next time.][2]'),
(25455, 'Here, I found them.\nBut... \nWhy do you want to keep this a secret?\nI don\'t think you are trying to help.  What is your purpose?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25456, 'Hmm.\nWell... I don\'t have to tell you everything... But you think I\'m up to something evil.  \nI\'ll tell you one thing... since I\'ll be needing your help. \nI am researching the dark power as you anticipated... \n... I think it\'s better to use it rather than just suppressing and defeating it. \nIt is wise to use it... rather than confronting it.\nDoes that answer your question?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25457, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25550, 'Dark Road - Another Way 3'),
(25551, 'Elderine\'s Lord Elbama found that something is happening in Roumen\'s lighthouse and went on a secret investigation. \nYou should get him 3 Mad Slug Shells from the Nest Mad Slugs, 3 Bad Teeth from the Nest Weasels, and 3 Bad Teeth from the Nest Gargoyles.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25552, 'Welcome.  Are you pretty familiar with Leviathan\'s Nest now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25553, 'What?  Oh, yes... Since I\'m doing a lot of things there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25554, 'Ho ho.  That\'s nice... \nWhat I\'m about to ask you is a little more dangerous.\nBut don\'t worry.  This will be your last job...  Don\'t make that face. \nGet me {color,yellow, 3 Mad Slug Shells from the Nest Mad Slugs, 3 Bad Teeth from the Nest Weasels, and 3 Bad Teeth from the Nest Gargoyles}.\nI\'ll be generous with your reward. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, I will, since I am on my way there.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have to go there today.  I\'ll go next time.][2]'),
(25555, 'Here, I found them all.\nBut... do these really help your research?\nI know I\'m helping you... but I don\'t have a good feeling about this.\nI feel like I\'m doing something wrong... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25556, 'Hmm, sorry to hear that.\nEveryone has their own way of protecting justice. \nI just have a different approach than people who just follow \'the light.\' \nAlthough we all have a common goal, I know that one way won\'t be enough.\nThat \'one\' will be... \ncertainly impossible to reach for those who have always been comfortable and happy all their lives... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25557, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25650, 'Eat the Light and Make the Dark 1'),
(25651, 'Chief Roumenus tells you what is happening in the lighthouse and that the rescue team for Raphael has gone missing. \nYou should help Roumen\'s Ancient Templar Maria find the rescue team and Raphael.\nGo to Maria with Chief Roumenus.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25652, 'Hey, hey [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25653, 'Yes?  Chief?  What is it?  Do  you have something urgent to tell me...  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25654, 'All 40 members of the rescue team for Raphael have gone missing. \nHow can this happen...  I was a fool.\nWhat do we do!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25655, 'Really?! All 40 of them?\nThey must of been Roumen\'s most talented soldiers... How... could this be... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25656, 'Huh, I\'ve lost my mind.  This is so unexpected. \nMaria wrote me a letter saying that the weird energy from the lighthouse has become stronger since yesterday... I underestimated them.\nLet\'s go to Maria.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'ll come with you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do I have to come?][2]'),
(25657, 'Maria! All of the soldiers are missing. \nI should have paid attention to your advice... Hugh! It\'s all my fault... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25658, 'Oh... eventually... \nWait.\nI will withdraw my protection over the town and observe the lighthouse.\n... \n... \n{color,yellow,(A dim light appears from Maria\'s body and disappears.)}\n... \nPhew.  That\'s better. {color,yellow, Calm down, Chief.  I think they haven\'t gone all the way.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25659, '\nHuh? What does that mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25660, 'Oh... You are here too, [NAME]. \nListen to me carefully. {color,yellow, The missing soldiers are sleeping somewhere in the basement of the lighthouse.  They... have lost their souls and are giving the energy of life to something in the lighthouse.}\nThe monsters... must be using their souls to get energy.\n[NAME], these monsters are too strong, even for the top-class soldiers of Roumen.\n{color,yellow, We are in desperate need of you and your friend\'s help. }\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25661, 'Let\'s go.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25750, 'Eat the Light and Make the Dark 2'),
(25751, 'Chief Roumenus tells you what is happening in the lighthouse and that the rescue team for Raphael has gone missing. \nYou should help Roumen\'s Ancient Templar Maria to find the rescue team and Raphael.\nBring her 3 Karis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25752, 'Listen to me carefully. \nThey are not dead.  They are still alive.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25753, 'What?  Really?  How do we save them?  How?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25754, 'Oh, I\'m so relieved...  Thank god.  So, what do we do now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25755, 'It is very likely that their souls have been... swallowed by the monsters in the lighthouse.\nTheir souls are alive, but their light is getting dimmer and dimmer with time. \nAnd... you can\'t bring the souls back just by defeating the monsters.\nSince the lighthouse is filled with darkness... the weak souls could get absorbed into darkness once they are released.\nIn order to bring the weak souls into their original bodies, we need a \'Karis Bottle.\' \nPlease find 3 Karis for me.  I will use it to make a bottle. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll bring it!  You can stay here, Chief.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Chief?  Do you have any Karis at hand?][2]'),
(25756, '(Panting)... Maria, I brought it.\nIt\'s not easy to extract Karis from weapons.\nPhew... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25757, 'You found it.  Well done.  Oh... Chief went to bring medicine from Healer Julia.  \nI will start making Karis Bottle.  Wait here. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25758, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25850, 'Eat the Light and Make the Dark 3'),
(25851, 'Chief Roumenus tells you what is happening at the lighthouse and that the rescue team for Raphael has gone missing. \nYou should help Roumen\'s Ancient Templar Maria to find the rescue team and Raphael.\nBring King Boogy\'s Soul to Maria.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25852, 'Phew... It\'s all done. \nKaris captures souls and keeps them safe.  An ordinary glass bottles can\'t capture the energy of souls completely. \n[NAME], you should hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25853, 'So, should I gather the souls from monsters and capture them in this bottle?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25854, 'Yes, you should capture the souls.  You should gather the souls as quickly as possible, [NAME].  We are running out of time. \nI should find where the bodies are, so the souls can come back.  Although I would need to withdraw my protection over Roumen... \nBut we will have to take that risk right now. \nHmm... And... the souls seem to have been eaten by a certain monster.\nIt looks like... {color,yellow, a Boogy.  It looks like a gigantic and strong Boogy.}\nI know it\'s dangerous... but we are counting on you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes!  I\'ll bring all of the souls back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You want me to capture ghosts?  I am scared...][2]'),
(25855, 'Maria!  Here are the souls!  Look at this.  The white and bubbly things in my hands... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(25856, 'Here!  This way!!\n(Maria quickly captured the souls in the Karis Bottle.)\nPhew...  I\'m so relieved.\nI think I know where the bodies are.  We should pray for the monsters to disappear... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25857, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25950, 'Eat the Light and Make the Dark 4'),
(25951, 'Chief Roumenus tells you what is happening in the lighthouse and that the rescue team for Raphael has gone missing. \nYou should help Roumen\'s Ancient Templar Maria to find the rescue team and Raphael.\nYou should bring the King Crab Soul to Maria.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25952, '[NAME]!\nI have a problem.  I think I made a mistake... What do we do?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(25953, 'Huh?!  You are one of the calmest people in the world... \nA mistake?! What did you do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25954, 'I let myself down... \nWhat happened is I thought the King Boogy swallowed all of the souls, but I figured that these souls are only for 20 people... \nMy mistake...  We have to go back and bring the rest of the souls!\nI am sure the King Crabs swallowed the rest of the souls. \nThey will use the souls to makea an even more powerful darkness. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Maria, don\'t worry.  I\'ll go there and capture the souls!  Don\'t panic.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even Homer sometimes nods... Maria... I\'m disappointed.][2]'),
(25955, 'Maria! Here are the souls. They look dimmer and weaker than the souls from King Boogy... \nWill they be OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(25956, 'Ahh... They are in danger, but we still have a chance.  They can only survive in Karis Bottle... \nI am almost certain where the bodies are, but the problem is that we need volunteers. \nI\'m counting on Chief Roumenus... \nAnyways, thank you.  You\'ve done it well. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(25957, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26050, 'Maria\'s Care '),
(26051, 'Maria says that she succeeded in communicating with Raphael through the flow of air. \nDeliver Maria\'s Care to Raphael.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26052, 'I used air to communicate with Raphael. \nI think his injury is more severe than we thought.  He is probably stuck there. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26053, 'I see... I thought he might have broken his bone.  The Band wouldn\'t help him...\nI should have brought him with me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(26054, 'Oh, no... It wouldn\'t have been easy to bring out an injured because of the monsters. \nDon\'t blame yourself.  What we must do... is to heal Raphael. \nThis... medicine quickly cures bone fractures.  I used Soul Stone, Top-class Spirit Powder... and Recovery Potion to make it. \nThis will cure him at once.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s awesome!  I\'ll take it to Raphael right now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So? (Looks blank)][2]'),
(26055, 'Raphael!  Phew... You are alive.  Monsters don\'t approach this altar. \nThis is a strong medicine that Maria made.  It will cure your bones quickly.\nTake it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(26056, 'Oh... Thank you.\n[NAME]... You have done so much for me. \n(Raphael drops his head and stays silent for a while.  Then, he drinks the potion.)\nPhew... Thank you.\nI have thought about it. \nI am sure you have realized what they are, right [NAME]...? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26057, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26150, 'Vicious Monster Leviathan'),
(26151, 'Vicious Monster Leviathan is absorbing the power of the gemstone in Roumen\'s lighthouse.  \nDefeat it and go back to Roumenus to rescue Raphael. (Epic Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26152, 'Leviathan is probably absorbing the power of the gemstone.  \nWhen the traveler released it, it was only a small snake. \nBut it\'s massive now.  It will keep absorbing the power of gemstone and keep growing larger. \nIf it becomes larger... that will be the end of it... \nHugh... my wound... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(26153, 'Are you OK?\nHah... Leviathan is clearly a problem, but Raphael... you are becoming weaker. \nDo you think you can hold on?\n{color,yellow, I will go ahead and kill Leviathan.  When I come back, I will help you out!}\n{color,yellow, Chief Roumenus} will rescue you right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(26154, 'Hugh... Thank you... \nWhen you defeat Leviathan... {color,yellow, go to Chief Roumenus.}\nI can wait here. \nPlease... \nBe... Be safe!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!  I will defeat Leviathan and rescue you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How could I even dare to fight such a big and frightening monster!][2]'),
(26155, 'Chief!  I defeated Leviathan!  Go and save Raphael!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(26156, 'Wh... what?!\nDid you really defeat Leviathan?\nMy god... I can\'t believe this!\nSince all of the top-class soldiers have failed... I was going to defend the town and ask Elderine for help... \nWow.  Well done!\nRa..Raphael.  Yes!  I must save Raphael!\nWait.  Thank you!\nThank you!!\nYou saved us all!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Epic Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(26157, 'Go back to Chief Roumenus... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2570, 'The Swamp of Dawn - Hunters\' Union Camp!'),
(2571, 'Kasandra of Hunters\' Union set up a new camp in the Swamp of Dawn.\nYou must deliver Kasandra\'s letter to Hugues in the Swamp of Dawn. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2572, 'Hey! {color,yellow,[NAME]}\nCome at once.  I have a personal favor to ask you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2573, 'What is it?  Is there something important?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2574, 'Ha ha ha, finally a reward for my effort!\nThe Hunters\' Union was able to set up a new camp in the Swamp of Dawn. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2575, 'What?  Already!?\nYou are great~\nI\'ll have to stop by sometime.  I\'m sure there is some stuff for me to do there~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2576, 'Sometime?!?!?! What about right now?\nI have a letter for Hugues who is at the camp in the Swamp of Dawn. \nYou can do something for me and visit the new camp! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Wow~ Good.  I\'ll take it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I still want to go later.][2]'),
(2577, 'Hello.  Are you Hugues of Hunters\' Union?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2578, 'Yes, I am Hugues.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2579, 'It won\'t be long until I make my Hunters\' Union the best in this continent~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2610, 'In Search of the Person 1'),
(2611, 'Deliver a letter to Hugues, a new member of Hunters\' Union, and listen to his story. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2612, 'This is the new camp of Hunters\' Union~\nHey... here, I brought {color,yellow, a letter from Kasandra}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2613, 'Thanks... Adventurer.\nAre you {color,yellow,[NAME]}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2614, 'Do you know me?  I don\'t think I have met you before. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2615, 'I haven\'t met you before either {color,yellow,[NAME]}. \nKasandra has told me much about you. She said that you are an adventurer who will help us a lot, {color,yellow,[NAME]}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2616, 'Did Kasandra really said that....\nI feel flattered and rewarded~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2617, 'However, Kasandra\'s recommendation doesn\'t tell me everything about you!\nMany things can happen and I would need adventurers to solve problems for me!\nI need talented adventurers that can solve any type of problems.\nSo, I will be counting on you, {color,yellow,[NAME]}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2618, 'What?  Me?\nHmm.... I don\'t know what will happen in the future, but I have done my best so far. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2619, 'But... there are things that you can\'t solve just by doing your best. \nYou need to be talented.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2620, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2630, 'In Search of the Person 2'),
(2631, 'Hugue of Hunters\' Union in the Swamp of Dawn tells you that he joined the Hunters\' Union to find someone. \nHugues asks you to find an Old Fragment of a Memory for his clue. \n(Old Fragment of a Memory can be found in the Cave of Memories to the west.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2632, 'Have you ever heard of the Cave of Memories?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2633, 'I have been to many places, but I have never heard of {color,yellow, the Cave of Memories}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2634, 'I bet you haven\'t...The Cave of Memories has just been discovered.  Right here in the Swamp of Dawn. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2635, 'Just head west from the camp and you will arrive at the Cave of Memories. \nIt is my personal favor, {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\nCould you find me {color,yellow, an Old Fragment of a Memories} from inside the Cave of Memories?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2636, 'I am motivated to go there since it\'s a new discovery~\nIt\'s a good opportunity for me~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2637, 'Good, then that will be my first request.\nGo to the Cave of Memories in the west and find an Old Fragment of a Memory for me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, consider it found.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think it would be too hard for me.][2]'),
(2638, 'Hugues, I\'m back. \nI got you an {color,yellow, Old Fragment of a Memory!]\nBy the way, why did you want this piece? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2639, 'When you powder this Old Fragment of a Memory and sprinkle it onto a item, it will show you how that item was used. \nI recently learned how it can be used, but I couldn\'t find one. \nAnyways, I forgot to tell you that there are monsters called {color,yellow, Memory Keepers} in the Cave of Memories, but I don\'t think it was a problem for you.  You are better than I thought, [NAME]..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2640, 'You should have told me that earlier!\nI came back safe, but I had a real trouble in the Cave of Memories!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2641, 'The Cave of Memories shouldn\'t be so hard to find.  Just head west. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2660, 'In Search of the Person 3'),
(2661, 'Hugues of Hunters\' Union asks you to find an item that was used by the person he is looking for. \nGo to Chief Adrian of Uruga. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2662, 'Since I have acquired the hard-to-find Old Fragment of a Memory...  All I need is a thing that a certain person used?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2663, 'Hugues, who are you looking for?\nI want to know who the person is, since I have to find them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2664, 'Right, you should know, [NAME].  I\'ll tell you, but don\'t tell anyone else. \nHmm... It\'s already been 3 years.  \nThe person or the woman that I\'m looking for is {color,yellow, Konzert}, my wife who disappeared 3 years ago...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2665, 'Huh, then you joined the Hunters\' Union to find your wife...\nWhy did she disappear?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2666, '(...Takes a moment to think.)\nWell... I don\'t know.\nWe were an ordinary couple and I thought we were happy together.\nIf she had a reason, she would have told me.  She just disappeared when I came back home.  Like smoke. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2667, 'Hmm... I\'m sorry. \nI will help you find her as best as I can. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2668, 'Thank you.  In order to use the Old Fragment of a Memory, I need something that she used.  \nFor accuracy, I need something that she used recently. \nI learned that she recently stayed in Uruga for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2669, 'If it\'s Uruga, I can help you.\nI can ask Chief Adrian.  He might know something!~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2670, 'Right, I have heard of her.  I\'ll be counting on you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry.  It shouldn\'t take long.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like Adrian...][2]'),
(2671, 'Chief Adrian, I\'m here!~  I have a quick question for you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2672, 'Oh~ [NAME], it\'s been a long time.\nI was just wondering how you were doing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2673, 'Why on earth would she disappear?...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2680, 'In Search of the Person 4'),
(2681, 'Chief Adrienne says that all left-behind belongings are temporarily kept in the west of the Marsh of Dawn. \nHowever, he lost all the belongings when Caiman Junior attached. \nYou must find a handkerchief and a small suitcase to return to Hugues of Hunters\' Union. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2682, 'Look at you panting.{color,yellow, [NAME]}, what\'s wrong?\nCatch your breath first. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2683, '(Panting)... I can\'t breathe.\nDo you happen to keep anything that travelers leave behind in the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2684, 'What travelers leave behind...\nI had a woman\'s {color,yellow, Handkerchief} and a couple\'s {color,yellow, Small Suitcase}.  Why?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2685, 'Hmm...\nI don\'t think I can tell you.  My client wanted to keep it a secret, but it\'s not for something bad.  Trust me!~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2686, 'You have my trust, [NAME].  I won\'t ask you for any more information. \nBut travelers\' belongings are not here anymore.   \nWe were attacked by a group {color,yellow, Caiman Junior\'s} and lost them while moving them to {color,yellow, The Swamp of Dawn}. \nCould you take this opportunity to find them for me, [NAME]? \nI think it\'ll help both of us. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, I can go ahead and look for it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll come back later, I\'m not in a hurry.][2]'),
(2687, 'Hugues, I brought the traveler\'s belongings that are left behind in Uruga .The latest belongings are this handkerchief and this small suitcase. \nI hope one of these belongs to {color,yellow, Konzert}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2688, 'We can check it out right away. \nOne moment. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2689, 'I know I said I won\'t be asking any more, \nbut I wonder why you need traveler\'s belongings. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2710, 'Something You Got to Know Someday...'),
(2711, 'Hugues of Hunters\' Union is looking for Konzert, his wife who disappeared. \nTalk to Hugues.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2712, 'I\'ll take this Old Fragment of a Memory... and....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2713, '(Wow, Hugues\' hands are glowing...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2714, 'Oh..\nI see...\nThat\'s what happened...\n(Sheds a tear.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2715, '...\nHugues...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2716, 'That\'s OK.  I was expecting this all along.  \nShe left me to go there... \nPlease remember in your heart what I am about to tell you.  It is something that will happen sometime in the future. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2717, 'Something that will happen sometime...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2718, 'Konzert and I are from the broad plains and mountains of the west, which not many people know. \nWe are not from this continent...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2719, 'What!?  The plains of the west?  The mountains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2720, 'Right.  You don\'t need to know everything now do you?  You will figure it out one by one.  The countless numbers of things that happen here are like dots that form a line.  What is certain is that {color,yellow, they} are longing for God\'s glory and the smile of people who have settled here.  As you start seeing them one after another, they will try to dominate this place with their dominating powers. \nThe time hasn\'t come yet, but the time will come. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2721, 'In that case, we must notify the chiefs of each village and the Lord to be prepared!\nWe don\'t have any time to waste!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2722, 'No, it\'s too soon, [NAME].  I\'m not telling you all this so that you can get prepared.  It\'ll just confuse everyone.\nIt\'s a seedling that has just begun to grow.  It needs to endure years of rain and winds and grow into a green tree.  Wait until it lays strong roots.  \n\n{color,yellow,[NAME]}, this applies to you, too.\n[NEXT]\n'),
(2723, 'OK... I don\'t know everything, but I think I know what you are saying, Hugues. \nI will try harder to make myself stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2724, 'The day will come.  For sure.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2730, 'Como of the Hunters\' Union'),
(2731, 'Listen to the story of Como of the Hunters\' Union.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2732, 'I am {color,yellow, Como}, the newest member of the Hunters\' Union~\nI have been waiting for you, [NAME]~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2733, 'Huh, do you know me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2734, 'Of course, the Hunters\' Union has told me that an adventurer named [NAME] will be coming to help us~\nThank you for helping us~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2735, 'Yes~ I will take any of your request, Mr. Como~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2736, 'No, don\'t call me Mr. Como. \nJust call me Como~ \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2737, 'Sure~ Como!\nI hope we can get along~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2738, 'I am Como of the Hunters\' Union Camp in the Swamp of Dawn~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2740, 'Tiara of the Hunters\' Union'),
(2741, 'Listen to the story of Tiara of the Hunters\' Union.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2742, 'Who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2743, 'Oh... Hello.\nI am [NAME] of Hennis Adventurers.\nI heard a new Hunters\' Union Camp opened in the Swamp of Dawn. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2744, 'Oh~ You are [NAME].\nI\'m {color,yellow, Tiara}.\nI\'m sure we will work together often.  I\'m sure we will turn out to be good friends!~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2745, 'I do too~  Call me anytime you need me~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2746, 'But you look weaker than I thought.  I thought you would be as robust as Hugues based on what Kasandra has told me...\nWell... I\'ll figure it out.  Welcome to the team!~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2747, 'Thanks, I won\'t let you down. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2748, 'I \'m Tiara of the Hunters\' Union Camp in the Swamp of Dawn~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2760, 'Cleaning around You 1'),
(2761, 'Como of Hunters\' Union says that he can\'t work because of a flock of Caiman that is making a lot of noise. \nYou must defeat 30 Caimans for Como.\n(Caimans are near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2762, '[NAME], come at once~\nIt\'s killing me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2763, 'Mr. Como~ No, Como.\nWhat\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2764, 'I like the camp here, but \nthose {color,yellow, Caimans} are making too much noise!\nI can\'t do anything when there\'s noise.  I\'m sensitive.  Those Caimans have no manners what so ever!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2765, '(Manners for monsters...)\nIt\'s not so bad...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2766, 'How can you say that!\nYou are not sensitive, [NAME]~\nWe must clean up the surroundings!  [NAME], please go out and make those Caiman\'s calm down!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, that\'s nothing~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m just not sensitive to do that.][2]'),
(2767, 'Como~ I\'ve swept all of the Caimans away from this area~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2768, 'I think it\'s a little quieter.  \nI think my nerves have calm down.\n[NAEM], you are the best~  Thank you~ \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2769, 'This is the worst place for someone so sensitive like me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2770, 'Cleaning around You 2'),
(2771, 'Como of Hunters\' Union says that he can\'t work because the flock of Rhinoces is making a lot of noise. \nYou must defeat 30 Rhinoce for Como.\n(Caimans are near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2772, 'Ahh!  I can\'t take it anymore!\nWhy won\'t they just leave me alone!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2773, 'Como, why are you so mad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2774, 'Those {color,yellow, Rhinoces} are sniffling everywhere!\n[NAME], do something!!\nI\'m so bothered.  Even my skin feels rough because I can\'t sleep!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2775, 'Come to think of it... the Rhinoces are just walking...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2776, 'No! No!\nIt gets on my nerves!\nDon\'t you feel sorry for my suffering because of those {color,yellow, Rhinoces}?\n[NAME], please show them what you\'ve got~  Teach them some manners!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, OK~ I\'ll show them~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have good manners myself.  Teach them yourself, Como.][2]'),
(2777, 'Como!  I taught them a lesson in manners!\nNo more sniffling to worry about!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2778, 'Thank you~\nI think I can have peace of mind~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2779, 'This is the worst place for someone so sensitive like me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2780, 'Territorial Battle'),
(2781, 'Hugues of Hunters\' Union says that the camp is threatened by the continuing attack of Rhinoce Lords.\nYou must help Hugues to defeat Rhinoce Lords before they gain more power. \n(Rhinoce Lord is near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2782, 'There is a problem that I can\'t solve by myself.  [NAME], I need your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2783, 'What is it?  I won\'t be able to do it if you can\'t do it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2784, 'It\'s nothing too serious.  Don\'t worry. \nThe number of Rhinoce Lords is constantly growing near the camp, so I can\'t go anywhere. \nI hope you can take care of Rhinoce Lords, [NAME].  It shouldn\'t be so hard, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2785, 'It\'s... not hard... for you, Hugues. \nRhinoce Lords are strong.  It\'s a challenge for me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2786, 'That\'s OK.  I think you can handle them, [NAME].\nNo need to worry.  Go ahead and keep those Rhinoce Lords from expanding their powers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, OK, I\'ll do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not as strong as you, Hugues!][2]'),
(2787, '(Panting)  I managed to defeat them somehow. \nThey won\'t be near the camp for a while!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2788, 'It must have been a little hard for you...\nBut what is important is that you got the job done.  I will be able to count on you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2789, 'Hugues, please!\nI\'m not that strong!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2790, 'Rhinoce Lords are strong, but they are not our biggest worry. \nThe real worry is still yet to come. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2810, 'A Stronger Guy'),
(2811, 'Hugues of Hunters\' Union asks you to defeat Rhinoce King, the king of Rhinoce Lords around the camp, and bring him a Gigantic Tooth of a Rhinoce King. \n(Rhinoce King is near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2812, 'We don\'t have to worry about Rhinoce Lords for now, but it\'s only for a while.\nTo keep them away from us forever, you must defeat the Rhinoce King, the head of all Rhinoce Lords.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2813, 'Rhinoce King?\nThere is a king among the flock of Rhinoces?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2814, 'I guess you don\'t know.  Unlike the Rhinoces, Rhinoce Lords are ruled by the king. \nIf we can get that one, Rhinoce Lords will no longer bother our camp. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(2815, 'Then I did all that fighting for nothing. I could have just gone after Rhinoce King!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2816, 'No, it was also your job to sweep up those Rhinoce Lords around the camp.  I thought if you had failed, [NAME], we could never go after Rhinoce King.  But you managed to take care of those Rhinoce Lords.  Now I can ask you to go after Rhinoce King.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2817, 'What?  You want me to go after Rhinoce King!\nI had trouble defeating those Rhinoce Lords~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2818, 'That\'s OK.  I think you will do just fine, [NAME].\nDefeat Rhinoce King and bring me a Gigantic Tooth of the Rhinoce King.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I really can\'t.][2]'),
(2819, '(Panting) I\'m back.  I almost got killed!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2820, 'I knew I was right.  [NAME], you are much stronger than you think. \nHave some self-esteem. \nYou will face many challenges in the future, but you will do well.  I trust you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2821, 'Rhinoce King will be in the middle of those Rhinoce Lords.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2830, 'Defeating Laplan.'),
(2831, 'Tiara of Hunters\' Union is worried about the increasing number of Laplan in the Swamp of Dawn and asks you to defeat them. \nDefeat 25 Laplan.\n(Laplan is near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2832, '[NAME], here\'s your chance to earn some credit from me!~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2833, 'What?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2834, 'Don\'t you want to be friends with me?\nYou don\'t have my full trust yet, [NAME].\nMr. Hugues is the true adventurer!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2835, 'Then why don\'t you go talk to Mr. Hugues?~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2836, 'Oh~  Are you jealous!\nI\'m giving you a chance.  \nWe opened a camp in the Swamp of Dawn, but there are too many monsters that are bothering us. \nPlease defeat Laplan for me, [NAME].  I\'ll give you credit if you do well~\n\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t need your credit.  It\'s my job!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t need your chance.  Talk to Hugues!][2]'),
(2837, 'Laphlan  all done!\nThat was not a problem at all!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2838, 'Wow~  You are stronger than I thought.\nYou deserve some credit!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2839, 'Laphlan can be cute sometimes~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2840, 'Furious Prince'),
(2841, 'Tiara of Hunters\' Union says that supplies to the camp were plundered by Laplan Prince.\nYou must defeat Laplan Prince and get the supplies back.\n(Laplan Prince is in Laplan Cave in the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2842, '[NAME], you have another chance!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2843, 'I don\'t need a chance!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2844, 'My recognition could get you something good, you know?\nI give you a chance to be my friend~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2845, 'I don\'t need a chance...\nBut what is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2846, 'After you defeated the Laplan\'s, our supplies to the camp were taken by a gigantic Laplan on its way.\nI think its the revenge of the Laplan Prince.  Please go there and get us our supplies back, [NAME].\nMr. Hugues is too busy settling the camp~\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  That better be your last request!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, find another adventurer.][2]'),
(2847, 'I brought the supplies back from the Laplan Prince!\nI thought it would be a handsome prince, but it was just horrible.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2848, 'I think this brought you a little closer to me, [NAME]~  I love strong people~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2849, 'Wouldn\'t Laplan  Prince look handsome?  He is a prince after all!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2860, 'Furious Princess'),
(2861, 'Tiara of Hunters\' Union says that some things are missing from the supplies that you retrieved. \nThe Laplan Prince must have given them to the Laphlan Princess.\nRetrieve the remainders from Laplan Princess. \n(Laplan Prince is in Laplan Cave in the Swamp of Dawn.) \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2862, '[NAME], it\'s the final chance for us to become true friends!~\nAren\'t you happy?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2863, 'No, I said I don\'t need that chance!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2864, 'We can be true friends now. \nDon\'t look so upset~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2865, '(I\'m getting tired...)\nOK, what is it this time?\nTalk fast, so I can have some time to rest.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2866, 'Some things are missing from the supplies that you got back, [NAME].\nI did some research and found out that the Laplan likes to give out his things.\nI think Laplan Prince gave some things to the Laplan Princess~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2867, 'Raphlan Princess... That must be another horrendous monster no matter what it\'s called.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2868, 'You never know~\nBut what is clear is that I\'m really going to like you if you do this job right, [NAME]~\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, whatever.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to!][2]'),
(2869, 'Tiara, I got everything back.\nThe princess was just as ugly. Just like I thought.\nPhew~  I\'m a little tired.  Now that we are friends, can I go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2870, 'Wow, [NAME]~\nWe are now truly true friends~\nPlease stay being my good friend~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2871, 'Don\'t you get an idea about Laplan Princess would be like?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2880, 'Mimic, Little Mimic!'),
(2881, 'A monster named Little Mimic that appeared in the Swamp of Dawn stole something from the camp.\nYou must retrieve it from Little Mimic.\n(Little Mimic is near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2882, '(Sobbing) [NAME], help me!~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(2883, 'Como!  Why are you crying?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2884, 'I was sleeping and woke up because something was making too much noise. \nThen, I saw a strange box eat up my favorite ring!\nIt escaped in the blink of an eye and just disappeared!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2885, 'A strange box?\nWas it a monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2886, 'I had never seen something like that, so I asked Mr. Hugues. \nHe says it\'s Little Mimic.  It used to appear in the west mountains, but has been appearing near the camp for some reason.  He says that it\'s not dangerous and I should just ignore it... But... I love my ring!~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2887, 'That\'s an interesting monster...\nDon\'t worry.  I will find the ring for you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2888, 'Please, [NAME]. That ring was given to me by my love.  It\'ll be too sad to lose it~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry, just trust me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Something urgent just came to my mind, sorry! ][2]'),
(2889, 'I got your ring back!\nBut, hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(2890, 'Did you get it!?\nGive it to me~  My No. 1 treasure~  You are back~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(2891, 'My ring~  It\'s my greatest treasure~\nPlease~ find it~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3010, 'The Revenge of the Ring!? 1'),
(3011, 'You got the ring back from Little Mimic, but it was broken. \nTalk to Como.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3012, 'What is this!\nMy ring is broken... (sobbing)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3013, 'I don\'t know how it happened, but sorry.  I should have been more careful. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(3014, 'My ring..  My precious ring.. (sobbing)\nThis ring was made by my friends when I first joined the Hunters\' Union... (sobbing)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3015, 'What?  You said it was a gift from your love?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3016, 'Hmm... that\'s not the point!~  My ring\'s broken.\nThat\'s what\'s important!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3017, 'Hmm.. \nThere is a talented blacksmith in Uruga.  Do you want me to ask him?\nThe ring could be fixed very quickly~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3018, 'No!  What I need is an action!\nAvenge!  Avenge me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3019, 'Avenge!?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3020, 'It\'s my favorite ring.. (sobbing)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3030, 'The Revenge of the Ring!? 2'),
(3031, 'Como is dreaming to avenge himself of the Little Mimic that broke his ring. \nDefeat Quiet Mimic\'s to calm Como down. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3032, 'Avenge!\nAvenge me, and get that vicious Little Mimic!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(3033, 'I know you are upset about the ring, but do you really want to avenge your?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3034, 'I do!  I want to avenge myself!!!\nIf I don\'t, they will think I\'m a pushover!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3035, 'Mr. Hugues said Little Mimic won\'t hurt you. \nTry to calm yourself down~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3036, 'Mr. Hugues says that the Quiet Mimic must be nearby wherever Little Mimic\'s are found.\nThe Quiet Mimic is responsible for not stopping the Little Mimic!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3037, '(Como... you are starting to scare me..)\nQuiet Mimic?  They certainly don\'t sound like a bad monsters..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3038, 'Hugues says that the Quiet Mimic won\'t attack you if you don\'t attack them first, but they are a Mimic!  Someone has to pay for messing with my ring!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll give them a serious warning, so calm yourself.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[But it\'s not a bad monster..][2]'),
(3039, 'I gave those Mimic a knuckle sandwich for you, Como!\nFeel better~?  Try to calm yourself now~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3040, 'I\'m not mad~\nI thought about it and I overreacted~\nI got the ring in Uruga a while ago, so I can just get another one~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(3041, 'What?  You bought it yourself!\nPoor Mimic...\nEveryone in the Hunters\' Union in the Swamp of Dawn is so bizarre...  They tire me out...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(3042, 'Mimic!  They are bad!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4010, 'Let\'s Do It until the End!'),
(4011, 'A dangerous Mimic emerged. \nThe new Crazy Mimic is quite dangerous unlike other Mimic.\nDefeat Crazy Mimic and retrieve Merchant\'s goods.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4012, '[NAME]~ [NAME]~\nI\'m sorry about last time~  So, I got you an easy job~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4013, '(I don\'t have a good feeling about this...)\nSo, what is this job that you got for me, Como~?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4014, 'A merchant named Kenton from Elderin was attacked by a Mimic while transferring his goods to the Ruins of Alberstol.  \nI asked Mr. Hugues and he says that the Crazy Mimic must have come with other Mimics.  They are dangerous and must be taken care of right away~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4015, 'So dangerous now it\'s Crazy Mimic\'s... is the job is for me...\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4016, 'Yes, [NAME].  You have already fought against Mimic\'s several times.\nSo, it must be an easy for you to do it again.\nThe Crazy Mimic is just Mimic after all.  Shouldn\'t be that different~?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4017, 'Hmm... I guess...\nOK~ I\'ll do it~\nI should defeat the Crazy Mimic and retrieve Kenton\'s goods, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4018, 'Oh~ OK~\nI like that you can comprehend what I say~\nMr. Kenton is a rich man and will give us a big reward.  Be quick~  I\'ll wait here~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shall we begin!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to fight another Mimic~][2]'),
(4019, 'Como!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4020, 'You are back already?\nThat\'s exactly why I like you, [NAME]~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4021, 'Co..mo..\nCrazy Mimic was nothing like other Mimic!  Not at all!!!\nIf I was alone, I would have died 10 times!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4022, 'But you came back safe~ That\'s what\'s important~\nDon\'t worry~\nI\'ll get you an easier job next time~ \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4023, 'Crazy Mimic should be just like the other Mimic, but going out alone won\'t be fun. \nWhy don\'t you go with other adventurers? \nI think that might be better for you~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4030, 'Mimic\'s Box 1'),
(4031, 'There is a rumor that some Mimic keeps precious items in their boxes.\nWe are getting endless requests to find the Mimic\'s Box.\nFind a Mimic\'s Box from a Mimic.\n(Mimic are near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4032, '[NAME], we have a new request.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4033, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4034, 'There is a rumor that the Mimic\'s Box are full of treasure.\nWe are constantly receiving requests to find as many of the Mimic\'s Boxes as we can find. \nThere are just too many.  So, I need your help, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4035, 'What if there isn\'t any treasure inside the Mimic\'s Box?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4036, 'We just get it because we are asked to. \nThey ask for a Mimic\'s Box no matter what\'s in it.\nWhat\'s inside is not our concern. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4037, 'Hmm... I see. \nThen, I\'ll take the job.  Mimic\'s Box!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4038, 'Thanks. \nLet me just clarify it for you. \nIt doesn\'t matter which Mimic you fight.  Just find the Mimic\'s Box.  It\'s simple.\nConsidering your work so hard, I don\'t think it would be a big challenge for you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll take this job.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[We are just harassing those Mimic too much these days!][2]'),
(4039, 'I\'m done.... I got the Mimic\'s Box!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4040, 'Good~  That was fast.\nWe have many other clients, so just let me know if you want to do it again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4041, 'Treasure in Mimic\'s Box... That\'s ridiculous.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4060, 'Mimic\'s Box 2'),
(4061, 'There is a rumor that some Mimic\'s keep precious items in their boxes.\nWe are getting endless requests to find Mimic\'s Box.\nFind Mimic\'s Box from Mimic.\n(Mimic\'s are near the Swamp of Dawn.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4062, 'Can you find me another Mimic\'s Box?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4063, 'Certainly! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4064, 'Just a reminder. \nIt doesn\'t matter which Mimic you fight.  Just find the Mimic\'s Box.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll take this job.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[We are just harassing those Mimic too much these days!][2]'),
(4065, 'Mimic\'s Box!  Here you go~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4066, 'That was easy.\nBut, don\'t be overconfident.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4067, 'Treasure in Mimic\'s Box... That\'s ridiculous.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5010, 'More Monkeys, More Problems 1 (Event Quest)'),
(5011, 'Item Merchant Pey in Roumen is rewarding those willing to fight against the monkey menance terrorizing the Free Battle Zones!\n(Slay 50 Mini Moes in the Free Battle Zone)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5012, 'I can\'t believe it! This is a disaster...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5013, 'What\'s worrying you, Pey? I was hoping I could just stop by and say hi.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5014, 'I\'m sorry [NAME]. It\'s good seeing you again. It\'s just that I have a bigger problem on my hands! You see, I was training a new mount for my shop, a small little monkey... but something went awry!\n \n[NEXT]'),
(5015, 'Oh no! What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5016, 'We were out walking one day when we stumbled upon a strange blue shard! Moe, the name of this monkey, picked up this shard and ran off into the trees!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5017, 'A strange shard? That is pretty odd! Is Moe ok? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5018, 'Oh, it\'s terrible! The next thing I know, Shuitian comes knocking on the door of my shop to tell me Moe has gone on a ramage! The shard has made him extremely large and powerful!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5019, 'You weren\'t kidding when you said you had a big problem!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5020, 'Something has to be done about Moe! I\'ve heard he\'s able to spawn smaller replicas of himself, ones that are not as powerful as him but just as mischievous! Perhaps once we get rid of those, we\'ll be able to attack Moe directly. What do you say, [NAME]? Will you help me slay 50 of the small monkeys?\n\n[BUTTON]=[You\'ve got it, Pey! Consider those monkeys gone!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m a little too busy right now!][2]'),
(5021, 'That shard sure did make Moe pretty cranky! It wasn\'t easy, but I managed to slay 50 of his minions!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5022, 'Thank you, [NAME]! I fear we have much more to do before Moe can finally be returned to normal, but you\'ve helped me so much. Take this reward, you have earned it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5023, 'How is Moe? Despite everything, I still worry about him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5030, 'More Monkeys, More Problems 2 (Event Quest)'),
(5031, 'Item Merchant Pey in Roumen is rewarding those willing to fight against the monkey menance terrorizing the Free Battle Zones!\n(Slay 100 Mini Moes in the Free Battle Zone)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5032, 'We\'re another step closer to bringing Moe back to normal, I can feel it! These little monkeys keep springing up, though, and we still need your help! Can you defeat 100 more Mini Moes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[More monkeys? No problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not today, Pey!][2]'),
(5033, 'Thank you, [NAME]! I know my Moe will be normal again someday. Take this reward, you have certainly earned it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5034, 'How is Moe? Despite everything, I still worry about him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4110, 'Blue Magic Stone 1'),
(4111, 'Talk to Kiera. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4112, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  Wait, do you have some spare time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4113, 'Chief, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4114, 'Oh, {color,yellow,[NAME]}!\nWell, have you heard?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4115, 'Heard what?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4116, 'The monsters around here have been known to drop a mysterious {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4117, 'Monsters that drop a mysterious {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone}...  I haven\'t heard about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4118, 'That stone doesn\'t appear to be natural, but specially treated. \nIt has a unique smell of chemicals.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4119, '(Wearing a serious face.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4120, 'Blue Magic Stone 2'),
(4121, 'Listen to Kiera about the Secret Lab. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4122, 'Look, this is the stone I got from a monster. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4123, '(Shows Blue Magic Stone.)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4124, 'What?  What does that mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4125, 'Well, I discovered a portal nearby. \nIt was located in an inaccessible area and hadn\'t been discovered by anyone. \nWhen I approached the portal, I noticed the entrance was locked tightly.  I couldn\'t enter the portal. \nIt was completely restricted..\nAs I was thinking I would find the key to get in, I was attacked by a monster.\nWhen I defeated the monster, it dropped this {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone}.\nI just happened to collect some of the stones from the monsters.  \nWhen I {color,yellow, approached the entrance with the Blue Magic Stone}, the portal opened?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4126, 'When I entered, the portal closed and my {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone had disappeared.}\nI only came out because it was too dark inside, and once outside the portal was locked again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4127, '..............\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4130, 'Search Team 1'),
(4131, 'Use a Blue Magic Stone to gain entrance to the Secret Lab and defeat 3 monsters called Space Guard #1.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4132, 'So, you can only enter the portal when you have a {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone}, right.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4133, 'Yes. \nI think that portal has a special barrier that is only accessible to someone who has a {color,yellow,} Blue Magic Stone}.\nPlease use the stones that you have to investigate the portal, {color,yellow,[NAME]}. \nI want to go myself, but I have another job to do. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4134, 'When I went in there, I saw a horrible organism that gave me goose bumps. \nPlease go with the most reliable colleagues.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m an expert in things like that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t even know where that is...][2]'),
(4135, 'I\'m back.\nThat place was like a laboratory. \nIt had the smell of all kinds of chemicals. \nAlso, it had ugly organisms flying around...\nI really had a hard time getting around. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4136, 'A lab...  Just thinking about it gives me goose bumps. \n{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4137, 'Please be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4140, 'Search Team 2'),
(4141, 'Capture 3 Lab Ghosts.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4142, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  I know it\'s a hard job, \nbut you are the only person who can investigate the Lab, {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4143, 'Please take your good colleagues and investigate the Lab. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, I have something else to do.][2]'),
(4144, 'I\'m back.\nI encountered a few of the Lab Ghosts...\nThey looked really horrible. \nWho did these brutal things to them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4145, 'I see.\nI think there is someone who continues to do these brutal experiments. \nIt would be helpful to find this person.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4146, 'Must have a Blue Magic Stone to enter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4160, 'Search Team 3'),
(4161, 'Defeat 6 Combat Subject #1.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4162, 'Go to the Lab and find out who is behind these brutal experiments. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4163, 'Check your Blue Magic Stone.\nAlso you must always stay alert.  You never know when monsters can attack you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, I have something else to do.][2]'),
(4164, 'Chief... This time, it was the Combat Subjects that I encountered...\nThat place is filled with all types demons that I have never imagined fighting. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4165, 'Demons? That just sounds scary. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4166, 'Check your Blue Stone and be careful...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4170, 'Taylor\'s Secret Documents 1'),
(4171, 'Taylor calls you.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4172, '..Hey.. {color,yellow,[NAME]}!!\n(Whispers)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4173, 'Huh?  Me?  Did you call me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4174, 'Yes, you.  Come here!!\nWell, are you investigating the Secret Lab?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4175, 'You are Chief\'s Secretary...  Are you on a mission, too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4176, 'Well, yes.  You can say that.\n{color,yellow,[NAME]}! \nI have a favor to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4177, 'A favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4178, 'Some of the monsters in the Lab will drop papers like this!!\nPlease bring me all of the papers you come across.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4179, 'Papers?  Hmm, are they important?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4180, 'I will tell you later.  I am currently investigating these papers that Lab monsters are dropping. \nI thought it was just one page, but there are multiple pages. \nWith these papers, I would be able to learn more about the Lab monsters. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4181, 'Please listen to me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4190, 'Taylor\'s Secret Documents 2'),
(4191, 'Taylor asks you to bring the secret research documents from the Secret Lab. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4192, 'So, {color,yellow,[NAME]}!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4193, 'Please bring me all the papers that the Lab monsters drop.  Please.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I already have a lot of things to do... I don\'t want anymore.][2]'),
(4194, 'Here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4195, 'Thank you so much!! \n{color,yellow,[NAME]}!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4196, 'Please bring me the papers that the Lab monsters drop.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4210, 'Search Team 4'),
(4211, 'Use the Blue Magic Stone to enter the Lab and defeat 5 Space Surveillance #2.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4212, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  Please go back to the Secret Lab and continue your investigation. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4213, 'I need to know why those monsters exist there.\nI know it\'s hard, but please help me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.  I\'ll help you as best as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It was so hard.  I don\'t want to go back.][2]'),
(4214, 'I\'m back.  I had trouble with the Space Surveillance #2.\nIt was strong and so horribly ugly. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4215, 'Space Surveillance...  Hmm.  Tell me more about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4216, 'Be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4230, 'Search Team 5'),
(4231, 'Experiment Subject #19 interrupts your lab investigation.  Defeat Experiment Subject #19.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4232, '(Talks to Kiera about the monster Space Surveillance #2.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4233, 'I see.  How interesting.\nI never thought such organisms would exist. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4234, 'I want to do a little more research before I decide whether I want to eliminate all the monsters or seal the place up. \n{color,yellow,[NAME]}!!  Can you please help me out a little more? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t take it anymore.  You\'d better shut it down.][2]'),
(4235, 'I\'m back.  There is a monster called Experiment Subject #19..  It was really violent and the looks of it made me throw up in my mouth a little bit..  It still gives me goose bumps thinking about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4236, 'Experiment Subject #19... All of the monsters there have weird names. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4237, 'Please be careful. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4240, 'Traces of Children 1'),
(4241, 'Take the items dropped by Experiment Subject #20 to Kiera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4242, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}, thanks to you, we learned a lot about the lab. \nI will get the information to Chief Adrian. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4243, 'Just a little more to go. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.  I\'ll help you as much as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m so tired.  I want to rest.][2]'),
(4244, 'That one was really scary this time.\nIt was very strong as well..\nOh, I found this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4245, 'This.. is.. a toy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4246, 'Yes, Experiment Subject #20 dropped this..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4247, 'I think that Lab is related to the missing children. \nI hope they don\'t use.. children.. for experiments.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4248, 'Be careful.  You never know what will attack you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4260, 'Traces of Children 2'),
(4261, 'Take the items dropped by Experiment Subject #23 to Kiera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4262, 'This is the last thing I wanted to see.\n{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  Please continue your investigation.  You might find more things that can be linked to the missing children. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4263, 'You\'ve done a lot for me..  Just a little more to go. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.  I\'ll help you as much as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m so tired.  I want to rest.][2]'),
(4264, 'Chief, I encountered Experiment Subject #23.\nIt dropped this...\nAnd it said something before it died.\nSomething about research on children and something about Experiment Subject #25...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4265, 'Experiment Subject #25 must be really vicious.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4266, 'Please look for more things that belong to children.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4270, 'Lab Master'),
(4271, 'Defeat Experiment Subject #25, the Lab Master. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4272, 'Hmm.  That... {color,yellow, Experiment Subject #25} must be the biggest problem inside of the Secret Lab. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4273, 'Yes.  I think that is the actual owner of the lab. \nI believe the children are being held captured where he is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4274, '{color,yellow,[NAME]}!  Please hurry.\nBefore {color,yellow, Experiment Subject #25} harms the children!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I should hurry up.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me take a rest first.][2]'),
(4275, 'Chief!!  I defeated Experiment Subject #25.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4276, 'Well done.  Chief Adrian told me the children are home safe. \nThank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4277, 'Please hurry. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4280, 'Blue Magic Stones 1'),
(4281, 'Taylor tells you he will give you a Blue Magic Stone to enter the Secret Lab.  \nHe wants you to defeat Mutant Snakes and Incomplete Subjects near Alberstol Ruins in return.. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4282, '[NAME], can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4283, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4284, 'Recently, new monsters escaped from Iyzel\'s Laboratory. The thing is they are more violent than previous monsters. It might have an affect on other monsters making them more brutal. {color,yellow,[NAME]}, I believe you can defeat 3 {color,yellow,Mutant Snakes} and 3 {color,yellow,Incomplete Subjects}.\nIf you help me, I will give you a {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone} for the Secret Lab.\nI think it\'s a good reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Blue Magic Stone!!  Don\'t forget that promise!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me take a rest first.][2]          '),
(4285, 'Talyor, I defeated the monsters..\nYou said you would give me a Blue Magic Stone..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4286, 'Don\'t worry.\nHere is a {color,yellow, Blue Magic Stone}.  I\'m looking forward to your {color,yellow, adventures in the Secret Lab}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4287, 'The Blue Magic Stone is the key to the Secret Lab. \nYou will need it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4290, 'Blue Magic Stones 2'),
(4291, 'Taylor tells you he will give you Blue Magic Stone for the Secret Lab. \nHe wants you to defeat Mutant snake and Incomplete subject near Alberstol Ruins in return.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4292, '[NAME], do you remember my last request?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4293, 'The one you completed for the Blue Magic Stone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4294, 'Yes. \nI have the same request again. Can you to defeat 5 {color,yellow,Mutant snakes} and 5 {color,yellow,Incomplete Subjects}. Can you do that for me?\nI\'ll give you another {color,yellow,Blue Magic Stone}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Blue Magic Stone!!  Don\'t forget that promise!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me take a rest first.][2]'),
(4295, 'Talyor, I defeated the monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4296, 'Here it is.  I hope this helps. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4297, 'The Blue Magic Stone is the key to the Secret Lab. \nYou will need it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4320, 'Crystal Shortage! (Event Quest)'),
(4321, 'Blacksmith James in Roumen asks you to collect 100 Magic Infused Crystals for his new weapons!  \n(Magic Infused Crystals can be found by mining.)  \n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4322, 'Thirty-four... thirty-five... thirty-six...  \nOh, [NAME]! I didn\'t see you come into the shop. Say, now that you\'re here, would you mind doing me a favor? I could really use your help!  \n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Event)][1]  \n[MENU]'),
(4323, 'Well, I guess that all depends! What would you need me to do, James?  \n[NEXT]'),
(4324, 'You see, I\'ve recently been trying to create these new weapons-- ones that gather their strength from the skies above! Everything from the stars to the moon will be forged into these weapons, and they shall be my greatest work to date!  \n[NEXT]'),
(4325, 'That sounds great! However, I don\'t really see how I fit into all of this...  \n[NEXT]'),
(4326, 'Well, when you came to see me I was busy counting all of the supplies that I have. I seem to have all the tools I need and enough iron and steel, but something is still missing.  \n[NEXT]'),
(4327, 'I don\'t claim to know much about weapons, but what else could you need that you don\'t already have?  \n[NEXT]'),
(4328, 'It\'s something very mysterious that not many weaponsmiths know about! They\'re called Magic Infused Crystals and they can be found, well, pretty much everywhere!  \n[NEXT]'),
(4329, 'Oh! I think I see what you\'re trying to say, James!  \n[NEXT]'),
(4330, 'You do? That\'s great! You look like someone who would be up for a challenge, so what do you say? Can you collect {color,yellow,100 Magic Infused Crystals} for me? I would go out and gather them myself, but I have way too many orders to fill at the shop right now!  \n[BUTTON]=[These weapons sound great! Consider it done!][1]  \n[BUTTON]=[No thanks! I\'m busy!][2]'),
(4331, 'Blacksmith James! I\'ve traveled far and wide and now I return with {color,yellow,100 Magic Infused Crystals} for you! How are the weapons coming along?  \n[NEXT]'),
(4332, 'It\'s going great thanks to you, [NAME]! I knew I made the right choice when I sent you on this quest! While forging these weapons, some mysterious residue was left over. Take this strange and wonderful substance as your reward!  \n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]'),
(4333, 'Are you have any trouble finding those crystals? I sure hope not!\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4340, 'Meeting the Spirit Tribe'),
(4341, 'Adrian hopes to start a great relationship with the Spirit Tribe of the new land. \nDeliver Adrian\'s Message to Chief Kiera of the Spirit Tribe! \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4342, '[NAME], Welcome back!  Have you met them yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4343, 'What?  Who?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4344, 'Them!  The Spirits!  The Spirit Tribe!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4345, 'Oh... The Spirit Tribe.  I did meet them, although I was not able to speak with them ... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4346, 'I see.  Hmm... I guess only a few adventurers were able to reach that far.  Err... can you deliver this to Chief Kiera of the Spirit Tribe?\nIt is necessary for us to build a good relationship with them. \nIt would be beneficial for them, as well.  You should get going soon.\nPlease {color,yellow, deliver this message} to {color,yellow, Chief Kiera} of the Spirit Tribe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will.  Don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about going there yourself?][2]'),
(4347, 'Hello, Chief Kiera. \nI was sent by Chief Adrian of Uruga Village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4348, 'Chief Adrian?\nOh, from the Elf Tribe... I see.\nThank you, it must have been quite a trip to get here... \nPlease rest well in the village... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4349, 'Well, how did it go?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4350, 'Foolish Competition'),
(4351, 'Lord Elbama is looking for a way to contact the Spirit Tribe.\nDeliver Elbama\'s Letter to Chief Kiera of the Spirit Tribe. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4352, 'What took you so long?\nCome this way!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4353, 'Err... what?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4354, 'Oh, it\'s just that...\nHmm.  Did you know Adrian spoke with Kiera in the Town of the Spirit Tribe?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4355, 'Oh, Chief Kiera?\nSure, I delivered Adrian\'s message.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4356, 'You what!\nWhat did you do that for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4357, 'Um... Sorry?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4358, 'Apologies, I went too far.\nWhat I mean is you should let Adrian do her own work from time to time.\nCan you deliver this letter to Chief Kiera ?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it... but you will have to pay the price.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Give me 100 Gold.][2]'),
(4359, 'Err, hello, Chief Kiera... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4360, 'Welcome.\nWhat is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4361, 'I have another letter for you.\nThis time it\'s from Lord Elbama... The Lord of Elderine.\nHe asked me to deliver this to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4362, 'Hmm... \n(Reads the letter.)\nInteresting use of words, as usual.\n(Looks baffled.)\n...\n...\nHmm...\nWell, thank you for your time and effort.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4363, 'Hurry!  You have to at lease get there faster than Roumenus.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4370, 'Present in Disguise'),
(4371, 'Lord Elbama of Elderine has requested for you to deliver a present to Chief Kiera of the Spirit Tribe.\nYou have to deliver Elbama\'s Present to Chief Kiera of Alberstol.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4372, 'Haha! Welcome!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4373, '...What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4374, 'Don\'t make that face?  Here, come and take this!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4375, 'A present for me! Wait... it\'s not for me is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4376, 'Haha, of course not.\nTake this to Kiera of Alberstol.  Did she... send me a reply from the last time you saw her?\nWell, that\'s alright.\nPlease deliver this to Chief Kiera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure....][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it yourself.][2]'),
(4377, 'Err... excuse me.  Chief Kiera?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4378, 'Oh, you\'re back.  What is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4379, 'Lord Elbama asked me to deliver this gift.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4380, 'Him again?\n...\n(Opens the present.)\n... It\'s jewelry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4381, 'Oh... \n(I feel ashamed...)\n... \n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4382, 'What\'s wrong, [NAME].  You don\'t have to be embarrassed.\nThis must be his way of making friends.\nHe\'s a little different from Chief Adrian or Roumenus.\nOh by the way, Chief Roumenus made a visit himself.  Did you know?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4383, 'Take it at once.  Why are you standing there?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4390, 'I Will Make a Visit'),
(4391, 'Lord Elbama of Elderine is paying a visit to Alberstol, paperwork needs to be prepared for his visit. \nDeliver Elbama\'s Message to Kiera\'s Assistant, Taylor. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4392, 'Well?  Was there a reply to my present?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4393, 'Unfortunately I wasn\'t given one. May I suggest you not send anymore presents?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4394, 'Then I shall go there myself!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4395, 'Oh really?\nI see.  That actually might seem a little more sincere... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4396, 'When I make my friendly visit, they\'d better show me some respect. \nI don\'t always make personal appearances you know. \nYou, deliver this message to, hmm... Kiera\'s assistant! \nI can\'t think of Kiera\'s assistants name....  Is it{color,yellow, Taylor...}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.  I think thats it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Stop this nonsense!][2]'),
(4397, 'Greetings Taylor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4398, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4399, 'Err, this is from Lord Elbama of Elderine.\nOh, I\'m not a soldier, just an adventurer!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4384, 'I\'ll take the message.  Rest well in the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4385, 'No reply?  They have no moral decency.\nAre you still there?  How dare you eavesdrop on me! \n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4410, 'Alberstol, the Dying City of Spirits'),
(4411, 'Arriving in Alberstol, the City of Spirits.\nTalk to Taylor, the Assistant of Alberstol\'s Chief.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4412, 'Greetings Taylor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Epic Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4413, 'Do you have a business in the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4414, 'Nope, I don\'t have any requests today. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4415, 'Oh... I see.  Well, have you looked around the village?\nOh... I should serve you something, but I\'m not quite sure what... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4416, 'Oh, no worries!  I just had something, so I\'m full and feeling pretty strong. \nOh... I looked around the village and I get this feeling of uneasiness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4417, 'I have no doubt.\nThis city... is dying.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4418, 'What do you mean!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4419, 'This village is dying, literally.\nWe can\'t hide it no matter how hard we try.\nWe can\'t fix it either no matter how hard we work.  It is overwhelming just to maintain it at this state.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4420, 'I can\'t believe it.  The village is so beautiful... \nAlthough it has become a little barren around the outer perimeter... But reguardless it\'s still beautiful and magnificent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4421, 'The village is getting by for now.  There are many young spirits that are premature, they are barely starting to take form.\nWe gather vitality and pour sacred water on them every day to protect them.  However, we don\'t know how much longer we can do this... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4422, 'Why is the village dying?  I did see many strange monsters around... \nI haven\'t fought them yet, but is... is it because of them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4423, 'No no... it\'s not because of them.\nThey used to be our colleagues once...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4424, 'Colleagues!  What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4425, 'I have said too much.  Its is forbidden to speak about this to outsiders.\nI\'m sorry... I will be taking my leave now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Epic Quest][1]'),
(4426, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4430, 'The Nightmare of the Past'),
(4431, 'Kiera, Chief of Alberstol and the Spirit of the Gingko Tree.\nTalk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4432, '[NAME]!  May I speak to you for a minute?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4433, 'Me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4434, 'Yes, that\'s right.  I heard about you from Adrian and Roumenus.\nThey told me that you\'ve been a great help to them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4435, 'Oh, it was nothing much. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4436, 'The reason I have called you is to warn you about the many dangers you must prepared for. \nThe nightmare of the past... this land... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4437, 'Many dangers and the nightmare of the past?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4438, 'Yes, that\'s right, it was a nightmare. \nAh...\n(Sighs.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4439, 'Um, can you tell me about it?\nTaylor said... outsiders are frobbiden from knowing this information.\nI\'m with the Heneath Adventurers, I want to help you... if I can help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4440, '[NAME], you are...\n\nYes.... Maybe you could help us.\n{color,yellow,I will tell you about the nightmare of this land.}\n{color,yellow,That day was just an ordinary day.}\n{color,yellow,There was windstorms and pouring rain.}\n{color,yellow,Because the lives and trees of this land had deep, solid roots, they were not affected.}\nBut everything came after that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4441, 'What came after?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4442, 'It was time for the rain to stop and the thunderclouds to clear.\nHowever the dark clouds over the sky did not go away.\nAt that time, {color,yellow,someone came into the village.}\n{color,yellow,It was the spirit of a young flower that had barely gotten its wings.}\n(She continued with a troubled face.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4443, 'That spirit looked terrible. \nShe was completely dry, almost like ashes. \nShe barely made it back to the village to warn us.\nShe whispered to us, "Run..."\nThen, she was blown off as ashes and even before we could calm ourselves down, we heard the screams from someone else.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4444, 'That... can\'t be...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4445, '{color,yellow,The forest began to dry up at unearthly speeds.  Trees became ashes and the soil scorched.}\n{color,yellow,Small animals stopped silently and big ones perished howling in pain...}\n{color,yellow,Countless lives, deities, and spirits of small plants around this land were taken over by darkness to surrender their pure, precious lives...}\nIt happened all so quickly. \n\nHowever, {color,yellow,the five Elders who had survived for thousands of years ran out of the village to save the young spirits and everyone inside the village.}\nThey were born when trees and plants were created in this land.\n{color,yellow,They used the power creation to transform themselves into the Ancient Elements.}\n{color,yellow,Their powers turned into stone statues to shield the village from the dark energy.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4446, 'I see, so that\'s why...\nOh!\nI saw the stone statues around the village, they were once the Elders?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4447, 'Yes. \nThose statues are frozen forms of the Elders, although they had to fossilize as Ancient Elements... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4448, 'I feel terrible.\nI guess that\'s why you are working hard to preserve the trees and plants...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4449, 'Yes, we still have many things to protect.\nWe can\'t give up our children and colleagues.\nWe have to fight. against this unknown darkness.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4427, '.. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4460, 'Grumpy Marcudos 1'),
(4461, 'Blacksmith Marcudos doesn\'t have positive thoughts about humans and elves.\nHe also does not like adventurers that come to the village.\nYou have to get the History Book of Humans and Elves for him (Go to Adrian). \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4462, '...What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4463, 'Oh, hello.  I\'m [NAME].\nI heard you sell weapons... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4464, 'Get what you want and leave. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4465, '(Ouch, he\'s cold...)\nDo you have a problem with me... or something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4466, '... I don\'t like humans or elves.\nSo leave me alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4467, 'May I ask why you don\'t like us?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4468, '...You are persistent.\nFine, I\'ll tell you.\nI don\'t like humans because they destroy things and eat meat and I don\'t like elves because they work with humans.  OK?  Now leave me alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4469, 'But you don\'t know everything about us!\nHave you ever talked to humans or elves?!\nLet me tell you about the past of humans and elves!  Hmm, I should get you a history book!\nThen you\'d be able to understand humans and elves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4470, 'I\'m not interested.\n...But I wouldn\'t mind reading a history book. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it right away!  Wait for me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmph, fine.  You won\'t like it anyway.][2]'),
(4471, 'Ugh!  I\'m exhausted.\nChief Adrian!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4472, 'Oh?  Why are you so overworked... what is it?\nAre you coming from Alberstol?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4473, 'Yes, I am.  Phew...  Let me catch my breath.\nOh, Chief Adrian, there is a man called Marcudos.\nHe really hates humans and elves. \nSo I was wondering if you have a history book about humans and elves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4474, 'I see... A history book is what you seek?  I\'m keeping the original copy of the history book.\nHmm... I can\'t give you the original and the copy is... oh Roumenus took it.\nI lent it to him few days ago.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4475, '... Why?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4480, 'Grumpy Marcudos 2'),
(4481, 'Retrieve Chief Adrian\'s History Book from Chief Roumenus.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4482, 'You can retrieve my book from Chief Roumenus.\nYou don\'t have to check back in with me again after you get it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4483, 'Oh!  [NAME]!  Long time no see.\nSo, what is it that you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4484, 'Greetings!  I heard that you borrowed a History Book from Chief Adrian.\nCan you lend it to me?  I need it...\nI told Chief Adrian about it and she said I could use it when you were done with it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4485, 'Oh, History Book?  I just finished it.\nYou can take it and bring it back to Chief Adrian when you\'re done.\nHere, take it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4486, '?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4490, 'Grumpy Marcudos 3'),
(4491, 'Take the History Book from Chief Roumenus to Marcudos.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4492, 'Here, you can take it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4493, 'Excuse me!  Marcudos!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4494, 'Aye, what... You again?\nWhat is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4495, 'This is the history book I told you about!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4496, '...History Book?  Oh, that... \nHmm, I didn\'t expect you to bring it... Well, I guess I can take a look at it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4497, 'No... You have to read it.  Promise!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4498, 'What are you still doing here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4510, 'Grumpy Marcudos 4'),
(4511, 'Bring the book from Marcudos back to Chief Adrian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4512, 'Marcudos!  Have you read the book?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4513, '...Yes, I finished it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4514, 'Really?  So, did you change your mind?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4515, '... I did learn a few things that I hadn\'t known before reading the book... but it doesn\'t change my mind.\nI still dislike humans and elves.\nSo... take this worthless history book out of my sight.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4516, '...Hew.\nIsn\'t there a way to change how Marcudos thinks?\nHmm... let\'s take this book back to Chief Adrian. \nOh... Chief Adrian might have an idea.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4517, 'Chief!  I\'m back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4518, 'Oh, [NAME].  This is a good time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4519, 'Chief!  Oh, here\'s your book... \nI have an issue.\nMarcudos, the Weaponsmith in Alberstol... Hates humans and elves because they destroy....\nHmm, wouldn\'t there be a way to help Marcudos understand humans and elves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4520, 'Hmm... \nI see.\nIn fact, elves had a problem understanding humans at first.\nBecause elves don\'t eat meat, we had a major conflict with humans that harmed life\'s balance.\nBut we overcame everything and we made a firm bond of alliance.\nI\'m sure... \nThere is a way we can make alliance with them. \nI\'ll give it a thought.\nIf I get a good idea, I\'ll let you know, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[NEXT]'),
(4521, 'Go back. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4530, 'Young Rell\'s Tears 1'),
(4531, 'Rell never forgot about the fire spirit Shella that used to give her warm energy when she was young. \nHowever, Fire Spirit Shella has become a horrible monster that wanders around Alberstol.\nDefeat 30 Fire Shellas for Rell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4532, '(Sobbing)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4533, 'Huh?\n(She\'s crying..)\nLady... are you OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4534, '(Sobbing) Huh?\nLady? \nI\'m not a lady!\n(Yells!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4535, 'Oh...!\nSorry!\nI apologize!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4536, '(Sobbing) My name is Rell... Not lady!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4537, 'Oh, ok... Rell. \nI\'m sorry, I was worried because you were crying.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4538, '(Sobbing) I wasn\'t crying.\nAnd when you see a girl cry, you should just leave her alone.  That\'s etiquette!\nHmph, why are you here?  You need to store something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4539, 'Haha, No.  I don\'t need storage.\nI was just worried because you were crying. \nI was wondering if I could help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4540, 'Help.\nIt\'s too late for that.\nShella has already lost its heart...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4541, 'Shella?  Are you talking about... TheFire Shellas around the village?\nOh, they are very powerful...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4542, 'Yes.  Fire Shella has become a monster.\nIt used to be a lovable spirit.\nHey, did you say you wanted to help me?  Then, {color,yellow,defeat some Fire Shellas for me.}\nAnd you better make it quick and painless. Do you think you can defeat {color,yellow,30} of them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, I don\'t know why, but OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Fire Shella is very scary. ][2]'),
(4543, 'They give off a lot of heat and I almost got caught in the fire. \nOh!  Rell!  I defeated the Fire Shellas for you.\nUm... but you don\'t look happy. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4544, 'Well, thank you.\nYou can leave now...\n(Sobbing)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4545, 'Leave now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4560, 'Young Rell\'s Tears 2'),
(4561, 'Rell never forgot about the fire spirit Shella that used to give her warm energy when she was young. \nHowever, Fire Spirit Shella has become a horrible monster that wanders around Alberstol.\nDefeat 40 Fire Shellas for Rell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4562, 'Oh!  Rell!  You are not crying today. \nHow do you feel?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4563, '(Looks unkindly)\nI don\'t cry all the time!\nGo away if you don\'t need storage.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4564, 'Hey.  I know you were crying\na minute ago. I was just checking on you.\nDo you feel pity for Shella?\nIt\'s not good to cry all the time.  Your tears would only make someone else sad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4565, '...\nDon\'t talk like you know everything.\nI know that too... \nBut... \nI don\'t have the power to let Shella rest in peace... \n\n[BUTTON]=[I do.  I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Then, just go back to weeping.][2]'),
(4566, 'Rell!  I defeated more Shellas for you.\nEven though it was a very violent fight... Shella will be able to sleep in peace someday.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4567, '\nYes... \nThank... you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4568, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4570, 'Red Ashes'),
(4571, 'Kiera\'s Assistant Taylor has doubts about Heneath Allies, but heard from Rell that an adventurer helped her.\nYou have to get 30 Red Ashes from the Fire Taitans for Taylor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4572, 'Hello, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4573, 'Oh, Taylor? \nHow are you?  It\'s a nice day.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4574, 'Yes.  Alberstol is always sunny and clear. \nOh.... I heard that you helped Rell a while ago. \nI must repay you for that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4575, 'No, it\'s not a debt.\nI just wanted to help her... \nRell seemed very emotional and vulnerable.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4576, 'Yes... I know.  She used to be very bright and happy... \nBut she cries often since she lost Shella.\nI always feel sorry for her... I don\'t know how to thank you for trying to help her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4577, 'Don\'t worry about it... It was nothing.\nI hope you can treat me with ease.  I want to be a friend.\nI\'m in debt to the hospitality of this village... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4578, 'Oh... \nThanks.\nWell, actually... I have a favor to ask you... \nWould it be possible for you to help me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4579, 'Oh, of course.  I\'ll do whatever I can to help you out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4580, 'Really \nHmm, Rell... told me that you can defeat Fire Shellas.\nThen, can you defeat the Fire Taitan as well? \nIf you can, I was hoping if you could get me 30 Red Ashes.\nYou could get Red Ashes by defeating Fire Taitans.\nCan you do it for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Red Ashes?  Hmm, I could give it a try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Err, I\'m still afraid of Taitan.][2]'),
(4581, 'Taylor!  I got 30 Red Ashes!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4582, 'Oh... \nI\'ve been waiting for you.\nYou are... Great and fast... \nHmm.\nOh, I\'ll tell you about the ashes.\nWhen the Fire Taitans turned into monsters, it lost its original form and became evil. \nSince then, it has been burning trees and plants into black ashes... \nWhat\'s even worse is when they burn the trees and plants it produces Red Ashes. The Red Ashes are harmful to the soil that no life can grow there ever again.\n... It\'s such a tragedy.\nWe are looking for a way to detoxify the Red Ashes.\nThank you so much for your help. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4583, '... Red Ashes are horrible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4590, 'Brothers of Fire 1'),
(4591, 'You met Fire Spirit Paella.\nShe is angry that all of her brothers have gone insane, but she is actually very sad.\nYou have to bring her "Shella\'s Fire" and "Taitan\'s Fire" from Fire Shella and Fire Taitan.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4592, 'It\'s you, the man who is troubling Alberstol.\nI can\'t even tell if you are human... or elf... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4593, '(Insulted)\nAhem!  I have never troubled the town. \nI\'m actually a very quiet person. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4594, 'You are loud.  Even your coughing is loud.  Hmph.\nSince you\'re troublesome, do me a favor as an apology.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4595, 'Err... Huh?  A favor?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4596, 'You know the Fire Spirits... right?  The ones you enjoyed defeating.\nAll of them... were my brothers once.\nAlthough they have gone insane now... \nYou know what I\'m saying?  My brothers are insane.\nBut there\'s nothing we can do.  I just want to cherish the happy memories that I had with them.\nPlease bring me their Fire.  Get me {color,yellow,10 Shella\'s Fires} and {color,yellow,10 Taitan\'s Fire}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No!  Why should I?!][2]'),
(4597, 'Oh, Paella!  Here is the Fire.\nStrangely, it\'s not hot at all!?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4598, 'Of course not.  They are... no longer fire spirits.\n... Give it to me.\nSo I can recall my memories... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4599, '... Why are you standing there like a fool?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4610, 'Brothers of Fire 2'),
(4611, 'You met Fire Spirit Paella.\nShe is angry that all of her brothers have gone insane, but she is actually very sad.\nShe asks you to defeat 30 Fire Shellas and 30 Fire Taitan.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4612, 'Hey!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4613, 'Err?  Oh... Um, hey...  My name is not \'Hey\', it\'s [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4614, 'Hey or [NAME]...  That doesn\'t matter!\nAnyways, ahem...\nThank you for helping with the last task but\nI have another favor to ask from you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4615, 'Ah... (Giggles)\nAh, ahem.\nI\'ll hear you out first.\nThen I\'ll make my decision.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4616, 'Just say yes like a man!  Don\'t be childish. \nGo out and defeat some Shellas and Taitans.\nI\'m sure it\'s like hell for them to remain on this land.\nThey have to burn their loved ones for all eternity.  Don\'t you feel sorry for them?\nI can\'t do it myself.\nThey used to... have a happy time with me.\nSo, you do it for me.\n{color,yellow, Defeat 30 Fire Shellas and 30 Fire Taitans.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.  It\'s my special treat for you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hmph, I don\'t want to.  You are arrogant!][2]'),
(4617, 'Paella!  I defeated 30 Fire Shellas and 30 Fire Taitan.\nBut my clothes have been blackened in the process.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4618, '... Good job.\nYour clothes won\'t be a problem.  Clean up.\nSniff... Sniff...\nYou do smell a little, though.  Go away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4619, 'What are you doing?\nAre you leaving or not?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4620, 'Don\'t Be Fooled by the Looks 1'),
(4621, 'Alca is a beautiful spirit of water and a monster.  Many adventurers have been fooled by her beauty.\nWorried, Alberstol\'s Healer Runadilla asks you to defeat 30 of these monsters called Alca.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4622, 'Oh, hello..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4623, 'Hello!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4624, 'The entire town of Alberstol is excited to tell your story.  \nI heard you are very kind and brave as well. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4625, 'Well, I\'m flattered... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4626, 'Ah, I hope everyone is as strong as you.\nEven the strong ones can be easily defeated when they are easily enticed. \nThese days... we have an increasing number of adventurers who travel to the village because they are enticed by the beauty of Water Alca, who was the spirit of water once.\nPhew... I\'m so busy treating those adventurers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can take care of Water Alca!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s funny.][2]'),
(4627, 'Runadilla!  I defeated some of the monsters called Water Alca!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4628, 'Im glad you are safe!  I was worried you might get hurt, [NAME]... \nAre you really safe?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4629, 'Please be safe... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4630, 'Don\'t Be Fooled by the Looks 2'),
(4631, 'Alberstol\'s Healer Runadilla asks you to defeat the monster Baridon that entices adventurers with beautiful looks and attacks with a powerful Magic Ball.\nYou have to defeat 40 of the monster Water Baridon and 40 of the monster Water Alca.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4632, 'Oh, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4633, 'Runadilla!  How are you?  Are you still busy with wounded adventurers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4634, 'Umm, oh... yes.  It\'s even worse...  There\'s Water Baridons, too... \nSo I have even more patients. \nI think the monsters are multiplying faster.\nWhat should I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will take care of both Alca and Baridon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can take Alca, but I can\'t take Baridon... ][2]'),
(4635, '(Panting) I\'m back. \nWow... Now that was a hard task... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4636, 'Oh... I guess you are not seriously injured, though.  Take some rest to recover. \nDo you want a potion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4637, 'Cheer up!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4640, 'Geric\'s Crystal Ball'),
(4641, 'Alberstol\'s Item Merchant Geric is a very quiet and polite man.\nHe lost a Crystal Ball that he received from Kiera while gathering pollen outside the village. \nYou have to find Geric\'s Crystal Ball.\n(A blue monster is your clue.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4642, 'Excuse me!  I\'m here to buy some items!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4643, 'Oh!  Oh, yes... welcome.\n[NEXT]'),
(4644, '(Why does he look so out of mind?)\nErr, are you OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4645, 'Ah..\nOops!  Sorry.  I didn\'t realize you are my customer... what do you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4646, 'Oh, well, I don\'t need anything in particular, but I just want to see if you have anything good in your shop.\nBut...  I guess you have something else going on that is more important...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4647, 'Oh yeah...  Sorry.\nI lost something important while gathering pollen outside the village few days ago...\nI got it from Kiera... \nOh, are you [NAME] that Kiera was talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4648, 'Yep, that\'s me.  I\'m surprised so many of you know my name.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4649, 'Oh, it is you.\nErr... then... I\'m sorry to ask you this, but could you get it for me?\nIt\'s a clear Crystal Ball...  It\'s a Crystal Ball that has been shined by the dew of a 1,000-year-old cedar tree...\nI saw a blue monster nearby.  I got really scared, so I ran back to the village.  I didn\'t know I dropped my ball while running back.\nIt was a blue monster... but I don\'t know what it was...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Blue monster?  Hmm, I think I know what it is!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wasn\'t it a Smurf?][2]'),
(4660, 'Geric!  I got your ball!\nIsn\'t this it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4661, 'Yes, this.. Is it!  You really found it.  Thank you.\nI don\'t know how I will ever repay you...\nThank you so much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4662, 'How could I lose the precious gift of Kiera...? \nI\'m so ashamed of myself...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4670, 'Damaged Storage '),
(4671, 'Storage Keeper Rell was shocked by the attack of violent bears a while ago.\nYou have to gather 40 pieces of Fine Firewood to repair Rell\'s Damaged Storage.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4672, 'Oh, thank you for the help last time.\nThanks for getting back at those bears for me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4673, 'Oh, haha.  Rell!  How are you?\nYou don\'t look fully recovered... \nHuh?  Your storage is damaged?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4674, 'Yes.\nWhen the bears ran towards me... I barely escaped, but the storage was damaged.\nI don\'t know how long it would take to fix this...\nFurthermore, there is almost no usable wood around here.  I\'m so sad.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can get wood for you!  About 40 pieces of Fine Firewood...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry.][2]'),
(4675, '..Rell!!  I got the wood for you!\nThere\'s not much wood in Alberstol, but there is wood in other villages.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4676, 'Hmm, thank you.\nAlthough it\'s your job as an adventurer in the village... \nHmm, good job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4677, 'What are you looking at?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4680, 'Fearful Magrite Cult 1'),
(4681, 'Uruga\'s Chief Adrian is investigating a cult called Magrite that is quickly spreading.\nYou have to help her investigate the \'Magrite Cult\', a horrible group that makes ordinary people become berserk and evil monsters.\n(Investigate the Magrite Summoner.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4682, '{color,yellow,<Villager 1>}\nChief, my daughter... my daughter, Mina, hasn\'t come back!!\n{color,yellow,<Villager 2>}\nMy youngest hasn\'t come back, either!  He went out late last night and there still is no sign of him!!\n\n{color,yellow,<Adrian>}\nPlease calm down first.  Hmm... so, three have gone missing so far.  Have we have looked around the village? \nWe should also contact Elderine and Roumen.\nHave you asked everyone in the village about the whereabouts of these kids?\n\n{color,yellow,<Villager 3>}\nErr... Chief.\nActually, I saw something suspicious... I saw Pellora, the lady who moved in last week..., pack up and leave the village in a hurry late last night.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4683, 'Chief Adrian?  Where you looking for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4684, 'Oh! [NAME]!!  You\'re here!\nIt\'s urgent.  Many villagers have gone missing in Uruga.\nFurthermore, I think it\'s also happening in Elderine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4685, 'Missing...?  Weren\'t they attacked by monsters...?\nCould it be the Magicians of Karasian?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4686, 'No, it\'s not them for sure.\nKarasian is not interested in villagers.  Also... it\' very well-organized and strange.\nOh, I heard that all of the people who have gone missing are interested in a new religion. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4687, 'A new religion?  Do you think they are enticed by a cult?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4688, 'Hmm, I think that would be our best guess.\nWhat is strange is that most cults require members to bring money or jewelry...  But nothing has been taken from the missing people. \nIt\'s like they disappeared all of a sudden... as if they are kidnapped. \nThere was a lady in Roumen who called herself \'Gloria Elderina of Elderine\' and she was expelled by Roumenus.\nIt\'s somewhat different from that case...  It seems more dangerous than that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4689, 'Hmm, I think we should focus on finding the missing and check out that new religious group. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4690, 'Yes.  We have investigated Uruga, Roumen, and Elderine. \nThe only remaining area is Alberstol..., the road to Kahalzar Mountains... \nWe can\'t get to that area because of the dangerous monsters.\nCan you help us, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  I\'ll look around Alberstol area.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[...I\'m still at a low level.][2]'),
(4691, 'Chief Adrian!  I discovered this amulet that was dropped by a strange monsters!\n{color,yellow,It says \'Magrite\'.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4692, 'Magrite?  Hmm, it\'s an amulet written with monster blood.\nIt\'s also very... evil. \nI can\'t believe it!  This amulet... is very similar to what I saw at the base of the Karasian Magic Group a few years ago!\nOh, thank you anyways.  I think I should do some research about this amulet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4693, 'I think I saw strange monsters near Alberstol. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4710, 'Fearful Magrite Cult 2'),
(4711, 'Uruga\'s Chief Adrian asks you to further investigate the monsters near the Alberstol area.  \nCollect information from the Spirit Tribe in Alberstol. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4712, 'I think they sneaked into Alberstol.\nCan you investigate the cult named \'Magrite\'?\nThe Spirit Tribe in Alberstol would know when they emerged in that area.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4713, 'OK, Chief.  You can count on me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Taylor in Alberstol.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[(What should I do now?)][2]'),
(4714, 'Hello, Taylor.\nThere\'s something I want to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4715, 'Oh, yes, [NAME].  Anything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4716, 'Thank you.\nHmm, I saw monsters from \'Magrite Cult\'  near Alberstol, like the Magrite summoners... Also saw Magrite Imps and Magrite Honeyings.\nDo you know, by any chance, when these monsters first appeared in this area?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4717, 'Magrite Cult...\nI haven\'t seen them myself and I don\'t know what they are because they don\'t come near the village. \nI\'m sure it\'s a very strange group, though...\nOh, I think Marcudos has encountered them... \nYou could get some information from Marcudos.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4718, 'Oh!  I see.  Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4719, '..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4720, 'Fearful Magrite Cult 3'),
(4721, 'Chief Adrian in Uruga asks you to further investigate the monsters near the Alberstol area.  \nCollect information from the Spirit Tribe in Alberstol for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4722, 'I believe Marcudos has spoken with them before. \nPerhaps you can try talking to him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4723, 'Ok, Chief!  You can count on me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Marcudos in Alberstol.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s take a rest for now.][2]'),
(4724, 'Marcudos? Errr, excuse me...\n(I hope he can\'t tell how nervous I am!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4725, 'Hm? Who is it?\nWhat are you doing here?  What do you want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4726, 'Err, well... the thing is...\n(He seems really annoyed by me already. Will he even answer my question?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4727, 'I was wondering if you know anything about the Magrite Cult.\nTaylor mentioned that you might know something... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4728, 'Magrite Cult, you say? Hmph!\nAre you talking about those despicable monsters?\nThey\'re everywhere! Magrite Imps, Magrite Honeyings, Magrite Prophets, Magrite Summoner... there are so many different kinds!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4729, '(Eep! I wish he wouldn\'t yell...)\nYeah, that sounds right! I think I heard that they kidnapped some villagers...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4730, 'Kidnapped villagers?\nWell, it certainly wouldn\'t surprise me if they did do that.\nEnough about those awful creatures! I don\'t want to talk about them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4731, 'But... but, please! You must listen to me.\nYou don\'t want those terrible creatures to continue harassing the village, do you?\nI\'m doing this to save the villagers!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4732, 'Hmph! I don\'t care.\nI\'ve told you all that I care to on that particular subject.\nNow leave me be!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4733, 'Was Marcudos able to tell you anything helpful?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4740, 'Fearful Magrite Cult 4'),
(4741, 'Chief Adrian in Uruga asks you to further investigate the monsters near the Alberstol area.  \nCollect information from the Spirit Tribe in Alberstol for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4742, 'You really don\'t get it, do you? Enough about the Magrites! I\'m sick of talking about them. I\'ve told everything I know to Geric, maybe you could go pester him about it.\nNow scram!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4743, 'Ok, ok! I\'m leaving.\n(Jeez... how rude!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Geric.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s take a rest for now.][2]'),
(4744, 'Err... are you Geric?\nI have a question for you. Marcudos said that you might know something about the Magrites.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4745, 'Oh, yes. I do.\nMarcudos has told me a little bit about that horrible group before.\nI\'ll tell you everything I know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4746, 'Oh, that would be great!\nSo... where to begin...\nCan you tell me when they first moved here? And what do they usually do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4747, 'Oh, I can answer that!  It was about... let me think. Four months ago, I believe. \nThere were only few of them at first, but there seem to be more of them every day.\nSome of them stumble around like zombies...  they appear to be humans, but they behave like monsters. It was very strange when I finally saw them. \nLuckily they didn\'t bother me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4748, 'Hm... I guess that means they don\'t cause any harm to the Spirit Tribe. \nCan you tell me anything else?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4749, 'I remember that sometimes they would begin acting like crazed maniacs, yelling that they need to find something. They would dig up the ground or yell at someone to bring them what they needed.\nIt seemed like they were addicted to something...\nOh, some of them would form groups and travel somewhere when the sun had gone down. To where, I do not know.\nI wish I could give you more information, but that is all I have to say.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4760, 'Hmph! Leave me be!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4770, 'Fearful Magrite Cult 5'),
(4771, 'Chief Adrian in Uruga asks you to further investigate the monsters near the Alberstol area.  \nCollect information from the Spirit Tribe in Alberstol for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4772, 'I have given you all the information I have about the Magrites.\nIf I happen to learn anything new, I\'ll let you know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4773, 'Oh, thank you! You\'ve been very helpful.\nI should be heading back now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s head back to Uruga!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s take a rest for now.][2]'),
(4774, '[NAME]! I\'ve been waiting! I was worried that something might have happened to you. Did you find out any information?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4775, 'As a matter of fact I did! Although, I believe I need to confront them myself in order to know exactly how they function.\nWell, According to the members of the Spirit Tribe, they\'re very similar to the undead.\nThey say they appear to be human, yet they act like monsters.\nThey also roam around like addicts, yelling at people to give them something... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4776, 'Act like the undead? Addicted to something? This may be worse than I thought...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4777, 'He also told me that they don\'t seem to bother the Spirit Tribe. In fact, they don\'t even come near the village in Alberstol.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4778, 'Hm, I see. I think I know what\'s going on here.\nI\'ll begin organizing a search team to look for the kidnapped villagers.\nI will need to ask the people of Elderine and Roumen for help, although I don\'t know if Elbama will be cooperative.\nI\'ll need your help, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4779, 'Oh, you are here.  What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4780, 'Magrite\'s Cruelty'),
(4781, 'Chief Adrien in Uruga believes that she has figured out what is happening with the Magrites.\nListen to Adrien explain her findings.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4782, 'I think I finally found out some more information about the Magrites.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4783, 'Really? What did you learn, Adrian?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4784, 'We found Mina, one of the kidnapped villagers. Unfortunately we could not find anyone else.\nShe can\'t even talk to express herself anymore.\nIf I didn\'t know any better, I would almost say that\'s she\'s not human anymore... but an undead shell with a living heart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4785, 'That\'s unbelievable! What could have caused her to become like that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4786, 'The Magrites, of course.\nMagrite, the leader of Magrites, is the new name for the cult leader who was in Roumen.\nI think she is working with Karasian.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4787, 'With Karasian?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4788, 'Yes, Karasian. People have told me that she can be very charming.\nWith her persuasion, a sane man would dive headfirst into a fire... or so I\'ve heard.\nShe entices people with her charm and urges them to drink \'Dark Juice\' that she made with Karasian.\nThis juice is very potent, but it needs to be drunk on the regular basis in order for it to be effective. It won\'t effect the victim\'s mental stability for a couple of days at first.\nShe gathers believers at her base and gives out the juice regularly until they are addicted and can\'t bear to live without it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4789, 'That\'s horrible...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4790, 'Once someone is addicted, it takes a long time for them to recover.\nWhen {color,yellow,they are addicted to that juice, they listen only to Magrite and are willing to sacrifice their lives to fulfill her orders.}\nWhen we found Mina she... assaulted one of the guards with a sword. Under the direct orders from Magrite, no doubt!\nWe were able to catch her alive because it hadn\'t been long since she got addicted, but I fear the others may not be so lucky.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4791, 'I... I can\'t believe it.\nIt\'s so cruel! How could they just turn living people into undead slaves like that?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4792, 'Far to many people have already fallen prey to Magrite\'s schemes. We must protect the others from becoming her next victims.\nWe now have to focus on conquering these Magrites and stopping them once and for all.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4793, 'I\'m not done yet... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4810, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4811, 'Town Chief Roumenus of Roumen has organized the Magrite Conquest Army.\nHelp the cause and defeat 20 Magrite Summoners Imp, 20 Magrite Summoner Honeying.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4812, 'Oh, [NAME]!\nThank goodness you\'re here. Have you heard about the Magrite Conquest Army?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4813, 'Magrite Conquest Army? Well, I did hear some rumors about you organizing some sort of retalliation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4814, 'Oh, you must join the army! We could sure use someone like you to help us.\n{color,yellow, Magrite Summoners Imp}, {color,yellow, Magrite Summoners Honeying} won\'t be a problem for you, right?  Let\'s kill of them! That would be a good start, I think.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course! I can take it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nope, not today!][2]'),
(4815, 'I\'m back, Roumenus! Wasn\'t that fast?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4816, 'Oh, very fast indeed! The rest of the army isn\'t even back from battle yet.\nWell done, [NAME]! Please take your reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4817, 'This is going to be a long battle... but I know we can win!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4820, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4821, 'Skill Master Ruby of Roumen has joined the Magrite Conquest Army.\nDefeat Magrite Summoners Imp and collect 30 Magrite Amulets.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4822, 'You don\'t scare me, Magrite... let\'s see what you\'ve got!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4823, 'Oh, Ruby! Where are you off to? You look fully armed...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4824, 'I\'m going to join the Magrite Conquest Army, of course! Haven\'t you heard of them?\nYou should come with me, [NAME]! They could sure use the help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4825, 'I was already planning on helping, actually.\nAre you off to capture the Magrite Summoners Imp?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4826, 'That\'s right! Say... why don\'t we turn this into a fun little game, shall we?\nAs you capture Magrite Summoners Imp, you will collect \'Magrite Amulets\'.\nLet\'s see... how about the first to collect 30 amulets wins! What do you say?\n\n[BUTTON]=[You\'ve got a deal, Ruby! I can\'t wait to win!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s Ok. You go on ahead.][2]'),
(4827, 'Whew, I\'ve collected all 30 amulets! How did I do? Did I win?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4828, 'Wow, really?\nI ran out of health stones after only 20 amulets! Oh well...\nIt looks like you\'re the winner, [NAME]! Here is your reward for all of your hard work.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4829, 'I\'ve already started collecting amulets! You better catch up, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4830, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4831, 'Roumen\'s Blacksmith James has also joined Magrite Conquest Army!\nHe is asking you to defeat 35 Magrite Cult Followers.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4832, 'Hey!  Long time no see, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4833, 'It\'s good to see you again, James!\nI heard that you\'ve joined the Magrite Conquest Army?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4834, 'Of course I did! I might be old, but I\'m just as strong as you!\nWe should work together. Do you want to help capture Magrite Cult Followers with me?\nYou must remember to never show mercy when dealing with these poor creatures... they aren\'t human anymore.\nThe moment you show any pity, they will attack you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, James! Only 35? Maybe it should be more...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know, I think I\'m just to sympathetic...][2]'),
(4835, 'I\'m back, James! I\'ve killed all 35 of those guys too.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4836, 'Already? Wow, that was fast!\nI killed only 30 of them and I\'m aching all over. Maybe I am getting old after all...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4837, 'Let\'s go, [NAME]! We\'ve got some Magrite Cult Followers to kill!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4840, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4841, 'Guard Captain Shutian has also organized a Magrite Conquest Army in Elderine.\nHelp Shutian and defeat 50 Magrite Cult Followers.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4842, 'Hey, [NAME]! Come over here!\nWould you be interested in joining my Magrite Conquest Army?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4843, 'Of course, Shutian! Sign me up!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4844, 'Haha, I knew you would say that! Such energy you have!\nWe need lots of help... Elderine has had nearly forty people fall to the Margrite cult!\nThe cult followers are even attacking children and senior citizens... the entire city is saddened by all of this madness.\nWe must take action, [NAME]! Let\'s go kill 50 of these Magrite Cult Followers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You\'ve got it, Shutian!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What! 50?! No way!][2]'),
(4845, 'I\'m... I\'m back, Shutian! That sure wasn\'t easy. \n(Whew! I hope he doesn\'t hear how hard I\'m panting...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4846, 'Now is not the time to complain, soldier! We still have a long road ahead of us.\nBe proud of the great job you\'ve done. Here is your reward!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4847, 'Let\'s get those Magrite Cult Followers and save Elderine!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4880, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4881, 'Skill Master Deikid in Elderine has also taken up arms against the Magrite cult.\nHelp Deikid to defeat 50 Magrite Cult Prophet.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4882, 'Oh, [NAME]! How have you been?\nI can\'t wait to get out there and conquer some of those awful Magrites!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4883, 'Me either, Deikid! I\'ve joined the Magrive Conquest Army.\nAre you going join, too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4884, 'Of course I am! I couldn\'t let an opportunity like this pass me by!\nHowever, if we\'re to prevent others from turning into victims we need to move fast.\nHave you fought the Magrite Cult Prophet yet? What awful creatures!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4885, 'They sound really dangerous...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4886, 'They are, but we must do what needs to be done! What do you say?\n{color,yellow,Let\'s go and defeat 50 Magrite Cult Prophet!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir! I\'m on it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What if I get addicted? I don\'t know about this...][2]'),
(4887, 'Blegh! Those Magrite Cult Prophets spit all over me!\nHow disgusting...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4888, 'You must watch out for them, [NAME]! \nThey are amongst the strongest of the Magrites. They\'ll show no mercy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4889, 'I\'m ready, [NAME]! Let\'s go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4890, 'Conquer Magrite! '),
(4891, 'Weapon Title Merchant Bran in Elderine has also vowed to fight against the Magrites!\nHelp him collect 30 vials of \'Dark Juice\' from the Magrite Cult Prophets .\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4892, 'Oh, [NAME]! I was just thinking about you!\nThese magrites are terrible... Have you joined the army yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4893, 'Of course I did! I\'m always ready to eliminate some dangerous monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4894, 'Haha, same here! I couldn\'t stand by and let everyone else have all the fun.\nDo you want to join me on my next mission?\nWe need to defeat the Magrite Cult Prophets and collect the \'Dark Juice\' that they carry.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  Let\'s go!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Uh, you go on ahead without me.][2]'),
(4895, 'I\'m back, Bran! I\'ve brought all of that strange juice you wanted...\nUgh, it smells terrible!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4896, 'Wow, you\'re not joking! And the color is just awful too.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4897, 'What are you still doing here? You have a mission!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4920, 'Spirit of the Extreme 1'),
(4921, 'Alberstol\'s Spirit Paella still has hope for Fire Spirit.\nCollect 10 Flames from Fire Shellas and 10 Warter Drops from Water Alcas.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4922, 'Hey, [NAME]! How have you been lately?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4923, 'Oh, Paella! I\'ve been good, you know... questing and stuff.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4924, 'Oh, that\'s perfect! You wouldn\'t happen to be avaliable for a little mission right now, would you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4925, 'Well, I guess that depends. What do you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4926, 'You seem to have some time on your hands.  Ahem.\nI\'m checking those spirits that have gone berserk to see if they still have any extreme attributes.\nCan you help me?\n{color,yellow,Collect 10 Fire Shella\'s Flame and 10 Water Alca\'s Water Drops.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, OK.  I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m busy.  Do it yourself.][2]'),
(4927, 'I\'m back, Paella! I\'ve collected everything you asked me to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4928, 'Oh, good! Took you long enough.\nI won\'t make you work without a reward, so please take this.\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4929, 'Were my directions not clear?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4930, 'Spirit of the Extreme 2'),
(4931, 'Alberstol\'s Spirit Paella still has hope for the Fire Spirit.\nCollect 10 Fire Taitan Flames and 10 of the Water Baradon\'s Droplets.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4932, 'Hmmm. This isn\'t looking good, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4933, 'Oh? How is your research going, Paella?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4934, 'Well, I haven\'t really come to any conclusive result yet. \nI need more items to analyze! Can you collect {color,yellow,10 Fire Taitan Flames and 10 of the Water Baradon\'s Droplets}?\nYou\'re not too busy for that, are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No, not really. I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should\'ve asked me before. I\'m busy! I\'m always busy!!][2]'),
(4935, 'Here you go, Paella! These things were definitely easier to handle this time around.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4936, 'I see that! You were much faster this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4937, 'My research is very important! I need to continue immediately.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4940, 'You Are Not a Child Anymore 1'),
(4941, 'Rick has run away from home, and needs you to deliver a letter to his father.\nBring the letter to the merchant Maxuter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4942, 'Hey, you! Over here!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4943, 'Oh, Hi.\nUh, at the risk of sounding rude... Do I know you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4944, 'Haha, of course not!\nThere\'s no way you could know me. I\'m new here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4945, 'I see. So... Can I help you with something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4946, 'You do look really stong, so I think I could use your help!\nI\'m {color,yellow,\'Rick\'}, and it\'s nice to meet you! You better remember my name too! I\'ll be the best merchant in Isya someday.\nYou might think I look like someone familar, and well... you\'re right.\n{color,yellow,My father is the famous merchant, Maxuter}, but I\'m determined to make a name for myself on my own! I don\'t need his help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4947, '(Wow, he\'s rather talkative!)\nOh, I see. I\'m [NAME], and it\'s nice to meet you too.\nErr, so... how do you want me to help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4948, 'Let me tell you something first. I wanted to quit school and start my  own business, but my father told me to go to school for 2 more years.\nSo... I ran away! I mean, I\'m 18 years old already! I think I\'m old enough to start my own business, don\'t you?\nBut when I ran away, I forgot to leave a note... my father must be so worried right now! \nI was hoping you might be able to take this letter to him, I just want him to know that I\'m safe.\nDo you think you could help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, since you\'re Maxuter\'s son... Ok.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Your runaway letter? I don\'t even want to think about it.][2]'),
(4949, 'Er... Maxuter? I think I have something for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4950, 'Huh?  Oh, [NAME]. \nSorry, I tend to ignore people when I\'m busy! Try not to take it personally.\nWhat can I do for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4951, 'Um. Your son asked me to give you this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4952, 'Rick? He asked you to give me something?\nWhy would he ask someone to give me this out of nowehere...?\nGive me a second to read this over.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4953, 'Er... what does it say, Maxuter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4960, 'Oh... curse that son of mine!\nI\'m sorry about this, [NAME]. Rick would tell me all the time that he hated school and how he wanted to start his own business.\nI just never thought he would do something as immature as this.\nAh, well. I suppose that this will teach him a thing or two about the outside world!\nCan you deliver this letter to him for me?\nI want him to know that he\'s a grown man now and that I will refuse to help him start his business. This is something he needs to do on his own.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4955, 'Please, hurry! I\'m sure my father will have to help me this time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4970, 'You Are Not a Child Anymore 2'),
(4971, 'Maxuter\'s immature son, Rick, wrote a letter to his father explaining that has run away from home to start a business. \nMaxuter wrote a reply that he will not forgive him.\nDeliver the father\'s letter to Rick in Alberstol. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4972, 'I\'ve finished my letter to Rick. Can you please deliver this to him for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4973, 'Hey, Rick! I\'ve spoken with your father and he gave me this letter for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4974, 'A response from my father? Let me see!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4975, 'Wait... what?! He doesn\'t want me to come back? And he\'s not going to help me?\nThis wasn\'t part of the plan... hey, [NAME]! What did you say to him?\nOh, it doesn\'t matter. What do I do now?\nHm... I guess I\'ll just have to start my business here!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4976, 'Er, that may not be a good idea. Maybe you should think about going back home. \nThis doesn\'t seem like a good place for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4977, 'Haha! I appreciate your concern, but I think right here is the best place for me! I\'ve never had an issue with monsters or anything like that.\nI\'m going to start my business right here, and you\'re going to help me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4978, 'Yes? What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4980, 'Rick\'s Seed Money 1'),
(4981, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nHe asks you to help collect 1 Magrite Summoner\'s Bone Pearls.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4982, '[NAME]! You have to help me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4983, 'Rick! What\'s wrong?\n(What could he possibly need now...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4984, 'You\'re not busy right now, are you?\nI have a task that I\'m willing to give you! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(4985, 'Well, I am a little busy...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4986, 'Don\'t worry, it\'s not difficult or anything.\nAfter receiving that letter from my father, I was so angry! I just really want to show him that I can do something on my own!\nWith you helping me, I\'ll regain my confidence in no time!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4987, 'I guess confidence is pretty important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4988, 'I knew you would understand!\nWhen I open up my shop, I plan on selling really rare items!\nThe only problem is, well... these things are hard to find!\nI remember by father once telling me that certain monster bones can sell for quite a bit, and I think I want to go after a Magrite Summonner! They seem like they would be expensive.\nCan you collect {color,yellow,1 Magrite Summoner\'s Bone Pearls} for me?  I know it\'s an unusual task, but I would really appreciate it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... ok. If this will finally help you become an adult.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why are you bothering me? Maybe you should just go home.][2]'),
(4989, 'You weren\'t kidding, Rick!\nThis bone took forever to find...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4990, 'Wow, you actually found one?\nI mean... of course you did! I always knew I could count on you!\nYou did a great job, take this reward for your troubles.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(4991, 'This bone is hard to find, but it\'s not impossible! You just need to look harder!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5040, 'Rick\'s Seed Money 2'),
(5041, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nHe asks you to find Nepilim\'s Voice.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5042, 'Oh, [NAME]! Glad you\'re here. You know that bone you gathered for me last time? I sold it... for a really expensive price, too!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5043, 'Really? How much did you sell it for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5044, 'You\'re silly, [NAME]! That information is confidential.\nLast time I didn\'t have much money to give you as a reward, but I promise to pay you better this time!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5045, '(He needs something else already?)\nDoes this mean you have another favor to request of me, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5046, 'Of course! I told you that you\'re the only one who can help me!\nYou\'re not... turning your back on me, are you? I couldn\'t stand the thought!\n\nThis time I\'m after something even more rare and special! I\'m after the Voice of the Wind Nepilim, the Corrupted Spirit!\nThis spirit hardly ever makes a sound, but when it does it brings a grown man to tears! I heard it contains magical powers.\n\nThis won\'t be easy to get for someone like me, but it won\'t be a problem for you! Right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. As long as you pay me...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t take any more of your weird requests!][2]'),
(5047, 'This voice... it\'s haunting! I can see why you wanted it.\nIt wasn\'t easy to get, even for me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5048, 'You\'re the best, [NAME]!\nVery few people have been able to get one of these. This will fetch a high price, for sure!\nAnd here\'s your reward, of course!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5049, 'Don\'t tell me you\'ve given up already?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5050, 'Rick\'s Seed Money 3'),
(5051, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nHe asks you to find the Nails from the Magrite Cult Followers.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5052, 'I have a very special request for you today, [NAME]! You better be ready for it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5053, '(Oh no, what now...)\nWhat do you need, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5054, 'You\'ve heard of the Magrite Cult Followers, haven\'t you?\nIn order to cure those that they\'ve infected, you need a piece of their skin or nail, something that has been tainted with their juice, to make the antidote!\nHow do I know this? I overheard someone telling my father! This means that we must get these items before he does.\nThe thought of collecting skin is just too disgusting, so let\'s go with the nail. Can you collect {color,yellow,10 Magrite Cult Follower\'s Nails} for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Only if it will help those that are infected!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh! Nails sound too disgusting too.][2]'),
(5055, 'I have all 10 nails for you, Rick! Those Magrite Cult Followers  sure are nasty creatures...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5056, 'Wow, you got it for me! I really hope they can make a rememdy out of these.\nI saw a Seidhunter the other day and I just had to run away! You must be really brave to go after these guys.\nPlease accept this reward, you\'ve earned it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5057, 'Did you gather the nails yet? Remember that they have to be the green kind!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5060, 'Rick\'s Seed Money 4'),
(5061, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nHe asks you to find 3 Mantles from Magrite Seidstars.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5062, 'Oh, [NAME]! I didn\'t even see you arrive! I was too busy staring at this fabulous new item...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5063, 'Huh? What is that, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5064, 'I knew you\'d like it! Isn\'t it beautiful? It\'s a Cape from the Magrite Cult Prophet.\nRight now this is the most expensive item you can buy in the area!\nI didn\'t buy it for myself, of course! I needed to show it to you.\nCan you get me some of these? The village won\'t have to worry about the Magrite Cult Prophets attacking them, and I get my Capes! It\'s such an amazing deal.\nIf you get me {color,yellow,3 Magrite Cult Prophet Capes}, I\'ll reward you well!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... ok. I do want to save the village.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This is where I draw the line, Rick!][2]'),
(5065, 'Phew! I\'ll have you know those Capes were not easy to get.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5066, 'Oh, the best things in life never are easy, [NAME]!\nThe texture of these Capes are just divine! I know I\'ll have no problem seeling these!\nTake this reward! It\'s yours!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5067, 'So shiny... and silky! This cape is simply gorgeous!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5070, 'Rick\'s Seed Money 5'),
(5071, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nHe asks you to find 3 pairs of Boots from the Magrite Cult Fanatics .\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5072, 'I was right, [NAME]! Those capes are selling like hotcakes!\nI have another request for you right now too.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5073, '(Why am I not surprised...)\nWhat is it this time, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5074, '{color,yellow, Ta-da! Boots! Aren\'t they amazing? I NEED more of these boots.}\nThey\'re worn by the Magrite Cult Fanatics, and the design quality is simply unmatched!\nThey are the most popular footwear in Isya right now. Can you collect 3 more pairs for me? What do you say, pal?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Pal? All right, I guess...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I said I\'ve had enough!][2]'),
(5075, 'Ugh! You didn\'t mention how heavy these boots were when you told me about them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5076, 'How amazing! I\'ll set aside a pair for myself, and sell the rest!\nHere, I have a great reward for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5077, 'I feel so much taller when I wear these boots! I must get more pairs.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5080, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick\'s Skin\''),
(5081, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nFind 10 Violets, 3 Rosemary, and 1 Karis for Rick.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5082, 'Everyone wants beautiful skin these days, don\'t they?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5083, 'I suppose so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5084, 'Everyone today, both men and women, hope for beautiful skin.\nSo, I\'ve got an idea on how to make money off of this! I want to make a nutritional cream for the skin!\nI\'ll call it... \'Rick\'s Skin\'! Catchy, huh?\nI need some supplies if I\'m going to make this cream. Can you get me{color,yellow,10 Violets, 3 Rosemary, and 1 Karis}? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, that doesn\'t sound too hard.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired.][2]'),
(5085, 'Rick, I got them. They were kind of difficult to find.\nI thought they were everywhere!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5086, 'That\'s what I\'ve heard!\nThank you, anyways. You\'re such a great helper!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5087, 'Huh? I told you what you need to collect! Get me 10 Violets, 3 Rosemary, and 1 Karis!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5090, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick\'s Wax\''),
(5091, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nGet 5 Sap (Low Quality), 10 Sap, and 10 Sap(High Quality) for Rick.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5092, 'Here it is! My new invention... \'Rick Wax\'!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5093, '(What did he make now...)\nWhat is that, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5094, 'The latest invention of the great inventor, Rick.\nIt\'s a wax you can use to style your hair! Clever, isn\'t it?\nHey, it\'s better than anything you\'ve ever invented!\nIt\'s time to get started making this stuff. Get me {color,yellow,5 Sap(Low Quality), 10 Sap, and 10 Sap(High Quality)}, please! \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, that\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired. Don\'t make useless things anymore...][2]'),
(5095, 'Here, I got it all! I never knew that Tree Sap could be used to style hair...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5096, 'Only when used with all of my other special ingredients!\nTake your reward now, and let me get started making this new item.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5097, 'Rick Wax\'... pure genius!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5110, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick\'s Pie\''),
(5111, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins.\nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own.\nFind 10 Lustered Soul Dust, 10 Glowing Spirit Dust, and 10 Chewy Meat for Rick.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5112, 'Hey, you\'re just in time! My new \'Rick\'s Pie\' just got done baking! How does it taste?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5113, 'Yuck! This is the worst thing I\'ve ever had in my life!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5114, 'Ugh, yeah... I guess fish pie wasn\'t such a good idea after all! \nI think the pie needs more meat! That would make it tastier.\nNow, since I need to make more sauce as well, get me {color,yellow,10 Lustered Soul Dust, 10 Glowing Spirit Dust, and 10 Chewy Meat.} And hurry! I need to start on the next batch right away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK. Just don\'t see any of those awful pies...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No! I don\'t want to help you make terrible food!][2]'),
(5115, 'Here you are, Rick! Lustered Soul Dust, Glowing Spirit Dust, and Chewy Meat.\nI was wondering... what\'s the dust for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5116, 'Oh, that is a secret, my friend!\nI just know these pies will be popular with all the villagers!\nTake your reward! I\'ve got some baking to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]'),
(5117, 'What? You think the ingredients are strange?\nIt\'s ok, I know they will make a delicious pie...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5120, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick Jewelry\''),
(5121, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins. \nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own. \nGet 10 Shiny Soul Powder, 10 Shiny Spirit Powder, and 10 Shiny Jewelry Powder for Rick.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5122, 'When it comes to jewelry, the shinier the better!\nUsing materials like Shiny Soul Powder and Jewelry Powder will make the most beautiful pieces.\nBut you have to be careful with how you mix them! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5123, 'Mixed?  Why do you want to mix them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5124, 'Why? To make jewelry, of course!\nI have to transform anything and everything into something that I can sell in my store.\nCan you get me {color,yellow,10 Shiny Soul Powder, 10 Shiny Spirit Powder, and 10 Shiny Jewelry Powder}? I would really appreciate it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok, I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too much work...][2]'),
(5125, 'I\'ve collected everything you asked me to, Rick. These things really sparkle in the sunlight!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5126, 'Oh, these are perfect for my store! I just know they\'ll sell really well.\nLet\'s go start making that jewelry, shall we?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5127, 'I know good quality jewelry when I see it! There\'s no fooling me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5130, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick Nutrition\''),
(5131, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins. \nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own. \nCollect 10 bottles of Fish Oil from Seidstar for Rick.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5132, 'I\'ve heard something pretty interesting, [NAME]. \nDid you know that Seidstars carry some of the best fish oil around?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5133, 'I didn\'t know that, Rick. Why would they carry fish oil? It seems very random.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5134, 'Hmm, not sure. My source wasn\'t able to tell me much, but I think they must drink some fish oil before gulping down that horrible juice of theirs!   \nI\'m pretty sure they believe that it helps the juice absorb quickly.\nI don\'t know about all that personally, but I hear it can do amazing things for your health.\nCan you collect {color,yellow,10 Fish Oil} for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m against anything from Seidstar!][2]'),
(5135, 'Yuck, this fish oil looks funny! Are you sure it\'s supposed to be good for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5136, 'Of course! I wouldn\'t lie to you about that, [NAME].\nI\'m sure these will fetch a fair price when I put them on sale.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5137, 'Yes? Do you have my Fish Oil?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5140, 'Rick\'s Seed Money: \'Rick Sedatives\''),
(5141, 'Rick insists that he will be able to start a business in Alberstol Ruins. \nHe is determined to prove to his father that he can survive on his own. \n(Get 10 Sedatives from Seidwarriors for Rick.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5142, 'I\'ve heard that the Seidwarriors take a certain type of sedatives to keep them going completely beserk.\nPerhaps they do care about their lives after all.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5143, 'Everybody does like living, I suppose.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5144, 'You\'re probably right, [NAME]. While I don\'t want the Seidwarriors going crazy, I think I can use their sedatives in something really important!\nPlease gather the {color,yellow,Sedatives of Seidwarriors} for me.\nI don\'t need many, I think 10 of them should do it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think so. It sounds very questionable![2]'),
(5145, 'I got it.  Here!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5146, 'Oh, thank you. \nYou know you\'ve been such an awesome helper, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5147, 'Why are you looking at me like that? Nothing bad is going on, I assure you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5150, 'The Unbreakable Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors '),
(5151, 'Nus, one of the most famous Elderine guards, has agreed to participate in the Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors.\nDefeat 20 Magrite Imps, 25 Magrite Cult Followers, and 30 Magrite Cult Prophets with Nus. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5152, 'Hey! [NAME]!\nYou are joining the Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5153, 'Hmm, what is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5154, 'It looks like we need to go out there and kill 20 Magrite Imps, 25 Magrite Cult Followers, and 30 Magrite Cult Prophets. \nSounds like a piece of cake, right?\nI\'m not worried at all! I bet you I\'ll kill twice as many as you, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[That sounds like a challenge! Let\'s do this!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have time for your silly games, Nus.][2]'),
(5155, 'I\'m back already, Nus! And I\'ve killed everything I was supposed to!\nHey! What are you still doing here? You didn\'t already finish, did you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5156, 'Err, of course! I finished, you know, hours ago. Killed all sorts of things, I did!\nDon\'t look at me like that! I\'m not lying... you just don\'t believe me!\nOh, it looks like I have something else to do. Gotta go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5157, 'So what are you going to give me if I win our little bet, huh?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5160, 'The Unbreakable Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors '),
(5161, 'Elderine\'s Paladin Master Keast asks you to fight against the Magrite cult.\nDefeat 20 Magrite Cult Prophets and 25 Magrite Cult Fanatics. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5162, 'Hello, [NAME]. I hear you that you have joined the Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors. Is that true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5163, 'Of course, Keast! I\'m always eager to do my part.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5164, 'Same here. I am now dedicating all of my time to help the wounded soldiers and adventurers.\nHowever, it looks like they\'re a little short-handed on the battlefield right now. I\'m heading out to defeat Magrite Cult Prophets and Magrite Cult Fanatics. Do you want to come?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It would be an honor to fight along side you, Keast.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m just too busy, sorry!][2]'),
(5165, 'Keast! You look injured! What happened out there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5166, 'Don\'t you worry about me, [NAME]. This is only a scratch.\nI am glad to see you return home in one piece. I was worried that the Magrite Cult would try to turn you into a monster.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5167, 'We don\'t have much time, we must leave now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5170, 'The Unbreakable Fellowship of the Magrite Conquerors '),
(5171, 'Poring in Uruga has also vowed to fight against the Magrites.\nHelp Pooring to defeat 25 Magrite Cult Prophets and 25 Magrite Cult Fanatics.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5172, 'Phew, I\'m so busy! Looks like I have all the stones I need, but maybe I should add a few more just in case...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5173, 'What are you doing, Poring?  Are you packing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5174, 'Oh, [NAME]! I\'ve been waiting for you to come.\nOur time has come! Let\'s get out there and fight this Magrite menace!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5175, 'Whaa--? You\'re joining too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5176, 'Of course I am, silly! Why wouldn\'t I?\nI may look weak, but I can be a big help out there.\nIf you run out of stones, I can quickly throw one to you and help you out!\nWhat are we waiting around here for? Let\'s go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[If you\'re going, I\'m definitely coming too!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh, I\'m so sick of hearing about Magrite.][2]'),
(5177, 'These Magrites sure aren\'t going down without a fight, Poring. I\'m glad to see that you werent hurt out there!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5178, 'Oh, I can take care of myself! I may be small, but I sure am fast.\nYou didn\'t do so bad yourself! Take this as a reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5179, 'How are you feeling, [NAME]? Do you need healing?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5180, 'The End of the Magrite Cult Warriors 1'),
(5181, 'Kiera in Alberstol is worried about the village and the fire the Magrite cult try to start.\nYou must figure out why the Magrite Cult avoid the Spirits. \nTake the Guardian Stone to defeat 35 Magrite Cult Prophets and 35 Magrite Cult Fanatics. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5182, 'It\'s good to see you again, [NAME]. With everything going on recently, I was worried about you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5183, 'Speaking of which, what has been going on? The villagers all seem agitated.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5184, 'Oh, you\'ve noticed?\nWell, you see... last night the Magrite Cult invaded us. It doesn\'t seem like they enjoy being around us, but they still came. When they were here they tried to start a fire.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5185, 'Fire?! They tried to set the village on fire?\nI can\'t believe it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5186, 'Our nearest water source is too far away. If a fire were to break out, I fear we would all be in grave peril.\nWe are lucky, though. When they saw they spirits, they ran away.\nFor some reason it seems that they are afraid of them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5187, 'Hmm, that\'s strange. I assumed they were always violent and attacked any living thing!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5188, 'Me too, [NAME]. This is why I\'m so curious as to why this happened.\nI need your help in determing what caused them to run away from the village.\nHere, take this. This is the Guardian Stone that all Spirits receive at their coming of age ritual.\nIt\'s a very special stone that has been washed by holy water for over a thousand years. \nIf this is why they are avoiding us, then we might be able to use this to our advantage.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on the case, Kiera!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That Guardian Stone is worthless!][2]'),
(5189, 'It didn\'t look like the Guardian Stone worked! Those Magrites still attacked me.\nIs it only effective when the spirits use it?\n[NEXT]'),
(5190, 'Hm, you might be right. Thank you for testing it out for me.\nIt looks like we don\'t have to worry about the Guardian Stone for now. Please take this reward for all of your help so far.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5191, 'How did the Guardian Stone work for you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5580, 'The End of the Magrite Cult Warriors  2'),
(5581, 'Kiera in Alberstol is worried about the village and the recent fire started by the Magrite cult.\nDefeat 40 Magrite Cult Prophets and 40 Magrite Cult Fanatics. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5582, '[NAME], look at this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5583, 'Huh? What am I looking at?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5584, 'This is the hair of a Magrite Cult Fanatic. I found it in the village last night.\nI conducted a few experiments with this, but the Guardian Stone didn\'t seem to have any effect on it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5585, 'Hm, that\'s not very promising. What do we do now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5586, 'Well, not all hope is lost. When the Guardian Stone is held by a spirit, it becomes activated.\nThey have a very powerful aura that influences the very air around them.\nHere, take a look! When I hold The Guardian Stone near the hair...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5587, 'Oh! The hair... it\'s burning!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5588, 'That\'s right! It seems as though the Spirit\'s energy is very powerful against the Undead.\nThe poor souls that have been captured by the Magrites have been turned into the undead, so this must be why this energy is such a powerful weapon against them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5589, 'Oh, that\'s so cruel. Poor humans becoming part of the undead...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5590, 'That is what the dark juice does to the villagers, [NAME].\nHowever, we must remind ourselves that they are no longer human and they must be destroyed.\nCan you please {color,yellow,Defeat 40 Magrite Cult Prophets and 40 Magrite Cult Fanatics} for me? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! I\'ll be right back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[40? I\'m way too tired for that!][2]'),
(5591, 'Those Magrites are very powerful, Kiera. They didn\'t even seem to feel the pain I was causing them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5592, 'It\'s such a tragedy. It appears that we must continue watching them for any signs of weakness.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5593, 'I know the Guardian Stone could be used to defeat them somehow...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5560, 'The Last of Evil Magrite '),
(5561, 'Magrite feeds her potion to people to turn them into monsters. She is a menace to the villages and must be stopped once and for all.\nDefeat Magrite, the leader of the Magrite Cult.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5562, 'Great news, [NAME]! We found the base of the Magrite cult!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5563, 'Really?\nWhere is she? Let me at her!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5564, 'Calm down, [NAME]. We must proceed with caution.\nShe appears to be located around here, Alberstol Ruins, but she moves the base often. It could be a little difficult to locate her.\nIt\'s all up to you now. Go out there and defeat Magrite!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just leave it to me!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, you must!  Go for it!][2]'),
(5565, 'I did it, Chief! I defeated Magrite!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5566, 'Errr, you did? Are you sure?\nBut... I just received a report that Magrite was spotted less than a few minutes ago!\nHow can this be?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5567, 'We must prevail, [NAME]. We cannot give up when we\'ve already come so far.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6110, 'The Real Last of Evil Magrite '),
(6111, 'Magrite feeds her potion to people to turn them into monsters. She is a menace to the villages and must be stopped once and for all.\nShe can clone herself, so you must defeat her again and being back her hair.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6112, 'I just don\'t get it! I do believe you, [NAME]. I\'m sure you defeated Magrite...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6113, 'I did defeat her! I\'m positive!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6114, 'Hmm, there may be a way to explain this.\nIt\'s clear that she is working with Karasian, so she might have been able to use Parchment Magic.\nIf so, that means the real Magrite must be someplace closeby.\nI know you\'ll be able to find it, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yup! Just count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want you to be disappointed in me if I don\'t...][2]'),
(6115, 'I\'ve done it! I\'ve defeat Magrite... again.\nI\'ve brought you back her hair as proof!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6116, 'Whaa--?? The hair... just turned to ash!\nOh, this must mean that you defeated another one of her clones.\nGrr, she is really getting on my nerves!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6117, 'I hope it\'s not another clone...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6120, 'The True Last of Evil Magrite '),
(6121, 'Magrite feeds her potion to people to turn them into monsters. She is a menace to the villages and must be stopped once and for all.\nShe can clone herself, so you must find the real Magrite and defeat her once and for all.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6122, '[NAME]! I\'m so glad you\'re here. It looks like they have found the true body of Magrite!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6123, 'Wait, so... no more clones? That\'s great news! Where is she?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6124, 'She was found near Alberstol, and this may be our only chance to win this.\nShe has nowhere to run now... it\'s time to finally defeat her!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah! I\'ve been waiting for this moment.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, I\'m tired!! I want to stop!][2]'),
(6125, 'Haha, it\'s done! Here is the hair of the real Magrite, Chief!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6126, 'Oh! Let me see!\nYes... this is the hair of the real Magrite! Oh, what a relief.\nWell done, [NAME]. You have saved us all!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6127, 'Let\'s just pray she is not invincible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5620, 'Revenge for the Young Man'),
(5621, 'Taylor of Alberstol Ruins heard a sad story about an adventurer who stopped by few days ago. \nListen to Taylor tell his story.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5622, 'Welcome, [NAME]. \nI heard that you defeated Magrite. Is that true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5623, 'Oh, well... Yes it is. It looks like good news travels fast, huh?\nI wouldn\'t have been able to do defeat her if I didn\'t have help from everyone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5624, 'You\'re so humble. You did a great thing for this young man. No one can deny that!\n[NEXT]'),
(5625, 'Huh? I\'m not sure I know what you\'re talking about...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5626, 'Let me explain. Awhile ago... an elf man risked his life to come to this village.\nHe wasn\'t nearly old enough to be adventuring in Alberstol, but still he came anyways. \nI cared for him while he was injured and he was finally strong enough to tell me his tale.\nAs it turns out, he had come to defeat Magrite.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5627, 'Oh. That\'s admirable, but Magrite was really powerful! I was barely able to defeat her with my strongest allies helping me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5628, 'Yes, and this young man came here knowing how poweful she was. He was gravely injured by Magrite Cult Followers before ever reaching Magrite herself. \nI didn\'t understand his determination at first, but then he told me why he must defeat her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5629, 'Why? What was his reason?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5630, 'Well, Magrite has been a menace to the villagers for quite some time.\nShe was heartless, sacrificing many of her loyal followers for pointless reaons.\nThose cult followers were mothers, fathers, daughters and sons. When the familes of the sacrificed members learned of their loved one\'s death, they were stricken with grief.\nWhat made it even worse is that she was killed, and then brough back to life!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5631, 'Wait, how did that happen? Oh! It was Karasian, wasn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5632, 'Yes, it was. Let me explain...\nMagrite was first killed by the villagers that had lost so many of their loved ones to her cult. \nShe was about to sacrifice this young man who came to Alberstol when something miraculous happened.\nA spirit, that young man\'s mother, came to help him at the moment he was almost sacrificed and it was her power that defeated Magrite.{color,yellow,That young man\'s mother had been killed by Magrite. You see, that boy\'s mother had been sacrificed days earlier and could not bear to watch her son be killed. It was the power of love and the desire to protect her son that brought her back to fight.\nHowever... Magrite did not remain dead for very long.\nKarasian revived her and asked her to join him and grow stronger with the help of his dark power.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5633, 'But... Magrite is dead, right? I killed her with my own two hands! She has to be dead.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5634, 'Yes, you did defeat her. But... I\'m not sure if she is really gone.\nHowever, I do know that you have avenged that young man who came to Alberstol.\nYou should be proud of yourself, [NAME]. You have done a great thing.\nI wanted to thank you, on behalf of that young man and behalf of the entire village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5635, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5640, 'Young Phouch\'s Whereabouts '),
(5641, 'Rell, the Spirit of Hackberry, believes that there still is a Young Pouch that is gentle outside the village. \nShow her Young Phouch\'s Poisonous Thorn. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5642, 'Furry phouches everywhere, cuddly phouhes over there, cutest phoches--\nOh! You startled me, [NAME]! What are you doing here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5643, 'Wait, why were you singing about those scary phouches? And calling them... cute?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5644, 'Whaa--? Scary? Phouces aren\'t scary!\nMaybe the grown-up phouches can be a little frightening, but the young ones are always cute!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5645, 'I don\'t think you know what you\'re talking about, Rell.\nWhen you fight a Phouch, even the young ones, they throw poisonous thorns at you! Talk about scary!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5646, 'Oh, you\'re just trying to trick me!\nI know that they\'re cute, and you can\'t convince me otherwise!\n\n[BUTTON]=[We\'ll just see about that! I\'ll show you proof!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, well I guess you can believe what you want...][2]'),
(5647, 'Look, Rell! Proof that young phouches are scary afterall!\nThis is Young Phouch\'s thorn. Do you know how much it hurts when this poisonous thorn stings you?\nYoung Phouch is a very scary monster, you must understand that. It\'s for your own safety.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5648, 'Don\'t... don\'t you try to lie to me!\nI can\'t hear you... if I don\'t see it, it must not be true.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5649, 'Someday you\'ll see how cute phouches really are!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5660, 'In Search of Darkness 1'),
(5661, 'Uruga\'s Chief Adrian is observing a monster called Poison Mantrap Plant in Dark Land.\nBring 10 Poison Mantrap Leaves. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5662, 'You look even stronger now, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5663, 'Oh, thank you, how can I help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5664, 'I have something to ask you.\nHave you been to Dark Land?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5665, 'Oh, of course.  I go there often. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5666, 'I see. \nHmm.. then, have you ever seen a monster called Poison Mantrap Plant?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5667, 'Oh, that guy?  Of course, but it\'s even more poisonous than the Mantrap Plant.  It looks like a Mantrap Plant... or maybe it\'s a little different.\nIt\'s definitely more difficult and dangerous to fight... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5668, 'I see. \nThere are many strange things in Dark Land...\nDark Land is filled with monsters that have undergone sudden changes and metamorphosis. \nIf most monsters there have been created by darkness... \nIt\'s like they have suddenly been transformed into darkness it self!\nIt seems that Poison Mantrap Plant was a friendly monsters once. \nUnfortunately, it suddenly transformed into such a scary monster.\nHmm, can you get me{color,yellow,10 Poison Mantrap Leaves}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  I\'ll be right back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[For what?][2]'),
(5669, 'Chief, here, 10 Leaves.  Be careful, they sting.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5670, 'Thank you.  Hmm... they are little different in color.\nI\'ll study these.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5671, 'I don\'t know why, but Dark Land has changed so suddenly... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5680, 'In Search of Darkness 2'),
(5681, 'Uruga\'s Chief Adrian is observing a monster called Poison Mantrap Plant in Dark Land.\nCollect 20 Poison Mantrap Leaves and deliver them to Roumenus in Roumen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5682, '[NAME], thank you for your help, I have a few research findings. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5683, 'Really?  What are they?\nWere they friendly Mantrap Plants that have gone bad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5684, 'Hmm...\nActually, I don\'t think so.  Some of them were, but others were not..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5685, 'What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5686, 'We are not sure, yet.  I can\'t say for sure.\n[NAME], can you help me again?\nCollect {color,yellow,20 Poison Mantrap Leaves} and take them to {color,yellow,Roumenus}.\nI\'ll send a letter to Roumenus along with my findings.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'ll help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m still tired... ][2]'),
(5687, 'Chief Roumenus!  Here!\nDid you get the letter from Chief Adrian?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5688, 'Oh, I\'ve been waiting for you.  I did get the letter.  Let me see the leaves. \nWow.. You are doing a great job.  You are a great help to everyone. \nI knew it..  I knew you were something great.  Hahaha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5689, 'Phew... so very tired...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5690, 'In Search of Darkness 3'),
(5691, 'Roumenus hands over the findings. \nDeliver Research Report to Adrian. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5692, 'Here, the findings are all written here.\nChief Adrian is so meticulous.  Haha... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5693, 'Now, take it to Adrian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go later.][2]'),
(5694, 'Chief Adrian!  Here\'s the Research Report from Chief Roumenus.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5695, 'Oh.. You are back.  I\'ve been waiting for you.\nLet\'s see.. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5696, '..Hmm, this is.. just as I though.\nOh, this is a little different.. Hmm... Oh... That\'s interesting.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5697, 'Err... Chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5698, 'Oh!  Oops, sorry.. I got carried away.\n[NAME]. Poison Mantrap Plant was.. not a friendly monster.\n{color,yellow,It was.. in the Swamp of Dawn.} \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5699, 'Huh?! Really? But that place was.. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5720, 'Yes, it was hard to get.  It was sealed... almost impossible to ger to.\nBut some did manage to get there and transformed into more powerful and vicious monsters in Dark Land...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5721, 'What?!  Monsters themselves went into Dark Land for metamorphosis?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5722, 'Yes.. I guess that is.. \n{color,yellow,the evolution of darkness...} \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5723, 'Are you still here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5730, 'Dark Evolution, the Trace 1'),
(5731, 'Chief Kiera of Alberstol Ruins received Adrian\'s letter.\nGet 50 Poison Mantrap Leaves and 50 Husks for Kiera who is interested in researching dark evolution. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5732, 'Good to see you again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5733, 'Right back at ya...\nHow can I help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5734, 'I got a letter from Chief Adrian of Uruga.\nRegarding the dark evolution...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5735, 'Oh.. that.\nI was very shocked.  I couldn\'t believe that monsters are evolved by darkness.. \nIt\'s horrible.\nI\'m worried... that even people could turn into monsters by darkness. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5736, 'There actually are people who seem to be going through such metamorphosis.  There is another cause, of course.. \nBut it\'s very rare that such metamorphosis is triggered by the power of the land itself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5737, 'That\'s what I think.  Hmm, isn\'t there a way to stop this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5738, 'No, we haven\'t find a way, yet. We can\'t even explain how they exist and how they are born. \nWe are just hoping that this does not spread farther. \nOh, I have something I want to find out.. \nCan you get me {color,yellow,50 Poison Mantrap Leaves and 50 Husks}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, sure.  It should take a little!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Again?  I\'m tired.. ][2]'),
(5739, 'I\'m back!  Here are the leaves and husks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5740, 'Oh, well done.\nI might need something else.\nI\'ll call you again.  Please come back if you can. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5741, '.. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5760, 'Dark Evolution, the Trace 2'),
(5761, 'Kiera has begun to study the dark evolution.\nKiera says that she is studying the dark evolution with Taylor.\nGet 30 Poison Mantrap Leaves and 10 Laplansia Petals for Taylor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5762, 'Oh, you are here.\nWe are continuing with the research.  Oh, Taylor has joined me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5763, 'Oh, Taylor? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5764, 'Yes.  Taylor was the one who suggested the research after reading Adrian\'s letter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5765, 'I see.. Oh, is there any other news?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5766, 'Oh, not yet.  I don\'t know about Taylor.\nHe said he needs {color,yellow,30 Poison Mantrap Leaves and 10 Raplansia Petals}... \nRaplansia is a similar case with Mantrap Plant.\nCan you get Poison Mantrap Leaves and Laplansia Petals for Taylor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d be happy to!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired.][2]'),
(5767, 'Taylor!  I got it.  \nI got 30 Poison Mantrap Leaves and 10 Laplansia Petals!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5768, 'Oh, you are here.  I was waiting for you.\nI heard that you are helping us with the research.  Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5769, 'Ask Taylor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5770, 'Dark Evolution, the Trace 3'),
(5771, 'Taylor at Alberstol Ruins is researching dark evolution with Chief Kiera.\nTaylor says that he sprayed herbicide on Laplansia\'s body. \nCollect 20 Rotted Laplansia Petals.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5772, 'Welcome.  I have a few findings.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5773, 'Is it good news?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5774, 'Hmm.. It\'s not that positive, yet.\nWe just hope to have an outcome. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5775, 'I see... so what are your findings?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5776, 'Well, I mixed holy water and spirit powder, and sprayed it on Laplansia\'s body. \nThere was a chemical reaction.  I was able to get additional information from Adrian in Uruga. \nWe don\'t have a result yet, so we are observing it. \nThere should be a result by now.  {color,yellow,Can you collect petals for me?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, I have an appointment..!][2]'),
(5777, 'Taylor!  I got them.  The petals are all rotten!  Tainted water is coming out of them.. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5778, 'Oh.. I didn\'t expect that.  I thought the leaves would harden or become similar to actual petals.. \nI can\'t believe they are rotten.  It\'s very strange.\nHmm, the monsters in Dark Land are certainly different from ordinary monsters... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5779, 'Hmm, we have done a few experiments, but we didn\'t get good results. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5780, 'Dark Evolution, the Trace 4'),
(5781, 'Taylor at Alberstol Ruins is researching dark evolution with Chief Kiera.\nCollect 20 Turned Leaves and Husks from the Poison Mandrake.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5782, 'Poison Mandrake is also similar to Raplansia.\nWe assume that it had come here from somewhere else for the metamorphosis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5783, 'The appearance is very similar, but it\'s stronger and has vicious venom... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5784, 'Probably.  They get the dark energy in Dark Land. \nSome of them even die when they fail to bear the darkness, while others swallow and acclimate to darkness gaining stronger powers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5785, 'So.. we are lucky that it hasn\'t affected humans and elves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5786, 'For now, yes.  But.. nobody knows what would happen. \nThe number of monsters in Dark Land is increasing.  They might spread to Alberstol Ruins and Swamp of Dawn. \nAnd they might invade villages...\nWe have to stop that no matter what.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5787, 'Certainly...\nI\'m worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5788, 'There\'s no time to be depressed. \nPlease get me {color,yellow,Turned Leaves and Husks of Poison Mandrake.  Twenty each}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Phew.. I have no passion to work.][2]'),
(5789, 'Be careful.. I got them.\nThey made me feel bad even when I approach them.  They are very poisonous. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5790, 'Well done.  I should work on my research with these.\nIt should be a long and hard journey. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5791, 'Sigh.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5810, 'Scary Appetite 1'),
(5811, 'Elderine\'s Skill Master Deikid says that he was attacked by a flock of Red Condor while patrolling Dark Land. \nDefeat 25 Red Condor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5812, '[NAME], have you been to Dark Land?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5813, 'Yes!  Of course!  I know almost every Dark Land monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5814, 'I see.  Then, you must know the Red Condor.\nA few days ago, Elderine patrolled Dark Land.\nI went with Marty, Abon, and Bran. In 4 teams.\nThere.. we faced Giant Red Condors.\nThey were monitoring us all along...\nWe lost three soldiers.  The arrows were no use because of their wings.\nWe barely.. barely.. ran away alive.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5815, 'If you ran away.. I can anticipate their power. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5816, 'Yes... there were a lot of them.  What was even more horrible was that they.. attacked soldiers... \nAnd ate them up...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5817, 'Wh.. What?!  The birds.. ate the soldiers?!\nOh, my...  that\'s horrible!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5818, 'Yes.. I wasn\'t careful enough... and they were just too strong. \nWe will form another 4 teams to defeat them, but if more will perish... we are hesitant. \nBut... I can\'t let them hurt innocent people.\nCan you lend your power to us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  I\'m with you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I\'m busy.. ][2]'),
(5819, '(Panting) Deikid!  Are you OK?!  What about the soldiers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5820, 'Oh, you are safe!  We have minor injuries, but nothing fatal.  Thank you for your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5821, 'Sigh.. It\'s all my fault... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5830, 'Scary Appetite 2'),
(5831, 'Elderine\'s Skill Master Deikid says that he was attacked by a flock of Red Condor while patrolling Dark Land. \nDefeat 30 Red Condor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5832, 'The 2nd Fleet is leaving today. [NAME], lend us your power!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5833, 'Of course!  Let\'s go!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5834, '{color,yellow,The target is 30 Red Condor!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can take on 30 with my friends!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, that\'s too many.][2]'),
(5835, 'Hyah!!  Deikid!  My friends and I defeated 30.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5836, 'Oh, you are great.  You are like a army on your own, [NAME].\nYou have been a great help.  I think the families of the victims are consoled a little by this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5837, 'Let\'s go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5840, 'Suspicious Patrol 1'),
(5841, 'An unidentified Great Feather was found in Alberstol Village.\nItem Merchant Geric is curious about this feather.\nTake the feather to Taylor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5842, 'Hello.  It\'s a great day.  There is not even a single cloud in the sky...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5843, 'I guess.  The air is fresh, too. \nHaha.  Huh?  You have a feather, who does it belong to?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5844, 'Oh, this feather.  I picked it up while taking a walk last night. \nIsn\'t it big and pretty?  It\'s gloss and hardness tell us that it belongs to a monster... I wonder which monster it is.\nOh.. Can you deliver this feather to Taylor? \nI\'m curious to whom it belongs.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm, I\'m curious, too.  OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have time.][2]'),
(5845, 'Taylor!  Excuse me.  Are you busy?\nI have a question for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5846, 'What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5847, 'Taylor is near the Life Springs.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5860, 'Suspicious Patrol 2'),
(5861, 'You brought the feather to Taylor.\nTaylor thinks that this feather belongs to a Giant Red Condor.. \nBring 5 Great Feathers of the Giant Red Condor.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5862, 'Tell me.  What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5863, 'Oh, yes.  Geric says that he discovered this feather yesterday.\nHe wants to know which monster it belongs to.. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5864, 'In the... village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5865, 'Yes.  He said he picked it up while walking outside last night. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5866, 'This is.. Hmm, I\'m sure.  It\'s a Giant Red Condor\'s feather.\nBut I don\'t know why it was in the village. \nDo you think they are patrolling the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5867, 'Huh?!  Really?  But monsters can\'t enter the village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5868, 'Giant Red Condor can fly very high.\nIt can observe the village from beyond the seal... \nI\'m sure that Giant Red Condor is patrolling the village.\nOh, can you defeat them and bring their feathers to make sure?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.  I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good today.][2]'),
(5869, 'Taylor!  I got it!  It\'s just like that feather!  It\'s them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5870, 'Hmm, that\'s what I thought.\nIt\'s shocking.. that they were patrolling the village.\nReport to Kiera immediately!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5871, 'Hmm, monsters are becoming smarter and smarter... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5880, 'The Real Man Eats Red Condor Meat! 1'),
(5881, 'Elderine\'s Guard Nus wants to have Red Condor meat, says its good for his health. \nGet 10 Red Condor Meat to Nus.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5882, 'I am craving meat!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5883, 'So?\n(What do you want?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5884, 'Haha, well..\nI heard that Red Condor meat makes you really strong.\nI\'m so depressed.. and weak...\nHmm, so... I\'m craving {color,yellow,Red Condor Meat}..\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, OK, I\'ll get you some.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are so weak!!][2]'),
(5885, 'Here, I brought some.  I hope you feel better.\nWhy are your shoulders so down?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5886, 'My shoulders?  That\'s how they are.\nLet\'s try the meat. \n[NAME], you are my best friend!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5887, 'Look at me.  Look at the dark circles under my eyes, huh?\nDon\'t you feel pity for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5890, 'The Real Man Eats Red Condor Meat! 2'),
(5891, 'Elderine\'s Guard Nus wants to have Red Condor meat, says its good for his health. \nGet 10 Giant Red Condor Meat to Nus.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5892, '[NAME], [NAME]!! \nLook at my muscles!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5893, 'Huh...?\n(Sees a small bulge.)\nHaha.  Oh.. OK.  You have muscles!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5894, 'It\'s all attributed to Red Condor Meat!\nIt gives me so much energy that I can exercise all day!\nNow I need to try.. {color,yellow,Giant Red Condor Meat}!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK. You want me to get Giant Red Condor meat?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Stop eating meat.  Have some vegetables.][2]'),
(5895, 'Here you go!  That\'s it!\nDon\'t ask me no more, OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5896, 'Hahaha!!  OK.  I won\'t, but I rewarded you, you know.\nBut I didn\'t get the money by selling the meat.. Haha!\nOK, you can go now.  Good job.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5897, 'I have muscles thanks to you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5910, 'Love of Mother 1'),
(5911, 'Cleo is Maxuter\'s close friend.  She always looks cold-hearted and strong, but she has a frown on her face. \nGet 5 Young Phouch\'s Paws for Cleo\'s mother. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5912, 'Sigh..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5913, 'Hello, Cleo!  Huh?  What is it?\nYou don\'t look good. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5914, 'Oh.. Do I really?\nHmm.. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5915, '..?\nTell me,\nI could help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5916, 'Sigh, I didn\'t want to worry you. \nActually... my mother is sick.\nShe hurt her leg a while ago and it\'s pretty bad... she can\'t move... and she has fever now.\nSince I\'m all the way out here, I can\'t even look after her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5917, 'I see..\nHmm.. You can get her something good for her health. \nOh.. what about bear paws?  Bear paws!  Bear paws are the heathiest food!\nShe could get better soon if she has steamed bear paws!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5918, 'Bear.. paws?\nHmm, I don\'t know... \n\n[BUTTON]=[The best bear paws are Young Phouch\'s Paws!  Wait right here!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Err, bear paws.. are.. Well?][2]'),
(5919, 'Cleo! Here are the bear paws!  I got them!\nJust boil it for a long time to make the broth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5920, 'Oh... thank you. \nI don\'t know how to pay you back... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5921, 'Sigh.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5930, 'Love of Mother 2'),
(5931, 'Cleo is Maxuter\'s close friend.  She always looks cold-hearted and strong, but she has a frown on her face. \nGet 10 Young Phouch\'s Paws, 30 Herb Roots, 20 Herb Stems, and 10 Herb Leaves for Cleo\'s mother. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5932, 'Wohoo!  Cleo!  How\'s your mother?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5933, 'Oh, [NAME].  She is doing much better.  Hmm.. Oh, the paws that you got me were very effective.\nAlthough she can\'t get up yet...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5934, 'Hmm... OK, then I\'ll get you more.\nHow about some herbs to boost the effectiveness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5935, 'But that\'s too much work for you..\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s OK!  I have a lot of time on my hands!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You think?  Let\'s do it later..][2]'),
(5936, 'Hyah!  Ta-da!  Here you go!  Bear paws.. and herbs!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5937, 'Thank you so much.\nThis is my reward for you.  Please take it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5938, 'I\'m so sorry to bother you... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5940, 'A Piece of Cake (Event Quest)'),
(5941, 'Vietree in Roumen is baking a cake and needs you to gather 20 Cups of Flour, 10 Roumen Eggs, and 2 Vanilla Beans.\n(Roumen Eggs and Flour can be found by defeating monsters. Vanilla Blossoms can be found by gathering flowers.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5942, 'Hmph! This is terrible... just terrible!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5943, 'Is everything ok, Vietree?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5944, '[NAME], you scared me! Sorry for being rude, I didn\'t even see you there. I was too busy staring at this awful mess I just made!\n\nEep, will you look at the time! People are going to be arriving soon... and they\'re going to be hungry... oh, this is a disaster!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(5945, 'Well, maybe I can help if you just tell me what\'s wrong! I\'m always willing to help someone in need.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5946, 'Have you not noticed the lumpy mess you\'ve been standing in? It was SUPPOSED to be a delicious cake, and I followed the recipe exactly... but it just turned out like this!\n\nThe villagers will be arriving soon and now I have no cake to feed them! They\'re not going to be happy, let me tell you!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(5947, 'A cake? I happen to be a, err... expert when it comes to cake! Or at least I do love eating them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5948, 'That\'s great, [NAME]! Too bad eating cake won\'t help me get out of this mess. \n\nSay... I guess I could just bake another cake! Oh, but it\'s no use! I simply don\'t have the time to go out and gather more indregients. \n\n[NEXT] '),
(5949, 'Ah, I think I see what I can do for you...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5950, 'Oh, that would be great, [NAME]! If you want to help me, I certainly wouldn\'t refuse your assistance.\n\nSince that recipe didn\'t work out so well, I\'m going to try this new one I just found. It looks perfect! I need you to gather {color,yellow, 10 Roumen Eggs}, {color,yellow, 20 Cups of Flour}, and {color,yellow, 2 Vanilla Blossoms} for me? I would really appreciate it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me, Vietree!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That sounds way too complicated for me.][2] '),
(5951, 'I have all the ingredients you requested! This better be one tasty cake you\'re going to make.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5952, 'Just in time, [NAME]! It\'ll be close, but I think I can have the cake ready in time for the party! I wouldn\'t have been able to do this without your help.\n\nPlease, take this as your reward. I can already tell that you two will be the best of friends!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5953, 'You don\'t have to worry about baking the cake, you can leave that to me! I just know I\'ll get it right this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5960, 'Malephar\'s Lair 1'),
(5961, 'Chief Kiera in Alberstol has noticed a massive power invading Dark Land.\nShe has attempted to investigate this mysterious new power, but she was unable to continue because the monsters were too strong.\nDefeat the Doom Guardians and then return to Kiera.\n(Malephar\'s Lair is in the Dark Land.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5962, 'They were just... too strong, [NAME]. We didn\'t stand a chance. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5963, 'What was too strong, Kiera? Is everything ok?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5964, 'We were recently informed by some traveling merchants that there is a massive power invading Dark Land. A power that is born from the deepest and darkest depths in Isya.\n\nWe fear that this power has the ability to change everything we\'ve ever known.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5965, 'Wow, that sounds pretty intense. I suppose a dark power would explain all those weird mutated monsters I see...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5966, 'We aren\'t sure that is what\'s causing the mutations, but I would bet that you\'re right.\n\nAs soon as we learned of this new threat, a team that was lead by myself was sent to investigate. We were hoping to reach and confront the creature behind all of this, but we weren\'t even able to get past the guardians.\n\nWe barely escaped alive, but I know that with your assistance we might be able to make it through. What do you say, [NAME]? Can you travel past the Dark Land and defeat the Doom Guardians there?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure thing, Kiera! I\'m not scared at all.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If they were too strong for you, I don\'t think I can do it either.][2]'),
(5967, 'I have returned victorious from Dark Land, Kiera!\n\nThey weren\'t easy, but we have destroyed all the Doom Guardians there.\n[NEXT]'),
(5968, 'What a relief, [NAME]. I was starting to worry that you would be defeated as well.\n\nNow that those pesky guardians are taken care of, we can begin our investigation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5969, 'Be careful! These monsters are stronger than they appear.\n \nThe more adventurers you take along with you, the greater your chances of survival.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5970, 'Malephar\'s Lair 2'),
(5971, 'According to Kiera, certain monsters in Dark Land are protecting the source of this new dark power.\nDefeat Euryale and Pirra and return to Kiera. \n(Malephar\'s Lair is in Dark Land.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5972, '[NAME]! Thank Teva you\'re here.\n\nWould you be willing you help us again? Oh, please say you\'ll help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5973, 'Of course I\'ll help! What\'s bothering you, Kiera? More Dark Land trouble?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5974, 'Yes, but thanks to your efforts we were able to investigate this new mystery a little bit more.\n\nUnfortunately, I only have bad news to report. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5975, 'Any information, good or bad, will help us know what kind of creatures we\'re up against.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5976, 'Of course. We will keep the Henneath Alliance as well informed as possible. Let me tell you what we\'ve found out so far.\n\nWe have witnessed vicious harpies protecting the source of their dark power - they are called Euryale and Pirra. Their gaze is constantly fixed on the source, and each of them is capable of casting a powerful spell that produces a force field.\n\nWhen that spell is active, it is impossible to even approach the source.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5977, 'I see. Do you think that spell would fade if we were to defeat those casters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5978, 'Yes, I believe it would.\n\nHowever, it\'s not that simple. Euryale and Pirra are more powerful than the others you have encountered thus far. We can\'t do it alone, so we need your help once again.\n\nWhat do you say, [NAME]? Can we count on you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can always count on the Henneath Alliance!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think we can make it this time.][2]'),
(5979, 'You were right about those monsters, Kiera! I didn\'t really know what to really expect, but we pulled through! \n\nConsider Euryale and Pirra erased from Isya for good!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5980, 'That\'s excellent news, [NAME].\n\nNow we can venture even deeper into the darkness and learn more about this new enemy. You have my thanks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5981, 'Whatever you do, don\'t try and approach the power source without defeating Euryale and Pirra first.\n\nI don\'t know what kind of protection spell those cursed harpies are casting, but it\'s stronger than anything I\'ve ever encountered.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5990, 'Malephar\'s Lair 3'),
(5991, 'The investigations of Malephar\'s Lair continues.\nSpeak with Kiera to discover if she has anything new to report.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(5992, '[NAME]! Come quick! I believe we have discovered what is behind all the mayhem in Dark Land!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(5993, 'Oh, what wonderful news!\n\nWhat did you find out? I want to know!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5994, 'I like your spirit, [NAME]!\n\nI was just about to go looking for you, so I could tell you what we have learned.\n\n[NEXT]\n'),
(5995, 'You\'ll be interested in hearing that our assumptions were correct... it looks like this dark power is to blame for the monster mutations that have been happening in Dark Land.\n\nI was looking through some very old tomes and I came across a part that mentions a monster... a monster with the power to change everything around it. It sounded strangely plausible, so I continued reading.\n \nHe\'s called Melephar, and his very presence was feared by every human and elf in Isya.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5996, 'However, that was a long time ago.\n\nAccording to the tome, Malephar appears from time to time... seeking to destroy everything and everyone he faces. I fear he will not stop until his dark work has been completed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5997, 'I see. If he\'s that powerful, wouldn\'t everything in Isya have been destroyed by now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(5998, 'The very land you stand on would have been destroyed centuries ago if it weren\'t for the brave souls who have fought against Malephar in the past.\n\nUnfortunately we do not have any records of these battles, but I have heard strories of the remarkable soldiers. People just you, who loved Isya, and were willing to risk their lives to protect it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(5999, 'So Malephar comes back once every so often just to terrorize Isya. Sounds like a royal pain to me.\n\nThis is a lot of information to process at once. Thank you for sharing your findings, Kiera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6009, '...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6010, 'The Heart of Darkness'),
(6011, 'After explaining the story, Kiera asks you to defeat Malephar. \n(Malephar can be found in Malephar\'s Lair, in Dark Land.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6012, 'It all comes down to this, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6013, 'The time for invesitagtions is over, and action must be taken to defeat this dark creature once and for all.\n\nIf the Henneath Alliance refuses to assist us, all of Isya will suffer. Mutated menaces will roam free and before too long... the entire land will succumb to the darkness.\n\nI... I can\'t let that happen! We must do something about it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6014, 'I\'m right there with you, Kiera!\n\nI don\'t want any more of those mutated creatures tearing up my beautiful Isya!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6015, 'We cannot get ahead of ourselves, [NAME].\n\nAccording to our research, Euryale and Pirra are always surrounding Malephar. These creatures are constantly casting spells upon the wretched creature and making him more powerful.\n\nIn order to defeat Malephar and ensure victory, you must target those creatures first. The fate of Isya is in your hands... please remember this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Defeat the harpies first! Got it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just don\'t think I\'m up to the challenge.][2]'),
(6016, 'We did it!\n\nMalephar is no more!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6017, 'Oh, [NAME]... I cannot thank you enough. You don\'t know what a relief it is to hear that Malephar has been defeated.\n\nWhile most of Isya rests easy, unaware of what has transpired here today, know that everyone in Alberstol Ruins will remember your bravery for as long as we live. We are forever grateful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6018, 'Once you defeat the harpies, the spell will be broken and you can attack Malephar directly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6020, 'A New Business Opportunity'),
(6021, 'Rick from Alberstol Ruins is interested in Malephar. \nDefeat Malephar and find something that he can sell.\n(Malephar can be found in Malephar\'s Lair, in Dark Land.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6022, 'Psst, [NAME]! Over here!\n\nI heard you\'re working with Kiera to defeat the new power over in Dark Land.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6023, 'Well... yes, actually.\n\nKiera has asked me to assist her in eliminating the creatures responsible for all this mayhem. Why do you ask, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6024, 'Yes, I knew it! Perfect timing on my part... as always! Haha!\n\nAnyways, I was thinking that perhaps Malephar might possess some rare items that could make me money. You know I\'m always looking for new and exotic things to sell in my shop! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6025, 'This creature stands to threaten life as we know it and all of Isya... and all you can think about is making money?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6026, 'Hey, you don\'t have to be like that! I\'m just an honest merchant trying to make a living. The way I see it, this Malephar is going to be destroyed one way or another... so I might as well try and use that to my advantage!\n\nI\'ll tell you what, [NAME]. If you defeat Malephar and bring me back something valuable, I\'ll definitely make it worth your while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, all right. But I won\'t make any promises!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you want something to sell, you should go defeat him yourself.][2]'),
(6027, 'Well... when you\'re right, you\'re right!\n\nI didn\'t find anything that seemed valuable when we defeated Malephar, but I did find this laying around next to him afterwards. Here, take a look!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6028, 'Black Crystal, eh? I have a good feeling about this!\n\nThanks, [NAME]! I knew I could count on you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6029, 'Be careful out there! I would go after Malephar myself, but you know... the shop keeps me very busy!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6030, 'Another Special Request'),
(6031, 'Rick from the Alberstol Ruins is interested in Malephar. \nDefeat Malephar and collect the Black Crystal.\n(Malephar can be found in Malephar\'s Lair, in Dark Land.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6032, 'Say... do you remember that Black Crystal you found for me when you defeated Malephar?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6033, 'Yes, of course. What about it, Rick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6034, 'Well, it turned out to be quite valuable.\n\nI mean, it didn\'t sell for a fortune... but it wasn\'t bad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6035, 'I see. If you have a point, I suggest you make it soon. I\'m very busy!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6036, 'Well, I was thinking you could go collect some more for me! You did say that it was just laying around, so there\'s bound to be more. Even though it didn\'t make me much money, it is very valuable to me. \n\nWhat do you say, [NAME]? Of course there\'s a reward in it for you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[All right. But this is the last time, Rick!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I just don\'t have the time.][2]'),
(6037, 'These crystals were a little harder to collect this time, but I managed to bring back some for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6038, 'Oh, thanks!\n\nHey... don\'t look at me like that! These didn\'t make me much of a profit, I swear! \n\nHere, take your reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6039, 'You must remember to defeat the harpies first! If you fail to do so, you\'ll never be able to attack Malephar directly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6040, 'A Strange Fragment'),
(6041, 'You have picked up an unidentified fragment from Malephar.\nTake this piece to Kiera in Alberstol Ruins to learn more.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6042, 'Oh, [NAME]! There, in your hand! Thats... !\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6043, 'Well, I was hoping you could tell me what it is!\n\nI picked this up from Malepahr. I figured you might want to take a look at it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6044, 'I\'ve heard stories about something like this. It could definitely be helpful in determining more about Malephar and what brought him here to Isya!\n\nI\'ll have to conduct research on this fragment right away. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6045, 'Oh, good. Any information to prevent another attack would be good news!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6046, 'Yes, it certainly would.\n\nOnce I am finished with my research, I will be sure to destroy this fragment. I sense a strong power eminating from it, and I wouldn\'t want this dark shard to fall into the wrong hands.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6047, 'You\'ve got that right. I\'m glad I could provide something useful, Kiera. I will be going now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6048, '[NAME]! Wait! Please, take this gift for all of your hard work.\n\nWithout your help and the aid of the Henneathe Alliance, we would have never stood a chance against Malephar and his minions. Thank you... from all of us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6049, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6060, 'Zombie Invasion! (Event Quest)'),
(6061, 'Guard Captain Shutian wants you to help fight against the current zombie invasion! Help cure the infected creatures by collecting 50 Healing Herbs.\n(Healing Herbs can be found by gathering flowers.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6062, 'Yuck! Another pile of zombie goo! And these were new boots too... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6063, 'Zombie goo? That sounds pretty gross, Shutian.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6064, 'You\'re telling me, [NAME]! This stuff seems to be everywhere these days. Curse this blasted zombie invasion!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(6065, 'Wait... zombie invasion? How did I manage to miss that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6066, 'Well, it\'s a good thing you have! Luckily we\'ve all managed to keep these undead invaders from spreading all over Isya, but it looks like we may no longer be able to keep it a secret.\n\nTheir numbers are increasing and unfortunately it looks like the number of infected creatures is increasing too...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(6067, '"Infected" creatures? Oh, that can\'t be good...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6068, 'Yes, it looks like stepping in zombie goo is the least of our worries right now! \n\nMore and more creatures disppearing from the fields and when they return, they\'re... different to say the least. Everything from Kebings to Honeyings seem to have been infected by the zombies. \n\nWho knows what type of new powers these creatures now possess. They could even turn into zombies themselves if given enough time!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(6069, 'More zombies? That\'s the last thing we need right now!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6070, 'I couldn\'t agree more! We just can\'t afford to wait around and run the risk of all these creatures turning into zombies right before our eyes.\n\nThat is why I\'ve organized a city wide research experiment! Our scientists have developed a Zombie Antidote that seems to cure all infected creatures of any zombie-like impairments. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6071, 'Well, that\'s great! Sounds like they need to cook up a big batch of Zom-B-Away and everything will be ok!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6072, 'Haha, I like your spirit! However, it\'s a little more complicated than that.\n\nWe need ingredients to make more of this Zombie Antidote, and we could use all the help we can get! I need you to collect {color,yellow, 50 Healing Herbs} and bring them back here right away! Are you up for the challenge, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just 50? I can do that in my sleep!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know about this...][2] '),
(6073, 'Here you are, Shutian! I really hope those scientists are able to make a lot of antidotes with all these herbs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6074, 'Don\'t you worry, [NAME]. The infected creatures seem to be looking better... in fact, I have a feeling all this zombie nonsense will be over with before you know it!\n\nWe\'ve had plenty of time to observe the way these zombies move, and we\'ve decided to come up with something fun. This will teach you a new dance just in time for the Halloween party-- go on, take it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6075, 'Be careful out there, [NAME]! If you happen to come across any infected creatures, be sure to stay away!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6080, 'Halloween Phino! (Event Quest)'),
(6081, 'Halloween Phinos have appeared! \nUnless the Halloween Phinos are defeated, the Halloween Festival \nwill be a disaster. Chief Roumenus has asked this favor of the \nHeneath Alliance. Defeat the Halloween Phinos and return to Chief \nRoumenus in Roumen. \n(Halloween Phinos are in the Free Battle Zones) \n\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n'),
(6082, '[NAME]!! I need your help more then ever before!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1] \n[MENU]'),
(6083, 'Hey Chief, what\'s going on? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6084, 'Halloween Phinos! They- they appeared out of nowhere and stole my keys!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6085, 'What? Halloween Phino? I have never heard of them before! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6086, 'Halloween Phinos only appear during Halloween time and they come only to create ruckus and havoc! Before you know it they disappear into thin air. We cannot allow this to go on any longer! [NAME]!! Can you lend us a hand? The last I saw them, they were all headed into the Free Battle Zone. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Count me in! Sounds like an exciting mission.][1] [BUTTON]=[Sorry, I have other plans for Halloween.][2]'),
(6087, 'Chief, I defeated the Halloween Phino! It was pretty big, but I wasn\'t intimidated! Ok, well maybe a little... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6088, 'I knew you would be able to defeat them! Thanks to you, they will no longer appear during our Halloween celebrations. You have made the Henneath Alliance proud, please accept this gift! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Complete][1] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6089, 'Halloween Phino is formidable opponent. Please be careful! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU]'),
(6130, 'Gobble Gobble! (Event Quest)'),
(6131, 'Town Chief Roumenus in Roumen is preparing for the annual Isyan Thanksgiving feast and he needs your help! Collect 30 Turkey Thighs, 15 Uruga Potatoes, and 5 Jars of Cranberry Sauce.\n(Turky Thighs, Uruga Potatoes, and Jars of Cranberry Sauce can be found by defeating monsters.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6132, 'One, two, three, four...\n\nOh, this is useless! I know it\'s just not going to be enough.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(6133, 'Oh, hey there Roumenus! Sorry, I didn\'t meant to interrupt your counting.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6134, 'It\'s all right, [NAME]. I was just counting what little food we have left for Thanksgiving! Can you believe we only have 30 yams left? How is that supposed to feed hundreds of hungry Isyans? \n\nI just don\'t know what to do...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6135, 'Wait, what? Calm down, Roumenus. Maybe if you take a deep breath and tell me what happened, I can help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6136, 'Well, I suppose you\'re right.\n\nLate last night some hooligans broke into the Roumen Cornucopia... the storehouse where we keep all the food for the Isyan Thanksgiving feast!\n\nNow I just don\'t know how we can find and return all the food that was stolen in time for the big day.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6137, 'Hooligans? Who do you think would do such a thing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6138, 'Well, maybe not hooligans... but I believe that the cornucopia was raided by hungry monsters!\n\nHungry or not, we need to get all of our food back in time for the Thanksgiving feast.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6139, 'You\'re right, Roumenus! Thanksgiving will not be ruined for Isya... not on my watch!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6140, 'That\'s the spirit, [NAME]! Let me take a quick inventory of what we have left and I\'ll tell you what we still need to go collect! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(6141, 'Hm, ok. I think I\'ve figured out exactly what was stolen from the cornucopia.\n\nCan you please recover {color,yellow, 30 Turkey Thighs}, {color,yellow, 15 Uruga Potatoes}, and {color,yellow, 5 Jars of Cranberry Sauce} for me? \n\nIt\'s not everything, but it would sure put us back on the path to a great Thanksgiving feast!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Turkey, cranberry sauce, and potatoes? Sounds good!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, Roumenus. Maybe later.][2] '),
(6142, 'Here you go, Roumenus! I have all the food you asked me to collect. \n\nAnd let me tell you, it sure was hard to keep from snatching one of those Turkey Thighs for myself. It smells delicious!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(6143, 'Thank you, [NAME]! We still have a long way to go before the Thanksgiving feast is ready to be served, but this is a good start.\n\nI appreciate you not snacking on the turkey, too. Take these for all of your hard work. This tasty cobbler is famous throughout all of Roumen! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(6144, 'Twenty-two, twenty-three, twenty-fo--\n\nCurse Legel! It seems I\'ve lost count again...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7620, 'The Unlikely Toymaker  (Event Quest)'),
(7621, 'Item Merchant Kenton in Elderine is making toys for the children of Isya, but he needs supplies to get started. Collect 25 Wooden Blocks, 40 Googly Eyes, and 20 Metal Lumps.\n\n(Wooden Blocks can be found by harvesting wood, Googly Eyes can be found by defeating monsters, and Metal Lumps can be found by mining.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7622, 'Oh, [NAME]! I barely recognized you...\n\nYou\'re looking rather stylish today - it\'s a nice change.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7623, 'Wait... hey! That wasn\'t very nice. Where is your Christmas spirit, Kenton?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7624, 'Oh, you\'re right. I don\'t know why, but I always feel like such a scrooge during the holidays! \n\nI guess business just hasn\'t been very good lately.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7625, 'That\'s a shame! You would think with the holidays right around the corner people would be lining up around the block to buy presents!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7626, 'I thought so too, but I guess I was wrong.\n\nHm... I know! I need something new and exciting in my store this Christmas. People will visit my shop then!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7627, 'That sounds like a great idea, Kenton! New stock is always exciting. What are you thinking about selling?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7628, 'Well, I was visiting Pey over in Roumen the other day when I noticed some children playing with the most marvlous toy!\n\nIt was made of wood, and it was so colorful... had a big metal wind-up key and everything!\n[NEXT]'),
(7629, 'A wind-up toy? I love playing with those! Er, I mean... I loved playing with them as a little kid!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7630, 'Well, I wouldn\'t make something exactly like what I saw, but I think the kids would go crazy for a toy like that!\n\nA wind-up toy will help my business this season, for sure!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7631, 'That sounds like a plan, Kenton! I guess I\'ll just be going now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7632, 'Wait, [NAME]! Don\'t leave yet, there\'s something that you might be able to help me with.\n\nI\'ve given this some though, and I think I\'m going to make some extra toys this season! However, they toys won\'t be for sale. I\'ll donate one of them to every child in Isya! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7633, 'Wow, that\'s a really nice thing to do! Nobody will dare call you a scrooge after this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7634, 'Well, maybe. I want to make sure every human and elven child has a great Christmas this year! It\'s going to take a bunch of supplies to make this happen, though. \n\nI have a lot of toys to make and I need your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7635, 'It looks like I will need {color,yellow,25 Wooden Blocks}, about {color,yellow,40 Googly Eyes}, and oh... about 20 {color,yellow,Metal Lumps}. The metal is for all the wind-up keys! The toys just wouldn\'t be complete without them.\n\nSo what do you say, [NAME]\n\n[BUTTON]=[You got it! Let\'s make this Christmas great!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m really busy this time of year.][2] '),
(7636, 'Here are all the supplies you asked for, Kenton! How are the toys coming along?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7637, 'They\'re looking very acceptable indeed! I\'ve been thinking that I may not sell these toys at all, and donate them all to those in need! That would certainly be an act of Christmas cheer, huh?\n\nI had some metal left over, so I made you something special! I hope you like it, [NAME]. May it always remind you of the holiday season!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7638, 'Those children in Roumen looked so happy... I can\'t wait to see their eyes light up like that again!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7700, 'Making Spirits Bright (Event Quest)'),
(7701, 'Item Merchant Pey in Roumen wants to build the most beautiful Christmas tree in all of Isya! Help her out by gathering Star Pieces, Angel Bells, and Scarlet Candles.\n(Search the Free Battle Zones for these items.) \n[LINE] \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7702, 'Hey there, [NAME]! Have you had a chance to see the Christmas tree in Roumen yet?\n\nIt makes me so sad to see such a sight! It\'s just so tacky and well... shabby.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1] \n[MENU]'),
(7703, 'Oh, really? I thought it was pretty cool...\n[NEXT]'),
(7704, 'No way! Those are the same ornaments I remember seeing as a child, they haven\'t been changed in over a decade. I want something different this year! I want the Christmas tree in Roumen to outshine all the other trees in Isya. We\'ll have the best tree ever!\n\nI heard you can find some pretty decorations in these special chests! However, you must travel to the Free Battle Zone in order to get them. Will you gather {color,yellow,Star Pieces}, {color,yellow,Angel Bells}, and {color,yellow,Scarlet Candles} for me?\n\nJust watch out! I heard there is a monster living there now... \n\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t wait!! Make the christmas tree we never ever seen.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d love so. But I have to go to party now.][2]'),
(7705, 'Pey, I\'ve got all the decorations you wanted. They\'re all so pretty... just look!\n\nI can hear the sounds of Christmas carolers off in the distance, and smell all the yummy candy canes! This really is what Christmas is all about.\n[NEXT]'),
(7706, 'Mm, I love candy canes! They always help me to get in the Christmas spirit.\n\nThank you for all your help, [NAME].  Thanks to you, we\'re going to have the best Christmas in Isya this year!\n\n{color,yellow,Merry Christmas!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7707, 'Jingle bells, jingle bells, jingle all the-- oh were you listening? \n\nHave you found all of the decorations I need for the tree? Head straight to the Free Battle Zone at once! I\'m counting on you, [NAME].\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1] \n[MENU]'),
(7640, 'An Ancient Power Returns (Event Quest)'),
(7641, 'Town Chief Roumenus in Roumen needs you to kill 15 Apprentices of Aquarius and 15 Apprentices of Neptune.\n\n(Apprentices of Aquarius and Apprentices of Neptune can be found roaming about in the Forest of Tides.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7642, '[NAME]! Boy, am I glad to see you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7643, 'Hey there, Roumenus! I thought I\'d stop by and say hello.\n\nThat was quite a holiday season we had, wasn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7644, 'You could certainly say that again. However, it seems like we have something new to worry about now.\n\nYou won\'t believe what news I have from the Sea of Greed! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7645, 'Oh, dear... is it Mara? Is she terrorizing the shores again? Because if she is, I\'ll go and teach her a lesson!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7646, 'Oh, no. Nothing like that! This news comes from Ancient Templar Beth, one of my most trusted guards.\n\nShe has reports of never before seen warriors settling on Isyan soil. While these invaders do not appear to be hostile towards our kind, they will attack when provoked.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7647, 'Strange warriors? Where are they coming from?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7648, 'Well, that is something that is a bit of a mystery to me as well. However, I do know that there are two sides to this story.\n\nThere appear to be two different groups of soldiers. One of these groups follow the ruling of Queen Aquarius, and the other obeys the commands of Queen Neptune.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7649, 'Queen Aquarius and... Queen Neptune?\n\nI\'m sorry, I don\'t quite follow you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7650, 'Let me explain, [NAME]. Long ago there was a fierce battle between two rivaling island nations, one belonging to Queen Aquarius and one belonging to Queen Neptune.\n\nHow this entire fiasco started is a thing of the past, however, it appears that the battle is far from over! A resolution was never reached all those years ago, and it appears the forces of Aquarius and Neptune have come to fight yet again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7651, 'I see. It\'s starting to sound vaguely familiar now. So what do we do about these invading soldiers, Roumenus?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7652, 'While this battle is between these two queens, it seems like Isya is always getting caught in the middle! I have been speaking with Shutian and Adrien about this issue, and we believe that taking the offensive is the way to go.\n\nWe need to squash this invasion before it has the chance to become a full blown war!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7653, 'I am in charge of eradicating the weaker soldiers, and those that stand to cause the most harm to Roumen. That being said, I need you to slay {color,yellow,15 Apprentices of Aquarius} and {color,yellow,15 Apprentices of Neptune}.\n\nWe\'re all in this together, [NAME]. Will you help?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course! Anything to defend Roumen!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I would prefer to not get involved right now.][2] '),
(7654, 'This may be an ancient battle, but those soldiers really have some fight left in them! I\'ve killed all the apprentices you have asked me to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7655, 'That is good to hear, [NAME]. I was awaiting any positive news from the front lines, so I thank you for this help.\n\nPerhaps when you are ready, you may speak with Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine to continue your journey. Until then, please accept this as a token of my appreciation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7656, 'While the apprentices may appear weaker when compared to the other invaders, they are still a threat to all of Isya! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7660, 'Turning of the Tides (Event Quest)'),
(7661, 'Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine needs you to kill 25 Zealots of Aquarius and 25 Zealots of Neptune.\n\n(Zealots of Aquarius and Zealots of Neptune can be found roaming about in Moonlight Tomb.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7662, 'This is troubling... very troubling, indeed!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7663, 'What\'s on your mind, Shutian? You always seem so busy, maybe there\'s something I can help you with!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7664, 'Busy? Well, you know what they say! "A Guard Captain\'s work is never done", or... something like that.\n\nI certainly have my hands full right now, I can tell you that much!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7665, 'Oh, I see. This isn\'t about the warriors of Queen Aquarius and Queen Neptune, is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7666, 'Why... yes! How did you know about that? Oh well, it doesn\'t matter!\n\nQueen Aquarius and Queen Neptune were once the beautiful leaders of two feuding island nations. According to the legend, they were both driven by their greed and desire for treasure. This all happened a long time ago, of course. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7667, 'If this happened long ago, why would this matter be troubling you now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7668, 'It appears this ancient battle is far from over, [NAME]. I have heard reports from Town Chief Roumenus of these invaders setting foot on Isyan soil. \n\nAt first they were confined to the areas located on the shores, but it looks like they\'ve made their way further inland. I fear Elderine may soon be in danger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7669, 'Elderine? That\'s... impossible! There are so many guards and soldiers that would protect this city.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7670, 'We cannot underestimate the power of these invaders, [NAME]. While they do not appear to be hostile towards us, I know it is only a matter of time before they begin to turn against the humans and elves. They are determined to fight one another, and Isya is the one who will be caught in between.\n\nI have discussed this matter with both Adrian and Roumenus and we have determined what action to take.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7671, 'All of the town chiefs need to be prepared to defend their cities, just as I am ready to take arms and protect Elderine. I could sure use your help, [NAME].\n\nThe Zealots are the warriors who seem to cause the most harm to my city. I need you to slay {color,yellow,25 Zealots of Aquarius} and {color,yellow,25 Zealots of Neptune}.\n\nThe fate of Elderine rests upon your shoulders. Will you help us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will fight for Isya! You have my word, Shutian.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just don\'t see how this effects me.][2] '),
(7672, 'You were right about taking the initiative in this battle, Shutian. Those Zealots seemed ready to attack the city walls at any moment!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7673, 'That is what I was afraid of, [NAME]. However, I know that within these city walls lives brave soldiers willing to fight for this land. I just hope that these followers of Aquarius and Neptune will settle there own petty dispute before it gets that far. \n\nI\'ve heard that Town Chief Adrian is still fighting to save Uruga. When you feel you are prepared to fight an even greater foe, you should pay her a visit. Until then, please accept this as a token of my appreciation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7674, 'So say the Zealots are the most devoted soldiers of Queen Aquarius and Queen Neptune. They must be stopped!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7680, 'The Battle Ends Now (Event Quest)'),
(7681, 'Town Chief Adrian needs you to kill 30 Guardians of Aquarius and 30 Guardians of Neptune.\n\n(Guardians of Aquarius and Guardians of Neptune can be found roaming about in Ancient Elven Woods.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7682, 'Can you beleve everything that has been happening recently, [NAME]? First Roumen, then Elderine... and now my fair city of Uruga!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7683, 'Roumen? Elderine? Am I missing something, Adrian?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7684, 'You haven\'t heard? Well, no matter. All you need to know is that this battle will end today!\n\nUruga will never fall... not on my watch! The followers of Queen Aquarius and Queen Neptune will be long gone before you know it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7685, 'Wait. Queen Aquarius...? Queen Neptune...? I think I missed a step somewhere. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7686, 'Oh, [NAME]! I simply don\'t have time for this, but I suppose I should quickly explain what is happening.\n\nA coupld days ago, all the town chiefs received word of soliders landing on the shores of the Sea of Greed. While it appears that these invaders are not hostile towards citizens of Isya, they will fight one another. Judging by their armor, we have determined that they are followers of Queen Aquarius and Queen Neptune.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7687, 'I see... It still doesn\'t really explain who Queen Aquarius and Queen Neptune are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7688, 'Oh, of course! I wasn\'t finished telling the whole story.\n\nQueen Aquarius and Queen Neptune both ruled over their own island nations long ago. Driven by their greed and lust for power, they fought against one another, both determined to reign as the only queen. This battle was never settled, however. \n\nNow it appears that both sides are continuing to fight in this petty battle, and on Isyan soil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7689, 'That sounds pretty exciting, Adrian! An ancient battle, two long forgotten queens... sign me up!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7690, 'This is a serious matter, [NAME]! All of Isya is caught in the middle of this ancient feud, and the consequences may be disastrous for our cities. \n\nBoth Shutian and Roumenus have been informed of the situation and we have all determined what our next step needs to be.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7691, 'Unfortunately, it appears that the city of Uruga will be the primary target of these invaders. The strongest soldiers of both Aquarius and Neptune have been spotted not far from here.\n\nWe need to attack these warriors before they cause any harm to Isya! I need you to slay {color,yellow,30 Guardians of Aquarius} and {color,yellow,30 Guardians of Neptune}.\n\nNow is the time to stand strong, [NAME]. We need to end this now. Will you help?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I am willing to give my life for Isya!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I think I\'ve changed my mind about this.][2] '),
(7692, 'When you said those guardians were the strongest soldiers, you weren\'t joking! I managed to defeat them all, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7693, 'Yes, unfortunately Uruga will need to fight the hardest to remain standing when the time comes. I thank you for all your assistance, [NAME]. This battle may not be over quite yet, but I feel that with your help we are now one step closer.\n\nPlease accept these gifts as a token of my appreciation. Go on, don\'t be humble!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7694, 'Please be careful out there. The guardians are the strongest of Aquarius and Neptune\'s forces. They will attack when provoked!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7710, 'Burning Cave 1'),
(7711, 'Storage Keeper Franz found a new cave in Burnning Rock. Talk with Franz.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7712, '[NAME], Wait a minute.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7713, 'What\'s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7714, 'Hush, be quiet\n[NAME], I have something to ask you in secret.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7715, 'Personal request, isn\'t it?\nI wish I could help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7716, 'Listen up.\nA few days ago, I found a strange cave on my way back from an errand for Merchant Master Maxuter \nBut I didn\'t think that it was formed naturally, so I enered it. An unseen monster slept there.\nLooked like a rock...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7717, 'In such cases, you\'d better tell Maxuter and defeat it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7718, 'Hush, please be quiet.\nOn second thought, it crossed the mind that there would be something marvelous in that monster.\nThis will be a chance to step closer to my dream.\n\nWould you help me? Please help me~ \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7719, 'This is a chance! Heaven helps me!~\n\n[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7720, 'Burning Cave 2'),
(7721, 'You must defeat the Rock Stone, the rock monster that is sleeping in the cave that Storage Keeper Franz found. Defeat the monster and bring back Shards of the Rock Stone.\n(The Burnning Cave is located in the north)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7722, 'Would you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7723, 'I\'m also curious about the Rock monster?\nI will help you~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7724, 'I will call the rock monster, Rock Stone.\nAs I found it first, I get to name it. What a cool name~I ask a favor of you~ Please bring me Shards from the Rock Stone.\nIt will be absolutely great!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK. Shards from the Rock Stone!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[May I have a raincheck?][2]'),
(7725, 'Franz!\nHere are Shards from the Rock Stone..\nThey are pretty normal...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7726, 'Well~ they look normal but,\nI\'ll have to wait and see it.\nThank you for your effort.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7727, 'The Rock Stone is in the cave in the north.\nIt looked strong, so make sure you are well prepared!\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7730, 'My hunchs never proves wrong!'),
(7731, 'Franz believes that there is something valuable in the Shards of the Rock Stones.\n Bring the Shards of the Rock Stone to Franz. \n(Burning Cave is in the north) \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7732, '[NAME], I ask a favor of you again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7733, 'Again?\nYou mean when you ask me to obtain the Shards of the Rock Stone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7734, 'The previous favor was just a Stone\'s shard.\nThis time, I think you will get something  remarkable. My hunchs tend to be on point 100%.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok!~ I believe your hunch!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just your hunch~ask another adventurer.][2]'),
(7735, 'Franz, I got the Shards of the Rock Stone, It looks normal, too~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7736, 'You can\'t mean that\nI will get it checked soon.\nThanks for your effort.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7737, 'Advanture is out there. Go Go GO!\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7740, 'Prior Block 1'),
(7741, 'A new cave in the northest was found.\nYou need to talk with the Item Merchnat Julian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7742, '[NAME], I really need your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7743, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7744, 'Here in Burning Rock, big and small earthquake occurs everyday by volcanic activity .\nThere was a relatively big earthquake recently. Afterwords I saw a small cave created in the northwest while looking around for geogrphical features.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7745, 'So?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7746, 'At first, the cave was empty but monsters gradually gathered in the cave because of the heat in the cave.\nI\'m not sure how many monsters gathered, but I think we have to take measures before it becomes a big problem.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7747, 'The solution before the the trouble starts is the best one.\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7750, 'Prior Block 2'),
(7751, 'Item Merchant Julian asks you to defeat the Fire Golem that rules the Cave of Fever.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7752, 'You must take measures before it becomes a problem.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7753, 'I can help solve it.\nWhat can I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7754, 'Thank you.\nWe called the northwest cave the Cave of Fever.\nIn the Cave of Fever, {color,yellow,Magmatons} and {color,yellow, the Fire Golem} have settled down.\nI think Magmatons have gathered, driven by the Fire Golem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7755, 'Then, if we defeat the Fire Golem, the other monsters in the Cave of Fever will disburse, right ?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7756, 'I think so.\n[NAME], If you defeat the {color, yellow,Fire Golem}, your efforts will be rewarded.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, trust me][1]\n[BUTTON]=[ Well, I think it\'s too hard yet][2]'),
(7757, 'I defeated the {color, yellow,Fire Golem}.\nSo much stronger than I thought.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7758, 'Thank you.\nI will wait and observe the situation.\nI hope the monsters don\'t gather again but it is kind of expected to happen.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7759, 'Fire Golem is such a strong a monster.\nIf you fight with it alone, you will never win. Cooperate with other adventurers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7760, 'Prior Block 3'),
(7761, 'Julian investigates the Cave of Fever whose temperature is higher than that of other areas.\nYou must help Julian collect Stone shards in the Cave of Fever.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7762, 'Would you help me investgate the Cave of Fever?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7763, 'Sure, I am very interested in the Cave of Fever.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7764, 'Thank you. Since the temperature in the Cave of Fever is higher than other areas, that cave is the best resting place to monsters that like high temperatures.\nI need to investigate why this happened, but combine it with the the work of a peddling merchant. So, I\'m short-handed.\nWould you find {color, yellow, 3 Stone Shards} for me in the Cave of Fever?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I will help you][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate it because there are many monsters][2]'),
(7765, 'I  got three Stone Shards from the Cave of Fever.\nI hope this solves the problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7766, 'Thank you for your concern.\nI believe it\'ll produce a good result.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7767, 'Hey, I know it will be tough.\n \n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7770, 'Prior Block 4'),
(7771, 'It is said that monsters would gather endlessly if the temperature is as high as it is.\nYou must defeat the Fire Golem to lower the temperature.\n(The Cave of Fever is in the northwest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7772, '[NAME], I checked the Stone Shards from the Cave of Fever.\n\n[BUTTON]= [Quest starts][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7773, 'Already? That was faster than a speeding tiger.\nI can\'t wait.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7774, 'Sorry to say, but the cave itself is not different from any other cave.\nThe heat has just gathered in the cave because of a change caused by the earthquake. So, the Fire Golem would probably appear, driven by that heat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7775, 'Then, what can I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7776, 'Unexpectedly the simple way was suggested.\nThen, other monsters\' gathering around will reduced.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7777, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7780, 'Prior Block 5'),
(7781, 'You must defeat the Fire Golem in the Cave of Fever and gain time until the heat lowers.\n(The Cave of Fever is in the northwest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7782, 'Now you\'ve been told the situation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7783, 'You mean I must gain time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7784, 'You understood exactly what I meant.\nWould you defeat the {color,yellow,Fire Golem} in the Cave of Fever?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you before big problems surface][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Having enough time so far, I wiil help you next time][2]'),
(7785, 'I defeated the Fire Golem and have returned.\nThings should be ok for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7786, 'Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7787, 'Ready to go? \n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7790, 'Block Heat!'),
(7791, 'The Fire Golem appeared in the Cave of Fever again.\nYou must defeat the Fire Golem and gain time until the heat reduces.\n(The Cave of Fever is in the northwest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7792, '[NAME], they say that Fire Golem appeared again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7793, 'Please go to Cave of Fever in the northwest and defeat the Fire Golem.\nYou\'d better move as fast as your little feet can take  you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you before bigger problems happen][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Having enough time so far, I will help you next time][2]'),
(7794, 'I returned after defeating the Fire Golem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7795, 'Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7796, 'No Worry! I hope see you soon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4070, 'Super Ping Pig 1'),
(4071, 'Cleo who assigns to adventurers in the Swamp of Dawn\nShe asks for defeating Super Ping Pig that intend to judge  adventurers and to tyrannize them.\nYou must defeat Super Ping Pig and bring the Super Pattern.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4072, 'It is said that a really  strange Ping Pig appeared.\nHe says he is a Super Ping Pig of justice and idolizes himselfoppresses the adventurers, using strong power, and spreads the black-hearted rumors.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4073, 'Darn it all! Ping Pig? I think he is not so strong...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4074, 'He is not an ordinary Ping Pig.\nHe is a Super Ping Pig.\nWe receive requests for help from far and near. help for defeating him...It is likely that he enterd the village, tyrannized people and set fire.\nToday\'s request is that you defeat Super Ping Pig and bring the Super pattern.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, of course][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I will refuse it][2]'),
(4075, 'Here is Superman..no, Super pattern.\nI think I\'ve seen it many times...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4076, 'Oh, do you? You are simply under an illusion.\nThank you. Here is the reward.\nWith this, the situation will subside for a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4077, 'It will be stronger than you think.\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4080, 'The vacation is mine!'),
(4081, 'Thompson wants to go on vacation after defeating Fire Ruby Guardian.\nHe must defeat Fire Ruby Guardian and bring Shards of it as a pledge.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4082, 'Hey hey.\n\nCome here quietly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4083, 'Who? Me?\n\nWhat\'s going on today?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4084, 'Hh...\nI\'m sure you have defeated Ruby Guardian, haven\'t you? But this time, a strong guy called Fire Ruby Guardian appeared.\nThanks to him, Maxuter got busy.\nIf I find someone that can defeat him, Maxuter promised me to go on vacation.\n\nHow about you? Won\'t you defeat him?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok, I will defeat him][1]\n[BUTTON]=[For whom? Hah][2]'),
(4085, 'Here is a Shard of Fire Ruby Guardian, a pledge of a Guardian.\n\nNow you can go do vacation, Can\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4086, 'He, he! What a lark!\nWill he certainly give a vacation? I eventually go home! Wahoo!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4087, 'Find it quickly. It is difficult if another one leap up.\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4090, 'Diamond is mine!'),
(4091, 'Thompson in Burning Rock says that he wants to have the diamond of the Diamond Tree this time.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4092, 'Oh oh the gleam, the beautiful diamond, the money!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(4093, 'Thompson, you wanted to see me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4094, 'Ohoh!  you\'ve come. My friend!\nWhew~ I have been a little uneasy these days, I haven\'t slept well since I saw that glittering diamond.\nThis happened when a new monster called \'Diamond Tree\' appeared.\n\nBrilliant diamonds are all over its body...!!\nHhhh... That amount will make me quit this merchant shop and start my business in Elderine.\nPlease bring me the diamonds of Diamond Tree!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok. I will bring it to you if you want][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What a fool! Do you think it\'s a real diamond?][2]'),
(4095, 'Here you are. Here are diamonds from Diamond Tree.\n(urgh~it feels ghastly)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(4096, '...Wow! How the color shines through this rough diamond... huh.\n(It is somehow soft to the touch)\n\nAargh! Nasty!\nWhat is this hogwash? It\'s giving me a strange feeling. It looks like a rough diamond, but it somehow feels like a living thing?!\nAre you kidding me?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(4097, '[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7810, 'Crystal Investigation 1'),
(7811, 'Thompson heard a rumor about the black crystal from the Crystal Palace Monsters.\nYou must obtain the unknown crystal from the monsters in Burning Rock.\n(The crystal can be obtained from Crystal Guardian.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7812, '[NAME]! Give me a chance to change my life!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7813, 'Uh? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7814, 'Not long ago, I went to Uruga and heard an interesting rumor there.\nI think [NAME] also know that...the black crystal comes froms from crystal palace.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7815, 'Sure, I think Heneath Adventures all knew that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7816, 'Then, do you know the power of the Black Crystal?\nIn fact, we can obtain crystal from Burning Rock as well. It\'s not black crystal but it\'s crystal, too. It will be sold as good Price.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7817, 'So would you like me to obtain the crystal for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7818, 'There is something extraordinary in this veteran adventurer. The Crystal can be obtained from the monster called the Crystal Guardian.\nI don\'t need that many crystals! Just obtain 10 crystals for me! Just 10 should work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, yes. 10 crystals!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I feel uneasy somehow][2]'),
(7819, 'Thompson, I got you the 10 crystals you requested.\nUmm, they are different from the Black Crystals.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7820, 'Please give me the crystals now. Umm, they look ok in appearance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7821, 'Crystal Guardian!~ You see what I mean?\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7830, 'Crystal Investigation 2'),
(7831, 'Thompson asks you to bring the crystal to Julian to investigate.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7832, 'Umm, I don\' have the slightest idea of what this is, no matter how I look at it~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7833, 'I don\'t know, either.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7834, 'So! I just asked Julian to investigate the crystal. \n~Precious crystal~ Let me put it into a Crystal Bag so bring it to Julian~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure~ give me that~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it on your own][2]'),
(7835, 'Julian, I  brought crystal at Thompson\'s request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7836, 'I\'ve been expecting you.\nHand over it to me. I am curious about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7837, 'What are you doing? \n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7840, 'Crystal Investigation 3'),
(7841, 'Julian says that a red hammer will help investigate the power of crystal.\nThe Red Hammer of the Flame Mole can be obtained from a Flame Mole.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7842, '[NAME]. There is no way to investigate it with my instruments. Maybe, you can help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7843, 'What can I do for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7844, 'There is a object that is hidden very well, called the Red Hammer, that will make the investigation of the power of the crystal much easier.\nThe Red Hammer can be obtained from a Flame Mole.\nCan you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, of course][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need to relax for a while][2]'),
(7845, 'Julian!\nHere is the Red Hammer of the Flame Mole.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7846, 'Indeed, that was really fast.I will check it right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7847, 'Flame Mine is an interesting place.\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7850, 'Crystal Investigation 4'),
(7851, 'Julian says that it is an ordinary crystal after investigating its power.\nYou must give it back to Thompson.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7852, 'Well, shall we check it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7853, 'Ok!\n(Pit-a-pet, pit-a-pet~)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7854, '(Julian who hits the crystal with the red hammer)\n..It must of been broken..\nThis is just an ordinary crystal.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7855, 'What? Have you finished analyzing the crystal?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7856, 'Yes~ I finished it.\nThere would have been a reaction if the crystal had had a strong power.\nThat\'s just logic.\nWell, would you bring the remnants to Thompson?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it on your own][2]'),
(7857, 'I\'m back from Julian.\nHere is the crystal pocket.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7858, 'Has it been already investigated?\nWhat did Julian say? Please tell me at once~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7859, 'Julian said that it was an ordinary crystal.\nSorry to get your hopes up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7860, 'I knew it!\nIts color was too tranparent!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7861, '\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7870, 'The threat of the Guardian 1'),
(7871, 'This area was damaged by the attatck from the Crystal Guardian.\nYou come back after defeating 6 Guardian Masters which control the Crystal Guardian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7872, 'These days, the attacks are getting more and more severe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7873, 'It worries me that the case damaged by monsters far and near increases. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7874, 'Not long ago, Crystal Guardians had attacked here.\nFortunately, there was no big damage but if they attack us again, we won\'t be able to defend against them. So, I ask a favor of you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7875, 'Isn\'t it a rare case for monsters to do a systematic attack?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7876, '[NAME], you are exactly right.\nMy guess is that the Crystal Guardian is ruled by the Guardian Master.\nI think if we defeat the Guardian Master, there will be no systematic movement from the Crystal Guardian.\nPlease defeat {color, yellow, 6 Guardian Masters}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, no problem][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not confident][1]'),
(7877, 'I\'ve just come back from defeating 6 Guardian Masters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7878, 'Thank you. The threat from the Crystal Guardians will get weaker over time, just as I expect.\nThis is a token of my gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7879, 'Haven\'t you started yet?\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7880, 'The threat of the Guardian 2'),
(7881, 'It\'s a tragic.\nYou should listen to Julian\'s story.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7882, '[NAME], the Crystal Guardians have attacked here again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7883, 'No way. We defeated Guardian Masters last time.\nSo there is no monster that rule the Crystal Guardians.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7884, 'I thought that if we defeated the Guardian Master, there would be no monster that controlled the Crystal Guardian. But boy was I wrong.\nNow that the Guardian Masters are gone, the Crystal Guardians started to leap for joy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7885, 'What can I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7886, 'That\'s what I\'m worried about.\nThere is a simple way...but I\'m not sure this will work.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7887, '.\n[BUTTON]=[To be contined][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7890, 'The threat of the Guardian 3'),
(7891, 'Julian is asking for the Guardian Master\'s Clothes.\nCan  you obtained 5 sets of the Guardian Master\'s Clothes and give them to Julian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7892, '[NAME], please can we use your services again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7893, 'Of course. Once I\'ve started something, I will see it through to the end.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7894, 'I am making puppets of the Guardian Master that rules the Crystal Guardian.\nIf I put the Guardian Master\'s Clothes on pupppets, the Crystal Guardians might take them for Gardian Masters.\n[NAME], Please obtain 5 sets of the Guardian Master\'s clothes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry~trust me][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too busy to do that][2]'),
(7895, 'Here are 5 sets of the Guardian Master\'s Clothes. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7896, 'You handled this task perfectly.\nI\'ve made the puppets just in time. Now we just have to wait for the results.\nThank you for your effort.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7897, 'It will be more effective if there are clothes that are not that damaged.\n\n[BUTTON]= [To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7910, 'Franz\'s Hunch'),
(7911, 'Franz feels unknowable anxiety.\nYou hear Fanz\'s story.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7912, '[NAME]..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7913, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7914, 'As I have told you before~ \nMy hunchs are usually right.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7915, 'Oh..yes..(In fact, I don\'t think so!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7916, 'I\'ve been feeling strange lately.\nI feel like something will happen. I don\' know why but I have a hunch that something is likely to appear in Isya.\n\nIt\'s too troublesome for me to sleep.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7917, 'You don\'t need to worry about things that haven\'t happen yet.\n\nIf such things happen, I will take care of them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7918, 'That\'s reassuring.\nI hope my hunch is wrong but it never is. I fear there will be many changes coming soon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7919, 'Did you hear Franz\'s story?\n\n[BUTTON]=[To be continued][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7920, 'Matchmaker Mania 1 (Event Quest)'),
(7921, 'Healer Avon in Elderine has a secret crush on someone in Isya, and it\'s up to you to find out who it is!\n\n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7922, 'Your eyes are as blue as a Bogey\'s shell...\n\nNo, no! That doesn\'t sound right at all!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7923, 'Hey there, Avon! I haven\'t seen you in ages.\n\nHow is the health stone business going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7924, 'Oh, hello [NAME]. Well, as a matter of fact it\'s been going rather slowly. I\'m afraid I\'ve just been too distracted lately!\n\nHer eyes, her smile... I just can\'t think of anything else!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7925, 'Uh-oh, Avon... it sounds like you\'ve been struck by Cupid\'s arrow!\n\nWho is the lucky lady you seem to be so smitten with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7926, 'Err... I don\'t know what you\'re talking about!\n\n*looks around nervously*\n\nOh, all right. Is it that obvious? I didn\'t want anyone to know...\n \n[NEXT] '),
(7927, 'There\'s nothing wrong with being in love, Avon! There is so much love in the air right now... it\'s rather contagious!\n\nIs that a poem you\'re working on there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7928, 'This? Well, I was hoping it would be a poem...\n\nIt seems like I don\'t have much of a knack for romance and stuff like that! I guess she\'ll just never know how I feel about her.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7929, 'Don\'t say that, Avon! If you let me know who has captured your heart, perhaps I can help you.\n\nI don\'t really like to brag, but I can be quite the matchmaker! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7930, 'That\'s really sweet of you, but unfortunately I can\'t let you know who it is!\n\nJust think of what could happen if I told you! What if she doesn\'t feel the same? Oh... I don\'t think I could stand the embarrassment.\n\n[BUTTON]=[If you won\'t tell me who it is, then I\'ll have to figure it out myself!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, you\'re stubborn! I guess I won\'t bother you anymore.][2]'),
(7931, 'Yes...? I\'m a very busy man, so please make this quick.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7932, 'I guess my love will just have to stay a secret forever!\n\nOh no... I hope some of my neighboring shop owners didn\'t overhear me speaking about my love! How embarassing!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7940, 'Matchmaker Mania 2 (Event Quest)'),
(7941, 'Healer Avon in Elderine has a secret crush on someone in Isya, and it\'s up to you to find out who it is!\n\nPerhaps there is someone who might have overheard Avon speaking about his secret love... \n\n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7942, 'No no! That\'s all wrong. The Spider licenses go over here and the Zombie ones go over there, not the other way around!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7943, 'Hm, let\'s see who would know something...\n\nOh, Bran! Perfect! Say, I was wondering if you could answer a question for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7944, 'I just hope this isn\'t about the latest batch of weapon licenses. You see, I recently hired this new apprentice and I specifically TOLD him not to...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7945, 'Er, licenses? I\'m here to talk to you about something else, actually.\n\nI imagine you\'re pretty close with Healer Avon over there, right? I mean, considering your shops are right next to each other.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7946, 'I suppose you could say that we are close friends. Why do you ask, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7947, 'Well, I\'m not sure if you\'ve noticed lately, but Avon seems to be acting a bit odd.\n\nAfter some clever pestering on my part, I managed to get the old healer to say he was in love! Can you believe it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7948, 'Love, you say?\n\nThat does seem to be going around these days, though if you ask me, romance is just a load of nonsense!\n\nBut that is besides the point. What does Avon being in love have to do with me? \n\n[NEXT] '),
(7949, 'Since you guys are friends, I was hoping you could tell me the name of the lady who has caught his eye! He seems very shy, so I am determined to help him win her over.\n\nHe finally admitted to me that he was in love, but he wouldn\'t say anything else...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7950, 'Hm, it sounds like you should quit being so nosy!\n\nThe truth is, I\'m afraid I can\'t help even if I wanted to. I tend not to meddle in matters such as these. \n\n[NEXT] '),
(7951, 'Oh... I see. Do you know of anyone who would be able to help me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7952, 'You seem very determined to help Avon, [NAME]. If you must know who he is in love with, I would recommend paying a visit to Vietree.\n\nThat hairstylist always likes to stay ahead of the latest gossip. If there is anything going on in Isya, she\'ll know about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Vietree, huh? Looks like I am off to Roumen!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Vietree? Ugh, I don\'t want to see her after what she did to my hair last time!] [2]'),
(7953, 'Hmmm? Do you have something you want to ask me, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7954, 'I already told you that I don\'t know anything.\n\nPerhaps you should try speaking to Vietree in Roumen, that would be my advice.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7960, 'Matchmaker Mania 3 (Event Quest)'),
(7961, 'Healer Avon in Elderine has a secret crush on someone in Isya, and it\'s up to you to find out who it is!\n\nSpeak with Vietree by her beauty shop in Roumen to learn more information.\n\n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7962, 'Hm, maybe if I add a little more red to this hair dye...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7963, 'Vietree! How is my favorite beautician doing? You are looking quite fabulous today!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7964, 'Oh, [NAME]... I always look fabulous!\n\nWhat can I do for you today? Let me guess... a new haircut?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7965, 'Actually, I came to visit you for a different reason. But now that you mention it...\n\nNo, nevermind! A new haircut will have to come later. What I really want to talk to you about is Healer Avon. You see, he\'s been acting weird lately.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7966, 'Oh? Tell me about it! I want to hear everything!\n\nStep right in to my beauty salon and have a seat! Oh, how I love gossip!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7967, 'Well, I was hoping you could tell me something! All I know is that Avon is in love with someone, but I can\'t determine who it is.\n\nWhen I ask him about it, he turns bright red and turns away! It\'s so childish, don\'t you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7968, 'Hm, he does seem like the shy type. But it definitely sounds like he is smitten with this girl-- whoever she is!\n\nCome to think of it, our town healer has been acting a little odd lately as well...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7969, 'Wait a minute...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7970, '*gasp*\n\nYou... you don\'t think this could be related, do you?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7971, 'You mean Healer Julia? She is rather pretty, I suppose...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7972, 'It sounds perfectly romantic, don\'t you think? I was just mentioning to Pey the other day how Julia seems to be off in her own little world lately.\n\nIf I didn\'t know any better, I would say she\'s in love too. Maybe you could try talking to her!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Julia is right around the corner... I might as well try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t really trust your judgement, Vietree... no offense.][2] '),
(7973, 'Whaaa--?! Oh, you startled me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7974, 'I\'m telling you, Julia has been acting very strange lately!\n\nIt\'s just too perfect to be a coincidence! It has to be fate...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7980, 'Matchmaker Mania 4 (Event Quest)'),
(7981, 'Healer Avon in Elderine has a secret crush on someone in Isya, and it\'s up to you to find out who it is!\n\n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7982, '*sigh*\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7983, 'Hey there, Julia!\n\nYou seem a little down. Is everything ok?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7984, 'Hmm? Oh, I\'m not down at all!\n\nI\'m just, well... oh, nevermind. You wouldn\'t understand.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7985, 'You never know, maybe I could help you!\n\nWhy don\'t you tell me about what it is that\'s bothering you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7986, 'Well, there\'s this boy in Elderine and he...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7987, 'Let me guess. Blue skin, light colored hair... purple vest? Possibly in the same business as you?\n\nAm I on the right track?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7988, 'Err... um...\n\n*Julia\'s cheeks flush bright red*\n\nOh, who am I fooling? You have to promise not to say anything at all, [NAME]! I don\'t know how you figured it out, but if Avon were to know how I felt...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(7989, 'Don\'t you worry, Julia! Your secret is safe with me...\n\n*giggle*\n\nI\'m just going to head off to Elderine on some unrelated business right now. See you later!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7990, 'I don\'t think I like the sound of that laugh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7991, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8020, 'Matchmaker Mania 5 (Event Quest)'),
(8021, 'Healer Avon in Elderine wishes to win the heart of Healer Julia, and he needs your help! Collect 20 Red Roses and 30 Fancy Chocolates so he can give them to his love.\n\n(Red Roses can be found by collecting flowers, and Fancy Chocolates can be found by defeating monsters.)\n\n[LINE]  \n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8022, 'Roses are red, violets are blue... Helga is smelly, and...\n\nWait, where was I going with this? Oh, it\'s no use. I\'ll never finish this poem!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8023, 'Hello again, Avon! I see you\'re still hard at work on that poem of yours.\n\nHow is it coming along?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8024, 'Oh, hey [NAME]. The poem is, you know... it\'s still a rough draft. I know I\'ll find the perfect words eventually.  \n\nWait... why are you smiling like that? Tell me!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(8025, 'Oh, me? Don\'t you worry about me! I\'m here to help YOU!\n\nNow if we\'re going to help you and Healer Julia get together, we\'re going to need a plan...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8026, 'A plan! Yes, exactly!\n\n...\n\nHEY! Now you wait just a second! Who... who told you? Oh, I knew this would end terribly.\n \n[NEXT]'),
(8027, 'Calm down there, Avon! Don\'t be so negative!\n\nI think you and Julia would make a great couple, and I know just the thing to help make it official. Trust me, I know she\'ll love it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8028, 'Oh, well I guess if you already know... all right. I met her during the annual Isyan Healers Association meeting last month, and not a day has gone by since that I haven\'t thought of her!\n\nI\'ve been trying to think of a way to tell her how I feel, but... I have to be honest, this poem isn\'t going well at all! What do you suggest I do to win over the heart of the fair Julia?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(8029, 'Hm, well how about showing her your sweet side? It\'s time to make her feel like the most beautiful girl in all of Isya!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8170, 'You\'re right, [NAME]! I think I know what you\'re trying to say. I know she\'ll love some fragrant red roses and delicious chocolates! \n\nThere is one problem, though. You\'ve helped me so much already, [NAME], but it looks like I will need your help again with this plan!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8171, 'Mmm, you know what I always say... any plan involving chocolate is a good plan!\n\nWhat do you need me to do, Avon?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8172, 'Well, I need you to collect all of these items for me! I would go myself, but then who will watch my shop? \n\nIf I want to impress Julia I will need to show her a romantic evening! I think {color,yellow,20 Red Roses} and {color,yellow,30 Fancy Chocolates} should be good! That way I can make a beautiful bouquet and have some yummy chocolates to go with.\n\nWhat do you think, [NAME]? Oh, please say you\'ll help!\n \n[BUTTON]=[It would be an honor, Avon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know, this really sounds like something you should do on your own.][2]  '),
(8173, 'I\'m back, Avon! Here are all the roses and chocolates you requested.\n\nThese weren\'t easy to find, so I hope she appreciates the gift!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(8174, 'Oh, they\'re perfect! The roses smell lovely too-- almost as lovely as Julia herself!\n\nI don\'t know how I\'ll ever be able to thank you enough for your help. You\'ve given me the confidence to tell my love how I feel! I\'ve made you a little gift as well for all of your hard work. Go on, take it! \n \nI am now off to Roumen, [NAME]! Wish me luck!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8175, 'How did I not think of this plan before now? It\'s genius! \n\nNow I just have to work on that poem...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8180, 'Attack of the Lava Gargoyles'),
(8181, 'Item Merchant Vellon of Uruga asks you to defeat 20 Lava Gargoyles that attacked him. \n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8182, '[NAME]![NAME]!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8183, 'What happened to you? You look like you\'ve been beaten up!\n[NEXT]'),
(8184, 'Yes, and this time I wasn\'t singing. \n[NEXT]'),
(8185, 'Okay so explain to me what happened.\n[NEXT]'),
(8186, 'I was roaming around {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} when all of a sudden a {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle} attacked me. I\'m terrified to go back there to pratice my music. If only you could help me? Do you think you can defeat {color,yellow,20 Lava Gargoyles} for me?\n[BUTTON]=[Sure I\'ll defeat them for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sure they had their own reasons.][2]'),
(8187, 'Thank you but I\'m still afraid to walk around in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. Do you think you can defeat {color,yellow,20} more {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyles}? They are coming out of no where!\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8188, '..\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8190, 'Black Bear Beatdown'),
(8191, 'Item Merchant Gerric in Alberstol Ruins asks you to defeat 200 Black Bears because they are disrupting his trade routes.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Black Bears can be found in Alberstol Ruins.)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8192, 'Ugh... a shipment has been delayed again? This is the third time this week!\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8193, 'Oh, hello there Gerric!\n\nYou seem to be upset about something. Is, uh... everything ok?\n[NEXT]'),
(8194, 'Yes, [NAME]... something is very wrong!\n\nIt\'s those darn Black Bears that seem to be roaming all over the area! They\'ve been scaring off my trade partners and preventing them from delivering my goods! \n\nThree times in one week? This is just unacceptable!\n[NEXT]'),
(8195, 'Oh, that doesn\'t sound very good. If I wasn\'t such an amazing soldier, I would probably run away from those bears too!\n[NEXT]'),
(8196, 'Yes, well... that is why I need your help!\n\nIf I\'m ever going to recieve my shipments on time again, then something must be done! I think defeating {color,yellow,200 Black Bears} would be a good start!\n\nWhat do you think, [NAME]? Will you help me? You can find those overgrown pests all over {color,yellow,Alberstol Ruins}.\n[BUTTON]=[Anything to help keep you in business, Gerric!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[But the Black Bears are so cute...][2]'),
(8197, 'I appreciate all of your help so far, but I still see far too many bears roaming about in  {color,yellow,Alberstol Ruins}. Do you think you can defeat {color,yellow,200 more Black Bears} for me? I can\'t rest until I know this problem has been taken care of.\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8198, '..\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8350, 'Playing with Fire'),
(8351, 'Alberstol Chief Kiera in Alberstol Ruins asks you to defeat 200 Fire Shellas.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Fire Shellas can be found in Alberstole Ruins and Dark Land.)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8352, 'What do you mean it\'s *too* dangerous?\n\nUgh, it\'s so hard to find good help these days.\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(8353, 'Kiera! How is my favorite Alberstol Chief doing? \n[NEXT]'),
(8354, 'But I\'m the only--\n\nNevermind. Can you believe these guys over here? I need to send troops to investigate matters over in Dark Land and they come back with their tail between their legs!\n\nThey say a huge monster with a firey horn chased after them. How ridiculous!\n[NEXT]'),
(8355, 'Well, actually I\'ve seen these monsters they\'re talking about.\n\nI guess they are pretty mean looking now that you mention it...\n[NEXT]'),
(8356, 'Oh, I don\'t doubt that these monsters exist... I\'m just disappointed that I didn\'t raise these soldiers to be brave enough to stand against them?\n\nHowever, you look like you might get the job done. Would you mind travelling to {color,yellow,Dark Land} and defeating {color,yellow,200 Fire Shellas} for me? I think that\'s the name of the monster. \n\nPerhaps once those demons are taken care of, my cowardly men will be able to finish their investigation!\n[BUTTON]=[Sure thing! I\'ll show them how much stronger I can be!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know, maybe I\'m not as strong as you think I am.][2]'),
(8357, 'You\'ve been a great help so far, [NAME]... but my soldiers still refuse to return to {color,yellow,Dark Land}! \n\nCan you please go defeat {color,yellow,200 more Fire Shellas} for me? In the mean time, I need to go work on training these men better!\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(8358, '..\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7060, 'Two-faced Reo and Mario'),
(7061, 'A strange clown introducing himself as the fashion leader of this generation.\nHe says there are two characters within him.\nLet\'s bring him two lowest level HP potions.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7062, 'What are you looking at! Haven\'t you ever seen a sharp dresser?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest starts][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7063, '...Huh?! Oh, me? Ah, I\'m sorry... Your outfit is strange. It caught my eyes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7064, 'Pah, you think my outfit is strange? It\'s not strange. It\'s awesome!\nDon\'t you think, Mario?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7065, 'Oh, yes. You\'re right. That one\'s not that special though. It should be more glamorous... with jewels and rubys and stuff... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7066, 'Hey! Don\'t get carried away. This is just good enough!\nThis is great. Simple, gorgeous... Oh, hey, you!  \nWhat\'s your name? ... [NAME]? [NAME]? I think I have heard it from somewhere... anyway... \nI\'m Leo, and this is Mario.\n(He greets twice. Once with his left hand and once with his right hand.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7067, '...Yes? Oh, I\'m sorry, but your name is \'Leo and this is mario\'? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7068, '...Wh.. What?! Are you stupid! Look! Here are two persons. In one body... I\'m Leo, and this is Mario.\nSee? Do you get it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7069, 'Ah... I think I get it. So, Reo and Mario are in one body, right?\nHum... What do I call this? Yes, dual personality!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7070, 'Ha, dual personality? Don\'t call us with something that weird.\nUh, we\'re tired. It\'s so tiring to stay in this boring town after being threatened by that \'guy\'. It\'s so tiresome standing all day.\nHey, was that [NAME]? Look, we are really tired. Why don\'t you get us some lowest level HP potions.\nHey, Mario, you want it too, right?\nYou do. Of course you do. Go get some.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Uh... Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I... I\'m kind of busy today...][2]'),
(7071, 'Excuse me, Reo? I got the postions... two of them... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7072, 'Oh, Reo\'s taking a nap, now. I\'m Mario.\nGive it to me. I\'ll have both. Haha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7073, 'Why? What are you looking at?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7080, 'Outsider spirit'),
(7081, 'Two-faced Trickster, Reo and Mario, are rambling about conditions of a Trickster.\nLet\'s listen to them.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7082, 'You are not that good looking a Trickster!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7083, 'Yes? What do you mean I don\'t look good,..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7084, '<Reo>\nI don\'t like how you talk! \nStraighten up your shoulders! Don\'t walk to lively. Walk like water flows, flexibly!\nNo, no. That\'s not it. Bend your arm a little more when you walk... \n<Mario>\nThat is way too stiff. Move your arms more flexibly.\nFlex your toes... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7085, '... uh, what are you doing...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7086, '... Waht! We are talking about great {color,yellow,outsider spirit of a Trickster}!\n(Yells!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7087, 'Eh? What the... how to talk is the outsider spirit?\nYou are just being weird.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7088, 'Q... quiet! That\'s what a Trickster is!\nYou! Go, go away!\nWell, a... a Trickster has to keep {color,yellow,your dignity} no matter what. You get that?\nAhem! Good-bye.\nShoot. Why am I mumbling so badly.\nShould I take talking lessons or something? Feh.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7089, '... What\'s wrong with them?\nOutsider spirit? Dignity?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7090, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30046, 'New power of Trickster 1'),
(30047, 'Reo and Mario caught Kebings saying they need toys. They\'re demanding Kebing\'s Hats.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30048, '<Reo>\nHey~ \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30049, 'Huh? Oh, Reo and Mario? Still looking great.\nWhat\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30050, '<Reo>\nHmm... (looking up and down)\nMario, what do you think?\n<Mario>\nHmm, well... Okay.\n<Reo>\nYou think?\n<Mario>\nYeah.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30051, '(...?)\nWhat\'s going on?\n(This dual personality thing is throwing me off.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30052, '<Reo>\nHmm. Nothing much.\nI\'m just a little board. Of course Mario is bored, too.\nRight?\nYou know, we need some toys. Catch Kebings, and get us Kebing\'s Hats.\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s a piece of cake! Don\'t worry!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can do that.][2]'),
(30053, 'Haa, Reo and Mario. Here... I got your Hats.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30054, '<Mario>\nOh, here you are.\nHmm... It sure is a funny looking Hat. Haha. Some jewels and laces would help.\nAh, I\'m Mario. Hey, Reo. He got the Hats. Wake up.\nWake up.\n<Reo>\nAw... So fast? I thought he\'d take longer. Hmm.\nGood job. \n{color,yellow,Oh, by the way, there\'s a place you should check out. Nothing special. There\'s this wicked god or something.... ah, no, no... }\nJust some saucy guy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30055, 'Good job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30060, 'Finding Mysterious Man'),
(30061, 'Two-faced \'Reo and Mario\' advises to find \'Mysterious Man\' in Forest of Mist.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30062, 'Why should I meet {color,yellow,\'Mysterious Man\'}?\nYou will find out when you meet him. Of course that smirky face is not good to see... Hmm.\nGo ahead. It can\'t hurt... I guess.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30063, 'Hello. I\'m [NAME].\nReo and Mario told me to go see you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30064, 'Ah~ Okay.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30065, 'Go ahead.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30070, 'New power of Trickster 2'),
(30071, 'The Mysterious Man two-faced \'Reo and Mario\' introduced said he wants to see what you can do. He and asked you to get Smart Phino\'s Hats in Forest of Mist.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30072, 'Glad to see you. You are the pupil of Reo and Mario.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30073, '(Flinch)\nI\'m not a pupil. I\'m actually...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30074, 'Hahaha! Don\'t be shy. You might not have noticed, but \'they\' are great men.\nThey\'re very different from what they show. You should be proud to be their pupil.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30075, '(Then, why is he avoiding my eyes?-_-)\nHmm, uh... What should I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30076, 'Haha! Nothing much. I just want to see what you can do.\nCan you get rid of some monsters in Forest of Mist? There are many strong ones. Just take care of {color,yellow, Smart Phino\'s Hats}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Mm, Yes. Okay, then.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do you want to know what I can do?][2]'),
(30077, 'Wow, I am back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30078, 'Oh, you\'re already done?\nWow! That\'s great.\nHaha, I like you.\nHere, this is the award for taking my test without QQ.\n{color,yellow,Go back to two-faced Reo and Mario with this.}\nThey\'ll give you something really nice. Haha.\nSee you later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30079, '... What are you doing? No QQ please. Go get them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30080, 'New power of Trickster 3'),
(30081, 'You got an Old Sheepskin\'s tatter from the Mysterious Man.\nBeing full of curiosity, it\'s time to see two-faced Reo and Mario.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30082, 'They\'ll tell you what this is.\nI would hurry back. Haha...\nWell, if it\'s okay to miss out on Fame, then don\'t bother... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest accepted][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30083, 'Haa! \nUm, Reo and Mario.\nI\'m back. He have me this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30084, 'Huh? Aw~ What is he bothering us with!\n... \n... ... \n(Reading Old Sheepskin\'s Tatter absentmindedly)\nOh, my. Hey, Mario. You do it.\n...Mario? Mario?\nShoot, is he asleep?\nIt\'s so tiresome. Hold on.\n(rustling)\nOh, it\'s so tiresome... Why is he making us do such tiresome stuff... It\'s not like we can run away or something... (complaining)\n... Here! Take this.\n{color,yellow,New power... skill... something like that..}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30085, 'Hurry back...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7370, 'Mind is warmer than heart. 1'),
(7371, 'Ling want\'s to have a heart with warm blood.\nLet\'s ask about the heart to Mysterious Man in Forest of Mist.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7372, 'Ling.\nI. Want. Heart. Blood. Heart. With. Warm. Blood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7373, 'Huh? H... heart!\nL...ling. You can\'t have that.\nNo matter how much you want it, you cannot have a heart of a living thing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7374, 'Why? Ling. Want. Can. Have. Heart. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7375, '... Mmm, that is... ah...\n(Mmm... what should I do? Who am I supposed to ask about this? ... {color,yellow,Hmm. Should I ask Ed?} He knows everything...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7376, '...Why?\nLing. Can. Have. Heart. Ling. Too. Blood. Warm blood. Heart. Live. Body. Warm. Blood. Flow. Heart. Beat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Mmm... Hold on. I\'ll do something.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Get real! You, marionette!][2]'),
(7377, 'Excuse me! Ed!\nI have something to ask you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7378, 'Huh? What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7379, '(Let\'s go to Dry Hill!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7480, 'Mind is warmer than heart. 2'),
(7481, 'You met the Mysterious Man, Ed.\nListen to his stories and find a \'Very Warm Heart\'.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7482, 'Do you know \'Ling\', Trickster\'s marionette?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7483, 'Ah. That moving wooden doll?\nLing... Yes. What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7484, 'Um. Ling says...\nShe wants a heart. With warm blood. A REAL LIVE heart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7485, 'Hmm... heart? That doll said she wants heart?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7486, 'Yes. I didn\'t know what to do. So, I just came to see you.\nWhat should I do? What can I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7487, 'Hmm.\nInteresting...\nOkay. I\'ll give you this. This is all I can do.\nYou will have to take care of the rest.\nUnderstand?\nHere. Take this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7488, '... This is!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7489, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7490, 'Mind is warmer than heart. 3'),
(7491, 'The Mysterious Man gave me \'Very Warm Heart\'.\nI should go back to Ling with this.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7492, 'Um, what are you giving me? There\'s nothing here!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7493, 'What are you saying? I just gave it you.  Look again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7494, 'Yes? Um, I don\'t see anything... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7495, 'Hahahaha! Sorry to TRICK you. But, you know. You listen well.\nWhat I just gave you is my \'mind\'.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7496, 'Mind...?\nWhat do you mean? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7497, 'Mind. Yes. It\'s a mind. The mind has no blood or warm heart, but it is still real.\nAny living person has a mind. That\'s what Ling is. She has no running blood, but she does have a mind.\nDo you think Ling really needs heart?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No. Ling doesn\'t need a heart.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[But, she wants it.][2]'),
(7498, 'Ling! I am back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7499, '[NAME]...?\nMy. Heart. Have. It?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7500, '... Ho ho.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7510, 'Mind is warmer than heart. 4'),
(7511, 'Came back to Ling.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7512, 'My. Heart. Have. It?\nYes?\nYes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7513, 'Mmm, uh... Ling.\nSorry. I have no heart.\nBut, Ling has something warmer than heart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7514, 'I. Don\'t. Get. It.\nWhat. Do. You. Mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7515, '[BUTTON]=[There\'s something warmer than heart. This hot-pack!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s mind. You have mind. Ling has warm mind.][2]\n[BUTTON]=[Want to try hot fish cake? It\'s really warm.][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Become a bloodsucking doll. Blood is warm. Drink blood!][4]'),
(7516, 'Hot. Pack?\nFool.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7517, 'Mind.?\nMind...?\nMind... Warm?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7518, 'Fish. Cake?\nFish cake...?\nWhat is that?\nName. Weird.\nGo away. Feel. Bad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7519, 'Blood. Sucking?\nMe. Blood. Sucking?\nI. Don\'t. Eat. Blood.\nI. Food. Epicure. I. Eat. Tasty. Food.\nBlood. No. Tasty. No.\nGo. Away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7520, 'Yes!\nLing has mind.\nMind wanting to have something. Mind wanting to eat something. Mind being glad to see me...\nThat is much more important and warmer than heart.\nHeart is just an organ that keeps something alive. But, with no mind, heart is nothing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7521, 'No. Thing...?\nHeart... Mind. More. Warm?\nI... \nDon\'t. Know. Well.\nBut.\nHeart...\nHeart. No. Need. Maybe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7522, '... ... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7530, 'Gift from Edge'),
(7531, 'Edge wants to give a gift for being nice to Ling.\nLet\'s give Edge a low-level SP potion and get a gift.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7532, 'Thank you. {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7533, 'Yes? Edge? Thank you?\nI haven\'t done anything special... What do you mean, \'thank you\'?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7534, 'Tell. Ling. Ling. My. Sister.\nStill. Young. Child. Ish.\nSaid. She. Wants. Heart.\n{color,yellow,[NAME]} Because. Of. You. Ling. Heart. No. Say. Want. To. Be. Warm. Human. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7535, 'Ah.. really? Edge knew?\nHmm. You.. what you are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7536, 'Edge. Know.\nLast. Time. {color,yellow,[NAME]}. Gave. Me. Insect.\nThen. Knew.\nAsked. Trickster. My. Strange. Memory.\nAsked. What. That. Is.\nTrickster. Told. Me. Angry. But. Told. Me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7537, '(Strange memory...? Edge has memories of past...?\nIs that so... Mayhe Edge is confused.\nEdge is kind of old...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7538, 'Edge.\nThank you.\n{color,yellow,[NAME]}. Thank you.\nSo. I. Want. Give. {color,yellow,one low-level SP potion}. Me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Haha! Okay. To give Ling? Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s really hard to get a potion... ][2]'),
(7539, 'Here! Edge! I got it. A low-level SP Potion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7540, 'Thank. You.\nEdge. Now. Friend. With. {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7541, '... Squeak.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7550, 'Gift from Ling'),
(7551, 'Ling called. You should probably talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7552, 'Ling. Like. {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\nLing. {color,yellow,[NAME]}. Friend.\nEdge. Told. Me.\nLing. Edge. Friend. {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7553, 'Yes... Ling. We\'re friends.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7554, 'Thank. You.\nLing. Edge. Being. Friends.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7555, 'What are you saying? I am glad to have good friends like Ling and Edge.\nThank YOU.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7556, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7560, 'Doll\'s mind 1'),
(7561, 'You heard that Elderin\'s Tricksters Reo and Mario\'s marionettes wanted to eat potions. \nGo find out more..\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7562, 'Um, Reo. Mario. \nThese two small marionettes talked to me. They even told me they want to eat potions.\nI was wondering if you knew about that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7563, '<Reo>\n...What? What nonsense?\n<Mario>\nDid you eat something bad? What on earth are you talking about? Haha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7564, 'It.. It\'s real! They told me they want to eat low-level potions. They even asked for them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7565, '<Mario>\nHmm... These marionettes talk to you?\nYou mean, dolls talked?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7566, 'Yes! Right! For real.\nThey talked to me. I can\'t believe it. Bu.. But, it\'s true.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7567, '<Reo>\nNo, no. That\'s not what we are talking about. They do talk. What we can\'t believe is that they talked to YOU.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7568, 'What? For reals. Their names were... Edge and Ling?\nThis one\'s Edge, and this one\'s Ling. They said they want to eat HP potion and SP potion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7569, '<Reo>\nHmm... I guess if you know their names...\nBut, I still can\'t believe that. They wouldn\'t talk to anyone they don\'t like.\nHahaha. {color,yellow,They must like you very much.}\n<Mario>\nYes, I guess. {color,yellow,Edge and Ling are really fussy.}\nYou know how long it took for them to say a few words to me?\nHmm, but they talked to you. That\'s really strange and hard to understand. '),
(7570, 'Huh? You... mean, that they do talk?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7571, '<Reo>\nHaha. Right. It hasn\'t been long.\nWell, thanks to me..\n<Mario>\nWhat are you talking about? Don\'t be silly. Thanks to me.\n<Reo>\nHa! They first talked to me. You were asleep.\n<Mario>\nI don\'t think so! You, liar of a clown! They talked to me first!\n<Reo>\nHaha! You want a piece of me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7572, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7580, 'Doll\'s mind 2'),
(7581, 'Elderin\'s marionette, Ling, wants to know about life.\nBring two Very Warm Hearts to Ling.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7582, '... I, Ling.\nYou. [NAME]. I. Want. Something.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7583, 'Uh, yes?\n(She\'s talking friendly again...)\nHmm. Are you asking me a favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7584, 'Ling. Warmth. Want. To. Feel. Reo. Said. Living. Thing. Is. Warm.\nLing. Want. To. Know.\nTo. Reo. Asked. I. Have. Warmth.\nReo. Said. I. Have. No. Warmth.\nLing. Why? Ling. No. Warmth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7585, 'What did Reo say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7586, 'Warmth for Ling was given to Frak, who was dying from injury.\nSo, Ling has no warmth.\nBut. Ling. Want to know what warmth is.\nBring me my two Very Warm Hearts Frak stole.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes? Ah, okay. I\'ll get them][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hold on! Reo lied to you.][2]'),
(7587, 'Here! Here are Very Warm Hearts!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7588, 'Thank. You. [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7589, '...Ling. Don\'t. Lie. Don\'t. Know. How. To. Lie.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7590, 'Doll\'s mind 3'),
(7591, 'Marionette, Edge, wants to see an insect.\nBring 3 Earth Spider\'s Skins to Edge.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7592, 'Edge. Like. Insects.\nEdge. Like. Spiders.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7593, '...Huh? I... insect? Spider?\n(Yuk... please don\'t say gross Earth Spider.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7594, 'Edge, Edge. Insect! Want. Like. Insect.\nSpider. Earth. Spider.\n{color,yellow,Earth. Spider.}\nEdge. Want.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Good. But, I can\'t get live ones. I\'ll get their skins.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why would you want that? Weird taste.][2]'),
(7595, '... Okay. Here! Skin.\nYou really like strange things. Very weird...\nSisters? With edge?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7596, '...Sisters. Us. Like. Twins. Same. Tree. Same. Tree.... \nHuman... Soul... \nWe... \nHuman...?\n...Edge. Confused.\nWe. Are. Marionettes. Trickster. Made.\nHead. Hurt. Hurt. Go away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7597, '...Edge. Like. Insects.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7600, 'Doll\'s mind 4'),
(7601, 'Two-faced Reo and Mario tell old stories of Edge and Ling.\nBring two Dead Tree\'s Barks.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7602, 'Um, Reo. Mario.\nWhat are Edge and Ling?\nThey don\'t seem like dolls without life.\nThe have feelings.. They seem like children full of curiosity.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(7603, '<Mario>\nHmm. You are sharper than I thought.\n<Reo>\nYou\'re right. Looks dull, but is sharp.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7604, 'Oh, my. Um... So, Edge and Ling are alive? Do they have souls?\nOr... Are they monsters? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(7605, '<Reo>\nMonsters! Watch your mouth. They may be gentle, but they are scary when they get angry.\nHmm... okay. I\'ll tell you about these two marionettes.\nTo explain, {color,yellow,I need Dead Tree\'s Barks.}\nBring 2 Dead Tree\'s Barks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. 2 barks?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll forget about it.][2]'),
(7606, 'Reo! Here. Two barks! I got them.\nPlease tell me now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7607, '<Reo>\nAh. Here you are. Wait.\n(Reo sticks barks to two little wooden dolls.)\n...  Look.\n... ... \n(Suddenly, eyes of two wooden dolls change weirdly.)\n{color,yellow,<Edge>}\n{color,yellow,Uhhh... }\n{color,yellow,<Ling>}\n{color,yellow,Grrrr... Human... Elf... I\'ll kill them... }\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7608, '...What the! What... what\'s going on?\nReo! Get them off! Fast!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(7609, 'Haha.\n(Quickly takes barks off.)\nSee. That\'s it.\nThese two dolls are... \n{color,yellow,\'trees remembering memories of life\'.}\nOf course, I made them. No, to be accurate, Mario and I made them together. We don\'t know what the tree is, but probably Ling and Edge were buried where this tree grew.\n{color,yellow,Two live girls. The tree grew where their bodies are buried, probably.'),
(7610, 'Is that so... \n(somehow blank)\nSomething\'s really very weird.\nHmm. I should be nicer to Ling and Edge from now on... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(7611, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30090, 'Choice [Job Changing Quest]'),
(30091, 'You have gained the blessings of fire and wind.\nYou must choose a new power after listening to Kiera\'s explanation.\nWill you be Spectre or Reaper.\n(Job changing quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30092, 'You have all the blessings...\nAs I predicted, you are much stronger.\nYour efforts, hard work and good nature impress me.\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30093, 'Not at all...\nIt\'s all because you helped me.\n[NEXT]'),
(30094, 'Now that you\'ve earned all the blessings, you have a choice to make.\nWith your current powers, you cannot overcome the dangers ahead.\nThis choice now... It is your only option. \nWhat will be right for you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Spectre][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Reaper][2]'),
(30095, '{color,yellow,One to deal damage.} That is {color,yellow,Spectre}. \nEndless power. Great harmony of speed and power... \n\nIs Spectre the right power for you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(30096, '{color,yellow, One faster than a lightning.} That is \n{color,yellow,Reaper.} You can hold a blade over the enemy\'s head.\nBlocking enemy\'s moves and attacking with great speed... \n\nIs Reaper the right power for you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(30097, 'Okay. Your choice has been made.  Your path is chosen!  \n[NEXT]'),
(30098, 'I feel.. full of energy.\nIt\'s like something hot is moving inside my heart.\n[NEXT]'),
(30099, 'You have gained power.\nBut...\nHow you wield that power is still up to you.\nTake this.\nThis is where you have to go to.\nAlso...\nYou will have to face many foes from the past.\n\n{color,yellow,Wishing you the blessing of Regel, I have a gift for you. Please talk to me again when you are ready.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest complete][1]'),
(30110, 'Two roads [Job Changing Quest]'),
(30111, 'Kiera talks about a strong power from within.\nYou can hear explanations about Spectre and Reaper.\n(Job Changing Quest)\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30112, 'What do you think is the right power for [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30113, 'Right... power? Hmm... \n[NEXT]'),
(30114, '{color,yellow,One to deal damage.} That is {color,yellow,Spectre}.\nAlso, {color,yellow, one faster than a lightning.,} that is {color,yellow,Reaper}.\n[NEXT]'),
(30115, '{color,yellow,Spectre} and {color,yellow,Reaper}?\n[NEXT]'),
(30116, 'Now, you have to choose the right power.\n\nPlease get blessings of elements: fire, wind. They will guide you to the right decision. Listen to the elements.\nIf you have really found the right power, come back to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest complete][1]'),
(30117, '{color,yellow,One to deal damage.} That is {color,yellow,Spectre}.\nAlso, {color,yellow, one faster than lightning.,} that is {color,yellow,Reaper.}.\nWhat path will you choose?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30120, 'Defense set for beginner Tricksters'),
(30121, 'Elderin\'s two-faced Reo and Mario needs beginner sets for beginner Tricksters. \n(level 2 Reo Boots, level 4 Reo Hood, level 6 Reo Pants, level 8 Reo Armor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30122, '<Reo>\nStupid! Mario! \nI told you to prepare ahead! \n<Mario>\nHey, who are you to say that!\nIf you have prepared in advance, there\'s no problem!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(30123, 'Ah... It\'s so noisy.\nYour noise can be heard from far away!\nWhy are you fighting?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30124, '<Reo>\nAh. That is! Recently, there are many adventurers asking how they can become Tricksters.\nSo, I decided to specially teach them how to become Tricksters. But, I don\'t have what I need!\n<Mario>\nHey! Don\'t tell him lies!\nThey are not here to learn your skills. Who was the one to fail Crow Skill! Haha.\n<Reo>\nShut up!\nWho failed! Who was the one to bother!\nAh, there\'s no time for this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll collect the sets! Anything to stop your bickering!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You two can work this out on your own][2]'),
(30125, 'Reo! Mario!\nI got beginner defense sets.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(30126, '<Reo>\nOh! Good job, good job!\nAll right! Now, I can teach my skills to beginner Tricksters with these.\n<Mario>\nHaha. Don\'t fail again while you teach!\n<Reo>\nThat was not what you think!\nHe gives me headache all the time!\nOkay! I have to get ready now. See you later!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(30127, '<Reo>\nDon\'t forget!\nA Trickster\'s {color,yellow,level 2 Reo Boots, level 4 Reo Hood, level 6 Reo Pants and level 8 Reo Armour.} There are 4 of them. Remember to bring all of them!\n<Mario>\nYou shouldn\'t be buying all of them at the store like Reo. Haha.\nCan I give you some tips? You can buy cheaper from high-level users!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9770, 'Stone Statue Repair 1'),
(9771, 'Merchant Master Maxuter has received a new request. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9772, '[NAME], I received a new request.  Do you want to do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9773, 'A new request?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9774, 'The stone statues in the village are too old and need to be repaired, but they don\'t have usable materials. \nThey asked us to get some materials to repair the stone statues with.  I don\'t know which materials would work. \nI think you\'ve got some idea, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9775, 'Materials for repairing stone statues...\nHmm, what do we have? A Boogie Backshell is smelly and a Magmaton Piece is too hot. \nOh!  How about some {color,yellow, Gargoyle Pieces}?  That might work!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9776, 'That\'s a good idea!\nWhy didn\'t I think of that!\nGargoyles are easy to find in Burning Rock and in Swamp of Dawn!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9777, 'If the Gargoyle Pieces are good, they might ask us to get more. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9790, 'Stone Statue Repair 2'),
(9791, 'Merchant Master Maxuter asks you to gather Gargoyle Pieces for stone statue repair.\nGather 20 Gargoyle Pieces.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9792, '[NAME], can you get me {color,yellow, Gargoyle Pieces}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9793, 'Yes, of course.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9794, 'Great.  I need about 20 {color,yellow, Gargoyle Pieces}.\nI don\'t think this is a difficult task. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, 20 Gargoyle Pieces!  Got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.  Ask somebody else.][2]'),
(9795, 'I got 20 Gargoyle Pieces.\nIt was too easy. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9796, 'If you hadn\'t helped me, I would still be squeezing my brain to come up with an idea, [NAME]. \nI\'ll let you know when I get a fun job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9797, 'If the Gargoyle Pieces are good, they might ask us to get more. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9810, 'Stone Statue Repair 3'),
(9811, 'Gargoyle Pieces\' were great for repairing stone statues.\nMaxuter got another request for Gargoyle Pieces.\nGather 30 Gargoyle Pieces.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9812, '[NAME], I got a request for more {color,yellow, Gargoyle Pieces}. \nDo you want to try?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9813, 'The ones I had got for the stone statue repair last time?\nOf course, I can get them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9814, 'This time, I need 30 {color,yellow, Gargoyle Pieces}.\nI don\'t think it\'ll be a problem. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!  Not a problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[30 is too many.  Ask somebody else.][2]'),
(9815, '30 Gargoyle Pieces!\nJob done! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9816, 'Thank you.  I\'m glad my shop is now carrying materials for stone statue repair!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9817, 'If the Gargoyle Piece are good, they might ask us to get more. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9830, 'Character Piece'),
(9831, 'Hunter\'s Union\'s Hugues tells you he has a new request.  Collect a Living Stone Piece from Living Stone in Temple of Spirit\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9832, '[NAME], I have a new request.\nIt might be a little hard, but do you want to try?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9833, 'Tell me what it\'s about. \n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9834, 'Go up the hills from here, and there is the Temple of Spirits, right? \nIn the Temple of Spirits is a monster called Living Stone.  It is said that this monster\'s body has old texts.  \nI don\'t know why, but Lord Elbama of Elderine says he is interested in them and asks us to get a Living Stone Piece.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9835, 'I don\'t like that it\'s from Elbama.\nHmm, but a job is a job!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9836, 'You sound like a professional, [NAME].\nGood, get me a Living Stone Piece.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!  Consider it done.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready to start right away.][2]'),
(9837, 'Mr. Hugues, I brought a Living Stone Piece.\nYour jobs are never easy. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9838, 'But you always get it done, [NAME]. \nSo I can trust you for anything. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9839, 'Then, what about getting me an easier job next time? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9840, 'I\'ll be getting you what you can afford.  So, give up your false hope. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9841, '[NAME], please make it quick. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9860, 'Character Piece Delivery'),
(9861, 'You have to deliver the Living Stone Piece that you gave Hugues to Lord Elbama of Elderine. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9862, '[NAME], we have to deliver the piece to Lord Elbama of Elderine. \nEveryone in the Hunter\'s Union is busy and can\'t make a trip to Elderine.  I think you should take it yourself, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9863, 'I have to go!?\nNo, I don\'t want to see him. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9864, 'What happened to your professionalism?\nDon\'t let your emotions get in the way of your job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'m a professional!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to be a professional.][2]'),
(9865, 'Lord Elbama, I brought the Living Stone Piece that you asked the Hunter\'s Union for.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9866, 'Oh!  Famous adventurer, [NAME].\nYou must be blessed to complete my request, [NAME]!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9867, 'What!?\nI guess.. I should be going since my blessed work is done. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9868, 'Leaving so soon?\nI thought you might want to know why I needed the Living Stone Piece, but maybe not!\nI\'ll have another job for you soon.  See you soon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9869, 'What are you doing?\nYou\'d better finish the job that you started.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9880, 'I Need Anti-venom! 1'),
(9881, 'Merchant Master Maxuter is asked to deliver Anti-venom, but there is not enough in the inventory. \nTalk to Wishis in Elderine. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9882, '[NAME], I have a request.\nI must have been out of my mind, forgetting to check the inventory. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9883, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9884, 'Uruga is looking for Anti-venom, but I don\'t have enough in the inventory to fulfill the order.  I thought I had enough left from last time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9885, 'I will help you if I can. \nJust tell me what you need.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9886, 'Oh, [NAME]!  Thank you. \nFirst, I need bottles where I can store the ingredients safely.  Ask Wishis in Elderine.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wishis in Elderine!  OK.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too far.  Ask someone else.][2]'),
(9887, 'Wishis, I\'m here for Maxuter. \nMaxuter needs your Medicine Bottles for Anti-venom. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9888, 'Is he out already?\nHis Anti-venom must be really good.\nLet me see.  Wait here. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9889, '[NAME], please make it quick. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9900, 'I Need Anti-venom! 2'),
(9901, 'Bring Wishis\' Safe Medicine Bottles to Maxuter. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9902, '[NAME], here\'s a box of Medicine Bottles.\nThis should be enough. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9903, 'Thank you.  I should hurry back. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9904, 'You are always busy, [NAME]. \nCome whenever you have time.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[The box is too heavy.  I will take it later.][2]'),
(9905, 'Maxuter, I have the Medicine Bottles. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9906, 'Now that I have the Bottles, I need the ingredients to make Anti-venom. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9907, 'I thought you were in a hurry.  Don\'t you have to go back to the Merchant in Burning Rock.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9920, 'I Need Anti-venom! 3'),
(9921, 'Maxuter asks you to get an ingredient for Anti-venom.\nFind the Nucleus of a Fire Spirit.\n(Fire Spirit is in Burning Rock.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9922, 'Now, help me get the ingredients.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9923, 'OK, just tell me what you need.  I\'ll get it right away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9924, 'I need two ingredients in order to make Anti-venom, but mixing them properly is also important. \nFirst, get me the Nucleus of a Fire Spirit.  It\'s not easy to find, but there is no replacement.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry.  Trust my luck and skills.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not easy!?  I\'ll pass this time.][2]'),
(9925, 'Maxuter, here\'s the Nucleus of a Fire Spirit!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9926, '[NAME], I knew I could trust you.\nI\'m so relieved you got it so fast!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9927, 'I don\'t have time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9940, 'I Need Anti-venom! 4'),
(9941, 'Maxuter asks you to get an ingredient for Anti-venom.\nFind Jewel Tree Sap.\n(Jewel Tree is in Burning Rock.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9942, 'I need Jewel Tree Sap.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9943, 'Jewel Tree is a little tricky, but I can do it.\nGet ready to make your Anti-venom. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9944, 'But Jewel Tree Sap is not easy to find. \nI am still running out of time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[My luck must have dried up.][2]'),
(9945, 'Maxuter, here\'s the Jewel Tree Sap.  Ta-da!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9946, 'Now, I can formulate my Anti-venom.\nThank you, you helped me hold up my reputation, [NAME]\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9947, 'I\'m running out of time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61000, 'We Are Ninjas! (Event Quest)'),
(61001, 'Town Chief Roumenus needs your help to win his bet with Shutian and fight against the pirate forces! Collect 20 Pirate Cutlasses and 10 Pirate Spyglasses then return to him in Roumen.\n(Pirate Cutlasses and Pirate Spyglasses can be found by defeating monsters.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61002, 'Pirates! Can you believe it? Dirty, stinking, water-loving pirates!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61003, 'Oh no... is this about Mara again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61004, 'Mara? Pfft, I\'ve got bigger things to worry about than that skinny little pirate wench! \n\nI\'m talking about something bigger... much bigger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61005, 'Are you saying there are more pirates out there, Roumenus? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61006, 'Not only are there more pirates out there, but Guard Captain Shutian over there in Elderine is HELPING them! \n\nShutian thinks he can win this bet... well he\'s wrong! I\'ve got a plan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61007, 'Wait... a bet? Is that what this is all about, Roumenus?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61008, 'Er... well... you know... bets can be very serious business!\n\nAnd trust me, if you knew how this all began, you\'d be on my side! The right side! The ninja side!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61009, 'Wait... ninjas? This is getting strange...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61010, 'That\'s right, we\'re ninjas! It\'s our duty to fight against those bloody pirates and come out victorious on the other end! \n\nIf we have any sort of chance at winning this bet, we\'re going to have to hit these smelly swashbucklers where it hurts! I\'m uh... talking about their supplies, of course! Now, if we were to gather {color,yellow,20 Pirate Cutlasses} and {color,yellow,10 Pirate Spyglasses}, then that will really leave them scratching their heads!\n\nWhat do you say, [NAME]? Are you with me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I still don\'t really understand what is going on, but... sure! I\'ll help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe this is something you should settle with Shutian.][2] '),
(61011, 'So I\'m still not entirely sure what the details of this ridiculous sounding bet is... but I\'ve returned with everything you asked me to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61012, 'Haha! That\'s great news! Did you happen to stop by Elderine on your way here and take a took at Shutian? Oh, I bet he\'s so scared!\n\nThanks for all your help, [NAME]. When the Roumen Ninjas win this bet, I\'ll definitely remember your name and all you\'ve done for us-- that\'s a promise! Here, take this and wear it proudly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61013, 'Shutian is going to regret ever agreeing to this bet... you just wait and see!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61020, 'We are Pirates! (Event Quest)'),
(61021, 'Guard Captain Shutian needs your help to win his bet with Roumenus and fight against the ninja forces! Collect 10 Throwing Stars and 20 Ninja Headbands then return to Shutian in Elderine.\n(Throwing Stars and Ninja Headbands can be found by defeating monsters.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61022, 'Haha... ninjas? That\'s... that\'s classic!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61023, 'Ninjas? Where?!\n\nWait... are they in stealth mode? If they\'re in stealth mode, we\'ll never find them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61024, 'Calm down, [NAME]! There are no ninjas around here.\n\nI was just told my dear friend Roumenus over there in Roumen has assembled his own group of ninjas! It looks like he\'s taking this bet more seriously than I thought... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61025, 'A... a bet? Oh, I think I heard him mention something about a bet. He never did explain what the circumstances were, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61026, 'Circumstances? Oh, those don\'t matter. \n\nWhat does matter, however... is how I\'m going to win that bet! If Roumenus thinks his ninjas can survive one second against my pirates, he has another thing coming!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61027, 'Pirates...? You have... pirates?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61028, 'Well, naturally! Look at this beautiful pirate beard I have, [NAME]... how could you expect any different?\n\nBut anyways... it\'s with these pirates that I\'m going to come out on top this time! Now to just find a way to gain the upper hand against those ninjas...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61029, 'So Roumenus has a group of ninjas and you have a group of pirates... I think this is all finally coming together!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61030, 'Hm... I\'ve got it! If one of those ninjas sneak into my city, they\'re going to try and attack my pirate army from a distance... right?\n\nHowever, what if they don\'t have anything to attack with! Oh, it\'s genius! I need you to collect {color,yellow,10 Throwing Stars} as quickly as possible! Oh, and while you\'re at it... why don\'t you collect {color,yellow,20 Ninja Headbands} while you\'re out? I want to hold proof of their defeat in my hands.\n\nWill you help me, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Pirates are pretty cool, I guess... I\'m in!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Pirates and Ninjas? This is getting too complicated for me.][2] '),
(61031, 'Wow, those Throwing Stars were not easy to find! And not to mention those headbands...\n\nThese ninjas seem pretty serious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61032, 'Haha! Is that so? Well, it looks like I have to give old Roumenus some credit... he\'s definitely making this bet an interesting one!\n\nI appreciate all of your help, [NAME]. Take this and always remember what it means to be a pirate! Now if you\'ll excuse me, I believe it\'s time for me to take a trip to Roumen...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61033, 'Hm... I feel an attack on Elderine may be coming soon. How are you supposed to protect yourself from an army of ninjas?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61040, 'Who is [GM]Trixie?'),
(61041, 'Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine is determined to uncover the true identity of [GM]Trixie. Help him collect 50 Trixie Clues.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61042, 'Psst, [NAME]! Over here!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61043, 'Oh, Shutian! How is my favorite Guard Captain doing this lovely Isyan morning?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61044, 'Well, as a matter of fact, I\'m busy working on something rather important at the moment.\n\nSomething BIG.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61045, 'Something big, huh? Sounds exciting!\n\nYou\'re not going to leave me out of the loop, are you? Go on and tell me what it is you\'re working on!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61046, 'Oh, well you see there\'s this new cla--\n\nHey, wait a minute! I\'m not giving up this information that easily. I need to know that you\'re, well... worthy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61047, 'Worthy? Me? Are you kidding?\n\nI\'m the worthiest Isyan out there! I\'ll beat anyone in worthiness! Why, just the other day--\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61048, 'Calm down, [NAME]! You definitely possess the right attitude, but I need you to complete a task for me before I am able to reveal anymore information. \n\nFormalities, you understand.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61049, 'Oh, ok... in that case, what is it that you need me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61050, 'I\'m not sure if you\'ve noticed, but there seems to be a lot of... rascals running around Isya lately. Well, just one to be exact... [GM]Trixie!\n\nI wish to know where this so-called Trixie comes from and what her purpose is here in Isya. This is why I need your help, [NAME]\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61051, '[GM]Trixie, huh? \n\nI think I\'ve seen her "handiwork" around here lately...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61052, 'Yes, well... this situation needs to be controlled immediately. But first we need to know more information about this troublemaker!\n\nPlease collect {color,yellow,50 Trixie Clues} for me... you\'ll no doubt find them littered all over Isya. What do you say, [NAME]? Will you help me uncover the secret identity of Trixie? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I will! I\'ve also been wondering who this Trixie really is!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know, this Trixie doesn\'t sound all that dangerous to me...][2] '),
(61053, 'I\'m back, Shutian! Did you miss me?\n\nI gathered all the information you requested. You\'re right, that [GM]Trixie sure does like to leave her mark!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61054, 'Yes, she most certainly does. Why, just in the short while that you were gone, that jokester managed to strike again!\n\nHere, perhaps you can make sense of this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61055, 'What motivates this [GM]Trixie? What drives her to create chaos? I must know these answers!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9960, 'Earning Your Claws '),
(9961, 'Blacksmith James in Roumen is developing two special weapons designed specifically for Tricksters. Come visit him when you are level 70 and he will reward your choice of a new weapon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9962, 'Oh, [NAME]! Come over here for a second.\n\nI see you are ready to begin your new journey as a Trickster! How do you feel?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9963, 'Well, I\'m a little nervous to tell you the truth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9964, 'Nervous? I guess I can understand that feeling. The path to become a great Trickster is a long and challenging one, but I believe you will be able to succeed.\n\nNow, first things first... do you have all the supplies you need to get started?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(9965, 'Er, let me just make sure...\n\nArmor? Check. Claws? Check. \n\nWait... is this weapon going be enough for me? I mean, I can\'t wait to go test these out on the nearest Slime... but if I\'m going to be a great Trickster, won\'t I need something a little more... epic?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9966, 'Haha! You have quite the spirit, [NAME]. The weapons of a Trickster, be it sword or claw, serve as an extension of the body. A good weapon is the strong foundation upon which your journey will be built.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9967, 'Exactly! I... think.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9968, 'Tell you what, [NAME]. There is something that I\'ve been secretly working on for the past couple of months... something special.\n\nTwo new weapons are being developed-- dual swords and a claw blade similar to yours. Both are designed to harmonize with a Trickster\'s natural abilities, to slice through the air with the most amazing speed and agility. \n\nCurving steel, forged in the flames... it\'s truly a sight to behold.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(9969, 'That sounds great! So... can I have one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9970, 'Hey, slow down there! These blades are only suited for the most dedicated and talented Tricksters.\n\nWhile you may not be ready to handle such power yet, I believe you possess the potential to reach that level soon. Come speak with me again when that time comes, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(9971, 'But how will I know when to return to you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9972, 'A Trickster, as with any other class, must show their allegiance and loyalty towards their chosen path before they can advance to a more powerful form.\n\nWhen you reach {color,yellow,level 70}, come see me again and I shall evaluate your progress at that point.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Level 70? Not a problem! I\'ll be back before you know it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh, level 70? Might as well be level 700.][2] '),
(9973, '[NAME]... ? Is that you?\n\nYou\'ve changed so much since we last spoke! I could barely recognize you. After seeing your face, however, I realize now that you have finally returned.\n\nMuch time has passed, and I imagine you are seeking the weapons I told you about. Let\'s me take a look and see how your journey has changed you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9974, '...\n\nHm...\n\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9975, 'Ah... yes. \n\nI never doubted you for a moment, [NAME]. You are ready.\n\nThe weapon you select says quite a bit about the type of Trickster you wish to be. Keep that in mind and choose wisely!\n\nCare for this weapon, [NAME]... it will serve you well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9976, 'How is your journey progressing? Come to me when you have reached level 70. I will not forget my promise, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9980, 'Save the Earth '),
(9981, 'Kid Woz of Elderine asks you to help find the stolen Earth Day flyers from the monsters spread out through Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9982, 'Hello, [NAME]! Can I talk to you.\nI see you are ready to begin celebrating Earth Day but do you think you can help me out?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(9983, 'Well, I\'m a little busy right now but I guess I can free up some time to help you out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9984, 'Sniff, sniff. Thanks. I just didn\'t know who to turn to but thinking about it now, you are the perfect person to help me out!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(9985, 'Don\'t cry.... What happened?\n\nWait... Are people at school bullying you? Do you need me to teach them a lesson?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9986, 'No [NAME], no one is bullying me at school. However, all of the Earth Day flyers I was going to put up around Elderine have been stolen, without them no one in Isya will know why we celebrate Earth Day.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(9987, 'That is terrible, who would do such a thing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(9988, 'I\'m not exactly sure, I went to my house to grab them and when I got there, they were gone. \nWhen I was looking around the house I did notice that everything was very dirty, I\'m beginning to think it might have been the monsters that reside outside of the town walls.\n\nPlease [NAME], help me find those flyers, I worked so hard on them. I bet if you asked the monsters sprawled across Isya, you will find some answers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure Kid, I\'ll find your flyers for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy planting trees....Maybe later.][2]  '),
(9989, 'Awesome!!! You found my flyers. \nI never doubted you for a moment, [NAME].\nThank you so much for getting my flyers back for me!\nI don\'t have much [NAME], but please take this as a token of my appreciation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(9990, 'Any luck in finding my flyers? I made 30 flyers and I know they couldn\'t have gone far. Please help me find them [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12000, 'Appreciation to Mom (Event Quest)'),
(12001, 'Grandma Myzen asks you to rekindle her Mother\'s Day spirit by getting her some gifts.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12002, 'Hello, [NAME]! It\'s a rather lovely day today isn\'t it?\n\nI use to love this time of year but now that my children are grown up and live so far away from me, they can\'t spend Mother\'s Day with me anymore. I wish I could relive those days.....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12003, 'Why don\'t your children come visit you during Mother\'s Day?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12004, 'They use to come and visit me when they lived closer to Elderine but they moved to Uruga and now it is too far for them to travel with their children. When I realized this, I told them to stop visiting me during Mother\'s Day and to only come see me during Thanksgiving and Christmas\n\n[NEXT] '),
(12005, 'I\'m sorry to hear that Grandma Myzen, at the same time it is understandable, your children are adults now and have to take care of their family as well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12006, 'Yes I know [NAME], but I still cant help myself from feeling a little sad during this time of year...\n\n[NEXT] '),
(12007, 'Well is there anything I can do to help out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12008, 'Now that you mention it, I would love to rekindle the joy I felt during Mother\'s Day when my childern lived close. Do you think you could do me a favor and make me smile again? My children use to give me this special feather that drops from monsters around Isya as well as some lovely flowers. I would love to smell those fantastic flowers again.\n[BUTTON]=[Anything to put a smile on your face Grandma Myzen, I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy trying to get my Mom gifts....Maybe later.][2]  '),
(12009, 'Why [NAME], these are some fantastic gifts you have brought me! This puts a smile back on my face and reminds me of all the great times I had with my children. Thank you! \n\nEvery year, when my children visited me, I would make them these chocolates that taste phenomenal. Since they aren\'t here to enjoy them, please take them as a way of me saying thank you. Each chocolate was made with love and joy!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12010, 'I can smell those flowers now, if you could help me reminisce the old days [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12030, 'Remembering the Veterans'),
(12031, 'Guard Nus in Elderine asks you to help remember the veterans during Memorial Day by seeking revenge on the monsters who killed his military friends.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12032, 'Hello, [NAME], how are you doing today? This time of year is always bittersweet for me...\n\nWhile Memorial Day saddens me because of the constant reminder of the military friends I have lost over the years but at the same time, thinking about them helps me remember all of the good times we had together. I wish they were still here..... This year it will be different, I will seek my revenge!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12033, 'Hi Guard Nus, I am sorry to hear about your loss and that Memorial Day continues to remind you of all the negative feelings, but I don\'t understand who are you going to seek your revenge on?\n[NEXT]'),
(12034, 'Do they not teach history in schools anymore? Have you heard about the great world war that happened in Isya?\n[NEXT] '),
(12035, 'There was a World War in Isya?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12036, 'Yes! The World War took many lives from our military, many of those fine souls were very good friends of mine. I understand war is war and it is inevitable that lives will be lost but what made me angry is what the monsters did after.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(12037, 'I can only imagine what war has done to your mind, body, and soul... Now I am curious, what exactly did the monsters do to the fallen soldiers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12038, 'Yes [NAME], war was definitely a tough time for everyone in the military. But, the monsters during the war were thieves, they took fallen soldiers\' hats as souvenirs! It infuriates me that I never had a chance to retaliate. Today is a new day, the monsters will finally pay for their actions! Will you help me obtain 40 hats stolen by the monsters and return them to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Those monsters are thieves! I will definitely help you out Guard Nus.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Make curry, not war. You\'ll have to take on this revenge mission on yourself.][2]'),
(12039, 'Thank you very much [NAME] for returning the hats of the soldiers that have passed, their families will be very happy that they have all the possessions of their loved ones. \n\nAs a token of my appreciation for all your hard work, please take these items, they should help you with your future journeys.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12040, 'All of the families that have lost loved ones are relying on me to get the soldiers\' hats back, come back to me once you have found all 40 of them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12050, 'Kobal\'s Curry(Event Quest)'),
(12051, 'Item Merchant Nina in Elderine asks you to help collect the ingredients for the curry recipe that [GM]Kobal has given her.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12052, 'Hello, [NAME], how are you doing today? Did you hear the good news? [GM]Kobal has blessed Isya with his famous curry recipe!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(12053, 'Hi Item Merchant Nina! Oh em gee!!! I can\'t believe that [GM]Kobal decided to give away his secret family recipe.... How\'d you get it from him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12054, 'Well...to tell you the truth, it wasn\'t easy. Let\'s just say that [GM]Kobal was tricked into giving me his recipe.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(12055, 'Tricked?!?!?!?!? Never mind, I don\'t want to know. So are you going to be making some of this famous curry?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12056, 'Of course, I\'m going to be making the curry, I mean wouldn\'t you? The only problem is I need some more ingredients but do not have the time to go and get them.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(12057, 'What do you mean you don\'t have any time? It looks you  are just standing here doing nothing, couldn\'t you go grab the ingredients for the curry now? It would only take you a few minutes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12058, 'Me? Plenty of time? Why [NAME], you have been sadly mistaken. I am the most profitable shop in all of Elderine. People from far and wide come and purchase my goods. How can you say I\'m not busy? If anything you\'re not busy since you\'re here talking to me during my work hours.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12059, 'Sorry, I must have mistaken you for someone else....Well Item Merchant Nina, would you like some help with obtaining the ingredients for the curry? The only stipulation is you have to share some with me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(12060, 'It\'s alright [NAME], it happens to me all the time. Sure, I would love some help getting the ingredients that I am missing. I apologize in advance but the list is quite long. I need the following items:\n\n30 Pounds of meat: Drops from the various monsters around Isya.\n20 Potatoes: Found from herb plants around Isya.\n20 Carrots: Found from herb plants around Isya.\n20 Tomatoes: Found from the flowers around Isya.\n20 Heirloom Mushrooms: Found from the mushrooms around Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, I can\'t wait to try out this curry!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am not your servant, get the ingredients on your own time.][2]'),
(12061, 'Thank you very much [NAME] for obtaining all the ingredients for me. I can finally get the curry made and try it for ourselves.\n\nGive me a minute and I will get a batch made up for you to take. Also here is a little token of my appreciation for obtaining all the ingredients for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(12062, 'I can smell that curry now, hurry [NAME] once you get all the ingredients we can get a batch made up to try!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61060, 'Helping the People Part One(Event Quest)'),
(61061, 'Town Chief Roumenus in Roumen asks you to help find the stolen armor and clothing of Town Chief Roumenus.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61062, 'Come quick [NAME], I need to talk to you in private.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61063, 'Hi Town Chief Roumenus, what is up with all the secrecy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61064, 'Well this would have been a funny story if it didn\'t happen to me but when I went to get dressed for work this morning, all of my armor and clothes were stolen from my closet. Apparently, the Guard Captain Shutian and the Town Chief Adrian are facing the same problem as I am.....\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61065, 'Ha ha ha, I mean I\'m sorry to hear that Roumenus. Do you think someone stole your armor and clothes? Do you think this is related to the thieves stealing the Earth Day flyers from Kid Woz?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61066, 'I know it\'s funny, laugh it out. But in all seriousness, I think this might be linked to Kid Woz getting his Earth Day flyers stolen from him. We need to get to the bottom of this! I want my clothes and armor back!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61067, 'Can I do anything to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61068, 'I would love the help! Thank you [NAME], I appreciate your kindness. I do have a few clues to help you out on your search. One thing I did notice in my closet were footprints of what looked like a few monsters that surround Isya. I think going after the mobs around Isya will be a great start to finding my clothes and armor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61069, 'Those meddling thieves! I will get to the bottom of this Town Chief Roumenus, you can count on me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61070, 'This is some good news [NAME]. I have lost my shirt, pants, helm, armor, and weapon. Please find them and return it to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, you can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I actually have to go join a KQ or wash my hair or something. I might be able to help later.][2]'),
(61071, 'Thank you very much [NAME] for obtaining my armor and clothes for me. I can finally get out of these old clothes. \n\nI hear that both Shutian and Adrian are facing similar problems, please go visit them and help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61072, 'No one is going to take me seriously in these clothes! Hurry [NAME] and please find my clothes and armor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61080, 'Helping the People Part Two(Event Quest)'),
(61081, 'Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine asks you to help find the stolen armor and clothing of Guard Captain Shutian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61082, 'Come quick [NAME], I need to talk to you in private.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61083, 'Hi Guard Captain Shutian, what is up with all the secrecy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61084, 'Well this would have been a funny story if it didn\'t happen to me but when I went to get dressed for work this morning, all of my armor and clothes were stolen from my closet. Apparently, the Town Chief Roumenus and the Town Chief Adrian are facing the same problem as I am.....\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61085, 'Ha ha ha, I mean I\'m sorry to hear that Shutian. Do you think someone stole your armor and clothes? Do you think this is related to the thieves stealing the Earth Day flyers from Kid Woz?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61086, 'I know it\'s funny, laugh it out. But in all seriousness, I think this might be linked to Kid Woz getting his Earth Day flyers stolen from him. We need to get to the bottom of this! I want my clothes and armor back!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61087, 'Can I do anything to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61088, 'I would love the help! Thank you [NAME], I appreciate your kindness. I do have a few clues to help you out on your search. One thing I did notice in my closet were footprints of what looked like a few monsters that surround Isya. I think going after the mobs around Isya will be a great start to finding my clothes and armor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61089, 'Those meddling thieves! I will get to the bottom of this Guard Captain Shutian, you can count on me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61090, 'This is some good news [NAME]. I have lost my shirt, pants, helm, armor, and weapon. Please find them and return it to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, you can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I actually have to go join a KQ or wash my hair or something. I might be able to help later.][2]'),
(61091, 'Thank you very much [NAME] for obtaining my armor and clothes for me. I can finally get out of these old clothes. \n\nI hear that both Roumenus and Adrian are facing similar problems, please go visit them and help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61092, 'No one is going to take me seriously in these clothes! Hurry [NAME] and please find my clothes and armor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61100, 'Helping the People Part Three(Event Quest)'),
(61101, 'Town Chief Adrian in Uruga asks you to help find the stolen armor and clothing of Town Chief Adrian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61102, 'Come quick [NAME], I need to talk to you in private.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61103, 'Hi Town Chief Adrian, what is up with all the secrecy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61104, 'Well this would have been a funny story if it didn\'t happen to me but when I went to get dressed for work this morning, all of my armor and clothes were stolen from my closet. Apparently, the Town Chief Roumenus and the Guard Captain Shutian are facing the same problem as I am.....\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61105, 'Ha ha ha, I mean I\'m sorry to hear that Adrian. Do you think someone stole your armor and clothes? Do you think this is related to the thieves stealing the Earth Day flyers from Kid Woz?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61106, 'I know it\'s funny, laugh it out. But in all seriousness, I think this might be linked to Kid Woz getting his Earth Day flyers stolen from him. We need to get to the bottom of this! I want my clothes and armor back!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61107, 'Can I do anything to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61108, 'I would love the help! Thank you [NAME], I appreciate your kindness. I do have a few clues to help you out on your search. One thing I did notice in my closet were footprints of what looked like a few monsters that surround Isya. I think going after the mobs around Isya will be a great start to finding my clothes and armor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61109, 'Those meddling thieves! I will get to the bottom of this Town Chief Adrian, you can count on me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61110, 'This is some good news [NAME]. I have lost my shirt, pants, helm, armor, and weapon. Please find them and return it to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, you can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I actually have to go join a KQ or wash my hair or something. I might be able to help later.][2]'),
(61111, 'Thank you very much [NAME] for obtaining my armor and clothes for me. I can finally get out of these old clothes. \n\nI hear that both Roumenus and Shutian are facing similar problems, please go visit them and help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61112, 'No one is going to take me seriously in these clothes! Hurry [NAME] and please find my clothes and armor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61120, 'Understanding the Monsters(Event Quest)'),
(61121, 'Storage Keeper Kyle of Elderine asks you to help him investigate the strange behaviors of the monsters in Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61122, 'Hello, [NAME]! How are you doing today?\n\nHave you noticed how strange the monsters around Isya have been acting lately?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61123, 'Hi Storage Keep Kyle, I am doing great! Thanks for asking. You know, now that you mention it, I have noticed that the monster around Isya have been acting more aggressive than before. I wonder why that is?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61124, 'I\'m not exactly sure but I want to get to the bottom of this. Their increased anger and aggressiveness is making Isyans take extra measures to protect themselves.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61125, 'Extra measures? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61126, 'Oh [NAME], it has been terrible. The number of monster attacks on innocent citizens has increased over the past couple weeks and since no one can figure out what is causing this, the citizens of Isya are carrying weapons with them whenever they leave the safety of the city walls. \n\nWe must ease the citizen\'s fears and get to the bottom of this!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61127, 'I want to do my part! What can I do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61128, 'We need to do some investigation work [NAME]! The Guard Captain Shutian was talking to me earlier and he told me that he found this strange green residue on his sword after his recent encounter with the monsters. We need to find out what this residue is. Can you help me by getting 20 samples of this green residue? I also require 20 vials of monster blood and 20 monster hair samples to help with my investigations. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure Kyle, I\'ll help out with you investigation.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy making friends with monsters....Maybe later.][2]'),
(61129, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the necessary samples to conduct my investigation. I can finally find out the reason why the monsters in Isya have been overly aggressive.\n\nPlease take these items as a token of my appreciation for all of your hard work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61130, 'Have you had a chance to collect the monster samples for me? I need to figure out how to stop the monsters from attacking innocent people!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61140, 'Summer Inventory(Event Quest)'),
(61141, 'Item Merchant Pey of Roumen asks you to help her obtaining some new items for her to sell in her store.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61142, 'Hello, [NAME]! How are you doing today?\n\nWhat a wonderful summer day we are having today, have you had a chance to enjoy it? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61143, 'Hi Item Merchant Pey, I am doing great! I actually just came back from an awesome hike through Ancient Elven Woods to hang out by the waterfall. Is there anything that you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61144, 'Well now that you ask [NAME], I was wondering if you could help me out. I am trying to get new inventory ready for my store and having a hard time obtaining a few items. If you have some free time, do you think that you could help obtain them for me?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61145, 'Sure Pey, I have some free time to help you out. What exactly do you need? Do I have to go halfway across the world to get you these items like last time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61146, 'Come on [NAME], how many times do I have to apologize about sending you to the other side of the world? I really needed it or else my shop was going to go out of business. \n\nBut anyways, since you offered to help, could you be kind enough to get me the following items. I require 12 dozen red roses, 20 bushels of portobello mushrooms, and 20 monster skins. I know this is rather unique request but it is all in the name of capitalism!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I really hope I don\'t wind up in Tristo again... I\'ll help you obtain your new merchandise.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m about to leave on a jet plane....Maybe later.][2]'),
(61147, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the items necessary to build out the store\'s summer inventory! I will finally be able to get enough money saved up for my trip!\n\nPlease take these items as a token of my appreciation for all of your hard work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61148, 'Have you had a chance to obtain my new inventory for the store? I need to make sure that everything is ready before the summer starts!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61150, 'The Root of the Problem'),
(61151, 'Kid Woz of Elderine asks you to help him out investigating why the monsters in Isya are acting weird.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61152, 'Hello, [NAME]! How are you doing today?\n\nHave you noticed recently how strange the monsters around Isya have been acting lately? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61153, 'Hi Kid Woz, I am doing great! Thanks for asking. You know, now that you mention it, I have noticed that the monster around Isya have been acting more aggressive than before. I wonder why that is?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61154, 'I think I have an idea on why they are being so strange. Last week, my friends and I were playing around with some new magic tricks and I think the Slime we converted to good has spread a weird virus around to all the monsters in Isya.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61155, 'You did WHAT!?!?!?!? You realize that the Shutian is going to be extremely mad at you guys once he finds out...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61156, 'Yes, I know, this is why I am begging you to help me out. I think we can fix this issue before Shutian or my parents find out about what I did. Do you think you can help me from getting in trouble [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61157, 'Why do I feel like I am always getting you out of these situations??? I guess I can spend time getting you out of trouble, AGAIN!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61158, 'Oh em gee, thank you soooo much [NAME], I swear from this point on I will try to not get in so much trouble. \n\nWith that being said, I think I know how to stop the monsters from being so crazy. After conducting some experiments and basing some things off my observations, I found that certain breeds of monsters are triggering these strange behaviors. I need you to kill these monsters and bring me their blood samples. With these samples, I can then create the potion necessary to revert these animals back.\n                                                             [BUTTON]=[Sure Woz, I\'ll help out with you investigation.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy making friends with monsters....Maybe later.][2]'),
(61159, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the monster blood samples. I can finally get these potion mixed up and distributed to the monsters. Yay for not getting into too much trouble.\n\nThank you again [NAME], please \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61160, 'Have you had a chance to collect the monsters blood samples for me? I need to change all the monsters back so that Shutian and my parents won\'t tear me apart for my stupidity!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61170, 'Defeat the Lizard Men! (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61171, 'Healer Poring asks you to defeat the Greedy Lizardmen that are attacking the tourists.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Forest of Slumber.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61172, '[NAME]![NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61173, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61174, 'I know you are busy, but can you do me a favor?  It\'s very a serious matter!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61175, 'Hmm.. I can\'t say no to that.  Tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61176, 'You know, many tourists have been frightened by the Greedy Lizardmen in the {color,yellow, Forest of Slumber}. It seems like they have gone wild. \nMoreso, the number of {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} have quickly increased and this has the people of Uruga worried. \nPlease defeat {color,yellow, 50 Greedy Lizardmen}. That shouldn\'t be that hard of a task for you to complete. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I can solve this problem for you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have told you before, I\'m busy...][2]'),
(61177, 'Oh!  I knew you could do it!\nYou know what?  Unfortunately, there are still {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} in the {color,yellow, Forest of Slumber} attacking tourists. \nCan you defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} one more time? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61178, 'Defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen}.  Please hurry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61180, 'Defeat the Lizard Men! (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61181, 'Healer Poring asks you to defeat the Greedy Lizardmen that are attacking the tourists.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Forest of Slumber.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61182, '[NAME]![NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61183, '??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61184, 'I hear the {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} are still in {color,yellow, Forest of Slumber} attacking the tourists. \nCan you defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} one more time? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired of them..][2]'),
(61185, 'Oh!  I knew you could do it!\nYou know what?  Unfortunately, there are still {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} in the {color,yellow, Forest of Slumber} attacking tourists. \nCan you defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen} one more time? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61186, 'Defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow, Greedy Lizardmen}.  Please hurry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61190, 'Goodbye, Nightmare!  (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61191, 'Guard Nus asks you to defeat the Blue Archons that keep haunting him in his dreams.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61192, 'Hey~ [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61193, 'Hey, Mr. Guard!  You switched your shift?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61194, 'Actually, there is something more important than my shift.\n\nYou wouldn\'t understand. No one understands!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61195, '(Don\'t understand what) What are you talking about?  Sir?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61196, 'I can\'t sleep well these days.  Why? \nWell, I keep having this nightmare... Dagnabbit\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61197, '(A guard with a nightmare... That doesn\'t sound too bad.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61198, 'Listen... It happened a few weeks ago.\nIt was the most horrifying incidence of my life.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61199, 'I\'m listening. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61200, 'It was a rainy night in Elderine and I was working the night shift.\nAll of a sudden, black shadows started to approach me slowly. Soon they began to gather around me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61201, 'Was it tourist from another town?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61202, 'No... It was {color,yellow,Blue Archons}.\nThey surrounded me and stripped me of everything.. I was left standing there in my birthday suit, then they disappeared, giggling..\nIt was the most horrifying moment of my life...\nTheir laughing faces are haunting me every night!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61203, '(I think you should be thankful to be alive)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61204, 'Anyhow, I have had nightmares every night since then. I want to be able to sleep peacefully again.\nThis nightmare won\'t go away until they are gone.\nSo, help me stop these nightmares.\nPlease defeat {color,yellow,5} {color,yellow,Blue Archons} in {color,yellow, Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}... Please.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.  I\'ll make your nightmare go away!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just keep having the nightmare.][2]'),
(61205, 'You are my savior.  Thank you so much. \nBut the nightmares are still happening.\nDefeat {color,yellow,5} more {color,yellow,Blue Archons}.\nCan you do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61206, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61210, 'Goodbye, Nightmare!  (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61211, 'Guard Nus asks you to defeat the Blue Archons that keep haunting him in his dreams.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61212, 'Hey~ [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61213, 'Mr. Guard, what now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61214, 'Thank you for helping me before.\nBut they are still haunting me in my dreams.\nDefeat {color,yellow,5} more {color,yellow,Blue Archons}.\nCan you do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired of them..][2]'),
(61215, 'Oh... You are the best adventurer I\'ve ever met.  I\'ll pay you back later. \n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61216, 'Defeat {color,yellow,5} more {color,yellow,Blue Archons} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61220, 'Nina\'s Revenge (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61221, 'Nina tells you that some Nox Hunters stole from her and asks you to avenge her.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61222, 'Hey!  Here!  [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61223, 'Oh!  Item Merchant Nina, what\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61224, 'Nothing much, but I am a bit irritated. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61225, 'Irritated? What has rustled your feathers? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61226, 'Listen.\nI was passing by the {color,yellow,Collapsed Prison} a while ago and some {color,yellow,Nox Hunters} stole my basket and ran away into the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}.  That basket was full of some delicious food that I made!\nI would have given it to them if they had asked me nicely.  Now I want to punish them for stealing from me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61227, 'So you want me to teach the {color,yellow,Nox Hunters} a lesson?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61228, 'You got that right!  They must be hiding out in the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}.  Please defeat {color,yellow,50} of these {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of Nox Hunters...][2]'),
(61229, 'I knew I could trust you!\nBut we don\'t know if the {color,yellow,Nox Hunters} will try to steal from others.  Help us get rid of them once and for all. \nPlease defeat {color,yellow,50} more {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61230, 'It\'s {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!  The more the better!  La, la!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61231, 'Nina\'s Revenge (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61232, 'Nina tells you that some Nox Hunters stole from her and asks you to avenge her.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61233, 'Hey!  [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61234, 'Do you still need me for something?  Ms. Nina?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61235, 'There must be more hiding in the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}.  Please defeat {color,yellow,50} more {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[They will pay!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m afraid of Nox Hunter...][2]'),
(61236, 'I knew I could trust you!\nBut we don\'t know if the {color,yellow,Nox Hunters} will try to steal from others.  Help us get rid of them once and for all. \nPlease defeat {color,yellow,50} more {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61237, 'It\'s {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Nox Hunters}!  The more the better!  La, la!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61240, 'Bat Hunter!'),
(61241, 'Karl of Elderine asked you to defeat Golden Bats that have prevented him from collecting the materials he needs for refining. Help him collect 50 Golden Husks. \n(Search Concealed Prison 1st Floor.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61242, 'What in the... I can\'t concentrate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61243, 'What\'s wrong with you, Mr. Blacksmith?  It seems like you are annoyed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61244, 'I went out to the woods to collect some materials for refining the other day. I was doing my job and these annoying {color,yellow,Golden Bats} kept bothering me. Since the {color,yellow,Golden Bats} kept attacking me, I failed to collect all my items for refining and now my reputation is on the line!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61245, 'Hmm.. I see. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61246, 'I want to go back and teach those {color,yellow,Golden Bats} a lesson, but I have so much to do in Elderine...\nI got an idea, can you get {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Golden Husks} for me? \nI will reward you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of bats...][2]'),
(61247, 'They should know better than to mess with me,\nthe blacksmith of Elderine.\nYou have some skills, the type that pays the bills. Come back when your weapon breaks. I\'ll hook you up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61248, 'These bats are driving me batty!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61250, 'Do I Look Weak?'),
(61251, 'Curly wants to prove his strength to the Golden Cave Fellowship. Help him defeat the monster Cave Lips in the Golden Cave.\n(Search Golden Cave)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61252, 'Do I look weak to you?\nHa ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61253, '(You do look weak)\nHello, Curly!  What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61254, 'This is about my pride.\nThey were recruiting for the Golden Cave Fellowship and I wanted to join.\nI wanted to go there because everyone talked about how beautiful {color,yellow,Golden Cave} is.\nBut!!!!!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61255, 'I guess you were not accepted.\nRight?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61256, 'Yes... That\'s right... I was honorably declined. You know why?\nThey said I might have been scared of this monster called {color,yellow,Cave Lips} that dwells in that area.\nThat means I look weak.\nHow dare them to judge me by the way I look!! Never judge a book by its cover!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61257, 'Hmm... You don\'t look happy. When I first started my adventures I was judged by my looks and it\'s not a good feeling. I know exactly how you feel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61258, 'Anyways, I can\'t let go of this.  I was hoping you can help me show them how strong I am. \nDefeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Cave Lips} from the {color,yellow,Golden Cave}.  If we can do this quicker than the Fellowship, it will show them how strong I am. \nCan you help me with this task?\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like caves.][2]'),
(61259, 'Thank you so much.  I couldn\'t of done it without your help. Now I feel stronger than before. Off to the Golden Cave I go.  I want to see its beautiful scenery that I have heard so much about. \n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61260, 'I could have gone there myself if only where were no {color,yellow,Cave Lips}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61261, 'To Kid Woz'),
(61262, 'Curly says he will introduce you to Kid Woz for helping him in Golden Cave. Kid Woz is waiting for you in Elderine and wants you to help him.\n(Search Elderine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61263, 'There is someone who needs your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61264, 'Who\'s that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61265, 'It is this tiny kid in {color,yellow,Elderine}.  He goes by the name of {color,yellow,Kid Woz}!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61266, 'I see... He is that short kid, right .\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61267, 'Yes, go find him.  He needs your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate kids.][2]'),
(61268, 'Thanks for coming.  You must be the problem-solver that Curly told me about right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61269, 'Go find {color,yellow,Kid Woz} in {color,yellow,Elderine}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61270, 'Kid Woz\'s Dream'),
(61271, 'Kid Woz wants to learn how to use a sword, but no one wants to give someone a sword that isnt ready for one.  Kid Woz has learned that he can get a sword by defeating the Cursed Sword and asked you to get him one..\n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor.)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61272, 'OK, here\'s my story. \nI need a sword. A big and sharp one.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61273, 'Why does a kid like you need a sword?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61274, 'I\'m not just a kid. I will learn to use the sword and become a great guardian of Elderine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61275, '(That will take forever)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61276, 'That is my plan. So could you get me a sword?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61277, 'Hmm... You do know that a sword is very dangerous weapon, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61278, 'Of course I know that. I want one to pratice with, but I can\'t even get a wooden sword.  No one wants to give one to me.\nThey don\'t understand how badly I want to learn the way of the sword and protect Elderine!\nAll of them are just telling me it\'s too dangerous for a kid... But let the haters hate, I\'m going to do it anyways.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61279, 'Hmm... But it really is dangerous for you.  You can hurt yourself or someone else if you don\'t use it properly. \nThat\'s why no one wants to give you a sword. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61280, 'Hmm... Then, please get me a sword.  I will keep it in my storage until I am strong enough to use it. I will only take it out to practice my skills when I\'m strong enough. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61281, 'Er... Can I trust you?  Are you sure?\nAre you really going to store it and not use it till you are strong enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61282, 'Of course.  \n(Of course not, you fool!)\nI\'ll keep my promise, so please go and get me a sword. I heard that there is a sword-shaped monster called {color,yellow,Cursed Sword} in the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}.\nIt will drop an actual {color,yellow,Sword} when you defeat it, so kill that monster and get me a {color,yellow,Cursed Sword\'s Sword}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, but you must keep your promise!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Play with a stick.][2]'),
(61283, 'Thank you.  Now I can learn how to use a sword. Er, I mean keep it in a safe place so no one can touch it.\n(Not!)\nI will be a great adventurer like you when I grow up!  Thanks!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61284, 'You are not scared of it, are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61290, 'Nina\'s Decision 1'),
(61291, 'Nina has a crush on someone and is trying to make herself look better to make an impression on him. She heard that Navar\'s Hair is the best material for wigs and asks you to get her Navar\'s Hair. \n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor) \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61292, 'Oh... What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61293, 'Why?  Nina?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61294, '(Sighs) It\'s my hair.  It\'s so frizzy and rough.  \nHair means a lot to women...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61295, 'Your hair looks just fine.\nDo you have a crush on someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61296, 'No... No!\nNever that!\n(Changing the subject)\nYou know, there is great news!\nActually, they say {color,yellow,Navar Hunters} have beautiful hair, so many women are dying to get their hands on Navar\'s Hair. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61297, 'So, you want the hair for yourself, right?\nIs it because you have a crush on someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61298, '...\n(Changing the subject)\nEr... I\'ll be making a beautiful wig with the hair.\nLet\'s see... Who could do this for me?  The adventurer in front of me?  Or the one behind me?  La, la!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61299, 'Whatcha talkin bout Wil... I mean Nina? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61300, 'So, you can get {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Navar Hunters\' Hair} for me? \nDon\'t worry about the rewards.  I\'m an item merchant, remember? \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you worry about something other than your hair?][2]'),
(61301, 'Yahoo!  I can make myself a beautiful wig now!\n(Now, I need a pretty handbag)\nThanks, anyways.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61302, 'Please get me the hair so I can make my wig!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61310, 'Nina\'s Decision 2'),
(61311, 'Now that she got her wig, Nina wants to make a new handbag. She heard a rumor that Lizardman\'s Tail is the best material for handbags and asks you to defeat Lizardman and get her its tail. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61312, 'Oh.. What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61313, 'What\'s wrong, Nina?\nYou don\'t like your wig?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61314, 'The wig is perfect.  All I need is a handbag.\nEr, I didn\'t mean to tell you that. \nBut since I did, I\'ll tell you the truth. I need a new bag. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61315, '(What is she going to need next time, gosh)\nSo, you need the handbag to impress your crush, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61316, 'Ha, ha, ha..\nSince you already know, I won\'t hide from you anymore. \nYou know me all to well. \nYou are right.  I am in love, but I can\'t tell you who.  I\'m sorry. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61317, 'You don\'t need to be sorry.  Love is a normal and is also a magical thing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61318, 'Oh, you are so nice.\nI want to ask you a favor.\nPlease get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Lizardman\'s Tails}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Get it yourself and see how hard it is to get them.][2]'),
(61319, 'Oh, thank you so much.  I can finally make the handbag I\'ve always wanted!\n(I\'m ready now)\nOh, please come back and see me when you are {color,yellow,Level} {color,yellow,76}.  I have a favor to ask you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61320, 'Oh, haven\'t you get them all yet?  I can\'t wait forever.  La, la, la!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61321, 'Lump\'s Revenge 1'),
(61322, 'Lump says he wants to get revenge on the monsters that gave him trouble in the last war, but he can\'t leave the village because of he\'s too frail and weak... Lump asks you to defeat Spade Trumpies and collect Spade Trumps, the most prized possession of Trumpies. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61323, '(Looking upset) Hmph... Hmph...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61324, 'Mr. Lump, huh?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61325, '(Looking normal)\nOh, long time no see.  What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61326, 'It seems like you are upset about something. \nI thought maybe I could help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61327, 'It\'s embarassing...  I am a quick tempered guild manager...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61328, 'That\'s OK.  You\'re very passionate about your job,  I understand. \nBut what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61329, 'Hmm... Actually, looking at the turmoil going on in Isya, it reminds me of what I experienced in the past.\n(Looking furious)\nIt was when we were at war with Dark Elves.  I was at the frontline with other brave soldiers.\nOne day, I was attacked by a group of monsters and facing certain death.  But the monsters surrounded me, laughed and disappeared.\nI still can\'t forget the frustration.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61330, 'I see... I think I\'m getting worked up listening to your story.  I\'m curious, what kind of monsters were these?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61331, 'They were {color,yellow,Spade Trumpies}.  I still vividly remember their eyes inside the helmets.\nI want to go out and destroy them myself, but I have become too weak.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61332, 'Of course!  It\'s very dangerous for you to fight alone.  If something bad happens to you, the people of Uruga will be lost. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61333, 'OK, let\'s do this.\nGet me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,SpadeTrumps} that {color,yellow,Spade Trumpies} are carrying. \nCan you do it?  Remember, it\'s for Uruga. \n[BUTTON]=[Yes!  You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I like Roumen better...][2]'),
(61334, 'I admire your skills and courage.  I can leave this incident in the past. \nPlease continue fighting for the prosperity of Uruga and peace of Isya!\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61335, 'Be careful.  They are not easy enemies. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61340, 'Lump\'s Revenge 2'),
(61341, 'Lump says he wants to get revenge on the monsters that gave him trouble in the last war  But he can\'t leave the village because of he\'s too frail and weak. Lump asks you to defeat Elf Knight Demons and bring its Pendant back as proof. \n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61342, 'Hmm... Yes, that\'s what happened...\n(Mumble... Mumble)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61343, 'I\'m back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61344, 'Oh, you.\nHmm...\n(Serious face)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61345, 'What were you thinking about?  You don\'t look glad to see me\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61346, 'Oh... No, of course not.  Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61347, '(Something\'s wrong.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61348, 'Hmm... I guess it would help to tell you the whole story and ask you for help.\n[NAME], listen carefully.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61349, 'Sure!  Just tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61350, 'It happened during the past war.  We were exhausted by ceaseless battles, but we couldn\'t even sleep well because of weird roars every night. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61351, 'Really... I didn\'t know.  What was it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61352, '(Looking furious)\n{color,yellow, Elf Knight Demons}... They made strange noises on purpose so we couldn\'t sleep at night.  The noises even made some soldiers go insane....\nIt was a long time ago, but I can still hear the noises when I close my eyse.  It\'s killing me! I can\'t stand it anymore.  I can\'t die before they are all gone!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61353, '(Surprised)\nSir!  Calm down. Don\'t get worked up.  It\'s not good for your health. \n[NEXT]'),
(61354, 'I have to ask you for a favor again.  You are the only person who can calm my fury. \n\nDefeat {color,yellow,Elf Knight Demons} and get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Demon\'s Pendant}.\nI\'m sure you can do it.  It would mean a lot if you could carry out my vengeance.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d be glad to help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to hear that noise.][2]'),
(61355, 'Oh, I think I can get some rest now.  I\'m still a little frightened, but my fury has gone away thanks to you. \nThank you, adventurer!  Please come back and help the people of Uruga. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61356, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61360, 'Jailbreak 1'),
(61361, 'Bran asks you to defeat the Black Incubus that has been seen roaming around Elderine as of late. \n(Search Concealed Prison 2nd Floor)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61362, '(Letter from Guard Captain Shutian)\nWe are getting reports that {color,yellow,Black Incubus} is being spotted near Elderine.  Please check if these reports are true.\n\nHmm... Hey, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61363, 'Oh, Mr. Bran, what can I do for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61364, 'We have a trouble.  I need someone I could depend on for this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61365, 'Oh!  You must be referring to me? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61366, 'Well...\nThat\'s enough, shut your pie hole and listen. \nIt seems that there are {color,yellow,Black Incubus} around Elderine, although I haven\'t seen them myself...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61367, 'Huh!  Don\'t they tend to roam around the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}?  Why are they in Elderine?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61368, 'Are you questioning what I say?\nWell, actually we are not even sure they are actually {color,yellow,Black Incubus}.\nCan you go out there and see what is happening in the Concealed Prison? While you do that, I will do an investigation in Elderine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61369, 'I could do that, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61370, 'If you see any {color,yellow,Black Incubus} in the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}, defeat about {color,yellow,50} of them. Watch out, they are a dangerous creature.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can go and see!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can do it.][2]'),
(61371, 'So... There actually are {color,yellow,Black Incubus} in the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison 2nd Floor}..\nI didn\'t see anything around Elderine while you were there...\nSomething\'s up..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61372, 'Go and defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Black Incubus}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61380, 'Jailbreak 2'),
(61381, 'Bran heard that the Ancient Stonies that should be in the Concealed Prison 2nd Floor are roaming around in the Forest of Slumber.  Bran asks you to go to Forest of Slumber and defeat Ancient Stonies so they don\'t harm the villagers. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61382, 'Why are they...\nSomething is going wrong..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61383, 'Is this about the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison} again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61384, 'Yes..\nThis time it\'s the {color,yellow,Ancient Stonies} that have been seen in the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber}..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61385, 'That means...\nThey may have broken out of jail!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61386, 'Jailbreak?!\n\nYes, I think that\'s the case since they have been seen here and there. \nI will do an investigation on their jailbreak. Can you go the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber} and see if the {color,yellow,Ancient Stonies} are there.\nDon\'t forget to defeat about {color,yellow,50} of them while you are there. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am actually scared of the fail.][2]'),
(61387, 'I\'m glad to see you defeated the {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Ancient Stonies} that I requested of you. But it seems like the {color,yellow,Ancient Stonies} are still roaming around the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber}.\nWhat the...   How are they escaping the {color,yellow,Concealed Prison}!?!? Maybe they have always been there and I never noticed them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61388, 'You must defeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Ancient Stonies}! {color,yellow,50}, I tell you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61390, 'Jailbreak 3'),
(61391, 'It has been found why the monsters at Concealed Prison have come to the village.  Talk to Bran.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61392, 'Hey, [NAME]. Come here. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61393, 'Oh, Bran!  Have you finally discovered how the monsters have broken out of jail? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61394, '(Stares at the sky for a while)\nPhew...\nI have found the cause...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61395, 'What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61396, 'The truth is that the reports of the monsters that have been seen around the village were lies. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61397, 'Huh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61398, 'I know it sounds crazy, but the nut jobs in the village seems to have mistaken {color,yellow,Ratmen} and {color,yellow,Boogies} for the monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61399, 'So there was no jailbreak at all?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61400, 'I guess...\nI know you are bummed, but you have trained in the prison and I have done my exercise patrolling the village..\nThanks for helping me.. . You are the best adventurer I have met!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61410, 'Nina\'s Decision 3'),
(61411, 'Nina is ready to profess her love.  She says the last thing she needs is a rose to show her love.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61412, 'Whoa...\n[NAME]! [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61413, 'Nina, what\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61414, '(Hesitating)\nToday is the day.  My heart is fluttering.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61415, 'The day for what?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61416, 'Hey, I thought you knew. \nIt\'s the day I profess my love!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61417, 'Oh!  Who is the lucky man?\nYou should tell me now. I think I deserve to know. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61418, 'It\'s the brave and quiet {color,yellow,Bran} in Elderine.  I don\'t know what I like about him, but he has taken over my heart... \nI\'m so embarrassed... I don\'t know what to do..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61419, 'Hmm, why don\'t you go and tell him right now?  Why are you still here? Go and tell him!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61420, 'Actually, I\'m almost ready to go, but I still need one last thing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61421, 'You mean like a ring or some flowers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61422, 'Yes!  I want to give him a rose to show I have feeling for him but it takes too much time for me to get it and it will ruin my outfit..\nHey, [NAME]!  Why don\'t you get me {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,Petals (Red)}, {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,Petals (Blue)}, and {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,Petals (Yellow)}?\nIf you get them for me, I will use them to make a rose. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it yourself.][2]'),
(61423, 'Finally... Everything is ready... Phew... It\'s more exciting but also scarier than negotiating item prices.  \nThank you for helping me make a rose!\nI need to relax myself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61424, 'Get me {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,red Petals}, {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,blue Petals}, and {color,yellow,15} {color,yellow,yellow Petals}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61430, 'Nina\'s Decision 4'),
(61431, 'Nina asks you to deliver her letter of love and the rose and Bran.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61432, 'Today\'s the day! I hope he accepts my love.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61433, 'Are you on your way to profess your love?  I would love to come and watch (giggle). \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61434, 'Yes, I will be professing my love... But I won\'t be going to tell him it myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61435, '!?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61436, '[NAME], please deliver this letter of love and rose to {color,yellow,Bran}. This is my last request.\nI can\'t do it myself because my heart is about to explode...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be your cupid.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You must do it yourself!][2]'),
(61437, 'Hmm? [NAME]!  What brings you here?\nWhat is this?\n(Reads the letter)\n!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61438, 'Please take these to {color,yellow,Bran}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61440, 'Their Story '),
(61441, 'Bran received Nina\'s proposal. Give his reply to Nina. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61442, 'Hmm... I don\'t know what to say.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61443, 'Mr. Bran, my job here is done. \nHow does it feel to be loved by someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61444, 'Well, I can\'t say anything yet, but it sure does feels awkward. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61445, '(That means he likes it?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61446, 'Since I received something, I should give something back.\n(Wiping)\nHere, take this to Nina.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Piece of cake.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it yourself][2]'),
(61447, '(Reads the letter carefully)\nBran says he wants to get to know me.  It\'s a positive response!\nGreat, isn\'t it?\nI couldn\'t of done this without you. Thank you, [NAME].  Thank you so much.  I owe you one.  La, la, la!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61448, 'Take it to {color,yellow,Nina}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61450, 'Robin\'s Memory 1'),
(61451, 'Robin says there was a time when he was courageous and popular.  Robin asks you to find the places that he can still remember. \n(Search Forest of Mist and Forest of Tides)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61452, 'It\'s been a long time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61453, 'Hello, grandpa. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61454, '{color,yellow,Grandpa}...\n(Thinks deeply.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61455, 'What\'s the matter?  Did I say something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61456, 'No... No.\nWhenever I see an adventurer like you, it reminds me of the time when I was young..\nI was a brave warrior myself.  Nothing scared me and I was ready to fight for justice...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61457, '(Is senility kicking in?)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61458, 'Yes, that\'s right.\nI remember fighting against {color,yellow,Joker Kebings} in the {color,yellow,Forest of Mist} and {color,yellow,Slimes} in the {color,yellow,Forest of Tides}.\nI miss those days. The battles in the {color,yellow,Forest of Mist} and the {color,yellow,Forest of Tides} are still fond memories for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61459, '(It doesn\'t sound very special though.)\nYou haven\'t changed much.  I would want to see you fight if we could turn back the hands of time!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61460, 'Turn back time?\nOh, no, no...\nYou can help me relive my memories in the {color,yellow,Forest of Mist} and the {color,yellow,Forest of Tides}. \nPlease help me feel young again.\nDefeat {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Joker Kebings} in the {color,yellow,Forest of Mist} and {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Slimes} in the {color,yellow,Forest of Tides}. \nCan you do that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I will help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t fight those weak monsters.][2]'),
(61461, 'Yes! You\'ve defeated them all?\nThank you for helping me remember the memories of my youth.\nBut, who are you?  I don\'t have a good memory. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61462, 'Haven\'t you left yet?  Are you playing games with this old man?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61470, 'Robin\'s Memory 2'),
(61471, 'Robin asks you to find his favorite past time food.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61472, 'Hmph... What was is?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61473, 'Grandpa!  Is there something else you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61474, 'You helped me relive my youth and the places I used to go.\nBut, I can\'t remember what I used to love...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61475, '(Huh?)\nCheer up.  You have to think carefully!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61476, 'Wait.. Er, Hp...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61477, 'Are you talking about {color,yellow,HP Potions}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61478, 'Yes!  That\'s it. I had a lot of {color,yellow,HP Potions} and {color,yellow,SP Potions} when I was young. \nYou really have a good memory.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61479, '(...)\nHahaha.  Thanks!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61480, 'Yes, I remember now! \nIt\'s your turn now. \nGet me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,HP Potions (Tier 1)} and {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,SP Potion (Tier 1)}. \nThey will help me remember everything.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you get your memories back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t need to remember all that.][2]'),
(61481, 'So many potions. Yes, this is good.  My memory is back.\nThanks to you.  Thank you so much...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61482, 'Are you still working on getting {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,HP Potions} and {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,SP Potion}?  It\'s taking so long. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61490, 'Hans\' Request 1 (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61491, 'Hans says someone important asked him to refine a sword.\nBut Sylphs have the materials he needs for refining and he asks you to defeat them and bring him the materials.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61492, 'Hey, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61493, 'Mr. Hans, hello!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61494, 'How you doin\'?  You\'re looking good these days\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61495, 'I guess... I\'m doing alright. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61496, 'OK, then.  I have a favor to ask you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61497, 'What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61498, 'Ha ha... Don\'t worry, it\'s nothing too difficult.  I am asking you because I know you are a talented adventurer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61499, '(I think it may be a hard job.)\nLet me hear it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61500, 'Someone important asked me to refine a sword, but I need special materials to refine the one he wants.  I don\'t have the materials right now.  It seems that {color,yellow,Sylphs} in the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber} have them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61501, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61502, 'Well, that\'s all I can say.  It\'s time for some action.\nGo to the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber} and get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph} from {color,yellow,Sylphs}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(61503, 'You are my kind of adventurer! \nThank you.  Now, I can refine the sword.  If you have time, I may have more work for you. \nI might need more of these feathers.  Can you get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph}? \nJust in case.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61504, 'I guess {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph} would do. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61510, 'Hans\' Request 1 (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61511, 'Hans says someone important asked him to refine a sword.\nBut Sylphs have the materials he needs for refining and he asks you to defeat them and bring him the materials.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Forest of Slumber)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61512, 'Hey, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61513, 'Do you have another favor to ask me, Mr. Hans?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61514, 'Go to the {color,yellow,Forest of Slumber} and get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph} from {color,yellow,Sylphs}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(61515, 'You are my kind of adventurer! \nThank you.  Now, I can refine the sword.  If you have time, I may have more work for you. \nI might need more of these feathers.  Can you get me {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph}? \nJust in case.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61516, 'I guess {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Feathers of Sylph} would do. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61520, 'The Ghosts and Ghouls'),
(61521, 'Healer Avon of Elderine asks you to help him investigate the increase of ghosts and ghouls plaguing the monsters around Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61522, 'Hello, [NAME]! How are you doing today?\n\nIt\'s been sooo strange, ever since we put up Halloween decorations around Elderine, there have been an increase in sightings of ghosts and ghouls. Do you think you can help me investigate?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61523, 'Hi Healer Avon, I am doing good, getting excited for Halloween! Thanks for asking. I haven\'t really seen any ghosts or ghouls around Isya, can you tell me more about this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61524, 'I was really young when my grandfather told me this story but I am beginning to think it is true... I knew I shouldn\'t have agreed to decorating the towns... Anyways, long ago, an evil warlord named Velkolightbone roamed the lands of Isya. He loved anything related to ghosts and ghouls and loved showing them off.\n\nTo make a long story short, his dying wish was whenever Halloween decorations are put up, ghosts and ghouls will scour the lands until the end of Hallow\'s Eve.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61525, 'WHAT? That is such a crazy story, I don\'t know if I can believe it... You are telling me that some whacko from way back decided to plague everyone in Isya whenever they put of decorations for Hallow\'s Eve? Come on Healer Avon, do you really expect me to believe this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61526, '[NAME], Do you really think I would be joking in this manner?!?!?! While the story sounds foolish, it is 100% true and we need to find out a way to release this curse without ruining all the festivities planned for Hallow\'s Eve. Can you help?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(61527, 'Ok Healer Avon, no matter how ridiculous this sounds, I believe you. What can I do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61528, 'We need to do some investigation work [NAME]! There have been many findings on how to break the curse, all but one seem foolish so let\'s try the one that makes the most sense.\n\nI was with Kid Woz the other day and he told me that his teacher told the tale long ago and he tells me the secret lies with the monsters. Apparently, the ghosts and ghouls rise from the hairs of the monsters. I need you to collect {color,yellow,40} {color,yellow,monster hair samples} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure Avon, I\'ll help out with you investigation.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy running away from ghosts and gouls....Maybe later.][2]  '),
(61529, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the monster hair samples so I can conduct my investigation. I can finally find a way to send these ghosts and ghouls back from where they came from.\n\nPlease take these items as a token of my appreciation for all of your hard work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61530, 'Have you had a chance to collect the monster hair samples for me? I need to figure out how to get rid of these ghosts and ghouls!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63210, 'Camp under Attack'),
(63211, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains says he will tell you about their circumstances.  Listen to Luke. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63212, 'Hey, [NAME]!  Thanks for coming all the way here. \nDo you like this place?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63213, '(Smiling)\nYes, it has fresh air.  I don\'t know everything, but I like that it is energetic. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63214, 'I see.  But this place wasn\'t like this until a while ago. \nIt was filled with despair after that incident and barely got its life back. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63215, '(Surprised)\nThe incident?\nWhat happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63216, 'We were a part of the frontiers of the Hunters\' Association and assigned to explore unknown lands. \nWe arrived here in Kahal Plains after a long journey. \nWhen we first got here, we thought this would be the most beautiful place on this continent...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63217, '(Listens carefully.)\nI think this actually is the most beautiful place. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63218, 'We built a pretty large town when we first settled here. \nWe wanted to attract more travelers to settle here and we had enough resources from the Association.  We settled without harming the environment and started our lives here. \nThe town flourished and many merchants visited us. \nThen, we confronted a big wall. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63219, 'Wall?  Are you referring to our fight with {color, yellow, Depraved Elves} in Guiltian\'s letter? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63220, 'Yes.  I guess you heard something from Chief Guiltian. \nI guess no more explanation is needed then. \nWe had conflicts with these Elves, but we didn\'t attack each other.  We just didn\'t invade each other\'s perimeters. \nWe sometimes helped each other to find resources or build homes and lived in balance.  But they became antagonistic against us overnight. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63221, 'Overnight?  Wasn\'t there something that triggered them to change? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63222, 'That is my question.\nI can\'t figure out what did.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63223, 'If you tell me that happened at that time, I could be able to find some evidence. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63224, 'You think?  Hmm..  I guess you are right. \nI will tell you what happened. \n\nOne night, countless invaders suddenly raided our camp.  We are ambushed in the middle of the night and didn\'t know what it was that invaded us.  We were in panic. \nWhen we finally got it together, we saw {color, yellow, Depraved Elves} gone berserk, setting our camp on fire, breaking everything, and running after us to kill us. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63225, 'I can see that it was such a tragedy.   What happened to the camp after that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63226, 'As you can see, {color, yellow,we are living in our temporary settlement and our camp has been lost to them.}\n(In despair)\nWe were helpless.  We think that we are lucky to be alive. \n[NAME], did you find any evidence from my story?\nIt is horrible to even think about that time.  I just can\'t understand why they had to change.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63227, 'I think there was something that changed them like you said. \nThere must be something behind this!  Something that caused them to transform!\nWe have to find what they are after.  That is the only way to protect the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains. \nI need your help in order to do so. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63228, '............\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63230, 'First Confrontation 1'),
(63231, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association is willing to introduce herself.  Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63232, 'It\'s nice to meet you, [NAME].\nLuke told me much about you. \nMy name is Joanna. \nI am the supply manager for the temporary settlement. \nI\'d be happy to work with you. \n(Smiles.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63233, 'Oh, you are Joanna.  Nice to meet you!\nI am [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63234, 'I guess you have heard about this place.  We are living in fear snce that incident. \nWe have gotten ourselves together, but we are so scared they might come back. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63235, 'Don\'t worry.\n(Pounding on chest)\nI am here now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63236, '(Stares suspiciously...)\nEr.. Well, I will count on you then. \n(Stares in the air with fear in the eyes.)\nI saw them.  They were crying in madness. \nIf you don\'t watch out...\n(Shivers in fear.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63237, 'Don\'t worry.  \nI won\'t let them do that to you again. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63238, 'I am glad to hear that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63239, '(Looks frightened with fear in the eyes.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63240, 'First Confrontation 2'),
(63241, 'Huey of the Hunters\' Association is willing to introduce herself.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63242, '[NAME], I heard much about you from Luke. \nI am Huey.  What I\'d like to tell you is that we have certain rules although this is a temporary settlement.   If you follow our rules, you won\'t have any problems with me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63243, 'I get it, Huey.\nWhat are the rules I need to know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63244, 'It\'s simple.  There are three rules related to survival.  First, this is a very dangerous place, so try not to go out too late. \nThe monsters around here become active late at night, so you must be careful. \nSecond, always take your Move Scroll if you go out alone. \nLike I said, the monsters here are very violent and you can easily be killed if you don\'t watch out.\nSo always take it with you just in case. \nLast, always listen to what the members of the Hunters\' Association say. \nThese are the basic rules, so please follow them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63245, '(Starting to have a headache.)\nThese are three long rules. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63246, 'You are here to help us.  Don\'t forget why you are here. \nAgain, you must observe these three rules. \n(Smiling)\nOK, that\'s it for today.  Let\'s have something warm. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63247, '(He muust be very strict.)\nYes, sir.\n(Smiling)\nI wonder what they are serving today. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63248, 'Always remember the rules. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63250, 'Stabilizing the Temporary Settlement 1'),
(63251, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.\nLuke of the Hunters\' Association asks you to help them to stabilize the temporary settlement. \nBring 50 Firewood for him. \n\n(Search Kahal and Dark Wood)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63252, 'Hey, [NAME].  It\'s time to start working. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63253, 'I am excited to start my first task in Kahal Plains. \nJust say anything. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63254, 'I love your attitude.  Good.  Your job today is reinforve this hut. \nWhat do you think; eash, eh?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63255, 'It\'s too each for my first task.  Ask me something harder!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63256, 'We will get to it.  The first step is to gather our efforts together to stabilize this temporary settlement!\nNow, go out and get {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Firewood} to reinforce this hut.  You can find it anywhere in Kahal Plains. \nShow me what you got. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It sounds boring.. Got anything else?][2]'),
(63257, 'Luke, I got {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Firewood}!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63258, 'Ha ha...  We are lucky Guiltian sent someone like you for us.  Nice job!  Go and take a rest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63259, 'What happened to {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Firewood}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63260, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 2'),
(63261, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Joanna of the Hunters\' Association asks you to get a number of materials to stabilize the temporary settlement.  Get 50 each of Tree Stems and Grass Stems. \n\n(Search Kahal and Dark Wood)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63262, '(Smiling)\n[NAME]!  I hear that you are doing a good job. \nLuke said you have been a great help. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63263, 'Ha ha, I haven\'t done much yet, but thanks for your compliment. \nJoanna!!  I will try harder to help you.  So you can count on me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63264, 'You are too modest.  I have a favor to ask you.  I piled up the Firewood that you got for us and I need ropes to hold them together.  But I\'m out of {color, yellow, Tree Stems} and {color, yellow, Grass Stems} that I need to make ropes.  I was wondering you could get them for me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63265, 'Oh, you are making your own ropes!  It\'s exciting to see what I wasn\'t able to see in larger towns. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63266, 'OK!  Time to get to work. \nGet me {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Tree Stems} and {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Grass Stems}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s a piece of cake!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh!  I just remembered that I am allergic to trees.][2]'),
(63267, 'Joanna, I got you {color, yellow, Tree Stems} and {color, yellow, Grass Stems}!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63268, '(Smiling)\nGreat.  I can make the hut stronger with these.  Go ahead a take a rest until your next job. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63269, 'You can get {color, yellow, Tree Stems} and {color, yellow, Grass Stems} anywhere in Kahal Plains like Firewood.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63270, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 3'),
(63271, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Huey of the Hunters\' Association asks you to get Young Herbal Leaves to stabilize the temporary settlement.  Get 50 Young Herbal Leaves.  \n\n(Search Kahal and Dark Herb)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63272, '[NAME]!  I know you have the skill, but danger is always around you. \nAlways be careful. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63273, 'Huey, you seem to be too careful. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63274, 'Being carefull is the best defense.  It doesn\'t hurt to be careful. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63275, '(Chuckles awkwardly)\nI.. I guess you are right.\nAnyways, do you have something to say to me, Huey?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63276, 'I am in charge of treating the ill for the Hunters\' Association, although we are not a large group...  We lost most of our supplies during the raid, including the medications.  So I would like it if you can get me {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Young Herbal Leaves} to make the medications again.  \nOh, don\'t forget to watch out for violent monsters!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you ask other towns?][2]'),
(63277, 'Huey, there are many quality herbs around here.  I got you {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Young Herbal Leaves}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63278, '(With sparking eyes)\nThese will be a great help for the Hunters\' Association.  I can make medications and food out of them, but I hope that I never get to use these Young Herbal Leaves...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63279, 'Always watch your back...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63280, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 4'),
(63281, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Joanna of the Hunters\' Association asks you to get Black Mushrooms for food to stabilize the temporary settlement.  Get 50 Black Mushrooms.  \n\n(Search Kahal and Dark Mushroom)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63282, 'How many days could we survive with this..\n(Looks worried.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63283, 'Joanna, anything wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63284, 'Phew... (sighs)\nYou know... We are running out of food. \nWe have food for only a week now. \nIt would take more than a month to get food from the Hunters\' Association in other regions and more than 2 weeks to get food from Adealia Village nearby..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63285, 'Ugh!!  That means we cannot eat after a week?\nI can\'t do anything if I don\'t eat...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63286, 'Anyways, we have to receive food supplies before we run out of food or find some food ourselves.. Phew.. \nIf we can\'t get food, we will suffer from hunger in addition to the monsters and will be driven out of Kahal Plains eventually. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63287, 'Don\'t worry.  I will get food.\nWhat do you want me to get?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63288, 'Oh... You are the guardian angel for the Hunters\' Association. \n(Spreads a piece of paper.)\nLet\'s see!\nHmm.. Not this.. This would be good.\nOK!  [NAME]!  {color, yellow, Black Mushrooms} would be good.  You should be able to find {color, yellow, Black Mushrooms} nearby.  Black Mushrooms make you feel full with only a small amount.  Also, it Black Mushroom Soup is tasty and serves many people.  It is the best food to get. \nNow!!  [NAME]!  Get me {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Black Mushrooms}.  Then, we sould be able to survive until we get food supplies. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh!  I see!  I\'m flying out now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.. How do you expect me to eat only mushrooms?][2]'),
(63289, 'Ta-dah!  {color, yellow, 50} mouth-watering {color, yellow, Black Mushrooms} are here.  Can we enjoy these tonight?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63290, 'Er... Thank you anyways.  We won\'t have to worry about food for a while. \n(So reliable!  He\'s a nice guy.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63291, 'Get me {color, yellow, 50} {color, yellow, Black Mushrooms}.  Don\'t attempt to eat it raw.  You might get stomachache. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63300, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 5'),
(63301, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Luke of the Hunters\' Association tells you that he is getting ready to reinforce the armory to right against Depraved Elves.  Get 75 Big and Heavy Leather for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63302, '[NAME]!  You must be pretty busy these days. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63303, 'I feel like I am a member of the Hunters\' Association. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63304, 'Oh.. The Hunters\' Association would be grateful to have a member like you, but we won\'t force you to join us since you are an adventurer.  Don\'t worry.  Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63305, 'Ha ha.  I feel like you are giving me a nudge. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63306, 'Anyhow.. I wanted to thank you because our temporary settlement has improved a lot wince you came. \nThank you.\nNow that this place is settled, we can prepare to get back at those Depraved Elves.  We have to settle things; it\'s either them or us that should leave this land. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63307, 'Does that mean...  You are planning to confront Depraved Elves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63308, 'I don\'t know what has gotten into them, but we can\'t live with the fact that we were defeated by them.  Ha ha.\nOh!  Come to think of it, I have a favor to ask you.  I\'m sure you\'ll help me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63309, 'I have done many things already and I can do more. \nTell me what it is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63310, 'As you know, Depraved Elves are not easy opponents and we are not ready to fight them yet.  If our equipment and weapons are stronger than theirs, we would have a chance.  Get me {color, yellow, 75} {color, yellow, Big and Heavy Leather} from {color, yellow, Vicious Apes} in the Plains for our equipment and weapons.  That would help us to reinforce our armors.\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the Hunters\' Association!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hope it\'s not really big and heavy.][2]'),
(63311, 'Luke, don\'t worry about your armors anymore.  I got {color, yellow, 75} {color, yellow, Big and Heavy Leather} for you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63312, 'Now we can fight them.  I owe you big time. \nI will pay you back someday.  Thanks!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63313, 'You can get {color, yellow, Big and Heavy Leather} from the monsters in the Plains!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63320, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 6'),
(63321, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Joanna of the Hunters\' Association says that she needs more food to stabilize the temporary settlement.  \nGet 30 Sweet Milk and 40 Dry Meat for her. \n\n(Search Item Merchant Loussier)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63322, '[NAME], can you do me a favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63323, 'Tell me what it is first. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63324, 'The Black Mushrooms you got me last time solved the food shortage problem, but it is not easy to feed on Black Mushrooms all the time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63325, '(I was sick of mushrooms myself.)\nHa ha ha..  I will certainly help you. \nWhere should I go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63326, 'Why are you laughing?  Didn\'t you like my soup?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63327, 'Oh.. No.  I love your black mushroom soup, Joanna.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63328, 'Phew. \nI am relieved.\nOK, go to {color, yellow, Adealia Village} and get me {color, yellow, 30} {color, yellow, Sweet Milk} and {color, yellow, 40} {color, yellow, Dry Meat}.  I want to go myself, but I can\'t leave the town because I got a letter that the supplies from the Hunters\' Association will be arriving soon.  \nYou can go for me, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go to Adealia Village.][2]'),
(63329, 'I\'m exhausted..\nHere are the things you asked us.  It was {color, yellow, 30} {color, yellow, Sweet Milk} and {color, yellow, 40} {color, yellow, Dry Meat}, right?\n(Yahoo, no more black mushroom soup!!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63330, 'Thank you so much.  Now, I can present different dishes. \nBut today\'s menu is still {color, yellow, Black Mushroom Soup}.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63331, 'Get me {color, yellow, 30} {color, yellow, Sweet Milk} and {color, yellow, 40} {color, yellow, Dry Meat} from {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.  Oh!  You need a hint?  Find Karuha in Adealia Village and ask her for Sweet Milk and Dry Meat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63340, 'Stabilizing Temporary Settlement 7'),
(63341, 'The Hunters\' Association is living at the temporary settlement since they lost the camp to Depraved Elves.  Huey of the Hunters\' Association tells you that he is getting ready to reinforce the armory to right against Depraved Elves.  Get 60 Steel Horns for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63342, 'This is the last job for you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63343, 'Huh?  Last job?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63344, 'It means that this temporary settlement has been stabilized a lot thanks to you. \nIt doesn\'t mean you can be relieved yet. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63345, 'All of us have worked hard.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63346, 'Luke is working on his tactics to fight against Depraved Elves and I am assigned to reinforcing the weapons to support his tactics.  Do you remember getting me the materials I asked you for reinforcing the armors?  It\'s not much different from that.  Please get me the materials for reinforcing the weapons this time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63347, 'Oh!!  Reinforcing the weapons!  I know!!  You need good weapons to fight well. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63348, 'Ha ha!!  You got it!!  Then, go to {color, yellow, Pergy} and get me {color, yellow, 60} {color, yellow, Steel Horns}.  That should be enough to reinforce the weapons for all members of the Hunters\' Association. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it for the Hunters\' Association!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What about my weapon?][2]'),
(63349, 'Here are {color, yellow, 60} {color, yellow, Steel Horns} that you asked. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63350, 'Now, we are ready to right Depraved Elves.  We owe you.  Thank you.\nBut we are going to need you more from now on. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63351, 'Do you think the horns are really sharp?  I am scared of sharp things...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63360, 'Threats for Temporary Settlement 1(Repeatable Quest)'),
(63361, 'The Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement has been stabilized, but Joanna is worried because there are monsters around the town.  Joanna asks you to defeat 142 Mean Leipoons, the most threatening monsters around the town. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63362, '[NAME]!\nI have the right job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63363, 'The right job for me...\nHmm.. I think I know what you mean!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63364, 'Let\'s save us some time then.  There is an increasing number of monsters appearing around the temporary settlement.  The biggest threat is {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons}.\nPlease defeat {color, yellow, 142} {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons} to set an example.  That would alert the monsters that appear around the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement. \n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s time to teach them a lesson!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(63365, 'Well done.\nDark Fogs would not appear near the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement for a while, right? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63366, '{color, yellow, 142} {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons} would do. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63370, 'Threats for Temporary Settlement 1(Repeatable Quest)'),
(63371, 'The Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement has been stabilized, but Joanna is worried because there are monsters around the town.  Joanna asks you to defeat 142 Mean Leipoons, the most threatening monsters around the town. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63372, '[NAME]!  That wasn\'t enough!  There are way more!!\nCapture all {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons} you see.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63373, 'Capture {color, yellow, about 142} {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem!!  I will capture them all.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(63374, 'Well done.  They should know better to stay away from the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement!! \nHow about capturing {color, yellow, 142} {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons}?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63375, '{color, yellow, about 142} {color, yellow, Mean Leipoons} would do. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63380, 'Threats for Temporary Settlement 2(Repeatable Quest)'),
(63381, 'The only supply channel of the Hunters\' Association has been blocked by Shella\'s violent attacks.   Huey asks you to defeat 154 Shellas so the supply wagon can move.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63382, 'Right on time, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63383, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63384, 'We have been reported that the Hunters\' Association\'s supply channel has been blocked by a flock of {color, yellow, Shellas}.  The supply wagon is captured, so we have to reopen the supply channel. \nOh, I don\'t know what to do.\nI have to wait here for correspondence and Luke and Joanna are busy. \nThat leaves you!!  You are our only hope!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63385, '(Look how that worked out.)\nI\'d be glad to help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63386, 'Defeat {color, yellow, 154} {color, yellow, Shellas}.  Capture as many as possible so they can\'t get back at us. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Those Shallas, they will stay away from the wagon!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wouldn\'t it be better to choose another road if there are too many Shellas?][2]'),
(63387, 'I\'m back. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63388, 'Good.  They won\'t attack the supply wagon anymore. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63389, 'We can receive our supplies only if you defeat as many {color, yellow, Shellas} as possible. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63390, 'Threats for Temporary Settlement 2(Repeatable Quest)'),
(63391, 'The only supply channel of the Hunters\' Association has been blocked by Shella\'s violent attacks.   Huey asks you to defeat 154 Shellas so the supply wagon can move.\n(Repeated Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63392, '[NAME]!  No!  No!!\nYou need to capture more {color, yellow, Shellas}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63393, 'Capture about {color, yellow, 154} {color, yellow, Shellas}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[154 it is.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ahh!!  I want to rest now!][2]'),
(63394, 'Good job.\nBut you must capture all Shellas you see to secure the supply channel!!\nGo!  Hurry!  Capture more!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63395, 'We can receive our supplies only if you defeat as many {color, yellow, Shellas} as possible. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63400, 'Token of Gratitude'),
(63401, 'Luke has successfully stabilized the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement and wants to thank you.  Listen to Luke.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63402, 'Hey, [NAME].  Your performance is brilliant.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63403, 'Ha ha, don\'t mention it.  There will be time when I will need your help in return. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63404, 'Frankly, I did not expect much when we asked Adealia for support.  I thought they would send someone to do our chores. \nYou have been the greatest help for the Hunters\' Association to settle at this temporary settlement.  I want to share this with more people. \nI will tell other members of the Hunters\' Association in Uruga, Swamp of Dawn, and other larger cities what you have done for us!\nIt is the birth of a new hero!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63405, 'I am flattered. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63406, 'Ha ha ha!  Are you trying to be modest?  Or are you just pretending?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63407, '(Embarrassed)\nI am not pretending.  I just did what I should do.  I don\'t want to be known or anything in return. \nI just want...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63408, 'What?  What is it?  You can say anything. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63409, 'I just want the Hunters\' Association to find peace again in this beautiful Kahal Plains.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63410, 'You are certainly different from other adventurers!\nI understand.  Now that we are ready, it\'s time for us to say hi?  You have to be well-prepared for it.  You have to be ready for any event.  It will be harder than you think...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63411, 'You are a great adventurer!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63420, 'Trainer in Black Fog'),
(63421, 'Kiera of the Alberstol Ruins asks you to deliver his box to Tamer Ranthis in the Adealia Village.  Go and talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63422, '[NAME]!  Right on time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63423, 'Kiera?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63424, 'It may be nothing for you, but it is an important thing for me.  I really need your help, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63425, 'What is it?  You sound serious. \nTell me what it is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63426, 'Oh, thank you. \nIf you go past this place, there is a place filled with black fog. \nThere is a person who has mysterious powers to tame animals..\nAs you can see, I have so many things to do and can\'t leave this place. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63427, 'I was wondering if you could take this and deliver my message to her. \nYou are the only person I can ask. \nPlease help me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Filled with black fog... It motivates my spirit of adventure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It sounds dangerous... You should ask someone else.][2]'),
(63428, '........ What the .. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63429, '(The ears!!  And looks very mean.)\nHello.\nI was asked by Kiera of Alberstol Ruins to bring this to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63430, '(Looks up and down.)\n...Kiera.. Never... heard of her...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63431, 'Don\'t get lost.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63440, 'Kiera\'s Box 1'),
(63441, 'Ranthis is surprised to get Kiera\'s Box and asks you to take it to Edward in Adealia Village. \nTake Kiera\'s Box from Ranthis to Edwina. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63442, 'I... don\'t... know... anything... about this box.\nRanthis... don\'t know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63443, '(What is she saying?  What should I do?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63444, 'Ranthis... don\'t... know... why...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63445, 'But Kiera asked me to bring this to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63446, 'Hmm. (Ranthis ponders)\nThen... take... this... to... Edwina.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63447, 'Edwina?  Who is that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63448, 'My... master....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63449, 'Talk to me... When you... are ready.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I am ready.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am not ready. ][2]'),
(63450, 'Oh!  You are the person Ranthis was talking about. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63451, '...............\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63460, 'Kiera\'s Box 2'),
(63461, 'Talk to Edwina of Adealia and take Kiera\'s Box back to Ranthis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63462, 'You look surprised.\nOh, you talk to Ranthis, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63463, '(Looks surprised)\n...Oh, so her name is Miss Ranthis. \nI guess that is whom I talked to. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63464, 'Ha ha.  You don\'t have to call her miss. \nJust be friendly. \nShe told me what this is about.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63465, 'When?  How did you talk to her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63466, 'Oh, ha ha.  I can\'t tell you how.\nCan you show me what you got?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63467, '(This kid is sly) \nHere it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63468, '(Edwina checks the inside of the box)\nHmm... I guess I should contact Kiera myself. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63469, 'Oh, let me introduce myself. \nI\'m Edwina.\nI will be seeing you often. \nYou can call me Ed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63470, 'Do you want to know how I am related to Ranthis?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63480, 'Old Soldier Guiltian'),
(63481, 'Edwina of Adealia tells you to go to Guiltian to learn more about the village. \nFind Guiltian and listen to his story. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63482, 'OK then.  What is your name?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63483, 'Oh, my name is [NAME].\nBut what is this village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63484, 'Ha ha.  There is someone who can better answer your questions than me, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63485, 'Look for a gray-haired man wearing the village\'s armor.  His name is Guiltian.  Find him and show this fragment.  He can answer your questions (although he rarely answers someone\'s questions).\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, gray-haired...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need more information!][2]'),
(63486, 'Are you Guiltian?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63487, 'Yes, I am.  Who are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63488, 'I\'m [NAME].\nEd.. No, Edwina told me to bring this to you and you will answer my questions.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63489, 'Hmm.. This certainly belongs to Ed, but I don\'t have the time to answer questions for someone I don\'t know. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63490, 'You don\'t know?  Hmm... Find Guiltian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63500, 'The Crystal of Black Fog'),
(63501, 'You were catching Black Spikehorns and you found a black fragment. \nTake it to Guiltian of Adealia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63502, '(This is something I have never seen before.\nLet\'s take it to Guiltian.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63503, 'Guiltian!!\nTake a look at this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63504, 'What makes you so excited?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63505, 'Look it.\nI got this while catching Black Spikehorns.  It feels strange.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63506, 'Let me see. \nHmm.. (examines for a while)\nI\'ve never seen this before, but it does feel strange..\nIt feels ominous.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63507, 'I think I should take it to Edwina.\nYou can go now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63508, '(Let\'s go to Guiltian.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63510, 'Village in Black Fog 1'),
(63511, 'Kiera of Alberstol Ruins tells you to deliver a letter to Marlene of Adealia.\nTake Kiera\'s Note to Marlene.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63512, '[NAME], there is a place filled with black fog at the end of the Alberstol Ruins.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63513, 'What?  Black fog?  I\'ve never heard of it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63514, 'I see.\nThe black fog is so think that even those with good eyesight cannot see through it. \nI just got a letter from someone who claims to live in the black fog, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63515, 'A letter from the black fog..  It doesn\'t make sense. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63516, 'I thought it was fishy and tried to ignore it, but a letter came everyday.  I couldn\'t ignore it anymore.  When I read it and it was about a village in the black fog. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63517, 'The letter is from someone who lives in that village and is researching the substances of the black fog around the village. They said they want to ask me about some of the substances in the black fog that they can\'t figure out. \nI studied the substances that were in the letter and found out a few things about the black fog. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63518, 'I replied to tell they about my findings, but they told me that they haven\'t received anything from me.  I found that out after sending them several letters.  So, I want you to go to that village in the black fog and find "Marlene" to deliver this letter since you are the only person I can trust, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wouldn\'t it me faster to tell her to come and get the letter?][2]'),
(63519, 'Are you Marlene?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63520, '(Checks out suspiciously)\nWho are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63521, 'Er... Kiera asked me to bring this letter to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63522, 'Oh, Kiera.. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63523, 'Be careful not to get lost.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63530, 'Village in Black Fog 2'),
(63531, 'Talk to Marlene of Adealia about Kiera\'s letter. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63532, 'So Kiera asked you. \nDid Kiera tell you what this is about?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63533, 'Briefly.  She didn\'t give me all the details. \nShe told me to find you in the black fog. \n(Staring)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63534, 'I see.\nI am Marlene.\nAnd you are staring at me so passionately.  You could make a hole in my face. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63535, 'Oh, I\'m sorry... You look so whimsical. \nI am [NAME].\nI guess everyone in the village... (shakes hands in the air)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63536, 'Oh, I guess I startled you. \nNot everyone in this village looks like me (shakes her tail). \nWelcome to Adealia Village.\nI hope we get along. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63537, '...............\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63540, 'The Welcoming Ritual 1'),
(63541, 'Guiltian of Adealia says he will not answer any questions for a stranger and tells you he might answer your questions if you catch 105 Black Spike Horns for him.\nCatch 105 Black Spike Horns.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63542, 'Guiltian, why there is the black fog around the village and why do the people look this way?  Why are they different?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63543, 'Why should I answer the questions of a stranger?  Ahem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63544, 'You don\'t have you.\nBut you can know me better. \nGuiltian, don\'t you need anything?  Don\'t you need my help (rolls up the sleeves)?\nI can knock down a few monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63545, 'You can\'t stand the curiosity. \nI remember that the Black Spike Horns have created a lair just outside the village and gathered there.  Drive the Black Spike Horns out of there.  Defeat about 105 of them and the rest will run away from you.  What do you say?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, I\'m confident.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Black Spike Horns?  I\'ve never heard of them.. Let me think..][2]'),
(63546, 'You have some skills.\n(He could be able to help our village)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63547, 'I don\'t like to say things twice, but you don\'t look smark enough.  The name of the monsters is Black Spike Horn.  Don\'t forget. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63550, 'The Welcoming Ritual 2'),
(63551, 'Guiltian of Adealia says he will not answer any questions for a stranger and tells you he might answer your questions if you get him 80 Dark Ape\'s Leather for him.\nGet 80 Dark Ape\'s Leather.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63552, 'Guiltian!  I want to know, since when has this village has been filled with black fog? How is this place floating and why do the people look how they do...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63553, 'Stop!!  (Touching his beard)\nOK.  Since you\'ve helped our village, I will tell you the story behind the black fog filling the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63554, '(Looks interested)\nYes, tell me, please.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63555, 'Honestly, I don\'t know.\nNo, I can\'t remember.\nIt\'s been too long. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63556, 'What?!\nYou mean you don\'t know?\nOh... I\'ve worked so hard to find that out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63557, 'I didn\'t say I don\'t know it.  I just can\'t remember it. \nI can\'t remember it, but I\'m still Guiltian.  Do you know Lupis?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63558, 'What\'s that?  I don\'t know it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63559, 'Then, you don\'t know much about our village.  OK, I will tell you about our village. \nThis village is called Adealia.  It is unknown since when it has been called so, but we believe that its name originated from Abalita, the sacred tree in the center of the village. \nAdealia has many highlands and luxurious forests, so we use a lot of leather crafts. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63560, 'In particular, Lupis is the leather craft created by stretching and pounding Dark Ape\'s soft leather. \nIt is the greatest specialty of our village. \nOh, you made me forget that I had to go out and get Dark Ape\'s Leather for Lupis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63561, 'I am also expecting a guest.  What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Since it\'s partially my fault, I will get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Since you forgot about it, it can\'t be that urgent.  You can get it later.][2]'),
(63562, 'Thank you.  You are fast. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63563, 'Now, tell me the rest of your story before your guest arrives.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63564, 'Unfortunately, my guest has already arrived. \nCome back later. \nI will tell you more. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63565, 'Since you volunteered, it\'s Dark Ape\'s Leather. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63570, 'Making Friends with Spirits'),
(63571, 'Bunis of Adealia tells you that he will answer the questions that you asked Guiltian if you bring the Wind Jewel to Ranthis in an attempt to win over her heart. Go and talk with Ranthis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63572, 'Hey!  You!!  (Shakes hands)\nThis way!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63573, '(Pointing at himself)\nMe?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63574, 'Yes, yes!!  Come closer!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63575, '(Looks scary.)\nWhat is it?\nDid I... do something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63576, 'Wrong?  Why?\nWhat do you mean?  Huh?\n(Frowns)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63577, 'I don\'t know what to say, since you are frowning your face.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63578, 'Oh, this is just the way I look.\nI saw you go to Guiltian to ask him some questions. \nI could help you if you want. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63579, 'Really?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63580, 'Yes, I\'m Bunis.\nIf you bring the Wind Jewel to Ranthis just outside the village and help me win over her heart, I will tell you everything I know. \nWhat do you say?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, goody.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.  I\'ll just ask Guiltian again.][2]'),
(63581, '...Wind Jewel!!\nWhy... did you.\n...I don\'t...\nI don\'t like this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63582, 'Hey, it\'s a gift.  Why don\'t you like it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63583, 'There is no... gift.. without.. a price. \nThat is the truth.. I have... discovered. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63584, 'Take this to Ranthis.  Or you will pay the price!! (Frowns.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63590, 'My Poor Birds'),
(63591, 'Ranthis of Adealia asks you to defeat 99 Dark Apes so they cannot bother his birds in the black fog. \nDefeat 99 Dark Apes for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63592, 'What... is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63593, 'What about this, Ranthis?\nDon\'t you need me to solve any problem for you?\nLet me help you with your troubles.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63594, 'Trouble?\nWhat does that mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63595, 'Hmm... (ponders)  Well, something that gives you a headache. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63596, 'Hmm... Trouble... That\'s what it means.\nI do have something that... gives me a headache. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63597, 'That\'s good.\nMy trouble is (murmurs)... making friends with you...\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63598, 'Why?  I don\'t.... know why it is... your trouble, but I\'ll let.... you solve my trouble. \nMy birds... can be... attacked... because of the black fog... around here...\nWhen the fog is thicker... like today... the monsters become aggro and approach... the nest of my birds... and bother them.\nI was wondering if... you could defeat about 99 Dark Apes... to scare them off.\nIt\'s not that... hard... is it...?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s hard.  Anything else?][2]'),
(63599, 'Well done.\n(Gives a single glance and stares at Wind Jewel.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63600, 'Dark Ape... Dark Ape... Dark Ape.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63610, 'Token of Friendship'),
(63611, 'Ranthis of Adealia gives you a piece of a Wind Jewel as a token of friendship.  Take it to Bunis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63612, '(Ranthis ponders, breaks the Wind Jewel into several pieces, and gives you a piece)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63613, 'What is this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63614, 'A token of gratitude.\nAs long as you have this, you are in alliance with me and my birds.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Thank you (I should take it to Bunis)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I would like something else...][2]'),
(63615, 'Something else?  What do you want?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Something like a drug that makes you powerful overnight?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Something like invaluable treasure?][2]\n[BUTTON]=[How about one of those birds behind you?][3]'),
(63616, '<Response to "Something like a drug that makes you powerful overnight?">\nI would also... like... something... like that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63617, 'Well... That\'s OK.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63618, '<Response to "Something like invaluable treasure?">\nI\'m not a treasure... merchant. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63619, '<Response to "How about one of those birds behind you?">\nI want to get a bird of my own and travel freely...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63620, 'Those... birds only follow spirits.\nThey... seem gentle... because I am here.  If I wasn\'t here... you\'d already be camping... in his gut. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63621, 'Bunis, I\'m back.\nThis fragment will make you Ranthis\'s ally. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63622, 'Oh, really?  Thank you. \nAs you can see, it hasn\'t been very long since I moved here. \nPlease come and help me from time to time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63623, 'Wind Jewel....... fragment....... I don\'t give it to everyone. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63630, 'Lovely Girl'),
(63631, 'Talk to Angela, the lovely girl of Adealia. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63632, '(Grabs my hand with sparkling eyes)\nOh, I can\'t believe I am looking at the warrior of winds.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63633, 'Huh?  What is she talking about?\n(She is kind of cute.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63634, 'The whole village is talking about the man who has come through the black fog to enter the village with sacred winds.  Didn\'t you know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63635, 'Is there someone that gorgeous? \nI want to meet him myself.  Who is he?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63636, 'Ha ha, you are really funny, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63637, 'Huh?  How did you know my name?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63638, 'Ha ha, you just looked very stupid?\nThe person you just talk to is my mother.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63639, 'Your mother..  I\'ve talk to so many people.  Oh, Ms. Karuha?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63640, 'That\'s right.  I saw you talking to my mother, so I asked her. \nI\'m Angela. \nI want to be your friend. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63641, '.......................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63650, 'Angela\'s Herb Farm'),
(63651, 'Angela of Adealia says that she has been growing her favorite herbs just outside the village. Recently she has lost some of her herbs to the Dark Apes that feed on the soft grass around her herbs. Defeat 99 Dark Apes to keep them away from her herbs.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63652, 'Wahhh\n(Angela crying)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63653, 'What is it?  I thought you were braver than this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63654, '[NAME].  The... Dark Apes... destroyed... my... herbs...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Dark Apes!  Got it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know what you are saying.  Calm down and say again.][2]'),
(63655, '(Opens eyes wide)\nDid you drive away those Dark Apes?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63656, 'Yes. \n(Pounds on the chest)\nI took care of them. \nThey will not want to come near your herbs for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63657, '[NAME]!! (Looks impressed.)\nThank you so much.\nAdealia Village is surrounded by a thicker black fog from time to time and no plant can grow because of the fog. \nI need to harvest my herbs before the fog gets thicker to make a new potion. Now that you have taken care of the Dark Apes, I should be able to harvest the herbs and make my potion. Thanks You, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63658, 'Thank you, [NAME]. \n(Smiles.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63659, 'The Dark Apes...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63670, 'I Need to Make Kurah Powder!'),
(63671, 'Angela of Adealia asks you to get Kurah Petals that she needs to make Kurah Powder to keep bad spirits away from Adealia Village.\nGet 50 Kurah Petals for her. \n\n(Search Adelia Field ) \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63672, 'Hi, [NAME]!  (Hugs you.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63673, 'Angela, you look happy today.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63674, 'Yes, Angela is excited when she makes potion or powder. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63675, 'That\'s good.  What are you doing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63676, 'Oh, this? \n(Golden powder in clear glass tube)\nIsn\'t it pretty?  I am drying this flower called Kurah to produce powder. \nIn Adealia Village, we believe that this flower brings good luck to good people and bad luck to bad people. \nWe dry Kurah flower to make powder and carry it everywhere. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63677, 'Really?  Should I carry it with me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63678, 'Ha ha ha, you are so funny, [NAME].\nWell, I am out of Kurah Petals.  Can you get me 50 Kurah Petals, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Would that be enough?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something to do.  I can help you later.][2]'),
(63679, '(Surprised)\nWow, you are the best, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63680, 'Hey, this is nothing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63681, '(Shakes her head.)\nNo, you are really great, [NAME]. \nThank you. \nNow!  (Rolls up her sleeves.)\nLet\'s make Kurah powder?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63682, 'Kurah Petals are usually found around the Adelia Field and Kurah Flower. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63690, 'The Fruit of Shield 1'),
(63691, 'Edwina of Adealia says he is managing the shield that protects the village from the black fog. \nEdwina says he will tell you about Fogberries that are needed to strengthen the village\'s shield.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63692, '(Edwina is surrounded by tasty-looking red-black berries.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63693, 'Ed!  What are all these?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63694, 'Oh, I suppose you haven\'t seen these before, [NAME].\nThese are called Fogberries.  What do you think?  Aren\'t they pretty?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63695, 'They are.  You are not trying to eat them all, are you, Ed?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63696, 'Ha ha.  I wish, but it\'s a large quantity.  As you know, [NAME], this village is the only place not filled with the black fog.\nWhy would that be?  Have you thought about why this village is protected from the black fog?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63697, 'Hmm, I guess not. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63698, 'Ha ha.  I wish, but it\'s a large quantity.  As you know, [NAME], this village is the only place not filled with the black fog.\nWhy would that be?  Have you thought about why this village is protected from the black fog?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63699, 'Hmm, I guess not.\nMaybe it\'s too windy?  Huh?  I just noticed that there is only a breeze. .\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63700, 'Ha ha.  I suppose you\'ve heard about Abalita Tree in the center of the village. \nGuiltian is currently the acting chief, but before him, there was a beautiful female chief named Karen Nastasya. \nShe was one of few people who could use magic. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63701, 'One day, the black fog came from nowhere to cover up this place.  Then, she used Abalita Tree and Fogberry Tree to create a shield over the village for protection. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63702, 'To create a shield over the entire village (looks around)\nwould have consumed much of her magical powers..\nShe must have been really powerful..\nWhat has happened to her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63703, 'I was too young back then and I heard about this from Guiltian, so I don\'t know.  He told me that she disappeared when she went to examine the source of the black fog. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63704, '....................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63710, 'The Fruit of Shield 2'),
(63711, 'Edwina of Adealia says he is managing the shield that protects the village from the black fog. \nEdwina asks you to get Fogberries that are needed to strengthen the village\'s shield.  Get 50 Fogberries for him.  \n\n(Search Adelia Field and Dark Wood)\n\n[LINE'),
(63712, 'OK!  Let\'s get to business. \nThese Fogberries have the power to protect us from the ominous energy of the black fog. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63713, 'I see.\n(Looks interested.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63714, 'The people of Adealia and the animals here eat Fogberries to protect their bodies, but Ranthis outside the village is affected by the black fog. \nI sometimes bring some for Ranthis and I thought this was enough for her and her birds.  But I guess I counted wrong. \n[NAME]!  Can you get me some Fogberries?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Fogberries...  OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I already have a favor to fulfill.  I\'ll get back to you later.][2]'),
(63715, '(Ed smiles.)\nNicely done.\nThis is enough.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63716, 'It seems that Fogberries have very sweet scent. \n(Seems drunk with the scent.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63717, 'Fogberries are so sweet that they are known as to have the scent of seduction. \nWe sometimes see insects drunk and resting on Fogberries, so we call Fogberries the shelter for insects. \nBe careful as Fogberries can make you drunk.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63718, 'Fogberries are usually found around the Adelia Field and Dark Wood. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63720, 'Delivering the Medicine of Protection'),
(63721, 'Edwina of Adealia asks you to take a bag of Fogberry powder made from Fogberries to Ranthis.  Take Fogberry powder from him to Ranthis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63722, 'Now!!  Take this to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63723, 'This is?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63724, 'This is the powder made from the Fogberries you just got for me, [NAME]. \nThis will protect Ranthis and his birds from the black fog. \n(Lifting the bag of Fogberry powder)\nThis should be enough for you. \nPlease take this to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, Ed.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t.  I have other errands to run.][2]'),
(63725, 'Ranthis!  Edwina asked me to bring this to you.\n(Handing over the bag of Fogberry powder)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63726, '\nFinally... I\'ve..... been waiting....\nThank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63727, '(Ranthis takes the Fogberry powder and sprinkles it over her body and the birds.  Red light covers Ranthis and the birds for a while and disappears.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63728, 'Take this to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63730, 'Passionate Blacksmith'),
(63731, 'Bunis of Adealia asks you to take his dagger to Alexia for repair.  Talk to Alexia while she fixes the dagger. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63732, 'Hurry...Hurry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63733, '(Bunis is getting ready to go somewhere)\nWhere are you going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63734, 'It\'s good to see you!  I was just leaving the village for business.  Oh, before I forget, can you take this to Alexia for repair?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, that\'s not that hard.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can stop by on your way out.][2]'),
(63735, '(Alexia is striking metal with something in her mouth)\nClang!  Clang!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63736, 'Er... Are you Alexia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63737, '(No response)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63738, 'Er... Alexia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63739, '(Stops striking and turns her head)\nHuh?  What?\nAh! \n(Looks at the dagger in hand)\nThis is?  Let me see. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63740, '(Looks at the dagger and removes the cover)\nOh, this dagger contains the spirits of Marcudos?\nWow.. I remember Marcudos\'s unique pattern.  I wonder how he is doing.\nAnyways, the owner hasn\'t taken a good care of it.  It\'s got a crack on the handle!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63741, 'Er... (Waving hands)  Look at me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63742, '(Alexia turns her head)\nOh, sorry...  I get distracted when I see others works of art. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63743, 'I can see that.\nYou must love your job. \nI got this from Bunis. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63744, 'I see.  I will fix this and tell Bunis to pick it up.  You can go now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63745, 'There is only one blacksmith in this village.  Do you not know her? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63750, 'Recycling Rusted Things from the Depraved 1'),
(63751, 'Alexia of Adealia asks you to gather the materials abandoned by the depraved people so she can recycle them. \nGet 40 each of Rusted Spear, Rusted Blade, and Rusted Shield for Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63752, 'Phew, I have so many things to make: the blade cover with the delicate engravings of the envoys of the god of hope, the shield with the engravings of the ancient heros, and tough leather armor with the Ape\'s soft leather...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63753, 'Ms. Alexia, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63754, 'Oh, it\'s you.\nHey, don\'t call me Ms. \nJust call me Alexia. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63755, 'OK, Alexia!  Anything wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63756, 'Ha ha ha.  Of course not. \nI just want to make so many things, but there is no mine near Adealia and I can\'t get the materials. \nI have to go to the mines in other villages or collect scrap metal and recycle it.\nAh!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63757, '\nWhy...  Why are you screaming?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63758, 'Ha ha.  I just thought of the most beautiful design of a weapon. \nThe blade is curved like a bird\'s feather and Ape\'s leather on the housing.  Let\'s see...  The materials I have...  Hmm, I have some metal for the blade and just enough Ape\'s leather.  Oh... I need more materials for the handle.. Oh, [NAME]!  Can you get me those rusted materials that belong to the corrupted people outside the village?  Get me 40 each of Rusted Spear, Rusted Blade, and Rusted Shield!!  Get those for me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[40 each?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What?  Steal!!  I can\'t do that.][2]'),
(63759, '...Huh?  Leave them there, will you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63760, 'Among the Depraved people, Depraved Spearmen, Depraved Rangers, and Depraved Fighters have the items that I need.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63770, 'Recycling Rusted Things from the Depraved 2'),
(63771, 'Alexia of Adealia asks you to gather the materials abandoned by the depraved people so she can recycle them. \nGet 50 each of Rusted Spear, Rusted Blade, and Rusted Shield for Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63772, '[NAME]~~~~~~[NAME]~~~~\n(Shakes my arm.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63773, 'Do you need more materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63774, 'Yes.\n(Nods fiercely.)\nGet me the rusted materials that belong to the depraved people outside the village: 50 each of Rusted Spear, Rusted Blade, and Rusted Shield!  Steal!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will just pretent I haven\'t heard you.][2]'),
(63775, 'Thank you!! Now I can get to work on these items.\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63776, 'Don\'t forget; it\'s depraved Spearmen, Depraved Rangers, and Depraved Fighters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63780, 'Aertsina\'s Concern 1'),
(63781, 'Aertsina of Adealia Village seems to have a concer.  Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63782, 'Hey, can you give me a minute?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63783, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63784, 'Let me introduce myself. \nI\'m Aertsina. Guiltian of Adealia Village... He has been my uncle since I was young. Anyways, I\'m so worried about him because Uncle Guiltian has no family.\n He can\'t take care of himself because he is always working for Adealia Village.\n I always tell him he should look after himself, but he always takes my words too lightly. I think, since you have been close with Uncle Guiltian, you could tell him why I am concerned. Um, what is your name, by the way?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63785, 'Oh, it\'s [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63786, 'Oh, [NAME].  I was wondering if you could tell Uncle Guiltian why I am concerned. \nWhen I talk to him, he just thinks I am complaining.  You could talk to him seriously and he might listen to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63787, 'You must really like Guiltian, Ms. Aertsina.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63788, 'Call me Aertsina.\nUncle Guiltian is the father of my soul. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63789, 'Father of your soul?  What does that mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63790, 'I can\'t explain it, but it means he is really important to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63791, '...................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63800, 'Fixing Guiltian\'s Spear 1'),
(63801, 'Aertsina of Adealia asks you to take Guiltian\'s old rusted spear to Alexia for repair.  Take Guiltian\'s rusted spear to Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63802, '[NAME]!  I have a favor to ask you.  Take this to Alexia.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63803, 'It\'s a spear. \nIt looks quite old. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63804, 'Yes.  Uncle has been using this since he was young. \nIt\'s very old and ugly, but he still wants to use it. \nI know why he still likes to use it and I wanted to fix it for him.  Only problem is that I know he won\'t like it, but I\'m going to do it anyways (smiles). \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63805, '(Smiles)\nI am sure Guiltian would understand why you did it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63806, 'Ha ha.  I certainly hope so.  Anyhow, can you take it to Alexia?\nI can\'t see Uncle use this spear like he did in the old times, fighting monsters, but I just want to make sure that his spear doesn\'t break when he uses it. \nIt would make me happy to see him hold this spear after it has been fixed by Alexia.\nOh, [NAME].  If you understand me, please take this to Alexia.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I understand, but I need Guiltian\'s permission.][2]'),
(63807, 'Hi.  (Smiles.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63808, 'Alexia!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63809, 'Hi.  Huh?  That is?  It seems to belong to Guiltian (looks suspiciously).\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63810, 'Are you going to take it to Alexia?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63820, 'Fixing Guiltian\'s Spear 2'),
(63821, 'Alexia of Adealia says that she doesn\'t have enough materials to fix Guiltian\'s spear.  Collect 35 each of Metal Piece, Hard Stone, and Tough Fabric for Alexia to fix Guiltian\'s spear. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63822, 'What\'s your story?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63823, 'Well, Aertsina asked me a favor.  She asked me to fix Guiltian\'s rusted spear. \nShe is worried Guiltian might be hurt by violent monsters carrying a rusted spear. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63824, 'Hmm..  I understand Aertsina, but fixing his old spear won\'t help Guiltian break away from his past... (murmuring) \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63825, 'Huh?  What?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63826, 'Nothing.  Aertsina is the only match for Guiltian.\nOK!  Let me see.\nIt\'s worse than it looks?  I don\'t even know how he carries it.\nGood!  [NAME]!  Go out there and get me 35 each of Metal Piece, Hard Stone, and Tough Fabric from Depraved people. \nI need those to start fixing this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.  I\'m already tired.][2]'),
(63827, 'Oh, good!!\nCome back in a while. \n(Rolls up his sleeves.)\nIt\'s going to take some time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63828, 'Go, Let\'s go~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63830, 'Fixing Guiltian\'s Spear 3'),
(63831, 'Alexia of Adealia says Guiltian\'s spear has been fixed as Aertsina asked.  Take fixed spear back to Aertsina.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63832, 'Clang!  Clang!!\n(Striking metal by the fire.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63833, 'Alexia!!  How are you doing with Guiltian\'s spear?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63834, 'Oh, [NAME]!  It\'s done!\nHere it is.  Take it to Aertsina.\nAlso, take this message to Aertsina, will you? \n"This won\'t be enough to bring Guiltian out of his past.  Good luck."\nDid you get that? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, thank you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not another delivery.  Let me take some rest first.][2]'),
(63835, 'Oh, thank you. \nYou don\'t.. have to know what it means. \nNot now. \nI\'ll tell you later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63836, 'Oh!!  Tell Aertsina I worked hard to fix this and I want her to treat me with something delicious. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63840, 'Karuha\'s Request'),
(63841, 'Karuha of Adealia says that she has lost her supplies to the corrupted group many times.  Help her and catch 80 each of Depraved Ranger and Depraved Fighter. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63842, 'Hey!  Young man!!  Come here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63843, 'Huh?  Me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63844, 'Yes.  Guiltian told me that you are helping the village a lot. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63845, 'My name is Karuha.  I am making and selling important supplies for the village.  I have a beautiful daughter.  I know you have met her already. \nOh, by the way, I am in trouble because I have lost my supplies to the corrupted group several times. \nI was wondering if you could defeat 80 each of Depraved Ranger and Depraved Fighter. \nWhat do you say?  You are not saying no, are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you if you are in trouble.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I am saying no.  I have something else to do.][2]'),
(63846, 'Oh!  Wow!  You are so noble. \nYour parents must be proud of you. \nThank you!  I have all the supplies for the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63847, '.. It\'s Depraved Ranger and Depraved Fighter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63850, 'Piece of Black Cell'),
(63851, 'You found a piece of Black Cell while hunting down the Depraved group.  It might mean something to Marlene who is studying the black fog.  Take it to Marlene.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63852, 'What is this?  It looks as if it is alive.  Let\'s take it to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63853, 'Marlene!  Look at this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63854, 'It\'s [NAME].\nWhat is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63855, 'Look at this agitating.\nI got it from the corrupted group and it feels strange..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63856, 'I haven\'t seen this before.\n(Examines with a magnifying glass)\nIt could be affected by the black fog. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63857, 'I have to do further research.\nThanks anyways, [NAME]!  It will help me examine this region. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63858, '(Let\'s take it to Marlene.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63860, 'Polluted Lands'),
(63861, 'Guiltian of Adealia asks you to deliver his letter containing the findings of his research to Marlene who is studying the pollution around Adealia.  Take Guiltian\'s Letter to Marlene..\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63862, '[NAME]!  Did you know that Marlene is studying the black fog? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63863, 'Yes, I did. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63864, 'I see.  Then, this is my note on the strange things happening in this village.  Can you take it to Marlene? \nI believe Marlene is much more talented than me in terms of research.  I can share valuable information with her.  So take this to her. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, that\'s nothing hard.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You could take it to her yourself.  Why are you asking me?][2]'),
(63865, 'Marlene, Guiltian asked me to bring this to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63866, 'This is... \n(Reads Guiltian\'s Letter.)\nHmm.. Guiltian has known about this. \nGuiltian\'s help would mean much to me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63867, '[NAME]!  Thank you. \nIf you see Guiltian, give him my gratitude. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63868, '.. Please take it to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63870, 'Study of Black Fog'),
(63871, 'Marlene of Adealia says that she needs corrupted group\'s Swirling Black Cell to study the black fog.  Collect 75 Swirling Black Cells for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63872, '.. The movement of black cells is combined with the wave of magic.\n(Ponders for a while.)\nIt only reacts to the materials from Adealia among the many magical materials. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63873, 'Marlene!  Are you studying the cells I brought you before?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63874, 'Yes.  I have found more cells besides the ones you got me for comparisons and I see something peculiar. \nLook at this, [NAME].\nThis cell to the right is what you\'ve brought me and that cell to the right is the new cell I found.  They move slightly differently according to the wave of magic. \n(Marlene brings Magic Jewel close to the cells and the two cells agitate.  Then, Marlene\'s cell stops moving and pops.)\nI want to do further research, but this Swirling Black Cell pops too quickly. \nIf you have time, please collect 75 Swirling Black Cells for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Swirling Black Cells.. OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about taking the trip yourself to get some fresh air?][2]'),
(63875, 'I got them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63876, 'Oh, thank you. \nI should get to the next step of my research with these. \nCome back for the results of my research. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63877, 'You need to get them from the corrupted people. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63880, 'Lost Necklace'),
(63881, 'You found a necklace while hunting down the corrupted group.  The necklace has a picture of a person that seems familiar to you.  It looks like Angela of Adealia.  Take the necklace to Angela.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63882, 'This is?\n(A familiar face appears in the necklace.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63883, 'Huh? [NAME]?!  You have a pretty necklace. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63884, 'Oh?  This?  I was coming to find you for this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63885, 'Huh?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63886, 'Look!  Here\'s your picture!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63887, 'My picture?  You\'re right! Hmm.. I don\'t remember having this necklace.. \nMy mom might know about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63888, 'Your mom might know something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63889, 'Huh?  My mom?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63890, '......\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63900, 'Whose Necklace Is It 1'),
(63901, 'Angela of Adealia says that the necklace is not hers, but it might belong to her mother, Karuha.  Take the nacklace to Karuha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63902, 'Yes, my mom!  You must have met her already.\nHer name is Karuha..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63903, 'Oh, Karuha is your mother? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63904, 'Yes, so take it to my mom.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can take it to her yourself.][2]'),
(63905, 'Karuha!!  Have you seen this before?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63906, 'I gave this necklace to my husband.  Where did you..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63907, 'I found this just outside the village. \nI saw a picture of Angela inside, so I thought it may belong to Angela...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63908, 'I see.  Have you heard about the previous chief of this village? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63909, 'Yes.  I heard she was beautiful and powerful and she disappeared after protecting the village...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63910, 'Yes.  She left with my husband. \nMy husband and Karen have not come back ever since. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63911, 'You know where Karuha is, don\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63920, 'Adealia\'s Remedy'),
(63921, 'Angela of Adealia wants to make a special remedy for Adealia.  In order to do so, she needs 80 Wind Grass from Tornado.  Get her 80 Wind Grass. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63922, '[NAME]!  I have a favor to ask you. \nI\'m sure you will say yes. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63923, 'Huh?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63924, 'You know. \nAdealia Village and its vicinity is always threatened by the black fog. \nI have been thinking why we have to take the regular remedy and the remedy from the black fog separately. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63925, 'So, I decided to create a remedy that cures both.  \n(Looks depressed)\nBut there is a problem. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63926, 'Huh?  Problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63927, 'Yes.\n(Nods fiercely.)\nThis herb known as Wind Grass from Tornado contains the substance that multiplies the effect of this remedy. \nWith Wind Grass, I can make this remedy in large quantities and sell it to more adventurers..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63928, '(Looks desperate.)\nI really, really want you to get me Wind Grass from Tornado, [NAME]. \nWhat do you say?  Yes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I will help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Please ask someone else.][2]'),
(63929, 'Wow!!  You are the best, [NAME].\n(Looks impressed)\nGood!!  I\'ll name this remedy Adealia Remedy after you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63930, 'Huh?  How am I related to Adealia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63931, 'Well, you are closely related!!\n[NAME]!  I have to get back to work.\nI\'ll see you later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63932, 'You can get Wind Grass from Tornado. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63940, 'Tracing the Evidence 1'),
(63941, 'Karuha of Adealia has been tracing her husband who has disappeared and found that Nell outside the village has recently saw her husband. \nShe asks you to ask Nell about her husband.  Talk to Nell for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63942, 'Hey!  [NAME], can I talk to you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63943, 'Oh, what is it, Karuha?\nYou sound urgent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63944, 'Oh, you know what? \nDo you remember that I told you about my husband?\nHmm... My husband that has disappeared...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63945, 'Oh... Yes, I do remember. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63946, 'Thanks for remembering. \nI have news about him. \nThere is a man named Nell just outside the village and he said that he saw someone similar to my husband. \nI was wondering if you could check if that\'s true, [NAME].\nI want to go myself, but I can\'t leave the town right now.  Please. \n\n[BUTTON]=[So you want me to find Nell?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can find time to go there yourself later.][2]'),
(63947, 'Are you.. Nell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63948, '(Indifferent face)\nYes, who are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63949, '(He sounds mean.)\nEr.. Well.. I have something to ask you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(63950, 'It\'s Nell outside the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63960, 'The Master of Crater of Darkness 1'),
(63961, 'Talk to Nell outside Adealia Village about Karuha\'s husband who has disappeared. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63962, '(No reaponse for a while.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63963, '.. What do you want to know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63964, 'I want to know about the husband of Karuha of Adealia Village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63965, '(No reaponse for a while.)\nAre you talking about that time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63966, 'What?  What are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63967, '(No reaponse for a while.)\nHmm.. I can\'t tell that story to a stranger. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63968, 'What?  Why not?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63969, 'I have nothing to say.\nGo back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63970, 'Look around the outside of Adealia Village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63980, 'The Master of Crater of Darkness 2'),
(63981, 'Nell outside Adealia Village says that he cannot tell his story to a stranger.  You have to run his errands to win his trust. \nNell might open his heart if you capture 111 Great Tornadoes around you. \nCapture 111 Great Tornadoes. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63982, 'But!  I have come all the way out here for that.  I can\'t just go back. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63983, 'That\'s your problem. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63984, '(Looks perplexed)\nOh..  What do I do.. How about this?\nWhen I looked around, Great Tornadoes were too strong that your things were flying everywhere.  If I fix this problem, tell me about Karuha\'s husband!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63985, '(Nell slowly turns his head toward me.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63986, 'OK?  You have to tell me the story.\nHmm.. Should I defeat about 111 Great Tornadoes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Good!  Just wait for me, Great Tornadoes!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[(Huh?  What is that face?  Wasn\'t it Great Tornadoes?)][2]'),
(63987, 'Nell!!  I got Great Tornadoes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63988, '(Gives me a glance without any response)\nOK.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63989, '..............................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63990, 'Collecting Twister Crystals(Repeatable Quest)'),
(63991, 'Nell outside Adealia Village is collecting rocks known as Twister Crystals that have been carved by the body of Dark Nepilim.  Collect 10 Twister Crystals for Nell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63992, 'These are called Twister Crystals from Dark Nepilim. \n \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(63993, 'Oh, I see.\nAre you collecting these?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63994, '(Nods without any response.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(63995, 'Oh!!  Then, I will help you collect these Twister Crystals. \nHow about that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Would 10 do for you?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t look excited.  I\'ll just come back later.][2]'),
(63996, '(Nell carefully examines Twister Crystals.)\nWell done.\nI should be able to examine the condition of Dark Nepilim more carefully. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(63997, 'Oh, I\'m happy I have made a conversation \nwith you for the first time!!  Ha ha. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(63998, 'I never asked you. \nBut I can give you some information. \nListen.\nLook for Dark Nepilim.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64010, 'Collecting Twister Crystals(Repeatable Quest)'),
(64011, 'Nell outside Adealia Village says he is collecting rocks known as Twister Crystals that have been carved by the body of Dark Nepilim.  Nell asks you to collect 10 Twister Crystals for him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64012, 'I need more Twister Crystals. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64013, 'You don\'t have enough Twister Crystals?!!\nJust ask me!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Would 10 do for you?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh.. I had something else to do.  I\'ll help you later.][2]'),
(64014, 'I am back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64015, 'Bring me Twister Crystals each time you get them.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64016, 'Find Dark Nepilim. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64020, 'Tracing the Evidence 2'),
(64021, 'Nell outside Adealia Village opened his heart and says that he will tell you about Karuha\'s husband.  Talk to Nell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64022, 'You have worked so hard and I will tell you the story you want despite that you are a stranger. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64023, 'I will tell you only once, so listen carefully. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64024, 'Have you heard about the disappeared chief of Adealia Village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64025, 'Yes.  Guiltian told me. \nAnd Karuha\'s husband was one of her escorts. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64026, 'I can\'t say for sure, but it was very similar to Karuha\'s husband. \nIt looked somewhat bizarre, but Karuha\'s husband was wandering through the black fog with a group of monsters that looked strange and nasty. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64027, 'Well, that\'s all I can say.  Go back to Karuha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64028, 'I have nothing else to say. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64030, 'The Message of Hope'),
(64031, 'Tell Karuha the story of Nell outside Adealia Village.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64032, 'I have nothing else to say. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64033, 'Nell!  Thank you so much.\nI\'ll deliver the story to Karuha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[(Let\'s hurry!)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s get equipped first.][2]'),
(64034, 'Karuha!!  Nell told me the story.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64035, 'Oh, I have been waiting for you. \nWhat did Nell say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64036, 'He said that he looked somewhat bizarre, but your husband was wandering through the black fog with a group of monsters that looked strange and nasty. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64037, '(Shedding tears of joy)\nReally?  If that\'s true.. Oh, it\'s the glory of Teva. \n(Gathers her hands to pray.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64038, 'I am so glad he is alive.\nI\'m so relieved.\n[NAME]!  Thank you so much!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64039, 'I have nothing else to say. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64040, 'Whose Necklace Is It 2'),
(64041, 'Karuha of Adealia tells you to take Angela\'s necklace back to Angela.  Take Angela\'s necklace from Karuha to Angela. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64042, '[NAME]!!  Can you take this necklace to Angela?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64043, 'That\'s strange.  You will see Angela at home anyway.  Why do you want me to give it to her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64044, '(Looks embarrassed)\nHa ha.  You\'re right..\nHonestly speaking, Angela doesn\'t like me so much. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64045, 'Huh?  Why not?  You are her mother.  How could she not like you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64046, '(Smiling)\nWell, Angela is misunderstanding because of what I did the day before my husband disappeared and I have never talked to Angela about it.  We may look like any other mothers and daughters, but we are not very close to each other. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64047, 'I will expect you to take this necklace to her, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.  I\'ll take it to Angela.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know.][2]'),
(64048, 'Angela!  I have your necklace.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64049, 'I can\'t believe you did this for me, [NAME]!!\n(Her eyes are sparkling.)\nI\'m so impressed, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64050, 'Please take this to Angela.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64060, 'Elves Tainted by Black Fog'),
(64061, 'Bunis of Adealia says that his resources about Adealia Village have been stolen by Shadow Elf Thieves.  Bunis is so angry and asks you to capture 161 Shadow Elf Thieves. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64062, 'Oh!  I\'m so mad!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64063, 'Why?  Why are you so mad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64064, '(Breathing fiercely)\nOh, you know, those vicious Shadow Elf Thieves have stolen what I have gathered to send to Elderine!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64065, 'Elderine?\nHuh?  Oh, I guess this is the map of Adealia Village, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64066, '(Looks perplexed)\nWhat!  What makes you think this is a map?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64067, 'Look!  This is where Guiltian lives and this is Abalita Tree.  Are you trying to send this to Elderine?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64068, 'Of course not!!\nAnyways, [NAME]!!  You have to capture about 161 Shadow Elf Thieves.\n(Opens eyes wide)  Understood?\n\n[BUTTON]=[(Intimidated) Oh, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know.][2]'),
(64069, 'Oh, thank you so much. \nI feel much better now.\nYou can get back to your business now, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64070, 'It\'s Shadow Elf Thieves!  Don\'t get mistaken!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64080, 'Marlene\'s Request'),
(64081, 'Nell outside Adealia Village says that Marlene asked him to gather Shadow Elf\'s hair.  Gather 70 Shadow Elf\'s Hair for Nell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64082, 'Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64083, 'Wow!  Are you really asking me for a favor?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64084, 'Silly..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64085, '(Scratching head)\nHa ha.  What can I do for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64086, 'Hmm, get me Shadow Elf\'s Hair. \nMarlene of Adealia Village asked me, but I can\'t do it myself. \nAnd you look bored, [NAME].\nHow about 70 Shadow Elf\'s Hair?\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s not that hard.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not bored at all.  I\'m busy.][2]'),
(64087, 'I got Shadow Elf\'s Hair. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64088, 'Hmm, well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64089, 'You can get the hair from both Shadow Elf Thieves and Shadow Elves (Magicians). \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64090, 'Study of Shadow Elves'),
(64091, 'Take Shadow Elf\'s Extracts from Nell outside Adealia Village to Marlene.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64092, '(Wrapping something.)\nTake this to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64093, 'For your information, this is the bottle of Shadow Elf\'s Extracts.\nHandle it with care and take it to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m so tired.  I want to take a rest.][2]'),
(64094, 'Marlene!\nNell told me to bring this Shadow Elf\'s Extracts to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64095, 'I was worried because I didn\'t have enough resources to study Shadow Elves.  Thank you so much. \nIf you see Nell again, ask him to study the black crater near Shadow Elves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64096, '(I feel sorry for Nell...)\nHa ha.  I will tell him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64097, 'Don\'t forget, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64098, 'Take it to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64100, 'Secret Documents'),
(64101, 'Nell outside Adealia Village says he has discovered paper documents in a sealed envelope from Shadow Elves.  Nell tells you to take them to Bunis.  Take the Sealed Envelope from Nell to Bunis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64102, '[NAME]!!  [NAME]!!  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64103, 'I\'ll be there when you call me. \nWhat is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64104, 'Hmm, well.\nI discovered a bunch of weird paper documents carried by the Shadow Elves around here.\nIt\'s sealed, so I couldn\'t read them.  I think it\'s confidential. \nThat\'s probably why it\'s sealed, right? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64105, 'Do you think it\'s the secret documents of Shadow Elves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64106, 'That\'s possible. \nBut you know what?  Bunis knew about it and asked me about it.\nHmm.. Something\'s fishy.\nAnyways, take this sealed envelope to  Bunis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest.][2]'),
(64107, 'Bunis!!  Nell told me to bring this to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64108, 'Oh, I\'ve been expecting it.  Thank you.\n[NAME]!\n(Murmuring)\nWow, that was so close.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64109, 'Huh?  What?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64110, 'Oh, nothing!  It\'s nothing.\nGo and do what you need to do!\n(Phew.. I almost lost Elbama\'s orders to Nell.  I should be more careful.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64111, 'Take it to Bunis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64120, 'Ancient Relics in Ruins'),
(64121, 'Guiltian of Adealia says that he is studying the relics with the trace of Chaos War of Gods.\nTalk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64122, 'Oh, [NAME]!  It\'s so nice to see you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64123, 'I feels like it was only yesterday when you came to Adealia Village, but it\'s actually been a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64124, 'It\'s been a while, Guiltian.\nEr, anyways, what were you looking at?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64125, 'Oh, these?\nThese are some of the relics from the Remains outside Adealia. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64126, '(Surprised)\nRemains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64127, 'Well, it seems that you haven\'t been to all places outside Adealia.\nGo to the southeast of Adealia Village and you will arrive at the ancient remains. \nYou can stop by when you have time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64128, 'It\'s to the southeast of Adealia Village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64130, 'Rescue Request from the Hunters\' Association'),
(64131, 'Guiltian has received a rescue request from the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains. Talk to Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64132, '[Letter from Luke]\nThe Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement is in danger.  We need your help. \nThe Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement has been surrounded by Depraved Elves and violent monsters that are constantly threatening the temporary settlement. \nWe are doing our best to protect the temporary settlement, but we are outnumbered at the Hunters\' Association. \nPlease understand our situation and send a number of brave adventurers to help us. \n\nFrom Luke, the Hunters\' Association\'s Temporary Settlement\n\n(Guiltian thinks with a serious face.)\n\n Hmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64133, 'Hello, Chief.  Is anything wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64134, 'Hmm, my worries have come true. \nI have warned them to be careful, but I knew this was going to happen. \nI knew it.  That sly traitor would not hide himself. \n(Guiltian murmurs.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64135, '(Looks confused.)\n..??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64136, 'There is no time.  Go to {color, yellow, Kahal Plains} at once and meet {color, yellow, Luke} at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.  He will tell you everything. \nThis has to be done quickly.  If not, {color, yellow, the Hunters\' Association} will be in danger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I am on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You didn\'t tell me what this is about.][2]'),
(64137, 'You must be Luke of the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64138, 'You are..\nYes, the adventurer sent by Chief Guiltian.  Welcome.  I\'m Luke the leader of the Hunters\' Association.\nPlease take a rest for now.  We will be very busy tomorrow. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64139, 'Go to the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64140, 'Counterattack!'),
(64141, 'The Hunters\' Association has settled and strengthened the temporary settlement.  Luke has come up with a plan to pay back to those Depraved Elves.\nHe says he will capture Depraved Elves Thieves first.  Capture 177 Depraved Elves Thieves for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64142, '(Luke is delivering a speech in front of the people at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.)\n\nWe, the Hunters\' Association, have never forgotten the humiliation we have gotten from the Depraved Elves.  \nIt\'s time to pay it back.  Soldiers!  Let\'s come together to fight those Depraved Elves!!!\nIn the name of the Hunters\' Association!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64143, '(Every member of the Hunters\' Association yells together!)\n\nWoo-oh!!  Fight the Depraved Elves!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64144, '(They are very determined.  With this much morale, we won\'t be easy for even the strongest Depraved Elves.)\nThat\'s great, Luke!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64145, 'They must not be underestimated and you must be alert at all times. \nWhat we need is to trust one another and proceed forward. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64146, 'Woo-oh!!  Fight the Depraved Elves!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64147, '(After Luke\'s speech)\n\n[NAME], we will check our equipment and move to their lair.  You should go to the previous camp of the Hunters\' Association.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64148, 'The camp to the east of this temporary settlement?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64149, 'Yes.  The Depraved Elves seem to think that we will come back for the camp someday. \nThey have multiplied the army there. \nYou should go there to check out their movement and capture {color, yellow, 177} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Thieves}.  Don\'t overwork yourself. \nFor your information, Depraved Elves Thieves are very agile.  If you don\'t move fast enough, you will be killed by Depraved Elves Thieves.\nDon\'t forget.\nWhile you keep Depraved Elves Thieves preoccupied, we will proceed north.  Our destiny lies on your hands.  I\'ll count on you.  Oh, you couldn\'t do this alone, so gather some of your colleagues.  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!  Don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Depraved Elves (Thieves).. I\'m scared..][2]'),
(64150, 'I have defeated {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Thieves}.\nPhew.. They were easy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64151, 'Well done.  You are what they say, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64152, 'You must move fast to defeat {color, yellow, 177} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves  Thieves}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64160, 'Suspicious Shadow'),
(64161, 'While going after the Depraved Elves, you have received a letter asking for help without the name of sender.  Take Mysterious Letter 1 to Luke of the Hunters\' Association. \n(Begin Quest Item)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64162, 'Huh?\n(I\'d better take this letter to Luke of the Hunters\' Association.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64163, 'Luke!!  Take a look at this letter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64164, '(Luke reads the letter with a serious face.  The sender must have been hurry when he was writing this letter.  It seems that there is something urgent.)\n\n.. Part of letter.. omitted\n\nPlease save my people. \nMy people is captured in darkness.  I was able to escape from the darkness, but I have to watch my people confined in a cage and losing their souls. \nIf a good adventurer has read this letter and is willing to help me and my people, please come to the Depraved Elves\' Base to the north of Kahal Plains. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64165, 'To the north.. The Depraved Elves\'s base..  Why?  Who could have sent this letter from that place...\n(Ponders.)\nHmm..  This letter that you brought could be the key to our relationship with Depraved Elves.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64166, 'Take this to Luke.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64170, 'Slowly Unraveling Truth'),
(64171, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association is pondering since he received the letter asking for rescue from the Depraved Elves.  Talk to him about his thoughts. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64172, 'I am so..\nConfused...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64173, 'I can\'t believe we received a rescue request from what we\'ve thought was an enemy!!\nWho could it be?  What would his intention be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64174, 'I don\'t know.  It could be one of the leaders of the Depraved Elves.  I have no clue.\nHmm.. The situation is not good.  You might not recognize it, but the Depraved Elves seem to have gained strength since they attacked our camp. \nSeeing them grow more powerful day by day, it seems that someone is pumping strength into them.  Ha ha. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64175, 'If they are getting stronger, don\'t we need to change our plan? \nIt would be better to find the sender of this letter and listen to him before we come up with a new plan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64176, 'You are right. \nLet\'s find the sender of this letter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64177, 'What is the intention of the sender of this letter?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64180, 'To Alexia'),
(64181, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement has made a decision to resolve the urgent situation.  He determined that his soldiers are not strong enough to fight the Depraved Elves and says that he needs more supplies from Adealia Village. \nGo to Alexia of Adealia Village for supplies. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64182, 'Let\'s see..\nWith our new plan, we are going to need more supplies.  \n[NAME]!  I guess this is a job for you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64183, '(The leader is very determined.)\nWould this be the last supply?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64184, 'There won\'t be any more supplies..  This will be the place I die or live.  Ha ha.\nHmm..  No, I shouldn\'t say that.  Ha.. Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64185, '(The leader sounds nervous.  His laughing strange.)\nHa ha ha.  I think it suits you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64186, '(Calming breaths.)\nOK.  Go to {color, yellow, Alexia}, the blacksmith, in {color, yellow, Adealia Village} and bring the supplies I have requested. \n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s very easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(64187, 'Hey, [NAME].  What brings you here?  Weapon repair?  Equipment repair?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64188, 'Go to {color, yellow, Alexia}, the blacksmith, in {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.  We will be preparing for our last fight. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64190, 'War Supplies 1'),
(64191, 'Alexia, the blacksmith of Adealia, says that it takes time to prepare her supplies and tells you to get other supplies first.  Talk to Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64192, 'Oh, so Luke sent you, huh? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64193, '(Explains the situation.)\n.. So I am here to deliver the supplies.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64194, 'Hmm..\nThat should give him a headache. \nOK, I will give you what you need. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64195, 'Thank you!  We are now ready for our final battle. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64196, 'But it will take me some time since I have provide only the best supplies.  While you wait, why don\'t you go to {color, yellow, Karuha} to get the rest of your supplies?  I believe Luke also asked Karuha for some supplies...\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, it\'s not that far.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will sort the supplies; why don\'t you go?][2]'),
(64197, 'Welcome.  How can I help you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64198, 'Pay {color, yellow, Karuha} a visit.  I will have the supplies ready. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64200, 'To Karuha'),
(64201, 'Alexia, the blacksmith of Adealia, tells you to get the supplies from Karuha while she gets ready.  Talk to Karuha and receive the supplies.  Then, return to Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64202, 'What?  What do you need?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64203, '(Briefly explains the situation.)\n.. So we need some rescue supplies. \nCan you help us?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64204, 'I can\'t believe Luke is going through that...\nI will certainly help him.\nI don\'t know how much I can supply, but I promise my best support. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64205, 'Wow!  Thank you so much.  I am sure everyone at the Hunters\' Association in Kahal will be glad to hear that!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64206, 'Oh, that\'s the only thing I can do for the alliance between Adealia Village and Henneath.\nI wish you and the Hunters\' Association the blessing of the goddess of victory. \n(It\'s almost time to go back to Alexia.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s time for me to leave.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, but I\'m thirsty.  Can I have a glass of water?][2]'),
(64207, '[NAME], what took you so long?  I almost left for an appointment!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64208, '(Let\'s go back to Alexia.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64210, 'War Supplies 2'),
(64211, 'Alexia, the blacksmith of Adealia, has the supplies ready.  Take the supplies from her and return to the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement to deliver them to Luke.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64212, 'What took you so long?!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64213, 'Oh, sorry.  It took me some time to get the supplies from Karuha.\nYou are the one that told me to take time!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64214, 'Oh, did I say that?\nHmm.. I can\'t remember..\nAnyways!  It wasn\'t easy.  I had to sort out the best of items that I carry.  Now I am exhausted. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64215, '(Hmph, you don\'t have to brag about it.)\nWell, thank you.\nGive me the supplies and take a rest. \nI have to deliver these supplies to the temporary settlement. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64216, '(Serious face)\nI don\'t feel good about this.  My weapons and equipment are good, but it doesn\'t mean you will win the battle. \nWell, I am not so worried considering how you the Hunters\' Association have fought. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Thank you anyways.  (Let\'s hurry back to the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am worried, too.  Let\'s think of a way together.][2]'),
(64217, '[NAME]!  You are back.  Well done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64218, 'Go back to the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64220, 'Final Preparation!'),
(64221, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement is happy to hear that you brought the supplies from Adealia Village and works on the final preparation.  Luke says that they will attack the major base of the Depraved Elves.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64222, 'We have gone through a lot until now.\nNow, all that that is left for us is the bloody battle against the Depraved Elves. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64223, 'Isn\'t there a way to settle things without fighting them?\nIt would have been nice to take another route. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64224, 'Yes, I agree, but our lives have been threatened.  We have lost our camp..  If they were open for conversations, we didn\'t have to go through all this. \nUgh.. (Looks outweighed)\nI don\'t know if I can handle this blade..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64225, 'You do have a plan, right.  We are outnumbered, so we shouldn\'t waste our forces.  They are much larger in number than us. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64226, 'I have a good idea.  We need to proceed up from the northeast to attack the major base of the Depraved Elves.  We could go across the waters to assault them from the back, but we can\'t go with the assault. \nWe have to stay with the standard tactics..\nAnyways, you\'ve done great today!  Take some rest.\nWe don\'t know when we need to head out, so be prepared to move according to the signal.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64227, '.. It\'s time for the final battle.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64230, 'The First Enemies: Depraved Elves Cleric'),
(64231, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement declared war against the Depraved Elves.  Their first target is the Depraved Elves Cleric.  Defeat 175 Depraved Elves Cleric for Luke. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64232, 'OK!  It\'s finally time to head out!\n(Shows his palms filled with sweat)\nI guess I am just as nervous as them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64233, '(Coughing)\nI am nervous myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64234, 'Listen carefully.  According to our latest information, the base of the Depraved Elves is straight ahead of us, just across the waters.  The base is surrounded by an enormous number of elves.  In fact, we are seriously outnumbered. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64235, 'Hmm, but we can\'t give up now. \nWe must retrieve the camp!  That\'s the only way to find out why they attacked us.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64236, 'Of course!  It\'s too late to give up. \nI have an idea.  You have more battle experience than any of us.  So we will be your bait. \nThat means, we will attack the Hunters\' Association camp that we lost.  We will pretend to attack and disappear when the backup comes down.\nThat\'ll be your chance!  Then, the enemies at the Hunters\' Association camp will be isolated from the base.  Then, we could attack from both sides.  \nWhat do you think? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64237, 'That\'s a great plan! \nI\'ll get to my position and wait for my chance.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64238, 'Good! \nWe will agitate them as much as we can, while you target the entrance to the Depraved Elves\'s base.  In particular, it will be relatively easy to go past the defense line of the {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Cleric}.  You should quickly eliminate about {color, yellow, 175} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Cleric} to make it easier. \nPlease be careful.  Your body is not just yours.  Remember, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll be fast and swift.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What if Depraved Elves (Cleric) don\'t die?][2]'),
(64239, 'Oh!  I think our first plan has been successful.  You are by far the best adventurer I have ever seen!\nBut we are not through yet. \nWe have much more to go through. \nAnyways, let\'s have a champagne and celebrate your success.  Ha ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64240, 'Don\'t underestimate {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Cleric}.  They are fast and strong. \nYou must be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64250, 'The Second Enemies: Depraved Elves Archer'),
(64251, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement that declared war against Depraved Elves is satisfied with the first success and planning for the second attack.  Luke asks you to defeat 172 Depraved Elves Archer.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64252, 'Celebrating our success! \nWe are planning for another operation!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64253, 'I\'m excited to see things go well regardless of how dangerous they are! \nI am looking forward to our next strategy!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64254, 'Our first plan was successful, but we can\'t proceed right onto the next tactic because we don\'t know how many there are that we need to fight.\nSo I am trying to be very careful...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64255, 'I have a concern.  You attacked the the Hunters\' Association camp and pulled back last time, so I am worried the enemies might come after the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement. \nIt\'s just my intuition, but I have a strong feeling about this. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64256, 'Hmm..\n(Thinks deeply)\nYou have a point.  How about this?  You should go out for the battle and we will hide here at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement to ambush them.  If you can give them an impact, we should be able to do well here.  Then, they won\'t come near the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement for a while. \n[NAME], you gave me a great idea.  The unexpected ambush..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64257, 'I just got the feeling.  \nThey have more soldiers than us and they would come after us no matter how reckless they are, this is the best time. \nBut I am sure the Hunters\' Association can fight back. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64258, 'Good, the catchphrase of our second tactic is hit & run!\nListen.\nYou have to fight the ones more powerful than your first target, {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Cleric}.  They are called {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Archer}. \nI won\'t say much since you know what you are doing, but you must be careful.  \nYou are the core of our army. \nNow, go out and defeat {color, yellow, 172} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Archer}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not scared at all.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of the arrows of Depraved Elves (Archer).][2]'),
(64259, 'Our second operation has succeeded! \nWe should be able to retrieve our camp soon and find out why the Depraved Elves have transformed. \nWell done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64260, 'It\'s {color, yellow, 172} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Archer}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64270, 'Division of a Race'),
(64271, 'While going after the Depraved Elves, you have received a letter asking for help from an unknown sender.  The handwriting looks familiar.  Take Mysterious Letter 2 to Luke of the Hunters\' Association. \n(Begin Quest Item)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64272, '(It\'s the same letter as the one I saw before.  It must have been written by the same person.  Let\'s take it to Luke.)\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64273, 'Luke!  I found another letter!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64274, 'Hmm... Let\'s see..\n\n(Suspicious Letter)\nI don\'t know who you are, but I don\'t have much to live.  The Depraved Elves are being tainted by the force of darkness and {color, yellow, Depraved Elf (Sage)} are behind it all because they are the wisest of all Depraved Elves.\nThey are working with Pagels to sell their souls to be a part of the force of darkness.  There is no elf not affected by this force.  My body contains the force of Ancient Elves.  That is why I haven\'t been tainted yet, but I am losing my strength and determination.  I need someone to stop it all.  Please save my race from foolish deception and help them stay away from turmoil. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64275, 'This is..\n(Reads carefully.)\nI got it.  All the riddles have been solved. \nWe don\'t have time.  We have to rescue the person who wrote this letter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64276, '(Let\'s take this letter to Luke at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64280, 'The Third Enemies: Depraved Elves Mage(Repeatable)'),
(64281, 'Luke declared a war against Depraved Elves.  His third target is Depraved Elves Mage.  Talk to Luke and defeat Depraved Elves Mage. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64282, '[NAME]!  It\'s time for you to do your job. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64283, 'We are almost there.  I should gear up again. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64284, 'I am sorry I have to call you for battles, but you are the only person who can lead our soldiers.  Please kindly understand. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64285, 'Ha ha.  Don\'t worry.  I know you have no other choice.  \nYou don\'t need to be sorry.  \nWe are almost there, anyway..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64286, 'Thank you for your generosity.  \nLet me tell you about our next tactic.  Our next target is {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Mage}.  I think they are closest to {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} in terms of strength. \nYou might be able to discover the weakness of  Depraved Elf Sage or how to defeat  Depraved Elf Sage while fighting Depraved Elves Mage. \nPlease keep up the good work. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64287, 'Yes, I will. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64288, 'We are almost there.  Please keep up the good work!  Our goal is {color, yellow, 185} {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Mage}. \nThank you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[The magic of Depraved Elves Mage is very power.  I need to gear up first.][2]'),
(64289, 'Well done.\nYou have done a good job defeating Depraved Elves Mage, but I guess you have not learnt much about {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64290, 'It is clear that there is something between {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Mage} and {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64300, 'The Third Enemies: Depraved Elves Mage(Repeatable Quest)'),
(64301, 'Luke declared a war against Depraved Elves.  His third target is Depraved Elves Mage.  Talk to Luke and defeat Depraved Elves Mage. \n(Repeated Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64302, '[NAME]!  Fifty Depraved Elves Mage were not enough. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64303, 'Capture as many Depraved Elves Mage as you can, 185 at a time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ha ha.  You want me to go out again?][2]'),
(64304, 'Well done.\nIt would be nice if you could capture all {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Mage} you encounter.\n(Smiles.)\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64305, 'It is clear that there is something between {color, yellow, Depraved Elves Mage} and {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64310, 'Meet Darian.'),
(64311, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlemen says he must meet the person who wrote the mysterious letter as soon as possible.  Talk to Luke.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64312, 'We are running out of time, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64313, 'You are talking about the confined elf.  We must rescue him..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64314, 'You must rescue that elf.\nAccording to my resource, that elf is in the innermost part of the Elves\' base. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64315, 'It would be very hard to reach him. \nWe must enter without getting noticed.  If we are captured at the entrance, we would need to fight countless elves. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64316, 'You can\'t go by yourself. \nI will keep them preoccupied at the back of the Depraved Elves\' base with the Hunters\' Association.  In the meantime, you should trust us and find the sender of this letter no matter what.  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think this is a trap!][2]'),
(64317, 'You read my letter and came to save me.\nOh.. I\'m so relieved.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64318, 'There is no time to waste.  Hurry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64320, 'The Book of Ancient Sage'),
(64321, 'You met Darian, a Depraved Elf, near the Depraved Elves\' base.  Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64322, 'You must be the person who wrote this letter. \nI\'m glad you are safe. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64323, 'My name is {color, yellow, Darian}.\nI can\'t die like this.  I can sacrifice myself if I can return my race to what they were. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64324, 'You are Darian. \nI am [NAME].\nBut why didn\'t the Depraved Elves kill you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64325, 'I still have the force of Ancient Elves, although it is a little bit.  When he found it out, {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} made me suffer to steal my force, but he didn\'t kill me.\nI have not submitted to Depraved Elf Sage until now.\nMy only hope was to save my race. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64326, 'Hmm..\nIt must have been hard for you. \nBut don\'t worry.  I am here to help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64327, 'But you must be careful.\nIf {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} finds out that you are here, he will summon all Depraved Elves to attack you.  If all of the Depraved Elves with the strong force of darkness gather to attack, it will be the greatest tragedy. \nYou must defeat {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} before that happens. \nThat is the only way to make the elves escape from the darkness. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64328, 'That would help us restore the relationship between Depraved Elves and the Hunters\' Association.\nAlright!  The Hunters\' Association will come together to defeat {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} for you and your race. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64329, 'Please help me. \nHe has the ability to fight against the puppet of {color, yellow, Pagels, the god of darkness}. \nAlso, he {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} took my {color, yellow, Book of Ancient Sage}, the book containing the knowledge and wish of Ancient Elves.  I am the only person who can read that book, so he doesn\'t know what the book means.  He told me there is a book that contains the knowledge of Ancient Elves and stole the Book of Ancient Sage because he wanted to possess the knowledge of Depraved Elf Sage. \nThat book is contains the knowledge that can help me to save my race, so I must find it. \n[NAME], please defeat {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} and find 20 {color, yellow, the Book of Ancient Sage}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can\'t I take a rest first?][2]'),
(64330, 'Oh.. I am finally freed from this nightmare. \nThank you.  Thank you so much. \nI will use the Book of Ancient Sage to look for a way to save my race. \nIf I successfully treat my race, I will tell them that my friend, [NAME], \nand the Hunters\' Association have saved our souls. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64331, 'Defeat {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} and bring my 20 {color, yellow, Book of Ancient Sage} back to me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64340, 'Psyken\'s Mansion '),
(64341, 'Depraved Elf, Darian, near the Depraved Elves\' base tells you that all of this tragedy has begun at Psyken\'s Mansion and warns you to be extra careful.  Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64342, 'Oh, I have a story to tell you. \n[NAME], listen to me carefully. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64343, 'Is it.. something important?  I\'m nervous.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64344, 'When I was on their watch, someone came here and said something strange to Depraved Elf Sage.  That person {color, yellow, was wearing a black robe and his face was hidden.  All that I remember is that the back of his hand was bluish-black.}  He said to {color, yellow, Depraved Elf Sage} to prepare well to take the elves deeper into the prison of deep darkness. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64345, 'The prison of deep darkness..  What would that be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64346, 'I am not sure.  I don\'t know why he would take my race to such a strange place..\nEverytime that {color, yellow, person in black robe} came, the force of darkness grew larger in our race.  \nI am sure he did something, but I have no idea what that is. \nOh, he said something like this.\nHe said he is from Psyken\'s Mansion or something like that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64347, '{color, yellow, Psyken\'s Mansion?}  Then, the cause of your suffering and the fight against the Hunters\' Association would be that {color, yellow, person in black robe.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64348, 'Yes..  I guess so.. But I think there is something more unpleasant behind him. \n[NEXT]'),
(64349, 'You mean that is someone else behind it. \nHmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64350, 'There is an underground tunnel and there is a mansion inside it. \nIf you go there, you should be able to learn more about that person in black robe and the place he was talking about. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64351, 'Look for Psyken\'s Mansion. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64360, 'Gratitude'),
(64361, 'Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement thanks you for your great job in Kahal Plains and asks you to deliver Luke\'s Letter to Guiltian of Adealia Village.  Talk to Luke.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64362, '[NAME], it\'s about time to let you go.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64363, 'Don\'t say that. \nI can come by anytime. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64364, 'That\'s true, but I can\'t work with you anymore..\nI\'m going to miss the time we worked together..\nHa ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64365, '(Sobbing)\nLuke..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64366, 'I sometimes think what would have happened to us if I hadn\'t asked {color, yellow, Guiltian} of {color, yellow, Adealia Village} for help. \n\n(Shakes his head fiercely to erase the terrible image.)\n\nThe Hunters\' Association thanks Guiltian for sending us the backup, but you have actually fought alongside us.\nYou have done a great job.  Thank you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64367, 'Don\'t mention it.  We were able to overcome the crisis because many members of the Hunters\' Association came together. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64368, 'Ha ha.\nYou\'re right.  We were in this together!  If you need our help, don\'t hesitate to ask us.  The Hunters\' Association will run for you no matter where you are. \nAlso, please deliver my Luke\'s Letter to {color, yellow, Guiltian} of {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.\nI want to be courteous. \n\n[BUTTON]=[See you later.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can deliver this letter yourself.][2]'),
(64369, '(Guiltian reads the letter from Luke, the leader of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.)\nWell done. \nYou can go ahead and take a good rest. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64370, 'Please deliver my letter to {color, yellow, Guiltian} of {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64380, 'Lips of Silence'),
(64381, 'Edwina of Adealia is interested in the unique magic of the Lich Tribe and discovered that the Lich Tribe saves all memories and knowledge in the crystal ball called the Lips of Silence and constantly expose the crystal ball to black fog to strengthen their forces.  Gather 20 Lips of Silence of the Lich Tribe for Edwina.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64382, '[NAME]! \n(Calls with his hands.)\nHurry!!  This way!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64383, 'Huh?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64384, 'Have you ever been to the ancient remains outside Adealia Village? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64385, 'Oh, I may have.  I don\'t remember.\nWhat about it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64386, 'We believe that there used to be people who worshipped a certain religious force.  \n.. I can\'t say for sure, but there may have been a tribe known as Lich..  It could have been one of their earliest settlements..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64387, '(Surprised)\nYou mean... They were ordinary people like us and transformed into horrible monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64388, 'I told you; it\'s just my assumption. \nSo, I think I am going to need your cooperation.  Ha ha.\nFirst, I will give you some of the information I have found out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64389, 'I would like for you to get 20 Lips of Silence that used to belong to the Lich Tribe. \nI will tell you more about it later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  I\'m in.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to help you..][2]'),
(64390, 'You\'re back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64391, 'I\'m back.  Are these the Lips of Silence?\nThey look like plain black crystal balls..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64392, 'That\'s right!  These are the Lips of Silence.\nI\'ll tell you what I have found out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64393, 'I am studying the unique magic of the Lich Tribe and conducting a research.  In result, I have found out that the Lich Tribe had a unique habit.  It seems that they stored their memories and knowledge in this crystal ball called the Lips of Silence and constantly exposed it to the black fog to strengthen their forces. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64394, 'I wanted to collect these Lips of Silence to look into the memories and the past of the Lich Tribe and to study how they exposed them to the black fog to strengthen their forces. \nMy research has just gotten easier thanks to you, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64395, 'The Lips of Silence would be easier to get from Dark Lich of the Lich Tribe. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64400, 'Psyken\'s Mansion 1'),
(64401, 'Guiltian of Adealia asks you to talk to the important people of the village to find out about Psyken\'s Mansion.  Talk to Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64402, '(Guiltian is contemplating.)\nHmm... Psyken..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64403, 'I think that was the one behind the Depraved Elves. \nDo you know anything about Psyken??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64404, 'No, I don\'t..  It\'s just that..\nThat name is familiar to me.  I don\'t know where I heart about him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64405, '.. You are sure he is frightening, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64406, 'He is known to be threatening, but considering what he has done to the Depraved Elves, he must have gotten a greater force. \nI can\'t say for sure based on what I have right now.  {color, yellow, Alexia} might have more detailed information since she travels a lot. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alexia.. I see.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I just saw her and she looked very busy.][2]'),
(64407, '[NAME], are you here to buy my weapon, finally?\n(Listens about Psyken.)\nOh!  I have heard about him before.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64408, 'Go to Alexia.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64410, 'Psyken\'s Mansion 2'),
(64411, 'Guiltian asks you to get more information about Psyken\'s Mansion.  Guiltian asks you to talk to Alexia first.  Listen to Alexia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64412, 'Well.. It\'s been a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64413, 'A while?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64414, 'Yes.   Four veteran adventurers came to me and asked me where Psyken\'s Mansion is.  Then, they bought the latest weapons and armors from me.  \nThey said they will wipe away Psyken\'s Mansion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64415, 'Then, we will have our answer if we find those adventurers!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64416, 'That would be the easiest way.\nBut I don\'t remember seeing those adventurers again.  Most people come back to me after visiting a place nearby.. Hmm, I wonder why. \n[NAME]!  You are not thinking about going there, are you?  You\'d better not. \nI don\'t feel good about it.\nWhat?  You think it\'s not worth listening to me? \nWhat?  You want to know about Psyken\'s dungeon?\nOh, in that case, ask {color, yellow, Marlene}. \nShe has done many secret studies and reads strange books all the time.  She might know about the mansion. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Marlene.. I see.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wait!!  I hear you created a new weapon.  I want to see that first.][2]'),
(64417, 'Did you say Psyken\'s Mansion?\nI know a little bit about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64418, 'Go and find {color, yellow, Marlene}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64420, 'Psyken\'s Mansion 3'),
(64421, 'Guiltian of Adealia says he wants some information about Psyken\'s Mansion.  He asks you to talk to Marlene after Alexia.  Listen to Marlene. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64422, 'Well.. Kahal Plains is slowly being affected by the black fog around Adealia Village. \nThe black fog around Adealia Village and the black clouds gathering toward Kahal Plains, or that place called Psyken\'s Mansion...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64423, 'Black clouds?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64424, 'The black clouds!  The black clouds are just as ominous as the black fog around Adealia Village...\nI am researching that place to figure out how they are related, but I have only figured out about the black clouds, a man in black robe, and that the mansion has been known as Psyken\'s Mansion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64425, 'I think they were doing a secret experiment there.  \nConsidering the abnormalities of the grass and animals around that place, that experiment could be related to the abnormalities around Adealia Village. \nOh!  I just remembered that {color, yellow, Karuha} has visited that place a few times. \nTalk to {color, yellow, Karuha}.  She could tell you something.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Karuha.. I see.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[A secret experiment!!  It sounds eerie.  I don\'t want to hear about it.][2]'),
(64426, '(How does [NAME] know about Psyken\'s Mansion?)\nPsyken\'s Mansion?  Hmm, I\'ve never heard about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64427, 'Talk to {color, yellow, Karuha}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64430, 'Psyken\'s Mansion 4'),
(64431, 'Guiltian of Adealia says he wants some information about Psyken\'s Mansion.  He asks you to talk to Karuha after Alexia and Marlene.  Listen to Karuha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64432, 'Hmm, I\'m sorry, but I don\'t know much about Psyken\'s Mansion. \nBut why?  Why do you want to know about the mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64433, 'I have learned about the black fog in Adealia Village, the Depraved Elves in Kahal Plains, and Marlene has told me that you have often gone near Psyken\'s Mansion. \nShe told me that you could tell me what these mean since you have visited Psyken\'s  Mansion. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64434, '(Hmm.. I should be careful.)\nHa ha ha.  Honestly, I don\'t know about Psyken\'s Mansion, but I have gone to a certain place in Kahal Plains lately.\nI didn\'t know.. that it was Psyken\'s Mansion or something. \nI swear. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64435, 'I see.\nHaven\'t you seen or experience anything special there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64436, 'No.  Nothing special?  I haven\'t gone there that often and it was not very close to the mansion.  I don\'t know.\n(Hmm.. This kid is digging too deep.  I should do something.)\nIf that\'s all you want to ask me, can you leave now?  I need to do something.. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.  (Let\'s go back to Guiltian.)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You do?  Do you need my help?][2]'),
(64437, 'Guiltian!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64438, 'You are back.\nHave you learned something about Psyken\'s Mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64439, 'Let\'s go back to {color, yellow, Guiltian}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64440, 'Psyken\'s Mansion 5'),
(64441, 'Share the information you have gathered in Adealia Village with Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64442, 'So.. \nHave you learned about Psyken\'s Mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64443, 'Well..  Most people sayd they don\'t know anything.\nMarlene had the most information.\nShe said she is studying about how the black fog around Adealia Village is related to the black fog around Psyken\'s Mansion in Kahal Plains. \nOh, I think Karuha was a little suspicious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64444, 'Huh?  Karuha?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64445, 'Yes.  She said she doesn\'t know anything about Psyken\'s Mansion at first, but when I told her that someone has seen her near there, she said she has gone there often. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64446, '(Karuha...)\nI see.\nYou\'ve done a good job.\nPlease leave this place at once.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64447, 'What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64448, 'Before you came, Luke of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement asked us to investigate Psyken\'s Mansion. \nI want you to meet the members of the Hunters\' Association to examine Psyken\'s Mansion.\nI will ask Marlene for help so she can give you some clues. \nLeave at once.  Luke should be waiting for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired..][2]'),
(64449, 'Luke!!  I\'m back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64450, 'Oh, welcome back, [NAME]. \nGuiltian told me you are coming.\nLet\'s dig the secret behind Psyken\'s Mansion together.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64451, 'Go to Luke at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64460, 'Black Stone Fragment'),
(64461, 'You captured monsters with Lich and acquired Black Stone Fragment.  It seems to be related to the black fog.  You\'d better take it to Marlene who is studying the black fog.  Take it to Marlene of Adealia Village.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64462, 'Hmm.. What is this?  Black Stone Fragment...\nIt\'s in the shape of a child, but its eye are very terrifying. \nHmm, it seems to contain the fog...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64463, 'I know!!  I should take it to Marlene since she is studying the black fog.  Let\'s take it to her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64464, 'Marlene!!  Do you know anything about this stone fragment?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64465, 'Huh?  [NAME]?  Stone fragment?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64466, 'Yes, take a look at this.\nIt\'s a stone fragment in the shape of a child and it seems to be divided in half. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64467, 'I see.\nIt wasn\'t meant to be this way, but it\'s cut at this edge.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64468, 'Let\'s take the stone fragment to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64470, 'Examining Black Stone Fragment 1'),
(64471, 'Marlene of Adealia says that black stone fragment has been affected by the black fog and asks you to help her examine it.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64472, 'Someone must have cut this in half on purpose. \nHmm, what is this for and why was it cut in half..?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64473, 'I need to examine this.\nWhere did you find this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64474, 'Near the Lich Tribe Settlement. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64475, 'The Lich Tribe?  Hmm, I see.\n(Murmuring.)\n[NAME]!   If you go back to that place, please find the other half of this stone fragment. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64476, 'The other half?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64477, 'Yes.\nIt\'s just my feeling, but I think it is related to the black fog. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64478, '(Pondering.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64480, 'Examining Black Stone Fragment 2'),
(64481, 'Marlene of Adealia asks you to find the other half of the stone fragment.  Find Black Stone Fragment (Right) for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64482, '[NAME]!\nI want to you find the other half of this stone fragment. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64483, 'I am asking you because it may not only be related to the black fog, but it may also have something sticky and black on the bottom. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64484, 'Anyone would feel the urge to look into something that gives them a strange feeling even if it means they have to suffer. \nI think I found that something the moment you brought this fragment to me.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64485, 'I don\'t know if it is good or bad, but I just can\'t let it go.  I\'m talking too much.  [NAME]!  Please find the other half for me so I can focus on my research.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'ll try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m a little tired right now.  I\'ll do it later.][2]'),
(64486, 'I found the other fragment.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64487, 'Oh, this is the other fragment.\nI\'m lucky to put the pieces together. \n[NAME], good job\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64488, 'Please find the other fragment from the Lich Tribe. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64490, 'The Secret of Black Stone'),
(64491, 'Marlene of Adealia Village tells you to take the whole stone fragment to Darian in ???? Plains.  Take the Complete Stone Fragment from Marlene to Darian. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64492, '(Marlene is bringing the pieces together.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64493, 'OK!  [NAME]!  This brings the two stone fragments together. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64494, 'Oh, that\'s amazing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64495, 'OK!  Take this to Darian in Kahal Plains. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Darian?  OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why?  All of a sudden?  Darian?][2]'),
(64496, 'Darian!\nMarlene told me to give this to you.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64497, 'Oh, I have been expecting you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64498, 'This is what she was talking about.\n(Observes the stone fragment with keen insights.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64499, 'Can you hang on for a minute?\nI\'ll observe this and come back to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64500, 'Take this Complete Stone Fragment to Darian. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64510, 'Tracing the God of Darkness'),
(64511, 'Darian in Kahal Plains carefully observed the Complete Black Stone Fragment and tells you about the history of this fragment.\nTalk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64512, '(Darian is meditating with her eyes closed.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64513, '(Hmm.. How long do I have to wait?  I\'m bored.  Oh, I\'m even drowsy..)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64514, '(Darian finally opens her eyes.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64515, '(Murmurs in unknown language.)\n\n"..seredo namodera welo welo gentoma.. Siban..resotona..ajuaju.."\n"..om..ombana.."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64516, '(After murmuring for a while, Darian looks at me and talks to me.)\nI think this stone fragment was used for the ritual for worshipping the god of darkness. \nIt\'s not normal, but there is the engraving of the spell for summoning the god of darkness in the language of fairies.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64517, 'What?  Is that what you were just saying? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64518, 'Oh, it is just a part of the spell for summoning the god of darkness. \nI think some parts of it has faded away. \nAccording to my research, it is surprising that the Lich Tribe were originally created by the blessing of Teva, just like us. \nBut they denied Teva and worshipped the god of darkness.  That\'s probably why they have become what they are today. \nI just saw the history of the Lich Tribe in a panoramic vision. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64519, 'I didn\'t see why they started worshipping the god of darkness, but please tell Marlene that it is worth looking into. \nHurry back to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to talk more with you, can I?][2]'),
(64520, 'Marlene!!\n(Tell her what Dalian told you.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64521, 'U see.\nI\'d need to study that place a little more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64522, 'Go back to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64530, 'Opal of the Ancient Relics'),
(64531, 'Aertsina of Adealia asks you to gather Opal from the plants growing around Strange Relics.  Gather 50 Opal for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64532, '[NAME]!!  [NAME]!!  Hold on!! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64533, 'Oh!!  Aertsina, what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64534, 'You know..  Uncle Guiltian has run out of the materials to sell for Adealia Village.  So, please take a look at this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64535, 'Huh?  Isn\'t this a type of gemstone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64536, 'Oh, yes. \nI made this using Opal that is easy to find around here.\nI think it would help the village if I could gather more Opal to make jewelry.  [NAME], if you see something like this, you can collect it and give it to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What?  That\'s a lot of work!  Ask someone else.][2]'),
(64537, 'Aertsina!!  I\'ve brought Opal.\nIt\'s about 70 pieces.  Is this enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64538, 'Oh, thank you so much.\nThis is certainly enough.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64539, 'You can get Opal from the plants around the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64540, 'The Past of Ancient Relics'),
(64541, 'Marlene of Adealia says that she has heard that Dark Lich carries Telescope of Destiny that shows the past of places.  Get 20 Telescope of Destiny from Dark Lich for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64542, '[NAME]!!  Come this way.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64543, 'What is it?  You don\'t look good..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64544, 'You know..  I haven\'t slept for days. \nBut that\'s not the point.  I just learned a while ago.. that you can sometimes get Telescope of Destiny from Dark Lich, which shows the past of places. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64545, 'I think it would help me examine the black stone fragment that you got me last time.  So I was wondering if you could get me a 20 Telescope of Destiny. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Telescope of Destiny?  OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something important to do.  Ask someone else.][2]'),
(64546, 'Marlene!!  Is this Telescope of Destiny?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64547, '[NAME]!!\nI don\'t know.  I haven\'t seen it before, but it does look like what it is supposed to look like. \nThank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64548, '.. Get me a Telescope of Destiny from Dark Lich.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64550, 'The Horn of Pergy, the Wandering Spirit'),
(64551, 'Alexia wants to make a weapon with a gorgeous horn decoration.  Collect 90 Wandering Spirit Pergy\'s Horns for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64552, 'Oh!!  It\'s not enough!!  I don\'t have enough materials!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64553, 'Alexia!  You don\'t lookk good.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64554, 'Oh, I want to add a horn decoration to my new shield.  What should I use?\n(Claps)\nYes!!  [NAME]!  Why didn\'t I think this before?  Pergy\'s Horn!!  It\'s so sharp and beautiful!!\nYes!  That\'s it!!\nPlease get me Wandering Spirit Pergy\'s Horns right away!!  About 90 would do!\nYou can do it for me, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s not that hard.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(64555, 'Here!  I got Wandering Spirit Pergy\'s Horns.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64556, 'Wow!  I\'m so excited!!\nThank you!!\n(Holding a carving knife)\nGood!  It\'s time to carve!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64557, 'Get me Wandering Spirit Pergy\'s Horns!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64560, 'The Past of Black Stone'),
(64561, 'Marlene of Adealia Village says that she saw a scene from the past of Psyken\'s Mansion using the Telescope of Destiny.\nTalk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64562, '(Marlene is thinking.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64563, 'Marlene?!!  Marlene?!!\nWhat\'s wrong?  I have called you several times..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64564, 'Oh, it\'s you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64565, 'You know.. I can\'t forget what I saw through the Telescope of Destiny that you got me last time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64566, 'Did you really see the past through the Telescope of Destiny?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64567, 'Yes, I did.\nThe black darkness.. And the horrifying mansion in a cave nearby.. \nAnd the tragedic incidents in that mansion..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64568, 'Huh?  I don\'t know what you are talking about.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64569, 'Oh, I will get the story right and tell you what I\'ve seen. \nI\'m a little confused right now..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64570, '(Marlene is thinking deeply.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64580, 'Rumor'),
(64581, 'Karuha of Adealia says she heard a strange rumor.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64582, '[NAME]?!!  Did you hear that rumor?\n \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64583, 'What? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64584, 'It\'s about Psyken\'s Mansion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64585, 'Oh, yes..  I did, but I haven\'t seen it myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64586, 'I see.\nPeople say that they sometimes witness strange screams and monsters there. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64587, 'Strange screams and monsters..  That\'s scary. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64588, 'Isn\'t it?  You should be careful when you go there.\nYou don\'t know what\'s going to happen.\n(For a while, that is.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64589, '.. This.. is...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64590, 'The Time of Gray Ghost'),
(64591, 'Angela of Adealia Village says that asks you to get her Wraith\'s Watch.\nGet Wraith\'s Watch for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64592, '[NAME]!!  Are you busy?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64593, 'Huh?  Not really.  Why?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64594, 'Well, I have a favor to ask you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64595, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64596, 'Someone asked me to get the watch carried by Wraith.  Can you get one for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do that.][2]'),
(64597, 'Wow!  Thanks!!\nThis can turn back the time. \nActually, someone told me that Wraith\'s Watch can turn back the time. \nI thought I could turn back the time to before my father has disappeared..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64598, '.. It\'s Wraith\'s Watch.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64600, 'Gray Ghost\'s Scream'),
(64601, 'Karuha of Adealia Village asks you to capture 165 Gray Incubus.  Capture 165 Gray Incubus for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64602, '[NAME]!!  Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64603, 'Yes, what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64604, 'I am growing some herbs for Angela, but Gray Incubus always ruin the herbs when they are almost grown!\nI want you to capture 165 Gray Incubus, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(64605, 'Oh, good!!\nWas it hard?!!\n(Hmm.. He must be quite talented.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64606, 'Capture Gray Incubus.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64610, 'Red Fruits and a Trap 1'),
(64611, 'Karuha of Adealia Village says that someone asked her to get the fruits from Psyken\'s Mansion\'s large garden.\nGet 50 Red Fruits for her.\n\n(Search Psyken\'s Mansion and ???????? ??????)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64612, '[NAME]!!  Do you have time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64613, 'Yes, I do.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64614, 'I have a favor to ask you. \nSomeone asked me to get about 50 Red Fruits from Psyken\'s Mansion\'s garden? \nIt won\'t be so hard for you.\n(Let\'s see if you can make it back alive!!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s not hard.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[50 is too many.][2]'),
(64615, 'Oh, ha ha ha!!\nYou got it.\n(I can\'t believe.. he beat them..  This guy is something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64616, 'Go to Psyken\'s Mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64620, 'Red Fruits and a Trap 2'),
(64621, 'Karuha of Adealia Village says someone asked her to right Wandering Soul Pergy in Psyken\'s Mansion. \nCapture 218 Wandering Soul Pergy for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64622, 'You are really good, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64623, 'Ha ha.  Piece of cake.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64624, 'Good!  Then, my next request won\'t be so hard, either. \nSomeone asked me to defeat 218 Wandering Soul Pergy in Psyken\'s Mansion.  How about that?  You can do it, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Duh.. 218 is too many.][2]'),
(64625, '(..damn it)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64626, 'Karuha, I\'m back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64627, 'Ha ha ha!!  Great, [NAME]!!\n(This guy is really good.  What do I do?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64628, 'It\'s 218 Wandering Soul Pergy!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64630, 'The Mansion in a Cave'),
(64631, 'Edwina of Adealia Village has heard about Psyken\'s Mansion and asks you to capture Chimera that lives there.  Capture Chimera for him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64632, 'Hi, [NAME]!!\nHave you heard about the ghost in Psyken\'s Mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64633, 'Ghost? \nI think I\'ve heard something like that.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64634, 'I see.\nPeople say that there is a ghost in Psyken\'s Mansion.  It\'s so bizarre-looking, so you couldn\'t forget it once you saw it..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64635, 'I was wondering if you could go there and see what that bizarre ghost is.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ghost!  Wait for me!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ghosts give me the creeps.][2]'),
(64636, 'I\'m Waiting!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64637, 'Rumors are not true most of the time. \nWhat I saw was not a ghost, but a very disgusting monster. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64638, 'A monster?\nTell me how it looks like.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64639, '..Go to Psyken\'s Mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64640, 'Rumor in the Mansion'),
(64641, 'As you were going after Psyken, you found a book called the Element of Truth.\nTake this book to Edwina in Adealia Village.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64642, 'Huh?  It\'s an old book. \nIt\'s like a magic book.  Edwina should know what it is.\nI should take it to Edwina.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64643, '(Edwina is concentrating on something)\n. . . Oh, this is..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64644, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\nThis is an old book.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64645, '(Flips the pages to read the book.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64646, 'Do you know what it\'s about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64647, 'Hmmm..  I don\'t.\nI should examine it more carefully. \nI\'ll get back to you about this book. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64648, '..Let\'s take this book to Edwina!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64650, 'A Man\'s Devoted Love '),
(64651, 'Huey has a crush on Joanna at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement and asks you to listen to his story.  Talk to Huey.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64652, 'Hmm....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64653, 'Are you sick?  You don\'t sound good..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64654, 'My chest feels heavy.\n(Sighs)\nPhew...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64655, 'Why do you feel heavy when you have all the fresh air and good views?  Is it a heartache?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64656, '(You got it..)\nYes, I admit.\nActually, I love Joanna.  But I\'m always too careful and she would only see me as a coward...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64657, '(But you are a coward!)\nI know why you sighed, but you are kind of cool..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64658, '.. I think my heart would explode.\nPlease help me.\nWhat do you say?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64660, 'Winning Joanna\'s Heart 1'),
(64661, 'Huey is trying to win the heart of Joanna at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement and wants to give her a pillow because she looks tired.  Talk to Huey.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64662, 'This is my first plan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64663, 'What is it? \n(He must have planned this all out.)\nYou are well-prepared.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64664, 'I would need to profess my love eventually.. so I have planned this.\nOK, I want to give Joanna a soft pillow because she is very tired these days. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64665, 'Soft pillow for fatigue..  That sounds good. \nJoanna will like it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64666, 'I have plans, but I need your help..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64670, 'Winning Joanna\'s Heart 2'),
(64671, 'Huey at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement asks you to get the materials to make a pillow for Joanna.  Talk to him and collect 35 Light Feathers, 35 Soft Sand, and 35 Soft Cotton. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64672, 'To make a soft pillow..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64673, 'Can\'t you just buy one?  Do you have to get the materials..? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64674, 'I need to give my heart!\nIt will only be meaningful when I make it myself for Joanna.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64675, '(Yeah, right.. I\'m the one getting all the materials..)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64676, 'Ahem.\nI\'ve done my research and it seems that the softest pillow in the world needs three materials. \nThey are: {color, yellow, Light Feathers}, {color, yellow, Soft Sand}, and {color, yellow, Soft Cotton}.  You can get these materials from the monsters in {color, yellow, Kahal Plains}.\nPlease be careful. \nOh, please get me {color, yellow, 35}each.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You really want the materials right away, don\'t you?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want that pillow.][2]'),
(64677, 'I got them all.  How long would it take you to make the pillow?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64678, 'Well done.  It\'s time to take the materials to the person who will make the pillow. \nYou need to take a rest first, right? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64679, 'I have already told you that you can get {color, yellow, Light Feathers}, {color, yellow, Soft Sand}, and {color, yellow, Soft Cotton} from the monsters in {color, yellow, Kahal Plains}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64680, 'Winning Joanna\'s Heart 3'),
(64681, 'Huey at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement asks you to take the pillow materials to Karuha in Adealia Village.  Talk to Huey.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64682, '(Signs)\nPhew..\nI hope she likes it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64683, 'You said it expresses your heart.  I\'m sure Joanna will like it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64684, 'What if she doesn\'t?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64685, '..\nIf she doesn\'t like the pillow, how about giving her a blanket next time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64686, '[NAME], I\'m very serious.  Don\'t kid around.  It hurts by pride. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64687, '(Have a sense of humor.)\nHa ha ha..\nI\'m just kidding.  No woman in the world would ignore the gift of truthful heart.\nYou don\'t have to be so nervous. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64688, 'Thank you...\nNow, take these materials to {color, yellow, Karuha} in {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.  She will turn them into a beautiful pillow. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I want to see you win your love, Huey.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Back to Adealia Village?  No way.][2]'),
(64689, '(It\'s look busy.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64690, 'Karuha, hello.  Can you make a pillow for me? \nI have all the materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64691, '[NAME], hello. \nPlease wait a second. \nIt would take me some time to make the pillow. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64692, 'Go to {color, yellow, Karuha} in {color, yellow, Adealia Village}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64700, 'Winning Joanna\'s Heart 4'),
(64701, 'Karuha of Adealia Village gives you the pillow.  Say thanks to Karuha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64702, 'Thank you for waiting. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64703, 'It certainly takes time to make a good pillow. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64704, 'These materials are not easily used, so I handled them very carefully.  Here you are.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64705, 'Thank you, Karuha.  I\'ll stop by later. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64706, 'You\'re welcome.\nWho is this pillow for?\nI think I know who.\nGood luck.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s hurry back to Huey!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest before I leave.][2]'),
(64707, 'What took you so long? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64708, 'Go back to Huey at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64710, 'Winning Joanna\'s Heart 5'),
(64711, 'Take the complete pillow to Huey at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64712, 'I thought you ran away with the pillow!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64713, 'I don\'t think anyone would run away with this.. Don\'t be so paranoid?\nI\'m sure Joanna will be impressed.\nYou have to calm down. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64714, 'I\'m so sorry. \nI\'m so nervous and stressed..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64715, '(I don\'t understand..)\nAnyways, here\'s your pillow.  Karuha took a good amount of time to make this, so Joanna will like it. \nDon\'t be nervous.  Just tell her you got this pillow because she looks a little tired. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64716, '(Breathes deeply.)\nOh, OK.\nI know I have to be a man.\nThank you.  You gave me confidence. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64720, 'Story after Winning Joanna\'s Heart '),
(64721, 'Huey of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement finally gave the pillow to Joanna.  Talk to Huey.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64722, '[NAME]! [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64723, 'Just call me once.  Did Joanna like your present?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64724, 'Ahem...\nShe said she really likes it. \n(Smiles.)\nIt was a good gift. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64725, 'Wow, congratulations, but she is not won over yet.  I think you should show how you feel about her rather than giving her gifts. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64726, 'I see...\nI wanted to win her with the gift, but I guess I was too hasty. \nI should stop giving her gifts and show her who I am. \nI\'m so confident.  Thank you. \nYou will help me again, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64730, 'Women'),
(64731, 'Ask Joanna how she feels about Huey at the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement.  Talk to Joanna.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64732, 'What brings you here, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64733, 'Oh, hello..  Nothing.\nI just wanted to see how you are doing, Joanna. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64734, 'As you can see, I\'m very busy.  Come back later for chatting. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64735, '(Should I ask her now..)\nWell, you know..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64736, 'What is it?  Do you have something ti ask me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64737, 'No, it\'s not that important.  I just thought Huey is working hard these days.\nI was wondering why he has changed.  He doesn\'t look so cowardly anymore..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64738, 'Oh, Huey..\n(Ponders)\nHe is a good man.  He looks timid, but he has keen insights.  He helped us settle here at first, although we all worked hard...\nBut I feel that Huey has changed a bit.  He is not as careful and considerate.  I was surprised to see him change. \nAre you thinking what I am thinking?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64739, '(She must be surprised to see Huey be a man.  They have spent a lot of time together..)\nYes, that was what I wanted to discuss with you.  I hope nothing is wrong with Huey.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64740, 'I should just ask him.. I know Huey more than anyone else.\nPeople rarely change.. I\'m sure there is an explanation.\nI\'ll ask him later.\nAnyways, I\'m worried about the leader..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64741, 'Why?  What\'s happened to Luke?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64742, 'Nothing.. Nothing in particular..\nBut he is working too hard.  He doesn\'t sleep to work for us.  He sometimes makes me concerned...\n(Ponders.)\nWow, look at the time.  I have work to do.  Let\'s talk again later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64750, 'Joanna\'s Concern'),
(64751, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement wants to do something for Luke and Huey who are working hard for the temporary settlement.  Talk to Joanna. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64752, 'Hmm, what wuold be good..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64753, 'You must not be so busy today?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64754, 'Yes.  I have some free time today.\nI want to give something to Huey and Luke who are working hard for the Association..\nThey have been very nice to me, so I want to give them something. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64755, 'Oh, I see.\nSince they are both men, how about a beautiful helmet?  It\'s very practical and they would like it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64756, 'A helmet..\nIt should make a great gift for Luke..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64757, 'Oh, Huey would like something like a book. \n,.\nOh!  How about a bracelet?  The stamina bracelet is pretty popular.  People say that it keeps you energized.  It\'s practical and both Luke and Huey would need it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64758, 'Stamina bracelet...\nHmm, that\'s nice.\nThey would need it and like it.\nOK, then.  Stamina bracelet it is.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64760, 'Joanna\'s Gift'),
(64761, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association\'s temporary settlement has decided to give 70 stamina bracelets to Luke and Huey.  Talk to Joanna.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64762, 'Now, the problem is how to get them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64763, 'Can you buy them in the village?  I thought..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64764, 'Yes, I asked some people, but the materials for the bracelets are sold out and the bracelets are no longer available in the village. \nYou have to get them from monsters..\nNothing seems easy..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64765, 'OK.  I\'ll help you for the Hunters\' Association!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64766, 'Really?  You would do that for me?\nThank you, but I\'m sorry I have to make you work.\nI should be able to do this by myself..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64767, 'That\'s OK.  You can get me something, too. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64768, 'Sure.. I will..\nThen, please get me the bracelets.\nSome say that they are carried by {color, yellow, Depraved Elves} in {color, yellow, Kahal Plains}.\nPlease fight them and get me {color, yellow, 70} {color, yellow, Stamina Bracelets}.\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Would they really like the bracelets?][2]'),
(64769, 'Ta-dah.  {color, yellow, 70} {color, yellow, Stamina Bracelets} coming up. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64770, 'Thank you. \nI\'ll have a special gift for you next time. \nYou can look forward to it. \nI should start wrapping these.\nYou can take a rest now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64771, '{color, yellow, Stamina Bracelets} are carried by {color, yellow, Depraved Elves}.  Be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64780, 'Embarrassing Hobby '),
(64781, 'Bunis of Adealia Village says he likes cute small dolls despite his scary looks. \nTalk to Bunis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64782, '(Bunis is holding something carefully.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64783, 'What is that?  You must really love that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64784, '(Laughing out loud.)\nNothing else in the world is so lovely and pretty.\n...\n(Bunis is surprised to find someone next to him.)\nHuh?\n{color,yellow,[NAME]}?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64785, 'Huh?  Isn\'t that a ball-jointed doll?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64786, 'What is that look on your face?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64787, 'Ha ha ha.  You and the doll don\'t really go together.\nYou are a macho.\n(Giggles.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64788, 'What do you mean? \n(Looks embarrassed.)\nThis is my taste.  Why do you care?! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64789, 'I don\'t.\nIt\'s just funny.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64790, '(Looks irritated.)\nStop giggling, will you?\nAnyways, {color,yellow, please tell no one that I like dolls.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64791, 'Why?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64792, '(Looks embarrassed.)\nI don\'t want people to talk about me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64793, '....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64800, 'In Search of Doll Master'),
(64801, 'Bunis of Adealia Village happened to hear that Joanna of the Hunters\' Association has been working with his favorite ball-jointed dolls.  He asks you to take the sewing kit to Joanna.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64802, '[NAME]!!  I have a favor to ask you!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64803, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64804, 'I am collecting these!!  I heard that there is someone who specializes in making these. \nIt\'s {color,yellow, Joanna, a member of the Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64805, 'How did you find that out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64806, 'That\'s not the point.\nBut I can\'t go to see Joanna myself. \n{color,yellow, Please take this to her for me, [NAME].}\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why can\'t you go? ][2]'),
(64807, 'Are you Joanna?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64808, 'Yes, I\'m Joanna.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64809, 'Someone asked me to give this to you, Joanna.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64810, '...............\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64820, 'Doll Master\'s Training 1'),
(64821, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association is actually a dall master.  Talk to her about her dolls. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64822, '(Looks curious.)\nIs this for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64823, 'Yes.  Someone asked me to bring this to you, but he couldn\'t come himself.\nI\'m his delivery boy.\n(Whispers.)\nHe doesn\'t want to reveal his identity.  Ha ha.\n(Chuckles awkwardly.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64824, 'I see.\nA present from a stranger..  Thank you, but I can\'t accept this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64825, 'Oh, you don\'t have to take this too seriously. \nActually, he is a huge fan of dolls.\nHe spends most of his time taking care of his dolls. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64826, 'I guess he is shier than he looks.\nHe was very excited to tell me that there is {color,yellow, a talented doll maker in Kahal Plains}.\nHe says that {color,yellow, it is nice to purchase dolls from famous doll masters, but he wants to make his own dolls.}\nThen, he found out about you and asked me to visit you {color,yellow, so he can learn how to make dolls.}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64827, 'Oh, I see.\nI misunderstood.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64828, 'Ha ha.  I don\'t blame you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64829, 'Go and meet the doll master!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64830, 'Doll Master\'s Training 2'),
(64831, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association says that you must first fulfill her assignment learn how to make the doll from her.  Talk to her and bring 60 Glass Beads to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64832, 'Then, should I teach {color,yellow, you} {color,yellow, how to make the doll}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64833, 'Yes, you can teach me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(64834, 'Good.\nFirst, I need to show you how dolls are made.  Hmm.. There is a doll that I am making right now...\n(It is small enough to place on the palm.)\nI will show you how this is made.  Look carefully and teach him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64835, 'Certainly!  What should I do first?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64836, 'Hmm..  Let me see.\nI was about to decorate its face, but I am out of Glass Beads for the eyes.  Go to Mean Reipoon and get me 60 Glass Beads.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Thirty Glass Beads?  Got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.  I can\'t get all by myself.][2]'),
(64837, 'Here you are.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64838, 'Oh, thank you.\nNow!  Let\'s turn these Glass Beads into eyes, shall we?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64839, 'Remember.\nGet Glass Beads from Mean Leipoon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64840, 'Doll Master\'s Training 3'),
(64841, 'Joanna of the Hunters\' Association says she is almost done with the ball-jointed doll.  She tells you to take her doll design to Bunis.\nTake her ball-jointed doll design to Bunis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64842, 'I used the Glass Beads you got me to create these beautiful eyes. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64843, '(Joanna explains how ball-jointed dolls are made.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64844, 'Wow!  It\'s very complicated.  I don\'t know if I could remember it all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64845, 'Don\'t worry.\nI have written down the procedures along with the design of a ball-jointed doll. \nYou can refer to my instructions to create a good doll. \nTake this to the mystery man. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, ma\'am.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take a rest first.][2]'),
(64846, 'Hey!  Do you know how long I\'ve waited?!!\nHow did it go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64847, 'I told you to look at this.\nJoanna wrote down the instructions for ball-jointed dolls.\n(Smiles.)\nShe even gave you a design.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64848, 'Oh!!  I couldn\'t be more thankful!\nThank you!  [NAME]!!\nI\'ll give you my thankful heart.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64849, '(Let\'s take this ball-jointed doll design to Bunis!)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64860, 'Bunis\'s Doll Making Challenge! 1'),
(64861, 'Bunis of Adealia Village says he is planning to make the doll using the design from Joanna.\nCollect 80 Rags from Depraved Spearmen for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64862, 'Now that I have the design, I should try to make the doll. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64863, 'Good luck.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64864, 'What do you mean!!  You must help me, of course!\nLet\'s see.  I need Rags.\nGood!  Go ahead and get me 80 Rags!!  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(64865, 'What the..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64866, 'I got them.\n(This is tiring.  Why on earth am I helping him?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64867, 'Thank you!  Hang on a second!\nI should have another job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64868, '..Rags!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64870, 'Bunis\'s Doll Making Challenge! 2'),
(64871, 'Bunis of Adealia Village says he is planning to make the doll using the design from Joanna.\nCollect 70 Old Cotton Balls from Depraved Rangers for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64872, '(Bunis works hard for a while.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64873, 'Let\'s see.  I also need Old Cotton Balls.\nGood!  Go ahead and collect 70 Old Cotton Balls for me!!  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(64874, 'Thank you!  Hang on a second!\nI should have another job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64875, '..Old Cotton Balls!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64880, 'Bunis\'s Doll Making Challenge! 3'),
(64881, 'Bunis of Adealia Village says he is planning to make the doll using the design from Joanna.\nCollect 70 Old Wood Pieces from Depraved Fighters for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64882, '(Bunis works hard for a while.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64883, 'Let\'s see.  I also need Old Wood Pieces.\nGood!  Go ahead and collect 70 Old Wood Pieces for me!!  OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(64884, 'Hurry up!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64885, 'Thank you!  Hang on a second!\nI should have another job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64886, '..Old Wood Pieces!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64890, 'Adealia Village\'s Weapon Master'),
(64891, 'Alexia of Adealia Village hopes to make the best weapon in the village. \nTalk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64892, 'Oh, I should be able to make a beautiful weapon..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64893, 'Pity.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64894, 'The best weapon in Adealia Village in my name!!\nThat would be so great.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64895, 'Yes!!  I will gather all of the remaining materials and make a weapon. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64896, 'Oh!  I want to make a good weapon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64900, 'Master\'s Weapon 1'),
(64901, 'Alexia of Adealia Village hopes to make the best weapon in the village. \nGet 70 Wind Jewel for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64902, '(Alexia started making the weapon.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64903, '[NAME]!  I need Wind Jewel!!\nGo ahead and collect 70!!  OK?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, ma\'am.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(64904, 'Thank you!  Hang on a second!\nI should have another job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64905, '..Wind Jewel!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64910, 'Master\'s Weapon 2'),
(64911, 'Alexia of Adealia Village hopes to make the best weapon in the village. \nGet 70 Dark Ape\'s Leather for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64912, '(Alexia started making the weapon.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64913, '[NAME]!  I need Dark Ape\'s Leather this time!!\nGo ahead and collect 70!!  OK?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, ma\'am.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(64914, 'Thank you!  Hang on a second!\nI should have another job for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64915, '..Dark Ape\'s Leather!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64920, 'Get Mysterious Herbs!(Repeatable Quest)'),
(64921, 'Angela of Adealia Village says she is collecting Mysterious Herbs.   Help her collect 50 Mysterious Herbs.\n\n(Search Adelia Field and Dark Herb)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64922, 'Have you heard of Mysterious Herbs?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64923, 'Mysterious Herbs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64924, 'Yes!!  It is known to have special effects..  I should be able to make better remedies with it..\n[NAME]!!  Can you get me 50 Mysterious Herbs?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I wanted to take a rest..][2]'),
(64925, '[NAME]!  This is not the end. \nMysterious Herbs will have many uses, so you should get them for me every now and then. \nOK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64926, '.......................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64930, 'Get Mysterious Herbs!(Repeatable Quest)'),
(64931, 'Angela of Adealia Village says she is collecting Mysterious Herbs.   Help her collect 50 Mysterious Herbs.\n\n\n(Search Adelia Field and Dark Herb)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64932, 'Now!  Get me as many Mysterious Herbs as you can!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest(Repeatable Quest)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64933, 'Can you get me 50 Mysterious Herbs?  It\'s not that hard.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I wanted to take a rest..][2]'),
(64934, 'Wow!  Great! \nYou are my hero!  Thank you so much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64935, '.......................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64940, 'Morning Remedy 1'),
(64941, 'Angela of Adealia Village hopes to make a remedy with the energy of morning dews and she needs the dew drops from Dark Apes.  Get 80 Dew Drops for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64942, '[NAME]!!  I want to make a remedy with the energy of morning dews!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64943, 'You can!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64944, 'Ha ha!  You know I need your help, right?\nOK!  Get me 80 Dew Drops from Dark Apes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Dark Apes!  OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Huh?  Sorry, I\'m busy.][2]'),
(64945, 'Thank you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64946, 'Don\'t mention it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64947, 'Get me 80 Dew Drops from Dark Apes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64950, 'Morning Remedy 2'),
(64951, 'Angela of Adealia Village hopes to make a remedy with the energy of morning dews and she needs Kurah Petals.  Collect 50 Kurah Petals for her.\n\n(Search Adelia Field and Kurah Flower)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64952, '[NAME]!!  I want to make a remedy with the energy of morning dews!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64953, 'Didn\'t you make it last time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64954, 'No, I was out of materials.\nGet me 50 Kurah Petals this time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Huh?  Sorry, I\'m busy.][2]'),
(64955, 'Thank you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64956, 'Get me Kurah Petals this time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64960, 'Hungry Spirit'),
(64961, 'Ranthis of Adealia Village says that he is managing birds, the mode of transportation for the adventurers coming into the village through the black fog. \nRanthis seems to be depressed.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64962, '(Ranthis doesn\'t look good.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64963, 'Are you ill?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64964, 'I\'m not ill, but I don\'t have any energy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64965, '(She looks translucent.  That\'s strange.)\nThat means you are ill. \nWait a second.\nI\'ll ask Edwina if he has some medication for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[(Let\'s go!)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oops!  I was running an errand.. I\'ll help you later.][2]'),
(64966, 'What?  Hmm..  What are her symptoms?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64967, '....................\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64970, 'Collecting Materials for Wind Jewel'),
(64971, 'Edwina of Adealia Village says that Ranthis is hungry and asks you to collect Translucent Stone Fragments.  Collect 65 Translucent Stone Fragments for Ranthis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64972, '(...)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64973, 'She looks.. lack of energy and somewhat translucent...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64974, 'Oh!!  I forgot to feed Ranthis.\nI am working on something...  Can you get some materials to make food for Ranthis?\nAbout 65 Translucent Stone Fragments would do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Translucent Stone Fragments?  OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(64975, 'Oh!!  Thank you.\nPlease wait here. \nI need to make food for Ranthis out of these.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64976, 'Translucent Stone Fragments can be found in Ice Lich. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64980, 'Wind Jewel Delivery'),
(64981, 'Edwina of Adealia Village says that Ranthis is hungry and asks you to give the processed piece of Translucent Stone to Ranthis.  Take Wind Jewel to Ranthis.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64982, 'Now!!  Take this to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64983, 'This is?  Wind Jewel. \nOK.  I\'ll take it to Ranthis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64984, 'This would be enough for Ranthis and her birds.\nTake this to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, Ed.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This is not a good time.  I have something else to do.][2]'),
(64985, '\nHuh?  Huh?  Something.. to.. eat..?\n(Holds and stares at Wind Jewel.  A swirl embraces Ranthis.)\n\nThank you.\nYou.. saved.. my life.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64986, 'Take it to Ranthis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64990, 'Bringing an Ancient Book'),
(64991, 'Edwina of Adealia Village asks you to bring an ancient book carried by Mist in Psyken\'s Mansion.  Bring the ancient book for him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(64992, '(Edwina is getting ready to go somewhere.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(64993, 'Where are you going, Edwina?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64994, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\nI\'m going to Psyken\'s Mansion to find the Book of Ancient Knowledge. \nIt would be hard for me to get it alone.  Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh!  I love Psyken\'s Mansion!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do you have to go to that scary place for a book?][2]'),
(64995, 'That book is..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64996, 'I found the book.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(64997, 'Oh!  I wanted to get it myself..\nWell done.\nI should start studying this book.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(64998, 'The Book of Ancient Knowledge should be carried by Mist. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61540, 'The Rock of Secret Magician'),
(61541, 'Edwina of Adealia Village asks you to bring an ancient book carried by Psyken in Psyken\'s Mansion.  Bring the 3 Magician\'s Rock for him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61542, '(Edwina is getting ready to go somewhere.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61543, 'Where are you going this time, Edwina?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61544, '[NAME]!!  [NAME]!!\nI\'m going to Psyken\'s Mansion to find the Rock of Magician. \nIt would be hard for me to get it alone.  Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh!  I love Psyken\'s Mansion!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do you have to go to that scary place for a rock?][2]'),
(61545, 'Good Job, [NAME]\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61546, 'I found the rock.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61547, 'Oh!  I wanted to get it myself..\nWell done.\nI should start studying this rock.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61548, 'The Rock of Magician should be carried by Psyken. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61550, 'Aertsina\'s Concern 2'),
(61551, 'Aertsina of Adealia Village says it hurts her to see Guiltian go around the village with his injured leg.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61552, '[NAME]!!\nListen to me!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61553, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61554, 'Look at Uncle Guiltian!!\nI don\'t know how he manages to around with his leg like that..\nI just got a new leg brace for him..\nBut it\'s already ruined.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61555, 'Why don\'t you fix the leg brace, Aertsina?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61556, 'Right!  That\'s a good idea.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61557, 'It hurts me to see Uncle Guiltian like that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61560, 'Guiltian\'s Leg Brace'),
(61561, 'Aertsina of Adealia Village says it hurts her to see Guiltian go around the village with his injured leg.  She wants to make a new leg brace for Guiltian. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61562, 'But there is a problem. \nUncle Guiltian won\'t take off his leg brace. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61563, 'Oh.. How about this?\nYou can give him a new leg brace.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61564, 'I can do that.\n[NAME]!  I have to give him a visit because I have to give him something. \nI was wondering if you could go to Alexia and ask her to make a strong leg brace for him. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I could do that!  No worries.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t now.  I have something else to do.][2]'),
(61565, '[NAME], What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61566, 'I came to see. Alexia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61567, 'Oh, [NAME]?!!  What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61568, '..Please ask Alexia for Uncle Guiltian\'s leg brace.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61570, 'Collecting Materials for Guiltian\'s Leg Brace!'),
(61571, 'Aertsina of Adealia Village says it hurts her to see Guiltian go around the village with his injured leg.  She wants to make a new leg brace for Guiltian. \nAlexia says she needs 80 Strong Steel Tendons for Guiltian\'s leg brace.  Collect 80 Strong Metal Tendons for her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61572, '(Alexia listens to the story.)\nGood!  I need Strong Metal Tendons first..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61573, 'Strong Metal Tendons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61574, 'Right!  They are often carried by Shadow Elves Thief.\nCan you get about 80 from them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too many.][2]'),
(61575, '(Tang, Tang..)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61576, 'I got 80 Strong Metal Tendons.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61577, 'Oh!  Wait a second!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61578, 'It\'s 80 Strong Metal Tendons!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61580, 'Guiltian\'s Leg Brace!'),
(61581, 'Alexia of Adealia Village says she made Guiltian\'s leg brace for Aertsina.\nTake Guiltian\'s leg brace to Aertsina.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61582, '(Alexia is concentrating on making the leg brace.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61583, 'Are you still working on it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61584, 'Oh..  I\'m almost done.\nTake this to Aertsina!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[(Let\'s hurry.)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(61585, '(I hear rustling coming from somewhere.\n Thought might be to create something.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61586, 'Aertsina!  Are you here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61587, 'Oh..  It\'s done, finally.\nI should take it to Uncle right away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61588, 'Take Guiltian\'s leg brace to Aertsina.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61590, 'Valuable Friend'),
(61591, 'Aertsina of Adealia tells you about her and Guiltian.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61592, 'Aertsina!  I wanted to ask you...  How are you related to Guiltian?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61593, 'Oh, he is like my other father. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61594, 'Other father?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61595, 'When I was young, my biological parents were killed by monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61596, 'I was in shock. I lost my memory and wandered around.  Uncle Guiltian found my foster parents. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61597, 'I see.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61598, 'I decided at that time.\nI can\'t heal him for everything he has done in Adealia Village, but I want to give him strength by his side!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61599, '.... Uncle is precious for me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61600, 'Holy Tree Festival'),
(61601, 'Marlene of Adealia says that there is a festival to worship Abalita, the guardian tree of the village.  She says she needs many things to prepare for the festival. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61602, 'Holy Tree Festival is a ritual for worshipping Abalita, the guardian tree, and remembering Karen, the previous chief of our village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61603, 'Oh.. The person who disappeared..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61604, 'Yes..\nHer body cannot come back, but we believe that her soul will safely return to the village if we pray to the sacred Abalita Tree. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61605, 'I see. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61606, 'OK!  Now!  You have to join us for the festival. \nPlease!  Hurry.\nWe need so many things.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61607, 'This is an event for cherishing Abalita, the guardian tree. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61610, 'Saving Holy Tree'),
(61611, 'Marlene of Adealia says that there is a festival to worship Abalita, the guardian tree of the village.  She says she needs many things to prepare for the festival. \nGet 50 Tree Sap.\n\n(Search Adelia Field and Dark Wood)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61612, 'We use Tree Sap instead of glue on paper. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61613, 'Oh..  tree sap..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61614, 'We will need it to decorate the village, so can you get 50 Tree Sap for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(61615, 'I got it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61616, 'Oh, thank you. \nThis should be enough for the festival. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61617, 'You can get Tree Sap from trees nearby. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61620, 'Fogberry Decoration 1'),
(61621, 'Angela of Adealia says that there is a festival to worship Abalita, the guardian tree of the village.  She says she needs many things to prepare for the festival. \nGet 50 Fogberries.\n\n(Search Adelia Field and Dark Wood)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61622, '[NAME]!!  Did you know that the village will have Holy Tree Festival?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61623, 'Yes, Marlene told me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61624, 'Really?  It should be easy, then.  I need to get 50 Fogberries.\nCan you collect the Fogberries for me, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(61625, 'Wow!  You are great, [NAME]!!\nThank you!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61626, 'Get me Fogberries.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61630, 'Fogberry Decoration 2'),
(61631, 'Angela of Adealia says that there is a festival to worship Abalita, the guardian tree of the village.  She says she needs many things to prepare for the festival. \nShe says she used Fogberry decoration with fabric dyed with Fogberries.  Take her Fogberry decoration to Marlene.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61632, '(Angela is making something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61633, 'What are you making?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61634, 'Oh?  This?  This is the Fogberry decoration Marlene asked me!\nIt\'s done.  Please take it to Marlene.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest first.][2]'),
(61635, 'I have been waiting for you.  Thank you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61636, 'Please take Fogberry decoration to Marlene.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61640, 'Materials for Wood Support'),
(61641, 'Edwina of Adealia asks you to get 50 Strong Piles for Abalita Tree from Nell.\nGet 50 Strong Piles from Nell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61642, '[NAME]!!  [NAME]!!\nDo you have any business outside the village?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61643, 'I don\'t know.  Why? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61644, 'Oh, I need strong piles to support Abalita Tree and I asked Nell to get them. \nCan you get 50 Strong Piles from Nell for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to take a rest today.][2]'),
(61645, 'Nell!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61646, 'What?  What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61647, 'Get Strong Piles from Nell.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61650, 'Wood Delivery'),
(61651, 'Take 50 Strong Piles from Nell of Adealia to Edwina.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61652, 'Edwina told me that you will give me 50 Strong Piles.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61653, 'Oh, take them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes!! (Let\'s run back to Adealia.)][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to rest for a minute.][2]'),
(61654, 'Oh, thank you!!\nNow!  We should take them to Abalita Tree.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(61655, 'Take these Strong Piles to Edwina!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61660, 'Awakening tragedy'),
(61661, 'Median had a dream of Helga being resurrected. She requests help from the Hunter\'s Union adventurers concerning Helga\'s resurrection. Inform Hugues about this premonition.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61662, '(Median\'s Dream)\nYou have given me another chance, I will destroy and eliminate all humans on this continent. Hellgeit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61663, 'Oh Hi Median!\nIsn\'t it a good day?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61664, '(With a pale expression)\nIt must be just a dream... but this...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61665, 'Hey! I\'m standing right here, this is not a dream! Are you still a bit drowsy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61666, '(With a long sigh)\nPhew...\nIt doesn\'t seems like a normal dream. I have dreamt on many occassions, but this is different.\nI have a bad feeling about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61667, 'Did you have a nightmare? People say that dreams are the opposite of reality.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61668, 'The king of Hellgeits, {color,yellow,Helga} seems to have been resurrected. Now, he seems to yield incomprehensible powers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61669, 'No, that can\'t be true...\nHelga has been vanquished!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61670, 'I had a vision in a dream, it must be true. I need to tell somebody about this... I can\'t keep this to myself. Someone in the Swamp of Dawn. Oh! Go and find {color,yellow,Hugues}, the leader of the Hunter\'s Union. And you have to tell him the story, there isn\'t much time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too afraid to tell anybody.][2]'),
(61671, 'Oh its you...\n(After listening to what Medien had to say)\nHmmm... thank you for sharing. Relax for a bit and we\'ll talk about this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61672, 'Hugues will be in the Hunter\'s Union Camp.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61680, 'Helga, once more'),
(61681, 'Hugues hears what Medien has to say about Helga\'s resurrection. He believes this is a big problem for the Isya Continent. Let\'s talk to him.\n(Search Helga\'s Tomb [Hard].)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61682, 'So... Helga has been resurrected.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61683, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61684, 'Hmm... I don\'t understand.\nWhy? For what? Just revenge?\nDarn, guesses and theories, but no facts. I\'m getting a migraine.\nWhat about you? Do you have any useful info?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61685, 'W...well...\nOne thing that\'s evident is that it\'s the evil doings of someone who doesn\'t want peace in Isya.\nI\'m curious who that might be...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61686, 'Well...\nNow there\'s only one thing we have to do.\nIt will be arduous though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61687, '<Como>\nHugues, someone named Median sent a letter.\n\n<Hugues>\nExcuse me.\n\n(Median\'s Letter)\nI think Helga\'s resurrection is certain. Helga is currently at the secret temple in the Swamp of Dawn with a number of Carasians. They are empowering Helga with some mysterious crystals. Please take care of this before Helga regains his strength. I don\'t want to have this dream ever again...\nFrom Medien\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61688, 'Crystals?  Seems that someone is empowering Helga.\nWhat\'s more important is "Who" that is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61689, 'That means that someone is trying to use Helga.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61690, 'Probably...\n\nThere are so many guesses and theories, but this problem won\'t solve itself. It might be arduous and difficult, but now we have to confront someone threatening the continent. We will need the help of talented adventurers.\nJoin forces for peace, and drive forward.\nFind {color,yellow,Helga} and defeat him before he grows too strong. It might be our only chance before he regains full strength. I believe in you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe next time...][2]'),
(61691, 'We have defeated {color,yellow,Helga} once again!\nThat was thrilling.\nI knew Isya wouldn\'t fall into the hands of evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61692, 'You have done well warriors.\nNow one of the threats of this continent has been solved.\nIt must have been a blow to the one who wanted to use Helga,\nI think I\'ll go back to my poem, I will need to make you heroes out of your story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61693, 'It is good to join forces, but do not become complacent. Complacency is the root of all accidents. Helga should be in {color,yellow,Helga\'s tomb (Hard)}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61700, 'Gathering clouds'),
(61701, 'Kiera feels something is wrong following the absence of Gorvan. Talk to her.\n(Search Alberstol Ruins)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61702, 'Hi [NAME], I\'ve been meaning to talk to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61703, 'What is it today? You look worried!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61704, 'Something just doesn\'t feel right. I feel like something\'s going to happen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61705, 'Hmmm... if that\'s coming from you, Kiera, it must be something serious. Tell us, so we can help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61706, 'Gorvan has gone missing recently.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61707, 'Missing? Then let\'s go on a search!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61708, 'The place he went missing was where the Shadow of Darkness Malephar used to be. And it seems that he was just sucked right into the wall without a trace.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61709, 'Sucked into the wall?\nHm...\nThat just doesn\'t make sense.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61710, 'I don\'t mean that he was literally sucked into the wall.\nBut what if it\'s something beyond what science can explain?\n\nAnd the place is where Malephar used to be, so that might have something to do with it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61711, 'Something seems to be adding up.\nThen... the destroyer?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61712, 'It is probably the Shadow of Darkness Malephar that we defeated once.\nSomething must have happened to him. Or else something this mysterious wouldn\'t have happened.\nAlso, we got a report that another strange gate has appeared to the north of {color,yellow,Dark Land}...\nWhat could this be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61713, 'Disappearnce of Gorvan,\na strange gate appearing to the north of Dark Land...\nCould this be what you, Kiera, have been worrying about? It doesn\'t feel good.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61714, 'We first need to check.\n[NAME], you will need to take some of the adventurers and find out what the gate in Dark Land is.\nWhat is the purpose of this gate and what lurks on the other side...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61715, 'I hope it\'s all just a coincidence, but if not...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61716, 'If not, it will be for the heroes of Isya to step up. I do not enjoy battle, but if it is the resurrection of Malephar, it is not just our problem, but the problem of the whole continent. I know it can be hard, but you might have to defeat him once more.\nWho would bring such a terrible being back to life?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61717, 'I guess I have no choice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61718, 'Heroes of Isya, I believe a being has returned that threatens the existence and peace of the continent.  The bravest and the brightest have gathered again to rise to the challenge. Please go into the strange gate to the north of {color,yellow,Dark Land} and defeat whoever or whatever is inside.\nFor Isya!\n\n[BUTTON]=[For Isya!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ummm... I\'m from another continent..][2]'),
(61719, '(Panting)\nKiera, you were right, {color,yellow,Malephar} was in there, stronger than ever. But the brave warriors of Isya defeated him once more into the abyss. So... Problem solved?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61720, 'You have done well!\nIt is good that we defeated Malephar, but we have to find out how he was brought back to life and for what.\nWell, tonight, we celebrate our victory. You have done well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61721, 'The strange gate is located to the north of Dark Land. I pray nothing happens to the heroes of Isya.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61730, 'The gradual unfolding of the truth'),
(61731, 'Kiera receives information regarding the resurrection of the Shadow of Darkness Malephar. Talk to her.\n(Search Alberstol Ruins)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61732, 'Hmmm... so that was it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61733, 'Have you found something out about recent events?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61734, 'A little bit, but I am not sure yet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61735, 'Well, at least you were able to find something, Kiera, you are the best!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61736, 'Well, this is what I have found so far,\nI believe Malephar resurrected using the power of the God of Darkness, {color,yellow,Neek}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61737, 'Neek? The God of Darkness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61738, 'I think Malephar was worshipping Neek, the God of Darkness from the beginning. Or maybe he came to the continent under orders. I guess Malephar would be a perfect fit with the God of Darkness. He lost to our proud Hennis crusade, but maybe Neek responded to the will of Malephar.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61739, 'That does seem to make sense. Neek, God of Darkness\nThe scale seems to get bigger and bigger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61740, 'If indeed the God of Darkness is involved, this is no easy matter. We might have to call all the heads of the villages.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61741, 'W...What would I do there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61742, 'Defeat Malephar once more, and bring {color,yellow,10} {color,yellow,Covenants of Darkness}, and we will be able to get to the bottom of this.\nI know this is no easy task.\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I get something else instead?][2]'),
(61743, 'Here are {color,yellow,10} {color,yellow,Covenants of Darkness} you have asked for. It was indeed difficult.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61744, 'Good work,\nWith this, I will be able to uncover the plans of Neek, God of Darkness. I will inform you if I find anything.\nCiao.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61745, 'Bring back {color,yellow,10} {color,yellow,Covenants of Darkness} and all secrets will unfold.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61750, 'It\'s Them Again (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61751, 'Julien claims that the Miner Moles are blocking all the roads to Burning Rock and so his caravan can\'t get sufficient supplies. He hopes you can help him solve this problem. \n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61752, 'When will they disappear?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61753, 'Who do you want to get rid of so badly?\nNot me I hope...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61754, 'Hmm... maybe?\nHaha... meh.\nI don\'t even feel like joking around right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61755, 'You? Not feel like joking? Who did this to you Julien? Server bears?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61756, 'No...\n{color,yellow,Miner Mole}. They\'re frequent in the area, but the thing is their population has increased exponentially recently.\nA scholar in Elderine claims it was due to the percipitation and their allergic reaction. Anyways.\nIt\'s bad enough I have to run a caravan in this kind of neighborhood, but not even getting supplies because of them? It\'s ridiculous...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61757, 'Hm...\nI wonder if feeding them after midnight has any side effects? No creature can multiply that fast. Maybe global warming is causing some weird change in their physiology.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61758, 'That might be the cause, but we can investigate that later. We need to stop their overpopulation first!\nAs you know, the Maxuter caravan is small in numbers, and there isn\'t enough manpower to take care of this.\nMaybe you\'d like to help out?\nHow about it? Could you get rid of {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Miner Moles}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it for the Maxuter caravan!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I would be able to get rid of the whole bunch.][2]'),
(61759, 'As you requested I caught {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Miner Moles}. And without even breaking a sweat~\nSo, you\'ll be able to move the supplies now, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61760, 'Wow! Impressive!\nI know you did well, but I just wanted to say... Wait... I mean... I think there are hundreds more in the area.\nHow about it? Let\'s show those {color,yellow,Miner Moles} who\'s boss!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61761, 'Let\'s start with an easy {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Miner Moles}~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61770, 'It\'s Them Again (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61771, 'Julien claims that the Miner Moles are blocking all the roads to Burning Rock and so his caravan can\'t get sufficient supplies. He hopes you can help him solve this problem. \n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61772, '[NAME], you still have work to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61773, 'Still swarming with {color,yellow,Miner Moles}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61774, 'Sadly, yes. We need to keep the caravan safe so could you please get rid of  {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Miner Moles}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s getting boring...][2]'),
(61775, 'Impressive again!\nBut sorry to say, I think there are still hundreds more in the area.\nHow about it? Let\'s show those {color,yellow,Miner Moles} who\'s boss!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61776, 'Let\'s start with an easy {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Miner Moles}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61780, 'That Ruby Is Mine!'),
(61781, 'Merchant Master Maxuter claims his precious red ruby was stolen. Let\'s see what he has to say.\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61782, 'Where did it go?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61783, 'Hello Master Maxuter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61784, 'Oh it\'s you, how have you been?\n(Turns away quickly, looking for something)\nI know I put it in here somewhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61785, 'Did you lose something?\nYou don\'t look like the type to misplace stuff.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61786, 'I have a BIG problem.\nThe family heirloom, those precious red rubies... gone!\nMy ancestors insisted those rubies brought good luck and said never to give them to anyone. I always kept my eyes on them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61787, 'Family heirlooms huh? I don\'t think you would have easily misplaced those.\nPerhaps they were stolen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61788, 'That\'s the only theory I can think of too.\nNobody, not even the people in my caravan knows of them. I wonder who would have found out about them.\nI really have no idea...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61789, '(Thinking deeply...)\nIs there a {color,yellow,Ruby Guardian} around?\nI believe I saw one before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61790, '{color,yellow,Ruby Guardian}?!\nLet me think...\n(Sinks into his own thoughts.)\nOh Em Gee! {color,yellow,Ruby Guardians}! If I get my hands on them... I\'ll, I\'ll!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61791, 'Calm down, calm down. Think about your responsibility as the leader of this caravan...\n(Actually I don\'t think you\'ll stand a chance against them...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61792, 'Phew...\n(Trying to suppress his anger)\nR...right... you\'re right. I was so mad I almost raged...\n(Recovering his calm)\nIt must have been them for sure. \nBut I have no proof.\n[NAME], could you please check whether the {color,yellow,Ruby Guardians} are behind this?\nThe rubies are very important to me. \nPlease bring back {color,yellow,50} {color,yellow,Red Rubies} from the {color,yellow,Ruby Guardians}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get to the bottom of this.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe it\'s not them.][2]'),
(61793, 'Yes, these are the rubies I inherited.\nPhew...\nThank you! If it wasn\'t for you I would have suffered the wrath of my ancestors.\nI won\'t forget this. If you ever need anything or are ever in danger, we\'ll definitely be at your service!\nI wish you good luck on your journey! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61794, 'From the {color,yellow,Ruby Guardians} retrieve {color,yellow,50}{color,yellow,Red Rubies}. Be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61800, 'Kidmon The Menace (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61801, 'Recently, Kidmons have been a problem for the Maxuter caravan. Master Maxuter is planning to get rid of these Kidmons. Talk with Master Maxuter.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61802, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61803, 'You\'ve been bothered by those little fellows, huh? Can\'t be too good for your reputation!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61804, '[NAME]..\nAh... yeah.\nIt is a shame, but Kidmons have been attacking our caravan, damaging supplies and injuring people.\nWe are having trouble defeating them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61805, 'Have you tried negotiating with them to make them leave?\nHonestly, I don\'t think you\'re... strong enough to get rid of them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61806, 'Well, we tried politely asking the first few we encountered.\nBut they\'re so many of them now. The group keeps getting larger and larger. They\'re messing up everything!\nWe want to get back at them, but everybody is too soft to do anything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61807, 'So that\'s the problem...\nYou guys started off being too nice!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61808, 'Yeah, we tried asking nicely...\nBut you haven\'t tried that, maybe you can help. I\'m sure you are skilled in these matter... eh?\nPlease help us get rid of those cunning {color,yellow,Kidmons} and bring back 50 {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade}.\nI heard Kidmons can\'t do anything without their spades! Haha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will give those Kidmons a taste of their own medicine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not really the one to defeat younglings.][2]'),
(61809, 'Hah, those worthless younglings. I got rid of them and brought 50  {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade}s.\nThey won\'t want to be around here for a long time! Hahahahaha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61810, 'No mercy! Even for the cute... young... adorable... I mean... You are a truly experienced warrior!\nHahaha, I feel so happy!\nBut I think without you, they\'ll come back and bother us some more.\nCould you defeat and bring back as many {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade} as possible. \nIf we get rid of their weapons, they can\'t bother us!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61811, 'Please defeat the {color,yellow,Kidmons} and bring back 50 {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade}. They might be a bit heavy, but I\'d appreciate it a lot!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61820, 'Kidmon The Menace (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61821, 'Recently, Kidmons have been a problem for the Maxuter caravan. Master Maxuter is planning to get rid of these Kidmons. Talk with Master Maxuter.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61822, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61823, 'Are the Kidmons still bothering you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61824, 'You have no idea, they are always looking to bother us.\nPlease bring back as many {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade} as possible. Please! You\'re our only hope!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s getting boring...][2]'),
(61825, 'No mercy! Even for the cute... young... adorable... I mean... You are a truly experienced warrior!\nHahaha, I feel so happy!\nBut I think without you, they\'ll come back and bother us some more.\nCould you defeat and bring back as many {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade} as possible. \nIf we get rid of their weapons, they can\'t bother us!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61826, 'Please defeat the {color,yellow,Kidmons} and bring back 50 {color,yellow,Kidmon\'s Toy Spade}. They might be a bit heavy, but I\'d appreciate it a lot!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61830, 'Curious Noises'),
(61831, 'Stone Merchant Thompson claims that there are strange noises near Flaming Mine. He wants this investigated. Talk to him.\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61832, 'Hm... This is bothering me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61833, 'Hi most fealess of Maxuter caravan. Master Thompson, what worries you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61834, 'Fearless? Me? Didn\'t know I was fearless.\nNow that you say it, maybe it\'s true! Hahahaha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61835, '(Eh... I shouldn\'t have said that...)\nHaha... Um... Hahh... yeah!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61836, 'I want to look into something... being the fearless person I am. But since I\'m a member of this caravan, I can\'t just up and leave.\n[NAME], you\'re the only person who can solve this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61837, 'Um... Ok. I guess...\nWell, let\'s hear it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61838, 'We\'re located in a pretty secluded spot. It\'s hard to meet travellers or other adventurers.\nSo getting the latest news from around the continent is kind of hard.\nWould you agree?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61839, '(What does he want me to agree to? A geography lecture?)\nUm... Sure~ I always appreciated the fact that the Maxuter caravan is working so hard to help commercially develop such distant locations~ Woot!?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61840, 'But recently I came across some strange information from an adventurer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61841, '(Nervously swallowing)\nWhat kind of information? Is it good? Bad? Right? Wrong? TELL ME!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61842, 'As you know, the Flaming Mine is around here. Now it\'s abandoned, but recently there have been strange noises coming from the Flaming Mine.\nScreaming, and... welll general spooky noises.\nThose strange noises can be heard when you pass by the Flaming Mine. It\'s actually stopping a lot of people from travelling through that path.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61843, 'Hm... If it is that kind of sound...\nMaybe it\'s some sort of noise made by the dead spirits in the mine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61844, 'You might be right, but we should make sure. Being fearless, I WOULD go, but I have to stay with the caravan.\nYou\'ll need to look into it. If they are ghosts, they\'re probably {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} or {color,yellow,Kart Miners}. Take care of 50 of these two monsters. If the noises pipe down, it was probably them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It is a bit spooky, but ok!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you\'re so fearless, you do it.][2]'),
(61845, 'Like you guessed, the cause of the noise was {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} and {color,yellow,Kart Miners}. Who you gonna call? Me! I took care of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61846, 'I guess I\'m fearless and make good guesses! Double woot!\nYou did well.\nI\'ll have to notify the larger towns about this. I\'ll see you again!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61847, 'Defeat 50 {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} and {color,yellow,Kart Miners}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61850, 'Road To Riches (Repeatable quests)'),
(61851, 'Stone Merchant Thompson of Maxuter caravan heard about the jewels the Jewel Tree carry. He wants your help in acquiring some. Defeat Jewel Trees and collect 50 Jewel Tree jewellery boxes.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61852, 'If I had enough jewels, I would quit this job and buy a nice house in Elderine...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61853, 'WHAT!? What are you talking about?\nYou want to quit the caravan?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61854, '(Suddenly looking serious)\nWhat? Me? Quit? No... Never!\nI\'m the most fearless of all in this caravan! I would never think of quitting...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61855, 'Haha!\nSpoken like a true man, Thompson!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61856, '(Phew)\nEh... Actually, I have something to ask of you and only you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61857, 'Ok... You\'re acting weird weird today and creeping me out. You don\'t seem like the old Thompson I knew... WHAT DID YOU DO WITH THE REAL THOMSPON!?!?\nHaha! Just kidding. So what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61858, '(Sigh)\nActually, business is not so good... We\'ve followed our leader, but there\'s no customers here. We\'re too far away from anything except more monsters... And trees, don\'t get me started about the trees. The worst part is when the wind blows and the... No! The worst part is...\n(Continues blabbering on...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61859, 'Then it WAS true when you said you\'re quitting?\nHmrph! Didn\'t see you as the quitting type.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61860, 'No... No no no. Um...\n(I\'ll have to lie.)\nUm... Ah! Yes! Actually my sister in Elderine is a bit low on funds these days. I was just looking around to see if there were any opportunities.\nThen this opportunity presented itself. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61861, 'You found something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61862, 'Well yes...\nAccording to my informant... Don\'t tell anyone, but...\n{color,yellow,Jewel Trees} carry a lot of jewels.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61863, 'So you\'re trying to get jewels from the {color,yellow,Jewel Trees} to help out your sister in Elderine. That\'s so brave and... fearless! I misjudged you, I\'m so sorry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61864, 'Eh... Haha, no worries. I should have told you the truth from the start.\nAnyways, I hope you can help me... I mean my sister.\nOf course if we get a lot of jewels from the {color,yellow,Jewel Trees}, we\'ll get a chance to earn some money! What\'s good for me... I mean... my sister. is good for you too! You can help by defeating the \n{color,yellow,Jewel Trees} and bringing me 50 {color,yellow,Jewel Tree jewellery boxes}. My sister and I would appreciate it so much. You could get rich too! So how about it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Help other people and get rich! I can\'t miss this chance!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, doesn\'t really tempt me.][2]'),
(61865, 'Here you go! It\'s 50 Jewel Tree jewellery boxes from the {color,yellow,Jewel Trees}. Now we just need to open up and divide the jewels.\nHehe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61866, '(Hm... What do do?)\nHm... Yes, but now that I think about it. I heard some rumor. When you open the chest it\'s suppose to release a poisonous gas! What\'s going to happen if we breathe in the gas? I\'d better analyze this more. Actually, if you can bring me more to analyze it will speed up the process.\n(Haha)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61867, 'Bring me 50 {color,yellow,Jewel Tree jewellery boxes} from {color,yellow,Jewel Trees} if you can.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61870, 'Road To Riches (Repeatable quests)'),
(61871, 'Stone Merchant Thompson of Maxuter caravan heard about the jewels the Jewel Tree carry. He wants your help in acquiring some. Defeat Jewel Trees and collect 50 Jewel Tree jewellery boxes.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61872, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61873, 'Are you done with the analysis of the jewellery box?\nIt\'s sure taking a long time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61874, 'It seems that this isn\'t an ordinary jewellery box... I think they may have locked the box with some magical power.\nPlease defeat more {color,yellow,Jewel Trees} and get me about 50 more {color,yellow,Jewel Tree jewellery boxes}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Fo sho!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nah, I\'m good.][2]'),
(61875, 'The magic expert hasn\'t arrived yet.\nDon\'t just stand there! Let\'s get more of those {color,yellow,Jewel Tree jewellery boxes}. The more, the better. Please?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61876, 'Bring me 50 more {color,yellow,Jewel Tree jewellery boxes} from {color,yellow,Jewel Tree} if you can.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61880, 'The Reason For Hating Flaming Mine (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61881, 'Storage Keeper Franz says he hates the Flaming Mine. Defeat 50 Lava Vivis.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Flaming Mine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61882, 'I really can\'t understand! Why is it a mine?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61883, 'Hi buddy. What\'s the problem now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61884, 'I just really, truly, deeply hate Flaming Mine on Burning Rock. I so hate the monsters inside...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61885, 'You can\'t hate something with no reason. What would other people say? Why do you hate the monsters so much? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61886, 'Well, do you know why the sky at Burning Rock is red?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61887, 'Hm... Not really. I don\'t know.\nBut, it\'s cool no?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61888, 'It\'s all because of the scorching ground in Flaming Mine. It makes the temperature so hot, and the sky becomes red because of that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61889, 'Ok... so maybe you should be a geologist... or meteorologist. What\'s your point?\n[NEXT]'),
(61890, 'I\'ve always wanted to see the clear blue sky. I\'m tried of this red sky...\nAnd it\'s all cause of the Flaming Mine. I seriously wish that place would collapse or cool down... or something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61891, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61892, 'On top of that, the monster inside the Flaming Mines are all born from lava. This just makes matters worse. They keep making Burning Rock so hot.\nIt\'s those {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61893, 'Hm... So, what can I do about it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61894, 'Well, I won\'t be able to see the blue sky even if I defeat all the {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}. But I heard these {color,yellow,Lava Vivis} are born from lava. Their heat destroys the enviornment and makes it unbearably hot.\nEven though it won\'t solve the problem, do you think you can get rid of 50 {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure! Anything to cool things down.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I don\'t like the heat either but it\'s not THAT hot.][2]'),
(61895, 'I\'ve gotten rid of 50 {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\nDoes this make you feel a bit better?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61896, 'Burning Rock feels the same, but I think a part of me is happier.\nBut... it\'s not enough. I\'m sorry, but please get rid of more. You have to understand I hate them with a burning passion. Just 50 more {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61897, 'Please get rid of 50 {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61900, 'The Reason For Hating Flaming Mine (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61901, 'Storage Keeper Franz says he hates the Flaming Mine. Defeat 50 Lava Vivis.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Flaming Mine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61902, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61903, 'Still hate Flaming Mine with a burning passion?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61904, 'WITHOUT A DOUBT! That\'s why I need your help to get rid of 50 more {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Fine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(61905, 'Burning Rock feels the same, but I think a part of me is happier.\nBut... it\'s not enough. I\'m sorry, but please get rid of more. You have to understand I hate them with a burning passion. Just 50 more {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61906, 'Please get rid of 50 {color,yellow,Lava Vivis}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61910, 'Storage Keeper Franz\'s Revenge 1'),
(61911, 'A monster in the Flaming Mine ate Storage Keeper Franz\'s pet that he\'s had since he was a kid. Let\'s see what Storage Keeper Franz has to say.\n(Search Flaming Mine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61912, 'Henry.. I hope you\'re well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61913, 'Henry? That\'s a great name!\nIs he your friend in Elderin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61914, '...\nHenry is the bird I raised since I was a kid.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61915, 'Seems a bit classy for a bird\'s name. Why do you hope he\'s ok? Did something happen to him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61916, 'Henry and I were always together. We were together when I first joined this caravan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61917, 'WERE together? So you aren\'t now?\nDid he leave you? Did something happen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61918, 'When we first arrived at Burning Rock. We were ambushed by monsters. Thankfully I was ok, but after the attack, but couldn\'t find Henry anywhere! Poor Henry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61919, 'Maybe he got scared and flew away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61920, 'No way! Henry\'s a brave birdy.\nPlus, I saw it with my own two eyes!\nHenry\'s feathers hanging out of a {color,yellow,Red Nix}\'s beak..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61921, 'OMG... Then...Henry was eaten by a {color,yellow,Red Nix}..?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61922, 'Maybe...\nI must avenge him! I\'m going to make that {color,yellow,Red Nix} pay for eating Henry!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61923, 'Wait!\nWhat will the caravan do if something happens to you?\nAnd your parents in Elderine?\nDon\'t be so selfish!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61924, 'Then what should I do? Everytime I close my eyes I see Henry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61925, 'I can see that you\'re grieving and in pain. But the {color,yellow,Red Nix} is not an easy foe. \nTell you what, if I take care of this will stay safe with the caravan?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61926, 'Yes, I suppose so. Oh, thank you so much... Henry must be avenged so he can rest in peace.\nYour target is 50 {color,yellow,Red Nix} from the {color,yellow,Flaming Mine}.\nSo no mercy! Don\'t let any get away. Promise me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[The Flaming Mine is too hot!][2]'),
(61927, 'I have gotten rid of the 50 {color,yellow,Red Nix} that you requested.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61928, 'Thank you so much! You\'ve avenged Henry.\nHenry, now you can rest in peace. I\'ll see you in the next world my friend.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61929, 'Let 50 {color,yellow,Red Nix} feel the same pain that Henry suffered!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61930, 'Storage Keeper Franz\'s Revenge 2'),
(61931, 'After Henry was eaten by a monster, Storage Keeper Franz got a new pet, Enri. However Enri was almost harmed as well. Storage Keeper Franz is seeking revenge.\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61932, 'Why don\'t they leave my friends alone! Why?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61933, 'Oh, so you have more friends than I thought!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61934, 'I actually found a small bird with a hurt leg during my route. He reminded me of Henry so I took him in.\nHe grew fond of me... So I gave him a name also.\nThe name is Enri!\nDon\'t you think it\'s neat?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61935, 'You really like birds huh? Doesn\'t seem... age appropriate.\nDon\'t kids your age usually play with toys?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61936, 'Hmmmph!\nThat\'s for kids, don\'t compare me with them.\nI\'m a proud member of the Maxuter caravan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61937, '(So much pride for a kid...)\nOk. Ok. Calm down. So what happen now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61938, 'Anyways, this just happened. No joke.\nWhile I was doing my regular route with Enri, a {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton} suddenly rushed towards Enri.\nIf I didn\'t pull out my sling as fast as I did, Enri might be next to Henry by now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61939, 'So you\'re saying you have the fastest sling in Isya huh?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61940, 'What? No, it\'s not that.\nI\'m saying I almost lost another good friend. They should have attacked me, not Enri... I can\'t let them get away with this. You must help. Like you have avenged Henry, please avenge Enri.\nPlease get rid of 1 {color,yellow,Giant Magmatons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I think your birds have a good owner.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You have to do things yourself.][2]'),
(61941, 'I defeated 1 {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton}s.\nThey won\'t be bothering you or Enri for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61942, 'Thanks again for your help. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61943, 'Can you punish 1 of the {color,yellow,Giant Magmatons} for their attack on Enri?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61950, 'Caravan Under Peril (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61951, 'Stone Merchant Thompson says that the whole caravan is suffering from the recession, but the Cursed Knight Armor seems to be selling well.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Flaming Mine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61952, '<Merchant Master Maxuter>\n...\n...\nDid you get that?\n\n<Stone Merchant Thompson>\nYes!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61953, 'Hello Thompson!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61954, 'My goodness!\nThis is way too much stress...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61955, 'Both Merchant Master Maxuter and you don\'t look happy. Are you guys having an argument?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61956, '(Sighing)\nActually, our caravan is currently going through a little financial crisis.\nI guess it\'s kind of expected trying to do business in this area, but still...\nI just don\'t understand...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61957, 'Finance huh?\nI guess that\'s none of my business so I\'ll just be moving...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61958, 'Actually there is something you can do.\nPlease revive our caravan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61959, 'Yeah, well um... I\'ve only got a few copper but...\nIs there\'s anything else I can do...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61960, 'Haha. Well, according to my sources the hottest item in Lumen and Elderin is the {color,yellow,Cursed Knight Armor} in the {color,yellow,Flaming Mine}.\nThe armor itself is of great value, but with the flames. It\'s just too hot to handle! Get it? Get it?\nAnyways, I hear EVERYONE is trying to get their hands on it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61961, 'The armor of the {color,yellow,Cursed Knight} huh?\nIt must sell pretty well if everybody is looking for it.\nSo you want me to bring back some of this armor? So that the Maxuter caravan can overcome this economic hard time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61962, 'Yeah. I\'m sorry that I\'m always asking you for stuff... but this time it\'s not just my personal problem. This impacts the entire caravan... I hope you can help.\nPlease bring back 15 {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\'s Armor} from {color,yellow,Flaming Mine}. I think this would get us through this recession.\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the Maxuter caravan!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to sell it myself.][2]'),
(61963, 'I\'ve brought back 15 {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\'s Armor}\nDo you think this will help the caravan?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61964, 'You\'ve done well. But this will only get us through this pinch.\nThere\'s no way to know how long this recession will last.\nJust in case, could you bring 15 more {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\'s Armor}. The survival of the Maxuter caravan is in your hands.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61965, 'Please bring me 15 {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\'s Armor} from the {color,yellow,Flaming Mine}. The {color,yellow,Cursed Knights} are fast and strong, be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61970, 'Caravan Under Peril (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61971, 'Stone Merchant Thompson says that the whole caravan is suffering from the recession, but the Cursed Knight Armor seems to be selling well.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Flaming Mine)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61972, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61973, 'I know, I know~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61974, 'Please bring me 15 {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\'s Armor} from the{color,yellow,Flaming Mine}. It will help solve some of our problems at hand.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s just too bothersome.][2]'),
(61975, 'You\'ve done well. But this will only get us through this pinch.\nThere\'s no way to know how long this recession will last.\nJust in case, could you bring 15 more {color,yellow,Cursed Knight Armor}. The survival of the Maxuter caravan is in your hands.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61976, 'Please bring me 15 {color,yellow,Cursed Knight\' Armor} from the {color,yellow,Flaming Mine}. The {color,yellow,Cursed Knights} are fast and strong, be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61980, 'Outlaw of the Swamp (Repeatable Quest)'),
(61981, 'Possessed Adventurer Watson at the Swamp of Dawn asks you to defeat the Mandrakes that are threatening the adventurers.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61982, 'Oh... How did I end up in such a place...\n\nJust my luck...\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(61983, 'Hey! What a coincidence meeting you here. It\'s like finding a marble on the beach!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61984, 'I guess...\nI just want to get out of here as soon as possible...\nI\'m so sick of swamps.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61985, 'Yea... I guess the terrain isn\'t good for adventurers. A swamp that you could sink into, various dangerous monsters, lack of sunlight...\nYou must have some extraordinary perseverance to come to a place like this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61986, '(Perseverance huh? Sometimes I wonder why I ever became an adventurer...)\nThat\'s flattering, but what\'s important now is that there is a monster more threatening than anything I\'ve seen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61987, 'Well, ALL monster are threatening. What makes this one special? What monster is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61988, '{color,yellow,Mandrake}!\nAt first, they look like a harmless old tree. But the {color,yellow,Mandrakes} are actually going around in the day threatening adventurers. At night they become one with the tress and deepen the swamp.\nThey\'re becoming a huge pain to the adventurer way of life! More so than any monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61989, 'Okay... You\'re walking around aren\'t you? \nAre you sure this is that big of an issue? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(61990, '(I don\'t want to hear that from you!)\nYou look brave. Do you think you could defeat 50 {color,yellow,Mandrakes} so adventurers besides just me can venture through the swap safely?\nThis might be my last request as an adventurer... Please help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shouldn\'t be a problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not fond of adventurers myself.][2]'),
(61991, 'I finished clearing out 50 {color,yellow,Mandrakes}. Do you think it\'ll be easier for new adventurers now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(61992, 'I admire your efforts, but I think there are still more {color,yellow,Mandrakes} around.\nIf you have some more time, could you get rid of 50 more {color,yellow,Mandrakes}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(61993, 'Get rid of 50 {color,yellow,Mandrakes}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62000, 'Outlaw of the Swamp (Repeatable Quest)'),
(62001, 'Possessed Adventurer Watson at the Swamp of Dawn asks you to defeat the Mandrakes that are threatening the adventurers.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62002, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62003, 'I know, I know~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62004, 'Do you think you could defeat 50 {color,yellow,Mandrakes} so adventurers besides me can venture through the swap safely?\nThis might be my last request as an adventurer... Please help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shouldn\'t be a problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not fond of adventurers myself.][2]'),
(62005, 'If you have some time, could you get rid of 50 more {color,yellow,Mandrakes}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62006, 'Get rid of 50 {color,yellow,Mandrakes}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62010, 'Beware Of The Bush!'),
(62011, 'Scared Adventurer Royden, hiding in the Swamp of Dawn, cannot go on a search because he is afraid of a monster.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62012, 'This forest is like a nightmare for adventurers...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62013, 'You look like an experienced adventurere, why are you hiding here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62014, 'I\'ve come to this nasty place, I can\'t distinguish the difference from a bush or a monster...\nYesterday while I was going through a bush I grabbed something slippery, and I found myself holding onto a monster\'s head. So I\'ve been hiding... just to be safe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62015, '(I don\'t think it\'s that safe there...)\nI understand. There\'s a lot of plant monsters here. You should be careful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62016, 'Seriously, there\'s monsters that you can\'t event distinguish from bushes. I think they need to be cleared out before I can get out of this hiding spot.\nDo you think you can help?\nPlease defeat 50 {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants}. I think that would do. Oh and I think you\'ll be able to find them near the bushes. Help pl0x!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shouldn\'t be a problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t really like adventureres myself.][2]'),
(62017, 'Okay, I\'ve taken care of 50 {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants}...\nBut I was confused myself. I\'m not sure it\'ll be possible to get rid of them completely..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62018, 'It\'s ok, I think that\'s good enough for me to start moving again. I\'ll just need to be a bit more careful...\nThank you~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62019, 'It\'s 50 {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants}. Don\'t confuse them bushes or something...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62020, 'The Threats of King Rhinoce(Repeatable Quests)'),
(62021, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union at Swamp of Dawn says the King Rhinoce has recently become a threat. Go talk to her.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62022, '[NAME]~ I think it\'s time for you to show your powers!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62023, 'NICE! I was awaiting a chance to prove myself to you, Tiara!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62024, 'Cute... Your confidence is impressive.\nBut your foe this time can\'t be tackled just with confidence alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62025, 'Whoever it is, I\'m ready!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62026, 'Listen. [NAME].\nRecently the leader of the Rhinoce, the {color,yellow,King Rhinoce} are appearing in Swamp of Dawn. \nFor that reason, the Rhinoce has become more fierce and violent.\nThe Hunter\'s Union is getting annoyed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62027, '(Nervously swallowing)\n{color,yellow,King Rhinoce}.\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62028, 'I\'m not sure if you\'re strong or not.\nI do know you won\'t be able to do this on your own. Gather some worthy party members.\nIf you can get rid of the {color,yellow,King Rhinoce}, I will recognize you as an adventurer even more skilled than Hugues himself. How about it? Are you up for the challenge?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I feel my heart pumping!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not feeling too good, I\'ll try next time.][2]'),
(62029, 'I\'ve gotten rid of the {color,yellow,King Rhinoce}.\nA piece of cake. Easy as pie... I mean cake. Um...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62030, '(Might even be stronger than Hugues himself...)\nI\'ll be hoenst, I didn\'t think you had it in you. I underestimated you.\nIf only everyone in the Hunter\'s Union has the same ferocity~\nThe {color,yellow,King Rhinoce} can always recover and come back, can I count on you when the time comes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62031, 'Just take care of the {color,yellow,King Rhinoce}. Make sure to gather a strong party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62040, 'The Threats of King Rhinoce(Repeatable Quests)'),
(62041, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union at Swamp of Dawn says the King Rhinoce has recently become a threat. Go talk to her.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62042, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62043, 'The {color,yellow,King Rhinoce} has returned!\nGather a strong party and vanquish him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe next time.][2]'),
(62044, '(Might even be stronger than Hugues himself...)\nI\'ll be hoenst, I didn\'t think you had it in you. I underestimated you.\nIf only everyone in the Hunter\'s Union has the same ferocity~\nThe {color,yellow,King Rhinoce} can always recover and come back, can I count on you when the time comes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62045, 'Just take care of the {color,yellow,King Rhinoce}. Make sure to gather a strong party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62050, 'Food Thief! (Repeatable Quests)'),
(62051, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union at the Swamp of Dawn is complaining that the food supply is disappearing. Hunt down Ping Pig and bring back 50 Ping Pig\'s Horns.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62052, '[NAME]~ Hey, I was looking for you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62053, 'Hola Como! Esta... I mean, what\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62054, 'I think somebody is stealing the food from the Hunter\'s Union. We\'ve been standing guard, so I don\'t know how.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62055, 'The Hunter\'s Union is such a tight knit group. Whoever\'s doing it must have bad intentions.\nWho could it be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62056, 'No matter how hard I think about it, there\'s not any monster that would go for our food...\n(Suddenly starts thinking)\nWait... maybe...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62057, 'Do you have something Como?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62058, 'There\'s only one monster that would do this!\nIt\'s {color,yellow,Ping Pig}.\nSwamp of Dawn is surrounded with plants only. {color,yellow,Ping Pig} hate plants. That\'s why they took our food.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62059, '{color,yellow,Ping Pig}?\nSilly pigs, act just like they look.\nShould I go teach them a lesson? Should I recruit some birds?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62060, 'I think you can handle this without birds...\nThis has been going on a while and we\'ve lost a lot to of those pigges. Teaching them a lesson won\'t be enough.\nGo defeat the {color,yellow,Ping Pig} and bring back 50 {color,yellow,Ping Pig\'s horn}.\nThat will set an example!\nCan you do this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[How could I refuse your request~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like pigs..][2]'),
(62061, 'I have defeated the {color,yellow,Ping Pig} and brought back 50 {color,yellow,Ping Pig\'s horns}~\nWill this be enough to show them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62062, 'Wow, I can always rely on [NAME]~\nThank you, the Hunter\'s Union will always be in your debt.\nWhile it makes an example for some, I\'m afraid others might attack in retaliation... I need more horns to send a clear message. Please get me more~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62063, 'Please bring me 50 {color,yellow,Ping Pig\'s horns}. This should show them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62070, 'Food Thief! (Repeatable Quests)'),
(62071, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union at the Swamp of Dawn is complaining that the food supply is disappearing. Hunt down Ping Pig and bring back 50 Ping Pig\'s Horns.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62072, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62073, 'Have the {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} reappeared?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62074, 'Yeah... So, I think they\'re pretty upset about their friends\' deaths. Could you get us 50 more {color,yellow,Ping Pig\'s horns}. You know, to show them who\'s in charge.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m a bit busy right now~][2]'),
(62075, 'Wow, I can always rely on [NAME]~\nThank you, the Hunter\'s Union will always be in your debt.\nWhile it makes an example for some, I\'m afraid others might attack in retaliation... I need more horns to send a clear message. Please get me more~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62076, 'Please bring me 50 {color,yellow,Ping Pig\'s horns}. This should show them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62080, 'Personal Revenge (Repeatable Quests)'),
(62081, 'The leader of the Hunter\'s Union in the Swamp of Dawn, Hugues, says there is some business he needs to take care of with a monster in the Temple of Spirit. Find the slow moving Slime and defeat 15 of them.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Spirit of Temple)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62082, 'If I go to the Temple of Spirit, Tiara might be able to take my place temporarily... But then...\n(Blabbering)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62083, 'Hello Hugues!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62084, 'Oh you\'re here. You look... Good. I guess. Did you get a haircut?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62085, 'Well, no... I didn\'t. But thanks. Hehe..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62086, 'Well, at least we\'re both breathing. Anyways, I\'ve got to get going now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62087, 'Where are you going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62088, 'I have some business in the Temple of Spirit. Not any official Hunter\'s Union business. Just some personal stuff.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62089, 'No matter how personal it is, you can\'t just leave the Hunter\'s Union like that. What will happen to the Hunter\'s Union if something bad happens to you?\nSeriously... don\'t be so selfish.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62090, '(Thinking hard)\nI\'m embarrassed... You\'re right.\nThis leadership thing is hard.\nBut I can\'t bring the entire Hunter\'s Union for some personal issue...\nI have an idea, can you hear me out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62091, 'Tell me. Tell me. Tutututu tell me~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62092, 'Well, this was when we first settled down here at the Swamp of Dawn.\nWe were still settling in, and it took a while to get used to the geography, climate and monsters.\nOf the monsters, there was the {color,yellow,Slug}. It\'s really big and super slow, but we passed out from the toxic gases it emitted. The {color,yellow,Slug} totally destroyed all our supplies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62093, 'Wow... You must have been furious!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62094, 'We had to work day and night because of that, and that\'s why we\'re such a small group now.\nI\'ve dreamt of getting back at them every night.\nAnd today was the day, but you\'re right. I need to stay with the Hunter\'s Union.\nDo you think you could punish them for me?\nJust 15 {color,yellow,Slugs} would do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the Hunter\'s Alliance!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Where is the Temple of Spirit?][2]'),
(62095, 'I took out 15 {color,yellow,Slugs}.\nI\'ve punished them for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62096, 'Thank you. Now I can be dignified in front of our fallen Hunter\'s Union members.\nBut it\'s still not even.\nThis is a personal request, but could you take out 15 more {color,yellow,Slugs} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62097, 'Please defeat 15 {color,yellow,Slugs}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62100, 'Personal Revenge (Repeatable Quests)'),
(62101, 'The leader of the Hunter\'s Union in the Swamp of Dawn, Hugues, says there is some business he needs to take care of with a monster in the Temple of Spirit. Find the slow moving Slime and defeat 15 of them.\n(Repeatable Quest)\n(Search Spirit of Temple)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62102, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62103, 'Still not enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62104, 'Unfortunately no.\nPlease take out 15 more {color,yellow,Slugs}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired][2]'),
(62105, 'Thank you. Now I can be dignified in front of our fallen Hunter\'s Union members.\nBut it\'s still not even.\nThis is a personal request, but could you take out 15 more {color,yellow,Slugs} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62106, 'Please defeat 15 {color,yellow,Slugs}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62110, 'Water Shortage'),
(62111, 'Leader of the Hunter\'s Union in the Swamp of Dawn, Hugues, is having a problem with a plant type monsters taking over the water. Defeat the Laplans and bring back 50 of their leaves.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62112, 'Bleh... Now I\'ll be drinking muddy water. Yuck!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62113, 'I knew mud was good for your skin, but what is muddy water good for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62114, 'Oh, its you...\nI\'m always glad to see you... your jokes... not so much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62115, 'I\'m sorry. Just trying to lighten the mood, you know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62116, 'There\'s a big problem. According to the information from the Hunter\'s Union, {color,yellow,Laplans} are absorbing all the water in the swamp.\nEventually they\'ll absorb the muddy water too. Then we won\'t event have that to drink.\nWe\'ll die of thirst at this rate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62117, 'Cool story bro... I mean... That\'s pretty serious.\nIf the water in the swamp is gone we\'ll have to change the name and reprint maps...\nSwamp of death maybe?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62118, 'Ok wiseguy. Whatever we do, we must stop them from absorbing any more water. \nFirst we need to request supplies from Elderine and Roumen. \nAlso look for places where there might be water... \nI\'m sorry but it\'s time for you to stop joking and start working.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62119, 'A friend in need is a friend indeed.\nThen I will need to get rid of the {color,yellow,Laplans}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62120, 'Yes, as many as possible! All you can find!\nDefeat as many {color,yellow,Laplans} as possible and bring back 50 {color,yellow,Laplan Leaves}. We might be able to find a solution to this problem by examining the leaves.\nAre you up for it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Not a problem~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me get a drink from Elderin first.][2]'),
(62121, 'I\'ve brought back 50 {color,yellow,Laplan Leaves}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62122, 'You have done well!!\nWe\'ve just gotten a supply from the city ourselves.\nPeople are looking for springs also...\nThank you so much. The Hunter\'s Union owes you one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62123, 'Please bring me 50 {color,yellow,Laplan leaves} then we should be able to find a solution.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62130, 'A Time for Thanks'),
(62131, 'Lord Elbama of Elderine asks you to help him show thanks to all of Isya by helping him gather some key items for his mural.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62132, 'Top of the morning to you, [NAME]! How are you doing today?\n\nI love this time of year and can\'t wait to make my mural. Unfortunately, I have a few issues. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(62133, 'Hi Lord Elbama, I am doing great! Thanks for asking. While I like this time of the year, I dislike how cold it gets. What\'s the problem you\'re having with creating your yearly Thanksgiving mural? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(62134, 'Well that\'s exactly it, I am very excited to get started but with all the crazy things that has happened in Isya recently, I haven\'t had the time to go out and gather all the materials needed to create my mural.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(62135, 'That seems like some poor planning on your part, Elbama.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62136, 'Yes, yes my dear, I know it was terrible planning on my part but when you are in a high position like me, having to deal with these untimed events is a daily occurrence. But since it seems like you have some free time, do you think you can help me out?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(62137, 'I hope I get some cool toys for helping you out! What do you need me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(62138, 'That is some delightful news, [NAME]! I have most of the items but there are a few things that I still require. In order to make the mural stand out and bright, I will need 10 Red Petals, 10 Blue Petals, and 10 Yellow Petals. In order to show thanks to those before us, I will require 10 Sap and 10 Common Mushrooms. Once I have all of these items, I will finally be able to create my yearly mural. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok Lord Elbama, I will get right on this.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh c\'mon Lord Elbama, you are asking me to go around the world for your items, maybe later.][2]  '),
(62139, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the necessary items to make my mural. I can finally get caught up and display my mural for everyone to see. \n\nPlease take these festive items and proudly display them to all of Isya!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(62140, 'Umm, excuse me [NAME]. Didn\'t you say you were going to collect some items for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44520, 'The Reason 1'),
(44521, 'Guiltian thinks there is something behind the Dark Apes and Black Spike Horns collecting the Kurah flowers. Go investigate to see what the real reason is.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44522, 'What has happened to Adealia...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44523, 'I think you have a serious problem. \nCan I ask you what is wrong with the village? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44524, 'Oh...[NAME].\nHmm...\nI don\'t know where I should begin...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44525, 'That\'s OK.  You can tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44526, 'It\'s been a while since I became the chief, but there are more elements threatening the village...\nMonsters are becoming more and more violent... and the elves are being corrupted in Kahal Plains...\nThey say it is related to the black fog, but people have told me that the monsters around the village are gathering Kurah flowers, the specialty of our village, and destroy the beautiful nature. \nIf we don\'t stop them, Adealia can become a barren desert.  \nIt\'s a serious problem...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44527, 'Why the flowers...\nAre they trying to dry out Adealia Village?  Or do Kurah flowers weaken their strength... There should be a reason. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44528, 'Hmm...\nThey are gathering the flowers for something...  The flowers must have an effect that we don\'t know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44529, 'We need to investigate it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44530, 'You should get on it.\nPeople tell me that there are two monsters that are gathering the most Kurah flowers in Adealia.  They are {color,yellow,Dark Apes} and {color,yellow,Black Spike Horns}.\nTake care of these two monsters to save the flowers.\nI\'m sure you can do it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Certainly.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I do it later?][2]'),
(44531, 'I\'m glad you are back safely.  Did you find out why they are gathering Kurah flowers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44532, 'I didn\'t.  There are too many of them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44533, 'It would have been nice to know...\nI see.  Good job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44534, 'Get rid of {color,yellow,Dark Apes} and {color,yellow,Black Spike Horns}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44540, 'The Reason 2'),
(44541, 'Guiltian talks about the monsters that are gathering Kurah flowers.  Help him investigate the issue.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44542, '[NAME]!  I have been waiting for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44543, 'You must need me for something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44544, 'Yes...\nI\'m sorry, you are not even one of us...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44545, 'Don\'t say that.  Just treat me as like any other villagers in Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44546, 'Will do.\nAs you know, I can\'t ask any of the villagers to go out for a job. \nIn fact, I thank them for staying in the village. \nI have to be responsible for them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44547, '(He is very responsible)\nI understand.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44548, 'Let\'s get to business. \nAccording to the resources, {color,yellow,Dark Ape} are the ones that ordered the monsters to gather Kurah flowers.\nYou should check this out.  It\'s a very serious problem. \nIf they resist, there is a solution.  They won\'t be a problem if you bring {color,yellow,the Crystal of Emptiness} from a {color,yellow,Tornados} from the east of village.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44549, 'What is the relationship between {color,yellow,Dark Ape} and {color,yellow,the Crystal of Emptiness}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44550, 'I don\'t know but they hate {color,yellow,the Crystal of Emptiness}.  They are both under the force of darkness. \nThere are so many strange things. \nGo and defeat {color,yellow,Dark Ape} and bring me {color,yellow,the Crystal of Emptiness} from {color,yellow,Tornados}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s too much.][2]'),
(44551, 'Are you back already?  I can\'t believe it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44552, 'I have brought what you asked and taught those {color,yellow,Dark Ape} a lesson.  They won\'t come out for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44553, 'You are so reliable.  You are qualified to become Adealia\'s warrior!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44554, 'Go and defeat {color,yellow,Dark Ape} and bring me {color,yellow,the Crystal of Emptiness} from a {color,yellow,Tornados}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44560, 'Abnormal Exchange'),
(44561, 'A village in the Isya Continent is ordering monsters to buy Kurah flowers at a bargain price.  Find out more information for Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44562, 'It\'s all good... Next time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44563, 'Chief!  Do you have something else for me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44564, 'I am beginning to figure out why they are gathering Kurah flowers.\nIf you investigate a little more, I should be able to find out why Adealia is covered in black fog. \nI owe you. \nThank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44565, 'That\'s what I do!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44566, 'Anyhow, the reason why they are using the animals to gather Kurah flowers...\nIf this is true, it\'s really shocking.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44567, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44568, 'They were asked by a villager to purchase Cura flowers cheap and resell them for higher prices...\nThey never sent backup when we were at a crisis...\nThey are using monsters for their own benefit...\nI can\'t believe... it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44569, 'Which one is it?  I wonder.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44570, 'I don\'t have... proof, so I can\'t tell you for sure...\n\n(Village Guard\'s Report)\nChief!  {color,yellow,Depraved Rangers} and {color,yellow,Great Tornados} are gathering just outside the village!\n\nWhat are they after this time?\nGo and fight {color,yellow,Depraved Rangers} and {color,yellow,Great Tornados} to find out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(44571, 'What were they after this time? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44572, 'Well... I didn\'t find anything peculiar. They didn\'t show any moves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44573, '(Guiltian ponders)\nHmm... There must be something else...\nSomething...\nGo ahead and get some rest for now.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44574, 'Fight {color,yellow,Depraved Rangers} and {color,yellow,Great Tornados}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44580, 'Village\'s Guardian Stone'),
(44581, 'Guiltian is tired of the unknown things happening lately, so he wants to build a guardian stone for the village. Help Guiltian with this task.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44582, 'I need this... This...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44583, 'What is that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44584, 'Hello, [NAME]\nI\'m trying to order a guardian stone to guard the village and "this" is the most important ingredient. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44585, '(So what is that!!)\nIt sounds very important. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44586, 'I need an ore called bernium.  It can\'t be smelted or found in Adealia anymore...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44587, 'Isn\'t there any other way?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44588, 'Listen.  According to my reliable source, the armor of {color,yellow,Depraved Knights} is made of bernium.  \nThis means that you can get the {color,yellow,Depraved Knight\'s Armor} by defeating a {color,yellow,Depraved Knight}.\nDo you want to try? \n\n[BUTTON]=[I do!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m allergic to ores...][2]'),
(44589, 'I\'m glad you are back safely.\nIs {color,yellow,Depraved Knight\'s Armor} really made out of bernium?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44590, 'I think it is...\nYou should show it to an expert.  I can\'t tell...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44591, 'I... see!\nLet\'s take it to the armor maker.  See you later!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44592, 'Defeat {color,yellow,Depraved Knights} and bring the{color,yellow,Depraved Knight\'s Armor} to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44600, 'Kahal Plains\' Problem 1'),
(44601, 'Guiltian says that there are problems in both Adelia and Kahal Plains. Investigate Adealia and Kahal Plains and see whats going on.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44602, 'Kahal Plains... It was not just us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44603, 'Isn\'t there a Hunters\' Association in Kahal Plains?  They should take care of any situation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44604, 'It could be too much for the just three of them.  The number of enemies is increasing and there are just the three oft them.  It may be physically burdening for them... I\'m so worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44605, 'I see... They have done a good job.  It would be nice if Adealia sends dispatch or supplies...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44606, 'The Hunters\' Association made a request in relation to the supplies.\nWe should help them this time...  They are still...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44607, '(There must be something else)\nYes, we should.  What is the message from the Hunters\' Association?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44608, 'The Hunters\' Association is fighting Cursed Elves.  There also are wild beasts.  The {color,yellow,Wild Apes} are attacking the supplies from Adealia..\nWhat is even stranger is that the supplies are being taken to {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Thieves} for some reason.\nEven in Adealia...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44609, 'Something is going on in Kahal Plains like it is in Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44610, 'I don\'t have a good feeling about it.\nGo and defeat {color,yellow,Wild Apes} in Kahal Plains and {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Thieves} in Adealia to find out how they are related.  Hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(44611, 'So?  What did you find?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44612, 'I defeated them.  I seems like the {color,yellow,Wild Apes} are being manipulated by something, but I didn\'t find anything from {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Thieves}..\nI\'m sorry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44613, '(Ponders)\nHmm... I see.  I will get on it with the other villagers.  You can get some rest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44614, 'Find the link between {color,yellow,Wild Apes} and {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Thieves}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44620, 'Kahal Plains\' Problem 2'),
(44621, 'Guiltian keeps talking about the problem in Adealia and Kahal Plains. Help him investigate the issue.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44622, 'Welcome.  I was about to call for you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44623, 'You seem to be busy every day.  You should take care of yourself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44624, 'I have to protect the village...\nuntil the day I die...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44625, '(Old Soldier Guiltian)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44626, 'That\'s enough.  I have a job for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44627, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44628, 'They have captured the enemies that are trying to contaminate Adealia and the Kahal Plains.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44629, 'There must be a reason... Why have they changed to do that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44630, 'That is what we are trying to find out.\nThere is no answer now, but we should be able to get to it eventually. \nGo out at once.  Defeat {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Mages} to the east of Adealia and {color,yellow,Wild LeoPards} in the Kahal Plains!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(44631, 'Didn\'t you find anything strange...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44632, 'No... I didn\'t...\nAll I could see is that they have gone berserk.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44633, 'Berserk...\nWell done...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44634, 'You must defeat {color,yellow,Shadow Elf Mages} and {color,yellow,Wild LeoPards}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44640, 'Kahal Plains\' Problem 3'),
(44641, 'Guiltian keeps talking about the problem in the Kahal Plains. Help him fix this problem.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44642, 'That shrewd...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44643, 'Who?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44644, 'The one that is manipulating the monsters to contaminate Adealia.\nI think it has shifted to Kahal Plains because we are defending Adealia too well. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44645, 'Considering its past...\nYou must be right.  Adealia, Kahal Plains, and back to Kahal Plains...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44646, 'The Hunters\' Association must be cornered.\nGo and help them.  If you stop the monsters this time, it would take them some time to gear up again.  They have been pushing it lately.\nBecause they had to fight you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44647, 'Thank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44648, 'This is your final mission.\nGo to the Kahal Plains and fight {color,yellow,Wild Apes} and {color,yellow,Wild Leopards}.\nOh!  Say hello to Luke and his friends.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(44649, 'Great.  You are not even from Adelia and you do all of this for this town...\nI just burst into tears looking at you...\n(Looks back)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44650, 'Although I am a stranger, it is my job to help those in need.\nI just do what is given to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44651, 'Thank you so much..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44652, 'Fight {color,yellow,Wild Apes} and {color,yellow,Wild Leopards}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44660, 'Adealia\'s Threat'),
(44661, 'Guiltian finds it necessary to stop the powerful monsters that has been threatening the village. Help him defeat these dark forces.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44662, 'There is no one...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44663, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44664, 'I\'m trying to organize Monster Hunters.  As you know there are the heads that are leading the monsters and they have been a big threat to the village and the tourists.\nWe have to do something.\nBut there is no one... No one...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44665, 'You have me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44666, 'You are talented and brave, but you can\'t do it alone.  You need to gather as many warriors as possible...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44667, 'Just let me get on it.  I can gather people or go by myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44668, 'There is difference between confidence and arrogance... I see.  I will listen to you.  Take your talented colleagues and fight {color,yellow,Dark Nepilims} and {color,yellow,Dark  Lichs} in Adealia.\nBe prepared.  Don\'t get distracted.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It sounds easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared.][2]'),
(44669, 'You are back safe! \nDid you defeat all of them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44670, 'Of course.  \nYou can be relieved for now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44671, 'I want to reward the hunters. \nHave something warm and rest yourselves.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44672, 'Don\'t underestimate {color,yellow,Dark Nepilims} and {color,yellow,Dark Lichs}.  They are strong..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44680, 'Unpleasant Memory'),
(44681, 'Guiltian is worried about the depraved group to the south of Adealia.  Go and defeat the depraved group of Spearmen, Rangers, Fighters, and Knights \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44682, '[NAME], welcome.  I have something to talk to you about.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44683, 'Hello!\nBut you still look worried.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44684, 'I feel so anxious.  There are so many things I can\'t understand...\nIf we let this happen, the future of this village is not so bright.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44685, 'Hmm...\nWhat did you want to discuss with me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44686, 'I am most worried about the depraved monsters in the south. \nThey are growing in number and have formed a town...\n(Hesitating)\nActually they were...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44687, '(Something from the past)\nThey are?  What happened in the past?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44688, '(Sighs)\nThey were actually our villagers...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44689, '!?\nThey were the villagers of Adealia?\nI can\'t believe it.  What happened to them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44690, 'They shouldn\'t be in agony.  They should rest in peace.\nIf they grow...\nOh... I don\'t know what to do...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44691, 'I don\'t have all the details, but it sounds agonizing.\nI don\'t know what to say...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44692, 'Please go and free them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s not an easy decision.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it.][2]'),
(44693, 'Did they resist?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44694, 'It must be hard for you, but they are not the people of Adealia anymore.  \nYou should accept the reality.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44695, 'I see... but...\n(Guiltian turns back)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44696, 'Please help them rest in peace...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44700, 'Indelible Past'),
(44701, 'Guiltian asks you to erase his agonizing past.  Collect the Fragment of Darkness from Tornados to help him forget.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44702, '(Guiltian is quiet)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44703, 'Guiltian...\n(Still thinking about the past... It must be hard on him)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44704, 'If I had only... joined the fellowship...\nIt must have not been this cruel...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44705, 'Tell me what happened.\nI will help you as much as I can.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44706, 'Those were peaceful days...\nThen, the black fog began to gather outside the village and all of the men in the village organized the fellowship to get ready for the threat.\nIt was led by Karen, the chief at that time... She was so beautiful and brave.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44707, '(Karen)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44708, 'The fellowship arrived near the black fog and discovered a black hole that was producing it. \nKaren focused on filling that hole and her powers filled the hole slowly. \nBut...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44709, 'What happened while she was filling the hole?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44710, 'The hole began to grow and the power of the black fog began to flow back.  Karen was forced into the hole by an unknown force.\nThe rest of the people began to change because of that force...\nAs time passed, they began to kill one another.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44711, 'So the depraved people...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44712, 'Yes... The survivors of that massacre.\nThe young men of Adealia..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44713, 'I see.  I finally got the last puzzle in place.\nWhy weren\'t you there?  There must be something else...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44714, 'Stop... Stop... Stop it!!\nI have a headache...\nI have to take a rest.  I... I have a request.\nI heard that if you gather and process {color,yellow,the Fragment of Darkness}, it will help you forget the past.\nI can no longer...\nPlease... gather {color,yellow,the Fragment of Darkness} from Tornados...\n\n[BUTTON]=[For you, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about doing it yourself?][2]'),
(44715, 'Where is the... fragment...?\nOh... You haven\'t..\nMy head...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44716, 'You can\'t get weak.  Chief!  I have {color,yellow,the Fragment of Darkness}. What do I do with it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44717, 'Take it to... Aertsina...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44718, 'Help... Me... Forget... Get me {color,yellow,the Fragment of Darkness}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44720, 'Time of Confusion 1'),
(44721, 'Aertsina talks about Guiltian\'s past.  Defeat Apes in Adealia and the Kahal Plains.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44722, '[NAME]!  Did you look for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44723, 'Please take this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44724, 'This is... {color,yellow, the Fragment of Darkness} for the potion that erases your past memory for a while...\nWhy are you giving this to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44725, '(Talk to her about Guiltian)\nSo the Chief asked me to bring it to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44726, '(Sighs deeply)\nAgain... Chief always thinks about the past and gets himself back the nightmare...\nAnyways, thank you for working for him. \nChief never trusts outsiders... But you must be special.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44727, 'Well... I try to work hard... Ha ha!\nBut why didn\'t he join the fellowship?  Was there a reason?  \nI\'m curious. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44728, 'I\'ll tell you since you have the Chiefs trust.\nI heard that the Chief was recovering from a injury that he got at a battle before the fellowship left.  \nSo the Chief stayed behind to heal.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44729, '(It wasn\'t anything critical)\nOh... That\'s why he couldn\'t go with them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44730, 'The problem is the battle that he was injured in.  He still can\'t go to sleep since he is thinking about it...\n(Sigh)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44731, 'Tell me about the battle.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44732, 'He was attacked by a group of {color,yellow, Wild Apes} running at him on his way back to Adealia from the Kahal Plains.\n{color,yellow, Wild Apes} were tame before that. \nI am sure anyone would have hesitated to fight {color,yellow, Wild Apes} in that situation because they used to be friendly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44733, 'Was it when Adealia was covered in that black fog?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44734, 'Probably..\nI\'m not sure, but I heard that was when the animals became vicious.  You know what happened after that...\nI have a request.  Defeat {color,yellow, Wild Apes} and {color,yellow,Dark Apes}, the monsters the Chief hates the most.  I feel sorry for him and all I can do is to ask talented adventurers to fight for his retaliation. \nI will make the potion for the Chief while you fight {color,yellow, Apes}.\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t say no.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to stay out of it.][2]'),
(44735, 'Thank you so much.  I am sure this will relieve the Chief.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44736, 'Hmm... There seems to be many things that I don\'t know.  I want to go and investigate.\nPlease take a good care of the Chief.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44737, 'Oh!  Look for Bunis.  He could tell you more about Chief.\nStay safe.. May the blessing of Isya be with you...\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44738, '{color,yellow, Wild Apes} and {color,yellow,Dark Apes}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44740, 'Time of Confusion 2'),
(44741, 'Bunis whats you to collect items for him if you want to know more about Chief Guiltian\'s past. Collect The Fragments of Souls and Leopard\'s Teeth from Black Spike Horns and Wild LeoPards.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44742, 'Hey, [NAME]!  What brings you here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44743, 'Actually, I am here to hear about Chief Guiltian\'s past...\nAertsina told me to talk to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44744, 'I am the source of all the information.\nLet me see... The Chief\'s past?\nHmm...\nI remember hearing something like that a long time ago. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44745, 'Really?  Can you tell me a little bit?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44746, 'Hmm... I barely remember it...\nOh!  You know what? \nI\'m making a new doll... I need two special materials to make this special doll...\nIf you can help me find them, I will retrieve my memory and talk to some people to refresh my memory about the Chief\'s story.\nHow about that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44747, 'Deal!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44748, 'What you need to get for my special doll are {color,yellow,the Fragments of Souls} and {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Teeth}. \nIf you get me these two materials, I should be able to provide the information you need.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like dolls.][2]'),
(44749, 'Did you find them?\nOh... My special doll is finally done!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44750, 'It\'s your turn to return the favor. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44751, 'Of course.  It was challenging.\nHmm... Where do I begin?\nIt\'s a story about Karen, the former chief of the village.\nYou have heard of her, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44752, 'The Chief told me a little about her...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44753, 'After she fell into the hole of darkness and was captured by the force of darkness, she is hiding somewhere and waiting for a chance to attack Adealia... That\'s what I heard.  \nI think all the strange things happening in Adealia are related to her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44754, 'Hmm... There is no reason for Karen to turn her back against Adealia, don\'t you think?\nI\'m sure she didn\'t go into the hole because of the fellowship...\nIs there something we don\'t know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44755, 'That sounds right... \nBut this is only a presumption.  We need more information.\nI\'ll find more about it and let you know.\nLet me get back to my doll then. \nOh!  Chief Guiltian is feeling better now.  Why don\'t you go see him?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44756, 'My doll needs {color,yellow,the Fragments of Souls} and {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Teeth}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44760, 'Reinvestigation 1'),
(44761, 'Guiltian seems to be feeling better but still needs some rest.  Go and talk with the Chief of Roumen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44762, '(Sighs)\nWhat a relief\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44763, 'How do you feel?  I heard you are feeling better!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44764, '[NAME].\nThank you.  I owe you.  Aertsina told me everything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44765, 'Don\'t mention it..\n(Talking about the past can worsen his conditions)\nI am happy to see you better. \nI\'ll see you later...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44766, '[NAME], anything wrong?\nYou look anxious...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44767, 'No.  I want to give you more time to get some rest...  I don\'t want to bother you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44768, 'Really?  Then, I won\'t stop you.\nI\'ll get some rest and come back.  We have more to talk about. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44769, 'I will.\n\n(Let\'s go and talk to the chief of Roumen)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Roumen.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s stay in Adelia.][2]'),
(44770, 'Oh...[NAME], you seem to be in a hurry...\nThere must be a reason that brought you here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44771, 'You are right.  You are good. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44772, 'Well... It\'s written on your face...\nLet\'s get down to business.  What do you want to know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44773, 'Do you know anything about Adealia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44774, 'Adealia...Adealia...\nI heard about it when I was younger...\nThere was a big incident that involved Adealia..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44775, 'That\'s right!\nDo you know anything about that incident?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44776, 'Wait...\n(Looks into the notebook)\nI wrote down something when I was young, but I don\'t know if it can be any help.\nDo you still want to hear it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44777, 'Of course! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44778, 'Here it is.\n\n(No one ever saw the Fellowship of Adealia again.  Then, Karen attacked Adealia trying to destroy the village.  The village was saved by a young warrior called Roumen.\n\n...(Omitted)\n\nLater, a visitor from Adealia came to Roumen and he passed away after saying these words: \nThose with the power of darkness are coming to destroy the village.  If they are not stopped, the Isya Continent will be captured in the swirl of shock and fear. \nThey... must be... stopped)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44779, '(Karen)\nHmm... It\'s all so confusing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44780, 'That\'s all I know.  You should find out the rest yourself. \nOh, find {color,yellow, Adrian}, the Chief of {color,yellow, Uruga}. \nShe must know something..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44781, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44790, 'Reinvestigation 2'),
(44791, 'Roumenus, the Chief of Rumen, tells you to find Adrian, the Chief of Uruga.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44792, 'Find {color,yellow, Adrian}, the Chief of {color,yellow, Uruga}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Uruga.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s stay in Rumen.][2]'),
(44793, 'Oh, long time no see, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44794, 'Hello, Adrian.\nI\'m here to ask you something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44795, 'Oh!  A question?\nI wonder what it is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44796, 'Well...\nI wanted to know if you are aware of Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44797, '(Looks serious)\nAdealia...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44798, '(She must know something)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44799, 'Adealia, the cursed village.\nEven Abalita could not save them from the tragedy...\nIs that what you are talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44800, 'Yes.  That\'s right...\n(The cursed village?  Adealia?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44801, 'I don\'t know if this is true, but most people in the Isya Continent are reluctant to talk about it.\nIt\'s ominous.\nI don\'t know much about its story, but I don\'t feel like talking more about it. \nI\'m sorry, but I can\'t talk to you anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44802, '...\nI see...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44803, 'Don\'t feel bad.  If a rumor starts, the people of Uruga would be worried.\nI can\'t help you concerning that village.  For anything else, please feel free to come back anytime. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44804, 'Thank you. \n\n(Elbama of Elderine must know more)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44805, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44810, 'Reinvestigation 3'),
(44811, 'That leaves Elbama, the Chief of Elderine.  Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44812, 'Welcome, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44813, 'Hello, Elbama.\nI have something to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44814, 'Is it something important?\nWell.\nWhat is it? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44815, 'Are you aware of Adealia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44816, 'Yes, I am.\nHas anything happened to Adealia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44817, '(I think she has much information)\nOh, no, but I wanted to know more about that village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44818, '(Ponders)\nAdealia...\nIt had a female Chief that was just like me.  But then, the Chief and all of the young men were cursed and disappeared.\nElderine once dispatched rescuers to save Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44819, 'Really?\nWhat happened to them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44820, 'None of the people who had left to Adealia found their way back.\nThey must be... the only ones who know what happened.\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44821, '(How did Roumen make it to Adealia)\nIf Elderine sent rescuers, Roumen or Ugura could have also... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44822, 'Well, I don\'t know.  They could have.\nThe results would have been same as Elderine...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44823, 'Each village sent out rescuers and they didn\'t make it back...\nDon\'t you know that Karen, the former chief, attacked Adealia with the power of darkness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44824, '(Hmm... He knows a lot...)\nIs that true? \nI think I heard that, but Karen failed to conquer Adealia and Adealia was forgotten after that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44825, '(She knew about it)\nI see.  So Karen must be the last one who knows all about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44826, 'I don\'t think she is still human.\nOh, look at the time.  I have an appointment.\nI\'ll talk to you later...\nGood bye.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44827, '(She is hiding something)\nThank you for sharing.  Bye.\n\n(Let\'s go back to Adealia)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44830, 'Wandering Soul'),
(44831, 'Guiltian in Adealia wants you to investigate the Wandering Souls in Psiken Gardens. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44832, 'I have been waiting for you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44833, 'I just got back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44834, 'I have news.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44835, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44836, 'Pergy and Leopard in the Kahal Plains were relatively friendly.  It has been reported that they are quickly decreasing in number. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44837, 'Didn\'t all animals in the Kahal Plains become violent after the black fog came about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44838, 'They must have been affected.  But it is strange that they are decreasing in numbers.\nI think someone is using those animals to do something...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44839, 'I heard that they inject the power of darkness to produce depraved people, but I don\'t know why they are taking the animals...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44840, 'That\'s what I want to find out..\nPeople are easily seduced by evil powers, but animals...\nThey are just hypnotized to lose themselves and become vicious...\nI can\'t see them disappear.  They used to safeguard the nature of the Kahal Plains after all. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44841, '(There must be something else to it)\nI see.  What should I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44842, 'There are villagers who saw the animals migrate to Psiken\'s Mansion from the Kahal Plains.  They are taken while howling and becoming wandering souls.\nPlease get on this.\nIf this is true, the best way would be to free their souls. \nI am counting on you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Please do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s eerie.][2]'),
(44843, 'Was the rumor true?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44844, 'Yes, they have lost their bodies and are wandering as souls. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44845, '(Sad face)\nWhy... who... for what... \nthey are doing this...\nIt\'s all my fault...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44846, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44850, 'Warrior\'s Soul'),
(44851, 'Giltian is saddened by what is happening in Adealia.  Hunt down the Shadow Elves and collect the Symbol of Courage.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44852, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44853, 'Chief...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44854, 'Oh, it\'s you...\nWhat brings you here?\nI don\'t want to see anybody for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44855, 'Cheer up.  What if something happens to the village?\nYou should get a grip. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44856, '(Looks down)\nHmm...\nYou are right.  I should cheer up to calm the people...\nYou are so right, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44857, 'You used to be a talented warrior.  Where is the soul of that warrior? \nAre you going to give in like this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44858, '(Guiltian has no words to say)\nIf you were from Adealia, everything would have been different..\nThe past tragedy and the current sadness...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44859, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44860, 'I get it..\nAll this time I never realized it.\nYou opened up my eyes.  I\'m sorry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44861, 'You are Guiltian, the brave warrior.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44862, 'Thank you. \nI will let go of the past. \nThey are cursed elves growing their powers to the east of the village.  They are separated from the Kahal Plains.\nThey are becoming a bigger threat to Adealia as they are growing in number. \nDo you get it?\nDefeat them and gather {color,yellow,the Symbol of Courage} that they used to carry.  They don\'t deserve it anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something else to do.][2]'),
(44863, 'I\'m glad you are back safe.\nHow are the elves? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44864, 'They have certainly grown in number as you suspected.  I cut them in half, so they won\'t be able to act up for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44865, 'I see... This is only the beginning.\nWell done...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44866, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44870, 'Time for Retaliation'),
(44871, 'Guiltian is back on the job and hopes to conquer the monsters. Help him defeat Dark Apes, Black Spike Horns, Tornados, and Great Tornados. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44872, '[NAME], it will be a busy day today.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44873, 'I need to get some rest!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44874, 'I know, but it will only get harder if we delay... You know that, right.\nPlease keep working hard for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44875, 'If you ask me...\nWhat should I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44876, 'I have been thinking about it and I think Karen is behind everything. \nThere could be something manipulating Karen...\nAnyways, I think she is using animals or elves to threaten Adealia because she failed to conquer it in the past.  \nNo matter who is behind it all we need to stop it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44877, 'I see.  I agree with you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44878, 'I think it\'s wiser to take matters into our own hands before it gets out of control. \nYou know that defending won\'t give you victory. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44879, 'That means you want to attack them preemptively?  And go after the monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44880, 'Yes.  We should get them before they get us.  If it works, they will be caught off guard.  Then, we should be able to take initiatives and have many advantages.\nThe key to this operation is you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44881, '!?\nI can feel the weight on my shoulders...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44882, 'Please reduce the number of monsters across Adealia.  I will discuss the future of this village with the villagers. \nThank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[For Adealia!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have a stomachache.][2]'),
(44883, 'Did my plan work?  Weren\'t they prepared for it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44884, 'They seemed confused and surprised.  That made it easier for me to conquer them.\nYour plan was good.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44885, 'Hmm...\nWell done.  You can get some rest now and wait for my next order.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44886, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44890, 'Remedy'),
(44891, 'Aertsina is worried about Guiltian and wants to make a remedy for his illness. Collect Kurah Petals so Aertsina can whip up a remedy.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44892, 'He shouldn\'t overwork himself...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44893, 'Aertsina?  What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44894, 'I am so worried about the Chief.  He has all the responsibilities, but he has to think about his age...\nHe is not looking after himself.\nIf something happens to him, our village...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44895, 'You shouldn\'t be so worried.  I think ambition gives strength and makes people healthier. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44896, 'You may be right, but Guiltian also has a physical illness. \nAlthough he doesn\'t know about it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44897, '(Illness?)\nWhat...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44898, 'You must not tell him.  He might kill himself if he finds out.  He would rather die than live with illness...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44899, 'Hmm, I didn\'t know.  Guiltian is ill...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44900, 'It gets worse when he is excited or angry.  It is critical for him since he is ill-tempered.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44901, 'Is there any medicine for it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44902, 'There is one... but it\'s too complicated.  I don\'t know if I can make it...\nIf it causes side effects...\nThen, The Chief...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44903, 'You are a fool to say that.  What are the ingredients?  I will get them.  In the meantime, you should study the directions for making it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44904, '...\nOh... OK.  I\'ll do my best.\nThe only ingredient I need is Kurah Petals.  \nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll save The Chief!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m allergic to flowers...][2]'),
(44905, 'I have been waiting for you.  I know how to make it now. Give me the supplies...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44906, 'With your truthful heart to save The Chief, it won\'t be so hard.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44907, '...\nPlease go and get somea rest.  I\'ll let you know if it works.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44908, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44940, 'Hidden Threat'),
(44941, 'Guiltian found out about Psiken and asks you to take care of it.  Go to Psiken\'s Mansion and defeat the beast.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44942, 'Psiken\'s Mansion...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44943, 'Hello!  Chief, you look better today. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44944, 'Welcome.  You are always here when I need you. \nYou and I must have been in a special relationship in our past lives. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44945, 'Ha ha, I guess you are right. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44946, 'A monster called Psiken is threatening the villagers and tourists. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44947, 'Is it that strong? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44948, 'I don\'t know, but there are many scary monsters in Psiken\'s Mansion. \nPsiken is known to manipulate monsters\' souls.  It may be a challenging opponent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44949, 'Something like a soul controller...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44950, 'It\'s just a rumor.  Why don\'t you go and see it for yourself?\nFind out why that mansion was built and why Psiken exists. \nIt would be very helpful for us.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44951, 'It sounds eerie, but I\'m not scared.  I\'ll go for it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44952, 'Good, go to Psiken\'s Mansion and defeat {color,yellow, Psiken}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Psiken\'s Mansion.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared.][2]'),
(44953, 'Oh, you are back.\nHow was Psiken? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(44954, 'Well... It was like a child.  It looked innocent, but it was vicious.  It looked like it was being controlled by something...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44955, 'Anyways, well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(44956, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44920, 'Valentine\'s Day Surprise!'),
(44921, 'Town Chief Roumenus of Roumen asks you to help retrieve the stolen Valentine\'s Cards and flowers so he can help spread the word of love.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44922, 'Sniff.....Sniff.....Oh hello [NAME], I didn\'t see you there. Sorry for looking like a mess, today has turned out to be a terrible day.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44923, 'Oh no, Roumenus, what\'s wrong? Did something happen? Is everything ok?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44924, 'Absolutely not [NAME]! Everything is ruined! I thought this was going to be the year but, but....It\'s all gone. What am I going to do? My reputation is going to be ruined.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(44925, 'Hold on a second, can we back up a little bit. What happened? I might be able to help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44926, 'Oh I\'m sorry, I got ahead of myself. The monsters, those evil creatures stole all of the Valentine\'s cards, candy, and flowers I was going to give out to the citizens. With Valentine\'s Day around the corner, there\'s no way I\'m going to be able to get another batch ready in time.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(44927, 'Mischievous little things those monsters can be, I bet it was the Honeyings. Fear not Roumenus, lucky for you I am an expert sleuth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44928, 'That is some delightful news, [NAME]! When I noticed this morning that all of my gifts were stolen, I saw a trail of candy out of my window. I think if you explore outside of the city, you will be able to find the monsters that stole my cards. The monsters took 50 Valentine\'s Day Cards and 50 Heart Candies. Also, if you don\'t mind could you collect 20 Red Petals, 20 Blue Petals, and 20 Yellow Petals so I can recreate my bouquet.  \n                                                             [BUTTON]=[Sure, the expert sleuth is on the job.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m not really interested in spreading the word of love right now.][2]  '),
(44929, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for returning my gifts to all the citizens. Everyone will be excited to receive their gifts. \n\nI\'ve been working on this prototype item for quite sometime and it is finally ready. I want you to take it and show your love to the world. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44930, 'Umm, excuse me [NAME]. I thought you were an expert sleuth?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44960, 'The Great Easter Egg Hunt'),
(44961, 'Kid Woz of Elderine has had this Easter Eggs, Raffle Tickets, and Chocolate stolen from him and asks you to help him retrieve it from the mosters that stole it from him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44962, 'Sniff, sniff... Hi [NAME]. Sorry that you have to see me like that, I just woke up to the worse day of my life! I don\'t know what I\'m going to do... Sniff, sniff.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44963, 'Oh no, Kid Woz. What happened? It the Easter season so there shouldn\'t be anything that you should be sad about. Did you dog go missing again? Is your brother picking on you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44964, 'NO [NAME], it\'s even worse than that! My plan was to win the annual Easter Egg Hunt and hopefully win the raffle for the really awesome Honeying tanktop and hat but I woke up this morning and everything was gone! All that hard work searching and obtaining raffle tickets and it was for nothing! I\'m going to be an embarrassment to my friends.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(44965, 'Hold on a second, this sound rather fishy, have you asked your brother if he is playing a trick on you? It seems rather odd that all of your stuff would just vanish from thin air.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44966, 'Yes, at first I didn\'t believe him so I went to my Mom and after she confronted him, I realized that he didn\'t have it.\n\nI did find one thing weird this morning. When I woke up, there was some slime residue on my window... I wonder if it were the monsters around Isya that stole all of my things. Oh [NAME], do you think you can check for me, I am almost certain that it was them.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(44967, 'Sure Kid Woz, I have some free time to help you out. What all did you lose? I will go an find them for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44968, 'That is some delightful news, [NAME]! I lost 50 Easter Eggs, 25 Easter Raffle Tickets, and 25 pieces of Easter Chocolate. I am certain if you defeat the monsters around Isya, you will find them.  \n                                                             [BUTTON]=[Ok Kid Woz, I\'m going to make your day!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, your stuff could be anywhere by now, maybe later.][2]  '),
(44969, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me back all of my stuff, I can finally turn it in and attempt to win this year\'s Easter festivities.\n\nPlease take these festive items and proudly display them to all of Isya!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44970, 'Umm, excuse me [NAME]. Didn\'t you say you were going to collect some items for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44980, 'The Message 1'),
(44981, 'Edwina of Adealia says there\'s a strange energy moving around Kahal Plains.\nDeliver Edwina\'s message to Marlene, Guard Nell, and Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44982, 'I sense a negative energy in Kahal Plains, do you know anything about this phenomenon [NAME]? I started to feel the negative energy a few days ago and it hasn\'t stopped. It feels so dark and malicious and I can feel it getting stronger. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44983, 'You know, I\'ve been hearing these stories from others about this small cave in Kahal Plains that no one will go near. They say that strange things have been happening and whenever you get close, all happiness is drained from your body.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(44984, 'That certainly seems out of the ordinary. Hmm... I think it might be time that we form an expedition party to investigate this cave. Would you deliver this message to Marlene, Guard Nell, and Town Chief Guiltian? \n\nPlease deliver the message to Marlene first, I think he should be the first to know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m busy. Maybe later....][2]'),
(44985, 'Excuse me! Marlene!\nI have an urgent message from Edwina!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44986, '... Deliver the message to Marlene first.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44990, 'The Message 2'),
(44991, 'Deliver the message to Marlene.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44992, 'A message from Edwina?\nHmm... I wonder what\'s happening... \n\n(Reads the letter)\n\nThis is indeed strange, I will gladly help Edwina in this manner.\n[NAME]! Please hurry and deliver the message to Guard Nell immediately.\nI urge your to hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(44993, 'Don\'t worry Marlene, I will move faster than the speed of light to deliver the message to Guard Nell!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(44994, 'You haven\'t left yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45000, 'The Message 3'),
(45001, 'Deliver the message to Guard Nell.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45002, 'This is urgent, please do me a favor and deliver the message to Guard Nell.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45003, 'Guard Nell! Guard Nell!\n(Thinks to self) I wonder if he fell asleep?\n... Guard Nell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45004, 'Hmm... Huh?!\nAh! It\'s you.\nSorry about that, it was break time for me so I was taking a nap.\n\n... What? A Letter? From Edwina? Oh this letter must be important and urgent.\nPlease give it to me. \nHmm... (Slowly reads the letter)\nI can\'t believe that it took this long for this news to get to me, I wonder why Edwina waited till now to tell me? Please let Edwina know that I received the message.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45005, 'Why are you still standing here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45010, 'The Message 4'),
(45011, 'The message has been delivered to Guard Nell, it\'s time to take the message to Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45012, 'It\'s time for me to go. I will see you later, Guard Nell!\nI think its time for me to go visit Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45013, 'Hey Town Chief Guiltian, you busy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45014, 'Oh hi, [NAME]. What\'s going on?\nOh you have a message for me? It\'s an urgent message from Edwina?\n(Quickly reads the letter)\nHmm... I figured something like this was going on. Thanks for the message, I need to go make my preparations.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45015, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45020, 'The Response'),
(45021, 'Return to Edwina with the Guiltian\'s reply.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45022, 'I must return to Edwina and deliver Guiltian\'s response.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45023, 'Edwina!\nI\'ve returned with Guiltian\'s reply. \nHe told me that you can count on him, he will do whatever it takes to help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45024, 'Thank you again [NAME], for helping me out.\nAhh yes, Guiltian is a reliable leader.\nIt seems like while people are willing to help, they are all busy increasing the fortifications of the villages.\nWhile we can\'t get their help, we still need to investigate the strange disturbances in Kahal Plains.\nCould I ask another favor from you [NAME]?\nCould you go investigate Kahal Plains and report back to me with your findings? \nPlease let me know when you are ready.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45025, '... ... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45030, 'Paving the Road'),
(45031, 'Edwina is worried that the soldiers hired to help investigate the caves will not be effective because of the monsters surround the cave. Edwina has asked you to defeat the LeoPards that block the entrance to the cave in Thorn Cave.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45032, '[NAME] as you know Kahal Plains is a dangerous place.\nWhen leading an army, it is very important to have your strongest warriors out on the front lines in order to push forward. I\'d like you to lead the front lines.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45033, 'One army cannot take out al the monsters in Kahal Plains. My troops and I will take care of Raccoons and Apes, why don\'t you take care of LeoPards? \n\nGood luck in your battles and don\'t worry other warriors will be there to assist you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am afraid this is too much for me.][2]'),
(45034, 'Edwina, I have returned from slaying the LeoPards! What is the status of the group to investigate the cave?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45035, '... ... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45040, 'Suspicious Help 1'),
(45041, 'Marlene has received word from Lord Elbama of Elderine that he will help with the expedition group. Before Lord Elbama will help, he has asked for the Beaks of Battle Beak in Kahal Plains.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45042, 'Ah, hello [NAME] I was wondering when you would come around. I have some great news!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45043, 'Good news? What is it? Did you find something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45044, 'Haha, no not at all.\nLord Elbama of Elderine has sent word that he is willing to help us.... Under one condition that is.\n\nNonetheless, he has assured me that he would provide an additional 300 soldiers... This should provide us with enough support to clear out Kahal Plains!\nCould you do me a favor and deliver Battle Beak\'s Beak. Once we deliver the items to Lord Elbama, he will provide us with the soldiers.\nThis is a great deal!\nPlease [NAME], can you deliver the package to Lord Elbama for me? .\n\n[BUTTON]=[What a great deal! Of course I will help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Lord Elbama? I don\'t like him, maybe later.][2]'),
(45045, 'Lord Elbama! I have arrived with your package of Battle Beak\'s Beak.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45046, 'Oh, you finally made it...\nThank you for bringing me my package. Here are my soldiers, please take them to Marlene. \nI will see you later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45047, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45050, 'Suspicious Help 2'),
(45051, 'To return the favor from Lord Elbama, Marlene has asked to help collect Ape Skins.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45052, 'Hi, [NAME].\nThank you very much for your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45053, 'It\'s no problem at all, I\'m glad that I can be of help to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45054, 'Yes, your help has been greatly appreciated. I\'ve received world from Elbama and he has provided us a method to eliminate the monsters in Kahal Plains. He says we should disguise ourselves to look like one of them!   All we have to do is use the Ape Skins to cover our bodies in hopes that we can blend in with their species, allowing us to get close. \n\n[NAME], could you please hunt down the Apes and gather their Skins and deliver it to Lord Elbama. I believe a 50 Ape Skins will do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[What a great idea, you can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even a child could come up with a better idea!][2]'),
(45055, 'Here are the Ape Skins, Lord Elbama. Do you really think this idea will work?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45056, 'Of course, this idea will work, it\'s common sense! If we cover ourselves with the monsters skins, not only will we look like Apes but we will smell like one as well. I believe that these monsters are dumb enough that this will be enough of a disguise to protect us from them.... I used this strategy once on a Slime.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45057, '... Where are all the Ape Skins?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45060, 'Irrationality 1'),
(45061, 'Lord Elbama of Elderine believes that we can infiltrate the cave in Kahal Plains by disguising ourselves like Apes. To further improve the disguise, he requires the blood of Giant Red Condors.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45062, 'Why hello [NAME]\nI\'ve been waiting for you! I believe that we have enough Monster Skins but we now need some monster blood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45063, 'Excuse me? Monster blood? What for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45064, 'Yes, we need to acquire some monster blood. We can only visually deceive the monsters using our monster costumes, if we can find monster blood, we can also deceive their noses! I have done my research and it seems like Red Condor\'s Blood is the best. Could you please go get some so we can finish our disguises?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm... This is rather weird but I\'ll get it][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Could you please stop with this nonsense!][2]'),
(45065, 'Hi Lord Elbama, I have returned with the Red Condor Blood. I still don\'t get it, how are we suppose to fool the monsters with their blood? They were extremely violent to each other.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45066, 'Are you challenging my wealth of knowledge? Maybe you should do your research before challenging my plans, all I asked you to do was do the job, no thinking.\n\nDon\'t you have another job to finish? Or go to sleep, you look tired.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45067, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45070, 'Irrationality 2'),
(45071, 'Lord Elbama of Elderine believes that if the expedition party covers themselves with Monster skins and blood, the monsters will not attack the expedition party.\n\nI should get him the blood of Ruga.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45072, 'Hello again [NAME]. The experiment is going well, the prototype has been built and the experiments have been successful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45073, 'What? This can\'t be right... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45074, 'I don\'t understand why you\'ve been so negative about this plan from day 1. Why can\'t you trust my intuition? I am the Lord of Elderine, I would think that deserves a little trust. Besides, why would I try to deceive you?\n\nJust trust me on this one... Can you go and get the blood from Ruga in Kahal Plains? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir. I will trust you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I cannot trust you any more!][2]'),
(45075, 'Here you go, Elbama. I\'ve brought you the blood of Ruga. How\'s the experiiment going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45076, 'I don\'t think it\'s wise to tell you about the experiment. All I can tell you is you will have to wait because the experiment has not been completed yet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45077, '...... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45080, 'Helping Hand 1'),
(45081, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga ran into Guiltian while visiting Kahal Plains. It\'s time to deliver the resources for Uruga and deliver the Letter to Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45082, 'Why hello [NAME]. How are you doing? Word is that you and Town Chief Guiltian of Adealia are very close, is this true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45083, 'Where did you hear this? I would say that we are friends but we aren\'t close by any means.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45084, 'Ahh, my apologizes, I must have gotten the wrong information. The reason why I bring it up is because when I was in Kahal Plains last, I ran into Town Chief Guiltian. We are merely acquaintances so we didn\'t really have a chance to talk much. \n\nHe told me that he was extremely busy investigating Kahal Plains and I would like to help him out. I hope that by giving him a helping hand, we will be able to get an update on everything that is going on with the investigation. Kahal Plains is too far from Uruga and I cannot leave at the moment. Can you [NAME] deliver these resources and letter   to him?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wow! This is really great! I\'ll give it to him right away!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I don\'t want to do that.][2]'),
(45085, 'Town Chief Guiltian! I have some great news!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45086, 'Oh? What are you so excited about?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45087, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45090, 'Helping Hand 2'),
(45091, 'Town Chief Adrian is asking Town Chief Guiltian for his help.\nHowever, Guiltian is hesitant to help because of his past experiences with Lord Elbama.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45092, '(Explains while handing over the Letter and Resources)\nBlah blah ... \nSo, that\'s how it happened. Isn\'t it great?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45093, '... ... Hmm, [NAME].\nThanks, but... I don\'t think I need your help.\nI do not want to read the letter and please take these resources back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45094, 'What? What are you talking about? What do you mean you don\'t need help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45095, 'It\'s exactly what I mean, I do not need anyone\'s help\nThe thought process of both Uruga and Elderine are so different from our village.\nI also believe that the distance results in a difference in what we believe in... \nI will not tolerate anymore loss. I am the leader of this village and I will not allow anymore losses to happen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45096, 'But Town Chief Guiltian, the Town Chief Adrian is completely different!\nTown Chief Adrian does not offer her help just for her own profits. She is a very reasonable leader and understands what it means to give and take. I can vouch for Town Chief Adrian. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45097, 'I see... I\'m not saying that I don\'t believe what you\'re saying but I don\'t want any other villages to be involved in our village\'s affairs. \n\nThe other villages don\'t feel the immediate threat of what\'s going on in Kahal Plains. This current situation is a situation of life and death for us. I personally don\'t know if we want to waste resources by seeking the help of the other villages. \n\nDo you see what I\'m trying to say here? I can handle this myself, I just wish I could have done something about this sooner...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45098, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45100, 'Helping Hand 3'),
(45101, 'Get back to Town Chief Adrian and return her the letter and resources.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45102, 'I\'m sorry, [NAME]\nI know it was difficult for you to get here but please take everything back.\nTell Town Chief Adrian that I appreciate the help but I kindly reject her request.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45103, 'Hi Town Chief Adrian...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45104, 'Welcome back [NAME]! How was the journey? Wait, what are you carrying with you? Those are the resources... Did Guiltian reject our offer?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45105, 'Yes, I guess there is a long feuded history with Lord Elbama and Town Chief Guiltian...\n(Explains what happened and what Guiltian told him)\nSo basically, he would not accept any assistance from the other villages.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45106, 'Ah... I always wondered why they did not like each other, it makes perfect sense now. If I had known of this earlier, I would have taken a different approach. Alright, I guess we will have to go a different route.  We don\'t need any more information. We will just help him without his approval. \n\nI can protect the village by myself.   Take my 200 well-trained soldiers to Town Chief Guiltian. I will provide them as a gesture of good faith. Tell him to accept this gift as an act of friendship.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45107, 'What\'s going to happen to you? Your forces will be depleted and you won\'t be able to defend.\nWhat if the monsters attack while our defenses are weak?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45108, 'HAHA! You don\'t have to worry about that one, [NAME].\nUruga is very strong. Just take a look around. This village has gone through many battles and history has proven the village is resistant.\n\nNo go, [NAME]! We do not have time to waste. As soon as you get there, tell him what I told you. \nOnce you leave, I will prepare the troops.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45109, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45110, 'Helping Hand 4'),
(45111, 'It\'s time to go visit Guiltian and tell him the news.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45112, 'It\'s time for you to go back. Tell him, this is a friendly gesture and I don\'t expect any favors in return. Just tell him that we fight on the same side and we are here to help. As a friend and as family.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45113, 'Town Chief Guiltian! Sorry, you seem extremely busy but I have something to tell you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45114, 'Oh [NAME], you\'re back.\nI don\'t really have much time to talk but what\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45115, 'Yes, I am really sorry for bothering you but I have an urgent message for Town Chief Adrian. Town Chief Adrian wants to help you and the people of Adealia. Please take the help as an act of friendship. She does not expect anything in return. She wants to offer her help as a friend and as family. \n\nPlease take her help, she will do everything in her power to help you, Guiltian and the village of Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45116, '... But... \n... ... \n... ... ... \nI guess I have no choice... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45117, 'I know that there aren\'t many soldiers based in Uruga. Town Chief Adrian said she would take care of the village herself, she did not want Adealia Village to be in jeopardy. \n\nAdrian meant these things from the bottom of her heart. She did not want you to bear all the risks and responsibilities by yourself.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45118, 'I feel very ashamed... I wasn\'t expecting this sort of compassion from her. To think that no one cared was so stupid of me. I know this is a poor excuse but I thought we had totally different interests and views.\n... \nPlease tell Town Chief Adrian that as a friend, I don\'t know how to thank her enough for her compassion and help.  \nI seriously mean it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45119, 'Return to Town Chief Adrian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45120, 'Thorn Cave 1'),
(45121, 'Town Chief Guiltian has found cause of the  disturbances in Thorn Cave.\nHe is recruiting adventurers who are willing to investigate the cave.\nHe asks adventurers to defeat Vampire ViVi\'s and Fog ViVi\'s from the Thorn Cave.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45122, '[NAME]. Thanks to you and Uruga\'s soldiers, I finally have had the time to research the cave and the strange shield in the southern part of Kahal Plains.\nI\'ve found that there are a lot of long thorny bushes inside the cave and we named it \'Thorn Cave\'...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45123, 'Thorn Cave... Clever name.\nHave you been able to investigate the inside of the cave?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45124, 'No, not yet...\nWhenever the soldiers go near the shield, they seem to suffer from an illness; so, only a few elves and I have been able to venture inside. \n\nWhen we got inside, a strange black fog filled the cave. I felt a strange energy from the black fog...\nThe fog seems to cause this illness to Isyans, therefore we cannot continue to investigate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[That is strange, I\'ll take a look around!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What an unfortunate setback...][2]'),
(45125, 'Town Chief Guiltian, I\'ve came back from my investigation of Thorn Cave.\nWhen I entered the cave, I could see bats and other creatures. Most of the creatures looked strange. They had this grey-colored fog surrounding them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45126, 'Yes, this is what I suspected. I think the monsters have been infected by the fog. \nIt\'s obvious now that the fog will infect monsters and Isyans alike. \nI think it\'s time we strengthen our defenses. The village is very close to the cave and we should protected it from all types of incidents. \n\nThank you very much. You\'ve been really helpful!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45127, 'Hmm... I\'m very confused.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45130, 'Thorn Cave 2'),
(45131, 'Town Chief Guiltian has finally found what the existence of the Thorn Cave.\nHe is recruiting those adventurers who will investigate the cave.\nHe asks to defeat Fog Weasels from Thorn Cave.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45132, 'You were really helpful last time. We can accelerate the investigations with your help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45133, '[NAME], thank goodness you\'re here. We tried to go deeper into the cave, but the monsters were too strong and we became hesitant to move on.\nCan you investigate further inside Thorn Cave with soldiers?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir! I don\'t need the soldiers, I can take of this on my own.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Who do you think I am?][2]'),
(45134, 'I have returned but the monsters were too strong... \nApparently, they were the weaker monsters of the cave. Even then they were amazingly strong.\nMost of the soldiers could not even go near them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45135, 'That\'s what happened to us as well... \nI half expected that to be the result. I could hardly take on those monsters at the entrance of the cave by myself.\n\nYou did a great job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45136, '... Huh... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45140, 'Cleo\'s Request'),
(45141, 'Cleo of the Swamp of Dawn has requested you to investigate Thorn Cave.\n\nHunt down Vampire ViVi, Fog ViVi, and Fog Weasel.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45142, 'Long time no see, adventurer.\nYou look great. My, you have grown strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45143, 'Thanks Cleo, I\'ve been taking care of myself. Did you need something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45144, 'In fact, I do. I need you to go investigate Thorn Cave. Do you know of the place because I\'ve never heard of it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[What? Of course.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I don\'t want to be involved with that.][2]'),
(45145, 'Cleo, I have returned. I checked out the Vampire ViVi, Fog ViVi, and Fog Weasel, and they were very strong.\nMost adventurers had difficulties in fighting them.\nHere\'s the information about their levels and offensive powers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45146, 'You did a great job.\nHere is your reward. I might need your help again in the near future\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45147, '...... Huh? Someone with this huge reward... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45150, 'When Zombies Attack'),
(45151, 'Bunis claims that there are a lot of zombies in Thorn Cave and they are weakening the troops of Adealia. He asks adventurers to hunt down those hungry zombies. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45152, 'The Thorn Cave investigation unit was badly damaged... darn it.\nThe hungry zombies in the midway of the cave are a real problem...\nThere were so many of them, the core unit was overwhelmed and seriously damaged!! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45153, 'I guess the investigation is at a stand-still now because the core unit was taking charge of the front line.\nPlease help us wipe out those hungry zombies!\n\n[BUTTON]=[What? Zombies? Piece of cake! I will take care of those zombies.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good about taking out zombies.][2]'),
(45154, 'Yes! I wiped out those hungry zombies.\nThere were so many of them after me... So many zombies.\nBut, this is me we are talking about! My crew and I wiped them all out!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45155, 'Haha, we feel very secure with you on the task, [NAME]!\nYou did a great job! I will work on the recovery of the core unit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45156, 'I am so worried, oh brother...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45160, 'Speedy Recovery... 1'),
(45161, 'Angela, Adealia\'s healer has been working on a medicine that could cure the wounded soldiers very quickly. Bring Spiritual Water to Angela so she can start working on the potion.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45162, 'Ah, adventurer! Did you hear the news?\nThe Bunis\' core unit was all taken down by monsters.\nThis is shocking news. I\'ve heard that the Adealia\'s core unit was only slightly damaged.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45163, 'All I can do is provide the best medicine so all the wounded soldiers can recover as soon as possible.\nI am currently working on a special potion that greatly speeds up the recovery process.\nCan you help me with something? I\'m out of time because I have done everything myself... \nI need you to get Spiritual Water from the Water Alca that roam Dark Land...  \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it for you. Don\'t worry about it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should get it yourself.][2]'),
(45164, 'Angela! Here is the Spiritual Water you asked for.\nClean and Tranquil... Doesn\'t it look like crisp morning dew?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45165, 'Yes it does! That is the core dew that was collected by the Water Alca.\nThey used to be part of decent spiritual groups. However, they don\'t collect the dew any more.\nThey have become really evil now, indulging in the blood & flesh of humans and elves.\nThey are to be feared, but still I have pity for them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45166, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45170, 'Speedy Recovery... 2'),
(45171, 'Angela, Adealia\'s healer has been working on a medicine that could cure the wounded soldiers very quickly. Bring Spiritual Water to Angela so she can start working on the potion.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45172, 'Thank you very much for helping me last time. Because of you, many soldiers have been able to recover more quickly than they would have.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45173, 'With that being said, I need more medicine.\nCould you get Spiritual Water from the Water Alca one more time?  \nIt would be of monumental help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I can do that. I\'ll have it back here before you know it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way. Do you really believe that is possible?][2]'),
(45174, 'I\'m back. Here is your Spiritual Water.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45175, 'Wow! Thank you very much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45176, 'I just do my best, that\'s all I can do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45180, 'Another Bloody Battle! 1'),
(45181, 'Adealia\'s Edwina wants to head out to Thorn Cave once again.\nThe core unit should be able to take out the Hungry Zombies that are posing a threat.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45182, 'Another bloody battle is upon us!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45183, 'Yes, sir! I\'ve been waiting for this!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45184, 'A herd of hungry zombies is posing a threat once again!\nI haven\'t seen or heard about those vile creatures since the last time we had to fight them... \nLet\'s go and take out those Hungry Zombies with the core unit!  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir! Let\'s go!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s wait a while and then take off!][2]'),
(45185, 'Oh, my goodness! Smells like decomposing bodies... The stink is unbearable!\nEdwina! Are you hurt?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45186, 'I\'m fine. I should go check on the wounded soldiers. But the situation is better this time, we had less injuries.\nYou did a great job today, your moves were much faster. \nI guess I can\'t beat you...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45187, 'Let\'s go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45190, 'Another Bloody Battle! 2'),
(45191, 'Adealia\'s Edwina wants to challenge Thorn Cave again.\nThe core unit should be able to take out the Fog Weasels that are posing a threat.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45192, 'The last battle was great.\nEven though it took several days to recover... \nJust being able to walk again is a blessing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45193, 'Yes, I thought so too.\nWhat kind of monsters do we need to defeat this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45194, 'Hmm... This time, you will have to take out the Fog Weasels  . We have had many soldiers injured due to these Fog Weasels.\nThis monster\'s offensive powers have not been looked into yet so be careful. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t you trust me?! Just trust me on this!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Weasel, you said? I... don\'t...][2]'),
(45195, 'Ta-da! I\'m back without any injuries.\nI think if I went with others, there would have been injuries.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45196, 'Is that so? I\'m glad that you were able to defeat the Fog Weasels. \nWe must do our part to protect our brothers. They are trustworthy comrades and will fight to the death. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45197, 'I\'m fighting!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45200, 'Black Fog\'s Slave 1'),
(45201, 'Edwina of Adealia has encountered some strange monsters deep inside Thorn Cave. \nAdventurers are asked to defeat and take the souls of Blood Shadows and Dark Shadows. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45202, 'Oh hello [NAME]. I haven\'t spoke to Town Chief Guiltian about this yet but there is something you should know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45203, '...What? What do you mean? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45204, 'I was deep inside Thorn Cave the other day and there seems to be monsters you would normally see in a different area. I have no clue how these monsters wound up in Thorn Cave but we need to get to the bottom of this. \n\nPlease bring back the souls of the Blood Shadows and Dark Shadows.  \nUse this soul bottle to lock the souls of these monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir. I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready yet.][2]'),
(45205, 'I have returned with the soul filled bottle. As soon as I defeated the monsters, their souls just floated into the bottle. I am beginning to think it\'s their nature to bind together because their souls have been trapped for so long. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45206, 'That seems rather strange. I don\'t know much about this subject, I think we need to ask Town Chief Guiltian about this.\n\nPlease wait a moment. \n\nI will write a letter for you to take to Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45207, '... Please go visit Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45210, 'Black Fog\'s Slave 2'),
(45211, 'Deliver Edwina\'s letter and the Filled Soul Bottle to Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45212, 'Here you go [NAME].\nPlease take the filled Soul Bottle and this letter to Town Chief Guiltian. I have sent word that you will be arriving shortly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45213, 'Town Chief Guiltian!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45214, 'Oh [NAME], I was expected you.\nWhat\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45215, 'Edwina told me to bring this filled Soul Bottle and letter to you. \n(Hands the glass bottle and letter) \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45216, 'Let me take a look at this... Oh my, I can\'t believe it! Are these the souls of the Blood Shadows and Dark Shadows? Why did you bring this stuff? \n\nWhat? You found these monsters in Thorn Cave?\n\nYou mean, the place where the tribe leader has been recently visiting?\nWell... that is strange... \nHow could the souls locked in from another area be found in Thorn Cave?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45217, 'Thank you for bringing me all of this, I can understand why Edwina told me to bring this to my attention. \n\nThank you, you did a great job.\n\nIf you have some free time, could I bother you to investigate and find out where the other area is.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45218, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45220, 'Seductive Voice 1'),
(45221, 'Guiltian, Adealia\'s village leader, said that he was lured by some \'voice\' into Thorn Cave.\nWe should bring the Fog Nepilim\'s Soul and Fog Lence\'s Soul to Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45222, 'Actually, I did visit Thorn Cave myself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45223, 'What?! All by yourself??? \nThat dangerous place... at your age... all by yourself... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45224, 'Why are you so surprised? I seem very relaxed here, but I can take care of myself.\nThese souls... I mean the souls you brought here.\nThese souls should have some sort of  \'memory\' attached to them.  \nTake this bottle and capture two bad souls  of the Fog Nepilim and Fog Lence   into this bottle. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No! You want me to go there again?!][2]'),
(45225, 'Elder! Here you go.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45226, 'You did a great job. Now I can find out for certain.\nWould you like to join me in there?\nThese guys\' voices are... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45227, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45230, 'Seductive Voice 2'),
(45231, 'Guiltian, Adealia\'s village leader, said that he was lured by some voice into Thorn Cave.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45232, '\n<Fog Nepilim>\nOh, my queen! My beautiful flame...  \n\n<Fog Lence>\nOh, my queen! My beautiful... more beautiful... flame...  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45233, 'Queen?!\nFlame...?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45234, 'So, this is... The voice of the Queen...\n\n<???>  \nOh, my sprits! Come to me. Make my cold heart beat, my spirits...  \n\nWhat do you think?\nIsn\'t her voice just so seductive?\nSo seductive that powerful wind spirits cannot help but give in...\n \n[NEXT]'),
(45235, 'Well... I feel very mysterious and have become really attached to this.\nI\'m in a dazed confusion...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45236, 'This voice really is fatal.  \nThe \'Spell of the Voice\' is so strong that most monsters were lured and dazed by it.\nIf you and I listed to this voice a couple more times, we could be lured to the cave without even knowing it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45237, 'Hmm... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45240, 'Queen\'s Knights 1'),
(45241, 'I got a clue from Guiltian, Adealia\'s village leader.\nI should go deep inside Thorn Cave to find out about the seductive voice.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45242, 'Why don\'t you go to Thorn Cave with Edwina\'s core unit?\nYou will be much safer with them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45243, 'No, my elder.\nI prefer going there with my own crew.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45244, 'Well, I am not that weak.\nIf I encounter them, I will have no choice but to fight.\nBe prepared. These monsters are not the ones you have encountered before...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry, I\'ll be strong enough!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What? I\'ll take off in a while then.][2]'),
(45245, 'Shoot! Village leader!\nI encountered the Blood Vampire inside the cave.  \nHe seemed very familiar. I thought he might have been one of the Magrite devotees... \nHe was unbelievably strong. He was a true challenge.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45246, 'Well... This is what I expected... \nI think they were the knights of the Queen.\nThose monsters, strong as they were, could not escape the queen\'s magic even when on the verge of death... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45247, 'Be very careful. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45250, 'Queen\'s Knights 2'),
(45251, 'The monsters deep inside Thorn Cave that are bewitched by the Queen\'s magic should be taken out at once.\nLet\'s go tell Adealia\'s Edwina about this.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45252, 'I agree to let you and your crew go to the cave. \nBut I better benefit from your voyage. \nYou should tell Edwina when you take off with your crew.\nMy investigation will benefit greatly if I follow your group into the cave. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45253, 'Edwina! How are you feeling?\nSooner or later, my crew and I will make moves to take out those monsters in Thorn Cave.\nGuiltian suggested that we should take off after we talk about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45254, 'So, that was what happened.\nWe prefer it that way.\nThat place is like a web of narrow roads... \nIf we follow your group very close before those monsters in the front line show up, more soldiers can conveniently and effectively march forward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45255, 'Don\'t you know Edwina?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45260, 'Queen\'s Knights 3'),
(45261, 'The monsters deep inside Thorn Cave that are bewitched by the Queen\'s magic should be taken out.\nPlease get rid of the Killer Hide.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45262, 'Are you now heading out to Thorn Cave?\nMy core unit crew and I are ready. \nRight after we take off, Guiltian\'s village soldiers will follow.\nAh! Well.. I heard this rumor that the Uruga force is really strong.\nYou [NAME] did a lot for us... I don\'t know how to thank you enough... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45263, 'Well... I didn\'t do anything.\nIt was Adrian, Uruga\'s village leader, who made this all happen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45264, 'No... \nWithout you, nothing could have been accomplished.\nThe black fog coming out of Thorn Cave... \nThis fog kills nearby grasses, human lungs and any other life form... It can even seriously harm elves.\nThe best solution for this village is to eliminate the root cause of the black fog.  \nThank you. Be strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! Just trust me on this!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t get paid in words you know... ][2]'),
(45265, 'Edwina! I wonder if maybe you have seen it..\nI encountered a strange monster.\nThe monster called itself a Killer Hide, and it was really fast. It even used some healing skills.\nI have never seen such techniques... \nAlthough I did take him out, I am still not sure that I completely eliminated the monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45266, 'Hmm... Those monsters may be reborn by the force of the Black Fog.\nWe should minimize this force and clean out the cave.\nIf we don\'t, these creatures will never completely go away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45267, 'Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45270, 'Queen\'s Knights 4'),
(45271, 'The monsters deep inside Thorn Cave that are bewitched by the Queen\'s magic should be taken out.\nI should defeat the Silver Wolf Silverk and bring back its canine tooth.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45272, 'Did you go deep inside the cave?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45273, 'Not yet.\nIt was really difficult to go deep inside the cave because there were so many strong monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45274, 'I see...  \nThere was this huge, shiny animal deep inside the cave.\nNot a human, at least I don\'t think it was completely human, I think it was a wolf.\nI have heard a song about something like this before.\n\n\'Old friend of the ancient spiritual guardian of woods,  \nThe Silver Wolf who loved a human.  \nYou look so shiny under the star and moon light.  \nMagical teeth and walks faster than the speed of light  \nOh, my Silver Wolf! You look so shiny and beautiful\'  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45275, 'Silver Wolf? Hmm... Could that be what is inside the cave...? \nThe song seems to suggest the Silver Wolf has been with us for a long time... \nHas the wolf also been seduced by the voice?  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45276, 'Yes... I don\'t want to believe it, but it may be true.\nIt\'s been said that the wolf had left Kahal\'s Plain a long ago and hid deep in the woods... \nWell, that should not happen again.\nI hope this is merely just a guess.\nIf you happen to take that monster out, please bring its largest canine tooth to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[What? Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Please hold on.][2]'),
(45277, 'Edwina! I\'m back with the canine tooth.\nI think that wolf was the one Guiltian talked about. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45278, 'I see.\nWell... \nThis canine tooth exactly matched the one that Guiltian talked about.\nThere is a word \'Silverk\' carved inside the tooth in human language...  \nSilverk who loved a human... he was also loved by a human.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45279, '... ... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45280, 'My Little Angel, My Little Karen 1'),
(45281, 'Adealia\'s Karuha told me of the story of the Silver Wolf, Silverk.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45282, 'Last night... \nThe wolf\'s soul came to me.  \nIt was a free soul that was brighter than the moon and more transparent than glass.  \nThe soul introduced itself as the Silver Wolf Silverk to me.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45283, 'Silverk came to you??\nBut why? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45284, 'I heard that you fought him.\nI also heard that he was killed by you. \nHe showed a memory of the past to me. Then... he explained to me why he ended up in that place and why he became a monster...\nMore precisely put... he had no choice but to become a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45285, 'What? He forced himself to become a monster? \nWhy?! How could he do that!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45286, 'Yes... It is his nature.\n\nA long ago.. somewhere in the village, he fell in love with a small girl  .\nIt was an innocent, paternal love  .\nThe long-lived Silverk had a spirit that was far beyond just an animal\'s. That is, it was a strong spirit that might have become a god.\nShe was a cute, red-haired girl who made such a great wolf fall in love  .\nShe was even courageous enough to dare to crawl inside the mouth of Silverk and carve out its name on its tooth... \nAnd... she finally became a tribe leader and was married to a man. But, the wolf still loved her.\nThe girl\'s name is... \'Karen\'.  \nShe is the very \'Succubus Queen\' who lives in the deepest region of Thorn Cave..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45287, 'Succubus Queen?!\nThen, she is the one who charms those powerful monsters with her seductive voice!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45288, 'Yes.\nSilverk simply could not let go of her.\nHe protected her until his last moment and decided to become a monster with her...  \nHe gave up everything he had and became a monstrosity just for her...  \nJust for \'Karen\'  , the Succubus Queen... One whom he truly loved... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45289, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45290, 'My Little Angel, My Little Karen 2'),
(45291, 'With Silverk\'s wishes in mind, Adealia\'s Karuha requested to take out the Succubus Queen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45292, 'Please make Silverk\'s wishes come true.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45293, 'Silverk really loved her... \nKaruha... \nWhat should I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45294, 'If we really care about the Silver Wolf Silverk... If we really want to make his wishes come true... \nWe should take out Karen.\nThis is the only way that we can truly understand his sorrow and pride, I guess... \nAlthough she is now the most powerful monster in this continent...  \nShe used to be human, so she should be able to be killed like a human.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will take her out...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think so? Don\'t we have to protect her?][2]'),
(45295, 'Karuha... \nI took defeated the Succubus Queen... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45296, 'Come here, adventurer.\nI will sing you a song... \nA song that will make all your sorrows and tears vanish... \nI will sing for Silverk, Karen and all lonely souls of Isya...  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45297, 'I can still feel Silverk\'s sorrow in my heart... \nI cannot stop crying... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45300, 'Bad Black Fog 1'),
(45301, 'Guiltian, Adealia\'s village leader, found out that the black fog in Kahal Plain  finally manifested into a monster.\nWe should take some of the dark fog.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45302, 'Welcome. \nI\'m sorry for such short notice.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45303, 'No, Town Chief. I will come see you as quickly as possible whenever you need me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45304, 'Thanks. Now then... \nI wanted to talk to you about a new monster that recently showed up in Kahal\'s Plain.\nHave you heard about the black fog coming out of Thorn Cave?\nThe black fog was not yet a real thing, but still very fatal. That is, until recently... \nEdwina paid a visit there and reported to me that the Black Fog finally became a monster. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45305, 'The fog became a monster?!\nHow? When? Did it just suddenly happen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45306, 'Yes, it just suddenly happened.\nEdwina was also very confused, and became injured.\nThat being said, can you bring some of the dark fog to me?\nI would like to examine this new foe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I don\'t think I can do it... ][2]'),
(45307, 'Here you go, this is the some of the dark fog.\nIt is round-shaped and a very dense-dark color. And it beats like a heart of an animal.\nWhat is this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45308, 'Hmm... maybe... \nThis should be a lump of force. I mean, the energy that makes the dark fog alive.\nRegardless of whether it is a human or an animal, the dark fog infects a subject, sucks every bit energy from it, and eventually leaves the subject dead...  \nThis may be a monster that was born from all the absorbed energy that was sucked into the fog.\nHmm... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45309, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45310, 'Bad Black Fog 2'),
(45311, 'A Black Heart that came from the dark fog in Kahal Plain.\nLet\'s take this to Karuha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45312, 'Take this and go show it to Karuha.\nI am sure she will find out what this force really is.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45313, 'Karuha!\nGuiltian, the village leader, sent me here.\nHe wants to know what this Black Heart really is... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45314, 'Yes... I\'ve been expecting you.\nPlease hand it to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45315, 'Whoops!  Almost dropped it! Here you go.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45316, 'What? \nJust hold on for a second.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45317, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45320, 'Bad Black Fog 3'),
(45321, 'Karuha tells the secret about the power sources that were sapped by the Dark Fog.\nLet\'s hear the secret.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45322, '...\nYes... I can feel it.\n...Not just one or two... So many human beings... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45323, 'So many?!\nThat can\'t be right. It was found there not long ago... How could so many people\'s energies get there? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45324, 'Black-haired man... \nHe was a very strong one, and so many other men... \nThere is only one female.\nOh, she was really suffering from some pain... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45325, 'But, Karuha!\nNo one other than adventurers have gone there. Also, there were no missing soldiers of the Adealia\'s core unit.\nHuman beings... Only adventurers could make it there!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45326, 'Although that is true... \nApparently, there are many human beings.\nOnly men.\nOnly one who seems to be female with such strong power... Red-haired... \nYes, it is clearly Karen.\nI can vaguely feel the power of Silverk.\nHowever, most power comes from one man. With moderate power from so many others... \nSomething must have already happened that we were unaware of.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45327, 'Something we were unaware of?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45328, '... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45330, 'Fishy Moves'),
(45331, 'Town Chief Roumenus said that Blacksmith James has been acting very fish lately. Let\'s discuss this issue with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45332, 'It seems like they are not making enough money... How dare them try to cook something up without even telling me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45333, 'Hi, Town Chief Roumenus!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45334, 'Ah! [NAME]. Welcome.\nYou came at just the right time. I have to tell you about something that concerns me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45335, 'What\'s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45336, 'Blacksmith James has been acting really strange lately.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45337, 'Are you questioning a town resident? Are you, town chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45338, 'I keep hearing from many people that James is up to something. I just feel worried about what he is up to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45339, 'Isn\'t that a privacy issue? I don\'t think it is necessary for you to interfere with your town residents\' personal matters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45340, 'I know that town residents have their own lives, and I don\'t get involved in their personal lives. However, I keep hearing these annoying rumors about James...\nI\'m just worried about him...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45341, 'What happened? Aren\'t you very close to James?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45342, 'James is up to something for sure. He may give up his blacksmith job, and...\nI can\'t think of anyone who could replace James for his blacksmith work in our town...\nCan you talk to James for me? Of course, you should not tell him it\'s me asking.\nCan you do that for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll talk to him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think this is the correct way to ask.][2]'),
(45343, 'Hey, what brought you here? Any problems with your equipment? Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45344, '(Nothing seems fishy)\nHi, James! How have you been?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45345, 'Great! I\'ve been doing great.\nIt is quite surprising for you to ask me how I am doing...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45346, '(Does he know something already?)\nWell, let\'s cut to the chase. I have something to ask you, James.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45347, 'Please, go ahead.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45348, 'Why don\'t you visit Blacksmith James and ask him about it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45350, 'Blacksmith\'s Decision 1'),
(45351, 'James told you he isn\'t going to be the town Blacksmith anymore along with the blacksmiths in the other towns. Let\'s tell Roumenus the news.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45352, 'Hmm?\nDo not hesitate. Just ask me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45353, 'Well..\nI heard that you\'ve been busy with some other stuff. Is it true?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45354, 'I\'ve always busy with my job as a blacksmith.\nI don\'t have time to do anything else!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45355, 'Please, tell me the truth. Word around town is that you\'ve been acting somewhat strange.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45356, 'Hmm...\n(I guess my moves have been noticed)\nI\'m not sure how much you know, but it is true that I\'ve been feeling very restless lately.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45357, 'Now, you\'re opening up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45358, 'Well, I guess I will fill you in.\nListen carefully. All the blacksmiths in Elderine and Uruga, including myself, will stop working soon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45359, 'Are you saying that you guys are going to quit your jobs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45360, 'I don\'t feel proud about my job.\nAs monsters are getting stronger, adventurers demand much more powerful weapons. As you know, demand and supply must be well-balanced.\nHowever, there is demand but no supply. Even my last hope, the town chief, ignored me.\nHow can I serve my duties under these circumstances?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45361, 'Hmm?\nIt seems still irresponsible. What about those adventurers who need weapons and shields right away?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45362, 'I don\'t care any more. I\'ve done my job and tried to get some help. Nonetheless, what I get in return... I don\'t want to talk about it any more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45363, '(There must be some misunderstanding between the town chief and James. However, the town chief told me that the blacksmith has been acting really fishy. Now, which side is lying?)\nWhat you\'ve been telling me really makes sense.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45364, 'If Roumenus sent you here, I want you to tell him this. I won\'t work for him any more as a blacksmith.\nYou heard what I said, now go tell him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You talk to him yourself.][2]'),
(45365, '[NAME], you\'re back. \nSo, what did he say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45366, 'He insisted that he has not received the necessary blacksmith tools and supplies to do his job properly. Is this true?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45367, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45368, '??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45369, 'You did a great job. Please give me some time to think it over.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45370, 'Tell the town chief exactly what I said.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45380, 'Awkward Relationship'),
(45381, 'Roumenus listened to what you told him James had to say. Now go tell James about Roumenus\' reply.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45382, 'Please tell me in detail exactly what James told you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45383, '(Explains to him about James\' complaints)\nSo, this is pretty much what he said. He sounded very certain about his decision not to work as a blacksmith in Roumen anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45384, 'You should know that what he is saying is partially true but there is also some confusion.\nIt wasn\'t that I couldn\'t support him because I didn\'t want to. I just wasn\'t able to do so.\nWe have to clear this misunderstanding up between us, but I\'m not sure where to start.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45385, 'What happened with you guys?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45386, 'Recently, James has told me several times that he needed more resources for his job.\nHowever, as you are well aware, our town does not have a stable source of income. How can I give him what he needs on short notice under our poor economic conditions?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45387, 'Yet, but he is the blacksmith for this town. He needs some sort of aid to do his job and it should be furnished, I guess.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45388, 'I wish I could use my personal supplies, but...\nI have my own reasons why I cannot support him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45389, 'Isn\'t it selfish to not want to help as a town chief? I believe that the well-being of your town residents should be your top priority.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45390, '...\nMaybe, you\'re right. I\'m being very selfish.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45391, '(Hmm, he admitted to being selfish too easily. There must be something else going on.)\nDo you plan on keeping this awkward relationship with James, town chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45392, 'I definitely do not want that type of relationship, but there is nothing I can do if we keep disagreeing with each other.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45393, 'I\'ll go talk to him about what you said.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45394, '(Looking very gloomy)\nYes, go ahead.\n\n[BUTTON]=[...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, you do it by yourself.][2]'),
(45395, 'What? The old man put it that way?\nThis is really ridiculous. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45396, 'Calm down, James.\nSo who\'s side of the story is true?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45397, 'Definitely not that old mans. Who else would be lying?\nAccording to some rumors, he has contacted several people from Elderine.\nA town chief who doesn\'t take care of his own town seems to be caught up with another towns\' business.\nI am afraid he has been trying to execute deals under the table.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45398, 'Roumenus admitted that he might be a selfish town chief. Does that mean he is up to something just for his own profits?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45399, 'There is nothing to expect from a town chief who is likely to destroy Roumen. I can\'t work with this jerk any more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45400, 'Cheer up!\n(Why don\'t I visit Blacksmith Karl of Elderine? He might know something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45401, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45410, 'Mysterious Shadow'),
(45411, 'Blacksmith Karl of Elderine, seems to know something about the serious situation going on in Roumen.  He tells you to talk to Guild Manager Fredrick for more information. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45412, 'So, what is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45413, 'Hello.  I am here to ask you about Blacksmith James of Roumen.  He is not doing well. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45414, 'Oh, it is finally happening...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45415, 'Oh... Do you know anything about what is happening?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45416, 'I met with James of Roumen and Hans from Uruga a while ago.  We had an urgent issue to talk about. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45417, 'You must have had something important to talk about!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45418, 'The monsters in the continent are gaining strength and growing in number day by day.  If we can\'t stop them, we need to be able to defend ourselves.  I am not worried about those who can fight, but what about the villagers?  They have to rely on our equipment.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45419, 'You are right...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45420, 'We had limitations trying to make or refine armory and weapons with the old materials, but none of the villagers has complained about them.  We did the best we could. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45421, 'But you asked the chiefs for support because the monsters are becoming stronger, right? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45422, 'That\'s right.\nBut the outcomes...  Well...\nI have made a request to Lord Elbama, but he refused.  The village also has financial issues...\nJames was regretting that he even became a blacksmith in the first place and so was I...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45423, 'James of Roumen said that Chief Roumenus of Roumen is having secret gatherings with the people from Elderine.  Do you have any idea what this is about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45424, '(Ponders deeply)\n...!!\nYes... That\'s right...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45425, 'Any clue?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45426, 'I have seen a group of unidentified people in black coats go into Elbama\'s chamber several times lately. \nThey wouldn\'t hide themselves in the coats if they had nothing to hide.\nThere must be something... between them and Elderine and Roumen. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45427, '(I feel sorry for the blacksmiths, but it sounds very interesting.)\nBut there is no hard evidence...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45428, 'If you can\'t find anything specific, you would not be able to find what is going on in Roumen and Elderine.\nYou would need {color,yellow, his} help for something like this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45429, '{color,yellow, His}??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45430, 'Look for {color,yellow,Fredrick} in {color,yellow,Elderine}.  Ask him about the rumors that are going on in the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good...][2]'),
(45431, 'Hmm?  You are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45432, 'Oh, I am [NAME].  Karl sent me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45433, 'Oh... Karl...\nThank you for coming.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45434, 'Go to {color,yellow,Fredrick} in {color,yellow,Elderine}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45440, 'Questions Unanswered'),
(45441, 'Fredrick thinks that Guard Captain Shutian might know something. Go and talk with him to find out more information about these mysterious things going on in town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45442, 'News from Karl...  Tell me everything.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45443, '(Talk about what is happening in Roumen.)\nWhat do you think?  Karl said that you might know something, Fredrick.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45444, 'Hmm...\nI haven\'t heard anything particular, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45445, 'Something\'s up, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45446, 'The men in black coats that Karl mentioned...  I don\'t know what they are after, but I have been paying attention to them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45447, 'Do you think Lord Elbama knows something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45448, 'Karl told you that they went into the Lord\'s chamber.  Isn\'t that your answer? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45449, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45450, 'But I don\'t think he would open his mouth about the men in black coats that easily.  It\'s foolish to ask him about them.\nLet\'s see...\nYes... Ask Shutian.  That must be the safest way..\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good about.][2]'),
(45451, '[NAME], what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45452, 'Oh... hello.  I am here to ask you about the men in black coats that are appearing in Elderine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45453, 'Hmm...\nWhy are you interested?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45454, '(Tell about the conflicts between villagers and blacksmiths.)\nI think they are related to this.  The blacksmiths in Roumen and Elderine have shut down their business temporarily. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45455, 'The Blacksmiths have shut down the businesses...\nIs this where things are going...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45456, 'Any clue?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45457, 'Yes, but I am not sure.  I have the bad feeling that darkness might be coming to Elderine.\nSince you are here, let\'s talk about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45458, 'Go to {color,yellow,Shutian}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45460, 'The Secret Society'),
(45461, 'Schtian offers to tell you what he heard.  Listen to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45462, 'I will tell you what one of the Lord\'s guards has told me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45463, '(Waits anxiously)\nOK...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45464, 'It was a rainy night.  The men in black coats emerged and went into the Lord\'s chamber.  They were very cautious and moved secretly. \nThey had a secret conversation with Lord Elbama.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45465, 'My hands are sweating.  I am nervous...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45466, 'They introduced themselves as the secret society and asked him about Elderine\'s finances.  Then, they told him to invest a certain portion of the village\'s taxes in them for a certain period of time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45467, 'The secret society... The taxes...\nHmm... But for what? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45468, 'Only Elbama and the secret society could answer that.  What is certain is that they are planning on something big.  The taxes are a lot of money.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45469, 'It just keeps getting more and more confusing...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45470, 'Roumen has already agreed to invest a portion of their taxes.  I don\'t know if it\'s true, though...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45471, 'Do you think they are working for someone?  Or are they working by themselves?  I think it needs some research.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45472, 'Either way, I know one thing for sure; that they are bad.  If their power grows, it won\'t be just between you and me, but it will be a big problem for the villages and for the continent...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45473, 'I think it is up to me to find more about it.  Thanks for the information.  I will let you know if I find out something new.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45474, 'Be careful.  Like I said, I don\'t feel good about it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45475, 'OK.  See you.\n(Let\'s go back to Karl.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45480, 'Their Goal, and Blacksmith..'),
(45481, 'Karl wants you to report to Blacksmith James in Roumen with your findings. Go and talk with James. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45482, 'You are back, [NAME].  Did you talk to Fredrick?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45483, 'Yes, I learned something new, but I don\'t know if it would be helpful for you...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45484, 'Tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45485, 'The men in black coats called themselves the secret society.  They wanted to take a certain portion of the villages\' taxes to manage the financial market of the entire continent of Isya or something...  That\'s all I heard.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45486, 'Manage the financial market?  Who do they think they are?  That\'s not good. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45487, 'What\'s more important is that the Chief of Roumen has accepted their request for some reason.\nI don\'t feel good about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45488, 'This must be related to the reason why they refused to support me and James.  But we should be careful.  You could also be in danger...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45489, 'You want me to... be careful..?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45490, 'That\'s right.  It\'s good that you gave us the information, but I am worried about James.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45491, 'But wouldn\'t it be more important to find out what is between this secret society and the villages...  When the truth is revealed, the Chief will lose the trust of people.  \nThen, you won\'t have to be worried anymore. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45492, 'I would love that.  James has shut down the shop, but he has been a blacksmith since birth...  I hope he comes back to his position.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45493, 'I hope so too!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45494, 'Go to Roumen and tell James about this.  He must be devastated.  And say hello to him for me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go in a moment.][2]'),
(45495, 'You are back.  I know you are going all over the place, but that doesn\'t change anything about my life in Roumen.  I am thinking about getting a new job... Do you want to hear about it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45496, 'But hear me out first.\n(Tell him about what happened in Elderine.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45497, 'Hmm...\nSo you are trying to expose what is between the secret society and the Chief for me and Karl?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45498, 'Of course.  I am also curious what is behind this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45499, 'As you know, I no longer trust the villagers.\nEven you...\nBut I appreciate your effort.  Go and do what you want.\nThen, bring me good results.  Then, I will give you my trust.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45500, 'Go to Roumen and tell James about this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45510, 'Reason of Existence'),
(45511, 'James, the blacksmith of Roumen, wanted me to listen to his side of a story. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45512, 'Would you please take some time to listen my story?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45513, 'I haven\'t even started this investigation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45514, 'That\'s true, but there is something that concerns me.\nI really didn\'t want to do my job because there were no resources available. Yet, I still love my job.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45515, 'Karl said the same thing. He said that you were born to be a blacksmith.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45516, 'Ha ha..\nAnyway, let\'s cut to the chase. Listen very carefully.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45517, '(What\'s he gonna tell me?)\nYes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45518, 'We, blacksmiths, had studied some materials that could be used for making new equipment. And, we think it can be a solution.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45519, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45520, 'Listen very carefully. If we get certain five rare materials, we could develop the new equipment. However, it is very difficult to acquire these materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45521, 'You\'re saying that you guys really need these rare materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45522, 'Getting those materials may be too much to ask for.. Nonetheless, most town chiefs didn\'t understand our sincerity and commitment. The most difficult problem is that those materials are hard to get. We can\'t spend all our time trying to acquiring those materials, we still have our jobs to do, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45523, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45524, 'So...\nWhy don\'t you give it a try? If you could get us those materials, not only your equipment\'s performance but also your town friends\' survival rates will be enhanced.\nThen you can be the real hero for this Continent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45525, 'Sounds great! Not only getting stronger but also being a hero...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45526, 'I don\'t really want to trouble you with this stuff, but you are the only one who can pull this off. Why don\'t you take some time to think it over? Take a break for a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45530, 'Rare Material 1'),
(45531, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants you to collect rare materials to help develop new weapons and armor. The first material he is asking for is Processed Jewelry from the Jewel Grave Robber. Go and collect this item for James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45532, 'Seems that you made up your mind taking this mission. You made the right decision.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45533, 'I decided to be a hero, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45534, 'You are such an ambitious adventurer.\nWhy don\'t I tell you about the five rare materials we discovered from our research?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45535, 'This is really exciting!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45536, 'First of all, we need the following five items; {color,yellow,Nucleus (Dust Golem\'s Energy Source)}, {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}, {color,yellow,Mysterious Powder}, {color,yellow,Shiny Stone}, and {color,yellow,Processed Jewelry}. All these items are those materials that are either possessed by strong monsters or unknown in the Continent. Therefore, it will be extremely difficult to acquire these materials.\nYou are the only hope we got.\n\n[NEXT]\n'),
(45537, 'Wow... That\'s a lot.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45538, 'According to our calculations, the {color,yellow,Processed Jewelry} turned out to be the easiest item to get. I want you to get that item first. You can get this item from the {color,yellow,Jewel Grave Robber}. You know a good start is half the battle, so... If you pull this off, subsequent missions would be easier to accomplish.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do my best!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(45539, 'So, what happened? Did you get the first item I told you about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45540, 'Phew! It was really hard to get this item. Here it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45541, 'Oh! This is the {color,yellow,Processed Jewelry} we really wanted. You did a great job!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45542, 'Well, this is just a beginning...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45543, 'Yes, you\'re right. You will be faced with more difficult challenges, but I am positive that you will pull this off.\nYou did a wonderful job. Why don\'t you take a rest and come back later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45544, 'You can get the second item from the {color,yellow,Jewel Grave Robber}. I wish you the best!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45550, 'Rare Material 2'),
(45551, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants you to collect rare materials to help develop new weapons and armor. The second material he is asking for is the Shiny Stone from a Cave Kebing.  Go and collect this item for James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45552, 'Now, I\'ll tell you about the second item.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45553, 'I am pumped up!! Let\'s do this!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45554, 'The second item is the {color,yellow,Shiny Stone}. It sounds not that challenging, but you should be very careful because this item is possessed only by strong monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45555, 'By the way, how do you guys know this stuff even though you have never captured them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45556, 'Ha ha! Our knowledge and insight are far superior than normal people. Do not underestimate our knowledge and insight!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45557, 'Alrighty then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45558, 'I want you to get the {color,yellow,Shiny Stone}. I heard that the {color,yellow,Cave Kebing} is the one that carries this item, but I am not sure. Be very careful as always!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go get it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can. I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(45559, 'So, did you get the second item?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45560, 'Of course, I did. However, I feel that it\'s getting more difficult.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45561, 'Sorry to hear that. Yet, you\'re the only hope we got. Please be more patient until you successfully acquire all the five materials.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45562, 'I want you to get the {color,yellow,Shiny Stone} from the {color,yellow,Cave Kebing}. Be careful! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45570, 'Rare Material 3'),
(45571, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants you to collect rare materials to help develop new weapons and armor. The third material he is asking for is Mysterious Powder from the Kebing Speeder. Go and collect this item for James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45572, 'You will be half way through if you get the third item. Let me tell you about the third material.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45573, 'Phew! It feels like I am gonna face real challenges from now on!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45574, 'You\'re doing great. If you could go a little bit further, everyone would be really happy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45575, 'Yes, I know that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45576, 'The third material is...\nIt is called the {color,yellow,Mysterious Powder}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45577, '{color,yellow,Mysterious Powder}? It sound really familiar.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45578, 'I\'m sure you have heard of the name several times, but nobody has been able to acquire the item. If you get the item, it will be the first time ever.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45579, 'Is that so? I\'ll do whatever it takes to get the item!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45580, 'I know that the {color,yellow,Kebing Speeder} always carries the {color,yellow,Mysterious Powder} with them.\nYour missions will be much tougher from now on. You should be more careful than ever before!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go get it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can. I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(45581, 'So, did you get the item?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45582, 'Phew! It was really hard this time. Here is the material you wanted.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45583, 'We are almost there. Please hang in there!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45584, 'The next item I want you to get for us is the {color,yellow,Mysterious Powder}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45590, 'Rare Material 4'),
(45591, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants you to collect rare materials to help develop new weapons and armor. The fourth material he is asking for is Mysterious Pendant from the Marlone. Go and collect this item for James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45592, 'We are almost there!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45593, 'Can I put on the new equipment you talked about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45594, 'You will be the first person to wear the equipment, I promise!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45595, 'Wow! I feel really pumped up!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45596, 'Why don\'t I tell you about the fourth item? It is the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}. We have deeply discussed the existence of this item and finally concluded that the item didn\'t exist.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45597, 'What? I may not be able to get this item. If I can\'t get the item, is there any substitute to that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45598, 'No, there is no substitute. That is, if we can\'t get this item, this project won\'t be completed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45599, 'I guest I just have to pray that the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant} does exist.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45600, 'I am sorry. It feels like I am endangering you with this unclear information. I\'m really sorry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45601, 'No, don\'t be. I prefer somewhat incomplete information rather than 100%-sure information. Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45602, 'Thanks. Then, why don\'t you get me the fourth item, {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}? I heard that the {color,yellow,Marlone} carries the item.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go get it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Would it be okay to take a rest for a while?][2]'),
(45603, '[NAME]!!, How did it go? Does the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant} exist?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45604, 'Yes! The research project by the blacksmiths is something. Here you go!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45605, 'Oh! We are even more closer to realizing our dream. And...\nYou did a great job. Why don\'t you call it a day and take a rest?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45606, 'The next item I want you to get for us is the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45610, 'Rare Material 5'),
(45611, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen wants you to collect rare materials to help develop new weapons and armor. The last material he is asking for is Nucleus (Dust Golem\'s Energy Source from the Dust Golem. Go and collect this item for James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45612, 'Finally, we are at the last item needed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45613, 'I feel really nervous this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45614, '[NAME], you know that finalizing a project is the hardest thing. However, I have no doubt about your performance. We trust you that much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45615, '(Smiling unnaturally)\nWell, I feel a bit embarrassed. I am just doing my job. I am a little tired though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45616, 'Let\'s finalize this mission. The last item is the {color,yellow,Nucleus (Dust Golem\'s Energy Source)}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45617, 'From the Tower of Iyzel...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45618, 'Yes. The {color,yellow,Dust Golem} is a very tough monster, so you\'d better take some of your crew. Otherwise, it could be a very difficult mission.\nGet me the {color,yellow,Nucleus (Dust Golem\'s Energy Source)}. Please do me this favor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I am feeling really excited!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t. I got a cold.][2]'),
(45619, 'Eventually, our dream could...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45620, 'Congratulations! You guys can now make new equipment. Here is the last material you requested.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45621, 'I\'ve never been this happy before! I want you to deliver this great news to Karl and Hans as well.\nWhenever you\'re ready, please let me know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45622, 'The last material is the {color,yellow,Nucleus (Dust Golem\'s Energy Source)}. Good luck!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45630, 'Good News'),
(45631, 'Blacksmith James of Roumen asked you to tell other blacksmiths about the news. That all the rare materials have been acquired. Go and speak with Blacksmith Karl of Elderine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45632, 'Go to Elderine and tell Karl about this.  Don\'t waste any time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45633, 'Oh... It\'s you.  Did you find anything specific?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45634, 'Here it is.  I finally got all five rare materials that all the blacksmiths have been longing for!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45635, 'How... How did you...?\nDid you get the village\'s support?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45636, 'No, there was nothing from the village.  I got it by myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45637, 'All by yourself?\nOh... I can\'t believe it...  Our dream has come true so fast...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45638, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45639, 'I should send someone to examine them.  It was all your work?  Thank you so much.  We don\'t need the village to support us anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45640, 'Don\'t mention it...  It\'s my job to help anyone in need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45641, 'But... any good news is always accompanied by bad news.  This is the truth I have learned.  You have come to give me good news, but... It makes me... wonder...  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45642, 'Go and tell Fredrick about this!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45650, 'Karl\'s Bad Feeling'),
(45651, 'Karl, the blacksmith of Elderine, said that he is happy that all materials have been gathered, but he is somewhat anxious.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45652, '(Karl looks disturbed)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45653, 'You shouldn\'t waste any time.  Hurry and talk to James.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45654, 'Hmm...\nI understand that you have a bad feeling, but you might be worried too much, Karl.  It\'s a good day!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45655, 'Well... It\'s always been like this for me.  Good news is always followed by bad news...\nI am always ready because life can\'t be good all the time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45656, '(He convinced me that something bad might happen)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45657, 'There is nothing more to say.  Go to James at once.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45658, ''),
(45659, ''),
(45660, ''),
(45661, ''),
(45662, ''),
(45670, 'A Bad feeling is always...'),
(45671, 'Blacksmith Karl of Elderine wants you to warn James in Roumen to be careful.  Go tell James what Karl is worried about.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45672, 'Be careful on your way and tell him what I said... I really have a bad feeling this time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45673, '[NAME]... I am so sorry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45674, 'What... What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45675, '(Looks out of his mind)\nThe materials you got me have been stolen...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45676, 'Karl of Elderine just sent me here to warn you because he had a bad feeling...\nHow could this happen...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45677, '(Karl...)\nKarl sensed that something bad would happen...  He is always the most sensitive person and his feelings are never wrong...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45678, 'What do we do now...  Do you have any idea who took them or when they were stolen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45679, 'I think.. it was when I stepped outside to watch this a quarrel in front of my shop...\nI am embarrassed.  I am so sorry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45680, 'If the five materials I collected are the only things missing... it means that someone has been watching our moves.\nIt must be someone\'s plan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45681, 'That\'s what I was thinking.  It\'s just the perfect timing.  Roumenus is the only person I can think of.\nThat sly old man...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45682, 'I know Chief Roumenus was the only person whom you had trouble with... but we shouldn\'t jump the gun.  There is no evidence...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45683, 'Evidence... If only we had evidence...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45684, 'Evidence...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45685, 'Let me think what happened when the materials were stolen.  You can take a rest in the meantime. \nOh, you can go to Ruby and ask her if she has seen anything.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45686, '..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45690, 'Witness Search'),
(45691, 'Skill Master Ruby saw someone sneak into the store with a Jewel Grave Robber costume. Hunt down the Jewel Grave Robbers and see what information you can find. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45692, 'What\'s up?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45693, 'Hi! I just wanted to know more about the fuss in front of the James\' store.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45694, 'Ah! I definitely remember there was a fuss there. What do you wanna know about the fuss?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45695, 'Did you witness anyone entering the James\' store during the fuss?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45696, 'Entering the James\'s store... Hmm... \n(Ruby, who is seriously recalling the incident)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45697, 'Anything suspicious would be really helpful. We lost very precious properties.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45698, 'Something was quite unusual, but I can\'t recall.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45699, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45700, 'I got it. Someone with a monster costume did sneak in the store. \nThe costume was like...\n...\n...\nYes, someone with the {color,yellow,Jewel Grave Robber} costume definitely sneaked in the store.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45701, '{color,yellow,Jewel Grave Robber}... This feels like a puzzle that should be solved. Someone with the Jewel Grave Robber costume sneaked in the store... Hmm\nWhy?\nThey probably wanted us to assume that they are Jewel Grave Robber... Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45702, 'I think you\'re right. One thing that bothers me is that that guy with the monster costume might be actually a monster.\nAnyway, I think I\'ve done my part...\nAnything else you wanna ask?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45703, 'This is enough! Thank you very much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go catch this Jewel Grave Robber.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s take a break for a while.][2]'),
(45704, '[NAME], did you find something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45705, 'Take a look at this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45706, 'Th... this is...!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45707, 'The {color,yellow,Jewel Grave Robber} is the clue to this incident.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45710, 'Questionable Letter'),
(45711, 'James, who read the questionable letter from the grave robber suspects someone but wants to find more evidence. Take out Marlone and gather all the information you can then report back to James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45712, 'Contents of the letter\n(If you can steal the five rare materials from the James\' shop, you will make a fortune and won\'t need to rob jewelry any more.\n\n(Omitted)...\n\nThis letter should be eliminated right away.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45713, 'As I expected, someone was behind all this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45714, 'Did you figure this out by yourself? You did such a great job!\nHowever, we still need more evidence. We should find out who\'s behind this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45715, 'Would the Anti-Hennis Alliance be involved in this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45716, 'I think that we should be open to every possibility. However, I am not sure where to start. This is really major.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45717, 'Are you still suspecting Roumenus?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45718, 'Of course. That sly old man should be the one. I am pretty sure that he will go through so many unpleasant experiences once the truth gets revealed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45719, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45720, 'What should I do next? \n(James, who looks so anxious...)\nHow about this? You said that the Anti-Hennis Alliance might be involved. Why don\'t we investigate the alliance first?\nWhy don\'t you go to {color,yellow, Marlone}\'s hideout and take him out? If he has been involved in some way, you would get information from him. Let\'s start with the most probable outcome.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Marlone, you said? I got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Could I take care of it later?][2]'),
(45721, 'So, what did you get from Marlone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45722, 'Unfortunately, I couldn\'t get anything from Marlone. Do you think our assumptions are wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45723, 'Hmm... Anyhow, you did a great job. No progress from this... Hmm... Let\'s take one step at a time!\nWhy don\'t you take a break and come back later?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45724, 'The {color,yellow, Marlone} is very strong, so you should be very careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45730, 'Search Mission 1'),
(45731, 'James thinks Mara, Marlone\'s sister should be investigated as well. Take out Mara and gather all the information you can then report back to James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45732, 'So, it\'s not Marlone.... Hmm, I can feel it, we are getting closer.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45733, 'Who else would be a suspect?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45734, 'Mara, the Marlone\'s sister, should definitely be on our list.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45735, 'Mara...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45736, 'As you know, they have not been getting along. Both of them are really selfish. We need to check and see what Mara has been up to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45737, 'That makes sense. We will eventually find out about the truth if we take one step at a time... I know the truth is out there...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45738, 'Yes, that\'s the spirit I\'m talking about. I hope you and I successfully finish this mission.\nWell, then... Why don\'t you take out Mara and bring back some type of information?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I feel very tired today.][2]'),
(45739, 'Did Mara have anything to do with it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45740, 'Actually, Mara had a letter too. Here you go.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45741, 'This letter is the same letter as the one that was sent to the grave robber. I seems that Mara didn\'t take this offer.\nThen, who is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45742, 'Do not underestimate {color,yellow, Mara}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45750, 'Search Mission 2'),
(45751, 'Blacksmith James said the guys in black cloaks are heading to the Tower of Iyzel. They are trying to take the powers of the Stone Golem. Defeat the Stone Golem before they can get to it. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45752, 'I guess that the Anti-Hennis Alliance has nothing to do with this case.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45753, 'However, it seems that the Anti-Hennis Alliance sent this letter to everyone who\'s against the alliance. They seem really smart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45754, 'However, there will always be consequences. Who would of imagine that you and I have come this far?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45755, 'Yes, that\'s true. Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45756, 'Town guard: James, I need to talk to you...\n(...)\nThanks! Now, go back to work.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45757, 'What\'s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45758, 'I just heard that those guys in black cloaks were in the Tower of Iyzel making their entries. This must have something to do with those golems in the Tower of Iyzel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45759, 'Golem? Well, all strong monsters in the Tower of Iyzel are golems. Hmm... Why would they want to contact these golems?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45760, 'They may want the special power of the golems.\nWell, we don\'t have much time. Before they do something, why don\'t you take the {color,yellow, Stone Golem} out first? GO! GO! GO! GO!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m feeling really tired. I\'ll take care of it later.][2]'),
(45761, 'Did you see those guys in black cloaks?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45762, 'No. They probably got there before me or they ran off when they saw me. It could be either case.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45763, 'Hmm... Are they trying to disturb us?\nThis is really strange.\nAnyhow, you did a great job. Why don\'t you take a break and come back tomorrow?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45764, 'The {color,yellow, Stone Golem} is a very powerful monster. Don\'t underestimate him. You\'d better take some of your crew. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45770, 'Search Mission 3'),
(45771, 'Blacksmith James has finally obtained information about the Secret Society\'s base. Let\'s see what we can find out about the Secret Society and report back to James.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45772, '[NAME], I finally obtained the critical information I needed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45773, 'Wow... What is it? I\'m really curious!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45774, 'I heard that the Secret Society group has finally revealed themselves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45775, 'So, I get to see those veiled monsters at last! Are they strong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45776, 'I haven\'t seen them yet, but you should be very careful. Although you did take out those golems in the Tower of Iyzel, we did not get anything useful for us. At this point, what we have to do is take them out and find out about the real truth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45777, 'Sounds like a real battle. I am being a little nervous, aren\'t I?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45778, 'I\'m not sure what they are really up to. So...\nJust hang in there! We are almost there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45779, 'Let\'s be more supportive to each other until then!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45780, 'Well, why don\'t you take out the {color,yellow, Secret Society Warrior}? During this battle, you will find out about the master villain who sent the letter to many of the monsters and Anti-Hennis Alliance members.\nPlease take care of this!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m feeling really tired. I\'ll take care of it later.][2]'),
(45781, 'How did it go? Did you finally get the evidence we need this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45782, 'They were really strong, but I could not get evidence. Looks like these guys are real pros.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45783, 'I guess we\'re down to only one option; having a double agent in the Secret Society. I know the perfect guy for this job. I\'ll take care of this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45784, 'Because we don\'t know much about this {color,yellow, Secret Society Warrior}, you should be very careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45790, 'Secret Society\'s Goal'),
(45791, 'The Secret Society finally revealing itself! And, James finding about the society\'s goal! Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45792, 'So, that\'s what happened.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45793, 'Did you figure everything out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45794, 'My strategy to have a double agent in the Secret Society eventually paid off. The agent just reported back to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45795, '(A blacksmith like him taking care of this kind of stuff? Hmm...)\nSo, what happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45796, 'Their goal is to dominate the economy of the Isya Continent and take over all towns on the Continent with their money and political manipulation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45797, 'That\'s why they have been trying to have some fishy deals with those selfish town chiefs. OK! I got that part. But, why would they want to steal the rare materials from you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45798, 'That is one of the unsolved mysteries I cannot solve. There are only two ways to explain this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45799, 'First, they maybe wanted to impress those town chiefs who had trouble with James. Second, they might have felt very threatened by the new equipment. It could either or both.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45800, 'That is some keen insight. You\'re right. However, I don\'t care about the Secret Society whatsoever. All I want is to get those rare materials back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45801, 'You\'re right. We should take care of the most urgent issue first. But, the evidence is still...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45802, '...\nCould you talk Roumenus into confessing something? If he has been involved with the stealing incident in any way, he should be feeling very uncomfortable right now. I want you to talk him into unveiling some evidence.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45810, 'Suspicious Roumenus'),
(45811, 'James who is obsessed with getting the rare items back asked you to manipulate Roumenus. Let\'s have a chat with Roumenus and see what we can find out.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45812, 'Please act normal while talking to him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45813, 'Hey, where have you been these days?\nWhat\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45814, 'Ah! Well... Ha ha ha! I\'ve been to here and there, you know. I\'ve been really busy discovering lots of new facts.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45815, 'What facts? Any good facts about Roumen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45816, 'I got this information that an organization called the Secret Society has been very active in many towns. I\'m sure Roumen has nothing to do with the organization.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45817, '(Roumenus looking extremely nervous)\nHmm... Well... I mean... We have nothing to do with the organization like that. No, we don\'t...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45818, 'However, many sources are telling me that a group of people in black cloaks have been frequently spotted in Roumen. What do you think about that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45819, 'Hmm... I don\'t know anything about that. Why are you asking that question?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45820, 'I\'m saying that many suspicious things have taken place in Roumen. You did not know about these? I\'m really surprised. How did you get associated with these black cloak guys? How, town chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45821, 'That is... Hmm...\nI know nothing. Don\'t harass me with those kind of strange questions any more!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45822, '(I\'m almost there)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45823, 'Just get out of here! Right now! How dare you treat me like this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45824, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45830, 'Evidence Securing'),
(45831, 'A great opportunity to reveal the truth from Roumenus who looked very anxious finally came. Get the Secret Document from the Secret Society Mage.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45832, 'Of course, he should be scared... Why don\'t we relieve that old man\'s anxiety?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45833, 'How?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45834, 'According to my sources, the chief commander of the Secret Society ordered his men to meet with the town chiefs. This means that if we could take the chief commander out, we would get the document that contains all the information we need.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45835, 'We are so close to revealing the truth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45836, 'We are currently at a very critical phase; therefore, we should be more focused. This is not just our problem but the whole Continent\'s issues associated with the Secret Society.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45837, 'I hear you. I\'ll do my best to the end!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45838, 'There is only one thing left to do; getting the secret document from the Secret Society Mage. You should very careful because he is well known for his powerful strengths.\nGo get him!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it later.][2]'),
(45839, '[NAME], did you bring me what I wanted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45840, 'Yes, I did. All we have to do now is solve this mysterious puzzle. Here you go!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45841, 'Now, we should show this to Roumenus and interrogate him accordingly. You did a great job. Please take a break.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45842, 'The {color,yellow, Secret Society Mage} is well known for his powerful strengths. You should be extra careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45850, 'Vast Conspiracy'),
(45851, 'It was finally revealed that Roumenus and the Secret Society did steal the rare materials. Let\'s talk to Roumenus and see what he has to say about this.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45852, 'Show this document to Roumenus. Report back to me with how he reacted to all of this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45853, 'Town Chief Roumenus ~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45854, 'Hmm? You again...\nWh... What brought you here? I still feel unhappy about your attitude last time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45855, 'Well, after doing some more investigation work, I found this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45856, 'What is that paper?\n(Is it...)\nWh... Why did you end up having this?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45857, 'I don\'t think that matters. What matters is why have you been associated with the Secret Society. You should tell me everything in detail before I tell all the Roumen residents that you\'re the one who betrayed them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45858, 'Ar... Are you threatening me? Me, the town chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45859, 'You still don\'t get it. It\'s you who made a huge mistake, not me. Who\'s the one betraying town residents for his own profits?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45860, 'Phew...\nYou got me. I\'ll tell you everything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45861, 'Let\'s see. Where should I start? There was an order from my superiors to steal the rare materials. They said that the new equipment would interfere with their actions and plans.\nI am so helpless, you know. I just pretended that I knew nothing. They told a certain monster to steal the materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45862, 'Once blacksmiths, whom have been arguing with town chiefs, started selling the new equipment, many adventurers would purchase the equipment, therefore allowing blacksmiths to make some serious money. This could be a big threat to some town chiefs. I get it. \nYet, this is very cowardly. Don\'t you think so?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45863, 'Well... But... They kept threatening me about the collapse of Roumen and its residents\' starvation unless we did not supply monthly tax tributes to them.\nAs you know, Roumen has been experiencing financial and commercial difficulties. \nI had no choice but following their instructions.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45864, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45865, 'Actually, I really wanted to help James. How could I forget all his devotion to this town?\nHowever, I could not share the town\'s various problems with him, and thing got even worse between us.\nTell James I said sorry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45866, 'So, then... What are you gonna do now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45867, 'I\'ll go tell James about what happened. And, I\'ll beg for his mercy. I\'ll try to go back to my first day as a town chief and work really hard for my town residents.\nI\'m really sorry for all of this... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45868, 'Why don\'t I talk to James first? Just wait here until I come back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45869, 'Okay, you do that.. You do that...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45870, 'Truth'),
(45871, 'James, who heard what happened to Roumenus. He was very angry at Roumenus but felt a little sorry for him. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45872, '[NAME], did you talk him into it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45873, 'Yes.\n(Tells him about what Roumenus confessed)\nHe confessed, but I feel really sorry for him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45874, 'Up to this point, I thought that Roumenus had schemed all these things for his personal dislikes towards me. However, I think I was wrong about him. He had his own reasons.\nMaybe, I have been too hasty in judging him...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45875, 'I felt the same about him. He did not ignore the well-being of his town residents just for his personal gains. He must have felt really distressed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45876, 'I know... \nIt won\'t be a problem to clear up some of the misunderstanding between us, but we still got one more problem to solve. We should still find the rare materials, you know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45877, 'I know that. I\'m sure he knows something. I\'ll go find out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45878, 'Tell him I said sorry for my suspicion against him. Maybe, we should have dinner or something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45879, 'I hear you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45880, 'Once again, please do me this favor.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45890, 'Weak Town Chief'),
(45891, 'Roumenus, who felt used and is expressing his apologetic emotion. Let\'s hear what he\'s about to say.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45892, 'So... What did James say?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45893, 'He seemed to understand your situation. He said that you should have felt really uneasy as a town chief.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45894, 'James... I\'m sorry. I\'m such a bad town chief...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45895, 'Don\'t be too harsh on yourself. Why don\'t you guys sit together and talk it over?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45896, 'Maybe, you\'re right... But, I still feel really terrible. How am I ever gonna face you and all those town residents?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45897, 'You don\'t have to worry about me. Ah!\nBy the way, who has the rare materials? Do you know anything about that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45898, 'I\'m not sure, but it should be probably either Elbama or the Secret Society\'s managers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45899, 'Elbama?\nYou mean the town chief of Elderine?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45900, 'Yes, he is deeply involved in this. Some even says that he is the founder of the Secret Society...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45901, 'Oh, my!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45902, 'I think it is better that you talk to Elbama. I\'m sorry for everything. I wish you the best.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45910, 'Elbama\'s Goal'),
(45911, 'Roumenus seems very sure that the Secret Society has the secret letter. Go get The records of the Secret Society from the Secret Society Warrior.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45912, 'I hope I could expiate some of my guilt to you and James this way.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45913, 'Is this about the rare materials stolen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45914, 'It may not be a definite information, but I am pretty positive about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45915, 'Please tell me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45916, 'There are commander-level guys in the Secret Society. They are tightly guarded. One of these guys is carrying the document that specifies the relation between the Secret Society and some civilians.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45917, 'Why is the document related to the stolen materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45918, 'It is the evidence needed to reveal who is behind this scheme. That document is the key to finding the location and possessor of the materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45919, 'Looks like it is the first step to find the rare materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45920, 'It is not only the first step but also the last step. This will be the key to everything. So, this mission can be very dangerous because the chief commander of the Secret Society is surrounded by many soldiers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45921, 'I\'ve completed this type of battle million times, so you don\'t need to worry a thing. Trust me on this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45922, 'I really trust you, but you should still be careful though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it later.][2]'),
(45923, 'Great to see you back. Did you get the item I told you about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45924, 'Yes, I did. It was a piece of cake!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45925, 'Now, go to Elbama. Show him this and reveal all the truth.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45926, 'The {color,yellow, Secret Society Warrior} has the {color,yellow, Secret Book}. We should get the book.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45930, 'Conclusion'),
(45931, 'Roumenus wants me to talk to Elbama about the Secret Book. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45932, 'I guess you are all set. Good luck! He is...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45933, 'What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45934, 'Hi, Elbama! I came here to talk to you about this document.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45935, 'I am really busy now right now. You should not bother me with this stupid...\nOops! This is the...\nHow did you...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45936, 'It is a surprise gift for you. Which one do you think is quicker? Me telling all of the Elderine residents about this or You taking this document away from me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45937, '(What an arrogant jerk)\nWhat do you want from me? Are you here to threaten me? What for?\nFor you and the blacksmith\'s materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45938, 'You don\'t get it, do you? There is nothing favorable left for you, Elbama.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45939, 'I did what I had to do. I worked with the Secret Society in order to make Elderine the most economically-developed city in the Continent. \nDid I kill anyone? Did I do something wrong?\nYou are completely mistaken. Maybe, it\'s because you\'re just a kid. I haven\'t done anything wrong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45940, '(Elbama got some nerve)\nDid you threaten the town chief of Roumen with this? Why did you steal the rare materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45941, 'I had never threatened the town chief of Roumen. I just tried to talk him into something because he was not being very cooperative. I told him it was good for his town. Have you ever made an investment? This is just like an investment.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45942, 'I don\'t care about the investment stuff. All I care is the rare materials. Why did you steal those materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45943, 'It was quite a threat to us. I mean, the scheme you and James had planned...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45944, 'So, you just coerce everyone for your own gains like that. That\'s how it goes in Elderine, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45945, 'Such a rookie adventurer like you will never understand this kind of stuff. Just go away. I don\'t care what you decide to do with the document. \nBy the way, why don\'t you also take these materials I borrowed from you last time? I don\'t need them any more, so... Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45946, '(There is nothing more to tell him. This guy is not a town chief but the one who will endanger the whole Isya Continent.)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45947, 'I don\'t wanna waste my precious time with you any more. Just get going.\nBy the way, be very careful~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45948, 'We\'ll see how things will go. So long!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45950, 'Punishment 1'),
(45951, 'James, who got his stuff back wants to wipe out the Secret Society. Lets start off by defeating Secret Society Archers.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45952, 'Aren\'t these the stolen materials?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45953, '(Tells him what happened with Elbama.)\nHe gave back these materials to me. I can\'t understand how such a loser like him became a town chief.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45954, '(James showing an unpleasant emotion)\nThat is why I hate Elderine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45955, 'It was a good opportunity for me to think about a great leader. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(45956, 'Nevertheless, a great leader sometimes should push something in his or her own way just like Elbama did.\nAnyway, I still don\'t like his approach.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45957, 'I guess we have pretty much solved the case.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45958, 'Not yet... Besides Elbama, there are still those Secret Society jabroni\'s out there we should take care of.\nWe should take them down to end this once and for all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45959, 'I\'ve been wondering who the chief commander is for this Secret Society.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45960, 'Let\'s find out about that. The first mission should be to reduce the number of the Secret Society members. You know what I mean..\nWhy don\'t you first reduce the number of the {color,yellow, Secret Society Archers} ?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It should be a piece of cake for me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a tough challenge.][2]'),
(45961, 'You\'re here early. Anything good to hear?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45962, 'There were tens of thousands of those monsters, but they were not that impressive.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45963, 'Great job! Just keep doing what you\'re good at until all of them are wiped out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45964, 'Just kick some {color,yellow, Secret Society Archer}\'s butt!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45970, 'Punishment 2'),
(45971, 'James with a plan to wipe out the Secret Society. The next target is the Secret Society Deputy Commander. Let go and take them down.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(45972, 'Our revenge is not completed yet...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(45973, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45974, 'This is only the beginning, isn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45975, '(Not exactly)\nYes, that\'s true.!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45976, 'We should take more of the Secret Society down. Please hang in there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45977, 'I\'ll do my best until this is over.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45978, 'This time, you should take out the {color,yellow, Secret Society Deputy Commander}. They are very quick and nimble, so you should be very careful.\nBut, I\'m sure you will take care of them, won\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It should be a piece of cake for me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a tough challenge.][2]'),
(45979, 'Was it easy this time as well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45980, 'Not a problem! I could wipe all of them out!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(45981, 'Feels like we are almost there. You did a great job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(45982, 'Why don\'t you go wipe out the {color,yellow, Secret Society Deputy Commander}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46110, 'Punishment 3'),
(46111, 'James with a plan to wipe out the Secret Society. The last target is the Secret Society Chief Commander. Lets go and take him down. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46112, 'We\'re getting really closer.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46113, 'After I wipe out the Secret Society, will you make the new equipment with the rare materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46114, 'I can start making the new equipment right away. However, we still have some business to take care of. I don\'t think productivity will pick up under these circumstances.\nI wanna make the best equipment under the best conditions. I think that\'s better for not only myself but also all the adventurers...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46115, 'You\'re such a pro! I hear you. I will end this journey ASAP by wiping out the organization so as to help you focus on your job.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46116, 'Thanks. Although we are almost there, we should be more careful in a situation like this. I\'m sure you already know what I mean.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46117, 'Yes, I know. Finally, the last mission!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46118, 'This time, you should take out the {color,yellow, Secret Society Chief Commander}. These guys are well known for their accuracy. Hope you pull this mission off and end this journey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Could I take a break first?][2]'),
(46119, 'Just what I expected! I won\'t ask you about the result.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46120, 'I really appreciate your belief in me. I don\'t think there is any enemy left to take down...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46121, 'I\'m not sure about that.\nWhy don\'t go get some rest? I\'ll get some more information just to be 100%-sure.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46122, 'Why don\'t you go take out the {color,yellow, Secret Society Chief Commander}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46130, 'Situation Clearing'),
(46131, 'James, who almost wiped out the Secret Society. He says that all he has to do now is to make the new equipment. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46132, 'Well, we only have one thing to take care of now; making the new equipment!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46133, 'Wow~ This is exciting. Are you going to make my equipment first?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46134, 'Of course. However, you should wait because there is a procedure of separating and synthesizing the materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46135, '...\n...\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46136, 'I can\'t believe this! How could this happen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46137, 'Is there something  wrong with the rare materials? Or, did Elbama do something to the materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46138, 'No, there is nothing wrong with the rare materials. Also, I don\'t see any manipulation by Elbama. Yet, these materials cannot be synthesized. \nDoes this mean I am missing something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46139, 'I feel really worried... Why is this happening?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46140, 'I got it. I think we, the blacksmiths, should focus more on our researches and studies. How could I forget this critical item?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46141, 'What do you mean? Are you saying that you need additional materials for the synthesis process?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46142, 'Yes, I need more materials for the synthesis process. Actually, I need two more rare items for the process.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46143, 'I\'m really sorry. I\'m afraid you will need to help me one more time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46144, '..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46150, 'Synthesis of Materials 1'),
(46151, 'James, saying he needs additional materials for a perfect synthesis. He needs the Zombie King\'s Mucus from the Zombie King. Help him get the item he needs.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46152, 'Hmm... Where should I start to explain this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46153, 'From the top~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46154, 'Before you came, I discussed this issue with Hans and Karl, but we totally forgot about the synthesis materials. I guess we are getting old, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46155, 'That could happen to anyone. We all make mistakes and learn from them, don\'t we?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46156, 'You\'re totally right. This was a great experience for us. Anyhow, I need the synthesis materials. Are you ready to get them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46157, 'I\'m always ready, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46158, 'Hmm... I feel relieved because we have you, but these synthesis materials are really hard to get.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46159, 'Where can I get them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46160, 'I need the {color,yellow,Zombie King\'s Mucus} from the {color,yellow, Zombie King}.\nI am worried because it\'s a strong monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46161, 'Oh... OK.  I\'ll try. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46162, 'I am really sorry for putting you through all these troubles and dangers, but you are the perfect person for this job. If it\'s too much, you may want to take your crew to get the {color,yellow, Zombie King\'s Mucus}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I hear you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have such crew.][2]'),
(46163, 'I am glad you are safe... I was more worried about you than I was about the material..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46164, 'It was quite challenging. Here are the material you asked for.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46165, 'Well done.  There is one last item to get.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46166, 'Go with strong friends.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46170, 'Synthesis of Materials 2'),
(46171, 'James, saying he needs additional materials for a perfect synthesis. He needs the Powder of Fantasy from the Iron Zombie Knight. Help him get the item he needs.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46172, 'This is the last step.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46173, 'I hope you are telling me the truth. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46174, 'Of course, it is. We don\'t need anything else except for this last material. I feel good about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46175, 'Phew... Glad to hear that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46176, 'The last item is the {color,yellow, Powder of Fantasy}, which you should get from the {color,yellow, Zombie Knight} . This challenge is a lot like the last one, so you\'d better take some adventurers with you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46177, 'OK.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46178, 'Go and get {color,yellow, Powder of Fantasy} from {color,yellow, Zombie Knight}\'s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have no strong friend.][2]'),
(46179, 'Is this it...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46180, 'It\'s done!  All done!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46181, 'Thanks... Thanks a million!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46182, 'Get {color,yellow, Powder of Fantasy} from {color,yellow, Zombie Knight}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46190, 'At Last...'),
(46191, 'James, who just finished preparatory works for the synthesis of the rare materials. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46192, 'Well, all we have to do now is pray.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46193, 'Didn\'t you say that everything was perfect?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46194, 'Yes, everything seems perfect now, but you never know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46195, 'Why do you keep saying these ominous words?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46196, 'I\'ve been through too many strange things lately, so... I\'m still a little worried.\nI guess that all these strange happenings have made me skeptical.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46197, 'I know what you mean. However, we should still pray for our luck too!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46198, 'I\'m really nervous. I\'ll get right into it, so why don\'t you wait for a while?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46199, '...\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46200, '(Iron-smiting sound)\nTang! Tang!\n...\nTang!! Tang!!\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46201, '(Waiting impatiently)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46202, 'I did it! I finally did it!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46203, 'Wow~ Congratulations!! At last, we can develop the new equipment!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46204, 'All of this could happen because of you. Thank you... Thank you so much...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46205, 'No, we did it together! Yes!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46206, 'So, our dream finally came true. Today in here!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46207, '...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46210, 'Reward'),
(46211, 'James, saying he would upgrade shields as a reward. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46212, '[NAME], welcome. It\'s time to get rewarded.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46213, 'New Armor? Thank you very much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46214, 'Hmm? This is not free!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46215, 'What? Are you saying I should pay for it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46216, 'Hu-hu, I\'m Just Kidding.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46217, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46218, 'It\'s all done. Here is your new armor. Please keep working hard for the peace of the Isya Continent!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46310, 'James\' Hunting Request 1'),
(46311, 'James, who\'s curious about the performance of the armor wants to test it out. He wants you to defeat Foxes and Fire ViVis and report back with results of the hunt.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46312, '[NAME], looking good~~!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46313, 'Well, maybe it\'s because of the new armor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46314, 'You seem very happy, and that makes me smile. However, I haven\'t tested the armor myself, and I\'m a little worried about its performance.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46315, 'It\'s the best for sure! Why don\'t we go for a hunt to test it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46316, 'Ha ha ha...\nI really appreciate your suggestion, but I can\'t leave this workshop. But if you have the time, I want you to do me a favor.\nCould you eliminate the {color,yellow, Foxes} and {color,yellow, Fire ViVis} and tell me about the armors performance?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m taking off!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You do it yourself.][2]'),
(46317, 'How did it perform?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46318, 'It performed flawlessly~ But there was certainly not many enemies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46319, 'Really? I got it. You did a great job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46320, 'Why don\'t you eliminate the {color,yellow, Foxes} and {color,yellow, Fire ViVis}  and then report to me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46330, 'James\' Hunting Request 2'),
(46331, 'James is running low on the materials to make the existing weapons and shields. He asks you to get the item Hard Rock from the Baby WereBears to help make the older weapons. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46332, '[NAME], give me some time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46333, 'Sure~~ What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46334, 'I\'m a little embarrassed. While I\'ve been using most materials for making the new equipment, there is shortage in material inventory for existing weapons and shields. I want you to get the necessary materials for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46335, 'Can\'t you just keep making only the new equipment?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46336, 'Most people would agree with that, but some adventurers with financial difficulties cannot afford the new equipment. Because the equipment materials are not disclosed to public, the new equipment cannot be made for free. Due to these reasons, I need certain materials for old weapons and shields.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46337, 'Hmm... That makes sense. Which types of materials should I bring to you then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46338, 'You should get the {color,yellow, Hard Rock}. However, this material is very scarce these days... You can get it from the {color,yellow, Baby WereBear}.\nOkay then! Please do it for me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a piece of cake.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about just using the stones from Roumen?][2]'),
(46339, 'You\'re here early. Do I have to still worry about the stone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46340, 'You know this... Man!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46341, 'Thanks. If anything comes up, I\'ll let you know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46342, 'I need more of those {color,yellow, Hard Rock}s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46350, 'James\' Hunting Request 3'),
(46351, 'James is running low on the materials to make the existing weapons and shields. He asks you to get the item Rusty Iron from the Hob to help make the older weapons. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46352, '[NAME], the same type of a problem came up again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46353, '...\nYou\'ve been facing too many problems. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46354, 'Since the Secret Society incident, I\'ve experienced these weird problems over and over again. Maybe some sort of an after effect?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46355, 'Yes, I still remember the incident. I totally understand what you are saying.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46356, 'I\'m really fine. However, whenever I try to work, it feels like something is missing. Just like being possessed by a demon... I also have a feeling that those rare materials could be stolen again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46357, 'Just tell me! I can get you anything you need. So, don\'t worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46358, 'Now, I feel very relieved. You are really a true Roumen warrior. Let\'s cut to the chase, then. Please get me the {color,yellow, Rusty Iron}. The {color,yellow, Hob} monsters carries this item. Then I can melt this item down and start making some equipment, but I don\'t have enough quantity of this item on hand. Once again, please do me this favor. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a piece of cake.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about just using the Roumen irons?][2]'),
(46359, 'You\'re  Back. You got the item I requested?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46360, 'It was harder than I expected to get this item. I though it would be easy. Anyhow, this should be enough for you for a while~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46361, 'As always, thank you very much. Go get some rest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46362, 'Would you get me the {color,yellow, Rusty Iron}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46370, 'James\' Hunting Request 4'),
(46371, 'James is running low on the materials to make the existing weapons and shields. He asks you to defeat the Hobs. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46372, 'That\'s right. These guys tried to steal my materials once already.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46373, 'Anything missing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46374, 'No, but...\nI just realized that some rude monsters tried to steal my materials in the past.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46375, 'What rude monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46376, 'They were the {color,yellow, Hob} monsters. Such disgraceful creatures...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46377, 'Time for revenge?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46378, 'With your skills and my armor, nothing will be impossible. So, do you wanna give it a try?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a piece of cake!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m busy right now, so...][2]'),
(46379, 'You\'re back so quick. Revenge is mine!!!! Or, am I getting ahead of myself?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46380, 'You\'re right, I seriously kicked their butts. They won\'t be seen around for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46381, 'Well, good job! Everything\'s going great. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46382, 'Why don\'t you go eliminate the {color,yellow, Hobs}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46390, 'Karl\'s Hunting Request 1'),
(46391, 'Blacksmith Karl of Elderine complains about the shortage in supplies of existing materials. Defeat the Goblins that carry the Blacksmith Tool Kit and bring them back to Karl.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46392, 'Hmm... We\'re in big trouble!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46393, 'Aren\'t you also making the new equipment? It doesn\'t seem like you are having any problems~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46394, 'Thanks to you and James, I\'ve been making the new equipment, but... Current tools that us blacksmiths use are extremely short in supply...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46395, 'James had the same problem, but I resolved the problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46396, 'Oh! So, you came here in advance to help me out? You are really something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46397, 'Not exactly... Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46398, 'Let\'s cut to the chase. Lately, these Goblin monsters have been trying to develop their own techniques. They all carry this special item, and I want you to get this {color,yellow, Blacksmith Tool Kit} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hear you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate Goblins.][2]'),
(46399, 'I\'ve been waiting for you to come. Most of the existing materials are almost gone...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46400, 'Don\'t worry! I\'ve taken lots of those Blacksmith Tool Kits. I don\'t think you have anything to worry about for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46401, 'Oh! This is really great. If anything challenging comes up, I\'ll count on you.\nYou did a wonderful job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46402, 'Get me as many {color,yellow, Blacksmith Tool Kit}s as possible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46410, 'Karl\'s Hunting Request 2'),
(46411, 'Karl The Blacksmith of Elderine is saying that he needs special items for certain equipment most customers request of... For some strange reason the Prock carries the Frog\'s Air Bladder. Go and get this item for Karl.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46412, 'Darn it! This item is always not available when I need it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46413, 'Which item made you this mad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46414, 'Ah, you\'re back. Phew! Not long ago, I had this great request from one of my best customers. He asked me to make a cool shield.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46415, 'What\'s the problem, then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46416, 'Well, there is something problematic... I can\'t find the most important item. It should be somewhere around here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46417, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46418, 'Anyway, time is running out. You\'re the only one who can solve this problem. I\'ll tell you what I need. \nYou can get the {color,yellow, Frog\'s Air Bladder} from a Prock. This special Air Bladder contains lots of great stuff I need. I really need this item. And don\'t ask me why a Prock carries this item. It just does.. Now, would you please help me with this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about another kind of a bladder?][2]'),
(46419, 'Did you get the bladder? It may sound to hasty, but I really need that item now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46420, 'Here is the bladder you wanted. All you gotta do now is stay calm.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46421, 'Great! I got plenty of time to make a great product for the customers. Before I say thank you, let me take care of this first...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46422, 'Please get me the {color,yellow, Frog\'s Air Bladder} ASAP.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46430, 'Karl\'s Hunting Request 3'),
(46431, 'Karl is so upset about the fact that his weapon are useless against particular types of monsters. Karl\nasks you to check out this theory with the Earth Spider. After facing the Earth Spider return to Karl.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46432, 'Oh, my! How could this sort of thing happen to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46433, 'It happens all the time. That\'s life, isn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46434, 'No... This is about my pride. The master-piece weapons I make are useless against those monsters... How could I live with that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46435, 'Hmm... Those monsters are so strong. It could happen to any blacksmith.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46436, 'That doesn\'t make sense at all. I\'ve never witnessed my weapons being this useless.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46437, '(Seems like his pride is really hurt)\nHmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46438, '(Taking a deep breath...)\nI want you to do me another favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46439, 'You\'ve always ask for my help!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46440, 'Asking you for a favor really hurts my pride. However, I really want to know what kinds of monsters are immune to my weapons.\nPlease do me this favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46441, 'Sounds fun! Which monster should I check out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46442, 'The monster is called the {color,yellow, Earth Spider}. After you take them out, I want you to go through a thorough analysis about them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of a spider, so...][2]'),
(46443, 'So, were they too strong for my sword? What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46444, 'Your weapon were sort of useless. Definitely, they were not one of those ordinary monsters. I don\'t think any civilian with any kind of weapon would take these monsters out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46445, 'Phew! If that\'s true, it\'s not my weapon that is the problem. It is a user who uses the weapon, isn\'t it?\nEven if that is true, I still have my duty to protect any civilian with my weapons even though the civilian is very weak. Tough situation for me...\nI need to be alone for a while. You did a great job, though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46446, 'Go check how capable the {color,yellow, Earth Spider} can be.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46450, 'Hans\' Hunting Request 1'),
(46451, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga is saying that he personally hates certain monsters. He asks you to defeat the Robo\'s and report back to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46452, 'Hmm... What can I do to kick these monsters\' butts?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46453, 'Hi, Hans!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46454, 'You are [NAME], whom has been a hero for us! What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46455, 'Not much. Lately, I\'ve been very busy taking care of business for many of the blacksmiths.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46456, 'Wow... You\'ve come this far to Uruga just to do me a favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46457, 'Ha ha ha!\nYes, probably!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46458, 'You\'re such a character. What matters is not a person\'s appearance but what\'s inside the person.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46459, 'Is there anything I can do for you? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46460, 'Yes, there is. I am having troubles with those {color,yellow, Robo} monsters lately. These monsters are so annoying and unforgivable, and they have been destroying my weapons and shields.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46461, 'It\'s time to show them what we got!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46462, 'That\'s what I\'m talking about! Kick those {color,yellow, Robo}s butts!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll show them what I got.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What do you mean by kicking their butts?][2]'),
(46463, 'Oh! Seems like you took care of that easily.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46464, 'Nothing is difficult to me. Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46465, 'Really? Then, I may trouble you with a more challenging task next time! You did a great job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46466, 'Go take those {color,yellow, Robo} monsters out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46470, 'Hans\' Hunting Request 2'),
(46471, 'Hans is running low on materials he needs for making armor. He needs you to get him the Blacksmith Tool Kit from the Hob Fighter. Find this item for Hans and bring it back to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46472, 'Ugh! Why do things like this keep happening to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46473, 'That\'s life, isn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46474, 'I know, but this is too much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46475, 'Talk to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46476, 'I need more of the blacksmith materials, you know... The item that the {color,yellow, Hob Fighter} monsters are carrying.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46477, 'Did you say {color,yellow, Hob Fighter}? Not long ago, these monsters were...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46478, 'Well... Sorry to bother you again! But, I have no choice but asking you to get me the {color,yellow, Blacksmith Tool Kit} from those monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46479, 'If I get you the {color,yellow, Blacksmith Tool Kit}, are you gonna be happy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46480, 'Of course. I won\'t bother you for quite a while. So, what do you think?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you do it yourself?][2]'),
(46481, 'You\'re back. You look great! Looks like I don\'t need to ask you about what happened.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46482, 'You figured it out already! Here is the kit you wanted.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46483, 'Wow! Thanks. I guess I just have to do my job without worrying about a thing for a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46484, 'If I could just get the {color,yellow, Blacksmith Tool Kit}..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46490, 'Hans\' Hunting Request 3'),
(46491, 'Blacksmith Hans of Uruga mentioned a monster he used to fight against. In a battle this monster cheated. Go and defeat the Dungeon Goblin for Hans.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46492, 'Yes, it was that monster...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46493, 'Which monster are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46494, 'There was this monster I used to fight against. I was about to finally get the material I was looking for, but the monster suddenly started to attack me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46495, 'Hmm... Did the monster want the same thing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46496, 'Probably, he did. Probably... We had a serious battle. And, the monster cheated and took the material away from me.\nSince then, I\'ve never seen it. Mysteriously...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46497, 'Hmm... Should I go get the monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46498, 'Well... Now, I don\'t have any grudge against the monster. I may have to thank it because the monster did not kill me although it cheated...\nStill, it was not fair...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46499, 'What do you want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46500, 'Speaking of the monster, why don\'t you kick its butt? This is not that necessary, but you seem so pumped up...\nThe monster\'s name was {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblin}. Go find the monster.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m taking off!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t take out the monster by yourself?][2]'),
(46501, 'Have you taken out the monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46502, 'Yes, I have. However, it was too easy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46503, '(Is this guy saying that I am kind of weak?)\nHmm... You did a great job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46504, 'Its name is {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblin}. I couldn\'t find it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46510, 'James\' Request 1'),
(46511, 'James wants me to eliminate the monster that has been bothering him for a long time. Help him eliminate the Mage Book.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46512, 'Hey, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46513, 'I don\'t know why, but you look really great today.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46514, 'I always look... Not great... A monster has been haunting me lately, and I have not been able to get enough sleep.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46515, 'Well you look okay, but how you felt is guess is totally different... What a fool I am!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46516, 'No one should be judged by their looks, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46517, 'Please tell me which monster has been bothering you. I\'ll take care of it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46518, '{color,yellow, Mage Book}... One day, I wanted to relax my mind and went out on an adventure. It was suppose to be a peaceful journey but then I was attacked by Mage Book. These monsters ruined my peaceful mind state I was in at the time. Now I am scarred by this encounter. Please help me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46519, 'I\'ll help you erase the bad memory.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46520, 'Thanks. I totally depend on you. The target this time is the {color,yellow, Mage Book}. Show it who is boss.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m taking off!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can because I have a bad stomachache][2]'),
(46521, 'You\'re back. Can I assume that you took care of my request?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46522, 'The monster won\'t be bothering you any more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46523, 'Thanks. Now, I\'m ready to go on another peaceful journey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46524, 'Do not underestimate the {color,yellow, Mage Book}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46530, 'James\' Request 2 (Repeated Quest)'),
(46531, 'James says he wants to have a certain item and makes a personal request. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46532, '[NAME]! What a perfect timing!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46533, 'I was a little surprised that you wanted to see me so soon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46534, 'Ah, I\'m sorry... I was being too hasty...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46535, 'No, no need to apologize... Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46536, 'Okay then! Let\'s cut to the chase.\nIn fact, I want to have an item called {color,yellow, Prism Powder}. This item is not useful for my work, but I have wanted this item for a long time. I don\'t think I can confront all those strong monsters just to get the item, but I\'m sure you\'re strong enough to take these monsters out and get me the item.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46537, 'Hmm... {color,yellow, Prism Powder}... Sounds like it is a very valuable item. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46538, 'Actually, it is not as valuable as it sounds. So, would you take care of my request?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I won\'t.][2]'),
(46539, 'What happened? Did you get the item?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46540, 'Looks like just a regular item. Why is it called Prism Powder? Anyway, here it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46541, 'Oh! I\'ve wanted this really badly.. Thanks! Hope you do me a favor next time again. In return, I will make your equipment great~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46542, 'Go get the {color,yellow, Prism Powder}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46550, 'James\' Request 2 (Repeated Quest)'),
(46551, 'James has a personal request and asks for more of the Prism Powders. Help James collect this item from Dungeon Mage Books.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46552, '[NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46553, 'Any other requests?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46554, 'Actually, I need more of the {color,yellow, Prism Powder}s. Can you do that for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I won\'t.][2]'),
(46555, 'You did a great job. If it\'s okay with you, can you get me more of the {color,yellow, Prism Powder}s?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46556, 'Go get the {color,yellow, Prism Powder}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46560, 'Karl\'s Request 1'),
(46561, 'Karl, the blacksmith of Elderine says that his age is catching up on him and he can no longer reach these itchy places by himself. He asks you to find a Skeleton\'s Bone to help him with his problem.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46562, 'Ugh! What now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46563, 'Hey, Karl!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46564, 'Good to see you back. I have a big burden on my shoulders...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46565, 'What kind of burden?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46566, 'As you know, I\'m getting older and feeling weaker every day. What do you think the most important thing is when you get old?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46567, 'Well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46568, 'I can\'t take care of itchiness by myself. This may sound ridiculous, but it is true. And, it is a serious issue to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46569, '(Trying not to laugh)\nPhew!\nYes, that\'s true. How painful would it be not being able to scratch an itchy spot...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46570, 'Speaking of itchiness, I want you to take care of my problem. Why don\'t you get me the {color,yellow, Skeleton\'s Bone} from a Skeleton Warrior? If you can do so, I\'ll take care of the rest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like sharp objects, so...][2]'),
(46571, 'I feel really itchy all over! Did you get me the item I wanted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46572, 'Here you go. No itchiness from now on...\nPhew!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46573, 'Itchiness is the worst enemy to a man. You will know it when you get older.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46574, 'Be careful not to have yourself cut with the {color,yellow, Skeleton\'s Bone}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46580, 'Karl\'s Request 2'),
(46581, 'Karl says he dislikes sharp objects and Skeletons. Help with one of his fears and eliminate some of the Skeleton Warriors\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46582, 'Hmm... I don\'t know how to understand this weird dream I keep having.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46583, 'Seems like you keep having a nightmare.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46584, 'In the dream, I was walking on a pile of sharply-broken bones with my bare feet. It reminded me of these Skeletons I really dislike.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46585, 'Hmm... Skeleton... They look scary at first sight but after awhile, you get used to it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46586, 'That\'s true. However, I really dislike sharp things and skeletons. These things make me sick. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46587, 'You\'re a blacksmith, so you should deal with lots of sharp objects. How can do your job then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46588, 'Whenever I see sharp objects, I try to make them blunt. But, a monster, though... \nThinking of skeletons makes me sick... Darn it! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46589, 'Are you OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46590, 'Would you please eliminate the {color,yellow, Skeleton Warriors}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds very spooky! I won\'t do it.][2]'),
(46591, 'Skeletons.. What happened to the Skeletons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46592, 'Don\'t worry! I took care of them~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46593, 'Th... Thanks... I need some rest. Can you come back later?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46594, '{color,yellow, Skeleton Warriors}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46600, 'Their Friendship 1'),
(46601, 'Hans talks about a monster that threatened his friend. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46602, 'Billy.. How have you been these days?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46603, 'Billy..? Never heard of him!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46604, 'Hey, it\'s you. \nBilly is my friend.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46605, 'Ah! Why Billy then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46606, 'He just popped up on my mind. He could have got into a serious accident, and I\'m kind of worried about him..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46607, 'What accident?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46608, 'He was seriously threatened by a monster called the {color,yellow, Desert Tree}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46609, 'Well, it could have been really ugly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46610, 'Although Billy could avoid the worst scenario, he is still suffering from the accident. All I wanna do for my friend, Billy, is a revenge against the monster. But, I can\'t leave here, so..\nI want you to do me a favor. Could you please eliminate the {color,yellow, Desert Tree}? For Billy?\nCan you do that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hear you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He\'s your friend. So, why don\'t you take care of it by yourself?][2]'),
(46611, 'So, did you take down the monster for Billy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46612, 'Yes, I did take it out, but I\'m not sure how helpful this would be for your friend, Billy..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46613, 'You did a great job for Billy. I\'ll tell him about this. Thanks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46614, 'Could you please eliminate the {color,yellow, Desert Tree}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46620, 'Their Friendship 2'),
(46621, 'Hans says there is a medicine for Billy. Let\'s have a chat with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46622, 'It\'s time to show the monster how it is gonna pay for its wrong doing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46623, 'Are you talking about your friend?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46624, 'You did a great job for Billy, but I still want to do something more for him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46625, 'Hmm.. Aren\'t you being too obsessive? I am pretty sure the monster learned a lesson.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46626, 'I know, but listen very carefully. There is an interesting fact you should know.\nThe {color,yellow, Desert Tree} has the {color,yellow, Old Sap}, and the sap could be a great cure for the Billy\'s pain.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46627, 'Hmm.. You\'re saying that the {color,yellow, Desert Tree} could be a great cure for Billy although it did hurt your friend.\nAm I right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46628, 'Yes. A pain as well as a cure.. In a certain way, this could be a great chance to make the monster pay for its wrong doing..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46629, 'Sounds like a good idea. Hmm.. We could not only get the Billy\'s medicine but also wipe them out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46630, 'Seems like a great plan! Then, why don\'t you take the {color,yellow, Old Sap} away from the {color,yellow, Desert Tree}?\nCan you do that for us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He\'s your friend. So, why don\'t you do it by yourself?][2]'),
(46631, 'I\'m sure my friend, Billy, will love you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46632, 'Here you go. Hope your friend gets cured soon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46633, 'Thanks. I\'ll tell Billy about your name and also your kindness.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46634, 'Would you go get the {color,yellow, Old Sap}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46640, 'Roumen\'s Security Issue 1'),
(46641, 'Maria, who is very concerned about Roumen says there is a security leak. The Archmage Book was seen in town, flying around. Go and defeat the Archmage Book so this doesn\'t happen again.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46642, 'Oh, dear! Why is this town so unstable?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46643, 'Ms. Maria, what makes you so anxious?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46644, 'What a perfect timing! [NAME]. Lately, Roumen\'s security has been really insecure.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46645, 'Aren\'t there some guards?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46646, 'Yes, there are, but... There has been this strange atmosphere around the town. It\'s like nobody cares even though something strange happens.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46647, 'Hmm... I know what you mean.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46648, 'Moreover, I did witness a strange thing by myself. A book was flying in the air. Most town residents got scared and just ran away.\n...\nYes, that\'s right. It was the {color,yellow, Archmage Book}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46649, '{color,yellow, Archmage Book}??\nWhy was a monster like that wandering around the town? \nActually, nobody could have noticed it because it was just a book...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46650, 'That is why I brought up the security issue. I should talk to our town chief about the town\'s security issue. Could you take care of the {color,yellow, Archmage Book} monsters so that they won\'t be seen in this town again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It seems really scary. I can\'t do it.][2]'),
(46651, 'Could I assume that Roumen\'s security issue has been settled?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46652, 'Yes, I guess so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46653, 'I wish that was true. You did a wonderful job for this town, but we still have more security issues, but you took care of the biggest part of our security problems.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46654, 'Go kick some {color,yellow, Archmage Book}\'s butt!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46660, 'Roumen\'s Security Issue 2 (Repeated Quest)'),
(46661, 'Maria, who is very concerned about Roumen says there is a security leak. The Archmage Book was only the 1st part of the problem. Seems that now the Cave Archmage Book is appearing in town. Lets handle this situation for Maria.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46662, 'Oh, dear! How could this town be still unsafe?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46663, 'Maria! Why are you so worried?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46664, 'Ah! [NAME]...\nPhew!\nIn spite of your wonderful job, this town\'s security is still unstable. Maybe, I am not that capable...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46665, 'Is there another monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46666, 'Yes, there is. Although the {color,yellow, Archmage Book} disappeared, a similar monster is still wandering around. \nWhy are these book-type monsters frequently appearing in Roumen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46667, 'You\'d better ask that to the monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46668, 'I guess we have no solution. You\'re the only one we can trust, [NAME]. It\'s only you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46669, 'Why me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46670, 'You\'re truly the only one. Please eliminate the {color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book}. Please make the monster disappear from Roumen.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t wanna do it.][2]'),
(46671, 'What happened? Did you take them out as I expected?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46672, 'Yes, ma\'am!\nYou will never see the monster again in Roumen...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46673, 'Great, [NAME]! Why don\'t you volunteer for the Roumen Guard service? If you do so, Roumen can remain peaceful...\nAh, something\'s not right. I\'m afraid that the {color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book} will strike this town again. Can you come back later?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46674, 'Go kick some {color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book}\'s butt!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46680, 'Roumen\'s Security Issue 2 (Repeated Quest)'),
(46681, 'Maria says that the Roumen\'s unstable security is still problematic. Go and defeat Cave Archmage Book\'s again to help stop the problem.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46682, 'Again...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46683, 'Those monsters, again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46684, 'I totally trust you, but the {color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book} keeps striking town. Could you please kick their butts?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t wanna do it.][2]'),
(46685, 'You did a great job. However, these monsters may come back later, so... Could you eliminate more of these {color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46686, '{color,yellow, Cave Archmage Book}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46690, 'Unpleasant Dream'),
(46691, 'Robin in Roumen said he keeps having a bad dream about spiders. Maybe if we eliminate the spiders his dream will go away. Lets see what happens...\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46692, 'Gosh, why do I keeping having this weird dream?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46693, 'Hi, Robin!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46694, 'So, [NAME]. What brings you here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46695, 'I\'m here to see you. You look great!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46696, 'I may look good outside, but I haven\'t been feeling well lately.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46697, 'What bothering you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46698, 'You know, an old man\'s agony... I keep having this bad dream about a spider. Feels like I saw this spider in the past...\nI\'ve done nothing wrong to any spider, but I keep having this weird dream about a spider.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46699, 'So, what happened? There must be something relating to the dream...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46700, 'You know I\'ve lived a very long life. I don\'t remember everything. The important thing is that this dream has made my life miserable.\nSo, what do you think? Is there anything you can do for this old man?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46701, 'Sure, I\'ll help you. What kind of spider was it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46702, 'Just a regular spider..\nIf you can eliminate these spiders, maybe the dream will go away.\nPlease help me. \nPlease eliminate the {color,yellow, Spider}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it now.][2]'),
(46703, '(Robin, an old man coughing badly)\nCough! Cough! You\'re back. So, was it worth waiting?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46704, 'Well, you won\'t have such spider dream ever again!\nIf you still have a dream like that with all those spiders taken down, I can\'t do anything about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46705, 'Thanks. I knew you wouldn\'t let me down. I\'ll try not to have such dreams again, but I\'m not sure it could be controlled that easy...\nAnyway, Thanks. [NAME]\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46706, 'Once you eliminate the {color,yellow, Spider}, I won\'t have the Spider Dream.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46710, 'Hobby (Repeated Quest)'),
(46711, 'Robin in Roumen is having some problems with his new hobby. He is having a problem getting things to glue together properly. Get him some Sticky Spider Web from a Spider so he can use that. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46712, 'Darn it! It\'s not getting properly glued.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46713, 'What are you doing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46714, 'Ah! You know...\nAn old man\'s little hobby... I wanted to make a sculpture, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46715, 'Sounds like a great hobby? It really matches you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46716, 'Well, thanks!\nYet, nothing\'s easy. It\'s not getting properly glued.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46717, 'Hmm... Do you want me to get some glue from Ms. Pey? Ms. Pey should must have something, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46718, 'Actually, I did ask Pey for a glue, but she is out of glue. I did some research and found something better than glue.  I found out that the {color,yellow, Sticky Spider Web} that can be acquired from the {color,yellow, Spider} is natures super glue.\nI don\'t think I can get the item myself, but... If you have some time, would you please go get the item for this old man\'s hobby? \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it now.][2]'),
(46719, 'I\'ve been expecting you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46720, 'Here is the item you wanted! Now, you can enjoy your hobby.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46721, 'Well, thanks! If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know. I really want to return your favor.\nCan you get me more of these just in case?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46722, 'If I could just get some {color,yellow, Sticky Spider Web}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46730, 'Hobby (Repeated Quest)'),
(46731, 'Robin needs more Sticky Spider Webs from a Spider for his hobby. Go and help the old man out. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46732, 'I\'m out of Sticky Spider Webs... Maybe, I used up too many materials.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46733, 'What? Already?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46734, 'An old man like me does run into problems, you know...\nI need more of {color,yellow, Sticky Spider Web}.\nCould you get me more of those?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it now.][2]'),
(46735, 'Well, thanks! If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know. I really want to return your favor.~\nCan you get me more of these just in case?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46736, 'If I could just get some {color,yellow, Sticky Spider Web}..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46740, 'I Want To Make a Necklace!'),
(46741, 'Kid Woz in Elderine wants to make his own necklace. He is asking for the Sharp Canine from an Tomb Fox. Help Kid Woz get the item so he can start on his necklace.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46742, 'What should I do to make my own necklace?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46743, 'Hey, kiddo! What\'s on your mind?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46744, 'Not much...\nI just want to make my own necklace for myself, but I don\'t know where to start.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46745, 'You have someone to impress, don\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46746, 'I just wanna do something on my own. That\'s all! Don\'t make fun of a little boy\'s pure dream.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46747, 'Hmm...\nThen, where do you want to start first?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46748, 'I do have a necklace string, but I haven\'t still decided what to be strung.\nAh! Okay!\nPlease listen very carefully, [NAME]. I heard that canines of the {color,yellow, Tomb Fox} were very shiny and beautiful!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46749, 'Are you saying that..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46750, 'Yes! Just like you though... Would you reject a little boy\'s request?\nI want you to get me the {color,yellow, Sharp Canine} of the {color,yellow, Tomb Fox}. It will make a perfect necklace!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it just once.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to do it.][2]'),
(46751, 'Did you get them? I\'ve waited so eagerly that I thought I would stop breathing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46752, 'Don\'t rush me, kid! Here is what you wanted. Now, it\'s your turn. You should make a cool necklace.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46753, 'Wow! This is really cool. I\'ll just start making a cool necklace~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46754, 'Don\'t forget! It is the {color,yellow, Sharp Canine} I want.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46760, 'Toys and Monsters'),
(46761, 'Kid Woz in Elderine says that he once mistook a walking stick monster as a toy and got himself in danger. Now he wants to take revenge on the monster called King Staff. Go and kick the King staff\'s butt!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46762, 'How could I be that stupid? Darn it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46763, 'This kid never gets tired~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46764, 'Don\'t be so sarcastic! I almost lost my life!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46765, 'What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46766, 'One day, I visited a countryside in Elderine and found this walking stick. It looked like one of those mysterious walking sticks, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46767, 'Hmm...  Did the walking stick suddenly become alive and attach you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46768, 'Yes! I ran like crazy. Why me? Why a little boy like me?\nI\'ll never forget this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46769, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46770, 'I want you to take my revenge on the monster. Don\'t forget I\'ve always appreciated your help.\nPlease go kick some {color,yellow, King Staff}\'s butt! I\'ll be here in Elderine cheering for you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it just once.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to do it.][2]'),
(46771, 'Did you make them feel my pain?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46772, '(Pain? This kid just ran away)\nPhew! More than you ever imagined! I don\'t think they will be spotted near hear any more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46773, 'Way to go! You are truly one of the best adventurers I\'ve ever seen. I look forward to asking you more favors.\nThanks, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46774, 'Why don\'t you kick some {color,yellow, King Staff}\'s butt!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46780, 'Ruby\'s Request 1'),
(46781, 'Ruby in Roumen says that she really dislikes nimble monsters. One that is getting to her is the Bored Fox. Go and defeat this nimble creature for Ruby.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46782, 'Ugh! Just thinking about monsters makes me sick. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46783, 'Ruby! Who made you this shivery?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46784, 'I... I really...\nI really hate these nimble monsters!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46785, 'Calm down! Tell me about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46786, 'These monsters can easily make my excellent swordsmanship skills useless. They are so nimble that they can dodge anything.\nAh! I need to be trained more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46787, 'No! It was either they got lucky or you were a little tired.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46788, 'That makes me wanna cry, but...\nNo... I should be stronger!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46789, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46790, 'I should get this humiliation out of my mind, so I\'d better do nothing for a while. Would you do me a favor, though? Kick that {color,yellow,Bored Fox}\' butt for me!\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like it.][2]'),
(46791, 'How did it go? Weren\'t they really nimble?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46792, '(Not really)\nYes, they were! They were so nimble that it was quite dangerous. Fortunately, I could kick their butt.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46793, 'Yeh, even [NAME], one of the best adventurers, had hard time. This should mean that these monsters are really tough to beat. I should train myself for better and sharper swordsmanship!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46794, '{color,yellow,Bored Fox}... I won\'t forget...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46800, 'Ruby\'s Request 2 (Repeated)'),
(46801, 'Ruby trained hard and went to take on the Grave Wolf. The Grave Wolf was too nimble and easily defeated Ruby. Go and defeat the monster for Ruby.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46802, 'I got defeated again... Again...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46803, 'Again? Do you mean...\nThose nimble monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46804, 'Stop! Please... I don\'t wanna hear about it.\nAh~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46805, '(Seems like she is really upset.)\nHow did you get hurt this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46806, 'I trained really hard and challenged the {color,yellow,Grave Wolf}, which is even more faster than the {color,yellow,Bored Fox}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46807, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46808, 'That makes me wanna cry, but...\nNo... I should be stronger!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46809, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46810, 'However, they were too strong and fast for me, so I just ran away. My pride and reputation as a swordsman were lost right there.\nShould I still be a swordsman for the rest of my life?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46811, 'Usually, you\'re such a cool-headed person. However, whenever you encounter a monster like that, you get so emotional that you cannot properly respond to their moves. Don\'t you agree?\nYou might have presumed that they are much faster than I am.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46812, 'That might be it. I was being over-reactive and over-powered, and this resulted in opposite effects. I guess I need to focus my training more on controlling my emotions. \nIn fact, my legs got injured during the battle with the {color,yellow,Grave Wolf}, so I can hardly move now. \n[NAME], would you please beat up the {color,yellow,Grave Wolf} for me? Eventually, I\'ll take down these monsters later on, though..\nWould you do that until I am fully healed?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like it.][2]'),
(46813, 'Was there any problem with my request?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46814, 'Nope! But, if you were there, those monsters would have been all dead, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46815, 'Well...\nThanks anyway! I\'ll try to be more humble and become a hard-working swordsman!!\nBy the way, I\'m still injured, so... Would you take out more of the {color,yellow,Grave Wolf} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46816, '{color,yellow,Grave Wolf}... I\'ll never forget...\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46820, 'Ruby\'s Request 2 (Repeated)'),
(46821, 'Ruby trained hard and went to take on the Grave Wolf. The Grave Wolf was too nimble and easily defeated Ruby. Go and defeat more of these monsters for Ruby.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46822, 'I\'m still injured...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46823, 'You need to heal and get rest. You need to me defeat more of those Gave Wolfs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46824, 'Yes, I\'ve been trying both medication and training just to get healed up faster. But until I get fully healed up, would you please take down those {color,yellow,Grave Wolf} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it now.][2]'),
(46825, 'I\'m still hurt, so... Would you mind eliminating more of the {color,yellow,Grave Wolf} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46826, '{color,yellow,Grave Wolf}.. I\'ll never forget...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46830, 'Zombie\'s Attack'),
(46831, 'Zach says that his outdoor swordsmanship training was ruined by a significant number of zombies. Help him defeat Zombie King.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46832, 'The outdoor training hasn\'t taken place in such a long time...\nThese jerks...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46833, 'Something wrong with the outdoor training?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46834, 'Everything went wrong. \nI could not show my prestige swordsmanship to my pupils. Even worse, I ran away.\nThere were too many zombies... Too many!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46835, 'Hmm... You know sometimes quantity matters.. Seems like you had no option but running away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46836, '{color,yellow,Zombie Kings}.. I will never forgive you zombies... I will hunt you down and slice up into pieces!\nUnder the name of Zach!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46837, 'You sound really serious. Yet, the number of those zombies are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46838, 'Ugh... I wish I could wipe them out all alone, but the reality makes me sad...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46839, 'In that case... Why don\'t you go with me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46840, 'As a master swordsman, it will be a shame for me to depend on you for a battle like this. Moreover, my pride won\'t allow me to do so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46841, 'However, it would make it an easier battle to finish...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46842, 'Stop! That\'s enough.\nI guess I should sometimes set my pride aside for a bigger picture. Fine! If they come in with headcounts, we fight them back with the same strategy.\nLet\'s go!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m really excited.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s just two of us! Wake up!][2]'),
(46843, 'An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth! This principle is never wrong. We made a great team, [NAME]!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46844, 'Yes... Yes...\n(Where was he when I was taking that zombie down?)\nYou did a wonderful job!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46845, 'Now, I feel like I\'ve done something. What\'s next? Maybe, I should schedule a new swordsmanship training day.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46846, '{color,yellow,Zombie King}... Today will be your last day!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46850, 'The Wild and Master (Repeated Quest)'),
(46851, 'Zach, who calls himself a master swordsman, tries not to acknowledge the value of the wild. He wants to know what its like to fight in the wild. Go and defeat the Wild Desert Wolf and bring back its claw to Zach.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46852, 'The wild? Nothing but bunch of guys with poor skills...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46853, 'The wild? What do you mean by that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46854, 'A master who got trained in the wild has been saying that he is the best master and that warriors would get stronger only by getting trained in the wild.\nI don\'t like the idea at all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46855, 'Hmm... I don\'t think it is important where you get trained. Aren\'t the current skills most important?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46856, 'I don\'t think so. Let\'s assume that the master was perfectly trained in the wild. He has only interacted with uncivilized animals and monsters. What could this master gain from these uncivilized interactions? I think he is just bragging about his nimbleness.\nWhat an arrogant guy he is!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46857, 'Why don\'t you have a showdown with the guy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46858, 'I wish I could. However, what would I get from a win? Everyone knows I\'m gonna defeat the guy! Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46859, '(How arrogant!)\nWell... I\'m sure a master like you will definitely win the showdown, definitely...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46860, 'You know me well. Yet, I still want to check one more thing. I would like to know what the wild looks like and how suitable it is for training.\nCan you fight any monster in the wild and and tell me what it feels like fighting in the wild?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46861, 'Well... I can do that, but... Why don\'t you have an open fight with the master?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46862, 'Huh, I just don\'t want to waste my precious time. Please do me this favor. Let\'s see... A monster in the wild...\nI got it! The {color,yellow,Wild Desert Wolf} sounds perfect. Bring me back its claw.\nCan you do that for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, I will~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I go through with all those troubles?][2]'),
(46863, 'I was just about to play with my sword. So? Was it as I expected?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46864, 'Well... I got nothing to say...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46865, 'Good! I expected you would say that. This monster doesn\'t seem that strong. I don\'t think I am needed for this mission.\nBy the way, if you have some spare time, would you visit the wild again for me? The more frequent you visit the wild, the more you get used to its environment. I want to see if there is any change in you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46866, 'Why don\'t you fight the {color,yellow,Wild Desert Wolf}? Even though your win is a sure thing..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46870, 'The Wild and Master (Repeated Quest)'),
(46871, 'Zach wants to see if spending time in the wild will have any effects in you. Go spend time in the wild and hunt more Wild Desert Wolfs and collect its claw.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46872, 'Why? Are you afraid of the wild?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46873, 'Not really...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46874, 'Go back to the wild again.. Get used to the environment of the wild. I can\'t wait to see how you change. Don\'t forget to eliminate the {color,yellow,Wild Desert Wolf} and collect its claw~\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it now.][2]'),
(46875, 'By the way, if you have some spare time, would you visit the wild one more time? The more frequent you visit the wild, the more you get used to its environment. I want to see if there is any change in you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46876, 'Why don\'t you fight the {color,yellow,Wild Desert Wolf}? Even though your win is a sure thing..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46880, 'Gardening 1'),
(46881, 'Pey in Roumen says that having a cozy garden is her dream. Let\'s help her with her dream.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46882, 'Ah... What should I do to have my own garden?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46883, 'Hey, Ms. Pey! Why don\'t  you save some money and buy out a garden? It\'s that simple.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46884, 'I want to do it myself... I want to have a romantic garden. My own cozy garden with great sunshine! And, beautiful flowers growing in the garden...\nDoesn\'t it just make you smile thinking about it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46885, 'Yes, it really does. Then, why don\'t you just go for it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46886, 'I need to buy some land, purchase good seeds, then manage the garden, and... Although I currently have some gardening tools, having and managing my own garden is not that easy!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46887, 'Sounds difficult. Anyway, what\'s the point of this conversation?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46888, 'In order to own a garden, I need to make the town residents think that I\'m a good person. Buying land is not like buying a potion. In order to make people think that I\'m a good person, I definitely need your help, [NAME]!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46889, 'Ugh... This is heavy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46890, 'This should be a piece of cake to such a talented adventurer like you. Listen carefully. I heard that there are two kinds of monsters that just destroy every flower in the Isya Continent. These monsters are {color,yellow,Prock Zones} and {color,yellow,Grave Robbers}. So, what do you think? If you could beat up these monsters, it will be much easier for me to have my own garden! \nWould you help me out?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds fun! I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like flowers, so...][2]'),
(46891, '[NAME]! What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46892, 'A piece of cake! From now on, you won\'t hear about these monsters. If most town residents become aware that it was you who took care of these monsters, then you will be really appreciated by them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46893, 'Ho ho ho! Finally, my own garden... Finally...!!\nI will never forget your kindness. You did a wonderful job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46894, 'They are {color,yellow,Prock Zones} and {color,yellow,Grave Robbers}. Don\'t forget~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46900, 'Gardening 2'),
(46901, 'Pey wants to start on her garden but is missing flowers. Help her get Petals (Red) ,Petals (Blue), and Petals (Yellow)~\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46902, 'I acquired the perfect piece of land, but there are still some...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46903, 'Ms. Pey~ Will your dream finally come true?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46904, '(Smiling sweetly)\nYes! This could be possible all because of you, [NAME]! Once again, thank you very much for everything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46905, 'I just did what I had to do... It was nothing... Blah blah~~\n(Mumbling)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46906, 'Ugh... Yet, I still need good flowers...\n(Pey, looking pitiful...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46907, 'Ugh! Why the sad face?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46908, 'Today, certain town supplies will be delivered to Roumen... Unfortunately, there are no good flowers available for me.\n[NAME]... [NAME]...\nCould you get me three different types of flower petals? Well the flower petals I\'m looking for are the {color,yellow,Petal (Red)}, {color,yellow,Petal (Blue)}, and {color,yellow,Petal (Yellow)}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care it~~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am allergic to flowers, so...][2]'),
(46909, '[NAME]! Did you get all the beautiful flower petals I requested?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46910, 'Only those flowers you told me about... They look all beautiful!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46911, 'Now, I\'m just gonna plant these petals and hope for the best~~\nLa la la~\nWould you like to join me making my garden?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46912, 'I want you to get me {color,yellow,Petal (Red)}, {color,yellow,Petal (Blue)}, and {color,yellow,Petal (Yellow)}~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46920, 'Practice 1'),
(46921, 'Zach wants you to be stronger. He asks you to go and fight the Mage Book, saying you can learn a lot from that battle.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46922, '(Zach, standing silently)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46923, '...\nZach?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46924, 'Darn it! A long session of meditation was spoiled by...\nSilence is one of the best practices and its something I\'ve been working on.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46925, 'Well, I\'m really sorry to bother your meditation...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46926, '[NAME], do you wanna be stronger?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46927, 'Sure, why not! I wanna be unbeatable!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46928, 'Let me tell you about this powerful monster. Pick a fight with the monster, and you will learn a lot from the fight.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46929, 'I hear you. What kind of monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46930, '{color,yellow,Mage Book}...\nYou should be very careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll keep that in mind.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t wanna be stronger!][2]'),
(46931, 'So, what happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46932, 'I\'m not sure whether this task was practice or not...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46933, 'You have a long way to go. Practice more and come back later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46934, '{color,yellow,Mage Book}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46940, 'Practice 2'),
(46941, 'Zach thinks it takes more than practice to make someone a master. He wants to see how you handle an extreme situation. Go and defeat Punch Mage Books.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46942, '(Zach, standing still with his eyes closed)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46943, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46944, 'Hmm... Someone\'s here. It should be... Is that you, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46945, 'You are incredible. You were able to identify me with your eyes closed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46946, 'This is just a part of my skills. You can do it if you work hard enough and practice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46947, 'Yes! I am doing everything I want to be a great master like you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46948, 'It takes more than hard work. It takes enormous amount of pain to be a great master! Put yourself in an extreme situation and fight for it! Mind over matter...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46949, 'An extreme situation? Hmm... I\'m not sure what you mean by that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46950, '{color,yellow,Punch Mage Book}... It\'s a tough monster.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready to test myself][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(46951, 'What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46952, 'This time, it was quite challenging! I think the fight was a great practice for me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46953, 'You have a long way to go. Practice more and come back later.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46954, '{color,yellow,Punch Mage Book}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46960, 'Secret of the Heritage Site'),
(46961, 'Temporary Soul Stone Merchant of Forest of Mist says that there is a secret in the nearby heritage site. Let\'s go and investigate.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46962, 'This is weird, very weird.. But at the same time, very interesting!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46963, 'Is there anything interesting to share with me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46964, 'Oh, my! My adventurer! You\'ve haven\'t heard the recent news?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46965, 'I do keep up with the current events but I haven\'t heard anything recently.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46966, 'Well this is news that only a selected few know. You\'ll be the only one I\'m telling about this. Listen very carefully! There is a heritage site around here, you know? Something very interesting is happening at the site.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46967, 'What\'s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46968, 'There may be a secret deal going on between a person and a monster called the {color,yellow,Skeleton}. This person could be either a genius mage who can communicate with monsters or a monster that is disguised as a person.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46969, 'Wow... This is interesting. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(46970, 'I have to be here protecting this town, but you can go visit the heritage site. What do you think? Are you interested in revealing the secret of the heritage site? If you can\'t get the information about this person, you may want to take down the {color,yellow,Skeleton} for some useful information.\nDo you want to give it a try?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not interested.][2]'),
(46971, 'I\'ve been expecting you. So, what happened? Was there a secret?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46972, 'No... Those skeletons seemed a little fishy, but I could not find out about the secret you told me about... Hmm...\nThere is definitely something going on, but I can\'t...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46973, 'Sounds very probable... I guess you need to thoroughly investigate this case!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46974, 'If you don\'t have the information about the person in question, you\'d better eliminate the {color,yellow,Skeleton}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46980, 'Poor Merchant (Repeated Quest)'),
(46981, 'Temporary Item Merchant in the Forest of Mist complains that sales have been very slow recently. Turns out its because of the Silver Slime taking his merchandise. Go and seek revenge for the Item Merchant.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(46982, 'Hmm... Besides working in a remote area, I also have to put up with these poor sales conditions...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(46983, 'How can a merchant like you have such concern? Why don\'t you quit your current job and look for something else?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46984, 'Ugh... You may be right... However, I used to be a great merchant!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46985, 'You\'re talking about the past. What\'s important is the current situation. Currently, you\'re not making much money, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46986, 'I\'m in deep trouble... To make things worse, I got robbed by the {color,yellow,Silver Slime} monsters and had a huge loss. Nothing is going in the right direction... Darn it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46987, 'How could you get robbed by such weak monsters? What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46988, 'I was supposed to have new merchandise delivered. But, those monsters took all the merchandise. I think I did underestimate these monsters, and that\'s why I was put into this kind of situation...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46989, 'Well, I don\'t think we could get that merchandise back from those monsters, but I can still beat those monsters up. So, what do you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46990, 'I really want that merchandise back really bad, but... I guess it could be a relief for me if you beat those monsters up. Please take my revenge on those monsters.\nI want you to take down the {color,yellow,Silver Slime}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care it~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(46991, 'Did you finally get even?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46992, 'Sure! I couldn\'t get the stolen merchandise back, but I really did beat them up. Hope this makes you happy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(46993, 'I really appreciate it, but... Ah! My new merchandise...\nI\'m still mad. If you\'re OK, could you please capture those {color,yellow,Silver Slime} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(46994, 'Take care of the {color,yellow,Silver Slime}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47000, 'Poor Merchant (Repeated Quest)'),
(47001, 'Temporary Item Merchant in the Forest of Mist complains that sales have been very slow recently. Turns out its because of the Silver Slime taking his merchandise. Go and seek revenge for the Item Merchant.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47002, 'I\'m still mad...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47003, 'Whatever you do, the stolen merchandise will never be returned...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47004, 'Please take down the {color,yellow,Silver Slime}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care it~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(47005, 'I really appreciate it, but... Ah! My new merchandise...\nI\'m still mad. If you\'re OK, could you please capture those the {color,yellow,Silver Slime} monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47006, 'Take care of the {color,yellow,Silver Slime}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47010, 'Pey\'s Collection 1'),
(47011, 'Item Merchant Pey talks about her new hobby of collecting rare items. She wants you to get the Gold Sculpture from the Gold Slime. Help her get the item for her collection.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47012, 'Speaking of the new hobby, there are too many items out there~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47013, 'You already have plenty of items. Aren\'t you being a little greedy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47014, 'Ho ho! An Item Merchant does not have everything~ If I already have everything, why would I be a merchant?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47015, 'You\'re right~ Which items do you want to collect then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47016, '{color,yellow,Gold Sculpture}!\nThat is the item I am trying to collect this time, but I can find neither the product nor a seller... Hmm...\nIt\'s getting really difficult.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47017, 'Sounds like the item is very valuable.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47018, '[NAME], I don\'t collect an item based on its value. I just collect an item because I want it. I don\'t need to make each decision based on value.\nWith that being said, I want you to do me a favor. You will be richly rewarded~\nI want you to get the {color,yellow,Gold Sculpture} from the {color,yellow,Gold Slime}~ I\'m sure you can get me the item...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Richly rewarded... Hmm..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I won\'t do it. I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(47019, 'I\'ve been expecting you... So, did you get what I wanted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47020, 'Phew! This job was really difficult. I couldn\'t have done it without a reward. You know what I\'m saying, don\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47021, 'So, this is the... Yahoo! This is really great~\nYou did a great job. Here is the reward I promised~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47022, 'Would you please get the {color,yellow,Gold Sculpture} from the {color,yellow,Gold Slime}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47030, 'Pey\'s Collection 2'),
(47031, 'Item Merchant Pey talks about her new hobby of collecting rare items. She wants you to get the Mysterious Pendant from the Marlone Megaton. Help her get the item for her collection.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47032, 'This time... Let\'s check the list...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47033, 'Do you know that a person\'s basic instinct for collecting things comes from an endless greed?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47034, 'I don\'t think that is true. Like I told you before, I just collect items I like. I don\'t care if you call that a greed or an obsession.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47035, 'You\'re so cool. What are you after this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47036, 'A {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}!!\nIf you wear this around you neck, you will get a mysterious power. However, this item is extremely difficult to acquire...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47037, 'That\'s why they call it a treasure because it\'s extremely hard to get, isn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47038, 'Yes, that\'s true. And, you\'re a treasure hunter, [NAME]! Ho ho! I heard you could get anything~\nThe {color,yellow,Marlone Megaton} carries this rare treasure, the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant}.\nWould you do me this second favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m also doing this for a reward.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like treasure.][2]'),
(47039, 'This is the moment I\'ve been waiting for! What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47040, 'Phew... It was really hard this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47041, 'Thank you very much! I guess I achieved my first goal. Are you ready to be rewarded?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47042, 'Why don\'t you go get the {color,yellow,Mysterious Pendant} from the {color,yellow,Marlone Megaton}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47050, 'Security Issue in Elderine 1'),
(47051, 'Shutian, who\'s having problems with the security in Elderine asks for some help. Go and reduce the number of Skeleton Soldiers for him so they can block them from entering town. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47052, 'Ugh, I\'m have a bad headache... Where did these monsters come from?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47053, 'Hi, Shutian! What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47054, 'Since I appointed guard captain, My days have been very stressful. Every night, these monsters appear in a certain part of Elderine and scare many of the town residents.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47055, 'Why don\'t you increase the number of night guards!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47056, 'What if more and more monsters keep coming back? Elderine does not currently have that type of budget. We have to eliminate the root of the problem.  Just increasing the number of guards is not an effective solution.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47057, 'Hmm... Sounds great. If we could find the spot where these monsters are getting into this town, all we gotta do is just block that spot!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47058, 'Easier said than done! Nobody has been able to find the spot. Unless someone keeps releasing these monsters using magic...\nUgh... My blood pressure...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47059, 'Calm down. Why don\'t I check it out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47060, 'I really appreciate your offer, but this is the Elderine Guard Captain\'s job. You are...\nActually, there is... Could you go to where the monsters\' are  and reduce their headcount? If you do that, we will be able to take some action...\nPlease go reduce the number of the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier}s. I\'m begging you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hear you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate skeletons.][2]'),
(47061, '[NAME], everything go good?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47062, 'I did my best reducing their headcounts. Yet, if they still appear in Elderine, we should come up with an alternative plan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47063, 'Hmm... Let\'s see what\'s gonna happen tonight. Thank you very much for your job, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47064, '{color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier}... I\'m gonna... These jerks...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47070, 'Security Issue in Elderine 2'),
(47071, 'Shutian, who\'s having problems with the security issue in Elderine, no longer cares about the situation.  Take matters into your own hands and collect Skeleton Soldier\'s Sword. Doing this might help reduce the risk of attack.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47072, 'Ugh... Ah~~~!!!!!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47073, '(Being very startled)\nShu... Shutian?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47074, '(Deeply breathing)\nAh... Ah...\nI may be suffering from neurosis. Every night, I see these monsters laughing at me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47075, 'Are you talking about the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier}? You still haven\'t found the root of the problem, have you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47076, 'Root of the problem? There is no root to the problem. These monsters keep coming back whenever they feel like destroying the town.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47077, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47078, 'There is nothing I can do any more. I don\'t care about the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier} anymore. Let them do whatever they do. I\'m sick of these monsters, really sick...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47079, 'What about the safety of the town residents? Aren\'t you being too irresponsible?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47080, 'Just leave me alone... If you are that scared, why don\'t you take their weapons and display them here and there? These stupid monsters won\'t know those weapons are theirs... Stupid monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47081, 'Taking weapons away from them is not a bad idea to reduce a certain risk level...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47082, 'Taking the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier}\'s weapons... Hmm... What if these monsters come back for their weapons? Hmm... Whatever... I don\'t care if they come in or not. \n[NAME], take down those monsters and bring back the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier\'s Sword}. This may be a good solution.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hear you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate skeletons...][2]'),
(47083, 'Did you get the sword?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47084, 'Ugh~~ So heavy... I did take them all!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47085, 'Hmm... We should wait and see, but... This time, it feels like we\'ve done it. You did a great job. Hmm..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47086, 'Go get the {color,yellow,Skeleton Soldier}\'s sword. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47090, 'Kenton\'s Revenge 1'),
(47091, 'Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine is planning to take his revenge on those monsters that have bothered him. The 1st monster he wants you to seek revenge on is the Bat. Now go and seek his revenge. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47092, 'Which one should I start with... Hmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47093, 'Looks like you\'re up to something big. Can\'t you tell me about it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47094, 'Oh, you... You look brave.\nOkay, I\'m gonna tell you about this story.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47095, 'I\'m excited. Is it big scale stuff?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47096, 'Well, it could be big or small. The thing is that...\nThis is my personal stuff. I\'ve been saving some money lately... I want to take my revenge on those monster that used to bother me...\nHa ha... I am trying to figure out which one to start with...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47097, '(Just a personal revenge)\nAh~~ Its scale is...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47098, 'What do you think? Isn\'t it big scale stuff? Actually, I\'ve been looking for a brave adventurer who can take care of my revenge.\nWhile I was searching for the perfect person, you came to me. I guess this is a sign. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47099, 'Does it have to be me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47100, 'Let me remind you that I saved lots of money. If you knew, you would never have talked to me like that. Let me tell you this! I am the richest man in Elderine. Ha ha...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47101, 'Is that so? I did not know that you were a millionaire.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47102, 'A millionaire? Well, I feel a little embarrassed. Anyway, the reason why I\'m telling you this is that you have nothing to worry about when it comes to a reward. Do you understand?\nLet\'s cut to the chase, then. It is the {color,yellow,Bat}, that was the first monster that bothered me. I want you to take them out. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m looking forward to that reward!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not such warrior who can be bought.][2]'),
(47103, 'Your being here early makes me really comfortable. So, did you defeat the Bats?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47104, 'I think you should prepare a huge reward for me. I destroyed all bats that I encountered!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47105, 'Great! Why don\'t I hire you as my personal adventurer. Hope we do business like this more often. So, are you satisfied with this compensation?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47106, 'The first monster to be taken care of for my revenge is... The {color,yellow,Bat}... I want you to be very thorough. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47110, 'Kenton\'s Revenge 2'),
(47111, 'Item Merchant Kenton of Elderine is planning to take his revenge on those monsters that have bothered him. The 2nd monster he wants you to seek revenge on is the Ice ViVi. Now go and seek his revenge. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47112, 'You completed the first mission. Let\'s move on to the next mission.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47113, 'Kenton... What else should I seek revenge on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47114, 'Of course... This will not end until I get rid of every monster that used to bother me. Those stupid monsters will pay!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47115, 'Let\'s say I took care of every personal revenge you have. What if those monsters come back for their own revenge?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47116, 'Well...\nThat\'s not a problem. I have you and also the Elderine guards. Why should I be worried?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47117, 'You\'re right...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47118, 'Until this is over, you can just take down the specific monster I as of you. OK!\nI did hire you as my personal revenge taker... I mean, personal adventurer...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47119, '(He treats me like his private servant because he is rich... How arrogant)\nWell... I don\'t really agree with...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47120, 'OK? This is our next target. This monster is called the {color,yellow,Ice ViVi} and makes me really cold. This stupid monster made me catch a cold for the first time in my life. Whenever I think back, I feel really angry..\nWell, go ahead! Eliminate all those monsters for me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it next time.][2]'),
(47121, 'You look great. That should mean that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47122, 'Of course. I pulled it off. By the way, how terribly bothered were you by these monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47123, 'Ugh... Ugh... Anyway, just wait for my next instruction. You should always be prepared for whenever I need you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47124, 'The second revenge is on... {color,yellow,Ice ViVi}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47130, 'Raina\'s Hunting Request 1'),
(47131, 'Storage Keeper Raina, says that she could have lost her Roumen-inbound supplies to some monsters. Help her feel safe again and defeat the Fox.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47132, 'How could they do to me like this? Darn it! I\'m really mad!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47133, 'Ms. Raina~ What makes you this mad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47134, 'Not long ago, I was returning from a trip, and my supply carriage got attacked by some monsters. I could have lost all my supplies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47135, 'Hmm... However, you were lucky that nothing was stolen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47136, 'This is not the matter of a robbery! I thought I took care of everything security-wise, but... I almost had a heart attack.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47137, 'Yet, I think you should feel better about it because nothing was stolen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47138, 'That\'s true; however, I can\'t feel safe placing an order any more. I can\'t get it by myself, you know... Phew... How can I work under these circumstances?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47139, 'If you feel that way, maybe I can help you. Which monster was it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47140, 'It was a nimble monster called the {color,yellow,Fox}. If you\'re OK, I want you to do me a favor. If I could send them a clear message, they will never try to attack my supply carriage.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take down those monsters real nice!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it next time.][2]'),
(47141, '[NAME]~ What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47142, 'What do you think happened? Just as Ms. Raina wanted...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47143, 'Ho ho... Now, I can laugh. Thanks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47144, 'Go hunt the {color,yellow,Fox}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47150, 'Raina\'s Hunting Request 2'),
(47151, 'Raina says one of her clients got badly injured by Fire ViVi\'s. Go and defeat of them so her clients can feel safe again\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47152, 'Hope it\'s not serious...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47153, 'Ms. Raina~ Are you feeling sick today?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47154, 'No, not me. There is this client who comes to my store very often. He got attached by a monster and badly injured.\nWhy is something like this happening to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47155, 'Things are not looking good these days... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47156, 'I would rather have it happen to me than to my client... It really hurts, you know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47157, 'Hmm... Maybe, it\'s time for me to step in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47158, 'I feel really sorry for frequently troubling you with lots of stuff, but I feel really terrible this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47159, 'I\'ll do it. Talk to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47160, 'It is a monster called the {color,yellow,Fire ViVi}. It seems really strong, so you should be careful. I hope you would take care of this. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it later.][2]'),
(47161, '[NAME]~ how did it go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47162, 'I took care of them very nicely.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47163, 'Ah... Thank you very much. I\'ll tell my client that you did a great job for him, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47164, '{color,yellow,Fire ViVi}... These ...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47170, 'Bran\'s Own Practice 1'),
(47171, 'Bran in Elderine has been practicing with his unique techniques. He has agreed to train you but first, you must take down the Baby WereBears.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47172, 'Hmm... This doesn\'t sound good.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47173, 'Hi, Bran! You\'re in some serious contemplation again~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47174, 'I\'m not currently in contemplation. I\'m currently under some mental training, doing this and that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47175, 'Aha! Has this mental training been useful in real battles?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47176, '...\nThis is why you will never overcome me. Why would I do something that\'s not helpful for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47177, 'Hmm... I wanna learn too! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47178, 'OK! If you have a strong desire for being stronger, you can be. Let me teach you how to do it step by step, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47179, 'But, what?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47180, 'Why don\'t you first take the {color,yellow,Baby WereBear} out? Let\'s see how well-prepared you are.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yup!!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s too trivial. I won\'t do it...][2]'),
(47181, 'Maybe, I underestimated you. It was too easy for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47182, 'Did you see me fight?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47183, 'I used some image training skills and pictured you in the battle. The next opponent would be a little more challenging. You should be very careful this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47184, 'If you can\'t easily take down the {color,yellow,Baby Were Bear}, you are not qualified for my practice.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47190, 'Bran\'s Own Practice 2'),
(47191, 'Bran in Elderine has been practicing with his unique techniques. The second part of the test requires you to hunt down the Goblin. Finish what other adventures have failed!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47192, '[NAME], do you still want to learn my techniques?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47193, 'Hmm... You bet... Yet, I have this feeling that I should do some more...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47194, 'Of course. Several adventurers have failed my tests. You just passed one of those tests.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47195, 'So, if I could pass this second test, I\'m totally qualified, aren\'t I?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47196, 'Well, you can put it that way, but... There has not been a single adventurer who has passed the second test. But, you might...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47197, 'Enough with the talking! What should I do next?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47198, '{color,yellow,Goblin}. You should challenge this cruel and mean monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47199, 'Sound like a fun!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47200, 'Let\'s see how it goes. Go take out the {color,yellow,Goblin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[The practice technique... You should definitely teach me that!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t need a practice technique.][2]'),
(47201, '[NAME], you did a great job!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47202, 'Then, I can learn your unique technique, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47203, 'Emptying your mind and be totally subconscious is my way of a mental practice. It may sound somewhat simple, but it will enable you to realize many important things. Why don\'t you periodically practice this technique from being totally subconscious from this day forward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47204, 'You should never underestimate the {color,yellow,Goblin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47210, 'Sick Vellon 1'),
(47211, 'Vellon says he has not been feeling well lately. He hopes that the Bone Imp\'s Necklace will help him feel better. Hunt down the Bone Imp and get this item for Vellon.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47212, '(Cough! Cough!)\nUgh... Why am I feeling sick?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47213, 'Everyone gets sick. Even a healthy person like yourself. Are you OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47214, 'I haven\'t been feeling good these days... I\'m feeling sore here and there... Fever, dizziness, and so forth...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47215, 'You seem really sick. What can I do for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47216, 'Except for praying for me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47217, 'Or, is there anything I can get you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47218, '{color,yellow,Bone Imp}... Cough! Cough!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47219, 'What about the {color,yellow,Bone Imp}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47220, 'Actually, last night I had a dream that I put on a {color,yellow, Bone Imp\'s Necklace} from a {color,yellow,Bone Imp}. Then, I felt much better. It may not be effective, but... Could you get me the {color,yellow,Bone Imp\'s Necklace}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How could relate the dream to it?][2]'),
(47221, '(Coughing constantly)\nCough!... Ah... Maybe, it\'s time for me to go back to nature.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47222, 'No way! Don\'t say that! Here is the necklace you talked about. It was hard to obtain since the monster was wearing this necklace.\nHowever, a monster\'s necklace does sound a little ominous..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47223, 'Oh... This is it! I did see this in my dream! In my dream!\nThanks. I feel that I will be cured.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47224, 'The {color,yellow, Bone Imp\'s Necklace} from my dream...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47230, 'Recent Trend'),
(47231, 'Vellon in Uruga says he wants to follow the recent trend. Get him the Robo Sword from a Robo to use as a decoration for his home.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47232, 'Which one do you think it is better for me? Shield? Sword?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47233, 'Are you preparing yourself for a war? I like it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47234, 'Not really. I\'m just a merchant in Uruga. A war? Me? Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47235, 'Then, why did you bring up the sword and shield stuff?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47236, 'Ah, that stuff! I heard that people will put weapons and armors in their house just in case. In that regard, I\'m considering buying some weapons and armors for myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47237, 'Why bother? Why don\'t you just buy both?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47238, 'Oh, No~~ That\'s what most people with no sense of beauty would do. Any item in my house should be special to me.\nWith that being said, I want you to...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47239, 'What do you want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47240, 'Listen carefully. There is this cool sword that the {color,yellow, Robo} carries around. Could you get me the {color,yellow, Robo\'s Sword}? A piece like that would fit my lovely house!\n\n[BUTTON]=[This is too much...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you do it by yourself?][2]'),
(47241, 'Oh! So, this is the {color,yellow, Robo\'s Sword}!!! Great~ This is it!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47242, 'Ha ha ha!\n(Why is he so happy about?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47243, 'I\'ll bring it home right away. By the way, I\'ll use this as my family treasure. Ha ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47244, 'Would you get the {color,yellow, Robo\'s Sword} from the {color,yellow, Robo}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47250, 'Poring\'s Hunting Request'),
(47251, 'Poring, who really hates spiders wants you to defeat Earth Spiders. Let\'s go and defeat this spiders.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47252, 'Ah~ It really creeps me out~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47253, 'What? Ms. Poring, what creeps you out that bad?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47254, 'Sp... Spider... Go away!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47255, 'Hmm... Are you scared of spiders?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47256, 'Not all of their species, but I still hate spiders. The way they crawl creeps me out!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47257, 'Most people dislike spiders, don\'t they?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47258, 'Ugh! I hate them so bad! Hate them! Hate them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47259, 'Ha ha... Calm down...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47260, 'Go get the {color,yellow, Earth Spider}... They keep haunting me in my dream. Please eliminate these spiders for me, please~\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just once, OK?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m also scared of spiders, so...][2]'),
(47261, 'What happened? Did you catch them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47262, 'You bet!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47263, 'Phew! Now, I can relax. Thanks, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47264, '{color,yellow, Earth Spider}... Please catch them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47270, 'Poring\'s Request'),
(47271, 'Poring says that she needs spiders\' sticky liquid and it will make you lots of money. Defeat the Earth Spider and get its Sticky Liquid.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47272, 'Not again! It\'s those spiders...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47273, 'Spider... Did you see a spider again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47274, 'This time, it\'s different. One adventurer told me that a special item generated from a spider has been sold at high prices. I don\'t care if it is any kind of a monster, but spiders are... Why spiders? Why! Why!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47275, 'Hmm... Sometimes, you gotta do when you gotta do to be rich. I guess it\'s time for you make a final decision, isn\'t it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47276, 'Money vs. spiders.. Hmm...\nShoot! I don\'t think I can. Never the spiders...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47277, 'Just imagine yourself being a millionaire in Uruga and living a luxurious life!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47278, '(Seriously thinking)\nWell...\nThat sounds fantastic...\nFantastic, but... Ugh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47279, 'So, what\'s it gonna be? Money? Integrity?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47280, 'I made up my mind! I would rather be a millionaire...\nWell, [NAME]! Then, I want you to do me a favor~\nPlease bring me the {color,yellow, Sticky Liquid} of the {color,yellow, Earth Spider}. You will be richly rewarded, I promise!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like it..][2]'),
(47281, '[NAME]! I\'ve been expecting you! Did you get it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47282, 'Here you go! Now, make some serious money! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47283, 'Ah... You\'re the best, [NAME]!! I\'ll sell this really hard to obtain item and be a millionaire some day! I\'ll also take care of you, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47284, 'If I could just get the {color,yellow, Sticky Liquid} of the {color,yellow, Earth Spider}!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47290, 'Superhero\'s Insignia'),
(47291, 'Town Chief Roumenus is proud of his involvement in the trails. You must take on the Superhero\'s trial and bring the insignia back.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47292, 'Not too long ago, great chiefs of each major town got together and dreamed up a trial arena to sort out a champion.\nThat was the root of the Warrior\'s Code.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin the Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47293, 'I was blissful to find out that my input can help out our great cause!\nOf course the outcome from all these trials are more important than our initial dreams...\n[NAME], would you take on the Superhero\'s trial and bring the insignia back?\nI believe you are ready to take on such trial, I know this won\'t be an easy task but... I think you are ready.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! I\'ll be back!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I\'ll survive such trial... ][2]'),
(47294, 'You are back!  Did you pass all the trials?\nWell, did you bring the Superhero\'s Insignia back?\nYou certainly are the champion of the champions!  We finally found someone worthy of such a deed!\nPlease if you are up to it, you can always take on the trial again and bring another insignia back!  It will proudly show what you are made out of!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47295, 'Huh?  Trial Arena?  Did you try the Kingdom Quest yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47300, 'Burning Adealia'),
(47301, 'Marlene, just outside Adelia Village, is looking for you.  She says that Adelia Village has been attacked by unidentified invaders.  Talk to Marlene. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47302, '(Looking for someone.)\nDang!!  I can\'t find [NAME] anywhere!  I really need help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47303, '{color, yellow, Marlene}, who are you looking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47304, '({color, yellow, Discovers [NAME]})\nWhere the heck have you been?!\nDo you know for how long I\'ve been looking for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47305, 'Me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47306, 'Where have you been all this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47307, 'Well you found me now! What do you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47308, '{color, yellow, Adealia Village is in danger.}\nThere were so many...  They ambushed us and everyone panicked...\nThere was nothing we could do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47309, 'Adealia Village is in danger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47310, 'Retrieving the Village'),
(47311, 'Marlene, just outside Adealia Village, asks you to defeat the monsters in Burning Adealia. \nHelp her to defeat Corrupted Spearmen. Corrupted Rangers, Corrupted Knucklemen, and the monster called Dark Lich. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47312, 'Oh, have the villagers been saved?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47313, 'Most of them have, but they got Loussier. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47314, 'Then, we have to go save her. \nIt is important that we know where she is being kept...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47315, 'I know where Loussier is.\nWe should {color, yellow, capture the monsters surrounding the area Loussier is kept captive} as a distraction and save Loussier.\n{color, yellow, [NAME]}, I can\'t fight them all by myself. \n{color, yellow, I need your strong heart and courage.  Can you fight with me?} \n\n[BUTTON]=[My friends are also in the village.  I must help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It would take more people to fight them.  Let me think about it.][2]'),
(47316, 'I know it\'s hard. \nBut I am glad I have you, {color, yellow, [NAME]}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47317, 'Let\'s go save Loussier. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47318, 'Yes...  Let\'s go. \nBut if you want to get some rest before we leave, this is your chance to do so. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47319, 'Please be careful.  You are our hope. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47320, 'Save Loussier. '),
(47321, 'Marlene, just outside Adealia Village, asks you to come with her to save Loussier. \nLet\'s go to Burning Adealia with Marlene and save Loussier. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47322, 'She must be captured {color, yellow, inside Burning Adealia}.\nI am sure she won\'t be an easy hostage to keep. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47323, 'I hope that is true.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47324, 'That is the truth... I know what she is capable of. \nHurry!\n[NAME]!  You should go first.\n{color, yellow, Estelle, Alber} and I will be there first.\nWe will get there faster since we know the area. \nOK, I will see you in {color, yellow, Burning Adealia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hope to see you in Burning Adealia.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready yet.  I want to get ready before I leave.][2]'),
(47325, 'Thank you. \nI owe you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47326, 'Are you safe?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47327, 'Yes, thank you for coming at the right time and saving me, {color, yellow, [NAME]}.\nThank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47328, 'You should look for Loussier. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47330, 'Eglack'),
(47331, 'Loussier in Adealia asks you to defeat Eglack that has invaded Adealia and save Adealia. \nHelp her defeat Eglack when he is glowing blue. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47332, 'Now!  Let\'s go and find the {color, yellow, boss of these monsters}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47333, 'What?  What are you saying?\nNow that I saved you, I am planning to take you to a safe place. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47334, '(Shaking head)\nNo!\nI can\'t abandon the village like this. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47335, 'But what could we possibly do here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47336, '(Loussier contemplates.)\nI can be of help!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47337, 'What?  You?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47338, 'All we need is a {color, yellow, strong and balanced group of adventures}!  They can help you defeat the monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47339, 'But the boss monster won\'t be an easy fight. \nLook what it has done to Adealia Village.  It must have enormous powers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47340, 'Please trust me and follow me. \nWe can\'t abandon the village.\nWe have to face countless monsters in order to find the boss monster, but, {color, yellow, [NAME]}, {color, yellow, I can\'t go by myself.}\n{color, yellow, You must help me!}\nYou are the only person who can save the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t say no to you.  I will come with you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s recover first and I will come back with my friends.][2]'),
(47341, 'I am glad.\nI was right.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47342, 'How did you knew all that...\nAnyways, the village is safe now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47343, 'We owe you big, {color, yellow, [NAME]}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47344, 'Let\'s find out who or what is controlling all these monsters!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47350, 'Disappearing Fire'),
(47351, 'Guiltian of Adealia Village says he wants to thank you for saving Adealia Village.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47352, '(Holds {color, yellow, [NAME]\'s} hands).\nThank you. \nOnce again you have come to this towns aid.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47353, 'No.\n{color, yellow, Loussier} is the true hero.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47354, 'That kid?\nI have always thought of Loussier as a quiet kid, but she had the wits to save the village with you. \nYou are such a great warrior. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47355, 'Thank you.  Ha ha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47356, '{color, yellow, Marlene and I will work with the people of Adealia} to rebuild the village.  Please stay and see how we rebuild Adealia Village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47357, 'You saved the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47360, 'The Sad Song of Love'),
(47361, 'Karuha in Adealia Village said that she has heard about the person she has been looking for.  She shows you her orgel part and asks you to find a part just like it. \nTalk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47362, '{color, yellow, [NAME]}?!!\nDo you have time to talk to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47363, 'Have you ever seen anything like this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47364, 'No.  Is it from your orgel?  What about this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47365, 'Well... I have been looking for Angela\'s father for a long time.  While searching for him, I have heard about him. \nYou must have heard his name.  \nIt\'s {color, yellow, Salare}.\nThat\'s the father of Angela\'s father.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47366, 'It can\'t be...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47367, 'I will tell you more if you can get me a part similar to this orgel part. Just a hint, I\'m sure Eglack has this item, too.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  I will bring it as soon as I find it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s too small for me to find.][2]'),
(47368, 'Thank you.\n{color, yellow, This part is from the orgel that I made for him to play the traditional songs of Adealia.}\nThank you for finding me his belonging.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47369, 'Get me the part of this orgel. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47370, 'The Sad Song of Love (Repeated Quest)'),
(47371, 'Karuha is sad to see the orgel part.  She tells you about her and Salare and asks you to help her find all the parts so she can listen to Salare\'s favorite song of Adealia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47372, 'I want to listen to his favorite song. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest (Repeatable)][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47373, 'Can you {color, yellow, get me all parts of this orgel so I can restore it?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!  I will bring them as soon as I find them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am a busy person.][2]'),
(47374, 'Oh, thank you.  But I {color, yellow, need more parts} in order to restore it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47375, 'Get me all orgel parts that you find. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47380, 'The Essence of Memory'),
(47381, 'Marlene, just outside Adealia Village, asks you to get a gorgeous gemstone called the Essence of Memory from the Dark Lich.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47382, '[NAME]! \nHave you ever seen this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47383, '(Smiling)\nIt\'s a beautiful gemstone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47384, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47385, 'If you see a gemstone like this in Adealia Village, {color, yellow, can you bring all the ones your find to me?} Word has it the Dark Lich has been known to carry these around.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ask somebody else.][2]'),
(47386, 'This?\n(Show the gemstone.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47387, '({color, yellow, Marlene} takes the gemstone.)\nYes, this it is.\nThis is the gemstone that contains someone\'s lost memories. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47388, 'Can a gemstone contain memory?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47389, 'Yes.  I don\'t know why or how it was made, but {color, yellow, someone\'s lost memory from a certain time and place has transformed into such a clear and beautiful gemstone.}\nI once received a gemstone similar to this in the past. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47390, 'Oh, can you see the memory that\'s contained inside it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47391, 'Of course.\nLike... this...\n(Covers the gemstone with another hand and slowly closes and opens her eyes.)\nNow... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47392, '(The gemstone sparkles.)\nThis is...  Have you heard of {color, yellow, the missing chief of Adealia Village}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47393, 'This is the memory of Karen, the chief, and her lover. \nThey look so happy.  If they weren\'t affected by the black fog, they would have been the happiest family in Adealia Village.  It\'s tragic. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47394, 'I will {color, yellow, take a good care of this memory... hoping that they would be happy in their next lives...}\n{color, yellow, [NAME]}, thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47395, 'Bring all of them to me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47400, 'Lost Traditions (Event Quest)'),
(47401, 'Item Merchant Pey of Roumen asks you to help her gather the materials to rekindle a lost Isyan tradition.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47402, 'Hello [NAME]! I haven\'t seen you around in forever! How are you doing today?\n\nI love this time of year but everyone in Isya has seemed to forget about a very special Isyan tradition. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47403, 'Hi Item Merchant Pey, I am doing great! Thanks for asking. I\'m confused, I was pretty certain that I knew about all of the traditions of Isya. What is this lost Isyan tradition that you speak of? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47404, 'Ahh yes, you might be too young to remember but years ago, all of Isya would get together and celebrate Isyan existance and give thanks to all the brave souls that fought for Isyan Independence. It seems like people have forgotten about this great celebration and it saddens me greatly. \n\nI miss the celebrations, fanfare, and seeing people that I don\'t get to see everyday.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(47405, 'That\'s so sad, I absolutely love celebrations and parties! Is there anything we can do to try to rekindle this awesome celebration you speak of? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47406, 'Yes, my dear, I think I am going to try my best and try to host the celebration this year. I want to bring back this great tradition since it will also help teach our young ones that Isyan pride is deeply rooted to our souls. \n\nIn order to do this, I will need your help [NAME], help bring light to Isyan Independence.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(47407, 'Absolutely, I am always trying to find additional ways to have fun. What do I need to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47408, 'That is some delightful news, [NAME]! I think I can take care of everything in town but could you go out and retrieve a few things for me. I need ingredients to create the Sacred Isyan Drink, a few decorations, and flowers for all the tables. \n\nCould you get me 20 Sea Mushrooms, 10 Toadstool (Low Quality), and 10 Sage for the Sacred Drink. \n\nI need 20 Animal Bones from monsters around Isya to create the decorative pieces. \n\nI will also need 5 Red Petals for the flower decorations.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ok Item Merchant Pey, I will get right on this.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are asking me to go arond the world for your items!? Maybe later...][2]  '),
(47409, 'You\'re back! That was really fast. \n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the necessary items for the celebration! We can finally begin the preperations for the wild party!\n\nPlease take these festive items and proudly display them to all of Isya!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47410, 'Umm, excuse me [NAME]. Didn\'t you say you were going to collect some items for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47420, 'Weakening of Burning Adealia 1'),
(47421, 'Town Chief Guiltian of Adealia says that he doesn\'t feel good about the monsters that have been appearing lately.  Help eliminate Corrupted Spearmen and Corrupted Rangers in Burning Adealia.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47422, '(Guiltian is deeply worried)\nHmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47423, 'Guiltian, you don\'t look good.  Is something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47424, '[NAME], good to see you.  I need your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47425, 'What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47426, 'There is a suspicious gate to the south of Adealia.  If you go past that gate, there are powerful monsters called {color,yellow,Eglack} and {color,yellow,Salare}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47427, '{color,yellow,Eglack} and {color,yellow,Salare}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47428, 'They are dangerous, but the various monsters under their command are also very dangerous.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47429, 'If we don\'t do anything, they will be a huge threat to the village, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47430, 'That\'s it.  I was hoping you could go out and eliminate them.  Go into the gate to the south and reduce the number of monsters there.  You should start with {color,yellow,Corrupted Spearmen} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Rangers}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am tired...][2]'),
(47431, 'How was it?  Was it an easy fight?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47432, 'It was not bad...  There were just too many, though...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47433, 'Then, we should eliminate more... Well done. Take a rest until I call you again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47434, 'You should reduce the number of {color,yellow,Corrupted Spearmen} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Rangers}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47440, 'Weakening of Burning Adealia 2'),
(47441, 'Town Chief Guiltian of Adealia  says that he doesn\'t feel good about the monsters that appeared lately.  Help eliminate Corrupted Knucklemen and Corrupted Rangers in Burning Adealia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47442, '[NAME], I am sorry, but there is more to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47443, 'Did I not do enough the other day?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47444, 'Yes, you did.  Everyone knows that you are working hard for Adealia.  I want to thank you again for that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47445, 'I am flattered. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47446, 'What I mean is that there still are many powerful monsters by the gate to the south.  You have certainly reduced them, but it was not enough.  You never know when they would invade the village...\nSo, I want to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47447, 'Oh... You should have told me earlier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47448, 'I didn\'t want to bother you too much... I feel bad...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47449, 'You don\'t need to be.  Now!  Tell me more about this mission!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47450, 'Please reduce the number of {color,yellow,Corrupted Knucklemen} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Rangers}.\nFor Adealia...  For you and me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go later.][2]'),
(47451, 'How was it?  Did you reduce more of them this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47452, 'I would say so... Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47453, 'Well done. They won\'t bother us for some time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47454, 'It\'s {color,yellow,Corrupted Knucklemen} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Rangers}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47460, 'Unexpected Treasure'),
(47461, 'Bunis is interested in the monsters that live past the suspicious gate that appeared.  He wants something from the monster called Dark Lich. Bring him the cape from the Dark Lich.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47462, 'Hey, [NAME].  Did you hear the news?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47463, 'What news?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47464, 'They say there is a suspicious gate to the south!  And there are many scary monsters in it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47465, 'I know...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47466, 'Hmm... I must have been the last to know.  Anyways, that\'s not important.  I have very interesting information!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47467, 'I think I already know that one too...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47468, 'No way!  I have not sold it or told anyone about this.  If you are curious, I can tell you.  If only you agree to help me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47469, '(Using information as bait)\nWell... Tell me.  I am curious.  I will hear you out and help you if it sounds alright. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47470, 'Listen carefully.  There is a strong monster called {color,yellow,Dark Lich} in that gate to the south.  That monster\'s cape can resist any evil magic in the world.  If you bring me the {color,yellow,Dark Lich\'s Cape}, I will reward you.  What do you say?  I guess it\'s a good suggestion for both of us...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Are you sure about the reward?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s not enough to get me moving.][2]'),
(47471, 'Oh!  [NAME], I have been waiting for you to come back.  Did you bring the Dark Lich\'s cape I asked for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47472, 'Yes, I did, but it looks like a rag for the homeless... I can\'t believe this cape has such miraculous powers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47473, 'You don\'t know anything about this cape.  Let me see...\n(Bunis puts on the cape and goes near fire.)\n...\nAhh!!!  It\'s hot... Darn... Was it false information?  So hot!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47474, 'Get me a cape from a {color,yellow,Dark Lich}.  Handle it carefully.  It\'s a treasure!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47480, 'Study of Artifact of Darkness'),
(47481, 'Bunis is interested in the sickle carried by Salare.  He thinks it has some mysterious powers and asks you to bring it to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(47482, 'I really... want to have it.  What should I do to get my hands on it... Ah!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(47483, 'I think you are pretty greedy, Bunis.  You seem to have enough!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47484, 'When I was an adventurer in the past, I was a renowned treasure hunter.  I traveled around to find many rare treasures.  I am an investigator for Adealia, but I am ready to go back to treasure hunting whenever I have a chance.  I am greedy, but that\'s what makes me a good treasure hunter.  Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47485, 'I guess... Treasure hunters are bound to go after treasure.  I didn\'t know that you were a treasure hunter, Bunis...  I couldn\'t even imagine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47486, 'Hmm.  If you want to listen to my story, come back anytime.  I will tell you everything...  Right now, I must have this treasure. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47487, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47488, 'It won\'t be easy.  There is a powerful monster named {color,yellow,Salare} inside that gate to the south.  I feel that {color,yellow,Salare\'s Sickle} would have special powers.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(47489, 'You haven\'t even been there.  Who is your source?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47490, 'Well... If you are in my position, you will get a lot of information about the treasures across the continent.  This was one of them.  The monster sounds very strong..  What do you say?  Do you want to try?  If you bring me {color,yellow,Salare\'s Sickle}, I promise to reward you well!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hope I have your word.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it myself.][2]'),
(47491, 'My sickle?  Did you get it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47492, 'Here... It was hard... It looks worthless considering that I risked my life for it.  Do you really think it has special powers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(47493, 'You don\'t have an eye for treasures.  Visit me sometime and I will teach you the basics of treasure hunting.  I have to study this sickle now.  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(47494, 'Bring me {color,yellow,Salare\'s Sickle}.  It won\'t be easy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48310, 'Threats to the Village'),
(48311, 'Town Chief Guiltian of Adealia says that the monsters in the gate will threaten the village and asks you to eliminate their head. Go and kill Eglack in his final form to help eliminate part of the threat.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48312, 'If we don\'t do anything, we might go back to the past nightmare...  We must stop them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48313, 'Chief, you don\'t look good...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48314, 'The mysterious gate to the south... It gets on my nerves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48315, 'I would have been like you if I were the chief.  You don\'t know when or where the monsters might come out from...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48316, 'There was something like this in Adealia in the past.  I can\'t tell you everything but many villagers lost lives.\nWe must prevent that from happening again.  That\'s what I am destined to do as the Chief of Adealia...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48317, 'I see.  Haven\'t you made the moves to eliminate the threat?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48318, 'Yes, but it wasn\'t the core of the threat...  Every war in history was won by the side that went straight to the head.  So, I changed my plan.  But... there are a lot of risks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48319, 'That means... you want to go directly to {color,yellow,Eglack}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48320, 'That\'s the only way.  I need your power to carry out this dangerous plan.  Please help me and our Adealia Village.. Not all of the threats will go away for good even if you defeat {color,yellow,Eglack}in his final form, but it won\'t be as dangerous without him.  The monsters will be confused without their head...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it alone.][2]'),
(48321, 'I am glad you are back safe... [NAME].\nSince you are back... Can I say that the village is safer?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48322, 'It was hard, but I fought for the people and for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48323, 'Thank you...  Thank you so much...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48324, '{color,yellow,Eglack} is known to be very powerful.  Go with reliable friends.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48330, 'The Badge of Evil Monsters (Repeated Quest)'),
(48331, 'Edwina is worried about the gate to the south.  He says there is a special badge that breathes strong powers into the monsters in the gate.  Edwina asks you to steal the badges from the monsters and bring them to him. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48332, 'We are in trouble...  We must destroy it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48333, 'Edwina, what are you up to?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48334, 'Oh... [NAME].  Good to see you.  I need your opinion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48335, 'Smart Edwina wants my help.  It must be something difficult to solve, Edwina.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48336, 'Do you know about the gate to the south?  There are enormous monsters on the other side of the gate.  They haven\'t invaded the village yet, but they are definitely a threat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48337, 'So, what do you suggest?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48338, 'I have done my research, and...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48339, 'And?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48340, 'The monsters in the gate have {color,yellow,Evil Badges} on their bodies.  It is said that this badge helps them forget fear and not feel any pain.  \nThis is the badge that makes the monsters go berserk.  It is a scary accessory.  How about we take it away from them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48341, 'Right...  That will weaken them, both physically and mentally...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48342, 'Chief Guiltian and many other people in the village are worried about this.  The only thing I can do for the village is to give you my information, [NAME]. \nCan you gather as many {color,yellow,Evil Badges} as you can?  The more, the better.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It sounds too difficult...][2]'),
(48343, 'I am glad you are safe.  I believe you have gotten the badges...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48344, 'Of course.  Here, you should examine them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48345, 'Sure... thanks.\nIf you have time, bring more badges.  It\'s always good to have many subjects to study.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48346, 'Please bring me the {color,yellow,Evil Badges} from the vicious monsters in the gate.  That will make them weaker. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48350, 'The Badge of Evil Monsters (Repeated Quest)'),
(48351, 'Edwina is worried about the gate to the south.  He says there is a special badge that breathes strong powers into the monsters in the gate.  Edwina asks you to steal the badges from the monsters and bring them to him. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48352, '[NAME], can you bring more badges for me?  I need more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48353, 'How many?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48354, 'The more, the better!  Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(48355, 'You are so trustworthy, [NAME]!  If you have time, bring more badges. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48356, 'Please bring me the {color,yellow,Evil Badges} from the vicious monsters in the gate.  That will make them weaker. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48360, 'Strange Energy'),
(48361, 'Chief Adrian of Uruga says that she felt something strange coming from Goblin Camp.  She wants you to find and talk with her patrol guard in Goblin Camp.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48362, 'It\'s strange...  What is this?  This ominous feeling...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48363, 'Adrian, isn\'t it a good day?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48364, '[NAME]!  Welcome.  I\'ve been waiting for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48365, 'Do you have a present for me?  Thank you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48366, 'Oh, no... That\'s not why I was waiting for you...\nHave you felt anything strange while traveling the continent lately?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48367, 'Anything strange?  Hmm... I don\'t think so...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48368, 'I feel strange energy from Goblin Camp near Uruga.  I feel something big might happen...\nUnfortunately, my bad feelings are always right.  We need to investigate the area before it\'s too late. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48369, 'If you feel so strong about it then we must investigate. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48370, 'Go to {color, yellow, Goblin Camp} and look for my patrol guard.  Find him and speak to him about the strange energy!\n\n[BUTTON]=[A lonely patrol...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have a cold...][2]'),
(48371, 'Are you Chapman?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48372, 'Yes, who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48373, 'Go to {color,yellow, Goblin Camp} at once. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48380, 'Lonely Patrol'),
(48381, 'Patrol Chapman is working alone in Goblin Camp.  Talk to him about what is happening in Goblin Camp.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48382, 'Are you here to keep me company?  I have been lonely and bored!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48383, 'There is a reason why I am here.  I am not here to play with you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48384, '(Looks disappointed)\nOh... Let me introduce myself.  I am Chapman.  I am working here all by myself. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48385, 'It\'s impressive you are working here alone. You must be pretty strong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48386, 'Ha ha ha!  You are good.  All you can rely on is your power when you are among so many monsters!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48387, 'Oh... I see...\nLet\'s get to business.  I was asked to investigate this place by Chief Adrian of Uruga.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48388, 'Investigate this place?\n(Darn... Is he here to take over my job...)\nI don\'t understand why she would give such order.  I am working hard here...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48389, 'Oh... Don\'t worry.  I am not here to replace you, Chapman... Adrian says she feels something strange going on here, so I am here to investigate that.  I also wanted to talk to you, Chapman. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48390, '(That\'s relieving..!!)\nOh.. I see.  Something strange...\nWell... I don\'t feel anything strange...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48391, '(I should do the investigation myself..)\nHmm..\nAre you really doing your patrol job out here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48392, 'What... are you talking about?\nI am probably the most hard-working guard in the world!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48393, 'Hmm, I should go around and do the investigation myself.  If anything happens to you, Chapman, please contact me right away. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48394, 'You can count on me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48400, 'Violent Goblins?'),
(48401, 'Chapman says that the Goblins in Goblin Camp have been strange lately.  Help him defeat the Goblins. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48402, 'Goblins are acting strange... Hmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48403, 'Chapman!  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48404, 'They have become somewhat... violent lately...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48405, 'They are always violent..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48406, 'I have observed them for quite some time, and they are certainly different these days.  You should check them out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48407, 'You know this place better than me, Chapman.  I will check them out.  It\'s my first job here!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48408, 'You should be careful.  I have been here for a long time and none of them has been easy...\n(Sighs)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48409, 'Well, that\'s probably because there are so many and you are here by yourself, Chapman...  It\'s obvious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48410, 'Anyways...  Always be alert.  Defeat {color,yellow,Goblins} and find out what has happened to them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to rest a little more...][2]'),
(48411, '[NAME]!  You are back.  So?  Did you find out anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48412, 'Well...  They didn\'t act strange at all... It\'s probably because it was my first time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48413, 'Hmm... You should be able to understand what I mean soon.  You can rest for now.  There will be many things for you to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48414, 'Why have the {color,yellow,Goblins} become violent...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48420, 'Investigating Monsters'),
(48421, 'Chapman asks you to talk to the soldier in disguise to find out what is happening in Goblin Camp.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48422, '(Chapman looks confused.)\nUgh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48423, 'Are you sick?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48424, 'What... Oh... No...\nSomething is definitely up, but I can\'t figure out what it is...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48425, 'Use your senses.  You have been here long enough!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48426, 'That makes me even more confused. \n...\n...\nLet\'s do this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48427, 'Oh!  Any idea?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48428, 'I have been here long enough to identify the monsters here and how they act.  But [NAME], what about you?  You don\'t have the knowledge. \nYou should defeat the monsters and learn about them.  You can investigate them while doing so. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48429, 'Hmm... That makes sense.  OK.  I\'ll get to the job right away.  Where should I begin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48430, 'Oh... right!  Listen carefully.  Go south from here and there is a soldier disguised as a Goblin.  You should talk to him.  Before talking to him, you should be prepared so that the monsters there can\'t see you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds fun.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good...][2]'),
(48431, '(Isn\'t this a real Goblin..?)\nExcuse me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48432, '...!?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48433, 'Chapman told me to go to you. \nAre you a person...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48434, 'That Chapman... I told him not to tell anyone about me... I can\'t talk with you long.  Make it quick.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48435, 'Talk to our spy disguised as a {color,yellow,Goblin}.  Be careful not to get caught by the monsters before you find him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48440, 'SpyGoblin'),
(48441, 'To get information from the SpyGoblin in Goblin Camp, you must help him first. Defeat Goblin Swordmen. \n \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48442, '(Looks anxious)\nWhat is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48443, 'Oh... I will get right to the point.  I was ordered by Adrian to investigate this place.  She said she feels something bad coming from this area...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48444, 'Something bad...  Well... The Goblins are always crazy, so I don\'t know if anything is strange about them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48445, 'Hmm... Where should I start my investigation...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48446, 'Hey, since you are already here, can you do me a favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48447, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48448, 'I am tired of staying here like a scarecrow... and {color,yellow,Goblin Swordmen} have started to doubt my identity.  As they become more doubtful, there are fewer days for me to live here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48449, 'I see... You have stayed here for a long time.  OK.  I will do your favor.  But you must let me or Chapman know if you find anything strange about the Goblins or other monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48450, 'Of course.  You seem like an interesting person.  I would have actually helped you if I was not like this...\nAnyways, go and defeat {color,yellow,Goblin Swordmen}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They sound scary...][2]'),
(48451, 'You are safe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48452, 'I have reduced the number of {color,yellow,Goblin Swordmen} around here.  They won\'t have any doubts about you for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48453, 'You have the guts and the skills.  I will let you know if I find something.  Thanks!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48454, '{color,yellow,Goblin Swordmen} are very quick-witted..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48460, 'No Progress'),
(48461, 'There is no progress in Goblin Camp, so you must ask Chief Adrian in Uruga for help. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48462, '[NAME], do you have any news from the SpyGoblin?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48463, 'No... There was not anything special.  I just did him a favor...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48464, 'Hmm...\nI should probably go back to Adrian...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48465, 'That\'s what I was thinking.  You are just wasting your time here...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48466, 'But Adrian did not send me here for nothing... Don\'t you think we are missing something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48467, 'Missing something...  Let me think.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48468, '(Chapman ponders deeply)\nWell... I have no idea...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48469, 'Let me talk to Adrian then. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48470, 'Good idea.  Please be safe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Come with me.][2]'),
(48471, '[NAME], what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48472, 'Oh, Chapman and I investigated Goblin Camp because you had that strange feeling, but we could not find anything abnormal. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48473, 'Hmm... Really? But I can still feel the ominous energy that is coming from there.  It might not be now, but something will definitely happen. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48474, 'If you still feel that strong about it, I will try again.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48475, 'Please give my thanks to Chapman and be careful...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48476, 'Go and meet {color,yellow,Adrian}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48480, 'Ripped Letter'),
(48481, 'Chapman said that he found a half-ripped letter while patrolling the area.  You must defeat the monsters to find the other half. Defeat a Goblin and Prock\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48482, '[NAME], you are back! Perfect timing.  Look at this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48483, '(Message in the Letter)\n...We need your help in order to summon the spirits of the dead.  If all goes well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48484, 'Summon the spirits of the dead...  It seems to be related to Adrian\'s bad feeling.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48485, 'I don\'t know... but you must be right.  We have to find who wrote this for whom. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48486, 'It\'s our job to find that out.  Let\'s first think of the monsters that have the capability to summon the spirits of the dead.  What could it be...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48487, 'Could it be related to the Goblins?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48488, 'If this letter was found here, I would say yes.  We should fight all monsters here to find out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48489, 'I see.  That must be a lot of work, but the best way.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48490, 'Then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48491, 'Let\'s start with the {color,yellow,Goblins} and {color,yellow,Procks}.  You should be able to find something if you keep fighting them.  You should get going!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am tired...][2]'),
(48492, '[NAME], did you find anything??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48493, 'No... I tired myself, but I could not find anything... Darn...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48494, 'Hmm.. Cheer up.  Those were the easiest ones, so there are other chances for us to find the truth!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48495, '(Why am I the only one fighting them...)\nI... get it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48496, 'Well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48497, 'Let\'s defeat the {color,yellow,Goblins} and {color,yellow,Procks} first!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48500, 'Finding the Other Half of the Letter 1'),
(48501, 'You are tracing the one that sent the letter and the monster that received the letter.  Find the other half of the letter with Chapman. Hunt down the Were Bears and see if you can find any clues about the other half of the letter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48502, 'How should we find the other half of the letter... Oh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48503, 'I thought much about it, but there is no other way but to go primitive... What do you think?  Do you have any smart ideas?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48504, 'If I did, I would have already tried it..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48505, '(Anyone can talk)\nHmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48506, 'Let\'s just start by going after the monsters that are closest to us.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48507, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48508, 'Let me see... Let\'s start with the {color,yellow,Were Bears}.  Don\'t underestimate them.  There are many of them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48509, 'I can see that, but I can\'t imagine them keeping the other half of the letter. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48510, 'I agree.. but we can\'t afford to take chances.  Go after the {color,yellow,Were Bears}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Something\'s not right...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t do it.][2]'),
(48511, '[NAME], the results?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48512, 'Like I said.  I think we are heading to the wrong direction. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48513, 'I don\'t think so.  I have been in Goblin Camp all by myself for...\nAnyways... I believe that I can find the other half of the letter nowhere else but here!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48514, 'OK.  I will trust you if you are that confident, Chapman.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48515, 'Thank you.  We will find the source of that letter and who wrote it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48516, 'Don\'t underestimate the {color,yellow,Were Bears}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48520, 'We Need Supplies!'),
(48521, 'You are tracing the one that sent the letter and the monster that received the letter, but Chapman says that he needs enough supplies as it would take a long time.  Chapman asks you to get the supplies. Collect the Goblin\'s Weapon and take them to Karl in Elderine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48522, '(We can\'t survive long if we don\'t find the letter soon...)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48523, 'Chapman?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48524, '...\nOh!  I was just thinking... [NAME].  We are looking for the letter, but  there something more urgent!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48525, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48526, 'I think it will take some time for us to investigate a case like this.  It means that we will need that much more supplies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48527, '(I don\'t need much...)\nI see.  Since you have been here by yourself...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48528, 'I need my personal supplies in order to help you, [NAME].  I am sorry to ask you again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48529, 'Don\'t be.  We are here to help each other.  We should be glad to help each other out!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48530, 'Oh... Thank you.  I used to get Goblins\' weapons and sold them to Karl in Elderine in exchange for the supplies.  You should do so, too.  Please gather {color,yellow,Goblins\' weapons} and take them to {color,yellow,Karl} in {color,yellow,Elderine} to get the supplies.  Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[You should wait here.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too far away...][2]'),
(48531, '[NAME]!  So, what brings you here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48532, '(Showing Goblins\' weapons)\nI am here to sell these!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48533, 'These are... Chapman used to get them to me.  Why are you doing his job?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48534, 'Oh...  Actually, I was ordered by Adrian to work with Chapman and he says that he needs supplies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48535, 'Oh... I see.  OK.  Since you are working for Chapman, I will give you something extra.  Oh... It would take some time.  Can you wait?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48536, 'The Goblins are carrying {color,yellow,Goblins\' Weapons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48540, 'Supplies Complete!'),
(48541, 'Karl gives you Chapman\'s supplies.  Take the supplies to Chapman.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48542, 'Thank you for waiting.  [NAME], here are the supplies.  Please say hi to him for me.  He is working hard all by himself... Let me know if you need anything else.  I\'d be glad to help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48543, 'Oh... You are back.  Thank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48544, 'Here you go.  I think Karl gave you more because I came for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48545, 'He didn\'t have to... I would have liked the usual..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48546, 'Now!  We can get back to business now, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48547, 'Of course.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48548, 'I am tired from going back and forth, so let\'s call it a day and start fresh tomorrow.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48549, 'OK.  Sleep tight..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48550, 'Take these supplies back to Chapman. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48560, 'Unexpected Information'),
(48561, 'Chapman is ready to start looking for the other half of the letter.  SpyGoblin has some information you can use. Go and talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48562, '[NAME], good news!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48563, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48564, 'I got a message from the SpyGoblin.  He said we would need this information.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48565, 'Oh!  I will go and talk to him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48566, 'OK, you should go. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be fast!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to..][2]'),
(48567, 'You are here.  I have a valuable piece of information for you... and you are too slow.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48568, 'I came as fast as I could.  The only way to be faster than this would be to teleport here.. If I could do that, I wouldn\'t be here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48569, 'Ha ha, just kidding.\nLet\'s get to business.  I called you because I found that {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} have been very suspicious lately. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48570, 'Suspicious...?  How?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48571, 'I found that they have been sneaky lately.  Only {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} looked more anxious and sneaky compared to other Goblins.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48572, '(Are {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} related to summoning the spirits...)\nIt\'s my turn to act.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48573, 'Oh.. but we should observe them a little more.  Don\'t be hasty, but let\'s take time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48574, 'Bring valuable information from the SpyGoblin!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48580, 'Finding the Other Half of the Letter 2'),
(48581, 'Goblin Mages\' suspicious actions may be related to the other half of the letter.  Get the other half from Goblin Mages.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48582, 'Are you ready?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48583, 'Anytime!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48584, 'Like I said, I am a Goblin.  There is no good for me if I stay here for too long.  You know that, right?  I want to go back to Elderine and live happily...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48585, 'Oh... I see.  I will defeat {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} as quickly as possible. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48586, 'Oh.. Didn\'t you say you are looking for something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48587, 'Yes, Chapman and I are looking for the half of this letter. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48588, 'With Chapman... I see... It is very likely that {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} would have the other half of the letter.  My gut tells me that.  You can count on me.  I have been with them for a long time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48589, '(He looks content...)\nIf you say so, it is almost 100% that they have the letter!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48590, 'Anyways, this is to pay you back for helping me last time.  Go and investigate {color,yellow,Goblin Mages}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Finally, the letter...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not interested.][2]'),
(48591, 'You are back.  It seems that no one is watching me or has doubts about me.  You\'ve done well. \nHave you found the letter, yet?  Did they have it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48592, 'Yes, {color,yellow,Goblin Mages} had the half of the letter.  But...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48593, 'But...?  What\'s the problem?  Didn\'t you get what you wanted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48594, 'This half is written in an illegible language...  It looks like a code...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48595, 'Let me see...\n(The SpyGoblin stares at the letter.)\nHmm.. It\'s definitely something we can\'t read.  You should find someone who has some knowledge in this area.  Go to Chapman.  He must be waiting for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48596, '{color,yellow,Goblin Mages} are strange...  They seem anxious!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48600, 'Decoding?'),
(48601, 'Chapman sees the other half of the letter.  He says he can\'t read it and needs somebody\'s help. Take the letter to  Roumenus, the chief of Roumen\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48602, '[NAME], how did it go?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48603, 'I found the other half of the letter, but it\'s written in a code language and I can\'t read it...  Phew... I\'m so disappointed...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48604, 'Let me see...\n(Chapman looks at the letter.)\nHmm.. We are in trouble.  We don\'t know what it\'s saying..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48605, 'We need someone who specializes in decoding...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48606, 'I guess... Any idea...?  Everyone I know is guards...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48607, 'It must be someone who has both knowledge and experience from adventures.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48608, 'The only person who meets this condition would be...\n...\n...\n...\nRoumenus, the chief of Roumen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48609, 'Right... I will visit Roumen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48610, 'Thanks for the hard work... I will ask my friends in Elderine while you go to Roumen and talk to Chief Roumenus.  I hope it works out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[To Roumen...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go any farther.][2]'),
(48611, '[NAME], what is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48612, 'Actually... Can you read what this letter is saying, Chief? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48613, 'Let me see.\n(Roumenus reads the letter.)\nThis writing.. is like a code...  Hmm... I am confused.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48614, 'Can you read it...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48615, 'It would take some time, but I will try to decode it since it\'s for you.  But there is one thing I need. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48616, 'I hope Chief Roumenus can decode it..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48620, 'I need glasses!'),
(48621, 'Roumenus says he can decode the message, but there seems to be one condition.  He is too old to read without his glasses, so he asks you to bring his glasses. Clams in Sand Beach might be able to help...\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48622, 'I will decode the message, but there is one problem. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48623, 'What\'s the problem?  Tell me.  I can solve it for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48624, 'I am old and my eyes are very blurry.  I can\'t even count the letters without my glasses. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48625, 'Oh... I see.  Don\'t worry.  I will get you a very good pair of glasses. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48626, 'Can you really?  I need to be able to see something in order to decode this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48627, 'But I actually don\'t know... where to get them from. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48628, 'I once heard a story from a traveler. {color,yellow, Clams} in {color,yellow, Sand Beach} have a sparkling glass pieces...  Those glass pieces will help you see everything clearly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48629, 'Do you mean that you need that {color,yellow, Sparkling Glass Piece}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48630, 'That\'s right.  I just need it to decode this letter... I don\'t need actual glasses.  Let\'s move!  If you bring it fast, I can read this that much faster.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like the sea..][2]'),
(48631, 'I have been waiting for you.  Is it my turn now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48632, 'Please.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48633, 'What might be written in this letter... that makes you so desperate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48634, 'Well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48635, 'Ha ha, just kidding.  Let me show you what I got. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48636, '{color,yellow, Clams} have a {color,yellow, Sparkling Glass Piece} that helps you see clearly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48640, 'Decoded: The Truth Revealed'),
(48641, 'Chief Roumenus decoded the other half of the letter.  The message was shocking. Go back to Chapman and tell him the results.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48642, 'I have decoded the letter... This letter is...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48643, '<Letter>\nI will use my dark magic to give you eternal life.  But if you refuse, I will kill everyone in your race.  I hope you make the right decision.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48644, 'Unfortunately, it doesn\'t say who it is from. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48645, 'I don\'t think it wanted to reveal itself by using the seal on the letter.  It could be someone very smart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48646, 'Hmm.. I thought I found it all... Darn...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48647, 'I will help you as much as I can.  Tell me if there is anything you need. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48648, 'OK.  Thank you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48649, 'That\'s all I can do for you now.  Didn\'t you say your friend named Chapman is waiting for you?  You should go back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Take care.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to stay in Roumen a little longer.][2]'),
(48650, '[NAME]!  I have been waiting for so long.  Did you decode the letter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48651, 'Yes.  Roumenus helped me... Come and see.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48652, '<Complete Message of the Letter>\n... We need your help in order to summon the spirits of the dead.  If all goes well, I will use my dark magic to give you eternal life.  But if you refuse, I will kill everyone in your race.  I hope you make the right decision.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48653, 'So.. this is what it said.  No wonder why they tried to hide it.  But we still don\'t know who it is from.. Oh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48654, 'I feel that this is only the beginning.  We should work harder...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48655, 'I agree.  I am getting motivated.  Let\'s get them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48656, 'I bet your friend Chapman is waiting for you.  You should go.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48660, 'Challenging Investigation 1'),
(48661, 'The letter has been decoded, but Chapman does not know where to begin.  He says that you should defeat the Goblins that carried the letter. Let start with the Goblin Captains...\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48662, 'Oh... What... should we do first..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48663, 'Nothing like this has ever happened.  There is just one after another...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48664, 'I have thought much, but thinking doesn\'t solve anything.  I have an idea.  Let\'s do this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48665, '(I hope it\'s useful this time...)\nGo ahead. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48666, '{color,yellow, Goblin Mages} were carrying half of the letter.  There must be something related to other Goblins.  We should start our investigation of the Goblins. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48667, 'That makes sense, but.. Hmm... \nWell, OK.  There is no other way.  Let\'s start with the Goblins.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48668, 'Good.  Let\'s... go after {color,yellow, Goblin Captains} first.  They control the Goblins, so they might have something!\n\n[BUTTON]=[There is no other way...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to rest; you should go this time.][2]'),
(48669, 'Well done, [NAME].  So?  Did you find anything...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48670, 'Nothing... I guess it\'s safe to say that the Goblins are not linked in any way...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48671, '(Was I wrong...)\nHmm... I guess.  We should go another way.\nPlease take a rest for now.  We don\'t know where we should be headed tomorrow. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48672, 'I hope {color,yellow, Goblin Captains} give us a clue..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48680, 'Challenging Investigation 2'),
(48681, 'Chapman is disappointed because the Goblins did not give him any clue.  He says that you should go check out the Goblin King and see what you can find. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48682, 'Then... We should rely on this one...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48683, 'We might have to capture all monsters in this region...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48684, 'If we have to.  We need to find out who wrote the letter... Or someone could just approach us and tell us about the letter... But that\'s not going to happen...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48685, '(I am tired, but there is no other way...)\nWhat is the next monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48686, 'The head of the Goblins - {color,yellow, Goblin King}.  It might know something, since it\'s the king. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48687, 'Let\'s do it.  To the {color,yellow, Goblin King}!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48688, 'Great.  I hope {color,yellow, Goblin King} has a clue..\n\n[BUTTON]=[I must find a clue this time...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you trying to destroy all Goblins...?][2]'),
(48689, 'How.. was it?  Did {color,yellow, Goblin King} give you any clues...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48690, '(Shaking head)\nNothing.  There was nothing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48691, 'Arrrrgh!  It gives me a headache...  What do I have to do..?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48692, 'Let\'s go and defeat the color,yellow, Goblin King}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48700, 'Tired Chapman'),
(48701, 'Chapman is exhausted because of the investigation that has no progress.  You need to find a medicine for him. Word has it that the Sand Ratmen might hold the answer to his problems.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48702, '(Moaning)\nUgh... Ugh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48703, 'Chapman?  Wake up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48704, 'Ugh... Ugh...\nMy body...  My head...\nUgh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48705, 'Just tell me what you need.  I will get it for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48706, 'I am not doing well.. I have a fever and my head is about to explode.  I don\'t know why this has happened to me...  I\'m sorry.  It\'s the worst time to be sick...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48707, '(I guess he is stressed out because of the investigation...)\nSay no more.  I don\'t have the time to call a doctor from Elderine or Roumen..  How do I get a medicine around here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48708, 'I heard that {color,yellow, Sand Ratman} carry a remedy.  That could make me feel better... Ugh... Ugh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just hold on.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t be a crybaby.][2]'),
(48709, '[NAME]... The medicine...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48710, 'Don\'t talk.  Just take this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48711, 'Ugh..  Thank you.  I have to take a rest until my body is recovered...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48712, 'With {color,yellow, Sand Ratman\'s Remedy}... I would be able to recover...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48720, 'Anonymous Reporter'),
(48721, 'Chapman says that an anonymous reporter sent him a letter.  The letter said that they will tell him who wrote the letter if he defeats the Goblins.  Defeat the Goblins and find out who wrote the letter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48722, 'Thank you, [NAME].  I feel much better.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48723, 'Good.  I was worried about you, Chapman. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48724, 'Sorry about that, but I am well now.  Anyways... you should read this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48725, '(A letter?)\nWhat is this...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48726, 'Read it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48727, '<Letter>\nI know what you are trying to find.  I can just tell you who it is, but I have a favor to ask you first..\n\n(Omitted...)\n\nI have almost been killed by the Goblins recently. If you defeat the Goblin, I will tell you what you are looking for.  Oh, you should get this done as soon as possible.  If you take too long, I wont be around since I am leaving for another continent.\nShow me what you\'ve got. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48728, 'Do you think we can trust the person who wrote this letter...?  I feel like this person is testing us.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48729, 'Indeed...  They have been watching us from afar.  Well, it doesn\'t hurt to try.  We haven\'t had any progress, so let\'s just do what they are telling us to do.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48730, 'The Goblins in the letter are in {color,yellow, Concealed Peak}, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48731, 'It\'s not very far from here.  There are many Goblins, so be careful... I am sure you won\'t have any problem, [NAME]... I will be watching this place in case something happens.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can stay here.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t be a crybaby.][2]'),
(48732, '[NAME], have you defeated all of the Goblins in the letter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48733, 'Of course.  I defeated them...  If someone has been watching us, they will contact us soon.  If not, we should just wait..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48734, 'I am nervous.  We are finally close to the information we have been chasing.  Also...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48735, 'You need to capture the Goblins in {color,yellow, Concealed Peak}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48740, 'Who They Are '),
(48741, 'The anonymous reporter told you who wrote the letter.  Who could it be...\n(Search xxxxx)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48742, '[NAME], the anonymous reporter was not lying.  I got a reply. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48743, 'I am.. so nervous.  Let me see.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48744, '<Letter>\nI didn\'t expect you to do the job so flawlessly...  Anyways, a promise is a promise.  I will give you the information in return.\nWhat you have been looking for is in {color,yellow, Scaffold Execution Ground}.\nWhen it\'s time, I will tell you who wrote the letter, because..\n\n(Omitted...)\n\nI will give you one hint.  They are trying to summon the spirit of a merciless villain who disappeared in {color,yellow, Scaffold Execution Ground}.  You must stop this...\nI hope you do a good job.  Bye.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48745, '...\nWe don\'t have the name, but we know where we should be headed at least..  And what they are after...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48746, 'I guess...  I thought he said he was going to tell us the name...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48747, 'We have narrowed it down.  That\'s good enough.  This is some progress. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48748, 'I feel much better now.  You couldn\'t imagine how stressed I was because of this...  Phew...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48749, 'Ha ha, let\'s forget the past and start fresh!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48750, 'Right...  You\'ve done well.  Let\'s take a rest for now!  But the letter says that they will tell us when it is the right time. I don\'t get it.. Do you have any idea what it means?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48751, 'That\'s.. probably.. because... he thinks I am not strong enough.  Since he has watched us from afar... I don\'t like being spied on, but he might be right.  Considering that he writes letters with riddles, I don\'t think he is an ordinary person. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48752, 'You seems to be right about that. I guess only time will tell...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48760, 'I Hate Goblins!'),
(48761, 'Wandering Adventurer Jax says he is tired of Goblins.  Let\'s defeat some dungeon Goblins.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48762, 'Nice day, huh?  [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48763, 'Of course!  I want to go on a trip.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48764, 'A trip... I do too. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48765, 'Why don\'t you?  What\'s the problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48766, 'Actually, I date {color,yellow, Goblins}.  No, I am tired of them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48767, 'No one likes {color,yellow, Goblins}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48768, 'Ain\'t that the truth!  I can stand other monsters, but I don\'t want to see another {color,yellow, Goblin}?? I\'m sick and tired of looking at them all the time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48769, 'I guess you have a bad memory of {color,yellow, Goblins}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48770, 'You eventually get tired of even the prettiest woman.  It\'s just like that.  Having said that, I want to make a request.  Please defeat {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblins}.  You won\'t say no to this adventurer, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I want to say no.][2]'),
(48771, 'You are back.  The results?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48772, 'I have defeated the {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblins} that you hate.  Feel better?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48773, 'Yes.. No... Not yet... I don\'t feel much better.  Here\'s the reward I promised...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48774, 'Please get rid of {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblins}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48780, 'Goblin\'s Box'),
(48781, 'Wandering Adventurer Jax is interested in the box carried by the Goblins.  Get him the Goblin\'s Box.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48782, 'I hate them, but I am curious about their box. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48783, 'What about the box?  It must be full of junk.  Ha ha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48784, 'That\'s probably what most people think.  Nevertheless, I am very curious about the box carried by the Goblins.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48785, 'You don\'t expect to see a very expensive diamond, do you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48786, 'You never know!  But seriously, I hate Goblins, but I still have to fulfill my curiosity.  Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48787, 'If you are that curious, you should go and get one yourself.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48788, 'I am a wandering merchant, so I can\'t leave my shop for my personal stuff.  I guess I have you ask you again, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48789, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48790, 'Please get me a {color,yellow, Goblin\'s Box} from {color,yellow, Dungeon Goblins}.  I can\'t stand the curiosity, so the value of your reward will go down if you take long...  Get it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like a threat...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are too arrogant.][2]'),
(48791, 'Did you get the box for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48792, 'I did.. But...  I don\'t even want to see what\'s inside...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48793, 'I am curious.  It\'s time to see the answer.  Well done, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48794, 'What would be inside that {color,yellow, Goblin\'s Box}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48800, 'Prock and Me 1'),
(48801, 'Wandering Adventurer Jax says that Cave Procks always harassed him whenever he takes a trip and wants revenge.  Help Jax to defeat Cave Prock.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48802, '(Jax is immersed in thoughts.)\n...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48803, 'Jax?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48804, 'Oh... you are here.  I was thinking how to revenge myself on those monsters that harassed me in the past.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48805, 'Did you find a solution?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48806, 'Well..  I don\'t.  I do have one solution, but it hurts me that I have to depend on someone else when I call myself an adventurer...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48807, 'There is no rule that only the strong ones can be adventurers.  No one can be perfect.  You have your strengths and your weaknesses...  That\'s the way of the world. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48808, '(Nodding...)\nYes... What you said makes me feel better, [NAME].  I have been forgetting the most important thing.\nAnyhow, I have you ask you, [NAME], to hunt {color,yellow, Cave Procks}.  I will stay here and think about my strengths. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48809, '{color,yellow, Cave Prock}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48810, 'Yes.  They used to bother me when I was an adventurer.  I want revenge!  Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, but...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired...][2]'),
(48811, 'So?  Did you get back at those {color,yellow, Cave Procks} for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48812, 'I have nothing against them, but they are not helping, so...  I did it not just for you, Jax, but for all other adventurers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48813, 'Thank you, [NAME].  I feel much better, but..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48814, '{color,yellow, Cave Procks} used to harass me a lot...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48820, 'Prock and Me 2'),
(48821, 'Jax thinks about revenge on Procks and is confused about his identity.  Help Jax calm down and defeat Dungeon Procks.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48822, 'You don\'t know how much of a hard time Procks give me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48823, 'Are you still on that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48824, 'I am not kidding.  I told you Procks used to harass me all the time since I was an adventurer.  Different kinds of Procks got onto me wherever I went.  I don\'t know why.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48825, 'Think about it.  They must have had something against you.  Or...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48826, 'I was just as weak as I am today.  I was more energetic back then, though..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48827, 'If so... Procks might like the way you look, Jax.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48828, 'They are not perverts that harass whom they like.  I guess you are trying to say something about the way I look.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48829, 'No... Not really... Then there is no explanation...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48830, 'There might not be any explanation.  Well.  Enough about Procks.  If they had no reason, I can ask you to get rid of Procks for no reason, right?  Please get rid of {color,yellow, Dungeon Procks}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[He looks hallucinated...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good about this.][2]'),
(48831, 'I have learned that you can harass monsters for no reason, but it\'s impossible without you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48832, 'Hey... Try to think positive...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48833, 'Not many people would smile at those that harassed them, right?  I have to think about what has happened to me all this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48834, 'It\'s {color,yellow, Dungeon Procks}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48840, 'Back to Goblins 1'),
(48841, 'Wandering Merchant Jax says he wants to eliminate the memory of Goblins.  Help him eliminate Goblin Swordman.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48842, 'Phew...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48843, 'What\'s with the sigh?  Any worries?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48844, 'The Goblins are now harassing me in my dreams.  Darn...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48845, 'Ha ha ha!  Can\'t you just get over it?  I often see monsters in my dreams as well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48846, 'Don\'t laugh at me.  Goblins are one of the monsters I never want to see again and they are there in my dreams.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48847, '(It\'s nothing to be serious...)\nThere is nothing you can do about it.. You can\'t always dream about what you want to see..  People can have all kinds of dreams. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48848, 'Even so, I can tolerate Goblins in my dreams.  I still feel dizzy thinking about them... Oh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48849, 'What do you want me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48850, 'Eliminate {color,yellow, Goblin Swordmen} for me.  Then, I won\'t be dreaming about the Goblins anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just keep dreaming.][2]'),
(48851, 'How did it go? [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48852, 'I fought the {color,yellow, Goblin Swordmen} that harassed you in your dreams, Jax.  I hope you don\'t see them in your dreams anymore. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48853, 'Thank you.  But what if I dream of other monsters... Ugh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48854, 'Please eliminate {color,yellow, Goblin Swordmen}.  Then, I won\'t be dreaming about the Goblins anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48860, 'No More Goblins 2'),
(48861, 'Wandering Merchant Jax is crazy because of the Goblins.  Help him eliminate the Dungeon Goblin Swordman.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48862, 'Oh... Oh... What is this sound...? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48863, 'Jax!  Wake up!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48864, 'Oh.. I hear a voice calling me... It sounds strangely friendly...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48865, 'Jax!!\nHe is out of his mind...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48866, 'I hear the voice of Go...Gobl... Goblins...  Oh.. What should I do...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48867, 'Who is calling you, Jax?  Tell me.\n(I have to capture the monsters that are bothering Jax.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48868, 'Dungeon... Go... Goblin...Sword...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48869, '{color,yellow, Dungeon Goblin Swordmen}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48870, 'I... I think so...  I can hear their soft voice...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s save Jax.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can leave him alone.][2]'),
(48871, 'Oh... I feel like I was hallucinating...  Huh, [NAME]... When did you come?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48872, '(He must be feeling better.  Let\'s not talk about what just happened.)\nOh...  I just got here.  You don\'t look good.  Are you OK?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48873, 'I am a little stunned, but I feel better.  Thank you for caring for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48874, '{color,yellow, Dungeon Goblin Swordman}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48880, 'Scary Ones 1'),
(48881, 'Jax asks you to eliminate the Were Bears that are threatening the travelers in flocks.  Help him eliminate the threat.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48882, 'Ugh... There has been nothing but trouble since I settled here...  This place might not be right for me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48883, 'Hmm.. That might be right.. It has not been working for me either. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48884, 'We should just go our own ways.  What do you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48885, 'It\'s so sudden...  Also, trouble always finds me wherever I go... I should just travel alone...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48886, 'I see.  Then, there is no reason for us to travel together.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48887, 'Anyways, what kind of trouble are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48888, 'I hear that violent {color,yellow, Were Bears} emerge here and there to attack the travelers.  We must stop them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48889, 'Of course.  We must not let them get away with it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48890, 'Please go out and defeat the {color,yellow, Were Bears}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am tired of this place...][2]'),
(48891, 'From the look on your face, you\'ve done the job, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48892, 'Of course.  They won\'t be bothering anyone for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48893, 'I like that I am bored when I am with you, [NAME]... Oh.. It doesn\'t mean I like you, [NAME]...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48894, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Were Bears} for the travelers!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48900, 'Scary Ones 2'),
(48901, 'Jax is worried because the number of Were Bears has not reduced.  Help him get Were Bears\' Claws.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48902, 'What\'s going on...  There are more of them!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48903, 'That\'s how the monsters work.  No matter how hard you fight, they always come back.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48904, 'That means it\'s no use to fight them...  Well, we still have to fight them so they don\'t bother us...\nOh.. It\'s hurting my head again...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48905, 'We have to keep wasting our energy and time to fight them until we eliminate the root of evil. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48906, '(Ponders deeply)\nThat.. makes sense.  I am tired, but we should eliminate more of the {color,yellow, Were Bears} again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48907, 'OK, then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48908, 'I have an idea.  There is one way to stop those {color,yellow, Were Bears}!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48909, 'Hmm.. Whatever it is, I have to fight them anyway... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48910, 'Well... just hear me out.  Eliminate the sharp claws of {color,yellow, Were Bears}.  Then, they won\'t be able to kill and won\'t be so dangerous.  When they lose their ability to kill, those {color,yellow, Were Bears} will be intimidated.\nWhat do you think?  Can you get {color,yellow, Were Bears\' Claws}?  \n\n[BUTTON]=[I can try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... I am so tired.][2]'),
(48911, 'So?  Did you get {color,yellow, Were Bears\' Claws}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48912, 'I did, but I have to see if this would quiet them down.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48913, 'Well done.  We will see how it goes! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48914, 'Bring {color,yellow, Were Bears\' Claws}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48920, 'Goblin\'s Trophy'),
(48921, 'Wandering Merchant Jax is interested in Goblin Mage\'s Mace that has been sold for an expensive price.  Help him get the mace. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48922, 'If only... If only I had this, I can stop wandering around like a nomad...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48923, 'Do you really think so?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48924, 'Listen carefully, [NAME].  The wealthy people in Elderine and Uruga are crazy for this special mace!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48925, 'They are crazy, but they haven\'t actually gotten one...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48926, 'Exactly.  They have even asked me to find one for them.  They said they are willing to pay a fortune for it.\n...\n[NAME], I don\'t want to lose this chance.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48927, 'What could be so special about the mace carried by monsters... that even the wealthy are after it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48928, 'They see things differently compared to us.  They don\'t have the ability to fight in a battle, but they have seen and possessed many rare treasures of the continent and they are well-aware of the value of that mace. \nThe value that you and I can never comprehend, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48929, 'Well.. I don\'t really want to work for them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48930, 'The monster that carries that mace is {color,yellow, Goblin Mages}.  If you can bring one for me, [NAME], you and I can get a fortune out of it!  What do you say, [NAME]?  Do you really want to let this chance slip through your hands?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No... way!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t work for the money.][2]'),
(48931, 'You can\'t imagine how long I\'ve been waiting.  Did you get {color,yellow, Goblin Mage\'s Mace}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48932, 'I did, but it really looks ugly.  Is this really what they want...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48933, 'Like I said before, this ugly mace can be a golden mace for them.  I should to go and trade this mace.  Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48934, 'If only I had {color,yellow, Goblin Mage\'s Mace}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48940, 'I don\'t want to see you!'),
(48941, 'Giant Goblin King, the king of Goblins, is leading the Goblins to invade the village.  Help Jax defeat the Giant Goblin King.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48942, 'It\'s...huge...  They are finally acting up...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48943, 'Anything fun? Jax?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48944, 'It\'s not a joke.  I heard that {color,yellow, Giant Goblin King} is leading its soldiers for an invasion. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48945, 'That\'s serious..  If he is bringing out all of those Goblins.. Isn\'t he trying to invade somewhere?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48946, 'That\'s what I think.  Finally, you and I are on the same page, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48947, '(I don\'t know about that...)\nAnyways, we have to stop them before it gets out of hand...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48948, 'Of course.  But even you won\'t be able to fight that many Goblins, [NAME]... So I was thinking...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48949, 'Any idea?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48950, 'You should go after their leader, {color,yellow, Giant Goblin King}!  Without their leader, the soldiers won\'t be able to do anything.\nI sound like a commander, but it is all up to you, [NAME]...\nPlease.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will teach them a lesson.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am sick of Goblins...][2]'),
(48951, 'How... did it go?  Did my plan work?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48952, 'I think so.  The soldiers didn\'t know what to do when their leader fell.  I think this has lessened their ambition a little bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48953, 'There is nothing we can\'t do with a good commander and a good soldier.\n(Do I have the blood of a commander...?  Ha ha.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48954, 'Everything will be easy if you defeat {color,yellow, Giant Goblin King}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48960, 'Useful One'),
(48961, 'Jax is looking for a way to regain energy after all of the fighting (?).  It is said that Sand Mushroom is good for regaining energy.  Bring Sand Mushrooms for Jax. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48962, 'Oh... I have no energy... I feel hungry...  What\'s wrong with me...?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48963, 'You are weak!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48964, 'No way.  I am an adventurer.  I can\'t fight, but I was strong enough to explore!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48965, 'But you look so weak now...  I can\'t imagine you being an explorer...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48966, 'I am obviously stressed from all of the fighting.. I haven\'t slept well ever since I came here...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48967, 'I can see {color,yellow, Sand Mushrooms} everywhere.  How about catching it and eating it?  Although it\'s a little barbarian...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48968, 'Oh!!\nI remember now... {color,yellow, Sand Mushroom} has the capacity to recover energy. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(48969, '(Can\'t believe it...)\nI... Didn\'t actually know that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48970, 'There you go.  I should recover fast for your sake, too, [NAME].  Get me {color,yellow, Sand Mushrooms}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have any energy, either.][2]'),
(48971, 'I am losing my energy...  Did you get the mushroom...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48972, 'I did, but it\'s nothing but a monster.  Are you sure about this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48973, 'I have a strong stomach.  Let me try it..\n(Jax eats the mushroom.)\n...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48974, 'I need {color,yellow, Sand Mushrooms}.  Now!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48990, '?????????? ????'),
(48991, '?????????? ?? ?????\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(48992, '??????! ???????? ?????? ????????!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(48993, '..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48994, '???? ?????\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have any energy, either.][2]'),
(48995, '?????\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48996, '????..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(48997, '???????\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(48998, '?????\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49000, 'Franz\'s Concern'),
(49001, 'Storage Keeper Franz has a concern he can\'t talk to his friends about.  It is about a traumatic experience with a monster...  Franz asks you to defeat the monster. \n(Search Guardian\'s Holy Shirne for Dungeon Guardian Master)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49002, '(Franz is thinking.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49003, 'Hey, kid, are you worried about something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49004, '...\nYes, I am.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49005, 'I bet it\'s about playing with your friends or eating something tasty.  Something childish. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49006, '{color,yellow,Dungeon Guardian Master}.  I want to know how to defeat it.  I am not a kid from Elderine. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49007, '(This... Kid... is not like other kids.)\n...\nWell... Why do you want to defeat {color,yellow,Dungeon Guardian Master}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49008, '{color,yellow,Dungeon Guardian Master} is scaring away all of our customers.  That\'s why I want to defeat it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49009, 'You are young yet thoughtful.  You must care about your merchants a lot...  OK, I will help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49010, 'I knew you would help me.  If I start a rumor about you turning down my request, it won\'t be good for your reputation.  Thanks anyways!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I changed my mind.][2]'),
(49011, 'There, it\'s done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49012, 'Wow, you are good, [NAME].  Come back and help me from time to time, will you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49013, 'Well... That depends on your attitude. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49014, 'You must defeat {color,yellow,Dungeon Guardian Master}... If not, the merchants will...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49020, 'The Merchants\' Pride 1'),
(49021, 'Maxuter, the leader of Burning Rock Merchants, says that he has lost his pride because the monsters can mine and sell the rocks much faster than his team.  Help him defeat the monsters. \n(Search Burnning Rock and Skeleton Miner)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49022, 'Ugh... What\'s happening? Does it mean our merchants can\'t work as much as the monsters? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49023, 'Hello, Maxuter.  Something tells me you have a trouble with the business...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49024, 'That\'s not the problem.  There is a reason why we are struggling.  I don\'t even want to acknowledge it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49025, 'What?  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49026, 'I saw {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} near here a while ago.  I didn\'t pay much attention to them, but I saw something unbelievable later.  Those {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} were mining like crazy and taking Burning Rock\'s resources...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49027, 'Much faster than your miners?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49028, 'No one here can mine as fast as they do and as much as they do...  It hurts me to admit that people are inferior to monsters...\nThe pride of our merchants has already gone down. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49029, '...What should we do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49030, 'I was wondering if you could help the Burning Rock Merchants.  You should defeat {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners} and learn how they mine the resources.  If people find out about this, the Burning Rock Merchants will go out of business... Sob...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about coming with me to learn from them?][2]'),
(49031, 'OK, it\'s done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49032, 'You are great, [NAME].  Please come back and help me, will you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49033, 'Well... That depends on your attitude. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49034, 'You must defeat {color,yellow,Skeleton Miners}... If not, the merchants will...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49040, 'Purification of Burning Rock 1'),
(49041, 'Stone Merchant Thompson of Burning Rock says that it is necessary to purify Burning Rock.  What is the first monster he pointed out?  Help Thompson to defeat the monster. \n(Search Burnning Rock for Kart Miner)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49042, 'How did we end up here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49043, 'If I were you, I would abandon this place as soon as possible and move your shop somewhere else. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49044, 'That\'s what I want, but our leader...\nAs you know, he has pride in this place..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49045, 'It can be a strength, but it can also be a weakness.  A man\'s pride...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49046, 'Ugh...  There is nothing we can do...  We should adjust to this place or change the place.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49047, 'Yes.  Didn\'t Burning Rock Merchants choose to adjust? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49048, 'Indeed... It\'s true that we don\'t have the power to change this place under these circumstances.  It\'s not that we didn\'t try.  We have tried a lot of times.  That\'s probably what made us who we are today...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49049, '(That must be the line of the leader...)\nI can feel your companionship.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49050, 'I have a request for you.  The goal is to purify Burning Rock.  We need to get rid of the monsters to make this a better place to live.  So, I would need to ask you to defeat {color,yellow,Kart Miners}.  They are a headache.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I didn\'t see that coming...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should do it yourself this time.][2]'),
(49051, 'You look good, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49052, 'Ha ha!  It\'s nothing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49053, 'But that doesn\'t mean all monsters have gone away.  It\'s only the beginning!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49054, 'Let\'s start with {color,yellow,Kart Miners}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49060, 'Useful Guys'),
(49061, 'Item Merchant Julian of Burning Rock says that there is a very useful monsters in Burning Rock.  Talk to Julian and get the item he needs. \n(Search Burnning Rock for Lava Vivi and Jewel Tree)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49062, 'I can\'t believe I didn\'t know this...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49063, 'Ms. Julian, you look serious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49064, 'Oh, [NAME], actually, I just found out that some of the monsters have an item that can help me stay cool in this hot weather. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49065, 'That sounds interesting.  What does it do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49066, 'I haven\'t used it myself yet.. but it is said that {color,yellow,Lava Vivi\'s} {color,yellow, Burning Fin} and {color,yellow,Jewel Tree\'s} {color,yellow, Lucid Gem} can be combined to make a {color,yellow, Cooling Device} that cools you just by looking it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49067, 'Wow, we could be able to make something very useful here!  That will revive Burning Rock Merchants right away, right?  It will attract more customers!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49068, 'Oh... I haven\'t thought of that yet... but it certainly sounds good. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49069, 'I hope it works out.  It\'s hard to run a shop in a place like this...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49070, 'Thank you.  But, [NAME], it would be nice if you could get {color,yellow, Burning Fin} and {color,yellow,Lucid Gem} for me.  I am too weak to get these items...\nPlease!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just this once!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should try it yourself.][2]'),
(49071, 'I have been waiting for you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49072, 'Here\'s what you asked.  Can you really make that cooling device?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49073, 'I should try!  It\'s valuable information.  I think it will work. \nI should get ready to combine the items. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49074, 'All I need is {color,yellow, Burning Fin} and {color,yellow,Lucid Gem}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49080, 'Purification of Burning Rock 2'),
(49081, 'Stone Merchant Thompson says that it is necessary to purify Burning Rock.  What is the second monster he pointed out?  Help Thompson to defeat the monster. \n(Search Burnning Rock for Magmaton)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49082, '[NAME], I have been waiting for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49083, 'It\'s about purifying Burning Rock again, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49084, 'You\'ve done well, but there still are many monsters to go after.  Don\'t forget that this is only the beginning. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49085, 'I... see. What is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49086, 'It\'s called {color,yellow,Magmaton}.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49087, 'It doesn\'t sound so hard. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49088, 'I know you are confident!  Go for it.  Let\'s make Burning Rock monster-free!\n\n[BUTTON]=[...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[.......][2]'),
(49089, 'Can I plan ahead for the next monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49090, '(Oh... What I am doing?)\nNo need to hurry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49091, 'Ha ha.  I can\'t waste your time.  I will come up with the next plan as soon as possible!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49092, 'It\'s {color,yellow,Magmaton} this time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49100, 'The Merchants\' Pride 2'),
(49101, 'Maxuter, the leader of Burning Rock Merchants, says that he has lost his pride because the monsters can mine and sell the rocks much faster than his team.  Help him defeat the monsters. \n(Search Burnning Rock for Flame Mole)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49102, 'It\'s happening again.  Worthless monsters!!  Arrrgh! \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49103, 'Do you still have doubts about the capacity of your miners?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49104, 'Yes, I do.  The monster called {color,yellow,Flame Mole} doesn\'t even take 5 minutes to dig up and get the resources inside.  How about my workers?  They take a lot of time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49105, 'Well... That\'s because it is a mole.  It is born to dig fast...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49106, '(Thinks deeply)\nWe have done this for a long time.  We are not taking advantage of our know-how.  This is delinquency of duties. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49107, '(I am not getting what he is saying...)\nWhy don\'t you train your workers again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49108, 'What if my workers don\'t like it and run away?  Then, we won\'t even have a backup plan.  Also, I don\'t like to be hard on my workers...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49109, 'So what do you want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49110, 'Only you can save my business.  Don\'t tell anyone and just collect {color,yellow,Flame Mole\'s Masks} from {color,yellow,Flame Mole}.  I think the masks are helping them work so fiercely.  Without those masks, our workers will be much better than them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am tired today.][2]'),
(49111, 'Have you protected the pride of Burning Rock Merchants?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49112, 'Hmm... I didn\'t think I did something so important, but if you say so. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49113, '(Sighs)\nThank you... but I can\'t ask you every single time... Should I sign a labor agreement with the monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49114, 'Please bring {color,yellow,Flame Mole\'s Masks} without telling anyone...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49120, 'Defeating the Guardian 1'),
(49121, 'Item Merchant Julian of Burning Rock learned that Crystal Guardians, known for their violence, have started to make their weapons even stronger.  Help Julian and defeat them before they become stronger!\n(Search Burnning Rock for Crystal Guardian)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49122, 'Phew... It\'s always bad news and no good news...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49123, 'There are problems everywhere.  When do you ever serve your customers? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49124, 'We did well in the beginning, but since the monsters became weird, we haven\'t been doing so well.  We are not thinking about making money.  We just hope that everyone is safe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49125, 'Oh... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49126, 'Furthermore, I just heard that {color,yellow,Crystal Guardian} have started making their weapons stronger.  We can fight other monsters, but if they become stronger... I don\'t even want to think about the consequences...  Phew...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49127, 'Don\'t worry!  I will help you Julian for the safety of your business.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49128, 'Really?  I would love that..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49129, 'You can count on me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49130, 'OK.  Please get rid of {color,yellow,Crystal Guardian} before they become stronger.  Always be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think I can do it.][2]'),
(49131, 'I am glad you are back safe.  I was worried about you..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49132, 'Ha ha!  Why don\'t you give me your trust, Julian?  I have taught them a lesson, so they will be quiet for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49133, 'One less thing to worry about.  Well done.  I should get back to my business plan now...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49134, 'Don\'t underestimate {color,yellow,Crystal Guardian}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49140, 'Defeating the Guardian 2'),
(49141, 'Stone Merchant Thompson of Burning Rock is planning to defeat Ruby Guardians and steal their gems.  Help Thompson and grant his favor. \n(Search Burnning Rock for Fire Ruby Guardian)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49142, 'Good... If it works out, I can be rich and famous... (Murmur.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49143, 'You are still working up a plan in this heat?  You must be very strong, Thompson.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49144, 'Ha ha, thanks.  Actually, I am an opportunist..  No, people tell me I know when to seize my chances. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49145, '(Who are those people?)\nSo you are trying to seize your chances this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49146, 'Of course.  That\'s what I do best.\nListen carefully.  There is a monster called {color,yellow,Fire Ruby Guardian} in Burning Rock, and this one is made of ruby.  I can\'t use its whole body, but it has expensive {color,yellow, Diry Rubys} all over its body.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49147, 'So... you are planning to defeat the monster and take its {color,yellow, Dirty Ruby} to make money, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49148, 'It\'s not just for me!!  Its for Burning Rock Merchants.  Anyways, I can have my cake and eat it too this way.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49149, 'It\'s a good plan, but none of the Merchants can pull it off.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49150, 'No, no.  I have you.  If you help me, I will reward you.  What do you say?  Want to give it a shot?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds good.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll pass.][2]'),
(49151, 'I have been waiting for you.  Where is the... ruby?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49152, 'I have it here.  It looks good considering that it\'s from a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49153, '(Nice...)\nYou have been a great help for the Burning Rock Merchants!  Here\'s your reward.  Please come back to help me again.  Well done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49154, 'If only I can have {color,yellow, Dirty Rubys} from {color,yellow,Fire Ruby Guardian}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49160, 'Defeating the Guardian 3'),
(49161, 'Guardian Master is angry because its servants have been defeated and planning to wipe away the Burning Rock Merchants.\n(Search Burnning Rock for Guardian Master)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49162, '[NAME]! [NAME]!  We are in trouble. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49163, 'What is it?  Are you exaggerating again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49164, 'Our Merchants... is in danger!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49165, 'Calm down and tell me... You should tell me everything so I know if it\'s huge or not!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49166, 'I bet you defeated {color,yellow,Guardians} a while ago, right, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49167, 'That\'s right.  They were weak.  Ha ha. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49168, 'The head of {color,yellow,Guardians}, {color,yellow,Guardian Master} has started to make the move itself.  It will destroy the Burning Rock Merchants to avenge its servants!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49169, 'Ugh... That is a huge problem...  I can\'t fight them myself...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49170, 'I was thinking and I think you, [NAME], should ambush them and defeat {color,yellow,Guardian Master} first.  Doesn\'t it sound like a plan?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No... We should wait...][2]'),
(49171, 'So?  Did my plan work?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49172, 'Yes.  You are a pretty sharp kid...  Why don\'t you go on an adventure? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49173, 'I can\'t do that.  The people here are like my family.  I can\'t leave my family...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49174, 'Go and ambush {color,yellow,Guardian Master}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49180, 'Hate to Look'),
(49181, 'Maxuter, the leader of Burning Rock, says there is a monster he personally hates.  He asks you to defeat the monster because it is strong... Help Maxuter with his problem.\n(Search Burnning Rock for Giant Magmaton)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49182, 'I would feel much better if only I could defeat it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49183, 'Maxuter, how about moving the Merchants to a different place?  This place is full of trouble and there is not much business...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49184, 'Well... I have been thinking about it, but I am a man and I have chosen this place.  I can\'t give up no matter what.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49185, 'I understand that... but your workers are exhausted.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49186, 'Ha ha!  They are always exhausted, but they do their jobs right.  They are elites~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49187, '(I don\'t think he gets it.)\nI guess it\'s right that good leader gathers good workers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49188, 'I\'m flattered.  Anyways, you are very good at uplifting the environment. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49189, 'I... don\'t know about that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49190, 'Oh, enough with the jokes... Let\'s get to business. There is a monster named {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton}.  I hate that one and I wanted to ask you to get rid of it.  It hasn\'t caused any trouble for us, but I just hate it. \nDefeat {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton} and brind {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton\'s Fist} as evidence.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Is it a personal request?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have the time.][2]'),
(49191, 'Good... So the Merchants...\n[NAME]!  You are back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49192, 'I have defeated the monster you hate, Maxuter...  I\'m tired...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49193, 'Well done.  This reward will cheer you up.  Ha ha, good job! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49194, 'I just hate {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton}.  Please bring {color,yellow,Giant Magmaton\'s Fist}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49200, 'Purification of Swamp of Dawn 1'),
(49201, 'Royden in Swamp of Dawn says that he can go back home when the swamp is free of monsters and asks you to defeat certain monsters.  Help him defeat the monsters. \n(Search Swamp of Dawn for Lava Gargoyle)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49202, 'Oh... When could I go back to my home, sweet home?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49203, 'I would just stand up and go home.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49204, 'Are you kidding me?  You say that because you are a good fighter... but this place is hell for someone as weak as me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49205, 'I guess you are right.  When are you planning to go home?  You can\'t stay here for the rest of your life.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49206, 'I need your help in order to go back home, [NAME].  I am so scared...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49207, 'I will help you as much as can. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49208, 'Well... You need to get rid of this monster first. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49209, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49210, 'It\'s {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle}.  It comes out to patrol from time to time, so I can\'t even sleep well at night...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Consider it gone.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(49211, 'Can I sleep safely at night, now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49212, 'Yes, you can... but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49213, 'Oh, I\'m glad.  I should dream about going back home!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49214, '{color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle} is watching me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49220, 'Purification of Swamp of Dawn 2'),
(49221, 'Royden in Swamp of Dawn says that he can go back home when the swamp is free of monsters and asks you to defeat certain monsters.  Help him defeat the monsters. \n(Search Swamp of Dawn for Caiman Junior)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49222, 'Arrr!  I thought is was an alligator...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49223, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49224, '(Shivering...)\nUgh!  The monster attacked me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49225, 'You should go inside...                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49226, 'Even if I do, I would never forget this enormos stress I got here.  I would suffer from the nightmare every night and take drastic measures...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49227, 'What do you want me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49228, 'When all of the monsters go away, I would feel safe to go home.  I can\'t leave before that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49229, '(What is with this guy...)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49230, 'Please  go out and defeat {color,yellow,Caiman Junior}.  While you are at it, please bring back {color,yellow,Caiman Junior\'s Fang}.  It won\'t be able to attack me without its fang.\n\n[BUTTON]=[...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[But I like alligators..][2]'),
(49231, 'Did you make it incapable of attacking?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49232, 'Well... I can\'t do that.  I can\'t call each one of them and tell them not to attack Royden...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49233, 'I... know... But... I guess taking its fang is enough..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49234, 'Collect {color,yellow,Caiman Junior\'s Fang}.  It won\'t be able to attack me without its fang.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49240, 'Scary One 1'),
(49241, 'Royden in Swamp of Dawn says that it is its dream to have a fragment of a monster called Rock Stone. Defeat Rock Stone and grant Royden\'s wish.\n(Search Burnning Rock for Rock Stone)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49242, 'Since it\'s almost time for me to go home... I should find the item of my dreams...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49243, 'Wasn\'t it your dream to go home?  You are having second thoughts now that the situation is better, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49244, 'Oh... no.  It\'s what my father wanted.  He couldn\'t have it until he passed away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49245, 'Hmm... What did he do?                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49246, 'He was a courageous adventurer.  He was good at fighting, unlike me...  He always collected rare treasures and showed them to me...\nOh... father...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49247, 'I am sure you have your father\'s blood in you, Royden.  You could be an outstanding adventurer.  Cheer up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49248, 'I am not ready yet.  I can\'t believe how foolish I am staying here like this...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49249, 'You should just try harder.  It\'s foolish not to give it a try at all. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49250, 'That\'s motivating, but I can\'t fight {color,yellow,Rock Stone} by myself.  Can you grant the wish of me and my father, [NAME]?\n{color,yellow,Rock Stone\'s Burning Fragment} has been the dream of my family.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Should I?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I can\'t.][2]'),
(49251, '{color,yellow,Rock Stone\'s Burning Fragment}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49252, 'Wow, that was hard.  But... If I give this to you, you have no other goal, do you, Royden?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49253, 'That\'s... right.  Actually, I don\'t know what to do next.. Thank you.  I am sure my father can rest more peacefully.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49254, 'It has been my father\'s dream to have {color,yellow,Rock Stone\'s Burning Fragment}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49260, 'Scary One 2'),
(49261, 'Watson in Swamp of Dawn believes that his father\'s death is related to Helga. Help him seek revenge and defeat Helga.\n(Search Forest of Slumber for Helgas Lair)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49262, 'Helga... That\'s why my father passed away...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49263, 'Is your father\'s death related to Helga?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49264, 'I guess so... My father\'s last letter told me to watch out for the King of Hell Gate.  I didn\'t know what it meant when I was young, but since I am an adventurer myself...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49265, 'Are you dreaming of revenge?                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49266, 'If I can, I want to, for myself and for my father...  But if I go after Helga like this, I will be ripped and killed.  It feels that my father is not resting in peace...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49267, '(I want to do it myself, but it won\'t mean anything to Watson.)\n...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49268, 'So, I\'ve made up my mind. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49269, 'Oh... Tell me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49270, '[NAME], please get back at Helga for my father.  I don\'t have the skills, but you and your courageous friends should be able to defeat {color,yellow,Helga}.  I should do it myself as his son, but my father would understand it.  Please!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I really can\'t...][2]'),
(49271, 'I am glad you are safe.  What about {color,yellow,Helga}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49272, 'I got back at it for you, Watson.  Your father will rest in peace now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49273, 'I see...  Thank you so much.  Really...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49274, 'We shouldn\'t let {color,yellow,Helga} get away with it..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49280, 'For the Research.. 1'),
(49281, 'Watson in Swamp of Dawn says he needs Helga\'s horn for his research.  Help him get Helga\'s horn.\n(Search Forest of Slumber for Helga Lair)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49282, 'Yes... This is what I need for my research...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49283, 'I think you are hard at work.  I don\'t want to bother you.  See you later. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49284, 'Wait!  I won\'t ignore a guest for my research!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49285, '(I guess he has a favor to ask me..)\nOh... That\'s OK.  Well... Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49286, 'Actually, I have a serious problem.  Research is always difficult.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49287, 'If it was easy, anyone could do it.  A true researcher should get over all difficulties.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49288, 'Hmm, are you trying to say I am not a true researcher?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49289, '(Got me...)\nOf course not... Everyone here knows that you are an outstanding adventurer and researcher, Watson. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49290, 'Hmm, anyways, I need something for my research.  It\'s {color,yellow,Helga\'s Horn}.  I was hoping you could get it for me.  If my research succeeds, I will be rich... I can pay you then!\n\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t have to...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will just make myself rich.][2]'),
(49291, 'Did you get {color,yellow,Helga\'s Horn}?  You have no idea how long I\'ve been waiting for this moment!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49292, 'Now that I got you what you need, I will wait for your astonishing results that will make you rich.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49293, 'Thank you for believing in me!  I\'m almost there..\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49294, '{color,yellow,Helga\'s Horn} will bring us money!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49300, 'For the Research.. 2'),
(49301, 'Watson in Swamp of Dawn says that he needs Slime\'s Tear for his research.  Help him get Slime\'s Tear.\n(Search Forest of Tide for Nest Slime)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49302, 'This is...!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49303, 'Have you found something remarkable?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49304, 'I can\'t say for sure... but the answer is yes. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49305, 'Wow, you haven\'t spent all that time for nothing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49306, 'Oh... But there is one problem... Where do I get {color,yellow,Slime\'s Tear}...?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49307, 'It sounds like something that\'s hard to get. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49308, 'That\'s why you are reputable, [NAME].  You rise above all other adventurers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49309, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49310, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Slime\'s Tear}.  As you can see, I can\'t do it myself...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should do it yourself.][2]'),
(49311, 'It seems that you have found {color,yellow,Slime\'s Tear}!  Thank you again!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49312, 'Don\'t I deserve something in return?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49313, 'I do value ethics.  Wait here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49314, 'People say {color,yellow,Slime\'s Tear} is really hard to get..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49320, 'Defeating Caiman 1'),
(49321, 'Median in Swamp of Dawn says she is worried about the fast increase in the number of Caiman.  Help Median with her request and reduce the number of Caiman.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn for Caiman Junior and Caiman)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49322, 'I don\'t feel good about it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49323, 'Hello, Median! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49324, '[NAME]... I can\'t stand it anymore, but seeing you gives me strength, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49325, 'Why... is that...  Is that because I am good?  Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49326, 'Of course.  If all adventurers were as courageous as you, [NAME], the world would have been a better place to live...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49327, 'OK, now I am embarrassed.  Tell me what you want!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49328, 'I am worried because the number of {color,yellow,Caiman Junior} and {color,yellow,Caiman} has increased so rapidly. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49329, 'Hmm, I understand. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49330, 'Can you get rid of them for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired.][2]'),
(49331, '[NAME]!  I can see in your face that it wasn\'t so hard!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49332, 'It wasn\'t.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49333, 'Well done.  Here\'s your reward.  Will you come back and help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49334, 'If we don\'t reduce the number of {color,yellow,Caiman Junior} and {color,yellow,Caiman}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49340, 'Defeating Caiman 2'),
(49341, 'Median in Swamp of Dawn says she is worried about the fast increase in the number of Caiman. Help Median with her problem and reduce the number of Caiman.\n(Search Tear\'s Marsh and Dungeon Cayman Junior)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49342, 'There are more monsters that I didn\'t know about.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49343, 'Median!  You look worried.  What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49344, 'Well...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49345, 'You can tell me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49346, 'I appreciate that you defeated Caiman, but I heard that there are other kinds of Caiman that are even stronger. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49347, 'Well, it seems to me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49348, 'I believe in your confidence.  Please go after {color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman Junior} this time!  While you are at it, please collect {color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman Junior\'s Necklace}.  I need evidence to make my report.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something else to do.][2]'),
(49349, '[NAME]!  Successful again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49350, 'Ha ha, Caiman won\'t be bothering you for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49351, 'Thank you.  You give me peace of mind, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49352, 'Please bring {color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman Junior\'s Necklace}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49360, 'Defeating Caiman 3'),
(49361, 'Median in Swamp of Dawn says she is worried about the fast increase in the number of Caiman.  Help Median with her problem and reduce the number of Caiman.\n(Search Tear\'s Marsh for Dungeon Cayman)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49362, 'They are back again...  Where are they coming from?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49363, 'I think I have done enough...  Are there still many of them out there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49364, 'I am sorry, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49365, 'You don\'t have to apologize to me, Median...  It\'s the monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49366, 'But it\'s my job to defeat Caiman.  I hope you can help me until the end, [NAME]. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49367, 'I will.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49368, '{color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman} must be the last one.  Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am tired.][2]'),
(49369, '[NAME], you must have special powers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49370, 'No, I certainly do not.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49371, 'No.  I can feel it.  You have special powers, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49372, '{color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman} is the last one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49380, 'Cleo\'s Worry 1'),
(49381, 'Cleo in Swamp of Dawn asks you to collect wood pieces from Mantrap Plant.  Help her get the wood pieces.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn for Mantrap Plant)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49382, 'Oh... I have to send out the supplies... but there is no way to get them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49383, 'Cleo?  Is anything wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49384, '[NAME], thank god you are here!  The wood pieces I have to send to Elderine are gone... There is not much time until the due date... What do I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49385, 'No worries?  You can use me!  But, remember that I am expensive. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49386, 'Oh... really?  You can do that for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49387, 'Don\'t worry and just take a rest. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(49388, 'Please bring {color,yellow, Hard Wood} from {color,yellow,Mantrap Plant}!  There is no time.  Hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good...][2]'),
(49389, 'Did you bring what I asked?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49390, 'As you ordered.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49391, 'Oh, wow.  Thank you.  I should be able to make the delivery to Elderine on time.  Well done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49392, 'Get me {color,yellow, Hard Wood} as soon as possible!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49400, 'Cleo\'s Worry 2'),
(49401, 'Cleo in Swamp of Dawn says that she can\'t sleep because of Wereboar.  Help her defeat Wereboar.\n(Search Swamp of Dawn her Wereboar)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49402, '(Anxious Cleo)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49403, 'Cleo?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49404, 'Ahhh!!  Don\'t!!  Don\'t come near me!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49405, 'Calm down...  It\'s just me!  Me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49406, 'Oh...[NAME].  Sorry.  I thought you were a {color,yellow, Wereboar}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49407, 'Are they harassing you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49408, 'Yes... I am so scared that I can\'t stay here anymore... Could you get rid of {color,yellow, Wereboar} for me, [NAME]?  If you could do that for me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired.][2]'),
(49409, '[NAME]!  You are back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49410, '{color,yellow, Wereboar} will never harass you again, Cleo!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49411, 'Thank you.  How could I pay you back... Let me think.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49412, '{color,yellow, Wereboar}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49420, 'It\'s not what\'s outside that counts!'),
(49421, 'Admitting that he has mistaken them for middle-aged gentlemen, from their appearance, a wandering item merchant asks for the disposal of the monsters.\n(Search Forest of Tides of Mist for Smart Phino)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49422, 'What trickery...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49423, 'Have you been robbed?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49424, 'Yes, a group of thiefs robbed me for my items and almost killed me in the process!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49425, 'Hmm... What has happened to you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49426, 'It was not long ago. It happened on a foggy day... I was looking around for something valuable.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49427, 'Sounds like a routine day except for fog, I guess.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49428, 'Yes. I was doing my job, as always when, what looked like a middle-aged gentleman wearing a hat was asking me for something, so I approached him to see if there is anything I can do. But...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49429, 'Are you saying that the gentleman was a monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49430, 'Yes, it was the {color,yellow, Smart Phino}. I can still vividly picture the monster coming at me. It was so terrifying. I\'m afraid they will keep haunting me in my dream. Would you take the {color,yellow, Smart Phino} monsters out for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(49431, 'So... What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49432, 'They got what they deserve!  From now on, you won\'t see such monsters in their unique costumes threatening any adventurer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49433, 'Thanks, I\'m very relieved. I will redeem myself soon...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49434, 'I want you to capture the {color,yellow, Smart Phino}. How dare the monster deceived me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49440, 'Kebing hunting'),
(49441, 'A wandering stone merchant asks you to defeat those Joker Kebings that move around in groups threatening adventurers.\n(Search Forest of Tides for Joker Kebing)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49442, 'What in the... What do I do with these monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49443, 'Seems like you are also having some problems. Why is it that you wandering merchants have been troubled so much lately?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49444, 'These monsters have troubled us for a while now! Merchants like us are helpless, you know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49445, 'Hmm... The time has changed. You need to have some combat capability these days, you know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49446, 'Well... Those numerous {color,yellow, Kebing} monsters are really worrisome.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49447, 'Sounds like there are so many Kebings moving around the area.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49448, 'Not just moving around! They have been fiercely attacking adventurers as well. They have become a serious issue in Elderine, too.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49449, 'I guess I\'d better teach these monsters a lesson.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49450, 'That\'s it. Why don\'t you kick some {color,yellow, Joker Kebing}\'s butt? Are you ready?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'m ready.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like doing it.][2]'),
(49451, 'What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49452, 'You won\'t see those monsters going around for a while. Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49453, 'That\'s a relief. I hope our merchant union won\'t be affected in any way.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49454, '{color,yellow, Joker Kebing} bastards...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49460, 'Why so fast?'),
(49461, 'A wandering skill merchant says that he cannot understand a monster called Speed Boogie. Let\'s investigate this monster and report back to the skill merchant.\n(Sand Beach of Mist and Speed Boogie)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(49462, 'Why on earth...?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(49463, 'You look like you have some serious problems.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49464, '[NAME], good to see you. I got pretty important stuff to discuss with you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49465, 'Something is not right. Talk to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49466, 'I\'m sure you have heard of a monster called {color,yellow, Speed Boogie}. I really can\'t understand this monster. How did this monster became so fast?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49467, '(...)\nWell... It appears to be a slow monster, you know. Anyway, I\'m also very curious about how they became so fast.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49468, 'With respect to that issue, I\'ve been working on a paper that is supposed to be submitted to Elderine. However, there are still some unsolved mysteries.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49469, 'Maybe, I should just confront them to find out how they became so fast. This is more of my own interest rather than a request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49470, 'Hope you could solve the mysteries about {color,yellow, Speed Boogie}. I\'ll be waiting.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready yet.][2]'),
(49471, 'What happened? Did you get the information you need to conclude my paper\'s finale?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49472, 'Actually, no! I still don\'t get it. It didn\'t look like one of those nimble monsters at all. Do they run by motors or something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(49473, 'Hmm... This should not become more and more of a mystery...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(49474, '{color,yellow, Speed Boogie}... Mysterious monster!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50310, 'For the Continent of Isya(LV 20-70, Tower of Iyzel)'),
(50311, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Iron Golem, the boss monster in the Tower of Iyzel.  This quest is available once a day. (Daily Quest)\n(Search Forest of Mist)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50312, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50313, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50314, 'The Continent of Isya used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50315, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50316, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50317, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Iron Golem} in the {color,yellow, Tower of Iyzel}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2]'),
(50318, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better fame, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50319, '{color,yellow, Iron Golem} in the {color,yellow, Tower of Iyzel} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50320, 'For the Continent of  Isya (LV 60-90, Crystal Castle)'),
(50321, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Cornelius, the boss monster in Dragons Tomb. This quest is available once a day. (Daily Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50322, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50323, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50324, 'The Isya Continent used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50325, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50326, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50327, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Jewel Golem} in {color,yellow, Crystal Castle}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2]'),
(50328, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better reputation, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50329, '{color,yellow, Jewel Golem} in {color,yellow, Crystal Castle} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50330, 'For the Continent of  Isya (LV 80-105, Dragon\'s Tomb)'),
(50331, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Dungeon Cornelius, the boss monster in Dragon\'s Tomb.  This quest is available once a day. (Daily Quest)\n(Search Burning Rock)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50332, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50333, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50334, 'The Isya Continent used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50335, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50336, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50337, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Dungeon Cornelius} in {color,yellow, Dragon\'s Tomb}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2] '),
(50338, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better fame, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50339, '{color,yellow, Dungeon Cornelius} in {color,yellow, Dragon\'s Tomb} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50340, 'For the Continent of Isya (LV 90-110, Leviathan Nest)'),
(50341, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Vicious Leviathan, the boss monster in Leviathan Nest.  This quest is available once a day. (Daily Quest)\n(Search Roumen)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50342, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50343, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50344, 'The Isya Continent used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50345, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50346, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50347, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Vicious Leviathan} in {color,yellow, Leviathan Nest}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2] '),
(50348, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better fame, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50349, '{color,yellow, Vicious Leviathan} in {color,yellow, Leviathan Nest} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50350, 'For the Continent of Isya (LV 100-115, Secret Laboratory)'),
(50351, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Experiment Subject #25, the boss monster in Secret Laboratory.  This quest is available once a day. (Daily Quest)\n(Search Alberstol Ruins)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50352, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50353, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50354, 'The Isya Continent used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50355, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50356, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50357, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Experiment Subject #25} in {color,yellow, Secret Laboratory}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2] '),
(50358, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better fame, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50359, '{color,yellow, Experiment Subject #25} in {color,yellow, Secret Laboratory} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50360, 'For the Continent of Isya (LV 111-115, Burning Adealia)'),
(50361, 'Guard Captain Shutian asks you to defeat Eglack, the boss monster in Burning Adealia.  This quest is available once a day. (Search Adealia)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50362, '[NAME], we need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50363, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50364, 'The Isya Continent used to be peaceful and abundant, but it has become deserted because of the power of evil.  The people of Isya are worried and threatened because there are monsters everywhere...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50365, 'You must already know that there are powerful monsters across the continent, [NAME].  Please start defeating them one by one to let everyone know that the power of light can defeat the power of darkness. It\'s up to you now. Please help bring everyone together to fight against the evil!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50366, 'OK, just leave it to me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50367, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Eglack} in {color,yellow, Burning Adealia}.  Everyone in the continent will hear about your courage!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t go right now.][2] '),
(50368, 'You did great!  Now, I will use my magic to spread your reputation across the Isya Continent.  With better fame, you can earn more powerful items.  I hope to see you become stronger!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50369, '{color,yellow, Eglack} in {color,yellow, Burning Adealia} is a powerful monster.  You should go with strong friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50370, 'We can do anything together! (Kingdom Quest Only)'),
(50371, 'Guard Captain Shutian gives special opportunities to adventurers who want to experience unforgettable adventures with friends.  What would the opportunities be? (Daily Quest)\n\n* [Hidden Mine] Kingdom Quest and PvP Kingdom Quest are not checked as daily quest counts. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50372, 'Hey, are you bored?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50373, 'Is there anything fun to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50374, 'Of course. \nDo you have reliable colleagues?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50375, 'Of course.  Why do you ask?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50376, 'I am not asking you because I don\'t have reliable colleagues, but you can overcome any hardship with friends by your side!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50377, 'Go with your reliable friends to challenge yourselves with a {color,yellow, Kingdom Quest}!  I don\'t know where you should go or whom you should fight though.  Ha ha ha!\nGood luck!\n\n[BUTTON]=[..??][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t have friends.][2]'),
(50378, 'Hey, you are back safe.  I can see your fame go up!  See you tomorrow!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50379, 'Don\'t you feel confident when you are with a reliable friend?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50380, 'Fine Deal (Daily quest Lv1 ~ Lv10)'),
(50381, 'Town Chief Rumenus of Roumen, has prepared a new quest and reward for adventurers. What is this quest which is available only once a day?\n(Search Roumen)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50382, '[NAME]! Oh! You are here! We just got something in for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50383, 'Is it something important?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50384, 'Well...it could be...But, it depends on what you want.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50385, 'What I want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50386, 'Something like to be strong or to be rich... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50387, 'Absolutely...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50388, 'Fine. Then you should complete this mission I\'m about to give to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50389, 'Ok. No problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50390, 'Hunt down the monster known as {color,yellow, Slime}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, that\'s easy.][1] \n[BUTTON]=[I want to do it later.][2]'),
(50391, 'It looks like you have completed the task. I will reward you as I promised. Just pick one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Increase Exp][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Increase item drop rate][4]'),
(50392, '<Increase physical attack>\nNow, you\'ve become much stronger than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
