(50591, 'It looks like you have completed the task. I will reward you as I promised. Just pick one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Increase Exp][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Increase item drop rate][4]'),
(50592, '<Increase physical attack>\nNow, you\'ve become much stronger than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50593, '<Increase magical attack>\nNow, your magical power has become stronger than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50594, '<Increase Exp>\nNow, you can level up faster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50595, '<Increase item drop rate>\nNow, you can find more items than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50596, 'I hope it will give you some slight help for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50597, 'You didn\'t hunt down the moster{color,yellow, Rhinoce Lord} yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50600, 'Fine Deal (Daily quest Lv111 ~ Lv115)'),
(50601, 'Town Chief Guiltian of Adealia, has prepared a new quest and reward for adventurers. What is this quest which is available only once a day?\n(Search Adealia)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50602, '[NAME]! Oh! You are here! We just got something in for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50603, 'Is it something important?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50604, 'Well...it could be...But, it depends on what you want.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50605, 'What I want?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50606, 'Something like to be strong or to be rich... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50607, 'Absolutely...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50608, 'Fine. Then you should complete this mission I\'m about to give to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50609, 'Ok. No problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50610, 'Hunt down the monster known as {color,yellow, Dark Ape}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, that\'s easy.][1] \n[BUTTON]=[I want to do it later.][2]'),
(50611, 'It looks like you have completed the task. I will reward you as I promised. Just pick one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Increase Exp][3]\n[BUTTON]=[Increase item drop rate][4]'),
(50612, '<Increase physical attack>\nNow, you\'ve become much stronger than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50613, '<Increase magical attack>\nNow, your magical power has become stronger than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50614, '<Increase Exp>\nNow, you can level up faster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50615, '<Increase item drop rate>\nNow, you can find more items than before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50616, 'I hope it will give you some slight help for you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50617, 'You didn\'t hunt down the moster{color,yellow, Dark Ape} yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50620, 'Do you need the key? (For Leviathan Nest, Repeatable Quest)'),
(50621, 'Roumenus is searching for someone who needs a key to enter Leviatan Nest. Maybe he is the right person to ask. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50622, '[NAME], Seems like you need something, don\'t you? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50623, 'I\'m searching for a key for Leviatan Nest.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50624, 'I knew it. I\'ve stashed the key for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50625, 'Wow! Thank you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50626, 'Don\'t lose the key. I can\'t make the key everytime you lose it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50627, 'Okay. I will keep that in my mind.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50628, 'Here\'s the key. Please be careful! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50630, 'Do you need the key? (For Dragon\'s Tomb, Repeatable Quest)'),
(50631, 'Adrian is looking for someone who is trying to enter to the Dragon\'s Tomb. Maybe he is the right person to ask. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50632, '[NAME], Are you looking for something?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50633, 'Yes, I\'m looking for a key for Dragon\'s Tomb. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50634, 'I knew it. I\'ve stashed the key for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50635, 'Wow! Thank you!\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50636, 'Don\'t lose the key. I can\'t make the key everytime you lose it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50637, 'Okay.  I will keep that in my mind.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50638, 'Here you are. Please be careful. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50640, 'Spooky Wookie (Event Quest)'),
(50641, 'Kid Woz asks you to help him investigate the increase of monsters around Isya.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50642, 'Hello, [NAME]! How are you doing?\n\nHave you noticed the increase in sightings of spooky monsters here lately? I\'ve received many reports about this ever since we put up Halloween decorations around here.\nCan you help me investigate?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50643, 'Hi Kid Woz, I am well, getting very excited for Halloween! Thank you for asking. I haven\'t really seen a lot of spooky monsters around though. Can you give me more information?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50644, 'Many Isyans reported that there\'s a large number of spooky monsters appearing around Elderine lately. The monsters keep on scaring little kids here and the situation has become more severe. Some kids fell ill because of this and their parents became worried. \n\nAfter doing some research, I learned some ritual that I can perform to make the spooky monsters go away. However, I need your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50645, 'Poor kids. I am so sorry to hear that, Kid Woz. I\'ll do whatever I can to help you investigate and eradicate these spooky monsters!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50646, '[NAME],thank you! I am sure the kids and their parents would appreciate your help. So I learned from my research that {color,yellow, Monster Hair Samples} and {color,yellow, Vial of Monster Blood} would do the trick. I need to mix them together with a special elixir and spray it at every corner of Elderine. Can you help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50647, 'No problem, Kid Woz. I will try my best. What can I do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50648, 'We need to work together, [NAME]! \n\nI need you to collect {color,yellow, 40 Monster Hair Samples} and {color,yellow, 40 Vials of Monster Blood}. While you are collecting the necessary items, I will prepare the special elixir. This will save us some time. Once I have everything, I\'ll make the elixir and perform the special ritual to eradicate these spooky ones.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure Kid Woz, I\'ll help the kids.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Umm, I\'m really busy running away from these spooky monsters....Maybe later.][2] '),
(50649, 'You\'re back! I\'ve been waiting for you.\n\nThank you very much [NAME] for bringing me the Mosnter Hair Samples and Vials of Monster Blood. I can now mix them together with the elixir and perform the ritual soon.\n\nPlease take these items as a token of my appreciation for all of your hard work!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50650, 'Have you had a chance to collect the Monster Hair Samples and Vials of Monster Blood? I need them quick so we can eradicate the spooky monsters!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50660, 'SOS!'),
(50661, 'An injured member of the Henneath Alliance came to Chief Adrian of Uruga.  She is looking for an adventurer who can come with her to save her colleagues who are in danger near the Ancient Forest of Elves.\nListen to Adrian and go to the place directed by the injured member of the Henneath Alliance to save the members in danger. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50662, '<Member of the Henneath Alliance>\n(Screaming in pain)\nAdrian...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50663, '(Helping the member of the Henneath Alliance)\nWhat happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50664, '<Member of the Henneath Alliance>\nWell... \n(Whispers to Adrian)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50665, 'I see...\n(Adrian had a look of shock.  She then got a grip and took the injured to the therapist)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50666, 'Err... What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50667, '(Adrian notices that {color, yellow,[NAME]} was listening the whole time)\nOh, it\'s you! How long have you been there for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50668, 'Oh, from the beginning.\nI didn\'t want to interrupt, so I just was waiting till you were done...\nThat person seems to be seriously injured.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50669, 'Yes, I think she was attacked. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50670, '{color, yellow, The injured member of the Henneath Alliance said that her colleagues are trapped and under attack.}\nCould you go there and {color, yellow, save the other members of the Henneath Alliance?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[You can count on me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh, I have another urgent task.][2]'),
(50671, 'The other adventurers are safe!!\nThey will arrive in the village soon. \nSome of them are injured, so it will take them more time to get here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50672, 'I\'m relieved.\nI should send more Henneath Alliance members for the injured, so they can get here safer and faster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50673, 'Well done.\n {color, yellow,[NAME]!}\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50674, 'If you can\'t find the place the injured adventurer was taking about, I will tell you again. \nIt was somewhere in the {color, yellow,Ancient Forest of Elves}, so {color, yellow,go to the Ancient Forest of Elves.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50680, 'Broken Pieces of Blade'),
(50681, 'Skill Master Cyburn in Uruga asks you to find and bring him the Broken Pieces of Blade.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50682, 'Why...  What took you so long?\nI asked Adrian to send you to me. \nWhat have you been up to?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50683, 'What?  I never got that message?  Ha ha. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50684, 'I guess Adrian didn\'t give you my message .\nAhem.\nAnyways, I have a favor to ask you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50685, 'A favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50686, 'Can you find the {color, yellow,Broken Pieces of Blade}? It is said to be found in the {color, yellow,Mysterious Place} near the Ancient Forest of Elves. Can you find this item and bring it to me. \nI will tell you why when you bring the {color, yellow,Broken Pieces of Blade}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[The Broken Pieces of Blade?  I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[The Broken Pieces of Blade?  It would be faster to get one from the blacksmith.][2]'),
(50687, 'You are back. \nNow!  Give me the Broken Pieces of Blade.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50688, 'Here.  What do you need this for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50689, 'It has no use alone, but with other pieces it can become part of a tool used for an important ritual.  If you just leave it out there, there could be unexpected incidents.  I just wanted to keep it safe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50690, 'It\'s the {color, yellow,Broken Pieces of Blade}.\nBring me whatever you can find.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50700, 'Collecting Pieces of Magic Marble'),
(50701, 'Skill Master Cyburn of Uruga asks you to bring him all the pieces of Magic Marble you can find. \nCyburn said they can be found around the same area that you found the Broken Pieces of Blade\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50702, 'Now that we have the Broken Pieces of Blade, you must find the {color, yellow,Pieces of Magic Marble.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50703, 'You should be able to find the {color, yellow,Pieces of Magic Marble} around the same area you found the {color, yellow,Broken Pieces of Blade.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[The Pieces of Magic Marble!!  OK!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ask someone else this time.][2]'),
(50704, 'You found them.\nWell done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50705, 'I will protect these Pieces of Magic Marble.  If you see other Pieces of Magic Marble, bring them to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50706, 'Not Broken Pieces of Blade, but {color, yellow,Pieces of Magic Marble}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50710, 'Suspicious Start'),
(50711, 'Adrian appreciates the performance of adventurers and asks them to keep what they have been through a secret.\nTalk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50712, ' {color, yellow,[NAME]}!  Do you remember the Henneath Alliance member you helped the other day?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50713, 'Of course I remember. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50714, 'She told me to give you her thanks when I see you.  Give her a visit when you have the time. \nShe said that it is a blessing to have known a great adventure like you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50715, 'I am flattered. About the place the Henneath Alliance members were found, it was nothing like what I have ever seen before.  It was filled with bizarre things.  What was that place?  And why were the adventurers there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50716, 'Oh...\nWe are doing a survey on that place. \nPlease hold your curiosity and wait for the findings. \nBy the way, don\'t tell anyone about that place. \nThis is my request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50717, 'If someone finds out about that place, I won\'t stay being so favorable to you. \nPlease help me keep thinking that you are a favorable person. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50718, 'Please don\'t tell anyone about your experience. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50720, 'Sweeping Devildom Soldiers 1'),
(50721, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga is intrigued about the Devildom monsters that have recently emerged.  She tells you to weaken their forces before they get stronger...  Help her defeat the Flame Soldiers of Devildom.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50722, 'What on earth is happening to this continent...  There are monsters from another world.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50723, 'I don\'t know for sure... but what is certain is that it is much greater in scale than any other event in the past...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50724, 'If we don\'t do anything, our continent will be ruined by the monsters from Devildom Territory.  We need a plan...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50725, 'Wouldn\'t the best way be to reduce the number of monsters in the area?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50726, 'That\'s right...\nWe should start with what we can do now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50727, 'Then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50728, '[NAME], the future of this continent relies on you.  Go into Devildom Territory and reduce the number of {color,yellow,Flame Soldiers of Devildom}.  Be careful since they are powerful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have a stomachache...][2]'),
(50729, 'You were great.  I was worried. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50730, 'Phew...  It was hard.  But this must not be the end, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50731, 'Unfortunately, no.  We have to stop all of them from coming into this continent. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50732, 'Let\'s start with {color,yellow,Flame Soldiers of Devildom}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50740, 'Sweeping Devildom Soldiers 2'),
(50741, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga is intrigued about the Devildom monsters that have recently emerged.  She tells you to weaken their forces before they get stronger...  Help her defeat the Ice Soldiers of Devildom.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50742, '[NAME], more enemies await you in Devildom Territory.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50743, 'Hmph... I feel like I\'m going to be doing this over and over again for a while...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50744, 'I know, but it would help us defend ourselves if you could reduce the number of Devildom monsters.  They need to be reduced...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50745, 'I see... But don\'t we have to stop their migration at the source?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50746, 'That\'s the job of the Sealing Sorcerer.  Unfortunately, I can\'t give you any orders. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50747, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50748, 'This time, reduce the number of {color,yellow,Ice Soldiers of Devildom }.  You must be fast and calm.  The monsters in that area are powerful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready..][2]'),
(50749, 'You are back safe.  [NAME], you are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50750, 'Ha ha.  It was hard, but doable!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50751, 'Well done, but this isn\'t the end...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50752, '{color,yellow, Ice Soldier of Devildom} is the next target.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50760, 'Sweeping Devildom Soldiers 3'),
(50761, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga is intrigued about the Devildom monsters that have recently emerged.  She tells you to weaken their forces before they get stronger...  Help her defeat the Storm Soldiers of Devildom.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50762, '[NAME], we are close.  You are the only person I can trust...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50763, 'I\'m flattered...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50764, 'I know you are tired, but please think of it as a mission for the Isya Continent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50765, 'I don\'t know what other Henneath Alliance members are doing.. Don\'t they need to come together to fight the Devildom monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50766, 'But this is a top secret mission.  If other people find out about the monsters... the Isya Continent will be in panic.  That\'s why you are the only one we can trust, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50767, 'It\'s such an important job.  I\'m a little overwhelmed. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50768, 'This time, reduce the number of {color,yellow,Storm Soldiers of Devildom}.  You must be fast and calm.  The monsters in that area are powerful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready...][2]'),
(50769, 'I\'ve been waiting for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50770, 'I\'m getting used to this.  Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50771, 'Please take a rest until your next mission.  I can\'t bear to see something happen to you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50772, '{color,yellow, Storm Soldiers of Devildom} is the next target.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50780, 'Sweeping Devildom Soldiers 4'),
(50781, 'Town Chief Adrian of Uruga is intrigued about the Devildom monsters that have recently emerged.  She tells you to weaken their forces before they get stronger...  Help her defeat the Lightning Soldiers of Devildom.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50782, 'The last group of soldiers remain.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50783, 'That was pretty fast.  I thought it would take longer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50784, 'That\'s probably because your skills are so advanced. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50785, 'Don\'t make me blush...  Ha ha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50786, 'Please focus on this last mission.  Never underestimate them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50787, 'I\'ll keep that in mind.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50788, 'This time, reduce the number of {color,yellow,Lightning Soldiers of Devildom}.  You must be fast and calm.  The monsters in that area are powerful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready..][2]'),
(50789, 'Well done.  The Devildom soldiers must have weakened a little after all of the ones you just defeated.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50790, 'They have... but there still is... {color,yellow, Focalor}...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50791, 'I know.  We are coming up with our next strategy, so please go back and take a rest.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50792, '{color,yellow,Lightning Soldiers of Devildom} is the next target.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50800, 'Defeating Focalor 1'),
(50801, 'Town Chief Adrian says that the threat won\'t go away if the leader is not defeated. Even if the number of Devildom soldiers have been reduced.  Help her and defeat Flame Focalor!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50802, 'The number of Devildom soldiers has been reduced. The only ones that remains is...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50803, 'The head of each group, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50804, 'That\'s right.  I wasn\'t too worried when you were fighting the soldiers, but you now have to confront the leaders.  I\'m worried...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50805, 'Don\'t worry.  I can form a party and take them down or do it myself!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50806, 'Forming a party is the smartest thing you can do.  If you are acting with reckless bravado, I need you to stop.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50807, 'Hmm, if you insist... I will go with reliable adventurers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50808, 'The first target is {color,yellow, Flame Focalor}.  I wish you luck.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need more adventurers..][2]'),
(50809, 'You are safe.  I was worried so much. Phew...\nI\'m so relieved!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50810, 'It was very hard, but mission complete!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50811, 'I\'m proud of you.  Keep up the good work! Now on to your next mission.  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50812, 'Be careful.  Your target is {color,yellow,Flame Focalor}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50820, 'Defeating Cold Focalor'),
(50821, 'Town Chief Adrian says that the threat won\'t go away if the leader is not defeated. Even if the number of Devildom soldiers have been reduced.  Help her and defeat Ice Focalor!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50822, 'Am I making you work too hard?  I\'m sorry...[NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50823, 'Don\'t worry about it!  I\'m just doing my job...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50824, 'Thank you for saying that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50825, 'OK, what\'s next?. Let\'s get this show on the road.  Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50826, 'We have the rest of boss monsters.  Three more to go...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50827, 'I\'m ready to head out anytime...  Just give me your order. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50828, 'It\'s time to defeat the {color,yellow,Ice Focalor}.  Be careful and don\'t forget to go with your most powerful friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need more adventurers...][2]'),
(50829, 'You are safe.  You certainly have the skills.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50830, 'Ha ha.  Don\'t mention it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50831, 'Take a rest for the next mission. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50832, 'Be careful.  Your target is {color,yellow,Ice Focalor}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50840, 'Defeating Storm Focalor'),
(50841, 'Town Chief Adrian says that the threat won\'t go away if the leader is not defeated. Even if the number of Devildom soldiers have been reduced.  Help her and defeat Storm Focalor!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50842, 'Not many remain...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50843, 'Wow...  Is it almost over?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50844, 'I can\'t say it\'s over, but we can be relieved for a bit after this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50845, 'I should keep myself together and focused.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50846, 'That\'s the spirit.  Carelessness always leads to trouble.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50847, 'I see.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50848, 'Now!  It\'s time to defeat {color,yellow,Storm Focalor}.  Be careful and don\'t forget to go with your most powerful friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need more adventurers...][2]'),
(50849, 'I have been waiting for you to come back.  This is it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50850, 'I am doing this pretty well so far. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50851, 'Please take a rest before the final mission.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50852, 'Be careful.  Your target is {color,yellow,Storm Focalor}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50860, 'Defeating Lightning Focalor'),
(50861, 'Town Chief Adrian says that the threat won\'t go away if the leader is not defeated. Even if the number of Devildom soldiers have been reduced.  Help her and defeat Lightning Focalor!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50862, 'This is the final battle...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50863, 'This is the moment I have been waiting for!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50864, 'I don\'t have a good feeling about the consequences of our actions...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50865, 'Let\'s think positive!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50866, 'Of course... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50867, 'Then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50868, 'This is it.  It\'s time to defeat {color,yellow,Lightning Focalor}.  Be careful and don\'t forget to go with your most powerful friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need more adventurers..][2]'),
(50869, 'Oh... We will be safe for a while, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50870, 'Let\'s hope so...  If this action angers someone and brings more monsters from the Devildom Territory, then we might be in trouble.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50871, 'That\'s what worries us...  Well done.  Let\'s keep fighting.  That\'s the destiny of our continent!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50872, 'This is our final target.  Defeat {color,yellow,Lightning Focalor}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50880, 'Come Back, Rudolph!'),
(50881, 'Rumor has it that Santa Claus, who has been preparing for the holiday season, is having a difficult time. Rudolph is not moving at all. Talk to Santa and try to revive Rudolph.\n(Search Sand Beach, Forest of Tides, Sea of Greed, Forest of Mist)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50882, 'Oh... How can this happen?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50883, 'Oh Em Gee! It\'s Santa Claus!! Can I please have some presents?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50884, 'I am sorry to say, but I don\'t have any presents right now. Sigh.\n[NEXT]'),
(50885, 'Santa Claus should never sound this worried! Whats going on? Are you pullling my leg?\n[NEXT]'),
(50886, 'I am not joking. Rudolph is not moving at all and I am worried!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50887, 'Oh no! What happened to Rudolph?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50888, 'I have no idea. Rudolph looks like he\'s being followed by some evil spirits. He\'s been acting weird for the past few days and he even fainted today. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50889, 'Followed by evil spirits? That is ridiculous...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50890, 'Last week, Rudolph went to the west to fetch presents for me and people said that they saw a strange smoke following Rudolph during his trip. I don\'t know what the dark smoke is, but I was told the strange smoke is evil spirits...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50891, 'Do you think it is possible? I mean, do you think the strange smoke did something to Rudolph... Do you think it\'s an evil monster? I could help if the culprit is an evil monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50892, 'I am not sure, but I did see a few monsters in town a few days ago. They were mumbling strange words. I think they might be the culprit. Do you think you can go after them and defeat them? I don\'t want Rudolph to suffer any more...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Um...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Scary.][2]'),
(50893, 'Oh! [NAME]! The evil monsters have been defeated! Rudolph is back!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50894, 'It was quite hard to figure out. The evil spirits seemed to paralyze animals by sending parasites in their bodies. Now that they\'re all destroyed, no need to worry anymore!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50895, 'I can finally deliver presents for Isyans now! Here, this is my gift. I have to go. Merry Christmas!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50896, 'Where are those mumbling monsters? I have to defeat them so Isyans can get their Christmas presents this year.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50900, 'Christmas Chaos (Lv1 ~ Lv54)'),
(50901, 'Berny the Elf needs your help to stop Snow Slimes from blocking the delivery of materials for the toy factory of Isya.\nYou will find them in the Free Battle Zone of your level.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50902, 'Oh no!!! Don\'t tell me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50903, 'Hello Berny, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50904, '[NAME], it\'s terrible! The toy factory of Isya is out of materials and the Snow Slime keeps preventing us from receiving a new shipment of materials ! Please find the Snow Slime and stop it from blocking the delivery of new materials but be careful, he may not be alone!\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the kids, I will help you][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m too busy playing with snow][2]'),
(50905, 'Okay, I fought it and now it\'s gone for now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50906, 'Excellent! The delivery should arrive at anytime by now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50907, 'So? Is it still around?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50910, 'Christmas Chaos (Lv55 ~ Lv99)'),
(50911, 'Berny the Elf needs your help to stop Snow Slimes from blocking the delivery of materials for the toy factory of Isya.\nYou will find them in the Free Battle Zone of your level.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50912, 'Oh no!!! Don\'t tell me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50913, 'Hello Berny, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50914, '[NAME], it\'s terrible! The toy factory of Isya is out of materials and the Snow Slime keeps preventing us from receiving a new shipment of materials ! Please find the Snow Slime and stop it from blocking the delivery of new materials but be careful, he may not be alone!\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the kids, I will help you][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m too busy playing with snow][2]'),
(50915, 'Okay, I fought it and now it\'s gone for now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50916, 'Excellent! The delivery should arrive at anytime by now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50917, 'So? Is it still around?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50920, 'Christmas Chaos (Lv100 ~ Lv115)'),
(50921, 'Berny the Elf needs your help to stop Snow Slimes from blocking the delivery of materials for the toy factory of Isya.\nYou will find them in the Free Battle Zone of your level.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50922, 'Oh no!!! Don\'t tell me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50923, 'Hello Berny, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50924, '[NAME], it\'s terrible! The toy factory of Isya is out of materials and the Snow Slime keeps preventing us from receiving a new shipment of materials ! Please find the Snow Slime and stop it from blocking the delivery of new materials but be careful, he may not be alone!\n\n[BUTTON]=[For the kids, I will help you][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m too busy playing with snow][2]'),
(50925, 'Okay, I fought it and now it\'s gone for now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50926, 'Excellent! The delivery should arrive at anytime by now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50927, 'So? Is it still around?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50930, 'Sweet Candy Cane (2 Snowflakes Required)'),
(50931, 'Let\'s get the reward from Berny the Elf.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50932, '[NAME]~ Have you collected any Snowflakes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50933, 'Hello Berny, Time for my Reward (I came to receive Sweet Candy Cane.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50934, 'Let\'s see if you brought enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I did!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, actually I wanted to have them free.][2]'),
(50935, 'It\'s good enough! [NAME] here is your reward! Here! Take them.\nHappy Holidays~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50936, 'You are a little short to receive rewards. Come back when you have enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50940, 'Christmas Fireworks (5 Snowflakes Required)'),
(50941, 'Let\'s get the reward from Berny the Elf.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50942, '[NAME]~ Have you collected any Snowflakes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50943, 'Hello Berny, Time for my Reward (I came to receive Fireworks.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50944, 'Let\'s see if you brought enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I did!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, actually I wanted to have them free.][2]'),
(50945, 'It\'s good enough! [NAME] here is your reward! Here! Take them.\nHappy Holidays~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50946, 'You are a little short to receive rewards. Come back when you have enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50950, 'Santa\'s Beard (10 Snowflakes Required)'),
(50951, 'Let\'s get the reward from Berny the Elf.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50952, '[NAME]~ Have you collected any Snowflakes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50953, 'Hello Berny, Time for my Reward (I came to receive Santa\'s Beard.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50954, 'Let\'s see if you brought enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I did!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, actually I wanted to have them free.][2]'),
(50955, 'It\'s good enough! [NAME] here is your reward! Here! Take them.\nHappy Holidays~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50956, 'You are a little short to receive rewards. Come back when you have enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50960, 'Snow Slime Mount + @ (14 Snowflakes Required)'),
(50961, 'Let\'s get the reward from Berny the Elf.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50962, '[NAME]~ Have you collected any Snowflakes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50963, 'Hello Berny, Time for Reward (I wonder what you got for me for all these SnowFlakes!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50964, 'Let\'s see if you brought enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I did!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, actually I wanted to have them free.][2]'),
(50965, 'It\'s good enough! [NAME] here is your reward! Here! Take them.\nHappy Holidays~\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50966, 'You are a little short to receive rewards. Come back when you have enough Snowflakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50970, 'Bill Burman?'),
(50971, 'Elbama of Elderine thinks Big Burman, the leader of Seal Sorcerers\' organization, is suspicious.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50972, 'Bill Burman... You think you can get away with this?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50973, 'Elbama?  What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50974, 'Oh, [NAME].  Have you heard of the group that calls themselves the Seal Sorcerers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50975, 'Seal Sorcerers?  No, I haven\'t...  Who are they?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50976, 'Hmph, they are a group that claims to be able to close the {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate} that\'s open in the continent, but I can\'t bring myself to trust them.  Who knows?  They could summon evil monsters to dominate the continent at the gate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50977, '(Thinks carefully...)\nWell...  You could say that, unless we actually see them seal that {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate} or whatever.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50978, 'I am constantly pressuring Bill Burman, the leader of Seal Sorcerers, but that old snake keeps getting away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50979, 'I see.  Based off what you say, Elbama, I think they sound fishy.  Do you want me to investigate them secretly?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50980, 'No, this is too risky for you.  It could cause something big for the continent. \nI have an idea... \nBill Burman...  This will be the end to your lies!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50981, 'Hmm...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50982, '<Guard\'s Urgent Message>\nElbama!  I have an urgent message from Captain Shutian!\n\n<Elbama>\nOh... This is...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50983, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50984, 'I knew something like this would happen.  You should go to {color,yellow, Shutian} at once.  You must report back to me about what happens after this, OK?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(50990, 'Investigation at Dimensional Gate'),
(50991, 'Shutian reported something to Elbama.  He wants you to enter the Dimensional Gate and see what\'s inside of the gate. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(50992, '(Surprised)\nOh... Why are you here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(50993, 'Ha ha, don\'t worry.  Elbama sent me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50994, 'Phew... I see... Welcome.  Things don\'t look good.  Something serious is happening around here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(50995, 'Is it about the {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50996, 'I don\'t know what Elbama has told you, but that\'s right.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50997, 'Something bad has happened at the {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate}...  I just found out about it and it\'s already happening.  I must be unlucky...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50998, 'You could say that, but it\'s been happening for some time.  Let\'s cut to the chase.  Listen carefully.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(50999, '(I wonder...)\nOK.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51000, 'The {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate} has opened along the {color,yellow, Path to Dark Passage II}.  According to the Seal Sorcerers, that gate leads to some place in the Isya Continent. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51001, 'That means... the Isya Continent is at crisis at this moment...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51002, '(Nods)\nIt\'s very serious.  You should go there.  If the {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate} is open, get inside.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51003, 'You want me to go inside the Dimensional Gate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51004, 'It\'s a little dangerous, but you are the only one we can trust.  You can come out of the gate as long as it\'s there.\nInvestigate what\'s inside the Dimensional Gate and defeat anything that looks strange.  Then, report back to me. \nRemember, our destiny lies on your hands!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure... I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared.][2]'),
(51005, 'I was worried.  [NAME], what happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51006, 'Hmm... It was a gloomy cave...  It was certainly different from our continent. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51007, 'Did you see any strange monsters?  How did they look?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51008, 'I haven\'t seen them before.  You should go there to see what they look like...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51009, 'I want to go there, but... \nAnyways, I\'m glad you are back safe.  Tell me everything you\'ve seen!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51010, 'You must investigate the {color,yellow, Dimensional Gate}.  Now!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51020, 'Oncoming Threat'),
(51021, 'Elbama thinks the Dimensional Gate is suspicious.  Go inside and defeat the beast called Ice Murumuru. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51022, 'I\'ve been waiting, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51023, 'I have told Shutian about everything... Has he reported to you already?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51024, 'All of the news gets to me fast, especially something like this.  How was it?  Inside the Dimensional Gate...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51025, 'I could see that it was a different world from our own...  There were tribes I have never seen before, but it seemed that they were being tortured.  I could see monsters I have never seen in the Isya Continent. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51026, 'I wonder if Bill Burman knows anything about this.  It\'s a mistake of that proud Seal Sorcerers\' organization...  Nice.  Very nice!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51027, 'Hmm... Don\'t we need to announce it to the entire village and gather military forces to attack the Dimensional Gate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51028, 'That\'s not your job.  That\'s my job. \nWhen Bill Burman mentioned the Dimensional Gate a while ago, he said that it is filled with scary monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51029, 'From what I have seen, that is correct!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51030, 'He once said that {color,yellow, Ice Murumuru} would cause a great catastrophe if it came into our continent.  That monster must remain there since it\'s a monster from that world.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51031, 'Should we ambush it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51032, 'It\'s too risky to ambush at this point.  We just need to prove that Bill Burman is not telling the truth - that he is just a cowardly lunatic.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51033, '(I don\'t get him.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51034, 'It\'s certainly risky because it\'s a monster from another world, but hopefully it will be a piece of cake for you.  Even so, you should still go with other adventurers.\nSince we have learned about the Dimensional Gate, let\'s take the initiative to take action first.  Go and defeat {color,yellow, Ice Murumuru}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That name scares me..][2]'),
(51035, 'Was it as scary as you thought it would be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51036, 'I don\'t know...  In some ways, yes...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51037, 'But I was right, since you are back safe.  Hmph, that cowardly old man... Well done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51038, 'There was a strange tribe inside...  Have you heard anything about them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51039, 'I heard there\'s a tribe called Fo... something. But why are they there?  I\'ll find out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51040, 'It\'s called {color,yellow, Ice Murumuru}.  I wonder...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51050, 'Painful Scar'),
(51051, 'Bran says that his apprentices are in serious condition because they were attacked by monsters from the Dimensional Gate.  Defeat the creature they call Devil Warrior and bring back The Sword of the Apprentice.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51052, 'Ugh...  Sorry, kids...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51053, 'You don\'t look good, Bran.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51054, 'Have you heard of the Dimensional Gate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51055, 'Yes, I\'ve been there a couple of times.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51056, 'My apprentices have recently been attacked and seriously injured by strange monsters in that area.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51057, 'Oh, my...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51058, 'I want to go inside the Dimensional Gate and kill all I can, but I shouldn\'t act when I am so emotional about my pupils being injured...  Ugh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51059, 'It\'s not your fault...  I know how you feel, Bran...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51060, 'The monster\'s name was {color,yellow, Devil Warrior}.  For some reason, it took all of their swords when they were attacked...  They must think I\'m a fool...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51061, 'Hmm... Their swords?  It\'s probably because they have never seen something like our swords before.  It must have looked amazing to them...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51062, 'You shouldn\'t underestimate them.  Anyways, I have to ask you a favor.  Please defeat {color,yellow, Devil Warrior} and bring back my {color,yellow, The Sword of the Apprentice}.  This is all I can ask of you...\nPlease.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That name scares me...][2]'),
(51063, 'That\'s...\nThank you.  I can face my wounded pupils now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51064, 'Don\'t mention it.  It\'s my job.  Those creatures are not even from our world...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51065, 'I will try to gather information to help you out.  And I will pay you back someday.  \nWell done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51066, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Devil Warriors} and bring back {color,yellow, The Sword of the Apprentice}.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51070, 'Blockade 1'),
(51071, 'Elbama has decided to go after the monsters on the other side of the Dimensional Gate.  He has asked you to defeat Storm Murumuru. Slay the creature and return back as soon as possible.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51072, 'It\'s not enough... We must defeat all of them inside the gate...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51073, 'Do you have any news, Elbama?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51074, 'Not much, but one thing is certain.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51075, 'Is it about that Bill Burman? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51076, 'I haven\'t found out what Bill Burman is doing, but at least we know that the Dimensional Gate exists.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51077, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51078, 'And now I know that the Dimensional Gate hasn\'t been sealed.  He must pay the price for challenging my authority with his Seal Sorcerers.  That old fool...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51079, 'But there could be something holding them back from doing their job. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51080, 'That\'s not my business.  Lets cut the nonsense and talk about our plan.  Listen carefully.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51081, 'OK.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51082, 'I\'ve heard that there is a monster similar to the one you\'ve defeated before.  It\'s a middle boss monster and if you defeat it, the rulers there will be intimidated.  It\'s name is {color,yellow, Storm Murumuru}. Don\'t disappoint me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh... OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you go yourself?][2]'),
(51083, '(Clapping hands)\nYou are great.  We are lucky we have someone like you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51084, '(I didn\'t volunteer to do it, but)\nI want to guard our continent.  These are monsters from the other world. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51085, 'Hmm.  Why don\'t you use your loyalty for a different purpose?  Your success is guaranteed...\nErr...  Take a rest for now.  You will have another mission soon. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51086, 'What happened to {color,yellow, Storm Murumuru}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51090, 'Blockade 2'),
(51091, 'Elbama has heard that a strong monster in the Dimensional Gate has defeated the Elderine Guards.  Go and defeat this monster that goes by the name of Ice Citrie.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51092, 'I can\'t believe it...  I have sent all of my royal guards...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51093, 'Lord Elbama?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51094, 'They were my most loyal and brave guards...  And all of them have been...\n(Elbama looks at his feet)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51095, 'May they rest in peace...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51096, 'I didn\'t choose to do this because I didn\'t trust you... I just wanted to show the world the ability of the brave guards of Elderine...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51097, 'What is those Monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51098, 'There was one last message from the soldier who died in my arms.\nHe said... {color,yellow, Ice Citrie}?  Or something like that...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51099, 'I see... Then, it\'s my turn to step up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51100, 'I have to take responsibility for this.  I have nothing else to say to you.  Defeat {color,yellow, Ice Citrie} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m busy.][2]'),
(51101, 'I hope this has consoled their souls a little bit...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51102, 'I am sure it has.  I feel sorry for them...\nI hope they rest in peace...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51103, 'Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51104, 'Don\'t let {color,yellow, Ice Citrie} get away with this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51110, 'An Urgent Message'),
(51111, 'There is an urgent message to Elderine\'s Captain Shutian.  What could it be?  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51112, 'What?  Is that true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51113, '(I hope it\'s nothing bad...)\nWhat is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51114, 'I just learned that contact has been lost with the Allied Patrol Team of Roumen and Uruga.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51115, 'That\'s what happened to the guards from Elderine...\nI hope they have not suffered the same fate!  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51116, 'I don\'t want to give up hope...  Ugh...  I don\'t know...  I hope they are safe...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51117, 'Do you think Elbama knows about this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51118, 'He has probably gotten the news by now...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51119, 'I will go and talk to him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51120, 'Would you?  I have so many things to take care of around here.  Thank you for your help. \nBe safe.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51130, 'First Things First'),
(51131, 'Elbama has heard that the patrol teams of Roumen and Uruga have disappeared.  He is trying to give a final order so no more soldiers are sacrificed.  Lets go and take care of the root of this problem.  Go and defeat Storm Citrie.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51132, 'I will not tollerate any more sacrifice of life. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51133, 'So you\'ve already heard...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51134, 'You have to bring an end to this.  I can\'t trust anyone else in any village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51135, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51136, 'There is only one reason why the patrols of Roumen and Uruga have been defeated.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51137, 'Monsters... right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51138, 'It seems that {color,yellow, Storm Citrie} has defeated them all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51139, 'It must be the strongest monster.  I need to be careful..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51140, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Storm Citrie} in our honor.  That seems to be the head of all these problems...  If you defeat it, the monsters there will lose power.  That could even close the gate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m a little busy.][2]'),
(51141, 'You are back...  It was a losing battle for both sides...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51142, 'You\'re right...  The villages have lost so much...  We never know when or if that gate will appear again...  This is where we need the power of the Seal Sorcerers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51143, 'I don\'t know.  Do you think all of this would have happened if they had done their jobs right the first time? I can\'t trust them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51144, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Storm Citrie}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51150, 'Collecting the Crystal of Magic'),
(51151, 'Kid Woz, from Elderine, says the monsters inside the Dimensional Gate carry an item with mysterious powers. Defeat Murumuru and collect The Crystal of Magic Power.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51152, 'Hello, [NAME]\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51153, 'Kid Woz!  What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51154, 'Hey, have you heard of the Dimensional Gate?  I\'m sure you know, since you are a great adventurer.  Right, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51155, 'Of course...  But why are you interested in it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51156, 'Well, I heard that the monsters there have a crystal with mysterious powers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51157, 'What does that have to do with you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51158, 'Hey, I\'m a Dark Elf!  I know more about magic than most people!  I just want to study it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51159, 'I guess...  You are quite a talker, aren\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51160, 'Who knows?  I could find out something big about it.  That being said, just get me {color,yellow, The Crystal of Magic Power} from {color,yellow, Murumuru}!  I\'m sure you wouldn\'t kill a young boy\'s dream, would you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Phew...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way.][2]'),
(51161, '[NAME]!  You really got it!\nHa ha ha!  I\'m so excited!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51162, 'But it doesn\'t look like it has mysterious powers...  Are you sure about your hypothesis?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51163, 'I told you...  I am a Dark Elf...  Our knowledge is different from that of other people.  Thank you.  I have to find out more about this now!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51164, 'Just get me {color,yellow, The Crystal of Magic Power} from {color,yellow, Murumuru}!  Piece of cake, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51170, 'For My Friend (Repeated Quest)'),
(51171, 'Kid Woz from Elderine, is furious to hear that the guards of Elderine have been defeated.  Go and defeat Ice Citrie and Storm Citrie and report back to Kid Woz.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51172, 'I can\'t believe it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51173, 'Kid Woz!  What are you up to?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51174, '[NAME], have you heard about this?  The guards from Elderine...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51175, '(Wears sad face)\nYes...  I know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51176, 'My friend\'s father was one of the guards. My friend is so sad he hasn\'t heard from his father and I can\'t tell him what has happened.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51177, 'He must be devastated.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51178, 'Why have they come all the way to our continent to cause this mess?  If only I was bigger...  I would have taught them a lesson myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51179, 'Are you sorry you are not strong enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51180, 'Yes...  I heard it\'s {color,yellow,Citrie} that is making the most trouble.  Can you go and defeat the beast for my friend\'s father, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t...][2]'),
(51181, '[NAME]... Thank you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51182, 'Don\'t mention it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51183, 'Ugh... But that\'s not enough.. Please defeat them if you are ever to see more, [NAME].  For my friend...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51184, '{color,yellow, Citrie}... If only I was bigger...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51190, 'For My Friend (Repeated Quest)'),
(51191, 'Kid Woz, from Elderine, is furious to hear that the guards of Elderine have been defeated.  Go and defeat Ice Citrie and Storm Citrie and report back to Kid Woz.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51192, 'Poor kid...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51193, 'Are you still... depressed?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51194, 'I feel so sorry for my friend\'s father...  He is my best friend...  Please go and defeat them, [NAME]...  Please!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t..][2]'),
(51195, '[NAME]... Thank you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51196, 'Don\'t mention it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51197, 'Ugh... But that\'s not enough.. Please defeat them if you are ever to see more, [NAME].  For my friend...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51198, '{color,yellow, Citrie}... If only I was bigger...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51200, 'I Really Love To Share My Love...(Lv 1-40)(Event Quest)'),
(51201, 'Item Merchant Nina of Elderine wants to make chocolate this Valentine\'s day and give it to her special someone. But she couldn\'t find the right ingredients and is in a panic...\n\nPlease help her to find those ingredients!\n\n(Use Unknown Seed in Forest of Tides)\n\n\n[LINE]\n\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51202, 'Ah...this is such a pain...\n\n[BUTTON] = [Begin Quest] [1]\n[MENU]'),
(51203, 'It\'s Valentine\'s day. Why are you so depressed? \nIt\'s as if you couldn\'t give chocolate to someone you love? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51204, 'That\'s right. [NAME]. That is the problem...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51205, 'Oops. I\'m sorry. I didn\'t know! Who is this special someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51206, 'That\'s not important. The Precious Cacao Fruit which is the most important ingredient for making chocolate cannot be found anywhere in the market. I have no way to find it anywhere.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51207, 'So you are missing the main ingredient for making chocolate... Right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51208, 'Correct, [NAME]! I cant miss this opportunity to show him I care! I really need to give chocolate to him this Valentine\'s day.\nI seriously need your help. I\'m desperate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51209, 'Hmm... I\'m not the kind of person who will just walk away from an adventure... but where can I find Precious Cacao Fruit when I cannot get them in the market?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51210, 'Listen carefully. I will give you this {color,yellow, Unknown Seed}. You will need  to use it in a certain area of the map. I don\'t know what will happen after you use this, but the important thing is there are certain areas  that you can use it in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51211, 'Certain areas I can use them...hmm, that\'s very interesting. I will help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51212, 'You must use this seed in certain areas. When you succeed, you will able to get {color,yellow, Precious Cacao Fruit}. I will be really happy when you bring those back!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hope this will help your happy Valentine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you just order them from a factory?][2]'),
(51213, 'I...can make chocolate...right??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51214, 'Haha- It took me some time but here, I have them with me so don\'t worry. I\'m not sure if it\'s enough to make quality chocolate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51215, 'How lovely. Yes, that\'s enough! Thank you very much. [NAME], I can now make...oh no, time is running out. I have to hurry!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51216, 'You have to farm the {color,yellow, Unknown Seed} to gather the {color,yellow, Precious Cacao Fruit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51220, 'I Really Love To Share My Love...(Lv 41-80)(Event Quest)'),
(51221, 'Item Merchant Nina of Elderine wants to make chocolate this Valentine\'s day and give it to her special someone. But she couldn\'t find the right ingredients and is in a panic...\n\nPlease help her to find those ingredients!\n\n(Use Unknown Seed in Moonlight Tomb)\n\n\n[LINE]\n\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
