(51236, 'You have to farm the {color,yellow, Unknown Seed} to gather the {color,yellow, Precious Cacao Fruit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51240, 'I Really Love To Share My Love...(Lv 81-125)(Event Quest)'),
(51241, 'Item Merchant Nina of Elderine wants to make chocolate this Valentine\'s day and give it to her special someone. But she couldn\'t find the right ingredients and is in a panic...\n\nPlease help her to find those ingredients!\n\n(Use Unknown Seed in Burning Rock)\n\n\n\n[LINE]\n\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51242, 'Ah...this is such a pain...\n\n[BUTTON] = [Begin Quest] [1]\n[MENU]'),
(51243, 'It\'s Valentine\'s day. Why are you so depressed? \nIt\'s as if you couldn\'t give chocolate to someone you love? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51244, 'That\'s right. [NAME]. That is the problem...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51245, 'Oops. I\'m sorry. I didn\'t know! Who is this special someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51246, 'That\'s not important. The Precious Cacao Fruit which is the most important ingredient for making chocolate cannot be found anywhere in the market. I have no way to find it anywhere.\n\n[NEXT]'),
