(51249, 'Hmm... I\'m not the kind of person who will just walk away from an adventure... but where can I find Precious Cacao Fruit when I cannot get them in the market?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51250, 'Listen carefully. I will give you this {color,yellow, Unknown Seed}. You will need  to use it in a certain area of the map. I don\'t know what will happen after you use this, but the important thing is there are certain areas  that you can use it in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51251, 'Certain areas I can use them...hmm, that\'s very interesting. I will help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51252, 'You must use this seed in certain areas. When you succeed, you will able to get {color,yellow, Precious Cacao Fruit}. I will be really happy when you bring those back!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hope this will help your happy Valentine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you just order them from a factory?][2]'),
(51253, 'I...can make chocolate...right??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51254, 'Haha- It took me some time but here, I have them with me so don\'t worry. I\'m not sure if it\'s enough to make quality chocolate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51255, 'How lovely. Yes, that\'s enough! Thank you very much. [NAME], I can now make...oh no, time is running out. I have to hurry!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51256, 'You have to farm the {color,yellow, Unknown Seed} to gather the {color,yellow, Precious Cacao Fruit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51260, 'Slime\'s Reward.'),
(51261, '"Go and get Slime\'s buff as reward."\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51262, '"All of you made our family happy again. Thank you."\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51270, '(20) Festival Egg 3'),
(51271, 'Item Merchant Kenton asked you to bring (20) festival eggs back.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51272, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51273, 'Mean monsters stole my festival eggs.\nPlease go to the {color,yellow, Protect the Golden Egg} KQ and bring the stolen eggs back!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK! Please hang on.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t be bothered.][2]'),
(51274, 'You brought the stolen eggs back! Please accept a reward as a token of gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51275, 'Please save the {color,yellow, festival eggs}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51280, '(25) Festival Egg 1'),
(51281, 'Item Merchant Kenton asked you to bring (25) festival eggs back.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51282, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51283, 'Mean monsters stole my festival eggs.\nPlease go to the {color,yellow, Protect the Golden Egg} KQ and bring the stolen eggs back!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK! Please hang on.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t be bothered.][2]'),
(51284, 'You brought the stolen eggs back! Please accept a reward as a token of gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51285, 'Please save the {color,yellow, festival eggs}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51290, '(25) Festival Egg 2'),
(51291, 'Item Merchant Kenton asked you to bring (25) festival eggs back.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51292, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51293, 'Mean monsters stole my festival eggs.\nPlease go to the {color,yellow, Protect the Golden Egg} KQ and bring the stolen eggs back!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK! Please hang on.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t be bothered.][2]'),
(51294, 'You brought the stolen eggs back! Please accept a reward as a token of gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51295, 'Please save the {color,yellow, festival eggs}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51300, 'Info'),
(51301, 'Julian from Sand Hill has apparently found a strange gate in the north. Let\'s take a listen to the story.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51302, '[NAME], hello?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51303, 'Julian, how are you?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51304, 'Haha, I\'m always well!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51305, 'Thank goodness. You\'ve always got a great view from here. \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51306, 'We can only see the desert from here... that\'s no use to us...\r\nBy the way, I\'ve got some info for you that I\'d like to discuss in private.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51307, 'Already thought that you had something there.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51308, 'A strange gate has apparently arisen to the north of Sand Hill. According to our scouts this has caused the dimension to be split. We haven\'t yet had the courage to begin our investigations because we just don\'t know what that thing is.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51309, '(A door to other dimensions.!?)\r\nPfft, what a load of rubbish!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51310, 'Why is that? Do you have any specific details?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51311, 'If I\'m not mistaken, that is a door to other dimensions... I\'ve seen something like that before and even fought monsters inside.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51312, 'Oh gosh! Does this mean that Sand Hill is in danger?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51313, 'I can\'t say I\'ve thought that far...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51314, 'That\'s a problem. Go speak again with my advisor, {color,yellow,Silver Allon}. I think Silver Allon knows more about this than I.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51320, 'The people of Foras'),
(51321, 'The dimensional gate has returned. Help Silver Allon investigate the gate in the north and help eliminate the threat.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51322, '[NAME], I\'ve already heard about this from Julian - I think it\'s fair to say that I\'m well informed about this.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51323, 'I want to know what you think about this.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51324, '[NAME], Have you ever heard of the people of Foras?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51325, 'Foras...Foras...yes, I can remember. I think they are some kind of slaves or something.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51326, 'I\'ve never seen them myself. But they must be somewhere in the dimensional gate.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51327, 'How do you know that?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51328, 'I read about it in an old document. The picture that I saw in the book resembles the dimensional gate in the north.\r\nIt\'s not really that important if we\'ve seen the people of Foras inside or not.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51329, 'The real problem is that this gate has arisen, don\'t you think?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51330, 'No, the Foras are the problem. They are meant to belong to the lowest class of monster in the world. They\'re also meant to be pretty dumb and the stronger monsters exploit them.\r\nOh...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51331, 'It won\'t be very easy to help them seeing as we\'re not in the same dimension. \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51332, 'Indeed, you\'re right, but according to the antique document these people really suffer there.\r\nIn addition, everyone should receive the help they deserve when they are in danger, don\'t you think? In the end it doesn\'t even matter if you come from the same dimension or not...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51333, 'OK, you\'ve convinced me. We\'ll have to take a look first at how the Foras are getting in, OK?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51334, 'That is the quickest way.[NAME], go to the dimension gate in the north yourself and check to see if the Foras are in there. If that is the case, then there are bound to be monsters about that exploit and suppress the Foras. In this case we\'ll have to wipe out the monsters and help the Foras, don\'t ya think?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s give that a try first.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good about it...][2]'),
(51335, 'And, is it true what the antique document says?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51336, 'Oh yeah - it seems as if the story isn\'t a lie. It seems that they are being forced into compulsory labor by some kind of devil soldiers.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51337, 'Well?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51338, 'Some of them wear something over their heads. Somehow these ones don\'t seem to be on our side... they seem to be a bit crazy, actually.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51339, 'However, it is indeed true that something bad has befallen these people. I\'ll have a chat about this with Julian. You go on and take a break.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51340, '{color,yellow, We require an investigation of the people of Foras}.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51350, 'Official call for help '),
(51351, 'Julian says that the Foras people have officially called for help. Let\'s hear what Julian has to tell us first. Then we can help them.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51352, '[NAME], Something bad has happened! \r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51353, 'I feel doubtful... What happened?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51354, 'The Foras people from the dimensional gate have asked us for help.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51355, 'The people of Foras? They are obviously having a really rough time. Why else would they ask us for help then?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51356, '(sigh)\r\nQuite. It\'s the same everywhere: the weak are always the ones to suffer. We\'re only a very small group for Sand Hill...\r\nHow can we possibly answer this call for help...?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51357, 'I will help these people! \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51358, '[NAME], You alone? That is way too dangerous!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51359, 'I\'ve been in the dimensional gate once before and have seen the monster world. Therefore, I do believe that I am more than a match for those monsters. If the members of the group at Sand Hill can\'t help, then I\'ll have to take on this adventure with just me, my luck and help the people.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51360, 'You are a real adventurer. [NAME]... I will send the people an answer and tell them that we will help.\r\nThen...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51361, '(now we have to conquer the strong monsters...)\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51362, 'It\'s all done. [NAME] must prepare and then go through the door.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51363, 'Now you need to prepare for it. My feeling tells me that this won\'t be a walk in the park...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51364, 'Always watch your back! Trust your comrades. Then we just have to march forwards.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51370, 'We are not enemies.'),
(51371, 'This is the first request from the Foras people. Help them anyway you can and report back as soon as you are finished. Go to the dimensional gate and investigate.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51372, '[NAME], it\'s time to start on the first task.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51373, 'We have obviously received a request from the Foras people. We are well prepared.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51374, 'Wow, you prepared yourself so quickly. You really are experienced.\r\nSo... I\'ll tell you what it\'s about.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51375, '(What could be inside...?)\r\nI hope they don\'t ask anything too complicated of us.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51376, 'There are obviously conflicts between the Foras people themselves. However, I don\'t know any more details. It just says here that there have been internal quarrels.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51377, 'That\'s not normal...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51378, 'At the end it also says that nothing can be done to change this, despite them all belonging to the same people. What could have happened there?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51379, 'Sitting around won\'t help - I\'m thinking about too many different things. I\'m going to find out a bit more. We must answer this call for help and eliminate the strange-looking Foras.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51380, 'I\'ll remain here at the outpost and keep in contact with the chief of the Foras people. [NAME], I wish you the best of luck and will keep my fingers crossed!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Ah...my stomach...suddenly...][2]'),
(51381, '[NAME], you\'re back. What\'s the situation there?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51382, 'Phew,no idea. I eliminated the Foras with the strange headdresses. I couldn\'t find out the reason behind it, though.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51383, 'It\'s not going quite as well as I\'d expected...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51384, 'We just need some patience, then it\'ll come again. We just need to have some patience.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51385, 'Hm... OK, let\'s take a look.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51386, '{color,yellow, Did you manage to eliminate the strange people among the Foras people}?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51390, 'Release from pain 1'),
(51391, 'We completed the first request from the Foras people. Now they are requesting us to defeat Fire Murumuru and Lightning Murumuru. Complete this task and report back.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51392, 'We have just received the Foras\' second request. The reason for their internal quarrels is described in it, although not in any real detail.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51393, 'And, what was the reason?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51394, 'Other monsters apparently controlled the people with magical powers that refused the forced labor. However, that isn\'t a very precise description...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51395, 'That is apparently what happened. They obviously seem to have been controlled. Now I understand somewhat better. Why did the chief inform us only by letter and not in person?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51396, 'I don\'t really know. Perhaps he couldn\'t bring us the information personally because he had to stay there under force of the brainwashed people.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51397, 'OK, then from what I understand they have their own problems to deal with. So, what is their second request?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51398, 'The second request consists of us eliminating the monsters that are most dangerous for the people.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51399, 'OK, then we\'d better take up their request. But we\'ll listen to the entire story later!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51400, 'Let\'s take a look...this time we have to eliminate the{color,yellow, Fire Murumuru}, and {color,yellow,Lightning Murumuru}.\r\n[NAME], you be careful!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[See you later!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Ah... my stomach... again suddenly...][2]'),
(51401, 'You are back safely. It is a good thing that we answered the call for help from the Foras. I\'m just worried about you.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51402, 'Don\'t worry about it. They were pretty strong. But I managed to eliminate them. The Foras are quite relived now.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51403, 'That comforts me inside - we have managed to relive the Foras from their woes step by step. However, we have not quite completely relived them. We must remain alert.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51404, 'Julian! Stay alert and make sure that nothing happens to the people at the outpost!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51405, 'Sure. We will handle our tasks.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51406, '{color,yellow, Fire Murumuru} and {color,yellow, Lightning Murumuru}... Even the names sound forbidding.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51410, 'Destroy the Brainwashing Device'),
(51411, 'Now we know the true reason behind the exploitation of the Foras. Go and defeat the Brainwashing Device and report back once finished.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51412, 'Now everything makes sense. That was the reason for it then.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51413, 'That is the reason why the Foras were fighting amongst themselves?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51414, 'Yes. The people of Foras were being influenced by the {color,yellow,Brainwashing Device} that the monsters installed. Makes sense - they aren\'t exactly the brightest bunch.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51415, 'Brainwashing Device... that\'s why the headdress things on their heads looked so strange...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51416, 'That is the cause... the monsters also don\'t have particularly great things.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51417, '(laughing)\r\nApparently nothing that special in the monster world, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51418, 'So, I suppose we\'d better destroy this Brainwashing Device?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51419, 'Must be easier than capturing monsters? Now we can set out with a relieved feeling.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51420, 'Destroy the {color,yellow,Brainwashing Device} and free the people of Foras!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[See you later!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Ah... my stomach... again suddenly...][2]'),
(51421, 'Are all of the Foras people are free?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51422, 'The Brainwashing Device is destroyed. However, the people don\'t seem any better. Seems like it takes a while till they are back to normal.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51423, 'Freedom awaits you now - very good!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51424, 'No, we did everything together.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51425, 'Now the issue with the Foras people has come to an end. You can take a rest now.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51426, 'We can only guarantee their freedom once the {color,yellow,Brainwashing Device} is destroyed!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51430, 'Internal Restructuring 1'),
(51431, 'We have received the final request from the Foras people. Defeat the Fire Citrie and report back once you have completed the task.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51432, 'Hm... we have a request- This time it is rather simple. \r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51433, 'That means that things are finally coming to an end... we have already done so much. Hehe.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51434, '{color,yellow, It says here that we only have to defeat the {color,yellow,Fire Citrie}.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51435, 'Hm...OK. This is a pretty simple request.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51436, 'Preparation?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51437, 'I\'m always prepared!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51438, 'There isn\'t really much to discuss here. Please defeat the {color,yellow,Fire Citrie}! The monsters here seem to be somewhat stronger. You should mentally prepare yourself well.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[See you later!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Ah... my stomach... again suddenly...][2]'),
(51439, 'Have you taken out the monsters?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51440, 'They were strong monsters. I really don\'t want to fight against them again.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51441, 'Hm... well done.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51442, 'You\'re good now right?!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51443, 'I have to send a letter there. We also need to know how things are there now... rest up first!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51444, '{color,yellow, We will eliminate the {color,yellow,Fire Citrie}...is that a strong monster?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51450, 'Internal Restructuring 2'),
(51451, 'We have received the actual final request from the Foras people. Defeat the Lightning Citrie and report back once you have completed the task.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51452, '[NAME], this one is a request like the last.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51453, 'It certainly feels like the final request.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51454, 'I think so, too. It says here that we only have to defeat the {color,yellow,Lightning Citrie}.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51455, 'I will prepare myself immediately. But where will the Foras people go when we have defeated it? The dimensional gate arose here...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51456, 'Hm... that is their thing. Therefore, I cannot really say. Firstly, defeat the {color,yellow,Lightning Citrie}!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[See you later!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Something important has come up.][2]'),
(51457, 'You are back. Now you have found an end, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51458, 'Yes. I am pleased that we managed to free the people of Foras. I have a good feeling about this.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51459, 'It could be because you did these things as a request... I agree with you. \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51460, 'Please contact the Foras people quickly...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51461, 'OK, then. We\'ve sent an express mail anyway. Now we just have to wait to get the answer. You go get some rest for now!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51462, '{color,yellow, The {color,yellow,Lightning Citrie}... definitely no easy monster\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51470, 'A special thanks'),
(51471, 'Julian has received thanks for saving them from all the dangers. Let\'s listen to their statement.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51472, '[NAME], we have received a letter from the Foras people with the following content.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51473, 'Let\'s see\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51474, '<Rameto, Leader of the Foras people>\r\nMany thanks that you saved the people of Foras. It has only now come to my attention that there are people that help the weak, even though they do not come from the same world.\r\n\r\nEven though all monsters have been defeated it does by no way mean that we are completely out of danger. We have been strengthened by you and are now preparing to defend ourselves.\r\n\r\nWe will definitely find a way to repay you for what you have done, although we do not know when we will see you again. Until then, stay healthy!\r\n\r\nRameto, Leader of the Foras people\r\n\r\n...\r\nWow, the Foras obviously have some brains.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51475, 'Not everyone can be their leader, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51476, 'I am really happy that they managed to learn something from us.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51477, 'I am too. I hope that these people can live well from now on.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51478, 'So, it has come to an end-. [NAME], you should drop by more often.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51479, 'Haha! Miss me already?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51480, 'Naah. We really got along well! Well done! Good luck!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51490, 'Release from Pain 2 (repeatable quest)'),
(51491, 'Silver Allon has found out that many of the Foras people have been brainwashed. Allon asks you to collect the Feather of the Foras Tribe from the fallen members and report back.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51492, '[NAME], the fight is not yet at an end.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51493, 'What? I bet lots of the Foras people were freed from the Brainwashing Device?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51494, 'Lots of people in the deepest part of the dimensional gate are still under the control of the device.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51495, 'Man... how many still?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51496, '{color,yellow, We have received the request to free the Foras people from the brain-washing}. Even destroying the Brainwashing Device won\'t help any more because they have been brainwashed too strongly.\r\nIt will be a sad battle. Get the {color,yellow,Feather of the Foras Tribe}. This feather is meant to comfort innocent souls...\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[...][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want that.][2]'),
(51497, '[NAME]...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51498, 'Please say nothing... not a word...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(51499, 'I can understand you. But something had to be done. When you\'re fit again, then please free the Foras people from the brain-washing...\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51500, '{color,yellow, It doesn\'t seem easy to get the {color,yellow,Feather of the Foras Tribe}.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(51520, 'To That Place...'),
(51521, 'Soldier Chapman tells you to go to the place in the letter. Go talk with Guard Captain Shutian in Elderine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51522, 'Hmm... It\'s time to say goodbye.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51523, 'We have worked like a team.  I\'m sorry I have to go. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51524, 'Ha ha!  You are worried you might miss me.  That\'s OK.  I\'m always on duty here, so you can come and visit me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51525, 'Call me anytime if you need anything.  I\'ll come right away. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51526, 'Good.  That\'s good teamwork!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51527, 'OK... Then...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51528, 'Where are you going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51529, 'Before heading to the place in the letter, I will stop by Elderine to talk to Shutian.  I should give him an update. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51530, 'It\'s a good plan to talk to Guard Captain Shutian.  Don\'t forget to ask him to dispatch pretty guards here. \n[NAME], good luck.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Take care.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not leaving yet.][2]'),
(51531, '[NAME], you are back.  So, what\'s happened?  I have got some information from Chapman... But I want the details. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51532, '(Tell him what has happened.  About the existence of mysterious reporter and that the enemies are trying to call the spirit of dead demon...)\nThat\'s what\'s happened...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51533, 'It sounds pretty serious, but you and Chapman tried to handle the case before it gets worse... I appreciate your sacrifice, but you\'d better be careful.  Well done. Take a rest and come back later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51534, 'I think you said you are going to see {color,yellow, Guard Captain Shutian} in {color,yellow, Elderine}, right? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51540, 'Patrolling the Problem Region'),
(51541, 'Guard Captain Shutian says that it is time to patrol the place in the letter.  Look around the Scaffold Execution Ground for any suspicious monsters.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51542, 'It\'s time for our last mission, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51543, 'I\'ve been waiting for you.  We have to use the valuable information I got with Chapman to find who is behind this!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51544, 'That\'s the spirit.  I hope my soldiers have half the spirit you have.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51545, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51546, 'Anyways, did the letter say that the enemy is at Scaffold Execution Ground?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51547, 'Yes, but it doesn\'t say "whom" at Scaffold Execution Ground we should look for.  We have to do further investigation there.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51548, 'Then... We should not limit our investigation in the Scaffold Execution Ground, but we should investigate the entire area.  What do you think? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51549, 'It\'s not a bad idea to see the big picture.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51550, 'Let\'s start right away.  Let\'s start with {color,yellow, Sand Ratman}.  Are you ready?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready yet..][2]'),
(51551, 'You are back.  Did you find anything from them? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51552, 'No, I didn\'t find anything special or strange.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51553, 'I see... There\'s no other way.  We have to start fresh...  Let\'s have patience and take one step at a time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51554, 'Let\'s start investigating {color,yellow, Sand Ratman}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51560, 'Suspicious One 1'),
(51561, 'You have to cooperate with Guard Captain Shutian to find the enemy in the letter. Go and investigate the Harkan.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51562, 'Good.  This time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51563, 'Do you have any good ideas?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51564, 'No... I\'m confused which ones we should continue to investigate.  I\'ve thought a lot about it, but there are so many enemies to investigate!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51565, 'I see.  The enemy might be someone we haven\'t even thought about..  For example...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51566, 'For example?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51567, 'It could be Slime\'s plan... Oh... It doesn\'t even make sense?  Ha ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51568, 'You... It\'s no time for a joke...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51569, 'I was just trying to cheer you up!  It\'s all too serious. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51570, 'I guess.  Well... Let\'s see...  That\'s right. {color,yellow, Harkan}! They look suspicious these days.  Go and investigate them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think they are it...][2]'),
(51571, 'So?  Did you find any clue?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51572, 'Not at all...  There was no information... We might have to spend a lot of time here like we did in Goblin Camp...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51573, 'There\'s no other way.  The only information we have is the area.  It\'s up to us to find where it is and whom we must go after.  \nWell done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51574, 'I have a bad feeling about {color,yellow, Harkan}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51580, 'Suspicious One 2'),
(51581, 'You have to cooperate with Guard Captain Shutian to find the enemy in the letter.  He senses the monsters behind the problem are Dungeon Weakened Ogre. Go and investigate them!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51582, 'There\'s no end!!  What should we do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51583, 'Calm down and let\'s think. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51584, 'So many enemies look suspicious.  Everyone seems to be behind it.  Do you see what I mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51585, 'I know more than you do, Shutian.  I\'ve already been through it at Goblin Camp with Chapman...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51586, 'Then you might have a solution to this problem. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51587, 'We just searched everything we saw and everything we could find...  It was a primitive method, but we\'ve come this far.  When we have a lack of information, it\'s a good idea to just carry it on.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51588, 'I... guess you are right..  I\'m convinced.  Is that the only way we could go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51589, 'Unless we have a better, more efficient way...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51590, 'OK, but before that, let\'s give my sixth sense one last chance.  I think the most suspicious ones are {color,yellow, Dungeon Weakened Ogres}.  Just trust me and go after them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I hope you are right.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t agree..][2]'),
(51591, 'So...?  Did you find anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51592, 'Unfortunately, my answer is no.  I really hoped they were it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51593, 'Well, I guess my sixth sense has worn out...  Well done.  I will be counting on you from now on...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51594, 'I\'m sure {color,yellow, Dungeon Weakened Ogres} are it!  I think my sixth sense is beginning to work again!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51600, 'The Critical Evidence'),
(51601, 'Guard Captain Shutian has learned that Younger King Coll\nhave a Secret Letter.  Go investigate and report back with your findings.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51602, '[NAME] It\'s the time...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51603, 'The time?  Did you find who is behind this?  How?  Who?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51604, 'Hey... Don\'t panic.  We don\'t have the answer... but I think we are close!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51605, 'Oh... So we don\'t know who it is yet...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51606, 'Listen. According to my source of information, {color,yellow, Younger King Coll} is carrying the secret letter.  This secret letter must be about..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51607, 'The ritual?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51608, 'Most likely.  We can\'t waste anymore time!  It\'s your turn!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51609, 'Yes, sir.  I will go and collect the secret letter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51610, 'Go and get the {color,yellow, Secret Letter} from {color,yellow, Younger King Coll}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think so..][2]'),
(51611, 'Have you brought the secret letter?  Or...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51612, 'They had it like you said.  Your source of information... is pretty reliable?  We should have contacted him earlier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51613, 'Good.  Let me see.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51614, '{color,yellow, Younger King Coll} has the {color,yellow, Secret Letter}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51620, 'The Investigation Activity'),
(51621, 'Guard Captain Shutian has the secret letter.  He wants you to go to Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground. Lets see if Paulmon can tell us anything.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51622, 'Oh... This is...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51623, 'Huh... What does it say?  I\'m curious.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51624, 'I think they have figured us out.  It says that they must be extra careful and perform the ritual sooner than they had originally planned.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51625, 'Hmm...  There is no sender...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51626, 'That\'s right...  Oh, right...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51627, '??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51628, 'Talk to Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground.  According to this letter, he might be able to help us figure this situation out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51629, 'Guard Paulmon...  Yes, sir.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51630, 'Hurry up.  Something might happen to Guard Paulmon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[it\'s tiresome.][2]'),
(51631, 'Guard Paulmon?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51632, 'Huh?  Who are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51633, 'Oh, I am [NAME].  I have the orders from Guard Captain Shutian of Elderine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51634, 'Shutian?  Hmm... Something must be up.  Welcome.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51635, 'Go to Guard Paulmon in Scaffold Execution Ground.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51640, 'Guard Paulmon\'s Information'),
(51641, 'Guard Paulmon asks you to start the investigation based on the information he has collected. Go and investigate King Coll.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51642, 'Where should we begin...  Let me hear what you know first.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51643, '(Tell him everything.)\n...\nWe have come this far to find the sender of that letter. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51644, 'Hmm... I see...  Now that I have that information, I have seen some enemies acting strange lately. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51645, 'But we have investigated all the suspicious ones.  We haven\'t found anything of course. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51646, 'There is no noticeable outcome, but every step takes you closer to the truth.\n(This is the best thing I have ever said.)\nHmm!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51647, 'Nicely put.  Well... I should get ready to head out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51648, 'We have to organize our thoughts before we take to action.  The enemies that have looked suspicious lately...  Those who have looked anxious and frightened.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51649, 'If you go after them, you should be able to find a clue!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51650, 'This one looks strange... and that one looks strange...\nOhh!\nI have a headache...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51651, '(Could I trust this guy?)\nThere is no need to hurry.  Take your time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51652, 'Hmm... I\'m ill-tempered...  I don\'t like to think..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51653, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51654, '(After some time)\nOh... I\'ve straightened it out.  I\'ll tell you what I think.  I think {color,yellow,King Coll} is most troublesome.  I\'m not sure, but we should start with them!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(51655, 'Have you found anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51656, 'No, nothing...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51657, 'Oh... They were not it...  It gives me a headache to think this much...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51658, '{color,yellow,King Coll} is the one!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51660, 'He Is Just A Proxy'),
(51661, 'Guard Paulmon still believes there is something up with King Coll. Go and investigate them one more time.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51662, 'This must be it...  It has to be...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51663, 'I hope so, too.\n(Please...)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51664, 'There have been so many suspicious ones lately.  Among them, {color,yellow,King Coll} seemed to have been controlled by something... I don\'t think I\'m wrong.  I\'ve been here long enough and I know their habits.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51665, 'Hmm... That sounds right.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51666, 'I\'ve never seen {color,yellow,King Coll} move so anxiously.  You might not have observed them close enough before.  Go and search {color,yellow,King Coll} once more.  Something will come out from this. I swear!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51667, 'Do you have any personal grudge against {color,yellow,King Coll}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51668, 'Err... Not at all.  It\'s just based on my experience.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51669, 'I see.  I will trust you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51670, 'Search {color,yellow,King Coll}.  You will fine {color,yellow,something} you are looking for...\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Next time.][2]'),
(51671, '(Guard Paulmon waiting anxiously.)\n!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51672, 'Guard Paulmon, you are so pro.  {color,yellow,King Coll} dropped the {color,yellow,Symbol of Authorization}. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51673, 'I knew it...  Were those... the origin of this problem...but I doubt that... Let\'s take a rest first and get back to it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51674, 'If it\'s not {color,yellow,King Coll}.. there is no other...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51680, 'The Chaser'),
(51681, 'Guard Paulmon and the searchers have come close to the enemies.  Could they stop the summoning ritual?  See if the Vampire Bat can give you any clues that might help.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51682, 'Well... There is no critical evidence about the one, but only assumptions...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51683, 'I\'m tired... I guess they are pretty cunning...  So any one letter won\'t give us any clues...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51684, 'As far as I know, no monster was smart enough to do that.  We have to consider the possibility that a human might be involved in this... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51685, 'I guess...  If it were the monsters, it wouldn\'t have been so large and perfectly concealed...  Oh... It gives me a headache.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51686, 'Hey... What\'s wrong?  I think... ugh... I also have a headache.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51687, '...\nWhat should we do now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51688, 'Like always, move onto the next task at hand.  The next monsters that looked suspicious after {color,yellow, King Coll}...  That\'s right.  These ones.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51689, 'I can rely on your instincts, Guard Paulmon!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51690, 'I can think of {color,yellow,Vampire Bat}.  Be careful when you go after them and I think they might give you a clue.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, sir.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Next time.][2]'),
(51691, 'I feel like I\'m going to get ill waiting for you.  Is there anything else?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51692, 'They were suspicious, but I didn\'t find anything. How much longer should we do this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51693, 'I know you are tired... But there is no other way.  It\'s just you and me...  Don\'t be disappointed and take a rest for now.  I will get back to you when I find something.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51694, '{color,yellow,Vampire Bat}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51700, 'Stop the Ritual 1'),
(51701, 'You received an urgent news from Guard Paulmon that the ritual is being carried out. Steal the items they need to carry the ritual. Start by investigating the Prisoners.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51702, 'What?  The ritual is already being carried out?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51703, 'What.. What are you talking about?  The ritual has already started?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51704, 'I got the information from the commander.  I had no idea.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51705, 'That... That can\'t be.  Are you saying that what we have found were just bait?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51706, 'They have played us, more accurately speaking...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51707, 'This is the worst day of my life...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51708, 'Cheer up.  We can still stop them before the ritual is done.  I will stay here to talk to the commander and observe their moves.  You should fight the {color,yellow,Prisoners}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51709, 'Shouldn\'t we request backup?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51710, 'I guess.  Oh... Another thing...\nThat summoning ritual requires many things the monsters carry. The only thing is I don\'t know what they are...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51711, 'If we could steal those things...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51712, 'If we could do that, they won\'t be able to carry out the ritual.  Oh!  The latest report says that {color,yellow,Prisoners} are gathering at {color,yellow,Scaffold Execution Ground}.  Go there to eliminate them and steal the ritual items.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I must hurry...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go later.][2]'),
(51713, 'That?  Oh... That was an item needed for the ritual.  Since you\'ve stolen so many of them, I guess their ritual haven\'t been successful.  Yes!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51714, 'I guess so...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51715, 'Cheer up.  Since we\'ve already stopped them once, they must be getting very angry.  If we don\'t get prepared, we will be in danger.  You must be cautious...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51716, 'The fact that {color,yellow,Prisoners} are gathering... tells us that they are getting ready for the ritual.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51720, 'Stop the Ritual  2'),
(51721, 'You helped stopped the ritual once, but it seems like it wasn\'t for good.  Once again you need to Steal the items they need to carry the ritual. Investigate Torturers.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51722, 'We have stopped the ritual once...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51723, 'This won\'t be the end of it.  I guess...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51724, 'Since you\'ve stopped them once, they will prepare themselves more carefully this time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51725, 'Hmph... That means more work for me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51726, 'I\'m sorry, but yes.  I want to help you... but I can\'t leave this place...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51727, 'I should get prepared better...  What happened to the backup from Elderine?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51728, '(I actually didn\'t call them..)\nErr... Well... I haven\'t heard from them yet. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51729, 'I guess they have their own problems. \n(Sigh.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51730, 'Anyways, this time, the {color,yellow,Torturers} are gathering.  Like before, they must be carrying an item that is needed for the ritual.  We must steal it to stop the ritual!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m aware of that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it later.][2]'),
(51731, 'What happened to the ritual?  Has the ritual been carried out?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51732, 'Luckily, I was able to stop it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51733, 'Phew.. That\'s a relief.  Well done.  If it wasn\'t for you, a great confusion would have struck the entire continent, but we can\'t tell if this will come to an end.  We have to come up with a better plan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51734, '{color,yellow,Torturers} are gathering...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51740, 'Who Is This Ritual For?'),
(51741, 'Guard Paulmon and others are still concentrating on the monsters\' ritual.  He is worried about the end of this action.  Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51742, 'Phew... I wasn\'t able to sleep at all...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51743, 'No one should be able to sleep well in this situation.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51744, 'It\'s shocking that we haven\'t been able to figure out who is behind this up to this point...  I just can\'t believe it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51745, 'I understand, but I think we are only few steps away from the truth.  We should cheer up. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51746, 'Hmm... I guess... So what do you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51747, 'About what?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51748, 'About what the monsters are doing.  What do you think they are trying to do at these rituals?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51749, 'I guess they are trying to sweep through the Isya Continent.  The greed of domination... something like that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51750, 'If that was the only reason, they would have gathered their allies from throughout the continent and invaded a big city. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51751, 'Hmm... I guess they are after something bigger by bringing back a powerful monster. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51752, 'We don\'t know the details, but they are up to something enormous...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51753, 'It\'s not normal for sure.  We must find out all about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51754, 'Of course.  Let\'s cheer up and go after the evils!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51760, 'Last Spurt 1'),
(51761, 'Guard Paulmon and others want to bring an end to this so desperately. Guard Paulmon wants you to defeat Senior Torturer and report back to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51762, 'There is no time to waste.  Let\'s bring an end to this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51763, 'That\'s just what I want.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51764, 'All of the monsters that had the ritual items were prisoners.  Let\'s get them all this time.  Like we did before...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51765, 'Since we succeeded last time, I want to trust the possibility.  Let\'s go right at them since we have no other way!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51766, 'You must be extra careful this time.  They have been stopped twice already, so they must be very irritated. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51767, 'Don\'t worry.\nI\'ve done this before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51768, 'I like that spirit.  Let\'s go after the leaders!  Let\'s see..\nLet\'s start with {color,yellow,Senior Torturer}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll  be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go later.][2]'),
(51769, 'So... how did it go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51770, 'They weren\'t it.  They had no item related to the ritual.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51771, 'OK, then.  Get some rest and come back when you are ready for the next target!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51772, 'When you are done defeating {color,yellow,Senior Torturer}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51780, 'Last Spurt 2'),
(51781, 'Guard Paulmon and others want to bring an end to this so desperately.  Guard Paulmon wants you to defeat Karasian Soliders and bring back Magic Source for Ritual.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51782, 'What? They had no item?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51783, 'I\'m not a bit surprised.  Sp what is the target this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51784, 'I don\'t know what it\'s for, but {color,yellow,Karasian Soliders} are carrying {color,yellow,Magic Source for Ritual}.  I guess they are trying to gather Magic Source for the summoning...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51785, 'We can steal it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51786, 'That\'s right.  That\'s why I need you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51787, 'I\'ll get ready.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51788, 'Steal {color,yellow,Magic Source for Ritual} from {color,yellow,Karasian Soliders}.  Let\'s stop the summoning ritual for good...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go later.][2]'),
(51789, 'Have you stolen the magic source?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51790, 'Here...  I don\'t want to see any more of this...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51791, 'I understand...  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51792, 'I think what {color,yellow,Karasian Soliders} have is important...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51800, 'Meaningless Fight'),
(51801, 'Guard Paulmon and others are trying to end this meaningless fight.  Let\'s defeat the final enemy, Des Harkan. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51802, 'I got a report saying that the enemies have given up the ritual, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51803, 'Are you serious?  But the leader...  What was the reason of our fight?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51804, 'Well... We have defeated the enemies that have threatened us.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51805, 'I want to take a rest after this.  I feel like I have been mesmerized by something since I was in Goblin Camp...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51806, 'Well done, [NAME].  I appreciate your effort. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51807, 'Don\'t mention it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51808, 'Wait, there is still one more task to be done. I hear that {color,yellow,Des Harkan} still remain.  It will be our last fight, so show them what you\'ve got!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go later.][2]'),
(51809, 'Did you defeat them all?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51810, 'I guess so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51811, 'Well done.  I mean it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51812, '{color,yellow,Des Harkan} is our final enemy.  I hope you do well until the end.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51820, 'Finally..'),
(51821, 'The ritual is suspended for now.  Go and tell Chapman about your finding.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51822, 'Do you remember your first partner, Chapman?  You should report our finding to him. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51823, 'Oh, Chapman. Right.\nI was working on this with him in the beginning.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51824, 'But I\'m sorry that we don\'t have any satisfying results to report to Chapman...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51825, 'But we did our best at least.  We have stopped the monsters...  What more do we need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51826, 'That\'s right.  We\'ve done a great job, but it\'s just that I don\'t feel content. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51827, 'I will give Chapman a visit and come back afterwards.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51828, 'See you soon and tell Chapman I said hello.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go later.][2]'),
(51829, 'Oh, [NAME]!  Long time no see. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51830, '(Tells him everything about what has happened, including the conclusion.)\n\nThat\'s what\'s happened.  Although we have not found who is behind this, we did our best!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51831, 'I see... I was curious about the  results of this situation. I\'m glad we were able to stop the ritual!  Well done.  I mean it!\nLet\'s talk more over a drink.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51832, 'Talk to {color,yellow,Chapman}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51840, 'Goblin King\'s Counter'),
(51841, '\nChapman has learned that the Goblins in Goblin Camp are up to something. Defeat their leader Goblin King and report back to Chapman. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51842, 'This is serious...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51843, 'I don\'t think so. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51844, 'You have no idea.  The Goblins have gathered by {color,yellow,Goblin King} to invade our camp!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51845, 'But they are still Goblins...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51846, 'Even the best adventurers can\'t stop them when outnumbered.  Moreover, they are bringing their leader...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51847, 'Then, we must evacuate the camp...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51848, 'But I am Chapman, the guard of Goblin Camp!\nI am not a coward and won\'t run from danger.  I will get ready for defense.  Meanwhile, how about going there and defeating {color,yellow,Goblin King}?  When their leader is gone, the Goblins will be confused.\n\n[BUTTON]=[That makes sense!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s just run...][2]'),
(51849, 'I guess you have stopped the Goblins.\n(Phew, that\'s a relief.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51850, 'I\'ve solved the problem.  Don\'t worry about the camp. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51851, 'Oh... good.  I was actually getting ready to fight myself...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51852, '{color,yellow,Goblin King} is coming... {color,yellow,Goblin King}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51860, 'What Has Been Swallowed'),
(51861, 'Chapman is furious because a monster has swallowed his precious ring from a friend. Go and defeat Mini Lips and report back to Chapman. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51862, 'Ugh... My ring...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51863, 'Have you lost something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51864, '{color,yellow,Mini Lips} have taken the ring I got from my best friend.  Well... They have swallowed it and run away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51865, 'Oh, no... Was it an engagement ring?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51866, 'What are you talking about...  It was nothing more than a symbol of friendship.  Don\'t you get any weird ideas. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51867, '(I did actually...)\nOf course not..  Ha ha ha! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51868, 'Well then.  You should avenge me.  It would be better if you bring the ring back, of course... But that wouldn\'t be possible...\nGo and defeat {color,yellow,Mini Lips}, please.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(51869, 'Have you taught them a lesson?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51870, 'Of course!  I tried to find the ring, but it wasn\'t there...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51871, 'Oh well...  It\'s just gratifying that you\'ve defeated them.  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51872, '{color,yellow,Mini Lips}... Vengeance is mine!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51880, 'Harkan Hunting 1'),
(51881, 'More Harkans have been attacking travelers lately. Jax wants you to go and defeat them.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51882, 'Harkans...  They are everywhere...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51883, 'I guess they haven\'t learned their lesson. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51884, 'That\'s why they are monsters.  Even if  you defeat them, they will gather up and come back to harass the travelers after some time.  How cunning...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51885, 'That\'s why there are adventurers like us.  Because of the endless trail of monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51886, 'That\'s right, but there are many adventurers who are not as skilled as you are.  I can\'t blame them, though...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51887, 'That\'s right.  We are not mercenaries who fight for the money.  Anyways!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51888, 'It\'s not a time to discuss the adventurers.  First, go and focus on defeating {color,yellow,Harkans}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(51889, 'Hey, you are back safe.  You must have completed your job. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51890, 'They are no match for me...  I\'ve shown them who\'s boss, so they won\'t bother you so much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51891, 'Well done.  Come back later! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51892, '{color,yellow,Harkans}...  Go and teach them a lesson in kicking butt 101!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51900, 'Harkan Hunting 2'),
(51901, 'More Harkans are attacking travelers lately.  Get the Harkan\'s Baton and report back afterwards.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51902, '[NAME], have you defeated those Harkans?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51903, 'Of course.  They won\'t be back for a while. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51904, 'Look at this.  It\'s a petition from the travelers.  Harkans have become more violent and no one can even travel at all.  What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51905, 'I can\'t believe it.  You know me.  I never lie about this stuff. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51906, 'I know... But this petition tells us that Harkans haven\'t learned their lessons...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51907, 'I will definitely show them this time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51908, 'That\'s a good idea, but let\'s stop them at the source.  Steal {color,yellow,Harkan\'s Baton} from {color,yellow,Harkans}.  Without the weapon, they won\'t be able to attack us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Harkan\'s Baton...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel good.][2]'),
(51909, 'Hey, how many have you brought?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51910, 'Many.  They shouldn\'t be able to attack for some time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51911, 'Good job!  See you later!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51912, 'Bring {color,yellow,Harkan\'s Baton} from {color,yellow,Harkans}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51920, 'Ogre\'s Attack 1'),
(51921, 'Chapman says that Ogres are harassing him.  Neutralize the threat and report back. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51922, 'Those... Jerks...  Why do they keep harassing me?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51923, 'Who is harassing you, Chapman?  I will help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51924, 'Oh...[NAME]... I appreciate it, but they always come to harass me when you are not around. That\'s the biggest problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51925, '(How come a soldier can\'t even protect himself?)\nHmm... How about training with me to get stronger?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51926, 'I am a good fighter when I fight one versus one, but when they come in a pack...  Well... I have to kneel down... to survive...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51927, '(I understand...)\nI see.  But there is no other way.  I don\'t want to leave you in danger, Chapman.  I will help you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51928, 'Can you do that?  I appreciate it.  Please defeat {color,yellow,Weakened Ogres}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will show them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Next time.][2]'),
(51929, 'You... are back...?  Have you defeated many?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51930, 'Yes, sir.  I crushed them all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51931, '(Chapman frowns)\nOh... I see.  Thanks.  I will come up with a way to fight multiple enemies on my own...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51932, '{color,yellow,Weakened Ogres} are harassing me...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51940, 'Ogre\'s Attack 2'),
(51941, 'Chapman says that now Ogres are harassing him.  Defeat the Ogres and report back to Chapman.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51942, 'Ahhh!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51943, 'Chapman, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51944, 'Since you defeated {color,yellow,Weakened Ogres}, now {color,yellow, Ogres} are coming to harass me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51945, 'They must have called the stronger ones in their tribe...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51946, 'I guess so...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51947, 'If it\'s too dangerous, you\'d better go back to Elderine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51948, 'I can\'t do that.  I have gained a good reputation by guarding this place all by myself!  I can\'t give up.  I will fight until the end.  Please help me defeat {color,yellow,Ogres}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You are firmly determined.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something else to do.][2]'),
(51949, 'Phew... I\'m ready.  I will fight until the end even if I have to die here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51950, 'You are firmly armed!  I am sure you will be able to defeat them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(51951, 'I need to show them what a man is all about.  Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51952, 'Please defeat {color,yellow,Ogres}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51960, 'King Coll and the Loot 1'),
(51961, 'Jax has found out that King Coll\'s Molar are sold at expensive prices. Go and collect the molars and bring them back to Jax. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51962, 'Oh... I had no idea they had it...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51963, 'Oh, do you have another secret from the wandering merchant?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51964, 'Oh.. [NAME].  You are a veteran adventurer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51965, 'I guess you are trying to make profit by selling the loots and you must know that you need my help. Right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51966, 'Of course.  Let\'s make a deal!  I will give you 30%.  How\'s that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51967, '30%... I have to think about it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51968, 'Take your time.  First of all, you should get me... {color,yellow,King Coll\'s Molar}. It\'s very sharp, so be careful..  Bring me as many as you can find!  That will make both of us rich. \n\n[BUTTON]=[You have the spirit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have another job.][2]'),
(51969, 'It\'s time for the money! [NAME]!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51970, 'I know.  I need my money fast.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51971, 'If all other adventurers are as open as you are, I would have bought a big mansion the size of Elderine by now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51972, 'Bring {color,yellow,King Coll\'s} {color,yellow,Molar}.  I\'ll count on you.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51980, 'King Coll and the Loot 2'),
(51981, 'Jax has found out that King Coll\'s Claw are sold at expensive prices. Go and collect the claw and bring them back to Jax. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(51982, 'How useful!  Ha ha ha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(51983, 'Oh, I guess you have found another source of profit...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51984, '[NAME], you always come here at the right time.  Do you have some kind of a special sense?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51985, 'Yeah, it\'s just my sixth sense.  Ha ha, that\'s all!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51986, 'You are already my business partner, so it doesn\'t matter... Let\'s get to business. It seems that {color,yellow,King Coll} would make us rich again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51987, 'Oh!  I was beginning to feel bored.  When should I begin?  Right now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51988, 'Don\'t be hasty.  I have found that {color,yellow,King Coll\'s Claw} is durable and popular among the blacksmith.  Its value will only go higher. \nHa ha ha!  Let\'s move!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ugh.. My stomach...][2]'),
(51989, 'I should get ready to visit my clients.  You are too fast!  [NAME]!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51990, 'Promptness is the key to a successful business.  I will look forward to my cut.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(51991, 'Sounds good!  Then, everything will be done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(51992, '{color,yellow,King Coll\'s} {color,yellow,Claw} is very rare.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52000, 'The Legend of Vampire Bat'),
(52001, 'Chapman says that he has seen the legendary Vampire Bat.  See if this legendary monster is fact or fiction!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52002, 'The legendary Vampire Bat...  Is that what I have seen...?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52003, 'What have you seen?  A magical unicorn lair?  Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52004, 'I wish...No... Who do you think I am?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52005, 'A guard? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52006, 'Stop the silly jokes and listen to me.  In Elderine, there is an old story about the legendary Vampire Bat.  It\'s a scary monster that transforms people into bats when there\'s a full moon. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52007, 'I think I\'ve heard about it from the adventurers.  I\'m not sure about it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52008, 'When there was a full moon the other night. I think I saw that legendary Vampire Bat.  It chased me at first and then disappeared all of a sudden.  I am so confused.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52009, 'Wasn\'t it just a regular bat?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52010, 'It could be... Anyways, can you go and make sure whether it was the legendary Vampire Bat or a regular bat, [NAME]?\nDefeat {color,yellow,Vampire Bat}.  If there is no {color,yellow,Vampire Bat}, it means that it is just a legend...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I bet it\'s just a regular monster..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to go.][2]'),
(52011, 'What was it?  Was it the legendary?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52012, 'No, it was just a regular bat...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52013, 'Oh... It can\'t be...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52014, 'I just hope that it was not the {color,yellow,Vampire Bat}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52020, 'I Need Warm Clothes!'),
(52021, 'Chapman says that the guard uniform is too cold.  Bring him the materials for warm clothes!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52022, '(Chapman shivering in cold)\nOh... It\'s too cold these days...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52023, 'You are a guard and you should be stronger.  Be a man and pretend that you are not cold!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52024, 'I want to, but this uniform is too thin. Darn... I\'ve caught the cold so many times.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52025, 'Hmm... It does look cold.  That uniform...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52026, 'If I don\'t do anything, I\'m going to freeze to death.  I have thought about a plan.  Hear me out.  {color,yellow,Vampire Bat}\'s wings are known to be warm.  I heard that it can resist even the coldest weather. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52027, 'You can make clothes with bat wings? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52028, 'I have no other choice.  I can\'t leave my post and it\'s embarrassing to ask Elderine for clothing.  I was hoping you could help me.  Get me many {color,yellow, Vampire Bat\'s Wings}.  I\'ll make the clothes myself.. It\'s too cold here!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Get yourself something warm in the meantime.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It doesn\'t look so warm.][2]'),
(52029, 'Oh... I almost froze to death waiting for you.  Have you found the materials?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52030, 'Yes, but I don\'t know if it\'s enough to make clothes...  I tried to get as many of them as I could.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52031, 'Oh!  This is enough!  I could even sell the excess!  No more cold weather for me!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52032, 'If only I had {color,yellow, Vampire Bat\'s Wings}... Oh... It\'s freezing...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52040, 'Ethical Conscience 1'),
(52041, 'Jax says that the monsters recently released from the Collapsed Prison have crossed the line.  Go and teach the Prisoners a lesson.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52042, 'Those Jerks. How could those prisoners be so arrogant?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52043, 'Criminals are always arrogant.  What can I say?  It\'s just the way it goes...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52044, 'I hate to see them act like they are the law.  They threatened my shop the other day... Those fools think that it is ok for them to take my stuff.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52045, 'Did you let them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52046, 'I did at first so I could get out of there alive...  But it angers me now that I think about it.  They have no ethical conscience...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52047, 'Let it go.  That\'s what I thought at first, but I don\'t now.  Based on my experience, it\'s just stressful to think of them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52048, 'As a merchant, I value commercial ethics.  I can\'t let them get away with this. [NAME], go and teach those {color,yellow, Prisoners} what justice is all about. I will reward you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go and teach them justice!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know what justice is.][2]'),
(52049, 'So?  Are they still arrogant?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52050, 'Yes, I think so.  They giggled and confronted me.  They were somewhat frightening to me, too.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52051, 'If only I had the strength... to defeat them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52052, 'I can\'t see those {color,yellow, Prisoners} flutter around.  Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52060, 'Ethical Conscience 2'),
(52061, 'Jax says that the monsters recently released from the Collapsed Prison have crossed the line.  Teach Dungeon Prisoners a lesson and bring back Jax their Prisoner\'s Uniform. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52062, 'How could I make an unforgettable impression on them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52063, 'That sounds scary.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52064, 'I am still angry at them.  I am even more furious. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52065, 'Hmm... What should we do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52066, 'There is only one way, fight them!  We need to strike them hard so they will remember it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52067, 'Hmm... You are too excited. Calm down a little. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52068, 'It\'s too late. [NAME], please do me a favor.  Defeat {color,yellow, Dungeon Prisoners} and bring me their {color,yellow, Prisoner\'s Uniform}.  I want to show them what it is like to live without what they need. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s too ethical.][2]'),
(52069, 'How did it go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52070, 'I brought their clothes...  But is it right to do this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52071, 'They have to know how it feels.  I\'m so satisfied.  Thank you. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52072, 'Defeat {color,yellow, Dungeon Prisoners} and bring their {color,yellow, Prisoner\'s Uniform}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52080, 'Source of Crime 1'),
(52081, 'Chapman says that Scaffold Execution Ground and Collapsed Prison are the places where monsters go bad.  Go and take out the Dungeon Torturer that seem to be the root of this problem.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52082, 'I don\'t know where to clean first.  Hmph...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52083, 'Clean?  There is no janitor around here...  Can\'t you clean after yourself, Chapman?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52084, '...What I mean by cleaning is not cleaning the place.  I mean sweeping up the places filled with monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52085, 'I see...  It\'s always better to clean up a large amount of monsters...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52086, 'Yes, that spirit will bring peace to the Isya Continent...  But that\'s not the reality.  We always take action only when there is a problem.  No matter how many times I report to the commander, they have never dispatched backup...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52087, 'It\'s certainly burdensome and dangerous to do all by yourself...  I can\'t help you all the time... It\'s like going into the enemy\'s base.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52088, 'Moreover, {color,yellow, Dungeon Torturers} are gathering monsters to promote an Anti-Isya movement.  They are very dangerous, so they must go at once.  What do you say?  Can you help?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s all too sudden...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t.  I need more time to prepare.][2]'),
(52089, 'You are back.  This must have weakened them a little, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52090, 'I guess...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52091, 'But this is only the beginning.  There are many things to do, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52092, '{color,yellow, Dungeon Torturers} are stirring up the monsters.  We must get rid of them. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52100, 'Source of Crime 2'),
(52101, 'Chapman says that Scaffold Execution Ground and Collapsed Prison are the places where monsters go bad.  Now the Dungeon Torturers are taking action again us! Go and defeat this monster!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52102, '[NAME]!  We have a problem!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52103, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52104, 'Since you defeated {color,yellow, Dungeon Torturers}, their leader, {color,yellow, Torturer King}, has begun to take action. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52105, 'Hmm... I guess I have struck them hard.  Ha ha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52106, 'You did a great job, but it will be a big problem if they invade a big city.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52107, 'I know what you mean.  You are telling me to defeat {color,yellow, Torturer King}, right?  As always.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52108, 'You got it!  Go and defeat {color,yellow, Torturer King} before anything happens!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m ready.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared.][2]'),
(52109, 'You must have completed the mission.  Since you\'ve gone to fight the leader, you are by far the best adventurer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52110, 'I just did my job...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52111, 'This must have intimidated them...  This is the right timing... I will call Elderine for backup.  Well done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52112, 'The {color,yellow, Torturer King} have taken action... You must go and defeat as many of them as you can...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52120, 'Liberation'),
(52121, 'Jax talks about the trees in pain that he saw in his dream.  Help bring comfort to Dead Tree Souls and report back to Jax.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52122, 'What could this dream mean?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52123, 'Have you had a dream of winning the lottery?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52124, 'I saw the spirits of trees in my dream.  They asked me to liberate them.  What could this mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52125, 'Trees?  Could they be... {color,yellow, Dead Tree Souls}?  They are the only remaining trees in the Isya Continent...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52126, 'I guess you are right. I haven\'t seen them myself.  But they must be in pain.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52127, 'I don\'t know... But if you saw them in your dream, there must be a reason. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52128, 'Please bring comfort to {color,yellow, Dead Tree Souls}, [NAME].\nI\'m sure they want it..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared...][2]'),
(52129, 'Were they thankful?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52130, 'I don\'t know about that, but they looked comfortable.  Hmm... I can\'t say since I never had this experience before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52131, 'Well done.  They must be resting in peace...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52132, 'Please bring comfort to {color,yellow, Dead Tree Soul}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52140, 'Precious Gloves'),
(52141, 'Jax has acquired information about the gloves that are great for excavating. Senior Torturer\'s Gloves to be exact. Go get him a pair and report back.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52142, 'If only I had those, I could have all the treasures buried in the Isya Continent...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52143, 'You are still into treasure hunting. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52144, 'That\'s the fate of all merchants.  The knowhow determines whether you can be a great merchant or an ordinary merchant. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52145, 'I bet you have a great knowhow, Jax.  Am I right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52146, 'My sources are very expensive... My information is also very expensive.  That\'s what makes me different from other merchants.  Ha ha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52147, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52148, 'I heard that {color,yellow, Senior Torturer\'s Gloves} are exceptionally great for excavating.  They can take me a step closer to being a great merchant.  \nWhat do you say?  Can you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just dig with your hands.][2]'),
(52149, 'Did you get the gloves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52150, 'Here they are.  They look ordinary.  I don\'t know if they are effective. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52151, 'I should try them first.  I am going digging.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52152, 'If only I had {color,yellow, Senior Torturer\'s Gloves}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52160, 'The Real Lesson 1'),
(52161, 'Chapman was almost attacked by a group of monsters. Avenge him and teach Senior Torturer a lesson. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52162, 'Those monsters...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52163, 'Huh?  Is something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52164, 'How dare them attack me, the elite soldier from Elderine...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52165, 'You are lucky you are safe...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52166, 'I could avoid injury with my agile defense, but I can\'t stand the rage.  My self-esteem has been injured...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52167, 'Hmm... Do you want me to avenge you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52168, 'It was {color,yellow, Senior Torturers}.  Go and teach them a lesson!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way.][2]'),
(52169, 'Have you succeeded?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52170, 'Of course I did.  You know me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52171, 'Hmm...  Thank you, but I\'m not all content...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52172, 'Defeat {color,yellow, Senior Torturers}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52180, 'The Real Lesson 2'),
(52181, 'Chapman was almost attacked by a group of monsters. Avenge him and teach  Karasian Soliders a lesson.  \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52182, 'It\'s different monsters this time... Ugh...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52183, 'Did something else get you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52184, 'Those monsters must think of me as a civilian, not a soldier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52185, 'How about going back to Elderine and living a peaceful life?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52186, 'I\'m seriously thinking about that...  Phew...  Why am I so weak?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52187, 'Do I have to step up again...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52188, 'I\'m sorry. Defeat {color,yellow, Karasian Soliders} for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way.][2]'),
(52189, 'Have you succeeded?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52190, 'Of course I did.  You know me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52191, 'Hmm... Thank you, but I must seriously think about my future.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52192, 'Defeat {color,yellow, Karasian Soliders}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52200, 'Final Request 1'),
(52201, 'Jax says that a monster stole his item.  Show the Karasian Arch Templar why its not smart to steal from others.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52202, 'Oh... I can\'t believe... they stole it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52203, 'Jax?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52204, 'Arrogant monsters...  They could steal something else, but not that!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52205, 'What did they steal from you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52206, 'The dagger, known as the treasure of the continent.  I went through a difficult route to get it for my safety.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52207, 'Didn\'t you have to get it yourself?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52208, 'I didn\'t have the time because I had too many orders from my customers...  Please.  Defeat {color,yellow, Karasian Arch Templar} to console my empty heart.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Hmm.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like it.][2]'),
(52209, 'Haven\'t you found my dagger? I\'m so upset I lost my treasure to the monsters...  I didn\'t even have a chance to use it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52210, 'I defeated the monsters, but I didn\'t see the dagger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52211, 'Oh... Well.  If that\'s the way it goes.  Thanks anyways.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52212, 'Show those {color,yellow, Karasian Arch Templars} the consequence of stealing from others. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52220, 'Final Request 2'),
(52221, 'Jax says that another item was stolen by a different monster this time.  Show Des Harkan why its not smart to steal from others.\n(Search Collapsed Prison)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52222, 'They stole from me again...  Should I quit being a merchant?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52223, 'Not again...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52224, 'This time, it was the necklace for safety.  It was one of the treasures of Clipper, a great merchant from the past. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52225, 'Next time, go and get it yourself. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52226, 'I spent 80% of my money to get it...  I don\'t want to live...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52227, 'Do you know who did it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52228, 'The shipper says it looked like {color,yellow, Des Harkan}.  He only had a peek at them because he had to run, but I think he\'s right.  This is my last request.  Please go {color,yellow, Collapsed Prison} and defeat them. \n\n[BUTTON]=[OK.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way.][2]'),
(52229, 'Oh... My necklace...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52230, 'I\'m sorry. I wanted to find it for you, but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52231, 'Oh, well... Is this life?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52232, 'It must be {color,yellow, Des Harkan} in {color,yellow, Collapsed Prison}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52240, '(4) Festival Egg 4'),
(52241, 'Item Merchant Kenton asked you to bring (4) festival eggs back.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52242, 'Oh, [NAME]!!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52243, 'Mean monsters stole my festival eggs.\nPlease go to the {color,yellow, Protect the Golden Egg} KQ and bring the stolen eggs back!\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK! Please hang on.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t be bothered.][2]'),
(52244, 'You brought the stolen eggs back! Please accept a reward as a token of gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Quest Completed][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52245, 'Please save the {color,yellow, festival eggs}!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52250, 'What\'s Over There?'),
(52251, 'Hugues is the leader of the Hunter\'s Union. He\'s currently busy with the suspicious gate that arose a short while ago in the Swamp of Dawn. What\'s this gate for? We should discuss this with Hugues.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52252, 'It\'s just as dangerous here. Now that this unknown gate has arisen, too... what is that thing, anyway?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52253, 'What\'s going on here, Hugues? \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52254, 'A massive gate has arisen below our outpost. That\'s why we\'re quaking with fear every single day. \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52255, 'Go over there and investigate it for yourself...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52256, 'I\'ve been to the gate a few times. It\'s pretty hard to know what happens inside without going in yourself. Naturally, a few people from the Hunter\'s Union don\'t want anything to do with it.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52257, 'Hm... What is going on with the Isyan continent? The more I think about it, the worse of a feeling I get...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52258, 'I think you should go through the gate one time and take a look at what\'s inside. We just want to help in some way. However, it\'s very dangerous to send our Union members inside. Sorry!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52259, 'Hm... I get what you mean. It\'s probably too much for me to go through the gate alone, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52260, 'I think so, too. Maybe the best solution would be to take experienced adventurers with you, but you\'d best take a few of them, not just one.\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52261, 'Okay, good to know!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52262, 'We\'ll have to ask around ourselves first, then we can give you the relevant info. That\'s all we can do for you at the moment. Good luck!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52270, 'Devildom Fortress'),
(52271, 'Hugues has apparently found out what\'s inside the newly arisen gate. Go talk with Como and find out more information about what\'s inside the gate. \r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52272, '[NAME] We\'ve found out what\'s inside the gate!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52273, 'What could be inside?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52274, 'The brave Como took a quick look inside and claims that a massive castle is within the gate. It\'s apparently called Devildom Fortress.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52275, 'A large castle?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52276, 'It seems that lots of unknown monsters were fighting in front of the castle. However, we don\'t currently know the reason behind the fighting. We also don\'t know where these monsters came from.\r\nWhat we do know is that this gate means bad news!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52277, 'What is going on with the Isyan continent... The more I think about it, the worse of a feeling I get.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52278, 'That\'s all I know. You can go talk to Como, though.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, got it.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go ask Komo later.][2]'),
(52279, 'Como, tell me precisely what you saw in the gate!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52280, 'Unknown monsters have been fighting in front of the giant fortress. An animal-like creature directed this battle. The creature seems to be called Foras, or so I found out.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52281, 'Foras...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52282, 'You know of it?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52283, 'Yes, but I thought that had all come to an end. Obviously not...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52284, 'Thank Teva you know what it is. I don\'t wanna go back in there, though. You go in there quickly and find out what\'s going on!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52285, 'Go get more detailed info from Como!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52290, 'Weakening the Devildom Fortress 1'),
(52291, 'This is a letter of request from a stranger. Hugues claims that the sender of the letter must be helped. Defeat the Flame Citrie in Devildom Fortress!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52292, '[NAME] We\'ve received a letter. The sender is, um, the leader of the Foras Tribe?\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52293, 'The Foras Tribe Chief... \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52294, 'According to the letter, he needs help because one soldier really isn\'t enough. It also says that we can\'t leave Devildom Fortress the way it is. So that means that he\'s asking for help, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52295, 'Yes, I think so...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52296, 'You know that we can\'t go there. You\'ll have to do it all by yourself.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52297, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52298, 'The letter says that we should defeat the {color,yellow,Flame Citrie} so that they can proceed.\r\nSo, will you take on the task?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I mean I\'ve got to help, right?][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Definitely, but I\'m not free right now myself.][2]'),
(52299, 'Phew, I\'m so happy you got back safely. Were you able to help them?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52300, 'Yes, it wasn\'t very easy, but I destroyed all of those monsters. This isn\'t the first time that I\'ve fought them. There are probably even more of those monsters in there!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52301, 'Haven\'t got a clue. I don\'t know anything. I\'m still happy that you\'re okay, though. How does this Foras know about us? That I\'d like to know!\r\nYou\'ve done well. Take a break for now because we don\'t know when the next letter of request will come.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52302, '{color,yellow, Flame Citrie}... Is it strong?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52310, 'Weakening the Devildom Fortress 2'),
(52311, 'We\'ve received a second letter. According to the letter, we should defeat the Ice Citries in order to render Devildom Fortress inoperative. Go! Complete this task!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52312, '[NAME] We\'ve received another letter.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52313, 'I presumed we\'d get another, but not so soon! \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52314, 'That must mean it\'s pretty urgent. Pretty dumb really. I mean, it\'s not really my problem. But it\'s definitely your problem!\r\nThe letter says that there\'s another type of Citrie. Get going, there\'s no time to lose. \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52315, 'Get there as quickly as possible!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52316, 'In my opinion, you\'ve already helped enough. So if you don\'t want to, you don\'t need to answer this call for help, okay?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52317, 'I suppose you\'re right. The Foras Tribe can\'t be helped.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52318, 'You\'ve gotten into a real pickle there. Hmm... \r\nWe need to destroy the {color,yellow,Ice Citrie}.\r\nDo you want to accept this task?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Of course, I mean I\'ve got to help, right?][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Definitely, but I\'m not free right now myself.][2]'),
(52319, 'It\'s great to see you back. Seems like you defeated the enemy without any problems this time.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52320, '...\r\nI need to rest. Looks like there will be lots of battles in the future.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52321, 'OK, then. Nicely done. Get some rest.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52322, '{color,yellow, Ice Citrie}... You must be careful.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52330, 'Weakening the Devildom Fortress 3'),
(52331, 'We\'ve received another letter. It says that we should defeat the Storm Citrie to make Devildom Fortress unusable.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52332, '[NAME] Devildom, here we come again!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52333, 'Yes, we are ready.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52334, 'There\'s nothing special in the letter. Let\'s push on with defeating the rest of the Citries! \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52335, 'That\'s the end of the Citries!! \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52336, 'I\'m shocked every time I get one of these letters. I suppose it\'s nothing special... just frightening somehow!\r\nEven though it\'s just a letter of request.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52337, 'The pressure in Devildom Fortress is very high. If you\'re head isn\'t strong enough, you won\'t be able to endure it. I hope you get what I mean. You get a headache just by watching!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52338, 'By the way, you have to defeat the {color,yellow,Storm Citrie} this time. Are you ready?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[No. Not yet.][2]'),
(52339, 'Is that the end of the Citries now?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52340, 'Maybe, but an unbelievably dangerous monster awaits us beyond!\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52341, 'Hm... good luck. \r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52342, '{color,yellow, Storm Citrie}... The seems to be the last of the Citries.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52350, 'Strong Enemy in the Devildom Fortress 1'),
(52351, 'Oh, we just got yet another letter. Apparently, we should prepare extremely well for the next mission because a very strong opponent awaits us. This time we have to defeat the Flame Focalor. Come on, let\'s get down to business!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52352, 'Hmm, this letter is a bit different than usual. Very different monsters to the ones beforehand and yet still this Focalor...\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52353, 'Focalor... \r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52354, 'Are they strong monsters?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52355, 'Oh yes, very strong. Not to be compared with the Citries. I\'m really scared stiff this time!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52356, 'You know what? It would be pretty nasty to refuse their request just because the monsters have gotten stronger. What\'s next? I mean, it doesn\'t affect me directly.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52357, 'I think you\'re right. We\'ve already begun the task of helping them. So we\'d better bring this thing to an end properly.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52358, 'I can\'t do anything more than cross my fingers and wish you luck. Are you ready to defeat the {color,yellow,Flame Focalor}?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, it\'s go time!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, but not now.][2]'),
(52359, 'Well done! This Foca...thing wasn\'t much of a challenge for you!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52360, 'It\'s not all thanks to me; a few wonderful adventurers also helped me.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52361, 'Well yes, it\'s an important skill to be able to find the right people. Well done. Go and take a rest, okay?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52362, 'The {color,yellow, Flame Focalor} will be stronger than before. Be careful!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52370, 'Strong Enemy in the Devildom Fortress 2'),
(52371, 'The second enemy is the Ice Focalor. The Foras Chief wishes to begin the battle immediately. Let\'s destroy the Ice Focalor in Devildom Fortress!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52372, 'Oh, another letter. As you already know, we need to destroy this Ice Foca...thing.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52373, 'I presumed so. We have no choice. Let\'s go!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52374, 'You are very diligent. Once all the work is done, sort out the reconstruction project in Swamp of Dawn, okay?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52375, 'I don\'t know if my body will hold out that long...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52376, 'Nah, that was just a joke - Good luck!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52377, 'You\'ll have to prepare yourself this time again.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52378, 'This time you\'ve got to destroy the {color,yellow,Ice Focalor}!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, but not now.][2]'),
(52379, 'You\'ve mastered every task till now, but good luck anyway!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52380, 'I\'m so tired, I\'ll have to rest first.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52381, 'Nicely done.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52382, '{color,yellow, The task is: }defeat the Ice Focalor. Always watch your back!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52390, 'Strong Enemy in the Devildom Fortress 3'),
(52391, 'The third enemy is the Storm Focalor. The Foras Chief wishes to begin the battle immediately. Come on, we\'ll defeat that Storm thingy in Devildom Fortress!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52392, '[NAME] You know what to do, yeah?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52393, 'Great, preparations are complete!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52394, 'Be careful! Good luck!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52395, 'Thanks. I will hurry back.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52396, 'It\'s the {color,yellow,Storm Focalor} this time. Are you ready?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m coming!][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[No. Not yet.][2]'),
(52397, 'Welcome. This thing is pretty much done now, right?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52398, 'As far as I know, there is still the boss monster in Devildom Fortress. We can knock out Devildom Fortress when we defeat this boss.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52399, 'Although it won\'t be easy. I\'ll keep my fingers crossed. Take a good rest before the battle!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52400, '{color,yellow, The mission is: }defeat the Storm Focalor. Always watch your back!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52410, 'Strong Enemy in the Devildom Fortress 4'),
(52411, 'Our fourth enemy is one of the most dangerous magical weapons to the Foras. Once you\'ve defeated it, we\'ll get into the boss room. Come on, let\'s defeat these things!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52412, '[NAME] An urgent letter from the Foras Chief.\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52413, 'Hm... what does it say?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52414, 'The Citries and Focalors have been defeated, but there are still a few problems thanks to the strong magical weapons.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52415, 'Huh, magical weapons? Does that mean we have to fight machines?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52416, 'Maybe. Let\'s defeat the {color,yellow,Melee Flame MagiWeapon} and the {color,yellow, Melee Ice MagiWeapon} together.\r\nBe careful. Even machines are enemies...\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I am scared of machines.][2]'),
(52417, 'How was the fight against the machines?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52418, 'The fight was different somehow. So, now there\'s just the boss monster left. I\'m so anxious!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52419, 'It\'s about time to fight against the strongest opponent. I\'ll keep my fingers crossed!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52420, 'The {color,yellow,Melee Flame MagiWeapon} and {color,yellow,Melee Ice MagiWeapon} must be defeated!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52430, 'The Last Enemy is the Lava Avanas.'),
(52431, 'The boss of Devildom Fortress is now the final opponent. It\'s called the Lava Avanas - what a name! This is one tough monster. You won\'t be able to defeat it without additional adventurers. Come on, let\'s try it together!\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52432, '[NAME] It\'s time to go.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52433, 'Uh oh, I\'m nervous.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52434, 'Even though we, the Hunter\'s Union, didn\'t help... I would still like to find out more about the gate as soon as you\'ve wasted all those monsters. \r\nCan you do that?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52435, 'Sure, provided I make it back alive.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52436, 'The Foras Chief will also wait for you. Go to him!\r\n{color,yellow, Defeat the Lava Avanas} and show them the meaning of power so that they never return to the Isyan continent.\r\nI will entrust you with this task.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[OK, then.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared. That\'s why I cannot go.][2]'),
(52437, 'You are back safely. Did you take down Devildom Fortress?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52438, 'That was a really strong opponent. I managed to do it together with the adventurers and the Foras Tribe. It was a really amazing moment.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52439, 'Nicely done. \r\nIt\'s about time to tell me about Devildom Fortress, okay? I\'m so anxious to hear... I bet it\'s very interesting.\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Quest complete][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52440, '{color,yellow, Lava Avanas}... I get scared just hearing its name. You can do it. Be careful.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52450, 'The Holy Ones finally step foot onto the continent.'),
(52451, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52452, 'Welcome! I don\'t know how long I\'ve waited for this day to come. \nThe day that the Crusaders finally bring things into motion on this continent.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52453, 'You\'ve accomplished much, O teacher of glorious light, Tiros!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52454, 'As long as we\'re on this continent, we shouldn\'t act like we\'re still in training. We have to be a role model for all people.\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52455, 'You\'re right. Where do we begin?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52456, 'Firstly, I\'ll test if you\'re ready to complete the training. \nThis is the final step in becoming an honored member of the Crusaders.\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52457, 'I know.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52458, 'You seem well prepared mentally. Let\'s repeat what Crusaders are first. Then we will begin the test. \nAre you ready?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52459, 'I\'m always ready!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52460, 'OK then. Now listen very carefully to what I say! \r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52470, 'Review 1: Light Power'),
(52471, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52472, 'The first test concerns our power: the {color,yellow,Light Power} which the Crusaders use.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52473, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52474, 'We use {color,yellow,Light Power} to perform various skills.  Of course, we can also use our skills without mana. {color,yellow,Light Power} emanates constantly from the body of a Crusader. You need to use it wisely.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52475, 'Does that mean it\'s possible to use skills without mana, because our {color,yellow,Light Power} is derived from the light?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52476, 'Correct! You\'ve got it already. You must remember that {color,yellow,Light Power} comes from a positive attitude and a reverential body. Without this power, we\'re just simple villagers.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52477, 'OK, I understand.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52478, 'It seems that the Crusaders have trained you well.\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52479, 'I\'ll keep working hard.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52480, 'Alright, on to the next topic.\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52490, 'Review 2: Attack Technique'),
(52491, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52492, 'The next topic is the most important of all - your attack skills. I\'ll explain it to you so you can use it to defeat enemies in battle.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52493, 'That\'s what I do best!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52494, 'Don\'t be so arrogant. You don\'t know any advanced skills yet. You still have much to learn!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52495, 'I\'m sorry. I just wanted to learn quickly...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52496, 'You can only learn when you have been properly trained. Your impatience won\'t change that. The Crusaders are unique beings who are able to use both physical and magical attack skills.  We use different skills to defeat the enemy, depending on the circumstances.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52497, 'I understand.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52498, 'The first thing to learn is the basic sword skill to perform a {color,yellow,Hero Strike}. You will learn how to incorporate light power into the sword and increase its damage.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52499, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52500, 'The second thing to learn is the basic magic skill to perform a {color,yellow,Light Blast}. You learn how to concentrate light power to a single point and attack from a safe distance.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52501, 'I\'ve heard about that... But I haven\'t learned it yet. When can I learn skills like that?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52502, 'You\'re very impatient. You\'ll be able to learn them soon.\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52510, 'Review 3: Crusader Weapons and Armor'),
(52511, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52512, 'I\'m now going to tell you about the weapons and armor carried by the Crusaders.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52513, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52514, 'The Crusader\'s weapon contains an artifact that boosts its magical power. This makes the weapon look heavy, but it is actually very refined and much lighter than you\'d think.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52515, 'That really seems to be true.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52516, 'Our armor does not cover the whole body in metal so that the body can absorb light power. The armor is light and comfortable to wear and is made from a special material.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52517, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52518, 'There are bound to be plenty of weapons and armor on the continent that have been crafted to suit us. Armor that increases the power of the light... It\'s your job to find these items.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52519, 'OK then.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52520, 'We\'ve already gave you the basic weapon. Let us now give you the armor for crusaders. I hope you find it useful.\nOK, let\'s move on to the next topic, shall we?\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52530, 'Review 4: Healing'),
(52531, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52532, 'So now we\'re going to take a look at the topic of "Healing."\n\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52533, 'OK, I\'ve heard that the Crusaders can heal their own wounds. But I don\'t believe I have skills like that.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52534, 'Only because you\'ve never learned the skills. I\'ll explain it to you now. Listen carefully!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52535, '...\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52536, 'Self-healing is another power contained in light power. So light power is not just used to grapple with the enemy.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52537, 'This is the skill {color,yellow,Lifeline}. It is used to heal wounds by wrapping the body in light power. Crusaders can use it to save an injured party member and go on to win the battle.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52538, 'When can I learn this technique?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52539, 'I\'ll teach you now. Hopefully this technique will make you an esteemed Crusader.\r\nNext up...\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52540, 'Special Skill'),
(52541, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders wants to put your skills to the test.\nGo and use Advent on the Secret Society Warrior.\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52542, 'I\'m now going to teach you the most important skill of all. They say it is the best skill that a Crusader can bring to the battlefield.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52543, 'Wow! I\'ve been waiting for this moment!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52544, 'This is the final Crusader skill. It is called {color,yellow,Advent}. You can use this skill to leap up into the sky at the speed of light before plunging back down and attacking the enemy.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52545, 'I\'m so excited!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52546, 'But not everyone can use this skill. Only those whom I have selected.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52547, 'Does that mean I haven\'t been selected?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52548, 'Having judged your skills and attitude, I am going to teach you this skill.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52549, 'Woohoo!\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52550, 'I will give you a skill book which you can use to learn the skill {color,yellow,Advent}. After you have learned this skill, head outside and try it out on a monster, then come back inside, OK?\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[OK, got it.][1]\r\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not ready yet.][2]'),
(52551, 'How do you feel now that you have learned the Advent skill?\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52552, 'I really feel like I\'ve become a true Crusader. I\'m very excited, but many difficulties still lie ahead.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52553, 'That\'s the perfect attitude for a Crusader. Let\'s finish off our reviews.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52554, '{color,yellow, After you have learned the Advent} skill, go out and practice it.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52560, 'Start of the Adventure'),
(52561, 'Tiros, the Leader of the Crusaders, wishes to give residents of the Isyan continent help and advice. \nYou should speak with Tiros.\r\n\r\n[LINE]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52562, 'You don\'t need any more advice from me. You are already an outstanding Crusader.\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[Start Quest][1]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52563, 'I will grow with every adventure to become stronger, help those in need and defeat the enemy.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52564, 'I like your attitude. Now that we\'re finished, I would like to give you the scroll to {color,yellow,Uruga}. A new adventure is about to begin there. But you may remain here if you wish.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52565, 'OK, I know what to do if I have any problems.\r\n\r\n[NEXT]'),
(52566, 'Always remember the will of the light. That\'s the only solution for fighting the dark forces on this continent.\r\nGood luck! You are now a fully-fledged Crusader, [NAME]!\r\n\r\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\r\n[SHOW_REWARD]\r\n[MENU]'),
(52570, 'Joining the Templars [Job Changing Quest]'),
(52571, 'Kiera talks about a strong power from within.\nYou can hear explanations about the Templar\n(Job Changing Quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52572, 'What do you think is the greatest power [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52573, 'Greatest... power? Hmm... \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52574, '{color,yellow, The Greatest Power} a Crusader can have is being {color,yellow,a Templar}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52575, '{color,yellow,Templar}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52576, 'Please get blessings from the elements of fire and wind. They will guide you down the right path. Listen to the elements.\nIf you have really found the right path for you, come back to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest complete][1]'),
(52577, '..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52580, 'Templar! [Job Changing Quest]'),
(52581, 'You have gained the blessings of fire and wind.\nYou are ready to recieve a new power after listening to Kiera\'s explanation.\n(Job changing quest)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52582, 'You have all the blessings...\nAs I predicted, you are much stronger now.\nYour efforts, hard work and good nature impress me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest start][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52583, 'Not at all...\nIt\'s all because you helped me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52584, 'Now that you\'ve earned all the blessings, you have a choice to make.\nWith your current powers, you cannot overcome the dangers ahead.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]'),
(52585, 'Are you ready to become a Templar\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(52586, 'Okay. Your choice has been made.  Your path is chosen!  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52587, 'I feel.. full of energy.\nIt\'s like something hot is moving inside my heart.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52588, 'You have gained power.\nBut... how you wield that power is still up to you.\nYou will have to face many foes from the past.\n\n{color,yellow,I will wish for a blessing of Legel upon you, oh... and I have a gift for you. Please talk to me again when you are ready to recieve it.}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Job changing quest complete][1]'),
(52589, '??\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52590, 'The Excavators\' Mission 1'),
(52591, 'The leader of the excavators, Griffin, tells you about their task and goal. The monster Rhinoce Lord is said to drop Old Geology Document (Vol. 1). Go and collect this item for Griffin. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52592, 'Hello, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52593, 'I don\'t think I\'ve seen you before. Where are you from?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52594, 'Hahaha!\nWe\'re digging up rare treasures of the Isyan continent. Ehhh, what I mean is, we\'re excavators!\nI\'m in charge of the operation. My name is Griffin. Nice to meet you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52595, 'The pleasure is mine. So your excavation team consists of only three people?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52596, 'The Isyan excavation teams usually work in groups of three. One chief leader and two assistants, which makes three.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52597, 'I see. That sounds very organized. So what do you think of {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}? It must be full of treasures, I\'m sure.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52598, 'When I first came here, that was my thought as well, but the problem is the monsters here. They\'re so strong that they\'re causing us quite some trouble.\nWell, I just hope that the reward is really as great as the risk.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52599, 'I need to tell you - if you really want to achieve anything here, you\'ll be facing many obstacles before you get there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52600, 'I\'m aware of that! But with an adventurer like yourself by our side, things should look up, don\'t you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52601, 'Like myself?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52602, 'Okay, let me tell you about the situation we\'re in. There are excavation supervisors in each larger city, and they are our superiors. We have to prove ourselves to them, or they won\'t trust and support us. I\'m going to give you your first mission. One of the monsters here, the {color,yellow, Rhinoce Lord}, is said to carry an {color,yellow,Old Geology Document (vol. 1)} in their possession. No one has been able to obtain any so far. We could be the first!\nWill you help us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m in!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Yeah, good luck with that. On your own.][2]'),
(52603, 'This is just the beginning. This place might be the chance we were waiting for!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52604, 'Hmmm. If you discover any rare treasures, what\'s in it for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52605, 'It won\'t be any fun if I tell you now. But I\'ll promise you one thing: the treasures you\'ll find if you work with me... no one else on this continent has ever laid eyes on them, so you\'ll be the first. Of course, I\'ll give you some of the big pieces, too!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52606, 'I don\'t think anyone has ever published the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord\'s} {color,yellow,Old Geology Document (Vol. 1)}. The fact that a monster carries such an important document remains very mysterious.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52610, 'The Excavators\' Mission 2'),
(52611, 'The leader of the excavators, Griffin, tells you about their second mission. The monster Laplan Prince  is said to drop Old Geology Document (Vol. 2). Go and collect this item for Griffin. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52612, 'These documents are incomplete. There must be a second part.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52613, 'Are you talking about the geology documents?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52614, 'Yes. It seems our first treasure consists of two parts. Darn, just when I thought we succeeded!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52615, 'Well, then we should get right to it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52616, 'We really appreciate your help, but this time we\'ll have to start at the basics. We must find out who has the documents and where they are. Only then can we start the mission.\nUnfortunately, we don\'t have any information whatsoever about the second part.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52617, 'What can I do to get you the information?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52618, 'Hm, wait here for a second.\n\n(Griffin instructs his men to do something.)\nWait just a moment, please.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52619, 'Okay.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52620, '(After quite a long time)\nWhat?\nI see.\nWell done.\n\nWe\'ve received word about the second set of documents. My men really are very good at what they do.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52621, 'I\'m glad to hear that. So who\'s our next target?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52622, 'It seems that {color,yellow,Laplan Prince} has them. Well, at least that\'s what we\'re suspecting. But it\'s the only clue we have at the moment.\nWill you do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure, I like to finish what I\'ve started.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Count me out this time.][2]'),
(52623, 'What happened? Did you get the documents?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52624, 'Yes, your men were right. Here you go.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52625, 'Ah! I can\'t believe I\'m holding two of these rare documents. It must be my lucky day! We have you to thank for all of this! Well done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52626, 'Please investigate the {color,yellow,Laplan Prince}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52630, 'Webster\'s Request'),
(52631, 'Webster, a member of the excavation team, wants to gain some recognition by personally gathering some treasure. Help him find the Old Relic (Sword) from Laplan before Gregory does. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52632, 'Dangitall, if Gregory finds his treasures first, I\'ll never hear the end of it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52633, 'Oh, I thought the two of you got along well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52634, 'Well, we\'re part of the same excavation team, so we\'re as close as real brothers. But of course we\'re also very competitive. That\'s one of the reasons we became excavators.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52635, 'Then what\'s the problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52636, 'I actually joined the excavators to find some treasure that I could keep for myself. (Whispers) Without the boss knowing, of course.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52637, 'Hmm, so you made a bet with your colleague about who could find the rarest items? Do you know how that makes you look?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52638, 'Well, since you know the truth now, I guess you could think that. For us, though, it\'s just a competition in good faith. It doesn\'t affect our personal feelings. Hehe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52639, 'Okay, I see. So what do you want from me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52640, 'You should have figured it out by now. I need you to get an {color,yellow,Old Relic (Sword)} for me, and you have to be quicker than Gregory. Oh, by the way, a {color,yellow, Laplan} is said to have one.\nI\'d appreciate it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll find it before Gregory can blink!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Please don\'t involve me in your gambling problem.][2]'),
(52641, 'I hope you were quicker than Gregory. Or did he maybe enlist help as well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52642, 'Psh, I don\'t know. You should ask him, not me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52643, 'Gregory! I can\'t believe him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52644, 'Please find an {color,yellow,Old Relic (Sword)} for me. You have to be faster than Gregory!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52650, 'Gregory\'s Request'),
(52651, 'Gregory, a member of the excavation team, wants to gain some recognition by personally gathering some treasure. Help him find the Old Relic (Shield) from Big Mud Man before Webster does. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52652, 'Dagnabbit, if Webster finds his treasures first, I\'ll never hear the end of it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52653, 'Oh, I thought the two of you got along well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52654, 'Well, we\'re part of the same excavation team, so we\'re as close as real brothers. But of course we\'re also very competitive. That\'s one of the reasons we became excavators.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52655, 'Then what\'s the problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52656, 'I actually joined the excavators to find some treasure that I could keep for myself. (Whispers) Without the boss knowing, of course.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52657, 'Hmm, so you made a bet with your colleague about who could find the rarest items? Do you know how that makes you look?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52658, 'Well, since you know the truth now, I guess you could think that. For us, though, it\'s just a competition in good faith. It doesn\'t affect our personal feelings. Hehe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52659, 'Okay, I see. So what do you want from me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52660, 'You should have figured it out by now. I need you to get an {color,yellow,Old Relic (Shield)} for me, and you have to be quicker than Webster. Oh, by the way, a {color,yellow,Big Mud Man} is said to have it. \nI\'d appreciate it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll find it before Webster knows what hit him!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Please don\'t involve me in your gambling problem.][2]'),
(52661, 'I hope you were quicker than Webster. Or did he maybe enlist help as well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52662, 'Psh, I don\'t know. You should ask him, not me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52663, 'Webster! I can\'t believe him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52664, 'Please find an {color,yellow,Old Relic (Shield)} for me. You have to be faster than Webster!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52670, 'Settling Down in Peace 1'),
(52671, 'Chief Excavator Griffin thinks it\'s more important at the moment to set up a secure camp for the excavators than finding treasure. He asks you to kill the dangerous monsters so they can excavate in peace. Shadow is the monster you must eliminate. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52672, 'This place is a lot more dangerous than I thought.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52673, 'Didn\'t you know it was dangerous before you came here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52674, 'Uhhh, of course I suspected it, but I didn\'t think it\'d be THIS bad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52675, 'You should know that this is nothing. There are much more dangerous places all over the continent.\nIf this already worries you, your journey from here on out will get a lot harder.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52676, '(Griffin is deep in thought)\nHm, I see. Still...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52677, 'You and your team members will have to be able to brave the dangers together. But of course, I\'ll help you as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52678, 'I understand. I\'ve made up my mind. To achieve anything at all, we have to establish a safe base for us within the region. That way we can concentrate fully on our work.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52679, 'You\'re right. Safety comes first!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52680, 'My team and I will take care of the camp itself. I need you to deal with the surroundings. We first have to get rid of the monsters before we can start excavating!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52681, 'I understand. I\'ll give it my all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52682, 'The most dangerous monster around here is the {color,yellow, Shadow}. Please eliminate that first.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(52683, 'Your face tells me that you taught them a lesson!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52684, 'That wasn\'t too hard. What\'s next?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52685, 'Hoho, hold your horses. Don\'t worry, there\'s still lots to do for you. I\'ll let you know your next task.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52686, 'The {color,yellow, Shadow} is the most aggressive monster around here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52690, 'Settling Down in Peace 2'),
(52691, 'Chief Excavator Griffin thinks it\'s more important at the moment to set up a secure camp for the excavators than finding treasure. He asks you to kill the dangerous monsters so they can excavate in peace.  Red Shadow is the next monster you must eliminate. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52692, 'Let\'s see now. Which other monsters are dangerous?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52693, 'A great number of monsters are still out there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52694, 'But we need to deal with them according to how scary and aggressive they are. We can take care of the regular monsters ourselves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52695, 'Oh! Really? You must be pretty good. I\'ve just never seen you fight before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52696, 'Don\'t underestimate us! We\'re actually quite strong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52697, 'I\'m glad to hear that. So who\'s the next opponent?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52698, 'Hm, let me think. According to this list, it\'s the {color,yellow,Red Shadow}. Be careful, it\'s said to be very dangerous. If you let down your guard, you might end up dead. Shall I leave it to you, then?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(52699, 'Whoa, it seems the monsters around here are no match for you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52700, 'Well, I don\'t know about THAT.\nHmmm.\nNow that I think about it, you might be right. Hahaha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52701, 'Hehe, well that works out nicely then for all of us. You did well!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52702, 'Don\'t think lightly of the {color,yellow,Red Shadow}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52710, 'The Team Members\' Tasks 1'),
(52711, 'Webster, a member of the excavation team, is researching ways to make the outpost safer. The only thing he was able to do, though, was to find out which monsters are the most dangerous. Help him take care of Laplans.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52712, 'Should I practice sword fighting? Or maybe self-defense?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52713, 'What\'s going on, Webster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52714, 'Oh, [NAME], good thing you\'re here. I\'m so miserable; I need help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52715, 'I\'ll help you out if I can, but don\'t put too much hope in me. I\'m not exactly a professional therapist.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52716, 'I know, I know. I also know you\'re busy helping us to settle down here. Our chief is doing the best he can, but I\'m so unhappy because I want to help, too, and don\'t know what to do. I don\'t know whether to learn sword fighting or self-defense.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52717, 'I think it\'d be wise to learn both.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52718, 'I\'d like to, but there\'s just no time. This place is so dangerous, you never know when something might happen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52719, 'Then I don\'t think there\'s anything I can do to help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52720, 'The most important thing is the safety of our camp. I need to find out for myself where my path leads me. But while I do that, I\'d like you to help me with something else.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52721, 'And that would be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52722, 'According to my information, the {color,yellow,Laplans} are blocking the roads so that travelers and, of course, our team are having troubles getting supplies. Without supplies, we\'ll be in danger, so I want you to go ahead and kill those monsters.\nWill you do it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll clear the roads for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sounds like too much work. Pass.][2]'),
(52723, 'Did you secure the supply route?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52724, 'Of course I did. Now you won\'t have to worry anymore!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52725, 'Hehe, well done. Okay, let\'s see what\'s next.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52726, 'We have to get rid of the {color,yellow, Laplans} or we won\'t be able to get supplies.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52730, 'The Team Members\' Tasks 2'),
(52731, 'Webster, a member of the excavation team, is researching ways to make the outpost safer. The only thing he was able to do, though, was to find out which monsters are the most dangerous. Help him take care of Big Mud Men.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52732, 'Good, you\'re here, [NAME]! I needed to talk to you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52733, 'Do you need me to kill monsters again? I think it\'s about time you tried it yourself for once.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52734, 'Well, that\'s exactly the reason why I asked you last time what I should practice. You were being vague and told me to do both.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52735, 'What I meant was that I can\'t help the excavation team out forever, and you should learn to do it yourself. You\'re getting into the habit of calling me every time you run into a problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52736, 'Hm, I know what you mean, but we can\'t acquire those skills in so little time. Please understand.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52737, 'I do understand, but I\'ll only help until the outpost is safe, alright?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52738, 'Of course, and we\'re really grateful for that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52739, 'Good. Shall we get down to business, then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52740, 'We received word that the {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} are trying to enforce the swamp with their own mud. They are probably trying to get travelers stuck so they can rob them. Please eliminate them before they can succeed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(52741, 'Wow, you\'re really a great fighter. Okay, I finally made up my mind.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52742, 'What are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52743, 'Learning to wield a sword is the right thing to do. I\'ll start training today! Anyway, you did a good job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52744, 'We can\'t let the {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} carry on!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52750, 'The Team Members\' Tasks 3'),
(52751, 'Webster, a member of the excavation team, is researching ways to make the outpost safer. The only thing he was able to do, though, was to find out which monsters are the most dangerous. Help him take care of Rhinoce Lord.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52752, 'Oh dear. This one will cause us some trouble.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52753, 'Again? You\'re postponing your sword training AGAIN to gather more information?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52754, 'Like I said, I like to take things slowly. Besides, my information is very valuable. Don\'t you think I should concentrate on what I do best?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52755, 'Talking big is obviously what you do best.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52756, 'Aaaaanyway, I did some investigating and found a very dangerous monster. We\'ll be able to work much more effectively if we could only be rid of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52757, 'You\'re not after the slimes again, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52758, 'You know the monster called the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord}, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52759, 'True, that one is a bit dangerous - even for me. You\'re not going to ask me to hunt him, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52760, 'I have to! That\'s the only thing you can do at the moment. Make sure to be careful when you kill the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me. Death is my middle name.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Please ask someone else first.][2]'),
(52761, 'Oh, I\'m so glad that you made it back unscathed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52762, 'Ugh. I\'m so tired. I\'ll have to take a break from hunting monsters for a bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52763, 'Hm. Well, I guess I can\'t say much about that. So I\'ll get back to practicing sword fighting then.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52764, 'Please kill the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord}. He\'s a tough opponent.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52770, 'Gregory\'s Decision 1'),
(52771, 'While on guard duty, excavation team member Gregory was attacked by monsters. Now he\'s so scared that he wants to quit the team. Help him restore his confidence by killing Weasels .\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52772, 'Ungh, I thought it would be a new challenge to join an excavation team. Blergh.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52773, 'Well, it all depends on your attitude, I guess. I\'ll go and tell Griffin what you said. Bye!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52774, 'No! Wait! I was just joking! It\'s just that work has been so difficult. It\'s really different from what I thought it would be.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52775, 'Then why don\'t you just quit? I\'m sure there are lots of adventurers who\'d like your job.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52776, 'If I quit now, I will shame my whole family back in Elderine. I couldn\'t live with that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52777, 'Why don\'t you work on your attitude, then? Try to overcome your fear!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52778, 'I guess I should. Before I can work on that, there\'s something I need you to take care of. I\'m talking about those {color,yellow,Weasels}. They\'re the ones who turned me into such a scaredy cat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52779, 'Will you change your mind if I kill the {color,yellow,Weasels} for you? Then I\'ll help you with this one. If not, then I\'m out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52780, 'Oh? Okay, I guess. I\'ll wait here while you kill the {color,yellow,Weasels}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Got it. Deep-fried Weasel, coming up!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t sound convinced. Ask me again later.][2]'),
(52781, 'I\'m so glad you made it back safely. I was worried something might have happened to you and it\'d be all my fault.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52782, 'I told you I was strong! So, have you decided what you want to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52783, 'I think it would be cowardly to quit now. I have to overcome my fear and find untold treasures. You\'ve openened my eyes! Thank you! Please keep helping me out in the future as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52784, 'Those freakin\' {color,yellow,Weasels}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52790, 'Gregory\'s Decision 2'),
(52791, 'While on guard duty, excavation team member Gregory was attacked by monsters. Now he\'s so scared that he wants to quit the team. Help him by killing Big Mud Men.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52792, 'Now I don\'t have to worry anymore. I\'ve made up my mind.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52793, 'What are you going to do? Does that mean that you\'re not thinking about returning home anymore?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52794, 'I won\'t think those weak thoughts anymore. My goal is to find a place within the excavation team.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52795, 'Great. I\'ll help you as much as I can.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52796, 'Thank you. First of all, let me think abo--\nOh yeah! We received word that those {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} are planning to take over our camp. Can you take care of them before it comes to that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52797, 'Since I said I\'ll help, I guess I have to keep my word?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52798, 'Good, thank you. If you just kill the {color,yellow,Big Mud Men}, our camp should have no troubles. Please take care!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Lemme at \'em. I\'ll drag \'em through the mud!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I\'m a little busy right now.][2]'),
(52799, 'Now that we\'ve taken care of the surrounding dangers, we have supplies scheduled to arrive soon. Thank you! We couldn\'t have done it without you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52800, 'No problem. Feel free to reward me if you get your hands on some really valuable treasures, hehe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52801, 'Of course! Don\'t worry, you have my word!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52802, 'We should be good if you can take care of the {color,yellow,Big Mud Men}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52810, 'Cleaning Up the Phouches'),
(52811, ' Town Chief Kiera of Alberstol Ruins is worried about the increasing numbers of Phouches. Help her get rid of them.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52812, 'Oh my, where are they all coming from?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52813, 'You seem to have something to worry about all the time, Lady Kiera.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52814, 'That\'s true. I wish I could take care of my village in peace, but life seems to have other plans for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52815, 'It sounds like you\'d have to get rid of every single monster in Isya to accomplish that, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52816, 'That would be ideal, but impossible as long as Legel stirs. The only thing I want is peace. Any village chief would wish for that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52817, 'But if that happened, how would adventurers like me make a living?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52818, 'Well, that\'s true, I suppose. I still think that even adventurers are first and foremost interested in their safety more than their adventures. You might think differently, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52819, 'Well, maybe that\'s really not in the best interest of the continent\'s adventurer associations, hehe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52820, 'Anyway, let\'s not get distracted. Right now, the increasing numbers of {color,yellow,Phouches} are causing problems in Alberstol Ruins. Do you think you could maybe take care of them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[They\'re as good as gone.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, Phouches give me nightmares.][2]'),
(52821, 'You did fantastically, [NAME]. Sadly, we can\'t be sure that the other monsters\' numbers won\'t increase as well. Who knows what might happen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52822, 'You can count on me if that happens. I\'ll take care of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52823, 'It wouldn\'t be right of me to keep bothering you with this, but thank you for offering. You helped us a lot, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52824, 'Why is the number of {color,yellow,Phouches} increasing suddenly?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52830, 'The Actual Work 1'),
(52831, 'Excavation Leader Griffin is ready to start with the actual excavation. His team won\'t be able to do it alone, so he\'s asking you to help find treasures. Help him locate the Rosarium Stones rumored to be carried by Living Statues.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52832, 'It\'s a long time coming, but shall we cautiously get started?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52833, 'Now that things are safe around here, you can finally start with your actual work. I hope you find many rare treasures.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52834, 'I hope so, too. After all these troubles, it would be a shame if we didn\'t find anything. Don\'t you think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52835, 'Well, I\'m not an excavator, so I don\'t know, but I think it would at least be kind of sad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52836, 'Now\'s the time to reap the fruits of our hard labor. For us and for you as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52837, 'For me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52838, 'Of course. You played a crucial part in helping us settle down here. Even though you\'re not an official member of the team, you\'re part of our family, [NAME]. But of course that means that you\'ll have to help us with the excavation as well!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52839, 'Hmm, I find it hard to follow your logic, but if you put so much trust in me, I\'ll help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52840, 'I knew that I could count on you!\nLet\'s see. We need to excavate ancient treasures; the future of my team depends on it. But before we find them, you have to get something else for me first. To decipher the ancient treasures, we need a special tablet called a {color,yellow,Rosarium Stone}. According to the intelligence we received, the {color,yellow,Living Statues} have these stones.\nGo and have fun hunting those creatures!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Heck yeah, it\'ll be fun!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Too dangerous for me. Can\'t you use a dictionary instead?][2]'),
(52841, '(Griffin is working hard on digging up the ground.)\n*pant* *pant*\nOh! You\'re back. Did you get the Rosarium Stone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52842, 'Who do you think I am? Of course I did!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52843, 'Great! Now things are looking up. We just need to hurry up and find some treasures now. You can go and take a rest for a bit!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52844, 'You can get the {color,yellow,Rosarium Stone} from the {color,yellow,Living Statues}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52850, 'The Actual Work 2'),
(52851, 'Excavation Leader Griffin said he received an urgent message from Elderine. What could have happened? Help locate the Ominous Stone Tablet Fragments\nsaid to be carried by Black Shadows.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52852, '(Griffin is concentrating on reading the letter.)\nWell, this is bad timing, indeed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52853, 'What does the letter say? Are they not sending supplies? Or did they discover the treasures are fake? What does it say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52854, 'No, that\'s not it. It says that they want me to send some items needed for researching a special kind of magic. We haven\'t even finished our actual work here yet. Oh, what should I do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52855, 'Just when you were getting started here, too. If the request is from Elderine, you can\'t refuse it, either. You\'re stuck between a rock and a hard place.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52856, 'It really lowers morale if you have to interrupt something just as you get rolling on it. That doesn\'t only go for excavators; everyone feels that way.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52857, 'That\'s true. So what are you going to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52858, 'I\'ve come to a decision. I need your help again, [NAME]. We\'ll keep working on our excavation and you try to find the item Elderine has requested. That way we can take care of both jobs at the same time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52859, 'Yes, that\'s true. So what you\'re saying is that you can\'t do it without me, right? Haha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52860, 'Of course! Okay, now let\'s get to work. Wait, what was it they wanted again?\nAh, here we go. You have to kill {color,yellow,Black Shadows} to get {color,yellow,Ominous Stone Tablet Fragments}. Seems like a tough thing to do, but I trust you can do it. Will you help us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just tell them you don\'t want to do it.][2]'),
(52861, 'You\'re back! How did it go? We\'ve been working hard as well, but it\'s been a challenge.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52862, 'I brought the things Elderine requested! I\'ll make sure to send them off. You just concentrate on your excavation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52863, 'Thank you. I hope we\'ll soon be able to yield some results and follow in your footsteps.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52864, 'It says to get {color,yellow,Ominous Stone Tablet Fragments} that {color,yellow,Black Shadows} carry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52870, 'The Actual Work 3'),
(52871, 'The excavation is in its final stages, but Griffin hasn\'t been able to yield any results yet. He is afraid that he might miss something if he concentrates too much on other things, so he asks you for help. Find the Fallen Wings that Shadow Masters are rumored to drop. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52872, 'It\'s taking much longer than I expected. Our schedule is getting delayed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52873, 'How long will I have to wait until I get to see some treasures?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52874, 'We\'re giving it all we\'ve got, but the excavation is too difficult. I can only commend my team members for staying so strong and concentrating so hard all this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52875, 'But the longer it takes, the more their morale will drop.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52876, 'That\'s why I have to ask a favor of you in secret. You can\'t tell my team members about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52877, 'Tell me what it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52878, 'The {color,yellow,Shadow Masters} are said to have a rare treasure called the {color,yellow,Fallen Wings}. While we keep working here, I want you to go and bring me the {color,yellow,Fallen Wings}. Make sure they don\'t see you handing them over to me. Then I\'ll pretend that I found them during the excavation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52879, 'Hmmm. That almost sounds like a special forces secret mission.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52880, 'It has to be that way. That\'s the best we can do in this situation, even if we have to rely on your help. Please get me the {color,yellow,Fallen Wings}. Those pesky {color,yellow,Shadow Masters} have them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sign me up for the Isya special ops!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think your men will find out. Pass.][2]'),
(52881, 'You got them. I\'ll thank you later. Now hand them over to me without anyone seeing...\n(Griffin is doing something behind his back.)\nOh! What\'s this? They look like {color,yellow,Fallen Wings}, don\'t they?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52882, 'Wooooow! You finally found something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52883, 'Our first discovery! The first! Now let\'s work hard on finding the second one!\n(Griffin looks uncomfortable.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52884, 'You can get the {color,yellow,Fallen Wings} from {color,yellow,Shadow Masters}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52890, 'Something Sharp'),
(52891, 'While he is sorting items, Webster looks like he just bit into a sour lemon. He needs something sharp to open the packaging, but all the camp\'s tools are being used at the dig site. Help Webster locate Weasel teeth.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52892, 'Where did I put it? If the chief finds out, he\'s going to be angry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52893, 'Will you be able to deal with the inventory like this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52894, 'I remember I put it somewhere. Argh! I have to find it quickly before the boss finds out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52895, 'Do you think you can find something sharp in these barren lands? You might have a hard time without my help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52896, 'Do I have to ask you for help yet again? I guess I don\'t have any other choice. Go get something sharp for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52897, 'Considering that you\'re asking for my help, your tone isn\'t really all that appropriate.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52898, '(Oh, that adventurer is too smart for his own good.)\nI really need your help. Pleeeeease help me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52899, 'That\'s more like it. What exactly is it that you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52900, 'Anything sharp. For example, something like a {color,yellow,Weasel Tooth}. You know better than me which monsters have something like that, right?\nPlease hurry. I don\'t have much time. If the boss finds out, I\'m toast.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll save you from his wrath.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think I\'d like to see what happens to you, actually.][2]'),
(52901, 'Ohoho, did you get it? I was afraid the chief might drop by while I was waiting for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52902, 'Yes, here it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52903, 'Ow! That\'s really sharp! It should do the trick. I\'ll trim it a bit and it\'ll look just like the one I lost!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52904, 'I need a {color,yellow,Weasel Tooth}. Quickly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52910, 'A Secret Request'),
(52911, 'Gregory wants to send his girlfriend in Elderine a present for her birthday. Help him track down Caiman Giant Bracelets dropped by Caiman Giants.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52912, 'Soon it\'ll be her birthday. I feel so bad that I came here and can\'t spend it with her.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52913, 'Oh, I didn\'t know you had a girlfriend. It\'s a shame that you can\'t do anything for her birthday.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52914, 'Even though I can\'t be with her, I had something in mind that I want to send her as a present.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52915, 'Something nice, I assume?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52916, 'It\'s a bracelet from the {color,yellow,Caiman Giants}. Even though I won\'t be able to spend a lot of money on the present, she\'ll be happy if she sees how cool it looks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52917, 'Hm, are you sure she\'ll like something that monsters have worn?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52918, 'I\'ve been watching them and saw that they clean their bracelets about ten times a day, so hygiene shouldn\'t be a problem.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52919, 'You\'re really clever, watching for things like that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52920, 'I know it would be more special if I got it for her, but I can\'t really leave at the moment, as you know. So please help me. Bring me a {color,yellow,Caiman Giant Bracelet}. I really want to send one to her as a present.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Birthdays are special. I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too busy, sorry.][2]'),
(52921, 'Seeing as you\'re back safely, you must have gotten the bracelet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52922, 'Of course. Now you only have to wrap it up and send it to her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52923, 'Oh, thank you! I won\'t forget what you did for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52924, 'If I only had a {color,yellow,Caiman Giant Bracelet}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52930, 'Settlement Journal 1'),
(52931, 'Javez is the leader of the new excavation team in Dark Land. In comparison to Griffin, he is much more quiet and meticulous. He has requested help to settle down in Swamp of Dawn. He asks you to defeat the dangerous monster Alka. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52932, 'This place seems very quiet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52933, 'Oh, travelers! I haven\'t seen you before.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52934, 'We\'re not travelers. We came here to excavate treasure.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52935, 'Oh, I see. At first I thought you were adventurers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52936, 'I don\'t like my men to stand out too much. We just want to do our work in peace. If we tell the whole world that we\'re here, we might get unwanted attention.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52937, '(A very diligent and quiet person. Joking won\'t work with him.)\nThe most important thing is to take care of the job. I agree with you on that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52938, 'Hm, this place seems quite dangerous. If we don\'t take care of the danger, we won\'t be able to do our work. What do you, as an adventurer, think?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52939, 'Well, you\'re right about that. Even though this place looks peaceful, it still bears several dangers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52940, 'Thank you for the useful information. I\'d like to ask you for a favor. To be able to settle down successfully, we seem to need outside help. Maybe it was destiny that we met here, because I hope for your help. Of course, I\'ll pay you well.\nFirst of all, I\'d like you to get rid of the most dangerous monster here, {color,yellow,Alka}. Can you do that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[For a small fee, of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too tired right now.][2]'),
(52941, 'I\'m so glad you made it back safely. Were you successful?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52942, 'I took care of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52943, 'Yes, I know. I\'ll try and find out more. Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52944, 'You haven\'t killed the {color,yellow,Alka} yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52950, 'Settlement Journal 2'),
(52951, 'Javez, one of the excavation team leaders, asks you to take care of the wild monsters nearby to guarantee the safety of the excavation. Help Javez defeat the monster Poison Mantrap Plant.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52952, '[NAME], can I ask you for a similar favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52953, 'Yes, I think I already know what you want to ask of me. Griffin at Swamp of Dawn asked me for something like this as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52954, 'Ah, Griffin, I see. I didn\'t know he was in Swamp of Dawn.\n(Griffin! I knew that he\'d be relying on others again to get around.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52955, 'Oh, so you don\'t seem to be friends?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52956, 'Well, it\'s just that the two of us haven\'t really -- Well, anyway, back to the favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52957, '(There seems to be a reason there. I should find out more.)\nYes, let\'s talk about the task at hand.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52958, 'According to the rumors, {color,yellow,Poison Mantrap Plants} are really vicious. They will definitely get in the way of our excavation. I\'d like you to eliminate them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it later.][2]'),
(52959, 'Oh, you are a really trustworthy person, aren\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52960, 'Okay, so who\'s next? We should take care of the other monsters while we\'re at it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52961, 'You\'re very enthusiastic, but at the moment you can get some rest. I\'ll go and find out more about our next target.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52962, 'The {color,yellow,Poison Mantrap Plants} are very dangerous...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52970, 'Settlement Journal 3'),
(52971, 'Javez, leader of the excavation team, asks you to take care of the wild monsters nearby to guarantee the safety of the excavation. Help Javez eliminate the Laplansia threat.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52972, 'I\'m so sorry I have to ask for your help all the time, but the monsters here are much stronger than I thought.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52973, 'This place is really rough. It\'s one of the most dangerous and rugged terrains I\'ve seen. I heard rumors that not even veteran adventurers come here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52974, 'But if we can\'t deal with this, how can we ever go somewhere else? I made the decision for us to come here, so I knew what I should expect. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(52975, 'The situation here is really extreme. Without an adventurer like myself, you won\'t be able to handle it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52976, 'You have no idea how much strength your presence gives me. I will be sure to make it up to you, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52977, 'Yes, you can count on me. So, what can I do for you this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52978, 'The new targets are the {color,yellow,Laplansias}. Without them, we should be able to start our first excavation!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go take them out quickly.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have a few other things to do first.][2]'),
(52979, 'Now we can cautiously start to work on our first excavation. Well done, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52980, 'Oh, can I watch you work?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52981, 'Of course. We\'ll soon show you why we\'re called the treasure detectors!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(52982, 'With the {color,yellow,Laplansias} gone, we can start our first excavation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52990, 'Trouble with the Alka'),
(52991, 'While excavation team member Rose was working on a personal excavation, she took something by accident from a monster. Now this monster is haunting her in her dreams. Go and defeat Alka for her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(52992, 'This is just great. Now it\'s even invaded my dreams.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(52993, 'Eh? Why are you looking so scared?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52994, '"It" appeared in my dream. Not only do I have to deal with "it" while I\'m awake, now "it\'s" in my dreams, too!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52995, 'What are you babbling on about? Did you do something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52996, 'I didn\'t! I just did my work while on a personal excavation. Suddenly I found something sparkling in the ground, so of course I was happy. It was my first discovery! But then, "it" showed up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52997, '"It?"\n\n[NEXT]'),
(52998, 'I turned around and saw a monster staring at me. It was an {color,yellow,Alka}. It started to chase me because the item in my hand belonged to it. I threw it to the ground and ran as fast as I could, but now the Alka has appeared in my dreams.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I have an idea. Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should return to Elderine and see someone about that.][2]'),
(52999, 'Ungh, I don\'t feel well. Eh? What are you doing back?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53000, 'I took care of the Alka. You should feel better soon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53001, 'Really? Are you speaking the truth? That\'s great! I\'ll have to see if I can get a decent night\'s sleep now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53002, 'Dear {color,yellow,Alka}, please stop appearing in my dreams.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53010, 'Special Guest'),
(53011, 'Excavation team member Kupers is enjoying his stay here. He\'s excited about the dangerous monsters and the unknown terrain. One day he suddenly starts talking about a guest coming to see him. Defeat this guest before Javez find out. Go and defeat Laplansias.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53012, 'Lalala, it\'s almost time for the guest to arrive. Huzzah!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53013, 'A guest in this faraway place? They must be a very brave person.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53014, 'No, the guest I\'m talking about is a monster! When I saw how boisterous it was walking around here, I told it to come here and fight me!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53015, 'You don\'t seem to realize how dangerous the monsters here are.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53016, 'Well, maybe I can be so brave exactly *because* I don\'t know? I am full of confidence! I can kill any monster that comes at me!\nEspecially those {color,yellow,Laplansias}. Come at me if you dare! Wahahaha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53017, 'Um, are you aware that Javez is really worried about the monsters here? I already helped him out a couple of times.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53018, '(Kupers looks surprised.)\nEh? If that\'s true, then the monster I challenged is really strong! Ummm, what should I do?\nAh, right! You. You! Help me. Make sure the {color,yellow,Laplansias} never even get here!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, whatever. Fine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Not my problem.][2]'),
(53019, 'What - what happened? Did you kill them all?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53020, 'Yes, for now. But be careful you never do anything like this again. This isn\'t just about you, it\'s about your team as well. You put them all in danger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53021, 'Yes, you\'re right. I\'ll be careful from now on.\n(Oof, how embarrassing.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53022, 'What if the {color,yellow,Laplansias} come here? I didn\'t think this through very well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53030, 'First Task.'),
(53031, 'Stone Merchant Sera said she saw something near the first gate. What is going on over there? Talk to Sera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53032, 'I\'m sure I saw something. Weird.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53033, 'Hello! I\'m an adventurer and came here to investigate the strange gate at the village. I heard you saw something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53034, 'Yes, I saw something come out of the gate. Like, it jumped right out. I don\'t know what it was, but I definitely saw something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53035, 'Maybe a monster?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53036, 'I\'m not sure, but I know that I saw something. Please go and take a closer look! If there really is a monster, you\'ll make sure to kill it, right?\nPlease be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m a bit busy right now.][2]'),
(53037, 'There was something at the gate, wasn\'t there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53038, 'Yes, you were right, Sera. Some monsters came through the gate. After I killed them all, the gate suddenly disappeared. I don\'t know what that means, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53039, 'Oh, my! Really? I\'m so glad to hear that! We only have to close the second gate as well, and the village should be safe again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53040, 'Be careful, you might come across scary monsters!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53050, 'Please Find My Candy 1 (Event Quest)'),
(53051, 'While preparing for the Halloween event, someone stole the candy in Margret\'s charge. Help her retrieve the stolen candy.\n(Search for ghostly Slimes and Honeyings)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53052, 'Oh my... What do I do? Something terrible has happened...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53053, 'Is there anything I can do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53054, 'Thank you for asking. We haven\'t met before, so I feel it\'s a bit rude, but I\'ll tell you what happened. I desperately need help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53055, 'Oh no... Take a deep breath and tell me what happened.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53056, 'The villagers and I poured all our energy into making some special candy for this year\'s Halloween event.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53057, 'Candy?  Is that why you\'re so upset?\nAren\'t you being a bit dramatic?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53058, 'The problem lies in the candy. It\'s totally different from normal candy!\nIf you eat it, it\'ll let you turn into a monster... Very potent candy! I can\'t even sleep anymore...\nSo, like I said, this special Halloween candy was stolen by someone...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53059, 'Oh no...  That\'s not good. So we\'re not talking about normal candy.\nDo you have any idea who could have taken it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53060, 'There was a note in the place where the candy had been.\nIt said: "We don\'t like it if you turn into us! So we\'re stealing all your candy! Hahaha!"\nIt was signed with: "We\'re the ghost monster thieves."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53061, 'The ghost monster thieves...\nHm... That means we\'ll have to take a good look at all the monsters nearby to find out which ones look like ghosts.\nMaybe then we\'ll find a clue...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53062, 'Let\'s see... I think I heard rumors of ghost like monsters appearing in the vicinity. Please teach them a lesson and then bring me the {color, yellow, Stolen Candy}. Retrieve as much as you can!\nI\'m counting on you.\n\n[BUTTON]= [Of course I\'ll help!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t really like candy...][2]'),
(53063, 'Oh, that\'s my candy! So they really were the culprits!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53064, 'But they only had a few pieces... Does that help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53065, 'Well, it doesn\'t really... It was a very large amount that was stolen from me. I\'m sure they hid it somewhere... I\'ll look into it... Thank you so much for helping me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53066, 'Please find my candy... The ghost monsters stole it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53070, 'Please Find My Candy 2 (Event Quest)'),
(53071, 'Margret got some of her candy back but it\'s still not enough for the festival. The other candy must surely be hidden somewhere...\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53072, '[NAME]! [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53073, 'Oh, Ms. Margret. Did you find any more information?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53074, 'Of course I did! I found their hideout.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53075, 'Their hideout... Then that\'s where I\'ll go!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53076, 'However... there\'s one problem. I discovered a gate that seems to lead into their hideout. But I just couldn\'t enter it, no matter how hard I tried...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53077, 'A gate that can\'t be entered...? There must be a way in...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53078, 'That\'s what I\'m saying... Those thieves must have something that allows only them to get in. Maybe... if you try and use my candy...\n\n[BUTTON]= [Of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like candy.][2]'),
(53079, 'These candies... Are they the candy corns you lost?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53080, 'Oh my! Yes, they are! Those are my candies. I\'d have never thought...\nBut how did you get into their hideout?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53081, 'Just as you said, when I turned into a monster, I was able to enter. It seems those thieves weren\'t as smart as they thought...\nOr maybe you\'re just incredibly clever, Ms. Margret.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53082, 'Oh, you flatter me... I\'m not that... Well, anyway!\nThank you so much for your help. Now our Halloween event will be a success.\nHere\'s a token of my gratitude. Please take it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53083, 'Maybe if you transform into a monster and then enter...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53090, 'The Anniversary Ball 1 (Event Quest)'),
(53091, 'The great festival of Isya is approaching fast! Town Chief Roumenus is managing all the preparations for Isya\'s fantastic anniversary ball. The Imps have stolen the anniversary ring required to start the ceremony. Roumenus is asking you to find the Imps and return the anniversary ring to Guard Captain Shutian. \n\n(Search Forest of Tides)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53092, 'You there! Hello [NAME], I\'ve been looking for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53093, 'Hello, Roumenus. Do you need something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53094, 'The anniversary ball is just around the corner, and a gang of Imps have stolen the ceremonial artifact, the anniversary ring! I need you to recover the ring. Find the Imp gang and bring the ring to Guard Captain Shutian.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, of course!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I don\'t have time.][2]'),
(53095, 'Hello, [NAME]. I heard about you from Roumenus. Did you have any luck on your search?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53096, 'Hello, Shutian. I have the ring, as requested.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53097, 'Look at that... It really is the anniversary ring!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53098, 'What are you still doing here? Did you find out which Imp is hiding the ring?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53100, 'The Anniversary Ball 2 (Event Quest)'),
(53101, 'You found the anniversary ring, but will it work for the ceremony? Shutian wants you to check with Blacksmith Karl in Elderine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53102, 'I\'m afraid the ring is broken. It\'s unusable in that state. Can you bring the ring to Blacksmith Karl? He might be able to repair it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. I\'ll ask him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry, I think I\'ve done enough.][2]'),
(53103, 'What can I do for you, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53104, 'Can you fix this ring? It\'s urgent!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53105, 'Sure, I\'ll do my best. Let me take a look.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53106, 'You should go speak to Karl. We need to get that ring repaired.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53110, 'Restoring an Ancient Artifact 1 (Event Quest)'),
(53111, 'Blacksmith Karl needs help fixing the anniversary ring. He sends you to Lord Elbama for assistance.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53112, 'Look at what those Imps have done! They destroyed an ancient artifact! Look at all these scratches and their nasty fingerprints all over it. I can repair the fracture, but we\'ll need Elbama to restore its magic.\n\nFind Elbama and talk to him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Got it!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, I don\'t have time.][2]'),
(53113, 'Greetings, adventurer. I sense unease.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53114, 'Do you know how to fix the anniversary ring?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53115, 'Perhaps. The anniversary ring is a unique, magical artifact which shines like a star only once a year during a special celebration. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(53116, 'So what are you going to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53117, 'I\'m going to try and restore its magical capabilities by reforming the runes. Hopefully, it will regain its strength somehow. To help restore its power, I need you to gather some supplies.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53118, 'Find Elbama and talk to him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53120, 'Restoring an Ancient Artifact 2 (Event Quest)'),
(53121, 'Lord Elbama has an idea on how to fix the anniversary ring but will need some supplies. Gather 10 Glittering Gold Ore from cave monsters and return them to Blacksmith Karl.\n\n(Search Echo Cave, Cave of Wind, or Golden Cave)\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53122, 'We will need 10 Glittering Gold Ore to repair the ring. They\'re being hoarded by cave monsters. Once you have all ten, take them immediately to Blacksmith Karl. We don\'t have much time before the ring\'s power fades away forever.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Consider it done!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way! I\'ve got better things to do.][2]'),
(53123, 'Do you have the ore?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53124, 'Yes, I have the ore with me. Take a look.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53125, 'Fantastic! I will get to work immediately. Here, take these as a reward for your efforts. Go talk to Shutian to give him an update.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53126, 'We really need that ore. Have you had any luck?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53130, 'Restoring an Ancient Artifact 3 (Event Quest)'),
(53131, 'Karl and Elbama have successfully repaired the ring. Shutian, worried about the ring\'s power, wants to lock it up for safekeeping. He sends you to Elemental Healer Remi for the vault key.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53132, 'It\'s you! Good thing you\'re here. We have a problem!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53133, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53134, 'Karl restored the anniversary ring, but it\'s far too powerful to be left unguarded in the future. I need you to get the vault key so we can lock it away for safekeeping. Would you mind getting the key from Remi?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m on my way!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you do it yourself?][2]'),
(53135, 'How may I help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53136, 'Shutian asks if we can borrow the vault key from you. Trust me when I say it\'s important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53137, 'You need the vault key? I\'ll lend it to you, but it\'s probably better that I don\'t know what it\'s for.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53138, 'Did you get the key from Remi yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53140, 'Restoring an Ancient Artifact 4 (Event Quest)'),
(53141, 'You\'ve brought the vault key to Guard Captain Shutian. He tells you that you still need an invitation to the anniversary ball. Claim your reward and find out how to get one!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53142, 'What a pleasure to see you again. I hope you have some good news for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53143, 'Here is the key! Anything else?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53144, 'Excellent! I think we\'re just about ready. You still need an invitation to the anniversary ball, and time is running short. Talk to Kenton and see if you can still get one. I\'ll give you my tamed Black Archon so you can get to him in time. Thanks again for your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53150, 'A Royal Invitation (Event Quest)'),
(53151, 'You will need an invitation to attend the anniversary ball. Kenton has a couple extras but needs you to deliver one to Healer Carol in Sand Hill first.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53152, 'Hey, [NAME]. I heard about your problem with the invitation. Still trying to find your way in?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53153, 'Yes. It seems like I\'ve hit a road block.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53154, 'I can help you out... if you help me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53155, 'You have another invitation?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53156, 'I do, and it shall be yours! However, I need you to deliver an invitation to a special guest I would like to invite first.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53157, 'Okay. Who is this special guest, and where do I find them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53158, 'I\'d like you to bring it to Healer Carol in Sand Hill.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ooh, someone has a crush! Sure, I\'ll give her the invitation.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think so. I would just keep it.][2]'),
(53159, 'Hello, [NAME]! What brings you to Sand Hill?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53160, 'I have an invitation to the anniversary ball for you from a secret admirer.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53161, 'From a secret admirer, you say? Whoever could it be? Anyway, thank you!\nOh! I have a message for you from Kenton.\n\n*Opens Kenton\'s message*\nThanks! Here\'s your invitation. Oh, have some of this delicious cake, too.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53162, 'I really need your help. Can you bring the invitation to Carol?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53170, 'The Kebing Gang\'s Christmas Capers'),
(53171, 'With all the towns\' Christmas decorations shining so brightly, the Kebing Gang can\'t sleep at night and decides to cause trouble by summoning Snowman monsters. Help Santa and protect the holiday spirit!\n\nSearch the lands of Isya for Snowman monsters. Collect the Snowman Crystals that they drop and return them to Santa. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(53172, '[NAME]! You have to help me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(53173, 'Santa, what\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53174, 'There are Snowman monsters disturbing my elves, and they can\'t bring the children any presents. Please help!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53175, 'Snowman monsters? Where did those suddenly come from? Did anything strange happen recently?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53176, 'Hm... A little while ago, I received an odd letter from the Kebing Gang. They must have sent the monsters here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53177, 'Why would they do something like that? I know they like to play pranks, but isn\'t this a bit much? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(53178, 'In the letter, they said they can\'t sleep because of the bright lights on the towns\' Christmas trees. They demanded that we stop the festivities.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53179, 'Even though we only have this celebration once a year, they just couldn\'t stand it, huh? Someone needs to teach them a lesson.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53180, '[NAME], please {color,yellow,destroy the Snowman monsters} that the Kebing Gang sent. Bring me their {color,yellow,Snowman Crystals} as proof and I\'ll even give you a reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry, I\'ll save Christmas!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d rather let the Kebing Gang have their fun.][2]'),
(53181, 'I\'m back! Those Snowmen are nothing but snowflakes now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(53182, 'Ho ho ho! With your help, [NAME], we were able to give all the children their presents. Here\'s your reward, as promised. Happy Holidays!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(53183, 'Please do something about those horrible Snowmen so I can bring back hope to the hearts of Isya\'s children.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101160, 'Road to Victory!'),
(101161, 'The first ski tournament of Isya is now in progress! Only those who cross the finish line before time runs out are eligible to receive rewards.\nBut who will be the lucky winner?\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101162, 'Hey, [NAME]!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101163, 'Hi there! What\'s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101164, 'Glad you asked! Do you like snow? How about sports?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101165, 'Those are some pretty strange questions. Why do you ask?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101166, 'Think about it. Snow and sports combined. It\'s the winter games!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101167, 'Ah, right! But what does that have to do with Isya?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101168, 'Didn\'t you hear? I\'m holding the first ever ski tournament in Isya! If you manage to place well in the rankings, good prizes await you.\nI\'ve always dreamed about a tournament that everyone can enjoy. Now my dream has finally come true.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101169, 'Wow, that\'s fantastic! May I participate too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101170, 'Of course, if you think you\'re brave enough to join the tournament.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I\'ll do my best!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t really like sports...][2]'),
(101171, 'Hey there, [NAME]! I hope you placed well in the rankings!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101172, 'Of course! What kind of prizes do you have?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101173, 'With these coins, you can get whatever you like.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101174, 'Talk to Winterming, Jr. near the finish line. He will give you your reward.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101180, 'Get the Stolen Eggs! [Event Quest]'),
(101181, 'This year for Easter 2014, Hosheming\'s soul is requesting that you reclaim stolen eggs from the Kebings. Let\'s get those eggs back and return them to Hosheming\'s soul!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101182, 'Traveler, please help me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101183, 'Ahh!! A ghost!\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101184, 'No, I\'m not a ghost, I am Hosheming\'s soul.\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101185, 'Well... Ghosts and Souls are almost the same thing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101186, 'Ahh!! A soul!\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101187, 'Traveler, please calm down. I\'m just dead, I have no intention of harming you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101188, 'It\'s bad enough to have a dead person show himself in the first place.\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101189, 'I had to. The townspeople have been preparing a small ceremony, waiting for my resurrection. But those prankster Kebings stole the eggs that were going to be used in the celebration!\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101190, 'I had to tell this to somebody in order to repay all the kindness that the townspeople have shown. So please get the {color,yellow,Stolen eggs} back from {color,yellow,the Kebings!}.\n \n [BUTTON]=[I will help you for the sake of the townspeople.][1]\n [BUTTON]=[You will eat me! You will eat me for sure!][2]"\n'),
(101191, 'You\'ve brought back the stolen eggs. Thank you so much.\n \n [BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n [SHOW_REWARD]\n [MENU]'),
(101192, 'Please get the eggs back from those Kebings! Quickly, for all the townspeople anxiously awaiting my resurrection.\n \n [BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n [MENU]"\n'),
(101200, 'Find Dye to Decorate the Eggs [Event Quest]'),
(101201, 'Hosheming\'s soul is attempting to decorate the eggs for the townspeople who have worked so hard. Let\'s go find Petal(Red), Petal(Yellow), Petal(Blue) from the flowers to help Hosheming.\n \n [LINE]\n [SHOW_REWARD]\n'),
(101202, 'Thank you for your hard work, traveler.\n \n [BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n [MENU]'),
(101203, 'If it\'s ok, may I ask you for one last favor?\n \n [NEXT]'),
(101204, 'Are those monsters still getting in the way of the celebration?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101205, 'No, they are just watching the townspeople working hard. I want to do something for the townspeople.\n \n [NEXT]\n'),
(101206, 'To repay them, I would like to decorate these eggs by myself.  And, if it\'s okay with you, could you gather for me three Petal colors? You can {color,yellow,gather} these from {color,yellow,Flowers}.\n \n [BUTTON]=[I\'m so moved. Of course I will help you!][1]\n [BUTTON]=[This time though, for sure, you will eat me. Right?][2]\n'),
(101207, 'You found the dye for me! Thank you so very much.\n \n [BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n [SHOW_REWARD]\n [MENU]\n'),
(101208, 'I like to repay those who have gone so far out of their way for me.\n \n [BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n [MENU]'),
(102660, 'Franz??s lost order'),
(102661, 'Rock Stone at Burning Cave stole the wondrous mineral from Storage Keeper Franz. He\'s worried because he was supposed to deliver the stolen mineral to Pie at Swamp of Dawn. Go and talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102662, 'Something bad has happened. I left the wondrous mineral in Burning Cave.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102663, 'Franz, what happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102664, 'A while back I was requested to safe keep the wondrous mineral. How wondrous is it? It allowed you to view small things much larger! So curiosity led me to walk outside while looking through that mineral, and before I realized what I have done, I was in Burning Cave.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102665, 'So what happened next?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102666, 'What do you think happened? I got scared, so I abandoned the mineral and fled. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102667, 'Oh... I was supposed to deliver the {color,yellow,Mineral} to {color,yellow,Pie} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} today. I can\'t believe those {color,yellow,Rock Stones} at  {color,yellow,Burning Cave} stole it from me. What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don??t worry! I??ll find it and deliver it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should go get it yourself.][2]'),
(102668, 'Are you by any chance here to deliver me the mineral?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102669, '{color,yellow,Rock Stone} at {color,yellow,Burning Cave} should have {color,yellow,Wondrous Mineral}. When you find it, please deliver it to {color,yellow,Pie} at  {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102670, 'Investigate Lava Gargoyle at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102671, 'Pie investigates monsters with the wondrous mineral. She uses monsters?? hides to analyze various data. Go and talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102672, 'Hello, my name is [NAME]. \nFranz asked me to deliver this mineral to you.\n\n[EMOTION][19]\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102673, 'Hello. I??m Pie and I was dispatched here from Alberstol Ruins to research the monsters at Swamp of Dawn. The delivery took longer than I thought, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102674, 'Well, there were unforeseen circumstances. Anyhow, Franz said the mineral has wonderful ability to show small things bigger. Is it imbued with some magic?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102675, 'It\'s not imbued with magic. It??s a new mineral that was discovered recently at Flaming Mine. It was transparent and clear in color, so it was to be crafted into an accessory at the time of discovery. While it was being crafted, the phenomenon of showing small things bigger was discovered. Currently it??s being used primarily for looking from afar, but I intend to investigate monsters with this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102676, 'How would you investigate monsters with that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102677, 'I??m not saying I would directly investigate the monsters. I would observe the hide??s humidity to foreign substances attached to the hide to infer their diet to character. So [NAME], would you get me some {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle Hide}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I guess I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do I have to gather them?][2]'),
(102678, 'Is this enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102679, 'Oh my! You brought quite a lot. I would have a lot of leftovers with this much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102680, 'You can get {color,yellow,Gargoyle Hide} from the {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102690, 'Killing useless monsters 1'),
(102691, 'Pie has abundance of the hides in leftover so she no longer needs Lava Gargoyle. She wants them killed. Go and talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102692, 'I have so many hides, I don\'t need Lava Gargoyle anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102693, 'What do you mean that you don\'t need Lava Gargoyle anymore?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102694, 'There\'s no particular need for Lava Gargoyles to exist in Swamp of Dawn. It\'s time to get rid of them for sake of many humans.\n[NEXT]'),
(102695, '!!!\n(She\'s scarier than I thought.)\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102696, 'It concerns my safety, and they would be a nuisance to other adventurers as well. [NAME], please kill {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t you pity the poor monsters?][2]'),
(102697, 'Phew! Now that the safety has been somewhat secured, I can begin analyzing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102698, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102700, 'Investigate Caiman Junior at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102701, 'Pie wants to analyze the hides of the Caiman Juniors from Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102702, 'While I\'m examining the Lava Gargoyle hides, I\'ll also need some Caiman Junior hides gathered as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102703, 'Well, good luck with that.\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(102704, 'Wait! [NAME]! You\'re not leaving me alone in a dangerous place like this, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102705, 'What? I??m a busy person.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102706, 'I\'m alone here so I??m always lonely, all the monsters nearby scares me, and I need to gather {color,yellow,Caiman Junior Hides} but you??ll ditch a weakling like me behind? *Sniff-Sniff-Sniff* \n\n[BUTTON]=[Tears indeed are a woman\'s weapon. I\'ll go and get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think your tears will make me weak?][2]'),
(102707, 'You\'re timing to bring the hide is great! I just finished the Lava Gargoyle analysis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102708, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Caiman Junior Hide} from  {color,yellow,Caiman Junior} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102710, 'Investigate Caiman at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102711, 'Pie wants to investigate Caiman Hide from Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102712, 'I\'m getting a handle at this, and my analysis speed is picking up. I better have Caiman Hide ready as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102713, 'By any chance, are you asking me to get it again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102714, 'Don\'t you like helping me, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102715, 'It\'s not that I don\'t like it, it\'s just...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102716, '*Sniff-Sniff-Sniff* I see. You find me bothersome. I often heard that in a village I used to live in as well. However, to think I??d hear these words from mere request for {color,yellow,Caiman Hide}??! *Sniff-Sniff-Sniff* \n\n[BUTTON]=[Stop crying, I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t think your tears will work on me twice, do you?][2]'),
(102717, 'You acquired them quicker than I thought. I??m not done with analysis since I cried so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102718, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Caiman Hide} from  {color,yellow,Caiman} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. *Sniff-Sniff-Sniff*\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102720, 'Killing useless monsters 2'),
(102721, 'Pie would like to request killing of the monsters since she isn??t done with the analysis. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102722, 'I can\'t let [NAME] leave here before I??m done with my analysis. I need a good excuse.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102723, '(Something is off.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102724, 'If you don\'t mind [NAME], could I ask you to kill Caiman and Caiman Junior? My safety is important after all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102725, 'I believe my safety is more important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102726, '(Bawling in tears.)\nB-but, you??re strong, [NAME], and I\'m weak. So, so??\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be back after I kill them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You really thought you can fool me three times with those tears?][2]'),
(102727, 'Thank you. Now I can analyze in peace. And thanks to you, I even discovered something strange.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102728, 'Something strange? Did you find something special about the Caiman and Caiman Junior?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102729, '(Bawling in tears.)\nPlease kill {color,yellow,Caimans} and {color,yellow,Caiman Juniors} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102730, 'Investigate Dungeon Caimans at Tear\'s Marsh'),
(102731, 'Pie discovered something special about Caiman. She wants to investigate the Dungeon Caiman at Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102732, 'When I compared the hides, despite the fact that it??s a Junior, I can infer that there??s a Caiman that??s tougher and more violent.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102733, 'There??s probably a stronger breed.  Even with humans, Some youths are strong while some adults are feeble.\n[NEXT]'),
(102734, 'That might be true. That??s why I\'d like to investigate  Dungeon Caiman and the Dungeon Caiman Junior at Tear\'s Marsh.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102735, 'Sigh.\nSo you need more hides?\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102736, '(Smiles brightly)\nYes. It seems you already know what to do, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I may be weak against the tears, but not to a smile.][2]'),
(102737, 'Since I brought you the hides, are we all done?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102738, 'I only have words of thanks to offer, [NAME].\nHowever??\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102739, 'You should be able to get the hides from {color,yellow,Dungeon Caimans} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Cayman Juniors} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102740, 'Gathering Dungeon Caiman Hides (repeat)'),
(102741, 'Pie needs more hides of Dungeon Caimans and Dungeon Caiman Juniors. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102742, 'While I analyze the hides, I end up wasting a lot of hides.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102743, 'That\'s because you have too many in a pile.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102744, 'It??s not as if I can just keep asking you for help, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102745, 'Oh! How about this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102746, '(I have a bad feeling about this.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102747, 'I\'ll get other adventurers to get me Caiman hides. That way you, [NAME], can go to {color,yellow,Tear`s marsh} and get me {color,yellow,hides} from  {color,yellow,Dungeon Caimans} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Juniors}. Doesn\'t that sound like a fair deal?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, If I have enough time, I\'ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Apparently you don\'t understand what ??fair?? means.][2]'),
(102748, 'You brought lots of hides. But...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102749, 'Please get the hides from {color,yellow,Dungeon Caimans} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Juniors} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102750, 'Investigate Rhinoce at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102751, 'Pie wants to investigate the hide of Rhinoce from Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102752, 'I\'m somewhat done with the Caiman analysis, so could you get me the hides of another monster?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102753, 'Which monster do you need this time?\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(102754, 'I need Rhinoce hides. I wanted to analyze Rhinoce this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102755, 'But is the analysis derived only from the hides any useful?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102756, 'Of course. Even though the data won??t have any immediate use, I\'m certain it??d be a worthwhile data. So please go to the {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} and get me {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hides} from  {color,yellow,Rhinoce}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[If it has its value, then I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you by any chance not know what a valuable data is?][2]'),
(102757, 'In case you might need more, I went out of my way to fetch a sufficient amount .\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102758, 'This is quite a lot. Sufficient? I??d say this is abundant.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102759, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hide} from  {color,yellow,Rhinoce} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102760, 'Killing useless monsters 3'),
(102761, 'Pie has so much Rhinoce hides that she doesn\'t need Rhinoce anymore. She wants them killed. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102762, 'That should be enough so that we can get rid of the Rhinoce now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102763, 'But if I end up killing all the monsters, what are you going to need your data for? Aren\'t you analyzing them to find out how to kill them best?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102764, 'No, that\'s not it. Even if you keep killing them, [NAME], there will always be new ones. I need you to kill them right here and now so I can be safe, [NAME]. My data will be of great help to other adventurers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102765, '(If she has no reservations saying that it\'s for her own sake, then I don\'t have much left to say.)\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102766, 'Okay, [NAME]. Now go to the {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} and kill some {color,yellow,Rhinoce}, so that I\'ll be safe... and the other adventurers as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, okay, I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I help you?][2]'),
(102767, 'I killed the Rhinoce. But you look like you have another errant for me to run?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102768, '[NAME]! You look excited about the next favor I\'m going to ask you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102769, 'Please kill the {color,yellow,Rhinoce} at the {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102770, 'Investigating Dungeon Rhinoce at Tear\'s Marsh'),
(102771, 'Pie wants to investigate the hides of the Dungeon Rhinoce from Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102772, 'Let\'s see, what I could ask of you this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102773, 'Uhh, hello? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102774, 'I heard there aren\'t only Caimans at Tear`s Marsh but also Rhinoce. If you don\'t mind, could you get me Dungeon Rhinoce hides?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102775, 'Why didn\'t you ask me to get them the last time I went to Tear`s Marsh?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102776, 'If I stocked them ahead of time and they go bad before I start the analysis, I would have to trash them. So I would have to acquire ingredients when I really need them. Now is the time I need {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce hides} from {color,yellow,Tear`s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t stand for this anymore. Find someone else.][2]'),
(102777, 'Hmm. You didn\'t get as many as I thought you would.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102778, 'How many do you need?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102779, 'Please get the hides from {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Juniors} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102780, 'Gathering Dungeon Rhinoce Hides (repeat)'),
(102781, 'Pie needs more Dungeon Rhinoce hides from Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102782, 'The hides from the monsters at Tear`s Marsh strangely spoils quickly, so I need a continous supply.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102783, 'You\'re not telling to go get more hides, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102784, 'How could I? I\'m not so rude that I would continue to  ask you for favors, [NAME]. You must be exhausted because of me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102785, '(Huh? I was ready to burst into anger if she was about to ask for more, but now that she??s speaking like this...)\n\nNo way. It was somewhat of a workout so I??m not exhausted. Well then, until next time.\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102786, 'Good. I thought you were tired and meant to ask someone else but since you say it??s somewhat of a workout for you, would you go to {color,yellow,Tear`s Marsh} and get me some more {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce hides}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m actually pretty exhausted.][2]'),
(102787, 'Well done. But I continuously need Dungeon Rhinoce hides.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102788, 'Please get the hides from {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Juniors} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102790, 'Investigate Mud Men at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102791, 'Pie wants to investigate Mud Men hides from Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102792, 'I\'m done with my analysis so far. This time, hmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102793, 'I figured it??s about time you??d look for me again.\n[NEXT]'),
(102794, 'Were you waiting for me? But my heart??s not ready.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102795, 'That\'s not what I meant. \n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102796, 'What? What are you trying to say? I meant I\'m not ready to ask you to go to {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} and get me {color,yellow,Mud Man hides} yet. I do feel bad because I\'m always asking you for help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Is that what you meant? I\'ll just go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t lie to me.][2]'),
(102797, 'You??ve gathered so many hides. Now I won\'t have to worry about the hides anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102798, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Mud Man Hides} from {color,yellow,Mud Men} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102800, 'Killing useless monsters 4'),
(102801, 'I might have said something that led Pie to a misunderstanding. Talk to Pie to resolve the issue.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102802, 'More over, in regards to what I said earlier??\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102803, 'I know. You find my requests bothersome.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102804, 'Well, rather than bothersome?? \n\n(Argh! What excuse do I give her?)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102805, 'I just wanted to say the hides are important but killing the monsters are just as important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102806, '(What did I just say?)\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102807, 'Actually, that??s what I was thinking and I guess you were thinking the same, [NAME]. Then without any further thoughts, go to {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} to kill {color,yellow,Mud Man}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, that\'s not what I meant.][2]'),
(102808, 'Well done. Now I can continue my analysis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102809, 'Please kill the {color,yellow,Mud Man} at the {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102810, 'Investigate Mantrap Plant at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102811, 'Pie wants to investigate the bark of the Mantrap Plant at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102812, 'This time I\'m going to investigate the Mantrap Plant.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102813, 'Do Mantrap Plants also have hides?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102814, 'No, Mantrap Plants don\'t have hides so I\'ll use their bark. The bark probably functions in the same manner as the hides, so I shouldn??t?? have issues to obtain the data I need.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102815, 'Barks from {color,yellow,Matrap Plants} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, huh?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This time, look for another adventurer.][2]'),
(102816, 'I know that barks break much easier unlike the hides, so I brought a lot.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102817, 'Thank you. So I can count on you for the rest as the usual, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102818, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Mantrap Plant Bark} from {color,yellow,Matrap Plants} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102820, 'Killing useless monsters 5'),
(102821, 'As usual, Pie requests the useless monsters to be killed. She wants Mantrap Plant to be eliminated. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102822, 'By ??as usual??, you are asking me to kill off Mantrap Plant?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102823, 'Yes. We can??t let useless monsters idle about. It\'d be best to get rid of them before they harm other adventurers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102824, '(I get the feeling the life will get harder by abiding to Pie??s request.) \n\n[BUTTON]=[She\'s not wrong though, so I??ll get to it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t be entrapped byr Pie anymore.][2]'),
(102825, 'Well done. As much as you were helping me, [NAME], I worked just as hard to finish my analysis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102826, 'You\'re done with the analysis already? So you\'ll need next ingredients.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102827, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants} at  {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102830, 'Investigate Mandrakes at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102831, 'Pie wants to analyze the bark of Mandrakes Plant at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102832, 'The bark analysis went much faster than that of the hide analysis, so this time I\'ll need Mandrake bark.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102833, 'And this goes without saying that I would be the one to get it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102834, 'I thought about it, and I\'ve been troubling you too much, and you seem to find it bothersome as well. So I decided to ask another adventurer for help from now on, [NAME]. Of course I won??t be able to find someone as trustworthy as you, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102835, 'Well, if that\'s what you think, I guess it can??t be helped. To be honest, I did find it bothersome but I do get experience from it and pay wasn??t bad either, so I don??t hate it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102836, 'If that??s what you think, [NAME], then please go to {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} and get me {color,yellow,Mandrake bark} from  {color,yellow,Mandrake}. If that??s how you really feel, I won\'t feel guilty asking you for help from now on. [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get them but you should feel at least a bit guilty.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Come to think of it again, this isn??t right.][2]'),
(102837, '[NAME], something bad has happened. Really bad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102838, 'What happened? Why are you so flustered?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102839, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Mandrake Bark} from  {color,yellow,Mandrakes} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102840, 'Ingredients exchanged for life.'),
(102841, 'When Pie was attacked by a Caiman, she saved herself by throwing Rhinoce hides at the attacker. Now she??s deficient of the hides. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102842, 'While you were gone, [NAME], a Caiman came around here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102843, 'A Caiman? You??re not hurt, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102844, 'No. Thankfully I redirected the Caiman by throwing Rhinoce hides at it, but now I don\'t have enough Rhinoce hides.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102845, 'I\'m just glad that you didn??t get hurt, Pie. I can always get more ingredients.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102846, 'So, anyway. Do you think you could get me more {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hides] from   {color,yellow,Rhinoce}? You might even be able to get it from the {color,yellow,Caimans} who took it from me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It can??t be helped. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[But Pie, you\'re the one who threw away the hide!][2]'),
(102847, 'I got the hide back. What??s with that look on your face? Did you get attack by another Caiman?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102848, 'Oh, [NAME]. It\'s just that I??m hungry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102849, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hides} from  {color,yellow,Rhinoce} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. You might even be able to get them from the {color,yellow,Caimans} who took it from me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102850, 'I cannot analyze with an empty stomach'),
(102851, 'Pie is hungry because she\'s been continuing her analysis. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102852, 'Isn\'t there anyone nearby who would share some food?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102853, 'The closest person would be Cleo. Do you want me to go and ask her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102854, 'I\'d be grateful if you did that. But could you hurry? I just remembered that I didn\'t have a single bite during last few days researching hides and barks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll hurry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hold on. The swamp messed up my shoes.][2]'),
(102855, 'Hello, Cleo. I\'m sorry for showing up so unexpectedly but do you happen to have something to eat?\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102856, 'Something to eat? You\'re going around without even eating these days, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102857, 'Oh! It??s not me. Pie hasn\'t eaten anything in a few days. Would you mind sharing some if you had any?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102858, 'Really? That\'s a shame. She should have stocked up as soon as her rations were low.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102859, 'I wonder if {color,yellow,Cleo} will really have something to eat?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102860, 'Bring me Caiman meat.'),
(102861, 'Cleo says that if you want food, she wants Caiman meat for herself. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102862, 'It??s a shame, but it??s not as if I have abundance of emergency rations either.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102863, 'Isn??t there a way? Or let me know who has a lot of emergency rations?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102864, 'Since you??re asking me, I guess it can??t be helped. It??s not as I have a lot to spare, but I??ll give you my emergency ration if you fetch me some ingredients.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102865, 'You would do that? What do you want me to bring you then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102866, 'There\'s not much to eat nearby, so I was eating dried meat as well. I can make emergency rations with {color,yellow,Caiman meat} found in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} so go get some for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be back in a hurry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Isn??t there something else I can get you?][2]'),
(102867, 'I brought a lot on purpose. You won??t have to worry about meat for a while with this much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102868, 'You??ve obviously never dried meat before if you think this is a lot. If you dry the meat, it shrinks quite a lot from the original quantity.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102869, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Caiman Meat} from  {color,yellow,Caiman} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102870, 'A weak stomach'),
(102871, 'Cleo was willing to share her rations but she warns not o tell Pie the identity of the emergency ration knowing that Pie has a weak stomach. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102872, 'Do you think Pie will eat dried Caiman meat?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102873, 'Considering how ravenous she was earlier, she would even chew stones.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102874, 'That\'s just because you haven\'t had dried crocodile meat before, [NAME]. It\'s more pungent that you\'d think. Well, some people find it repulsive simply because it\'s crocodile meat. If Pie finds out what it is, she might choose to starve instead.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102875, 'Well then, I??ll just lie to her that it\'s dried mushrooms. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102876, 'I don\'t know if she\'ll believe that but I guess it\'s better than collapsing from hunger. Give it a shot. Even if she finds out that it\'s Caiman meat later, you can deal with that later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get back to Pie before she collapses.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Pie might know the identity of this meat.][2]'),
(102877, 'I managed to get some food. Here, have some of this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102878, 'Oh, [NAME]! I??m hallucinating because of the hunger. You\'ve never looked so handsome before.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102879, 'Lie that the Caiman meat is dried mushroom and bring it to {color,yellow,Pie}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102880, 'New mineral'),
(102881, 'The mineral has a significant wear and Pie has requested new mineral from Franz. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102882, '*Munch-Munch-Slurp-Slurp* How are these mushrooms dried? It??s amazing that mushroom can taste like this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102883, 'Eat slowly. There??s no medicine for upset stomach either.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102884, 'That\'s alright. Mushrooms are healthy, so even if I upset my stomach, it will go down on its own. But while I\'m eating, could you fetch new mineral from Franz?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102885, 'New mineral?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102886, '*Munch-Munch-Slurp-Slurp* I used the wondrous mineral so much that it\'s worn out. I already requested for a new mineral with {color,yellow,Storage Keeper Franz} at {color,yellow,Burning Rock}, so all you have to do is go get it. Anyhow, these mushrooms are really tasty.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll go so eat slowly.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Say what? I was watching you eat and I didn??t hear you.][2]'),
(102887, 'Hello! I\'m here to get the mineral Pie requested.\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(102888, '[NAME]! Something bad has happened. I messed up again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102889, 'Go see {color,yellow,Storeage Keeper Franz} at {color,yellow,Burning Rock} and fetch the new mineral. *Munch-Munch-Slurp-Slurp* \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102890, 'Another lost order'),
(102891, 'Once again, Franz lost the mineral at the Burning Cave. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102892, 'Calm down and tell me slowly. You lost the mineral again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102893, 'I waited for a while and no one came to pick up the mineral, so I went out to deliver on my own. Unfortunately, I ran into a Crystal Guardian near Swamp of Dawn and took shelter in a nearby cave. That cave happened to be Burning Cave yet again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102894, 'So Rock Stone has the mineral again?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102895, '{color,yellow,Rock Stone} at the {color,yellow,Burning Cave} might have it. If you don\'t mind, could you go get the mineral yourself, [NAME]? After all, this all happened because you were late, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I\'ll go get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What? How is this my fault?][2]'),
(102896, 'I got the mineral.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102897, 'Thank you for helping me with even this kind of task. But there are some strange stains on the mineral.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102898, 'I\'m sorry but please go to {color,yellow,Burning Cave} in my place and get {color,yellow,Wondrous Mineral} from {color,yellow,Rock Stones}. When you find it, please take it to {color,yellow,Pie} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102900, 'Mineral cleaning hide'),
(102901, 'Pie needs some soft Caiman Junior hides to clean the stains off the mineral. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102902, 'Is there something on Wondrous Mineral?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102903, 'I??m not sure if it??s dirt or stone dust but there\'s a lot of weird things on the mineral. I specifically told Franz to take a good care of it since it\'s so valuable.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102904, '(I guess Rock Stone??s dust got on it.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102905, 'If I use a cloth to wipe it off, I\'m afraid I might scratch the mineral. Ah! {color,yellow,Caiman Junior} hides are pretty soft and they would wipe well. Can you get me a few of finest {color,yellow,Soft Hides}? With that, I should be able to clean the mineral without scratching it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I see. I\'ll get them for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It doesn\'t seem so bad, so just use a cloth to wipe it.][2]'),
(102906, 'I got some hides but I don\'t have a good eye for these things. I\'m not sure whether these would suffice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102907, 'These are pretty soft, you made the right decision. Actually, I don\'t know either which ones are really soft.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102908, 'Please get {color,yellow,soft hides} from  {color,yellow,Caiman Juniors}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102910, 'For sake of serious analysis'),
(102911, 'To get serious with her analysis Pie wants nearby monsters killed. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102912, 'I\'d like to get serious with my analysis, so in the meantime, would you kill off all the nearby monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102913, 'Of course I??d help if they??re interrupting your analysis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102914, 'After all, I can only focus on the analysis once my safety has been secured. So please kill nearby {color,yellow,Caiman}, {color,yellow,Caiman Junior}, and  {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of them so you can work in comfort.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Couldn\'t you just do your analysis at a safer location?][2]'),
(102915, 'I killed quite a lot of monsters, you should be safe now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102916, '(Is concentrating on the wondrous mineral and the monster hides.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102917, 'Hey! Did you hear what I said?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102918, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Caiman}, {color,yellow,Caiman Junior}, and {color,yellow,Lava Gargoyle}, so I can concentrate with my analysis.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102920, 'Investigate the strongest monster at Tear\'s Marsh'),
(102921, 'Pie needs hides from Dungeon Caiman Giant and Dungeon Rhinoce Lord at Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102922, 'Ah, [NAME]! I\'m finally done with my analysis of Caiman and Rhinoce. But of course I still have to analyze the Giant and the Lord.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102923, 'By any chance, are you referring to Dungeon Caiman Giant and Dungeon Rhinoce Lord at Tear\'s Marsh?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102924, 'Impressive, [NAME]. You always know what you need to do. As mentioned [NAME], this time I need the {color,yellow,hides} from {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow.Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow, Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Those monsters are a bit strong, so take your time while you wait for me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too young to die.][2]'),
(102925, 'It took some time because those monsters are strong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102926, 'You\'re back already? I thought it would take you longer but you??ve returned really quickly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102927, 'Please get the hides from the {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102930, 'Investigate the strongest monster at Tear\'s Marsh (repeat)'),
(102931, 'Pie needs more hides from the Dungeon Caiman Giant and Dungeon Rhinoce Lord at Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102932, 'You\'re back faster than I expected, and accordingly, you only brought a little bit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102933, 'Those monsters are quite strong. I went through quite a bit of trouble to get even these.\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102934, 'Hmm. What do I do? I still don\'t have enough  {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} {color,yellow, hides} from {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go back once again.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t be able to help you with that.][2]'),
(102935, 'Would this much suffice?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102936, 'Hold on. So??\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102937, 'Please get the hides from the {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102940, 'Killing the strongest monster at Tear\'s Marsh'),
(102941, 'Cleo says there can only be peace at Swamp of Dawn if  Dungeon Caiman Giant and Dungeon Rhinoce Lord at Tear\'s Marsh are killed. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102942, '[NAME]. I heard you\'re helping Pie with her research these days?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102943, 'Yes, I\'m getting hides for her so she can analyze them with her wondrous mineral. How did you know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102944, 'There??s hardly anyone who doesn??t know that you\'re rampaging about Swamp of Dawn, [NAME]. I even know that you recently went to Tear\'s Marsh.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102945, 'I get whatever Pie needs as long as it??s within my means.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102946, 'Monster hides don??t have much to do with me but  {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow.Tear\'s Marsh} are the most dangerous monsters even here. So aside from getting their hides, I would like them to be killed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes. Well, I??ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to go there anymore.][2]'),
(102947, 'I know those monsters are quite strong, so how was it facing them yourself?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102948, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102950, 'Killing the strongest monster at Tear\'s Marsh (repeat)'),
(102951, 'Cleo says for sake of peace Swamp of Dawn must rid of more Dungeon Caiman Giant and Dungeon Rhinoce Lord at Tear\'s Marsh. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102952, 'They were strong but they were doable monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102953, 'Yeah? That??s a relief. Even if you wipe them out once, more would return so I was planning to ask you to continue your efforts.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102954, 'You\'re asking me to continue killing monsters?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102955, 'You just said they weren\'t that strong. Don??t be like that and for sake of peace in Swamp of Dawn, kill {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow.Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Tear`s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes. Well, I??ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to go there anymore.][2]'),
(102956, 'I??ve returned from killing the monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102957, 'So? They??re still doable, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102958, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Dungeon Caiman Giant} and {color,yellow,Dungeon Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Tear\'s Marsh}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102960, 'Investigate Wereboars at Swamp of Dawn'),
(102961, 'Pie wants to analyze the hides of the Wereboars from Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102962, 'I haven\'t seen you in quite some time, [NAME]. How have you been?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102963, 'I??ve been well. So what\'s up? You seem different today.\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(102964, 'Different? You make me sound as a person who changes attitude each time she needs a favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102965, 'Which means you??re looking for yet another favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102966, 'It\'s true that I need {color,yellow,Wereboar Hide} from {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} but that\'s not why I\'m being so kind to you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I\'ll get them for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So you don??t need the hides?][2]'),
(102967, 'I got the hides. And if it??s hides you need, just ask like you always do. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102968, 'Hmm, actually, there is a bigger problem than the hides.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102969, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Wereboar Hide} from  {color,yellow,Wereboar} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102970, 'Vines to fixate the tall grass.'),
(102971, 'Pie is worried that grasses hiding her are withering because she\'s been in one location for too long. She needs some vines to pull up the weeds. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102972, 'Actually, I\'m worried because all the grasses around me are withering. They used to safely hide me from the monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102973, 'Why not relocate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102974, 'I thought about it but I can\'t let the monsters find this place. If they pick up my scent here, they might be able to find me and if I burn everything here, that might lead to even greater danger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102975, 'That sounds plausible. So what can I do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102976, ' I\'m trying to pull the grasses back up, so I need the {color,yellow,Vine} from {color,yellow,Mantrap Plant} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. I??ll try to hold out with the vines somehow.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about you just relocate?][2]'),
(102977, 'I got the vines but do you really think you can fixate the withered grasses with this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102978, 'I have to give it a shot.\nI have no idea how my life ended up like this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102979, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} and get the {color,yellow,vine} from {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102980, 'Cleo doesn??t get attacked by monsters'),
(102981, 'Pie is curious how Cleo isn\'t being attacked by monsters when she isn??t even hiding. She wants to know how Cleo does it. Let??s talk to Pie first.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102982, 'I feel miserable trying to fixate these grasses with vines. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102983, 'Aren??t you overdoing it, Pie?  Cleo isn\'t even hiding and the monsters don\'t attack her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102984, 'Really? There are people who doesn??t get attacked from monsters without hiding?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102985, 'She must be as strong as you are, [NAME]. That must be why she doesn\'t have to hide like me or fear monsters?? attack.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102986, 'I might be mistaken but she didn??t looked that strong. It seemed like there??s something she relies on.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Should I find out?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[For now, fixate the other side a bit more.][2]'),
(102987, 'What??s up? You wouldn\'t come to see me without a reason.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102988, 'There??s something I??m curious about. Mind if I ask you right now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102989, '{color,yellow,Cleo}, do you really know how to prevent monsters from attacking you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102990, 'A fragrance the monsters dislike'),
(102991, 'Cleo says there??s an herb that can produce a fragrance monsters dislike from Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102992, 'What do you want to know?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102993, 'Pie is nervous that nearby monsters will attack her. But you\'re not hiding like Pie does, Cleo, and monsters don??t seem to attack you. So I figured I??d ask how you do it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102994, 'What? Don??t tell me there are still people who doesn??t know this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102995, 'Yeah? Does that mean there is a method to curb monsters?\n\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(102996, 'Maybe Pie doesn\'t know because she\'s just got here. If you take a closer look at the {color,yellow,Herb} around here, you\'ll notice there is a fragrance called {color,yellow,Monkil}. The monsters dislike that smell and won\'t come near it. So people around here all spray that fragrance upon ourselves.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll need to find them quickly.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What, do you expect me to believe that?][2]'),
(102997, 'I asked her and she said that all the people here are using this fragrance. The monsters don\'t attack them because they dislike it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102998, 'So something like this did exist. Thank you for looking into it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102999, 'I should be able to get {color,yellow,Monkil} from the {color,yellow,Herb} here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103000, 'Dual Safety Feature'),
(103001, 'Pie is too nervous to be satisfied just with the herb alone. She also wants some more materials to hide herself with the withering grasses. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103002, 'Thank you so much for getting me the fragrance but I\'ll still need to fixate the grasses after all. I\'m just too nervous to trust in the herb alone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103003, 'Well, that won??t be necessary but it won??t hurt to have dual safety features. More over, do you think the vines alone are sufficient enough to fixate the grasses?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103004, 'I was actually just waiting for you, [NAME], because of that. The grasses are too withered to be straightened up, so I need something to raise them. I was thinking about using the {color,yellow,Staff}  {color,yellow,Mandrake} carries around. Could you get me some?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just use the fragrance. What a bother.][2]'),
(103005, 'You got me the staff. Now I can resume my research in safety. Thank you so much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103006, 'Please get me {color,yellow,Mandrake Staff} from  {color,yellow,Mandrakes} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103010, 'Renewed Crisis [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103011, 'After Eglack and Salare were defeated in battle, they have returned to Burning Adealia much stronger. Let??s talk to Town Chief Guiltian.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103012, 'I can\'t believe that Eglack and Salare have returned to Burning Adealia even stronger after they were defeated.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103013, 'What are you saying? Didn\'t Eglack and Salare withdraw from Burning Adealia?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(103014, 'That\'s what I thought but according to Marlene\'s report, they\'ve returned to Burning Adealia [HARD] with even stronger troops. That\'s why I\'ve decided to take the villagers and attack Burning Adealia as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103015, 'Is there anything I can do to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103016, 'Actually, I just received Marlene\'s report and haven\'t had the chance to tell the villagers about Burning Adealia yet. While I try to convince the villagers, I\'d be grateful if you could take care of the {color,yellow,Corrupted Spearman} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Ranger} to open a way out.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I got it. Trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What, do you expect me to believe that?][2]'),
(103017, 'What do you think? Did the soldiers get much stronger?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103018, 'I don\'t know how they were trained, but they were much stronger. Thankfully, I was able to complete the task, though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103019, 'Please go ahead to {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]} and kill the {color,yellow,Corrupted Spearman} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Ranger}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103020, 'People who needs to be convinced [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103021, 'Town Chief Guiltian discovered that his people didn\'t respond too well. He asks you to kill other monsters while he tries to convince the villagers. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103022, 'My problem is that the villagers didn\'t take it too well. I need some more time to convince them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103023, 'I was already expecting that. Even though much time has passed, it surely wasn\'t enough for anyone to forget the terror Eglack and Salare caused.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103024, 'Yes. You might be right. \nBut it would be shameful thing to only rely on Henneath alliance once again and do nothing. So I??ll try to convince the villages a bit more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103025, 'Should I keep attacking Burning Adealia in the meantime?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103026, 'I\'m sorry to ask this of you but please eliminate  {color,yellow,Corrupted Knuckleman} and  {color,yellow,Corrupted Ranger}. The less monsters there are, easier it would be to convince the villagers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I got it. Trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m sorry but can\'t I do that later?][2]'),
(103027, 'I killed the monsters. Were you successful, too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103028, 'I??d like to congratulate you for your victory but I??d have to apologize to you first.\nI??m sorry and thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103029, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]} and kill {color,yellow,Corrupted Knuckleman} and {color,yellow,Corrupted Ranger} while I convince the villagers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103030, 'I\'ll leave it to you [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103031, 'In the end, Town Chief Guiltian didn\'t manage to convince the villagers. He wants you to kill Eglack. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103032, 'So you couldn\'t convince the villagers after all.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103033, 'I\'m sorry. I really wanted us to defend the village with our own hands, but once again, I\'d need to rely on you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103034, 'I??m alright. After all, this all happened because I didn??t do it right first time around. This time, I??ll kill Eglack once and for all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103035, 'That\'s what I wanted to ask of you anyway. One of the main reasons I couldn\'t convince the villagers was actually Eglack. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(103036, 'I see. I\'ll make sure to deal with {color,yellow,Eglack} at{color,yellow,Burning Adealia} once and for all.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll be on my way then.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I need to shop a bit before I go.][2]'),
(103037, 'You made it back safe. You have no idea how worried I was about you while you were at Burning Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103038, 'No need to worry anymore. Eglack won\'t be attacking Adealia ever again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103039, 'Thank you. Really, thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103040, 'Defeat  {color,yellow,Eglack} at {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]}, so we can sever this tenacious tie.  [BUTTON]=[Continue][1] [MENU]'),
(103050, 'Returned treasure [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103051, 'Guild Manager Bunis shows great interest in appearance of even stronger Burning Adealia. He is interested in the Dark Lich??s Cape. Let??s talk to him.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103052, 'Hey, [NAME]. You heard the news, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103053, 'That Eglack and Salare returned to Burning Adealia with an even stronger army?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103054, 'Right, that\'s what I meant. Seems I was the last one to hear of that. But if they brought stronger monsters, that means that the Dark Lich must have returned stronger as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103055, 'I suppose.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103056, 'You suppose? If {color,yellow,Dark Lich} is stronger, that means {color,yellow,Dark Lich??s Capes} would be more powerful as well. I thought the information I had received was a lie but now that I think about it, it may have referred to this Cape.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll leave right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You fell for it last time, and believe that again?][2]'),
(103057, 'Good, did you get the Dark Lich??s Cape? I was counting the days with my fingers for your return.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103058, 'I got them but they look like old capes any vagabonds would use.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103059, 'Experiment would tell. Well, let??s see.\n(Guild Manager Bunis puts the cape on and approaches the fire.)\n\nHuh? Can this cape really block evil magic? It doesn\'t feel like... Argh! Ow, that\'s hot! This cape is wrong as well! I was stupid to trust all those lies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103060, '(If Guild Manager Bunis thinks the cape blocks evil magic, why does he keep testing it against fire?}\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103061, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]} and get  {color,yellow,Dark Lich??s Cape} from {color,yellow,Dark Lich}. This is an important item, so you have to handle it with care.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103070, 'Much desired item [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103071, 'Guild Manager Bunis wants to get his hands on Salare\'s Sickle at the even more powerful Burning Adealia. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103072, 'I\'m certain that there\'s something special, more powerful about Salare\'s Sickle as well. Treasure hunter like me wouldn??t miss it. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103073, 'Is your instinct to collect as a treasure hunter kicking in again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103074, 'How would I ignore an appearance of such a rare item? Please get me Salare\'s Sickle from the even more powerful Burning Adealia. I\'ll reward you handsomely.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103075, 'You really need to get your hands on everything you set your eyes on, don\'t you, Guild Manager Bunis?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You fell for it once and you believe that again?][2]'),
(103076, 'Did you get my sickle? I was counting the days with my fingers for your return. From Burning Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103077, 'I got it but considering how difficult it was, it doesn\'t look like much. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(103078, 'Don\'t judge this treasure with the eyes of a regular person. That??s an insult to the treasure. \nYou don\'t even know what a treasure is.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103079, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]} and get {color,yellow,Salare\'s Sickle} from {color,yellow,Salare}. I really want it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103080, 'Why they became more powerful [Burning Adealia HARD]'),
(103081, 'Edwina says the monsters at Burning Adealia have become stronger through Evil Badges infused with evil energy. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103082, 'This is bad. Evil Badges have to be destroyed quickly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103083, 'Edwina, what are you mumbling to yourself? Are you researching something again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103084, 'Ah, [NAME]! You know that Eglack and Salare returned to Burning Adealia with an even stronger monsters, right? I did some research and it??s most probably that the monsters became stronger through their Evil Badges.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103085, 'Evil Badges? Doesn??t that makes you forget all pain and fear, turning you into a berserker?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103086, 'I found out in my research that the energy of the Evil Badge can amplify the evil power as well. Evil Badges that we couldn??t collect last time are causing the monsters to grow stronger. If we don\'t act now, even more powerful monsters would occupy Burning Adealia in no time. We have to collect all {color,yellow,Evil Badge} from the monsters at {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]} before that happens.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I see. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This seems too difficult for me.][2]'),
(103087, 'Did you get all the Evil Badges?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103088, 'I brought as many as I can carry. There were so many monsters so I couldn??t carry them all at once.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103089, 'Please collect the {color,yellow,Evil Badges} before the stronger monsters occupy {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103090, 'Why they became more powerful [Burning Adealia HARD] (repeat)'),
(103091, 'Edwina says the monsters at Burning Adealia have become stronger through Evil Badges infused with evil energy. He wants badges to be collected continuously. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103092, 'We have to collect the Evil Badges before the monsters become even stronger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103093, 'I understand Don\'t worry, I know what\'s at stake.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103094, 'I\'m sorry. This work is just so important that I cannot help but rush you . I hope you\'ll understand how important it is to get {color,yellow,Evil Badges} from the monsters at {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I\'ll go get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This is too difficult for me.][2]'),
(103095, 'Did you get all the Evil Badges?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103096, 'I brought as many as I can carry. There were so many monsters so I couldn??t carry them all at once.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103097, 'Please collect the {color,yellow,Evil Badges} before the stronger monsters occupy {color,yellow,Burning Adealia [HARD]}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103100, 'Investigate Ping Pig at Swamp of Dawn.'),
(103101, 'Pie wants to investigate Ping Pig at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103102, 'I would like to investigate Ping Pig in the north this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103103, 'Ping Pig? That monster looks strong.\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(103104, 'Yeah? I thought it was cute. Anyhow, I need Ping Pig??s Hide in order to investigate Ping Pig.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103105, 'By any chance, are you scared of Ping Pig?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103106, 'Scared? I??m a member of Brave Hennis Adventurers. They\'re merely pigs. I??ll get all of the {color,yellow,Ping Pig??s Hide} from the {color,yellow,Ping Pig} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Trust me and wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even so, I should gain more levels, right?][2]'),
(103107, 'You got the hide.\nFirst I was a bit worried, but I knew you would return safely since I know all to well how skilled you are.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103108, 'Get me {color,yellow,Ping Pig??s Hide} from {color,yellow,Ping Pig} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103110, 'Killing useless monsters 6'),
(103111, 'Pie wants Ping Pigs killed to stop them trampling about Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103112, 'However, the Ping Pig is quite strong. Even I was in danger a number of times.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103113, 'Hmm. If they??re such a dangerous enemy, they should be killed off before something happens.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103114, 'It would take a while since it??s a strong enemy, okay? It??s not as if the analysis is complete.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103115, 'I should be okay since I probably don??t need to ask for the hides for a while.So [NAME], please kill {color,yellow,Ping Pig} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Trust me and wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even so, I should gain more levels, right?][2]'),
(103116, 'Hey you there!\nWhat was your name?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103117, '(After looking around,)\nAre you referring to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103118, 'Yes! You! Your name was [NAME], right?\nCome here for a bit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103119, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Ping Pig} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103120, 'Needless advice'),
(103121, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants to say something. Let??s hear him out.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103122, 'I was curious who you were since I hear of you around Swamp of Dawn these days, but you seem smaller than I thought.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103123, 'Humph! Did you think I would look like a hulking monster?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(103124, 'Exactly, I truly thought you would look like a hulking monster. Otherwise, rumors about you were simply unbelievable.\nA hero who goes in and out of Swamp of Dawn as if it were a home.\nI know rumors are a bit exaggerated, but it was too much when it came to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103125, 'It??s safe to say you??re picking a fight with me, right?\n\n[EMOTION][11]\n[NEXT]'),
(103126, 'If that??s how I came off, I apologize. I was passing comments about your look, but I was not underestimating your skill. Let me tell you this, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103127, 'This may be unnecessary word of advice, but you will regret it one day if you underestimate Swamp of Dawn believing in your skill alone. So if you really are skilled, it??s more of a reason for you to be humble.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103128, 'Thanks for the advice. However, you should know there is strength that??s recognized by all no matter how humble one becomes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103129, 'I also appreciate that needless advice. Also, we??ll see if you possess such a strength you??ve mentioned in due time. So don??t overdo it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103130, 'Sudden increase of Mandrake'),
(103131, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union says it??s difficult to stand watch with the sudden increase of Mandrakes. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103132, 'How do I kill this many Mandrakes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103133, 'Is there a problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103134, 'Recently it??s been difficult to defend this location due to the sudden increase of Mandrakes. Of course we regularly kill Mandrakes, but given time, and never this many spawns. So there??s not much that can be done about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103135, 'Should I help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103136, 'Really? Will you really kill off the Mandrakes?\nYou do know how strong of a monster a Mandrake is, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103137, 'I killed {color,yellow,Mandrakes} several times before at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, so it shouldn??t be a much of a problem.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you can??t trust me, just keep on worrying.][2]'),
(103138, 'Did you really kill off Mandrakes? It should have been quite a powerful monster.\n\n[NEXT]"'),
(103139, 'I told you. I??ve killed them a number of times before. Also, to be honest, it??s not that tough of a monster either.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103140, 'I see. Then may I ask for another favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103141, 'Can you really kill {color,yellow,Mandrakes} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103150, 'Gather Firewood.'),
(103151, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union started a fire to stop the Mandrake??s invasion. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103152, 'Is there anything else you need?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103153, 'Truth to be told, the fire is lit as you can see on the side to stop Mandrake??s invasion. Monkil was used before, but this is more effective since wood based monsters are more scared of being burned. However, I have not been able to gather firewood due to other tasks given to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103154, 'You want me to gather Firewood, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103155, 'I don??t mean to trouble you, so if you have time, get me {color,yellow,Mandrake??s Staff} from {color,yellow,Mandrake} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. Nothing else is more appropriate than firewood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So I??m not cutting down trees?][2]'),
(103156, 'Wow! You brought a lot of staves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103157, 'Hnngh. Don??t just watch and take some of these staves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103158, 'S-Sorry. Heavy, right? Even so, I wouldn??t have to worry about firewood for a while with this much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103159, 'Get me {color,yellow,Mandrake??s Staff} from {color,yellow,Mandrake} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} for firewood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103160, 'Supplies thief Mud Man'),
(103161, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union is troubled by Mud Men stealing Supply Boxes. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103162, 'Mud Man stole a Supplies Box yet again while we were fending off the Mandrakes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103163, 'Hi. There are a lot of boxes here.\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(103164, 'Sigh. I am worried because of these boxes. If we??re watching Mandrakes for a bit, a Mud Man appears from somewhere to steal the boxes in stealth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103165, 'If we fend off the Mandrakes, Mud Men steals the boxes, and if we watch for Mud Men, the Mandrakes attacks. I??m really not sure what to do about this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103166, 'Then should I help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103167, 'Yeah? Then can you retrieve the {color,yellow, Supplies Box} from the {color,yellow,Mud Men} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}? Meanwhile, I??ll stand guard here to prevent the Mud Men from stealing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??m weak so I can??t pick up heavy stuff.][2]'),
(103168, 'You retrieved it already? Quite impressive!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103169, 'Retrieve the {color,yellow,Supplies Box} from the {color,yellow,Mud Men} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103170, 'Vine to fixate the box'),
(103171, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union needs some vines to tie up the Supply Boxes. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103172, 'The Supply Boxes have been recovered, but something has to be done to prevent Mud Man from stealing again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103173, 'I saw that Mantrap Plant has vines, so how about we tie it up with that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103174, 'That??s not a bad idea! I had a similar thought, but since I don??t have anywhere to acquire vines or ropes, I was just mulling over the idea.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103175, '[NAME], since we??re on the topic, get me some {color,yellow,Vines} from the {color,yellow,Mantrap Plant} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. In the meantime, I??ll guard these boxes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll guard the boxes instead.][2]'),
(103176, 'Would this much suffice?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103177, 'Who knows? I??d have to tie up all the boxes to find out. Good work on gathering the vines. Go take a break for a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103178, 'Since we??re on the topic, let me get some {color,yellow,Vines} from the {color,yellow,Mantrap Plant} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} to tie up the boxes.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103180, 'Wereboar that watches Watson'),
(103181, 'Something urgent came up, but Possessed Adventurer Watson can??t do anything because Wereboars are watching him. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103182, 'Hey! Here! Over here! Approach me without alerting Wereboars.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103183, 'What??s up, Watson?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103184, 'I have an urgent matter to attend to right now, but I can??t take care of it because of the Wereboars. Kill the Wereboars so I can quickly handle the urgent matter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103185, 'What??s the urgent matter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103186, 'Every second counts, and it??s truly urgent. So quickly kill the {color,yellow,Wereboars} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll kill it right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So what??s the urgent matter?][2]'),
(103187, 'Phew, I??m saved. That was too close.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103188, 'What was the urgent matter you are fussing that much over?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103189, 'It??s embarrassing. Do you really have to keep asking?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103190, 'It??s truly urgent. Kill {color,yellow,Wereboars} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103200, 'Delicious Pork.'),
(103201, 'Cleo is sick of alligator meat. She wants Ping Pig??s meat. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103202, '[NAME]. Do me a favor if you??re not busy. It should be pretty easy for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103203, 'Favor? What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103204, 'It??s no big deal. I??m just sick of only eating alligator meat, so I want to eat some other meat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103205, 'I heard there??s a monster called the {color,yellow,Ping Pig} to north of {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, so can you get some {color,yellow,Ping Pig??s Meat}? I??m craving pork since it??s been a while.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Eww. How would a human eat that?][2]'),
(103206, 'I got it since you asked for it, but are you really going to eat it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103207, 'Say what? There??s this delicious looking pork in front of you. Today, we??re having a BBQ party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103208, 'I heard there??s a monster called the {color,yellow,Ping Pig} to north of {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, so can you get some {color,yellow,Ping Pig??s Meat}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103210, 'Deliver Analysis Data'),
(103211, 'Pie wants to deliver the up-to-date analysis data to Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103212, '[NAME]. Can you deliver my up-to-date analysis data to Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103213, 'We??ll finally adapt the analysis data in real combat. But of all people, why Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union? I don??t particularly want to help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103214, 'Sounds like you had an incident with Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union without my knowing. Even so, lives depend on it so it??s not as if we can ignore the Hunter`s Union.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103215, 'If it bothers you that much, think of it as delivering for sake of others, since {color,yellow,Hugues} isn??t the only one in the {color,yellow,Hunter`s Union}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll deliver it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, they??ll figure out something on their own.][2]'),
(103216, 'I brought the Analysis Document from Pie.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103217, 'You brought it after all.\nI??ll look at the Analysis Document first, so please be quiet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103218, 'Deliver the analysis data to {color,yellow,Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103220, 'Skill Confirmation 1'),
(103221, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union has a question regarding Pie??s Analysis Document. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103222, 'Hmm! This is quite a useful Analysis Document. It should be helpful to us. However??\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103223, 'Is there a problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103224, 'I can??t help but doubt one thing since the Analysis Document is so impressive.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103225, 'Doubt? Pie??s analysis content is accurate. I can vouch for her as I have provided her the materials.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103226, 'I??m not doubting Pie??s Analysis Document, but I am doubting you. In order to aid this much with the investigation, skill of such accordance would be required. However, I don??t know much about you yet. So in order to confirm your skill, go kill a few {color,yellow,Wereboars} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. Then I would be able to trust this Analysis Document.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll prove it to you if you insist.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Give back the Analysis Document if you don??t trust me.][2]'),
(103227, 'I would trust the Wereboar data for now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103228, 'Kill {color,yellow,Wereboars} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} to prove this Analysis Document is correct.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103230, 'Skill Confirmation 2'),
(103231, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union is once again curious about the Analysis Document. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103232, 'Pie put her life on the line for that analysis. If you don??t trust it, just give back the Analysis Document.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103233, 'I repeat once again, but it??s not Pie??s Analysis Document I don??t trust. It??s you whom I don??t trust.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103234, 'What don??t you trust so much?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(103235, 'The end of the Analysis Document was in regards to the Ping Pig. This time, go kill a few {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. If you??re successful this time as well, I??ll acknowledge your skill as well as the Analysis Document.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll prove it to you if you insist.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Hand over the analysis data if you don??t trust me.][2]'),
(103236, 'Now do you trust me and Pie??s Analysis Document?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103237, 'Since it turned out this way, I must trust it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103238, 'Kill {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} to prove this Analysis Document is correct.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103240, 'Invisible Danger'),
(103241, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union acknowledges your skill but recommends against carelessly roaming about Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103242, 'I acknowledge your skill, but I do not recommend carelessly roam about Swamp of Dawn. There are enemies scarier than monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103243, 'Quit condescending on me. I know there are monsters stronger than Ping Pigs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103244, 'Condescend? You still don??t know what the most truly fearsome enemy here is. I won??t be responsible if you turn into Scared Adventurer Royden after roaming about without fear.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103245, 'Speaking of which, why aren??t you rescuing Royden? It??s not as if he??s far from here. You should be plenty capable of rescuing him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103246, 'If that\'s true, then why aren??t you rescuing Royden? If you are so confident, you should rescue him yourself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103247, 'I didn??t expect that from you. I??m disappointed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103250, 'Hugues?? Intention'),
(103251, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union wants to tell you something after hearing your conversation with Hugues of the Hunter??s Union. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103252, '[NAME]. Let??s chat for a bit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103253, 'Is there something you want to tell me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103254, '[NAME], I heard you talking with Hugues, and [NAME], you seem to misunderstand something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103255, 'Misunderstand? What did I misunderstand?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(103256, 'Hugues may seem indifferent, but he??s actually pretty kindhearted. I also want you to know we attempted to rescue Royden quite a number of times.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103257, 'So why is Royden still standing in middle of the swamp?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103258, 'You??ll eventually find out the details, so don??t hate Hugues so much. He also wants to go rescue Royden, but urgency here disables him to do so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103259, 'I know that matters are urgent here, but I still don??t think this is right.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103260, 'What can be done for Royden'),
(103261, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union says there is a way to help Scared Adventurer Royden. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103262, 'How about killing off Wereboars nearby if you really want to help Royden?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103263, 'Wereboars? Would it really help Royden to kill off Wereboars instead of directly helping him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103264, 'Don??t worry too much in regards to the rescue. We??ll be executing a plan to rescue Royden in near future. [NAME], wouldn??t we be able to initiate the plan quicker if you kill Wereboars ahead of time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I??ll kill Wereboars for now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That alone should be insufficient to resolve it all.][2]'),
(103265, 'I??ve returned from killing Wereboars.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103266, 'Yeah? Then I will talk to Hugues to see if we can work on rescuing Royden a bit earlier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103267, 'First, kill {color,yellow,Wereboars} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} for Royden??s safety.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103270, 'GatherMonkil'),
(103271, 'Scared Adventurer Royden ran out of the Monkil provided by Hunter??s Union, so he is asking for some more. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103272, 'Thanks for coming. I was waiting for you, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103273, 'Do you need a favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103274, 'Hunter`s Union gave me some Monkil, but I realized I was almost out when I tried to spray them today. I was actually pretty scared, so I sprayed more than what Hunter`s Union suggested, and that must be why I??m out already. So [NAME], can you get me some {color,yellow,Monkil} from {color,yellow,Herbs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}? I??ll be sure to use them sparingly this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get them right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just leave the swamp with me.][2]'),
(103275, 'Would this much do?\n[NEXT]'),
(103276, 'Oh! You brought it already. Quickly, give me Monkil. I have to spray more before Wereboars approach me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103277, 'Get me some {color,yellow,Monkil} from {color,yellow,Herb} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. I might get killed by the monsters at this rate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103280, 'Escape Attempt'),
(103281, 'Royden is hesitant to escape because he??s scared of something. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103282, 'Instead of that, reach out to the Hunter`s Union to escape from here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103283, 'Uh, thing is??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103284, 'Royden, you told me you wanted to go home. Instead of doing this, leave the swamp with me right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103285, '(He rejects your hand,)\nI??m too scared to leave this swamp.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103286, 'What do you mean? Quick, grab my hand.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103287, 'Sorry. But I just can??t do it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103288, '(Now that I think about it, Como stopped short of telling me something. {color,yellow,Como of the Hunter\'s Union} might know something.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[First, let??s go see Como.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll rescue Royden no matter what.][2]'),
(103289, '[NAME]! Did you go into the swamp? Your clothes are a bit dirty.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103290, 'I??m too scared to escape this swamp. {color,yellow,Como of the Hunter\'s Union} tried to rescue me too, but I couldn??t take a single step.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103300, 'Cause of Fear'),
(103301, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union knows why Scared Adventurer Royden is fearing the escape. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103302, 'Royden is scared of making an escape. Como, you know why right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103303, 'I know why, but it??s Hunter??s Union business, so I can??t tell an outsider. Also, Hugues doesn??t like talking about it, so everyone avoids bringing it up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103304, 'I still have to know the cause if I am to rescue Royden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103305, 'Sigh.[NAME], no matter what you do, Royden won??t budge. Royden accidently pushed a rescuer who came to save him into the swamp before. Royden panicked and tried to pull out his rescuer anyway he could. However, without any rescue knowledge, Royden made his rescuer sink even deeper into the swamp. By the time we arrived, the rescuer had vanished into the swamp, nowhere to be found.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103306, 'No way! So Royden is afraid of killing someone again by pushing the person into the swamp? Anyhow, why are you telling me all of this if this was forbidden to discuss?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103307, '[NAME], I figured you??d harass Royden if I didn??t tell you the truth. I also thought you misunderstood Hugues who??s genuinely trying.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103308, 'I didn??t know there was such an incident. However, I??m still not sure how I misunderstood Hugues.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103309, 'Don??t be impatient and wait a bit. We??ll searching for the best method as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103310, 'Incomprehensible Request 1'),
(103311, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants Ping Pigs killed without a good reason. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103312, 'Kill the Ping Pigs right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103313, 'You want me to kill Ping Pigs without a good reason? Last I checked, I wasn??t a member of the Hunter`s Union.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103314, 'I won??t insist. If you don??t want to, don??t.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103315, 'You??re so self-centered. You suddenly want me to kill {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[It??s vexing but let??s help him for now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??m not your subordinate.][2]'),
(103316, 'I killed Ping Pig.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103317, 'Good work.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103318, 'Good work? Is that it? Why don??t you tell me why I had to kill Ping Pigs instead?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103319, 'Kill {color,yellow,Ping Pig} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103320, 'Incomprehensible Request 2'),
(103321, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants vines from Mantrap Plants without a good reason. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103322, 'Get vines from Mantrap Plants right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103323, 'Look here. I asked you to tell me why I had to kill Ping Pigs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103324, 'I told you clearly. If you don??t want to, don??t. Are you one of those people who needs a reason to do what you want to do? It??s the same deal this time as well. If you don??t want to, don??t. If you won??t do it, I can order another member of the Hunter??s Union to do it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103325, 'Hunter`s Union members are this busy, and you would ask them to get {color,yellow,Vines} from {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll help because I pity the poor members of Hunter`s Union.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Good. Ask your subordinates to do it.][2]'),
(103326, 'I got the vines.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103327, 'Good work. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103328, 'Get {color,yellow,Vines} from {color,yellow,Mantrap Plants} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103330, 'Reasonable Request'),
(103331, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants Rhinoce Lord??s Horn to make rope ladder. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103332, 'Why aren??t you asking me about the vines this time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103333, 'It??s not like you would tell me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103334, '??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103335, 'I plan on making ropes with vines. Then with those ropes, I??ll make a rope ladder and throw it to Royden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103336, 'If that??s the plan, you could have told me earlier. I was doubting you for no reason, Hugues.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103337, 'I need footholds to make the rope ladder. I plan on making footholds with a {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord??s Horn} from {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. Get me horns this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I??ll be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about a bit weaker monster instead?][2]'),
(103338, 'I got the horn. If you need more vines, I??ll get some more. Actually, let me know if you have insufficient materials. I??ll get them as quickly as I can.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103339, 'This is enough. Also, take a break for a bit since it takes a while to make a rope ladder. You??ll join in on the rescue operation as well, no?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103340, 'I plan on making footholds for a rope ladder, so get me a {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord??s Horn} from the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103350, 'Supplies Box has been stolen once again'),
(103351, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union says Mud Men have stolen the Supplies Boxes once again. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103352, '[NAME], help me. It turns out that Mud Men have stolen the Supplies Box once again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103353, 'It was stolen even though they were fixated with vines?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103354, 'While I put too much faith in the vines and focused on the Mandrakes, Mud Men came and stole the Supplies Box again. I was too careless.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103355, 'Don??t blame yourself so much. I??ll retrieve the {color,yellow,Supplies Box} stolen by the {color,yellow,Mud Man}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait a little bit. I??ll be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Moreover, let??s think of a better safety device.][2]'),
(103356, 'I retrieved Supplies Box stolen by the Mud Man. Watch it carefully so Mud Men can??t steal it from now on.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103357, 'Thanks, [NAME]. I??ll watch them properly, considering that they??re never safe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103358, 'Anyhow[NAME], Hugues was looking for you, so you should go see him if you??re not busy. It looked like he wanted to ask you for a favor, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103359, 'Retrieve the {color,yellow,Supplies Box} stolen by the {color,yellow,Mud Man}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103360, 'Royden Rescue Operation'),
(103361, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants to run the rescue operation for Scared Adventurer Royden. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103362, 'I heard you were looking for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103363, 'The rope ladder is complete and I want to run the rescue operation for Royden. So I sought out for you to run this rescue since you were the biggest help in making this rope ladder.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103364, 'So I deliver the rope ladder to Royden right now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103365, 'Even if you deliver the rope ladder, if there are monsters nearby, this operation won??t be successful. So kill the nearby {color,yellow,Wereboars} and when it??s deemed to be safe, give the {color,yellow,Rope Ladder} to {color,yellow,Scared Adventurer Royden}. The rest will be up to Royden??s will.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I??ll be sure to rescue Royden.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Moreover, rope ladder looks like it??ll break easily.][2]'),
(103366, 'Royden! We came to rescue you from the swamp! Quickly grab onto this rope ladder.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103367, '??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103368, 'What are you doing? Quickly grab onto the rope ladder.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103369, 'So kill the nearby {color,yellow,Wereboars} and when it??s deemed to be safe, give the {color,yellow,Rope Ladder} to {color,yellow,Scared Adventurer Royden}.\n\n[[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103370, 'Failed Rescue Operation'),
(103371, 'Scared Adventurer Royden is too afraid to move from the swamp. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103372, 'Just go back. I-I??m not ready yet. No, I don??t think I can do it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103373, 'Royden,I know why you??re doing this. If you don??t want the rescuer??s death to be in vain, grab onto this rope to come on out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103374, '[NAME], you could fall and die. How could I do that? The person trying to rescue me died right in front of me. And it was because I was the one who pushed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103375, 'That??s why I brought a rope ladder. I??ll hold onto the rope ladder from a safe place. As long as you hold onto the rope ladder, I can pull you out even if you fall into the swamp.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103376, 'But I will die if I lose my grip on the rope ladder.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103377, 'Why are you thinking of dying first? You can escape no matter what. Just trust me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103378, 'Sorry. I??m really sorry. I can??t. No, I won??t. So tell Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union. The operation has failed again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103380, 'Last way to help Royden'),
(103381, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants to at least secure Scared Adventurer Royden??s safety by killing monsters. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103382, 'The operation must??ve failed since you returned alone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103383, 'Royden seemed really traumatized. He was too scared of falling into the swamp.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103384, 'That??s the reason we have failed up until now, so it won??t be resolved easily. I was a bit more confident this time, so it??s a shame. I thought Royden would develop fear before this operation even began, which is why I asked you for favors without telling you anything either. I apologize about that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103385, 'That??s why you kept asking for favors without giving me a reason. I didn??t know that??s how it was and I misunderstood you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103386, 'I can tell you now that the reason we asked you to kill the monsters was all because of the same reason. We didn??t want Royden to feel burdened. We thought that way his fear would subside a bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103387, 'However, since it turned out like this,I want {color,yellow,Wereboars} and {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} killed to provide maximum security for Royden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave that kind of task to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well,good luck with that.][2]'),
(103388, 'Thanks for doing even this kind of favor. However, I won??t know for sure that this will guarantee his maximum security.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103389, 'I want {color,yellow,Wereboars} and {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} killed to provide maximum security for Royden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103390, 'Last way to help Royden (Repeat)'),
(103391, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union wants monsters killed continuously to secure safety for Scared Adventurer Royden. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103392, 'We have to find a way to convince Royden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103393, 'If we can bring Royden out for sure, we wouldn??t have to do this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103394, 'It can??t be helped. He saw a person drown to death right in front of him. In addition, he thinks he??s the cause of that incident so he won??t change any time soon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103395, 'I guess we have to provide maximum security for him until then?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103396, 'It??s a shame that this is the only viable plan right now. Even so, I want {color,yellow,Wereboars} and {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} killed to provide maximum security for Royden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand. I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, good luck with that.][2]'),
(103397, 'Good work. I know you??re laboring the most because of this, but don??t rebuke Royden. Of course I know you??re not that type of a person, but I want to help the best I can to relieve Royden from other thoughts. Well, that??s that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103398, 'I want {color,yellow,Wereboars} and {color,yellow,Ping Pigs} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} killed to provide maximum security for Royden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103400, 'Rescuer??s Identity'),
(103401, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union would like to inform you about the dead rescuer. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103402, 'Well? Did you resolve your misunderstanding with Hugues?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103403, 'Now I know what you meant when you said that Hugues may seem indifferent, but he??s actually pretty kindhearted. Instead, I??m now more curious about why he??s so desperate to save him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103404, 'Probably because of his dead little brother. Truth is, the rescuer who drowned to death was Hugues?? little brother. That??s why Hugues thinks that rescuing Royden would be for sake of his little brother.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103405, 'That??s what happened. That??s why Hugues is so desperate to save Royden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103406, 'Well, we tried a lot of methods and talked a lot, but it??d be best to watch those two for now. Truth to be told, there isn??t a way for us to help anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103407, 'I see. Then I too should act as I did the first time I met those two. It seems that only time will resolve this issue.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103410, 'Skilled Member'),
(103411, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union says he needs to dispatch a skilled member to Priest Median. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103412, '[NAME]. Let??s talk for a bit if it??s okay.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103413, 'What??s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103414, 'Priest Median has requested for dispatch of a skilled member, but as you can see, we??re shorthanded as we are. So if you??re okay with it, I would like to recommend you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103415, 'Priest Median? Is there some kind of problem there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103416, 'I don??t know the details myself either. I only received an epistle requesting for dispatch of a member.\nMoreover, what do you think? Would you go see {color,yellow,Priest Median}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??m not sure what??s going on, but I??ll go.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll just stay here and kill monsters.][2]'),
(103417, '[NAME], what are you doing here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103418, 'Would you go see {color,yellow,Priest Median}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103420, 'Analysis Continues'),
(103421, 'Priest Median will continue Pie??s analysis of strong monsters at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103422, 'Hi. Priest Median, the Hunter??s Union is short on people so I??m here to help.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103423, 'Ah! You came to help with my analysis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103424, 'Analysis?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103425, 'Do you happen to know Pie? I??m to continue her work to analyze strong monsters at Swamp of Dawn. So I was looking for a person to help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103426, 'If that??s the case, it??s good thing I came. I??m the one who actually helped Pie with her analysis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103427, 'Yeah? What a relief. Then can you get {color,yellow,Laplan Leaves} from {color,yellow,Laplans} right now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[What? Sure, I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What do you mean all of the sudden?][2]'),
(103428, 'I got the leaves.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103429, 'Thank you. As expected, you got the materials fast since you??re experienced.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103430, 'Get {color,yellow,Laplan Leaves} from {color,yellow,LaplanS}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103440, 'Investigate Rhinoce Lord at Swamp of Dawn'),
(103441, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Rhinoce Lord in Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
