(103443, 'What do you need help with this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103444, 'I want to investigate the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord} this time. So can you get me a {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord??s Horn}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[W-Wait. That monster??s too strong.][2]'),
(103445, 'I got the horn.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103446, 'Whoa, [NAME]. Handle it with care. It??s easy to be stabbed with the horn.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103447, 'Get {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord??s Horn} from the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103450, 'Investigate Slug at Temple of Spirit'),
(103451, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Slugs at Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103452, 'I would like to investigate Slugs at Temple of Spirit this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103453, 'Slugs? Now what do I have to get?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103454, 'Hmm. Get me the shell.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103455, 'If it??s the shell, don??t you have some I got for you before?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103456, 'I didn??t know I would be assigned to this kind of task then, so there??s no way I would still have it.Just get me the {color,yellow,Slug Shell} again from {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I was lucky then, but I might die this time.][2]'),
(103457, 'I??ve acquired the shell. Also, store it with care since you don??t know how or when it??ll be used.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103458, 'Get me the {color,yellow,Slug Shell} from the {color,yellow,Slugs} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103460, 'Investigate Mad Slug at Temple of Spirit'),
(103461, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Mad Slugs at the Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103462, 'This time I want to investigate Mad Slugs. They\'re a bit stronger than Slugs.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103463, 'The Slugs were tough enough and you want to investigate even stronger Mad Slugs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103464, '[NAME], truthfully it??s not that strong so your level of skill should suffice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103465, '(I suddenly see an image of Pie overlapping Priest Median.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103466, 'Then get the {color,yellow,Mad Slug Shell} from {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I might really die this time.][2]'),
(103467, 'You got the shell. See [NAME], I told you your level of skill should suffice.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103468, 'Get the {color,yellow,Mad Slug Shell} from the {color,yellow,Mad Slug} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103470, 'Investigate Shadow at Temple of Spirit'),
(103471, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Shadows at the Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103472, 'The Slug??s analysis is complete so now I should investigate Shadows.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103473, 'What will you analyze the Shadows with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103474, 'I thought about it a lot and wouldn??t the hair produce a lot of data? It is said that hair holds nutritional facts and much more information.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103475, 'Then I have to retrieve {color,yellow,Hair} from {color,yellow,Shadows} at the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You want me to touch filthy hair that hasn??t even been shampooed?][2]'),
(103476, 'I thought I smelled something strange. So you got the hair.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103477, 'I got it but this stench was driving me nuts. Monsters should at least wash their hair as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103478, 'Get me {color,yellow,Hair} from {color,yellow,Shadows} in the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103480, 'Somewhat Different Method'),
(103481, 'Priest Median asks for materials but she doesn??t ask to kill monsters. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103482, 'So we don??t need to kill monsters we get materials from?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103483, 'What? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103484, 'Pie always asked to kill monsters after I got materials from them. But Priest Median, you never had such a request, so I was just asking.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103485, 'Hmm. [NAME], you wanted to kill monsters, but I guess I only thought of myself. Then can you kill {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lords} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}? Truth to be told, I thought it wasn??t necessary to kill them on the side since they had to be killed to acquire the materials.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Priest Median, I agree as well.][2]'),
(103486, 'I killed the Rhinoce Lord.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103487, 'Ah,[NAME]! So? Did you relieve some stress? If you ever build up stress because of me, let me know. So you can at least relieve stress like this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103488, '(I don??t kill monsters to relieve stress.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103489, 'If you really want to kill monsters, kill {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103490, 'Really Amazing Antique'),
(103491, 'Excavation Leader Griffin says a Shadow??s sword holds great value. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103492, 'Excuse me! May I ask you for a favor since you occasionally go to Temple of Spirit?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103493, 'Yeah? What kind of favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103494, 'Truth to be told, Shadow??s sword is an antique of great value. However, only people who knows of its value are excavators like me or archaeologists. I really want that sword but I don??t have any other way to acquire it, so I??m asking you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103495, 'Ah! Are you referring to the {color,yellow,Shadow Blade} carried by {color,yellow,Shadows} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why do I have to get that?][2]'),
(103496, '(While delivering the sword,)\nThis is the sword you??ve mentioned? But does a worn out sword like this have such a value?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103497, 'Oh! You got the sword for me. Thank you very much. You asked about the sword??s value. Truth to be told, it has almost no monetary value. However, to people like me, it??s an item with highest research value.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103498, 'Get the {color,yellow,Shadow Blade} carried by {color,yellow,Shadows} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103500, 'Even More Amazing Antique'),
(103501, 'Excavation Leader Griffin says Red Shadow??s sword has even greater value. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103502, 'Uh, if it??s okay, may I ask you for another favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103503, 'Speak away. I??ll help if it??s not too difficult of a request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103504, 'Truth to be told, Red Shadow??s sword is an antique of even greater value than Shadow??s sword. So if it??s okay, I would like to ask for that sword as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103505, 'Hmm. The {color,yellow,Red Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} is a bit strong. Anyhow, you want the {color,yellow,Red Shadow Blade}, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll think about it if you pay me a lot.][2]'),
(103506, '(While delivering the sword,)\nAt least this sword is cleaner. This may have some monetary value as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103507, 'T-This sword is mine now. Don??t eyeball it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103508, 'Get the {color,yellow,Red Shadow Blade} carried by the {color,yellow,Red Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103510, 'Antique Collection (Repeat)'),
(103511, 'Excavation Leader Griffin wants continued gathering of swords carried by Shadows and Red Shadows. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103512, 'If you really want them, I can give you a few swords.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103513, 'No. I have a much better weapon anyway.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103514, 'Phew! That??s good. Then whenever you need to go to the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, can you get the {color,yellow,Blade} carried by {color,yellow,Shadows} and {color,yellow,Red Shadows}? They??re really valuable antiques, so more the better.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get them for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll think about it for much greater reward than you have offered so far.][2]'),
(103515, '(While delivering the sword,)\nI brought the sword. But more I look at it, more it really seems to be a valuable sword.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103516, 'T-This sword is mine now. Don??t eyeball it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103517, 'Get the {color,yellow,Blade} carried by {color,yellow,Shadows} and {color,yellow,Red Shadows} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103520, 'Laplan Pressures Excavation Team'),
(103521, 'Excavation Team Member Webster is concerned about Laplans. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103522, 'Hi. Why do you seem so worried? Is there a problem?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103523, 'Ah! Hi. It??s because I??m concerned a lot about nearby monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103524, 'If it??s the nearby monster, are you referring to Ping Pigs? I??ll kill them right away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103525, 'I??m more concerned about the {color,yellow,Laplan} than the Ping Pig. It??s guarding the bridge that crosses onto the other side, so we??re unable to go that way. We somehow have to figure out a way to cross that bridge.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don??t worry. I??ll kill them right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Would you hire a less expensive mercenary?][2]'),
(103526, 'I killed the Laplans, so no need to worry anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103527, 'Thank you very much. Thanks to you, the bridge can be used to cross onto the other side. Thank you very much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103528, '(Monsters have probably spawned by now, though.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103529, 'Kill the {color,yellow,Laplans} so we can travel to west of {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103530, 'Investigate Red Shadow at Temple of Spirit'),
(103531, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Red Shadow in the Temple of Sprit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103532, '[NAME]. I want to investigate Red Shadows this time, so Red Shadow??s Hai-\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103533, '(Interrupting Priest Median,)\nWait. You want me to get that stinking hair again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103534, 'Although it smells a bit, there is no better material. Also, [NAME], I suffer more than you since I have to analyze it. So don??t say another word and get me the {color,yellow,Red Shadow??s Hair} from {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you really need it, at least give me perfume.][2]'),
(103535, 'As expected, [NAME], I knew of your arrival from the stench.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103536, 'I can??t get used to this smell no matter how many times I smell it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103537, 'I suffer more so don??t say another word and get me some {color,yellow,Red Shadow??s Hair} from the {color,yellow,Red Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. That would be how you can console me.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103540, 'Investigate Big Mud Mad at Swamp of Dawn'),
(103541, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Big Mud Man at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103542, 'I??m already losing my focus, just from anticipating the stench.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103543, 'Then should I get some fragrance?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103544, 'This stench would linger by my nose even if fragrance is sprayed over this hair. I would rather finish the work quickly and throw this hair out. [NAME], get {color,yellow,Big Mud Man??s Screw} from the {color,yellow,Big Mud Man} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} for my next analysis. I??m going to hold my breath as long as I can now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be back as quick as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Consider my nose as well. I need some fragrance.][2]'),
(103545, 'Puff-Puff-Puff\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103546, 'Priest Median? Why are you keep making the weird noise?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103547, 'Ah! [NAME]. I. Am. Holding. My. Breath. So. Don??t. Talk. To. Me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103548, 'Get me {color,yellow,Big Mud Man??s Screw} from the {color,yellow,Big Mud Man} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103550, 'Investigate Phouch at Swamp of Dawn'),
(103551, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Phouch at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103552, 'Hi, [NAME]. I??m done with previously provided material??s analysis, and I want to investigate another monster. You??ll help, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103553, 'Of course I??ll help. What do I need to get?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103554, 'I want to investigate {color,yellow,Phouch} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. So get me {color,yellow,Phouch??s Hide}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be back as quick as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How would I kill such of a cute monster?][2]'),
(103555, 'Hnngh! Hnngh!\nThe hide is quite heavy since the monster??s so big.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103556, 'Oh my! You brought the entire hide. You only had to cut out a little bit so it??s easy to carry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103557, 'You should have told me earlier.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103558, 'Get me a {color,yellow,Phouch??s Hide} from {color,yellow,Phouch} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103560, 'Stress Relief 1'),
(103561, 'Priest Median suggests relieving stress by killing Rhinoce Lords at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103562, 'The hide is heavy and thick, so it will take a lot of time to analyze it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103563, 'Is there anything else I can help with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103564, 'No. [NAME], I??ll ask for you when I need you again. That??s right! [NAME], you get stressed pretty easily, right? Then go relieve your stress on the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103565, 'That??s not necessarily true.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be back after relieving some stress.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Priest Median, you??re the cause of my stress.][2]'),
(103566, 'Your steps seem lighter since you relieved stress. When shall I make you relieve stress again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103567, 'Stress management is important but you don??t have to give me stress on purpose like that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103568, 'Relieve your stress against {color,yellow,Rhinoce Lord} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103570, 'Bridge Blocking Laplan'),
(103571, 'Hugues of the Hunter`s Union says supplies can??t be delivered because Laplans at Swamp of Dawn are blocking the bridge. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103572, 'Supplies aren??t arriving this time either, I guess.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103573, 'Supplies aren??t arriving?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103574, 'Ah! [NAME]. I was mumbling to myself and I guess you heard me. As you heard, supplies aren??t being delivered properly. It??s probably because the Laplans are blocking the only bridge that routes here. It??s a sticky situation and I don??t know what to do.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103575, 'I see. If the {color,yellow,Laplans} are blocking the bridge, it would be troubling for people who are delivering the supplies.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be back after killing it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll be concerned with you.][2]'),
(103576, 'Thanks for killing Laplan. Thanks to you, supplies would arrive shortly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103577, 'That??s a relief.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103578, 'Supplies won??t arrive because of {color,yellow,Laplan} at {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103580, 'Suspicious Big Mud Man'),
(103581, 'Tiara of the Hunter\'s Union says Big Mud Men in Swamp of Dawn are showing unusual activity. Lets?? talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103582, '[NAME]. Come here for a bit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103583, 'What??s wrong? You look concerned.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103584, 'Thing is, I??ve been pressured by the Mud Men to protect the Supplies Box and now the Big Mud Men have been acting suspiciously. The Mud Men might have asked Big Mud Men for help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103585, 'No way. They dwell at a different location, so how would they have asked for help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103586, 'No, I??m telling you I??m right!\nI??m certain the {color,yellow,Big Mud Man} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} will attack here shortly targeting the Supplies Box.\n\n[BUTTON]=[If you??re that worried, I??ll go kill it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you??re that concerned, I??ll be worrying with you.][2]'),
(103587, 'Well? As I said, the Big Mud Man was trying to steal the Supplies Box, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103588, 'I??m not sure. What kind of activity indicated their attempt to steal the Supplies Box?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103589, '{color,yellow,Big Mud Man} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} is definitely targeting the Supplies Box.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103590, 'Fire on Hands and Feet'),
(103591, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union finds the Big Mud Man with fire on its hands and feet marvelous. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103592, 'Come to think of it, Big Mud Man has fire on its hands and feet. Isn??t it hot?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103593, 'Now that you tell me, I??m curious as well. But is it really fire that??s on its hands and feet?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103594, '[NAME], if you??re curious, can you check the hands and feet of {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}? If it??s really fire, it can be used in place of firewood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll find out.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You want me to feel that fire with my own body?][2]'),
(103595, 'Well? Is it really hot? Is it a real fire?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103596, 'It seemed like real fire but it can??t be used to replace firewood. The fire disappeared when it died.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103597, 'That is a real shame. Recently, the Mandrake??s Staff has been difficult to acquire so we??ve been looking for new firewood.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103598, 'Isn??t there something else that can be used as firewood?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103599, 'Check the hands and feet of {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. I??ll treat your wound if you get burned, so don??t worry about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103600, 'Unextinguishable Fire'),
(103601, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union says Mad Slug??s Juice at Temple of Spirit keeps fire going. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103602, 'By any chance, have you heard of Slug Juice??s function?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103603, 'No. I haven??t heard of such a thing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103604, 'Some adventurer said when a piece of wood dipped in Slug Juice is lit on fire, it won??t even extinguish in water. If that??s true, it would be better to get Slug Juice than firewood.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103605, 'That??s rather hard to believe.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103606, 'You never know. So can you get some Slug Juice? Ah! Since you??re getting it anyway, get {color,yellow,Mad Slug Juice} from the stronger {color,yellow,Mad Slug} in the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. Since it??s stronger than the regular Slug, its Juice should be powerful as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Amazing. I??ll go get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You really believe those words?][2]'),
(103607, 'I brought Mad Slug Juice. Test to see if the fire stays on even when it??s submerged under water.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103608, 'Oh! You really got Mad Slug Juice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103609, 'However, experimenting is another story. This is a swamp area so I might drown in a swamp looking for water.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103610, 'What a shame. I wanted to see if the fire would stay on in water.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103611, 'I??m curious as well but first, let??s check to see if it gets lit up easily.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103612, 'I heard fire dipped with {color,yellow,Mad Slug Juice} cannot be extinguished, so get me some. You can get it from the {color,yellow,Mad Slug} in the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103620, 'Unextinguishable Fire (Repeat)'),
(103621, 'Como of the Hunter\'s Union wants continued supply of Juice from Mad Slugs in Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103622, 'It lights up better than I thought. If it sustains like this, we won??t need any more firewood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103623, 'It??s busy enough defending here, so it??s good Mad Slug Juice would relieve you of firewood concerns.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103624, 'Speaking of which, can you get me {color,yellow,Mad Slug Juice} from the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} whenever you need to go there? It??s not urgent so there??s no rush.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I probably have no reason to go there anymore.][2]'),
(103625, 'I got Mad Slug Juice.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103626, 'Oh! [NAME]. Fire was about to go out, so you came at a good time. Thank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103627, 'Moreover, how is it? Is Mad Slug Juice more flammable than firewood?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103628, 'If you need to go to {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, get me {color,yellow,Mad Slug Juice} from the {color,yellow,Mad Slug}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103630, 'Uncertainty'),
(103631, 'Excavation Leader Griffin might go to Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103632, 'I was so caught up with antiques, it didn??t occur to me I can go to Temple of Spirit myself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103633, 'Temple of Spirit is a dangerous place. Do you plan on going there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103634, 'Not right at this moment, but I may eventually need to go to {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} to acquire antiques. So can you kill {color,yellow,Shadows}? I feel like I can somehow go in if Shadows are taken care of.\n\n[BUTTON]=[No worries. I??ll go kill them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just not going would be the wise choice.][2]'),
(103635, 'I killed the Shadows so there??s no need to worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103636, 'You already killed the Shadows? A professional sure is different.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103637, 'Well, this is what I always do. Griffin, you??re a professional as well when it comes to excavation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103638, 'I may eventually lead the excavation team into {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} in search of antiques, so can you kill {color,yellow,Shadows}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103640, 'Gregory??s Concern for Leader'),
(103641, 'Excavation Team Member Gregory is worried about Excavation Leader Griffin because he wants to go into Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103642, 'Sigh. I don??t know what got into leader??s mind to plan to go to a place like that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103643, 'By leader, are you referring to Griffin? Did something happen to Griffin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103644, 'He really sucks at fighting and he wants to go into the Temple of Spirit. It doesn??t seem like he has any security measure either. I really don??t know what goes through his mind. Sigh.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103645, 'What if you all fight together?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103646, 'We??re well aware of our skill, so if that was possible, I wouldn??t even worry. If someone kills the {color,yellow,Red Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, it might be somewhat manageable.\n\n[BUTTON]=[No worries. I??ll go kill it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Try to stop him anyway you can.][2]'),
(103647, 'You??ve returned safely. Well? Did you kill the Red Shadow? You didn??t chicken out, did you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103648, 'Do I look like such a coward? I took care of your request, so there??s no need to worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103649, 'Thank you very much. Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103650, 'Leader wants to lead the excavation team into the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. Please kill the {color,yellow,Red Shadow}, for our sake.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103660, 'Passage Breakthrough'),
(103661, 'Hugues of the Hunter\'s Union is concerned Phouches are blocking the passage. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103662, 'Phouch is a problem. What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103663, 'Phouch? You mean that docile monster? It\'s size is intimidating, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103664, 'As you said, Phouches are very gentle compared to other monsters here. However, I??m trying to figure out what to do since it??s not as if we can just leave the monster there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103665, 'That is true. It still is a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103666, 'There are people who refer to the {color,yellow,Phouch} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} as an animal rather than a monster. Safety here comes before that kind of nonsense, though. Someone has to get it done regardless of the denunciation.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll go kill it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So you expect me to be denounced?][2]'),
(103667, 'Although it??s docile, it still has monstrous strength. Are you hurt anywhere?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103668, 'It has monstrous strength, but it??s just as slow, so I??m not particularly hurt. Moreover, heed attention so bad rumors don\'t start. I don??t want to become a center of focus from this incident.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103669, 'Don??t worry about that. No matter what happens, the Hunter\'s Union will be on your side.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103670, 'No matter how docile the {color,yellow,Phouch} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} is, I can??t just leave it be like this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103680, 'Falsely Accused of Lying'),
(103681, 'Excavation Team Member Webster wants to say something. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103682, 'Liar. You said you killed it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103683, 'You??re calling me a liar out of nowhere. What lie did I speak?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103684, 'You said you killed Laplans guarding the bridge. I trusted those words and I went to the bridge but there are still a lot of Laplans. What??s going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103685, 'That??s obvious. If all monsters disappeared once they??re killed, there wouldn??t be adventurers like me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103686, 'But I really liked it when you said the {color,yellow,Laplans} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} had been killed. I was really happy from the thought that the bridge could be crossed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll kill however many as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No matter how many I kill, the situation will remain the same.][2]'),
(103687, 'I killed the Laplans, so if you want to cross the bridge, go this very moment. There shouldn??t be monsters there right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103688, 'You lie again. You just said all monsters won??t disappear even when you kill them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103689, '(What does he expect me to do?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103690, 'But I really liked it when you said the {color,yellow,Laplans} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} had been killed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103700, 'Investigate Weasel at Swamp of Dawn'),
(103701, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Weasel at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103702, 'The long awaited moment is here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103703, 'You need materials for analysis. What do I need to get this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103704, 'You sure know how to sap my strength by guessing my intention so easily. I will investigate the {color,yellow,Weasel} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, so get me {color,yellow,Weasel??s Hide}.\n\n(Mumble, mumble.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103705, '(Is she sulking because I didn??t play along?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. It??ll be my pleasure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No. I can getticked off as well.][2]'),
(103706, 'You got it. I??ll just continue my work as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103707, '(Is she still sulking?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103708, 'I will investigate the {color,yellow,Weasel} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}, so get me {color,yellow,Weasel??s Hide}.\n\n(Mumble, mumble.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103710, 'Investigate Stone at Temple of Spirit'),
(103711, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Living Statues and Living Stones in Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103712, 'Get me a stone fragment this time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103713, '(Picking up a stone fragment on the ground,)\n\nThis?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103714, 'I??ll consider that funny, so be thankful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103715, '(I have to be thankful?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103716, 'I will investigate the {color,yellow,Living Statue} and {color,yellow,Living Stone} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. However, I can??t use the same materials I have used on other monsters to analyze monsters composed of stones. So this time, get me a {color,yellow,Stone Fragment}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. It??ll be my pleasure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It??s a same stone fragment, so analyze with ones on the ground.][2]'),
(103717, 'It??s just a stone fragment but it??s pretty heavy. It must be quite different from ones on the ground.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103718, 'I??ll consider that funny as well, so be thankful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103719, 'Get a {color,yellow,Stone Fragment} from the {color,yellow,Living Statue} and {color,yellow,Living Stone} in the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103720, 'Stress Relief 2'),
(103721, 'Priest Median wants you to relieve stress by killing Big Mud Men at Swamp of Dawn. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103722, 'What wrong have I done to deserve your sarcasm like this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103723, 'Ah! Judging from your sudden irritation, you have built up a lot of stress. That should be relieved right away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103724, 'Do you even know who is causing me this stress?\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(103725, '[NAME], I??m guessing the cause of your stress is the {color,yellow,Big Mud Man} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}. Kill some {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} and relieve some stress.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Speak properly. Why are you pleading ignorance?][2]'),
(103726, 'Well? Did you relieve some stress?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103727, 'I??ll also consider that the stress has been relieved this once, so be thankful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103728, 'Kill {color,yellow,Big Mud Men} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} to relieve some stress.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103730, 'Indecisiveness'),
(103731, 'Excavation Team Member Gregory says Excavation Leader Griffin seems concerned before the entry into the Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103732, 'You didn??t go into Temple of Spirit yet. What??s going on?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103733, 'Don??t even mention it. Our leader is still undecided on whether we should enter Temple of Spirit or not.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103734, 'What is he concerned about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103735, 'I??m not sure, but he mumbles to himself about {color,yellow,Living Statues} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, so I guess he??s worried about them. He would be worried after all, since Living Statues are composed of stones and most weapons won??t work against it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let me give it a shot.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll think about it if you give me a new weapon.][2]'),
(103736, 'I killed the Living Statues so it should be fine now. I still can??t feel my hands from striking a stony body.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103737, 'You can??t feel your hands?\nDid you fight with bare hands even though you have a weapon?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103738, 'I am scared of the {color,yellow,Living Statue} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103740, 'Cause of Indecisiveness'),
(103741, 'Excavation Leader Griffin seems undecided whether he should enter Temple of Spirit or not. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103742, 'This is a real problem. What do I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103743, 'Hi.\nI heard you were seriously contemplating whether you should go into Temple of Spirit or not. I killed some of Living Statues, so if you want to go in, now is the time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103744, 'How do you know that?\nWait, did you say you killed Living Statue? Then what did you do with Living Statue Blade?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103745, 'I just left it at Temple of Spirit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103746, 'Sword of the {color,yellow,Living Statue} found in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} is an antique of precious value. But you??re telling me you just left it there. If it??s okay by you, will you get me a {color,yellow,Living Statue Blade}? If you hurry, the sword might still be there.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Ah, sure. I??ll be back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Stop being greedy for antiques now.][2]'),
(103747, 'I??m not sure if someone took it, but by the time I got there, the sword was gone. So I got a new one.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103748, 'Thank you. I actually wanted to go into Temple of Spirit to acquire a Living Statue Blade. However, [NAME], since you did it for me, there??s no need for us to go in any longer. Once again, thank you very much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103749, 'Get a {color,yellow,Living Statue Blade} from the {color,yellow,Living Statue} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103750, 'Warm Comforter'),
(103751, 'Excavation Team Member Webster wants to sleep with a warm comforter. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103752, 'Others say it??s hot, but why am I cold?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103753, 'Is it really cold? Then at least dress warm.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103754, 'It??s hot now but it gets cooler during the night. Others say it??s hot even during the night, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103755, 'If you??re that cold, at least make a small fire. It would be warm and feel like a campfire.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103756, 'I would like that, but I need an alternative solution since it??s hot for others. It??d be different if I could get a thick hide or something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103757, 'Thick hide? The thickest hide found in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn} would be {color,yellow,Phouch??s Hide}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Is there some other hide?][2]'),
(103758, 'It looks like a very warm hide. Thank you. Now I can spend the night in warmth.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103759, 'Is {color,yellow,Phouch??s Hide} the thickest hide that can be found in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103760, 'Investigate Black Shadow at Temple of Spirit'),
(103761, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Black Shadows in Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103762, '[NAME]. The hour of hardship is upon us yet again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103763, 'What do you mean by that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103764, 'It??s time to investigate the Black Shadow.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103765, 'Gasp! It??s time to get that stinking hair.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103766, 'I??m also tormented by the fact that I have to analyze that stinking hair at a close proximity. Since we have to do it anyway, I will get it done as fast as I can. [NAME], get {color,yellow,Black Shadow??s Hair} as fast as you can from the {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} before the smell lingers on you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll be back as fast I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It was nice knowing you. Good bye.][2]'),
(103767, 'Quickly! Quickly, take the hair.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103768, 'Don??t rush me. Let me take a deep breath.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103769, 'Get {color,yellow,Black Shadow??s Hair} as fast as you can from {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} before the smell lingers onto you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103770, 'Stress Relief 3'),
(103771, 'Priest Median suggests killing Weasels to relieve stress from the stench. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103772, 'I??m sure you built up a lot of stress from the stinking hair, so why not go kill some Weasels?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103773, 'It??s not bad enough to go kill monsters, but I am stressed from the stinking hair.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103774, 'If you stay here all you??ll do is smell the stinking hair. Go relieve stress by killing {color,yellow,Weasels} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I would have to do that to avoid the stench.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'d rather take a bath.][2]'),
(103775, 'I moved around a lot from here and there killing monsters, so the lingering stench is gone from my body.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103776, 'How envious. This stench made me vomit. Ugh!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103777, 'Remove the stench from your body and relieve stress by killing {color,yellow,Weasels} in {color,yellow,Swamp of Dawn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103780, 'Most Valuable Antique'),
(103781, 'Excavation Leader Griffin desires Black Shadow??s Blade from Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103782, 'Why does Temple of Spirit have this many valuable antiques?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103783, 'You found something you want again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103784, 'According to dedicated excavation team information network, the {color,yellow,Black Shadow} is found in inner most part of {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. I??m certain the {color,yellow,Black Shadow Blade} is an antique of high value as well. No. It may be the most valuable antique.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Get it yourself this time.][2]'),
(103785, 'Oh! This sword feels better than other swords from Shadow.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103786, 'You??re not going to take it after just showing it to me, are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103787, 'Can you get a {color,yellow,Black Shadow Blade} from the {color,yellow,Black Shadow} found in inner most part of {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103790, 'I used to bea marksman'),
(103791, 'Excavation Team Member Webster brags he used to be a marksman. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103792, 'I miss those days. A bow was all I needed to feel as if the world was mine.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103793, 'What are you thinking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103794, 'Ah! I was just thinking of the old days.You see, I used to be a marksman. Back then, a bow was all I needed to feel as if the world was mine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103795, 'Why? You??re awesome now as well. Not everyone gets to be part of an excavation team.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103796, 'I??m not saying I don??t like it now, I just miss those days, you know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103797, 'Hmm. {color,yellow,Living Stones} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} do carry bows.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[It??s no big deal, I??ll get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh right. They do have bows.][2]'),
(103798, 'This is a bow.\nAre you giving it to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103799, 'You looked like you really wanted a bow, so I got it for you. I got a lot, so feel free to use them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103800, 'I am so thankful, I??m speechless. Thank you. Thank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103801, 'I did hear that {color,yellow,Living Stones} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} carry bows.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103810, 'Leader??s Excuse'),
(103811, 'Excavation Team Member Gregory says Excavation Leader Griffin seems concerned before entry into Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103812, 'Does leader intend to go in to Temple of Spirit or not?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103813, 'He doesn??t seem like he does.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103814, 'Right? You think so too, right?If he doesn??t intend to go, he should say so clearly. If he mumbles to himself about the {color,yellow,Living Statue} and the {color,yellow,Living Stone} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, what am I supposed to do about it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Calm down. As usual, I??ll go take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That??s probably not what the mumbles meant.][2]'),
(103815, 'I did take care of it for now, but how about not going to a dangerous place like Temple of Spirit?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103816, 'That??s what I thought first, but now that he dragged it out this long, I refuse to give up.\nI??ll send the leader into Temple of Spirit no matter what.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103817, 'If he mumbles to himself about the {color,yellow,Living Statue} and the {color,yellow,Living Stone} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}, what am I supposed to do about it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103820, 'Investigate Rhinoce Hunter at Temple of Spirit.'),
(103821, 'Priest Median wants to investigate Rhinoce Hunters at Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103822, 'Isn??t it about time you looked for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103823, 'You came by at a good time. I was looking for you to investigate the Rhinoce Hunter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103824, 'Rhinoce Hunter? Rhinoce Hunter is too strong of a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103825, 'I know it??s a strong monster. What, are you saying you can??t handle the Rhinoce Hunter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103826, 'Well, not exactly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103827, 'That??s a relief. [NAME], I was worried what I would have to do if you gave up.If it??s too difficult, you can gather friends. Do whatever you have to do to get the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Horn} from the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It was nice knowing you. Good bye.][2]'),
(103828, 'See? I told you that you could get it. [NAME], it seems that I know you better than yourself, [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103829, 'Don??t say that kind of weird stuff. It??s as if you??re surveilling me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103830, 'Do whatever you have to do to get the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Horn} from the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103840, 'Last Analysis'),
(103841, 'Priest Median wants to investigate the Shadow Master in Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103842, 'Only the last investigation remains now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103843, 'Last investigation? Aren\'t there a lot more monsters remaining?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103844, 'I am assigned up to Shadow Master, so this will be the last for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103845, 'In other words, you need material from the Shadow Master.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103846, 'Wait! Shadow? Does this mean hair again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103847, '(Holding [NAME]??s hand,)\nThis is the last. Get {color,yellow,Shadow Master??s Hair} from the {color,yellow,Shadow Master} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll do my best.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about you get the last one yourself?][2]'),
(103848, 'You got the last material. Master certainly ranks as master in stench as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103849, 'You should breathe in as much as you can now. You may miss this stench when we??re done with the analysis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103850, '[NAME], I may miss the time I spent with you but I do not want to miss this stench.\nThanks for everything up to now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103851, 'This is the last. Get {color,yellow,Shadow Master??s Hair} from the {color,yellow,Shadow Master} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103860, 'Obdurate Gregory'),
(103861, 'Excavation Team Member Gregory says he won??t give up the Excavation Team??s entry into Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103862, 'Since the leader keeps avoiding entry into Temple of Spirit, now I have to see this happen.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103863, 'I know the place pretty well from going in there several times, and I would recommend against it. It??s a really dangerous place.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103864, 'Of course I??m not suggesting we conquer Temple of Spirit. However, since it was brought up, we should at least get past the entrance.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103865, 'So you want to see the leader at least step in and out of Temple of Spirit??s entrance, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103866, 'Recently he mumbles on about the {color,yellow,Black Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. No matter what I have to do, I??ll kill the Black Shadows and see the leader in Temple of Spirit.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Temple of Spirit is dangerous so I??ll go.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll pray for your safe return.][2]'),
(103867, 'I killed the Black Shadow, but I truly recommend against going into Temple of Spirit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103868, 'We just have to get past the entrance and come right back out, so don??t you worry. We??re well aware of our skill, so we won??t start a fight with monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103869, 'He mumbles on about the {color,yellow,Black Shadow} in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. No matter what I have to do, I??ll kill it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103870, 'Greedy Leader'),
(103871, 'Excavation Leader Griffin wants Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang from Temple of Spirit. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103872, 'I forgot something important as I was consumed every day about looking for the Black Shadow.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103873, 'Don??t tell me you??re going into Temple of Spirit. As I??ve told Gregory, I wish you wouldn??t go in, Griffin.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103874, 'What are you talking about? Why would I go into such of a dangerous place?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103875, 'You said you forgot something important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103876, 'Ah! I was referring to {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang} found in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. That boomerang is quite a valuable antique but I forgot about it because of the Black Shadow Blade. The way I feel right now, I do want to go into Temple of Spirit just to get that Boomerang.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I??ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??m not responsible if you get hurt.][2]'),
(103877, 'I got the boomerang, so you won??t go into Temple of Spirit, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103878, 'Oh! Thank you, really. Also, I never said I was going into Temple of Spirit, so who did you hear that from?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103879, 'What? You never said such a thing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103880, 'I mumbled to myself because I wanted antiques in Temple of Spirit so badly, but I never said I would go in to get antiques.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103881, 'Then I guess Gregory misunderstood you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103882, 'Misunderstood? I don??t know what misunderstanding there was, but I would have to talk to Gregory.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103883, '{color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang} found in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit} is a really valuable antique as well and I totally forgot about it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103890, 'Greedy Leader (Repeat)'),
(103891, 'Excavation Leader Griffin wants a continued supply of the Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang and the Black Shadow??s Blade. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103892, 'I have to collect as many valuable antiques as I can before they all disappear.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103893, 'So you need all the antiques I??ve acquired up until now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103894, 'Not all. I just need {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang} and {color,yellow,Black Shadow Blade} found in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}. I have a sufficient amount of the others, but I don??t have much of those two. Can I ask you for those two?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll get them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??m exhausted as well now.][2]'),
(103895, 'I got both antiques you asked for.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103896, 'Thank you. Thanks to you, antique related investigation will advance with haste.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103897, 'Is there anything else you need?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103898, 'Can you get some more of the {color,yellow,Rhinoce Hunter??s Boomerang} and the {color,yellow,Black Shadow Blade} found in {color,yellow,Temple of Spirit}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103900, 'Ostracized Excavation Team'),
(103901, 'Excavation Leader Javez feels like the Excavation Union has forgotten about his team. Since it turned out this way, he wants to earn money from Black Bear??s Gallbladder and go home. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103902, 'It??s been quite some time since we arrived here. Why is there no message from the Union?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103903, 'Hi. There is an excavation team here as well. Is there anything to excavate here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103904, 'I??m curious about that myself. One day we were suddenly dispatched to Dark Land and we haven??t received any supplies or orders until now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103905, 'Are there ruins or items to excavate?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103906, 'Look around here! Does it look like there??s a place to excavate? Rather than waiting for an order to arrive from the Union, I would rather make money and go home.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103907, 'There are no ruins but there are items of monetary value, huh?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103908, 'Since long ago, Bear??s Gallbladder was rumored to be a good medicine. However, since it was such an expensive medicinal ingredient, there weren\'t many who ate Bear??s Gallbladder. So I thought about gathering the {color,yellow,Bear??s Gallbladder} from a {color,yellow,Black Bear}. Anyhow, money doesn??t come easy for anyone. It??s no wonder how expensive it is since the task is so dangerous.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Should I give it a shot?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Exercise is better than medicine.][2]'),
(103909, 'I didn??t know which part was the gallbladder, so it took me a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103910, 'Is this Bear??s Gallbladder? I??m actually not certain what is what since I??ve never seen one myself. I can??t afford to eat such an expensive medicinal ingredient on my income.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103911, 'I really empathize and that makes my tears well up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103912, 'There??s an expensive medicinal ingredient called {color,yellow,Bear??s Gallbladder}. I wanted to get that ingredient from a {color,yellow,Black Bear}. Anyhow, money doesn??t come easy for anyone. It??s no wonder how expensive it is since the task is so dangerous.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103920, 'Antivenin for Venom'),
(103921, 'Excavation Leader Javez says there??s another expensive medicinal ingredient in Dark Land. He wants Poison Mandrake??s Venom Sac. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103922, 'Come to think of it, there??s another expensive ingredient here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103923, 'What are you mulling over?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103924, 'Isn??t it obvious? How to earn more money.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103925, 'So have you thought of any ideas to earn more money?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103926, 'Have you heard of how venom governs venom?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103927, 'Govern venom with venom.\nNo way! Does it mean to poison someone who??s been poisoned already to make certain of the end? If that??s so, it??s quite cruel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103928, 'I??m not sure how you came up with such an answer, but it means that sometimes venom can turn into medicine.{color,yellow,Poison Mandrake} here has a {color,yellow,Venom Sac} that can be a medicine. This is also as dangerous of a task as it is expensive. If it can be obtained, it??ll secure a sizable earning.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Should I give it a shot?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Exercise is better than medicine.][2]'),
(103929, 'I did get it, but does this venom seep through the skin? I dripped a little onto my arm earlier and that spot has been itching a bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103930, 'That??s a problem. Then we should govern that venom with venom.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103931, 'W-Wait. I need to ready myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103932, 'Don??t be so scared! Well, come here, I??ll apply plenty of venom on you. Hahaha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103933, '{color,yellow,Poison Mandrake} here has a {color,yellow,Venom Sac} that can be a medicine. This is also a dangerous task as it is highly expensive.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103940, 'Expensive Hide'),
(103941, 'Brown Bear??s Hide is popular amongst noblewomen because of its vintage color. Excavation Team Member Rose wants Brown Bear??s Hide. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103942, 'Boredom is killing me with no work to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103943, 'Hi, What kind of work does this excavation team do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103944, 'What kind of work do we do? Hmm. Let??s see. We eat, sleep, and zone out amongst other things. We??re actually not sure why we??re here either.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103945, 'I guess you have nothing in particular to do. Even so, isn??t it boring if you stay put doing nothing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103946, 'Of course it??s boring. There is no excavation equipment, and it??s not as if we have a site to excavate either. If this is how it is, it??d be best to earn some money and go home. I don??t even want to breathe the air around here anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103947, 'Even so, it??s not that easy to earn money, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103948, 'Truth be told, {color,yellow,Brown Bears} are really popular with noblewomen here because of their vintage color. To be specific, I??m referring to the {color,yellow,Brown Bear??s Hide}. So how about we go into business together? You go get me the hide, I??ll buy it off you for a high price. Of course I would sell it for even higher price to noblewomen.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Boss, wait just a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I rather sell it myself.][2]'),
(103949, 'I got the high quality goods. It??s the best without any damage.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103950, 'Hmm. The fur isn??t even and they??re all over the place. Now that I look at them, all the other hides are the same.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103951, 'That??s because it??s all natural. What kind of bear has completely even fur?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103952, 'Even so, you did work hard so I??ll pay you this much. You know I??m losing money on this business, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103953, '{color,yellow,Brown Bears} are really popular with noblewomen here because of their vintage color. To be specific, I??m referring to the {color,yellow,Brown Bear??s Hide}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103960, 'Path I have Chosen'),
(103961, 'Excavation Member Kupers says he??ll firmly walk the path of an excavator. He wants Alkas killed to excavate. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103962, 'It??s strange how everyone changed. We??re not merchants, but an excavator team.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103963, 'Why are you so upset? What??s bothering you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103964, 'What??s bothering me? I??m bothered because the excavation team is not excavating and they??ve all turned into merchants, so how can it get worse than this? Everyone has trashed their respect as an excavation team.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103965, 'So you??re going to excavate alone? Moreover, there??s no particular site to excavate, no?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103966, 'Why wouldn??t there be? There are a few sites I??m suspicious of, but I just can??t go because of the monsters. So can you kill {color,yellow,Alkas} in {color,yellow,Dark Land}? Alkas prevent me from approaching any suspicious areas.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll help. Wait a moment.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll just learn how to peddle goods here.][2]'),
(103967, 'I killed the Alkas. But do you have any equipment to excavate with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103968, 'I do have basic equipment, so I should be able to manage somehow. I??m really thankful to you for killing the Alkas.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103969, 'There is an area I??m suspicious of, but I can??t approach it because of the {color,yellow,Alkas}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103970, 'Dark Land??s Unique Delicacy'),
(103971, 'Excavation Leader Javez wants to obtain Dark Land??s unique delicacy, Red Condor??s Egg. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103972, 'A Red Condor??s egg would make quite a bit of money as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103973, 'Are you brainstorming ways to earn money again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103974, 'What do you mean again? Since it turned out this way, I have to earn as much as I can before I go home. Since you brought it up, if you??re not busy, help me a bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103975, 'You want a Red Condor??s Egg?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103976, 'Yes. {color,yellow,Red Condor??s Egg} is a delicacy that can only be obtained here. It??s difficult to acquire and distribution is complicated as well, making it an expensive cooking ingredient. So if you get me the egg from the {color,yellow,Red Condor}, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Wait a little bit.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me first taste how delicious it is.][2]'),
(103977, 'I??ve got the egg right here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103978, 'Whoa, careful not to break it. I can??t sell the egg as a product if it??s broken.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103979, 'Kill the {color,yellow,Red Condor} to obtain the {color,yellow,Red Condor??s Egg}, and I??ll reward you accordingly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103980, 'To Home'),
(103981, 'Excavation Leader Javez says it would be difficult to return home while avoiding the Fire Titan??s watch. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103982, 'I made as much money as I need to and I would like to return home, but would I be able to get there safely?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103983, 'Do you need an escort?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103984, 'It??s not like we??re returning home after a successful mission, so an escort would be overkill. We should be able to get home by ourselves as long as the monster blocking the path is taken care of.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103985, 'Then have a safe passage back home.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103986, 'W-Wait. Didn??t you just hear me? You have to kill the {color,yellow,FireTitan} that??s blocking the path back home in order for us to go.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Wait a while.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let me first taste how delicious it is.][2]'),
(103987, 'I took care of the Fire Titan, so you shouldn??t have any big issues on your way home.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103988, 'Thanks. I should start packing now. Ah! I have to deliver this news to rest of the excavation members.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103989, 'Kill the {color,yellow,Fire Titan} that??s blocking the path back home.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103990, 'Surprise Attack 1'),
(103991, 'Excavation Team Member Kupers got chased away by a Baridon while investigating the excavation site alone. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(103992, 'I need to take care of the Baridons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(103993, 'Excavation isn??t going well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103994, 'Ah! [NAME]. Welcome. I happen to have a favor to ask of you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103995, 'From me? What is it this time?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103996, 'Since I??m trying to excavate alone, there are a lot of nearby monsters that threaten me. Even just now, I had to run here because of the {color,yellow,Baridon}. So can you kill it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I??ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don??t you give up on the excavation now?][2]'),
(103997, 'I killed the Baridons, but why don??t you give up on roaming alone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(103998, 'What are you talking about? I??ll protect the pride of the excavation team until the end. Anyhow, thanks for killing the Baridons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(103999, 'I had to run before I even started the investigation because of the {color,yellow,Baridon}, so can you kill it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104000, 'Surprise Attack 2'),
(104001, 'Excavation Team Member Kupers got chased away by a Red Bear while investigating the excavation site alone. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104002, 'There are so many monsters, I got chased off before I had the chance to do anything.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104003, 'Did you get chased off by monsters yet again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104004, 'At least it was a different monster this time. I got chased off by a Red Bear.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104005, 'So I have to chase off Red Bears right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104006, 'Would you? There are a few sites I??m suspicious of, but I couldn??t investigate because of the {color,yellow,Red Bear}. I would like to investigate there once you chase off the {color,yellow,Red Bears}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I??ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don??t you give up on excavation now.][2]'),
(104007, 'I killed the Red Bears. But you never know, so pack a few weapons.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104008, 'Thanks for killing the monsters. However, it??s heavy to carry a lot of weapons and that makes it more difficult to run away. So it??s better to pack only the essentials.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104009, 'I discovered a site that might have something, but because of the {color,yellow,Red Bears}, I got chased off before I got to investigate.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104010, 'Surprise Attack 3'),
(104011, 'Excavation Team Member Kupers got chased away by Water Alcas while investigating the excavation site alone. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104012, 'I get chased off every time without getting anything done because of the monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104013, 'I??m sure there are a lot of challenges when excavating alone. So how about you give up now? Everyone else has given up already.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104014, 'Don??t think of me as one of them just because we??re in the same group. I joined the excavation team with a sense of pride unlike those guys.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104015, 'Darnit, I would have discovered something if it wasn??t for the {color,yellow,Water Alca}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don??t you give up on excavation now?][2]'),
(104016, 'I killed the monster so go check it out. Also, I can??t help you indefinitely, so if you get chased off again by monsters, don??t be stubborn by yourself anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104017, 'It??s true that I can??t ask you for favors indefinitely, since you??re not even a member of Excavation Union. I??ll mull it over slowly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104018, 'Darnit, I would have discovered something if it wasn??t for the {color,yellow,Water Alca}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104020, 'Expensive Horn'),
(104021, 'Excavation Team Member Rose says wealthy merchants collect Fire Shella??s Horn to showcase their affluence. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104022, '[NAME]! There??s a good way to make money, so do you want do it together?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104023, 'What is it? Also, no matter how much money it makes, I will never commit a crime.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104024, 'I don??t commit crimes either. Also, it??s a good thing to kill off monsters, no?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104025, 'Make money by killing monsters? If that were possible, I??d have accumulated an incredible wealth by now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104026, 'To be precise, it??s not just killing monsters, but we??re getting {color,yellow,Fire Shella??s Horn} to sell. Wealthy merchants decorate with Fire Shella??s Horn to showcase their affluence. Also, in order to obtain the horn, we have to kill {color,yellow,Fire Shellas} during the process, so isn??t that a great way to make money?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let us work hard to make money.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll take 8 and you take 2, or we have no deal.][2]'),
(104027, 'I brought a lot of horns. It??s exciting to know all this is worth money.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104028, 'There are still a plenty of ways to make money, so don??t get surprised from this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104029, 'Wealthy merchants purchase a lot of {color,yellow,Fire Shella??s Horns} to showcase their affluence. So we get that to sell to the merchant.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104030, 'Expensive Wing'),
(104031, 'Excavation Team Member Rose says children of wealthy nobilities love the Giant Red Condor\'s Wing. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104032, 'We??ll get the Giant Red Condor??s Wing this time. It??s the most popular item amongst wealthy noble??s children.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104033, 'Don??t tell me we??re doing something as cruel as chopping off the wings or something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104034, 'Of course not. I did say wing, but the actual item we??ll have to get is Giant Red Condor??s Feather.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104035, 'So I have to get a {color,yellow,Giant Red Condor??s Feather} from the {color,yellow,Giant Red Condor}, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll get it right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I actually have feather allergy.][2]'),
(104036, 'I got the feather. Are you going to craft the wing yourself?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104037, 'That may be more profitable, but time is of essence in business. We??ll leave it to an expert craft it, so we can sell it as quickly as possible before the trend is over.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104038, 'It??s a trend for wealthy nobles\' children to wear the Giant Red Condor??s Wing so let??s get a {color,yellow,Giant Red Condor??s Feather} to craft the wing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104040, 'Chase Off Wild Ape'),
(104041, 'Joanna of the Hunter`s Union wants to show the nearby Wild Apes that she means business. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104042, 'I neglected the monsters for a short while since I was busy with work, and they??ve invaded up to here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104043, 'Did you get attacked by the monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104044, 'We didn??t get attacked yet. But it seems imminent, seeing how Wild Apes have come all the way up here to roam about.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104045, 'Then you should quickly chase off the monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104046, 'Didn??t you hear what I just said? I am busy with my work here. Well, I??m thinking that an operation to chase off monsters will be commenced in the near future, but if you??re so worried, you can chase off the {color,yellow,Wild Apes} yourself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It doesn??t concern me since I just have to leave here.][2]'),
(104047, 'I chased off the monsters so it should be safe for a while.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104048, 'Thanks to you I don??t have to bore myself hunting monsters. I??ll have fun continuing to organize documents. Tsk!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104049, 'If you??re that worried, you chase off the {color,yellow,Wild Apes}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104050, 'Securing Tent1'),
(104051, 'Luke of the Hunter`s Union needs Pergy??s Horn because he doesn??t have the pegs to secure the tent. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104052, 'I have to secure the tent to the ground, but where did the pegs go?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104053, 'Are you missing any pegs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104054, 'Rather than missing, I think I??ve used them all. Adealia is too far to travel just to get pegs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104055, 'Isn??t there something that can substitute as pegs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104056, '{color,yellow,Pergy??s Horn} should be sufficient enough to use in place of pegs, but the problem is, the {color,yellow,Pergy} is quite violent. It might be quicker to make a trip to Adealia.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me. I??ll get the horn.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, Goodbye.][2]'),
(104057, 'The horn feels small because Pergy is so big. I brought enough, so you won??t have any shortage.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104058, 'Good work. Since the horns are here, I??ll continue my work on the tents after a short break.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104059, '{color,yellow,Pergy??s Horn} should be sufficient enough to use in place of the pegs.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104060, 'Unusual Method to Distinguish Friends'),
(104061, 'Huey of the Hunter??s Union says Mean Leipoon uses leaves on their heads to distinguish friendlies. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104062, 'Did you know Mean Leipoon distinguish friendlies using leaves on their heads?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104063, 'They don??t look at the appearance at all and only rely on the leaves on their heads to distinguish friendlies?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104064, 'I had a number of experiments, but they mistake anyone with their leaves on the head as friendlies. I plan on using this to attack where Depraves Elvesdwells.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104065, 'Since Mean Leipoon blocks the passage to where Depraved Elves are, if they can be deceived, we should be able to get there without any trouble.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104066, 'But in order to do that, a {color,yellow,Mean Leipoon??s Leaf} has to be acquired, but it??s not an easy task. It??s not as if the {color,yellow,Mean Leipoons} keep their heads down to have their leaves picked.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me. I??ll get the leaves.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, Goodbye.][2]'),
(104067, 'I got the leaves, but no matter how I think about it, it??s amazing how they grow leaves on their heads instead of hair.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104068, 'That wouldn??t be the only amazing thing. From Mean Leipoon??s perspective, growing hair would be more amazing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104069, 'I really need a {color,yellow,Mean Leipoon?? Leaf}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104070, 'Detective Luke'),
(104071, 'Luke of Hunter`s Union says Depraved Elf Thieves have stolen the weapons.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104072, 'I had no idea the weapons were missing, so when were they stolen?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104073, 'Did you lose something?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104074, 'I tried to look for any used weapons to send to Adealia for repair, but they??re all missing. It seems like they have been missing for a while but nobody noticed it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104075, 'If no one knew they were missing, couldn??t it be an inside job? Insiders would be well informed of internal affairs, so stealing without getting caught would be do-able.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104076, 'I thought about that too, but this is definitely the work of a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104077, 'Do you have some kind of proof?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104078, 'The monster??s name is self-evident. {color,yellow,Depraved Elf Thief}. Doesn??t the name alone reek ofculprit? I??m certain they took the {color,yellow,Missing Weapons}, so get those retrieved.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It??s a sound deduction. I??ll go get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How can I trust such of a bogus deduction?][2]'),
(104079, 'Depraved Elf Thieves really had the Missing Weapons. How did you deduct with the name alone? Luke, you really are a detective.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104080, 'In order to find a prey, information has to be gathered from all sources, then they have to be reconstructed for deduction. That??s how you find hidden ones. Well, it??s easier said than done. But I??m sure you can be like me with enough effort, so don??t be too envious.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104081, 'All the senses I have attained while hunting and evidence I have gathered tells me that the {color,yellow,Depraved Elf Thief} is the culprit who stole the {color,yellow,Missing Weapons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104090, 'Unfactored Hindrance'),
(104091, 'Joanna of the Hunter`s Union says it??s difficult to pressure Depraved Elves because of the nearby Shellas. Let??s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104092, 'I didn??t even think about them, but now that we??re trying to pressure Depraved Elves, they??re becoming quite a bit of problem.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104093, 'Them? Who are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104094, 'Who? Shellas of course. We would like to press onto the Depraved Elves, but Shellas are nearby and we would end up in an unnecessary fight. If possible, I would like to avoid that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104095, 'Instead of trying to dodge the fight, isn??t it better to kill them for the sake of the future?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104096, 'Of course if stipulations are met, it would be best to kill the {color,yellow,Shellas} now. However, we only have three of us here, so do you think that??d be possible?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Then we should figure out a way to avoid them.][2]'),
(104097, 'I punched out a pathway, so you can commence your operation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104098, 'You returned already? I didn??t make any any plans yet. Good work, though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104099, 'Of course if stipulations are met, it would be best to kill the {color,yellow,Shellas} now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104100, 'Securing Tent 2'),
(104101, 'Luke of the Hunter??s Union says Vehimoth??s Molar is needed to secure the tent.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104102, 'Pergy??s Horn was smaller than I thought, so it wouldn??t secure the tent.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104103, 'Then we would need an even bigger horn. But is there a monster with such of a big horn?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104104, 'It doesn??t have to be a big horn, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104105, 'What else is there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104106, 'How about {color,yellow,Vehimoth}? {color,yellow,Vehimoth??s Molar} should be big enough to secure the tent.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll get it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[There should be something even bigger.][2]'),
(104107, 'Vehimoth??s Molar is bigger than I thought. This should be enough to tightly secure the tent.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104108, 'Well, we??ll have to peg the molars to the ground to find out whether it will tightly secure the tent or not. Anyhow, good work.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104109, 'How about {color,yellow,Vehimoth}? {color,yellow,Vehimoth??s Molar} should be big enough to secure the tent.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104110, 'Retirement Plan'),
(104111, 'Guild Manager Bunis wants to retire at Psiken Mansion. However, he??s concerned about Blood Spiders. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104112, 'I finally found it! I wanted to live a rustic life when I aged a bit more, and I found the perfect house for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104113, 'Yeah? Congratulations, really. So where is that house?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104114, 'Psiken Mansion. That??s the house I??ve been looking for until now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104115, 'What? Do you really want to live there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104116, 'I don??t plan on moving into {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion} right now, but it doesn??t look good to have spider webs everywhere in the mansion. So I want you to kill some of the {color,yellow,Blood Spiders}. I??ll reward you accordingly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Spiders aren\'t my specialty.][2]'),
(104117, 'Well? Does the mansion have too many spider webs? It??s hard to clean if there??s a lot.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104118, 'Thankfully, there??s no need to worry about the spider webs. The house is fairly clean.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104119, 'It doesn??t look good to have spider webs everywhere in the mansion. So I want you to kill some of the {color,yellow,Blood Spiders}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104120, 'Desire to Farm'),
(104121, 'Guild Manager Bunis wants to farm while living at the Psiken Mansion. However, he??s concerned about any nearby monsters. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104122, 'Don??t you want to know why I chose Psiken Mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104123, 'Come to think of it, why do you want to live in a house like that? I couldn??t live a day in a place dreary as that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104124, 'My dream is to farm and live in seclusion. Some may refer to such life as the most extravagant life in this continent, but I sacrificed all of my youth for that kind of life. So I sought out for a land that would be appropriate for such a purpose. However, as you know, no such land can be found in this continent. As extravagant as it may be, I recently found the land and a house I exchanged my youth for. That??s why even if it means kicking all the monsters out, I want to live in Psiken Mansion.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104125, 'Since we??re on the topic, can you kill the {color,yellow,Monsters} in {color,yellow,Psiken Garden}? I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly, especially since I planned on spending my entire fortune on Psiken Mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Life is more important than money.][2]'),
(104126, 'I tidied up your garden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104127, 'You??re trustworthy as expected.\nI??m not sure when I??ll be moving, but I??ll be sure to invite you as a gardener at the house warming party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104128, 'As I planned on spending my entire fortune on Psiken Mansion, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly if you kill the {color,yellow,Monsters} in {color,yellow,Psiken Garden}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104130, 'Haunted Mansion'),
(104131, 'Guild Manager Bunis is concerned about Mists roaming about Psiken Mansion. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104132, 'The mansion is really nice but it??s a problem since it??s haunted with ghosts.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104133, 'By ghost, are you referring to Mists?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104134, 'Yeah. I really don??t like how it goes in and out of Psiken Mansion as if it were its home. That mansion is about to be my home, so it??d be terrible if it continues to go in and out of the mansion even after I move in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104135, 'So can you kill {color,yellow,Mists} in {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}? As I planned on spending my entire fortune on Psiken Mansion, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Life is more important than money.][2]'),
(104136, 'I killed all the Mists that I could spot. I??ll be sure to offer my guaranteed service if any Mists appears again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104137, 'You??re trustworthy as expected.\nI??m not sure when I??ll be moving, but I??ll be sure to invite you as a guard to the house warming party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104138, 'As I planned on spending my entire fortune on the {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly if you kill the {color,yellow,Mists.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104140, 'Mansion Guard Living Statue Obstructs the Move'),
(104141, 'Guild Manager Bunis says Mansion Guard Living Statues roam around Psiken Mansion, obstructing the move. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104142, 'Even though I want to move in, Mansion Guard Living Statues make it difficult to do so.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104143, 'You plan on moving in already?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104144, 'I??m not moving right now, but wouldn??t it be better to kill Mansion Guard Living Statue ahead of the time? I may suddenly decide to move in, you know?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104145, 'Since we??re on topic, can you kill {color,yellow,Mansion Guard Living Statues} in {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}? I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly, especially since I planned on spending my entire fortune on Psiken Mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Life is more important than money.][2]'),
(104146, 'I killed the Mansion Guard Living Statues, so you shouldn??t have any problem moving in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104147, 'You??re trustworthy as expected.\nI??m not sure when I??ll be moving, but I??ll be sure to invite you as a sculptor at the house warming party.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104148, 'As I planned on spending my entire fortune on {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly if you kill {color,yellow,Mansion Guard Living Statues}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104150, 'Guard Dog Stays Out'),
(104151, 'Guild Manager Bunis isn??t happy that Chimera is inside Psiken Mansion. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104152, 'Why is the guard dog inside the mansion? Shouldn??t a guard dog stay outside in order to guard the mansion?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104153, 'Guard dog? Are you referring to Chimera by any chance?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104154, 'Correct. It??s a guard dog no matter who looks at it. How??s it going to guard the mansion if it stays indoor like a pet dog?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104155, 'Do you have cynophobia? If not, I??d like you to chase {color,yellow,Chimera} out of {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}. I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly, especially since I planned on spending my entire fortune on the mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Life is more important than money.][2]'),
(104156, 'I chased it out when it tried to crawl in, so it won??t come inside the Mansion anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104157, 'I really don??t want it to come into the mansion. I??m allergic to dog hair.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104158, 'As I planned on spending my entire fortune on {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly if you chase {color,yellow,Chimera} out of the mansion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104160, 'Get me the Key'),
(104161, 'Guild Manager Bunis needs the key to own Psiken Mansion. He wants the key to be acquired from the current mansion owner Psiken. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104162, 'Regardless of who lives in Psiken Mansion, whoever holds the key is the owner. So I should call it Bunis Mansion instead of Psiken Mansion from now on.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104163, 'Do you have the Psiken Mansion??s Key?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104164, 'Right now {color,yellow,Psiken} has the key, but it will soon be in my hands. You??ll bring me the {color,yellow,Mansion Key} soon, won??t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even though it??s a monster, that??s still a crime.][2]'),
(104165, 'I did get the key, but my conscience isn??t clear since I feel like I committed a crime against the monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104166, 'What are you talking about? All we did was fight the monster and we won.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104167, 'To be honest, we are stealing the mansion that Psiken lives in.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104168, 'I don??t recall stealing it. I definitely bought it from you with my money.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104169, 'What are you talking about? I received your money to heed your request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104170, 'What are you talking about? I definitely paid money to you to receive the key, so I bought it from you. Isn??t that right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104171, '(I knew my conscience wasn??t clear from the start. He??s framing me for everything.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104172, 'As I planned on spending my entire fortune on {color,yellow,Psiken Mansion}, I??ll be sure to reward you accordingly if you get me {color,yellow,Mansion Key} from {color,yellow,Psiken}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104180, 'Ridiculous Dispatch'),
(104181, 'Bat Hunter Polan has been dispatched to Thorn Cave for the simple reason that the Succubus has bat??s wings. He??s asking to you prove your skill by killing Hungry Zombies. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104182, 'Do you think this makes any sense? How can I be dispatched here just because the Succubus has bat??s wings?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104183, 'Why are you so upset? Is there a problem?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104184, 'I??m a Bat Hunter and I was dispatched here just because the Succubus has bat??s wings. Does this makes any sense? She is not a bat, but a monster.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104185, 'First, calm down. Being upset doesn??t solve anything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104186, 'Do I look like I can stay calm? I??m not sure why I was sent here, I can??t even kill a Hungry Zombie, so how would I ever kill the Succubus?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104187, 'I??ll help. So calm down a bit.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104188, 'You??ll help? You don??t look that trustworthy, but it would be a different story if you could kill {color,yellow,Hungry Zombies} inside {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}. Why don??t you prove how skilled you are to me? That way I can trust you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Just trust me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No need to force yourself to trust me.][2]'),
(104189, 'Now can you trust me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104190, 'What? You just killed Hungry Zombies? Where??s the evidence? Who??s the witness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104191, 'I-I didn\'t bring any proof, but I really killed it...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104192, 'Then you should have brought evidence. If you just go in and out of Thorn Cave, how would I know what you have done?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104193, 'First prove your skill to me by killing {color,yellow,Hungry Zombies} in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104200, 'Incubus??s Horn'),
(104201, 'Bat Hunter Polan doesn??t believe that you killed the Hungry Zombies. He??s asking you to kill Incubus Rock and Incubus Agole, then retrieve their horns as proof. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104202, 'Even if you really killed the Hungry Zombies, you have to kill the likes of the Incubi to be capable of fighting the Succubus.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104203, 'You??re very disrespectful. Don??t you think I can kill that level of monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104204, 'Then prove it. Kill the {color,yellow,Incubus Rock} and the {color,yellow,Incubus Agole} inside {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}, and bring back their {color,yellow,Incubus?? Horn}. Then I??ll believe that what you have told me weren??t lies. I honestly don??t think you??re that skilled, though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You??ll regret what you just said.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I??ll just live on as a liar.][2]'),
(104205, 'Can you repeat what you had said earlier even after looking at this horn?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104206, 'Is there evidence that horn is an Incubus?? Horn?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104207, 'You??ve been asking for a witness to the evidence, but do you have any right to say such things as a person who can??t even brave an entry into Thorn Cave? If you really want a witness or evidence, let??s go into Thorn Cave together. I can??t guarantee your safety, though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104208, 'W-What are you talking about? I-I believed everything you said from the beginning.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104209, 'Kill {color,yellow,Incubus Rock} in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave} and bring back the {color,yellow,Rock??s Horn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104210, 'Shadow Clone of Succubus'),
(104211, 'Bat Hunter Polan says Fog Bats in Thorn Cave are shadow clones of the Succubus. He wants the Fog Bats killed to weaken the Succubus. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104212, 'Do you happen to know what kind of a monster the Succubus is?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104213, 'Isn??t she a monster that seduces men in their dreams?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104214, 'Then do you know how the Succubus moves about to show up in men??s dreams?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104215, 'Does she transform into a bat to fly?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104216, 'To be precise she moves around with a bat she created with a portion of her strength. A bat created in such a manner hides in caves until night time then flies out looking for prey when it??s dark. But you can??t think of them as normal bats. These bats inherited a portion of the Succubus?? strength, so they??re quite strong. However, on the other hand, the Succubus herself becomes weak after creating such a bat because it??s made with a portion of her strength.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104217, 'So we have to wait to target the Succubus until she is weakened from creating a lot of bats.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104218, 'That??s what I??m trying to say. So you should kill as many {color,yellow,Fog Bats} as you can in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}. Then, as we just went over, we attack the Succubus who??s been weakened from creating her bats.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I??ll take out as many as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Isn??t there another way?][2]'),
(104219, 'I??ll be exhausted from killing bats before I even attack the Succubus.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104220, 'That won??t do. However, thanks to you, the Succubus should be pretty worn out as well. So hang in there!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104221, 'Kill as many {color,yellow,Fog Bats} as you can inside of {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104230, 'Thorn Cave??s Overseer'),
(104231, 'Bat Hunter Polan says Pamelia of Red Fire alerts the Succubus of any danger. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104232, 'No matter how strong you are, a direct confrontation against the Succubus would be difficult.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104233, 'Is there a plan?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104234, 'It??s not a grand plan but first, {color,yellow,Pamelia of Red Fire} has to be killed. As {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}??s Overseer, She reports everything that occurs within Thorn Cave to the Succubus. So You have to kill Pamelia of Red Fire before the Succubus learns of your presence.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I??ll take care of it as quietly as I can.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Isn??t there another method?][2]'),
(104235, 'Did you kill Pamelia of Red Fire? The Succubus hasn??t noticed yet?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104236, 'If she noticed, Thorn Cave would be noisy. But it doesn??t seem like the Succubus has noticed it yet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104237, 'Then we should start preparing to end this all.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104238, 'Kill {color,yellow,Pamelia of Red Fire} in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave} before the Succubus learns of your presence.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104240, 'Conqueror of Dreams, Succubus Queen Karen'),
(104241, 'Bat Hunter Polan wants to awaken from the horrendous nightmare by killing the Succubus Queen Karen. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104242, 'It??s time to awaken from this nightmare.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104243, 'Only Succubus Queen Karen remains.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104244, 'Kill {color,yellow,Succubus Queen Karen} and put an end to my nightmares of being encaged in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104245, 'What? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104246, '(Bat Hunter Polan goes limp as if he fell asleep.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let??s go kill Succubus first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How can you fall asleep at an important moment like this?][2]'),
(104247, 'I killed Succubus Queen Karen. Now stop sleeping and wake up!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104248, '(Yawns loudly and opens his eyes.)\n\nW-Who are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104249, 'Are you not fully awake yet? Polan, it??s me, [NAME]. I killed Succubus Queen Karen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104250, 'Do you know me? Who are you? Also, where am I? I was sure I was sleeping at my house.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104251, 'What? What are you talking about? You were just strategizing how to kill Succubus Queen Karen with me. You really don??t know who I am?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104252, 'I-I??m not sure what you??re talking about, but I was really sleeping at my own house. I haven??t had a pretty woman in my dream in a while, so I was really happy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104253, 'Kill {color,yellow,Succubus Queen Karen} and put an end to my nightmares of being encaged in {color,yellow,Thorn Cave}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104260, 'Bat Hunter Polan??s Dream'),
(104261, 'Bat Hunter Polan says he was sleeping at his own house. Let??s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104262, 'Do you happen to know why I??m here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104263, 'That??s what I want to ask you, Polan. You really don??t remember anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104264, 'Sigh. This is really confusing. I don??t know what??s going on at all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104265, 'Well, you mentioned a pretty woman appeared in your dream earlier. Can you tell me a bit about that dream?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104266, 'She was a really pretty person, but now that I??m actually trying to speak of her, I can??t recall anything. She was definitely one of those beautiful women you??d never forget. But I can??t remember what shoes she was wearing, what accessories she had, and not even what color her clothes were.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104267, 'Calm down and think slowly. Then you should be able to recall something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104268, 'I don??t know. I really don??t know. Also, I think she thanked me but I don??t know what she thanked me for at all.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104269, 'Polan, it looks like you were mesmerized by Succubus Queen Karen. That??s why you came here Polan, and you regained your consciousness when I killed Succubus Queen Karen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104270, 'I was mesmerized by the Succubus? But then why did she thank me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104271, 'Who know? I??m not sure about that. Maybe you??re mistaken, Polan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104272, 'Y-You think so?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104273, '(Or she may have sought me out on purpose for her tragedy.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100060, 'Rumors'),
(100061, 'Town Chief Guiltian is worried about what Marenne told him but is too busy to investigate it further. Help him by going to Marenne to find out more.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100062, 'I wonder if the strange rumors about Kahalzar Mountains are true?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100063, 'You seem worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100064, 'Oh, you\'re here [NAME]. \nMarenne told me something a couple days ago and now I can\'t concentrate on anything else. But I\'m just too busy to investigate.\nThat\'s why I wanted to ask you for help; so I can continue with my responsibilities in the village.\nCan you investigate the rumors for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100065, 'Of course I\'ll help you, town chief. Where should I start?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100066, 'Entry to the Kahalzar Mountains, south of Kahal Plains, used to be sealed off to all outsiders. But recent rumors are saying that someone has been able to get in.\nPlease go to Marenne and ask who it was.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I still have something to do in Adealia. I will go later.][2]'),
(100067, 'Did you need anything from me? Or did you maybe bring me something for my research?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100068, 'Please hurry to Marenne and ask her who got into Kahalzar Mounts!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100070, 'The Truth Behind the Rumors'),
(100071, 'Luke of the Hunter\'s Union was the one who instigated the current rumors. Go find Luke in Kahal Plains and ask him whether the rumors are true or not.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100072, 'Welcome. Did you bring me something new for my research?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100073, 'No, I\'m here because the Town Chief sent me. He wants to know more about the rumors going around lately. Who did you say went to the mountains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100074, 'Ah yes, you want to know more about the rumors! I heard Luke talking when I went to Kahal Plains to buy materials I needed for my research.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100075, 'Luke? What did he say he was doing in the mountains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100076, 'I only heard him talking about going there. I was worried that my materials might start to spoil, so I had to hurry home. It would be best if you went and asked Luke yourself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go right away to ask him about that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to go all the way to Kahal Plains.][2]'),
(100077, 'Welcome! What can I do for you this time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100078, 'Go to Luke in Kahal Plains and ask him about Kahalzar Mountains.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100080, 'The Situation in Kahalzar Mountains'),
(100081, 'Go to Luke of the Hunter\'s Union in Kahal Plains and ask him what is happening inside the Kahalzar Mountains.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100082, 'Hello, what can I do for you? Are you here to hear about how to get beyond the seal in the mountains?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100083, 'Yes I am. How did you get past the seal and into the Kahalzar Mountains? What did you see there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100084, 'Heh what\'s the rush? Take your time and ask your questions!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100085, 'I\'m sorry, I was just so curious. I didn\'t mean to overwhelm you.\nHow were you able to enter the mountains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100086, 'A while back, I discovered a hole in the seal. I used that hole to get inside.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100087, 'Did you see anything special inside?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100088, 'Everything was shrouded in darkness. But inside the darkness, there was a city where the Yeti lived.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100089, 'A Yeti city in the darkness...\nBut what was the cause of the darkness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100090, 'I\'m not sure about that. But why don\'t you ask Darian? He uses magic, so maybe he has an idea as to what caused it. Go, talk to him!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100091, 'I don\'t have much strength left.\nI hope I can help you, [NAME]. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100092, 'You\'ll find Darian near the Cursed Elf Post in Kahal Plains. Please give him my regards.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100100, 'Bera, the Village that Appeared When the Seal Weakened'),
(100101, 'After Darian explains the reason for the darkness in Kahalzar Mountains to you, find and talk to the town chief of Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100102, 'I don\'t have much strength left... I hope I can help you, [NAME]. What brings you here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100103, 'Luke said the Kahalzar Mountains are shrouded in darkness.\nI came here because I thought you might know something about this darkness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100104, 'Ah, I know what you\'re talking about. \nOne day I suddenly felt a dark energy coming from the mountains.\nWhen I started looking into it, I found that Fargels occupied the inside of the darkness. He probably has gathered followers by now who have also submitted to this darkness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100105, 'What? Fargels again?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100106, 'If you want to know more, go to the village of the Ancient Elves, {color,yellow,Bera}. Their descendants still live there and they should be able to tell you more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100107, '{color,yellow,Bera}, the village of the Ancient Elves? I\'ve never heard of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100108, 'There is a village on the way to the Kahalzar Mountains that used to be completely isolated.\nWhen the seal became weak, the thunder and lighting that once cut the village off disappeared. Now it can be easily reached.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100109, 'I think I should go there. When I get to {color,yellow,Bera}, whom should I talk to first?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100110, 'Your best bet will be to talk to the town chief of {color,yellow,Bera}. His name is Balier.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I see.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It was hard enough coming here. I need to rest before I continue.][2]'),
(100111, 'Welcome to {color,yellow,Bera}, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100112, 'When the seal at Kahalzar Mountains started to weaken, {color,yellow,Bera}, the village of the Ancient Elves, reappeared.\nTalk to the Balier, Town Chief of Bera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100120, 'Town Chief Balier of Bera'),
(100121, 'After talking to Bera\'s Town Chief Balier, go and meet the eldest person in town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100122, 'Welcome to {color,yellow,Bera}.\nOh, do you by any chance belong to the Henneath Adventurer Union? I\'m very excited to meet you!\nI\'ve been hoping for adventurers from Henneath to find their way to {color,yellow,Bera} for some time now.\nMy name is {color,yellow,Balier, Town Chief of the Elvish city Bera}. You having found your way here means that we\'ll soon be able to start trading with other villages.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100123, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] of the Henneath Adventurer Union. I\'m here to investigate a rumor that has been going around in Adealia.\nAs descendants of the Ancient Elves and living in the vicinity of Kahalzar Mountains, I was wondering if you maybe knew something about the darkness spreading there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100124, 'All that happened before we were born, so we don\'t know much either. But maybe Elder Duskin might know something. Why don\'t go you and introduce yourself to him?\nI will give you a recommendation letter from me that you can show him.\nOh, and don\'t forget to introduce yourself to the other villagers as well!\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go later. First I want to look around the village.][2]'),
(100125, 'I haven\'t seen you here before. Who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100126, 'Go to meet Elder Duskin of Bera. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100130, 'Elder Duskin of Bera'),
(100131, 'Talk to Elder Duskin, the oldest living person in Bera, and ask him if he knows anything.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100132, 'I haven\'t seen any adventurers in many years. I\'m {color,yellow,\'Duskin\'}, nice to meet you. People call me \'Elder\' because I\'ve been living here for so long.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100133, 'Hello, I\'m [NAME] from the Henneath Adventure Union. Here\'s a recommendation letter from the Town Chief for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100134, 'I see.\nYou\'re here because you want to know more about the darkness and Kahalzar Mountains! \nThose mountains once were the home to a glorious civilization of Dwarfs and a paradise for Sirens.\nBut then one day, Fargels came and started his sinister scheme. He gained more and more followers and slowly things came to be as they are now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100135, 'Fargels, again? I can\'t believe he\'s done all this. He must be evil.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100136, 'We were worried that Fargels\' influence might extend to this village, so we sent out a group of scouts.\nThe Town Chief\'s sister Hilda and her friend Hunter are part of that group. They probably found something already. \nGo to them and ask what they learned of the situation. That should help you as well as us.\nSince they might reservations against a stranger suddenly appearing, I\'ll give you a letter to take along. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100140, 'To Kahal Snow Plains'),
(100141, 'Go to Kahal Snow Plains and talk to Hunter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100142, 'Here\'s the letter. Take this, enter the seal and then go to Kahal Snow Plains.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100143, 'Where do I have to go?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100144, 'If you go southeast from the village, you\'ll see a crack in the seal.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll go.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of people I don\'t know.][2]'),
(100145, 'Who are you? I\'ve never seen you before... If you come any closer, I\'ll put an arrow in your head.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100146, 'There\'s a crack in the seal leading to the Kahalzar Mountains to the southeast of Bera village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100150, 'Meeting Hunter'),
(100151, 'Talk to Hunter in Kahal Snow Plains.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100152, 'Who are you? I\'ve never seen you before. If you come any closer, I\'ll put an arrow in your head.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100153, 'Wait! I came from Bera. Here, I have a letter for you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100154, 'A letter from the village Elder? I\'m sorry about what I said. My name is Hunter, I\'m part of the scout team that was sent here.\nThe letter says you\'re here to get information? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100155, 'I\'d hate to be on your bad side!\nYes, I\'m here to find out more about the Kahal Snow Plains.\nCan you tell me more about this place, Hunter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100156, 'This place? You mean the Kahal Snow Plains? I\'m sorry I have to disappoint you, but I\'ve been so busy examining the crack in the seal that I didn\'t have time to check out anything else. \n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100157, 'Please tell me if you\'ve found out anything of importance.\nOh, wait! Where is Hilda?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100158, 'Ah, don\'t even mention her name.\nYou have no idea how much she complained on the way here about having been sent to such a cold place.\nI wanted to investigate more thoroughly and thus take more time, so she went ahead. I hope she is alright...\nWould you mind going and checking on her? I still have things left to do here.\nOh! Why don\'t you talk to Cuero first? He\'s a dwarf that has lived here his whole life. He might be able to help you.   \n\n[BUTTON]=[Good, I\'ll talk to Cuero.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of people I don\'t know.][2]'),
(100159, 'I don\'t recognize your face. Who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100160, 'We became friends when I visited Kahal Snow Plains in the past. As a dwarf he\'ll surely know more about what happened at the snow plains.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100170, 'Meeting Cuero'),
(100171, 'Talk to Cuero in Kahal Snow Plains and ask him for information.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100172, 'A strange adventurer. Why are you here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100173, 'Hello. I\'m [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. Are you Cuero?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100174, 'How do you know my name? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100175, 'Hunter told me about you. She told me you live in the Kahal Snow Plains.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100176, 'What do you wish to know?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100177, 'I came here to find out what has been happening in the Kahal Snow Plains. If you could tell me anything, I\'d really appreciate it.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100178, 'Kahal Snow Plains was once known as the home of a glorious civilization and a paradise for the Sirens. But one day Fargels came with his sinister plans, and our king, Albereo, made a bad decision... This led to the near extinction of the whole dwarvish population.\nThe remaining dwarfs moved west of the Kahalzar Mountains to live there.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100179, 'I\'m sorry to hear of the hardships against your people. I just hope Fargels will be stopped soon.\nBut what brings you here, Cuero?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100180, 'I wanted to find out how the Kahal Snow Plains changed after we dwarfs left. I discovered something strange; time is flowing differently inside the seal. The tragedy of Arkroute only happened a few days ago for us but in the outside world, hundreds of years have passed.\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100181, 'Oh my! So when I return to Bera, it will be hundreds of years in the future?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100182, 'I don\'t think you have to worry about that. Since the crack appeared, time has been identical on both sides of the seal.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100190, 'A Promise to Hunter'),
(100191, 'Talk to Hunter for Cuero.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100192, 'I need to fix my weapon.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100193, 'Is something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100194, 'I was just repairing my weapon when I realized that I was supposed to meet with Hunter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100195, 'Well, you can just leave right now, can\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100196, 'That\'s what I would like to do, but my weapon is too worn.\nThis place is crawling with monsters, so I need to be prepared to defend myself at any time.\nWhat can I do... Oh, why don\'t you go and tell her I won\'t make it in time?\n\n[BUTTON]=[OK, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you do it yourself when you\'re done here?][2]'),
(100197, 'Hunter, why do you look so down?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100198, 'Well...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100199, 'Tell her I\'m sorry I couldn\'t make it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100200, 'Cuero\'s Worries'),
(100201, 'Hunter tells you that Cuero has a big problem. Go to the Kahal Snow Plains him and help him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100202, 'My poor friend Cuero...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100203, 'Did something happen, Hunter? You look worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100204, 'It\'s not me, it\'s Cuero.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100205, 'What? What is wrong with Cuero?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100206, 'He still doesn\'t know... Could you deliver this message to him? And please help him if you can.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go right away!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think it\'s that bad.][2]'),
(100207, 'Did you tell her what I said?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100208, 'That\'s not important now! Something has happened! Here, look at this.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100209, 'What is it? Let\'s see... What? But how...\n(Cuero desperately)\nMy daughter... My daughter! No...\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100210, 'There is no time... Please hurry to Cuero!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100220, 'The Whereabouts of Cuero\'s Daughter, Gerta'),
(100221, 'Cuero\'s daughter, Gerta, has disappeared from Arkroute. Find out where she is.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100222, 'Please help me find my daughter Gerta...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100223, 'What did the letter say? What happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100224, 'None of my people who went to Arkroute came back home. But my daughter Gerta was with them...\nOh, my beloved daughter! *sniff* \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100225, 'Cuero, you keep doing what you\'re doing and I\'ll help you. I just need to go to Arkroute and find your daughter, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100226, 'Would you do that? Please, find her...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll hurry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Maybe she went off to some other place?][2]'),
(100227, 'Are you Gerta? What happened here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100228, 'Are you still in your right mind? Who are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100229, 'Your father, Cuero, sent me here to find you. Something is wrong with the others here. Are you alright?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100230, 'You didn\'t drink from that water when you came here, did you? No matter what, you cannot drink it! Everyone who did suddenly started acting strange. \nI didn\'t drink any either, so I\'m alright.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100231, 'My daughter\'s name is Gerta. Please find her!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100240, 'Cuero\'s Daughter Gerta '),
(100241, 'Go deep into the workshop, steal the components and blueprints for the ancient weapon and bring them to Cuero.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100242, 'Critical materials from Arkroute\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100243, 'Hey, you!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100244, '"Hey, you"? My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. Now let\'s get out of here, it\'s too dangerous for you to stay alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100245, '[NAME]? I was just kidding.\nI just want to take a better look around before I go. If the dwarves attack me, I\'ll just act like I\'m crazy, that should keep them away.\nBut what\'s more important are the critical materials from Arkroute. I can\'t steal them on my own.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100246, 'Are you sure you\'ll be alright here? I\'m more worried about you than about the materials. \nI\'ll get the materials for you. What do I need to look for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100247, 'Don\'t worry about me. Just get the {color,yellow,\'Workshop Technician\'}\'s ancient weapon components and the {color,yellow,\'Workshop Designer\'}\'s blueprints.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I \'ll steal them and bring them straight to Cuero.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You were rude to me so I won\'t help you.][2]'),
(100248, 'Cuero! *pant pant* \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100249, 'What happened? Did you find Gerta?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100250, 'I meant to drag her back here but she said she had something else to investigate and told me not to worry.\nShe\'s very brave for her age. Oh, and she asked me to bring these important materials from Arkroute to you.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100251, 'I feel much better hearing that she is OK. \nAs a father, I cannot help but worry. But she\'s being stubborn. I wonder who she got that from?\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100252, 'Please hurry and steal the materials then bring them to my father!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100260, 'Enchanted Materials from Arkroute'),
(100261, 'Take the ancient weapon blueprint to Hilda.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100262, 'The cask with the blueprint does not open.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100263, 'Heave ho! Heave ho! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100264, 'Let me try.\n*struggles*\nHm, strange...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100265, 'Why doesn\'t it open? Maybe someone put a spell on the cask itself... \nCould you take it to Hilda and ask her? She knows about magic.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Too bothersome. Can\'t you just take an axe to the cask?][2]'),
(100266, 'Hilda, could you take a look at this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100267, 'What? You brought this all the way here just because you can\'t open it?\n \n[NEXT]'),
(100268, 'Take a good look at it. Can\'t you see that something isn\'t quite right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100269, 'Hm... You\'re right. It\'s magically sealed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100270, 'Take the cask to Hilda who knows a lot about magic.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100280, 'The Truth Behind the Materials from Arkroute'),
(100281, 'Hilda was able to open the cask with the blueprints. Inside were also Fargels\' invasion plans. When Hilda saw its contents, she sent a message to Duskin and Balier at the village. Return to Bera and discuss how to proceed.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100282, 'Alohomora!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100283, 'Wow, you had no problem at all. Impressive!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100284, 'Don\'t flatter me! Shall we look inside?\nHere are the plans, but what\'s this? \n<Fargels\' Invasion Plans>\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100285, 'That evil Fargels! He\'s planning to invade Isya!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100286, 'I think I should send a message about all this to Bera. And I\'d like to ask you to return there as well to help work on a solution.\n \n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So much fuss about a single piece of paper?][2]'),
(100287, 'Chief, did you receive the message?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100288, 'Fargels is preparing to use Arkroute technology to attack us...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100289, 'Please hurry back to Bera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100290, 'The Elder\'s Advice'),
(100291, 'Town Chief Balier saw Fargels\' invasion plans... He asked you to get advice from the Elder.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100292, '*trembling*\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100293, 'Why are you shaking? We just need to stop Fargels from carrying out his plans.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100294, 'You only say that, [NAME], because you haven\'t seen the glorious civilization of the dwarfs. Their technology and their weapons surpassed anything you could imagine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100295, 'No matter how powerful they are, the Henneath Adventurer Union will easily stop them with bravery and conviction!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100296, 'Those words don\'t exactly comfort me. Maybe the Elder knows of another way. Please go and talk to him.\n \n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100297, 'Elder, how have you been?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100298, 'Fine, I\'m fine. But I imagine you came here because of Fargels\' invasion; right, [NAME]?\nI don\'t know what we can do to stop it. The only chance we have is if the leader of the Elderine guard sends us more adventurers like you, [NAME].\nIf we trust in their courage, I know not even someone like Fargels will be able to stop them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100299, 'Go to the Elder and get his advice.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100300, 'Hunter is Worried About Hilda'),
(100301, 'Hunter came with Hilda to the Kahal Snow Plains. But when Hilda left to go up ahead, Hunter started to worry about her. Find Hilda.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100302, 'I wonder if she\'s alright all by herself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100303, 'You seem worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100304, 'Oh, It\'s because of Hilda... The Town Chief trusted me to keep her safe and now we\'re both investigating alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100305, 'You didn\'t have a choice. Do you want me to go and look for her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100306, 'Would you do that? You\'ll recognize her, she\'s carrying a bow.\n \n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100307, 'Who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100308, 'An Elf who carries a bow, I should be able to spot her easily.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100310, 'Meeting Hilda 1'),
(100311, 'You met Hilda. She started right off by giving you a job to do. Help her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100312, 'Brrr, it\'s freezing! I can\'t believe the Elder sent me out here to investigate!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100313, 'Hello. Are you Hilda? I\'m [NAME]. I\'m here to check out the Kahal Snow Plains.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100314, 'Forget the introductions for now! I need you to go and kill me a Yeti!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100315, 'What? You\'re ordering me to kill a Yeti for you?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100316, 'I don\'t have time for chit-chat. Hurry up and kill a Yeti, then we can talk!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Well, I guess I\'ll do that then.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like to fight.][2]'),
(100317, 'At least I got a good workout. I think I\'m done now. But don\'t you think it\'s a bit rude to send me right into battle without a proper introduction?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100318, 'I\'m sorry! But you\'re pretty good. How can you be so strong? Who are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100319, 'Hurry and kill a Yeti.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100320, 'Meeting Hilda 2'),
(100321, 'Those giant Yetis are planning to attack Bera. We have to strike first and overpower them.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100322, 'The Yetis are taken care of now, but if the giant Yeti are planning to attack the village...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100323, 'Hello, Hilda. I\'m [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. I came here to investigate the Kahal Snow Plains.\nBy the way, this is the second time that I\'m introducing myself to you...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100324, 'I\'m sorry, I was a bit distracted earlier. Please understand.\nBut no wonder that you\'re from the Henneath Adventurer Union. That\'s why you were able to kill the Yeti so easily!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100325, 'Well, that wasn\'t very hard. But what bone do you have to pick with the Yetis?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100326, 'I managed to spy on the Yetis but then they discovered me. I had to flee.\nHowever I found out that the giant Yetis are planning to attack my home town, Bera. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100327, 'An attack plan? But why would they want to attack Bera?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100328, 'Isn\'t that obvious? They want to bring the darkness to Bera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s terrible. I\'ll kill them right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know, that doesn\'t sound plausible.][2]'),
(100329, 'They are a bit large and a bit difficult to kill, but still...\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100330, 'I knew it when you killed the Yeti! You\'re incredible! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100331, 'Now you need to deal with the giant Yetis who are planning to attack the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100340, 'Hilda\'s Request 1'),
(100341, 'Hilda asked you to examine the strange statue north of Vannel.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100342, 'I have another favor to ask of you, will you help me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100343, 'What kind of favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100344, 'Promise me you\'ll do it, then I\'ll tell you what it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100345, 'That doesn\'t sound very fair. Didn\'t I already kill a Yeti for you?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100346, 'Okay, okay. I\'ll tell you.\nWhile I was being chased by a Yeti, I came to a lake. There I saw a strange statue.\nI didn\'t think much about it until I saw that something scary was written on it.\nSomething about a "swamp of death" but I can\'t remember what the rest was.\nActually, I was so scared that I didn\'t want to go anywhere near it again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100347, 'What are you saying? You were scared at the sight of a simple statue?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100348, 'Everything was dark and I came across a statue that said "swamp of death," so I ran without reading the rest.\nBut now I\'m just too curious. Can you go and check it out? And don\'t you dare run away like I did, or I\'ll never let you hear the end of it!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Piece of cake! I\'ll go right now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared, too. I don\'t want to go.][2]'),
(100349, 'Beware of Akisha if she appears.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100350, 'Investigate the strange statue north of Vannel.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100360, 'The Woman of the Statue'),
(100361, 'Talk to Akisha near the statue.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100362, 'Beware of Akisha if she appears.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100363, 'Akisha? Who are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100364, '(A far away voice)\nWho are you? You, who came from the snow of death... Come to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I should follow that voice.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared, I shouldn\'t go.][2]'),
(100365, 'Come here...\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100366, 'Who are you? Why did you tell me to come to you?\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100367, 'Aren\'t you afraid of me? You don\'t seem afraid.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100368, 'I\'m [NAME] of the Henneath Adventurer Union. You can say what you want, I don\'t easily get scared.\nBut why are you standing next to such a cold lake?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100369, 'I\'m Akisha, owner of this lake.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100370, 'Akisha? The name that\'s written on that stone there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100371, 'Yes. I wasn\'t such a bad person. I did something and they all misunderstood my intentions.\nWhen the people became scared of me, I started to despise them as well. I try to be scary so that they don\'t come near me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100372, 'I see. But what happened that the people think so wrongly of you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100373, 'I fell for Fargels\' ideology and when I saw a human dancer who danced better than me. I started to hate her.\nMy jealousy brought out the worst in me and I took her here to kill her.\nWhen I came back to my senses, it was already too late. People only saw this evil and started avoiding me. They built a statue like that wherever I appeared.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100374, ' Beware of her.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100380, 'Akisha Asks for Forgiveness'),
(100381, 'Now return to Hilda to tell her about Akisha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100382, ' If I could only be forgiven...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100383, 'I know it\'s pathetic but I only wish everyone would forgive me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100384, 'I\'ll try my best. But I can\'t promise you that they will change their minds.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100385, 'Yes, my brave friend. You have my gratitude.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go and talk to them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t I stay with you for a bit?.][2]'),
(100386, ' Hilda.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100387, 'You look like nothing happened.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100388, 'Please tell them what I said...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100390, 'Take Duskin\'s Message to Balier 1'),
(100391, 'Report what you found out to Elder Duskin.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100392, 'Report to the Elder about the Sirens and Arkroute.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100393, 'So that\'s the story behind the statue!\n[NAME], would you mind reporting everything we\'ve found out about the Sirenes and Arkroute to the Elder of Bera?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100394, 'What are you going to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100395, 'Don\'t be so nosy. I have my own secret investigation going on that I can\'t tell you about.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll go if you tell me the secret.][2]'),
(100396, 'Elder!\nHere\'s a report of everything that has happened so far.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100397, 'Yes, the Sirens and Arkroute. Wait a moment.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100398, 'Everything is changing so quickly. Please hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100400, 'Take Duskin\'s Message to Balier 2'),
(100401, 'After reading the message, Elder Duskin wrote a letter. Take it to Balier in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100402, 'Please take this to the Town Chief.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100403, 'I know you must be tired, [NAME], but could you take care of this letter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100404, 'What does it say? May I read it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100405, 'Can you? If you can, you may read it. It\'s written in Elvish so I would be surprised if you could.\nI\'ve gotten used to writing documents in Elvish, so I did it without even thinking about it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100406, 'Eh? What\'s this? I can\'t read a single word. That\'s unfair.\n\n[NEXT]  '),
(100407, 'I\'ve gotten used to writing messages in Elvish, please understand. \nTake this letter to the Town Chief, and he\'ll tell you what it says, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll deliver it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t go if you don\'t tell me what it says.][2]'),
(100408, 'Did you see a lot of the Kahalzar Mountains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100409, 'A lot of things happened. Read this to find out more. The Elder asked me to bring it to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100410, 'Hm... This is not good.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(100411, 'Take the letter to Town Chief Balier in Bera.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100420, 'Building a Strike Team for Arkroute'),
(100421, 'Cuero wants to create a strike team to send to Arkroute. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100422, 'Can you go to Bera for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100423, 'Please hurry. Go to Bera and find out whether or not they can set up a strike team for Arkroute.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100424, 'What? A strike team? But those are your own people.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100425, 'It pains me as well, but what can I do? The dwarf village has come to the same conclusion.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I see..][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That\'s impossible.][2]'),
(100426, 'You\'re back, [NAME]!\nWhy do you look so sullen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100427, 'I feel bad for bringing you this request.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100428, 'What are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100429, 'Cuero is requesting a strike on Arkroute because it fell to Fargels\' darkness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100430, 'So the dwarf village decided that this was unavoidable. \nI don\'t think we will be able to solve this problem alone. I\'ll send a message to the Elderine guards asking for the aid of more Henneath Adventurers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100431, 'What can we do? It\'s already too late...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100440, 'Becoming Part of the Arkroute Strike Team'),
(100441, 'Preparations for the strike team have been completed in Bera. Everything else lies in Cuero\'s hands. Go to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100442, 'The strike team is ready.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100443, 'They say the strike team is read. Will you participate as well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100444, 'It hurts me but if the Henneath Adventurer Union participates, I cannot just stand by and watch. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100445, 'Yes, this is unavoidable. Thank you for your help. Everything else lies in the hands of Cuero. Please help him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100446, '[NAME], you\'re back?\nThis pains me as much as it does you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100447, 'Yes, I know. But Fargels... we won\'t let him get away with this!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100448, 'Yes... Thank you for making that decision.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100449, 'Please hurry... or it will be too late.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100450, 'Killing Arkoute Guards'),
(100451, 'Kill the guards that guard the entrance to Arkroute.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100452, 'Kill the guards at the entrance to Arkroute.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100453, 'To get into Arkroute, we first need to break through their defenses. Please kill their guards.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100454, 'I think you managed to break through the guards\' defense. Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100455, 'Now we need to get ready... \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100460, 'Killing Arkroute Guards (Repeat)'),
(100461, 'Kill the guards that guard the entrance to Arkroute.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100462, 'Kill the guards at the entrance to Arkroute.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100463, 'To get into Arkroute, we first need to break through their defenses. Please kill their guards.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100464, 'I think you managed to break through the guards\' defense. Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100465, 'Now the guards have become nervous.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100470, 'Killing Arkroute Trainees'),
(100471, 'Now it\'s time to kill the trainees at the Arkroute entrance.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100472, 'They are training at the Alkain workshop.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100473, 'The guards aren\'t the only ones at the entrance, there are also the trainees who carry out different chores. Please kill them as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100474, 'I thought the trainees were a piece of cake but their resistance is quite strong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100475, 'Back in the day, they were as harmless as sheep, but Fargels\' darkness must have brought out the worst in them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100476, 'Don\'t think they\'re easy targets just because they are trainees.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100480, 'Capturing Arkroute\'s Entrance (Repeat)'),
(100481, 'The entrance to Arkroute is guarded by guards and trainees. Recapture the entrance.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100482, 'It\'s starts with the entrance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100483, 'Their defenses are strong... I don\'t know how best to proceed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100484, 'Why don\'t we start by occupying the entrance?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100485, 'That\'s what we should do. Will you continue attacking the entrance, [name]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100486, 'Now we\'re in control over the entrance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100487, 'Hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100490, 'Important Blueprints'),
(100491, ' Retrieve the workshop designers\' Blueprints.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100492, 'We need Blueprints.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100493, 'Things are looking bad. We\'ve received word that the designers are using the blueprints as weapons.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100494, 'But how can they use blueprints as weapons? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100495, 'This is no joking matter. Arkroute is based on these documents and if just anyone is running around with them... I need you to go and retrieve them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100496, 'Well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100497, 'We need as many as possible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100500, 'Important Blueprints (Repeat)'),
(100501, 'Retrieve the workshop designers\' blueprints.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100502, 'We need more blueprints.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100503, 'The documents all of Arkroute is based on. Many are still missing. Please go and retrieve them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100504, 'Well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100505, 'We need as many as possible. Many are still missing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100510, 'Special Wrenches'),
(100511, 'There\'s a special wrench that contains the memories of the workshop designers. Find it.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100512, 'They have a special wrench.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100513, 'A wrench... \nSomething that is very precious to Arkroute...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100514, 'What about this wrench? Isn\'t it just something used for assembly?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100515, 'What are you talking about?!\nThis wrench is bestowed unto workshop designers who have spent years and years carrying out all kinds of chores.\nFor normal people it might just be a regular wrench but for a workshop designer, it\'s the tool of a lifetime.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100516, 'But they\'re just using them as weapons now!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100517, 'That\'s why it pains me so much to see them... \nI can still remember each one of their faces when I gave them their wrench...\nNow that they have fallen to the darkness, I want to hold onto their wrenches for them, in their memory. Please get them for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100518, 'Wrenches of memories..\nDesigners... I will keep them safe for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100519, 'Make sure to remember who you took which wrench from, so you can tell me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100520, 'Special Wrenches (Repeat)'),
(100521, 'Cuero needs more wrenches. Bring him more of the workshop designer\'s memory Wrenches.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100522, 'Wrenches with the memories of the workshop designers...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100523, 'You brought me these, [NAME], but there are still many missing. Can you get me more?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100524, 'Wrenches of memories..\nDesigners... I will keep them safe for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100525, 'Make sure to remember who you took which wrench from, so you can tell me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100530, 'Astan Remodeling'),
(100531, 'Only the best technicians are allowed to build Astan. Kill them so they cannot work anymore.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100532, 'The best technicians are working on Astan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100533, 'This isn\'t good... I received word that the best of the technicians are working on Astan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100534, 'Astan? What\'s that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100535, 'Originally, Astans were used for transport but now the mechanics are remodeling them to turn them into weapons. \nThat\'s bad. The more they complete, the tougher our job will be.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will make sure they cannot make any more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just leave them be.][2]'),
(100536, 'Are they still making them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100537, 'Yes, I heard they already finished a great number.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100538, 'What?! There is more of them? Well you still did a good job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100539, 'We need to stop them from remodeling Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100540, 'The Best Technicians (Repeat)'),
(100541, 'Kill the mechanics working on remodeling Astans.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100542, 'They are still working.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100543, 'There are still many great technicians working on the Astans.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100544, 'They\'re still making them? Won\'t they give up any time soon?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100545, '[NAME]!\nPlease kill the Astan mechanics so they cannot remodel them anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired, too.][2]'),
(100546, 'Well done. But they are still remodeling the Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100547, 'Please kill the Astan mechanics so they cannot make any more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100550, 'Terrible Astans'),
(100551, 'Kill the Astans the mechanics made.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100552, 'Pure horror.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100553, 'Many members of the strike team suffered greatly under the Astans\' attack.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100554, 'Are the Astans that scary?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100555, 'Their firepower and the strange sound they emit are pure horror.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100556, 'But they\'re still just man-made machines. I\'ll take care of them for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100557, 'You seem confident. Then go and deal with the Astans!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Actually, I don\'t feel so confident.][2]'),
(100558, 'If only their voices weren\'t so loud...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100559, 'Oho... You didn\'t get hurt? Well done.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100560, 'I want to see how good you are.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100570, 'Terrible Astans (repeat)'),
(100571, 'The strike team needs your help. There are still many Astans left in Arkroute. Help the strike team by defeating the Astans terrorizing them. Speak to their team leader know when you\'ve defeated the Astans.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100572, 'I heard there are still many Astans left.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100573, 'Those who joined the strike team are still speaking of the Astans\' terror.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100574, 'There must be still many left.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100575, 'You\'ve already killed some, so please take care of these as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Now I\'m tired.][2]'),
(100576, 'I knew I could count on you! I\'ll be sure to ask for your help next time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100577, 'Please take care of the Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100580, 'Another Astan'),
(100581, 'Someone reported seeing an Astan with someone riding on top of it. They\'re called Astarons. Help destroy the Astarons.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100582, 'The mechanics made another kind of Astan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100583, 'I heard reports there\'s another kind of Astan out there and there\'s something peculiar about it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100584, 'Astaron? With drivers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100585, 'Yes, those! You must have seen them. I never thought there would be another type of Astan out there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100586, 'Shall I destroy them as well?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100587, 'Yes, you\'re already familiar with them. Will you destroy the Astarons?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like I can.][2]'),
(100588, 'I\'ve destroyed them. They weren\'t as dangerous as I originally thought.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100589, 'Well done! I knew you could do it, [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100590, 'Astarons. Don\'t confuse them with Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100600, 'Killing Astarons (Repeat)'),
(100601, 'There are many Astarons still in Arkroute. Kill the Astarons in Arkroute.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100602, 'There are almost as many Astarons as there are Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100603, 'They look just like Astans from the outside but are very different on the inside.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100604, 'There\'s still more of them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100605, 'Will you help us destroy the Astarons, just as you did the Astans?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired now.][2]'),
(100606, 'I\'m sorry for troubling you with all of this. Thank you for helping us again!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100607, 'Astarons. Don\'t confuse them with Astans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100610, 'Workshop Artisans with Astan Cannons'),
(100611, 'The workshop artisans are running around with the Astan cannons that used to be hidden. Stop the workshop artisans and retrieve the Astan cannons.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100612, 'Those artisans!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100613, 'They left the workshop with Astan cannons!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100614, 'Astan cannons?\nWhere did they get those?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100615, 'The workshop artisans usually left most of the work to the technicians and mechanics. In their free time, they started making Astan cannons.\nThey\'ve gone insane and are now running around with them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100616, 'So I just need to kill the workshop artisans?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100617, 'That won\'t be enough.\nIf the mechanics or technicians get their hands the cannons, chaos will break out. You have to retrieve the cannons as well.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired now.][2]'),
(100618, 'Shall we take a look at how they made them? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100619, 'Please stop the workshop artisans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100620, 'Workshop Artisans with Astan Cannons (repeat)'),
(100621, 'Cuero knows of the danger of the Astan cannons. He\'s worried they might cause chaos. Find the Astan cannons and return them to Cuero.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100622, 'Those Astan cannons are dangerous.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100623, 'We have to do something!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100624, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100625, 'After you left. [NAME], I climbed up the mountain to test the Aston cannons\' power.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100626, 'What were your results?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100627, 'I only charged them a little but it was enough to cause some serious damage. If they are fully charged they could blast that whole mountain away!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100628, 'What a scary thought!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100629, 'We have to do something. There are more Astan cannons out there. Please retrieve them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m tired now.][2]'),
(100630, 'You were right. I saw a lot of Astan cannons out there but only brought this many because they\'re so heavy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100631, 'Just as I thought. Can I ask you for another favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100632, 'Please go and find those dangerous Astan cannons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100640, 'The Greatest Weapon of Arkroute'),
(100641, 'Fargels\' ultimate weapon was spotted in Arkroute by the scouts. Kill Fargels\' ultimate weapon, Astanica.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100642, 'Astanica, Fargels\' ultimate weapon!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100643, '[NAME], [NAME]!\nAccording to the scouts I sent out, Fargels\' ultimate weapon has been sighted in Arkroute.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100644, 'If it\'s his ultimate weapon, was it designed according to the blueprints Greta gave me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100645, 'Correct!\nThe scouts\' report and the blueprints contain identical information.\nWe were so worried about Astanica and now it\'s completed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100646, 'The Astans and Astarons have great firepower but due to their weak defenses, we were able to defeat them. Won\'t it be the same case with Astanica? I don\'t think it will be too difficult to destroy it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100647, 'Sadly, you\'re wrong. They equipped it with the glove of space, so it has much greater defenses now.\nYou won\'t be able to defeat it alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100648, 'That sounds scary! What can we do? I know! I\'ll take some allies along when I fight it. The Henneath Adventurer Union is incredibly strong when we stand together.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100649, 'The Henneath Adventurer Union. Yes, then Astanica should be an easy opponent for you. Will you gather some friends and help us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t feel like it.][2]'),
(100650, 'I knew it! The great Henneath Adventurer Union! There\'s nothing they can\'t do as a team.\nThat will stop Fargels in his tracks for now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100651, 'You won\'t be able to defeat Astanica alone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100660, 'Hunter\'s Favor 1'),
(100661, 'Hunter doesn\'t have enough ammunition to catch any more Porgies. She asks you to catch some for her. Catch some Porgies and return to Hunter.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100662, 'I don\'t have any more ammunition. What do I do now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100663, 'You\'re just standing there, not hunting?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100664, 'I ran out of ammunition.\nThe Porgies have such thick fur that just one or two bullets per Porgy aren\'t enough. \nI don\'t know what to do now. Hm, your weapon looks sturdy. Could I ask you to go hunting for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, this weapon is just for decoration.][2]'),
(100665, 'They have incredibly thick fur. I still managed to catch some though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100666, 'Oh! You\'re really good.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100667, 'Ah, yes, you. Can I ask you a favor? Just catch me some Porgies.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100670, 'Hunter\'s Favor 2'),
(100671, 'Hunter asks for another favor. She wants you to kill Werebears for her. Kill the snow plains Werebears. Return to Hunter when you\'re done.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100672, 'I trust in your abilities.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100673, 'You\'re incredibly good!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100674, 'You flatter me. It wasn\'t really that difficult.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100675, 'Since you\'re already at it, please kill some {color,yellow,Werebears} for me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100676, 'Well, I already caught Porgies. How hard can  {color,yellow,Werebears} be?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100677, 'Snow plains Werebears are a lot stronger than regular Werebears.\nWatch out for their claws!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I understand.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want them to tear me apart.][2]'),
(100678, 'Hunter! Is that enough?\nOr do you need me to kill more?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100679, 'I knew it. You\'re really good! That should be enough for now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100680, 'You\'re not ready yet to go into battle?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100690, 'Retrieving Ammunition 1'),
(100691, 'Hunter has run out of ammunition. She says Cuero has more. Go to Cuero and tell him of Hunter\'s request.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100692, 'I just can\'t keep standing around.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100693, 'What\'s wrong, Hunter? Are you hurt?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100694, 'No, it\'s just that when I see you hunting, [NAME], I really want to go out there myself and kill something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100695, 'Haha, and here I thought you were sick or something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100696, 'If I only had ammunition, I could show you my hunting skills. Ah! Maybe Cuero has some more ammunition. \nCan you go to him and tell him I\'ve run out? Ask him if he can spare some ammunition for me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(100697, 'Cuero, Hunter asked me to come here.\nDo you  have some ammunition to spare?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100698, 'Ammunition?  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100699, 'Did you ask Cuero about the ammunition yet?\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100700, 'Retrieving Ammunition 2'),
(100701, 'You went to Cuero for ammunition. While he is making new ones, kill the monsters nearby to pass the time. Speak to Cuero when you\'re done and check on the status of the ammunition.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100702, 'I need some time to make more ammunition.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100703, 'Oh. You don\'t have any readily available?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100704, 'Don\'t pretend you don\'t know. It\'s not like dwarves can create everything out of thin air.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100705, 'How long will I have to wait?\nIs there anything I do while I wait?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100706, 'It won\'t take long. But if you\'re bored why don\'t you kill some of the monsters around here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll take care of them right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll just watch you.][2]'),
(100707, 'I killed them all. Are you done with the ammunition?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100708, 'What took you so long? I had them ready but when you didn\'t return, I gave them to someone else.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100709, 'What? You\'re that quick? And you already sent the ammunition off? You dwarves are really impatient!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100710, 'Impatient? No! You\'re just that slow! \nMaybe you should learn some more about the monsters in Kahal Snow Plains.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100711, 'Hurry up and kill those monsters!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100720, 'Noisy Animals 1'),
(100721, 'Cuero can\'t sleep because the Megantereons are making a lot of strange sounds at night. Find the Megantereons and kill them. Speak to Cuero when you\'re done.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100722, 'Argh! I can\'t concentrate!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100723, 'I can\'t sleep and now I just can\'t concentrate. It\'s driving me crazy!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100724, 'Hey Cuero! Stop yelling! Get a grip!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100725, 'Every night I can hear something crying out there. I can\'t sleep anymore.\nI think it\'s the Megantereons who make that strange sound.\nI need to stay here again tonight, so could you kill the {color,yellow,Megantereons} nearby?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just live with it.][2]'),
(100726, 'That should be enough, right?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100727, 'You scared off the rest of the Megantereons, so they won\'t come near here anymore! Thank you. Now I\'ll finally get a decent night\'s sleep.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100728, 'I hate their cries. Please stop them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100730, 'Noisy Animals 2'),
(100731, 'Even though you scared off the Megantereons, Cuero still can\'t sleep at night. Apparently there are Werebears roaring nearby. Help him get some sleep by killing the Werebears. Let Cuero know when you\'re done.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100732, 'Snoooore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100733, 'Cuero! Wake up! Why are you dozing off in the middle of the day?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100734, 'Yaaaawn.\nI couldn\'t sleep all night because of the noise.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100735, 'What? So it wasn\'t the Megantereons after all?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100736, 'I didn\'t hear any Megantereons. Instead I heard other strange sounds. I\'m pretty sure it was the roar of the {color,yellow,Werebears}.\nPlease kill some Werebears for me so that I can find peace tonight. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just plug your ears while you sleep.][2]'),
(100737, 'Did you kill them? You didn\'t get hurt, did you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100738, 'I got a nasty wound. I have a blister on my precious hand.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100739, 'Ha! Seeing as you can still joke, it can\'t be that bad. Thank you! \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100740, 'This time I need to ask you to kill both {color,yellow,Werebears} and, {color,yellow,Megantereons}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100750, 'Noisy Animals 2 (Repeat)'),
(100751, 'Cuero needs you to kill more monsters so he can sleep at night. Kill the Werebears and Megantereons nearby. Speak to Cuero when you\'re done.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100752, 'I need some peace and quiet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100753, 'Did you sleep well last night?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100754, 'Yes, for the first time in what seems like ages thanks to you!\nCan I trouble you some more today? Could you help me kill more Megantereons and Werebears so I can sleep tonight?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll always help you out.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something else to do. I\'ll help you next time.][2]'),
(100755, 'Can I ask you next time as well?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100756, 'This time I need to ask you to kill both {color,yellow,Werebears} and, {color,yellow,Megantereons}...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100760, 'Fierce Wind'),
(100761, 'Hilda needs help defending herself against the fierce cold winds of Kahal Snow Plains. Kill some Yetis and collect Yeti fur. Bring them back to Hilda so she can make some warmer clothes.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100762, 'Brrr! Cold, so cold!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100763, 'Why is the wind so brisk here? Aren\'t you cold, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100764, 'I\'m cold as well but I just deal with it. The wind here is really something.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100765, 'Considering the Yetis here don\'t suffer in the cold, their fur must be really warm.\nMaybe I could be warmer if I made it into clothes.\n[NAME], can you get me some Yeti fur? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m too cold for that.][2]'),
(100766, 'Here\'s the Yeti fur. Is this enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100767, 'Great, that\'s perfect. I\'ll send it to the village and have some clothes made. Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100768, 'I\'m sorry but can you get me some more {color,yellow,Yeti fur}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100770, 'Special Goods 1'),
(100771, 'There are special Yetis who have a horn. Hilda has received a request from the Town Chief and is asking you to get her some horns. Find the special Yetis and bring their horns back to Hilda.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100772, 'I need something special!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100773, 'Argh, this drives me crazy! It\'s cold and boring, and my brother keeps asking me for weird stuff!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100774, 'What is he asking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100775, 'He said Bera needs to be famous for something special. He told me to get some Yeti horns.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100776, 'But that\'s easy! Just kill some and send their horns back to the village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100777, 'Do you know how hard it was for me to catch that {color,yellow,giant Yeti} last time? I almost got killed!\n[NAME], will you help me? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do it on your own.][2]'),
(100778, 'I knew you could do it! Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100779, 'You\'re not scared, are you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100780, 'Special Goods 2'),
(100781, 'This time the Town Chief is asking Hilda for Mastodos horns. Help Hild collect some Mastodos horns and bring them to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100782, 'Argh, now he\'s telling me to get Mastodos horns!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100783, 'My brother has set his mind on Bera becoming famous for horns. Now he wants me to get {color,yellow,Mastodos} horns.\nAfter you got the Yeti horns so easily last time, [NAME], he wants more horns.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100784, 'Well, we\'ll just have to get some more then. Do you want me to help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100785, 'You\'re the one who started this mess, so you go and get them. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Now it\'s your turn.][2]'),
(100786, 'Is this enough, Hilda? Do you need more?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100787, 'That should be enough for now. I\'ll tell you if I need more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100788, 'You don\'t want to get any more horns, do you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100790, 'Special Goods 2 (Repeat)'),
(100791, 'The Mastodos horns are selling like hot cakes. The Town Chief asked Hilda to send him even more. Hilda\'s having a hard time collecting them on her own. Help Hilda gather some more Mastodos horns and bring them to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100792, 'Pah! This is much too difficult alone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100793, 'It\'s all your fault, [NAME]! The horns are selling so well in Bera, that my brother keeps asking me to send more {color,yellow,Mastodos} horns...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100794, 'But that\'s a good thing. You should be happy to help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100795, 'I don\'t care if the village is doing well! I just hate doing this. Since it\'s all your fault, [NAME], you can go and get the job done!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I\'ll help you one last time.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s your job, you do it!][2]'),
(100796, 'Heave! Ho! Heave! Ho! Is that enough for now? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(100797, 'That should be enough but I\'m sure my brother will sooner or later ask for more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100798, 'Get me as many as possible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100800, 'Magentia'),
(100801, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100802, 'I smell the scent of a foreign land. \nYou, have you come from the outside world?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100803, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. You are very beautiful!\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100804, 'You came all this way to see me. You\'re not a regular person.\nI\'m {color,yellow,High Priest Magentia of the Elvish village Bera}.\nWith the help of the spirits, I can read people. Do you want me to read you?\n\n[NEXT] '),
(100805, 'What kind of person do I seem like? This is rather embarassing.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100806, 'I can see a warm and heartfelt energy surrounding you.\nNo need to be embarrassed.\nBright-eyed adventurer, you will be very happy one day.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100810, 'The Little Priest Etti'),
(100811, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100812, 'Hello. I\'m {color,yellow,Magentia\'s apprentice Etti}.\nYou\'re an adventurer, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100813, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100814, 'I\'m only 8 years old, so you don\'t have to be formal with me. I\'m helping Magentia. \nWelcome to our village.\nI hope you\'ll get some rest here before you leave.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100820, 'Blacksmith MacDillan'),
(100821, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100822, 'Welcome. I\'m {color,yellow,Blacksmith MacDillan} and I like to make swords out of bones.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100823, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100824, 'Finally, the time has come for our village to receive visitors from the outside world. Let me show you my bone swords.\nCome here and look at them. By the way, these are not for sale.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100825, 'Hey! Why are you showing me weapons if you\'re not selling them? I need something I can use to hunt.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100826, 'Hahaha! Okay, okay. Those weapons over there, they are for sale.\nI only made these for fun, so take a look if you like.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100830, 'Item Vendor Edmond'),
(100831, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100832, 'Oho! An adventurer! Nice to meet you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100833, 'Hello. I\'m [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. What is that amazing smell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100834, 'I\'m happy to meet you!\nI\'m selling ingredients and other cooking items.\nDo you like the smell?\nIt\'s coming from my {color,yellow,cooking art, more than food}.\nIf you\'re interested in cooking, you can come and see me any time.\nSo, what do you think? Would you like to cook?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100840, 'Storage Keeper Lily'),
(100841, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100842, 'I don\'t think we\'ve met, adventurer.\nIs there anything you might want to leave with me?\nI\'m {color,yellow,Storage Keeper Lily}. Nice to meet you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU'),
(100843, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union.\nWait a moment, I\'ll look at my bag and see if I have anything for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100844, 'You wouldn\'t happen to have any tasty food, would you?\nTraveling all over the world, you must have come across a lot of food, no?\nSomething sweet, maybe? That\'s true bliss.\nCome on, show me any sweet dishes you have on you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100850, 'Skill Master Hal'),
(100851, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100852, 'Oh, an adventurer.\nI\'m {color,yellow,Skill Master Hal from Bera}.\nPleased to meet you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100853, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union.\nDo you think I might learn a new skill from you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100854, 'Why, yes of course. If you want to learn, I have a lot to teach.\nBut of course I don\'t know everything there is to know either. \nI hope to see you around.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100860, 'Florist Amelia'),
(100861, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100862, 'Excuse me, adventurer.\nPlease don\'t step on the flowers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100863, 'Oh, I\'m sorry! I was in a hurry to start hunting and didn\'t see them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100864, 'That\'s alright. You barely stepped on them, so they\'ll grow back.\nOh! I didn\'t introduce myself. I\'m {color,yellow,Florist Amelia}.\nI\'ll show you my flowers some day, so come and see me when you have the time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100870, 'Stone Vendor Olivia'),
(100871, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100872, 'Hello, adventurer.\nI\'m {color,yellow,Bera\'s Stone Vendor Olivia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100873, 'Hello. I\'m [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. You are very beautiful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100874, 'You\'re very kind. Thank you.\nBut can you feel that? This strange energy surrounding the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100875, 'A strange energy? I\'m not very perceptive, so I\'m not sure.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100876, 'I think maybe it\'s because we haven\'t been open to the outside world before.\nThat\'s why I\'m praying every day now. I hope our village will thrive. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100880, 'Fruit Seller Milly'),
(100881, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100882, 'Excuse me, are you thirsty?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100883, 'You\'re an adventurer, right? So happy to meet you. Yay!\nMy name is Milly. \nM. I. L. L. Y. Isn\'t my name just as pretty as my face?\nAre you thirsty? Would you like something cold to drink? Hehe!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100884, '*Gulp, gulp* Urgh!\nWhat\'s is that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100885, 'Why do you look so disgusted? You have no idea how healthy this drink is!\nLet me see. It\'s made of {color,yellow,carp guts, ginseng root juice, rock salt, potato juice, mint fragrance, parsley juice, olive oil...}!\nIt\'s really good for you! A healthy drink, I promise.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100890, 'The Citizens of Bera'),
(100891, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100892, 'Hey, are you from the outside world?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100893, 'Hello. My name is [NAME] from the Henneath Adventurer Union. Nice to meet you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100894, 'Well, since you\'re here, will you tell me a secret? If you tell me one, I\'ll tell you one about the citizens of Bera.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100895, 'I don\'t really have secrets. But what\'s the secret about the villagers here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100896, 'Are you curious? I\'ll tell you more once you\'ve gotten a bit more attached to our village!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100900, 'The Guards of Bera'),
(100901, 'Let\'s meet villagers of Bera Town.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100902, 'When you\'re wandering around the village, make sure to always greet me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100903, 'Hello. My name is [NAME]. Your equipment looks very different from that of other villages.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100904, 'Of course it does. I overpower my enemies with my great agility, which means I don\'t need any heavy armor.\nNever forget that I\'ll always be watching you while you\'re in our village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100910, 'Bone Sword 1'),
(100911, 'The only true muscle man in Bera, the Blacksmith MacDillan, has the strange hobby of making weapons from monster bones.\nGet some Porgy bones and bring them back to Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100912, 'This bone sword is a masterpiece!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100913, 'Hello, Mr. MacDillan?\nI\'m here to look at the weapons.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100914, 'Heh.\nThose weapons aren\'t important right now!\nHere, take a look at this!\nThis is my {color,yellow,weapon made of monster horns and bones}!\nIt can be used like an actual weapon. Isn\'t it beautiful?\nWhat a perfect weapon! Hahaha!\nBut I\'m still not satisfied.\nI need you to help me out a bit.\nPlease go and get me some {color,yellow,Porgy bones}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I do that?][2]'),
(100915, 'Oh, you got so many! Thank you.\nNow I can make a lot of new bone swords. Haha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100916, 'Why are you working so hard on these swords?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100917, 'It\'s my hobby, but some day I want to create a legendary bone sword. Haha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100918, 'Please hurry up. I really need those bones.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100920, 'Bone Sword 2'),
(100921, 'Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera is making bone swords.\nThis time he needs sturdy teeth to decorate the swords. Collect some sturdy teeth and bring them back to Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100922, 'I need something urgently!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100923, 'You didn\'t finish the other bone swords yet?\nI thought you said you could make several swords from the horns I brought you last time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100924, 'I thought they were enough, [NAME], but I was wrong and now I\'m missing some Porgy teeth.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100925, ' Oh! You should have estimated the numbers better. You must have been in a hurry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100926, 'This time I need some more help from you.\nHurry and get me some Porgy teeth in good condition.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I?][2]'),
(100927, 'You\'re back. Let me see. Okay, good, very good.\nThese teeth are in good condition. Well done. Those will make for good swords.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100928, 'I need Porgy teeth again, but in really good condition.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100930, 'Bone Sword 3'),
(100931, 'Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera forgot to make hilts for the bone swords. Collect some Werebear leather. When you have enough, bring them back to Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100932, 'I\'m finally nearing the end!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100933, 'How many did you make?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100934, 'Hey! [NAME]!\nI think I made at least a hundred swords. Come back later and I\'ll show you how to wield them.\nOh, that reminds me. I didn\'t make any hilts.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100935, 'Are you saying you\'ve only been working on the blades so far?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100936, 'Hilt don\'t take a lot of time to make!\nI only need {color,yellow,tough Werebear leather}.\nPlease go and get me some {color,yellow,tough Werebear leather}! Hurry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes! I\'ll hurry!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you really need that?!][2]'),
(100937, 'Blacksmith MacDillan! Is this enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100938, 'Well done.\nNow I can finish the swords.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100939, 'The bone swords are almost ready. Hurry up, come on!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100940, 'A Legendary Bone Sword?'),
(100941, 'Blacksmith MacDillan in Bera claims that one of his bone swords will become legendary. The sword looks pretty ordinary to you. Blacksmith MacDillan demonstrates the sword\'s power, only to have the sword destroyed during the test, leaving only the hilt.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100942, '[NAME]! [NAME]! Look at this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100943, 'I found a legendary sword among all the bone swords I made.\nCan you see the aura surrounding the sword? Wouldn\'t you call that legendary?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100944, 'Actually, I\'m not sure. To me it looks just like a sword made of bone.\nWhy don\'t I test it against some monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100945, 'No! You can\'t! Not my legendary sword! I want to use it. Look at this! It can even split this large rock with its power.\nHiyaaa!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n{color,yellow,(The large rock breaks, the sword is destroyed and only the hilt remains)}\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100946, 'Hey, what just happened???  The bone sword shattered.\nOnly the hilt is left.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100947, 'Haha! Perfect! \nDid you see that? The power of the bone sword.\nOh! Didn\'t I tell you? Bone swords are one time-use only. But they also break down into small shards that will cause the enemy\'s wounds to bleed worse.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100948, 'Wow. I feel like all my energy is drained.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100949, 'Haha! I can make other legendary bone swords, no problem.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100950, 'The Destroyed Flower Garden'),
(100951, 'Florist Amelia in Bera is very uspet. Yetis snuck into the village destroyed her flower garden. Go and teach the Yetis a lesson. When you have finished, speak to Florist Amelia in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100952, '*Sniff* My poor flower garden. My flowers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100953, 'This is terrible! *sniff, sniff*\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100954, 'Why are you crying? You were always smiling so brightly like your flowers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100955, 'Last night, someone completely devastated my flower garden. They destroyed all my lovely flowers. *Sniff, sniff*\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100956, 'Please calm down. Who do you think did it? Did they leave any evidence?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100957, '*Sniff*\nI think it might have been the Yetis. I found one of the head bands they always like to wear.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll teach them a lesson!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They surely won\'t return.][2]'),
(100958, 'I taught them a lesson they won\'t forget. They must have been fascinated by the flower garden, so they started rolling around in it. I could still smell the flowers on them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100959, 'Now that the Yetis are dealt with, I hope I\'ll find the strength to plant new flowers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100960, 'My flowers. *Sniff, sniff*\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100970, 'Edmond\'s Fish Dish'),
(100971, 'To dry fish out really well, a staff like the witches of the North Wind use is needed. Get a Magic Staff of the North Wind Witch for Item Vendor Edmond in Bera. He will use this to prepare a fish dish.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100972, 'My fish just won\'t dry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100973, '[NAME]!\nWill you help fan my fish so they dry quicker? I need to finish up with my cooking inside.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100974, 'Fanning? But that\'s hard on my arm. Can\'t you just let them dry on their own?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100975, 'You don\'t know much about cooking, do you? If I just leave them be, they\'ll start to rot. And this fish is one of my main dishes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100976, 'So you\'re fanning them dry every single time? Isn\'t there an easier way?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100977, 'Actually, there is. Maybe you can help. The The Magical Staff of the North Wind Witch at Kahal Snow Plains are said to create wind! \nWhat do you think? Will you try to get one?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll try my luck.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m scared of witches.][2]'),
(100978, 'Is this the staff you are looking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(100979, 'Shall I swing it? \n(*Swish*)\nOh, wow. Great! Thank you so much!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100980, 'A staff of the North Wind witches is needed to fan my fish dry!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100990, 'The Revenge of the Bera Guards'),
(100991, 'The Bera Guards ran into some trouble. Last night, the wolves attacked the village and many of guard got hurt. Please go and take revenge for them. Kill the Kahal Snow Plaints Wolves for guards and let them know when you\'re done.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100992, 'My poor comrades are hurt!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(100993, 'Last night, the Kahal Snow Plains Wolves attacked the village and many guards got hurt. \nI would go and take revenge myself but I cannot leave the village undefended.\nCan you go and take revenge for us guards?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(100994, 'Good, you took revenge for my comrades. Now we should be safe from the {color,yellow,Snow Plains Wolves} for a while.\nThank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(100995, 'Please avenge my comrades.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101000, 'Preparations for Etti\'s Ritual'),
(101001, 'The staff that Little Priest Etti was going to use for a ritual has broken. Find Little Priest Etti a new staff.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101002, 'Oh no! (*crying*)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101003, '*Crying*\nHello, [NAME]\n*Crying*\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101004, 'Why are you crying?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101005, 'I was playing around with Magentia\'s staff last night and it broke. I was just pretending to be Magentia.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101006, 'Oh no! You shouldn\'t play with such important items. What kind of staff was it? Maybe one like the {color,yellow,Snow Plains Witches} use?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101007, 'It was originally one of the {color,yellow,Snow Plains Witches}\' staves but it was purified. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101008, 'Shall I get you one? If I can get you the staff, can you take care of the rest?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101009, 'You can really get me a new staff? If you do that, then I can purify it. May I really ask for your help in this endeavor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[You\'re a nice kid, I\'ll help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You did something bad, so you need to take it like a man.][2]'),
(101010, 'Here. I brought some more just in case.\nBut don\'t play around with the staff anymore!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101011, 'Thank you so much. I\'ll hurry and make a new ritual staff.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101012, 'If I only had a staff of the North Wind Witch.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101020, 'Milly Needs a Wolf\'s Tail'),
(101021, 'Fruit Seller Milly says she needs the tail of a Snow Plains wolf. Get her a Snow Plains Wolf Tail and bring it back to her in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101022, 'I have a favor to ask. Please help me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101023, 'I want to have what the other kids have.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101024, 'What do the other kids have?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101025, 'They are running around with Snow Plains Wolf Tails on their backs, dancing.\nI want to do that, too.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101026, 'Haha, I see. Do you want me to get you one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101027, 'Really? Would you do that, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101028, 'What, you don\'t believe me? I\'ll get you one in no time. But then you can\'t play anymore pranks on me, okay? Promise?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101029, 'If you bring me a {color,yellow,Snow Plains Wolf Tail}, I promise I\'ll never ever play a prank on you again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay then...][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Even if I get you one, you\'ll still do it again. I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(101030, 'Here are some extra, so you don\'t run out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101031, 'Thank you. Can I offer you a glass of my healthy drink as reward?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101032, 'It looks like fun, wiggling a Snow Plains Wolf Tail on your back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101040, 'Skill Master Hal\'s Request'),
(101041, 'Skill Master Hal is wonder what monsters could swing such large hammers at Kahal Snow Plains. You discover the North Wind Giants weild these hammers. You bring a few Hammers of the North Wind Giants back to Skill Master Hal in Bera.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101042, 'Wonderful, wonderful!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101043, 'Have you heard of those nimble monsters with their great hammers at Kahal Snow Plains?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101044, 'You must be talking about the {color,yellow,North Wind Giants}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101045, 'The {color,yellow,North Wind Giants}... How heavy do you think their weapons are?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101046, 'I don\'t know. They seem pretty heavy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101047, 'Can you get me some of their hammers? I\'m really curious to see if they are really that light or if they are maybe using special skills to wield them. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m curious as well. I\'ll get them for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to.][2]'),
(101048, 'Here, take these *huff* hammers. *Huff* They are really, really heavy. *huff*\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101049, 'They\'re too heavy to be held in one hand, but the giants still use them. That means anyone who wants to defeat them will need a lot of training.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101050, 'Maybe I\'ll learn something about their weapons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101060, 'The Secret of the People in Bera 1'),
(101061, 'A villager from Bera has a secret to tell, but it doesn\'t seem like they\'re up to share without a a price. You bring back some Mastodos Fur to the villager so they can make a wig. In return, they tell you Skill Master Hal likes Store Vendor Olivia!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101062, 'Do you want to know a secret?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101063, 'I know a secret, do you want to hear it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101064, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101065, 'Hm, I don\'t want to tell you anymore. I won\'t tell.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101066, 'Pah! First you make me curious and now. You leave me hanging? Come on, tell me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101067, 'Tell you without anything in return? I\'ll tell you if you get me some {color,yellow,Mastodos}\' Fur. I want to use it for a wig.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it right away.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t care about the secret anyway.][2]'),
(101068, 'I brought you the {color,yellow,Mastodos} Fur. Now tell me the secret.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101069, 'You really got it. Okay, in return, I\'ll tell you. Here, come closer...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101070, 'Hurry up and tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101071, 'Did you know Skill Master Hal likes Olivia?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101072, 'If you want to know the secret, better get me the fur. Haha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101080, 'The Old Blueprint Scale'),
(101081, 'MacDillan is complaining that he cannot read the markings on the Blueprint Scale anymore because it is so old. Find him a new Blueprint Scale.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101082, 'I can\'t see anything... *mumble, mumble*\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101083, 'What are you squinting at?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101084, 'I need to draw up a design but I can\'t see the markings. The scale is too old.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101085, 'Let me see. Oh my... Can you a new one anywhere? I\'ll go and get one for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101086, 'These aren\'t easy to find. I got this one from another continent.\nOh, wait. I forgot that the workshop designers have some. They don\'t need them anymore, so maybe you can steal on from them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just keep using the old one.][2]'),
(101087, 'I brought you some more, just in case.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101088, 'Thank you... Now I can design newer and stronger knives... \n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101089, 'Get me a whole bunch of them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101090, 'Peaches for the Cooking Tournament'),
(101091, 'Edmond is preparing for a cooking tournament. But then, out of no where, his peaches disappeared.\nAccording to the traces, it was either the angry Yetis or the clever Yetis who stole them. Go and retrieve Edmond\'s peaches. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101092, 'Oh! My peaches have disappeared.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101093, 'What happened? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101094, 'The peaches I wanted to use for the cooking tournament have disappeared. The traces of the footsteps led me to believe that it was the Yetis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101095, 'Hm, let me see. According to the size and form, it must have been the clever Yetis or the angry Yetis.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101096, 'That\'s terrible. Where will I ever find red and yellow peaches again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get them back for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just give up.][2]'),
(101097, 'I was right. The Yetis really stole them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101098, 'Now that you got them back for me, [NAME], I\'ll be sure to win first place.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101099, 'There are two kinds of peaches. Please get me both.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101100, 'More Bragging From MacDillan'),
(101101, 'MacDillan is the only muscle man in Bera.\nHe claims that all other men in Bera are much weaker than himself.\nTalk to Blacksmith MacDillan.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101102, 'Hey, come here for a moment.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101103, 'Haha! You\'re an adventurer. Let\'s see... \nHmhm, great. You have good muscles.\nJust like it should be.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101104, 'What are you doing? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101105, 'Ehem! Why are you looking at me like that?! \nI just wanted to see if your muscles were as great as mine.\n{color,yellow,None of the adventurers in Bera have such great muscles as I do! They\'re all as weak as a wet paper bag.}\nDon\'t you think that a true adventurer should have muscles like us?\n(Keeps flexing his muscles)\nWahaha! Anyway, I\'m glad I found someone with some decent muscles.\nLet me know if you ever need a weapon.\nI\'ll make something great for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101110, 'MacDillan Shows Off His Body'),
(101111, 'MacDillan became angry after he heard that the North Wind Giants had a better body than him. Find him the hammer of a North Wind Giant that he can use for his workouts. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101112, 'That doesn\'t make any sense! I don\'t have enough muscles?!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101113, 'Do you even lift? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101114, 'Pah! I was showing my muscles off to Hal and he only said that the North Wind Giants had much more muscles than me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101115, 'Really? I don\'t know.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101116, 'I think they are running around with these large hammers all the time... Please go and get me one. Then I can use it to become even stronger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I\'ll get it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just give it up.][2]'),
(101117, 'It\'s really heavy... Here, take it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101118, 'You got one. Great! Now I can start to work out! Its lifting time!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101119, 'I can\'t believe that they have more muscles than me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101120, 'The Revenge of the Bera Guards (repeat)'),
(101121, 'The guards are still angry that their comrades got hurt. Go and carry out their revenge for them.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101122, 'I\'m still so furious!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101123, 'I know that you took revenge for us, [NAME], but it\'s just not enough! I\'m still so angry! Can you go and take revenge again?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll do it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.][2]'),
(101124, 'Good, good... you took revenge for my comrades. I feel a lot better but still not...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101125, 'Please revenge my comrades.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101130, 'Suppressing the Yetis'),
(101131, 'Skill Master Hal of Bera has lost all reason and wants to suppress the Yetis that are trying to get into Bera.\nYou need to kill the Yetis that attack Bera every night. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101132, 'Hm... is this better? Since they are so nimble, I should take something stronger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101133, 'Hello, Skill Master Hal.\nOh? What are you doing with all those weapons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101134, 'Oh... hello!\nI\'ll be using these to go {color,yellow,Yeti} hunting.\nEach night, the {color,yellow,Yetis} become more and more aggressive and start attacking the village.\nJust last night, their attack was really fierce.\nOh... would you like to help, too, adventurer?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'ll help.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just give up.][2]'),
(101135, 'Whew... well done.\nThose Yetis have become much stronger and so fierce... They are not to be taken lightly.\nMake sure you\'re careful when you hunt them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101136, 'Hm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]"\n'),
(101140, 'Yeti\'s Invasion (Repeatable)'),
(101141, 'Every night Yeties invade Bera. They have to be stopped.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101142, 'The Yeties keep trying to Invade us..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101143, 'What? Are they still coming to the Village? After we have killed so many of them?\n[NEXT]'),
(101144, 'They will never stop coming....\nCan you help us again tonight?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Have fun tonight, I am giving up.][2]'),
(101145, 'Phew.. Thanks for your help.\nThey will never stop, but neither will I give up protecting Bera together with you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101146, 'Tonight again..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101150, 'Gerta\'s Request'),
(101151, 'Gerta thinks her father is worried about her. Let\'s go to Cuero and tell him everything is fine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101152, 'Is he sad?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101153, 'He must be really worried. Can you tell him everything is fine here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101154, 'That is not a big deal.. But for how long will you be fine? It is dangerous here..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101155, 'I shouldn\'t drink the Spring\'s water, but aside from that I have nothing to fear here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. Be careful.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will wait for you until you escape from here][2]'),
(101156, 'Cuero! I found Gerta!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101157, 'Oh, thank you! How is she?\n \n[BUTTON]=[Gerta is doing fine.] [1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101158, 'Please tell him that I am fine. He must be worried about me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101210, 'Something urgent came up to Hilda'),
(101211, 'Hilda is looking for me in Kahal Snow Field. It must be really urgent. Let\'s talk to Hilda. Hurry up.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101212, 'Hilda sent me the alert. She was looking for you desperately. I don\'t know what\'s going on with her but please help Hilda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101213, 'Hilda? Again? I have no idea what she really wants to do this time...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101214, 'I don\'t know exactly, either. However, it seems very important this time since {color,yellow,Hilda} was "desperately" looking for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101215, 'Hm?? I don\'t think she has something urgent though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will talk to Hilda.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Ah! I also have someting urgent.][2]'),
(101216, 'What took you so long? I sent the alert a long time ago.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101217, 'I shouldn??t have come here....\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101218, 'It must be really urgent. Please hurry up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101220, 'Sick Akisha'),
(101221, 'Akisha is sick and she is looking for me. Let\'s talk to her. Hurry up.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101222, 'What happened? Why are you looking for me "desperately?"\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101223, 'Something urgent came up to me. Akisha is too sick.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101224, 'Akisha?  Is she okay? What happened to her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101225, 'I don\'t know actually. I have asked her several times but she keeps asking where you are. So you have go to her and talk to her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101226, 'Is {color,yellow,Akisha} looking for only me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s talk to her.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[She has to go to see a doctor....][2]'),
(101227, 'Headache?? Awful headache.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101228, 'Akisha! Are you okay?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101229, 'She keeps calling only your name.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101230, 'North Wind Witch\'s dark power'),
(101231, 'The North Wind Witch gives off the Pagel\'s dark power. Let\'s go to take care of it.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101232, 'North Wind??.. Witches are giving off the dark power.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101233, 'Dark power?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101234, 'Dark power??. That is from Pagel\'s power?? I am sure I will go back to the ugly past?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101235, 'No way. You know it should not happen. \n[NEXT]'),
(101236, 'Please defeat {color,yellow,North Wind Witches}. Otherwise??. Ugh. Headache. Pagel\'s power is controlling me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will defeat Windy Witches.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wait. Where is headache pill?][2]'),
(101237, 'I defeated the North Wind Witches. Are you okay now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101238, 'Headache?? Aweful headache.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101240, 'Pagel\'s voice 1'),
(101241, 'Pagel orders Mastodons contaminated with dark power to invade the village. Defeat Mastodons to save the village.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101242, 'Pagel ordered monsters contaminated with dark power to attack Bera village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101243, 'Bera Village? How could you know that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101244, 'There was an echo in my head when I struggled for dark power. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101245, 'I cannot hear Pagel\'s voice anymore after [NAME] defeated Noth Wind Witches. However, I did hear his voice. His voice.. ordering Mastodons to invade Bera village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101246, 'The village will be destroyed once huge monsters like {color,yellow,Mastodons} attack the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[We should save the village.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about going back to hometown?][2]'),
(101247, 'There was something more??...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101248, 'You are the only one who can save the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101250, 'Pagel\'s voice 2'),
(101251, 'Akisha vaguely remembers Pagel\'s plan to use Snowy Dire Wolf. Defeat Snowy Dire Wolves for the village. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101252, 'Do you mean there is something more?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101253, 'Pagel ordered to another monster than Mastodons. I couldn\'t hear his voice since the dark power was gone. Snowy??. Something snowy....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101254, 'Was it Snowy Dire Wolf?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101255, 'Yes, it was probably {color,yellow,Snowy Dire Wolf}. There are not many monsters as strong as Mastodons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[We should save the village.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How are your friends in hometown?][2]'),
(101256, 'I defeated them. Can you remember something more?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101257, 'In the middle of hearing his voice, I was freed from his control. I have no idea what he ordered after that. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101258, 'You are the only one who can save the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101260, 'Someone can help us.. Right?'),
(101261, 'Akisha couldn\'t hear Pagel\'s next plan after dark power was gone. Let\'s ask Cuero whether Dwarves can help to save Bera village. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101262, 'I couldn\'t hear Pagel\'s next plan. However, Pagel will attack Bera village no matter what. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101263, 'Do you think we can save Bera village from Pagel?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101264, 'To be honest, I don\'t think it is possible.\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101265, 'Are you sure? Then I have to ask another village to help us. Probably Dwarf village. They are strong. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101266, 'Dwarf Village? {color,yellow,Cuero}\'s Village??...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I have to meet Cuero then.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He looks weak though...][2]'),
(101267, 'Oh! [NAME]. I have been looking for you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101268, 'Find someone who can help us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101270, 'Yeti inivading Arkroute'),
(101271, 'Yeti failed to invade the village and tried to involve Arkroute. Let\'s find the document which Yeti gave to Arkroute Guard.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101272, 'Is everyting okay? By the way...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101273, 'A Yeti gave a document to the Arkroute Guard right before. I guess Pagel ordered Yeti to make Arkroute join them after they failed to invade the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101274, 'Another thing...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101275, 'I am sure Pagel will order to attack Bera village in exchange for releasing King Albireo. Once King Albireo is released, he will try to dominate the Dwarves. The Dwarves tragedy will start again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101276, '(At first, just listen Cuero.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101277, 'I cannot let that happen. Please take the {color,yellow,the Document} from {color,yellow,Arkroute Guard} before King Albireo gets to it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay! I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I do that? I don\'t even live in the village][2]'),
(101278, 'Oh, yes! That\'s the one. It must be the one Big Yeti gave to the Arkroute Guard.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101279, 'I barely got the document before King Albireo could get to it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101280, 'That\'s what I thought. Let me read it first. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101281, 'We should take the document before King Albireo gets it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101290, 'A Strong Alliance'),
(101291, 'Bera village needs to make alliance with another village to save itself. Let\'s talk to Cuero about this.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101292, 'What is this document about? How to prosper the village? It is not Pagel\'s order.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101293, 'Well... Cuero.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101294, 'Oh my god, I have never missed my guess. I have disgraced myself here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101295, '(???? He never lets me talk.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101296, 'By the way. What are you doing here? Do you have something to tell me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101297, 'Pagel\'s large army will rise to attack Bera village soon. They won\'t be able to save themselves without any help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101298, 'Do you mean they need help from the Dwarves?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes. Please help them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well. They don\'t need your help necessarily.][2]'),
(101299, 'Did you think I came here only for exploring Arkroute?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101300, 'What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101301, 'We have been in strong alliance with Bera village for a long time. I am right here and one of the best.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101302, 'Then you will help Bera village, won\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101303, 'By the way I couldn\'t imagine you cared about them. You\'re not from there.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101304, 'I will help them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101310, 'To prosper Bera village'),
(101311, 'Let\'s deliver the document about how to prosper the village to Town Chief Valiere.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101312, 'What should I do with this document? I thought it was Pagel\'s document for King Albireo. But it is about how to prosper the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101313, 'You can take it and use it to prosper Dwarf village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101314, 'Bera village needs this more than I do.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101315, 'Yes! I can give the document to Town Chief {color,yellow,Valiere}. It can strengthen your alliance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will deliver that to Valiere.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think they really need that?][2]'),
(101316, 'What is this document?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101317, 'Please give it to him and tell him this is the present from Dwarf village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101320, 'The Adventurers are not arriving'),
(101321, 'Town Chief Valiere is worried that the adventurers have not arrived yet. Let\'s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101322, 'I got this document from Arkroute and brought it to you. I thought it could be helpful for your village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101323, 'Prospering the village is just one of big issues...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101324, 'Is there another problem?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Tell me more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am busy as well...][2]'),
(101325, 'I asked Elderine for help to prevent Pagel\'s army a long time ago, but any adventurers sent have not arrived yet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101326, 'What are you talking about? I can see quite a lot of adventurers around the village right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101327, 'They came here to explore the mountain like [NAME], they are not the ones who came from Elderine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101328, 'Don\'t worry. Those adventurers are in the Henneath Alliance as well. They will help you to fight Pagel. \n\n[EMOTION][11]\n[NEXT]'),
(101329, 'Now there is hope for me as I am listening [NAME]. I am ready to fight Pagel to save the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101330, 'I am worried that the adventurers have not arrived yet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101340, 'Strange Town Chief Valiere'),
(101341, 'Town Chief says something is strange with the document taken from Arkroute. Take it back and go to Village Elder Duskin.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101342, 'Pagel is coming! Pagel is coming!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101343, 'What are you doing, Town Chief?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101344, 'Bera village will be destroyed. Pagel is coming!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101345, 'Something must be wrong with him. Why does he keep calling Pagel?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101346, 'Pagel\'s order. As the document tells you. The document is his voice. He is my master.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101347, '(Town Chief Valiere calls Pagel, staring at the document about how to prosper the village.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101348, 'That is what I gave to him!\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(101349, 'That document is strange. I have to take it back from him and go to Elder {color,yellow,Duskin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Elder Duskin.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He is funny. I will watch him more.][2]'),
(101350, 'Elder. Something is wrong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101351, 'Oh! [NAME]. What is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101352, 'Pagel is destroying Bera village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101360, 'Dark power from the document'),
(101361, 'The document gives off dark power. Let\'s go to Magentia and seal the aura. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101362, 'The Town Chief went wacky, he keeps repeating "For Pagel" holding this document. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101363, 'Are you talking about the document which you are holding? I have been curious where the dark power came from. It was from that document. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101364, 'Can you feel the dark power from this document?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(101365, 'Give that to {color,yellow,Magentia} as soon as possible. She can seal the dark power.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Magentia.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He is lying to me.][2]'),
(101366, 'What is it? I can feel Pagel\'s aura from [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101367, 'Go to Magentia. Hurry up before the village is covered with dark power.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101370, 'Sealed Pagel\'s aura'),
(101371, 'Magentia tries to seal the dark power from the document. Let\'s pray for her success.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101372, 'I can feel the contagious dark power from the document. It is quite weak though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101373, 'Elder said you could seal the dark power so I brought it to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101374, 'It will be dangerous if you are close to me. Move back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[She should seal the aura.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Is she lying to me?][2]'),
(101375, 'Phew. I sealed the dark power. Luckly it wasn\'t strong. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101376, 'By the way, how is Town Chief. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101377, 'Move back. You can get injured while I sealing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101380, 'Town Chief contaminated with dark power'),
(101381, 'Let\'s go to Town Chief Valiere with a Crystal Wand which can get rid of the dark power.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101382, 'The Town Chief has been looking for Pagel. He must be contaminated with dark power.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101383, 'The Town Chief? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101384, 'First, go to Town Chief {color,yellow,Valiere} with this Crystal Wand. It will work, though it is only temporary.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I got it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Give me some medicine.][2]'),
(101385, 'For Pagel?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101386, 'Aaaaaahhhhhh!!!!!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101387, '(Bang!!)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101388, 'The Crystal Wand Magentia given to me has broken.\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(101389, 'Headache?? Oh no?? Where am I???\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101390, 'Go to the Town Chief. Hurry up!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101400, 'Truth of the document'),
(101401, 'The document taken from Arkroute had Pagel\'s aura. Something might happen in Arkroute. Let\'s talk to Cuero.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101402, 'Town Chief, are you okay? Wake up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101403, 'Ah! [NAME]. What happened? I was reading the document and then... I can??t remember anything after that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101404, 'The document was what Big Yeti tried to deliver to King Albireo. I just read the title and thought it would be helpful to you. But Pagel set a trap on the document to dominate Arkroute. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101405, 'Arkroute? Then Cuero could be in danger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101406, 'Take care about yourself first...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101407, 'I am fine now. However, if Cuero is in danger the alliance with the Dwarf Village will fall out. Quick, go to Cuero. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101408, 'Ah! What should I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay I will go to him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How can I leave you alone?][2]'),
(101409, '[NAME]? What happened? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101410, 'Go to Cuero right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101420, 'Gerta! Gerta in Danger.'),
(101421, 'If something goes wrong in Arkroute, Gerta could be in danger. Go and find her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101422, 'Cuero. You were contaminated with the dark power from the document. The title tricked us.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101423, 'What are you talking about? Calm down and tell me what happened. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101424, 'It was all Pagel\'s plan. He made us take the document to the village. \n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(101425, 'Calm down and think about Arkroute. If dark power is coming from the document, then the most dangerous place is Arkroute. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101426, 'Arkroute !!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101427, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101428, 'Gerta!! My daughter Gerta is in danger. She could be contaminated with dark power.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101429, 'Cuero. Please calm down.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go and find her.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Calm down and tell me again.][2]'),
(101430, 'Everything is for Pagel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101431, 'Is she already contaminated with Pagel\'s aura?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101432, 'Who are you? You are [NAME]. I thought you were a Dwarf from Arkroute.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101433, 'How can I be calm right now? My daughter is in danger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101440, 'Arkroute Dwarfs have been changed'),
(101441, 'Arkroute Dwarves got violent after  the master made a Magical Power Amplifier to empower Astanica. Take the Magical Power Amplifier.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101442, 'Gerta! Are you okay?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101443, 'I am okay but the Dwarfs suddenly got violent after the Master made something to empower Astanica. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101444, 'Really?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101445, 'They attack whoever has a different opinion. They keep saying "everything is for Pagel."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101446, 'Ah! That is why you were saying that. I was so surprised that you seemed to be contaminated with the dark power.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101447, 'We don\'t have enough time. We should take the {color,yellow,Magical Power Amplifier} from {color,yellow,Astanica} as soon as possible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will take that back to you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way. You could be contaminated with dark power.][2]'),
(101448, 'Everything is for Pagel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101449, 'Eh? Were you contaminated while I was gone?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(101450, 'I was surprised. You shouldn\'t suddenly come up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101451, 'Be careful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101460, 'Magical Power Amplifier'),
(101461, 'Magical Power Amplifier amplifies Pagel\'s dark power. As Magentia sealed the dark power, she might know how to take care of it. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101462, 'This must be a Magical Power Amplifier.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101463, 'How could you find out what that was? I heard about dwarves advanced mechanics but I could imagine this much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101464, 'You didn\'t look close enough. "Magical Power Amplifier" is written here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101465, 'Oh?? Yes. What are you gonna do with this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101466, 'You could have found out as well. The document with Pagel\'s power... amplifier amplifying that power. Don\'t you get it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101467, 'Probably...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101468, 'Yes! It is exactly what you are thinking.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101469, 'You are really good at guessing like Cueta.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101470, '(Suddenly Gerta fell down.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101471, 'Hey. Everyone realized Pagel was trying to dominate Arkroute Dwarfs.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101472, 'Ah??do you think so? I though he tried to make us take the document to the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101473, '(Gerta is Ignoring [NAME]) By the way, what should I do with this?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Magentia has some idea.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Heh! I will ignore you.][2]'),
(101474, 'This is what amplifies magical power. Why did you give it to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101475, 'Be careful. You should not be contaminated with the power.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101480, 'Breaking the Magical Power Amplifier'),
(101481, 'Hilda is the best magic expert in the village. Let\'s bring her the Magical Power Amplifier.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101482, 'I am sure Magentia know how to take care of it. I just want to break it but dark power could come out. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101483, 'Okay, I see why [NAME] brought it to me but I don\'t know anything about magic power. {color,yellow,Hilda} knows more than I do about magic.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will bring it to her.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can you take care of it?][2]'),
(101484, 'What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101485, 'I want to break this, but I don\'t know how to. If things go wrong??..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101486, '(Hilda steppes on the Amplifier and breaks it.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101487, 'Ugh! We will be contaminated with Pagel\'s power.\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(101488, 'What\'s wrong with you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101489, 'Hilda is the best magic power expert in Bera village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101490, 'Is Akisha in danger?'),
(101491, 'Pagel\'s power is getting stronger. Akisha might go back to her ugly past. Let\'s go meet Akisha.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101492, 'By the way, how is Akisha? You haven\'t told anything about her since you came back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101493, 'Oh yes. Akisha! Pagel\'s power might affect her because of the document. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101494, '[NAME]. So how is {color,yellow,Akisha}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go meet Akisha.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nothing would happen. The document was already sealed.][2]'),
(101495, 'Ugh?? Ugh...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101496, 'Akisha! Are you okay?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101497, 'The dark power has become stronger than it was earlier. I could be controlled by Pagel. Good thing is the power is almost gone now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101498, 'So how is Akisha?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101500, 'Akisha, controlled by Pagel 1'),
(101501, 'Pagel is about to invade the village with Mastodons. Go kill Mastodons.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101502, 'By the way, [NAME]. We have to eliminate Mastodons. Pagel is about to invade the village with the same plan again. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101503, 'Have you heard Pagel\'s voice?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101504, 'Yes. I have heard him since his power got stronger. So we have to kill {color,yellow,Mastodons} as soon as possible.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go kill them as soon as possible.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[At first, I have to tie my shoes.][2]'),
(101505, 'I killed them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101506, 'It is not over yet. Pagel ordered other monsters to invade the village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101507, 'We have to kill Mastodons to save Bera village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101510, 'Akisha, controlled by Pagel 2'),
(101511, 'Pagel has ordered the Snowy Wolf to invade the village. Let\'s go kill them to save Bera village. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101512, 'Other monsters?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101513, 'Fargels ordered the Snowy Dire Wolf to invade Bera village. We have to prevent {color,yellow,Snowy Dire Wolf} from doing that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I should hurry. I have to kill Snowy Wolf.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have to tie my shoes first.][2]'),
(101514, 'I defeated the Snowy Dire Wolf.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101515, 'Hahahahahaha\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101516, 'Haha. Be happy for Bera village. It is safe now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101517, 'How stupid Vannel villagers are. Hahahahaha\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101518, 'Akisha! What\'s wrong with you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101519, 'Shut up. You are not allowed to say my name. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101520, 'We have to prevent the {color,yellow,Snowy Dire Wolf} from following Pagel\'s order.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101530, 'Akisha\'s betrayal'),
(101531, 'I helped Pagel because Akisha lied to me. I have to tell this to Town Chief Valiere in Bera village.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101532, 'Thank you anyway. I have to say that to you. It will be easier to invade Bera village, thanks to you. Hahahahahaha\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101533, 'Oh?? Oh my god! You have been lying to me. It was all lie that you wanted to run away from Pagel.\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(101534, 'Why should I help Vannel villagers? I don\'t even want to talk with them. They deserve death.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101535, 'How dare you? You betrayed the Bera Villagers and me. I will never forgive you.\n\n[EMOTION][11]\n[NEXT]'),
(101536, 'Bang!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101537, '([NAME] tried to attack Akisha but couldn\'t because Akisha is protected by the mountain...)\n\n[EMOTION][1]\n[NEXT]'),
(101538, 'I am not as stupid as the Vannel villagers. I have already prepared everything. This mountain belongs to Pagel. As long as he has power, it will never be broken. Hahahahaha!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101539, 'Darn it. What should I do now? I cannot kill Akisha?? Should I meet Town Chief {color,yellow,Valiere} first in Bera village?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go back to the village.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s convice Akisha.][2]'),
(101540, 'Town Chief!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101541, '[NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]]'),
(101542, 'The Vannel villagers are stupid, Hahahahahaha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101550, 'Heading to Siren\'s Castle'),
(101551, 'Town Chief Valiere is preparing to fight Pagel. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101552, 'Town Chief. I have something to tell you. We should prepare to fight Pagel. We should hurry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101553, 'I am always well prepared. I am just waiting for adventurers from the Henneath Alliance. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101554, 'You don\'t look well. Is there something wrong with you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101555, '([NAME] told everything that happened to Town Chief Valiere.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101556, 'I listened to the whole story from [NAME], and I cannot let it go anymore. Many of adventurers from Henneath alliance haven\'t arrived yet, but I have to investigate Siren\'s Castle right now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'d better wait for adventurers.][2]'),
(101557, 'I will send someone there right now. Until that time, [NAME], please prepare to fight.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101558, 'Alright. Then call me when you need my help.\n\n[EMOTION][20]\n[NEXT]'),
(101559, '(Everything is for Pagel??)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101560, '??\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101561, 'Didn\'t he say something earlier?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101562, 'Well?? It\'s not important.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101563, '(Everything is for Pagel??)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101564, 'I cannot let it go anymore. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101570, 'A ritual for purifying the magic power 1'),
(101571, 'Priest Magentia is worried that monsters are contaminated with dark power. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101572, 'Should I leave here?..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101573, 'Hello~ Magentia! \n\n[EMOTION][19]\n[NEXT]'),
(101574, 'Oh.. [NAME]. You look well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101575, 'What happened to you? You don\'t look well..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101576, 'Do I? Yes.. I am so worried about monsters. I have no idea why they got so violent. I heard that there are many places having the same problem. I haven\'t seen this horrible situation since I became a priest. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101577, 'That is true. The dark power is contaminating the whole continent. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101578, 'But I cannot let that happen anymore. I am a priest. I have to save our villagers from monsters and the dark power. I will hold a ritual to purify the dark power. May I ask you a favor?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101579, 'Sure. Tell me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101580, 'It will be a very holy ritual. But {color,yellow, Holy Waterdrop} is all gone. We need it for all rituals. Can you bring me some?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I cannot help you.][2]'),
(101581, 'Thank you for your help. [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101582, 'It was not a big deal. It is all for the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101583, 'Thank you. Bera village really needs [NAME]. Then I will start the ritual.\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101584, 'You can get {color,yellow, Holy Waterdrop} from {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101590, 'A ritual for purifying the magic power 2'),
(101591, 'Magentia is worried that she is missing something for the ritual. Who could\'ve taken it? Let\'s talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101592, 'It is not possible.. it was just here....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101593, 'Is something missing? Maybe monsters took it..?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101594, 'I think someone stole it to interrupt the ritual. I am not really sure who did it??A Monster? Some villagers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101595, 'Do.. You mean there is spy amongst the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101596, 'I don\'t want to accuse one of our villagers. But it is not easy for monsters to enter the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101597, 'Um.. We should investigate this. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101598, 'I need to discuss this with village guards. I will let you know once I get some information.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101600, 'A ritual for purifying the magic power 3'),
(101601, 'Magentia is about to start the ritual. Arkroute Novice needs Candlestick for the ritual. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101602, '[NAME], Good to see you here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101603, 'Hasn\'t it started yet?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101604, 'No. As it is very important, we need a lot of holy things to prepare.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101605, 'How about the thing you were looking for earlier?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101606, 'Ah.. I am still looking for it. I\'ve found nothing out about it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101607, 'Okay. Is there anything else I can help you with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101608, 'Can you bring me {color,yellow, Candlestick for ritual}? I need some more candlesticks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me~][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well, It will be hard for me to do that.][2]'),
(101609, 'Thank you. [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101610, 'Can you start the ritual now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101611, 'Sure. I can start now thanks to [NAME]. Ah. Can you go meet my Little Priest Etty during the ritual? Etty might need your help.\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101612, 'You can get {color,yellow, Candlestick for ritual} from  {color,yellow, Novice} in {color,yellow, Arkrute}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101620, 'Want to be a priest 1'),
(101621, 'Little Priest Etty is learning under Magentia, the priest in Bera village. She wants to be a respectable priest like Magentia. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101622, 'When will I be a priest like Magentia?..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101623, 'Maybe in 100 years?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101624, 'Oh, [NAME]. You are too rude! How dare you?!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101625, 'Hehe, I am kidding. You will be a priest. Don\'t worry. You are trying your best. \n\n[EMOTION][9]\n[NEXT]'),
(101626, 'Yes I am. But... I have no idea. I am always thinking about killing all of the monsters not healing them. I should not even think about that... I will be a priest. .\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101627, 'It is right that the useless ones should be removed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101628, 'You have the same idea as me. I wasn\'t the only one.  Ah, can you do me a favor? Please defeat {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy}. They recently got more violent. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101629, 'You defeated them!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101630, 'I couldn\'t ignore the future priest\'s request. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101631, 'Hmm.. I will try hard to be a priest! I will discuss everything coming up with [NAME]. Thank you!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101632, 'I hope the {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} will be gone...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101640, 'Want to be a priest 2'),
(101641, 'Little Priest Etty is learning under Magentia, the priest in Bera village. She wants to be a respectable priest like Magentia. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101642, 'Ah! [NAME]. You came. {color,yellow,huehuehue}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101643, 'What happened to our future priest this time?\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(101644, 'Well.. Some tourists visited Bera village but they cannot return home due to monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101645, 'Okay..  It could happen. But is it important to you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101646, 'I just want to help them. I cannot do anything at the moment though. I am asking for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101647, 'Um.. Okay.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101648, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Snowy Were Bears}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101649, 'Now tourists can travel around easily thanks to [NAME]\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101650, 'I didn\'t do that alone. Everyone helped. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101651, 'You are so humble. I should learn from you. Thank you!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101652, 'Please defeat {color,yellow, Snowy Were Bears}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101660, 'Building a beautiful garden 1'),
(101661, 'Amelie wants to plant a beautiful garden. But it seems difficult for her. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101662, 'Um... How can I plant a beautiful garden?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101663, 'You should water the flowers and fertilize the soil. That\'s it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101664, 'I know that but I cannot plant a garden only with my effort.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101665, 'Ah! You need good seeds, don\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101666, 'Of course I do. But the most important thing is protecting the garden from monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101667, 'Um..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101668, 'So can you defeat {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy}? They often come and ruin the garden. I have to teach them a lesson. This time I really hope I can make a beautiful garden.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101669, 'Did you defeat them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101670, 'Of course I did.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101671, 'Thank you.. Then the next thing to do is this. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101672, 'I cannot let {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} ruin my garden..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101680, 'Building a beautiful garden 2'),
(101681, 'Amelie wants to plant a beautiful garden. One thing was done with her garden. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101682, 'Now I just finished one thing..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101683, 'So you have only one more thing left with your garden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101684, 'I think so.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101685, 'Oh! I really want to see your garden. So what is next?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101686, 'I have to make a fence to protect the garden from monsters. With magic power, of course.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101687, 'Sounds nice! A fence with magic power..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101688, 'But I need {color,yellow,Magical Flask} to make a fence with magic power. As you know, {color,yellow, Megantereons} carry some with them.  Can you bring some to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101689, 'Wow! You got them! Now I can plant my beautiful garden.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101690, 'Good to hear that. I hope all villagers enjoy this garden with beautiful flowers. \n\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(101691, 'Sure. You should come visit! It will be full of fragrant flowers for everybody!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101692, 'As you know {color,yellow, Megantereons} carry {color,yellow,Magical Flask}  with them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101700, 'Milly\'s Healthy Wonder Medicine 1'),
(101701, 'Milly wants to make a wonder medicine for our busy Town Chief. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101702, 'What should I do for the Town Chief?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101703, 'Health is the best! Guys especially love whatever is good for their health.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101704, 'There are a lot of things that are good for your health. Um. Anyway I am thinking about the best one for Town Chief. I don\'t think I can make the best one alone. I won\'t be able to get all ingredients. However, if I make one with common ingredients, it will be of no effect. \n[NEXT]'),
(101705, 'May I help you get some ingredients?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101706, 'Can you help me? Then, let\'s see.. Oh yes this one might be good! I need {color,yellow, Food Stuck between Puggy\'s Teeth} for my wonder medicine.  It sounds disgusting but it really works. Can you bring me some?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Should I bring you that disgusting thing?][2]'),
(101707, 'Oh you brought them. It must have been really hard to get. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101708, 'I promised you. But are you sure that you can make one with this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101709, 'Of course! Town Chief will love it. I will tell him [NAME] helped me. \n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101710, 'Are you still looking for {color,yellow, Food Stuck between Puggy\'s Teeth}? I have all the rest of ingredients.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101720, 'Milly\'s Healthy Wonder Medicine 2'),
(101721, 'Milly wants to make a wonder drug for our busy Town Chief. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101722, 'It won\'t be good enough with only one thing...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101723, 'Do you need something else?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101724, 'I did make one as a recipe... But one thing was missing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101725, 'I will help you again. It is for the Town Chief. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101726, 'Can you do that? This time I need you to bring me {color,yellow, Puggy\'s Smelly Fur}. That will be disgusting as well?? Please help me!\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101727, '[NAME], You are an expert at getting the ingredients!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101728, 'Haha...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101729, 'I have to hurry. I will make a drink for the Town Chief. I will give [NAME] some when It is done. \n \n[NEXT]'),
(101730, 'That\'s okay?? I am healthy enough.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101731, 'Are you still looking for {color,yellow,Puggy\'s Smelly Fur}?  I have all the rest of ingredients.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101740, 'Lost Luggage'),
(101741, 'Recently, tourists have lost their luggage to violent monsters. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101742, 'Already happened?five times today.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101743, 'What happened, Lily?\n\n[EMOTION][19]\n[NEXT]'),
(101744, 'More and more tourists are losing their luggage these days. Monsters keep taking tourists\' luggage. If we let it go, less and less tourists come visit Bera village....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101745, 'That is a big problem. Is there anything I can help you with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101746, 'Can you get the tourists\' {color,yellow, Lost Luggage} from the monsters? {color,yellow, Yeti}es must have attaked the tourists. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too annoying.][2]'),
(101747, 'Oh.. That must be tourists\' lost luggage. You got it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101748, 'It was a piece of cake.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101749, 'I can relax now. Many tourists are working part-time jobs to get some money to go back... From now on, they will be able to have fun in the village.\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101750, '{color,yellow, Yeti}es often attack tourists.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101760, 'A Revenge Plan'),
(101761, 'Lily heard that monsters planned to get revenge after you took back the tourists\' luggage. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101762, 'What can we do now?...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101763, 'They still attack the tourists? I taught them a lesson last time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101764, 'No. It is worse this time. After you took the luggage back earlier, they have been planning to attack with more monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101765, 'Let them come! I will defeat them once again!\n\n[EMOTION][11]\n[NEXT]'),
(101766, 'I wish there were more adventurers like [NAME]. But we, the villagers, are not as strong as [NAME].\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101767, 'Um.. Well.. If they are coming with more monsters..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101768, 'I have to discuss this with our Town Chief. I will notify the village guards.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101770, 'A failed plan?'),
(101771, 'Lily?wants to stop the Yeti\'s plan in its tracks. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101772, 'It\'s finally happened?[NAME]\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101773, 'What happened? Is there something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101774, 'I just got this information. Yeties are invading the village tonight.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101775, 'Then we should prepare to fight. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101776, 'No. We cannot just defend ourselves. My plan is to attack them before they get organized. You are the only one who can do this. If you kill {color,yellow, Angry Yeti}, they will panic.  They will fall into disorder without their leader. \n\n[BUTTON]=[It will work.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t we just wait for them?][2]'),
(101777, 'Did you kill their leader, Angry Yeti?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101778, 'Yes I did. They got panicked without the leader just as?you thought they would. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101779, 'Woot, this worked thanks to my clear information and your courage. Well done. I will deliver this good news to Town Chief. \n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101780, 'If we kill their leader {color,yellow,Angry Yeti}, we will win. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101790, 'Difficult to interact with others 1'),
(101791, 'Olivia says it is hard to interact with other villages due to?the rough terrain in Bera village. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101792, 'Um.. How can I make it easier for?people visit other villages?..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101793, 'Yes it is quite hard to get here thanks?to rough terrain and tons of monsters..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101794, 'Bera Village cannot interact with other villages and villagers cannot get some medicine thanks to Mother Nature. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101795, 'Medicine? Which one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101796, 'Monsters often attack tourists and many tourists get hurt. However, we cannot make any medicine for them because we don\'t have enough ingredients. Oh yes, why don\'t you help us? Can you bring me some {color,yellow, Mysterious Herb} from {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} or {color,yellow, Snowy Were Bear}\'s fur. We need them as soon as possible. Please help us. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They can spit on their scars.][2]'),
(101797, 'Did you bring some Herbs?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101798, 'Of course I did~ It was quite hard..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101799, 'Thank you so much. We really appreciate it. So?do the tourists. \n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101800, 'You can get {color,yellow, Mysterious Herb} from {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} or {color,yellow, Snowy Were Bear}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101810, 'Cause of wounds'),
(101811, 'Olivia is worried about lots of the wounded. Let\'s talk?to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101812, 'More and more.. What is the reason?..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101813, 'What\'s wrong? I brought you some ingredients to make a medicine earlier~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101814, 'Yes you did. But more and more wounded tourists and villagers are coming to me...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101815, 'I need to find out the reason. If we just let it go...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101816, 'I don\'t know why but the wounded never want to tell me how they got hurt. There must be something. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101817, 'We need to find out the cause.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101818, 'It won\'t be easy but I will try my best. If it is related to something??\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101820, 'Unknown causes.. However'),
(101821, 'Olivia cannot figure out the reason why?people got wounded. She decides something. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101822, 'I have no idea why more and more people are?getting wounded. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101823, 'They are still not telling you, aren\'t they?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101824, 'They look like they are possessed by something. They won\'t tell me anything. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101825, 'What is going on here?..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101826, 'I have to rely on my?instincts for now. I heard {color,yellow, Megantereon} is doing something secretly. I might be wrong but I?have decided?they must be killed. They are just monsters. Please defeat them. I hope no one gets wounded anymore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is annoying.][2]'),
(101827, 'So were they the culprits?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101828, 'Well.. I am not sure. We will see. If no one is wounded anymore, your guess?was correct. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101829, 'Thank you. I was worried about you [NAME], that you?could be in danger because of my wrong guess. You can take a rest now.\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101830, 'I hope {color,yellow, Megantereon} is the culprit..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101840, 'Guard\'s tears 1'),
(101841, 'Guard cannot go home each night because he should prevent monsters from coming into the village. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101842, 'Damn it, I cannot do this anymore!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101843, 'Then give up and go back to your daily life~\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101844, 'Ughhhhhhhh.. How could you say it like that? I am already in a bad mood working all night...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101845, 'Wait..wait.. it didn\'t mean that. Take it easy. I just want you to feel better.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101846, 'It is all because of {color,yellow, Yeti}es. They keep coming into the village. I cannot allow them! I will forgive you if you defeat them. How\'s that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is annoying.][2]'),
(101847, 'Oh, I can go home earlier thanks to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101848, 'Well.. I defeated them. However?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101849, 'It will be alright. I have taken care of this for a long time. I know better than you do. Don\'t worry anymore. Hahahaha I am going home~~\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101850, '{color,yellow, Yeti}es...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101860, 'Guard\'s tears 2'),
(101861, 'Guard cannot go back home each night because he should prevent monsters from coming into the village. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101862, 'Darn it, I cannot do this anymore!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101863, 'What\'s wrong?.. I helped you last night..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101864, 'Chief guard ordered me to work all nights from today. I cannot work all day long, I\'ll?die from working too much!  I am still single! I want time to date! What is wrong here?..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101865, 'Monsters are too annoying these days. I don\'t think he did that on purpose. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101866, 'No.. There must be something behind it. There must be!! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101867, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101870, 'I have to talk with Town Chief. I am sick of doing this!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101880, 'Guard\'s tears 3'),
(101881, 'Guard cannot go back home each night because he should prevent monsters from coming into the village. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101882, 'Damn it, I cannot do this anymore! I\'m going to?quit this job!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101883, 'Did chief guard order you to work all night again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101884, 'Yes he did.. I am in tears... I will be a single forever and die alone!!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101885, 'I am so sorry...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101886, 'This time {color,yellow, Smart Yeti} is too annoying.\nPlease help me?? I want to get married.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s annoying.][2]'),
(101887, 'So can I go home now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101888, 'Woot. Have a good night.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101889, 'Thank you. If I get married, I will invite you to the wedding. Yay! Now where shall I go to?meet a single woman? \n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101890, 'I will be so happy when I get married.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101900, 'Distrust 1'),
(101901, 'A Villager thinks people get wounded all because the village guards are too lazy to protect the village. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101902, 'Damn it.. I?could do a better job myself..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101903, 'Sorry?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101904, 'I am talking about the village guards. They are doing nothing.. More and more people get wounded these days. The problem is all?the monsters outside the village. But the thing is, these stupid guards only protect the inside of the village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101905, 'I agree with you?to a?point but disagree with you at the same time. Who will protect the village instead of the guards?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101906, 'That is the problem. Of course they should protect the inside of the village. However, they should take care of the outside of the village as well in these dangerous?times. They don\'t know how to deal with this. We\' shoud hire [NAME] instead of those stupid guards. Ah! yes, can you defeat {color,yellow, Yeti}es? I will recommend [NAME] as a new chief guard.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Deal!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t want to be a chief guard.][2]'),
(101907, 'I have an good eye. [NAME] is strong enough to be a chief guard.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101908, 'Well. I don\'t want to live here forever. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101909, 'This is a perfect place to live! Those guards are so stupid though. They are always chasing women. Wait.. Don\'t get me wrong. It isn\'t because they don\'t ask me on a date though. Never!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101910, 'Guards cannot even defeat {color,yellow, Yeti}. How stupid are they...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101920, 'Distrust 2'),
(101921, 'A Villager thinks people get wounded because the?village guards are too lazy to protect the village properly. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101922, 'I have to get them before the village guard gets them...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101923, 'You still don\'t trust the guards. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101924, 'I think the guards are collecting them for upgrading their weapons. It will be better that I take them instead of those stupid guards. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101925, '(What\'s wrong with this village..)\n.. So what can I do for you?\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101926, 'Please take {color,yellow, Broken Sword}s from {color,yellow, Smart Yeti} before the guards get them.   \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s?such an?annoying thing.][2]'),
(101927, 'Great. Now?they?will have to come to see me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101928, 'Um..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101929, 'It is too late to ask me out. Hahahahahaha!\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101930, 'Please bring me {color,yellow, Broken Sword}s as soon as possible. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101940, 'Honey, for better flavor'),
(101941, 'Edmond is preparing for a cooking contest. He needs more ingredients for the contest. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101942, 'I won\'t be able to win the contest just with peaches! I need something extra.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101943, 'What did you have in mind?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101944, 'I need {color,yellow, Ice Flower Honey} to make the peach more tasty. You can collect honey from {color,yellow, Ice Flower} around Kahal snow field.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some for?the delicious food.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate sweets.][2]'),
(101945, 'I brought you some honey.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101946, 'Okay, I am done with the flavour. Second thing is the texture.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101947, 'Texture?\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101948, 'You can collect {color,yellow, Ice Flower Honey} from {color,yellow, Ice Flower}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101950, 'Mushrooms, for better texture'),
(101951, 'Edmond is preparing for a cooking contest. This time he needs an ingredient to improve the texture. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101952, 'Peaches are too squishy. I need something chewy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101953, 'Which one might be good?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101954, 'I need {color,yellow, Mushroom Bottom} from {color,yellow, Ice Mushroom}. Then I can make it more chewy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some for?the delicious food.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate chewy things.][2]'),
(101955, 'I brought you Mushroom Bottom.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101956, 'The texture will be perfect with Mushroom Bottom. Now I need to make some drinks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101957, 'Some drinks? It sounds very difficult to win the contest.\n \n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101958, 'You can get {color,yellow, Mushroom Bottom} from {color,yellow, Ice Mushroom}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101960, 'Drinks for the dishes'),
(101961, 'Edmond is preparing for a cooking contest. Now he needs to make some drinks for the dishes. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101962, 'What drink might go well with the dishes?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101963, 'Yes! I heard a tourist threw a wine bottle to Snowy Puggy. I can get some wine from Snowy Puggy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101964, 'That tourist must have been in a panic?to throw?a wine bottle to them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101965, 'Anyway {color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} might have {color,yellow, Wine}. Please?get that for?me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do that for delicious dishes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I hate wine.][2]'),
(101966, 'Here you are.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101967, 'Drinks are ready. Now I need to decorate the dishes. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101968, 'Do you need to decorate the dishes? Being a chef must be very hard.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101969, '{color,yellow, Snowy Puggy} might have {color,yellow, Wine}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101970, 'Pretty decoration'),
(101971, 'Edmond is preparing for a cooking contest. As a final touch, he needs something to decorate his dishes. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101972, 'The last thing for a dish is always garnish.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101973, 'I decorated my dishes with an herb last year. Which herb might be good this time?...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101974, 'How about a branch? It will match the snowy field perfectly.\n[NEXT]'),
(101975, 'A branch? Yes! I can put some honey on the tip of it. That reminds people of spring! \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101976, 'You can get a {color,yellow, Branch} from {color,yellow, Ice Wood}. Please bring me some.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some for a great dish.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just cut the wood next to you.][2]'),
(101977, 'I brought some for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101978, 'Alright! Let\'s do the last thing. I can make delicious and beautiful dish this year, thanks to you. Thank you!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101979, 'Please bring me a {color,yellow, Frozen Branch} from {color,yellow, Ice Wood}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101980, 'Man\'s appetizer'),
(101981, 'McDilan, the second-place winner last year, just started to prepare for the cooking contest as he saw Edmond preparing for it too. He asked for help to cook "Man\'s dish." Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(101982, 'This time I will defeat Edmond and be the winner. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(101983, '[NAME], Edmond is not the only one preparing for the contest. If you are going to help someone, help everyone. Or just don\'t help anyone. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(101984, 'Are you going to participate in the contest?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101985, 'Of course. I will be the winner this time. No one will defeat me. So you must help me as well. It is not fair that you help only Edmond.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101986, '???? What do you want me to do?\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(101987, 'This year, my dish will be "Man\'s dish." First, I will need some {color,yellow, Rib}s for an appetizer, so bring me some from {color,yellow, Megantereon}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(101988, 'You will help me, won\'t you? You already helped Edmond.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some for your delicious appetizer.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I am a vegetarian.][2]'),
(101989, 'I got some ribs. This time I need some meat for main dish. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(101990, 'Please bring me some from {color,yellow, Megantereon}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102000, 'Man\'s main dish'),
(102001, 'McDilan, the second-place winner last year, just started to prepare for the cooking contest when he saw Edmond preparing for it too. He asked for help to cook "Man\'s Dish." Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102002, 'It should be a great steak if it is called "Man\'s dish."\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102003, 'Does the main dish also have meat? You already made your appetizer with meat.\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102004, 'That is why it is "Man\'s Dish." "Man" means "Strength." "Strength" means "Meat." So bring me steak meat this time!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102005, 'Appetite is very important for a man.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102006, 'There should be some fat on the meat so I will need {color,yellow, Mastodons}\'s {color,yellow, Tenderloin}. Please bring me some.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some for your delicious main dish.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I am a vegetarian..][2]'),
(102007, 'I got some meat for the main dish. Now I need to prepare a dessert. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102008, 'Please bring me {color,yellow, Tenderloin} from {color,yellow, Mastodons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102010, 'Man\'s dessert'),
(102011, 'McDilan, the second-place winner last year, just started to prepare for the cooking contest when he saw Edmond preparing for it too. He asked for help to cook "Man\'s Dish." Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102012, 'You won\'t make a dessert with meat, will you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102013, 'What is that supposed to mean? Of course the dessert should be meat for my "Man\'s Dish."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102014, '(He will be the worst in the contest.)\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102015, 'I will make sweet boiled meat for the dessert. And {color,yellow, Snowy Wolf}\'s {color,yellow, Rump} is the best one to use for boiled meat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring some for a delicious dessert.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Sorry. I am a vegetarian][2]'),
(102016, 'I brought you some meat for your dessert. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102017, 'Thank you. I will be the winner this year thanks to you. Then I will be known as Chef McDilan, not Blacksmith! Hahahaha!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102018, 'Please bring me some {color,yellow, Rump} from {color,yellow, Snowy Wolf}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102020, 'The Workshop Master is making a weapon'),
(102021, 'Little Priest Etty is afraid of the Workshop Master. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102022, 'What happened to you? You don\'t look well. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102023, 'Do you think Masters from Arkrute will repair their weapons and attack the village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102024, 'Well. I don\'t know anything about that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102025, 'The Town Chief came here earlier and talked with Magentia. I heard Masters could invade the village?? So...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102026, '(Even this little kid is worried about the village??)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102027, 'If you are so worried about that, I will go to {color,yellow, Arkroute} and defeat the {color,yellow,Workshop Master}s. Then you can relieve. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Arkroute!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wait! I shouldn\'t have said that!][2]'),
(102028, 'I defeated Workshop Masters so you don\'t need to worry anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102029, 'Are you sure that Workshop Masters won\'t attack the village?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102030, 'I am afraid of {color,yellow, Workshop Master}s from {color,yellow, Arkroute}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102040, 'Workshop master is making a weapon (Repeat)'),
(102041, 'Little Priest Etty is still afraid of Workshop Masters. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102042, 'There are many Workshop Masters in Arkroute, right?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102043, 'Yes?? Yes...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102044, 'Then I cannot?relax yet. The village is still in danger. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102045, 'Then how about this? I will go to {color,yellow, Arkroute} whenever I have free time and defeat {color,yellow, Workshop Master}s. Then you can relax.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102046, 'So nice of you. You are doing a lot for the village.?? [NAME] must be the warrior from Nature.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Arkroute!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Wait! I shouldn\'t said that!][2]'),
(102047, '[NAME] is always nice to me but I cannot relax yet. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102048, 'I am still afraid of {color,yellow, Workshop Master}s from {color,yellow, Arkroute}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102050, 'Selling Junk'),
(102051, 'A villager urgently needs some money. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102052, 'I urgently need some money. Where can I get some money...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102053, 'You can ask other villagers to?lend you some money. Or you can work. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102054, 'If I?am at work [NAME],??you will no doubt be desperately looking for me. You always have some request to do. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102055, '(?!?!?!)\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102056, 'I cannot leave [NAME] alone here. So Let\'s do this. I heard there is quite a lot of junk in {color,yellow, Arkroute}. [NAME] can you?go to {color,yellow, Astan Mechanic} and get some {color,yellow, Piles of Junk}. Then I will sell them to McDilan and get some money.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Arkroute!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you a NPC?][2]'),
(102057, 'Are these enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102058, 'Thank you for your help but these are never enough. Man loves a rich woman these days.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102059, 'Please go to {color,yellow, Arkroute} and bring me some {color,yellow, Piles of Junk} from {color,yellow, Astan Mechanic}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102060, 'Selling junk (Repeat)'),
(102061, 'A villager urgently needs some money. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102062, 'I need more junk to get enough money.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102063, 'How much do you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102064, 'Okay, think about this. If I give you some money as a reward whenever [NAME] brings me some junk. Then there won\'t be much left for me.\n[NEXT]'),
(102065, '(?!?!?!)\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102066, 'Anyway, it is almost a losing business for me. So bring me {color,yellow, Piles of junk} from {color,yellow, Astan Machenic} whenever you go to {color,yellow, Arkroute}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Arkroute!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Aren\'t you a NPC?][2]'),
(102067, 'Are there enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102068, 'Thank you for what you\'ve done. But it is never enough.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU'),
(102069, 'Please go to {color,yellow, Arkroute} and bring me some {color,yellow, Piles of Junk} from {color,yellow, Astan Mechanic}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102070, 'The scariest monster'),
(102071, 'The Town Chief conducted a survey asking which monster is the scariest one according to the villagers. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102072, 'Which monster seems the scariest to [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102073, 'Um????The North Wind Giant is so huge and carries a huge weapon with it. That one the scariest to me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102074, '[NAME] thinks exactly the same way with villagers. The survey concluded that the North Wind Giant is the scariest monster to villagers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102075, 'Perhaps the other adventurersagree that there are not many monsters as scary as North Wind Giants are. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102076, 'We need to kick off {color,yellow, North Wind Giant}s for villagers. Can [NAME] help me to do that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They are scary to me as well.][2]'),
(102077, 'I did my best but I am not sure it was helpful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102078, 'Thank you so much. Villagers can sleep peacefully tonight.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102079, 'Villagers are afraid of {color,yellow, North Wind Giant} the most.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102080, 'Smart Yeti is preparing for an exam'),
(102081, 'Duskin wants to give an exam to Smart Yeti to check his intelligence. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102082, 'Do you know how smart a Yeti is?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102083, 'I heard there are some smart Yeties among them but I have no idea exactly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102084, 'Well, I also heard about them but no one knows how smart they are. So I will ask Hilda to check their intelligence secretly. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102085, 'Secretly?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102086, 'Hilda put a lot of exam papers in Yeti\'s Hideout earlier. Maybe some Yeties already solved all questions. But the thing is I have to get them back. So I need you to bring the {color,yellow, Exam Paper}s from {color,yellow, Smart Yeti}es.\n\n[BUTTON]=[It is interesting. I will hurry.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think they already solved all questions.][2]'),
(102087, 'There were not that much exampapers left there. There is also dirt on them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102088, 'We just need their answers. Let me see. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102089, 'Oh no!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102090, 'What is it? Did they really solve all of the questions?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102091, 'It must be their poop.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102092, 'Did they already know that they can use exam papers as toilet paper? They are really smart??...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102093, 'Did {color,yellow, Smart Yeti} solve all questions on {color,yellow, Exam Paper}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102100, 'Not enough medicine'),
(102101, 'Olivia says she doesn\'t have enough medine. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102102, 'There are a lot of people who got wounded from monsters but I don\'t have enough medicine. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102103, 'You still don\'t have enough medicine? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102104, 'It is difficult to get ingredients to make more medicine. I might need to get some from the North Wind Witch. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102105, 'I can help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102106, 'Will you bring {color,yellow, Medicine} from the {color,yellow, North Wind Witch}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes. I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No. Let me check around first.][2]'),
(102107, 'Are these enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102108, 'Not enough, but I can handle for a while. Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102109, 'Will you bring {color,yellow, Medicine} from the {color,yellow, North Wind Witch}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102110, 'A cold garden'),
(102111, 'Amelie is worried about it getting colder in the village. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102112, 'The flowers will be frozen if it gets colder.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102113, 'It is suddenly getting cold.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102114, 'It is colder because of the North Wind Witches. All flowers will be frozen in the village...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102115, 'Will it be warmer if the North Wind Witches are gone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102116, 'Since it is getting colder because of the {color,yellow, North Wind Witch}es\' ice magic. I think it will work. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Then, I will kick them off.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[There must be another reason.][2]'),
(102117, 'I kicked the Witches out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102118, 'Yes, it is warmer than before. [NAME] did kick out the North Wind Witches. Thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102119, 'It is getting colder because of {color,yellow, North Wind Witch}es.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102120, 'Worried about a landslide'),
(102121, 'Milly is worried that a landslide could occur. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102122, 'If a landslide occurs in Kahal Snow Field, our village will be isolated. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102123, 'It will be but I don\'t think a landslide will occur.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102124, 'No way. If huge monsters like the North Wind Giant fall down, a landslide will definitely occur.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102125, 'Nature is more powerful than you think.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102126, 'Pooh. You have no idea how strong the {color,yellow, North Wind Giant}s are.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It will never happen.][2]'),
(102127, 'As I promised you, I killed the North Wind Giants. Don\'t worry any more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102128, 'However?? Did they fall down when [NAME] killed them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102129, 'Yes they did. Something wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102130, 'Hm?? A landslide didn\'t occur even when that many North Wind Giants fell down on the mountain. Were they weak?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102131, 'A huge landslide will occur because of the {color,yellow, North Wind Giant}s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102140, 'A Girl smaller than shoes'),
(102141, 'People make fun of Little Priest Etty. She looks mad. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102142, 'Pooh! They are not that tall either. How could they do this to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102143, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[EMOTION][8]\n[NEXT]'),
(102144, 'I am talking about Milly. She makes fun of me and says that I am smaller than shoes. She is small as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102145, 'No way. You are bigger than shoes!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102146, 'I have to show her that I am bigger than shoes. Can you bring me {color,yellow, Giant\'s Shoes} from the {color,yellow, North Wind Giant}? You will help me, won\'t you, [NAME]?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will bring you the shoes.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you really need to do this?][2]'),
(102147, 'I brought the shoes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102148, 'Wow! they are really big. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102149, 'But you are bigger than those shoes. I can see that at once.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102150, 'Of course I am bigger than the shoes. By the way, they are really stinky though. I have to wash them first. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102151, 'Do you think I am smaller than the {color,yellow,North Wind Giant}\'s {color,yellow, Giant Shoes}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102160, 'A suspect?'),
(102161, 'Milly is playing with something. It looks like what Magentia lost for the ritual. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102162, 'It is really good making healthy drinks. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102163, 'Wait. Where did you get that cup?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102164, 'Do you mean this cup? I found it when I was playing with Yeti. I just picked it up around the playground.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102165, 'It looks like something Magentia lost for a ritual. Did you get that from there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102166, 'No way. It doesn\'t look like something for a ritual.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102167, 'Look at here. This pattern is the same?as the one used for a ritual.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102168, 'Ah! You are right. I just thought it was a useless one.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102169, 'Magentia is so worried that this one was missing. You took it.\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102170, 'I didn\'t know that it is Magentia\'s! And I woudn\'t have taken it, if I knew it belonged to that kind of person!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102171, 'That kind of person? She is a priest taking care of the village!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102172, 'Pooh! A priest? Anyway I will give you the cup so don\'t worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102173, '(Did something happen between Milly and Magentia?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102174, 'Anyway you should have looked for the owner. I will?tell Magentia so don\'t?try to sneak it back. You should apologize to her.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102180, 'A Food thief?'),
(102181, 'A villager is staring at the sky and thinking about something. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102182, 'Ah! I cannot forget about McDilan\'s boiled meat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102183, 'What are you staring at?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102184, 'Ah! [NAME]. Umm?? I miss McDilan\'s boiled meat from the cooking contest. It was so sweet and chewy. I cannot forget that taste.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102185, 'Ah! You are talking about McDilan\'s "Man\'s Dessert."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102186, 'I asked him to cook that again but he said he would only do it if I bring {color,yellow, Snowy Wolf}\'s {color,yellow, Rump}.?I can\'t do that on my own. That is why I am just standing here and thinking about it. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102187, 'Do you want me to bring some for you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102188, 'Can  you do that? He was the second winner this time again and that boiled meat was amazing.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait a second. I will bring you some.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You will gain weight.][2]'),
(102189, 'Oh! You really brought me some. Thank you so much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102190, 'By the way it was "Man\'s dish." Was it delicious for women too?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102191, 'I don\'t know about "Man\'s dish." The other things were too greasy?so I couldn??t eat anything there. Other dishes got 0 point but he could have gotten the second prize with boiled meat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102192, 'He should have brought only boiled meat. Then he could be the winner. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102193, 'Please bring me {color,yellow, Snowy Wolf}\'s {color,yellow, Rump}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102200, 'Nightmare 1'),
(102201, 'Magentia had a nightmare. She is so worried about that dream. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102202, 'I often have nightmares. In the dream, someone attacked the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102203, 'Do you think it was a prophecy?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102204, 'I hope it wasn\'t but I am afraid that I have nightmare of the North Wind Giant every night.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102205, 'Even if it doesn\'t mean anything, people will be worried.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102206, 'I could never kill anything but I cannot just look away and let something happen. Can [NAME] defeat {color,yellow, North Wind Giant} and help me relax?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait a second. I will take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is just a dream. Don\'t worry.][2]'),
(102207, 'I defeated North Wind Giants so you won\'t have a nightmare anymore. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102208, 'Thank you. But I wasn\'t the only one who had the nightmare. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102209, 'Is there anyone else that?had the same nightmare?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102210, 'I have a nightmare every night. {color,yellow, North Wind Giant} was attacking the village in my dream.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102220, 'Nightmare 2'),
(102221, 'Magentia told there someone else having a nightmare. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102222, 'Little Priest Etty often has the nightmare as well. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102223, 'Two of the priests have a nightmare??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102224, 'However, Etty told me North Wind Witches were attaking the village in her dream. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102225, 'Anyway that means the village is in danger. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102226, 'It is always wrong to kill someone.. However..?? [NAME], can you kill {color,yellow, North Wind Witch} and help me relax?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait a second. I will take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is just a dream. Don\'t worry.][2]'),
(102227, 'Etty will not have any nightmare anymore. I killed them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102228, 'Thank you so much. But there is one more thing different in her dream from mine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102229, 'Sorry?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102230, 'Etty told me North Wind Witches were attaking the village in her dream. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102240, 'A strange dream 1'),
(102241, 'Two of the priests often have the nightmare that the village is attacked. Let\'s talk with Magentia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102242, 'There wasn\'t a Town Chief in my dream.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102243, 'What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102244, 'As I told you, only the Town Chief was missing in my dream.?All the villagers were there but...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102245, 'Do you mean the Town Chief is in danger?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102246, 'I am not sure but can you ask Etty whether there was a Town Chief in her dream?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102247, 'I want to ask her in person but I already told her that the dream didn\'t mean anything.  Just to make her relax. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will ask her.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'d better ask in person.][2]'),
(102248, 'You don\'t look well. What\'s going on with you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102249, 'Ah! [NAME]. Um.. I just had a strange dream?last night. Magentia told me it didn\'t mean anything. But I am not sure. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102250, 'A strange dream? Can you tell me more about the dream?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102251, 'Ask {color,yellow, Little Priest Etty} about the dream.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102260, 'A strange dream 2'),
(102261, 'Little Priest Etty often has a strange dream. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102262, 'Well?? My dream is not about Bera village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102263, 'Not Bera village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102264, 'North Wind Witches were attacking the village in the dream, but it wasn\'t Bera village. It was a castle covered with ice. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102265, 'Were there any villagers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102266, 'I cannot remember that. The Town Chief was there with me. I cannot remember clearly, he looked happy..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102267, 'A castle covered with ice?? Is there a castle around here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I have to ask to Magentia.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think it is useful information.][2]'),
(102268, 'What did Etty say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102269, 'Is there a castle covered with ice around here? Etty told me North Wind Witches were attaking a castle which was covered with ice in her dream. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102270, 'A castle covered with ice??. It might be Siren\'s Castle.. Did she say if there were any villagers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102271, 'She couldn\'t remember clearly, but she was sure that the Town Chief was there. But he was looking happily at the village. The village was attacked. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102272, 'I think Etty\'s dream is related to the future. And the Town Chief is the key. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102273, 'I believe in the Town Chief, but I have to?watch him carefully. He could have?been captured by monsters. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102274, 'Does Magentia know about a castle covered with ice?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102280, 'Something delivered back?'),
(102281, 'Milly took the important thing for a ritual. Let\'s?see whether she apologized to Magentia.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102282, 'Have you seen Milly here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102283, 'Milly?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102284, 'You told me something was missing for a ritual. I saw Milly had it. She picked it up from the ground. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102285, 'It is never right to?take someone\'s things. I told her to bring it?back to you and apologize to you. But I guess she didn\'t do that, did she?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102286, 'Ah that is why it was here again. That is okay. I got it back anyway.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102287, 'She should apologize to you. I will bring her to you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102288, 'Don\'t do that. She will not come to me. Everything is my fault.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102289, 'I think Milly doesn\'t like you.. Can I ask you why she doesn\'t like you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102290, 'It is a long story. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102300, 'Three Shamans\' Story 1'),
(102301, 'Magentia is telling you her story. Let\'s listen. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102302, 'Something happened between you two.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102303, 'Etty, Milly and me are not Bera villagers. We are from Vannel, a lost village. We are the last people alive and shamans from Vannel. Milly\'s mother was the best shamen. She was killed by Siren.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102304, 'How could you be a priest here? You are not even a villager. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102305, 'When I got here, Bera was at war with monsters. And many priests were killed by monsters.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102306, 'Bera villagers believed that Vannel\'s Shamens had strong holy power. So the villagers asked me to become a priest. I became a priest on condition that the villagers took care of Milly and Etty.. However...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102307, 'However?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102308, 'The villagers worked really hard repair the damage inflicted on the village. They worked day and night on it.?Everyone was so busy that?no one was taking care of Milly and Etty any more. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102309, 'I needed to make an?important decision?about Milly and Etty. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102310, 'Three Shamans\' Story 2'),
(102311, 'Magentia is telling you her story. Let\'s listen. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102312, 'What was your decision?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102313, 'I told them I would take care of Milly and Etty. But they didn\'t give them back to me since they didn\'t think I could do much work as a priest while taking care of them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102314, 'But they couldn??t leave the babies. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102315, 'I convinced villagers that I would teach them to become a priest. As Milly was the daughter of the best shamen,?I thought she?would be the best priest in the future. However, Bera village was too poor to have three priests at that time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102316, 'What was the matter? They shouldn\'t have left two babies anyway. \n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102317, 'As you know, a priest is not allowed to do anything else except the ritual. The villagers bring me?my food. And at that time, they could only feed one of us.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102318, 'In the end, I chose the younger one of the two babies and it was Etty. I tried to keep this secret to Milly but the villagers made a mistake. They told Milly. That is why Milly doesn\'t want to see me again. Milly thinks I left her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102319, 'Oh?? oh no...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102320, 'Three shamans\' the last story'),
(102321, 'Magentia is telling you her story. Let\'s listen. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102322, 'If you explain all this to?Milly, she will understand your decision. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102323, 'It will never change that I left her when she was a little baby. That is the truth. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102324, 'But you should tell her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102325, 'I thought about her a lot after I left her. Etty was younger than Milly and that was why I chose Etty but Milly could become a better priest than me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102326, 'I don\'t know. Maybe I didn\'t like her at that time. I respected her mom a lot but maybe I was jealous at the same time. I am still thinking we could save Vannel village if Siren hadn\'t been jealous?of her mom. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102327, 'I shouldn\'t have asked to hear your story. For you?? for Millly and Etty.\n\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(102328, 'I feel better for having told you what happened. The truth will never change though. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102329, '??...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102330, 'A little girl, smaller than a hammer'),
(102331, 'Etty is making fun of Milly, saying?that she is smaller than a hammer. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102332, '[NAME]. Have you seen the hammer that the North Wind Giant\'s carry with them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102333, 'Well?? I saw a couple of times but I didn\'t look that closely at them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102334, 'I made fun of Etty and said?that she looked smaller than north Wind Giant\'s shoes. Now she is making fun of me? and is saying that I look smaller than a North Wind Giant\'s hammer. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102335, '(They measure their height with strange things.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102336, 'How could she say that to me? I am?much taller than her! Okay. [NAME]. I will show her that I am bigger than a {color,yellow, North Wind Giant}\'s {color,yellow, Giant\'s Hammer}. Can you bring me that one?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will bring you that one soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think I can bring you that something that heavy?][2]'),
(102337, 'Pooh. I can see that I am bigger than a hammer at once.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102338, 'Well.. Can you carry it to Etty? It is very heavy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102339, '??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102340, '??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102341, '[NAME]. I am sorry but can you bring Etty to me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102342, 'Bring me a {color,yellow, North wind Giant\'s Hammer} from {color,yellow, Nord Wind Giant}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102350, 'Tourists are afraid of something'),
(102351, 'Lily says tourists are afraid of Snowy Wolf. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102352, 'Tourists are very?afraid of Snowy Wolf. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102353, 'Tourists already got there. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102354, 'We are hunting many monsters in Kahal Snow Field thanks to [NAME]. But Snowy Wolves are too strong?? Can you kill them?\n\n[BUTTON]=[No problem. I will help you again.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Well.. They are too strong?for me as well.[2]'),
(102355, 'I killed Snowy Wolf.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102356, 'Thank you. Now the tourists can travel safely thanks to [NAME].\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102357, 'Tourists are very?afraid of {color,yellow, Snowy Wolf}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102360, 'A story of Elder Duskin and Hunter 1'),
(102361, 'Elder Duskin is telling you story. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102362, 'I remember when I met Hunter for the first time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102363, 'Hunter? Who was sent to Snow Field?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102364, 'The weather was really bad on that day. It wasn\'t raining but the sky was full of dark cloud. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102365, 'I was so depressed after I lost my son from the monsters\' attack. And the villagers wanted to have another Elder.. They didn\'t want to deal with me and my depression anymore\n[NEXT]'),
(102366, 'I lost my son and people didn\'t want me anymore.. I decided to give up on everything.?Then I met a boy who was crying?his eyes out. He was looking for his father. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102367, 'That boy was Hunter.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102368, 'He reminded me of my son. But people didn\'t want me to have a human baby. They kept shouting at me to leave him outside?the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102369, 'Leave him? Oh no..How could people even think that way? \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102370, 'A story of Elder Duskin and Hunter 2'),
(102371, 'Elder Duskin is telling you his?story. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102372, 'Am I boring you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102373, 'No please continue.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102374, 'I took him tomy home and I called him Hunter. I took care of him as if he was?my son. Thank God, he loved me so much. He loved me more than my son did. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102375, 'One day monsters suddenly attacked the village. The villagers were trained to fight them. I kept him from going out of the house, to keep him safe. However, the villagers made a plan to use Hunter as a trap.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102376, 'Use him as a trap?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102377, 'I tried my best to save Hunter but he volunteered. And he went to fight monsters with only one sword. I couldn??t stop him. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102378, 'They planned to exchange the village for a human.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102379, 'However, the monsters heard about the plan and invaded the village. They didn\'t kill Hunter. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102380, 'A story of Elder Duskin and Hunter 3'),
(102381, 'Elder Duskin is telling you his story. Let\'s listen.\n\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102382, 'Hah. By the way, Hunter hated listening to old stories. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102383, 'So what happened next?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102384, 'You\'d better listen to the rest of the story from Hunter in person. He can tell his story better than me. After all, it is his story.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102385, 'Um?? What should I do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go meet Hunter.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I\'m not that interested.][2]'),
(102386, 'Hunter! How did you feel when you were used as a trap?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102387, 'Sorry? How could you know that story?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102388, 'Elder told me that story. So what happened after you went to fight alone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102389, 'Hah ok! Why did he tell you that story?.. He knows that it is quite embarrassing for me to tell that story. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102390, 'You\'d better listen to the rest of the story from {color,yellow, Hunter} in person.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102400, 'The last story of Elder Duskins and Hunter.'),
(102401, 'Hunter is telling you rest of the story about Elder and the village. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102402, 'Okay, are you ready to listen to this embarrassing story?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102403, 'I went to the spot as the villages told me and waited for monsters. But the monsters didn\'t show up. About an hour later, I found out the village?was in danger. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102404, 'The village was burning. I desparately looked for the Elder in the fire.?He was hurt, but thank God he was alive. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102405, 'Thank god.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102406, 'The Villagers started to talk behind my back that I was one of them. How ridiculous! I was one of them? No way! They were running away from the village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102407, 'No one fought the monsters? The Town Chief couldn\'t run away because he got hurt.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102408, 'I didn\'t want to waste my time?on the villagers. I had to go to fight the monsters. I loaded a gun and I killed them one by one. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102409, 'I killed about 30 of them.. Town Chief Valiere, he was a young boy at that time. Anyway he came in front of the villagers and convinced them to fight the monsters.... The villagers were so brave. They even brought their kitchen knives to fight. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102410, 'Why did you say it was embarrassing story?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102411, 'What made me embarrassed happened next. After the battle, Valiere came to me and ask me why I helped them, helped those who left me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102412, 'And I answered that I didn\'t do it to save the village, but to save my father. It still makes me feel embarrassed. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102420, 'A story of McDilan and Edmond 1'),
(102421, 'McDilan suddenly remembers an old story. Let\'s listen to it.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102422, 'Ecery time?I make a bone sword, it reminds me of an old story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102423, 'Which story?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102424, 'Actually Edmond and me are war orphans. We lost our parents during the war. Back then?? We couldn\'t buy anything to eat, so we stole some food from the restaurant. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102425, 'Oh no.\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102426, 'Well?? We were caught and made to?work at the restaurant as our punishment. We still think that wasn\'t punishment at all though. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102427, 'The owner was Chef Cuzen and he was giving some food to orphans secretly. Now I think we didn\'t need to steal some food. We just should have visted him. Hahaha. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102428, 'He was a nice man.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102429, 'Yes! He was very nice. So we tried hard to become a chef like him. But...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102430, 'A story of McDilan and Edmond 2'),
(102431, 'McDilan suddenly remembers an old story. Let\'s listen to it.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102432, 'It makes me sad?telling you this old story. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102433, 'Did something happen to Cuzen?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102434, 'Have you heard about the second war with the monsters? The war which made Hunter say something really cheesy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102435, 'Ah! "I saved my father not the village"?\n\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(102436, 'Hahaha. You got it. It made me really embarrased.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102437, 'Anyway everyone was so brave at that time. People brought the knives from Cuzen\'s restaurant and went to war. However??. Edmond and?I lost Cuzen in that war. We loved him so much. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102438, 'Ah! I am so sorry. He was the best person I have ever met..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102439, 'Since then, I have made weapons. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102440, 'A story of McDilan and Edmond 3'),
(102441, 'McDilan has more to his story. Lets listen to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102442, 'Well, it isn\'t just me making weapons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102443, 'Since then, Edmond and I made weapons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102444, 'At that time we both thought we needed to make weapons, and not food for the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102445, 'Ah! I have to make new weapons for the guards by the end of the day. I have to go now. If you want to listen the rest of the story, go to Edmond.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Edmond.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is not interesting at all.][2]'),
(102446, 'Why did you start to cook instead of making weapons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102447, 'Did McDilan tell that story to a tourist again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102448, 'He told me that you two started to make weapons. I want to hear the rest of the story. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102449, 'Hah~ Okay I will tell you the rest of the story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102450, 'If you want to listen the rest of the story, go to {color,yellow, Edmond}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102460, 'The last story of McDilan and Edmond'),
(102461, 'Edmond is telling you the rest of the story. Let\'s listen to it.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102462, 'So you heard that we started to make weapons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102463, 'After the war, the village?was peaceful again. But there was a lot of starving orphans.?When?I saw their plight, I started to wonder whether I should make food or weapons. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102464, 'The economy was a mess after the war...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102465, 'I saw babies starving to death. I was looking for their parents. I was so angry that they left their babies. I really wanted to punish them. But I couldn\'t find them anywhere in the village..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102466, 'After a while it became clear that the babies were orphans.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102467, 'I asked a lot of people about the babies. One guy came?to me and told me he was the only one alive from the village Vannel. I wanted to meet the person that brought the babies here, and I found them. But I couldn\'t say anything bad to her.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102468, 'Well?? I just decided to be a chef for them. And I told that to McDilan. Can you guess what he said to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102469, 'No.  Did he say something embarrasing like Hunter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102470, 'He said "what Cuzen left us is not the skill for cooking, but a warm heart. So you just need to live for the people and I need to live for the village."\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102471, 'It is as embarrassing as Hunter\'s sentence. I fall in love with the village whenever I listen the old story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102480, 'A story of Olivia and Hal 1'),
(102481, 'Hal\'s love story. Let\'s listen to it.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102482, 'Do you want to listen to?my story? The more I tell it, the better I will remember it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102483, 'Did something bad happen to you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102484, 'Where should I start???  When I was young, I killed every monster in front of me. I did that for the village. Of course I got a lot of?wounds from my battles. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102485, 'You must be very strong. You are the hero in the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102486, 'But people might think that I was just a little kid, and not a hero. There was no one taking care of me when I got hurt by the Megantereon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102487, 'Why did no one take care of you?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102488, 'At that time everyone was so busy?rebuilding the village. But there was someone. One day I opened my eyes while I was?recovering in?bed, and there was Olivia, next to me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102489, 'Maybe?? there was romance?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102490, 'A story of Olivia and Hal 2'),
(102491, 'A good romance....lets continue this story!\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102492, 'Unfortunately, it wasn\'t a romance. I was wrong. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102493, 'She pitied me. I though she was in love with me. I told everyone in the village that she was in love with me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102494, 'Did she just let you do that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102495, 'Of course not. She told me I shouldn\'t do that. But I misunderstood, I thought she was just embarrassed. I always told everyone that she loved me more than I loved her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102496, 'I thought she had a crush on me?because I fought monsters bravely. So I thought if I killed more and more monsters, many other girls would love me. But there was no one that came to me. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102497, 'And people started avoiding you because of that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102498, 'Yes.?When I figured that out?I became a liar and a bad boy. But I kept going to fight?against monsters. At the end, I  almost died fighting them.\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102500, 'A story of Olivia and Hal 3'),
(102501, 'There\'s more to Hal\'s story. Let\'s listen\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102502, 'Telling you my story is making me feel sad.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102503, 'Did your final battle leave any scars?\n[NEXT]'),
(102504, 'Yes. Deep in my heart. When I woke up again, I found out I really loved her. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102505, 'It was?unrequited love.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102506, 'I decided that I would dedicate my life to saving her. I started to learn new skills I felt I lacked?in my past experiences.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102507, 'When I finally got out of the hospital, I had to meet her before going to fight more monsters. But I couldn\'t look into her eyes. I really couldn\'t. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102508, 'Love made you change.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102509, 'I felt I couldn\'t breath?if she?left me for a second. So I didn\'t go to fight monsters I couldn\'t bear to be apart. I kept looking at her from a distance. I was just looking at her. That made me the happiest man in the world.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102510, 'One day she confronted me. Of course she got angry that I followed her. But I was just happy that I could see her in front of me. I was about to tell her that I was in love....\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102520, 'The last story of Olivia and Hal'),
(102521, 'Let\'s listen to Hal and hope there\'s a happy ending.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102522, 'So did you tell her? That you loved her?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102523, 'No. I just told her I was selling documents about a war. I was so stupid. Actually that is why I am here and selling skill books.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102524, 'And that\'s it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102525, 'I will tell her that I love her soon. But I am still too shy.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shall I go to Olivia?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It\'s not my business.][2]'),
(102526, 'I saw you were talking with Hal. Why did you come to me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102527, 'Ah! I just bought new skill books from him. I am on my way to hunt monsters. I think I need some medicine too. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102528, 'Hal is looking over. If I ask him again, he will tell me that he is looking at Olivia. He is just a coward. He will never ask a girl to be his girlfriend. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102529, 'Um?? does she love him?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102530, 'I was stupid. I shouldn\'t have told [NAME] I like {color,yellow,Olivia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102540, 'A story of Amelie and Lily 1'),
(102541, 'Amelie is telling you her?story. Let\'s listen. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102542, 'You look beautiful, just like a flower.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102543, 'Do you know that I once was a troublemaker?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102544, 'You were? I don\'t think so.. Never..\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102545, 'It is a really old story. It\'s?about?when my mother became a priest. Have you heard about Town Chief\'s father? About how he passed away?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102546, 'Well....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102547, 'After the Town Chief\'s father was killed by monsters, the villagers started to have questions about priest\'s competency. They started to think they didn\'t need a priest anymore. Because of that me and my mother felt like we did something really terrible.\n[NEXT]'),
(102548, 'But, a priest cannot revive a dead person. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102550, 'A story of Amelie and Lily 2'),
(102551, 'Amelie is telling her sad tale. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102552, 'What would you do if people blame you for what you have no control over?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102553, 'Well. I might leave the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102554, 'I told my mother to leave the village, but she worked?harder for the village. She believed that?one day the villagers would notice her effort.?They didn\'t.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102555, 'I can see what happened.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102556, 'She wanted people to believe her again. So she made a plan to use Hunter as a trap. That plan failed though. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102557, 'Did your mom make Hunter fight alone?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102558, 'She was the one who said Hunter was one of them. My mother passed away in that war. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102559, 'She was the one who said Hunter was one of them. My mother passed away in that war. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102560, 'A story of Amelie and Lily 3'),
(102561, 'Amelie\'s tale continues. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102562, 'Well I became a troublemaker. I believed that the villagers killed my mom.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102563, 'I did a lot of bad things to the villagers. Because of that they?wanted to kick me out of the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102564, 'I cannot believe you. You look so beautiful and kind now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102565, 'If Lily?had not been?there, I?would have been kicked out of the village and got myself killed by monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102566, 'Lily?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102567, 'Lily was a merchant selling stuff from village to village. I did a lot of bad things to her. I wanted to make her have a bad impression?of the village. But people didn\'t even help. They just looked for a reason to kick me out. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102568, 'Finally, she got hurt severely and people decided to kick me out of the village. But Lily told them that it was an acccident, and not?me. Lily told them that I was innocent. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102569, 'When I met Lily for the first time, I could feel that she was a very nice person.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102570, 'A story of Amelie and Lily 4'),
(102571, 'Amelie\'s tale continues. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102572, 'I got even?angrier. I thought Lily?pitied?me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102573, 'Did you kept trying to do wrong?by her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102574, 'Yes I did. I was the worst troublemaker in the village. However, Lily forgave me everytime. In the end, the villagers finally decided to kick Lily out of the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102575, 'No way!\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102576, 'Hah~ I still remember that time. When the villagers took Lily out of that door. Even then, Lily looked at me and smiled. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102577, 'That smile reminded me of my mother. My mother always smiled at everyone even if they hated her. She always smiled at me as well. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102578, 'Lily reminded you of your mother..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102579, 'But there was nothing I could do except cry\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102580, 'The last story of Amelie and Lily'),
(102581, 'Amelie\'s tale continues. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102582, 'This is the last part of the story. Be patient a little longer. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102583, 'I cried a lot and apologized to everyone. I promised that I would never do anything wrong again. I cried more than when my mother passed away. Do you know what Lily did?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102584, 'Yes! There should be something cheesy here. \n\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(102585, 'She gave me a periwinkle and said "A periwinkle means a happy moment. You sometimes can be facing a hard time and sad moments, but I hope you will make every moment meaningful with this flower." From that time, I haved planted flowers around the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I have to meet Lily.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[This must be a fake.][2]'),
(102586, 'I heard that you were not from this village. How could you become a villager?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102587, 'The villagers might tell you about me. Well.. How I got to this village??.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102588, '(Smiling)\nI gave them the most beautiful flowers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102589, 'Everything was changed, when {color,yellow, Lily} gave me that flower. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102590, 'A story of Valiere and Hilda 1'),
(102591, 'Valiere is telling you his story. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102592, 'So how do you like Bera?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102593, 'I really like it here. More and more. All because of you. \n\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(102594, 'No. I couldn\'t do that much, not compared to my father. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102595, 'If your father had seen you as Town Chief, he would have been proud of you. I guess you were a great person when you were young. I cannot say anything about Hilda though. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102596, 'When I was young...  Yes. Hilda and me were great once. Of coure we were great in different ways. I was a coward and Hilda was a troublemaker. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102597, 'Sorry? I can imagine?Hilda as a troublemaker?but I cannot believe that about you. \n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(102598, 'My father wanted to raise me as the next Town Chief. He brought me everywhere he went. And he sent Hilda to Shamen school in Vannel to make her calm.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102599, 'But we couldn\'t meet his expectations. Hilda was even expelled from the Shaman school. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102600, 'A story of Valiere and Hilda 2'),
(102601, 'Valiere is telling you his story. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102602, 'No surprise. I can see Hilda... Ah! I didn\'t mean to say bad things about Hilda?? I just..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102603, 'Don\'t worry. Not only you, but everyone has the same thought about her. However, the biggest reason that she was expelled was she couldn??t be chosen by the god. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102604, 'Ah! She has magic powers that are?incompatible with holiness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102605, 'Exactly. That is why.. And she got in a terrible situation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102606, 'What happened to her?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102607, 'My father got severly wounded from monsters while he patroled around the village. Unfortunately, no one could cure him. Not even the priest could do that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102608, 'Yes, my father passed away and Hilda got very depressed. Hilda thought she could cure him if she had the holy powers. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102609, 'I can imagine how sad that must have made her. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102610, 'A story of Valiere and Hilda 3'),
(102611, 'Valiere wants to tell you his old story. Let\'s listen.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102612, 'But Hilda overcame everything unlike me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102613, 'After my father passed away, I gave up everything. I didn\'t even know what I could do. But Hilda was different. Hilda became as happy as she was before. Some people might think Hilda forgot everything about father.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102614, 'Hilda had thought she should get over it and do something meaningful if she tried. She looked happy all the time but I am sure she was crying deep inside.\n\n[EMOTION][16]\n[NEXT]'),
(102615, '[NAME] knows Hilda better than I do.  I couldn??t take responsibility for what she did, I was too depressed. I just stayed in the dark and became a coward. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102616, 'One day, Monsters attacked the village. But we didn\'t have a Town Chief who could lead the villagers. We lost the war and people had to leave the village. I was also about to leave the village with Hilda. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102617, '(This was the war that Hunter saved his father..)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102618, 'We were leaving the village and on the way out, I met Hunter. I saw him going to fight for the village. He wasn\'t a villager and even the villagers hated him. But he was going to save the village even if it cost him his life. He suddenly reminded me of my lost father. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102620, 'A story of Valiere and Hilda 4'),
(102621, 'Valiere is continuing to tell you his old story. Let\'s listen to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102622, 'I thought about what my father would do if he were alive. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102623, 'I stood up to the people who spoke bad about Hunter. I told them to go join the fight just like my father. And we could win the war. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102624, 'Hunter raised you up. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102625, 'I was young that time but the villagers still asked me to be Town Chief. From that time I became the Town Chief and I am here for villagers just as my father was. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102626, 'Then what about Hilda?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102627, '[NAME] can ask Hilda about her story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go to Hilda.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is not that interesting story.][2]'),
(102628, '[NAME]! What\'s wrong? Why are you staring at me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102629, 'Hilda. Tell me whenever you need me. I will always be by your side.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(102630, 'I am not sure if {color,yellow, Hilda} will tell you that story.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102640, 'The last story of Valiere and Hilda'),
(102641, 'Hilda is telling you her story. Let\'s listen to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(102642, 'What happened to you? Since when were you so kind?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(102643, 'I heard everything from Valiere. You really had a tough time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102644, 'Shut up, or I will make you shut up with magic. Why did my brother tell that story to [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102645, 'By the way, when did you learn how to use magic? You cannot use magic only by having magic power. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102646, 'Phew! I guess he told you about how he became a Town Chief. He wasn\'t the only one who realized something at that time. I also realized something from the monsters. Well.. just about monsters\' magic. That it was exactly what I had.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102647, 'After the war, I studied alone about magic. I thought I could use magic that I learned at school, using my magic power instead of holiness. What I mean is I could use magic If I used healing skills.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102648, 'That is why you can use magic.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(102649, 'It sounds easy but it was really difficult to use magic at the end. I tried really hard but I failed a lot. Anyway, I am happy to meet you since you can help my brother. I should do this since I don\'t need to be Town Chief thanks to him stepping up and taking the responsibility. It would be really annoying if I had to. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(102650, 'Hilda is really good sister. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104280, 'A question about Albireo'),
(104281, 'Town Chief has an alert and a question about something. He seems to want to ask Hunter something. Let\'s talk with Town Chief Valiere first. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104282, 'Hmm??  Do you think there is some connection between Arkroute and Pagel? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104283, 'Sorry? I don\'t know about the alert.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104284, 'Let me tell you about that briefly. According to the alert, it seems the Sirens are not ready for a war yet, but Albireo is planning to attack Bera with Pagel. Do you think Albireo and Pagel made an alliance?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104285, 'The information was carried by a normal guard in a document containing information about Pagel\'s plan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104286, 'I think that is a little too strange. Do you think it was an important document? Let me think. How did they give something that important to just a normal guard? That means Albireo couldn\'t get the plan or maybe it wasn\'t important for him to get. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104287, 'That makes sense. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104288, 'At first we need something to prove that. {color,yellow,Hunter} is taking care of {color,yellow,Arkroute} so I should go and ask if he has {color,yellow,Evidence about Albireo}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will ask him instead of you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do we really need that one?][2]'),
(104289, '[NAME]? What\'s up?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104290, 'I came here instead of Town Chief Valiere. Tell me everyting that you know about Albireo.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104291, '{color,yellow,Hunter} is taking care of {color,yellow,Arkroute} so I should ask if he has {color,yellow,Evidence about Albireo}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104300, 'An expert about Arkrute'),
(104301, 'Hunter tells you that Gerta knows more about Albireo. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104302, 'I don\'t know much about Albireo. I have never been in Arkroute. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104303, 'Then should I meet Cuero?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104304, 'Cuero has never been in Arkroute either. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104305, 'Then how about Gerta?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104306, 'She is still in {color,yellow,Arkroute} so I am sure she knows something. Then, will you go to {color,yellow,Gerta} right now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Sure. I am going to her now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t think she knows something.][2]'),
(104307, '[NAME]? You have never come to me without any reason?? Did something bad happen?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104308, 'She is still in {color,yellow,Arkroute} so I am sure she knows something. Then, will go you to {color,yellow,Gerta} right now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104310, 'Astan Mechanic has met Albireo'),
(104311, 'Gerta says an Astan Mechanic came to visit Albireo with a print. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104312, 'What\'s up?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104313, 'I need some information about Albireo. Do you know something about him? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104314, 'I am staying here for a while but I have never seen King Albireo. Some Dwarfs came to meet King Albireo but they always went back with nothing. I don\'t think they recieved any orders from King Albireo.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104315, 'Ah! One day an Astan Mechanic came to visit King Albireo with a print.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104316, 'Really? What was the print for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104317, 'Well, I have no idea about that. I am not sure if the Astan Mechanic still has that print. It was long time ago. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104318, 'Why don\'t you ask him? He might still have that print. After that he has never returend to visit King Albireo. He might be drawing another print or making something with that print.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104319, 'As I heard, the Astan Mechanic met him to check something on the print. If he has never met the king after that, you might be right. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104320, 'Then hurry up!\nAh! If you get the {color,yellow,Print} from {color,yellow,Astan Mechanic}, can you deliver that to my father {color,yellow,Cuero}? I studied mechanics little bit but my father is an expert.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then Let\'s start.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you sure it was a print?][2]'),
(104321, 'Did you go to Arkrute alone? ?? You didn\'t do anything to my daughter, did you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104322, 'If you get the {color,yellow,Print} from {color,yellow,Astan Mechanic}, can you deliver that to my father {color,yellow,Cuero}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104330, 'Albireo\'s weapon'),
(104331, 'Cuero is telling you King Albireo is making a new weapon with the print. Before going to Town Chief Valiere, Let\'s talk with him first. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104332, 'Hmm?? This print is for making a weapon. Something carrying a human with it. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104333, 'Astan is still very strong but carrying a human with it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104334, 'I guess he couldn\'t finish making the one as the Astan Mechanic still has the print. You should know that Dwarfs have very advanced mechanics skills. It must be almost done. And that weapon must be for King Albireo.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104335, 'Then what should we do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104336, 'To be honest, I really don\'t know what to do. Why don\'t we discuss this with everyone? So please go to {color,yellow,Town Chief Valiere} and tell him about the {color,yellow,Story of Arkroute and King Albireo}. I will go to the Dwarf\'s village and make a plan. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are alwaying doing nothing except just making a plan.][2]'),
(104337, '[NAME]. Have you found out anything?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104338, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Town Chief Valiere} and tell him about {color,yellow,Story of Arkroute and King Albireo}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104340, 'Town Chief is in trouble'),
(104341, 'Town Chief is concerned about the village because he heard about Arkroute and King Albireo. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104342, 'The weapon for King Albireo??. It must be very powerful.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104343, 'Do you have a plan to stop him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104344, 'To be honest, Bera will never defeat him as long as he has that weapon. If they invade the village now, we will definetely lose the war. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104345, 'But we cannot just give up without trying. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104346, 'We don\'t have any weapon as powerful as King Albireo\'s. However, Bera village has [NAME] and the Henneath Alliance. We are also very brave and clever. I am sure we can find a solution.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104347, 'I will try my best to help Valiere.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104350, 'Hunter needs a gun'),
(104351, 'Hunter keeps asking you to get him a Master\'s gun from Arkroute. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104352, 'By the way, [NAME]. If you are supposed to go to Arkroute, can I ask you something?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104353, 'Sure. What do you want me to do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104354, 'I need a new gun. This old one is not working well. I heard that the Masters from Arkroute use a good one. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104355, 'Okay. I will bring you that gun.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104356, 'Oh! You already know what I was about to ask?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104357, 'You asked me more than hundreds of times. Of course I can guess whatever you are about to say. I will go to {color,yellow,Arkroute} and bring you a {color,yellow,Workshop Master}\'s {color,yellow,Gun}, so don\'t worry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I am leaving to Arkroute.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can\'t you use a bow?][2]'),
(104358, 'You brought a lot. I could use these guns forever! Hahahaha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104359, 'You should go to Dwarf Village just to repair the guns when they break. I brought as many as I could. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104360, 'Go to {color,yellow,Arkroute} and bring me a {color,yellow,Gun} from the {color,yellow,Workshop Master}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104370, 'Chaoming is alive?'),
(104371, 'Lily is worried about Chaoming. Chaoming left to Siren\'s castle a long time ago but he has not returned yet. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104372, 'Why hasn\'t he returned?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104373, 'Hello, Lily. Are you waiting for someone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104374, 'Yes. When I was a merchant, I met Chaoming. One day, he suddenly came to me to borrow some money . Once he was really rich but now.. No one knows about the future. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104375, 'I don\'t know who he is. But are you waiting for him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104376, 'Yes. I felt pity for him because of his old clothes, so I told him that there is the pearl of the abyss. He left to Siren\'s Castle to retrieve it right after I told him about it. But he has not yet come back... I don\'t know he is still alive.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104377, 'I don\'t have any news about him, but I can go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and look for {color,yellow,Chaoming}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Shall I go?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have to level up more...][2]'),
(104378, 'Are you Chaoming?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104379, 'Sorry? If you want to exchange items with me, give me something first.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104380, 'Lily is waiting for you. Let\'s go back to the village with me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104381, 'No way! I will never go back until I find the pearl of the abyss.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104382, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and find {color,yellow,Chaoming}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104390, 'Crystal of the ocean is also good'),
(104391, 'Chaoming is looking for the crystal of the ocean which only the Siren\'s generals have. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104392, 'By the way, did you get here after killing Anais?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104393, 'Yes I did, otherwise I couldn??t get here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104394, '(He is suddenly smiling at you)\n\nOh my god. You came here just for me. I am afraid I was rude to you earlier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104395, 'What\'s wrong with you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104396, 'Nothing. What should happen between us? By they way, if you killed {color,yellow,Anais}??  do you happen to have a {color,yellow,Crystal of the ocean}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104397, 'Well. I am not sure if I have one or not.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I can get one for you if I don\'t have that right now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will never give you even if I have one.][2]'),
(104398, 'Oh! Yes, that is the one. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104399, 'Do you need this one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104400, 'Hehe.\nI have some good items, do you want to trade that one for something of mine?\nI mean that shiny crystal.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104401, 'If you killed {color,yellow,Anais}??  do you happen to have a {color,yellow,Crystal of the ocean}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104410, 'Too quiet Cyrus'),
(104411, 'The Village guard is worried about Wave Cyrus because he is doing nothing at the moment. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104412, 'I am worried why they are so quiet. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104413, 'Who are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104414, 'I am talking about Wave Cyrus from Siren\'s Castle. I thought they would attack the village soon after they attacked Vannel. I am worried they are making some plan. \n \n[NEXT]'),
(104415, 'I think they are not attaking here because of our strong guards. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104416, 'Well?? It is true that we are strong. Hahahaha. We can defeat Wave Cyrus.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104417, 'Of course! You are really strong guards. I am sure that all villagers agree with us. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104418, 'Yes?? That is true.. But don\'t say that to villagers. We are just doing what we have to do. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104419, 'Villagers should know that you are doing great job. \nAh! How about attacking Wave Cyrus and making them proud of you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104420, 'Woot! We can even distroy Siren\'s Castle tonight, but then I won\'t have anything left to let adventurers do . So.. um.. yes! how about you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Wave Cyrus}? \nOf course.. we can do that on our own.. but just to give you some work..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Thank you for beliving me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you afraid of them?][2]'),
(104421, 'I defeated Wave Cyrus. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104422, 'Really??? you killed Wave Cyrus? Wait,you did do that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104423, 'Yes. Thanks to you, villagers will like me and my friends. Thank you for giving me the chance. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104424, 'To make villagers like you more, how about you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Wave Cyrus}? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104430, 'Etty\'s lullaby 1'),
(104431, 'When she was young, her mom always sang a lullaby for her?and let her hold?Siren\'s shell. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104432, 'I cannot remember a lot about my mom but I sometimes remember the shell she gave to me while singing lullaby for me. I always fell asleep?to the?sound of the waves. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104433, 'Ah! Her mom passed away.. What should I say to her?...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104434, 'Don\'t worry. I am all grown up. I sometimes miss her and the sound of waves?? just sometimes. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104435, '(She makes me want to help her more.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104436, 'If you really miss the sound of waves from the shell, I could bring you another shell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104437, 'Really? Can you bring me Wave Siren\'s Shell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104438, '(Wasn\'t it just a shell from the beach?)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104439, 'Of?? Of course.. If you want to have one, I will go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring you {color,yellow,Wave Siren}\'s {color,yellow,Shell} right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s try.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Oh my god!][2]'),
(104440, 'Is?this what you wanted?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104441, 'You really brought it. Thank you. I\'m crying but these are happy tears! Thank you so much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104442, 'My pleasure. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104443, 'Will you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring me {color,yellow,Wave Siren}\'s {color,yellow,Shell}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104450, 'Is a Bone Sword really powerful?'),
(104451, 'McDilan is curious if a Bone Sword can break Cyrus\'s armors. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104452, 'Hm?? Is it possible to break Cyrus\'s armors with a Bone Sword?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104453, 'What are you talking about?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104454, 'Ah! [NAME]. I was wondering whether this Bone Sword can break Cyrus\'s armors from Siren\'s Castle. Of...of course i can guarantee that this Bone Sword is very powerful. But I can sell?many more if I show villagers and adventurers?that the Bone Sword can?break Cyrus\'s armors.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104455, 'If it is just for making money, you can always make something else too. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104456, 'That is true but I cannot miss this chance as I am a master of making  Bone Swords. If my Bone Sword fails to break {color,yellow,Wave Cyrus}\'s {color,yellow,Armors} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}, people will be defeated in the war. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you the armor.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[That makes sense, why don\'t you go find out?][2]'),
(104457, 'I brought the armor from Wave Cyrus.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104458, 'Oh! Thank you. By the way, could you break Cyrus\'s armor with your weapon?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104459, 'Sorry? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104460, 'How about I make what you have instead of making a Bone Sword?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104461, 'No way! What did I say to you?\nWake up McDilan! You are the only one who can make a Bone Sword.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104462, 'If my Bone Sword fails to break {color,yellow,Wave Cyrus}\'s {color,yellow,Armors} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}, people will be defeated in the war. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104470, 'Siren, luring guys with a song'),
(104471, 'A villager tells you that if Wave Siren is singing a song to your men, they won\'t fight bravely in a war. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104472, 'Siren is luring?men with a song. I am worried that all?men will be lured away by Siren. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104473, 'Guys love a beautiful girl not just the song. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104474, 'So?? so I am telling you it is dangerous. It will be very dangerous if she lures the?men, even if she?only?uses a song. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104475, 'Well. Are Sirens so beautiful?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104476, 'I don\'t know! Even if they aren\'t beautiful, there will be no one who can fight?them if they start to sing. So we have to kill {color,yellow,Wave Siren}s from {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} in advance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will go to Siren\'s Castle.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No way, that will be just a rumor.][2]'),
(104477, 'How was it? Were they really beautiful?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104478, 'They were so beautiful. They don\'t need to sing a song. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104479, 'It was really a good decision to kill them in advance. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104480, 'Well. You didn\'t ask me to do that only because they were beautiful, didn\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104481, 'We have to kill {color,yellow,Wave Siren}s from {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} in advance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104490, 'Typhoon Cyrus'),
(104491, 'Town Guard is worried about Typhoon Cyrus as he heard it is stronger than Wave Cyrus. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104492, 'There is a?stronger Cyrus than Wave Cyrus.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104493, 'Stronger Cyrus? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104494, 'Yes. It is Typhoon Cyrus. I heard that it is stronger than Wave Cyrus. I am not sure we can defeat them? as easily?as Wave Cyrus.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104495, 'You can show them you are stronger than them this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104496, 'Of course I want to do that but we should save our energy to fight with Freloan. \nOh! Yes. How about you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus} for us? You will become?famous?in the vaillge. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will take care of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t need to be?famous.][2]'),
(104497, 'I killed Typhoon Cyrus, so please take care of Freloan.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104498, 'Well??Did you really kill Typhoon Cyrus? Well?? We could do it on our own but we have to save our energy to fight with Freloan as I told you before. Hmm\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104499, 'Yes! That is why I went to kill them. So don\'t worry about them any more and just focus on fighting with Freloan. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104500, 'Oh! Yes. How about you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus} for us? You will become?famous in the village. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104510, 'Etty\'s lullaby 2'),
(104511, 'Etty is telling you that she might have a Typhoon Siren\'s shell. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104512, 'I listened several times?to this but this is not the one.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104513, 'I brought you quite a lot.. didn\'t you find anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104514, 'No. I think what my mom gave to me is Typhoon Siren\'s shell. Well.. I can just hear some sound from this one but it\'s very faint...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104515, 'Typhoon Siren\'s shell...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104516, 'You are thinking about going to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} again, aren\'t you? It is not easy to get one from {color,yellow,Typhoon Siren}. These are enough for me so you don\'t need to go get a Thyphoon {color,yellow,Shell}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I promised you to get the right one. Wait for a second.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[If you say so....][2]'),
(104517, 'Here, I got this from Typhoon Siren. Is this the right one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104518, '(Etty is listening to the?sound of waves coming?from the shell)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104519, 'Yes this is the one. Sounds of waves and wind. I always?fell asleep?listening to?this sound. Its making me?feel sleepy now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104520, 'I don\'t know if you can meet your mom in your dreams but sleep well tonight.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104521, '{color,yellow,Typhoon Siren} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} is very strong. You don\'t need to go for a {color,yellow,Shell} again. These are enough for me.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104530, 'Need more time'),
(104531, 'Town Chief Valiere suggests killing Varamus first. It will be dangerous to be attacked by Siren while fighting with Pagel. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104532, 'It will be really dangerous if Siren attacks us while we are fighting with Pagel.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104533, 'No one is easy to defeat. We will never save the village if we have to fight with Pagel and Siren at the same time. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104534, 'Sirens believe that they are much stronger than us so they can raise the army anytime. Of course, we won\'t be able to defeat them. It will be less risky for them to attack with Pagel than to attack us alone. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104535, 'Do you have any idea to stop them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104536, 'Many of our?adventurers?haven\'t arrived yet, we need more time?to prepare for?the war. It will be better to attack Siren\'s Castle rather than attacking Pagel as we even don\'t know where Pagel is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104537, 'I will help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104538, 'You don \'t need to go to deep into Siren\'s Castle, risking your life. Anyway it is just?to buy us some?time?while we?wait for the?other adventurers. It will be enough to kill {color,yellow,Varamus} who is?guarding the entrance of {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Is there someone else who could do that?][2]'),
(104539, 'You succeeded. Well done. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104540, 'It was a sudden attack for them and now they also need some time to reorganize themselve. We showed them we?are capable of?attacking them anytime too?so they need to prepare?to fight with us. Your plan was really great. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104541, 'It will be enough to kill {color,yellow,Varamus} who is?guarding the entrance of {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104550, 'The memory of Vannel'),
(104551, 'Magentia is worried about Bera village as she remembers that Vannel was defeated by Siren monsters. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104552, 'I cannot let Bera?be defeated by?Siren monsters like Vannel.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104553, 'Other adventurers and I will save the village no matter how many monsters come to attack?it. Don\'t worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104554, 'As long as Typhoon Siren is there, they will never stop. Can you save our village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104555, 'Well?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104556, 'The most important thing is not about their monsters but {color,yellow,Typhoon Siren} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}. I cannot let Bera fall like Vannel. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry. Other adventurers and I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about going to another village with me?][2]'),
(104557, 'Other adventurers adn I?defeated Typhoon Sirens so don\'t worry anymore. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104558, 'I am not one for?praying to?god but [NAME] looks like god for me right now. Thank you very much. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104559, 'To save Bera village, we need to kill {color,yellow,Typhoon Siren}s in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104560, 'Making Armors'),
(104561, 'McDilan needs Typhoon Siren\'s weapons to make armors. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104562, 'We have enough weapons. Now we have to make armors.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104563, 'Do you know how to make armors? I thought you only make a Bone Sword. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104564, 'Making weapons and making armors are not that different. They both get made with the same materials. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104565, 'I think they are totally different. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104566, 'Don\'t worry about that. Just go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring me some {color,yellow,Weapon}s from {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus}. I will make armors so strong that their weapons will never break them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you some soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you ask me to make them?][2]'),
(104567, 'Typhoon Cyrus\'s weapon looks very strong. Are you sure you can make?armors strong enough that their weapons will never break them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104568, 'Sure. Don\'t you think I can do that? Well.. I don\'t know how much time it will take and how?many I can make. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104569, 'Go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring me some {color,yellow,Weapon}s from {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus}. I will make armors?so strong that?their weapons will never break them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104570, 'For stronger Bone Sword'),
(104571, 'McDilan needs Varamus\'s?weapon to enable him to upgrade Bone Swords. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104572, 'How can I upgrade a Bone Sword?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104573, 'How about comparing it with other strong weapons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104574, 'Strong weapons?? How about yours?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104575, 'I need my weapon to fight. How about monster weapons?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104576, 'If you say so, {color,yellow,Varamus\'s Weapon} from {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} might be good. As he is?guarding the entrance, he must have a really good weapon. To be honest, I like your weapon more though. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you that soon. Don\'t even think about mine.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will think about?it if you?pay me?10 times?it\'s value.][2]'),
(104577, 'Can you just give me yours? I think yours will be perfect. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104578, 'Well. I was actually thinking about that. I saw Varamus\'s weapon but mine looks stronger than his one. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104579, 'Sorry? Yours?is stronger than that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104580, 'What are you talking about? I asked you to bring Varamus\'s weapon not yours. Hand it over.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104581, 'I need {color,yellow,Varamus}\'s {color,yellow,Weapon} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} to upgrade my Bone Sword.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104590, 'Amazing salt'),
(104591, 'Edmond needs amazing salt from Chaoming caught in Siren\'s Castle. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104592, '[NAME]. Are you going to Siren\'s Castle? Can I ask you something?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104593, 'Do you need to go to Siren\'s Castle too Edmond?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104594, 'Well. I need to meet Chaoming. Lily introduced him to me. He has some?amazing salt and I want?a bit. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104595, 'I also need to meet {color,yellow,Chaoming} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}. I\'ll ask him for the salt too, save you a journey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I might go later.][2]'),
(104596, 'Hehe?? Did you bring a Crystal of the ocean, [NAME]? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104597, 'Ah! I came to you to ask a favour, not for that. Do you happen to have some salt?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104598, 'Do you mean "Amazing salt"?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104599, 'Can you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and ask Chaoming if he has some salt?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104600, 'Do it?on your own'),
(104601, 'Chaoming says Typhoon Cyrus and Typhoon Siren took his salt while he was captured by Sirens. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104602, 'Well. I don\'t have the?salt anymore. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104603, 'What? Did you lose?it somewhere?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104604, 'I didn\'t lose it. When I was captured by Sirens, Typhoon Cyrus and Typhoon Siren took it. Those fish sure like their salt!. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104605, 'Anyway, if you need some salt,?you should go?and find?it on your own. As I told you, {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus} and {color,yellow,Typhoon Siren} have the?{color,yellow,Salt} that you need. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I suddenly don\'t want to do that.][2]'),
(104606, 'I brought some salt for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104607, 'Oh! This is what is known as?"Amazing salt." I heard about this several times but it is the first time I\'ve had some. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104608, 'Does it make dishes more delicious?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104609, 'If it doesn\'t, it wouldn\'t be called as "Amazing salt." Let me try.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104610, 'Awwwww~?Well is it? Is it really amazing salt? It smells too fishy. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104611, 'Go to {color,yellow,Typhoon Cyrus} and {color,yellow,Typhoon Siren} and find some {color,yellow,Salt} on your own.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104620, 'Please convince my brothers'),
(104621, 'Akisha says Chief Guard Anika and Anais look down on?Bera village as they believe the village is weak. She asks help for convincing them. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104622, 'My brothers should admit their mistake and think about living?in harmony?with Bera village. They are too young to think about going it alone. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104623, 'Do you have brothers?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104624, 'I have two brothers. They are twins. They believe that Sirens are victims. They were taught that Elves lied to them and took their village. And they even ingore weak elves and humans. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104625, 'They were mistakenly taught that, which is why?they ignore weak people.. They are so bad. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104626, 'I think so too, but there is no one to defeat my brothers among elves and humans in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}. My brothers, {color,yellow,Anika} and {color,yellow,Anais} are very strong among Sirens. But someone should teach them the right thing?to do. Otherwise they will never know the truth. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go to convince them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just let them do anything they want to.][2]'),
(104627, 'I taught them a lesson.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104628, 'Wait! What did you say?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104629, 'Ah~ I convinced them to listen Elves and humans. I didn\'t hit them. Don\'t worry. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104630, 'Ah~ ah! Yes?? You did. So?? hmm?? then my brothers realized the truth. Thank you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104631, '(No one wants to be violent to brothers. But I shouldn\'t have shocked her like that.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104632, 'Please go to {color,yellow, Siren\'s Castle} and convince my brothers {color,yellow,Anika} and {color,yellow,Anais} of the truth.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104640, 'Abyss Judge Tamyu'),
(104641, 'Abyss Judge Tamyu doesn\'t think he needs to listen to humans and elves as they are too weak. Akisha wants to show the power that humans and elves have to Abyss Judge Tamyu. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104642, 'There is no way to stop?this injustice. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104643, 'Do you mean judges are hiding the truth?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104644, 'It is worse, Abyss Judge Tamyu believes Siren should help the weak Elves. That won\'t happen, it will be a Siren dictatorship. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104645, 'That is really dangerous thought. How could he believe that is the only thing for elves?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104646, 'Judge always tells me that humans and elves need some help. But you are not that weak. So you should go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and show {color,yellow,Abyss Judge Tamyu} how strong you are. Then he will stop thinking that?human and elves need the Sirens\' protection. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will show him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Should I really show my strength?][2]'),
(104647, 'I showed strength to Judge. From now on, he will never say that we are weak.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104648, 'Really? Did you really defeat him? Okay?? Okay. Haha Well done. Well done.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104649, '(Akisha asked me to do but why is she so nervous?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104650, 'Go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and show your?strength to {color,yellow,Abyss Judge Tamyu}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104660, 'Elf, protecting Freloan'),
(104661, 'Elder Duskin is telling you about an Elf who is protecting Freloan in Siren\'s Castle. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104662, 'Is he really there?...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104663, '[NAME]. I am sure you would?do this anyway?but can you kill Guardian Hayreddin in Siren\'s Castle?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104664, 'There is no reason not to do if he is the enemy, but I\'m guessing?there is a story behind your request. Can you tell me?please?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104665, 'Guardian Hayreddin was an Elf from Bera village. Freloan promised him a better life. He gave up the life of an elf and became human. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104666, 'We need to save him if he was an elf from Bera village, don\'t we?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104667, 'If I could do it, I wouldn\'t have?asked for your help. But he gave up  his elven life and got Freloan\'s magic power in return.?If he is cut of from Freloan\'s magic power, he will die. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104668, 'Then we just need to capture him. And Freloan..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104669, 'Ah! ?? Hayreddin will be dead once we kill Freloan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104670, 'This is all my fault. I had to hug him that time.... This is all my fault. It will be hard for you now that you have heard everything about him, but I cannot let the villagers kill another villager. I am so sorry to have to ask?you, but can you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Guardian Hayreddin}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t have another choice. Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I cannot do that.][2]'),
(104671, 'Did you kill Hayreddin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104672, 'Well?? He got?really mad and blocked my way. I don\'t know it was because of Freloan\'s magic power.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104673, 'Okay. Finally.. But I am happy that Hayreddin is dead?? It have made me sadder if the villagers had killed him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104674, 'I am so sorry to ask this of?you, but can you go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Guardian Hayreddin}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104680, 'Judge Milly'),
(104681, 'Milly wants to have a gavel which Abyss Judge Tamyu uses in a trial. Let\'s talk with her. \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104682, 'Bang! Bang! Bang! You are guilty. You bothered me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104683, 'Are you playing?at being a judge? That doesn\'t sound much like a gavel though. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104684, 'I know. I really?need a gavel. I feel little bit weird using this instead of a gavel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104685, 'Do you have anything similar to a gavel that you could use instead?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104686, 'Well. Can you get a real gavel? I heard {color,yellow,Abyss Judge Tamyu} has one in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}. As he is a?judge, I am sure he has one. Please bring it to me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Oh??Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You\'ve just handed me a death sentence.][2]'),
(104687, 'Here, I brought you a gavel. It was so hard to get?it so don\'t go?hitting?the ground with it. Otherwise it will be broken. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104688, 'No way~ I need to hit on the ground to make the?right noise!?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104689, 'However, I will take care not to break the gavel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104690, '[NAME] is guilty. You were too noisy. Bang! Bang! Bang!\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104691, 'I heard {color,yellow,Abyss Judge Tamyu} has a gavel in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle}. As he is?a judge, I am sure he has one. Please bring it to me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104700, 'Flower seeds are not fluttering'),
(104701, 'Wind is suddenly not blowing these days. Flower seeds need wind to flutter around. The Chief Guard is worried about that and wants to have Chief Guard Anika\'s Wind Crystal. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104702, 'It should be windy here for the flowers...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104703, 'By the way, it is rarely windy in this village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104704, 'That is true. It is rarely windy after the dimension was cracked. Well?? Due to that, many adventurers came to Bera village but it is not good for flowers at all. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104705, 'Do you know what happened?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104706, 'I heard that {color,yellow,Chief Guard Anika} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} has {color,yellow,Wind Crystal} which makes wind. If you are going to Siren\'s Castle, can you bring me one?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay. I will go to Siren\'s Castle.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can plant seeds by hand.][2]'),
(104707, 'I brought the crystal. Do you  know how to use this?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104708, 'According to book of magic I once read, people breathe magical power and holiness into this kind of thing. I think I?should try?that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104709, 'Well. I have never used this kind of thing. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104710, '(Once Amelie breathed holiness into the crystal,?a huge wind suddenly blew?through her garden.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104711, 'No! No! No way! My garden was blown away by the wind. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104712, '{color,yellow,Chief Guard Anika} in{color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} has {color,yellow,Wind Crystal} making wind.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104720, 'Stream, in need of water'),
(104721, 'Olivia needs a Water Crystal as the stream is drying up. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104722, 'I need a Water Crystal to stop the stream from drying up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104723, 'There is still?a lot of?water here. You don\'t need to worry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104724, 'Ah! [NAME] just came to Bera village so you don\'t know much about this water. [NAME], a couple of years ago, it started to dry up. Now almost half of the water is gone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104725, 'Is?this stream drying up naturally?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104726, 'There was a {color,yellow,Water Crystal} in the bottom of the stream and it automatically controled the level of water?using magical powers. But one day {color,yellow,Chief Guard Anais} from {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} came to the village at night and stole the crystal. Since then, the stream has been drying up. Now only a?small amount of water is left. We need to get that crystal back to stop the stream drying up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go and find it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about melting snow in Snow Field?][2]'),
(104727, 'I brought the crystal back,?do I just throw this into the water?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104728, 'Ah! No, you cannot throw that into the water. There should be magic power in the crystal as Anais already used this. We need to purify that magic power?using Magentia\'s holiness.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104729, 'Phew~ I was about to throw this into the water. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104730, 'Anyway, Thank you for bringing it back.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104731, '{color,yellow,Chief Guard Anais} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} has {color,yellow,Water Crystal}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104740, 'For a new sword'),
(104741, 'Skill Master Hal wants to have Guardian Hayreddin\'s sword as a Bone Sword does not suit everyone. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104742, 'I don\'t understand why McDilan keeps making Bone Swords. I want to make a new kind.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104743, 'Well. You cannot make a?all swords a Bone Sword. A bone sword breaks itself when you attack the enemy.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104744, 'So can you bring me Guardian Hayreddin\'s sword? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104745, 'Why Guardian Hayreddin\'s sword?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104746, 'If the sword doesn\'t match with your body type, you cannot use sword properly. Even if the sword is the best one in the world. Of course the materials and its solidity are also important. But the most important thing is to match with a person\'s body type. \n{color,yellow,Guardian Hayreddin} from {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} has almost same body type with me and he is the guardian for Freloan. I am sure he must have some good {color,yellow,Sword}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go find that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can?just improve that sword.][2]'),
(104747, 'Guardian Hayreddin had quite a lot of swords. I brought the one which looked most expensive among them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104748, 'You brought me one. Thank you. I can make?new swords?with this. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104749, '{color,yellow,Guardian Hayreddin} in {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} might have a good {color,yellow,Sword}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104750, 'Letting him rest in peace'),
(104751, 'Elder Duskin asks you to help Angry Guardian Hayreddin rest in peace. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104752, 'He is still bearing a lot of grudges.He is angry and that is why he can\'t just close his eyes and rest in peace. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104753, 'You are talking about Guardian Hayreddin, aren\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104754, 'He is suffering because he won\'t let go of his anger. We should help him leave here and rest in peace....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104755, 'Someone should help him. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104756, 'I am so sorry. But I cannot bear?to see?the tragedy?of people?fighting each other. Please go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Angry Guardian Hayreddin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can ask another adventurer to do that.][2]'),
(104757, 'Now he can go to his final rest. Can you tell me what happened between you and Hayreddin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104758, 'You did me a?favor even though?you didn\'t know anything about that. Yes, I should tell you this story. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104759, 'Please go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,Angry Guardian Hayreddin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104760, 'Elder Duskin and Hayreddin'),
(104761, 'Duskin knows something happened to Angry Guardian Hayreddin. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104762, 'Do you remember that I had a son?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104763, 'Do you mean your son who was killed by monsters?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104764, 'Yes. But my son wasn\'t killed by monsters. I left him. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104765, 'You left him? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104766, 'The village was about to?fall to the monsters. I came to Freloan and desperately asked for his help. But he wanted my son in return for helping the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104767, 'You gave your son to him?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104768, 'I made a terrible decision but I didn\'t have any other choice. I thought I could save a lot of people if I sacrificed only one life. But he lied to me. I found out later that Siren\'s King Freloan ordered monsters to attack the village. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104769, 'He took your son\'s life, didn\'t he?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104770, 'No. I don\'t think so. He wanted to attack Bera village. But he changed his mind when I came to him. He made us more desperate by making my son go mad. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104771, 'His evil plan succeeded. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104772, 'I know I did a terrible mistake, but?I can never forgive Freloan. He shouldn\'t have done that to my son. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104780, 'Killing Freloan'),
(104781, 'Elder Duskin asks you to kill depraved King Freloan. Let\'s talk with him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104782, 'Pleaseavenge him for my son and Bera village.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104783, 'You need me to kill Siren\'s King Freloan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104784, 'I will gladly accept any pushiment for what I have done. But Freloan will never be punished by anyone except you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104785, 'Okay. I will go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and kill {color,yellow,depraved Siren\'s King Freloan}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Siren\'s Castle.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s take a rest first.][2]'),
(104786, 'I won the battle with Freloan but I failed to kill Freloan, because he is receiving grace from Pagel.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104787, 'Okay. That is punishment enough for him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104788, 'What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104789, 'He will suffer from the adventurers attack for the rest of his life. That is enough punishment for him. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104790, 'Go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and Kill {color,yellow,depraved Siren\'t King Freloan}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104800, 'The pearl of Abyss'),
(104801, 'Lily wants to have the pearl of Abyss that the depraved Siren\'s King Freloan has. Let\'s talk with her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104802, 'Chaoming won\'t be able to get the pearl of Abyss.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104803, 'Hmm???It seems he gave up the pearl of Abyss as he is collecting the crystals of the ocean in jail. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104804, 'Why don\'t you get the pearl of Abyss?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104805, 'If you want, I will get it for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104806, 'Go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring me the {color,yellow,the pearl of Abyss} from {color,yellow,depraved Siren\'s King Freloan}. Are you sure that you don\'t want it yourself? It would make you rich....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Lily, you will use that better.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I think I need that one.][2]'),
(104807, 'I brought you the pearl of abyss. But are you sure that it is really expensive? I mean it seems just as shiny as every other jewel...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104808, 'It is not expensive because its shiny. It\'s rarity is what makes it so expensive.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104809, 'Okay. You will be rich. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104810, '[NAME], I will not keep the money for myself. I will spend all the money to rebuild Bera village and other villages attacked by monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104811, 'Great idea. You are a very nice person. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(104812, 'Go to {color,yellow,Siren\'s Castle} and bring me the {color,yellow,the pearl of abyss} from {color,yellow,depraved Siren\'s King Freloan}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104820, 'Let\'s use a skill'),
(104821, 'Skill Master Ruby of Roumen asks you to defeat Mandragora.\n(Search Forest of Tides) \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104822, 'I have never met you before. How do you like staying in Roumen?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104823, 'Hello. I am [NAME].\nThe village looks peaceful but there are a lot of animals here. I\'m finding it difficult because I haven\'t learnt {color,yellow,how to Attack} yet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104824, 'Why don\'t you use a {color,yellow,Skill}. I know some skills which will be suitable for you. You can use these effectively once you learned them.  \nYou have enough {color,yellow,Money} to buy a skill, don\'t you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104825, 'Should I pay for that? I don\'t have enough money. I just got here....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104826, 'Do you think I would sell skills at a high price to newbie? If people heard that my skills were too expensive I would not be able to sell skills anymore here. I would never do that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104827, 'Are you sure that skills are really useful for me?\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104828, 'You don\'t believe me... \nThen how about this? First {color,yellow,Buy a Skill} from me and defeat {color,yellow,Mandragora}. Just try. If the skill is not that useful, I will give you your money back.\nAh! To use a skill, you should press {color,yellow, K} and put it in a {color,yellow,Quickslot}. You know this, don\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Um, I\'m poor.][2]'),
(104829, 'How was it? Was it helpful?\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104830, 'It was amazing. I was like a God in battle. It is the best.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104831, 'I thought you would lie to get money back but you did\'t. Okay, I will give you your money back anyway. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104832, 'Sorry? You don\'t need to do that. I really like the skill. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104833, 'Basically a master wants people to be happy with his skills more than to sell them at a high price.?I am so happy thanks to you. This is just to show my appreciation.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104834, 'Then I cannot refuse.. Thank you so much. I will train hard and buy myself some more skills. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104835, 'First {color,yellow,Buy a Skill} from me and defeat {color,yellow,Mandragora}. Just try. If the skill is not that useful, I will give you your money back.\nAh! To use a skill, you should press {color,yellow, K} and put it in a {color,yellow,Quickslot}. You know this, don\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104840, 'Town Chief Roumenus\'s alert'),
(104841, 'Town Chief Roumenus of Roumen needs help. Let\'s go to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104842, 'Ask to help out?other adventurers who got an alert.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104843, 'I am Town Chief {color,yellow,Roumenus} of {color,yellow,Roumen}. There are many people asking for?help in the village. Will every ambitious adventurer who can survive attacks?from monsters, please come to {color,yellow,Roumen} once you get this alert.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104844, 'As I said, only those?who can survive attacks?from monsters. Please come to {color,yellow,Roumen} and find {color,yellow,Town Chief Roumenus}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104845, 'Roumen needs help??. Should I go there or not?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Roumen.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have something left?to do?here.][2]'),
(104846, 'Ah?I see adventurers arriving here like you, the alert must have been sent correctly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104847, 'Hello. I am [NAME]. Though I am not that strong, I will train in Roumen and become the best one day.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104848, 'Hahaha. After sending the alert, a lot of adventurers came to me. But I like you the most. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104849, 'Welcome to Roumen Adventurer!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104850, 'Item Merchant Pey'),
(104851, 'Item Merchant Pey. Let\'s go to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104852, 'As you?are here, how about introducing yourself to people?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104853, '{color,yellow,Item Merchant Pey} is near here. Go meet her first. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104854, 'What kind of items?does {color,yellow,Item Merchant Pey} sell?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104855, 'You\'d better go to {color,yellow,Item Merchant Pey} and ask in person. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am a bit shy...][2]'),
(104856, 'Hello. I am [NAME] and just arrived in Roumen. As I will stay in Roumen for a while, thank you in advance for any help you give me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104857, 'You look so reliable. Thank you in advance. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104858, 'Go meet {color,yellow,Item Merchant Pey} near here.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104860, 'Healer Julia'),
(104861, 'Healer Julia. Let\'s go meet her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104862, 'By the way, have you?stocked up on?{color,yellow,Stones}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104863, 'Ah! You mean the {color,yellow,Stones} restoring {color,yellow,HP} and {color,yellow,SP}. I got some from Tabbot Town but I will need to buy more.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104864, '{color,yellow,Healer Julia} sells {color,yellow,Stones} so go buy some from her right now, that way you won\'t forget. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104865, 'I was going to do it later...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104866, 'I saw many adventurers saying the same?as you and they were killed by monsters. Don\'t hesitate, just go to {color,yellow,Healer Julia} and buy some {color,yellow,Stones}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will look around the village first.][2]'),
(104867, 'Hello. I am [NAME] and just?arrived in Roumen. As I will stay in Roumen for a while, thank you in advance for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104868, 'You are wise to stock up before you encounter monsters. Most adventurers come to me after being chased by monsters. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104869, '(Scratching his head)\n\nThank you for your compliment. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104870, 'Don\'t be chased by monsters just because you forgot to buy Stones. Buy stones from {color,yellow,Healer Julia} right now.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104880, 'Skill Master Ruby'),
(104881, 'Skill Master Ruby. Let\'s go meet her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104882, 'Have you learned any {color,yellow,New Skills}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104883, 'Is there a new skill that i haven\'t learned in Tabbot Town?\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(104884, 'Once you level up to 5, you can learn a {color,yellow,New Skill}. So if you haven\'t learnt it yet, go to {color,yellow,Skill Master Ruby}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go to her later.][2]'),
(104885, 'Hello. I am [NAME] and just came here in Roumen. As I will stay inRoumen for a while, thank you in advance for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104886, 'As you just got here, you haven\'t learned any new skills yet, have you? Skills will be really helpful to defeat monsters. Don\'t forget to buy some.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104887, 'Once you level up to 5, you can learn a {color,yellow,New Skill}. So if you haven\'t learned it yet, go to {color,yellow,Skill Master Ruby}.\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104890, 'Blacksmith James'),
(104891, 'Blacksmith James. Let\'s go meet him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104892, 'By the way, {color,yellow,Blacksmith James} said he needed {color,yellow,Help} from adventurers.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104893, 'Finally I can help someone.\n[EMOTION][14]\n[NEXT]'),
(104894, 'Do you like to help other people, [NAME]? You can find {color,yellow,Blacksmith James} up the stairs. Go and find him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I will go later.][2]'),
(104895, 'Hello. I am [NAME] and just?arrived here in Roumen. As I will stay in Roumen for a while, thank you in advance for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104896, 'Oh! Nice to meet you. I was looking for someone who can do me a?favor. You came at just the right time. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104897, 'You can find {color,yellow,Blacksmith James} upstairs. Go and find him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104900, 'Fire Mushrooms disturbing delivery of materials'),
(104901, 'Blacksmith James is worried that Fire Mushrooms are disturbing the delivery of materials needed to make an item.. Let\'s talk to him.\n(Search Forest of Tides and Sand Beach) \n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104902, 'I need materials to be delivered here. I am so worried that {color,yellow,Fire Mushrooms} are disturbing the delivery of them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104903, 'Are {color,yellow,Fire Mushrooms} strong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104904, 'Not really. But A huge bunch of them disturb my deliveries every time I request materials. Can you kill {color,yellow,Fire Mushrooms} for me?\nThey are around {color,yellow,Forest of Tides} and {color,yellow,Sand Beach}. It won\'t be hard to find them. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(104905, 'Ah! Once you are {color,yellow,done}, you can see {color,yellow,my portrait in the right side of your screen}. When you {color,yellow,click} on that, you can get {color,yellow,rewards} from where you are. You don\'t need to come to me again after killing {color,yellow,Fire Mushrooms}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you have something else I can help you with?][2]'),
(104906, 'I killed Fire Mushrooms but I am not sure it was helpful.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104907, 'Haha. You don\'t need to be humble. You are the best adventurer I have ever met.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104908, 'If you are okay, can you kill {color,yellow,Fire Mushrooms}? \nYou can find them around {color,yellow,Forest of Tides} and {color,yellow,Sand Beach}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104910, 'Have you heard about the Quest alert?'),
(104911, 'Skill Master Ruby wants to tell you about the?quest alert system. Let\'s talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104912, '[NAME]. Have you heard about the?{color,yellow,quest indicator}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104913, '{color,yellow,Quest indicator}? What is that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104914, 'Normally you {color,yellow, go and find them in person} when {color,yellow,villagers?ask for your help} or to {color,yellow,get your rewards}. It doesn\'t matter if you are near to them. However, if they are far away, adventurers are not so willing to go to them and help them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104915, 'To be honest, I\'d rather do other things than go to them as well.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104916, 'Well?? People understand that and that is why we made the {color,yellow,quest alert system}.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104917, 'Okay, what is this {color,yellow,quest alert system}?\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104918, 'Can you see the {color,yellow,shining jewel icon} on the {color,yellow,Top} of [NAME]\'s screen? That is called a {color,yellow,quest indicator}. With this {color,yellow,quest indicator}, you can get {color,yellow,requests from villagers} or {color,yellow,rewards} wherever [NAME] is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104919, 'Really? It looks a really convenient system.\n[NEXT]'),
(104920, 'The {color,yellow,quest indicator} comes up whenever villagers?{color,yellow,are in need of your help}. When you want to get {color,yellow,rewards} from the quest alert, press {color,yellow,L key} or the shining jewel {color,yellow,click on the portrait} on the right side of your screen. Of course the {color,yellow,portrait} comes up only when {color,yellow,you have done} what the villagers?asked. You cannot find it on your screen right now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104921, 'By the way...  The quest indicator alert has been shining for a while now. Don\'t you want to click it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104930, 'Auto find system'),
(104931, 'Town Chief Roumenus teaches you about the auto move system. Let\'s go and find him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104932, '[NAME]. Have you heard about the {color,yellow,auto move system}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104933, '{color,yellow,Auto move system}? I have never heard of it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104934, 'When you press {color,yellow,M}, you can see your {color,yellow,mini map}.  {color,yellow,Right clicking} an {color,yellow,NPC icon} on the {color,yellow,mini map}, allows you to {color,yellow,move to an NPC} automatically without pressing any buttons. This is the auto move system.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104935, 'Is?there more to?this convenient system?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104936, 'Not only from your mini map, you can also use this system when you press {color,yellow,L} or click the {color,yellow,quest indicator}. An {color,yellow,icon} is shown at each {color,yellow,monster} or {color,yellow,NPC} name. This icon is also for the {color,yellow,auto move system}. So don\'t move with keyboard and mouse. This system  is a more convenient and easy way to move around.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104937, 'Ah! The icon is for the auto move system!. \nThank you. Now I can travel easier than before.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104940, 'No news from the Dwarf Village'),
(104941, 'Cuero is worried about Tumbloot in the Dwarf Village. Let\'s talk with him.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104942, 'I sent the report to Tumbloot a long time ago.. Why haven\'t they replied yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104943, 'What is going on?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104944, 'I sent the report about Arcroot, but they haven\'t sent me back anything yet. I am worried about what happened to them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104945, 'Hmm??. Shall I go there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104946, 'That will be nice. But do you know where Tumbloot is?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104947, 'Um?? You can give me directions.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104948, '{color,yellow,Tumbloot Village} is located at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}. I don\'t know exactly though. Our Dwarfs must be around the canyon, so you can ask to them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t you have a map?][2]'),
(104949, 'Ah! Cuero said there must be Dwarfs but there is a human!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104950, 'Are you maybe running away from Garuda?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104951, '{color,yellow,Tumbloot Village} is located at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}.  I don\'t know where exactly though. There must be some of our Dwarfs friends, so you can ask them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104960, 'Scary Vale Snowy Puggy'),
(104961, 'Jey said a Vale Snowy Puggy attacked him. Let\'s talk with him.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104962, 'You must be running away from Garuda. However, it\'s not so safe here either.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104963, 'What is Garuda? What do you mean that it\'s not safe here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104964, 'You don\'t know Garuda? Let\'s move somewhere safer first. A {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy} might {color,yellow,Attack} us again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104965, 'Should we really move to somewhere else?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will kill them.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They won\'t attack us if we pretend to be dead.][2]'),
(104966, 'You killed a Vale Snowy Puggy??  You are stronger than I expected.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104967, 'What does it mean?\n[EMOTION][15]\n[NEXT]'),
(104968, 'I can stay here longer thanks to you. There was no where to run due to Garuda though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104969, 'First let\'s move to somewhere safe. {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy} might {color,yellow,Attack} us again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104970, 'Head of the Hunter Union Jey'),
(104971, 'Jey is talking about Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104972, 'You keep saying \'Garuda\' for some time. Who is that?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104973, 'It must be the first time visiting Kahal Canyon since you\'ve never heard of Garuda.\n\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104974, 'I am Jey from the Hunters Union. I came here to examine Kahal Canyon under orders. After the huge monster called Garuda killed most of my colleagues, I ran here. It almost killed me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104975, 'Garuda must be strong.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104976, 'As we know, it was the guardian of Nature. It attacks people and monsters no matther if they care about Nature or not.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104977, 'Then you should go to the Union and inform them as soon as possible. What are you still doing here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104978, 'One of my colleagues is still in the camp where we were. He is still alive. How can I leave him alone there?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104980, 'Jey\'s Weapon'),
(104981, 'Jey\'s weapon was broken when he ran away from Garuda. He wants to make a spear with Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104982, 'I saw you killed a Vale Snowy Puggy. May I ask you something?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104983, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104984, 'My weapon has broken when I escaped from Garuda so I need to make a new one. Can you bring me some {color,yellow,Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104985, '{color,yellow,Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[yes, I can get you some.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No, you will probably make a billiard ball.][2]'),
(104986, 'Thank you. I can make a spear with this and a long branch.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104987, 'Can you bring me some {color,yellow,Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory}?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104990, 'Have You Seen Dwarfs?'),
(104991, 'To go to Tumbloot, you have to find a Dwarf. Let\'s ask to Jey whether he has seen any Dwarfs at Kahal Canyon.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104992, 'Have you seen any Dwarfs at Kahal Canyon?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(104993, 'Dwarfs? \nHmm?? I have seen the {color,yellow,Soul of a Dwarf} on the {color,yellow,bridge} at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}. I don\'t know were exactly. I have never crossed that bridge. If there are {color,yellow,Dwarfs} here, they might be {color,yellow,over the bridge}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104994, 'Wait?? Did you say the \'Soul of a Dwarf\'?\n[EMOTION][13]\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104995, 'Of course you are surpirsed. Something is going on there as they sometimes fight Garuda. I don\'t know exactly though?? \nAh! If you meet Dwarfs over the Canyon, can you bring me some warm clothes? As you see, it is too cold  here to stay with these clothes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104996, 'Soul means ghost, doesn\'t it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s cross the canyon at first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[The ghost will kill me for sure.][2]'),
(104997, 'Finally I met a Dwarf.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(104998, 'Who are you? Aren\'t you a monster?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(104999, 'If {color,yellow,Dwarfs} are here they might be {color,yellow,Over the Bridge}. If you meet Dwarfs over the Canyon, can you bring me some warm clothes? As you see, it is too cold to stay here with these clothes.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105000, 'Dwarf Basilone'),
(105001, 'Dwarf Basilone in Kahal Canyon is worried due to the Vale Beaks. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105002, 'Hello, I am [NAME]. Cuero asked me to go visit Tumbloot to do something. Where should I go?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105003, 'By the way, I haven\'t told to Cuero about this. Unfortunately, you cannot go to {color,yellow,Tumbloot Village}. I closed the way to the {color,yellow,Village} because Garuda could attack.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105004, 'Then is there no way to go to the Village?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105005, 'I am sorry but I cannot let you go before Garuda is killed. So forget about Cuero\'s request and do me a favor.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105006, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105007, 'I have something to research but the {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} are so annoying. Please kill them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You can do that on your own.][2]'),
(105008, 'Thank you. I can do research now without any their disturbance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105009, 'I have something to research but the {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} are so annoying. Please kill them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105010, 'Stolen Whetstone'),
(105011, 'Basilone said that ValeBeak sometimes come to the camp and steal Whetstones. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105012, 'I am in a hurry. Can you do me a favour?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105013, 'Tell me what I can do for you. I can do almost anything unless it is something stupid.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105014, '{color,yellow,ValeBeaks} sometimes come to the camp to steal the {color,yellow,Whetstones}. I don\'t know what they would use them for unless to sharpen their beaks to fight against Garuda maybe. However without the Whetstones I might be in danger.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105015, 'I can help you. But where are the ValeBeaks?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105016, 'There\'s a {color,yellow,Garuda\'s Shelter} when you walk down from my camp. Go search for Vale Beaks, but be sure to avoid Garuda. The Vale Beaks which stole the Whetstones might be there. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Before I go do that, you have a Whetstone to sharpen my weapon, don\'t you?][2]'),
(105017, 'There were not so many Whetstones as the ValeBeaks used most of them up.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105018, 'That\'s too bad. Then I cannot sharpen my axe??. Anyways you did good job.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105019, 'Please bring me the stolen {color,yellow,Whetstones} from the {color,yellow,Vale Beaks}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105020, 'Jey\'s Request'),
(105021, 'Jey asked to bring some warm clothes from Tumbloot. Let\'s ask Basilone whether he has some warm clothes.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105022, 'Umm?? Do you have some warm clothes? Someone asked me to get some.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105023, 'Warm clothes? Why should I have some with this great weather? Why do you need them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105024, 'There is a guy over the Canyon. It is too cold there so he needs warm clothes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105025, 'How about a {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Fur Skin}? It will be better because he can use it as {color,yellow,Disguise} to be dead.\n\n[BUTTON]=[That is a great idea.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Then Garuda\'s leather will be the best.][2]'),
(105026, 'I couldn\'t bring warm clothes but I brought a Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Fur Skin. You can use it as disguise to be dead when you\'re in danger. It will be better than warm clothes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105027, 'You couldn\'t find Tumbloot so you couldn\'t bring warm clothes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105028, 'I couldn\'t go to the village because of Garuda. By the way, did you make a spear?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105029, 'It is quite hard to sharpen the Ivory. I have to make one as soon as possible before Nicolas freezes there??.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105030, 'Then bring me another {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Fur Skin}. It will be better than warm clothes and I can use it as disguise.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105040, 'Transportation in the Snow'),
(105041, 'Jey wants to make a sled with Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns since it snows a lot. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105042, 'It\'s too hard to walk in the snow. It will be better to move with a sled.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105043, 'Isn\'t it easy to make a sled?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105044, 'Yes, I can make one with tree branches and {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}. {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horn} is thick and should be smooth enough to move with. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105045, 'So you need me to bring you some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105046, 'I don\'t have a weapon yet. [NAME], please bring me some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}. I will find some tree branches. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[How about I bring you the tree branches instead?][2]'),
(105047, 'Is this enough? I brought as many as I could since I don\'t know which ones are good.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105048, 'You really brought a lot. I hope there are enough useful horns.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105049, 'I don\'t have a weapon yet. [NAME], please bring me some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105050, 'Transportation in the Snow (Repeat)'),
(105051, 'Jey said there were not enough useful Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105052, 'There were not enough useful horns. I need some equipment to trim them. So I need some smooth horns at least.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105053, 'Why don\'t you just build a sled out of rough ones?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105054, 'I could but running will be faster than moving with that one. To make the right sled, I need useful {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105055, 'Okay...\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you another stack.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you just give up making one?][2]'),
(105056, 'I brought more Horns. How about these?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105057, 'Well.. Let me see.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105058, 'To make the right sled, I need useful {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s Horns}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105060, 'Embarrassed Basilone'),
(105061, 'Basilone is embarrassed that he can\'t find what he\'s looking for. It seems that the Vale Beaks took it. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105062, 'If it\'s not in the shelter??  Where is it?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105063, 'What are you looking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105064, 'Um?? Um??..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105065, 'If you don\'t tell me then I won\'t be able to help you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105066, 'Um?? Um??..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105067, 'Actually I am looking for a {color,yellow,Leather Pocket}. The {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} probably took it when they took the Whetstones... It\'s impossible to find it alone. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[They probably already ate it.][2]'),
(105068, 'Is this what you are looking for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105069, 'Yes?? that is the one...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105070, 'It\'s very strange. I don\'t know exactly, but I can feel a very strong power from this pocket. Um.. Something like magic.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105071, 'What?? what are you talking about?.. Just give it to me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105072, 'Probably the {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} stole it when they took the Whetstones... It\'s impossible to find alone. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105080, 'Basilone is avoiding to answer'),
(105081, 'Basilone refuses to answer about the Leather Pocket and asks to kill Vale Shella. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105082, 'In my opinion that pocket is not just a normal one. What did you put inside?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105083, 'That is not your business. Oh.. By the way.. If you have nothing to do, just go kill some {color,yellow,Vale Shella}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105084, 'Vale Shellas are nothing. But why are you refusing to answer my question?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105085, 'Shut up. It is not your business whatever I put in there. Go kill {color,yellow,Vale Shella\'s} if you are bored.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Nah, I rather wait for you to answer the question.][2]'),
(105086, 'I killed some Vale Shella\'s. I am sorry I was rude earlier, if you don\'t want to answer, you don\'t have to.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105087, '...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105088, 'To be honest, this is what was left by my colleage. He was killed by Garuda. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105089, 'Go to kill some {color,yellow,Vale Shella} if you are bored.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105090, 'Stolen Rice Ball 1'),
(105091, 'Vale Shella\'s stole Basilone\'s Rice Ball for lunch. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105092, 'What should I eat for lunch today?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105093, 'Haven\'t you had lunch yet?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105094, 'I prepared a {color,yellow,Rice Ball} but the {color,yellow,Vale Shella\'s} have stolen it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105095, 'I\'m sure that they will kill me when I am too starved to fight back. What an evil plan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring back your Rice Ball.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think they are clever enough to do that?][2]'),
(105096, 'I got your rice ball back. However, I don\'t think you can eat this. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105097, 'What is this smell? It shouldn\'t be rotten but it smells like it is.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105098, '(Throwing Rice Ball on the ground)\n\nI rather starve to death, I can\'t eat this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105099, '{color,yellow,Vale Shella\'s} stole my rice ball.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105100, 'Basilone\'s Colleagues'),
(105101, 'Basilone starts talking about Vale Ark Guard. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105102, 'You saw the Vale Ark Guard when you crossed the bridge, didn\'t you? Those Dwarfs were my colleagues who got killed by Garuda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105103, 'Ah! They are still there to get revenge at Garuda, even as a soul.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105104, 'It\'s not natural for them to stay there. So I will collect their belongings and pray for them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105105, 'I can help you. It will be hard to do it alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105106, 'It\'s okay. This is what I have to do. I cannot ask for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105107, 'What are you talking about? I brought the Leather Pocket. Let me help you please.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105108, 'Umm?? Ahh??It\'s okay??.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105110, 'Collecting the Colleagues belongings 1'),
(105111, 'Basilone said a Vale Snowy Puggy took the belt that was left by one of this colleagues. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105112, 'I can\'t keep refusing your help since you really want to help me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105113, 'Four of my colleagues were killed by Garuda. One of them cherished a {color,yellow,Belt} with big buckle. The {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s} took his {color,yellow,Belt}. Please bring it to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105114, 'Belt? By the way, how did the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy} take it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105115, 'Um??um?? I saw the belt blow away when my colleague flew away from Garuda\'s flapping wings. Please bring it to me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring you the belt.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think I believe that story?][2]'),
(105116, 'Phew, that was hard.  Here I brought the Belt. I was able to find it quickly because of this big buckle.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105117, 'What! Did you bring the belt? Why??why was it there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105118, 'Sorry? What do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105119, 'No..nothing. Now only two are left. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105120, 'One of my collegues cherished a strange {color,yellow,Belt}. The {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s} took his {color,yellow,Belt}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105130, 'Collecting the Colleagues belongings 2'),
(105131, 'Basilone said Vale Mastodons took the necklace that was left by one of his colleagues. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105132, 'This time you have to find the necklace.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105133, 'Necklace? Did it belong to a woman?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105134, 'One of my colleagues has a baby. He cherished the {color,yellow,Necklace} with the picture of his baby. Now {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} have that necklace but I don\'t think they cherish the necklace as my colleague did.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105135, 'Was it blown away from Garuda\'s flapping wings?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105136, 'Exactly. Now please find {color,yellow,Necklace}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will find it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think I believe that story?][2]'),
(105137, 'I saw the picture of the baby. Dwarf\'s babies looks like human babies.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105138, 'What?? there really was a necklace with the picture of baby?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105139, '{color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} took his {color,yellow,Necklace}.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105140, 'Collecting the Colleagues belongings 3'),
(105141, 'Basilone said there was nothing special that the fourth colleague left but he loved a Leopard Skin when he was alive. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105142, 'Why are you so surprised? Is it so surprising that I got them back?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105143, 'No.. I was just surprised that you came back so fast. There is nothing special the last colleague left so please bring me a {color,yellow, Leopard Skin} from Vale Shella.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105144, 'Skin? It is not a big deal but why should I bring a skin?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105145, 'When he was alive, he loved Leopards and decorated his house with {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Skins}. So I would like to hang a {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Skin} on the bridge. Please bring the best one.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have leopard phobia.][2]'),
(105146, 'Um?? You brought quite good ones. He would love this.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105147, 'Phew! Good to hear that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105148, 'You didn\'t need to bring all of them. Only a few would have been fine.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105149, 'When he was alive, he loved Leopards. Please bring me {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Skin}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105150, 'Present for Jey'),
(105151, 'Basilone wants to send a Leopard\'s skin to Jey who is freezing in the cold. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105152, 'By the way, you said there was someone freezing in the cold, didn\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105153, 'Ah! Yes. You do remember {color,yellow,Jey}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105154, 'His name is {color,yellow,Jey}. Anyway I have some {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Skins} left over, so bring them to him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He doesn\'t need it anymore. He already got another one.][2]'),
(105155, 'Hey. I have a present for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105156, 'Is that really a leopard skin [NAME], you holding in your hand?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105157, 'Exactly. Basilone over the Canyon gave it for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105158, 'I have no idea who he is. But.. Lepoard...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105159, 'His name is {color,yellow,Jey}. Anyway I have some {color,yellow,Leopard\'s Skin} left over, so bring them to {color,yellow,Jey}.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105160, 'Jey\'s Colleague'),
(105161, 'Jey is missing his colleague. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105162, 'This leopard skin reminds me of my collegues who were killed by Garuda. He always put on a leopard cloth and a strange belt??.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105163, 'Strange Belt? Was it probably the belt with a big buckle?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105164, 'Do you know them? It might be hard to get the belt with a big buckle. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105165, 'Was there another guy who had the necklace with a picture of a baby?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105166, 'Do you know him as well? He cherished that necklace with the picture of his baby. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105167, '(Something is strange.?? those belongings I brought to Basilone were all were left by Jey\'s colleagues.)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105170, 'Jey Needs More Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory.'),
(105171, 'While making a spear the Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory had broken. Jey needs some more Ivory. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105172, 'It is not that easy to make a spear. I should have learned how to make weapons. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105173, 'If you broke all the {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Ivory}, shall I bring you some more?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105174, 'Can you do that? As a matther of fact, most of them were broken and got too small while I trimmed the {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Ivory} so I cound\'t make anything with them. Please?? bring me some more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry. I will bring you more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It will be better to bring a spear to you.][2]'),
(105175, 'Are these enough? I brought a lot to cover for your poor skills.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105176, 'You brought a lot to cover my poor skills??. I got little bit sad.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105177, 'Ah! I didn??t mean it like that. I am sorry.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105178, 'No.. Don\'t be..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105179, 'Bring me some more {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Ivory}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105180, 'Jey Needs More Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory (Repeat)'),
(105181, 'Jey needs more Vale Mastodon\'s Ivory. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105182, 'I am little bit embarrassed to say this.. I need more Ivory as I am pretty bad at this work. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105183, 'Do you need more than what I brought you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105184, 'I will get better as I trim them but I am not good enough. I need more {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Ivory}. Please bring me more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry. I will bring more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It will be better to bring a spear to you.][2]'),
(105185, 'I brought a lot to cover for your poor skills. Are these enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105186, 'Hmm???? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105187, 'Bring me some more {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Ivory}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105190, 'Basilone\'s Lie'),
(105191, 'For some reason Basilone is lying. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105192, 'I did\'t imagine that [NAME] knew my colleagues.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105193, 'Ah??  I just heard about them. I have to go to {color,yellow,Basilone} at first. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105194, 'If you are going to Basilone, I would like to give him some {color,yellow,Dried Meat}. Can you bring them to him? I feel sorry for {color,yellow,Basilone} since I didn\'t give him anything in return.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I eat them instead?][2]'),
(105195, 'What do you want again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105196, 'I gave the skin to Jey and Jey wanted to give you something in return. He asked me to bring you this dried meat.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105197, 'It wasn\'t a big deal?? Please give my thanks to Jey.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105198, 'Please bring {color,yellow,Dried Meat} to {color,yellow,Basilone}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105200, 'Suspiciuos Basilone'),
(105201, 'Basilone asks to kill ValeBeak and ValeShella as he is supected. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105202, 'By the way, Jey\'s colleagues belongings were exactly the same as Basilone\'s colleauge\'s\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105203, 'What?? what do you mean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105204, 'I talked with Jey for a while. Jey\'s colleagues also had the same things. Isn\'t it strange?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105205, 'What?? what a coincidence.... Something might happen soon?? hah??ha..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105206, 'Are you sure?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105207, 'Do you mean that I am lying right now? If you are too bored, just go to kill {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} and {color,yellow,Vale Shella}. They are so annoying these days. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you at first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should tell me the truth first.][2]'),
(105208, 'Huh. You are still strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105209, 'If you are too bored, just go kill {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} and {color,yellow,Vale Shella}.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105210, 'Continues  Suspicion (Repeat)'),
(105211, 'Basilone asks to kill more Vale Beaks and Vale Shella\'s. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105212, 'So tell me what is going on.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105213, 'I really don\'t know what you are talking about. Even if I tell you, you won\'t believe me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105214, 'If you tell me the truth, I will believe it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105215, 'I have never lied to you. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105216, 'Can I believe you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105217, 'You see? You don\'t believe me whatever I say. Just go kill {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} and {color,yellow,Vale Shella\'s} to refresh yourself.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will help you at first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You should tell me the truth first.][2]'),
(105218, 'Huh. You are still strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105219, 'If you are bored still, just go kill {color,yellow,Vale Beaks} and {color,yellow,Vale Shella\'s}.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105220, 'Nicolas Left to the Camp'),
(105221, 'Jey asks to bring Mastodons\'s skin to Nicolas freezing in the cold. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105222, 'Finally I made a spear. Now I can go to the camp to save my colleage.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105223, 'Is her name Ni??cole?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105224, 'I only told you about her once but you sill remember her.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105225, 'Is there anything else I can help you with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105226, 'Nicolas feels the cold badly, [NAME], can you get a {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Skin} and go to the camp down there to {color,yellow,Nicolas}? I will follow you as soon as I get ready.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why don\'t you come with me?][2]'),
(105227, 'Hey! Did you come here to run away from Garuda? Or because of the coldness?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105228, 'Are you Nicolas?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105229, '[NAME],can you get a {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s Skin} first and go to the camp for {color,yellow,Nicolas}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105230, 'Vale Megantereon Coming Closer'),
(105231, 'Nicolas is worried that the Vale Megatereons are coming closer to the fire. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105232, 'Hello. Jey asked me to bring warm skin for you, Nicolas. It is quite warm and cozy with the fire.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105233, 'It got too cold here so I made a fire. But the {color,yellow,Vale Meganterons} are coming closer to the fire. I can\'t put the fire out though...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105234, 'Don\'t worry. I will make the {color,yellow,Vale Megantereons} go away. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105235, 'Really? For me the {color,yellow,Vale Megantereons} are much more scary than Garuda??. If you can do that, I will let you stay near the fire.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like the rewards.][2]'),
(105236, 'Wow! You are so strong. Did you come here to kill Garuda?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105237, 'No but I didn\'t come here to kill Vale Megantereons either. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105238, 'Hahahaha. You are kidding me. I haven\'t laughed in quite a long time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105239, 'For me the {color,yellow,Vale Megantereons} are much more scary than Garuda. Please make the {color,yellow,Vale Megantereons} go away.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105240, 'Vale Snowy Wolf Coming Closer'),
(105241, 'Nicolas is worried that Vale Snowy Wolf is coming closer to the fire. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105242, 'The monsters have lived here for a long time but why do they keep coming to the fire?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105243, 'What\'s wrong?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105244, 'As I made this fire, the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf} is coming closer to the fire. As I heard, animals normally run away from fire. However, they don\'t here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t like the rewards.][2]'),
(105245, 'The Vale Snowy Wolf will not come here for now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105246, 'For now? Then I have to escape here before the Vale Snowy Wolf comes again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105247, 'I am worried that the Vale Snowy Wolf is coming closer to the fire. \n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105250, 'Beads of Bijou'),
(105251, 'Nicolas said the reason that Garuda became a tyrant was related to the beads of Bijou. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105252, 'Jey is coming late. Why don\'t we escape alone?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105253, 'Escaping is just one thing. I have something important to do first. I am sure that Garuda became a tyrant because of the beads of Bijou.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105254, 'The {color,yellow,beads of Bijou}? What was that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105255, 'Don\'t you know the {color,yellow,beads of Bijou}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105256, 'Okay, I\'ll tell you so listen carefully. Did you know that {color,yellow,Legel} infused his {color,yellow,Own Power} into {color,yellow,Bijou} when he was caught by Pagel the God of Greed? Never mind. Just listen to what I say.  After that the {color,yellow,God of Greed} found out about {color,yellow,the Existence of  Bijou}, he tried to {color,yellow,Destory} him. But {color,yellow, Bijou wasn\'t destroyed} he shattered in pieces of beads containing his power and spead all around the continent. The Beads were really powerful. The Beads sometimes make monsters stronger or change the weather.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105257, 'That means Garuda ate a bead of the powerful Bijou.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105258, 'I am not sure about eating, but It could be something like that. I heard the Vale Ark Guards fought with Garuda.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105259, 'Do ghosts speak?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105260, 'A Person Who Knows the truth'),
(105261, 'Nicolas said some of the Dwarfs knew about the beads and Garuda. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105262, 'What did they say when the Vale Ark Guards fought Garuda?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105263, 'I couldn\'t hear well since I was too far away from them. But I heard them say cough up the beads. I think all of this happened because of the beads, the weather changed over the Canyon and the Vale Ark Guards became souls when they walk around the bridge.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105264, 'Do you mean everything will be as before if Garuda coughs out the piece of beads?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105265, 'I am not sure but there is someone who might know. Some of the {color,yellow,Dwarfs} will know about this since the {color,yellow,Vale Ark Guards} are involved.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Do you have any idea which one knows?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I have no idea how to do this since I cannot go to the Dwarf Village.][2]'),
(105266, 'Oh my! What do you want from me now?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105267, 'I have something to ask about the Vale Ark Guards and Garuda.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105268, 'What are you talking about? I don\'t know anything.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105269, 'Some of the {color,yellow,Dwarfs} will know about this, since, well, the{color,yellow,Vale Ark Guards} are involved.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105270, 'Diarrhea Pill?'),
(105271, 'Basilone suggests to make him eat Vale Shella\'s cursed horn and make him cough beads up. Let\'s talk with him about Diarrhea Medicine.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105272, 'Do you mean that everything happened because Garuda ate the piece of beads?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105273, 'Are you sure that you really don\'t know anything about that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105274, 'I told you several times. I cannot tell you anything as you don\'t believe me. However, I know one way to take the piece of beads out of Gaurda. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105275, 'How can I do that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105276, 'Why don\'t you make him get food poisoning? Though you cannot get rotten food, you can make Garuda get Diarrhea with {color,yellow,Cursed Horns}. It will be better than any other rotten food. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go to get the cursed horn.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think it works?][2]'),
(105277, 'I got the horn. Let\'s set a trap now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105278, 'Give me a second. We need some more for Garuda\'s huge body.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105279, 'You can make Garuda get diarrhea with {color,yellow,Cursed Horn}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105280, 'One is Not enough.'),
(105281, 'Basilone suggests we find Snowy Wolf\'s Fang. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105282, 'Is there anything else can we add to make him get horrible diarreha?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105283, 'Yes! We can add {color,yellow,Snowy Wolf\'s Fang\'s}. Snowy Wolf has a very bad breath. His Fang will be so disgusting. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105284, 'Are you asking me to bring that you disgusting thing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105285, 'Do you think it is okay that Garuda attacks everyone? You can wash away disgusting smells but you cannot go back to the ugly past.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What is that supposed to mean?][2]'),
(105286, 'I brought the fang. Can we start now? By the way that Snowy Wolf?had really?bad breath. It is not enough to wash this just once to get?rid of?the smell. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105287, 'Give that to me. Now I can melt this with cursed horn.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105288, 'Bring a {color,yellow,Snowy Wolf}\'s {color,yellow,Disgusting Fang}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105290, 'In need of Firewood.'),
(105291, 'Basilone needs firewood to boil the materials. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105292, 'Um.. I need more firewood, I don\'t have enough yet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105293, 'Is that all you need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105294, 'To make it I have to boil the material for a long time. I think I don\'t have enough {color,yellow,Firewood}. I need more {color,yellow,Firewood}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105295, 'I can bring more firewood for you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105296, 'So nice of you. You can get {color,yellow,Firewood} from the {color,yellow,Icewood} at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}. Please bring plenty. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Aren\'t they sterilized if you boil them?][2]'),
(105297, 'I brought the firewood.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105298, 'Wait. Didn\'t you understand me? I asked you to bring a lot..\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105299, 'Can you can get more {color,yellow,Firewood} from the {color,yellow,Icewood} at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}. Please bring plenty. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105300, 'In need More Firewood (Repeat)'),
(105301, 'Basilone said he needed more firewood. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105302, 'That\'s not enough. I need more firewood.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105303, 'How much do you need? It is hard to get {color,yellow,firewood} as there aren\'t many {color,yellow,Icewoods} around.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105304, 'I have to boil them for hours. Bring some more.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[So how much do you need exactly?][2]'),
(105305, 'I brought more firewood.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105306, 'Wait. Didn\'t you understand me? I asked you to bring A LOT.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105307, 'You can get {color,yellow,Firewood} from the {color,yellow,Icewood} at {color,yellow,Kahal Canyon}. Please bring me a lot. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105310, 'Vale Ark Guards and Basilone'),
(105311, 'Nicolas said something was going on between the Vale Ark Guards and Basilone. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105312, 'I heard that the Vale Ark Guards were betrayed by a colleague while they fought Garuda. Is there a Dwarf Village near here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105313, 'There might be Tumbloot but the way was closed because of Garuda.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105314, 'Really? How do you know that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105315, 'I heard that from a Dwarf called Basilone over the Canyon.\n[NEXT]'),
(105316, 'Hmm?? could Basilone be the one who betrayed the colleagues?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105317, 'I also have suspected Basilone. I talked with him but he kept saying he didn\'t know anything. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105318, 'I am not sure whether it is true or not. However, one of the Dwarfs betrayed the Vale Ark Guards for sure. I have no idea who though.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105320, 'Nicolas\'s Emergency Food'),
(105321, 'Nicolas asks to bring Vale Mastodons\'s meat, as her emergency food is running out. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105322, 'Have I stayed here too long? My emergengy food is running out. \n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105323, 'Shall I bring you some from Jey?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105324, 'His food must be running out as well. And I\'d rather roast meat than eat dried meat. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105325, 'It is more tasty. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105326, 'So [NAME], please bring me {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s meat}. I cannot move from here since I don\'t have any weapons and I have to keep the fire burning. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring some for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t if you eat alone.][2]'),
(105327, 'I only brought good ones. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105328, 'Wow! I cannot wait to eat them. I haven\'t have anything tasty to eat in a long time.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105329, 'Please bring me some {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons\'s meat}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105330, 'Jey is not coming'),
(105331, 'Nicolas wanted to tell me about everything that happened to Jey. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105332, 'I have to stay here little bit longer and look into the Vale Ark Guards.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105333, 'Should we let {color,yellow,Jey} know about thi?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105334, 'Ah! I almost forgot about him. However, why isn\'t he coming here?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105335, 'Well. {color,yellow,Jey} said he would follow me as soon as he got ready. Why isn\'t he here yet? \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go back to find him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[He will come.][2]'),
(105336, 'Are you still preparing?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105337, 'Ah! I was about to go there. Why did you come back? By the way, is Nicolas still alive?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105338, 'Tell {color,yellow,Jey} about Garuda and the beads.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105340, 'Report to Jey'),
(105341, 'Nicolas asked you to find Jey. Tell Jey everything that happened.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105342, 'I would\'ve arrived there in a minute. Did something happen?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105343, 'Garuda might have become this scary because of the beads of Bijou. Nicolas is looking into that. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105344, 'Beads of Bijou? Hmm?? Now I can understand why the weather is different over the Canyon and why the kind Garuda became like that. But, do you think he ate a piece of beads on purpose, knowing what it would do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105345, 'Nicolas told me the Vale Ark Guards said there was someone who betrayed them. They could have made him eat it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105346, 'Didn\'t Basilone betrayed them?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105347, 'I thought so too but he keeps saying he didn\'t. I\'m having a hard time believing him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105348, 'The Dwarf\'s Village is closed and one Dwarf left alone?? That is very suspicious.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105350, 'Jey\'s Research'),
(105351, 'Jey asks to kill Vale Snowy Wolves, Vale Snowy Puggys, and Vale Mastodons to look into Garuda and  the Vale Ark Guard. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105352, 'The problem about the piece of beads needs looking into, so I will also need to look into the Vale Ark Guards and Garuda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105353, 'How about working together? Then I will go with you and investigate the ValeArkGuard and Garuda.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105354, 'Sure. But can you kill the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf\'s}, {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s}, and {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} around me rather than coming with me? They are annoying me. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is boring.][2]'),
(105355, 'I killed them. Did you find something out?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105356, 'Nothing yet. There are still a lot of monsters around here. I found out almost nothing. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105357, 'Please Kill the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}\'s, {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy}\'s, and {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} around me rather than coming with me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105360, 'Clear surroundings (Repeat)'),
(105361, 'Jey asks to kill the Vale Snowy Wolf\'s, Vale Snowy Puggy\'s, and Vale Mastodons to look into Garuda and ValeArkGuard. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105362, 'My research gets delayed because of the monsters around here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105363, 'Leave them to me and keep working on your research.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105364, 'Then please kill the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}\'s, {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy}\'s, and {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} around me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright. Don\'t worry about that][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am hungry. Do you have something to eat?][2]'),
(105365, 'I came back. Have you found out anything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105366, 'Not yet. There are still a lot of monsters around here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105367, 'Please Kill the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}\'s, {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy}\'s, and {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} around me rather than coming with me? \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105370, 'Keepsake for Kahal Canyon'),
(105371, 'Jey wants to get the Vale Snowy Wolf\'s necklace as keepsake for visiting Kahal Canyon. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105372, 'Can you find a Vale Snowy Wolf\'s necklace?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105373, 'A {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf\'s necklace}? Do you need that for your research?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105374, 'Not exactly. I just wanted to have something to remember Kahal Canyon for a long time. I know that it is not the right time for this but I don\'t think I will have time to get one later. I am sorry but can you find a {color,yellow,Necklace} from the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will find one for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I cannot believe that you asked me to do that right now.][2]'),
(105375, 'I brought the Wolf\'s necklace. And keep in mind that it was the last time I did you a personal favour. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105376, 'Thank you and I am sorry.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105377, 'I am sorry but can you find a {color,yellow,Necklace} from the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105380, 'Favor from Bera Village'),
(105381, 'Jey promised a little child in Bera Village that he would bring a Vale Snowy Puggy\'s smelly fur. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105382, 'Someone from Bera Village asked me to do something. Could you do that for me instead?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105383, 'From Bera Village? What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105384, 'A little child asked me to bring a {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy\'s smelly fur} and I promised to do it. I was about to ignore him but he blackmailed me with weird drinks??I couldn\'t ignore him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105385, '(I think I have an idea who he was as I heard the story.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105386, 'So can you find a {color,yellow,Smelly Fur} from {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy}\'s instead of me? I really don\'t want to drink those weird drinks.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It will be healthy one.][2]'),
(105387, 'I brought what you asked. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105388, 'Thank you so much. I was worried to drink those weird drinks. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105389, 'Please bring a{color,yellow,Smelly Fur} from {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Puggy}\'s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105390, 'Something needed for Hunter Union'),
(105391, 'Jey wants to give Vale Mastodons\'s Fur to the members. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105392, 'Some members are in really cold places like me under orders. I want to give them Mastodons\'s Fur.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105393, 'Seeing your clothes I could imagine.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105394, 'Haha. We have another uniform though. Unfortuantely I came here wearing these clothes.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105395, 'You also need warm clothes so I will bring enough {color,yellow,Warm Fur} from the {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} first.\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait for a minute, I\'ll be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Before that, how about making a fire here?][2]'),
(105396, 'I brought the fur but we need to wash them first. It\'s really smelly. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105397, 'Those are enough to survive. And it should be smelly to make monsters think that I\'m a Vale Mastodons.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105398, 'Please bring a{color,yellow,Warm Fur} from {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105400, 'Trap to Give Diarrhea Pill'),
(105401, 'Basilone decides to put the pill into Vale Spike\'s meat as a trap. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105402, 'It\'s almost done so we should find something that Garuda would like to eat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105403, 'What does Garuda like to eat the most?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105404, 'If you walk down there, there will be some {color,yellow,Vale Spike}\'s. Garuda loves their {color,yellow,Meat}. So let\'s get that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you think it works?][2]'),
(105405, 'I wasn\'t not sure how much we needed so I brought as much as I could get. Will this be enough?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105406, 'Don\'t worry we can eat whats left. The meat is really tasty.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105407, 'Bring some {color,yellow,Vale Spike}\'s {color,yellow,Meat}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105410, 'Greedy ValeBeak'),
(105411, 'Basilone is worried that the Vale Beaks would eat the meat. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105412, 'I want to place the meat in Garuda\'s shelter. Do you have better idea?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105413, 'I don\'t know as much as you about this land. I just came here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105414, 'That will be good because that\'s the most familiar place for Garuda. But the problem is the {color,yellow,Vale Beak}s. They shouldn\'t eat the meat before Garuda gets there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105415, 'I can kill all the{color,yellow,Vale Beak}s around the shelter. So don\'t worry about that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[By the way have you make the pill already?][2]'),
(105416, 'I killed all ValeBeaks so nothing to worry about anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105417, 'You\'re done so fast. I couldn??t even finish making the pill yet.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105418, 'Please prevent the {color,yellow,Vale Beak}s from eating the meat.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105420, 'Collecting Company'),
(105421, 'Basilone needs company to fight against Garuda after making Garuda eat the pill. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105422, 'Do you know someone who can join us?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105423, 'There are some members the other side of the Canyon. We can ask them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105424, 'I need someone helpful....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105425, 'I met them on my way here. They will be really helpful. I will meet with {color,yellow,Jey} first. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you sure about the pill?][2]'),
(105426, 'Hello, Jey.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105427, 'I was about to ask you something. Good to see you again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105428, 'Can we trust {color,yellow,Jey}? I need someone strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105430, 'Cooporation for Jey'),
(105431, 'Jey needs Basilone to kill Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105432, 'I\'ve looked into Garuda and the Vale Ark Guards. We won\'t be able to kill them on our own. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105433, 'Don\'t worry about that. Basilone is making a plan to take the piece of beads out of Garuda\'s body. I came here to ask for your help, Jey.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105434, 'Oh, good to hear that. I was thinking about asking you for help to Basilone, [NAME]. By the way did you tell this story to {color,yellow,Nicolas}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105435, 'No. I came here first since you\'re the leader, Jey. Now I will let {color,yellow,Nicolas} know.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[By the way should I go there?][2]'),
(105436, '[NAME]. Long time no see.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105437, 'Hello. I have something to tell you, Nicolas.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105438, 'Have you told this to {color,yellow,Nicolas}?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105440, 'Cooperation from Nicolas'),
(105441, 'Nicolas doesn\'t trust Basilone but she thinks Garuda is the biggest problem at the moment. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105442, 'What do you want to tell me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105443, 'Basilone is making a plan to take the piece of beads out of Garuda\'s body with the diarrhea pill. At first, Jey will join us to fight against Garuda. I came to ask for your help.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105444, 'I don\'t trust Basilone but there is no reason to join since the leader is joining in. So what should we do?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105445, 'Okay, you two help us. I will go back to {color,yellow,Basilone} and ask about the plan. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105446, 'Sorry? Did you come here to ask for our help without any plan?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Please wait a second. I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You don\'t need to join us then.][2]'),
(105447, 'That is a big problem. Why aren\'t the piece of beads coming out of Garuda\'s body?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105448, 'The piece of beads? What do you mean?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105449, 'Go to {color,yellow,Basilone} and ask what we need to do.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105450, 'Nice Horn'),
(105451, 'Nicolas wants to hang a Vale Spike\'s Horn at the Union office. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105452, 'It will be great if our Union office is decorated with a nice horn. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105453, 'Something like a{color,yellow,Vale Spike\'s Horn}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105454, 'You have good eyes for decoration. I was thinking about a {color,yellow,Vale Spike\'s Horn} as well. You know the horn so will you bring me one?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105455, 'What do you want me to bring? A {color,yellow,Vale Spike\'s Horn}? Are you sure?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105456, 'Sure. I also want you to hang the horn in the office. Hurry up.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright. Just wait for a second][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you believe it is possible?][2]'),
(105457, 'I brought the biggest and greatest one. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105458, 'Wow! Yes, it should look great like this. I always hoped there would be a really nice one in the office. Now people will come to the office just to see the horn. Hahahaha.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105459, 'Please bring a {color,yellow,Vale Spike\'s Horn} to decorate the Union office.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105460, 'Suspected Basilone'),
(105461, 'Basilone seems to hide something. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105462, 'You didn\'t do anything alone, did you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105463, 'What?? what are you talking about? I was the one who asked you to gather people. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105464, 'Okay. But why are you stammering?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105465, 'I.. I just got angry that you didn\'t believe me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105466, 'I am sorry. I didn\'t want to doubt you.?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105467, 'Anyway, everything is working well with the pill. By the way, how about gathering people? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105468, 'Ah! Jey and Nicolas will join us. Now you should tell me more details about the plan. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105470, 'Vale Shella likes the camp'),
(105471, 'Basilone says the Vale Shella\'s keep coming down to the camp. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105472, 'I am sure that the Vale Shella\'s know this was once their home.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105473, 'Are {color,yellow,Vale Shella}\'s coming down to the camp again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105474, 'They didn\'t come for a while after you killed {color,yellow,Vale Shella}\'s and I almost forgot about them. However they are coming here again. I should scare them off again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105475, 'Should I go this time again? It\'s a meaningless question though. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Wait for a minute.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t you pity the Vale Shella#s?][2]'),
(105476, 'I scared them so they won\'t come anymore. If you are worried, how about moving the camp?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105477, 'Out of the question! Here is the best place to watch Garuda. I cannot leave here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105478, 'Anyway you did good job.. Hmm??Hmm...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105479, 'Go and scare the {color,yellow,Vale Shella}\'s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105480, 'Vale Ape threatening the camp'),
(105481, 'Basilone is worried that Vale Apes may threaten the camp. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105482, 'The Vale Apes are trying to take the camp because of the Vale Shella\'s.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105483, 'Basilone\'s camp is so well known to many monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105484, 'No kidding. It\'s really annoying to me. Especially, the {color,yellow,Vale Ape}\'s sometimes throw rocks and hit their chest trying to scare me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105485, 'This is quite serious, Basilone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am not sure whether I can help you.][2]'),
(105486, 'Did you kill the Vale Apes?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105487, 'They won\'t come back for awhile. I scared them off.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105488, 'Good to hear that. Well done. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105489, 'The {color,yellow,Vale Ape} sometimes throw something like rocks and pound their chest scaring me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105490, 'Basilone\'s Plan'),
(105491, 'Basilone suggests to gather together in an hour to go fight Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105492, 'I am ready so let\'s have everyone meet at Garuda\'s shelter in an hour. Because of the route, Garuda should be there in an hour.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105493, 'I should hurry. I don\'t have much  time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105494, 'Everyone joining us should be standing ready. You just need to tell them the time. In an hour from now. You won\'t tell everyone in an hour, will you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105495, 'I won\'t do that kind of stupid thing?? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105496, 'Ah! On your way, please kill {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons}. If Garada fights with {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons}, he won\'t come to his shelter. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105497, 'Go kill {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} I should go to {color,yellow,Jey} first.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will go right now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Isn??t it easier to go to Nicolas first?][2]'),
(105498, 'Oh! [NAME]. Now do we work on the plan?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105499, 'Kill {color,yellow,Vale Mastodons} and tell {color,yellow,Jey} about the plan.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105500, 'Delivering the plan 1'),
(105501, 'Jey is curious about Basilone\'s plan. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105502, 'So when will we start the plan?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105503, 'Um?? It is...?? in 40 minutes we will fight with Garuda on the top part of the canyon. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105504, 'That\'s enough time to sharpen my weapon. Have you told the plan to Nicolas?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105505, 'No. I am going to Nicolas now. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105506, 'Then can you go to {color,yellow,Nicolas} after killing the {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}\'s? I don\'t want to be late because of those Vale Snowy Wolves.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just come earlier.][2]'),
(105507, 'You came here to tell me the plan. What are we going to do?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105508, 'Can you go to {color,yellow,Nicolas} after killing {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}\'s?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105510, 'Delivering the Plan 2'),
(105511, 'Nicolas is curious about the plan. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105512, 'So. What\'s the plan?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105513, 'Oh, time flies. There is Garuda\'s shelter on the top part of the Canyon. We will meet there in 20 minutes. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105514, 'That is too early. Why did you tell me so late? Anyway you will come, won\'t you, [NAME]?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105515, 'Sure. I will be there early and wait for the others.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105516, 'Hmm?? Something is annoying to me. Will you spend some time with the {color,yellow,Vale Spike}\'s around there, [NAME]? Don\'t go to the Shelter right away. I\'ll tell you the details later with the others. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright??.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[What is going on?][2]'),
(105517, 'What happened? Why didn\'t you come?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105518, 'No surprise, everything happened as expected. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105519, '[NAME], don\'t go to the shelter yet, just spend some time with {color,yellow,ValeSpike} around there.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105520, 'Button is off'),
(105521, 'Nicolas wants to repair the button with Vale Megantereon\'s Fang. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105522, 'I am looking for something for a button. Which one might be good?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105523, 'A button? How about a {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon}\'s {color,yellow,Fang}? It will be so cool, Hahaha.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105524, 'A {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon\'s Fang}?? Just bring it first.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105525, 'Sorry? Why should I do that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105526, 'I was going to put something else on instead, but you told me to put a {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon\'s Fang} on it. So you should bring that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You convinced me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Then find another one on your own.][2]'),
(105527, 'Here, I brought some. Choose which one you want. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105528, 'I would like to, but I found the button which was off. How about putting on you? It will be cool.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105529, 'Bring me a {color,yellow,Vale Megantereons Fang}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105530, 'Ineffective Cooperation'),
(105531, 'Nicolas is not showing up for some reason. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105532, 'What you do mean you expected everything. There was no one at the meeting point.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105533, 'I was sure that Dwarf Basilone wouldn\'t come here. But I was surpised that leader {color,yellow,Jey} didn\'t show either. Are you saying that I broke the promise and didn\'t go there? Of course I was there and watched everything.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105534, 'Anyway you didn\'t go there. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105535, 'I told you several times, I don\'t trust Dwarf Basilone. I should just save myself.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105536, 'No matter what, I cannot forgive you this time. I\'m sure I\'ll say something to {color,yellow,Jey}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[So, bye.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why didn\'t you come?][2]'),
(105537, '[NAME]! I was waiting for you. Why didn\'t you come to the meeting point?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105538, 'I was surprised that leader {color,yellow,Jey} didn\'t come either. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105540, 'The same excuse'),
(105541, 'Jey is saying the same thing as Nicolas. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105542, 'Why didn\'t you go there, Jey?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105543, 'What are you talking about? I waited for everyone on the bridge but no one showed up. So I left there and came back here. And from now on I will never believe a word from {color,yellow,Basilone}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105544, 'You are saying the same as Nicolas. In the end, no one showed up. But why you are complaining only about {color,yellow,Basilone}?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105545, 'No?? That is not true. I didn\'t go to the meeting point. But I was around there and waited for others. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105546, 'I am sick of the same exuse. You all are complaining about {color,yellow,Basilone}. Okay, then I will bring {color,yellow,Basilone} here.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I gotta go now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why didn\'t you come there?][2]'),
(105547, 'I have to leave here before [NAME] is coming.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105548, 'Basilone, what are you doing here?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105549, 'I never believed {color,yellow,Basilone}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105550, 'Basilone\'s truth 1'),
(105551, 'Basilone seems like he gave up everything. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105552, 'Are you running away now?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105553, '??...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105554, 'Tell me something. Everyone believed your plan and joined us. Why are you running away?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105555, 'I should have told you the truth?? But please understand me. Pagel??.. What if he weren\'t????....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105556, 'I heard a very familiar name from you again. So do you mean that Pagel is envolved in everything?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105557, 'Do you remenber when I said you should never go back to the past? I know everything will look like an excuse with whatever I say. But give me another chance to tell you the reason I had to do that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105558, 'Okay. Tell me everything. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105560, 'Basilone\'s truth 2'),
(105561, 'Basilone is talking as?if he is giving up. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105562, 'After Nature was gone, we assembled a team, a team made out of five Dwarve. We took care of Garuda who was left alone.Back then, Garuda and?I were the best of?friends. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105563, 'We switched team every week. However???one night when my colleagues and I?arrived here, Pagel showed up in front of me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105564, 'Pagel blackmailed you, Basilone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105565, 'Pagel gave me?a?strand?of beads and forced me to give it to Garuda. He threatened me, saying that they would burn down Tumbloot Village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105566, 'I was going tothrow away the?strand of beads and fight with Pagel. But he found out my plan and laughed at me. I couldn??t do anything but follow his order. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105567, 'That is why you didn\'t tell me about the Leather Pocket. But you could have told me the truth and we could have fought him together. Why did you try to run away?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105568, 'I?hoped to fight all together in the end. But there was no one showing up. How could I fight alone? I was just going back to the village, to tell them the truth and we planned to run away.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105569, 'Everyone had the same reason....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105570, 'The Henneath Alliance power is needed.'),
(105571, 'Basilone wants to use the Henneath Alliance to?kill Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105572, 'I was thinking about a possible way to kill Garuda but I\'m drawing a blank. Do you have any ideas?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105573, 'Nothing is impossible?for the Henneath Alliance. How about asking their help?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105574, 'Henneath Alliance?? Can you kill {color,yellow,Garuda} with the Henneath Alliance? I can pay you with jewels. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105575, 'The Henneath Alliance will help me to keep the?peace in Tumbloot and Kahal Canyon,?but they have no need for jewelry. Just wait for their help. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will come back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can I believe you about the jewelry?][2]'),
(105576, 'I saw you and your colleagues killed Garuda. Thank you.. Thank you very much.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105577, 'We killed Garuda but we cannot move on. Garuda didn\'t cough up the beads.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105578, 'That?? that means Gurada could revive?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105579, 'It could happen. But don\'t worry. The Henneath Alliance will take the beads out of Garuda\'s body.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105580, 'Please kill {color,yellow,Garuda} with the Henneath Alliance.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105590, 'Basilone\'s decision'),
(105591, 'Basilone asks you to tell Nicolas and Jey to leave here. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105592, 'Garuda will revive since he didn\'t cough up the beads. But all the people caught in Kahal Canyon?should leave now. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105593, 'Aren\'t you coming with us, Basilone?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105594, 'I\'ll help the Henneath Alliance since everything happened because of me. I can\'t fight but I can strenghten their jewelry to help them fight.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105595, 'I will go and tell?{color,yellow,Nicolas} and then I\'ll be back. I\'ll help you until Garuda coughs up the beads, Basilone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you have ?][2]'),
(105596, '[NAME] killed Garuda, right? I could see that you did, even from here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105597, 'Thanks to the help from the Henneath Alliance. I couldn\'t have done it alone.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105598, '[NAME], you are a part of Henneath Alliance. You are the hero who killed that scary Garuda. So don\'t be shy and bask in the compliments. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105599, 'Tell {color,yellow,Nicolas} that {color,yellow,Garuda} was killed.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105600, 'Stolen Rice Ball 2'),
(105601, 'Basilone says that Vale Ape\'s stole his rice ball. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105602, 'Oh no! My rice ball was stolen again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105603, 'Did the Vale Shella steal it again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105604, 'This time the {color,yellow,Vale Ape} stole it, not Vale Shella. They probably saw Vale Shella steal my {color,yellow,Rice Ball}. I will starve to death if they keep stealing my rice balls. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105605, 'I will get it back. Don\'t worry. \n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Will you throw away rice ball this time again?][2]'),
(105606, 'I got it back. It\'s smelly though\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105607, 'Sniffing. It really is smelly.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105608, '(Throws the Rice Ball on the ground)\n\nI\'d rather starve. I cannot eat this.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105609, 'Bring me my {color,yellow,Rice Ball} back from {color,yellow,Vale Ape}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105610, 'Trap for Garuda'),
(105611, 'Basilone needs Vale Spike\'s meat as a trap for Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105612, 'Garuda loves Vale Spike\'s meat. It will be a good trap.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105613, 'Will you make the pill again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105614, 'I am telling you the truth now. I actually failed that plan. The beads detoxinated the pill in Garuda\'s body. However, we can use {color,yellow,ValeSpike\'s meat} to attract him or lure him out.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105615, 'We can use it in many ways.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will bring the meat.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Can we just fight without the meat?][2]'),
(105616, 'You brought too much. They could spoil while saving them.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105617, 'Is there a refrigerator in the camp???  How can you keep cool water and some ingredients?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105618, 'I drink boiled water. I suffered for a long time since I boiled water in the pot used to make the pill. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105619, 'Please bring {color,yellow,Vale Spike\'s meat} to attract Garuda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105620, 'Nicolas\'s decision'),
(105621, 'Nicolas has made a decision after hearing about Basilone. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105622, 'By the way, what is it going on with Dwarf Basilone?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105623, '{color,yellow,([NAME]} told Basilone was blackmailed by the Pagel and everything that happened until now.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105624, 'Now I got everything. Basilone was a victim too. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105625, 'I killed Garuda but Garuda could revive again. Go back to the Union with Jey.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105626, 'Hmm???? I could understand Bailone. However, I can\'t forgive him for betraying his colleagues. I will bring Basilone to Hunter Union and teach him what comradeship is. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105627, 'What would you do if Garuda revives while doing that?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105628, '[NAME], you will kill Garuda again. I am not worried at all. Anyway I will convince him and bring him to the Union. [NAME], tell this to leader {color,yellow,Jey} instead of me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why should I do that?][2]'),
(105629, 'Ah! [NAME]. It was so impressing. You are very strong.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105630, 'I will convince Basilone to join the Union. Please tell this to leader {color,yellow,Jey} instead of me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105640, 'Vale Megantereon\'s threat'),
(105641, 'Nicolas says Vale Megantereon is more threatening than Garuda. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105642, 'Since youre here, do me a favor?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105643, 'What is it?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105644, 'Garuda was killed but for me {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon} is more scary than Garuda. So can you kill {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon} for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105645, 'Alright. That is not a big deal. I killed Garuda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just go back to the Union.][2]'),
(105646, 'I killed the Vale Megantereon so don\'t worry anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105647, 'Phew! By the way is it true that Vale Megantereon could revive as Garuda?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105648, 'No way. I have never heard of Vale Megantereon eating the piece of beads.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105649, '{color,yellow,Vale Megantereon} is more scary for me than Garuda. So can you kill {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon} for me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105650, 'Jey\'s decision'),
(105651, 'Jey heard from Nicolas. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105652, 'Didn\'t Nicolas come with you? We have to go back to the Union since Garuda was killed...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105653, '{color,yellow,([NAME]} told Jey that Basilone was blackmailed by Pagel and Nicolas wanted Basilone to join the Union.)\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105654, 'Okay. Nicolas couldn\'t leave Bailone alone since he couldn\'t go back to the Village.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105655, 'Ah! All this happended because of Pagel\'s blackmail, but still, it is still a result from him. That is why the Village people don\'t want him to come back and Basilone wanted to stay here. How could I have not realized this sooner?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105656, 'Are you looking for a good blacksmith to repair the weapons? You should scout him.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105657, 'Aren\'t you going back to the Union?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105658, 'I can\'t go back and leave my team alone. I will wait for Nicolas and our new man Basilone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105660, 'Vale Snowy Wolf\'s threat'),
(105661, 'Jey says Vale Snowy Wolf is more threatening than Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105662, 'By the way, we have to kill Vale Snowy Wolf to wait for Nicolas and Basilone.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105663, 'Now the others became annoying after Garuda was killed.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105664, 'We need a lot of time to scout Basilone. We better kill some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf} instead of just waiting.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105665, 'Alright. That is no a big deal. I even killed Garuda.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will be back soon.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just go back to the Union.][2]'),
(105666, 'I killed Vale Snowy Wolf. We need to kill other monsters, don\'t we?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105667, 'I can do that alone. Don\'t worry. I am the leader of the Hunter Union.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105668, 'We have to kill some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf} first.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105670, 'Vale Megantereon\'s theat (Repeat)'),
(105671, 'Nicolas says Vale Megantereon is more threatening than Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105672, 'No one knows what will happen. So kill more Vale Megantereon please. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105673, 'You better go back to the Union. I will talk with Basilone about joining the Union.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105674, 'What do you mean? To make him join, I need to explain a lot of our benefits and our vision. How can you do that? Even you are not in our Union. So go to kill {color,yellow,Vale Megantereon} while I convince Basilone. I am asking you...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I cannot do anymore. I am tired.][2]'),
(105675, 'I killed Vale Megantereon. Don\'t worry anymore.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105676, 'However, Vale Megantereons keep coming here. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(105677, 'I have never heard that Vale Megantereon ate a piece of beads.....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105678, 'No one knows what will happen. So kill more Vale Megantereon please. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105680, 'Vale Snowy Wolf\'s threat (Repeat)'),
(105681, 'Jey says Vale Snowy Wolf is more threatening than Garuda. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105682, 'I have to go kill another monster. So [Name], please go to kill some Vale Snowy Wolf.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105683, 'I am busy too...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105684, 'But we cannot let monsters run aroung Kahal Canyon. Of course I should save myself too. So [NAME], please help me to kill {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}. I will treat you well when I go back to the Union.\n\n[BUTTON]=[You promised me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just go back to the Union.][2]'),
(105685, 'I thought I could come back earlier. I was so tired after fighting with Garuda. By the way, are you okay, Jey?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105686, 'Don\'t worry about me. I am the leader of the Union. I think we have to kill more monsters in the Canyon. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Complete the Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105687, '[NAME], please kill some {color,yellow,Vale Snowy Wolf}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105690, 'The Crisis Restarts'),
(105691, 'Town Chief Guiltian said Eglack and Salare occupied Burning Adelia with a stronger army, while all village people are exploring Kahal mountain.  He asks to get rid of Occupation Force Spearman and Occupation Force Ranger in Seized Adelia while he takes care of village people, convince them, and raise an army to attack Seized Adelia. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105692, 'Eglack and Salare has brought much stronger army and invaded the Burning Adelia again.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105693, 'What are you talking about? Didn\'t Eglack escape from Burning Adelia?\n\n[EMOTION][13]\n[NEXT]'),
(105694, 'I heard that as well. However, according to Marlene\'s report he led a stronger army and captured Burning Adelia. I\'m here taking care of the villagers that escape. I will attack Seized Adelia and get it back with the villagers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105695, 'Is there anything I can help you with?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105696, 'I just got report from Marlene, so I couldn\'t tell the village people about Seized Adelia. I was hoping you could get rid of {color,yellow, Occupied Force Spearman {color,yellow, Occupied Force Ranger} and find the way out while I convince the village people....\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright. Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Aw, you don\'t really believe that, do you?][2]'),
(105697, 'How was it? Are they stronger?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105698, 'I don\'t know how they trained the army. They were stronger than expected. But I could handle everything you asked me to do.\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105699, 'Please go and get rid of {color,yellow, Occupation Force Spearman} and {color,yellow, Occupation Ranger} at {color,yellow, Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105700, 'People Need Convincing'),
(105701, 'Town Chief Guiltian said people were unreceptive not like he thought. He asks to get rid of Occupation Force Knucklemen and Occupation Force Rangers while he convinces the village people. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105702, 'More than that, people are quite unreceptive. I need more time to convince them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105703, 'I expected that to some extent. It\'s not enough to forget fear from Eglack. The time has passed though.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105704, 'Yes?? It could be. However, it\'s a shame we believe Henneath Alliance to do nothing again. Therefore, please help me get some more time to convince the village people.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105705, 'Should I attack Seized Adelia in the meantime?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105706, 'It will be eaiser to convince them if there are less monster left. Please get rid of  {color,yellow,Occupation Force Knucklemen} and {color,yellow,Occupation Force Rangers}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright. Leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I am sorry. Can I do this later?][2]'),
(105707, 'I defeated them. How is convincing people going?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105708, 'I would like to thank you for bringing good news. But I have to say sorry first. They are hard to convince.\nI\'m so sorry and thank you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105709, 'Please get rid of {color,yellow, Occupation Force Knucklemen} and {color,yellow,Occupation Force Rangers} at  {color,yellow,Seized Adelia} while I convince the village people.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105710, 'Leave it to You'),
(105711, 'Town Chief Guiltian failed to convince the village people. He wants to get rid of Eglack. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105712, 'You failed to convince them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105713, 'I\'m sorry. I really wanted to save our village on our own, but I am asking your help again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105714, 'Don\'t worry. It happened because I clearly couldn\'t handle it. I can do it this time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105715, 'I was about to ask you. The reason that I couldn\'t convince them is due to Eglack\'s existance.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105716, 'Alright. This time I will handle {color,yellow,Eglack} once again, at {color,yellow, Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Then I am going now.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Before that I need to go shopping.][2]'),
(105717, 'You came back. I was so worried about you while you were in Seized Adelia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105718, 'Don\'t worry anymore. Eglack will never attack Adelia again.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105719, 'Thank you. Thank you so much.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105720, 'Please get rid of {color,yellow,Eglack} in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia} and let me be off with them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105730, 'Return the Treasure'),
(105731, 'Bunis is so curious about Seized Adelia. He is paying attention to Senior Lich\'s Cape. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105732, 'Hey~[NAME]. You heard about the news, didn\'t you?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105733, 'The news that Eglack came back to Seized Adealia with a stronger army?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105734, 'Yes!! I was too late. There must be a stronger {color,yellow,Senior Lich} than Dark Lich in Seized Adealia if he came with stronger monsters.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105735, 'Yes, there must be.\n[NEXT]'),
(105736, 'How could you say it like that. If {color,yellow,Senior Lich} exists. then that means there is a stronger Senior Lich\'s Cape. Actually I didn\'t believe the news, maybe the {color,yellow,Cape blocking evil magic} was the {color,yellow,Senior Lich\'s Cape} from the rumor, not Dark Lich\'s Cape. So please bring me {color,yellow,Senior Lich\'s Cape}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Will you  reward me as always?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you still believe this after you were wrong that time?][2]'),
(105737, 'So, did you bring Senior Lich\'s Cape? I was looking forward to your return from Seized Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105738, 'I brought it, but it doesn\'t really look like a magical cape.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105739, 'We will know once I test it. Okay???Let\'s go..\n(Brunis is going closer to the fire, wearing Senior Lich\'s Cape.)\n\nEh? Can this Cape really block evil magic? Well??Aaahh!! It is too hot! This one is also not the right one. I was foolish to believe those rumors until now.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105740, '(Why does Brunis keep testing with fire if it blocks evil magic?}\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105741, 'Please bring me {color,yellow,Senior Lich\'s Cape} in {color,yellow,Seized Adealia}. And be careful, it\'s a very important item.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105750, 'The Item he really wants to have'),
(105751, 'Brunis really wants to get Salare\'s Sickle somehow in Seized Adealia. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105752, 'I\'m certain that there\'s no weapon stronger than Salare`s Sickle. I cannot miss that treasure as a treasure hunter!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105753, 'Do you want to help me with collecting treasures again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105754, 'This is very precious. How could I miss it. Please bring me {color,yellow,Salare\'s Sickle} from {color,yellow,Seized Adealia}. I will prepare rewards for you like always.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105755, 'You must always have everything your way, Brunis.\n\n[BUTTON]=[I will do it for you.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Do you believe me now after you were wrong with the Lich?][2]'),
(105756, 'Did you bring my sickle? I was looking forward to your return with the sickle from Seized Adealia.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105757, 'I brought it. But it wasn\'t worth the trouble..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105758, 'Don\'t judge this treasure if you don\'t know much about it. That\'s insulting. \nYou don\'t know anything...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105759, 'Please bring me {color,yellow,Salare`s Sickle} from {color,yellow,Salare} in {color,yellow,Seized Adealia}. I can\'t wait to have it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105760, 'The reason they are stronger'),
(105761, 'Edvina said monsters in Seized Adelia became stronger due to an Evil Badge gives evil power. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105762, 'Oh my! I have to destroy the Evil Badge as soon as possible...\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105763, 'Edwina. What are you talking to yourself? Are you researching something again?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105764, 'Ah! [NAME]. Do you know that Eglack led a stronger army and attacked Seized Adelia? I think the monster became stronger due to his Evil Badges. This is consistent will my research so far..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105765, 'Evil Badge? Are Evil Badges the item that makes fear and pain forgotten and lighter?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105766, 'As I researched, Evil Badge has the effect of strengthening the evil power. It seems that Evil Badge that we couldn\'t collect last time made mosters stronger. As time goes on, much stronger monster will be there in Seized Adelia. Therefore, we mustcollect all of the {color ,yellow,Evil Badges} from monsters in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}\n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, I will do that.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too hard to do for me.][2]'),
(105767, 'Did you collect all of theEvil Badges?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105768, 'First I brought as much as I could do. I couldn\'t bring everything at once because there were too many monsters.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105769, 'Please collect {color,yellow,Evil Badge} before much stronger monster coming in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105770, 'The reason they are stronger (repeat)'),
(105771, 'Edvina said monsters in Seized Adelia became stronger due to the Evil Badge that gave them evil powers. Let\'s talk with him.\n\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105772, 'We have to collect all Evil Badges before monster get much stronger.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105773, 'Okay, I\'m still on it!\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105774, 'I am sorry. I pushed you because it is really important. Please understand me. It is as important that I push you to collect {color,yellow,Evil Badge} from monsters in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright, I will get more.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[It is too hard to do for me.][2]'),
(105775, 'Did you collect all of the Evil Badges?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105776, 'I brought as much as I could do. I couldn\'t bring everything at once because there were too many monsters\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105777, 'Please collect {color,yellow,Evil Badge} before much stronger monsters come in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105780, 'Purpose of Eglack'),
(105781, 'Marlene is worried because Loussier hasn\'t come back. According to her, Eglack tried to make Abelita\'s tree rotten, with the power of the Stone of Darkness  and destroyed the village along with the tree. Let\'s talk with her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105782, 'Loussier was supposed to come back after evacuating people. Why isn\'t she here yet?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105783, 'Maybe Loussier got caught in Seized Adelia?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105784, 'I have no idea about that. Loussier went to Adealia to evacuate the villagers as soon as she found out Eglack would try to destroy the Adealia tree with the power of the {color,yellow,Stone of Darkness}. But she hasn\'t returned yet.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105785, 'How does power from the Stone of Darkness destroy the tree?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105786, 'I also heard that from Loussier.  Eglack might contaminate Adealia tree with dark power from the {color,yellow,Stone of Darkness} and that might make the tree rotten. Loussier couldn\'t escape from Seized Adealia to prevent Eglack from doing that.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105787, 'So before tree rots completely, the {color,yellow,Stone of Darkness} should be destroyed, right? Ah! Of course we need to save Loussier.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105788, 'That\'s true?? I will look for Loussier. [NAME], please destroy all  {color,yellow,Stones of Darkness} in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Alright, leave it to me.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Is there any environment organization nearby?][2]'),
(105789, 'Are you sure that you destroyed the Stone of Darkness completely?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105790, 'I destroyed everything. But, will the rotting tree be able to regenerate back to normal?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105791, 'Don\'t worry about that. Adealia tree will return to normal as water from the spring of recovery is showered on to the tree. Originally, the spring is used for that.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105792, 'Please destroy all {color,yellow,Stones of Darkness} in {color,yellow,Seized Adelia}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105800, 'Town Chief Guiltian, who is looking for Adventurers in hurry.'),
(105801, 'Town Chief Balier has heard rumor from adventurers who is visiting Bera that Town Chief Guiltian is looking for Adventurers in hurry. Go and talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105802, 'Have you heard the rumors?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105803, 'Rumours? What rumors?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105804, 'I also heard from adventurers who went to Bera that there is something going on with Adelia. Town Chief Guiltian who is in there is currently recruting adventurers.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105805, 'Town Chief Guiltian is looking for an adventurer?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105806, 'I haven\'t heard in detail but I heard many adventurers are refuse to do it because it\'s tiresome. If you have time, why don\'t you go to Adelia to check out?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Of course I should go and help him.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I don\'t know what that is but I also do not like get into troublesome.][2]'),
(105807, 'Chief! What happened? Is there something big happening?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105808, 'Oh! [NAME]. I couldn\'t find you from anywhere so I was recruting adventurers??. But you have have found me before it gets out of hand.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105809, 'I haven\'t heard in detail but I heard many adventurers are refuse to do it because it\'s tiresome. If you have time, why don\'t you go to Adelia?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105810, 'Shining Piece 1'),
(105811, 'Chief Valiere has a found a shining piece around Siren Castle. Let\'s go talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105812, 'What is this? Such a shiny item looks like it is quite precious.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105813, 'Hello, Chief.\nI\'m here because I saw something shiny from far away, and it appears that you\'re holding it.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105814, 'Ah! [NAME].\nOur guard found this near Siren Castle, but I have no idea what it is. It looks like it could be very valuable.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105815, 'Do you happen to know anybody that would have seen this, or maybe know what it\'s used for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105816, 'For things that are mysterious, {color,yellow,Chaoming} from {color,yellow,Siren Castle} should know. Do you want me to take it to him and ask?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105817, 'If you could, it would be really helpful. I\'m worried that this is infused with corruption since it\'s from Siren Castle.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Don\'t worry. There won\'t be big problem with it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[You are giving me something so dangerous?][2]'),
(105818, 'Hehe.\nHave you collected lots of Crystal of the Ocean?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105819, 'It\'s not Crystal of the Ocean??but..\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105820, 'color,yellow,(Showing the shining piece)}\n\nHave you ever seen this item?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105821, 'Maybe {color,yellow,Chaoming} can tell us what this is, since he\'s seen so many mysterious things.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105830, 'Shining Piece 2'),
(105831, 'Chaoming said he has seen this shiny piece before. Let\'s go and talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105832, 'Ah-ha!\nThis looks quite similar to the piece I have seen from Roumen.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105833, 'From Roumen? I\'ve never seen anything like this come from Roumen.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105834, 'If I remember correctly, there was an island near {color,yellow,Roumen}, and I believe I saw one of these come from there.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105835, 'An island?\n\n(Was there island near Roumen?)\n\n[BUTTON]=[Let\'s go to Chief Roumenus first.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Why is Chaoming lying to me?][2]'),
(105836, 'Hello Chief. It has been a long time.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105837, 'Oh! [NAME].\nI was waiting for you. There is a new adventure that awaits you.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105838, 'Could it be... A new enemy awaits?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105839, 'You\'re slow to catch on. Didn\'t you know that enormous monsters have been found coming from the island that {color,yellow,Science Ming} was exploring? These monsters have brought many challenges.\nCome to think of it, there\'s only 3 {color,yellow,Small Ship Ticket} left.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105840, 'Island?\nI\'m here because of that island, but what is all this about enormous monsters and tickets?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105841, 'Many adventurers are gathering here right now because of these monsters. However, too many people have shown up and aren\'t helping one another, so I\'m limiting them with {color,yellow,Tickets}.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105842, 'Wait, wait. Enough about monsters. My topic was this piece...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105843, 'For now, I will give you my three remaining tickets. Go to {color,yellow,Science Ming} near the port and ask for the details.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105844, 'Enough about {color,yellow,Roumen} or whatever, but you haven\'t brough any Crystal of the Ocean. Why are you vising me?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105850, 'Ominous Canyon'),
(105851, 'Science Ming, from the island. Let\'s talk to him to find out what is going on.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105852, 'Hello. Are you Science Ming from the island?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105853, 'If you have come to use the ticket, you are with the right person, but can\'t you see the name above my head?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105854, '{color,yellow,(Showing the shining piece)}\n\nI want to ask about something other than the ticket, have you seen this item by any chance?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105855, 'This is the lamp from my lab!\nYou have stolen a lamp from my lab?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Lamp?][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Are you saying I\'m a thief?][2]'),
(105856, 'Wait, my lab is surround by big plants so you couldn\'t have gone to there. How did you get there?\n[NEXT]'),
(105857, 'This piece is not from the same island as you, but it\'s from place called Kahal Snowfield. Chaoming has told me he has seen this piece from the island near Roumen, so I have brought this here.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105858, 'Chaoming was the salesman that came to me to sell the light bulb. I have only used this as a lamp, so I don\'t know what this is exactly. But, maybe if I can go to my lab, I might can find the secret about this piece......\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105859, 'A secret about the piece?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105860, 'Several weeks ago, there was a huge earthquake on the island. (???) Since then, the island has become a canyon as you can see. For now, the priority is to defeat these monsters on the island. Go and bring people that will help you. Then I will bring you to the former island, Ominous Canyon.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105861, 'Ah! Also when you are defeating monsters from the island, you will get {color,yellow,Ominous Coin}. It seems not only the piece you brought to me, but these coins also have some effects on this island. So bring these coins to me.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105862, 'You\'re not asking for me to give these coins to you for free, are you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105863, 'Of course I\'m not asking for free {color,yellow,Ominous Coins}. For my experiment, I need {color,yellow,at least 100 Ominous Coins} so that I can give you one {color,yellow,armor} that I\'ve been developing. How\'s that? To have the best armor that I created in such an easy manner seems like a good deal for you as well...\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105864, 'But why are people calling the island that my lab is located on a canyon? Why?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105870, 'Ticket that brings to Canyon'),
(105871, 'Science Ming  is asking if you have enough tickets to make it to Ominous Canyon. Let\'s talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(105872, 'Do you have enough {color,yellow,Tickets} to reach Ominous Canyon?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(105873, 'Maybe? Let me check my inventory.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(105874, 'If you do, tell me. I can give you one right now if you need it.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Yes, I\'m short one.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No thanks.][2]'),
(105875, 'You have not forgotten what I have told you last time, have you? For {color,yellow,100 Ominous Coins}, I will give you {color,yellow,one armor} that I have created, so go and collects lots of them.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(105876, 'But why are people calling the island that my lab is located on a canyon? Why?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(370, 'The Birthday Cake'),
(371, '{color,yellow,Guard Captain Shutian} wants to make a birthday cake for everyone in Isya, but he burned every cake he made. Talk to him. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(372, '[NAME], I need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(373, 'Calm down. What\'s going on? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(374, '(sob) ...\nMy cakes are always burned or taste like smelly feet, although I\'d like to make the most beautiful and tasty cake to celebrate the birthday of Fiesta Online.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(375, '(sigh) ...\nWell ... and {color,yellow,Item Merchant Nina} has suggest to help me, but some ingredients are missing for the perfect cake. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(376, 'Pie, Cake, Cookies, ... I love sweet Stuff! May I help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(377, 'Please save our birthday celebration and bring {color,yellow,Item Merchant Nina} tasty {color,yellow,honey}, dark {color,yellow,cacao bean} and some {color,yellow,vanilla pod}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Eggs, lard, sugar or salt whatever! I help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just get a gingerbread.][2]'),
(378, 'Hehe.\nDo you have all your ingredients?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(379, 'I\'ve found all the ingredients! Can I help you with anything else?\n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(380, '{color,yellow,Item Merchant Nina} is still waiting for her ingredients.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(390, 'The Birthday Cake 2'),
(391, 'It seems like {color,yellow,Item Merchant Nina} is looking for something. Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(392, 'Ah! [NAME].\nDo you still have a moment? I need immediately help by getting one important item. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(393, 'Of course! \nI haven\'t something better to do as running around all day long. What can I do for you? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(394, 'I have all your ingredients, but I need a big baking bowl to mix all the ingredients. \n{color,yellow,Healer Avon} has some pots and kettles. Go and ask him if he has a big bowl for me.\n \n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I prefer to brush my hair.][2]'),
(395, 'Hello [NAME], can I do something for you? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(396, 'Uhm... No, I\'m only here to ask for a big bowl for Nina. Nina want to make a birthday cake but she needs a big bowl to mix the ingredients.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(397, 'Hmm...All my bowls are unsuitable for baking. The smell of basilicum and herb root are deep in the bowls. \n \n[NEXT]'),
(398, 'Oh, no. Then there won\'t be a birthday cake. What can I do? I can\'t go back to Nina with empty hands. \n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(399, 'Get a big baking bowl for Nina. {color,yellow,Healer Avon} can help you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(410, 'The Birthday Cake 3 (Lvl 1-79)'),
(411, 'Healer Avon has no bowls for you but he has an idea. Talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(412, 'Wait!\nIf you search for some Silver Ore you can bring it to Blacksmith Karl. He is great in making big bowls. He made all my bowls, so you can trust him.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(413, 'That sounds great.\nIt seems like we can make a birthday cake. What do I need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(414, 'Well... let me take a look on my list.\nYou will need a lot of {color,yellow,Silver Ore [High Grade]} and some {color,yellow,Rubies}. Bring them to {color,yellow,Blacksmith Karl}. \n\n[BUTTON]=[That sounds easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.. I am allergic to collecting things.][2]'),
(415, 'Hello young adventurer.\nYour backpack seems pretty heavy. What\'s in there?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(416, 'Oh great Blacksmith Karl. I need your help!\nPlease... can you make me a big bowl for baking?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(417, 'S-sure.. \nBut I need some things first....\n\n[NEXT]'),
(418, 'Fine! \nI have everything in my backpack. Healer Avon already told me what you will need. Can you start fast? Nina needs the big bowl for the birthday cake. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(419, 'Hand me the rubies which are shining bright like diamonds!\nAnd of course the Silver Ore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(420, 'Bring some {color,yellow,Silver Ore [High Grade]} and {color,yellow,Rubies} to Blacksmith Karl.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]'),
(430, 'The Birthday Cake 4 (Lvl 1-79)'),
(431, 'Blacksmith Karl has a baking bowl for you. Take it and talk to Item merchant Nina. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(432, 'Uhm...\nI just need the baking bowl for Nina.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(433, '(laughing)\nRight. The next time you can just ask me before you go an adventure to search for the items.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(434, 'It wasn\'t that hard.\nWhen I searched for them I talked with the Slimes and looked after the Honeyings. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(435, 'Alright. \nThere you have a {color,yellow,ruby baking bowl}. Farewell my little friend. And don\'t forget to save me a big piece of cake! \n\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t forget it. See you later.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Forget it! I want the whole cake!!][2]'),
(436, 'Oh. You are back!\nDo you have something for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(437, 'Well, ... \nFirst I went to Healer Avon but he hasn\'t got a baking bowl and ...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(438, 'Just give me the baking bowl. Thank you!\nYou have earned a big piece of cake. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(439, 'Bring the baking bowl to {color,yellow,Item Merchant Nina} so that she can bake a birthday cake.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(440, 'The Birthday Cake 5 (Lvl 1-79)'),
(441, 'It seems like Item Merchant Nina has finished the birthday cake. Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(442, 'I just finished the birthday cake. Doesn\'t it looks delicious?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(443, 'WOW!\nThe birthday cake looks amazing and so delicious. May I have a piece of it, please?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(444, 'Not now! \nDon\'t touch the cake. You will get your piece later. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, but I still want one piece of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t withstand... don\'t hand it over to me.][2]'),
(445, '(breathless)\nI have the birthday cake for you! Look how delicious and yummy it looks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(446, 'Thank you {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\nYou saved our birthday party with this cake and it looks so stunning.\nHere, have some cake. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(447, 'Guard Captain Shutian needs the birthday cake for the birthday party. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(450, 'The Birthday Cake 1 (Lvl 80-125)'),
(451, '{color,yellow,Town Chief Adrian} wants to make a birthday cake for everyone in Isya, but she burned every cake she made. Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(452, '[NAME], I need your help!\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(453, 'Calm down. What\'s going on? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(454, '(sob) ...\nMy cakes are always burned or taste like smelly feet, although I\'d like to make the most beautiful and tasty cake to celebrate the birthday of Fiesta Online.    \n\n[NEXT]'),
(455, '(sigh) ...\nWell ... and {color,yellow,Healer Pooring} has suggest to help me, but some ingredients are missing for the perfect cake.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(456, 'Pie, Cake, Cookies, ... I love sweet Stuff! May I help you?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(457, 'Please save our birthday celebration and bring {color,yellow,Healer Poring} tasty {color,yellow,honey}, dark {color,yellow,cacao bean} and some {color,yellow,vanilla pod}.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Eggs, lard, sugar or salt whatever! I help you!][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Just get a gingerbread.][2]'),
(458, 'Hehe.\nDo you have all your ingredients?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(459, 'I\'ve found all the ingredients! Can I help you with anything else?\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(460, '{color,yellow,Healer Pooring} is still waiting for her ingredients.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(470, 'The Birthday Cake 2 (Lvl 80-125)'),
(471, 'It seems like {color,yellow,Healer Pooring} is looking for something. Talk to her. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(472, 'Ah! [NAME].\nDo you still have a moment? I need immediately help by getting one important item. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(473, 'Of course! \nI haven\'t something better to do as running around all day long. What can I do for you? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(474, 'I have all your ingredients, but I need a big baking bowl to mix all the ingredients. \n{color,yellow,Blacksmith Hans} has some pots and kettles. Go and ask him if he has a big bowl for me.\n \n[BUTTON]=[I will be right back.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I prefer to brush my hair.][2]'),
(475, 'Hello [NAME], can I do something for you? \n\n[NEXT]'),
(476, 'Uhm... No, I\'m only here to ask for a big bowl for Pooring. She wants to make a birthday cake but needs a big bowl to mix the ingredients.  \n\n[NEXT]'),
(477, 'Hmm...All my bowls are unsuitable for baking. The smell of Metals does not leave the bowls. \n \n[NEXT]'),
(478, 'Oh, no. Then there won\'t be a birthday cake. What can I do? I can\'t go back to Pooring with empty hands. \n\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(479, 'Get a big baking bowl for Healer Pooring. {color,yellow,Blacksmith Hans} can help you.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(480, 'The Birthday Cake 3 (Lvl 80-125)'),
(481, 'Blacksmith Hans has no bowls for you but he has an idea. Talk to him.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(482, 'Wait!\nIf you search for some Golden Ore you can bring it to me. I am great in making big bowls. I made all the bowls for the village, so you can trust me.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(483, 'That sounds great.\nIt seems like we can make a birthday cake. What do I need?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(484, 'Well... let me take a look on my list.\nYou will need a lot of {color,yellow,Golden Ore [High Grade]} and some {color,yellow,Sapphires}. Bring them to me as fast as possible. \n\n[BUTTON]=[That sounds easy.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[No.. I am allergic to collecting things.][2]'),
(485, 'Welcome back, young adventurer.\nYour backpack seems pretty heavy. Do you have everything I asked for?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(486, 'I have found everything that was on the list. How long will it take before the bowl is ready?\nHealer Pooring needs the big bowl fast so she can start baking.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(487, 'Give me the Saphires, as bright as a thousand diamonds and fo course the gold ore.\n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(488, 'Collect some {color,yellow,Golden Ore [High Grade]} et des {color,yellow,Sapphires} for Blacksmith Hans.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]'),
(490, 'The Birthday Cake 4 (Lvl 80-125)'),
(491, 'Blacksmith Karl has a baking bowl for you. Take it and talk to Healer Pooring. \n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(492, 'Uhm...\nI just need the baking bowl for Pooring.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(493, '(laughing)\nRight. The next time you can just ask me a little earlier, so you do not have to rush finding the items.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(494, 'It wasn\'t that hard.\nWhile searching for them I talked with the Slimes and observed the Honeyings. \n\n[NEXT]'),
(495, 'Alright. \nThere you have a {color,yellow,golden baking bowl}. Farewell my little friend. And don\'t forget to save me a big piece of cake! \n\n[BUTTON]=[I won\'t forget it. See you later.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[Forget it! I want the whole cake!!][2]'),
(496, 'Oh. You are back!\nDo you have something for me?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(497, 'Well, ... \nFirst I went to Blacksmith Hans but he didn??t have a baking bowl and ...\n\n[NEXT]'),
(498, 'Just give me the baking bowl. Thank you!\nYou have earned a big piece of cake. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(499, 'Bring the baking bowl to {color,yellow,Healer Pooring} so that she can bake a birthday cake.\n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]'),
(520, 'The Birthday Cake 5 (Lvl 80-125)'),
(521, 'It seems like Healer Pooring has finished the birthday cake. Talk to her.\n\n[LINE]\n[SHOW_REWARD]'),
(522, 'I just finished the birthday cake. Doesn\'t it looks delicious?\n\n[BUTTON]=[Begin Quest][1]\n[MENU]'),
(523, 'WOW!\nThe birthday cake looks amazing and so delicious. May I have a piece of it, please?\n\n[NEXT]'),
(524, 'Not now! \nDon\'t touch the cake. You will get your piece later.  \n\n[BUTTON]=[Okay, but I still want one piece of it.][1]\n[BUTTON]=[I can\'t withstand... don\'t hand it over to me.][2]'),
(525, '(breathless)\nI have the birthday cake for you! Look how delicious and yummy it looks.\n\n[NEXT]'),
(526, 'Thank you {color,yellow,[NAME]}.\nYou saved our birthday party with this cake and it looks so stunning.\nHere, have some cake. \n\n[BUTTON]=[End Quest][1]\n[SHOW_REWARD]\n[MENU]'),
(527, 'Town Chief Adrian needs the birthday cake for the birthday party. \n\n[BUTTON]=[Continue][1]\n[MENU]');
